const MEALDB=[{"id":"53284","n":"Algerian Bouzgene Berber Bread with Roasted Pepper Sauce","a":"Algerian","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/se5vhk1764114880.jpg","y":"","i":[["Red Pepper","2"],["Tomato","4"],["Olive Oil","1 tablespoon"],["Garlic","4 Cloves Chopped"],["Jalapeno","1 chopped"],["Salt","To taste"],["Semolina","2 Lbs"],["Salt","1 1/2 tsp"],["Water","3 Cups"],["Olive Oil","4 tablespoons"],["Olive Oil","6 tablespoons"]],"s":"Preheat your oven's broiler. Place red bell peppers and tomatoes on a baking sheet, and roast under the broiler for about 8 minutes, turning occasionally. This should blacken the skin and help it peel off more easily. Cool, then scrape the skins off of the tomatoes and peppers, and place them in a large bowl. Remove cores and seeds from the bell peppers.\r\n\r\nHeat 1 tablespoon of olive oil in a skillet over medium heat. Add the jalapenos and garlic, and cook until tender, stirring frequently. Remove from heat, and transfer the garlic and jalapeno to the bowl with the tomatoes and red peppers. Using two sharp steak knives (one in each hand), cut up the tomatoes and peppers to a coarse and soupy consistency. Stir, and set sauce aside.\r\n\r\nPlace the semolina in a large bowl, and stir in salt and 4 tablespoons of olive oil. Gradually add water while mixing and squeezing with your hand until the dough holds together without being sticky or dry, and molds easily with the hand. Divide into 6 pieces and form into balls.\r\n\r\nFor each round, heat 1 tablespoon of olive oil in a large heavy skillet over medium heat. Roll out dough one round at a time, to no thicker than 1/4 inch. Fry in the hot skillet until dark brown spots appear on the surface, and they are crispy. Remove from the skillet, and wrap in a clean towel while preparing the remaining flat breads.\r\n\r\nTo eat the bread and sauce, break off pieces of the bread, and scoop them into the sauce. It will slide off, but just keep reaching in!","z":"预热烤箱的烤肉机。将红甜椒和西红柿放在烤盘上，在烤炉下烤约 8 分钟，偶尔翻动。这会使皮肤变黑并帮助其更容易剥落。冷却，然后刮掉西红柿和辣椒的皮，然后将它们放入一个大碗中。从甜椒中取出核心和种子。\r\n\r\n在煎锅中用中火加热 1 汤匙橄榄油。加入墨西哥胡椒和大蒜，煮至变软，经常搅拌。从火上移开，将大蒜和墨西哥胡椒与西红柿和红辣椒一起放入碗中。使用两把锋利的牛排刀（每手一把），将西红柿和辣椒切成粗糙的汤状。搅拌，将酱汁放在一边。\r\n\r\n将粗面粉放入一个大碗中，加入盐和 4 汤匙橄榄油，搅拌。一边用手搅拌和挤压，一边逐渐加水，直到面团粘在一起，不粘也不干，用手就能轻松成型。分成6份并搓成球状。\r\n\r\n每一轮，在一个大的重煎锅中用中火加热 1 汤匙橄榄油。一次将面团擀成圆形，厚度不超过 1/4 英寸。放入热锅中煎至表面出现黑褐色斑点，外皮酥脆。从煎锅中取出，用干净的毛巾包裹起来，同时准备剩余的扁面包。\r\n\r\n吃面包和酱汁时，将面包片掰下来，舀入酱汁中。它会滑落，但只要继续伸进去！"},{"id":"53282","n":"Algerian Carrots","a":"Algerian","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/o2cd4r1764113576.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mF2ND56szUQ","i":[["Water","1 1/2 cup"],["Carrots","2 Lbs"],["Olive Oil","5 tablespoons"],["Salt","1 tsp"],["Black Pepper","1/2 teaspoon"],["Ground Cinnamon","1/2 teaspoon"],["Ground Cumin","1/2 teaspoon"],["Garlic","3 Cloves Crushed"],["Thyme","1/2 teaspoon"],["Bay Leaf","1"],["Lemon Juice","1 tsp"]],"s":"Place a steamer insert into a saucepan, and fill with 1 1/2 cups of water, or just below the bottom of the steamer. Cover, and bring the water to a boil over high heat. Add the sliced carrots, reduce the heat to medium, and cover the pan again. Steam until tender but not mushy, 4 to 6 minutes depending on the thickness of the slices. Reserve 1/2 cup of the cooking liquid.\r\n\r\nHeat the olive oil in a skillet over medium heat. Reduce the heat to low and stir in the salt, pepper, cinnamon, cumin, garlic, and thyme. Cook the spices and garlic, stirring frequently, until fragrant, about 10 minutes. Add the 1/2 cup reserved cooking liquid and the bay leaf, cover, and simmer for 20 minutes.\r\n\r\nStir in the carrots, tossing well to coat with the spice mixture, and cook until heated through, about 2 to 3 minutes. Sprinkle with lemon juice and remove the bay leaf before serving.","z":"将蒸锅放入平底锅中，加入 1 1/2 杯水，或刚好位于蒸锅底部下方。盖上盖子，用大火将水煮沸。加入胡萝卜片，将火调至中火，然后再次盖上锅盖。蒸4至6分钟，直至变软但不糊状，具体取决于切片的厚度。保留 1/2 杯烹饪液。\r\n\r\n在煎锅中用中火加热橄榄油。把火调小，加入盐、胡椒、肉桂、孜然、大蒜和百里香。煮香料和大蒜，经常搅拌，直至散发出香味，大约需要 10 分钟。加入 1/2 杯保留的烹饪液和月桂叶，盖上盖子，煮 20 分钟。\r\n\r\n拌入胡萝卜，充分搅拌，使其沾上香料混合物，煮至热透，约 2 至 3 分钟。食用前撒上柠檬汁并除去月桂叶。"},{"id":"53288","n":"Algerian Flafla (Bell Pepper Salad)","a":"Algerian","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/tbj1bs1764118062.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JXrS1doDnNg","i":[["Green Pepper","3"],["Olive Oil","1 tablespoon"],["Red Onions","1 tablespoon chopped"],["Garlic","1 clove peeled crushed"],["Salt","To taste"],["Pepper","To taste"],["Plum Tomatoes","1 Diced"]],"s":"Preheat an oven to 450 degrees F (230 degrees C). Place the whole peppers on aluminum foil. Bake until the skin is spotted black and the peppers are soft, 30 to 45 minutes, turning the peppers once if necessary.\r\n\r\nRemove peppers from the oven and set aside to cool for 10 minutes. Peel off the skin and remove the stem and seeds. Chop the roasted peppers into half-inch pieces.\r\n\r\nHeat the olive oil in a skillet over medium heat. Stir in the onion and cook, stirring frequently, until the onion has softened and turned translucent, about 5 minutes. Add the garlic, salt, and pepper; stir in the chopped peppers and tomato. Cook over medium heat, stirring occasionally, until the tomato is soft and the mixture is well incorporated, about 5 minutes.","z":"将烤箱预热至 450 华氏度（230 摄氏度）。将整个辣椒放在铝箔上。烘烤 30 至 45 分钟，直至表皮变黑且辣椒变软，必要时可将辣椒翻动一次。\r\n\r\n将辣椒从烤箱中取出，放在一边冷却 10 分钟。剥去外皮并去除茎和种子。将烤辣椒切成半英寸的碎片。\r\n\r\n在煎锅中用中火加热橄榄油。拌入洋葱，不断搅拌，直至洋葱变软并变成半透明，大约需要 5 分钟。加入大蒜、盐和胡椒粉；拌入切碎的辣椒和番茄。用中火煮约 5 分钟，偶尔搅拌，直到番茄变软并且混合物充分混合。"},{"id":"53281","n":"Algerian Kefta (Meatballs)","a":"Algerian","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/8rfd4q1764112993.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IRadJQNLvPs","i":[["Ground Beef","1 lb"],["Garlic","4 Cloves Crushed"],["Onion","1/2 cup"],["Salt","To taste"],["Pepper","To taste"],["Plum Tomatoes","3"],["Parsley","1 tsp"],["Water","1/2 cup"]],"s":"Combine ground beef with 1/2 of the minced garlic and 1 tablespoon chopped onion in a large bowl. Mix with your hands until fully incorporated. Shape meat mixture into 1 1/2-inch oblong patties; you should have 12 to 14 meatballs.\r\n\r\nHeat a large skillet over medium-high heat. Brown patties in batches in the hot skillet until crispy on both sides and no longer pink in the center, about 10 minutes. Set meatballs aside in a rimmed serving dish.\r\n\r\nReduce heat to medium and stir remaining chopped onion into drippings in the skillet. Season with salt and pepper. Cook, stirring constantly, until onion has softened and turned translucent, about 5 minutes. Stir in remaining garlic and cook for 30 seconds. Stir in Roma tomatoes, dried parsley, and ras el hanout. Pour in water. Cook until tomatoes are soft, about 5 minutes.\r\n\r\nPour tomato sauce over meatballs to serve.","z":"将碎牛肉、1/2 蒜末和 1 汤匙切碎的洋葱放入一个大碗中。用手搅拌直至完全融合。将肉混合物制成 1 1/2 英寸的椭圆形肉饼；你应该有12到14个肉丸。\r\n\r\n用中高火加热一个大煎锅。将肉饼分批放入热煎锅中，直至两面酥脆，中间不再呈粉红色，大约需要 10 分钟。将肉丸放在有边的盘子中。\r\n\r\n将热量降至中火，将剩余的切碎洋葱搅拌成煎锅中的水滴。用盐和胡椒调味。煮约 5 分钟，不断搅拌，直到洋葱变软并变成半透明。加入剩余的大蒜，煮 30 秒。加入罗马番茄、干欧芹和拉斯埃尔哈努特。倒入水。煮约 5 分钟，直至西红柿变软。\r\n\r\n将番茄酱倒在肉丸上即可食用。"},{"id":"53290","n":"Cheese Borek","a":"Algerian","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/oal8x31764119345.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UphcO5hC9rU","i":[["Egg","1 beaten"],["Parsley","1  bunch"],["Garlic","2 cloves minced"],["Red Pepper","3/4 teaspoon"],["Gouda Cheese","6 oz"],["Emmentaler Cheese","6 oz"],["Phyllo Dough","12"],["Unsalted Butter","1 1/2 cups"]],"s":"In a medium bowl, whisk together egg, parsley, garlic and crushed red pepper. Mix in Gouda and Emmentaler.\r\n\r\nOne sheet at a time, place phyllo dough on a flat surface and brush with about 1 tablespoon butter. Cut lengthwise into 4 strips. Place a rounded teaspoon of the egg mixture at one end of each strip. Fold corner of strip over the filling, forming a triangular fold. Continue folding the length of the strip in triangular folds to form a small stuffed triangle. Repeat with remaining phyllo dough.\r\n\r\nPreheat oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Lightly butter a large baking sheet.\r\n\r\nArrange stuffed phyllo triangles in a single layer on the prepared baking sheet. Bake in the preheated oven 30 minutes, or until lightly browned. Serve warm","z":"在一个中等大小的碗中，将鸡蛋、欧芹、大蒜和碎红辣椒搅拌在一起。加入豪达干酪和艾门塔尔干酪。\r\n\r\n一次一张，将菲罗面团放在平坦的表面上，并刷上约一汤匙黄油。纵向切成4条。在每条条的一端放一茶匙圆形鸡蛋混合物。将条带的一角折叠到填充物上，形成三角形折叠。继续将条带的长度折叠成三角形，形成一个小的填充三角形。对剩余的菲罗面团重复上述步骤。\r\n\r\n将烤箱预热至 350 华氏度（175 摄氏度）。在一张大烤盘上涂上少许黄油。\r\n\r\n将填充的三角形单层排列在准备好的烤盘上。在预热的烤箱中烘烤 30 分钟，或直至浅棕色。趁热食用"},{"id":"53289","n":"Chorba Hamra bel Frik (Algerian Lamb, Tomato, and Freekeh Soup)","a":"Algerian","c":"Lamb","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/p9tebp1764118792.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2z6IldJl_lQ","i":[["Freekeh","1 cup"],["Lamb","12 ounces"],["Onion","1 finely chopped"],["Black Pepper","1 tsp"],["Paprika","1 tsp"],["Ground Cinnamon","1 tsp"],["Salt","To taste"],["Vegetable Oil","3  tablespoons"],["Cilantro","1  bunch"],["Mint","1  bunch"],["Celery","1"],["Chickpeas","14 oz jar"],["Water","4 cups"],["Zucchini","1 Diced"],["Carrots","1 Diced"],["Tomato Puree","1 tablespoon"],["Tomato","3 Medium"],["Potatoes","1 Diced"]],"s":"Place freekeh in a small bowl and cover with cold water. Set aside.\r\n\r\nCombine lamb, onion, black pepper, paprika, cinnamon, and salt in a pot. Stir in oil, 1/2 the cilantro, 1/2 the mint, and celery stalk until combined. Simmer over low heat for 15 minutes. Stir in chickpeas; pour in just enough water to cover, and return to a simmer. Stir in zucchini, carrot, and tomato paste.\r\n\r\nSet a steamer over the pot; add tomatoes. Cover and steam tomatoes until soft, about 5 minutes. Crush tomatoes using a wooden spoon, so pulp drips into soup. Remove the steamer and discard leftover tomato peels.\r\n\r\nAdd potato to soup and just enough water to cover. Simmer until potato is soft, about 10 minutes.\r\n\r\nDrain freekeh and add to soup. Simmer until soft, about 15 minutes. Remove celery stalk and discard. Sprinkle soup with remaining 1/2 cilantro and remaining 1/2 mint before serving.","z":"将 freekeh 放入小碗中，盖上冷水。放在一边。\r\n\r\n将羊肉、洋葱、黑胡椒、辣椒粉、肉桂和盐放入锅中。加入油、1/2 香菜、1/2 薄荷和芹菜茎，搅拌直至混合。小火煮15分钟。拌入鹰嘴豆；倒入足够的水覆盖，然后重新煮。加入西葫芦、胡萝卜和番茄酱。\r\n\r\n将蒸锅放在锅上；添加西红柿。盖上盖子，蒸番茄至软，大约 5 分钟。用木勺将西红柿压碎，使果肉滴入汤中。取出蒸笼并丢弃剩余的番茄皮。\r\n\r\n将土豆加入汤中，加水刚好没过土豆。煮约10分钟，直至土豆变软。\r\n\r\n沥干水分并加入汤中。煮约15分钟直至变软。去除芹菜茎并丢弃。食用前，在汤上撒上剩余的 1/2 香菜和剩余的 1/2 薄荷。"},{"id":"53283","n":"Chtitha Batata (Algerian Potato Stew)","a":"Algerian","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/q8pu1k1764114334.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kpsZQTVVjdk","i":[["Garlic","4 cloves"],["Red Chilli","1 small"],["Ground Cumin","1 tsp"],["Paprika","1 teaspoon"],["Black Pepper","1/2 teaspoon"],["Cayenne Pepper","1/2 teaspoon"],["Salt","1/2 teaspoon"],["Olive Oil","2 tablespoons"],["New Potatoes","2 Lbs"],["Tomato Puree","1 tablespoon"],["Water","Boiled"],["Salt","To taste"]],"s":"Combine garlic, chile pepper, cumin, paprika, black pepper, cayenne, and salt in a mortar; grind with a pestle until it forms a paste. Add olive oil and mix dersa well.\r\n\r\nHeat a large saucepan over medium heat and stir-fry dersa until fragrant, 2 to 4 minutes. Add potato halves and stir to combine with the dersa. Stir in tomato paste. Pour in enough water to just cover the potatoes and bring to a boil. Reduce heat and simmer until potatoes are tender, about 40 minutes.\r\n\r\nLadle potatoes into a serving bowl. Spoon any remaining sauce over the potatoes.","z":"将大蒜、辣椒、小茴香、辣椒粉、黑胡椒、辣椒和盐放入研钵中混合；用杵研磨直至形成糊状。加入橄榄油并将dersa充分混合。\r\n\r\n用中火加热一个大平底锅，炒香 dersa 2 至 4 分钟。加入土豆半块，搅拌与德萨混合。拌入番茄酱。倒入足够的水，刚好没过土豆，然后煮沸。调小火，煮约 40 分钟，直至土豆变软。\r\n\r\n将土豆舀入碗中。将剩余的酱汁舀到土豆上。"},{"id":"53291","n":"Cornes de Gazelle (Gazelle Horns)","a":"Algerian","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/0h1b7m1764120235.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KVnfEBh-rUk","i":[["Almonds","2 cups"],["Sugar","3/4 cup"],["Sugar","1 tablespoon"],["Ground Cinnamon","1/4 tsp"],["Egg","1"],["Orange Blossom Water","1 tablespoon"],["All purpose flour","2 cups"],["Unsalted Butter","1/2 cup"],["Salt","1 pinch"],["Egg","1 beaten"],["Vegetable Oil","3  tablespoons"],["Orange Blossom Water","1 ½ tbsp"],["Pistachio","3  tablespoons"]],"s":"Preheat oven to 300 degrees F (150 degrees C). Line a baking sheet with parchment paper. Spread almonds over the baking sheet.\r\n\r\nBake in the preheated oven until almonds are fragrant and roasted, 20 to 25 minutes.\r\n\r\nPrepare pastry dough while almonds are roasting. Combine flour, 1/2 cup plus 1 tablespoon butter, and salt in a bowl and rub together until the mixture resembles breadcrumbs. Add egg, oil, and 1 1/2 tablespoons orange blossom water; knead everything into a smooth pastry dough. Add a little water, 1 teaspoon at a time, if dough is too dry. Shape pastry dough into a ball, wrap in plastic wrap, and set aside for 30 minutes.\r\n\r\nRemove almonds from oven and cool slightly, about 5 minutes. Place almonds in the bowl of a food processor; process until finely and evenly ground. Add 3/4 cup plus 1 tablespoon sugar, cinnamon, egg, and 1 tablespoon orange blossom water in that order to the food processor, pulsing after each addition until mixture is evenly combined and resembles a paste.\r\n\r\nRemove small walnut-sized portions of filling with greased hands. Roll them into small logs with thin ends. Set aside.\r\n\r\nPreheat oven to 325 degrees F (165 degrees C). Line a baking sheet with parchment paper.\r\n\r\nRoll out half of the pastry dough on a lightly floured surface until very thin. Place one of the almond paste logs on the edge of the pastry, fold pastry over the filling, covering it completely, and seal the edges. Mold with your fingers into a crescent shape. Using a pastry cutter, cut around the crescent, and transfer to the prepared baking sheet. Repeat with remaining dough and filling.\r\n\r\nBake in the preheated oven until gazelle horns are lightly golden and baked through, about 20 minutes. They should not get too dark. Let cool slightly, about 3 minutes.\r\n\r\nHeat honey in a small saucepan over low-medium heat. Remove from heat and stir in 1 tablespoon orange blossom water. Dip gazelle horns into the honey and place on a serving plate. Sprinkle with crushed pistachios.","z":"将烤箱预热至 300 华氏度（150 摄氏度）。在烤盘上铺上羊皮纸。将杏仁铺在烤盘上。\r\n\r\n在预热的烤箱中烘烤 20 至 25 分钟，直至杏仁散发出香味并烤熟。\r\n\r\n在烘烤杏仁的同时准备糕点面团。将面粉、1/2 杯加 1 汤匙黄油和盐放入碗中混合，揉搓直至混合物看起来像面包屑。加入鸡蛋、油和1 1/2汤匙橙花水；将所有东西揉成光滑的糕点面团。如果面团太干，加一点水，一次一茶匙。将糕点面团揉成球状，用保鲜膜包起来，放置 30 分钟。\r\n\r\n将杏仁从烤箱中取出并稍微冷却约 5 分钟。将杏仁放入食品加工机的碗中；处理直至精细且均匀地研磨。按顺序将 3/4 杯加 1 汤匙糖、肉桂、鸡蛋和 1 汤匙橙花水加入食品加工机中，每次添加后进行脉冲处理，直至混合物均匀混合并形成糊状。\r\n\r\n用抹了油的手取出核桃大小的小部分馅料。将它们卷成两端细的小圆木。放在一边。\r\n\r\n将烤箱预热至 325 华氏度（165 摄氏度）。在烤盘上铺上羊皮纸。\r\n\r\n将一半糕点面团放在撒有少许面粉的表面上，擀至非常薄。将一根杏仁酱放在糕点的边缘，将糕点折叠在馅料上，完全覆盖它，然后密封边缘。用手指将其塑造成月牙形状。使用糕点刀，在新月形周围切开，然后转移到准备好的烤盘上。对剩余的面团和馅料重复上述步骤。\r\n\r\n在预热的烤箱中烘烤约 20 分钟，直至瞪羚角呈浅金黄色并烤透。它们不应该变得太暗。稍微冷却约 3 分钟。\r\n\r\n在小平底锅中用中低火加热蜂蜜。从火上移开并加入 1 汤匙橙花水搅拌。将瞪羚角浸入蜂蜜中，然后放在盘子上。撒上碎开心果。"},{"id":"53285","n":"Dziriat (Algerian Almond Tarts)","a":"Algerian","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/ne5wzp1764115568.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=koPyA-HO8Q4","i":[["Sugar","1 cup"],["Water","1 cup"],["Lemon Juice","1 tsp"],["Orange Blossom Water","2 tablespoons"],["All purpose flour","2 cups"],["Vegetable Oil","2 tablespoons"],["Egg","1"],["Lemon Juice","1/2 teaspoon"],["Salt","1 pinch"],["Orange Blossom Water","1 tablespoon"],["Almonds","4 cups"],["Sugar","1 cup"],["Egg","3"],["Baking Powder","1/2 teaspoon"],["Vanilla","1 tsp"],["Lemon","Zest of 1"],["Orange Blossom Water","2 tablespoons"],["Cornstarch","Sprinkling"],["Pine Nuts","To serve"]],"s":"Prepare the almonds the day before. Bring 6 cups of water to a boil. Remove from heat, and add the almonds. Let the almonds soak in water for about 5 minutes, then drain and peel. Spread the almonds on baking sheets, and bake at 200 degrees F(95 degrees C) until completely dry and toasted. This takes several hours, and needs to be prepared ahead. Be careful not to burn the nuts, as this will give a bitter taste to the filling.\r\n\r\nCombine 1 cup sugar and 1 cup water in a saucepan, and bring to a boil. Add 1 teaspoon lemon juice, reduce heat to low, and let it simmer until syrupy, about 30 to 40 minutes. Stir in orange blossom water, and remove from heat. Set sugar syrup aside.\r\n\r\nCombine flour and salt in a large mixing bowl. Make a hole in the center, and pour oil, egg, 1/2 teaspoon lemon juice, and 1 tablespoon orange blossom water into the center. Mix with fingers until the dough resembles coarse crumbs. Gradually sprinkle with warm water while mixing until the dough becomes soft and pliable. Divide into 4 equal portions. Cover dough with a wet cloth, and set aside.\r\n\r\nIn a food processor, finely grind the almonds. Measure 3 cups of the finely ground almonds into a mixing bowl, and stir together with 1 cup sugar, baking powder, vanilla powder, lemon zest, and 2 tablespoons orange flower water. Mix in three eggs one at a time, stirring constantly; mix until you get a sticky, paste-like mixture.\r\n\r\nSprinkle cornstarch on the rolling surface to prevent sticking. Roll each portion of dough very thinly, 1 to 2 millimeters (1/16 inch). Cut the rolled dough into circles of about 10 centimeters (4 inches) in diameter each. Lightly wipe the surface of each circle with cornstarch, and fit into a tart mold, cornstarch side down to prevent sticking. Gently press the dough onto the sides and bottom of the mold, and trim extra dough from around the rim. Fill three quarters of each mold with the almond filling.\r\n\r\nBake on the top shelf at 350 degrees F (175 degrees C) for 20 to 25 minutes, or until the surface of the tart is golden and the dough is firm. Remove the tarts from the molds as soon as they come out of the oven. Dip each tart in the sugar syrup while still hot. Stick a pine nut into the middle of each tart for decoration. Place on a wire rack to drain.","z":"前一天准备好杏仁。将 6 杯水煮沸。从火上移开，加入杏仁。让杏仁在水中浸泡约 5 分钟，然后沥干并去皮。将杏仁铺在烤盘上，在 200 华氏度（95 摄氏度）下烘烤，直至完全干燥并烘烤。这需要几个小时，需要提前做好准备。小心不要烧焦坚果，因为这会给馅料带来苦味。\r\n\r\n将 1 杯糖和 1 杯水放入锅中，煮沸。加入 1 茶匙柠檬汁，将火调小，煮约 30 至 40 分钟，直至呈糖浆状。加入橙花水搅拌，然后离火。将糖浆放在一边。\r\n\r\n将面粉和盐放入一个大搅拌碗中。在中心挖一个洞，然后将油、鸡蛋、1/2 茶匙柠檬汁和 1 汤匙橙花水倒入中心。用手指搅拌直至面团呈粗面包屑状。边搅拌边逐渐撒上温水，直到面团变得柔软柔韧。分成4等份。用湿布盖住面团，放在一边。\r\n\r\n在食品加工机中，将杏仁磨碎。将 3 杯磨碎的杏仁放入搅拌碗中，与 1 杯糖、泡打粉、香草粉、柠檬皮碎和 2 汤匙橙花水一起搅拌。加入三个鸡蛋，一次一个，不断搅拌；混合直至得到粘稠的糊状混合物。\r\n\r\n在擀面皮上撒上玉米淀粉，防止粘连。将面团的每部分擀得很薄，1 到 2 毫米（1/16 英寸）。将擀好的面团切成每个直径约 10 厘米（4 英寸）的圆形。用玉米淀粉轻轻擦拭每个圆圈的表面，然后放入挞模中，玉米淀粉面朝下，防止粘连。轻轻地将面团压到模具的侧面和底部，并修剪边缘周围多余的面团。用杏仁馅填充每个模具的四分之三。\r\n\r\n在顶层架子上以 350 华氏度（175 摄氏度）烘烤 20 至 25 分钟，或直至馅饼表面呈金黄色且面团变硬。从烤箱中取出蛋挞后，立即将其从模具中取出。趁热将每个馅饼浸入糖浆中。在每个挞的中间粘上一颗松子作为装饰。放在金属架上沥干。"},{"id":"53286","n":"Khobz el Dar (Algerian Semolina Bread)","a":"Algerian","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/5u37fy1764116774.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-BzhiwgfAOQ","i":[["Semolina Flour","1/2 cup"],["Semolina Flour","2 tablespoons"],["Sesame Seed","3  tablespoons"],["Sugar","1 tablespoon"],["Yeast","1 tsp"],["Salt","3/4 teaspoon"],["Vegetable Oil","1/4 cup"],["Egg","1"],["Egg","1"],["Milk","1 cup"],["All purpose flour","3 Cups"],["All purpose flour","2 tablespoons"],["Water","1 tsp"]],"s":"Mix 1/2 cup plus 2 tablespoons semolina, 2 tablespoons sesame seeds, sugar, yeast, and salt together in a large bowl. Whisk in oil, egg, and egg white. Stir in warm milk slowly until a liquid dough forms.\r\n\r\nCover the bowl with a plate or plastic wrap; let stand at room temperature until frothy, about 1 hour.\r\n\r\nStir in 2 3/4 cups flour with a wooden spoon until a sticky dough forms. Cover again and allow to rest for 30 minutes.\r\n\r\nLine a baking sheet with parchment paper or a baking mat.\r\n\r\nSprinkle 1 tablespoon flour over the dough and your hands. Mix dough, adding flour as needed, 1 tablespoon at a time, until it pulls away from the sides of the bowl. Shape into a round loaf and place on the prepared baking sheet. Cover loosely with a towel and let rise for 1 hour in a warm place until loaf doubles in volume.\r\n\r\nPreheat oven to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C).\r\n\r\nBeat egg yolk and water in a bowl with a fork; brush over the entire surface of the loaf. Sprinkle 1 tablespoon sesame seeds on top.\r\n\r\nBake in the preheated oven until loaf is golden brown, about 20 to 25 minutes.","z":"将 1/2 杯加 2 汤匙粗面粉、2 汤匙芝麻、糖、酵母和盐放入一个大碗中混合。加入油、鸡蛋和蛋白，搅拌。慢慢加入温牛奶，直至形成液体面团。\r\n\r\n用盘子或保鲜膜盖住碗；在室温下静置约 1 小时直至起泡。\r\n\r\n用木勺加入 2 3/4 杯面粉，搅拌直至形成粘性面团。再次盖上盖子，静置 30 分钟。\r\n\r\n在烤盘上铺上羊皮纸或烤垫。\r\n\r\n在面团和手上撒上一汤匙面粉。混合面团，根据需要添加面粉，一次一汤匙，直到它从碗的侧面脱离。形成圆形面包并放在准备好的烤盘上。用毛巾松松地盖住，在温暖的地方发酵 1 小时，直至面包体积加倍。\r\n\r\n将烤箱预热至 400 华氏度（200 摄氏度）。\r\n\r\n用叉子将蛋黄和水放入碗中搅打；刷过面包的整个表面。在上面撒上一汤匙芝麻。\r\n\r\n在预热的烤箱中烘烤约 20 至 25 分钟，直至面包呈金黄色。"},{"id":"53280","n":"Poulet Roti a l'Algerienne (Algerian Roast Chicken)","a":"Algerian","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/nlxald1764112200.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=78O6Sv7HNO0","i":[["Water","1 cup"],["Onion","1 chopped"],["Olive Oil","5 tablespoons"],["Balsamic Vinegar","2 tablespoons"],["Dijon Mustard","1 tablespoon"],["Garlic","3 Cloves Crushed"],["Black Pepper","1 tsp"],["Cayenne Pepper","1 tsp"],["Salt","To taste"],["Chicken","1"]],"s":"Preheat oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).\r\n\r\nMix water, onion, olive oil, balsamic vinegar, Dijon mustard, garlic, black pepper, cayenne pepper, and salt together in a roasting dish. Add chicken; turn until well coated with mixture.\r\n\r\nBake in the preheated oven until an instant-read thermometer inserted into the thickest part of the thigh, near the bone, reads 165 degrees F (74 degrees C), about 1 hour 30 minutes.","z":"将烤箱预热至 350 华氏度（175 摄氏度）。\r\n\r\n将水、洋葱、橄榄油、香醋、第戎芥末、大蒜、黑胡椒、辣椒和盐放入烤盘中混合。添加鸡肉；转动直至充分涂上混合物。\r\n\r\n在预热的烤箱中烘烤，直到将即时读数温度计插入大腿最厚的部分（靠近骨头），读数为 165 华氏度（74 摄氏度），大约需要 1 小时 30 分钟。"},{"id":"53287","n":"Tajine de Poulet aux Carottes et Patates Douces (Chicken and Sweet Potato Tagine)","a":"Algerian","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/d8bfyg1764117503.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=thf-JDXoTVg","i":[["Onion","2 sliced"],["Celery","2 sliced"],["Cilantro","1/2 bag"],["Parsley","1/2 bag"],["Turmeric","1/2 tsp"],["Ground Cumin","1/2 tsp"],["Paprika","1/2 teaspoon"],["Ground Ginger","1/4 tsp"],["Cayenne Pepper","1/4 tsp"],["Salt","To taste"],["Black Pepper","To taste"],["Chicken Thighs","4"],["Olive Oil","Drizzle"],["Raisins","1/4 cup"],["Chicken Stock","1 cup"],["Sweet Potatoes","1 large"],["Carrots","3 sliced thinly"],["Prunes","1/4 cup"]],"s":"Combine onions, celery, cilantro, and parsley in a large pot. Stir in turmeric, cumin, paprika, ginger, cayenne pepper, salt, and pepper. Place chicken thighs on top. Drizzle olive oil over chicken. Cover and simmer over low heat until chicken is tender, about 40 minutes.\r\n\r\nPlace raisins in a small bowl and cover with hot water; let soak for 10 minutes. Drain.\r\n\r\nPreheat oven to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C).\r\n\r\nTransfer chicken mixture into an oven-safe tagine or casserole dish. Add sweet potato and carrots. Cover with lid or aluminum foil.\r\n\r\nBake in the preheated oven until sweet potato is soft, about 40 minutes. Add drained raisins and prunes. Continue baking, covered, until raisins and prunes are heated through, about 10 minutes.","z":"将洋葱、芹菜、香菜和欧芹放入一个大锅中。加入姜黄、孜然、辣椒粉、姜、辣椒、盐和胡椒。将鸡腿放在上面。将橄榄油淋在鸡肉上。盖上锅盖，小火煮约 40 分钟，直至鸡肉变软。\r\n\r\n将葡萄干放入小碗中，倒入热水；浸泡 10 分钟。流走。\r\n\r\n将烤箱预热至 400 华氏度（200 摄氏度）。\r\n\r\n将鸡肉混合物放入烤箱安全的塔吉锅或砂锅中。加入红薯和胡萝卜。盖上盖子或铝箔。\r\n\r\n在预热的烤箱中烘烤约40分钟，直至红薯变软。加入沥干的葡萄干和李子。继续烘烤，盖上盖子，直到葡萄干和李子被加热，大约需要 10 分钟。"},{"id":"53138","n":"Alfajores","a":"Argentina","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/a4kgf21763075288.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9WR40GHpsyo","i":[["All purpose flour","300g"],["Cornstarch","200g"],["Butter","200g"],["Sugar","100g"],["Egg Yolks","2"],["Lemon Zest","1 teaspoon"],["Dulce de leche",""],["Desiccated Coconut","Sprinkling"]],"s":"Make the Dough: Cream butter and sugar. Add egg yolks and lemon zest. Gradually mix in flour and cornstarch to form a dough. Chill for 1 hour.\r\nBake the Cookies: Roll out the dough, cut into circles, and bake at 180°C (350°F) for 12-15 minutes. Let cool.\r\nAssemble: Spread dulce de leche on one cookie, then sandwich with another. Roll the edges in coconut flakes.\r\nPro Tips:\r\n\r\nChill the dough before rolling it out to make it easier to handle and to prevent the cookies from spreading too much while baking.\r\nDip the alfajores in melted chocolate and let them set on a wire rack for an extra decadent treat.","z":"制作面团：奶油黄油和糖。加入蛋黄和柠檬皮碎。逐渐加入面粉和玉米淀粉，形成面团。冷却1小时。\r\n烘烤饼干：将面团擀开，切成圆形，然后在 180°C (350°F) 下烘烤 12-15 分钟。让其冷却。\r\n组装：将焦糖酱涂在一块饼干上，然后与另一块饼干夹在一起。将边缘卷入椰子片中。\r\n专业提示：\r\n\r\n在擀开之前先将面团冷却，这样更容易处理，并防止饼干在烘烤时铺得太多。\r\n将 alfajores 浸入融化的巧克力中，然后将它们放在金属架上，以获得额外的美味享受。"},{"id":"53133","n":"Asado","a":"Argentina","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/kgfh3q1763075438.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=q5f6Z6i1hQ8","i":[["Mixed Beef Cuts","2kg"],["Chorizo","4"],["Morcilla","2"],["Salt","To taste"]],"s":"Prepare the Fire: Start a wood fire in your grill and let it burn down to coals.\r\nSeason the Meat: Generously salt the beef cuts.\r\nGrill the Meat: Place the beef on the grill, starting with the thickest cuts farthest from the coals. Add chorizo and morcilla after the beef has been cooking for a while.\r\nCook to Perfection: Cook the meat, turning occasionally, until it reaches your desired doneness. Typically, ribs may take up to 2 hours; thinner cuts will cook faster.\r\nRest and Serve: Let the meat rest for about 10 minutes before slicing. Serve with chimichurri sauce and grilled vegetables.\r\nPro Tips:\r\n\r\nUse a mix of wood and charcoal for a consistent heat source. Wood adds flavor, while charcoal maintains temperature.\r\nSeason the meat just before grilling to ensure it retains its moisture and flavor.\r\nServing Suggestions:\r\n\r\nServe with a side of chimichurri sauce, a fresh tomato salad, and crusty bread. Pair with a robust Malbec wine to complement the rich flavors of the meat.","z":"准备火：在烤架上生火，让它燃烧成煤炭。\r\n给肉调味：在牛肉块上撒大量盐。\r\n烤肉：将牛​​肉放在烤架上，从距离煤最远的最厚的部位开始。牛肉煮一会儿后加入香肠和羊肠。\r\n煮至完美：煮肉，偶尔翻动，直到达到您想要的熟度。通常，排骨可能需要长达 2 小时；切得更薄会煮得更快。\r\n休息和食用：切片前让肉休息约 10 分钟。与 Chimichurri 酱和烤蔬菜一起食用。\r\n专业提示：\r\n\r\n使用木材和木炭的混合物来获得稳定的热源。木材增加风味，而木炭则保持温度。\r\n在烧烤前对肉进行调味，以确保其保留水分和风味。\r\n服务建议：\r\n\r\n搭配 Chimichurri 酱、新鲜番茄沙拉和硬皮面包。搭配浓郁的马尔贝克葡萄酒，以补充肉的浓郁风味。"},{"id":"53141","n":"Carbonada Criolla","a":"Argentina","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/8b2msz1763074897.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MSyvKDBXuKQ","i":[["Beef","500g"],["Onion","1 chopped"],["Carrots","2 chopped"],["Potatoes","2 chopped"],["Pumpkin","1 small"],["Dried Apricots","100g"],["Beef Stock","2 Litres"],["Salt","To taste"],["Pepper","To taste"]],"s":"Brown the Beef: In a large pot, brown the beef cubes. Remove and set aside.\r\nSauté Vegetables: In the same pot, cook the onion until translucent. Add carrots, potatoes, and pumpkin, cooking for a few minutes.\r\nSimmer: Return the beef to the pot. Add broth and dried apricots. Season with salt and pepper. Simmer for 1-2 hours, until the beef is tender.\r\nServe: Enjoy hot, with a crusty piece of bread.\r\nPro Tips:\r\n\r\nBrown the beef in batches to ensure it gets a good sear, which adds depth to the stew's flavor.\r\nAdding the fruits towards the end of cooking preserves their texture and adds a subtle sweetness to the dish.","z":"将牛肉煎成棕色：在一个大锅中，将牛肉块煎成棕色。取出并放在一边。\r\n炒蔬菜：在同一个锅中，将洋葱煮至半透明。加入胡萝卜、土豆和南瓜，煮几分钟。\r\n慢炖：将牛肉放回锅中。加入肉汤和杏干。用盐和胡椒调味。小火煮1-2小时，直至牛肉变软。\r\n食用：趁热搭配一块硬皮面包享用。\r\n专业提示：\r\n\r\n分批将牛肉煎至褐色，以确保其得到良好的烤焦效果，从而增加炖菜的味道。\r\n在烹饪结束时添加水果可以保留其质地，并为菜肴增添微妙的甜味。"},{"id":"53136","n":"Choripán","a":"Argentina","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/5i25sg1763075353.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FNrU5mQKFOE","i":[["Chorizo","4"],["Crusty Bread","4"],["Chimichurri sauce","Drizzle"]],"s":"Grill the Chorizos: Cook the chorizos on a grill or pan until fully cooked, about 10-15 minutes.\r\nPrepare the Rolls: Slice the rolls and toast them lightly on the grill or in a pan.\r\nAssemble: Slice each chorizo lengthwise and place in a roll. Top with a generous amount of chimichurri sauce.\r\nServe: Enjoy immediately while hot.\r\nPro Tips:\r\n\r\nGrill the chorizo slowly on medium heat to prevent the skin from bursting and to ensure it cooks evenly throughout.\r\nToast the bread on the grill to absorb some of the chorizo's flavors.","z":"烤香肠：将香肠放在烤架或平底锅上煮至完全煮熟，大约需要 10-15 分钟。\r\n准备面包卷：将面包卷切成薄片，然后在烤架上或平底锅中轻轻烘烤。\r\n组装：将每个香肠纵向切片并卷成一卷。上面撒上大量的奇米丘里酱。\r\n食用：趁热立即享用。\r\n专业提示：\r\n\r\n用中火慢慢地烤香肠，以防止皮破裂并确保整个过程均匀烹饪。\r\n在烤架上烤面包，以吸收香肠的一些味道。"},{"id":"53137","n":"Dulce de Leche","a":"Argentina","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/jyjlhj1763075323.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2J0ICGYsBL4","i":[["Milk","1 Litre"],["Sugar","300g"],["Baking Powder","1/4 tsp"],["Vanilla Extract","1 teaspoon"]],"s":"Combine Ingredients: In a large, heavy-bottomed pot, mix the milk, sugar, and baking soda. Cook over low heat, stirring constantly to prevent burning.\r\nThicken: Continue to cook, stirring frequently, until the mixture becomes thick and caramel-colored, about 1-2 hours.\r\nFlavor: Stir in the vanilla extract.\r\nCool: Let the dulce de leche cool, then transfer to a jar. It will thicken further as it cools.\r\nPro Tips:\r\n\r\nStir continuously and keep the heat low to prevent the milk from burning and sticking to the bottom of the pan.\r\nA drop of vanilla extract added at the end of cooking enhances the flavor.","z":"混合成分：在一个大的厚底锅中，混合牛奶、糖和小苏打。用小火煮，不断搅拌以防止烧焦。\r\n变稠：继续煮，经常搅拌，直到混合物变稠并呈焦糖色，大约需要 1-2 小时。\r\n味道：加入香草精搅拌。\r\n冷却：让牛奶汁冷却，然后转移到罐子中。当它冷却时，它会进一步变稠。\r\n专业提示：\r\n\r\n不断搅拌并保持低火，以防止牛奶烧焦并粘在锅底。\r\n烹饪结束时添加一滴香草精可增强风味。"},{"id":"53134","n":"Empanadas","a":"Argentina","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/q99te31763075494.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RRNVLC6IAv4","i":[["All purpose flour","500g"],["Butter","200g"],["Water","120ml"],["Salt","1 tsp"],["Ground Beef","500g"],["Onion","2 chopped"],["Egg","4 Chopped"],["Green Olives","100g"],["Cumin","1 teaspoon"],["Paprika","1 teaspoon"],["Salt","To taste"],["Pepper","To taste"]],"s":"Make the Dough: Mix flour and salt in a large bowl. Add butter, using your fingers to blend into a crumbly texture. Gradually add water, mixing until a dough forms. Wrap and chill for 30 minutes.\r\nPrepare the Filling: Cook onions in a pan until translucent. Add ground beef, cooking until browned. Stir in spices, then remove from heat. Once cooled, mix in eggs and olives.\r\nAssemble: Roll out the dough and cut into circles. Place a spoonful of filling in each, fold over, and seal the edges.\r\nCook: Bake at 200°C (400°F) for 20-25 minutes, or until golden.\r\nPro Tips:\r\n\r\nFor a flakier crust, incorporate a tablespoon of vinegar into the dough mixture. This helps prevent gluten formation.\r\nSeal the edges of the empanadas with a fork to ensure they do not open during baking or frying.","z":"制作面团：在一个大碗中混合面粉和盐。添加黄油，用手指搅拌成易碎的质地。逐渐加水，搅拌直至形成面团。包裹并冷藏 30 分钟。\r\n准备馅料：将洋葱放入锅中煮至半透明。加入碎牛肉，煮至棕色。加入香料搅拌，然后离火。冷却后，加入鸡蛋和橄榄。\r\n组装：将面团擀开并切成圆形。每一个都放一勺馅料，折叠起来，密封边缘。\r\n烹饪：在 200°C (400°F) 下烘烤 20-25 分钟，或直至呈金黄色。\r\n专业提示：\r\n\r\n为了获得更脆的外皮，可在面团混合物中加入一汤匙醋。这有助于防止麸质的形成。\r\n用叉子密封肉馅卷饼的边缘，以确保它们在烘烤或煎炸过程中不会打开。"},{"id":"53139","n":"Fainá","a":"Argentina","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/849jd81763075251.jpg","y":"","i":[["Chickpea Flour","200g"],["Water","600ml"],["Olive Oil","4 tablespoons"],["Salt","To taste"],["Pepper","To taste"]],"s":"Prepare the Batter: Whisk together chickpea flour, water, salt, and pepper. Let sit for at least 4 hours.\r\nBake: Preheat the oven to 220°C (430°F). Pour olive oil into a round baking dish and heat in the oven. Pour in the batter and bake for 25-30 minutes, until golden.\r\nServe: Slice and serve hot, optionally with black pepper on top.\r\nPro Tips:\r\n\r\nLet the batter rest for at least 2 hours, or overnight in the refrigerator, to ensure the chickpea flour fully hydrates and the flavors meld.\r\nFor a crispy edge, preheat the baking pan with oil in the oven before adding the batter.","z":"准备面糊：将鹰嘴豆粉、水、盐和胡椒搅拌在一起。静置至少 4 小时。\r\n烘烤：将烤箱预热至 220°C (430°F)。将橄榄油倒入圆形烤盘中，然后在烤箱中加热。倒入面糊，烘烤25-30分钟，直至呈金黄色。\r\n食用：切片并趁热食用，可以选择在上面撒上黑胡椒。\r\n专业提示：\r\n\r\n让面糊静置至少 2 小时，或在冰箱中放置过夜，以确保鹰嘴豆粉充分水合且风味融合。\r\n为了获得酥脆的边缘，请在加入面糊之前在烤箱中用油预热烤盘。"},{"id":"53146","n":"Locro","a":"Argentina","c":"Miscellaneous","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/5sgsob1763196284.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vX0KYKAkBTU","i":[["Dried white corn","500g"],["Dried white beans","200g"],["Pumpkin","300g"],["Potatoes","200g"],["Beef","300g"],["Pork","200g"],["Chorizo","1"],["Onion","1 chopped"],["Paprika","1 teaspoon"],["Salt","To taste"],["Pepper","To taste"]],"s":"Soak: Soak corn and beans overnight in water.\r\nCook Meats: In a large pot, brown the beef and pork. Add onions and spices, cooking until translucent.\r\nSimmer the Stew: Add soaked corn and beans, pumpkin, potato, and enough water to cover. Simmer for 2-3 hours, until thick.\r\nServe: Enjoy hot, with bread on the side.\r\nPro Tips:\r\n\r\nToasting the corn slightly before adding it to the stew enhances its flavor.\r\nAdd a spoonful of paprika or a dash of cumin for an extra layer of warmth and complexity","z":"浸泡：将玉米和豆类在水中浸泡过夜。\r\n煮肉：在一个大锅中，将牛肉和猪肉煎至棕色。加入洋葱和香料，煮至半透明。\r\n慢炖：加入浸泡过的玉米和豆类、南瓜、土豆和足够的水覆盖。煮2-3小时，直至浓稠。\r\n食用：趁热享用，配上面包。\r\n专业提示：\r\n\r\n在将玉米加入炖菜之前稍微烘烤一下可以增强其风味。\r\n添加一勺辣椒粉或少许小茴香，以增加一层温暖和复杂性"},{"id":"53140","n":"Matambre a la Pizza","a":"Argentina","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/wf49qs1763075222.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=X5UxDaNHD30","i":[["Beef Flank Steak","1 kg"],["Tomato Sauce","200g"],["Mozzarella","200g"],["Oregano","1 tbsp"],["Green Olives","100g"],["Salt","To taste"],["Pepper","To taste"]],"s":"Prepare the Steak: Season the steak with salt and pepper. Grill one side until half-cooked.\r\nAdd Toppings: Spread tomato sauce over the cooked side, then add cheese, oregano, and olives.\r\nFinish Grilling: Grill until the cheese is melted and bubbly.\r\nServe: Slice and serve hot.\r\nPro Tips:\r\n\r\nTenderize the matambre by scoring it lightly on both sides. This helps it cook more evenly and absorb the flavors.\r\nPrecook the matambre on the grill before adding the toppings to ensure it's fully cooked without burning the cheese.","z":"准备牛排：用盐和胡椒给牛排调味。将一侧烤至半熟。\r\n添加配料：将番茄酱涂在煮熟的面上，然后添加奶酪、牛至和橄榄。\r\n完成烧烤：烧烤直至奶酪融化并起泡。\r\n食用：切片并趁热食用。\r\n专业提示：\r\n\r\n通过在两侧轻轻刻划来使马坦布尔变软。这有助于烹饪更均匀并吸收味道。\r\n在添加配料之前，在烤架上预煮马坦布尔，以确保其完全煮熟而不会烧焦奶酪。"},{"id":"53135","n":"Milanesa","a":"Argentina","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/wdfa171763065079.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_G3cyucbB3o","i":[["Beef Cutlet","4"],["Egg","2 Beaten"],["Breadcrumbs","200g"],["Parsley","2 tbs chopped"],["Garlic","2 cloves minced"],["Salt","To taste"],["Pepper","To taste"]],"s":"Season the Cutlets: Salt and pepper the cutlets.\r\nBread the Cutlets: Dip each cutlet in egg, then coat with a mixture of breadcrumbs, parsley, and garlic.\r\nFry: Heat oil in a large pan over medium heat. Fry the cutlets until golden and cooked through, about 3-4 minutes per side.\r\nServe: Serve hot with lemon wedges or a side salad.\r\nPro Tips:\r\n\r\nFor an extra crispy crust, use panko breadcrumbs mixed with finely grated Parmesan cheese.\r\nGently pound the cutlets to an even thickness for uniform cooking.","z":"给肉排调味：在肉排上加盐和胡椒粉。\r\n将肉排裹上面包屑：将每块肉排浸入鸡蛋中，然后涂上面包屑、欧芹和大蒜的混合物。\r\n煎炸：在大平底锅中用中火加热油。将肉片煎至金黄色并煮熟，每面约 3-4 分钟。\r\n食用：与柠檬角或配菜沙拉一起趁热食用。\r\n专业提示：\r\n\r\n为了获得额外的酥脆外皮，请使用panko面包屑与磨碎的帕尔马干酪混合。\r\n轻轻地将肉排捣成均匀的厚度，以便均匀烹饪。"},{"id":"53111","n":"Anzac biscuits","a":"Australian","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/q47rkb1762324620.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1nAVbfQVWRQ","i":[["Porridge oats","85g"],["Desiccated Coconut","85g"],["Plain Flour","100g"],["Caster Sugar","100g"],["Butter","100g"],["Golden Syrup","1 tblsp"],["Bicarbonate Of Soda","1 teaspoon"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4. Put the oats, coconut, flour and sugar in a bowl. Melt the butter in a small pan and stir in the golden syrup. Add the bicarbonate of soda to 2 tbsp boiling water, then stir into the golden syrup and butter mixture.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nMake a well in the middle of the dry ingredients and pour in the butter and golden syrup mixture. Stir gently to incorporate the dry ingredients.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nPut dessertspoonfuls of the mixture on to buttered baking sheets, about 2.5cm/1in apart to allow room for spreading. Bake in batches for 8-10 mins until golden. Transfer to a wire rack to cool.","z":"步骤1\r\n将烤箱加热至 180C/风扇 160C/煤气 4. 将燕麦、椰子、面粉和糖放入碗中。在小锅中融化黄油，加入金色糖浆搅拌。将小苏打加入 2 汤匙沸水中，然后搅拌至金色糖浆和黄油混合物中。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n在干原料中间挖一个洞，倒入黄油和金色糖浆混合物。轻轻搅拌以加入干成分。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n将一勺混合物放在涂有黄油的烤盘上，间隔约 2.5 厘米/1 英寸，以便有空间铺展。分批烘烤 8-10 分钟直至呈金黄色。转移到金属架上冷却。"},{"id":"53099","n":"Aussie Burgers","a":"Australian","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/44bzep1761848278.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pSupybydA_U","i":[["Lean Minced Steak","500g"],["Cooked Beetroot","100g"],["Naan Bread","2 small"],["Rocket","50g"],["Soured cream and chive dip","4 tablespoons"]],"s":"step 1\r\nMake the burgers: Tip the meat into a bowl and sprinkle over 1 tsp salt and a good grinding of black pepper.Work with wet hands to mix in the seasoning. Divide into four with your hands and shape into burgers. (It can be frozen at this stage.)\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nSort out your ingredients: Slice the beetroot and split the naan breads.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nToast the naans: Heat a griddle pan or barbecue. Griddle the naans on both sides until lightly toasted and set aside. Add the burgers to the grill or barbecue and cook for 2-3 minutes, then turn and cook the other side for a further 2-3 minutes.\r\n\r\nstep 4\r\nAssemble the dish: Set half a toasted naan on each serving plate and put a pile of rocket on each. Top with a burger, then a few slices of beetroot and a dollop of soured cream. Sprinkle with salt and freshly ground black pepper and serve immediately with a big green salad and chips. A glass of red wine wouldn’t go amiss, either.","z":"步骤1\r\n制作汉堡：将肉放入碗中，撒上 1 茶匙盐和磨碎的黑胡椒。用湿手混合调味料。用手分成四份，做成汉堡。 （此阶段可以冻结。）\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n整理好你的食材：将甜菜根切片，将馕面包切开。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n烤馕饼：加热平底锅或烤肉架。将馕饼两面煎至稍微烤熟，放在一边。将汉堡放入烤架或烧烤炉上，煮 2-3 分钟，然后翻转另一面，再煮 2-3 分钟。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n组装菜肴：在每个盘子上放半个烤馕饼，并在每个盘子上放一堆火箭。上面放一个汉堡，然后放几片甜菜根和一块酸奶油。撒上盐和现磨的黑胡椒，立即搭配大份蔬菜沙拉和薯条。一杯红酒也不会出错。"},{"id":"53107","n":"Avocado dip with new potatoes","a":"Australian","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/flrajf1762341295.jpg","y":"","i":[["Avocado","3 Large"],["Natural Yoghurt","200g"],["Lime","Zest and juice of 1"],["Lemon","Juice of 1/2"],["Baby New Potatoes","1.25kg"],["Olive Oil","2 tablespoons"],["Hot Chilli Powder","1 teaspoon"],["Cumin Seeds","1 teaspoon"],["Tortillas","200g"]],"s":"step 1\r\nWhizz half the avocado flesh with the yogurt, lime and lemon juice and seasoning. Dice the remaining avocado, then gently stir into the whizzed mix with most of the lime zest. Cover, then chill until ready to serve.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nBoil potatoes for 6 mins, then drain well and toss with olive oil, chilli powder and cumin seeds. Now set aside until half an hour before your guests arrive.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nHeat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6, then roast potatoes for about 30 mins, shaking the tray halfway, until golden and tender. Transfer the dip to one or two bowls, scatter with the remaining lime zest and serve with the hot potatoes, and tortilla chips for dipping.","z":"步骤1\r\n将一半牛油果果肉与酸奶、酸橙、柠檬汁和调味料一起搅拌。将剩余的鳄梨切成丁，然后轻轻搅拌到与大部分酸橙皮碎混合的混合物中。盖上盖子，然后冷却直至可以食用。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将土豆煮 6 分钟，然后沥干，加入橄榄油、辣椒粉和孜然籽。现在留到客人到达前半小时。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n将烤箱加热至 200C/180C 风扇/煤气 6，然后烤土豆约 30 分钟，中间晃动托盘，直至土豆金黄变软。将酱汁转移到一两个碗中，撒上剩余的酸橙皮碎，与热土豆和玉米片一起食用。"},{"id":"53103","n":"Barramundi with Moroccan spices","a":"Australian","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/4o4wh11761848573.jpg","y":"","i":[["barramundi","2 x 400g"],["Ground Cumin","1/2 teaspoon"],["Coriander","1/2 tsp"],["Paprika","Pinch"],["Chili Powder","Pinch"],["Garlic Clove","2"],["Lemon","Juice of 1"],["Olive Oil","5 tablespoons"],["Coriander","Bunch"]],"s":"step 1\r\nTip all the dressing ingredients into a food processor with a pinch of salt and blitz to a dressing. Slash the fish three times on each side, coat with half of the dressing, then set aside to marinate for about 30 mins.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nHeat oven to 220C/fan 200C/gas 7. Place the fish on a roasting tray, then cook in the oven for 20 mins until the flesh is firm and the eyes have turned white. Serve the fish with the rest of the dressing and steamed couscous or rice.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nKNOW HOW: HOW TO COOK IT: Cooking barramundi on the bone, as we have done here, has its advantages – it will stay more moist during cooking, and some would say that the flavour is enhanced, too. If you want to take out the bones they are easy to locate and less likely to be lodged in the fillet if the fish is cooked whole. Fillets can be simply pan-fried or grilled. If you like trout, you will really enjoy the flavour of barramundi, which lends itself to similar ingredients and cooking methods – citrus flavours are particularly good, as are garlic and wild mushrooms. Simply roasting the fish with some fresh herbs, olive oil and seasoning is delicious, and in the summer months you could barbecue it, too. One thing that you mustn’t miss are the cheeks or ‘pearls’ of the fish, these are simply lovely, moist and really sweet – well worth leaving the head on for!","z":"步骤1\r\n将所有调料配料倒入食品加工机中，加入少许盐，然后快速搅拌成调料。将鱼每面划三刀，涂上一半的调料，然后腌制约30分钟。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将烤箱加热至 220C/风扇 200C/煤气 7. 将鱼放在烤盘上，然后在烤箱中煮 20 分钟，直至鱼肉变硬且鱼眼变白。将鱼与其余的调料和蒸粗麦粉或米饭一起食用。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n知道如何：如何烹饪：像我们在这里所做的那样，在骨头上烹饪尖吻鲈有其优点 - 在烹饪过程中它会保持更加湿润，有些人会说味道也会增强。如果您想取出骨头，很容易找到它们，并且如果将鱼整条煮熟，它们就不太可能卡在鱼片中。鱼片可以简单地煎或烤。如果您喜欢鳟鱼，您一定会喜欢澳洲肺鱼的味道，它们的原料和烹饪方法都很相似——柑橘味特别好，大蒜和野生蘑菇也一样。只需用一些新鲜香草、橄榄油和调味料烤鱼就很美味，在夏季，您也可以烧烤。你绝对不能错过的一件事是鱼的脸颊或“珍珠”，它们非常可爱、湿润而且非常甜——非常值得一试！"},{"id":"53100","n":"Blueberry & lemon friands","a":"Australian","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/e756bf1761848342.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7tq5JvO88E0","i":[["Unsalted Butter","100g"],["Icing Sugar","125g"],["Flour","25g"],["Almonds","85g"],["Egg White","3"],["Unwaxed Lemon","1"],["Blackberries","85g"]],"s":"step 1\r\nPreheat the oven to fan 180C/conventional 200C/gas 6. Generously butter six non-stick friand or muffin tins. Melt the butter and set aside to cool.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nSift the icing sugar and flour into a bowl. Add the almonds and mix everything between your fingers.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nWhisk the egg whites in another bowl until they form a light, floppy foam. Make a well in the centre of the dry ingredients, tip in the egg whites and lemon rind, then lightly stir in the butter to form a soft batter.\r\n\r\nstep 4\r\nDivide the batter among the tins, a large serving spoon is perfect for this job. Sprinkle a handful of blueberries over each cake and bake for 15-20 minutes until just firm to the touch and golden brown.\r\n\r\nstep 5\r\nCool in the tins for 5 minutes, then turn out and cool on a wire rack. To serve, dust lightly with icing sugar.","z":"步骤1\r\n将烤箱预热至 180C/传统 200C/燃气 6. 在六个不粘油炸食品或松饼罐上涂上大量黄油。将黄油融化并放在一边冷却。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将糖粉和面粉筛入碗中。添加杏仁并用手指混合所有东西。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n在另一个碗中搅拌蛋白，直至形成轻柔的泡沫。在干原料的中心挖一个洞，倒入蛋清和柠檬皮，然后轻轻搅拌黄油，形成柔软的面糊。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n将面糊分装在罐子中，大勺子非常适合这项工作。在每个蛋糕上撒上一把蓝莓，烘烤 15-20 分钟，直至触感坚硬并呈金黄色。\r\n\r\n步骤5\r\n在罐中冷却 5 分钟，然后取出并放在金属架上冷却。食用时，撒上少许糖粉。"},{"id":"53101","n":"Chocolate Coconut Squares","a":"Australian","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/8oupz51761848432.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8TzqUo8PCLg","i":[["Butter","100g"],["Caster Sugar","100g"],["Egg","2"],["Self-raising Flour","140g"],["Baking Powder","1 teaspoon"],["Cocoa Powder","2 tablespoons"],["Milk","2 tablespoons"],["Plain Chocolate","100g"],["Butter","25g"],["Icing Sugar","100g"],["Desiccated Coconut","100g"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4. Butter and line the base of a 20cm square baking tin. Beat together the butter and sugar until pale and creamy, then beat in the eggs. Add 1 tbsp of the flour if the mix starts to curdle.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nSieve in the flour, baking powder and cocoa and fold in with a metal spoon. Stir in the milk. Scrape mix into the tin and level the top. Bake for 18-20 mins or until the cake springs back when pressed. Allow to cool in the tin.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nTo make the icing, put the chocolate, butter and 4 tbsp water in a pan and gently heat until melted. Allow to cool slightly, then beat in the icing sugar.\r\n\r\nstep 4\r\nRemove cake from tin and peel away paper. Cut into 16 squares. Dip the squares into the icing, then roll in the coconut. Allow to set on cooling rack.","z":"步骤1\r\n将烤箱加热至 180C/风扇 160C/煤气 4. 在 20 厘米见方的烤盘底部涂上黄油并铺上衬里。将黄油和糖一起搅拌直至呈奶油状，然后加入鸡蛋。如果混合物开始凝结，则添加 1 汤匙面粉。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n筛入面粉、泡打粉和可可粉，用金属勺拌匀。加入牛奶搅拌。将混合物刮入罐中并平整顶部。烘烤 18-20 分钟或直至蛋糕受压时弹回。让其在罐中冷却。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n为了制作糖霜，将巧克力、黄油和 4 汤匙水放入锅中，轻轻加热直至融化。稍微冷却，然后加入糖粉。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n从罐子中取出蛋糕并剥去纸。切成16个正方形。将方块浸入糖霜中，然后滚入椰子中。允许放置在冷却架上。"},{"id":"53104","n":"Lamingtons","a":"Australian","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/j2n7vg1761848636.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CbHWqzw4Qxg","i":[["Salted Butter","125g"],["Golden Caster Sugar","250g"],["Egg","3 Large"],["Self-raising Flour","250g"],["Milk","3  tablespoons"],["Salt","1/2 teaspoon"],["Double Cream","250ml"],["Icing Sugar","2 tblsp"],["Raspberry Jam","200g"],["Desiccated Coconut","350g"],["Unsalted Butter","80g"],["Milk","250ml"],["Cocoa Powder","50g"],["Icing Sugar","400g"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Butter and line a 20 x 30cm rectangle tin.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nBeat the butter and sugar in a free-standing mixer until pale and fluffy. Add the eggs one at a time and beat well. Beat through the flour, milk and salt until fully combined, then spoon into the tin. Bake in the oven for 25 mins or until golden and firm to the touch. Set aside to cool completely.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nSlice the sponge horizontally to create two halves. Trim the edges to make perfect corners. Cut the sponge into 18 squares. Lightly whip the cream with the icing sugar until it reaches soft peaks. Spread a little of the jam on half of the sponge squares then pipe or spread over a little of the cream. Sandwich each one with a second square of sponge then set aside in the fridge to chill.\r\n\r\nstep 4\r\nTo make the icing, whisk together the melted butter and milk in a bowl. Sieve the cocoa powder and icing sugar together in a seperate bowl. Gradually add the cocoa and sugar to the butter and milk mixture, whisking continuously to ensure there are no lumps. If it gets lumpy, whizz with a hand blender until smooth.\r\n\r\nstep 5\r\nDivide the coconut between three shallow bowls (this keeps it from getting coated in too much chocolate whilst you’re dipping).\r\n\r\nstep 6\r\nDip each lamington in the icing until completely covered. Roll in the coconut and set on a wire rack. Repeat with the remaining sponges. Chill for a minimum of 1 hr.","z":"步骤1\r\n将烤箱加热至 200C/180C 风扇/燃气 6. 在 20 x 30cm 矩形罐中涂上黄油并铺上衬里。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n在独立式搅拌机中搅拌黄油和糖，直至颜色变浅且蓬松。一次加入一个鸡蛋并搅拌均匀。将面粉、牛奶和盐搅拌至完全混合，然后用勺子倒入罐中。在烤箱中烘烤 25 分钟或直至呈金黄色且触感坚硬。放在一边使其完全冷却。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n将海绵水平切成两半。修剪边缘以形成完美的角。将海绵切成18块正方形。用糖粉轻轻搅打奶油，直至达到软峰。将一点果酱涂在一半的海绵方块上，然后挤在或涂在一点奶油上。用第二块海绵将每个夹在中间，然后放在冰箱中冷藏。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n为了制作糖霜，将融化的黄油和牛奶放入碗中搅拌。将可可粉和糖粉一起筛入另一个碗中。逐渐将可可和糖加入黄油和牛奶混合物中，不断搅拌以确保没有结块。如果它变得结块，用手持式搅拌机搅拌直至光滑。\r\n\r\n步骤5\r\n将椰子分成三个浅碗（这样可以防止在浸泡时沾上太多巧克力）。\r\n\r\n步骤6\r\n将每个拉明顿浸入糖霜中，直至完全覆盖。将椰子卷起来，放在金属架上。对剩余的海绵重复上述步骤。冷却至少 1 小时。"},{"id":"53109","n":"Mini chilli beef pies","a":"Australian","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/6sarfo1762340107.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PHuU1L92-Ns","i":[["Ready rolled shortcrust pastry","450g"],["Sunflower Oil","1 tablespoon"],["Onion","1 small"],["Hot Chilli Powder","2 tsp"],["Ground Cumin","2 tsp"],["Minced Beef","250g"],["Tomato Puree","85g"],["Beef Stock","150ml"],["Ground Cinnamon","Pinch"],["Kidney Beans","200g"],["Potatoes","1 large"],["Sour Cream","3  tablespoons"],["Chopped Chive","2 tablespoons"]],"s":"step 1\r\nTo make chilli, heat oil in a pan and fry onion for 5 mins until soft. Add spices; fry for 1 min. Stir in beef and cook for a few mins. Add tomato purée, stock and cinnamon. Give it a stir, bring to the boil, then simmer for 15-20 mins until very little liquid is left. Add beans 5 mins before the end of cooking. Check seasoning and cool.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nHeat oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6. Using a 7cm pastry cutter, stamp out 12 circles from the pastry. Use to line a 12-hole mini muffin tray, prick the base of the pastry with a fork, and bake for 10 mins. Remove from oven and cool on a wire tray. Repeat with remaining pastry.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nMeanwhile, cook the potato in boiling water until tender. Drain, mash with soured cream and seasoning, then stir through chives. Spoon 1-2 tsp of chilli mix into the pastry cases and top with a tsp of mash. Ruffle mash with a fork; return to the oven for 15 mins or until golden.","z":"步骤1\r\n制作辣椒时，在锅中加热油，将洋葱炒 5 分钟直至变软。添加香料；煎1分钟。拌入牛肉，煮几分钟。加入番茄泥、高汤和肉桂。搅拌，煮沸，然后小火煮 15-20 分钟，直到只剩下很少的液体。在烹饪结束前 5 分钟添加豆子。检查调味料并冷却。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将烤箱加热至 200C/风扇 180C/煤气 6. 使用 7 厘米糕点刀，从糕点上切出 12 个圆圈。将其放在 12 孔迷你松饼托盘上，用叉子在糕点底部扎孔，然后烘烤 10 分钟。从烤箱中取出并放在金属丝托盘上冷却。对剩余的糕点重复上述步骤。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n与此同时，将土豆放入沸水中煮至变软。沥干水分，与酸奶油和调味料一起捣碎，然后拌入细香葱。将 1-2 茶匙辣椒混合物倒入糕点盒中，并在上面放上一茶匙土豆泥。用叉子将土豆泥弄皱；返回烤箱 15 分钟或直至呈金黄色。"},{"id":"53108","n":"Quick salt & pepper squid","a":"Australian","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/cp74zo1762341241.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CxHTj_6sU_A","i":[["Squid","400g"],["Oil","3  tablespoons"],["Chinese five spice powder","1/2 teaspoon"],["Sesame Seed Oil","Dash"],["Coriander","Sprigs of fresh"],["sweet chilli sauce","Drizzle"]],"s":"step 1\r\nAsk the fishmonger to clean the squid; little ones often come ready-cleaned. Using kitchen scissors, cut open the body and open out. Wash well, then pat dry. If you have a large squid, cut the body into four portions, roughly square. Small squid can just be opened up.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nUsing the tip of a very sharp knife, score the top in a neat criss-cross. Brush with oil and set aside while you heat the barbecue or griddle until ready to cook.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nMix together 2 tsp sea salt, Chinese five-spice and 1 tsp freshly ground black pepper. Sprinkle on both sides of the squid just before cooking, according to taste. You may not need it all. Heat the griddle pan to hot and cook about 1 min each side, until it starts to curl. Remove with tongs to a serving plate and drizzle with a little sesame oil. To serve, garnish with coriander leaves and serve with small bowls of sweet chilli sauce to dip into.","z":"步骤1\r\n请鱼贩把鱿鱼清洗干净；小孩子通常都已经清洗干净了。使用厨房剪刀，剪开主体并打开。洗净，然后拍干。如果您有大鱿鱼，请将鱿鱼体切成四部分，大致呈方形。小鱿鱼可以直接打开。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n用一把非常锋利的刀尖，在顶部划出整齐的十字形。刷上油，放在一边加热烧烤架或煎锅，直到准备好烹饪。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n将2茶匙海盐、五香和1茶匙现磨黑胡椒混合在一起。根据口味，在烹饪前撒在鱿鱼的两面。您可能不需要这一切。将平底锅加热至热，每面煎约 1 分钟，直至开始卷曲。用钳子夹到盘子里，淋上少许芝麻油。食用时，用香菜叶装饰，并配上小碗甜辣酱。"},{"id":"53105","n":"Spiced smoky barbecued chicken","a":"Australian","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/a08uqk1761848682.jpg","y":"","i":[["Garlic","2 cloves"],["Lemon","Juice/zest of one"],["Curry Powder","2 tblsp"],["Chilli Flakes","Pinch"],["Olive Oil","3  tablespoons"],["Chicken Thighs","12"],["Rosemary","Bunch"],["Rosemary","Bunch"],["Thyme","Bunch"],["Thyme","Bunch"],["Bay Leaves","2"]],"s":"step 1\r\nMake the marinade. Smash the garlic with a little salt using a pestle and mortar. Add the lemon zest and juice, the spice mix, chilli, oil and a good grinding of black pepper. Mix to a paste. This can be done in a mini food processor.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nToss the chicken in the marinade and set aside while you light the barbecue. When the barbecue’s hot, lay the bunches of herbs on the grid and put the chicken, skin side up, on top. Close the lid, if your barbecue has one, and cook the chicken on the smouldering herbs for about 10 minutes until the meat starts to colour. Turn the chicken and continue to cook for a further 20-30 minutes, turning as necessary, until it is slightly charred from the burnt herbs and cooked through to the bone.","z":"步骤1\r\n做腌料。用杵和研钵将大蒜和少许盐捣碎。加入柠檬皮碎和柠檬汁、混合香料、辣椒、油和磨碎的黑胡椒。混合成糊状。这可以在迷你食品加工机中完成。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将鸡肉放入腌料中，放在一边，然后点燃烧烤。当烧烤热时，将香草束放在烤架上，然后将鸡肉（带皮的一面朝上）放在上面。如果您的烧烤炉有盖子，请盖上盖子，然后将鸡肉放在闷烧的香草上煮约 10 分钟，直到肉开始变色。将鸡肉翻面，继续煮 20-30 分钟，必要时翻面，直到鸡肉被烧焦的香草稍微烧焦，并煮熟到骨头。"},{"id":"53102","n":"Squid, chickpea & chorizo salad","a":"Australian","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/wsu0rc1761848482.jpg","y":"https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/squid-chickpea-chorizo-salad","i":[["Red Pepper","4"],["Can of chickpeas","2 400g Cans"],["Parsley","Bunch"],["Red Chilli","1"],["Garlic Clove","2"],["Olive Oil","100 ml"],["Squid","600g"],["Chorizo","200g"],["Lemon","Juice/zest of one"]],"s":"step 1\r\nCook the peppers whole under a grill, on a barbecue or griddle, until completely charred. Place the peppers in a bowl, cover with a plate until cool enough to handle, then peel, deseed and finely slice. In a large bowl mix the peppers and any juices with the chickpeas, parsley, chilli and garlic. Set aside.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nHeat a large frying pan until smoking. Working quickly and carefully, add a splash of oil to the pan, then the squid. Stir-fry for about 30 secs. Scatter the chorizo over the squid, continue to cook for 30 secs more, then tip into the bowl with the peppers. Season everything with salt and pepper, then dress with the remaining oil, lemon juice and lemon zest. Mix together, pile onto a platter and let everyone help themselves.","z":"步骤1\r\n将整个辣椒放在烤架、烤架或煎锅上烹制，直至完全烧焦。将辣椒放入碗中，盖上盘子，直至冷却到可以处理，然后去皮、去籽并切成薄片。在一个大碗中，将辣椒和任何果汁与鹰嘴豆、欧芹、辣椒和大蒜混合。放在一边。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n加热大煎锅直至冒烟。快速而小心地工作，在锅中加入少许油，然后加入鱿鱼。炒约30秒。将香肠撒在鱿鱼上，继续煮 30 秒，然后与辣椒一起倒入碗中。用盐和胡椒调味，然后用剩余的油、柠檬汁和柠檬皮调味。混合在一起，堆放在盘子上，让每个人自助。"},{"id":"53110","n":"Sticky Chicken","a":"Australian","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/cj56fs1762340001.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=o8tz2BOltTg","i":[["Chicken drumsticks","8"],["Soy Sauce","2 tblsp"],["Honey","1 tablespoon"],["Olive Oil","1 tblsp"],["Tomato Puree","1 teaspoon"],["Dijon Mustard","1 tbsp"]],"s":"step 1\r\nMake 3 slashes on each of the drumsticks. Mix together the soy, honey, oil, tomato purée and mustard. Pour this mixture over the chicken and coat thoroughly. Leave to marinate for 30 mins at room temperature or overnight in the fridge. Heat oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nTip the chicken into a shallow roasting tray and cook for 35 mins, turning occasionally, until the chicken is tender and glistening with the marinade.","z":"步骤1\r\n在每个鸡腿上划 3 道斜线。将大豆、蜂蜜、油、番茄泥和芥末混合在一起。将这种混合物倒在鸡肉上并彻底涂抹。在室温下腌制 30 分钟或在冰箱中腌制过夜。将烤箱加热至 200C/风扇 180C/燃气 6.\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将鸡肉放入浅烤盘中，煮 35 分钟，偶尔翻动，直到鸡肉变软，并因腌料而闪闪发光。"},{"id":"53106","n":"Warm roast asparagus salad","a":"Australian","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/ktsws11761998344.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pR_ZfbTxwms","i":[["Asparagus","500g"],["Red Wine Vinegar","2 tbsp"],["Tomato","4"],["Extra Virgin Olive Oil","1 tbsp"],["Streaky Bacon","12"],["Clear Honey","1 teaspoon"],["Jersey Royal Potatoes","16"],["Extra Virgin Olive Oil","2 tblsp"],["Dijon Mustard","1 teaspoon"],["Rocket","100g"]],"s":"step 1\r\nPreheat the oven to 200C/Gas 6/fan 180C. Snap off the woody ends of the asparagus and discard. Arrange the asparagus in a single layer in a baking tray with sides. Cut the tomatoes in half widthways, nestle them in with the asparagus, season with sea salt and pepper and drizzle with olive oil. Roll each bacon rasher into a tight roll (if large, first cut in half crosswise), and arrange in the tray. Drizzle the bacon rolls with the honey and bake for 20 minutes until the tomatoes are soft and the bacon is crisp.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nIn the meantime, boil the potatoes until tender. Whisk the vinegar, olive oil, mustard, some sea salt and pepper in a large bowl until blended. Toss the rocket or spinach leaves in half of the dressing, and arrange on a large serving platter.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nDrain the potatoes and cut in half. Gently toss them in the rest of the dressing, and arrange on the platter with the asparagus. Tuck in the tomatoes and bacon.","z":"步骤1\r\n将烤箱预热至 200C/燃气 6/风扇 180C。折断芦笋的木质末端并丢弃。将芦笋单层放入有侧面的烤盘中。将西红柿横向切成两半，将它们与芦笋放在一起，用海盐和胡椒调味，淋上橄榄油。将每个培根皮卷成紧密的卷（如果大，首先横向切成两半），然后放在托盘中。在培根卷上淋上蜂蜜，烘烤 20 分钟，直至西红柿变软、培根变脆。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n与此同时，将土豆煮至变软。将醋、橄榄油、芥末、一些海盐和胡椒粉放入一个大碗中，搅拌直至混合。将芝麻菜或菠菜叶放入一半的调料中，然后放在一个大盘子上。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n将土豆沥干，切成两半。轻轻地将它们放入其余的调料中，然后与芦笋一起放在盘子上。塞入西红柿和培根。"},{"id":"52893","n":"Apple & Blackberry Crumble","a":"British","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/xvsurr1511719182.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4vhcOwVBDO4","i":[["Plain Flour","120g"],["Caster Sugar","60g"],["Butter","60g"],["Braeburn Apples","300g"],["Butter","30g"],["Demerara Sugar","30g"],["Blackberries","120g"],["Cinnamon","¼ teaspoon"],["Ice Cream","to serve"]],"s":"Heat oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. Tip the flour and sugar into a large bowl. Add the butter, then rub into the flour using your fingertips to make a light breadcrumb texture. Do not overwork it or the crumble will become heavy. Sprinkle the mixture evenly over a baking sheet and bake for 15 mins or until lightly coloured.\r\nMeanwhile, for the compote, peel, core and cut the apples into 2cm dice. Put the butter and sugar in a medium saucepan and melt together over a medium heat. Cook for 3 mins until the mixture turns to a light caramel. Stir in the apples and cook for 3 mins. Add the blackberries and cinnamon, and cook for 3 mins more. Cover, remove from the heat, then leave for 2-3 mins to continue cooking in the warmth of the pan.\r\nTo serve, spoon the warm fruit into an ovenproof gratin dish, top with the crumble mix, then reheat in the oven for 5-10 mins. Serve with vanilla ice cream.","z":"将烤箱加热至 190C/170C 风扇/燃气 5. 将面粉和糖倒入一个大碗中。加入黄油，然后用指尖揉入面粉中，形成轻薄的面包屑质地。不要过度劳累，否则碎块会变得很重。将混合物均匀地撒在烤盘上，烘烤 15 分钟或直至颜色变浅。\r\n同时，制作蜜饯时，将苹果去皮、去核并切成 2 厘米的方块。将黄油和糖放入中型平底锅中，用中火融化。煮 3 分钟，直至混合物变成淡焦糖。拌入苹果，煮 3 分钟。加入黑莓和肉桂，再煮 3 分钟。盖上盖子，离火，然后在锅的温暖中继续煮 2-3 分钟。\r\n食用时，将温热的水果舀入耐热烤盘中，上面放上碎混合物，然后在烤箱中重新加热 5-10 分钟。与香草冰淇淋一起食用。"},{"id":"52768","n":"Apple Frangipan Tart","a":"British","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/wxywrq1468235067.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rp8Slv4INLk","i":[["digestive biscuits","175g/6oz"],["butter","75g/3oz"],["Bramley apples","200g/7oz"],["Salted Butter","75g/3oz"],["caster sugar","75g/3oz"],["free-range eggs, beaten","2"],["ground almonds","75g/3oz"],["almond extract","1 tsp"],["flaked almonds","50g/1¾oz"]],"s":"Preheat the oven to 200C/180C Fan/Gas 6.\r\nPut the biscuits in a large re-sealable freezer bag and bash with a rolling pin into fine crumbs. Melt the butter in a small pan, then add the biscuit crumbs and stir until coated with butter. Tip into the tart tin and, using the back of a spoon, press over the base and sides of the tin to give an even layer. Chill in the fridge while you make the filling.\r\nCream together the butter and sugar until light and fluffy. You can do this in a food processor if you have one. Process for 2-3 minutes. Mix in the eggs, then add the ground almonds and almond extract and blend until well combined.\r\nPeel the apples, and cut thin slices of apple. Do this at the last minute to prevent the apple going brown. Arrange the slices over the biscuit base. Spread the frangipane filling evenly on top. Level the surface and sprinkle with the flaked almonds.\r\nBake for 20-25 minutes until golden-brown and set.\r\nRemove from the oven and leave to cool for 15 minutes. Remove the sides of the tin. An easy way to do this is to stand the tin on a can of beans and push down gently on the edges of the tin.\r\nTransfer the tart, with the tin base attached, to a serving plate. Serve warm with cream, crème fraiche or ice cream.","z":"将烤箱预热至 200C/180C 风扇/燃气 6.\r\n将饼干放入可重新密封的大冷冻袋中，然后用擀面杖将其捣成细碎的面包屑。在小平底锅中融化黄油，然后加入饼干屑，搅拌直至涂上黄油。倒入挞罐中，用勺子背面按压挞罐的底部和侧面，形成均匀的一层。制作馅料时，将其放入冰箱冷藏。\r\n将黄油和糖搅打至松软。如果你有食品加工机的话，你可以用食品加工机来做这件事。处理 2-3 分钟。加入鸡蛋，然后加入杏仁粉和杏仁提取物，搅拌直至充分混合。\r\n将苹果去皮，然后将苹果切成薄片。在最后一刻这样做可以防止苹果变成棕色。将切片放在饼干底上。将鸡蛋花馅料均匀地铺在上面。将表面平整并撒上杏仁片。\r\n烘烤 20-25 分钟直至呈金黄色并凝固。\r\n从烤箱中取出并冷却 15 分钟。去掉罐子的侧面。一个简单的方法是将罐子放在一罐豆子上，然后轻轻地向下推罐子的边缘。\r\n将带有锡底的馅饼转移到盘子上。趁热与奶油、法式酸奶油或冰淇淋一起食用。"},{"id":"52959","n":"Baked salmon with fennel & tomatoes","a":"British","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/1548772327.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xvPR2Tfw5k0","i":[["Fennel","2 medium"],["Parsley","2 tbs chopped"],["Lemon","Juice of 1"],["Cherry Tomatoes","175g"],["Olive Oil","1 tbs"],["Salmon","350g"],["Black Olives","to serve"]],"s":"Heat oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4. Trim the fronds from the fennel and set aside. Cut the fennel bulbs in half, then cut each half into 3 wedges. Cook in boiling salted water for 10 mins, then drain well. Chop the fennel fronds roughly, then mix with the parsley and lemon zest.\r\n\r\nSpread the drained fennel over a shallow ovenproof dish, then add the tomatoes. Drizzle with olive oil, then bake for 10 mins. Nestle the salmon among the veg, sprinkle with lemon juice, then bake 15 mins more until the fish is just cooked. Scatter over the parsley and serve.","z":"将烤箱加热至 180C/风扇 160C/煤气 4. 修剪茴香的叶子并放在一边。将茴香球茎切成两半，然后将每一半切成 3 个楔形。在沸腾的盐水中煮10分钟，然后沥干。将茴香叶大致切碎，然后与欧芹和柠檬皮混合。\r\n\r\n将沥干的茴香铺在耐热浅盘上，然后加入西红柿。淋上橄榄油，然后烘烤 10 分钟。将三文鱼放在蔬菜中，撒上柠檬汁，然后再烤 15 分钟，直到鱼刚刚煮熟。撒上欧芹即可食用。"},{"id":"52767","n":"Bakewell tart","a":"British","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/wyrqqq1468233628.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1ahpSTf_Pvk","i":[["plain flour","175g/6oz"],["chilled butter","75g/2½oz"],["cold water","2-3 tbsp"],["raspberry jam","1 tbsp"],["butter","125g/4½oz"],["caster sugar","125g/4½oz"],["ground almonds","125g/4½oz"],["free-range egg, beaten","1"],["almond extract","½ tsp"],["flaked almonds","50g/1¾oz"]],"s":"To make the pastry, measure the flour into a bowl and rub in the butter with your fingertips until the mixture resembles fine breadcrumbs. Add the water, mixing to form a soft dough.\r\nRoll out the dough on a lightly floured work surface and use to line a 20cm/8in flan tin. Leave in the fridge to chill for 30 minutes.\r\nPreheat the oven to 200C/400F/Gas 6 (180C fan).\r\nLine the pastry case with foil and fill with baking beans. Bake blind for about 15 minutes, then remove the beans and foil and cook for a further five minutes to dry out the base.\r\nFor the filing, spread the base of the flan generously with raspberry jam.\r\nMelt the butter in a pan, take off the heat and then stir in the sugar. Add ground almonds, egg and almond extract. Pour into the flan tin and sprinkle over the flaked almonds.\r\nBake for about 35 minutes. If the almonds seem to be browning too quickly, cover the tart loosely with foil to prevent them burning.","z":"制作糕点时，将面粉放入碗中，用指尖揉入黄油，直到混合物像细面包屑一样。加入水，搅拌形成柔软的面团。\r\n在撒了少许面粉的工作台上将面团擀开，然后在 20 厘米/8 英寸的果馅饼罐中铺上衬里。放入冰箱冷藏 30 分钟。\r\n将烤箱预热至 200C/400F/Gas 6（180C 风扇）。\r\n在糕点盒上铺上箔纸，并填入烘焙豆。盲烤约 15 分钟，然后取出豆子和箔纸，再煮 5 分钟，使底部变干。\r\n为了归档，在果馅饼的底部涂上大量覆盆子酱。\r\n将黄油放入锅中融化，关火，然后加入糖搅拌。加入杏仁粉、鸡蛋和杏仁提取物。倒入果馅饼罐中，撒上杏仁片。\r\n烘烤约35分钟。如果杏仁看起来褐变得太快，请用箔纸松松地盖住馅饼，以防止它们烧焦。"},{"id":"52894","n":"Battenberg Cake","a":"British","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/ywwrsp1511720277.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aB41Q7kDZQ0","i":[["Butter","175g"],["Caster Sugar","175g"],["Self-raising Flour","140g"],["Almonds","50g"],["Baking Powder","½ tsp"],["Eggs","3 Medium"],["Vanilla Extract","½ tsp"],["Almond Extract","¼ teaspoon"],["Butter","175g"],["Caster Sugar","175g"],["Self-raising Flour","140g"],["Almonds","50g"],["Baking Powder","½ tsp"],["Eggs","3 Medium"],["Vanilla Extract","½ tsp"],["Almond Extract","¼ teaspoon"],["Pink Food Colouring","½ tsp"],["Apricot","200g"],["Marzipan","1kg"],["Icing Sugar","Dusting"]],"s":"Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and line the base and sides of a 20cm square tin with baking parchment (the easiest way is to cross 2 x 20cm-long strips over the base). To make the almond sponge, put the butter, sugar, flour, ground almonds, baking powder, eggs, vanilla and almond extract in a large bowl. Beat with an electric whisk until the mix comes together smoothly. Scrape into the tin, spreading to the corners, and bake for 25-30 mins – when you poke in a skewer, it should come out clean. Cool in the tin for 10 mins, then transfer to a wire rack to finish cooling while you make the second sponge.\r\nFor the pink sponge, line the tin as above. Mix all the ingredients together as above, but don’t add the almond extract. Fold in some pink food colouring. Then scrape it all into the tin and bake as before. Cool.\r\nTo assemble, heat the jam in a small pan until runny, then sieve. Barely trim two opposite edges from the almond sponge, then well trim a third edge. Roughly measure the height of the sponge, then cutting from the well-trimmed edge, use a ruler to help you cut 4 slices each the same width as the sponge height. Discard or nibble leftover sponge. Repeat with pink cake.\r\nTake 2 x almond slices and 2 x pink slices and trim so they are all the same length. Roll out one marzipan block on a surface lightly dusted with icing sugar to just over 20cm wide, then keep rolling lengthways until the marzipan is roughly 0.5cm thick. Brush with apricot jam, then lay a pink and an almond slice side by side at one end of the marzipan, brushing jam in between to stick sponges, and leaving 4cm clear marzipan at the end. Brush more jam on top of the sponges, then sandwich remaining 2 slices on top, alternating colours to give a checkerboard effect. Trim the marzipan to the length of the cakes.\r\nCarefully lift up the marzipan and smooth over the cake with your hands, but leave a small marzipan fold along the bottom edge before you stick it to the first side. Trim opposite side to match size of fold, then crimp edges using fingers and thumb (or, more simply, press with prongs of fork). If you like, mark the 10 slices using the prongs of a fork.\r\nAssemble second Battenberg and keep in an airtight box or well wrapped in cling film for up to 3 days. Can be frozen for up to a month.","z":"将烤箱加热至 180C/160C 风扇/煤气 4，并在 20 厘米方形锡罐的底部和侧面铺上烘焙羊皮纸（最简单的方法是在底部交叉 2 x 20 厘米长的条带）。制作杏仁海绵，将黄油、糖、面粉、杏仁粉、发酵粉、鸡蛋、香草和杏仁精放入一个大碗中。用电动搅拌器搅拌直至混合均匀。刮入罐头，涂抹到角落，烘烤 25-30 分钟——当你用叉子戳进去时，它应该是干净的。在罐中冷却 10 分钟，然后转移到金属架上完成冷却，同时制作第二块海绵。\r\n对于粉色海绵，按照上面的方法在罐子上划线。如上所述将所有成分混合在一起，但不要添加杏仁提取物。加入一些粉红色食用色素。然后将其全部刮入罐中并像以前一样烘烤。凉爽的。\r\n组装时，将果酱在小锅中加热直至流淌，然后过筛。稍微修剪杏仁海绵的两个相对边缘，然后修剪第三个边缘。大致测量海绵的高度，然后从修剪好的边缘开始切割，用尺子帮你切4片，每片的宽度与海绵的高度相同。丢弃或啃掉剩余的海绵。用粉红色蛋糕重复上述步骤。\r\n取 2 片杏仁片和 2 片粉红色片并修剪，使它们的长度相同。将一块杏仁蛋白糖块放在撒有少许糖粉的表面上擀成 20 厘米宽，然后继续纵向滚动，直到杏仁蛋白糖厚度约为 0.5 厘米。刷上杏酱，然后在杏仁蛋白糖的一端并排放置一片粉色和一片杏仁片，中间刷上果酱粘上海绵，末端留下4厘米透明的杏仁蛋白糖。在海绵上刷上更多果酱，然后将剩余的 2 片夹在上面，交替颜色以产生棋盘效果。将杏仁糖修剪成蛋糕的长度。\r\n小心地提起杏仁蛋白糖，用手将蛋糕抹平，但在将其粘到第一面之前，请沿底部边缘留下一个小杏仁蛋白糖折叠。修剪另一侧以匹配折叠的大小，然后用手指和拇指压接边缘（或者更简单地，用叉子的尖头按压）。如果您愿意，可以用叉子的尖头在 10 片切片上做标记。\r\n组装第二个 Battenberg 并保存在密封盒中或用保鲜膜包裹最多 3 天。最多可冷冻一个月。"},{"id":"52848","n":"Bean & Sausage Hotpot","a":"British","c":"Miscellaneous","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/vxuyrx1511302687.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=B0YX0yPX4Wo","i":[["Sausages","8 large"],["Tomato Sauce","1 Jar"],["Butter Beans","1200g"],["Black Treacle","1 tbls"],["English Mustard","1 tsp"]],"s":"In a large casserole, fry the sausages until brown all over – about 10 mins.\r\n\r\nAdd the tomato sauce, stirring well, then stir in the beans, treacle or sugar and mustard. Bring to the simmer, cover and cook for 30 mins. Great served with crusty bread or rice.","z":"在一个大砂锅中，将香肠煎至全部变成棕色，大约 10 分钟。\r\n\r\n加入番茄酱，搅拌均匀，然后加入豆子、糖浆或糖和芥末。煮至沸腾，盖上锅盖，煮 30 分钟。非常适合搭配硬皮面包或米饭。"},{"id":"52873","n":"Beef Dumpling Stew","a":"British","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/uyqrrv1511553350.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6NgheY-r5t0","i":[["Olive Oil","2 tbs"],["Butter","25g"],["Beef","750g"],["Plain Flour","2 tblsp"],["Garlic","2 cloves minced"],["Onions","175g"],["Celery","150g"],["Carrots","150g"],["Leek","2 chopped"],["Swede","200g"],["Red Wine","150ml"],["Beef Stock","500g"],["Bay Leaf","2"],["Thyme","3 tbs"],["Parsley","3 tblsp chopped"],["Plain Flour","125g"],["Baking Powder","1 tsp"],["Suet","60g"],["Water","Splash"]],"s":"Preheat the oven to 180C/350F/Gas 4.\r\n\r\nFor the beef stew, heat the oil and butter in an ovenproof casserole and fry the beef until browned on all sides.\r\n\r\nSprinkle over the flour and cook for a further 2-3 minutes.\r\n\r\nAdd the garlic and all the vegetables and fry for 1-2 minutes.\r\n\r\nStir in the wine, stock and herbs, then add the Worcestershire sauce and balsamic vinegar, to taste. Season with salt and freshly ground black pepper.\r\n\r\nCover with a lid, transfer to the oven and cook for about two hours, or until the meat is tender.\r\n\r\nFor the dumplings, sift the flour, baking powder and salt into a bowl.\r\nAdd the suet and enough water to form a thick dough.\r\n\r\nWith floured hands, roll spoonfuls of the dough into small balls.\r\n\r\nAfter two hours, remove the lid from the stew and place the balls on top of the stew. Cover, return to the oven and cook for a further 20 minutes, or until the dumplings have swollen and are tender. (If you prefer your dumplings with a golden top, leave the lid off when returning to the oven.)\r\n\r\nTo serve, place a spoonful of mashed potato onto each of four serving plates and top with the stew and dumplings. Sprinkle with chopped parsley.","z":"将烤箱预热至 180C/350F/燃气 4.\r\n\r\n对于炖牛肉，在耐热砂锅中加热油和黄油，然后将牛肉煎至各面变成棕色。\r\n\r\n撒上面粉，再煮 2-3 分钟。\r\n\r\n加入大蒜和所有蔬菜，炒 1-2 分钟。\r\n\r\n加入葡萄酒、高汤和香草，然后加入伍斯特沙司和香醋调味。用盐和现磨的黑胡椒调味。\r\n\r\n盖上盖子，转移到烤箱中煮约两个小时，或直至肉变软。\r\n\r\n制作饺子时，将面粉、发酵粉和盐筛入碗中。\r\n加入羊脂和足够的水，形成厚面团。\r\n\r\n用撒了面粉的手，将一勺面团擀成小球。\r\n\r\n两个小时后，取下炖菜的盖子，将球放在炖菜上。盖上盖子，放回烤箱再煮 20 分钟，或直到饺子膨胀变软。 （如果您喜欢金顶的饺子，请在返回烤箱时将盖子打开。）\r\n\r\n上菜时，将一勺土豆泥放在四个盘子上，然后在上面放上炖菜和饺子。撒上切碎的欧芹。"},{"id":"52824","n":"Beef Sunday Roast","a":"British","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/ssrrrs1503664277.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2l3-dBdNehY","i":[["Beef","8 slices"],["Broccoli","12 florets"],["Potatoes","1 Packet"],["Carrots","1 Packet"],["plain flour","140g"],["Eggs","4"],["milk","200ml"],["sunflower oil","drizzle (for cooking)"]],"s":"Cook the Broccoli and Carrots in a pan of boiling water until tender.\r\n\r\nRoast the Beef and Potatoes in the oven for 45mins, the potatoes may need to be checked regularly to not overcook.\r\n\r\nTo make the Yorkshire puddings:\r\nHeat oven to 230C/fan 210C/gas 8. Drizzle a little sunflower oil evenly into 2 x 4-hole Yorkshire pudding tins or a 12-hole non-stick muffin tin and place in the oven to heat through\r\nTo make the batter, tip 140g plain flour into a bowl and beat in four eggs until smooth. Gradually add 200ml milk and carry on beating until the mix is completely lump-free. Season with salt and pepper. Pour the batter into a jug, then remove the hot tins from the oven. Carefully and evenly pour the batter into the holes. Place the tins back in the oven and leave undisturbed for 20-25 mins until the puddings have puffed up and browned. Serve immediately.\r\n\r\nPlate up and add the Gravy as desired.","z":"将西兰花和胡萝卜放入沸水中煮至变软。\r\n\r\n将牛肉和土豆放入烤箱烤 45 分钟，可能需要定期检查土豆以免煮过头。\r\n\r\n制作约克郡布丁：\r\n将烤箱加热至 230C/风扇 210C/煤气 8. 将少许葵花籽油均匀淋入 2 x 4 孔约克夏布丁罐或 12 孔不粘松饼罐中，然后放入烤箱中加热\r\n制作面糊时，将 140 克普通面粉倒入碗中，加入四个鸡蛋，搅打至光滑。逐渐加入200毫升牛奶，继续搅拌直至混合物完全无结块。用盐和胡椒调味。将面糊倒入壶中，然后从烤箱中取出热罐。小心地将面糊均匀地倒入孔中。将罐子放回烤箱，静置 20-25 分钟，直到布丁膨胀并变成棕色。立即上菜。\r\n\r\n装盘并根据需要添加肉汁。"},{"id":"52803","n":"Beef Wellington","a":"British","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/vvpprx1487325699.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FS8u1RBdf6I","i":[["mushrooms","400g"],["English Mustard","1-2tbsp"],["Olive Oil","Dash"],["Beef Fillet","750g piece"],["Parma ham","6-8 slices"],["Puff Pastry","500g"],["Flour","Dusting"],["Egg Yolks","2 Beaten"]],"s":"Put the mushrooms into a food processor with some seasoning and pulse to a rough paste. Scrape the paste into a pan and cook over a high heat for about 10 mins, tossing frequently, to cook out the moisture from the mushrooms. Spread out on a plate to cool.\r\nHeat in a frying pan and add a little olive oil. Season the beef and sear in the hot pan for 30 secs only on each side. (You don't want to cook it at this stage, just colour it). Remove the beef from the pan and leave to cool, then brush all over with the mustard.\r\nLay a sheet of cling film on a work surface and arrange the Parma ham slices on it, in slightly overlapping rows. With a palette knife, spread the mushroom paste over the ham, then place the seared beef fillet in the middle. Keeping a tight hold of the cling film from the edge, neatly roll the Parma ham and mushrooms around the beef to form a tight barrel shape. Twist the ends of the cling film to secure. Chill for 15-20 mins to allow the beef to set and keep its shape.\r\nRoll out the puff pastry on a floured surface to a large rectangle, the thickness of a £1 coin. Remove the cling film from the beef, then lay in the centre. Brush the surrounding pastry with egg yolk. Fold the ends over, the wrap the pastry around the beef, cutting off any excess. Turn over, so the seam is underneath, and place on a baking sheet. Brush over all the pastry with egg and chill for about 15 mins to let the pastry rest.\r\nHeat the oven to 200C, 400F, gas 6.\r\nLightly score the pastry at 1cm intervals and glaze again with beaten egg yolk. Bake for 20 minutes, then lower the oven setting to 180C, 350F, gas 4 and cook for another 15 mins. Allow to rest for 10-15 mins before slicing and serving with the side dishes of your choice. The beef should still be pink in the centre when you serve it.","z":"将蘑菇与一些调味料一起放入食品加工机中，然后打成粗糊状。将糊状物刮入锅中，用大火煮约10分钟，并经常翻动，以煮出蘑菇中的水分。铺在盘子上冷却。\r\n在煎锅中加热并加入少许橄榄油。将牛肉调味，并在热锅中每面煎 30 秒。 （这个阶段你不想煮它，只需给它上色即可）。将牛肉从锅中取出，冷却，然后刷上芥末。\r\n在工作台面上铺上一张保鲜膜，然后将帕尔马火腿片稍微重叠地排列在上面。用调色刀将蘑菇酱涂在火腿上，然后将烤好的牛柳放在中间。紧紧抓住边缘的保鲜膜，将帕尔马火腿和蘑菇整齐地卷在牛肉周围，形成紧密的桶形。扭转保鲜膜的两端以固定。冷却 15-20 分钟，让牛肉凝固并保持其形状。\r\n在撒了面粉的表面上将酥皮擀成一个大矩形，厚度相当于 1 英镑硬币的厚度。去掉牛肉上的保鲜膜，然后放在中间。在周围的糕点上刷上蛋黄。将两端折叠起来，将糕点包裹在牛肉上，剪掉多余的部分。翻过来，使接缝位于下面，然后放在烤盘上。在所有糕点上刷上鸡蛋，冷却约 15 分钟，让糕点静置。\r\n将烤箱加热至 200C、400F、气体 6。\r\n以 1 厘米的间隔在糕点上轻轻划痕，并再次涂上打散的蛋黄。烘烤 20 分钟，然后将烤箱设置降至 180C、350F、燃气 4，再煮 15 分钟。休息 10-15 分钟，然后切片并与您选择的配菜一起食用。当你上桌时，牛肉的中心应该仍然是粉红色的。"},{"id":"52874","n":"Beef and Mustard Pie","a":"British","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/sytuqu1511553755.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nMyBC9staMU","i":[["Beef","1kg"],["Plain Flour","2 tbs"],["Rapeseed Oil","2 tbs"],["Red Wine","200ml"],["Beef Stock","400ml"],["Onion","1 finely sliced"],["Carrots","2 chopped"],["Thyme","3 sprigs"],["Mustard","2 tbs"],["Egg Yolks","2 free-range"],["Puff Pastry","400g"],["Green Beans","300g"],["Butter","25g"],["Salt","pinch"],["Pepper","pinch"]],"s":"Preheat the oven to 150C/300F/Gas 2.\r\nToss the beef and flour together in a bowl with some salt and black pepper.\r\nHeat a large casserole until hot, add half of the rapeseed oil and enough of the beef to just cover the bottom of the casserole.\r\nFry until browned on each side, then remove and set aside. Repeat with the remaining oil and beef.\r\nReturn the beef to the pan, add the wine and cook until the volume of liquid has reduced by half, then add the stock, onion, carrots, thyme and mustard, and season well with salt and pepper.\r\nCover with a lid and place in the oven for two hours.\r\nRemove from the oven, check the seasoning and set aside to cool. Remove the thyme.\r\nWhen the beef is cool and you're ready to assemble the pie, preheat the oven to 200C/400F/Gas 6.\r\nTransfer the beef to a pie dish, brush the rim with the beaten egg yolks and lay the pastry over the top. Brush the top of the pastry with more beaten egg.\r\nTrim the pastry so there is just enough excess to crimp the edges, then place in the oven and bake for 30 minutes, or until the pastry is golden-brown and cooked through.\r\nFor the green beans, bring a saucepan of salted water to the boil, add the beans and cook for 4-5 minutes, or until just tender.\r\nDrain and toss with the butter, then season with black pepper.\r\nTo serve, place a large spoonful of pie onto each plate with some green beans alongside.","z":"将烤箱预热至 150C/300F/燃气 2.\r\n将牛肉和面粉一起放入碗中，加入一些盐和黑胡椒。\r\n将一个大砂锅加热至热，加入一半菜籽油和足够的牛肉，以刚好覆盖砂锅底部。\r\n煎至每一面都变成棕色，然后取出并放在一边。用剩下的油和牛肉重复上述步骤。\r\n将牛肉放回锅中，加入酒，煮至液体体积减少一半，然后加入高汤、洋葱、胡萝卜、百里香和芥末，用盐和胡椒调味。\r\n盖上盖子，放入烤箱烘烤两个小时。\r\n从烤箱中取出，检查调味料并放在一边冷却。取出百里香。\r\n当牛肉冷却并准备好组装馅饼时，将烤箱预热至 200C/400F/Gas 6。\r\n将牛肉转移到馅饼盘中，在边缘刷上打好的蛋黄，然后将糕点放在上面。在糕点顶部刷上更多打好的鸡蛋。\r\n修剪糕点，使其多余部分卷曲边缘，然后放入烤箱烘烤 30 分钟，或直至糕点呈金黄色并煮熟。\r\n对于青豆，将一锅盐水煮沸，加入青豆，煮 4-5 分钟，或直至变软。\r\n沥干并与黄油一起搅拌，然后用黑胡椒调味。\r\n上菜时，在每个盘子上放一大勺馅饼，旁边放一些青豆。"},{"id":"52878","n":"Beef and Oyster pie","a":"British","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/wrssvt1511556563.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ONX74yP6JnI","i":[["Beef","900g"],["Olive Oil","3 tbs"],["Shallots","3"],["Garlic","2 cloves minced"],["Bacon","125g"],["Thyme","1 tbs chopped"],["Bay Leaf","2"],["Stout","330ml"],["Beef Stock","400ml"],["Corn Flour","2 tbs"],["Oysters","8"],["Plain Flour","400g"],["Salt","pinch"],["Butter","250g"],["Eggs","To Glaze"]],"s":"Season the beef cubes with salt and black pepper. Heat a tablespoon of oil in the frying pan and fry the meat over a high heat. Do this in three batches so that you don’t overcrowd the pan, transferring the meat to a large flameproof casserole dish once it is browned all over. Add extra oil if the pan seems dry.\r\nIn the same pan, add another tablespoon of oil and cook the shallots for 4-5 minutes, then add the garlic and fry for 30 seconds. Add the bacon and fry until slightly browned. Transfer the onion and bacon mixture to the casserole dish and add the herbs.\r\nPreheat the oven to 180C/350F/Gas 4.\r\nPour the stout into the frying pan and bring to the boil, stirring to lift any stuck-on browned bits from the bottom of the pan. Pour the stout over the beef in the casserole dish and add the stock. Cover the casserole and place it in the oven for 1½-2 hours, or until the beef is tender and the sauce is reduced.\r\nSkim off any surface fat, taste and add salt and pepper if necessary, then stir in the cornflour paste. Put the casserole dish on the hob – don’t forget that it will be hot – and simmer for 1-2 minutes, stirring, until thickened. Leave to cool.\r\nIncrease the oven to 200C/400F/Gas 6. To make the pastry, put the flour and salt in a very large bowl. Grate the butter and stir it into the flour in three batches. Gradually add 325ml/11fl oz cold water – you may not need it all – and stir with a round-bladed knife until the mixture just comes together. Knead the pastry lightly into a ball on a lightly floured surface and set aside 250g/9oz for the pie lid.\r\nRoll the rest of the pastry out until about 2cm/¾in larger than the dish you’re using. Line the dish with the pastry then pile in the filling, tucking the oysters in as well. Brush the edge of the pastry with beaten egg.\r\nRoll the remaining pastry until slightly larger than your dish and gently lift over the filling, pressing the edges firmly to seal, then trim with a sharp knife. Brush with beaten egg to glaze. Put the dish on a baking tray and bake for 25-30 minutes, or until the pastry is golden-brown and the filling is bubbling.","z":"用盐和黑胡椒给牛肉块调味。在煎锅中加热一汤匙油，然后用大火煎肉。分三批进行，这样就不会把锅挤得太满，一旦肉全部变成棕色，就把肉转移到一个大的防火砂锅里。如果锅看起来很干，请添加额外的油。\r\n在同一个锅中，加入另一汤匙油，将葱煮 4-5 分钟，然后加入大蒜，炒 30 秒。加入培根，煎至略呈棕色。将洋葱和培根混合物转移到砂锅中，然后添加香草。\r\n将烤箱预热至 180C/350F/燃气 4.\r\n将黑啤酒倒入煎锅中，煮沸，搅拌以清除锅底粘附的棕色碎片。将黑啤酒倒在砂锅菜中的牛肉上，然后加入高汤。盖上砂锅盖，放入烤箱烤 1.5-2 小时，或直至牛肉变软且酱汁变少。\r\n撇去表面的脂肪，品尝并根据需要添加盐和胡椒，然后拌入玉米粉糊。将砂锅放在炉灶上（别忘了它会很热），小火煮 1-2 分钟，搅拌，直至变稠。让它冷却。\r\n将烤箱温度升至 200C/400F/煤气 6. 制作糕点时，将面粉和盐放入一个非常大的碗中。将黄油磨碎，分三批与面粉搅拌。逐渐加入 325 毫升/11 液量盎司冷水（您可能不需要全部），然后用圆刃刀搅拌，直至混合物刚好混合在一起。在撒有少许面粉的表面上将糕点轻轻揉成球状，并留出 250 克/9 盎司的面粉作为馅饼盖。\r\n将剩余的糕点擀开，直到比您使用的盘子大约 2 厘米/3/4 英寸。将糕点铺在盘子上，然后堆入馅料，将牡蛎也塞进去。在糕点边缘刷上打散的鸡蛋。\r\n将剩下的糕点卷起来，直到比盘子稍大，然后轻轻地提起馅料，用力按压边缘以密封，然后用锋利的刀修剪。刷上打好的鸡蛋来上釉。将盘子放在烤盘上烘烤 25-30 分钟，或直至糕点呈金黄色且馅料冒泡。"},{"id":"52891","n":"Blackberry Fool","a":"British","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/rpvptu1511641092.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kniRGjDLFrQ","i":[["Hazlenuts","50g"],["Butter","125g"],["Caster Sugar","150g"],["Lemon","Grated"],["Plain Flour","150g"],["Baking Powder","½ tsp"],["Blackberries","600g"],["Sugar","75g"],["Caster Sugar","2 tbs"],["Lemon Juice","1 tbs"],["Double Cream","300ml"],["Yogurt","100ml"],["Mint","Garnish with"]],"s":"For the biscuits, preheat the oven to 200C/180C (fan)/Gas 6 and line two large baking trays with baking parchment. Scatter the nuts over a baking tray and roast in the oven for 6-8 minutes, or until golden-brown. Watch them carefully so that they don’t have a chance to burn. Remove from the oven, tip onto a board and leave to cool.\r\nPut the butter and sugar in a large bowl and beat with a wooden spoon until light and creamy. Roughly chop the cooled nuts and add to the creamed butter and sugar, along with the lemon zest, flour and baking powder. Stir well until the mixture comes together and forms a ball – you may need to use your hands.\r\nDivide the biscuit dough into 24 even pieces and roll into small balls. Place the balls the prepared baking trays, spaced well apart to allow for spreading.\r\nPress the biscuits to flatten to around 1cm/½in thick. Bake the biscuits, one tray at a time, for 12 minutes or until very pale golden-brown. Leave to cool on the trays. They will be very soft when you take them out of the oven, but will crisp as they cool.\r\nStore in an airtight tin and eat within five days.\r\nFor the fool, rinse the blackberries in a colander to wash away any dust or dirt. Put the blackberries in a non-stick saucepan and sprinkle over the caster sugar.\r\nStir in the lemon juice and heat gently for two minutes, or until the blackberries begin to soften and release their juices. Remove and reserve 12 blackberries for decoration and continue cooking the rest.\r\nSimmer the blackberries very gently for 15 minutes, stirring regularly until very soft and squidgy. Remove from the heat and press the berries and juice through a sieve over a bowl, using the bottom of a ladle to help you extract as much of the purée as possible. Leave the purée to cool and discard the seeds. You should end up with around 325ml/11fl oz of purée.\r\nPut the cream and yoghurt in a large bowl and whip with an electric whisk until soft peaks form when the whisk is removed from the bowl – the acidity of the fruit will thicken the cream further, so don’t take it too far.\r\nWhen the purée is completely cold, adjust the sweetness to taste by adding more sugar if needed. Pour it into the bowl with the whipped cream and yoghurt and stir just once or twice until very lightly combined.\r\nSpoon the blackberry fool into individual wide, glass dishes – or one large, single bowl. It should look quite marbled, so don’t over-stir it. Scatter a few tiny mint leaves on top and decorate with the reserved blackberries. Sprinkle with a little sugar if you like and serve with the hazelnut biscuits.","z":"对于饼干，将烤箱预热至 200C/180C（风扇）/燃气 6，并在两个大烤盘上铺上烤羊皮纸。将坚果撒在烤盘上，然后在烤箱中烤 6-8 分钟，或直至呈金黄色。仔细观察它们，以免它们有机会燃烧。从烤箱中取出，倒在板上并冷却。\r\n将黄油和糖放入一个大碗中，用木勺搅拌直至呈奶油状。将冷却的坚果大致切碎，加入奶油黄油和糖，以及柠檬皮、面粉和发酵粉。充分搅拌，直到混合物聚集在一起并形成一个球——您可能需要用手。\r\n将饼干面团分成均匀的24份，然后搓成​​小球。将球放在准备好的烤盘上，间距适当，以便散开。\r\n将饼干压平至约 1 厘米/½ 英寸厚。将饼干一次一盘烘烤 12 分钟或直至变成浅金棕色。放在托盘上冷却。当你把它们从烤箱里拿出来时，它们会很软，但冷却后会变脆。\r\n存放在密封罐中并在五天内食用。\r\n对于傻瓜来说，用漏勺冲洗黑莓，洗掉灰尘或污垢。将黑莓放入不粘锅中，撒上细砂糖。\r\n加入柠檬汁，轻轻加热两分钟，或直到黑莓开始软化并释放出汁液。取出并保留 12 个黑莓用于装饰，其余的继续烹饪。\r\n将黑莓轻轻煮 15 分钟，期间不断搅拌，直至黑莓变得柔软、松软。从火上移开，将浆果和果汁压过碗上的筛子，用勺子底部帮助您提取尽可能多的果泥。让果泥冷却并丢弃种子。您最终应该得到大约 325 毫升/11 液量盎司的果泥。\r\n将奶油和酸奶放入一个大碗中，用电动搅拌器搅打，直到从碗中取出搅拌器时形成软峰 - 水果的酸度会使奶油进一步变稠，所以不要搅拌得太远。\r\n当果泥完全冷却后，根据需要添加更多糖来调整甜度。将其与生奶油和酸奶一起倒入碗中，搅拌一两次直至轻轻混合。\r\n将黑莓傻瓜舀入单独的宽玻璃盘中 - 或一个大的单碗中。它应该看起来很有大理石花纹，所以不要过度搅拌。在上面撒上一些小薄荷叶，并用保留的黑莓装饰。如果您愿意，可以撒上一点糖，然后与榛子饼干一起食用。"},{"id":"52792","n":"Bread and Butter Pudding","a":"British","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/xqwwpy1483908697.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vz5W1-BmOE4","i":[["butter","25g/1oz"],["bread","8 thin slices"],["sultanas","50g/2oz"],["cinnamon","2 tsp"],["milk","350ml/12fl"],["double cream","50ml/2fl oz"],["eggs","2 free-range"],["sugar","25g/1oz"],["nutmeg","grated, to taste"]],"s":"Grease a 1 litre/2 pint pie dish with butter.\r\nCut the crusts off the bread. Spread each slice with on one side with butter, then cut into triangles.\r\nArrange a layer of bread, buttered-side up, in the bottom of the dish, then add a layer of sultanas. Sprinkle with a little cinnamon, then repeat the layers of bread and sultanas, sprinkling with cinnamon, until you have used up all of the bread. Finish with a layer of bread, then set aside.\r\nGently warm the milk and cream in a pan over a low heat to scalding point. Don't let it boil.\r\nCrack the eggs into a bowl, add three quarters of the sugar and lightly whisk until pale.\r\nAdd the warm milk and cream mixture and stir well, then strain the custard into a bowl.\r\nPour the custard over the prepared bread layers and sprinkle with nutmeg and the remaining sugar and leave to stand for 30 minutes.\r\nPreheat the oven to 180C/355F/Gas 4.\r\nPlace the dish into the oven and bake for 30-40 minutes, or until the custard has set and the top is golden-brown.","z":"在 1 升/2 品脱的馅饼盘上涂上黄油。\r\n把面包上的面包皮切掉。在每片的一侧涂上黄油，然后切成三角形。\r\n将一层面包涂黄油的一面朝上放在盘子底部，然后添加一层葡萄干。撒上一点肉桂，然后重复面包和葡萄干的层，撒上肉桂，直到用完所有面包。最后铺上一层面包，然后放在一边。\r\n将牛奶和奶油放入平底锅中，用小火轻轻加热至滚烫点。不要让它沸腾。\r\n将鸡蛋打入碗中，加入四分之三的糖，轻轻搅拌至颜色变浅。\r\n加入温热的牛奶和奶油混合物，搅拌均匀，然后将蛋奶冻滤入碗中。\r\n将蛋奶冻倒在准备好的面包层上，撒上肉豆蔻和剩余的糖，静置 30 分钟。\r\n将烤箱预热至 180C/355F/燃气 4.\r\n将盘子放入烤箱烘烤 30-40 分钟，或直至蛋奶冻凝固且顶部呈金黄色。"},{"id":"52842","n":"Broccoli & Stilton soup","a":"British","c":"Starter","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/tvvxpv1511191952.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_HgVLpmNxTY","i":[["Rapeseed Oil","2 tblsp"],["Onion","1 finely chopped"],["Celery","1"],["Leek","1 sliced"],["Potatoes","1 medium"],["Butter","1 knob"],["Vegetable Stock","1 litre hot"],["Broccoli","1 Head chopped"],["Stilton Cheese","140g"]],"s":"Heat the rapeseed oil in a large saucepan and then add the onions. Cook on a medium heat until soft. Add a splash of water if the onions start to catch.\r\n\r\nAdd the celery, leek, potato and a knob of butter. Stir until melted, then cover with a lid. Allow to sweat for 5 minutes. Remove the lid.\r\n\r\nPour in the stock and add any chunky bits of broccoli stalk. Cook for 10 – 15 minutes until all the vegetables are soft.\r\n\r\nAdd the rest of the broccoli and cook for a further 5 minutes. Carefully transfer to a blender and blitz until smooth. Stir in the stilton, allowing a few lumps to remain. Season with black pepper and serve.","z":"在大平底锅中加热菜籽油，然后加入洋葱。用中火煮至软。如果洋葱开始粘住，请加一点水。\r\n\r\n加入芹菜、韭菜、土豆和一小块黄油。搅拌直至融化，然后盖上盖子。允许出汗 5 分钟。取下盖子。\r\n\r\n倒入高汤并添加大块的西兰花茎。煮 10 - 15 分钟，直至所有蔬菜变软。\r\n\r\n加入剩余的西兰花，再煮 5 分钟。小心地转移到搅拌机中并快速搅拌直至光滑。加入斯蒂尔顿搅拌，留下一些块状物。用黑胡椒调味即可食用。"},{"id":"52897","n":"Carrot Cake","a":"British","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/vrspxv1511722107.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=asjZ7iTrGKA","i":[["Vegetable Oil","450ml"],["Plain Flour","400g"],["Bicarbonate Of Soda","2 tsp"],["Sugar","550ml"],["Eggs","5"],["Salt","½ tsp"],["Cinnamon","2 tsp"],["Carrots","500g grated"],["Walnuts","150g"],["Cream Cheese","200g"],["Caster Sugar","150g"],["Butter","100g"]],"s":"For the carrot cake, preheat the oven to 160C/325F/Gas 3. Grease and line a 26cm/10in springform cake tin.\r\nMix all of the ingredients for the carrot cake, except the carrots and walnuts, together in a bowl until well combined. Stir in the carrots and walnuts.\r\nSpoon the mixture into the cake tin and bake for 1 hour 15 minutes, or until a skewer inserted into the middle comes out clean. Remove the cake from the oven and set aside to cool for 10 minutes, then carefully remove the cake from the tin and set aside to cool completely on a cooling rack.\r\nMeanwhile, for the icing, beat the cream cheese, caster sugar and butter together in a bowl until fluffy. Spread the icing over the top of the cake with a palette knife.","z":"对于胡萝卜蛋糕，将烤箱预热至 160C/325F/燃气 3. 在 26 厘米/10 英寸弹簧蛋糕罐上涂上油脂并铺上衬里。\r\n将胡萝卜蛋糕的所有原料（胡萝卜和核桃除外）混合在一个碗中，直至充分混合。拌入胡萝卜和核桃。\r\n将混合物倒入蛋糕罐中，烘烤 1 小时 15 分钟，或直至用叉子插入蛋糕中间，取出时干净为止。将蛋糕从烤箱中取出，放置冷却 10 分钟，然后小心地将蛋糕从罐中取出，放在冷却架上完全冷却。\r\n与此同时，为了结冰，将奶油干酪、细砂糖和黄油一起放入碗中，搅拌至蓬松。用调色刀将糖霜铺在蛋糕顶部。"},{"id":"52898","n":"Chelsea Buns","a":"British","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/vqpwrv1511723001.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=i_zemP3yBKw","i":[["White Flour","500g"],["Salt","1 tsp"],["Yeast","7g"],["Milk","300ml"],["Butter","40g"],["Eggs","1"],["Vegetable Oil","Dash"],["Butter","25g"],["Brown Sugar","75g"],["Cinnamon","2 tsp"],["Dried Fruit","150g"],["Milk","2 tbs"],["Caster Sugar","2 tbs"]],"s":"Sift the flour and salt into a large bowl. Make a well in the middle and add the yeast.\r\nMeanwhile, warm the milk and butter in a saucepan until the butter melts and the mixture is lukewarm.\r\nAdd the milk mixture and egg to the flour mixture and stir until the contents of the bowl come together as a soft dough. (You may need to add a little extra flour.)\r\nTip the dough onto a generously floured work surface. Knead for five minutes, adding more flour if necessary, until the dough is smooth and elastic and no longer feels sticky.\r\nLightly oil a bowl with a little of the vegetable oil. Place the dough into the bowl and turn until it is covered in the oil. Cover the bowl with cling film and set aside in a warm place for one hour, or until the dough has doubled in size.\r\nLightly grease a baking tray.\r\nFor the filling, knock the dough back to its original size and turn out onto a lightly floured work surface. Roll the dough out into a rectangle 0.5cm/¼in thick. Brush all over with the melted butter, then sprinkle over the brown sugar, cinnamon and dried fruit.\r\nRoll the dough up into a tight cylinder , cut ten 4cm/1½in slice and place them onto a lightly greased baking sheet, leaving a little space between each slice. Cover with a tea towel and set aside to rise for 30 minutes.\r\nPreheat oven to 190C/375F/Gas 5.\r\nBake the buns in the oven for 20-25 minutes, or until risen and golden-brown.\r\nMeanwhile, for the glaze, heat the milk and sugar in a saucepan until boiling. Reduce the heat and simmer for 2-3 minutes.\r\nRemove the buns from the oven and brush with the glaze, then set aside to cool on a wire rack.","z":"将面粉和盐筛入一个大碗中。在中间挖一个洞，加入酵母。\r\n同时，将牛奶和黄油放入平底锅中加热，直至黄油融化且混合物微温。\r\n将牛奶混合物和鸡蛋加入面粉混合物中，搅拌直至碗中的内容物混合成柔软的面团。 （你可能需要添加一点额外的面粉。）\r\n将面团倒在撒有大量面粉的工作面上。揉捏五分钟，必要时添加更多面粉，直到面团光滑有弹性并且不再感觉粘稠。\r\n在碗里涂上少许植物油。将面团放入碗中并转动直至其被油覆盖。用保鲜膜盖住碗，放在温暖的地方一小时，或直到面团体积增加一倍。\r\n在烤盘上涂上少许油脂。\r\n制作馅料时，将面团敲回原来的大小，然后放在撒有少许面粉的工作面上。将面团擀成 0.5 厘米/1/4 英寸厚的矩形。刷上融化的黄油，然后撒上红糖、肉桂和干果。\r\n将面团卷成一个紧密的圆柱体，切成十个 4 厘米/1 英寸的薄片，然后将它们放在涂有少许油脂的烤盘上，每片之间留一点空间。盖上茶巾，静置醒发 30 分钟。\r\n将烤箱预热至 190C/375F/燃气 5.\r\n将面包放入烤箱中烘烤 20-25 分钟，或直至面包发酵并呈金黄色。\r\n与此同时，为了上釉，将牛奶和糖放入平底锅中加热直至沸腾。减少热量并煮 2-3 分钟。\r\n将面包从烤箱中取出，刷上釉料，然后放在金属架上冷却。"},{"id":"52846","n":"Chicken & mushroom Hotpot","a":"British","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/uuuspp1511297945.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bXKWu4GojNI","i":[["Butter","50g"],["Onion","1 chopped"],["Mushrooms","100g"],["Plain Flour","40g"],["Chicken Stock Cube","1"],["Nutmeg","pinch"],["Mustard Powder","pinch"],["Chicken","250g"],["Sweetcorn","2 Handfuls"],["Potatoes","2 large"],["Butter","1 knob"]],"s":"Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Put the butter in a medium-size saucepan and place over a medium heat. Add the onion and leave to cook for 5 mins, stirring occasionally. Add the mushrooms to the saucepan with the onions.\r\n\r\nOnce the onion and mushrooms are almost cooked, stir in the flour – this will make a thick paste called a roux. If you are using a stock cube, crumble the cube into the roux now and stir well. Put the roux over a low heat and stir continuously for 2 mins – this will cook the flour and stop the sauce from having a floury taste.\r\n\r\nTake the roux off the heat. Slowly add the fresh stock, if using, or pour in 500ml water if you’ve used a stock cube, stirring all the time. Once all the liquid has been added, season with pepper, a pinch of nutmeg and mustard powder. Put the saucepan back onto a medium heat and slowly bring it to the boil, stirring all the time. Once the sauce has thickened, place on a very low heat. Add the cooked chicken and vegetables to the sauce and stir well. Grease a medium-size ovenproof pie dish with a little butter and pour in the chicken and mushroom filling.\r\n\r\nCarefully lay the potatoes on top of the hot-pot filling, overlapping them slightly, almost like a pie top.\r\n\r\nBrush the potatoes with a little melted butter and cook in the oven for about 35 mins. The hot-pot is ready once the potatoes are cooked and golden brown.","z":"将烤箱加热至 200C/180C 风扇/燃气 6. 将黄油放入中型平底锅中，中火加热。加入洋葱，煮 5 分钟，偶尔搅拌。将蘑菇和洋葱一起放入锅中。\r\n\r\n洋葱和蘑菇快熟后，加入面粉搅拌——这会形成一种称为面糊的浓稠糊状物。如果您使用汤块，请立即将汤块粉碎到面糊中并搅拌均匀。将面粉糊放在小火上，持续搅拌 2 分钟——这样可以煮面粉并防止酱汁带有面粉味。\r\n\r\n把面粉糊从火上移开。慢慢加入新鲜汤料（如果使用），或者倒入 500 毫升水（如果您使用汤块），并一直搅拌。添加完所有液体后，用胡椒、少许肉豆蔻和芥末粉调味。将平底锅放回中火上，慢慢煮沸，同时不断搅拌。一旦酱汁变稠，就用小火加热。将煮熟的鸡肉和蔬菜加入酱汁中，搅拌均匀。在中等大小的耐热馅饼盘上涂上少许黄油，然后倒入鸡肉和蘑菇馅料。\r\n\r\n小心地将土豆放在火锅馅料上，稍微重叠，就像馅饼顶一样。\r\n\r\n在土豆上刷上少许融化的黄油，然后在烤箱中煮约 35 分钟。土豆熟了，呈金黄色后，火锅就做好了。"},{"id":"52875","n":"Chicken Ham and Leek Pie","a":"British","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/xrrtss1511555269.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xr-CpPE_lNk","i":[["Chicken Stock","450ml"],["Chicken Breast","3"],["Butter","75g"],["Leek","2 sliced"],["Garlic","2 cloves minced"],["Plain Flour","50g"],["Milk","200ml"],["White Wine","3 tbs"],["Double Cream","150ml"],["Ham","150g"],["Sea Salt","spinkling"],["Pepper","pinch"],["Plain Flour","350g"],["Butter","200g"],["Free-range Egg, Beaten","1"],["Cold Water","1 tbls"],["Free-range Egg, Beaten","1"]],"s":"Heat the chicken stock in a lidded saucepan. Add the chicken breast and bring to a low simmer. Cover with a lid and cook for 10 minutes. Remove the chicken breasts from the water with tongs and place on a plate. Pour the cooking liquor into a large jug.\r\nMelt 25g/1oz of the butter in a large heavy-based saucepan over a low heat. Stir in the leeks and fry gently for two minutes, stirring occasionally until just softened. Add the garlic and cook for a further minute. Add the remaining butter and stir in the flour as soon as the butter has melted. Cook for 30 seconds, stirring constantly.\r\nSlowly pour the milk into the pan, just a little at a time, stirring well between each adding. Gradually add 250ml/10fl oz of the reserved stock and the wine, if using, stirring until the sauce is smooth and thickened slightly. Bring to a gentle simmer and cook for 3 minutes.\r\nSeason the mixture, to taste, with salt and freshly ground black pepper. Remove from the heat and stir in the cream. Pour into a large bowl and cover the surface of the sauce with cling ilm to prevent a skin forming. Set aside to cool.\r\nPreheat the oven to 200C/400F/Gas 6. Put a baking tray in the oven to heat.\r\nFor the pastry, put the flour and butter in a food processor and blend on the pulse setting until the mixture resembles fine breadcrumbs. With the motor running, add the beaten egg and water and blend until the mixture forms a ball. Portion off 250g/10oz of pastry for the lid.\r\nRoll the remaining pastry out on a lightly floured surface, turning the pastry frequently until around 5mm/¼in thick and 4cm/1½in larger than the pie dish. Lift the pastry over the rolling pin and place it gently into the pie dish. Press the pastry firmly up the sides, making sure there are no air bubbles. Leave the excess pastry overhanging the sides.\r\nCut the chicken breasts into 3cm/1¼in pieces. Stir the chicken, ham and leeks into the cooled sauce. Pour the chicken filling into the pie dish. Brush the rim of the dish with beaten egg. Roll out the reserved pastry for the lid.\r\nCover the pie with the pastry lid and press the edges together firmly to seal. Trim any excess pastry.\r\nMake a small hole in the centre of the pie with the tip of a knife. Glaze the top of the pie with beaten egg. Bake on the preheated tray in the centre of the oven for 35-40 minutes or until the pie is golden-brown all over and the filling is piping hot.","z":"在有盖的平底锅中加热鸡汤。加入鸡胸肉，小火慢炖。盖上盖子煮 10 分钟。用钳子将鸡胸肉从水中取出并放在盘子上。将烹饪液倒入一个大壶中。\r\n将 25 克/1 盎司的黄油放入一个大的厚底平底锅中，用小火融化。拌入韭菜，轻轻煎两分钟，偶尔搅拌直至变软。加入大蒜，再煮一分钟。加入剩余的黄油，黄油融化后立即加入面粉搅拌。煮 30 秒，不断搅拌。\r\n慢慢地将牛奶倒入锅中，一次一点点，每次添加之间充分搅拌。逐渐添加 250 毫升/10 液量盎司的保留汤料和酒（如果使用），搅拌直至酱汁变得光滑并稍微变稠。小火煮 3 分钟。\r\n用盐和现磨的黑胡椒调味混合物。从火上移开并拌入奶油。倒入一个大碗中，并用保鲜膜覆盖酱汁表面，以防止结皮。放在一边冷却。\r\n将烤箱预热至 200C/400F/燃气 6. 将烤盘放入烤箱中加热。\r\n对于糕点，将面粉和黄油放入食品加工机中，并在脉冲设置下搅拌，直到混合物类似于细面包屑。在电机运转的情况下，加入打散的鸡蛋和水，搅拌直至混合物形成球。分出 250 克/10 盎司的糕点作为盖子。\r\n将剩余的糕点放在撒有少许面粉的表面上擀开，经常翻转糕点，直至其厚度约为 5 毫米/1/4 英寸，比馅饼盘大 4 厘米/1/4 英寸。将糕点放在擀面杖上，轻轻放入馅饼盘中。用力按压糕点的两侧，确保没有气泡。让多余的糕点悬在两侧。\r\n将鸡胸肉切成 3 厘米/1 英寸的块。将鸡肉、火腿和韭葱放入冷却的酱汁中搅拌。将鸡肉馅倒入馅饼盘中。在盘子的边缘刷上打好的鸡蛋。将预留的盖子擀开。\r\n用糕点盖盖住馅饼，并将边缘用力压在一起以密封。修剪多余的糕点。\r\n用刀尖在馅饼的中心开一个小孔。在馅饼的顶部涂上打好的鸡蛋。将其放在烤箱中央的预热托盘上烘烤 35-40 分钟，或直至馅饼整体呈金黄色且馅料滚烫。"},{"id":"52853","n":"Chocolate Avocado Mousse","a":"British","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/uttuxy1511382180.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wuZffe60q4M","i":[["Banana","1"],["Cacao","3 tbsp"],["Avocado","1"],["Honey","2 tblsp"],["Lemon Juice","1 tsp"],["Vanilla","1 tsp"],["Water","2 tbsp"],["Sea Salt","pinch"]],"s":"1. Blend all the mousse ingredients together in your food processor until smooth. Add the cacao powder first and, as you blend, have all the ingredients to hand in order to adjust the ratios slightly as the size of avocados and bananas varies so much. The perfect ratio in order to avoid the dish tasting too much of either is to use equal amounts of both.\r\n\r\n2. Taste and add a few drops of stevia if you feel you need more sweetness.\r\n\r\n3. Fill little cups or shot glasses with the mousse, sprinkle with the cacao powder or nibs and serve.\r\n\r\nTip If you don’t have a frozen banana to hand you can just use a normal one and then chill the mousse before serving for a cooling dessert.","z":"1. 将所有慕斯原料放入食品加工机中搅拌至光滑。首先添加可可粉，混合时，准备好所有原料，以便稍微调整比例，因为鳄梨和香蕉的大小差异很大。为了避免菜肴尝起来太多，完美的比例是使用等量的两者。\r\n\r\n2. 如果您觉得需要更多甜味，请品尝并添加几滴甜叶菊。\r\n\r\n3. 将慕斯倒入小杯子或小玻璃杯中，撒上可可粉或可可粒即可食用。\r\n\r\n提示如果您手头没有冷冻香蕉，您可以使用普通香蕉，然后将慕斯冷却，然后再享用冷却甜点。"},{"id":"52966","n":"Chocolate Caramel Crispy","a":"British","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/1550442508.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qsk_At_gjv0","i":[["Mars Bar","6 chopped"],["Butter","150g"],["Rice Krispies","120g"],["Milk Chocolate","150g"]],"s":"Grease and line a 20 x 20cm/8\" x 8\" baking tin with parchment paper.\r\nPut the mars bars and butter in a heat proof bowl and place over a pan of barely simmering water. Mixing with a whisk, melt until the mixture is smooth.\r\nPour over the rice krispies in a mixing bowl and mix until all the ingredients are evenly combined. Press evenly into the prepare baking tin and set aside.\r\nMelt the milk chocolate in the microwave or over a pan of barely simmering water.\r\nSpread the melted chocolate over the rice krispie mixture and leave to set in a cool place. Once set slice into squares and serve!","z":"在 20 x 20 厘米/8 英寸 x 8 英寸的烤盘上涂上油脂并铺上羊皮纸。\r\n将火星棒和黄油放入耐热碗中，然后放在一锅刚刚沸腾的水上。用搅拌器混合，融化直至混合物光滑。\r\n将米花倒在搅拌碗中，搅拌直至所有成分均匀混合。均匀地压入准备好的烤模中并放在一边。\r\n将牛奶巧克力放入微波炉或一锅刚刚煮沸的水中融化。\r\n将融化的巧克力涂在脆米花混合物上，然后放置在阴凉的地方。凝固后切成方块即可食用！"},{"id":"52788","n":"Christmas Pudding Flapjack","a":"British","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/vvusxs1483907034.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OaqvGvEiwzU","i":[["salted butter","250g"],["dark soft brown sugar","225g"],["golden syrup","150g"],["orange","Zest of 1"],["rolled oats","500g"],["Christmas pudding","250g"]],"s":"Preheat the oven to 180°C/fan 160°C/gas mark 4 and grease and line a 25cm x 20cm tin. Melt the butter, sugar, syrup and orange zest in a large saucepan over a medium heat. The aim is to dissolve all the ingredients so that they are smooth, but to not lose any volume through boiling so be careful not to overheat.\r\n\r\nAdd the oats and stir well until evenly coated. Stir through the leftover Christmas pudding and tip into the prepared tin. Use a spoon to flatten the top and bake for 40 minutes until the edges start to brown. Whilst still warm in the tin, score into 12 squares. Allow to cool completely before cutting along the scores.\r\n\r\nKeeps for 5 days in an air tight tin or freeze for up to 1 month.","z":"将烤箱预热至 180°C/风扇 160°C/气体标记 4，并在 25 厘米 x 20 厘米的烤盘上涂上油脂和衬里。将黄油、糖、糖浆和橙皮放入大平底锅中，用中火融化。目的是溶解所有成分，使它们变得光滑，但不会因煮沸而损失任何体积，因此要小心不要过热。\r\n\r\n加入燕麦并搅拌均匀直至均匀涂上。搅拌剩下的圣诞布丁，然后倒入准备好的罐子中。用勺子将顶部压平，烘烤 40 分钟，直至边缘开始变成棕色。趁罐子里还热的时候，划成12个方格。在沿着刻痕切割之前让其完全冷却。\r\n\r\n在密封罐中可保存 5 天，或冷冻最多可保存 1 个月。"},{"id":"52989","n":"Christmas Pudding Trifle","a":"British","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/r33cud1576791081.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jRfyNQs5qhU","i":[["Orange","3"],["Demerara Sugar","1 tbs"],["Grand Marnier","2 tbs"],["Christmas Pudding","300g"],["Custard","500g"],["Mascarpone","250g"],["Double Cream","284ml"],["Flaked Almonds","Handful"],["Dark Chocolate","Grated"]],"s":"Peel the oranges using a sharp knife, ensuring all the pith is removed. Slice as thinly as possible and arrange over a dinner plate. Sprinkle with the demerara sugar followed by the Grand Marnier and set aside.\r\n\r\nCrumble the Christmas pudding into large pieces and scatter over the bottom of a trifle bowl. Lift the oranges onto the pudding in a layer and pour over any juices.\r\n\r\nBeat the mascarpone until smooth, then stir in the custard. Spoon the mixture over the top of the oranges.\r\n\r\nLightly whip the cream and spoon over the custard. Sprinkle with the flaked almonds and grated chocolate. You can make this a day in advance if you like, chill until ready to serve.","z":"用锋利的刀将橙子去皮，确保去除所有的果核。尽可能切成薄片并放在餐盘上。撒上德梅拉拉糖，然后撒上金万利酒，备用。\r\n\r\n将圣诞布丁弄碎成大块，撒在小碗的底部。将橙子一层一层地放在布丁上，然后倒在果汁上。\r\n\r\n将马斯卡彭奶酪打至光滑，然后拌入蛋奶冻。将混合物舀到橙子顶部。\r\n\r\n轻轻搅打奶油，然后用勺子浇在蛋奶冻上。撒上杏仁片和磨碎的巧克力。如果你愿意的话，你可以提前一天做好，冷藏直到可以上桌。"},{"id":"52990","n":"Christmas cake","a":"British","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/ldnrm91576791881.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=34yeL8TstO0","i":[["Butter","200g"],["Muscovado Sugar","200g"],["Plain Flour","200g"],["Eggs","4 Beaten"],["Ground Almonds","50g"],["Sherry","100ml"],["Candied Peel","85g"],["Glace Cherry","85g"],["Raisins","250g"],["Currants","250g"],["Pecan Nuts","100g"],["Lemon","Grated zest of 1"],["Mixed Spice","1 ½ tbsp"],["Rose water","1 ½ tbsp"],["Vanilla Extract","1/2 tsp"],["Baking Powder","1/2 tsp"]],"s":"Heat oven to 160C/fan 140C/gas 3. Line the base and sides of a 20 cm round, 7.5 cm deep cake tin. Beat the butter and sugar with an electric hand mixer for 1-2 mins until very creamy and pale in colour, scraping down the sides of the bowl half way through. Stir in a spoonful of the flour, then stir in the beaten egg and the rest of the flour alternately, a quarter at a time, beating well each time with a wooden spoon. Stir in the almonds.\r\n\r\nMix in the sherry (the mix will look curdled), then add the peel, cherries, raisins, cherries, nuts, lemon zest, spice, rosewater and vanilla. Beat together to mix, then stir in the baking powder.\r\n\r\nSpoon mixture into the tin and smooth the top, making a slight dip in the centre. Bake for 30 mins, then lower temperature to 150C/fan 130C/gas 2 and bake a further 2-2¼ hrs, until a skewer insterted in the middle comes out clean. Leave to cool in the tin, then take out of the tin and peel off the lining paper. When completely cold, wrap well in cling film and foil to store until ready to decorate. The cake will keep for several months.","z":"将烤箱加热至 160C/风扇 140C/煤气 3. 将 20 厘米圆形、7.5 厘米深的蛋糕罐的底部和侧面铺平。用电动手动搅拌机将黄油和糖搅拌 1-2 分钟，直至呈奶油状且颜色变浅，中途刮掉碗的侧面。加入一勺面粉搅拌，然后交替加入打散的鸡蛋和其余面粉，一次四分之一，每次用木勺搅拌均匀。拌入杏仁。\r\n\r\n加入雪利酒（混合物看起来会凝结），然后加入果皮、樱桃、葡萄干、樱桃、坚果、柠檬皮、香料、玫瑰水和香草。一起搅拌混合，然后加入发酵粉。\r\n\r\n将混合物倒入罐中，抹平顶部，在中心稍微倾斜。烘烤 30 分钟，然后将温度降至 150C/风扇 130C/煤气 2，再烘烤 2-2¼ 小时，直至插入中间的串取出干净。在罐中冷却，然后从罐中取出并剥掉衬纸。完全冷却后，用保鲜膜和箔纸包裹好存放，直到准备装饰。蛋糕可以保存几个月。"},{"id":"52988","n":"Classic Christmas pudding","a":"British","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/1d85821576790598.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Pb_lJxL1vtk","i":[["Almonds","50g"],["Bramley Apples","2 large"],["Candied Peel","200g"],["Nutmeg","1 whole"],["Raisins","1kg"],["Plain Flour","140g"],["Breadcrumbs","100g"],["Muscovado Sugar","100g"],["Eggs","3 Large"],["Brandy","2 tbs"],["Butter","250g"]],"s":"Get everything for the pudding prepared. Chop the almonds coarsely. Peel, core and chop the cooking apples. Sharpen your knife and chop the candied peel. (You can chop the almonds and apples in a food processor, but the peel must be done by hand.) Grate three quarters of the nutmeg (sounds a lot but it's correct).\r\n\r\nMix the almonds, apples, candied peel, nutmeg, raisins, flour, breadcrumbs, light muscovado sugar, eggs and 2 tbsp brandy or cognac in a large bowl. \r\n\r\nHolding the butter in its wrapper, grate a quarter of it into the bowl, then stir everything together. Repeat until all the butter is grated, then stir for 3-4 mins – the mixture is ready when it subsides slightly after each stir. Ask the family to stir too, and get everyone to make a wish. \r\n\r\nGenerously butter two 1.2 litre bowls and put a circle of baking parchment in the bottom of each. Pack in the pudding mixture. Cover with a double layer of baking parchment, pleating it to allow for expansion, then tie with string (keep the paper in place with a rubber band while tying). Trim off any excess paper. \r\n\r\nNow stand each bowl on a large sheet of foil and bring the edges up over the top, then put another sheet of foil over the top and bring it down underneath to make a double package (this makes the puddings watertight). Tie with more string, and make a handle for easy lifting in and out of the pan. Watch our video to see how to tie up a pudding correctly.\r\n\r\nBoil or oven steam the puddings for 8 hrs, topping up with water as necessary. Remove from the pans and leave to cool overnight. When cold, discard the messy wrappings and re-wrap in new baking parchment, foil and string. Store in a cool, dry place until Christmas. \r\n\r\nTo make the brandy butter, cream the butter with the orange zest and icing sugar. Gradually beat in the brandy or cognac and chopped stem ginger. Put in a small bowl, fork the top attractively and put in the fridge to set. The butter will keep for a week in the fridge, or it can be frozen for up to six weeks. \r\n\r\nOn Christmas Day, boil or oven steam for 1 hr. Unwrap and turn out. To flame, warm 3-4 tbsp brandy in a small pan, pour it over the pudding and set light to it.","z":"准备好布丁的所有材料。将杏仁粗切碎。将烹饪苹果去皮、去核并切碎。磨快你的刀并切碎蜜饯皮。 （你可以在食品加工机中切碎杏仁和苹果，但去皮必须用手完成。）将四分之三的肉豆蔻磨碎（听起来很多，但这是正确的）。\r\n\r\n将杏仁、苹果、蜜饯皮、肉豆蔻、葡萄干、面粉、面包屑、淡黑砂糖、鸡蛋和 2 汤匙白兰地或干邑白兰地混合在一个大碗中。 \r\n\r\n将黄油放在包装纸中，将四分之一磨碎放入碗中，然后将所有东西搅拌在一起。重复此操作，直到所有黄油都磨碎，然后搅拌 3-4 分钟——每次搅拌后混合物稍微消退，即表示混合物已准备就绪。请家人也一起搅拌，让每个人都许愿。 \r\n\r\n在两个 1.2 升的碗中涂上大量黄油，并在每个碗的底部放一圈烘焙羊皮纸。装入布丁混合物中。盖上双层烘焙羊皮纸，将其打褶以使其膨胀，然后用绳子系紧（系紧时用橡皮筋将纸固定到位）。剪掉多余的纸张。 \r\n\r\n现在将每个碗放在一大张箔纸上，将边缘向上放在顶部，然后将另一张箔纸放在顶部并将其放在下面，制成双层包装（这使布丁不透水）。用更多的绳子系紧，并制作一个手柄，以便于将其放入和取出锅中。观看我们的视频，了解如何正确扎布丁。\r\n\r\n将布丁煮沸或用烤箱蒸8小时，必要时加水。从锅中取出并冷却过夜。冷后，丢弃杂乱的包装材料，并用新的烘焙羊皮纸、箔纸和绳子重新包裹。存放在阴凉干燥的地方直到圣诞节。 \r\n\r\n制作白兰地黄油时，将黄油与橙皮碎和糖粉打成奶油状。逐渐加入白兰地或干邑白兰地和切碎的姜。放入一个小碗中，将顶部叉成漂亮的叉子，然后放入冰箱中凝固。黄油可在冰箱中保存一周，或者冷冻最多六周。 \r\n\r\n圣诞节那天，煮沸或用烤箱蒸 1 小时。打开包装并取出。将 3-4 汤匙白兰地放入小平底锅中加热，倒在布丁上，然后点燃。"},{"id":"53096","n":"Corned Beef Hash","a":"British","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/vz94r81760534692.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SPr_UnCrYPg","i":[["Unsalted Butter","3  tablespoons"],["Onion","1 medium chopped"],["Corned Beef","3 Cups"],["Potatoes","3 chopped"],["Kosher Salt","Dash"],["Black Pepper","Dash"],["Freshly Chopped Parsley","Chopped"]],"s":"Sauté the onions:\r\nHeat butter in a large skillet (preferably cast iron) on medium heat. Add the onion and cook a few minutes, until translucent.\r\n\r\nAdd the potatoes and corned beef:\r\nMix in the chopped corned beef and potatoes. Spread out evenly over the pan. Increase the heat to high or medium high and press down on the mixture with a metal spatula.\r\n\r\n\r\nCook until browned and then flip:\r\nDo not stir the potatoes and corned beef, but let them brown. If you hear them sizzling, this is good.\r\n\r\nUse a metal spatula to peek underneath and see if they are browning. If nicely browned, use the spatula to flip sections over in the pan so that they brown on the other side. Press down again with the spatula.\r\n\r\nIf there is too much sticking, you can add a little more butter to the pan. Continue to cook in this manner until the potatoes and the corned beef are nicely browned.\r\n\r\nStir in the parsley and season:\r\nRemove from heat, stir in chopped parsley. Add plenty of freshly ground black pepper, and add salt to taste.","z":"炒洋葱：\r\n在大煎锅（最好是铸铁）中用中火加热黄油。加入洋葱，煮几分钟，直至半透明。\r\n\r\n添加土豆和咸牛肉：\r\n加入切碎的咸牛肉和土豆。均匀地铺在烤盘上。将热量升至高或中高，然后用金属抹刀按压混合物。\r\n\r\n\r\n煮至焦黄，然后翻转：\r\n不要搅拌土豆和咸牛肉，而是让它们变成棕色。如果你听到它们发出嘶嘶声，那就太好了。\r\n\r\n用金属抹刀查看下面，看看它们是否变成褐色。如果变成漂亮的棕色，用抹刀将锅中的部分翻转，使另一面变成棕色。用抹刀再次按下。\r\n\r\n如果粘太多，可以在锅里再加一点黄油。继续以这种方式烹饪，直到土豆和咸牛肉变成漂亮的棕色。\r\n\r\n加入欧芹并调味：\r\n从火上移开，拌入切碎的欧芹。加入大量现磨的黑胡椒，并加盐调味。"},{"id":"52841","n":"Creamy Tomato Soup","a":"British","c":"Starter","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/stpuws1511191310.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lBhwjjUiFk4","i":[["Olive Oil","3 tbsp"],["Onions","2 chopped"],["Celery","2 sticks"],["Carrots","300g"],["Potatoes","500g"],["Bay Leaf","4"],["Tomato Puree","5 tblsp"],["Sugar","2 tblsp"],["White Vinegar","2 tblsp"],["Chopped Tomatoes","1½ kg"],["Passata","500g"],["Vegetable Stock Cube","3"],["Whole Milk","400ml"]],"s":"Put the oil, onions, celery, carrots, potatoes and bay leaves in a big casserole dish, or two saucepans. Fry gently until the onions are softened – about 10-15 mins. Fill the kettle and boil it.\r\nStir in the tomato purée, sugar, vinegar, chopped tomatoes and passata, then crumble in the stock cubes. Add 1 litre boiling water and bring to a simmer. Cover and simmer for 15 mins until the potato is tender, then remove the bay leaves. Purée with a stick blender (or ladle into a blender in batches) until very smooth. Season to taste and add a pinch more sugar if it needs it. The soup can now be cooled and chilled for up to 2 days, or frozen for up to 3 months.\r\nTo serve, reheat the soup, stirring in the milk – try not to let it boil. Serve in small bowls with cheesy sausage rolls.","z":"将油、洋葱、芹菜、胡萝卜、土豆和月桂叶放入一个大砂锅或两个平底锅中。轻轻煎至洋葱变软——大约 10-15 分钟。将水壶装满并煮沸。\r\n加入番茄泥、糖、醋、切碎的番茄和帕萨塔，然后将汤块碾碎。添加 1 升沸水并煮沸。盖上锅盖，小火煮 15 分钟，直至土豆变软，然后取出月桂叶。用棒式搅拌机打成泥（或分批舀入搅拌机中）直至非常光滑。调味并根据需要添加少许糖。汤现在可以冷却并冷藏最多 2 天，或冷冻最多 3 个月。\r\n食用时，重新加热汤，加入牛奶搅拌——尽量不要让它沸腾。与奶酪香肠卷一起盛在小碗中。"},{"id":"53098","n":"Cumberland Pie","a":"British","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/pvfkz61761595976.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r1lnsOTNjws","i":[["Celery","2"],["Onion","1 chopped"],["Carrots","2 large"],["Bay Leaves","5"],["Thyme","3"],["Vegetable Oil","2 tblsp"],["Butter","1 tablespoon"],["Flour","2 tablespoons"],["Tomato Puree","2 tblsp"],["Worcestershire Sauce","2 tablespoons"],["Beef Stock Cubes","2"],["Feather blade beef","800g"],["Potatoes","800g"],["Mature Cheddar","25g"],["Parmesan Cheese","25g"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3. Soften the celery, onion, carrots, bay and 1 thyme sprig in a casserole with 1 tbsp oil and the butter for 10 mins. Stir in the flour, followed by the purée, Worcestershire sauce and stock cubes.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nGradually stir in 600ml hot water, then tip in the beef and bring to a gentle simmer. Cover and cook in the oven for 2 hrs 30 mins, then uncover and cook for 30 mins -1 hr more until the meat is really tender and sauce thickened.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nMeanwhile, cook potatoes in a pan of boiling water until they’re not done but about ¾ of the way there.\r\n\r\nstep 4\r\nTransfer meat to a baking dish. Slice spuds into 1cm thick rounds and gently toss with seasoning, the remaining oil and thyme leaves. Layer on the beef, scattering with the cheese as you layer. You can cover and chill the pie now for 1 day, or freeze for up to 3 months.\r\n\r\nstep 5\r\nIncrease oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6 and bake for 30-40 mins until golden and crispy, and sauce bubbling if the dish went in cold. Serve with peas.","z":"步骤1\r\n将烤箱加热至 160C/140C 风扇/燃气 3. 将芹菜、洋葱、胡萝卜、月桂叶和 1 根百里香小枝放入砂锅中，加入 1 汤匙油和黄油，软化 10 分钟。加入面粉，然后加入果泥、伍斯特沙司和汤块。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n逐渐加入 600 毫升热水，搅拌，然后倒入牛肉，小火慢炖。盖上盖子，在烤箱中煮 2 小时 30 分钟，然后揭开盖子，再煮 30 分钟 -1 小时，直到肉变软且酱汁变稠。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n与此同时，将土豆放入沸水锅中煮至未熟，但大约 3/4 为止。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n将肉转移到烤盘中。将马铃薯切成 1 厘米厚的圆形，轻轻拌入调味料、剩余的油和百里香叶。铺在牛肉上，铺的时候撒上奶酪。您现在可以将馅饼盖上并冷藏 1 天，或冷冻最多 3 个月。\r\n\r\n步骤5\r\n将烤箱温度升至 200C/180C 风扇/煤气 6，烘烤 30-40 分钟，直至金黄酥脆，如果菜肴冷了，酱汁就会冒泡。与豌豆一起食用。"},{"id":"52899","n":"Dundee cake","a":"British","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/wxyvqq1511723401.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4hEXsfpeMQE","i":[["Almonds","100g"],["Butter","180g"],["Muscovado Sugar","180g"],["Orange","Zest of 1"],["Apricot Jam","3 tbs"],["Plain Flour","225g"],["Baking Powder","1 tsp"],["Eggs","3 Large"],["Ground Almonds","100g"],["Milk","2 tbs"],["Dried Fruit","500g"],["Glace Cherry","100g"],["Milk","1 tbs"],["Caster Sugar","2 tsp"]],"s":"Put the almonds into a small bowl and pour over boiling water to just cover. Leave for 5 mins then drain in a sieve and leave to dry.\r\nPreheat the oven to 180C/160 C fan/Gas Mark 4. Line a deep loose-based 20cm cake tin with baking parchment.\r\nPut the butter in a large bowl and beat well until soft. Add the sugar and beat until light and fluffy. Stir in the orange zest and apricot jam.\r\nSieve together the flour and baking powder. Add the eggs to the creamed butter and sugar, a little at a time, beating well between each addition. If the mixture starts to curdle, stir in a little flour.\r\nAdd the remaining flour and ground almonds and mix well. Mix in the milk and then add the dried fruit and cherries and mix gently together.\r\nSpoon the mixture into the prepared tin and spread level using the back of a spoon. Arrange the whole almonds close together in neat circles on the top of the cake. Bake in the oven for 45 mins.\r\nLower the oven temperature to 160C/140 C fan/Gas Mark 3 and cook for a further 60–80 minutes. Check the cake after 50 minutes by inserting a wooden or metal skewer into the cake. When it’s done it should have just a few crumbs attached. Check every 10 minutes - it’s important not to overcook this cake so the centre will be a little soft.\r\nWhen cooked, remove the cake briefly from the oven, put the milk and sugar into a small pan and heat gently until the sugar has dissolved. Brush over the top of the cake and return the cake to the oven for 2-3 mins. Remove and allow the cake to cool in the tin. When quite cold remove from the tin and wrap in foil and keep for at least 2 days before cutting.","z":"将杏仁放入小碗中，倒入沸水，刚好没过杏仁。放置 5 分钟，然后用筛子沥干并晾干。\r\n将烤箱预热至 180C/160C 风扇/Gas Mark 4。在松散的 20 厘米深蛋糕罐中铺上烘焙纸。\r\n将黄油放入一个大碗中，搅拌均匀直至变软。加入糖，搅拌至松软。加入橙皮碎和杏酱搅拌。\r\n将面粉和泡打粉一起过筛。将鸡蛋加入奶油黄油和糖中，一次一点，每次添加之间搅拌均匀。如果混合物开始凝结，加入少许面粉搅拌。\r\n加入剩余的面粉和杏仁粉，搅拌均匀。加入牛奶，然后加入干果和樱桃，轻轻混合在一起。\r\n将混合物倒入准备好的罐子中，并用勺背将其摊平。将整个杏仁整齐地排列在蛋糕顶部。在烤箱中烘烤 45 分钟。\r\n将烤箱温度降低至 160°C/140°C 风扇/Gas Mark 3，再烹饪 60-80 分钟。 50 分钟后，将木签或金属签插入蛋糕中检查蛋糕。完成后，它应该只附着一些面包屑。每 10 分钟检查一次 - 重要的是不要把蛋糕煮过头，这样中心就会有点软。\r\n煮熟后，将蛋糕从烤箱中短暂取出，将牛奶和糖放入小锅中，轻轻加热直至糖溶解。刷在蛋糕顶部，然后将蛋糕放回烤箱烤 2-3 分钟。取出蛋糕并让其在罐中冷却。当相当冷时，从罐中取出并用箔纸包裹，并在切割前保存至少 2 天。"},{"id":"52888","n":"Eccles Cakes","a":"British","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/wtqrqw1511639627.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xV0QCJ0GD5w","i":[["Butter","250g"],["Plain Flour","350g"],["Lemon","Juice of 1/2"],["Butter","25g"],["Currants","200g"],["Mixed Peel","50g"],["Muscovado Sugar","100g"],["Cinnamon","1 tsp"],["Ginger","1 tsp"],["Allspice","1 tsp"],["Lemon","Zest of 1"],["Eggs","1 beaten"],["Sugar","spinkling"]],"s":"To make the pastry, dice the butter and put it in the freezer to go really hard. Tip flour into the bowl of a food processor with half the butter and pulse to the texture of breadcrumbs. Pour in the lemon juice and 100ml iced water, and pulse to a dough. Tip in the rest of the butter and pulse a few times until the dough is heavily flecked with butter. It is important that you don’t overdo this as the flecks of butter are what makes the pastry flaky.\r\nOn a floured surface roll the pastry out to a neat rectangle about 20 x 30cm. Fold the two ends of the pastry into the middle (See picture 1), then fold in half (pic 2). Roll the pastry out again and refold the same way 3 more times resting the pastry for at least 15 mins each time between roll and fold, then leave to rest in the fridge for at least 30 mins before using.\r\nTo make the filling, melt the butter in a large saucepan. Take it off the heat and stir in all the other ingredients until completely mixed, then set aside.\r\nTo make the cakes, roll the pastry out until it’s just a little thicker than a £1 coin and cut out 8 rounds about 12cm across. Re-roll the trimming if needed. Place a good heaped tablespoon of mixture in the middle of each round, brush the edges of the rounds with water, then gather the pastry around the filling and squeeze it together (pic 3). Flip them over so the smooth top is upwards and pat them into a smooth round. Flatten each round with a rolling pin to an oval until the fruit just starts to poke through, then place on a baking tray. Cut 2 little slits in each Eccles cakes, brush generously with egg white and sprinkle with the sugar (pic 4).\r\nHeat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 8. Bake the Eccles cakes for 15-20 mins until just past golden brown and sticky. Leave to cool on a rack and enjoy while still warm or cold with a cup of tea. If you prefer, Eccles cakes also go really well served with a wedge of hard, tangy British cheese such as Lancashire or cheddar.","z":"制作糕点时，将黄油切成小块，然后放入冰箱中使其变硬。将面粉与一半黄油一起放入食品加工机的碗中，搅拌至面包屑的质地。倒入柠檬汁和100毫升冰水，揉成面团。倒入剩余的黄油，搅拌几次，直到面团上沾满黄油。重要的是不要做得太多，因为黄油斑点是使糕点变得片状的原因。\r\n在撒了面粉的表面上将糕点擀成约 20 x 30 厘米的整齐矩形。将面团两端向中间折叠（见图1），然后对折（图2）。再次将糕点擀开，以同样的方式重新折叠 3 次，每次在卷起和折叠之间将糕点放置至少 15 分钟，然后在使用前在冰箱中放置至少 30 分钟。\r\n制作馅料时，将黄油放入大平底锅中融化。将其从火上移开，加入所有其他成分直至完全混合，然后放在一边。\r\n制作蛋糕时，将糕点擀成比 1 英镑硬币厚一点的大小，然后切出 8 个直径约 12 厘米的圆片。如果需要，重新卷修边。在每个圆形的中间放一大汤匙混合物，用水刷圆形的边缘，然后将糕点聚集在馅料周围并将其挤压在一起（图3）。将它们翻转过来，使光滑的顶部朝上，然后将它们拍成光滑的圆形。用擀面杖将每个圆形压平成椭圆形，直到水果刚刚开始戳穿，然后放在烤盘上。在每个埃克尔斯蛋糕上切两条小缝，刷上大量蛋白，撒上糖（图4）。\r\n将烤箱加热至 220C/200C 风扇/煤气 8. 将埃克尔斯蛋糕烘烤 15-20 分钟，直至呈金黄色且粘稠。放在架子上冷却，趁热或冷时配一杯茶享用。如果您愿意，埃克尔斯蛋糕也可以搭配一块坚硬、味道浓郁的英国奶酪，如兰开夏奶酪或切达干酪。"},{"id":"52895","n":"English Breakfast","a":"British","c":"Breakfast","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/utxryw1511721587.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FXjYU2Ensck","i":[["Sausages","2"],["Bacon","3"],["Mushrooms","2"],["Tomatoes","2"],["Black Pudding","1 Slice"],["Eggs","2"],["Bread","1 Slice"]],"s":"Heat the flat grill plate over a low heat, on top of 2 rings/flames if it fits, and brush sparingly with light olive oil.\r\nCook the sausages first. Add the sausages to the hot grill plate/the coolest part if there is one and allow to cook slowly for about 15-20 minutes, turning occasionally, until golden. After the first 10 minutes, increase the heat to medium before beginning to cook the other ingredients. If you are struggling for space, completely cook the sausages and keep hot on a plate in the oven.\r\nSnip a few small cuts into the fatty edge of the bacon. Place the bacon straight on to the grill plate and fry for 2-4 minutes each side or until your preferred crispiness is reached. Like the sausages, the cooked bacon can be kept hot on a plate in the oven.\r\nFor the mushrooms, brush away any dirt using a pastry brush and trim the stalk level with the mushroom top. Season with salt and pepper and drizzle over a little olive oil. Place stalk-side up on the grill plate and cook for 1-2 minutes before turning and cooking for a further 3-4 minutes. Avoid moving the mushrooms too much while cooking, as this releases the natural juices, making them soggy.\r\nFor the tomatoes, cut the tomatoes across the centre/or in half lengthways if using plum tomatoes , and with a small, sharp knife remove the green 'eye'. Season with salt and pepper and drizzle with a little olive oil. Place cut-side down on the grill plate and cook without moving for 2 minutes. Gently turn over and season again. Cook for a further 2-3 minutes until tender but still holding their shape.\r\nFor the black pudding, cut the black pudding into 3-4 slices and remove the skin. Place on the grill plate and cook for 1½-2 minutes each side until slightly crispy.\r\nFor 'proper' fried bread it's best to cook it in a separate pan. Ideally, use bread that is a couple of days old. Heat a frying pan to a medium heat and cover the base with oil. Add the bread and cook for 2-3 minutes each side until crispy and golden. If the pan becomes too dry, add a little more oil. For a richer flavour, add a knob of butter after you turn the slice.\r\nFor the fried eggs, break the egg straight into the pan with the fried bread and leave for 30 seconds. Add a good knob of butter and lightly splash/baste the egg with the butter when melted. Cook to your preferred stage, season and gently remove with a fish slice.\r\nOnce all the ingredients are cooked, serve on warm plates and enjoy straight away with a good squeeze of tomato ketchup or brown sauce.","z":"用小火加热平烤盘，如果合适的话，放在 2 个环/火焰的顶部，并少量刷上淡橄榄油。\r\n先煮香肠。将香肠放入热烤盘/最凉的部分（如果有）中，慢慢煮约 15-20 分钟，偶尔翻动，直至呈金黄色。前 10 分钟后，将火调至中火，然后开始烹饪其他原料。如果您空间有限，请将香肠完全煮熟并放在烤箱中的盘子上保持热度。\r\n在培根的脂肪边缘剪一些小切口。将培根直接放在烤盘上，每面煎 2-4 分钟，或直至达到您喜欢的松脆程度。与香肠一样，煮熟的培根可以放在烤箱的盘子上保持热度。\r\n对于蘑菇，用糕点刷刷掉所有污垢，并将蘑菇茎修剪到与蘑菇顶部齐平。用盐和胡椒调味，淋上少许橄榄油。将茎朝上放在烤盘上，煮 1-2 分钟，然后翻转并再煮 3-4 分钟。烹饪时避免过多移动蘑菇，因为这会释放出天然汁液，使蘑菇变得潮湿。\r\n对于西红柿，将西红柿从中心切成两半，如果使用李子西红柿，则将其纵向切成两半，然后用小而锋利的刀去除绿色的“眼睛”。用盐和胡椒调味，淋上少许橄榄油。将切面朝下放在烤盘上，不动煮 2 分钟。轻轻翻面并再次调味。再煮 2-3 分钟，直至变软但仍保持形状。\r\n对于黑布丁，将黑布丁切成3-4片并去除皮。放在烤盘上，每面煎 1.5-2 分钟，直至稍微酥脆。\r\n对于“正确的”炸面包，最好在单独的锅中烹饪。理想情况下，使用几天前的面包。将煎锅加热至中火，并在底部涂上油。加入面包，每面煎 2-3 分钟，直至面包酥脆呈金黄色。如果锅太干，再加一点油。为了获得更浓郁的味道，请在翻转切片后添加一小块黄油。\r\n煎鸡蛋时，将鸡蛋与炸面包一起直接打入锅中，静置 30 秒。加入一大块黄油，融化后在鸡蛋上轻轻泼洒/涂上黄油。煮至您喜欢的阶段，调味并用鱼片轻轻取出。\r\n所有原料煮熟后，盛入温热的盘子中，挤上番茄酱或棕酱即可享用。"},{"id":"52791","n":"Eton Mess","a":"British","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/uuxwvq1483907861.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=43WgiNq54L8","i":[["strawberries","500g"],["double cream","400ml"],["meringue nests","3 x 7.5cm"],["ginger cordial","1 tbsp"],["Mint","sprigs of fresh"]],"s":"Purée half the strawberries in a blender. Chop the remaining strawberries, reserving four for decoration.\r\nWhip the double cream until stiff peaks form, then fold in the strawberry purée and crushed meringue. Fold in the chopped strawberries and ginger cordial, if using.\r\nSpoon equal amounts of the mixture into four cold wine glasses. Serve garnished with the remaining strawberries and a sprig of mint.","z":"将一半草莓放入搅拌机中打成泥。将剩余的草莓切碎，保留四个用于装饰。\r\n搅打双份奶油直至形成硬性发泡，然后拌入草莓泥和压碎的蛋白酥皮。如果使用的话，加入切碎的草莓和生姜甜酒。\r\n将等量的混合物倒入四个冷酒杯中。用剩余的草莓和薄荷枝装饰即可食用。"},{"id":"52802","n":"Fish pie","a":"British","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/ysxwuq1487323065.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2sX4fCgg-UI","i":[["Floury Potatoes","900g"],["Olive Oil","2 tbsp"],["Semi-skimmed Milk","600ml"],["White Fish Fillets","800g"],["Plain flour","1 tbsp"],["Nutmeg","Grating"],["Double Cream","3 tbsp"],["Jerusalem Artichokes","200g"],["Leek","1 finely sliced"],["Prawns","200g peeled raw"],["Parsley","Large handful"],["Dill","Handful"],["Lemon","Grated zest of 1"],["Gruyère","25g grated"],["Lemon","Juice of 1"]],"s":"01.Put the potatoes in a large pan of cold salted water and bring to the boil. Lower the heat, cover, then simmer gently for 15 minutes until tender. Drain, then return to the pan over a low heat for 30 seconds to drive off any excess water. Mash with 1 tbsp olive oil, then season.\r\n02.Meanwhile put the milk in a large sauté pan, add the fish and bring to the boil. Remove from the heat, cover and stand for 3 minutes. Remove the fish (reserving the milk) and pat dry with kitchen paper, then gently flake into an ovenproof dish, discarding the skin and any bones.\r\n03.Heat the remaining oil in a pan, stir in the flour and cook for 30 seconds. Gradually stir in 200-250ml of the reserved milk (discard the rest). Grate in nutmeg, season, then bubble until thick. Stir in the cream.\r\n04.Preheat the oven to 190°C/fan170°C/gas 5. Grate the artichokes and add to the dish with the leek, prawns and herbs. Stir the lemon zest and juice into the sauce, then pour over. Mix gently with a wooden spoon.\r\n05.Spoon the mash onto the fish mixture, then use a fork to make peaks, which will crisp and brown as it cooks. Sprinkle over the cheese, then bake for 35-40 minutes until golden and bubbling. Serve with wilted greens.","z":"01.将土豆放入一大锅冷盐水中煮沸。降低热量，盖上锅盖，然后小火煮 15 分钟直至变软。沥干水分，然后放回锅中，小火加热 30 秒，去除多余的水分。用 1 汤匙橄榄油捣碎，然后调味。\r\n02.同时将牛奶放入大煎锅中，加入鱼煮沸。从火上移开，盖上盖子静置 3 分钟。取出鱼（保留牛奶），用厨房用纸拍干，然后轻轻地切成薄片放入耐热盘中，丢弃鱼皮和任何骨头。\r\n03.将锅中剩余的油加热，加入面粉，煮30秒。逐渐加入200-250ml保留的牛奶（丢弃其余的）。磨碎肉豆蔻，调味，然后起泡直至浓稠。拌入奶油。\r\n04. 将烤箱预热至 190°C/风扇 170°C/煤气 5. 将洋蓟磨碎，与韭葱、虾和香草一起放入盘中。将柠檬皮和柠檬汁拌入酱汁中，然后倒在上面。用木勺轻轻搅拌。\r\n05.将土豆泥舀到鱼肉混合物上，然后用叉子叉出尖峰，煮时会变脆并呈棕色。撒在奶酪上，然后烘烤 35-40 分钟，直至奶酪呈金黄色并冒泡。与枯萎的蔬菜一起食用。"},{"id":"52896","n":"Full English Breakfast","a":"British","c":"Breakfast","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/sqrtwu1511721265.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FXjYU2Ensck","i":[["Sausages","4"],["Bacon","4"],["Mushrooms","4"],["Tomatoes","3"],["Black Pudding","2 sliced"],["Eggs","2"],["Bread","1 Slice"],["Baked Beans","100g"]],"s":"Heat the flat grill plate over a low heat, on top of 2 rings/flames if it fits, and brush sparingly with light olive oil.\r\nCook the sausages first. Add the sausages to the hot grill plate/the coolest part if there is one and allow to cook slowly for about 15-20 minutes, turning occasionally, until golden. After the first 10 minutes, increase the heat to medium before beginning to cook the other ingredients. If you are struggling for space, completely cook the sausages and keep hot on a plate in the oven.\r\nSnip a few small cuts into the fatty edge of the bacon. Place the bacon straight on to the grill plate and fry for 2-4 minutes each side or until your preferred crispiness is reached. Like the sausages, the cooked bacon can be kept hot on a plate in the oven.\r\nFor the mushrooms, brush away any dirt using a pastry brush and trim the stalk level with the mushroom top. Season with salt and pepper and drizzle over a little olive oil. Place stalk-side up on the grill plate and cook for 1-2 minutes before turning and cooking for a further 3-4 minutes. Avoid moving the mushrooms too much while cooking, as this releases the natural juices, making them soggy.\r\nFor the tomatoes, cut the tomatoes across the centre/or in half lengthways if using plum tomatoes , and with a small, sharp knife remove the green 'eye'. Season with salt and pepper and drizzle with a little olive oil. Place cut-side down on the grill plate and cook without moving for 2 minutes. Gently turn over and season again. Cook for a further 2-3 minutes until tender but still holding their shape.\r\nFor the black pudding, cut the black pudding into 3-4 slices and remove the skin. Place on the grill plate and cook for 1½-2 minutes each side until slightly crispy.\r\nFor 'proper' fried bread it's best to cook it in a separate pan. Ideally, use bread that is a couple of days old. Heat a frying pan to a medium heat and cover the base with oil. Add the bread and cook for 2-3 minutes each side until crispy and golden. If the pan becomes too dry, add a little more oil. For a richer flavour, add a knob of butter after you turn the slice.\r\nFor the fried eggs, break the egg straight into the pan with the fried bread and leave for 30 seconds. Add a good knob of butter and lightly splash/baste the egg with the butter when melted. Cook to your preferred stage, season and gently remove with a fish slice.\r\nOnce all the ingredients are cooked, serve on warm plates and enjoy straight away with a good squeeze of tomato ketchup or brown sauce.","z":"用小火加热平烤盘，如果合适的话，放在 2 个环/火焰的顶部，并少量刷上淡橄榄油。\r\n先煮香肠。将香肠放入热烤盘/最凉的部分（如果有）中，慢慢煮约 15-20 分钟，偶尔翻动，直至呈金黄色。前 10 分钟后，将火调至中火，然后开始烹饪其他原料。如果您空间有限，请将香肠完全煮熟并放在烤箱中的盘子上保持热度。\r\n在培根的脂肪边缘剪一些小切口。将培根直接放在烤盘上，每面煎 2-4 分钟，或直至达到您喜欢的松脆程度。与香肠一样，煮熟的培根可以放在烤箱的盘子上保持热度。\r\n对于蘑菇，用糕点刷刷掉所有污垢，并将蘑菇茎修剪到与蘑菇顶部齐平。用盐和胡椒调味，淋上少许橄榄油。将茎朝上放在烤盘上，煮 1-2 分钟，然后翻转并再煮 3-4 分钟。烹饪时避免过多移动蘑菇，因为这会释放出天然汁液，使蘑菇变得潮湿。\r\n对于西红柿，将西红柿从中心切成两半，如果使用李子西红柿，则将其纵向切成两半，然后用小而锋利的刀去除绿色的“眼睛”。用盐和胡椒调味，淋上少许橄榄油。将切面朝下放在烤盘上，不动煮 2 分钟。轻轻翻面并再次调味。再煮 2-3 分钟，直至变软但仍保持形状。\r\n对于黑布丁，将黑布丁切成3-4片并去除皮。放在烤盘上，每面煎 1.5-2 分钟，直至稍微酥脆。\r\n对于“正确的”炸面包，最好在单独的锅中烹饪。理想情况下，使用几天前的面包。将煎锅加热至中火，并在底部涂上油。加入面包，每面煎 2-3 分钟，直至面包酥脆呈金黄色。如果锅太干，再加一点油。为了获得更浓郁的味道，请在翻转切片后添加一小块黄油。\r\n煎鸡蛋时，将鸡蛋与炸面包一起直接打入锅中，静置 30 秒。加入一大块黄油，融化后在鸡蛋上轻轻泼洒/涂上黄油。煮至您喜欢的阶段，调味并用鱼片轻轻取出。\r\n所有原料煮熟后，盛入温热的盘子中，挤上番茄酱或棕酱即可享用。"},{"id":"52890","n":"Jam Roly-Poly","a":"British","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/ysqupp1511640538.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5ZYWVQ8imVA","i":[["Butter","50g"],["Self-raising Flour","250g"],["Vanilla","1 small"],["Suet","50g"],["Milk","150ml"],["Raspberry Jam","100g"],["Custard","to serve"]],"s":"Put a deep roasting tin onto the bottom shelf of the oven, and make sure that there’s another shelf directly above it. Pull the roasting tin out on its shelf, fill two-thirds with boiling water from the kettle, then carefully slide it back in. Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Tear off a large sheet of foil and greaseproof paper (about 30 x 40cm). Sit the greaseproof on top of the foil and butter it.\r\nTip butter, flour and vanilla seeds into a food processor; pulse until the butter has disappeared. Tip into a mixing bowl. Stir through the suet, pour in the milk and work together with a cutlery knife until you get a sticky dough. You may need a drop more milk, depending on your flour.\r\nTip the dough out onto a floured surface, quickly pat together to smooth, then roll out to a square roughly 25 x 25cm. Spread the jam all over, leaving a gap along one edge, then roll up from the opposite edge. Pinch the jam-free edge into the dough where it meets, and pinch the ends roughly, too. Carefully lift onto the greased paper, join-side down (you might find a flat baking sheet helpful for this), loosely bring up the paper and foil around it, then scrunch together along the edges and ends to seal. The roly-poly will puff quite a bit during cooking so don’t wrap it tightly. Lift the parcel directly onto the rack above the tin and cook for 1 hr.\r\nLet the pudding sit for 5 mins before unwrapping, then carefully open the foil and paper, and thickly slice to serve.","z":"将一个深烤盘放在烤箱的底部架子上，并确保其正上方有另一个架子。将烤盘从架子上拉出，从水壶中倒入三分之二的沸水，然后小心地将其滑回原位。将烤箱加热至 180C/160C 风扇/煤气 4. 撕下一大张箔纸和防油纸（约 30 x 40 厘米）。将防油剂放在箔纸上并涂上黄油。\r\n将黄油、面粉和香草籽倒入食品加工机中；脉冲直至黄油消失。倒入搅拌碗中。搅拌羊脂，倒入牛奶，用餐具刀搅拌，直到形成粘稠的面团。您可能需要多滴牛奶，具体取决于您的面粉。\r\n将面团倒在撒了面粉的表面上，快速拍打至光滑，然后擀成约 25 x 25 厘米的正方形。将果酱铺满，沿一侧留出间隙，然后从另一侧卷起。将无果酱的边缘捏入面团的交接处，并粗略地捏住两端。小心地提起涂有油脂的纸，连接面朝下（您可能会发现平坦的烤盘对此很有帮助），松散地提起纸和周围的箔纸，然后沿着边缘和末端揉捏在一起以密封。不倒翁在烹饪过程中会膨胀很多，所以不要把它包得很紧。将包裹直接放在罐子上方的架子上，煮 1 小时。\r\n让布丁静置 5 分钟，然后打开包装，然后小心地打开铝箔和纸，切成厚片即可食用。"},{"id":"52887","n":"Kedgeree","a":"British","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/utxqpt1511639216.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_Pw1I1-SItE","i":[["Smoked Haddock","300g"],["Bay Leaves","2"],["Milk","300ml"],["Eggs","4"],["Parsley","Handful"],["Coriander","Handful"],["Vegetable Oil","2 tbs"],["Onion","1 chopped"],["Coriander","1 tsp"],["Curry Powder","2 tsp"],["Rice","300g"]],"s":"For the rice, heat the oil in a large, lidded pan, add the onion, then gently fry for 5 mins until softened but not coloured. Add the spices, season with salt, then continue to fry until the mix start to go brown and fragrant; about 3 mins.\r\nAdd the rice and stir in well. Add 600ml water, stir, then bring to the boil. Reduce to a simmer, then cover for 10 mins. Take off the heat and leave to stand, covered, for 10-15 mins more. The rice will be perfectly cooked if you do not lift the lid before the end of the cooking.\r\nMeanwhile, put the haddock and bay leaves in a frying pan, cover with the milk, then poach for 10 mins until the flesh flakes. Remove from the milk, peel away the skin, then flake the flesh into thumbsize pieces. Place the eggs in a pan, cover with water, bring to the boil, then reduce to a simmer. Leave for 4½-5 mins, plunge into cold water, then peel and cut the eggs into quarters. Gently mix the fish, eggs, parsley, coriander and rice together in the pan. Serve hot, sprinkled with a few extra herbs.","z":"对于米饭，在一个带盖的大锅中加热油，加入洋葱，然后轻轻煎 5 分钟，直至变软但不变色。加入香料，加盐调味，然后继续炒，直到混合物开始变成棕色并散发出香味；约3分钟\r\n加入米饭并搅拌均匀。加入600毫升水，搅拌，然后煮沸。转小火，然后盖上锅盖煮 10 分钟。关掉火，盖上盖子，静置 10-15 分钟。如果在烹饪结束前不打开盖子，米饭就会完全煮熟。\r\n与此同时，将黑线鳕和月桂叶放入煎锅中，倒入牛奶，煮10分钟，直至肉片剥落。从牛奶中取出，剥去外皮，然后将果肉切成拇指大小的碎片。将鸡蛋放入锅中，加水盖过鸡蛋，煮沸，然后改小火煮。静置 4.5-5 分钟，浸入冷水中，然后将鸡蛋剥皮并切成四等份。将鱼、鸡蛋、欧芹、香菜和米饭在锅中轻轻混合。趁热食用，撒上一些额外的香草。"},{"id":"52877","n":"Lamb and Potato pie","a":"British","c":"Lamb","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/sxrpws1511555907.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NCyPaaUNYUk","i":[["Lamb Shoulder","500g"],["Flour","1 tbls"],["Vegetable Oil","Dash"],["Onion","1 sliced"],["Carrots","2 sliced"],["Vegetable Stock","350ml/12fl"],["Potatoes","500g"],["Shortcrust Pastry","450g"],["Eggs","To Glaze"]],"s":"Dust the meat with flour to lightly coat.\r\nHeat enough vegetable oil in a large saucepan to fill the base, and fry the onion and meat until lightly browned. Season with salt and pepper.\r\nAdd the carrots, stock and more seasoning to taste.\r\nBring to the boil, cover and reduce the heat to a simmer. Simmer for at least an hour or until the meat is tender. Take your time cooking the meat, the longer you leave it to cook, the better the flavour will be.\r\nPreheat the oven to 180C/350F/Gas 4.\r\nAdd the drained potato cubes to the lamb.\r\nTurn the mixture into a pie dish or casserole and cover with the shortcrust pastry. Make three slits in the top of the pastry to release any steam while cooking.\r\nBrush with beaten egg and bake for about 40 minutes, until the pastry is golden brown.\r\nServe.","z":"在肉上撒上面粉，轻轻地裹上一层面粉。\r\n在大平底锅中加热足够的植物油以填充底部，然后将洋葱和肉煎至浅棕色。用盐和胡椒调味。\r\n加入胡萝卜、高汤和更多调味料。\r\n煮沸，盖上盖子，将火调至小火慢炖。煮至少一个小时或直到肉变软。煮肉的时候要慢慢来，煮的时间越长，味道就越好。\r\n将烤箱预热至 180C/350F/燃气 4.\r\n将沥干的土豆块加入羊肉中。\r\n将混合物放入馅饼盘或砂锅中，并盖上酥皮糕点。在糕点顶部切三个切口，以便在烹饪时释放蒸汽。\r\n刷上打散的鸡蛋，烘烤约40分钟，直至糕点呈金黄色。\r\n服务。"},{"id":"52884","n":"Lancashire hotpot","a":"British","c":"Lamb","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/uttrxw1511637813.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=w6TS5J8YRA4","i":[["Butter","100g"],["Lamb","900g"],["Lamb Kidney","3"],["Onions","2 medium"],["Carrots","4 sliced"],["Plain Flour","25g"],["Worcestershire Sauce","2 tsp"],["Chicken Stock","500ml"],["Bay Leaves","2"],["Potatoes","900g"]],"s":"Heat oven to 160C/fan 140C/gas 3. Heat some dripping or butter in a large shallow casserole dish, brown the lamb in batches, lift to a plate, then repeat with the kidneys.\r\nFry the onions and carrots in the pan with a little more dripping until golden. Sprinkle over the flour, allow to cook for a couple of mins, shake over the Worcestershire sauce, pour in the stock, then bring to the boil. Stir in the meat and bay leaves, then turn off the heat. Arrange the sliced potatoes on top of the meat, then drizzle with a little more dripping. Cover, then place in the oven for about 1½ hrs until the potatoes are cooked.\r\nRemove the lid, brush the potatoes with a little more dripping, then turn the oven up to brown the potatoes, or finish under the grill for 5-8 mins until brown.","z":"将烤箱加热至 160C/风扇 140C/煤气 3. 在一个大的浅砂锅中加热一些滴水或黄油，将羊肉分批煎成棕色，提起到盘子上，然后对腰子重复上述步骤。\r\n将洋葱和胡萝卜放入锅中煎至金黄色。撒上面粉，煮几分钟，摇匀伍斯特沙司，倒入高汤，然后煮沸。拌入肉和月桂叶，然后关火。将切好的土豆片放在肉上，然后淋上一点水。盖上盖子，然后放入烤箱约 1.5 小时，直至土豆煮熟。\r\n取下盖子，在土豆上多刷一点水，然后将烤箱调高，使土豆变成棕色，或者在烤架下烤 5-8 分钟，直到变成棕色。"},{"id":"52900","n":"Madeira Cake","a":"British","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/urtqut1511723591.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-YDh4WEmK_E","i":[["Butter","175g"],["Caster Sugar","175g"],["Eggs","3"],["Self-raising Flour","250g"],["Milk","3 tbs"],["Lemon","Zest of 1"],["Mixed Peel","To Glaze"]],"s":"Pre-heat the oven to 180C/350F/Gas 4. Grease an 18cm/7in round cake tin, line the base with greaseproof paper and grease the paper.\r\nCream the butter and sugar together in a bowl until pale and fluffy. Beat in the eggs, one at a time, beating the mixture well between each one and adding a tablespoon of the flour with the last egg to prevent the mixture curdling.\r\nSift the flour and gently fold in, with enough milk to give a mixture that falls slowly from the spoon. Fold in the lemon zest.\r\nSpoon the mixture into the prepared tin and lightly level the top. Bake on the middle shelf of the oven for 30-40 minutes, or until golden-brown on top and a skewer inserted into the centre comes out clean.\r\nRemove from the oven and set aside to cool in the tin for 10 minutes, then turn it out on to a wire rack and leave to cool completely.\r\nTo serve, decorate the cake with the candied peel.","z":"将烤箱预热至 180C/350F/燃气 4. 在 18 厘米/7 英寸圆形蛋糕罐上涂上油脂，在底部铺上防油纸，并在纸上涂上油脂。\r\n将黄油和糖一起放入碗中，搅打至发白蓬松。一次打一个鸡蛋，将每个鸡蛋之间的混合物充分搅拌，并在最后一个鸡蛋中加入一汤匙面粉，以防止混合物凝结。\r\n筛入面粉，轻轻拌入足够的牛奶，形成混合物，从勺子中缓慢落下。拌入柠檬皮碎。\r\n将混合物倒入准备好的罐子中，并轻轻平整顶部。在烤箱的中间架子上烘烤 30-40 分钟，或直至顶部呈金黄色，然后用叉子插入中间，取出时干净即可。\r\n从烤箱中取出，放在罐中冷却 10 分钟，然后将其放在金属架上，让其完全冷却。\r\n食用时，用蜜饯果皮装饰蛋糕。"},{"id":"52880","n":"McSinghs Scotch pie","a":"British","c":"Lamb","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/vssrtx1511557680.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1nArqhRyszw","i":[["Cumin","2 tsp"],["Rapeseed Oil","1 tbs"],["Red Onions","2 finely chopped"],["Garlic Clove","6"],["Green Chilli","3 finely chopped"],["Red Pepper","1 finely chopped"],["Nutmeg","1 tsp"],["Coriander","2 tsp"],["Lamb Mince","1kg"],["Pepper","1 tsp"],["Coriander","3 tbs"],["Plain Flour","340g"],["Salt","½ tsp"],["Milk","90 ml"],["Lard","150g"],["Egg Yolks","Beaten"]],"s":"Heat a large frying pan and toast the cumin seeds for a few minutes, then set aside. Heat the oil in the same pan and fry the onion, garlic, chilli, pepper and a good pinch of salt for around eight minutes, until there is no moisture left. Remove from the heat, stir in the toasted cumin seeds, ground mace (or nutmeg) and ground coriander. Leave to cool.\r\nIn a large bowl mix together the minced lamb, white pepper, fresh coriander, and the cooled spiced onion mixture until combined. Set aside, covered, in the fridge.\r\nPreheat the oven to 200C/400F/Gas 6 and generously grease a 20cm/8in diameter loose-bottomed or springform round cake tin with lard.\r\nTo make the pastry, sift the flour and salt in a large bowl and make a well in the centre.\r\nPut the milk, lard and 90ml/3fl oz of water in a saucepan and heat gently. When the lard has melted, increase the heat and bring to the boil.\r\nPour the boiling liquid into the flour, and use a wooden spoon to combine until cool enough to handle. Bring together into a ball.\r\nDust a work surface with flour and, working quickly, knead the dough briefly – it will be soft and moist. Set aside a third of the pastry and roll the rest out on a well-floured surface. Line the pie dish with the pastry, pressing it right up the sides until it pokes just over the top of the tin.\r\nAdd the filling into the pastry-lined tin bit by bit. As you reach the top, form a slight peak. Roll out the reserved pastry and top the pie with it. Pinch the edges to seal and trim the excess. Poke a hole in the top of the pie and insert a small tube made from aluminium foil to allow steam to escape.\r\nBrush the top of the pie with a little beaten egg yolk, and bake in the preheated oven for 30 minutes (put a tray on the shelf below to catch any drips). Then reduce the temperature to 160C/325F/Gas 3 and cook for a further 1¼ hours until golden-brown. Leave to cool completely before refrigerating for two hours, or overnight.\r\nRun a knife around the edge of the pie, remove from the tin and serve with chutneys, salads or pickles.","z":"加热一个大煎锅，将孜然籽烤几分钟，然后放在一边。在同一锅中加热油，然后将洋葱、大蒜、辣椒、胡椒和一小撮盐炒约八分钟，直到没有水分为止。离火，拌入烤孜然籽、肉豆蔻粉（或肉豆蔻粉）和香菜粉。让它冷却。\r\n在一个大碗中，将切碎的羊肉、白胡椒、新鲜香菜和冷却的香料洋葱混合物混合在一起，直至混合。放在一边，盖上盖子，放入冰箱。\r\n将烤箱预热至 200C/400F/燃气 6，并在直径 20 厘米/8 英寸的松底或弹簧圆形蛋糕罐上涂上大量猪油。\r\n制作糕点时，将面粉和盐筛入一个大碗中，并在中间挖一个洞。\r\n将牛奶、猪油和 90 毫升/3 液量盎司水放入平底锅中，轻轻加热。当猪油融化后，增加热量并煮沸。\r\n将沸腾的液体倒入面粉中，然后用木勺搅拌直至冷却到可以处理的程度。聚集成一个球。\r\n在工作表面撒上面粉，然后快速揉捏面团，面团会变得柔软湿润。留出三分之一的糕点，将其余的放在撒了面粉的表面上。将馅饼盘与糕点排成一行，将其从侧面压上，直到它正好戳到罐子的顶部。\r\n将馅料一点一点地加入到衬有糕点的罐子中。当你到达顶部时，形成一个小山峰。将保留的糕点擀开，然后将其放在馅饼上。捏住边缘以密封并修剪多余的部分。在馅饼顶部戳一个洞，插入一根铝箔制成的小管，让蒸汽逸出。\r\n在派的顶部刷上少许打好的蛋黄，然后在预热的烤箱中烘烤 30 分钟（在下面的架子上放一个托盘以接住滴落的水滴）。然后将温度降至 160C/325F/Gas 3，再煮 1¼ 小时直至呈金黄色。使其完全冷却，然后冷藏两个小时或过夜。\r\n用刀在馅饼边缘划一圈，从罐中取出，与酸辣酱、沙拉或泡菜一起食用。"},{"id":"52991","n":"Mince Pies","a":"British","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/qe8pf51576795532.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PnXft7lQNJE","i":[["Butter","225g"],["Plain Flour","350g"],["Caster Sugar","100g"],["Mincemeat","280g"],["Egg","1 small"],["Icing Sugar","Topping"]],"s":"To make the pastry, rub 225g cold, diced butter into 350g plain flour, then mix in 100g golden caster sugar and a pinch of salt.\r\n\r\nCombine the pastry into a ball – don’t add liquid – and knead it briefly. The dough will be fairly firm, like shortbread dough. You can use the dough immediately, or chill for later.\r\n\r\nPreheat the oven to 200C/gas 6/fan 180C. Line 18 holes of two 12-hole patty tins, by pressing small walnut-sized balls of pastry into each hole.\r\n\r\nSpoon 280g mincemeat into the pies.\r\n\r\nTake slightly smaller balls of pastry than before and pat them out between your hands to make round lids, big enough to cover the pies. \r\n\r\nTop the pies with their lids, pressing the edges gently together to seal – you don’t need to seal them with milk or egg as they will stick on their own. (The pies may now be frozen for up to 1 month).\r\n\r\nBeat 1 small egg and brush the tops of the pies. Bake for 20 mins until golden. Leave to cool in the tin for 5 mins, then remove to a wire rack.\r\n\r\nTo serve, lightly dust with icing sugar.","z":"制作糕点时，将 225 克切块的冷黄油加入 350 克普通面粉中，然后加入 100 克金砂糖和少许盐混合。\r\n\r\n将糕点揉成一个球——不要添加液体——然后短暂揉捏。面团会相当坚硬，就像脆饼面团一样。您可以立即使用面团，也可以稍后冷藏。\r\n\r\n将烤箱预热至 200C/煤气 6/风扇 180C。将核桃大小的小糕点球压入每个孔中，将两个 12 孔肉饼罐排成 18 个孔。\r\n\r\n将 280 克肉末舀入馅饼中。\r\n\r\n取比以前稍小的糕点球，用双手拍打它们，形成圆形盖子，大小足以盖住馅饼。 \r\n\r\n盖上馅饼的盖子，轻轻地将边缘压在一起密封——你不需要用牛奶或鸡蛋密封它们，因为它们会自己粘在一起。 （馅饼现在可以冷冻最多 1 个月）。\r\n\r\n打 1 个小鸡蛋，刷在馅饼的顶部。烤20分钟直至金黄。在罐中冷却 5 分钟，然后移至金属架上。\r\n\r\n食用时，轻轻撒上糖粉。"},{"id":"52876","n":"Minced Beef Pie","a":"British","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/xwutvy1511555540.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QY47h-uqq5g","i":[["Vegetable Oil","2 tbs"],["Minced Beef","500g"],["Onion","1 chopped"],["Tomato Puree","1 tbls"],["Plain Flour","1 ½ tbsp"],["Mushrooms","75g"],["Beef Stock","250ml"],["Worcestershire Sauce","Dash"],["Shortcrust Pastry","400g"],["Egg Yolks","1"]],"s":"Preheat the oven to 200C/400F/Gas 6.\r\nHeat the oil in a deep frying pan and fry the beef mince for 4-5 minutes, breaking it up with a wooden spoon as it browns.\r\nAdd the onion and cook for 2-3 minutes, then stir in the tomato purée and cook for 2-3 more minutes. Stir in the flour and cook for a further minute, then add the chopped mushrooms, the stout or beef stock and a couple of dashes of Worcestershire sauce. Bring to the boil, then reduce the heat, cover the pan with a lid and leave to simmer for 20 minutes. Set aside and leave to cool, then turn the meat mixture into a one litre pie dish.\r\nRoll out the pastry on a floured work surface until it is slightly larger than the pie dish. Gently drape the pastry over the dish, pressing firmly onto the edges. Trim, then shape the edges into a fluted shape.\r\nCut some leaf shapes out of the pastry trimmings and decorate the top of the pie, sticking them to the pastry with the beaten egg yolk.\r\nMake three or four slits in the pastry to allow the steam to escape, then brush the pie with the rest of the beaten egg yolk and bake in the oven for 20-25 minutes, or until golden-brown.\r\nTo serve, slice into wedges.","z":"将烤箱预热至 200C/400F/燃气 6.\r\n在深煎锅中加热油，将牛肉末煎4-5分钟，当其变成棕色时用木勺将其打碎。\r\n加入洋葱，煮 2-3 分钟，然后加入番茄泥，再煮 2-3 分钟。加入面粉，再煮一分钟，然后加入切碎的蘑菇、黑啤酒或牛肉高汤和几滴伍斯特沙司。煮沸，然后关小火，盖上锅盖，小火煮20分钟。放在一边冷却，然后将肉混合物放入一升的馅饼盘中。\r\n将糕点放在撒了面粉的工作台上擀开，直到它比馅饼盘稍大。轻轻地将糕点放在盘子上，用力压在边缘上。修剪，然后将边缘塑造成凹槽形状。\r\n从糕点边上切出一些叶子形状，装饰馅饼的顶部，用打好的蛋黄将它们粘在糕点上。\r\n在糕点上划三到四个口子，让蒸汽逸出，然后在馅饼上刷上剩余的打好的蛋黄，然后在烤箱中烘烤 20-25 分钟，或直至呈金黄色。\r\n食用时，切成楔形。"},{"id":"52864","n":"Mushroom & Chestnut Rotolo","a":"British","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/ssyqwr1511451678.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GNN7_ZSJ5YE","i":[["Mushrooms","30g"],["Chestnuts","240g"],["Challots","3"],["Garlic","3 cloves"],["Rosemary","3 sprigs"],["Wild Mushrooms","500g"],["Soy Sauce","2 tblsp"],["White Wine","125ml"],["Lasagne Sheets","350g"],["Breadcrumbs","4 tbsp"],["Sage","1/2 handful"],["Truffle Oil","to serve"]],"s":"Soak the dried mushrooms in 350ml boiling water and set aside until needed. Blitz ¾ of the chestnuts with 150ml water until creamy. Roughly chop the remaining chestnuts.\r\nHeat 2 tbsp olive oil in a large non-stick frying pan. Fry the shallots with a pinch of salt until softened, then add the garlic, chopped chestnuts and rosemary, and fry for 2 mins more. Add the wild mushrooms, 2 tbsp oil and some seasoning. Cook for 3 mins until they begin to soften. Drain and roughly chop the dried mushrooms (reserve the soaking liquid), then add those too, along with the soy sauce, and fry for 2 mins more.\r\nWhisk the wine, reserved mushroom liquid and chestnut cream together to create a sauce. Season, then add half to the mushroom mixture in the pan and cook for 1 min until the sauce becomes glossy. Remove and discard the rosemary sprigs, then set the mixture aside.\r\nHeat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Bring a large pan of salted water to the boil and get a large bowl of ice water ready. Drop the lasagne sheets into the boiling water for 2 mins or until pliable and a little cooked, then immediately plunge them into the cold water. Using your fingers, carefully separate the sheets and transfer to a clean tea towel. Spread a good spoonful of the sauce on the bottom two thirds of each sheet, then, rolling away from yourself, roll up the shorter ends. Cut each roll in half, then position the rolls of pasta cut-side up in a pie dish that you are happy to serve from at the table. If you have any mushroom sauce remaining after you’ve rolled up all the sheets, simply push it into some of the exposed rolls of pasta.\r\nPour the rest of the sauce over the top of the pasta, then bake for 10 mins or until the pasta no longer has any resistance when tested with a skewer.\r\nMeanwhile, put the breadcrumbs, the last 2 tbsp olive oil, sage leaves and some seasoning in a bowl, and toss everything together. Scatter the rotolo with the crumbs and sage, then bake for another 10 mins, until the top is golden and the sage leaves are crispy. Leave to cool for 10 mins to allow the pasta to absorb the sauce, then drizzle with a little truffle oil, if you like, before taking your dish to the table.","z":"将干蘑菇浸泡在350毫升沸水中，备用。将 3/4 栗子加入 150 毫升水，搅拌至呈奶油状。将剩下的栗子大致切碎。\r\n在一个大的不粘煎锅中加热 2 汤匙橄榄油。用少许盐将青葱炒软，然后加入大蒜、切碎的栗子和迷迭香，再炒 2 分钟。加入野蘑菇、2汤匙油和一些调味料。煮 3 分钟直到它们开始软化。将干蘑菇沥干并大致切碎（保留浸泡液），然后将其与酱油一起加入，再煎2分钟。\r\n将葡萄酒、保留的蘑菇液和栗子奶油搅拌在一起，制成酱汁。调味，然后将一半加入锅中的蘑菇混合物中，煮 1 分钟，直至酱汁变得有光泽。取出并丢弃迷迭香小枝，然后将混合物放在一边。\r\n将烤箱加热至 180C/160C 风扇/燃气 4. 将一大锅盐水煮沸，并准备好一大碗冰水。将千层面放入沸水中煮 2 分钟或直至变软并稍微煮熟，然后立即将其浸入冷水中。用手指小心地将床单分开并转移到干净的茶巾上。在每张纸的底部三分之二处涂上一勺酱汁，然后远离自己，卷起较短的一端。将每卷意大利面切成两半，然后将切面朝上的意大利面卷放在您乐意在餐桌上享用的馅饼盘中。如果卷起所有的面片后还剩下蘑菇酱，只需将其推入一些暴露的意大利面卷中即可。\r\n将剩余的酱汁倒在意大利面的上面，然后烘烤 10 分钟，或者直到用串测试意大利面不再有任何阻力。\r\n同时，将面包屑、最后 2 汤匙橄榄油、鼠尾草叶和一些调味料放入碗中，然后将所有东西搅拌在一起。将面包屑和鼠尾草撒在罗托洛上，然后再烤 10 分钟，直到顶部呈金黄色，鼠尾草叶酥脆。冷却 10 分钟，让意大利面吸收酱汁，如果您愿意，可以淋上一点松露油，然后再将菜肴上桌。"},{"id":"52902","n":"Parkin Cake","a":"British","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/qxuqtt1511724269.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k1lG4vk2MQA","i":[["Butter","200g"],["Egg","1 large"],["Milk","4 tbs"],["Golden Syrup","200g"],["Black Treacle","85g"],["Brown Sugar","85g"],["Oatmeal","100g"],["Self-raising Flour","250g"],["Ground Ginger","1 tbs"]],"s":"Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3. Grease a deep 22cm/9in square cake tin and line with baking parchment. Beat the egg and milk together with a fork.\r\n\r\nGently melt the syrup, treacle, sugar and butter together in a large pan until the sugar has dissolved. Remove from the heat. Mix together the oatmeal, flour and ginger and stir into the syrup mixture, followed by the egg and milk.\r\n\r\nPour the mixture into the tin and bake for 50 mins - 1 hr until the cake feels firm and a little crusty on top. Cool in the tin then wrap in more parchment and foil and keep for 3-5 days before eating if you can – it’ll become softer and stickier the longer you leave it, up to 2 weeks.\r\n","z":"将烤箱加热至 160C/140C 风扇/燃气 3. 在 22 厘米/9 英寸深的方形蛋糕罐中涂上油脂，并铺上烘焙纸。用叉子将鸡蛋和牛奶搅拌在一起。\r\n\r\n在一个大平底锅中轻轻地将糖浆、糖浆、糖和黄油一起融化，直到糖溶解。从火上移开。将燕麦片、面粉和生姜混合在一起，搅拌成糖浆混合物，然后加入鸡蛋和牛奶。\r\n\r\n将混合物倒入罐中，烘烤 50 分钟 - 1 小时，直至蛋糕感觉坚硬且顶部有点硬皮。在罐头中冷却，然后用更多的羊皮纸和箔纸包起来，如果可以的话，在食用前保存 3-5 天——放置时间越长（最多 2 周），它会变得更软、更粘。"},{"id":"52901","n":"Rock Cakes","a":"British","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/tqrrsq1511723764.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tY3taZO3Aro","i":[["Self-raising Flour","225g"],["Caster Sugar","75g"],["Baking Powder","1 tsp"],["Butter","125g"],["Dried Fruit","150g"],["Eggs","1"],["Milk","1 tbs"],["Vanilla Extract","2 tsp"]],"s":"Preheat oven to 180C/350F/Gas 4 and line a baking tray with baking parchment.\r\nMix the flour, sugar and baking powder in a bowl and rub in the cubed butter until the mixture looks like breadcrumbs, then mix in the dried fruit.\r\nIn a clean bowl, beat the egg and milk together with the vanilla extract.\r\nAdd the egg mixture to the dry ingredients and stir with a spoon until the mixture just comes together as a thick, lumpy dough. Add a teaspoon more milk if you really need it to make the mixture stick together.\r\nPlace golfball-sized spoons of the mixture onto the prepared baking tray. Leave space between them as they will flatten and spread out to double their size during baking.\r\nBake for 15-20 minutes, until golden-brown. Remove from the oven, allow to cool for a couple of minutes then turn them out onto a wire rack to cool.","z":"将烤箱预热至 180C/350F/Gas 4，并在烤盘上铺上烤羊皮纸。\r\n将面粉、糖和发酵粉放入碗中混合，加入黄油块，直至混合物看起来像面包屑，然后加入干果。\r\n在一个干净的碗中，将鸡蛋和牛奶与香草精一起搅拌。\r\n将鸡蛋混合物加入干原料中，用勺子搅拌，直到混合物形成厚实的块状面团。如果您确实需要使混合物粘在一起，请再加一茶匙牛奶。\r\n将高尔夫球大小的混合物勺子放在准备好的烤盘上。在它们之间留出空间，因为它们在烘烤过程中会变平并展开至两倍大小。\r\n烘烤 15-20 分钟，直至呈金黄色。从烤箱中取出，冷却几分钟，然后将它们放在金属架上冷却。"},{"id":"52960","n":"Salmon Avocado Salad","a":"British","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/1549542994.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FJiu2S0Xap0","i":[["Salmon","400g"],["Avocado","3"],["Cucumber","1"],["Spinach","400g"],["Mint","4 tbs"],["Lime","zest and juice of 1"],["Honey","2 tsp"],["Olive Oil","3 tbs"]],"s":"Season the salmon, then rub with oil. Mix the dressing ingredients together. Halve, stone, peel and slice the avocados. Halve and quarter the cucumber lengthways, then cut into slices. Divide salad, avocado and cucumber between four plates, then drizzle with half the dressing.\r\n\r\nHeat a non-stick pan. Add the salmon and fry for 3-4 mins on each side until crisp but still moist inside. Put a salmon fillet on top of each salad and drizzle over the remaining dressing. Serve warm.","z":"将鲑鱼调味，然后涂上油。将调味料混合在一起。将牛油果切半、去核、去皮并切片。将黄瓜纵向切成两半并切成四等份，然后切成片。将沙拉、牛油果和黄瓜分装在四个盘子中，然后淋上一半的调料。\r\n\r\n加热不粘锅。加入三文鱼，每面煎 3-4 分钟，直至酥脆但内部仍湿润。在每份沙拉上放一片三文鱼片，然后淋在剩余的调料上。趁热食用。"},{"id":"52784","n":"Smoky Lentil Chili with Squash","a":"British","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/uwxqwy1483389553.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pKmqawK2Tqs","i":[["Olive Oil","1 tbls"],["Onion","1"],["Leek","1 chopped"],["Garlic","3 cloves"],["Cumin","4 tsp ground"],["Coriander","2 tsp ground"],["Smoked Paprika","1 tsp"],["Cinnamon","1/2 tsp"],["Chili Powder","1 tsp"],["Cocoa","1 tsp"],["Dried Oregano","1/2 tsp"],["Diced Tomatoes","1 can"],["Water","3 cups"],["Carrots","3 chopped"],["Brown Lentils","1 1/2 cups"],["Sea Salt","1 tsp"],["Squash","1 Small"],["Cashews","1 Cup"],["Apple Cider Vinegar","1 tsp"]],"s":"Begin by roasting the squash. Slice it into thin crescents and drizzle with a little oil and sprinkle with sea salt. I added a fresh little sage I had in the fridge, but it’s unnecessary. Roast the squash a 205 C (400 F) for 20-30 minutes, flipping halfway through, until soft and golden. Let cool and chop into cubes.\r\nMeanwhile, rinse the lentils and cover them with water. Bring them to the boil then turn down to a simmer and let cook (uncovered) for 20-30 minutes, or until tender. Drain and set aside.\r\nWhile the lentils are cooking heat the 1 Tbsp. of oil on low in a medium pot. Add the onions and leeks and sauté for 5 or so minutes, or until they begin to soften. Add the garlic next along with the cumin and coriander, cooking for a few more minutes. Add the remaining spices – paprika, cinnamon, chilli, cocoa, Worcestershire sauce, salt, and oregano. Next add the can of tomatoes, the water or stock, and carrots. Let simmer, covered, for 20 minutes or until the veg is tender and the mixture has thickened up. You’ll need to check on the pot periodically for a stir and a top of of liquid if needed.\r\nAdd the lentils and chopped roasted squash. Let cook for 10 more minutes to heat through.\r\nServe with sliced jalapeno, lime wedges, cilantro, green onions, and cashew sour cream.\r\n\r\nSIMPLE CASHEW SOUR CREAM\r\n\r\n1 Cup Raw Unsalted Cashews\r\nPinch Sea Salt\r\n1 tsp. Apple Cider Vinegar\r\nWater\r\n\r\nBring some water to the boil, and use it to soak the cashews for at least four hours. Alternatively, you can use cold water and let the cashews soak overnight, but I’m forgetful/lazy, so often use the boil method which is much faster.\r\nAfter the cashews have soaked, drain them and add to a high speed blender. Begin to puree, slowly adding about 1/2 cup fresh water, until a creamy consistency is reached. You may need to add less or more water to reach the desired consistency.\r\nAdd a pinch of sea salt and vinegar (or lemon juice).","z":"首先烤南瓜。将其切成薄薄的新月形，淋上少许油，撒上海盐。我加了冰箱里的新鲜小鼠尾草，但这是不必要的。将南瓜在 205 摄氏度（400 华氏度）的温度下烤 20-30 分钟，中途翻转，直至南瓜变软并呈金黄色。冷却并切成方块。\r\n同时，冲洗扁豆并用水覆盖它们。将它们煮沸，然后转小火煮（不加盖）20-30 分钟，或直至变软。沥干并放在一边。\r\n煮扁豆时，加热 1 汤匙。中号锅中的油要低。加入洋葱和韭葱，炒 5 分钟左右，或直到它们开始变软。接下来加入大蒜、小茴香和香菜，再煮几分钟。添加剩余的香料——辣椒粉、肉桂、辣椒、可可、伍斯特沙司、盐和牛至。接下来加入一罐西红柿、水或高汤和胡萝卜。盖上锅盖，小火煮 20 分钟或直至蔬菜变软且混合物变稠。如果需要，您需要定期检查锅的搅拌情况和液体顶部。\r\n加入扁豆和切碎的烤南瓜。再煮 10 分钟以使其热透。\r\n与墨西哥辣椒片、酸橙角、香菜、葱和腰果酸奶油一起食用。\r\n\r\n简单腰果酸奶油\r\n\r\n1 杯生无盐腰果\r\n捏点海盐\r\n1 茶匙。苹果醋\r\n水\r\n\r\n将一些水烧开，然后用它浸泡腰果至少四个小时。或者，你可以用冷水让腰果浸泡过夜，但我很健忘/懒，所以经常使用煮沸的方法，这样更快。\r\n腰果浸泡后，沥干水分并加入高速搅拌机中。开始打泥，慢慢加入约 1/2 杯淡水，直至达到奶油状稠度。您可能需要添加更少或更多的水才能达到所需的稠度。\r\n添加少许海盐和醋（或柠檬汁）。"},{"id":"52886","n":"Spotted Dick","a":"British","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/xqvyqr1511638875.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fu15XOF-ros","i":[["Self-raising Flour","250g"],["Salt","pinch"],["Suet","125g"],["Currants","175g"],["Caster Sugar","80g"],["Lemon","Zest of 1"],["Orange","Zest of 1"],["Milk","150ml"],["Custard","to serve"]],"s":"Put the flour and salt in a bowl. Add the suet, currants, sugar, lemon and orange zest.\r\nPour in 150ml milk and mix to a firm but moist dough, adding the extra milk if necessary.\r\nShape into a fat roll about 20cm long. Place on a large rectangle of baking parchment. Wrap loosely to allow for the pudding to rise and tie the ends with string like a Christmas cracker.\r\nPlace a steamer over a large pan of boiling water, add the pudding to the steamer, cover and steam for 1 1/2 hours. Top up the pan with water from time to time.\r\nRemove from the steamer and allow to cool slightly before unwrapping. Serve sliced with custard.","z":"将面粉和盐放入碗中。加入羊脂、醋栗、糖、柠檬和橙皮。\r\n倒入 150 毫升牛奶，搅拌成坚硬但湿润的面团，如有必要，可添加额外的牛奶。\r\n擀成约20厘米长的脂肪卷。放在一大块长方形的烘焙羊皮纸上。松松地包起来，让布丁膨胀起来，然后像圣诞拉炮一样用绳子把两端系起来。\r\n将蒸锅置于一大锅沸水之上，将布丁放入蒸锅中，盖上锅盖，蒸 1 1/2 小时。时不时地给锅加水。\r\n从蒸锅中取出并稍微冷却后再打开包装。切片与蛋奶冻一起食用。"},{"id":"52881","n":"Steak and Kidney Pie","a":"British","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/qysyss1511558054.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oTw5tPt4KmA","i":[["Puff Pastry","300g"],["Egg White","Beaten"],["Egg Yolks","Beaten"],["Vegetable Oil","2 tbs"],["Beef","70 ml"],["Lamb Kidney","200g"],["Onions","2 chopped"],["Plain Flour","30g"],["Beef Stock","85 ml"],["Salt","pinch"],["Pepper","pinch"],["Worcestershire Sauce","Dash"]],"s":"Preheat the oven to 220C/425F/Gas 7\r\nHeat the vegetable oil in a large frying pan, and brown the beef all over. (You may need to do this in batches.) Set aside, then brown the kidneys on both sides in the same pan. Add the onions and cook for 3-4 minutes.\r\nReturn the beef to the pan, sprinkle flour over and coat the meat and onions\r\nAdd the stock to the pan, stir well and bring to the boil.\r\nTurn the heat down and simmer for 1½ hours without a lid. If the liquid evaporates too much, add more stock.\r\nRemove from the heat. Add salt, pepper and Worcestershire sauce and allow to cool completely. Place the cooked meat mixture into a pie dish.\r\nRoll out the pastry to 5mm/¼in thick and 5cm/2in larger than the dish you are using.\r\nUsing a rolling pin, lift the pastry and place it over the top of the pie dish. Trim and crimp the edges with your fingers and thumb.\r\nBrush the surface with the beaten egg mixture and bake for 30-40 minutes until golden-brown and puffed.\r\nServe with creamy mash and steamed vegetables to soak up the gravy.","z":"将烤箱预热至 220C/425F/燃气 7\r\n在大煎锅中加热植物油，将牛肉煎至焦黄。 （你可能需要分批进行。）放在一边，然后在同一个锅中将肾两面煎成棕色。加入洋葱，煮 3-4 分钟。\r\n将牛肉放回锅中，撒上面粉，裹上肉和洋葱\r\n将高汤加入锅中，搅拌均匀并煮沸。\r\n将火调低，不盖盖子，煮 1.5 小时。如果液体蒸发太多，请添加更多原料。\r\n从火上移开。加入盐、胡椒和伍斯特酱，让其完全冷却。将煮熟的肉混合物放入馅饼盘中。\r\n将糕点擀成 5 毫米/¼ 英寸厚，比您使用的盘子大 5 厘米/2 英寸。\r\n使用擀面杖将糕点提起并将其放在馅饼盘的顶部。用手指和拇指修剪并卷曲边缘。\r\n在表面刷上打散的鸡蛋混合物，烘烤 30-40 分钟，直至呈金黄色并膨化。\r\n与奶油泥和蒸蔬菜一起食用，以吸收肉汁。"},{"id":"52883","n":"Sticky Toffee Pudding","a":"British","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/xqqqtu1511637379.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Wytv3bjqJII","i":[["Butter","100g"],["Muscovado Sugar","175g"],["Eggs","2 large"],["Self-raising Flour","225g"],["Baking Powder","1 tsp"],["Bicarbonate Of Soda","1 tsp"],["Black Treacle","3 tbs"],["Milk","275ml"],["Double Cream","to serve"],["Butter","100g"],["Muscovado Sugar","125g"],["Black Treacle","1 tbs"],["Double Cream","300ml"],["Vanilla Extract","1 tsp"]],"s":"Preheat the oven to 180C/160C Fan/Gas 4. Butter a wide shallow 1.7-litre/3-pint ovenproof dish.\r\nPut the butter, sugar, eggs, flour, baking powder, bicarbonate of soda and treacle into a mixing bowl. Beat using an electric handheld whisk for about 30 seconds or until combined. Pour in the milk gradually and whisk again until smooth. Pour into the prepared dish. Bake for 35–40 minutes or until well risen and springy in the centre.\r\nTo make the sauce, put all the ingredients into a saucepan and stir over a low heat until the sugar has dissolved and the butter has melted. Bring to the boil, stirring for a minute.\r\nTo serve, pour half the sauce over the pudding in the baking dish. Serve with the cream or ice cream.","z":"将烤箱预热至 180C/160C 风扇/煤气 4. 在 1.7 升/3 品脱的耐热宽浅盘上涂抹黄油。\r\n将黄油、糖、鸡蛋、面粉、泡打粉、小苏打和糖蜜放入搅拌碗中。使用电动手持式搅拌器搅拌约 30 秒或直至混合。逐渐倒入牛奶，再次搅拌至光滑。倒入准备好的盘子里。烘烤 35-40 分钟或直至中心充分发酵并有弹性。\r\n制作酱汁时，将所有原料放入平底锅中，小火搅拌，直至糖溶解和黄油融化。煮沸，搅拌一分钟。\r\n食用时，将一半酱汁倒在烤盘中的布丁上。与奶油或冰淇淋一起食用。"},{"id":"52793","n":"Sticky Toffee Pudding Ultimate","a":"British","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/xrptpq1483909204.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hKq6RbxJHBo","i":[["Medjool dates","225g"],["water","175ml Boiling"],["vanilla extract","1 tsp"],["self-raising flour","175g"],["bicarbonate of soda","1 tsp"],["eggs","2"],["butter","85g"],["demerara sugar","140g"],["black treacle","2 tbsp"],["milk","100ml"],["ice cream","1 scoop"],["muscovado sugar","175g"],["butter","50g"],["double cream","225ml"],["black treacle","1 tbsp"]],"s":"Stone and chop the dates quite small, put them in a bowl, then pour the boiling water over. Leave for about 30 mins until cool and well-soaked, then mash a bit with a fork. Stir in the vanilla extract. Butter and flour seven mini pudding tins (each about 200ml/7fl oz) and sit them on a baking sheet. Heat oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4.\r\nWhile the dates are soaking, make the puddings. Mix the flour and bicarbonate of soda together and beat the eggs in a separate bowl. Beat the butter and sugar together in a large bowl for a few mins until slightly creamy (the mixture will be grainy from the sugar). Add the eggs a little at a time, beating well between additions. Beat in the black treacle then, using a large metal spoon, gently fold in one-third of the flour, then half the milk, being careful not to overbeat. Repeat until all the flour and milk is used. Stir the soaked dates into the pudding batter. The mix may look a little curdled at this point and will be like a soft, thick batter. Spoon it evenly between the tins and bake for 20-25 mins, until risen and firm.\r\nMeanwhile, put the sugar and butter for the sauce in a medium saucepan with half the cream. Bring to the boil over a medium heat, stirring all the time, until the sugar has completely dissolved. Stir in the black treacle, turn up the heat slightly and let the mixture bubble away for 2-3 mins until it is a rich toffee colour, stirring occasionally to make sure it doesn’t burn. Take the pan off the heat and beat in the rest of the cream.\r\nRemove the puddings from the oven. Leave in the tins for a few mins, then loosen them well from the sides of the tins with a small palette knife before turning them out. You can serve them now with the sauce drizzled over, but they’ll be even stickier if left for a day or two coated in the sauce. To do this, pour about half the sauce into one or two ovenproof serving dishes. Sit the upturned puddings on the sauce, then pour the rest of the sauce over them. Cover with a loose tent of foil so that the sauce doesn’t smudge (no need to chill).\r\nWhen ready to serve, heat oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4. Warm the puddings through, still covered, for 15-20 mins or until the sauce is bubbling. Serve them on their own, or with cream or custard.","z":"将枣子去核，切成小块，放入碗中，然后倒入开水。静置约 30 分钟，直至冷却并充分浸泡，然后用叉子捣碎。加入香草精搅拌。在七个迷你布丁罐（每个约 200 毫升/7 液量盎司）中涂上黄油和面粉，然后将它们放在烤盘上。将烤箱加热至 180C/风扇 160C/燃气 4.\r\n当枣子浸泡的时候，做布丁。将面粉和小苏打混合在一起，然后在另一个碗中搅打鸡蛋。将黄油和糖在一个大碗中一起搅拌几分钟，直到稍微呈奶油状（混合物会因糖而呈颗粒状）。一次一点地加入鸡蛋，每次加入之间搅拌均匀。然后加入黑色糖蜜，用大金属勺轻轻拌入三分之一面粉，然后加入一半牛奶，小心不要搅拌过度。重复此操作，直到用完所有面粉和牛奶。将泡好的枣子拌入布丁面糊中。此时混合物可能看起来有点凝结，并且会像软而浓的面糊一样。将其均匀地舀在罐子之间，烘烤 20-25 分钟，直至发酵变硬。\r\n与此同时，将用于酱汁的糖和黄油放入一个中等大小的平底锅中，加入一半的奶油。用中火煮沸，一直搅拌，直到糖完全溶解。拌入黑色糖蜜，稍微调高热量，让混合物冒泡 2-3 分钟，直到变成浓郁的太妃糖颜色，偶尔搅拌以确保不会烧焦。把锅从火上拿下来，加入剩下的奶油。\r\n将布丁从烤箱中取出。将罐子放在罐子里几分钟，然后用小调色刀将它们从罐子的侧面充分松开，然后将其取出。你现在可以把酱汁淋在上面，但如果把酱汁涂上一两天，它们会更粘。为此，将大约一半的酱汁倒入一两个耐热盘中。将翻转的布丁放在酱汁上，然后将其余的酱汁倒在上面。用松散的箔纸盖住，这样酱汁就不会弄脏（不需要冷却）。\r\n准备食用时，将烤箱加热至 180C/风扇 160C/煤气 4. 将布丁加热 15-20 分钟，仍盖上盖子，或直至酱汁冒泡。单独食用，或与奶油或蛋奶冻一起食用。"},{"id":"53005","n":"Strawberry Rhubarb Pie","a":"British","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/178z5o1585514569.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tGw5Pwm4YA0","i":[["Flour","350g"],["Salt","1 tsp"],["Sugar","2 tbs"],["Butter","1 cup"],["Water","1/2 cup"],["Rhubarb","450g"],["Strawberries","450g"],["Cornstarch","3 tbs"],["Sugar","150g"],["Cinnamon","1/4 tsp"],["Lemon Juice","1 tsp"],["Unsalted Butter","2 tbs"],["Milk","2 tbs"],["Sugar","Spinkling"]],"s":"Pie Crust:  In a food processor, place the flour, salt, and sugar and process until combined. Add the butter and process until the mixture resembles coarse\r\n\r\nmeal (about 15 seconds). Pour 1/4 cup (60 ml) water in a slow, steady stream, through the feed tube until the dough just holds together when pinched. If necessary, add more water. Do not process more than 30 seconds.\r\nTurn the dough onto your work surface and gather into a ball. Divide the dough in half, flattening each half into a disk, cover with plastic wrap, and refrigerate for about one hour before using. This will chill the butter and relax the gluten in the flour. \r\n\r\nAfter the dough has chilled sufficiently, remove one portion of the dough from the fridge and place it on a lightly floured surface.  Roll the pastry into a 12 inch (30 cm) circle. (To prevent the pastry from sticking to the counter and to ensure uniform thickness, keep lifting up and turning the pastry a quarter turn as you roll (always roll from the center of the pastry outwards).)  Fold the dough in half and gently transfer to a 9 inch (23 cm) pie pan. Brush off any excess flour and trim any overhanging pastry to an edge of 1/2 inch (1.5 cm). Refrigerate the pastry, covered with plastic wrap, while you make the filling. \r\n\r\nRemove the second round of pastry and roll it into a 13 inch (30 cm) circle. Using a pastry wheel or pizza cutter, cut the pastry into about 3/4 inch (2 cm) strips. Place the strips of pastry on a parchment paper-lined baking sheet, cover with plastic wrap, and place in the refrigerator for about 10 minutes. \r\n\r\nMake the Strawberry Rhubarb Filling: Place the cut strawberries and rhubarb in a large bowl. In a small bowl mix together the cornstarch, sugar, and ground cinnamon. \r\n\r\nRemove the chilled pie crust from the fridge. Sprinkle about 2 tablespoons of the sugar mixture over the bottom of the pastry crust. Add the remaining sugar mixture to the strawberries and rhubarb and gently toss to combine. Pour the fruit mixture into the prepared pie shell. Sprinkle the fruit with about 1 teaspoon of lemon juice and dot with 2 tablespoons of butter.\r\n\r\nRemove the lattice pastry from the refrigerator and, starting at the center with the longest strips and working outwards, place half the strips, spacing about 1 inch (2.5 cm) apart, on top of the filling. (Use the shortest pastry strips at the outer edges.) Then, gently fold back, about halfway, every other strip of pastry. Take another strip of pastry and place it perpendicular on top of the first strips of pastry. Unfold the bottom strips of pastry and then fold back the strips that weren't folded back the first time. Lay another strip of pastry perpendicular on top of the filling and then continue with the remaining strips. Trim the edges of the pastry strips, leaving a 1 inch (2.5 cm) overhang. Seal the edges of the pastry strips by folding them under the bottom pastry crust and flute the edges of the pastry. Brush the lattice pastry with milk and sprinkle with a little sugar. Cover and place in the refrigerator while you preheat the oven to 400 degrees F (205 degrees C) and place the oven rack in the lower third of the oven. Put a baking sheet, lined with aluminum foil, on the oven rack (to catch any spills.)\r\n\r\nPlace the pie plate on the hot baking sheet and bake the pie for about 35 minutes and then, if the edges of the pie are browning too much, cover with a foil ring. Continue to bake the pie for about another 10 minutes or until the crust is a golden brown color and the fruit juices begin to bubble.\r\n\r\nRemove the pie from the oven and place on a wire rack to cool for several hours. Serve at room temperature with softly whipped cream or vanilla ice cream. Leftovers can be stored in the refrigerator for about 3 days. Reheat before serving. This pie can be frozen.\r\n\r\nMakes one 9 inch (23 cm) pie.","z":"饼皮：将面粉、盐和糖放入食品加工机中，加工直至混合。加入黄油并加工直至混合物变得粗糙\r\n\r\n进餐（约15秒）。通过加料管缓慢、稳定地倒入 1/4 杯（60 毫升）水，直到面团捏紧时刚好粘在一起。如有必要，添加更多水。处理时间不要超过 30 秒。\r\n将面团转到工作台上并聚集成球。将面团分成两半，将每一半压平成圆盘，用保鲜膜覆盖，并在使用前冷藏约一小时。这将使黄油冷却并松弛面粉中的面筋。 \r\n\r\n面团充分冷却后，从冰箱中取出一部分面团，并将其放在撒有少许面粉的表面上。  将糕点卷成 12 英寸（30 厘米）的圆圈。 （为了防止糕点粘在柜台上并确保厚度均匀，在滚动时不断提起并转动糕点四分之一圈（始终从糕点中心向外滚动）。）将面团对折并轻轻转移到 9 英寸（23 厘米）馅饼盘中。刷掉多余的面粉，并将所有悬垂的糕点修剪至 1/2 英寸（1.5 厘米）的边缘。制作馅料时，将糕点冷藏，并用保鲜膜覆盖。 \r\n\r\n取出第二圈糕点，并将其卷成 13 英寸（30 厘米）的圆圈。使用糕点轮或披萨刀，将糕点切成约 3/4 英寸（2 厘米）的条状。将糕点条放在衬有羊皮纸的烤盘上，盖上保鲜膜，然后放入冰箱约 10 分钟。 \r\n\r\n制作草莓大黄馅：将切好的草莓和大黄放入一个大碗中。在一个小碗中将玉米淀粉、糖和肉桂粉混合在一起。 \r\n\r\n从冰箱中取出冷冻的馅饼皮。将约 2 汤匙糖混合物撒在糕点皮的底部。将剩余的糖混合物加入草莓和大黄中，轻轻搅拌混合。将水果混合物倒入准备好的馅饼壳中。在水果上撒上约 1 茶匙柠檬汁，并撒上 2 汤匙黄油。\r\n\r\n从冰箱中取出格子糕点，从最长的条带的中心开始向外，将一半的条带放在馅料的顶部，间隔约 1 英寸（2.5 厘米）。 （在外边缘使用最短的糕点条。）然后，每隔一条糕点轻轻向后折叠大约一半。取另一条糕点，将其垂直放在第一条糕点的顶部。展开底部的糕点条，然后将第一次未折回的条带折回。将另一条糕点垂直放在馅料顶部，然后继续放置剩余的条。修剪糕点条的边缘，留下 1 英寸（2.5 厘米）的悬垂部分。将糕点条折叠到底部糕点皮下，密封糕点条的边缘，并在糕点边缘形成凹槽。在格子糕点上刷上牛奶，撒上少许糖。盖上盖子并放入冰箱，同时将烤箱预热至 400 华氏度（205 摄氏度），并将烤箱架放在烤箱的下三分之一处。将衬有铝箔的烤盘放在烤箱架上（以接住溢出物。）\r\n\r\n将馅饼盘放在热烤盘上，将馅饼烘烤约 35 分钟，然后，如果馅饼边缘过度褐变，请盖上箔纸环。继续将馅饼烘烤约 10 分钟，或直至饼皮呈金黄色并且果汁开始冒泡。\r\n\r\n将馅饼从烤箱中取出，放在金属架上冷却几个小时。在室温下与淡奶油或香草冰淇淋一起食用。剩菜可以在冰箱里保存大约3天。食用前重新加热。这个馅饼可以冷冻。\r\n\r\n制作一个 9 英寸（23 厘米）的馅饼。"},{"id":"52889","n":"Summer Pudding","a":"British","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/rsqwus1511640214.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=akJIO6UhXtA","i":[["Strawberries","300g"],["Blackberries","250g"],["Redcurrants","100g"],["Raspberries","500g"],["Caster Sugar","175g"],["Bread","7 Slices"]],"s":"Bring out the juices: Wash fruit and gently dry on kitchen paper – keep strawberries separate. Put sugar and 3 tbsp water into a large pan. Gently heat until sugar dissolves – stir a few times. Bring to a boil for 1 min, then tip in the fruit (not strawberries). Cook for 3 mins over a low heat, stirring 2-3 times. The fruit will be softened, mostly intact and surrounded by dark red juice. Put a sieve over a bowl and tip in the fruit and juice.\r\nLine the bowl with cling film and prepare the bread: Line the 1.25-litre basin with cling film as this will help you to turn out the pudding. Overlap two pieces of cling film in the middle of the bowl as it’s easier than trying to get one sheet to stick to all of the curves. Let the edges overhang by about 15cm. Cut the crusts off the bread. Cut 4 pieces of bread in half, a little on an angle, to give 2 lopsided rectangles per piece. Cut 2 slices into 4 triangles each and leave the final piece whole.\r\nBuild the pud: Dip the whole piece of bread into the juice for a few secs just to coat. Push this into the bottom of the basin. Now dip the wonky rectangular pieces one at a time and press around the basin’s sides so that they fit together neatly, alternately placing wide and narrow ends up. If you can’t quite fit the last piece of bread in it doesn’t matter, just trim into a triangle, dip in juice and slot in. Now spoon in the softened fruit, adding the strawberries here and there as you go.\r\nLet flavours mingle then serve: Dip the bread triangles in juice and place on top – trim off overhang with scissors. Keep leftover juice for later. Bring cling film up and loosely seal. Put a side plate on top and weight down with cans. Chill for 6 hrs or overnight. To serve, open out cling film then put a serving plate upside-down on top and flip over. serve with leftover juice, any extra berries and cream.","z":"取出果汁：清洗水果并在厨房用纸上轻轻擦干 - 将草莓分开。将糖和 3 汤匙水放入大锅中。轻轻加热直至糖溶解 - 搅拌几次。煮沸 1 分钟，然后倒入水果（不是草莓）。小火煮3分钟，搅拌2-3次。果实会变软，大部分完好无损，周围有深红色的汁液。在碗上放一个筛子，倒入水果和果汁。\r\n在碗上铺上保鲜膜并准备面包：在 1.25 升的盆上铺上保鲜膜，这样可以帮助您制作布丁。将两片保鲜膜重叠在碗的中间，因为这比试图让一张保鲜膜粘在所有曲线上更容易。让边缘伸出约 15 厘米。把面包上的面包皮切掉。将 4 片面包切成两半，稍微倾斜一点，每片形成 2 个不平衡的矩形。将 2 片切成 4 个三角形，并将最后一块保留完整。\r\n制作布丁：将整片面包浸入果汁中几秒钟，以使其覆盖。将其推入盆底部。现在，一次将不稳定的矩形块浸入其中，然后按压盆的侧面，使它们整齐地组合在一起，交替将宽端和窄端放在一起。如果你不能完全放入最后一块面包，也没关系，只需将其切成三角形，浸入果汁并放入即可。现在用勺子舀入软化的水果，边加边加草莓。\r\n让味道混合在一起，然后上桌：将三角形面包浸入果汁中，然后放在上面 - 用剪刀修剪掉突出的部分。剩下的汁留着以后用。将保鲜膜卷起并松散密封。将侧板放在上面，然后用罐头压下。冷藏 6 小时或过夜。食用时，打开保鲜膜，然后将盘子倒置在上面并翻转。与剩余的果汁、多余的浆果和奶油一起食用。"},{"id":"52882","n":"Three Fish Pie","a":"British","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/spswqs1511558697.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ds1Jb8H5Sg8","i":[["Potatoes","1kg"],["Butter","Knob"],["Milk","Dash"],["Gruyere","50g"],["Butter","75g"],["Leek","2 sliced"],["Plain Flour","75g"],["White Wine","150ml"],["Milk","568ml"],["Parsley","2 tbs chopped"],["Salmon","250g"],["Haddock","250g"],["Smoked Haddock","250g"],["Eggs","6"]],"s":"Preheat the oven to 200C/400F/Gas 6 (180C fan).\r\nPut the potatoes into a saucepan of cold salted water. Bring up to the boil and simmer until completely tender. Drain well and then mash with the butter and milk. Add pepper and taste to check the seasoning. Add salt and more pepper if necessary.\r\nFor the fish filling, melt the butter in a saucepan, add the leeks and stir over the heat. Cover with a lid and simmer gently for 10 minutes, or until soft. Measure the flour into a small bowl. Add the wine and whisk together until smooth.\r\nAdd the milk to the leeks, bring to the boil and then add the wine mixture. Stir briskly until thickened. Season and add the parsley and fish. Stir over the heat for two minutes, then spoon into an ovenproof casserole. Scatter over the eggs. Allow to cool until firm.\r\nSpoon the mashed potatoes over the fish mixture and mark with a fork. Sprinkle with cheese.\r\nBake for 30-40 minutes, or until lightly golden-brown on top and bubbling around the edges.","z":"将烤箱预热至 200C/400F/Gas 6（180C 风扇）。\r\n将土豆放入装有冷盐水的平底锅中。煮沸并小火煮至完全变软。沥干水分，然后与黄油和牛奶一起捣碎。加入胡椒粉并尝一尝以检查调味料。如有必要，添加盐和更多胡椒粉。\r\n制作鱼馅时，将黄油在平底锅中融化，加入韭菜，加热搅拌。盖上盖子，小火煮 10 分钟，或直至变软。将面粉量入一个小碗中。加入酒并搅拌直至光滑。\r\n将牛奶加入韭菜中，煮沸，然后加入酒混合物。快速搅拌直至变稠。调味并加入欧芹和鱼。加热搅拌两分钟，然后将勺子放入耐热砂锅中。撒在鸡蛋上。让其冷却直至变硬。\r\n将土豆泥舀到鱼混合物上，并用叉子标记。撒上奶酪。\r\n烘烤 30-40 分钟，或直至顶部呈浅金黄色且边缘冒泡。"},{"id":"52822","n":"Toad In The Hole","a":"British","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/ytuvwr1503070420.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=t1dWkDrC330","i":[["sausages","8"],["vegetable oil","3 tbsp"],["plain flour","100g"],["eggs","2 medium"],["horseradish","1 tbsp grated"],["milk","225ml"],["cherry tomatoes","200g"]],"s":"Preheat the oven to 200°C/fan180°C/gas 6. fry sausages in a non-stick pan until browned.\r\nDrizzle vegetable oil in a 30cm x 25cm x 6cm deep roasting tray and heat in the oven for 5 minutes.\r\nPut the plain flour in a bowl, crack in the medium free-range eggs, then stir in the grated horseradish. Gradually beat in the semi-skimmed milk. Season.\r\nPut the sausages into the hot roasting tray and pour over the batter. Top with cherry tomatoes on the vine and cook for 30 minutes until puffed and golden.","z":"将烤箱预热至 200°C/风扇180°C/煤气 6. 在不粘锅中将香肠煎至棕色。\r\n在 30 厘米 x 25 厘米 x 6 厘米深的烤盘中淋上植物油，然后在烤箱中加热 5 分钟。\r\n将普通面粉放入碗中，打入中等散养鸡蛋，然后加入磨碎的辣根搅拌。逐渐加入半脱脂牛奶。季节。\r\n将香肠放入热烤盘中，然后倒在面糊上。在上面放上挂在藤上的樱桃番茄，煮 30 分钟，直至膨化呈金黄色。"},{"id":"52892","n":"Treacle Tart","a":"British","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/wprvrw1511641295.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YMmgKCNcqwI","i":[["Plain Flour","250g"],["Butter","135g"],["Golden Syrup","400g"],["Breadcrumbs","150g"],["Lemons","Zest of 2"],["Eggs","1 beaten"]],"s":"First make the short crust pastry: measure the flour into a large bowl and rub in the butter with your fingertips until the mixture resembles fine breadcrumbs (alternatively, this can be done in a food processor). Add about three tablespoons of cold water and mix to a firm dough, wrap in cling film and chill in the fridge for about 20 minutes.\r\nPreheat the oven to 200C/400F/Gas 6 and put a heavy baking tray in the oven to heat up. Grease a deep 18cm/7in loose-bottomed fluted flan tin with butter.\r\nRemove about 150g/5½oz of pastry from the main ball and set aside for the lattice top.\r\nRoll the rest of the pastry out thinly on a lightly floured work surface and line the prepared flan tin with the pastry.\r\nPrick the base with a fork, to stop the base rising up during baking.\r\nPlace the reserved pastry for the lattice top on cling film and roll out thinly. Egg wash the pastry and set aside to chill in the fridge (the cling film makes it easier to move about). Do not cut into strips at this stage. Do not egg wash the strips once they are on the tart as it will drip into the treacle mixture.\r\nTo make the filling, heat the syrup gently in a large pan but do not boil.\r\nOnce melted, add the breadcrumbs, lemon juice and zest to the syrup. (You can add less lemon if you would prefer less citrus taste.) If the mixture looks runny, add a few more breadcrumbs.\r\nPour the syrup mixture into the lined tin and level the surface.\r\nRemove the reserved pastry from the fridge and cut into long strips, 1cm/½in wide. Make sure they are all longer than the edges of the tart tin.\r\nEgg wash the edge of the pastry in the tin, and start to make the woven laying lattice pattern over the mixture, leave the strips hanging over the edge of the tin.\r\nOnce the lattice is in place, use the tin edge to cut off the strips by pressing down with your hands, creating a neat finish.\r\nBake on the pre-heated baking tray in the hot oven for about 10 minutes until the pastry has started to colour, and then reduce the oven temperature to 180C/350F/Gas 4. If at this stage the lattice seems to be getting too dark brown, cover the tart with tin foil.\r\nBake for a further 25-30 minutes until the pastry is golden-brown and the filling set.\r\nRemove the tart from the oven and leave to firm up in the tin. Serve warm or cold.","z":"首先制作酥皮糕点：将面粉放入一个大碗中，用指尖揉入黄油，直到混合物类似于细面包屑（或者，这可以在食品加工机中完成）。加入约三汤匙冷水，搅拌成坚硬的面团，用保鲜膜包起来，放入冰箱冷藏约20分钟。\r\n将烤箱预热至 200C/400F/Gas 6，然后将重烤盘放入烤箱中加热。在 18 厘米/7 英寸深的松底凹槽果馅饼罐上涂上黄油。\r\n从主球上取出约 150 克/5 盎司的糕点，放在一边作为格子顶部。\r\n将剩余的糕点在撒有少许面粉的工作台上擀薄，然后将准备好的果馅饼罐装在糕点上。\r\n用叉子在底部扎孔，防止烘烤过程中底部升起。\r\n将保留的格子顶部糕点放在保鲜膜上，然后擀薄。将糕点涂上鸡蛋液，放在冰箱里冷藏（保鲜膜更容易移动）。在此阶段不要切成条。一旦将条放在馅饼上，请勿用鸡蛋清洗，因为它会滴入糖浆混合物中。\r\n制作馅料时，将糖浆在大锅中轻轻加热，但不要沸腾。\r\n融化后，将面包屑、柠檬汁和果皮加入糖浆中。 （如果您不喜欢柑橘味，可以少加柠檬。）如果混合物看起来很稀，请再加一些面包屑。\r\n将糖浆混合物倒入有衬里的罐子中并平整表面。\r\n从冰箱中取出保留的糕点，切成 1 厘米/½ 英寸宽的长条。确保它们都比挞罐的边缘长。\r\n用鸡蛋清洗罐中糕点的边缘，然后开始在混合物上制作编织的格子图案，使条带悬挂在罐的边缘上。\r\n一旦格子就位，用手向下压，用锡边剪掉条子，形成整齐的表面。\r\n将预热的烤盘放在热烤箱中烘烤约 10 分钟，直至糕点开始上色，然后将烤箱温度降至 180C/350F/燃气 4. 如果在此阶段格子似乎变得太深棕色，请用锡纸盖住挞皮。\r\n再烘烤 25-30 分钟，直至糕点呈金黄色且馅料凝固。\r\n将馅饼从烤箱中取出，放在罐中使其变硬。热食或冷食。"},{"id":"52845","n":"Turkey Meatloaf","a":"British","c":"Miscellaneous","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/ypuxtw1511297463.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mTvlmY4vCug","i":[["Olive Oil","1 tblsp"],["Onion","1 large"],["Garlic","1 clove peeled crushed"],["Worcestershire Sauce","2 tblsp"],["Tomato Puree","3 tsp"],["Turkey Mince","500g"],["Eggs","1 large"],["Breadcrumbs","85g"],["Barbeque Sauce","2 tblsp"],["Cannellini Beans","800g"],["Parsley","2 tblsp"]],"s":"Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Heat the oil in a large frying pan and cook the onion for 8-10 mins until softened. Add the garlic, Worcestershire sauce and 2 tsp tomato purée, and stir until combined. Set aside to cool.\r\n\r\nPut the turkey mince, egg, breadcrumbs and cooled onion mix in a large bowl and season well. Mix everything to combine, then shape into a rectangular loaf and place in a large roasting tin. Spread 2 tbsp barbecue sauce over the meatloaf and bake for 30 mins.\r\n\r\nMeanwhile, drain 1 can of beans only, then pour both cans into a large bowl. Add the remaining barbecue sauce and tomato purée. Season and set aside.\r\n\r\nWhen the meatloaf has had its initial cooking time, scatter the beans around the outside and bake for 15 mins more until the meatloaf is cooked through and the beans are piping hot. Scatter over the parsley and serve the meatloaf in slices.","z":"Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Heat the oil in a large frying pan and cook the onion for 8-10 mins until softened.加入大蒜、伍斯特酱和 2 茶匙番茄酱，搅拌直至混合。放在一边冷却。\r\n\r\nPut the turkey mince, egg, breadcrumbs and cooled onion mix in a large bowl and season well.将所有东西混合在一起，然后成型为矩形面包并放入一个大烤罐中。 Spread 2 tbsp barbecue sauce over the meatloaf and bake for 30 mins.\r\n\r\n同时，仅沥干一罐豆子，然后将两罐豆子倒入一个大碗中。加入剩余的烧烤酱和番茄泥。调味并放在一边。\r\n\r\n当肉饼完成最初的烹饪时间后，将豆子撒在外面，再烘烤 15 分钟，直到肉饼煮熟并且豆子滚烫。撒上欧芹，将肉饼切成片。"},{"id":"52863","n":"Vegetarian Casserole","a":"British","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/vptwyt1511450962.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oHmKE9mWtWM","i":[["Rapeseed Oil","1"],["Onion","1"],["Garlic","3 cloves"],["Paprika","1 tsp"],["Cumin","½ tsp"],["Thyme","1 tblsp"],["Carrots","3 Medium"],["Celery","2 small stalks"],["Red Pepper","1"],["Yellow Pepper","1"],["Tomato","2 x 400g tins"],["Vegetable Stock Cube","250ml"],["Courgettes","2 sliced"],["Thyme","2 sprigs"],["Lentils","250g"]],"s":"Heat the oil in a large, heavy-based pan. Add the onions and cook gently for 5 – 10 mins until softened.\r\nAdd the garlic, spices, dried thyme, carrots, celery and peppers and cook for 5 minutes.\r\nAdd the tomatoes, stock, courgettes and fresh thyme and cook for 20 - 25 minutes.\r\nTake out the thyme sprigs. Stir in the lentils and bring back to a simmer. Serve with wild and white basmati rice, mash or quinoa.","z":"在一个大的厚底锅中加热油。加入洋葱，轻轻煮 5 - 10 分钟直至变软。\r\n加入大蒜、香料、干百里香、胡萝卜、芹菜和辣椒，煮 5 分钟。\r\n加入西红柿、高汤、西葫芦和新鲜百里香，煮 20 - 25 分钟。\r\n取出百里香小枝。拌入扁豆并重新煮沸。与野生印度香米、白印度香米、土豆泥或藜麦一起食用。"},{"id":"52867","n":"Vegetarian Chilli","a":"British","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/wqurxy1511453156.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=D0bFRVH_EqU","i":[["Roasted Vegetables","400g"],["Kidney Beans","1 can"],["Chopped Tomatoes","1 can"],["Mixed Grain","1 Packet"]],"s":"Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/ gas 6. Cook the vegetables in a casserole dish for 15 mins. Tip in the beans and tomatoes, season, and cook for another 10-15 mins until piping hot. Heat the pouch in the microwave on High for 1 min and serve with the chilli.","z":"将烤箱加热至 200C/180C 风扇/燃气 6. 将蔬菜放入砂锅中煮 15 分钟。倒入豆子和西红柿，调味，再煮 10-15 分钟，直至变热。将袋子放入微波炉中高火加热 1 分钟，然后与辣椒一起食用。"},{"id":"53097","n":"Yorkshire Puddings","a":"British","c":"Miscellaneous","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/x5qz5k1761595900.jpg","y":"https://www.bing.com/videos/riverview/relatedvideo?q=yorkshire+pudding+pecipe+youtune&&mid=8A37CC95703100D3C8E58A37CC95703100D3C8E5&mcid=757E2787DB13499281255AD4321A912C&FORM=VAMGZC","i":[["Flour","140g"],["Egg","4"],["Milk","200ml"],["Sunflower Oil","Drizzle"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat oven to 230C/fan 210C/gas 8.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nDrizzle a little sunflower oil evenly into two 4-hole Yorkshire pudding tins or two 12-hole non-stick muffin tins and place in the oven to heat through.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nTo make the batter, tip 140g plain flour into a bowl and beat in 4 eggs until smooth.\r\n\r\nstep 4\r\nGradually add 200ml milk and carry on beating until the mix is completely lump-free. Season with salt and pepper.\r\n\r\nstep 5\r\nPour the batter into a jug, then remove the hot tins from the oven. Carefully and evenly pour the batter into the holes.\r\n\r\nstep 6\r\nPlace the tins back in the oven and leave undisturbed for 20-25 mins until the puddings have puffed up and browned.\r\n\r\nstep 7\r\nServe immediately. You can now cool them and freeze for up to 1 month.","z":"步骤1\r\n将烤箱加热至 230C/风扇 210C/燃气 8.\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将少许葵花籽油均匀地淋入两个 4 孔约克郡布丁罐或两个 12 孔不粘松饼罐中，然后放入烤箱加热。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n制作面糊时，将 140 克普通面粉倒入碗中，加入 4 个鸡蛋，搅打至光滑。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n逐渐加入200毫升牛奶，继续搅拌直至混合物完全无结块。用盐和胡椒调味。\r\n\r\n步骤5\r\n将面糊倒入壶中，然后从烤箱中取出热罐。小心地将面糊均匀地倒入孔中。\r\n\r\n步骤6\r\n将罐子放回烤箱，静置 20-25 分钟，直到布丁膨胀并变成棕色。\r\n\r\n步骤7\r\n立即上菜。您现在可以将它们冷却并冷冻最多 1 个月。"},{"id":"52928","n":"BeaverTails","a":"Canadian","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/ryppsv1511815505.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2G07UOqU2e8","i":[["Water","1/2 cup"],["Yeast","2 parts"],["Sugar","1/2 cup"],["Milk","1/2 cup"],["Butter","6 tblsp"],["Eggs","2"],["Salt","1 ½ tsp"],["Flour","2-1/2 cups"],["Oil","for frying"],["Lemon","garnish"],["Sugar","garnish"],["Cinnamon","garnish"]],"s":"In the bowl of a stand mixer, add warm water, a big pinch of sugar and yeast. Allow to sit until frothy.\r\nInto the same bowl, add 1/2 cup sugar, warm milk, melted butter, eggs and salt, and whisk until combined.\r\nPlace a dough hook on the mixer, add the flour with the machine on, until a smooth but slightly sticky dough forms.\r\nPlace dough in a bowl, cover with plastic wrap, and allow to proof for 1 1/2 hours.\r\nCut dough into 12 pieces, and roll out into long oval-like shapes about 1/4 inch thick that resemble a beaver’s tail.\r\nIn a large, deep pot, heat oil to 350 degrees. Gently place beavertail dough into hot oil and cook for 30 to 45 seconds on each side until golden brown.\r\nDrain on paper towels, and garnish as desired. Toss in cinnamon sugar, in white sugar with a squeeze of lemon, or with a generous slathering of Nutella and a handful of toasted almonds. Enjoy!","z":"在立式搅拌机的碗中加入温水、一大撮糖和酵母。静置直至起泡。\r\n在同一个碗中，加入 1/2 杯糖、温牛奶、融化的黄油、鸡蛋和盐，搅拌直至混合。\r\n将面团钩放在搅拌机上，在机器打开的情况下添加面粉，直至形成光滑但略粘的面团。\r\n将面团放入碗中，盖上保鲜膜，发酵 1 1/2 小时。\r\n将面团切成 12 块，然后擀成约 1/4 英寸厚的长椭圆形，类似于海狸的尾巴。\r\n在一个大的深锅中，将油加热至 350 度。轻轻地将海狸尾面团放入热油中，每面煎 30 至 45 秒，直至呈金黄色。\r\n用纸巾吸干水分，并根据需要装饰。加入肉桂糖、白糖和柠檬汁，或者加入大量的花生酱和一把烤杏仁。享受！"},{"id":"52965","n":"Breakfast Potatoes","a":"Canadian","c":"Breakfast","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/1550441882.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BoD0TIO9nE4","i":[["Potatoes","3 Medium"],["Olive Oil","1 tbs"],["Bacon","2 strips"],["Garlic Clove","Minced"],["Maple Syrup","1 tbs"],["Parsley","Garnish"],["Salt","Pinch"],["Pepper","Pinch"],["Allspice","To taste"]],"s":"Before you do anything, freeze your bacon slices that way when you're ready to prep, it'll be so much easier to chop!\r\nWash the potatoes and cut medium dice into square pieces. To prevent any browning, place the already cut potatoes in a bowl filled with water.\r\nIn the meantime, heat 1-2 tablespoons of oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat. Tilt the skillet so the oil spreads evenly.\r\nOnce the oil is hot, drain the potatoes and add to the skillet. Season with salt, pepper, and Old Bay as needed.\r\nCook for 10 minutes, stirring the potatoes often, until brown. If needed, add a tablespoon more of oil.\r\nChop up the bacon and add to the potatoes. The bacon will start to render and the fat will begin to further cook the potatoes. Toss it up a bit! The bacon will take 5-6 minutes to crisp.\r\nOnce the bacon is cooked, reduce the heat to medium-low, add the minced garlic and toss. Season once more. Add dried or fresh parsley. Control heat as needed.\r\nLet the garlic cook until fragrant, about one minute.\r\nJust before serving, drizzle over the maple syrup and toss. Let that cook another minute, giving the potatoes a caramelized effect.\r\nServe in a warm bowl with a sunny side up egg!","z":"在你做任何事情之前，当你准备好准备时，先冷冻培根片，这样切起来会容易得多！\r\n将土豆洗净，切成中等大小的方块。为了防止褐变，将切好的土豆放入盛有水的碗中。\r\n与此同时，在大煎锅中用中高火加热 1-2 汤匙油。倾斜煎锅，使油均匀分布。\r\n油热后，将土豆沥干并放入煎锅中。根据需要用盐、胡椒和老海湾调味。\r\n煮 10 分钟，经常搅拌土豆，直至变成棕色。如果需要，再加一汤匙油。\r\n将培根切碎并添加到土豆中。培根将开始发酵，脂肪将开始进一步煮土豆。稍微扔一下吧！培根需要 5-6 分钟才能变脆。\r\n培根煮熟后，将火调至中低，加入蒜末并搅拌。再次季节。添加干或新鲜欧芹。根据需要控制热量。\r\n让大蒜煮香，大约一分钟。\r\n上菜前，淋上枫糖浆并搅拌。再煮一分钟，让土豆产生焦糖效果。\r\n盛在一个温暖的碗里，配上单面朝上的鸡蛋！"},{"id":"52923","n":"Canadian Butter Tarts","a":"Canadian","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/wpputp1511812960.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WUpaOGghOdo","i":[["Shortcrust Pastry","375g"],["Eggs","2 large"],["Muscovado Sugar","175g"],["Raisins","100g"],["Vanilla Extract","1 tsp"],["Butter","50g"],["Single Cream","4 tsp"],["Walnuts","50g"]],"s":"Preheat the oven to fan 170C/ conventional 190C/gas 5. Roll out the pastry on a lightly floured surface so it’s slightly thinner than straight from the pack. Then cut out 18-20 rounds with a 7.5cm fluted cutter, re-rolling the trimmings. Use the rounds to line two deep 12-hole tart tins (not muffin tins). If you only have a regular-sized, 12-hole tart tin you will be able to make a few more slightly shallower tarts.\r\nBeat the eggs in a large bowl and combine with the rest of the ingredients except the walnuts. Tip this mixture into a pan and stir continuously for 3-4 minutes until the butter melts, and the mixture bubbles and starts to thicken. It should be thick enough to coat the back of a wooden spoon. Don’t overcook, and be sure to stir all the time as the mixture can easily burn. Remove from the heat and stir in the nuts.\r\nSpoon the filling into the unbaked tart shells so it’s level with the pastry. Bake for 15-18 minutes until set and pale golden. Leave in the tin to cool for a few minutes before lifting out on to a wire rack. Serve warm or cold.","z":"将烤箱预热至 170C/常规 190C/燃气 ​​5. 将糕点放在撒有少许面粉的表面上，使其比直接从包装中取出时稍薄一些。然后用 7.5 厘米凹槽切刀切出 18-20 个圆形，并重新卷起边角料。使用圆圆排列两个深 12 孔馅饼罐（不是松饼罐）。如果您只有常规尺寸的 12 孔挞罐，您可以制作一些稍浅的挞。\r\n将鸡蛋放入一个大碗中，与除核桃之外的其他成分混合。将混合物倒入锅中，持续搅拌 3-4 分钟，直至黄油融化、混合物起泡并开始变稠。它的厚度应该足以覆盖木勺的背面。不要煮过头，并且一定要一直搅拌，因为混合物很容易燃烧。从火上移开并拌入坚果。\r\n将馅料舀入未烘烤的挞壳中，使其与糕点齐平。烘烤 15-18 分钟直至凝固并呈浅金黄色。将罐子放入冷却几分钟，然后将其放在金属架上。热食或冷食。"},{"id":"53343","n":"Classic Tourtière","a":"Canadian","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/0sd7ac1764787957.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PM9TZPUJTiU","i":[["Canola Oil","2 tablespoons"],["Onion","1 chopped"],["Garlic","2 cloves minced"],["Ground Beef","1 lb"],["Ground Pork","1 lb"],["Dried Leaves Of Summer Savoury","1 tsp"],["Salt","To taste"],["Pepper","To taste"],["Ground Clove","1/2 tsp"],["Ground Nutmeg","1/2 tsp"],["Bay Leaf","1"],["Beef Stock","1 cup"],["Russet Potato","1 small"],["Shortcrust Pastry","4"],["Egg","1 beaten"]],"s":"Heat oil on medium-high heat in a large sauté pan or skillet, then sauté the onion and garlic until softened, about 5 minutes. Add the ground beef, pork, and spices and cook until the meat is browned.\r\nAdd the beef broth and bring it up to a simmer then reduce heat to medium low. Add the grated potato and stir it in. Cook until liquid is almost absorbed, about 15 min. Remove the bay leaves and add salt to taste. Remove the pan from the heat and let the mixture cool completely — it bakes best if the filling is chilled.\r\nPreheat the oven to 375 °F (190 °C). On a lightly floured surface, roll out one disc of the pie dough to less than the 1/4-inch thickness and line the 9-inch pie plate. Fill this with the cooled tourtière mixture and spread out evenly. Roll out the remaining dough to the same thickness, cut a hole in the centre (for steam to escape) and place on top of the filling. Trim the dough to 1/2-inch beyond the edge of the pie plate and pinch the edges of the crust together. Brush the crust with the egg wash.\r\nBake tourtière for about 45 minutes or until the pastry is a rich golden brown. Let cool for 15 minutes before slicing to serve.\r\nServes: 8-10 (makes 2 9-inch pies)","z":"在大炒锅或煎锅中用中高温加热油，然后炒洋葱和大蒜直至变软，大约需要 5 分钟。加入碎牛肉、猪肉和香料，煮至肉变成棕色。\r\n加入牛肉汤并将其煮沸，然后将热量降至中低。加入磨碎的土豆并搅拌。煮约 15 分钟，直至液体几乎被吸收。取出月桂叶，加盐调味。把锅从火上移开，让混合物完全冷却——如果馅料是冷冻的，烤得最好。\r\n将烤箱预热至 375 °F (190 °C)。在撒了少许面粉的表面上，将一盘馅饼面团擀成小于 1/4 英寸的厚度，并在 9 英寸的馅饼盘上划线。将冷却的 Tourtière 混合物倒入其中，并均匀地铺开。将剩余的面团擀成相同的厚度，在中心切一个洞（以便蒸汽逸出），然后放在馅料的顶部。将面团修剪至超出馅饼盘边缘 1/2 英寸，并将饼皮边缘捏在一起。在饼皮上刷上蛋液。\r\n将 Tourtière 烘烤约 45 分钟或直至糕点变成浓郁的金黄色。冷却 15 分钟，然后切片食用。\r\n份量：8-10（制作 2 个 9 英寸的馅饼）"},{"id":"53338","n":"Date squares","a":"Canadian","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/u4scbo1764446514.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=E0bOy1FWkXA","i":[["Pitted Dates","2 1/2 cups"],["Water","1 cup"],["Vanilla","1 1/2 cup"],["Oats","2 cups"],["All purpose flour","1 cup"],["Brown Sugar","1 cup"],["Baking Powder","1/2 tsp"],["Salt","1/4 tsp"],["Unsalted Butter","1 cup"]],"s":"Preheat oven to 350°F (180°C). Grease an 8-inch (20 cm) square baking pan.\r\nTo make the date filing: Combine the dates and water in a medium saucepan over high heat and bring to a boil. Reduce heat to low and simmer gently, stirring occasionally until the mixture thickens, around 6 to 8 minutes. Remove from heat, stir in vanilla and let cool. Set aside.\r\nCombine rolled oats, flour, sugar, baking soda and salt in a food processor. Pulse 3 times (careful not to overmix, you don’t want the mixture to be powdery, just combined). Add butter and pulse again until the mixture is crumbly in pea-sized clumps. Transfer to a mixing bowl to thoroughly mix in the butter.\r\nSpread half of the oat mixture on the bottom of the prepared baking pan, pressing down to make a flat, equal bottom later. Add the date mixture over the crust and then spread evenly. Layer with the remaining oat mixture and press down to flatten the top layer.\r\nBake in the centre of the oven until the top is golden brown, 30 to 35 minutes. Let cool completely in the pan before cutting and serving. Date Squares keep well, covered in the refrigerator for up to a week, and frozen for 2 to 3 months.","z":"将烤箱预热至 350°F (180°C)。在 8 英寸（20 厘米）方形烤盘上涂抹油脂。\r\n制作日期归档：将日期和水放入一个中等大小的平底锅中，用高火煮沸。将火调至小火，轻轻煮约 6 至 8 分钟，偶尔搅拌直至混合物变稠。从火上移开，加入香草精搅拌并冷却。放在一边。\r\n将燕麦片、面粉、糖、小苏打和盐放入食品加工机中混合。脉冲 3 次（注意不要过度混合，你不希望混合物呈粉状，只需混合即可）。加入黄油并再次搅拌，直到混合物变成豌豆大小的易碎块。转移到搅拌碗中，与黄油充分混合。\r\n将一半燕麦混合物铺在准备好的烤盘底部，然后向下压，形成平坦、相等的底部。将枣子混合物添加到饼皮上，然后均匀地铺开。将剩余的燕麦混合物分层，然后向下压以压平顶层。\r\n在烤箱中央烘烤 30 至 35 分钟，直至顶部呈金黄色。在切割和食用之前，让其在锅中完全冷却。枣子保存得很好，盖上冰箱可保存一周，冷冻可保存 2 至 3 个月。"},{"id":"53342","n":"Figgy Duff","a":"Canadian","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/kzi6p51764787198.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=b2bF5gZyYDA","i":[["All purpose flour","2 cups"],["Brown Sugar","1/2 cup"],["Baking Powder","2 tsp"],["Ginger","1 tsp"],["Allspice","1 tsp"],["Cinnamon","1 tsp"],["Raisins","1 cup"],["Melted Butter","1/3 cup"],["Molasses","1/2 cup"],["Water","1 tablespoon"]],"s":"In a medium bowl, whisk together flour, brown sugar, baking powder, and spices.\r\nAdd raisins and stir well, making sure to coat the raisins in the flour mixture.\r\nAdd melted butter, molasses and water and mix with a wooden spoon. Form a ball with the spoon or your hands and put the dough ball in a cotton pudding bag. Tie the bag, leaving at least 1 inch of room to allow the pudding to expand while cooking.\r\nBoil pudding for 1.5 hours. (In NL, this is typically done in the pot along with Jiggs Dinner, but it can be done independently.)\r\nWhen the duff is firm, remove it from the boiling water and let it cool slightly before removing it from the pudding bag.\r\nSlice pudding like a cake and serve with the warm sauce of your choice: rum butter sauce, warmed molasses or Molasses Coady sauce (1 cup (250 mL) molasses, 1/4 cup (60 mL) butter, 1/4 cup (60 mL) water) is common in Newfoundland.\r\n","z":"在一个中等大小的碗中，将面粉、红糖、泡打粉和香料搅拌在一起。\r\n加入葡萄干并搅拌均匀，确保葡萄干裹上面粉混合物。\r\n加入融化的黄油、糖蜜和水，用木勺搅拌。用勺子或手将面团形成一个球，然后将面团放入棉质布丁袋中。扎紧袋子，留出至少 1 英寸的空间，以便布丁在烹饪时膨胀。\r\n将布丁煮1.5小时。 （在荷兰，这通常与吉格斯晚餐一起在锅中完成，但也可以独立完成。）\r\n当果馅变硬时，将其从沸水中取出并稍微冷却，然后将其从布丁袋中取出。\r\n像切蛋糕一样将布丁切成薄片，搭配您选择的温热酱汁：朗姆酒黄油酱、温热糖蜜或糖蜜 Coady 酱（1 杯（250 毫升）糖蜜、1/4 杯（60 毫升）黄油、1/4 杯（60 毫升）水）在纽芬兰很常见。"},{"id":"53341","n":"Flapper Pie","a":"Canadian","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/6ht8141764786479.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ALTeJItoxHg","i":[["Graham Cracker Crumbs","1 1/2 cups"],["Melted Butter","6 tablespoons"],["Sugar","1/2 cup"],["Ground Cinnamon","1/2 tsp"],["Milk","2 1/2 cups"],["Sugar","1/2 cup"],["Cornstarch","1/4 cup"],["Egg Yolks","3"],["Vanilla Extract","1 tsp"],["Salt","1/4 tsp"],["Egg White","3"],["Sugar","1/4 cup"],["Cream Of Tartar","1/4 tsp"]],"s":"Preheat the oven to 350˚F.\r\nMix all the crust ingredients (graham cracker crumbs, melted butter, granulated sugar and ground cinnamon) in a medium bowl. Set aside about 2 Tbsp (30 mL) for later and press the mixture into a 9-inch deep-dish pie plate in the bottom and up the sides. Bake crust for 10 minutes, it will only brown slightly.\r\nCombine the vanilla custard filling ingredients (milk, granulated sugar, cornstarch, egg yolks, vanilla extract and salt together) and cook on medium heat, stirring constantly, until it bubbles and thickens to the texture of pudding. Set aside to cool while you make the meringue topping.\r\nIn the bowl of a stand mixer fitted with the beater attachment or in a large bowl using an electric mixer beat the meringue ingredients (egg whites, granulated sugar, cream of tartar) together until it holds stiff and glossy peaks.\r\nTo assemble the pie, pour the filling into the crust and top with a thick layer of the meringue, making little spikes that will brown on top. Sprinkle the reserved crumb over the top and place it into the preheated oven.\r\nBake until the meringue browns, around 10 minutes, making sure to watch it carefully.\r\nChill in the fridge and eat within a few hours of baking. This pie is best eaten the same day as the meringue will soften and liquify.","z":"将烤箱预热至 350°F。\r\n将所有饼皮成分（全麦饼干屑、融化的黄油、砂糖和肉桂粉）放入一个中等大小的碗中。留出约 2 汤匙（30 毫升）供稍后使用，然后将混合物压入 9 英寸深盘馅饼盘的底部和两侧。将面包皮烤10分钟，它只会稍微变成棕色。\r\n将香草蛋奶冻馅料（牛奶、砂糖、玉米淀粉、蛋黄、香草精和盐）混合在一起，用中火煮，不断搅拌，直到起泡并变稠，达到布丁的质地。制作蛋白酥皮配料时，放在一边冷却。\r\n在配有搅拌器附件的立式搅拌机的碗中或使用电动搅拌机的大碗中，将蛋白酥皮成分（蛋白、砂糖、塔塔粉）搅拌在一起，直至形成坚硬且有光泽的峰。\r\n组装馅饼时，将馅料倒入饼皮中，并在上面铺上一层厚厚的蛋白酥皮，形成小尖刺，顶部会变成棕色。将保留的面包屑撒在顶部，然后放入预热的烤箱中。\r\n烘烤大约 10 分钟，直到蛋白酥皮变成棕色，一定要仔细观察。\r\n放入冰箱冷藏，烘烤后几个小时内食用。这个馅饼最好在当天吃，因为蛋白酥皮会软化并液化。"},{"id":"53340","n":"Hodge Podge","a":"Canadian","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/xihv0c1764447887.jpg","y":"","i":[["New Potatoes","1 lb"],["Carrots","1 lb"],["Green Beans","1 cup"],["Peas","1/2 cup"],["Dill","1 tablespoon"],["Chives","1 tablespoon"],["Milk","3 Cups"],["Heavy Cream","1/2 cup"],["Butter","1/2 cup"],["Salt","1/2 tsp"],["Black Pepper","1/4 tsp"]],"s":"First, cook your vegetables. Bring a large pot of salted water to boil. Par-cook carrots and potatoes for five minutes until carrots and potatoes are fork tender, then blanch the peas and beans for about a minute in the same pot. Strain vegetables and set aside.\r\nIn a heavy-bottomed pot or Dutch oven, melt butter over medium heat, add vegetables, and cook to warm through.\r\nAdd milk and cream and bring the soup to a boil. Turn the heat down to low and season with salt and pepper.\r\nAdd dill and chives and let simmer for at least 10 minutes. Serve warm.","z":"首先，煮蔬菜。将一大锅盐水煮沸。将胡萝卜和土豆煮五分钟，直到胡萝卜和土豆变软，然后将豌豆和豆类在同一个锅中焯约一分钟。过滤蔬菜并放在一边。\r\n在厚底锅或荷兰烤箱中，用中火融化黄油，加入蔬菜，煮至热透。\r\n加入牛奶和奶油，将汤煮沸。把火调小，用盐和胡椒调味。\r\n加入莳萝和香葱，煮至少 10 分钟。趁热食用。"},{"id":"53339","n":"Jam jam cookies","a":"Canadian","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/sktequ1764447186.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8dh7HmkBLCI","i":[["Egg","1"],["Butter","1 cup"],["Sugar","1 cup"],["Molasses","1/2 cup"],["Vanilla","1 tsp"],["Baking Powder","2 tsp"],["Water","3  tablespoons"],["Baking Powder","2 tablespoons"],["Cinnamon","1 tsp"],["Salt","2 tsp"],["Flour","4 cups"],["Jam","2 cups"]],"s":"Preheat the oven to 350 °F (180 °C) and line a large baking sheet with parchment paper.\r\nIn a stand mixer with the paddle attachment, cream the butter, white sugar and egg until combined, then add the molasses and vanilla and mix until smooth.\r\nOnce combined, add the baking soda water mixture and mix for another minute to combine.\r\nCombine dry ingredients; mix baking powder, cinnamon, flour and salt in a separate bowl then add to the wet ingredients a little at a time, mixing on low until fully combined and scraping down the sides to ensure everything is incorporated. The dough should be easily shaped.\r\nPortion dough with a small spoon, roll them into balls and place them on the lined cookie sheet, press them into flat discs using a floured glass or your moistened palm.\r\nPlace cookies on parchment-lined baking sheets and bake for 10-12 mins. Remove from the oven and let them cool for at least 10 minutes.\r\nOnce cooled the cookie sandwiches by spreading at least two teaspoons of your favourite jam between the two cookies. Repeat and enjoy with a cup of tea.","z":"将烤箱预热至 350 °F (180 °C)，并在大烤盘上铺上羊皮纸。\r\n在带有桨叶附件的立式搅拌机中，将黄油、白糖和鸡蛋搅打至混合，然后加入糖蜜和香草精，搅拌至光滑。\r\n混合后，加入小苏打水混合物，再混合一分钟以混合。\r\n混合干成分；将发酵粉、肉桂、面粉和盐在一个单独的碗中混合，然后一次一点地添加到湿成分中，低速搅拌直至完全混合，并刮下侧面以确保所有成分都融入其中。面团应该很容易成型。\r\n用小勺子将面团分成小份，将它们滚成球状，然后将它们放在有内衬的饼干片上，用撒了面粉的玻璃杯或湿润的手掌将它们压成扁平的圆盘。\r\n将饼干放在衬有羊皮纸的烤盘上，烘烤 10-12 分钟。从烤箱中取出并冷却至少 10 分钟。\r\n一旦饼干三明治冷却，在两块饼干之间涂上至少两茶匙你最喜欢的果酱。重复并享用一杯茶。"},{"id":"53335","n":"Jiggs Dinner","a":"Canadian","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/z1tfnw1764443171.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=w-rVGvZXVfs","i":[["Beef","2 Lbs"],["Yellow Split Peas","1 cup"],["Cabbage","1 head"],["Carrots","6"],["Turnips","1 large"],["Potatoes","8"],["Butter","3  tablespoons"],["Black Pepper","To taste"]],"s":"The night before, break salt beef into big chunks and soak in water overnight, at least 8-10 hours. Put split peas into a bowl and cover with water to soak overnight.\r\nDrain the salt beef and place it into a large stockpot. Cover with fresh water, at least 6-7 litres. Place the split peas into a pease pudding canvas bag or triple layer of cheesecloth and tie, making sure to leave room for peas to expand inside the bag.\r\nPut the bag inside the pot, tying the strings to the outside handle so it doesn't stick to the bottom of the pot with the salt beef. Bring to a boil, then lower the heat and simmer for 2 hours.\r\nRemove the peas pudding bag and empty contents into a bowl, mixing with butter and pepper for taste. Set aside.\r\nAdd your cabbage to the pot and boil for 20 more minutes. Then add turnip, carrots and potatoes then boil for 20 more, or until vegetables are tender.\r\nRemove salt beef and vegetables from the pot and put them on a platter.\r\nUse the cooking liquid in two ways; as a pot liquor which some people like to drink or reduce it to make a jus or gravy to pour over the meal.","z":"前一天晚上，将盐牛肉切成大块，用水浸泡过夜，至少8-10小时。将豌豆放入碗中，加水浸泡过夜。\r\n将盐牛肉沥干，放入大汤锅中。用淡水覆盖，至少 6-7 升。将裂开的豌豆放入豌豆布丁帆布袋或三层粗棉布并打结，确保留出空间让豌豆在袋子内膨胀。\r\n将袋子放入锅内，将绳子系在外面的手柄上，这样袋子就不会粘在咸牛肉的锅底上。煮沸，然后转小火，煮2小时。\r\n取出豌豆布丁袋，将内容物倒入碗中，与黄油和胡椒粉混合调味。放在一边。\r\n将卷心菜放入锅中，再煮 20 分钟。然后加入萝卜、胡萝卜和土豆，再煮20分钟，或直到蔬菜变软。\r\n将盐牛肉和蔬菜从锅中取出，放在盘子上。\r\n有两种方式使用烹饪液：有些人喜欢将其作为罐装酒饮用，或者将其稀释成汁或肉汁浇在饭菜上。"},{"id":"53336","n":"Molasses Baked Beans","a":"Canadian","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/9tddhg1764443699.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=60tmFXd4uoI","i":[["Dried White Navy Beans","2 cups"],["Bacon","1/2 lb"],["Onion","1 medium"],["Molasses","1/2 cup"],["Brown Sugar","1/4 cup"],["Cider Vinegar","2 tablespoons"],["Mustard","Ground"],["Salt","To taste"],["Pepper","To taste"]],"s":"Place the dried beans into a Dutch oven with 6 cups (1.5 L) of water. Soak overnight.\r\nDrain and pour beans back into the pot with enough water to cover the beans by a couple of inches, cook for 30 minutes until they are tender but still firm. Drain beans, making sure to reserve cooking liquid, set aside.\r\nPreheat the oven to 325 °F (160 °C). While the oven is preheating, cook pork over medium-high heat in the Dutch Oven until fat is rendered and pork is beginning to brown, then add the onion cooking until tender.\r\nAdd the beans back to the pot, along with molasses, brown sugar, apple cider vinegar, ground mustard, salt and pepper and 3 cups (750 mL) of reserved bean water.\r\nBake uncovered for 3 to 5 hours until the beans are tender, and the sauce has thickened, and the edges of the pot get sticky.\r\n(Note: if beans get dry, add another cup of water.)","z":"将干豆放入装有 6 杯（1.5 升）水的荷兰烤箱中。浸泡过夜。\r\n将豆子沥干并倒入锅中，加入足够的水以覆盖豆子几英寸，煮 30 分钟，直到豆子变软但仍然坚硬。沥干豆子，确保保留烹饪液体，备用。\r\n将烤箱预热至 325 °F (160 °C)。当烤箱预热时，在荷兰烤箱中用中高火煮猪肉，直到脂肪呈现并且猪肉开始变成棕色，然后加入洋葱煮至变软。\r\n将豆子与糖蜜、红糖、苹果醋、芥末粉、盐和胡椒粉以及 3 杯（750 毫升）保留的豆水一起放回锅中。\r\n不盖盖子烘烤3到5小时，直到豆子变软，酱汁变稠，锅的边缘变得粘稠。\r\n（注意：如果豆子变干，请再加一杯水。）"},{"id":"52927","n":"Montreal Smoked Meat","a":"Canadian","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/uttupv1511815050.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=g5oCDoyxbBk","i":[["Beef Brisket","1"],["Salt","3 tbs"],["Black Pepper","3 tbs"],["Coriander","1 tbs"],["Sugar","1 tbs"],["Bay Leaf","1 tsp"],["Cloves","1 tsp"],["Black Pepper","3 tbs"],["Coriander","1 tbs"],["Paprika","1 tbs"],["Garlic","1 tbs"],["Onion","1 tbs"],["Dill","1 tbs"],["English Mustard","1 tsp"],["Celery Salt","1 tbs"],["Red Pepper Flakes","1 tsp"]],"s":"To make the cure, in a small bowl mix together salt, pink salt, black pepper, coriander, sugar, bay leaf, and cloves. Coat entire brisket with the cure and place in an extra-large resealable plastic bag. Place in the coldest part of the refrigerator and cure for 4 days, flipping brisket twice a day.\r\nRemove brisket from bag and wash as much cure off as possible under cold running water. Place brisket in a large container and fill with water and let soak for 2 hours, replacing water every 30 minutes. Remove from water and pat dry with paper towels.\r\nTo make the rub, mix together black pepper, coriander, paprika, garlic powder, onion powder, dill weed, mustard, celery seed, and crushed red papper in a small bowl. Coat entire brisket with the rub.\r\nFire up smoker or grill to 225 degrees, adding chunks of smoking wood chunks when at temperature. When wood is ignited and producing smoke, place brisket in, fat side up, and smoke until an instant read thermometer registers 165 degrees when inserted into thickest part of the brisket, about 6 hours.\r\nTransfer brisket to large roasting pan with V-rack. Place roasting pan over two burners on stovetop and fill with 1-inch of water. Bring water to a boil over high heat, reduce heat to medium, cover roasting pan with aluminum foil, and steam brisket until an instant read thermometer registers 180 degrees when inserted into thickest part of the meat, 1 to 2 hours, adding more hot water as needed.\r\nTransfer brisket to cutting board and let cool slightly. Slice and serve, preferably on rye with mustard.","z":"为了制作这种疗法，在一个小碗中将盐、粉红盐、黑胡椒、香菜、糖、月桂叶和丁香混合在一起。将整个牛胸肉涂上固化剂，然后放入一个超大的可重新密封的塑料袋中。放入冰箱最冷的地方，腌制 4 天，每天翻转牛胸肉两次。\r\n从袋子中取出牛胸肉，并在冷水下尽可能多地清洗固化物。将牛胸肉放入一个大容器中，装满水，浸泡 2 小时，每 30 分钟更换一次水。从水中取出并用纸巾拍干。\r\n为了制作摩擦剂，将黑胡椒、香菜、辣椒粉、大蒜粉、洋葱粉、莳萝草、芥末、芹菜籽和碎红辣椒放入一个小碗中混合。将整个牛胸肉涂上摩擦剂。\r\n将烟熏器或烤架加热至 225 度，在该温度下添加大块的烟熏木块。当木头被点燃并产生烟雾时，将牛胸肉放入，脂肪面朝上，然后冒烟，直到插入牛胸肉最厚部分时即时读数温度计显示 165 度，大约需要 6 小时。\r\n将牛胸肉转移到带有 V 形架的大烤盘中。将烤盘放在炉灶上的两个燃烧器上，并注入 1 英寸的水。将水用大火煮沸，调至中火，用铝箔盖住烤盘，然后蒸牛胸肉，直至即时读取温度计插入肉最厚的部分时显示 180 度，1 至 2 小时，根据需要添加更多热水。\r\n将牛胸肉转移到切板上并稍微冷却。切片后食用，最好搭配黑麦和芥末。"},{"id":"52924","n":"Nanaimo Bars","a":"Canadian","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/vwuprt1511813703.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MMrE4I1ZtWo","i":[["Custard","125g"],["Caster Sugar","50g"],["Cocoa","5 tbs"],["Egg","1 beaten"],["Digestive Biscuits","200g shredded"],["Desiccated Coconut","100g"],["Almonds","50g"],["Butter","100g"],["Double Cream","4 tbs"],["Custard Powder","3 tbs"],["Icing Sugar","250g"],["Dark Chocolate","150g"],["Butter","50g"]],"s":"Start by making the biscuit base. In a bowl, over a pan of simmering water, melt the butter with the sugar and cocoa powder, stirring occasionally until smooth. Whisk in the egg for 2 to 3 mins until the mixture has thickened. Remove from heat and mix in the biscuit crumbs, coconut and almonds if using, then press into the base of a lined 20cm square tin. Chill for 10 mins.\r\nFor the middle layer, make the custard icing; whisk together the butter, cream and custard powder until light and fluffy, then gradually add the icing sugar until fully incorporated. Spread over the bottom layer and chill in the fridge for at least 10 mins until the custard is no longer soft.\r\nMelt the chocolate and butter together in the microwave, then spread over the chilled bars and put back in the fridge. Leave until the chocolate has fully set (about 2 hrs). Take the mixture out of the tin and slice into squares to serve.","z":"从制作饼干底开始。在一个碗中，在一锅沸水中，将黄油与糖和可可粉一起融化，偶尔搅拌直至光滑。加入鸡蛋搅拌 2 至 3 分钟，直至混合物变稠。从火上移开，加入饼干屑、椰子和杏仁（如果使用），然后压入有衬里的 20 厘米方形罐底。冷却 10 分钟。\r\n中间层做蛋奶糖霜；将黄油、奶油和吉士粉搅拌至松软，然后逐渐加入糖粉直至完全混合。铺在底层上，放入冰箱冷藏至少 10 分钟，直到蛋奶冻不再柔软。\r\n将巧克力和黄油在微波炉中融化在一起，然后铺在冰镇的巧克力棒上，然后放回冰箱。静置直至巧克力完全凝固（约 2 小时）。将混合物从罐中取出，切成方块即可食用。"},{"id":"52930","n":"Pate Chinois","a":"Canadian","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/yyrrxr1511816289.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QRFqnLkEv3I","i":[["Potatoes","4 cups"],["Butter","60ml"],["Milk","½ cup"],["Minced Beef","450g"],["Onion","1 finely chopped"],["Creamed Corn","500ml"],["Paprika","to taste"],["Parsley","to taste"],["Salt","Dash"],["Pepper","Dash"]],"s":"In a large pot of salted water, cook the potatoes until they are very tender. Drain.\r\nWith a masher, coarsely crush the potatoes with at least 30 ml (2 tablespoons) of butter. With an electric mixer, purée with the milk. Season with salt and pepper. Set aside.\r\nWith the rack in the middle position, preheat the oven to 190 °C (375 °F).\r\nIn a large skillet, brown the onion in the remaining butter. Add the meat and cook until golden brown. Season with salt and pepper. Remove from the heat.\r\nLightly press the meat at the bottom of a 20-cm (8-inch) square baking dish. Cover with the corn and the mashed potatoes. Sprinkle with paprika and parsley.\r\nBake for about 30 minutes. Finish cooking under the broiler. Let cool for 10 minutes.","z":"在一大锅盐水中，将土豆煮至变软。流走。\r\n用捣碎器将土豆和至少 30 毫升（2 汤匙）黄油粗碎。用电动搅拌机，将牛奶打成泥。用盐和胡椒调味。放在一边。\r\n将架子置于中间位置，将烤箱预热至 190 °C (375 °F)。\r\n在一个大煎锅中，用剩余的黄油将洋葱煎至棕色。加入肉，煮至金黄色。用盐和胡椒调味。从火上移开。\r\n将肉轻轻压在 20 厘米（8 英寸）方形烤盘的底部。盖上玉米和土豆泥。撒上辣椒粉和欧芹。\r\n烤约30分钟。在烤炉下完成烹饪。冷却 10 分钟。"},{"id":"52932","n":"Pouding chomeur","a":"Canadian","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/yqqqwu1511816912.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WFvj71RZYPc","i":[["Butter","½ cup"],["Sugar","1 cup"],["Eggs","2"],["Vanilla Extract","1 tsp"],["Flour","2 cups"],["Baking Powder","1 tsp"],["Milk","1 1/4 cup"],["Maple Syrup","1 1/2 cup"],["Brown Sugar","1 1/2 cup"],["Single Cream","1 1/2 cup"],["Butter","1/3 cup"]],"s":"In a large bowl, with an electric mixer, mix the butter and sugar till the mix is light.\r\nAdd eggs and vanilla and mix.\r\nIn another bowl, mix flour and baking powder.\r\nAlternate flour mix and milk to the butter mix.\r\nPour into a 13 inch by 9 inch greased pan.\r\nMAPLE SAUCE.\r\nIn a large casserole, bring to boil the syrup, brown sugar, cream and butter and constantly stir.\r\nReduce heat and and gently cook 2 minutes or till sauce has reduced a little bit.\r\nPour sauce gently over cake.\r\nBake at 325°f (160°c) about 35 minutes or till cake is light brown and when toothpick inserted comes out clean.","z":"在一个大碗中，用电动搅拌机将黄油和糖混合直至混合物变淡。\r\n加入鸡蛋和香草精并混合。\r\n在另一个碗中，混合面粉和发酵粉。\r\n将面粉混合物和牛奶与黄油混合物交替使用。\r\n倒入已涂油的 13 英寸 x 9 英寸平底锅中。\r\n枫酱。\r\n在一个大砂锅中，将糖浆、红糖、奶油和黄油煮沸，并不断搅拌。\r\n减少热量并轻轻煮 2 分钟或直到酱汁减少一点。\r\n将酱汁轻轻倒在蛋糕上。\r\n在 325°f (160°c) 下烘烤约 35 分钟，或直至蛋糕呈浅棕色，并且插入牙签后取出时是干净的。"},{"id":"52804","n":"Poutine","a":"Canadian","c":"Miscellaneous","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/uuyrrx1487327597.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UVAMAoA2_WU","i":[["Vegetable Oil","Dash"],["Beef Gravy","1 Can"],["Potatoes","5 thin cut"],["Cheese Curds","2 cups"]],"s":"Heat oil in a deep fryer or deep heavy skillet to 365°F (185°C).\r\nWarm gravy in saucepan or microwave.\r\nPlace the fries into the hot oil, and cook until light brown, about 5 minutes.\r\nRemove to a paper towel lined plate to drain.\r\nPlace the fries on a serving platter, and sprinkle the cheese over them.\r\nLadle gravy over the fries and cheese, and serve immediately.","z":"将油炸锅或深煎锅中的油加热至 365°F (185°C)。\r\n用平底锅或微波炉加热肉汁。\r\n将薯条放入热油中，煮至浅棕色，大约 5 分钟。\r\n移至内衬纸巾的盘子上沥干。\r\n将薯条放在盘子上，然后在上面撒上奶酪。\r\n将肉汁浇在薯条和奶酪上，然后立即食用。"},{"id":"52933","n":"Rappie Pie","a":"Canadian","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/ruwpww1511817242.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ys2kZnTVXAM","i":[["Butter","2 tbs"],["Onions","2 chopped"],["Chicken Stock","4 qt"],["Chicken Breast","1.5kg"],["Potatoes","4kg"],["Salt","2 tbs"],["Black Pepper","1tbsp"]],"s":"Preheat oven to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C). Grease a 10x14x2-inch baking pan.\r\nHeat margarine in a skillet over medium heat; stir in onion. Cook and stir until onion has softened and turned translucent, about 5 minutes. Reduce heat to low and continue to cook and stir until onion is very tender and dark brown, about 40 minutes more.\r\nBring chicken broth to a boil in a large pot; stir in chicken breasts, reduce heat, and simmer until chicken is no longer pink at the center, about 20 minutes. Remove from heat. Remove chicken breasts to a plate using a slotted spoon; reserve broth.\r\nJuice potatoes with an electric juicer; place dry potato flesh into a bowl and discard juice. Stir salt and pepper into potatoes; stir in enough reserved broth to make the mixture the consistency of oatmeal. Set remaining broth aside.\r\nSpread half of potato mixture evenly into the prepared pan. Lay cooked chicken breast evenly over potatoes; scatter caramelized onion evenly over chicken. Spread remaining potato mixture over onions and chicken to cover.\r\nBake in the preheated oven until golden brown, about 1 hour. Reheat chicken broth; pour over individual servings as desired.","z":"将烤箱预热至 400 华氏度（200 摄氏度）。在 10x14x2 英寸的烤盘上涂抹油脂。\r\n在平底锅中用中火加热人造黄油；拌入洋葱。煮约 5 分钟，搅拌直至洋葱变软并变成半透明。把火调小，继续煮并搅拌，直到洋葱变软并呈深棕色，大约需要 40 分钟。\r\n将鸡汤放入大锅中煮沸；拌入鸡胸肉，调小火，煮约 20 分钟，直至鸡肉中心不再呈粉红色。从火上移开。用漏勺将鸡胸肉盛入盘中；保留肉汤。\r\n用电动榨汁机将土豆榨汁；将干土豆肉放入碗中并倒掉汁液。将盐和胡椒粉倒入土豆中搅拌；加入足够的保留肉汤，使混合物具有燕麦片的稠度。将剩余的肉汤放在一边。\r\n将一半的土豆混合物均匀地撒入准备好的平底锅中。将煮熟的鸡胸肉均匀地铺在土豆上；将焦糖洋葱均匀地撒在鸡肉上。将剩余的土豆混合物铺在洋葱和鸡肉上以覆盖。\r\n放入预热好的烤箱中烘烤约1小时至金黄色。重新加热鸡汤；根据需要倒在单独的份上。"},{"id":"53337","n":"Saskatoon Pie","a":"Canadian","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/5xdrkw1764444472.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wla0ijWVLCs","i":[["All purpose flour","6 cups"],["Salt","2 tsp"],["Unsalted Butter","1 cup"],["Vegetable Shortening","1 cup"],["Egg","1 large"],["Vinegar","1 tablespoon"],["Water","Splash"],["Saskatoon Berries","5 Cups"],["Sugar","1/2 cup"],["Sugar","1 tablespoon"],["Cornstarch","3  tablespoons"],["Unsalted Butter","2 tablespoons"],["Egg","1 beaten"],["Water","1 tablespoon"]],"s":"To make the pastry, place the flour and salt in a large bowl. Mix well. Add the cubes of butter and shortening and mix them in (I like to use my hands to mix the fat into the flour, but you can use a pastry blender) just until it looks like coarse oatmeal with some pea-sized bits remaining. Place the egg in a 2-cup measure and beat it with a fork. Beat in the vinegar and just enough ice-cold water to bring it to the 1-cup mark. Stir this into the flour mixture, just until the dough clings together. I like to use my hands for this part as well, but a wooden spoon would also work. Try not to overmix it.\r\nOn a lightly floured surface, gather the dough into a ball and divide it into 5 evenly sized portions. Shape each portion into a disc and wrap tightly in plastic. Chill 2 of these discs for 1 hour. Freeze the other 3 in a resealable freezer bag for future use. The pastry keeps well in the freezer for up to 2 months.\r\nPreheat the oven to 350°F. Place the rack in the lower third of the oven. Line a baking sheet with aluminum foil to catch drippings.\r\nOn a lightly floured surface, roll out 1 disc of pastry into a 12-inch circle, or thereabouts. Place it in the bottom of a 9-inch pie plate, with the pastry overhanging the edges of the pie plate.\r\nTo make the filling, place the saskatoon berries in a large bowl and stir in the 1/2 cup sugar and the cornstarch until well combined. Pour the berry mixture into the bottom of the pie. Dot with the butter. On a lightly floured surface, roll out the pastry in another 12-inch circle for the top crust. Use a ruler to guide you when cutting the pastry into 6 wide, long strips to keep the edges straight. Save the 2 end pieces in case you need to do any patching. I like wide strips, but if you like a thinner look, feel free to cut thin strips of pastry. Weave the pastry strips, going over and under, making sure they connect with the edges of the pie crust. Fold over the edges of the bottom crust, tucking in the lattice ends. This will help to trap the juices and give a rustic look.\r\nIf you prefer a cleaner, tidier look, you can trim the overhanging pieces and crimp the edges with a fork. Brush the top of the pie with the egg wash. Sprinkle with the remaining Tbsp sugar. Place the pie on the prepared baking sheet and bake it for about 90 – 100 minutes, until it’s golden brown and bubbling. Remove the pie from the oven and place it on a wire rack to cool.\r\nServe the pie warm or at room temperature with whipped cream or ice cream. Makes 6 servings. This keeps well if covered with plastic and refrigerated for up to 4 days.","z":"制作糕点时，将面粉和盐放入一个大碗中。搅拌均匀。加入黄油块和起酥油，然后将它们混合（我喜欢用手将脂肪混合到面粉中，但你可以使用糕点搅拌机），直到它看起来像粗燕麦片，还剩下一些豌豆大小的碎片。将鸡蛋放入 2 杯量的容器中，然后用叉子搅打。加入醋和足够的冰水，使其达到 1 杯标记。将其搅拌到面粉混合物中，直到面团粘在一起。我也喜欢用手来做这部分，但木勺也可以。尽量不要过度混合。\r\n在撒了少许面粉的表面上，将面团揉成一个球，然后将其分成 5 份大小均匀的部分。将每个部分塑造成圆盘并用塑料紧紧包裹。将其中 2 个圆盘冷却 1 小时。将另外 3 个冷冻在可重新密封的冷冻袋中以供将来使用。糕点在冰箱中可保存长达 2 个月。\r\n将烤箱预热至 350°F。将架子放在烤箱的下三分之一处。在烤盘上铺上铝箔以接住滴落的液体。\r\n在撒了少许面粉的表面上，将 1 片糕点擀成 12 英寸或大约 12 英寸的圆形。将其放在 9 英寸馅饼盘的底部，使糕点悬垂在馅饼盘的边缘。\r\n制作馅料时，将萨斯卡通浆果放入一个大碗中，加入 1/2 杯糖和玉米淀粉，搅拌均匀。将浆果混合物倒入馅饼底部。点上黄油。在撒了少许面粉的表面上，将糕点擀成另一个 12 英寸的圆，作为顶皮。将糕点切成 6 条宽长条时，请使用尺子引导，以保持边缘平直。保存好 2 个末端部件，以备需要修补时使用。我喜欢宽条，但如果你喜欢更薄的外观，可以随意切细条。将糕点条上下编织，确保它们与馅饼皮的边缘相连。折叠底部外壳的边缘，塞入格子末端。这将有助于保留汁液并呈现质朴的外观。\r\n如果您喜欢更干净整洁的外观，可以修剪悬垂的部分并用叉子卷曲边缘。在馅饼的顶部刷上蛋液。撒上剩余的汤匙糖。将馅饼放在准备好的烤盘上，烘烤约 90 - 100 分钟，直至其呈金黄色并冒泡。将馅饼从烤箱中取出，放在金属架上冷却。\r\n将馅饼趁热或在室温下与生奶油或冰淇淋一起食用。做 6 份。如果用塑料覆盖并冷藏最多 4 天，可以保存完好。"},{"id":"52925","n":"Split Pea Soup","a":"Canadian","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/xxtsvx1511814083.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qdhWz7qAaCU","i":[["Ham","1kg"],["Peas","200g (soaked overnight)"],["Onions","2 chopped"],["Carrots","2 chopped"],["Bay Leaves","2"],["Celery","1 chopped"],["Frozen Peas","300g"],["Bread","to serve"]],"s":"Put the gammon in a very large pan with 2 litres water and bring to the boil. Remove from the heat and drain off the water – this helps to get rid of some of the saltiness. Recover with 2 litres cold water and bring to the boil again. Put everything but the frozen peas into the pan and bring to the boil. Reduce to a simmer and cook for 1½-2½ hrs, topping up the water as and when you need to, to a similar level it started at. As the ham cooks and softens, you can halve it if you want, so it is all submerged under the liquid. When the ham is tender enough to pull into shreds, it is ready.\r\nLift out the ham, peel off and discard the skin. While it is still hot (wear a clean pair of rubber gloves), shred the meat. Remove bay from the soup and stir in the frozen peas. Simmer for 1 min, then blend until smooth. Add a splash of water if too thick, and return to the pan to heat through if it has cooled, or if you are making ahead.\r\nWhen you are ready to serve, mix the hot soup with most of the ham – gently reheat if made ahead. Serve in bowls with the remaining ham scattered on top, and eat with crusty bread and butter.","z":"将火腿放入一个大锅中，加入 2 升水，煮沸。从火上移开并沥干水——这有助于去除一些咸味。用2升冷水恢复并再次煮沸。将除冷冻豌豆以外的所有东西放入锅中煮沸。将水调至小火煮 1.5-2.5 小时，需要时加水至与开始时类似的水位。当火腿煮熟并变软时，如果你愿意，你可以将其减半，这样它就会全部浸入液体中。当火腿变软，可以撕成碎片时，就可以了。\r\n取出火腿，剥掉并丢弃皮。趁热（戴上干净的橡胶手套），将肉切碎。从汤中取出月桂叶，拌入冷冻豌豆。煮 1 分钟，然后搅拌至光滑。如果太稠，加一点水；如果已经冷却，或者如果你正在做，则返回锅中加热。\r\n当你准备好上桌时，将热汤与大部分火腿混合——如果提前做好的话，轻轻地重新加热。将剩余的火腿撒在碗中，搭配硬皮面包和黄油食用。"},{"id":"52931","n":"Sugar Pie","a":"Canadian","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/yrstur1511816601.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uVQ66jiL-Dc","i":[["Brown Sugar","2 cups"],["Butter","¼ cup"],["Eggs","2"],["Vanilla Extract","1 tsp"],["Salt","1 tsp"],["Plain Flour","½ cup"],["Milk","1 1/2 cups"]],"s":"Preheat oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Grease a 9-inch pie dish.\r\nPlace the brown sugar and butter in a mixing bowl, and beat them together with an electric mixer until creamy and very well combined, without lumps. Beat in eggs, one at a time, incorporating the first egg before adding the next one. Add the vanilla extract and salt; beat the flour in, a little at a time, and then the milk, making a creamy batter. Pour the batter into the prepared pie dish.\r\nBake in the preheated oven for 35 minutes; remove pie, and cover the rim with aluminum foil to prevent burning. Return to oven, and bake until the middle sets and the top forms a crusty layer, about 15 more minutes. Let the pie cool to room temperature, then refrigerate for at least 1 hour before serving.","z":"将烤箱预热至 350 华氏度（175 摄氏度）。在 9 英寸的馅饼盘上涂上油脂。\r\n将红糖和黄油放入搅拌碗中，用电动搅拌机搅拌直至呈奶油状且充分混合，无结块。一次打一个鸡蛋，先加入第一个鸡蛋，然后再加入下一个鸡蛋。加入香草精和盐；一次一点地加入面粉，然后加入牛奶，制成奶油状的面糊。将面糊倒入准备好的馅饼盘中。\r\n放入预热好的烤箱烤35分钟；取出馅饼，并用铝箔覆盖边缘以防止燃烧。返回烤箱，烘烤约 15 分钟，直至中间凝固且顶部形成硬皮层。让馅饼冷却至室温，然后在食用前冷藏至少 1 小时。"},{"id":"52929","n":"Timbits","a":"Canadian","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/txsupu1511815755.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fFLn1h80AGQ","i":[["Flour","2 cups"],["Sugar","1/3 cup"],["Baking Powder","3 tsp"],["Salt","½ tsp"],["Egg","1 beaten"],["Milk","¾ cup"],["Oil","3 tbs"],["Oil","for frying"],["Icing Sugar","garnish"]],"s":"Sift together dry ingredients.\r\nMix together wet ingredients and incorporate into dry. Stir until smooth.\r\nDrop by teaspoonfuls(no bigger) into hot oil (365 degrees, no hotter), turning after a few moments until golden brown on all sides.\r\nRemove and drain.\r\nRoll in cinnamon sugar while still warm and serve.","z":"将干成分一起过筛。\r\n将湿成分混合在一起并加入干成分中。搅拌至光滑。\r\n将一茶匙（不要更大）放入热油（365 度，不要更热）中，几分钟后翻转，直至各面呈金黄色。\r\n取出并沥干。\r\n趁热滚入肉桂糖即可食用。"},{"id":"52926","n":"Tourtiere","a":"Canadian","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/ytpstt1511814614.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=A96hbwobKKs","i":[["Potatoes","1 medium"],["Sunflower Oil","1 tsp"],["Minced Pork","500g"],["Onion","1 finely chopped"],["Garlic Clove","1 finely chopped"],["Cinnamon","¼ tsp"],["Allspice","¼ tsp"],["Nutmeg","¼ tsp"],["Vegetable Stock","100ml"],["Shortcrust Pastry","400g"],["Egg","To Glaze"]],"s":"Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Boil the potato until tender, drain and mash, then leave to cool. Heat the oil in a non-stick pan, add the mince and onion and quickly fry until browned. Add the garlic, spices, stock, plenty of pepper and a little salt and mix well. Remove from the heat, stir into the potato and leave to cool.\r\nRoll out half the pastry and line the base of a 20-23cm pie plate or flan tin. Fill with the pork mixture and brush the edges of the pastry with water. Roll out the remaining dough and cover the pie. Press the edges of the pastry to seal, trimming off the excess. Prick the top of the pastry case to allow steam to escape and glaze the top with the beaten egg.\r\nBake for 30 mins until the pastry is crisp and golden. Serve cut into wedges with a crisp green salad. Leftovers are good cold for lunch the next day, served with a selection of pickles.","z":"将烤箱加热至 200C/180C 风扇/燃气 6. 将土豆煮至变软，沥干并捣碎，然后冷却。在不粘锅中加热油，加入肉末和洋葱，快速煎至焦黄。加入大蒜、香料、高汤、大量胡椒粉和少许盐，搅拌均匀。从火上移开，拌入土豆中，然后冷却。\r\n将一半糕点擀开，铺在 20-23 厘米的馅饼盘或果馅饼罐的底部。填充猪肉混合物，并用水刷糕点的边缘。把剩下的面团擀开，盖上馅饼。按压糕点的边缘以密封，修剪掉多余的部分。刺破糕点盒的顶部，让蒸汽逸出，并在顶部涂上打好的鸡蛋。\r\n烘烤 30 分钟，直至糕点酥脆呈金黄色。切成楔形，搭配清脆的绿色沙拉。剩菜冷了可以当第二天的午餐，配上精选的泡菜。"},{"id":"53373","n":"Air Fryer Egg Rolls","a":"Chinese","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/grhn401765687086.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XnA-wcVb4l0","i":[["Olive Oil","1 tablespoon"],["Ground Pork","1 lb"],["Garlic","1 clove peeled crushed"],["Ginger","1 tablespoon"],["Carrots","1 medium"],["Scallions","3 chopped"],["Cabbage","3 Cups"],["Soy Sauce","1 tablespoon"],["Rice Vinegar","1 tablespoon"],["Egg Roll Wrappers","12"],["Oil","For brushing"],["Duck Sauce","To serve"],["Plum Sauce","To serve"],["Soy Sauce","To serve"]],"s":"Alternative Pan Fry Method: If you don’t have access to an air fryer, you can make these egg rolls using a traditional pan fry method. Add enough oil to a medium skillet with high walls so the oil is about 1/2 inch up the side of the skillet. Heat oil on medium high heat until it reaches 350°F. Add egg rolls and fry for 3 to 4 minutes, flip, and fry for another 3 to 4 minutes until golden brown. Remove and let them drain and cool on a few paper towels.\r\n\r\nCook the filling:\r\nIn a large skillet over medium heat, add the olive oil along with the ground pork or chicken. Break apart the meat with a spatula or wooden spoon as it cooks. Cook until the meat is cooked through, 6 to 8 minutes.\r\n\r\nAdd garlic, ginger, carrot, scallions, and cabbage. Continue to cook until cabbage wilts down and is soft, another 3 to 4 minutes, stirring regularly. Season the filling with soy sauce and rice wine vinegar, and take off the heat to cool. (This filling can be made in advance.)\r\n\r\nAssemble the egg rolls:\r\nPlace a single egg roll wrapper on a dry surface with one point of the square facing you (like a diamond). Place about 1/4 cup of the egg roll filling mixture in the middle of the wrapper.\r\n\r\nDip your fingers in water and run around the edges of the wrapper. Then fold the edges of the wrapper over the center and start rolling the egg roll away from you to form a tight cylinder. Place on a plate and repeat until you are out of filling. You should get at least a dozen egg rolls.\r\n\r\nAir fry the egg rolls:\r\nPlace the egg rolls in the basket of your air fryer. Spray or brush them lightly with oil. Add as many as you can without stacking the egg rolls, making sure they don’t touch. Air needs to circulate around them. Brush the egg rolls lightly with oil.\r\n\r\nPlace the basket in the air fryer and turn the air fryer to 350°F. Cook for 6 to 7 minutes, then flip the egg rolls, spray or brush with oil a second time on the bottom side, and cook for another 4 to 5 minutes.\r\n\r\nFinished egg rolls should be golden brown and crispy! Serve immediately.","z":"替代煎锅方法：如果您没有空气炸锅，您可以使用传统的煎锅方法制作这些蛋卷。在高壁中型煎锅中加入足够的油，使油位于煎锅侧面约 1/2 英寸处。用中高温将油加热直至达到 350°F。加入蛋卷煎3至4分钟，翻面，再煎3至4分钟至金黄色。取出并让其沥干并用几张纸巾冷却。\r\n\r\n煮馅料：\r\n在一个大煎锅中，用中火加热，加入橄榄油和碎猪肉或鸡肉。烹饪时用抹刀或木勺将肉分开。煮6到8分钟，直到肉熟透。\r\n\r\n加入大蒜、姜、胡萝卜、葱和卷心菜。继续煮 3 至 4 分钟，直至卷心菜枯萎变软，期间不断搅拌。用酱油和米酒醋调味，关火冷却。 （这个馅料可以提前做好。）\r\n\r\n组装蛋卷：\r\n将单个蛋卷包装纸放在干燥的表面上，正方形的一个点面向您（如菱形）。将约 1/4 杯蛋卷馅混合物放在包装纸的中间。\r\n\r\n将手指浸入水中并沿着包装纸的边缘滑动。然后将包装纸的边缘折叠到中心上，并开始将蛋卷卷离您，形成一个紧密的圆柱体。放在盘子上并重复，直到馅料用完。你应该至少得到一打蛋卷。\r\n\r\n空气炸蛋卷：\r\n将蛋卷放入空气炸锅的篮子中。轻轻地喷洒或刷上油。尽可能多地添加蛋卷，但不要堆叠蛋卷，确保它们不会相互接触。空气需要在它们周围流通。在蛋卷上轻轻刷上油。\r\n\r\n将炸篮放入空气炸锅中，然后将空气炸锅调至 350°F。煮6至7分钟，然后翻转蛋卷，在底部再次喷或刷油，再煮4至5分钟。\r\n\r\n成品蛋卷应该是金黄色、酥脆的！立即上菜。"},{"id":"52952","n":"Beef Lo Mein","a":"Chinese","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/1529444830.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZT9LSsNXXe0","i":[["Beef","1/2 lb"],["Salt","pinch"],["Pepper","pinch"],["Sesame Seed Oil","2 tsp"],["Egg","1/2"],["Starch","3 tbs"],["Oil","5 tbs"],["Noodles","1/4 lb"],["Onion","1/2 cup"],["Minced Garlic","1 tsp"],["Ginger","1 tsp"],["Bean Sprouts","1 cup"],["Mushrooms","1 cup"],["Water","1 cup"],["Oyster Sauce","1 tbs"],["Sugar","1 tsp"],["Soy Sauce","1 tsp"]],"s":"STEP 1 - MARINATING THE BEEF\r\nIn a bowl, add the beef, salt, 1 pinch white pepper, 1 Teaspoon sesame seed oil, 1/2 egg, corn starch,1 Tablespoon of oil and mix together.\r\nSTEP 2 - BOILING THE THE NOODLES\r\nIn a 6 qt pot add your noodles to boiling water until the noodles are submerged and boil on high heat for 10 seconds. After your noodles is done boiling strain and cool with cold water.\r\nSTEP 3 - STIR FRY\r\nAdd 2 Tablespoons of oil, beef and cook on high heat untill beef is medium cooked.\r\nSet the cooked beef aside\r\nIn a wok add 2 Tablespoon of oil, onions, minced garlic, minced ginger, bean sprouts, mushrooms, peapods and 1.5 cups of water or until the vegetables are submerged in water.\r\nAdd the noodles to wok\r\nTo make the sauce, add oyster sauce, 1 pinch white pepper, 1 teaspoon sesame seed oil, sugar, and 1 Teaspoon of soy sauce.\r\nNext add the beef to wok and stir-fry","z":"第 1 步 - 腌制牛肉\r\n在碗中加入牛肉、盐、1撮白胡椒粉、1茶匙芝麻油、1/2个鸡蛋、玉米淀粉、1汤匙油，搅拌均匀。\r\n第 2 步 - 煮面条\r\n在 6 夸脱的锅中将面条放入沸水中，直至淹没面条，然后高火煮 10 秒。面条煮熟后过滤并用冷水冷却。\r\n第 3 步 - 炒\r\n加入2汤匙油，加入牛肉，用大火煮至牛肉中熟。\r\n将煮熟的牛肉放在一边\r\n在锅中加入 2 汤匙油、洋葱、蒜末、姜末、豆芽、蘑菇、豌豆和 1.5 杯水，或直至蔬菜淹没在水中。\r\n将面条加入锅中\r\n制作酱汁时，加入蚝油、1 小撮白胡椒、1 茶匙芝麻油、糖和 1 茶匙酱油。\r\n接下来将牛肉放入锅中翻炒"},{"id":"53366","n":"Beef and Broccoli Stir-Fry","a":"Chinese","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/m0p0j81765568742.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BBABeZjlRM8","i":[["Soy Sauce","1 tsp"],["Dry sherry","1 tsp"],["Cornstarch","1/2 tsp"],["Black Pepper","1/8 teaspoon"],["Sirloin steak","1 lb"],["Oyster Sauce","2 tablespoons"],["Dry sherry","1 tsp"],["Soy Sauce","1 tablespoon"],["Chicken Stock","1/4 cup"],["Broccoli","1 lb"],["High Heat Cooking Oil","2 tablespoons"],["Garlic","2 cloves minced"],["Cornstarch","1 tsp"],["Water","1 tablespoon"]],"s":"Marinate the beef:\r\nStir together the beef marinade ingredients (1 teaspoon soy sauce, 1 teaspoon Chinese rice wine, 1/2 teaspoon cornstarch, 1/8 teaspoon black pepper) in a medium bowl.\r\n\r\nAdd the beef slices and stir until coated. Let stand for 10 minutes.\r\n\r\nPrepare the sauce:\r\nStir together the sauce ingredients (2 tablespoons oyster sauce, 1 teaspoon Chinese rice wine, 1 teaspoon soy sauce, 1/4 cup chicken broth) in a small bowl. Set aside.\r\n\r\nBlanch or steam the broccoli:\r\nBring a pot of water to a boil. Add the broccoli and cook until crisp-tender, about 2 minutes. Drain thoroughly.\r\n\r\nStir-fry the beef:\r\nHeat a large frying pan or wok over high heat until a bead of water sizzles and instantly evaporates upon contact. Add the cooking oil and swirl to coat.\r\n\r\nAdd the beef and immediately spread it out all over the surface of the wok or pan in a single layer (preferably not touching).\r\n\r\nLet the beef fry undisturbed for 1 minute. Flip the beef slices over, add the garlic to the pan, and fry for an additional 30 seconds to 1 minute until no longer pink.\r\n\r\nAdd the sauce, cornstarch, and broccoli:\r\nPour in the sauce and the cornstarch slurry (1 teaspoon cornstarch dissolved in 1 tablespoon of water). Stir until the sauce boils and thickens, about 30 seconds. Stir in the broccoli.\r\n\r\nServe immediately, with steamed rice or on its own.","z":"腌制牛肉：\r\n将牛肉腌料（1 茶匙酱油、1 茶匙黄酒、1/2 茶匙玉米淀粉、1/8 茶匙黑胡椒）放入一个中型碗中，搅拌均匀。\r\n\r\n加入牛肉片，搅拌直至裹上牛肉片。静置 10 分钟。\r\n\r\n准备酱汁：\r\n将酱汁材料（2汤匙蚝油、1茶匙米酒、1茶匙酱油、1/4杯鸡汤）放入小碗中搅拌。放在一边。\r\n\r\n焯或蒸西兰花：\r\n将一锅水烧开。加入西兰花，煮约 2 分钟，直至变脆。彻底沥干。\r\n\r\n炒牛肉：\r\n用高火加热大煎锅或炒锅，直到水珠发出嘶嘶声并在接触时立即蒸发。加入食用油并旋转以涂上油。\r\n\r\n添加牛肉并立即将其单层铺在炒锅或平底锅的表面（最好不要接触）。\r\n\r\n让牛肉静置煎 1 分钟。将牛肉片翻过来，将大蒜放入锅中，再煎 30 秒到 1 分钟，直至不再呈粉红色。\r\n\r\n添加酱汁、玉米淀粉和西兰花：\r\n倒入酱汁和玉米淀粉浆（1茶匙玉米淀粉溶解在1汤匙水中）。搅拌约 30 秒，直至酱汁沸腾并变稠。拌入西兰花。\r\n\r\n立即上桌，搭配米饭或单独食用。"},{"id":"52956","n":"Chicken Congee","a":"Chinese","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/1529446352.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kqEfk801E94","i":[["Chicken","8 oz"],["Salt","pinch"],["Pepper","pinch"],["Ginger Cordial","1 tsp"],["Ginger","1 tsp"],["Spring Onions","1 tbs"],["Rice","1/2 cup"],["Water","8 cups"],["Coriander","2 oz"]],"s":"STEP 1 - MARINATING THE CHICKEN\r\nIn a bowl, add chicken, salt, white pepper, ginger juice and then mix it together well.\r\nSet the chicken aside.\r\nSTEP 2 - RINSE THE WHITE RICE\r\nRinse the rice in a metal bowl or pot a couple times and then drain the water.\r\nSTEP 2 - BOILING THE WHITE RICE\r\nNext add 8 cups of water and then set the stove on high heat until it is boiling. Once rice porridge starts to boil, set the stove on low heat and then stir it once every 8-10 minutes for around 20-25 minutes.\r\nAfter 25 minutes, this is optional but you can add a little bit more water to make rice porridge to make it less thick or to your preference.\r\nNext add the marinated chicken to the rice porridge and leave the stove on low heat for another 10 minutes.\r\nAfter an additional 10 minutes add the green onions, sliced ginger, 1 pinch of salt, 1 pinch of white pepper and stir for 10 seconds.\r\nServe the rice porridge in a bowl\r\nOptional: add Coriander on top of the rice porridge.","z":"第 1 步 - 腌制鸡肉\r\n在碗中加入鸡肉、盐、白胡椒粉、姜汁，然后搅拌均匀。\r\n把鸡肉放在一边。\r\n第 2 步 - 冲洗白米\r\n将大米放入金属碗或锅中冲洗几次，然后沥干水。\r\n第 2 步 - 煮白米\r\n接下来加入8杯水，然后将炉子放在高火上直至沸腾。米粥开始沸腾后，将炉子调至小火，然后每隔8-10分钟搅拌一次，持续约20-25分钟。\r\n25分钟后，这是可选的，但您可以添加一点水来煮粥，以使其不那么稠或根据您的喜好。\r\n然后将腌制好的鸡肉加入米粥中，小火再煮10分钟。\r\n再过 10 分钟后，加入葱、姜片、1 撮盐、1 撮白胡椒，搅拌 10 秒。\r\n将米粥盛入碗中即可\r\n可选：在米粥上添加香菜。"},{"id":"53367","n":"Chicken Fried Rice","a":"Chinese","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/wuyd2h1765655837.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mUr-7wjhHuU","i":[["Chicken Thighs","1 lb"],["Salt","1 tsp"],["Canola Oil","3  tablespoons"],["Egg","3 Large"],["Onion","2/3 Cup"],["Garlic","2 cloves minced"],["Ground Ginger","2 tsp"],["Carrots","1 large"],["Peas","2/3 Cup"],["Jasmine Rice","4 cups"],["Scallions","2 sliced"],["Chinese five spice powder","1/2 tsp"],["Soy Sauce","2.5 tbsp"],["Sesame Seed Oil","1 tsp"]],"s":"Fried rice is best made with leftover rice that's at least a day old. Otherwise it becomes gummy in the skillet.\r\nIf you don’t have any leftover rice from the night before, cook a batch of rice and spread it on a large baking sheet or several large plates. Let the rice dry out for about 1 to 2 hours before using it for fried rice.\r\n\r\nRice sticks to the pan very easily, so make sure to use a wok or pan that doesn’t have a sticky surface. I usually cook stir-fries in my seasoned carbon steel wok, but cast iron or nonstick pans work well, too. You might need to add a little more oil if things aren’t releasing easily.\r\n\r\nPrepare the chicken:\r\nChop the chicken into small 1/4-inch to 1/2-inch cubes. Sprinkle 1/2 teaspoon of salt over the chicken and mix to combine. Set the chicken aside for about 10 minutes (I usually use this time to chop all the vegetables).\r\n\r\nScramble the egg:\r\nHeat a wok or large sauté pan over medium-high heat. Swirl in a tablespoon of oil and add the whisked eggs. Use a spatula to quickly scramble the eggs, breaking the curds into smaller pieces as they come together. Transfer the eggs to a plate.\r\n\r\nCook the chicken:\r\nAdd another tablespoon of oil in the wok or pan. Add the chicken and cook for 4 to 5 minutes, stirring occasionally. Turn off the heat and transfer the cooked chicken to a plate.\r\n\r\nUsing your spatula, scrape off any chicken bits that are still stuck to the wok so they don't burn during the next step. You can also use paper towels to wipe down your wok or pan.\r\n\r\nCook the vegetables:\r\nSwirl 1 tablespoon of oil into the wok over medium-high heat. Add the diced onions and cook them for 1 minute, until they start to soften. Mix in the minced garlic and ginger and cook until fragrant, about 30 seconds. Add the diced carrots and cook for 2 minutes, stirring frequently. Add 1/2 teaspoon salt and the peas, and stir to incorporate.\r\n\r\nCook the rice:\r\nAdd the rice to the wok or pan on top of the vegetables and stir to combine. Using the back of your spatula, smash any large chunks of rice to break them apart. Add the white and green parts of the sliced scallions (save the dark green parts) and five-spice powder. Stir to incorporate. If the rice starts to stick to the pan, stir in a little more oil.\r\n\r\nDrizzle the soy sauce and sesame oil over the rice and stir to incorporate. Stir in the cooked chicken, scrambled eggs, and the dark parts of the scallions. Stir briefly to bring it together, and cook for another 1 to 2 minutes.\r\n\r\nServe:\r\nTaste, and add more soy sauce if necessary. Serve immediately.","z":"炒饭最好用至少一天的剩饭来做。否则在煎锅里会变得粘稠。\r\n如果您没有前一天晚上剩下的米饭，请煮一批米饭并将其铺在一个大烤盘或几个大盘子上。让米饭干燥约 1 至 2 小时，然后再用于炒饭。\r\n\r\n米饭很容易粘在锅上，因此请确保使用表面不粘的炒锅或平底锅。我通常用经验丰富的碳钢锅炒菜，但铸铁锅或不粘锅也很好用。如果东西不容易释放，您可能需要添加更多的油。\r\n\r\n准备鸡肉：\r\n将鸡肉切成 1/4 英寸至 1/2 英寸的小块。在鸡肉上撒 1/2 茶匙盐，搅拌均匀。将鸡肉放置约10分钟（我通常用这段时间切碎所有蔬菜）。\r\n\r\n炒鸡蛋：\r\n用中高火加热炒锅或大煎锅。加入一汤匙油，加入打散的鸡蛋。用抹刀快速炒鸡蛋，将凝乳打碎成小块。将鸡蛋转移到盘子上。\r\n\r\n煮鸡肉：\r\n在炒锅或平底锅中加入另一汤匙油。加入鸡肉，煮 4 到 5 分钟，偶尔搅拌。关掉火，将煮熟的鸡肉转移到盘子上。\r\n\r\n用抹刀刮掉仍然粘在锅上的鸡块，这样它们在下一步中就不会烧焦。您也可以使用纸巾擦拭炒锅或平底锅。\r\n\r\n煮蔬菜：\r\n将 1 汤匙油旋入炒锅中，用中高火加热。加入洋葱丁，煮 1 分钟，直至洋葱开始软化。加入蒜末和姜末，煮约30秒至香味四溢。加入胡萝卜丁，煮 2 分钟，经常搅拌。添加 1/2 茶匙盐和豌豆，搅拌混合。\r\n\r\n煮米饭：\r\n将米饭放入炒锅或平底锅中，放在蔬菜上，搅拌混合。用抹刀的背面将大块的米饭打碎，将它们分开。加入葱片的白色和绿色部分（保留深绿色部分）和五香粉。搅拌合并。如果米饭开始粘在锅上，请再加一点油搅拌。\r\n\r\n将酱油和芝麻油淋在米饭上，搅拌均匀。加入煮熟的鸡肉、炒鸡蛋和葱的深色部分。短暂搅拌使其混合在一起，然后再煮 1 到 2 分钟。\r\n\r\n服务：\r\n尝一尝，必要时添加更多酱油。立即上菜。"},{"id":"53365","n":"Chinese Orange Chicken","a":"Chinese","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/s73ytv1765567838.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-222Dutomek","i":[["Orange","Zest of 1"],["Orange Juice","1/4 cup"],["Soy Sauce","1/4 cup"],["Water","1/4 cup"],["Rice Vinegar","1/3 cup"],["Cornstarch","1 tablespoon"],["Sesame Seed Oil","1 tablespoon"],["Sugar","1/2 cup"],["Chicken Thighs","650g"],["Egg","2 large"],["Salt","1 tsp"],["Black Pepper","1/4 tsp"],["Cornstarch","1/2 cup"],["All purpose flour","1/2 cup"],["Vegetable Oil","2 cups"],["Garlic","2 cloves chopped"],["Shallots","1 chopped"],["Scallions","Sliced"],["Sesame Seed","Garnish"],["Rice","To serve"]],"s":"Make the orange sauce:\r\nWhisk together sauce ingredients in a medium bowl. Set aside.\r\n\r\n\r\nPrep the chicken:\r\nCut chicken into about 1-inch cubes. Whisk eggs with salt and black pepper in a bowl and add chicken. Stir together.\r\n\r\nIn a separate bowl, whisk together flour and cornstarch. Remove chicken from eggs with a slotted spoon or tongs, letting excess egg drain off, then transfer to cornstarch mixture and coat well.\r\n\r\n\r\nFry the chicken:\r\nAdd oil to a large 10- to 12-inch skillet. Heat over medium-high heat until it reaches 350°F. If you don’t have a thermometer, you can also test the temperature by sprinkling in some flour. If the oil is hot enough, it should fizzle immediately.\r\n\r\nOnce oil is hot, fry the chicken in two batches. The oil might not completely cover the chicken—that’s okay. Cook for 3 to 4 minutes. Flip the chicken pieces and cook until the chicken is cooked through, about 3 to 4 more minutes. Total cook time is about 6 to 8 minutes.\r\n\r\nRemove fried chicken cubes and transfer to a plate lined with paper towels, so the chicken can drain. Repeat until all the chicken is cooked.\r\n\r\n\r\nSimmer the chicken in the sauce:\r\nOnce chicken is done, pour out hot oil and wipe pan clean. Add a fresh tablespoon of oil along with chopped garlic and shallot. Cook for a minute and then add the sauce. Simmer the sauce until it starts to thicken.\r\n\r\nOnce the sauce is lightly bubbling, add fried chicken and toss together to coat. The sauce should continue to thicken and stick to the chicken. Let simmer for a minute or two more. Serve orange chicken over cooked white rice, garnished with sesame seeds and fresh scallions.\r\n\r\nDid you love this recipe? Let us know with a rating and review!\r\n\r\n\r\nLEFTOVERS! The orange chicken keeps well in the fridge for 5 days. Reheat in a skillet with a splash of water over low heat. Freeze the orange chicken for up to 3 months, but be sure to thaw it before reheating so the chicken doesn’t clump together.","z":"制作橙汁：\r\n在一个中等大小的碗中将酱汁成分搅拌在一起。放在一边。\r\n\r\n\r\n准备鸡肉：\r\n将鸡肉切成约 1 英寸的方块。在碗中加入盐和黑胡椒搅拌鸡蛋，然后加入鸡肉。搅拌在一起。\r\n\r\n在另一个碗中，将面粉和玉米淀粉搅拌在一起。用有槽的勺子或钳子将鸡肉从鸡蛋中取出，让多余的鸡蛋沥干，然后转移到玉米淀粉混合物中并涂匀。\r\n\r\n\r\n炸鸡：\r\n在 10 至 12 英寸的大煎锅中加入油。用中高温加热直至达到 350°F。如果没有温度计，也可以撒一些面粉来测试温度。如果油足够热，它应该立即沸腾。\r\n\r\n油热后，将鸡肉分两批煎。油可能不会完全覆盖鸡肉——没关系。煮3至4分钟。翻转鸡块，煮至鸡肉熟透，大约再煮 3 到 4 分钟。总烹饪时间约为 6 至 8 分钟。\r\n\r\n取出炸鸡块，转移到衬有纸巾的盘子上，这样鸡肉就可以沥干。重复直到所有鸡肉都煮熟。\r\n\r\n\r\n将鸡肉放入酱汁中煮：\r\n鸡肉完成后，倒出热油并将锅擦干净。加入一汤匙新鲜油以及切碎的大蒜和葱。煮一分钟，然后加入酱汁。将酱汁煮至开始变稠。\r\n\r\n一旦酱汁轻轻冒泡，加入炸鸡，拌匀，裹上酱汁。酱汁应该继续变稠并粘在鸡肉上。再煮一两分钟。将橙鸡放在煮熟的白米饭上，饰以芝麻和新鲜葱。\r\n\r\n你喜欢这个食谱吗？通过评分和评论让我们知道！\r\n\r\n\r\n剩菜！橙色的鸡肉在冰箱里可以保存 5 天。在煎锅中用小火加水重新加热。将橙色鸡肉冷冻最多 3 个月，但一定要在重新加热之前解冻，以免鸡肉结块。"},{"id":"53372","n":"Chinese Tomato Egg Stir Fry","a":"Chinese","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/rwvw8q1765660071.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Wn8ox93Qhus","i":[["Plum Tomatoes","1 lb"],["Vegetable Oil","1 tablespoon"],["Eggs","5 Large"],["Sesame Seed Oil","1 tsp"],["Chicken Bouillon Powder","2 tsp"],["Sugar","2 tsp"],["Pepper","1/2 tsp"],["Salt","1/4 tsp"],["Spring Onions","1"],["Jasmine Rice","2 cups"]],"s":"You can use chicken broth in place of the chicken bouillon powder. Add 1/4 cup of broth followed by 2 teaspoons of cornstarch dissolved in 1 tablespoPrepare the tomatoes:\r\nSlice the tomatoes in half. Remove the tough stem from each half that connects to the vine. Cut each half into equal thirds (you’ll get 6 slices from each tomato).\r\n\r\nMake the soft scrambled eggs:\r\nIn a cold, 8 to 10-inch nonstick skillet, add the vegetable oil and beaten eggs. Turn the heat to medium. Once a thin layer of eggs is just beginning to cook on the bottom, push the eggs in one direction to create layers of scrambled eggs.\r\n\r\nCook, gently stirring the whole time, until the scramble eggs are mostly set but still slightly wet and shiny, 2 to 5 minutes. Remove the eggs to a plate and, if needed, wipe out the pan.\r\n\r\nStir-fry the tomatoes and seasonings:\r\nAdd the sesame oil to the pan followed by the tomatoes and stir-fry over medium heat until the tomatoes are softened but not mushy, about 3 minutes. Add the chicken bouillon powder, sugar, and white pepper. Toss until combined and the sugar and bouillon have dissolved, about 1 minute.\r\n\r\nAdd eggs, stir-fry, and garnish:\r\nAdd the eggs back to the pan with the tomatoes. Stir-fry for about 2 minutes to heat through and combine. Taste, adding salt only if needed. Sprinkle with the green onions and serve with steamed rice.on of water, plus salt to taste.","z":"你可以用鸡汤代替鸡汤粉。加入 1/4 杯肉汤，然后加入 2 茶匙溶解在 1 汤匙中的玉米淀粉准备西红柿：\r\n将西红柿切成两半。从连接到藤蔓的每一半上取下坚硬的茎。将每一半切成相等的三分之一（每个番茄可切 6 片）。\r\n\r\n制作软炒鸡蛋：\r\n在冷的 8 至 10 英寸不粘锅中加入植物油和打散的鸡蛋。将火调至中火。当底部的一层薄薄的鸡蛋刚刚开始煮熟时，将鸡蛋推向一个方向，形成一层层的炒鸡蛋。\r\n\r\n煮2到5分钟，全程轻轻搅拌，直到炒鸡蛋大部分凝固，但仍然微湿且有光泽。将鸡蛋放入盘子中，如果需要，擦干净盘子。\r\n\r\n将西红柿和调味料翻炒：\r\n将芝麻油加入锅中，然后加入西红柿，用中火炒至西红柿变软但不糊状，约3分钟。加入鸡汤粉、糖和白胡椒。搅拌约 1 分钟，直至糖和肉汤溶解。\r\n\r\n加入鸡蛋，炒匀，装饰：\r\n将鸡蛋和西红柿一起放回锅中。炒约2分钟以加热并混合。尝一尝，只在需要时加盐。撒上葱，配上米饭。加水，加盐调味。"},{"id":"52955","n":"Egg Drop Soup","a":"Chinese","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/1529446137.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9XpzHm9QpZg","i":[["Chicken Stock","3 cups"],["Salt","1/4 tsp"],["Sugar","1/4 tsp"],["Pepper","pinch"],["Sesame Seed Oil","1 tsp"],["Peas","1/3 cup"],["Mushrooms","1/3 cup"],["Cornstarch","1 tbs"],["Water","2 tbs"],["Spring Onions","1/4 cup"]],"s":"In a wok add chicken broth and wait for it to boil.\r\nNext add salt, sugar, white pepper, sesame seed oil.\r\nWhen the chicken broth is boiling add the vegetables to the wok.\r\nTo thicken the sauce, whisk together 1 Tablespoon of cornstarch and 2 Tablespoon of water in a bowl and slowly add to your soup until it's the right thickness.\r\nNext add 1 egg slightly beaten with a knife or fork and add it to the soup slowly and stir for 8 seconds\r\nServe the soup in a bowl and add the green onions on top.","z":"在锅中加入鸡汤，等待煮沸。\r\n接下来加入盐、糖、白胡椒粉、芝麻油。\r\n当鸡汤沸腾时，将蔬菜放入锅中。\r\n为了使酱汁变稠，将 1 汤匙玉米淀粉和 2 汤匙水放入碗中搅拌，然后慢慢添加到汤中，直至达到合适的稠度。\r\n接下来加入1个鸡蛋，用刀或叉稍微打散，慢慢加入汤中，搅拌8秒\r\n将汤盛入碗中，并在上面添加葱。"},{"id":"53370","n":"Egg Foo Young","a":"Chinese","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/47y6ii1765658818.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XVTJrkgW304","i":[["Unsalted Beef Stock","1 cup"],["Soy Sauce","1 tablespoon"],["Shaoxing Wine","1 tablespoon"],["Oyster Sauce","1 tablespoon"],["Pepper","1/2 tsp"],["Cornstarch","1 tablespoon"],["Water","1 tablespoon"],["Cornstarch","1 tablespoon"],["Water","1 tablespoon"],["Egg","8 large"],["Kosher Salt","1/2 tsp"],["Sugar","1/4 tsp"],["Spring Onions","1"],["Mung Bean Sprouts","1 cup"],["Shrimp","20"],["Vegetable Oil","3 Cups"],["Jasmine Rice","2 cups"]],"s":"Make the gravy:\r\nIn a small saucepan, add the beef stock, soy sauce, Shaoxing wine, oyster sauce, and white pepper powder over medium heat. Whisk together and bring to a simmer. \r\n\r\nCombine the cornstarch and water in a small bowl and whisk to dissolve. Add to the saucepan and whisk until the gravy thickens and coats the back of the spoon, 2 to 3 minutes. Cover the saucepan with a lid and keep it warm on the lowest possible heat.\r\n\r\nMake the egg foo young batter:\r\nIn a medium bowl, whisk together the cornstarch and water until dissolved. Add the eggs, salt, and sugar. Whisk until well combined and there are no more egg white clumps. \r\n\r\nAdd the green onion, bean sprouts, and shrimp. Stir until everything is evenly coated.\r\n\r\nFry the egg foo young:\r\nAdd the vegetable oil to a large wok; it should reach about 2 inches up the sides. Heat the oil over medium-high heat to 350°F, or until vigorous bubbles form around an inserted wooden chopstick. \r\n\r\nWith a ladle, gently and slowly add 1/4 of the omelet batter. Egg foo young should immediately bubble and puff up like magic. Fry until golden brown and crispy on each side, about 2 minutes per side. If there are any light spots, use a ladle to gently baste it with hot oil.\r\n\r\nTip\r\nEgg foo young can be a bit tricky to flip. The easiest method is to put a tool in each hand (a spider, slotted spoon, tongs, and large chopsticks are all good candidates) and gently coax the omelet over, pulling up on one side and pushing down and around on the other.\r\n\r\nRemove the omelet and place it on a paper towel-lined baking sheet. Let it cool for 5 minutes. Meanwhile, repeat with the remaining batter to make 4 omelets. If needed, add more oil to the pan between batches.\r\n\r\nServe and enjoy:\r\nPlate each egg foo young over a bed of rice. Spoon the warm gravy over the top and serve immediately. ","z":"做肉汁：\r\n在小锅中加入牛肉高汤、酱油、绍兴酒、蚝油和白胡椒粉，中火加热。一起搅拌并煮沸。 \r\n\r\n将玉米淀粉和水放入一个小碗中，搅拌溶解。添加到平底锅中，搅拌 2 到 3 分钟，直至肉汁变稠并覆盖勺子背面。盖上锅盖，并用尽可能低的热量保温。\r\n\r\n制作鸡蛋面糊：\r\n在一个中等大小的碗中，将玉米淀粉和水搅拌直至溶解。加入鸡蛋、盐和糖。搅拌直至充分混合并且不再有蛋清块。 \r\n\r\n加入葱、豆芽和虾。搅拌直至所有东西都均匀地涂上。\r\n\r\n煎鸡蛋芙蓉：\r\n将植物油加入大锅中；它应该达到侧面约 2 英寸。用中高温将油加热至 350°F，或直至插入的木筷子周围形成剧烈的气泡。 \r\n\r\n用勺子轻轻地慢慢加入 1/4 的煎蛋卷面糊。富年轻蛋应该立即像魔法一样起泡并膨胀。每面煎至金黄色酥脆，每面约 2 分钟。如果有光点，用勺子轻轻地涂上热油。\r\n\r\n提示\r\n鸡蛋 foo young 翻转起来可能有点棘手。最简单的方法是每只手各放一个工具（蜘蛛、漏勺、钳子和大筷子都是不错的选择），轻轻地将煎蛋卷翻过来，一侧向上拉，另一侧向下推。\r\n\r\n取出煎蛋卷并将其放在衬有纸巾的烤盘上。让它冷却 5 分钟。同时，用剩余的面糊重复制作 4 个煎蛋卷。如果需要，请在批次之间向锅中添加更多油。\r\n\r\n服务和享受：\r\n将每个鸡蛋放在米饭上。将温热的肉汁舀到上面即可立即食用。"},{"id":"52951","n":"General Tsos Chicken","a":"Chinese","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/1529444113.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wWGwz0iBmvU","i":[["Chicken Breast","1 1/2"],["Plain Flour","3/4 cup"],["Egg","1"],["Starch","2 tbs"],["Baking Powder","1 tbs"],["Salt","1 tsp"],["Onion Salt","1/2 tsp"],["Garlic Powder","1/4 tsp"],["Water","3/4 cup"],["Chicken Stock","1/2 cup"],["Duck Sauce","1/4 cup"],["Soy Sauce","3 tbs"],["Honey","2 tbs"],["Rice Vinegar","1 tbs"],["Sesame Seed Oil","2 tbs"],["Gochujang","1/2 tbs"],["Starch","2 tbs"],["Garlic","1 clove"],["Spring Onions","2 chopped"],["Ginger","1 tsp"]],"s":"DIRECTIONS:\r\nSTEP 1 - SAUCE\r\nIn a bowl, add 2 Cups of water, 2 Tablespoon soy sauce, 2 Tablespoon white vinegar, sherry cooking wine, 1/4 Teaspoon white pepper, minced ginger, minced garlic, hot pepper, ketchup, hoisin sauce, and sugar.\r\nMix together well and set aside.\r\nSTEP 2 - MARINATING THE CHICKEN\r\nIn a bowl, add the chicken, 1 pinch of salt, 1 pinch of white pepper, 2 egg whites, and 3 Tablespoon of corn starch\r\nSTEP 3 - DEEP FRY THE CHICKEN\r\nDeep fry the chicken at 350 degrees for 3-4 minutes or until it is golden brown and loosen up the chicken so that they don't stick together.\r\nSet the chicken aside.\r\nSTEP 4 - STIR FRY\r\nAdd the sauce to the wok and then the broccoli and wait until it is boiling.\r\nTo thicken the sauce, whisk together 2 Tablespoon of cornstarch and 4 Tablespoon of water in a bowl and slowly add to your stir-fry until it's the right thickness.\r\nNext add in the chicken and stir-fry for a minute and serve on a plate","z":"路线：\r\n第 1 步 - 酱汁\r\n在碗中加入2杯水、2汤匙酱油、2汤匙白醋、雪利料酒、1/4茶匙白胡椒、姜末、蒜末、辣椒、番茄酱、海鲜酱和糖。\r\n充分混合并放在一边。\r\n第 2 步 - 腌制鸡肉\r\n在碗中加入鸡肉、1 撮盐、1 撮白胡椒、2 个蛋白和 3 汤匙玉米淀粉\r\n第 3 步 - 油炸鸡肉\r\n将鸡肉在350度的温度下炸3-4分钟或直至呈金黄色，然后将鸡肉松开，以免它们粘在一起。\r\n把鸡肉放在一边。\r\n第 4 步 - 炒\r\n将酱汁加入锅中，然后加入西兰花，等待煮沸。\r\n为了使酱汁变稠，将 2 汤匙玉米淀粉和 4 汤匙水放入碗中搅拌，然后慢慢加入炒菜中，直至达到合适的稠度。\r\n接下来加入鸡肉，炒一分钟，装盘"},{"id":"52954","n":"Hot and Sour Soup","a":"Chinese","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/1529445893.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KgV9Zq3aSTo","i":[["Mushrooms","1/3 cup"],["Wood Ear Mushrooms","1/3 cup"],["Tofu","2/3 Cup"],["Pork","1/2 cup"],["Chicken Stock","2-1/2 cups"],["Salt","1/2 tsp"],["Sugar","1/4 tsp"],["Sesame Seed Oil","1 tsp"],["Pepper","1/4 tsp"],["Hotsauce","1/2 tsp"],["Vinegar","1-½ cups"],["Soy Sauce","1 tsp"],["Cornstarch","1 tbs"],["Water","2 tbs"],["Spring Onions","1/4 cup"]],"s":"STEP 1 - MAKING THE SOUP\r\nIn a wok add chicken broth and wait for it to boil.\r\nNext add salt, sugar, sesame seed oil, white pepper, hot pepper sauce, vinegar and soy sauce and stir for few seconds.\r\nAdd Tofu, mushrooms, black wood ear mushrooms to the wok.\r\nTo thicken the sauce, whisk together 1 Tablespoon of cornstarch and 2 Tablespoon of water in a bowl and slowly add to your soup until it's the right thickness.\r\nNext add 1 egg slightly beaten with a knife or fork and add it to the soup and stir for 8 seconds\r\nServe the soup in a bowl and add the bbq pork and sliced green onions on top.","z":"第 1 步 - 煮汤\r\n在锅中加入鸡汤，等待煮沸。\r\n接下来加入盐、糖、芝麻油、白胡椒、辣椒酱、醋和酱油，搅拌几秒钟。\r\n将豆腐、香菇、黑木耳放入锅中。\r\n为了使酱汁变稠，将 1 汤匙玉米淀粉和 2 汤匙水放入碗中搅拌，然后慢慢添加到汤中，直至达到合适的稠度。\r\n接下来加入 1 个鸡蛋，用刀或叉稍微打散，然后加入汤中，搅拌 8 秒\r\n将汤盛入碗中，然后在上面添加烧烤猪肉和葱片。"},{"id":"52945","n":"Kung Pao Chicken","a":"Chinese","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/1525872624.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QqdcCHQlOe0","i":[["Sake","2 tbs"],["Soy Sauce","2 tbs"],["Sesame Seed Oil","2 tbs"],["Corn Flour","2 tbs"],["Water","2 tbs"],["Chicken","500g"],["Chilli Powder","1 tbs"],["Rice Vinegar","1 tsp"],["Brown Sugar","1 tbs"],["Spring Onions","4 Chopped"],["Garlic Clove","6 cloves"],["Water Chestnut","220g"],["Peanuts","100g"]],"s":"Combine the sake or rice wine, soy sauce, sesame oil and cornflour dissolved in water. Divide mixture in half.\r\nIn a glass dish or bowl, combine half of the sake mixture with the chicken pieces and toss to coat. Cover dish and place in refrigerator for about 30 minutes.\r\nIn a medium frying pan, combine remaining sake mixture, chillies, vinegar and sugar. Mix together and add spring onion, garlic, water chestnuts and peanuts. Heat sauce slowly over medium heat until aromatic.\r\nMeanwhile, remove chicken from marinade and sauté in a large frying pan until juices run clear. When sauce is aromatic, add sautéed chicken and let simmer together until sauce thickens.","z":"将清酒或米酒、酱油、芝麻油和玉米粉溶解在水中混合。将混合物分成两半。\r\n在玻璃盘或碗中，将一半的清酒混合物与鸡块混合，搅拌均匀。盖上盘子并放入冰箱约 30 分钟。\r\n在中型煎锅中，将剩余的清酒混合物、辣椒、醋和糖混合。混合在一起，加入葱、大蒜、荸荠和花生。用中火慢慢加热酱汁直至芳香。\r\n与此同时，将鸡肉从腌料中取出，在大煎锅中炒至汁液清澈。当酱汁芳香时，加入炒好的鸡肉，一起煮至酱汁变稠。"},{"id":"52946","n":"Kung Po Prawns","a":"Chinese","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/1525873040.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ysiuZm9FIxs","i":[["Prawns","400g"],["Soy Sauce","2 tbs"],["Tomato Puree","1 tsp"],["Corn Flour","1 tsp"],["Caster Sugar","1 tsp"],["Sunflower Oil","1 tsp"],["Peanuts","85g"],["Chilli","3 Large"],["Brown Sugar","1 tbs"],["Garlic Clove","6 cloves"],["Water Chestnut","450g"],["Ginger","to taste"]],"s":"Mix the cornflour and 1 tbsp soy sauce, toss in the prawns and set aside for 10 mins. Stir the vinegar, remaining soy sauce, tomato purée, sugar and 2 tbsp water together to make a sauce.\r\n\r\nWhen you’re ready to cook, heat a large frying pan or wok until very hot, then add 1 tbsp oil. Fry the prawns until they are golden in places and have opened out– then tip them out of the pan.\r\n\r\nHeat the remaining oil and add the peanuts, chillies and water chestnuts. Stir-fry for 2 mins or until the peanuts start to colour, then add the ginger and garlic and fry for 1 more min. Tip in the prawns and sauce and simmer for 2 mins until thickened slightly. Serve with rice.","z":"将玉米粉和1汤匙酱油混合，拌入虾，搁置10分钟。将醋、剩余的酱油、番茄泥、糖和 2 汤匙水搅拌在一起制成酱汁。\r\n\r\n准备做饭时，将大煎锅或炒锅加热至非常热，然后加入 1 汤匙油。将虾煎至部分呈金黄色并张开，然后将其从锅中倒出。\r\n\r\n加热剩余的油，加入花生、辣椒和荸荠。炒2分钟或直到花生开始变色，然后加入姜和大蒜，再炒1分钟。倒入虾和酱汁，煮 2 分钟直至稍微变稠。与米饭一起食用。"},{"id":"52947","n":"Ma Po Tofu","a":"Chinese","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/1525874812.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IhwPQL9dFYc","i":[["Tofu","450g"],["Minced Beef","100g"],["Sesame Seed Oil","1/2 tbs"],["Doubanjiang","1 1/2 tsp"],["Fermented Black Beans","1/2 tsp"],["Pepper","1 tbs"],["Salt","1/2 tsp"],["Sichuan pepper","1/2 tsp"],["Soy Sauce","1 tbs"],["Water","400ml"],["Olive Oil","2 tbs"],["Scallions","2 chopped"],["Spring Onions","4"],["Garlic","2 cloves chopped"],["Ginger","4 sliced"],["Water","2 1/2 tbs"],["Cornstarch","1 tbs"]],"s":"Add a small pinch of salt and sesame oil to minced beef. Mix well and set aside.\r\nMix 1 tablespoon of cornstarch with 2 and ½ tablespoons of water in a small bowl to make water starch.\r\nCut tofu into square cubes (around 2cms). Bring a large amount of water to a boil and then add a pinch of salt. Slide the tofu in and cook for 1 minute. Move out and drain.\r\nGet a wok and heat up around 2 tablespoons of oil, fry the minced meat until crispy. Transfer out beef out and leave the oil in.\r\nFry doubanjiang for 1 minute over slow fire and then add garlic, scallion white, ginger and fermented black beans to cook for 30 seconds until aroma. Then mix pepper flakes in.\r\nAdd water to the seasonings and bring to boil over high fire. Gently slide the tofu cubes. Add light soy sauce and beef.Slow the heat after boiling and then simmer for 6-8 minutes. Then add chopped garlic greens.\r\nStir the water starch and then pour half of the mixture to the simmering pot. Wait for around 30 seconds and then pour the other half. You can slightly taste the tofu and add pinch of salt if not salty enough. By the way, if you feel it is too spicy, add some sugar can milder the taste. But be carefully as the broth is very hot at this point.\r\nTransfer out when almost all the seasonings stick to tofu cubes. Sprinkle Szechuan peppercorn powder (to taste)and chopped garlic greens if using.\r\nServe immediately with steamed rice.","z":"在牛肉末中加入少许盐和香油。充分混合并放在一边。\r\n将 1 汤匙玉米淀粉与 2 又 1/2 汤匙水在小碗中混合，制成水淀粉。\r\n将豆腐切成方块（约2厘米）。将大量水煮沸，然后加入少许盐。把豆腐滑进去煮1分钟。移出并沥干。\r\n起锅，烧热约2汤匙油，将肉末煎至酥脆。将牛肉取出，留下油。\r\n用文火将豆瓣酱炒1分钟，然后加入大蒜、葱白、生姜和豆豉煮30秒至出香味。然后拌入胡椒粉。\r\n将水加入调味料中，用大火煮沸。轻轻滑动豆腐块。加入生抽和牛肉，煮沸后转小火，煮6-8分钟。然后加入切碎的蒜苗。\r\n搅拌水淀粉，然后将一半混合物倒入锅中。等待大约 30 秒，然后倒入另一半。豆腐可以稍微尝一下，如果不够咸就加少许盐。对了，如果觉得太辣的话，可以加点糖，可以淡化味道。但要小心，因为此时肉汤很热。\r\n当所有的调料都粘在豆腐块上时，就可以出锅了。如果使用的话，撒上四川花椒粉（适量）和切碎的蒜苗。\r\n立即与米饭一起食用。"},{"id":"53377","n":"Napa Cabbage with Dried Shrimp","a":"Chinese","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/9nh4dl1766435484.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Fj0JALB4_5k","i":[["Dried Shrimp","2 tablespoons"],["Boiling Water","3/4 cup"],["Napa Cabbage","1 head"],["Peanut Oil","2 tablespoons"],["Scallions","4 Chopped"],["Ginger","1 tablespoon"],["Soy Sauce","1 tablespoon"],["Water","1 tablespoon"],["Cornstarch","2 tsp"],["Kosher Salt","1 tsp"],["Pepper","1/2 tsp"]],"s":"Dried shrimp gives this Chinese dish a punch of salty umami flavor. You can find it at an Asian grocery store in the frozen or refrigerated section. Look for small-sized dried shrimp, about a 1/4-inch in size. If you use medium or large dried shrimp, hydrate the shrimp with more water (1 cup for medium-sized shrimp, 1 1/4 cup for large) and for longer time (45 to 60 minutes), then chop it up into smaller 1/4-inch chunks. To make this recipe vegetarian, omit the dried shrimp and use four or five dried shiitake mushrooms, rehydrated, and sliced thin.\r\n\r\nRehydrate the dried shrimp:\r\nPlace the dried shrimp in a small bowl and pour the boiling water over it. Cover with a small plate and let sit for 30 minutes so the shrimp can rehydrate. The shrimp will be lighter in color and plump up slightly.\r\n\r\nPrep the cabbage:\r\nMeanwhile, split the napa cabbage in half lengthwise. Rinse the cabbage and shake it dry. Cut out the core of the cabbage and discard.\r\n\r\nSet out two large bowls. Cut the remaining cabbage into 1-inch pieces, putting the thicker white pieces at the bottom of the cabbage into one bowl and the top thinner leafy green pieces into the other bowl.\r\n\r\nDrain the shrimp:\r\nOnce the shrimp has rehydrated, drain it and discard the liquid.\r\n\r\nCook the shrimp and cabbage:\r\nIn a large wok or skillet over high heat add the peanut oil, swirling it around to coat the pan.\r\n\r\nHeat until the oil looks shimmering hot, then carefully add the scallions, ginger, and rehydrated shrimp, paying specially attention as the wet ingredients may cause the hot oil to splatter. Toss with a spatula until the scallions are bright green and the entire mixture is fragrant, about 1 minute.\r\n\r\nAdd the thicker white part of the napa cabbage to the pan and lower the heat to medium high. Continue to cook and stir for 3 to 4 minutes, or until the edges of the cabbage pieces start to look slightly translucent but the center of the cabbage pieces are still opaque white.\r\n\r\nReduce the heat to medium low and add the leafy green pieces of cabbage into the pan. Cook until the leaves are wilted, about 2 minutes.\r\n\r\nMake a cornstarch slurry:\r\nIn a small bowl, combine the soy sauce, cold water, and cornstarch, stirring to make a slurry. Then pour over the cabbage and continue to cook and stir until a sauce has thickened slightly to the consistency of whole milk.\r\n\r\nSeason the stir fry:\r\nSeason the stir fry with salt and pepper, then taste and add more salt and pepper if you wish. The cabbage will be translucent and silky looking, with specks of dried shrimp all over.","z":"干虾给这道中国菜带来了一丝咸鲜味。您可以在亚洲杂货店的冷冻或冷藏区找到它。寻找小尺寸的干虾，大约 1/4 英寸大小。 If you use medium or large dried shrimp, hydrate the shrimp with more water (1 cup for medium-sized shrimp, 1 1/4 cup for large) and for longer time (45 to 60 minutes), then chop it up into smaller 1/4-inch chunks.要使此食谱成为素食，请省略虾米，而使用四到五个干香菇，重新水化并切成薄片。\r\n\r\n给虾米补充水分：\r\n将干虾放入小碗中，倒入沸水。盖上一个小盘子，静置 30 分钟，以便虾能够补充水分。虾的颜色会变浅，并且稍微丰满。\r\n\r\n准备白菜：\r\n同时，将纳帕卷心菜纵向切成两半。将卷心菜洗净并摇干。切掉卷心菜的核心并丢弃。\r\n\r\n摆出两个大碗。 Cut the remaining cabbage into 1-inch pieces, putting the thicker white pieces at the bottom of the cabbage into one bowl and the top thinner leafy green pieces into the other bowl.\r\n\r\n将虾沥干：\r\n一旦虾重新水化，将其沥干并丢弃液体。\r\n\r\n煮虾和卷心菜：\r\n在一个大炒锅或煎锅中，用高温加入花生油，旋转以覆盖锅。\r\n\r\nHeat until the oil looks shimmering hot, then carefully add the scallions, ginger, and rehydrated shrimp, paying specially attention as the wet ingredients may cause the hot oil to splatter.用抹刀搅拌约 1 分钟，直到葱变成亮绿色且整个混合物散发出香味。\r\n\r\n将纳帕卷心菜较厚的白色部分放入锅中，并将热量降至中高。 Continue to cook and stir for 3 to 4 minutes, or until the edges of the cabbage pieces start to look slightly translucent but the center of the cabbage pieces are still opaque white.\r\n\r\n将热量调至中低，然后将绿叶卷心菜放入锅中。煮约 2 分钟，直至叶子枯萎。\r\n\r\n制作玉米淀粉浆：\r\n在一个小碗中，将酱油、冷水和玉米淀粉混合，搅拌成浆状。然后倒在卷心菜上，继续煮和搅拌，直到酱汁稍微变稠，达到全脂牛奶的稠度。\r\n\r\n给炒菜调味：\r\n用盐和胡椒调味，然后尝一尝，如果你愿意的话，可以添加更多的盐和胡椒。卷心菜看起来半透明，丝滑，上面布满了干虾的斑点。"},{"id":"53383","n":"Ramen Noodles with Boiled Egg","a":"Chinese","c":"Miscellaneous","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/ip5xtp1769779958.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AbJNVnkndS4","i":[["Noodles","1 Packet"],["Water","2 cups"],["Egg","1 large"],["Soy Sauce","1 tbsp"],["Chilli Sauce","1/2 tsp"],["Spring Onions","1 tbls"],["Salt","1/2 tsp"],["Pepper","1/2 tbs"]],"s":"Boil: Bring water to a boil, gently add eggs, and cook for exactly 6½ to 7 minutes.\r\nIce Bath: Immediately transfer the eggs to a bowl of ice water for 3–5 minutes to stop cooking.\r\nMarinate (Optional but recommended): Peel the eggs and marinate in a mix of 2 tbsp soy sauce, 2 tbsp mirin, 1 tsp sugar, and 4 tbsp water for at least 4 hours (or overnight).\r\nServe: Slice in half, letting the yolk flow into the broth","z":"煮沸：将水煮沸，轻轻加入鸡蛋，煮 6.5 至 7 分钟。\r\n冰浴：立即将鸡蛋转移到一碗冰水中 3-5 分钟以停止烹饪。\r\n腌制（可选，但建议）：将鸡蛋剥皮，用 2 汤匙酱油、2 汤匙味醂、1 茶匙糖和 4 汤匙水的混合物腌制至少 4 小时（或过夜）。\r\n食用：切成两半，让蛋黄流入肉汤中"},{"id":"53378","n":"Sesame Cucumber Salad","a":"Chinese","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/93iok31766436070.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=q37qn81lg5c","i":[["Cucumber","2 medium"],["Salt","1/2 tsp"],["Sesame Seed Oil","2 tsp"],["Rice Vinegar","2 tablespoons"],["Basil Leaves","6"],["Red Chilli Flakes","1/2 tsp"],["Sesame Seed","2 tsp"]],"s":"Prep the cucumbers:\r\nPeel the cucumbers. Cut them into quarters, lengthwise. (If the seeds are bitter, scrape out the seeds and discard.) Cut the cucumbers again, crosswise, into 1/2-inch thick pieces.\r\n\r\nToss the salad:\r\nPlace cucumbers into a serving bowl. Sprinkle with salt. Toss with sesame oil, seasoned rice vinegar, basil (if using), and chili flakes. Sprinkle with toasted sesame seeds if using.","z":"准备黄瓜：\r\n将黄瓜去皮。将它们纵向切成四份。 （如果种子是苦的，则刮出种子并丢弃。）再次将黄瓜横向切成 1/2 英寸厚的片。\r\n\r\n扔沙拉：\r\n将黄瓜放入碗中。撒上盐。加入芝麻油、调味米醋、罗勒（如果使用）和辣椒片。如果使用，撒上烤芝麻。"},{"id":"52953","n":"Shrimp Chow Fun","a":"Chinese","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/1529445434.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wzaTcpoFEaY","i":[["Rice Stick Noodles","1/2 bag"],["Prawns","8 oz"],["Egg","1/2"],["Pepper","pinch"],["Sesame Seed Oil","2 tsp"],["Cornstarch","2 tbs"],["Oil","4 tbs"],["Minced Garlic","1 tsp"],["Ginger","1 tsp"],["Onion","1/2 cup"],["Bean Sprouts","1 cup"],["Spring Onions","1/2 cup"],["Cooking wine","1 tbs"],["Oyster Sauce","1 tbs"],["Sugar","1/2 tbs"],["Vinegar","1/2 tbs"],["Soy Sauce","1 tbs"]],"s":"STEP 1 - SOAK THE RICE NOODLES\r\nSoak the rice noodles overnight untill they are soft\r\nSTEP 2 - BOIL THE RICE NOODLES\r\nBoil the noodles for 10-15 minutes and then rinse with cold water to stop the cooking process of the noodles.\r\nSTEP 3 -MARINATING THE SHRIMP\r\nIn a bowl add the shrimp, egg, 1 pinch of white pepper, 1 Teaspoon of sesame seed oil, 1 Tablespoon corn starch and 1 tablespoon of oil\r\nMix together well\r\nSTEP 4 - STIR FRY\r\nIn a wok add 2 Tablespoons of oil, shrimp and stir fry them until it is golden brown\r\nSet the shrimp aside\r\nAdd 1 Tablespoon of oil to the work and then add minced garlic, ginger and all of the vegetables.\r\nAdd the noodles to the wok\r\nNext add sherry cooking wine, oyster sauce, sugar, vinegar, sesame seed oil, 1 pinch white pepper, and soy sauce\r\nAdd back in the shrimp\r\nTo thicken the sauce, whisk together 1 Tablespoon of corn starch and 2 Tablespoon of water in a bowl and slowly add to your stir-fry until it's the right thickness.","z":"第 1 步 - 浸泡米粉\r\n将米粉浸泡一晚至软\r\n第 2 步 - 煮米粉\r\n将面条煮10-15分钟，然后用冷水冲洗以停止面条的烹饪过程。\r\n第 3 步 - 腌制虾\r\n在碗中加入虾、鸡蛋、1小撮白胡椒、1茶匙芝麻油、1汤匙玉米淀粉和1汤匙油\r\n充分混合在一起\r\n第 4 步 - 炒\r\n锅中加入2汤匙油，将虾仁炒至金黄色\r\n把虾放在一边\r\n加入一汤匙油，然后加入蒜末、姜末和所有蔬菜。\r\n将面条加入锅中\r\n接下来加入雪利料酒、蚝油、糖、醋、芝麻油、1撮白胡椒粉和酱油\r\n再加入虾\r\n为了使酱汁变稠，将 1 汤匙玉米淀粉和 2 汤匙水放入碗中搅拌，然后慢慢加入炒菜中，直至达到合适的稠度。"},{"id":"53375","n":"Shrimp With Snow Peas","a":"Chinese","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/fpl3mv1766433431.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RmbTaEqabN4","i":[["Cornstarch","2 tsp"],["Dry sherry","1 tablespoon"],["Kosher Salt","1/2 tsp"],["Shrimp","1 lb"],["Peanut Oil","2 tablespoons"],["Ground Ginger","1 tablespoon"],["Garlic","3 cloves Chopped"],["Snow Peas","1/2 lb"],["Soy Sauce","2 tsp"],["Chicken Stock","1/4 cup"],["Scallions","4"],["Sesame Seed Oil","2 tsp"]],"s":"You can also use sugar snap peas for this recipe. Save prep time by prepping the peas, ginger, and garlic while the shrimp is marinating.\r\n\r\nMarinate the shrimp:\r\nMix all marinade ingredients in a large bowl, then add the shrimp. Toss to coat. Let sit for 15 to 20 minutes while you prep the peas, ginger, and garlic.\r\n\r\nStir-fry the ginger and garlic:\r\nHeat a wok or large sauté pan over high heat for 1 minute. Add the peanut oil and let it get hot, about 30 seconds. Add the ginger and garlic and toss to combine. Stir-fry for about 30 seconds.\r\n\r\nAdd the shrimp, snow peas, soy sauce, stock:\r\nAdd the shrimp and all the marinade to the pan (scrape out all the marinade with a rubber spatula). Add the snow peas, soy sauce and chicken stock. Stir-fry until the shrimp turns pink, about 2 minutes.\r\n\r\nAdd the scallions and finish with sesame oil:\r\nAdd the scallions and stir-fry 1 more minute. Turn off the heat and add the sesame oil. Toss to combine once more and serve with steamed rice.","z":"您也可以使用甜豌豆来做这个食谱。在腌制虾的同时准备豌豆、姜和大蒜，可以节省准备时间。\r\n\r\n腌制虾：\r\n将所有腌料混合在一个大碗中，然后加入虾。扔到外套上。静置 15 到 20 分钟，同时准备豌豆、生姜和大蒜。\r\n\r\n将姜和蒜炒香：\r\n将炒锅或大炒锅用大火加热 1 分钟。加入花生油，加热约30秒。加入生姜和大蒜，搅拌均匀。炒约30秒。\r\n\r\n添加虾、荷兰豆、酱油、高汤：\r\n将虾和所有腌料加入锅中（用橡皮刮刀刮掉所有腌料）。加入荷兰豆、酱油和鸡汤。炒至虾变成粉红色，大约2分钟。\r\n\r\n加入葱，最后撒上芝麻油：\r\n加入葱，再炒1分钟。关掉火，加入芝麻油。再次搅拌均匀，与米饭一起食用。"},{"id":"53374","n":"Sichuan Eggplant","a":"Chinese","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/1oz4nb1765687990.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=j54Af9gBmzo","i":[["Egg Plants","1.5 pounds sliced"],["Peanut Oil","2 tablespoons"],["Chicken Stock","1/4 cup"],["Sugar","2 tsp"],["Soy Sauce","1/2 tsp"],["Chilli Bean Paste","1 ½ tbsp"],["Sichuan Pepper","2 tsp"],["Ginger","2 tsp"],["Garlic","5 cloves"],["Cornstarch","1 tsp"],["Apple Cider Vinegar","2 tsp"],["Scallions","4 Chopped"],["Cilantro","Garnish"]],"s":"This recipe calls for asian eggplants, or Japanese eggplants. They are long and thin compared to a European or globe eggplant, and much more tender and delicate. If you can't find them you can substitute globe eggplant, but the dish is really best with the asian eggplant.\r\n\r\n*A lot of grocery stores have Asian ingredient aisles now. You should be able to find chili-bean paste, a mixture of preserved chilies mixed with mashed soybeans, there or at any Asian market. (Do not confuse with black bean paste or chili-garlic paste.)\r\n\r\n**Sichuan peppercorns are available at some stores and online for quite cheap. They aren't spicy like other peppers but rather have a citrusy flavor and induce a tingly, numbing sensation like a carbonated drink.\r\n\r\nPrep eggplant, chili sauce, cornstarch slurry, vinegar and scallions:\r\nBegin your mise en place. Quarter the eggplant lengthwise and chop into large batons and set aside.\r\n\r\nIn a small bowl, mix together the chicken stock, sugar, and soy sauce and set it aside.\r\n\r\nIn a second bowl, mix together the chili bean paste, garlic, ginger, and sichuan peppercorns and set it aside.\r\n\r\nIn a third bowl, mix together the cornstarch with a tablespoon of water and set it aside.\r\n\r\nLastly, in a fourth bowl, mix together the scallions and vinegar and set it aside.\r\n\r\nSauté eggplant:\r\nPlace the oil in a wok or large sauté pan over medium-high heat until the oil is almost smoking. Add the eggplant and sauté, allowing it to sit for a few seconds each time you move it to allow it to brown and blister. If the eggplant absorbs all the oil and some pieces don't get any then add a little more oil.\r\n\r\nAdd the chili bean paste, garlic, ginger, and sichuan peppercorns and sauté:\r\nuntil fragrant, about 30 seconds.\r\n\r\nAdd the chicken stock mixture:\r\nturn the heat to medium-low and simmer for 90 seconds.\r\n\r\nAdd the cornstarch mixture:\r\nand stir together until the sauce thickens a bit.\r\n\r\nAdd the scallions and vinegar:\r\nand cook for 15 seconds to diffuse their harsh flavors a bit.\r\n\r\nGarnish with cilantro and serve.","z":"这个食谱需要亚洲茄子或日本茄子。与欧洲茄子或球形茄子相比，它们又长又薄，而且更加嫩滑。如果你找不到它们，你可以用地球茄子代替，但这道菜最好搭配亚洲茄子。\r\n\r\n*现在很多杂货店都有亚洲原料货架。您应该能够在当地或任何亚洲市场找到豆瓣酱，这是一种腌制辣椒与捣碎的大豆的混合物。 （不要与黑豆酱或辣椒蒜酱混淆。）\r\n\r\n**四川花椒在一些商店和网上有售，价格相当便宜。它们不像其他辣椒那样辛辣，而是具有柑橘味，并像碳酸饮料一样产生刺痛、麻木的感觉。\r\n\r\n准备茄子、辣椒酱、生粉浆、醋和葱：\r\n开始你的准备工作。将茄子纵向切成四等分，切成大棒放在一边。\r\n\r\n在一个小碗中，将鸡汤、糖和酱油混合在一起，放在一边。\r\n\r\n在第二个碗中，将豆瓣酱、大蒜、生姜和花椒混合在一起，放在一边。\r\n\r\n在第三个碗中，将玉米淀粉与一汤匙水混合并放在一边。\r\n\r\n最后，在第四个碗中，将葱和醋混合在一起，放在一边。\r\n\r\n炒茄子：\r\n将油放入炒锅或大煎锅中，用中火加热，直到油几乎冒烟。加入茄子并炒，每次移动茄子时，让它静置几秒钟，使其变成棕色并起泡。如果茄子吸收了所有的油，而有些茄子没有吸收，那么就再加一点油。\r\n\r\n加入豆瓣酱、大蒜、生姜和花椒，炒香：\r\n直至散发出香味，约30秒。\r\n\r\n添加鸡汤混合物：\r\n将火调至中低，煮 90 秒。\r\n\r\n添加玉米淀粉混合物：\r\n一起搅拌，直到酱汁变稠一点。\r\n\r\n加入葱和醋：\r\n煮 15 秒，以散去一点刺鼻的味道。\r\n\r\n用香菜装饰即可食用。"},{"id":"53371","n":"Sichuan Style Stir-Fried Chinese Long Beans","a":"Chinese","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/i0610h1765659464.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7mzLphZJ3xc","i":[["Chinese Long Beans","1/2 lb"],["Peanut Oil","1 tablespoon"],["Dried Chillies","6"],["Sichuan Pepper","1 tsp"],["Salt","1/4 tsp"],["Sugar","1/2 tsp"],["Sesame Seed Oil","1 tablespoon"],["Soy Sauce","Splash"]],"s":"Chinese long beans can be found in both green and purple varieties. Both have similar flavors and textures, and either kind can be used for this recipe.\r\nIf you don't have a wok, use a sturdy, large sauté pan that has at least a two-inch lip.","z":"中国长豆有绿色和紫色两种品种。两者都有相似的味道和质地，任何一种都可以用于此食谱。\r\n如果您没有炒锅，请使用坚固的大煎锅，其边缘至少有两英寸。"},{"id":"53369","n":"Silken Tofu with Sesame Soy Sauce","a":"Chinese","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/j9nray1765657692.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/bSLv5vFn5Z0","i":[["Silken Tofu","16 ounces"],["Soy Sauce","3  tablespoons"],["Chinese Sesame Sauce","2 tablespoons"],["Scallions","1 sliced"],["Sesame Seed","2 tsp"]],"s":"Prepare the tofu: \r\nDrain the tofu and gently remove it from its packaging onto a large plate. Carefully slice the tofu into 1/2-inch slabs widthwise. With the palm of your hands, gently push the sliced tofu sidewise so that they fan out over the plate.\r\n\r\nGarnish with toppings and serve:\r\nDrizzle the soy sauce and sesame sauce on top. Then garnish it with scallions and sesame seeds, and serve.\r\n\r\nTightly cover leftovers and refrigerate for up to 2 days. You can enjoy it cold straight out of the fridge or you can reheat it by microwaving in 30-second increments until warmed through","z":"准备豆腐： \r\n将豆腐沥干，轻轻地将其从包装中取出放到一个大盘子上。小心地将豆腐横向切成 1/2 英寸的厚片。用手掌轻轻地将豆腐片向侧面推，使它们在盘子上呈扇形散开。\r\n\r\n用配料装饰即可食用：\r\n在上面淋上酱油和芝麻酱。然后撒上葱花和芝麻，即可食用。\r\n\r\n盖紧剩菜并冷藏最多 2 天。您可以直接从冰箱中取出冷饮，也可以通过微波炉以 30 秒的增量重新加热，直至热透"},{"id":"53368","n":"Singapore Noodles with Shrimp","a":"Chinese","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/f3cxnc1765656994.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DiFUyPAGoug","i":[["Sesame Seed Oil","2 tsp"],["Soy Sauce","2 tablespoons"],["Seasoned Rice Vinegar","2 tablespoons"],["Vermicelli Rice Noodles","6 oz"],["Egg","2 large"],["Ground Ginger","2 tblsp"],["Garlic","1 clove finely chopped"],["Carrots","2"],["Jalapeno","1 sliced"],["Onion","1/2"],["Salt","1/2 tsp"],["Ham","4 oz"],["Napa Cabbage","1/2"],["Scallions","4"],["Red Pepper","1/2"],["Curry Powder","2 tsp"],["Shrimp","1/2 lb"],["Cilantro Leaves","2 tablespoons"]],"s":"For the sweet onion, look for Vidalia, OSO Sweet, or Walla Walla. The super-sweet varieties are more suited to this stir-fry because at the end of cooking, the onion still has a slight crunch.\r\n\r\nMake the sauce:\r\nIn a bowl, combine the sesame oil, soy sauce, and rice vinegar.\r\n\r\nCook the rice noodles:\r\nBring a large saucepan of water to a boil, add the noodles, and use tongs to turn them so they are submerged. Cook for 2 minutes, or until they are tender but still have some bite (they will cook a little more once you add them to the skillet).\r\n\r\nDrain, rinse with cold water, and use scissors to snip the noodles several times to break them up into shorter lengths.\r\n\r\nScramble the eggs:\r\nIn a small bowl whisk together the eggs. Heat the skillet or Dutch oven over medium heat. Add 1 tablespoon of the peanut or canola oil. Add the eggs and scramble them for 2 minutes, or until they form large, soft curds. Transfer them from the pan to a plate or bowl.\r\n\r\nCook the vegetables:\r\nAdd 1 tablespoon of the remaining oil to the pan. When it is hot, add the ginger, garlic, carrots, jalapeño, onion, and salt. Cook, stirring constantly, for 2 minutes or until the vegetables start to soften.\r\n\r\nAdd the remaining ingredients:\r\nSprinkle the vegetable mixture with the remaining 1 tablespoon peanut or canola oil. When the oil is hot, add the ham, cabbage, scallions, red pepper, and curry powder to the pan. Cook, stirring constantly, for 1 minute.\r\n\r\nAdd the shrimp and cook, stirring, for 3 more minutes or until the shrimp are bright pink and cooked through.\r\n\r\nAdd the noodles in batches:\r\nAdd the eggs, the sauce mixture, and half the noodles to the pan. Toss for 1 minute.\r\n\r\nAdd the remaining noodles and continue tossing for 1 minute more until they are thoroughly combined and the mixture is heated through.\r\n\r\nServe:\r\nTaste for seasoning and add more salt or soy sauce, if you like. Sprinkle with cilantro leaves and serve.","z":"对于甜洋葱，可以选择 Vidalia、OSO Sweet 或 Walla Walla。超甜品种更适合这种炒菜，因为在烹饪结束时，洋葱仍然有轻微的嘎吱声。\r\n\r\n做酱汁：\r\n在碗中，将芝麻油、酱油和米醋混合。\r\n\r\n煮米粉：\r\n将一大锅水烧开，加入面条，然后用钳子转动面条，使面条浸没在水中。煮 2 分钟，或者直到它们变软但仍然有一些咬感（一旦将它们添加到煎锅中，它们会再煮一点）。\r\n\r\n沥干水分，用冷水冲洗，然后用剪刀将面条剪几次，将其切成较短的长度。\r\n\r\n炒鸡蛋：\r\n在一个小碗中将鸡蛋搅拌在一起。用中火加热煎锅或荷兰烤箱。添加一汤匙花生油或菜籽油。加入鸡蛋，炒 2 分钟，或直至形成又大又软的凝乳。将它们从锅中转移到盘子或碗中。\r\n\r\n煮蔬菜：\r\n将 1 汤匙剩余的油加入锅中。热时，加入生姜、大蒜、胡萝卜、墨西哥辣椒、洋葱和盐。不断搅拌，煮 2 分钟或直到蔬菜开始变软。\r\n\r\n添加剩余成分：\r\n在蔬菜混合物上撒上剩余的一汤匙花生油或菜籽油。当油热时，将火腿、卷心菜、葱、红辣椒和咖喱粉放入锅中。煮 1 分钟，不断搅拌。\r\n\r\n加入虾并搅拌，再煮 3 分钟或直至虾呈亮粉色并煮熟。\r\n\r\n分批加入面条：\r\n将鸡蛋、酱汁混合物和一半面条放入锅中。折腾1分钟。\r\n\r\n加入剩余的面条，继续搅拌 1 分钟，直到它们完全混合并且混合物加热透。\r\n\r\n服务：\r\n尝尝调味料，如果你喜欢的话，可以添加更多的盐或酱油。撒上香菜叶即可食用。"},{"id":"53376","n":"Sweet and Sour Chicken","a":"Chinese","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/arzs741766434335.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cblsP5S9PhU","i":[["Chicken Thighs","1 lb"],["Egg White","1 large"],["Kosher Salt","1 tsp"],["Cornstarch","2 tsp"],["Pineapple Chunks","10 oz"],["Pineapple Juice","1/4 cup"],["White Vinegar","1/4 cup"],["Tomato Ketchup","1/4 cup"],["Brown Sugar","3  tablespoons"],["Oil","4 tsp"],["Red Pepper","1 chopped"],["Yellow Pepper","1 chopped"],["Ginger","1 tsp"]],"s":"Coat the chicken with egg white:\r\nIn a bowl, combine the chicken with the egg white, 1/2 teaspoon kosher salt, and cornstarch. Stir to coat the chicken evenly. Let sit for 15 minutes at room temperature or up to overnight in the refrigerator.\r\n\r\nMake the sweet and sour sauce:\r\nWhisk together the pineapple juice, vinegar, ketchup, 1/2 teaspoon kosher salt, and brown sugar.\r\n\r\nStir-fry the chicken over high heat:\r\nHeat a large frying pan or wok over high heat until a bead of water instantly sizzles and evaporates. Pour in 1 tablespoon of cooking oil and swirl to coat. It's important that the pan is very hot.\r\n\r\nAdd the chicken and spread the pieces out in one layer. Let the chicken fry untouched for 1 minute, until the bottoms are browned.\r\n\r\nFlip and fry the other side for 1 minute. The chicken should still be pinkish in the middle. Dish out the chicken onto a clean plate, leaving as much oil in the pan as possible.\r\n\r\nStir-fry the bell pepper and ginger:\r\nReduce the heat to medium and add the remaining 1 teaspoon of cooking oil. Let the oil heat up before adding the bell pepper chunks and ginger. Fry for 1 minute.\r\n\r\nAdd the pineapple, sauce, and then, the chicken:\r\nAdd the pineapple chunks and the sweet and sour sauce. Turn up the heat to high. When the sauce is simmering, add the chicken pieces back in.\r\n\r\nLet simmer for 1 to 2 minutes, until the chicken is cooked through. Timing depends on how thick you've cut your chicken. The best way to tell if the chicken is done is to take a piece out and cut into it. If it's pink, add another minute to the cooking.\r\n\r\nAdjust the seasoning and serve:\r\nTaste the sauce and add more brown sugar or vinegar to suit your tastes, if you’d like.\r\n\r\nServe hot with steamed white or brown rice.","z":"将鸡肉涂上蛋清：\r\n在一个碗中，将鸡肉与蛋白、1/2 茶匙粗盐和玉米淀粉混合。搅拌均匀，让鸡肉均匀裹上一层。在室温下静置 15 分钟或在冰箱中静置过夜。\r\n\r\n制作糖醋汁：\r\n将菠萝汁、醋、番茄酱、1/2 茶匙粗盐和红糖搅拌在一起。\r\n\r\n用大火炒鸡肉：\r\n用高火加热大煎锅或炒锅，直到水珠立即发出嘶嘶声并蒸发。倒入一汤匙食用油并旋转以涂上油。重要的是锅要非常热。\r\n\r\n加入鸡肉并将鸡块铺成一层。让鸡肉原封不动地煎 1 分钟，直至底部变成棕色。\r\n\r\n翻转并煎另一面 1 分钟。鸡肉中间应该还是粉红色的。将鸡肉盛到干净的盘子上，尽可能多地在锅中留下油。\r\n\r\n将青椒和姜一起炒香：\r\n将火调至中火，加入剩余的 1 茶匙食用油。先将油加热，然后加入甜椒块和生姜。煎1分钟。\r\n\r\n加入菠萝、酱汁，然后加入鸡肉：\r\n加入菠萝块和糖醋酱。将热量调高。当酱汁煮沸时，将鸡肉块重新放入。\r\n\r\n煮1到2分钟，直到鸡肉煮熟。时间取决于你切鸡肉的厚度。判断鸡肉是否煮熟的最佳方法是取出一块并切成薄片。如果是粉红色，请再煮一分钟。\r\n\r\n调整调味料即可食用：\r\n尝一下酱汁，如果你愿意的话，可以添加更多的红糖或醋来适应你的口味。\r\n\r\n趁热与蒸白米或糙米一起食用。"},{"id":"52949","n":"Sweet and Sour Pork","a":"Chinese","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/1529442316.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mdaBIhgEAMo","i":[["Pork","200g"],["Egg","1"],["Water","Dash"],["Salt","1/2 tsp"],["Sugar","1 tsp"],["Soy Sauce","10g"],["Starch","10g"],["Tomato Puree","30g"],["Vinegar","10g"],["Coriander","Dash"]],"s":"Preparation\r\n1. Crack the egg into a bowl. Separate the egg white and yolk.\r\n\r\nSweet and Sour Pork\r\n2. Slice the pork tenderloin into strips.\r\n\r\n3. Prepare the marinade using a pinch of salt, one teaspoon of starch, two teaspoons of light soy sauce, and an egg white.\r\n\r\n4. Marinade the pork strips for about 20 minutes.\r\n\r\n5. Put the remaining starch in a bowl. Add some water and vinegar to make a starchy sauce.\r\n\r\nSweet and Sour Pork\r\nCooking Instructions\r\n1. Pour the cooking oil into a wok and heat to 190°C (375°F). Add the marinated pork strips and fry them until they turn brown. Remove the cooked pork from the wok and place on a plate.\r\n\r\n2. Leave some oil in the wok. Put the tomato sauce and white sugar into the wok, and heat until the oil and sauce are fully combined.\r\n\r\n3. Add some water to the wok and thoroughly heat the sweet and sour sauce before adding the pork strips to it.\r\n\r\n4. Pour in the starchy sauce. Stir-fry all the ingredients until the pork and sauce are thoroughly mixed together.\r\n\r\n5. Serve on a plate and add some coriander for decoration.","z":"准备工作\r\n1. 将鸡蛋打入碗中。将蛋清和蛋黄分开。\r\n\r\n咕噜肉\r\n2. 将猪里脊肉切成条。\r\n\r\n3. 用少许盐、一茶匙淀粉、两茶匙生抽和一个蛋清准备腌料。\r\n\r\n4.将肉条腌制20分钟左右。\r\n\r\n5.将剩余的淀粉放入碗中。加一些水和醋制成淀粉酱。\r\n\r\n咕噜肉\r\n烹饪说明\r\n1. 将食用油倒入炒锅中，加热至 190°C (375°F)。加入腌制好的猪肉条，煎至焦黄。将煮熟的猪肉从锅中取出，放在盘子上。\r\n\r\n2.锅里留少许油。将番茄酱和白糖放入锅中，加热至油和酱充分混合。\r\n\r\n3. 锅中加入适量水，将糖醋汁烧热，然后加入肉条。\r\n\r\n4.倒入淀粉酱。将所有材料炒至猪肉和酱汁充分混合。\r\n\r\n5.装盘，撒上少许香菜装饰即可。"},{"id":"52950","n":"Szechuan Beef","a":"Chinese","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/1529443236.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SQGZqZYz7Ms","i":[["Beef","1/2 lb"],["Salt","1/2 tsp"],["Sesame Seed Oil","1 tsp"],["Pepper","1 pinch"],["Egg White","1"],["Starch","3 tbs"],["Oil","4 tbs"],["Ginger","1 tsp"],["Garlic","1 tsp"],["Onion","3/4 cup"],["Carrots","1/2 cup"],["Green Pepper","3/4 cup"],["Celery","1 cup"],["Mushrooms","1 cup"],["Cooking wine","1 tbs"],["Water","1 cup"],["Oyster Sauce","1 tbs"],["Hotsauce","1/2 tsp"],["Sugar","1 tsp"],["Soy Sauce","1 tbs"]],"s":"STEP 1 - MARINATING THE BEEF\r\nIn a bowl, add the beef, salt, sesame seed oil, white pepper, egg white, 2 Tablespoon of corn starch and 1 Tablespoon of oil.\r\nSTEP 2 - STIR FRY\r\nFirst Cook the beef by adding 2 Tablespoon of oil until the beef is golden brown.\r\nSet the beef aside\r\nIn a wok add 1 Tablespoon of oil, minced ginger, minced garlic and stir-fry for few seconds.\r\nNext add all of the vegetables and then add sherry cooking wine and 1 cup of water.\r\nTo make the sauce add oyster sauce, hot pepper sauce, and sugar.\r\nadd the cooked beef and 1 spoon of soy sauce\r\nTo thicken the sauce, whisk together 1 Tablespoon of cornstarch and 2 Tablespoon of water in a bowl and slowly add to your stir-fry until it's the right thickness.","z":"第 1 步 - 腌制牛肉\r\n在碗中加入牛肉、盐、芝麻油、白胡椒粉、蛋清、2汤匙玉米淀粉和1汤匙油。\r\n第 2 步 - 炒\r\n首先加入2汤匙油将牛肉煎至金黄色。\r\n把牛肉放在一边\r\n在锅中加入1汤匙油，加入姜末、蒜末，炒几秒钟。\r\n接下来加入所有蔬菜，然后加入雪利酒料酒和 1 杯水。\r\n制作酱汁时，加入蚝油、辣椒酱和糖。\r\n加入煮熟的牛肉和1勺酱油\r\n为了使酱汁变稠，将 1 汤匙玉米淀粉和 2 汤匙水放入碗中搅拌，然后慢慢加入炒菜中，直至达到合适的稠度。"},{"id":"52948","n":"Wontons","a":"Chinese","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/1525876468.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9h9No18ZyCI","i":[["Pork","1lb"],["Garlic Clove","3 chopped"],["Ginger","1 tsp"],["Soy Sauce","1 tbs"],["Sesame Seed Oil","1 tsp"],["Carrots","3 finely chopped"],["Celery","3 finely chopped"],["Spring Onions","6 chopped"],["Wonton Skin","1 Packet"],["Oil","Fry"],["Water","Bottle"]],"s":"Combine pork, garlic, ginger, soy sauce, sesame oil, and vegetables in a bowl.\r\nSeparate wonton skins.\r\nPlace a heaping teaspoon of filling in the center of the wonton.\r\nBrush water on 2 borders of the skin, covering 1/4 inch from the edge.\r\nFold skin over to form a triangle, sealing edges.\r\nPinch the two long outside points together.\r\nHeat oil to 450 degrees and fry 4 to 5 at a time until golden.\r\nDrain and serve with sauce.","z":"将猪肉、大蒜、生姜、酱油、芝麻油和蔬菜放入碗中。\r\n馄饨皮分开。\r\n将一茶匙馅料放在馄饨的中心。\r\n在皮肤的 2 个边缘刷水，覆盖距离边缘 1/4 英寸的地方。\r\n将皮肤折叠起来形成三角形，密封边缘。\r\n将两个长的外侧点捏在一起。\r\n将油加热至450度，一次煎4至5个，直至金黄。\r\n沥干并配上酱汁。"},{"id":"53060","n":"Burek","a":"Croatian","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/tkxquw1628771028.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YsJXZwE5pdY","i":[["Filo Pastry","1 Packet"],["Minced Beef","150g"],["Onion","150g"],["Oil","40g"],["Salt","Dash"],["Pepper","Dash"]],"s":"Fry the finely chopped onions and minced meat in oil. Add the salt and pepper. Grease a round baking tray and put a layer of pastry in it. Cover with a thin layer of filling and cover this with another layer of filo pastry which must be well coated in oil. Put another layer of filling and cover with pastry. When you have five or six layers, cover with filo pastry, bake at 200ºC/392ºF for half an hour and cut in quarters and serve.","z":"将切碎的洋葱和肉末在油中煎炸。添加盐和胡椒。在圆形烤盘上涂上油脂，然后在里面放上一层糕点。盖上一层薄薄的馅料，然后再盖上另一层费罗糕点，该糕点必须充分涂上油。再放一层馅料，盖上糕点。当你有五或六层时，盖上费罗糕点，在 200°C/392°F 下烘烤半小时，切成四等分即可食用。"},{"id":"53055","n":"Cevapi Sausages","a":"Croatian","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/vc08jn1628769553.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_MpSxSgS7f8","i":[["Minced Beef","500g"],["Minced Pork","250g"],["Onion","1"],["Garlic","4 cloves"],["Parsley","3 tblsp chopped"],["Paprika","1 tbs"],["Baking Powder","3/4 teaspoon"],["Breadcrumbs","2 tbs"],["Water","3 tbs"],["Vegetable Stock Cube","1"],["Salt","1 tsp"],["Pepper","1 tsp"]],"s":"Place the ground meat in a bowl. Chop the onion very finely and grate the garlic cloves. Add to the bowl. Add the chopped parsley, all sorts of paprika, baking soda, dried breadcrumbs, water, Vegeta, salt, and pepper.\r\nMix well with the hand mixer fitted with the dough hooks. Cover the bowl with cling film/ plastic foil and leave to rest for 1 or 2 hours in the refrigerator.\r\nTake portions of the meat mixture, about 50-55 g/ 1.7-1.9 oz/ ¼ cup portions, and form the cevapi. The rolls should be about as thick as your thumb and about 7-10 cm/ 3-4 inches long. I had 18 sausages. The recipe can be easily doubled.\r\nGrill the cevapcici on the hot grill pan or on the barbecue for about 12-14 minutes, turning them several times in between, or until brown and cooked through. I checked by cutting one in the middle and then grilling the following batches for the same period of time.\r\nServe hot as suggested above. The cevapcici can be reheated in the oven at 180 degrees Celsius/ 350 degrees Fahrenheit for about 10 minutes or until heated through. Check one, if it is not hot enough, give the sausages a few more minutes.","z":"将碎肉放入碗中。将洋葱切碎，然后将蒜瓣磨碎。添加到碗中。加入切碎的欧芹、各种辣椒粉、小苏打、干面包屑、水、蔬菜、盐和胡椒。\r\n用装有面团钩的手动搅拌机搅拌均匀。用保鲜膜/塑料箔盖住碗，然后在冰箱中放置 1 或 2 小时。\r\n取一份肉混合物，大约 50-55 克/1.7-1.9 盎司/ ¼ 杯，制成 cevapi。卷的厚度应与拇指一样厚，长约 7-10 厘米/3-4 英寸。我有18根香肠。食谱可以轻松加倍。\r\n将 cevapcici 放在热烤盘或烤架上烤约 12-14 分钟，期间将其翻转几次，或直至变成棕色并煮熟。我通过在中间切一个然后在同一时间段内烧烤以下批次来进行检查。\r\n按照上面的建议趁热食用。 Cevapcici 可以在烤箱中以 180 摄氏度/350 华氏度重新加热约 10 分钟或直至热透。检查一下，如果不够热，就再给香肠几分钟。"},{"id":"53058","n":"Croatian Bean Stew","a":"Croatian","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/tnwy8m1628770384.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mrjnQal3S1A","i":[["Cannellini Beans","2 cans"],["Vegetable Oil","3 tbs"],["Tomatoes","2 cups"],["Challots","5"],["Garlic","2 cloves"],["Parsley","Pinch"],["Chorizo","1/2 kg chopped"]],"s":"Heat the oil in a pan. Add the chopped vegetables and sauté until tender. Take a pot, empty the beans together with the vegetables into it, put the sausages inside and cook for further 20 minutes on a low heat. Or, put it in an oven and bake it at a temperature of 180ºC/350ºF for 30 minutes. This dish is even better reheated the next day.","z":"在锅中加热油。加入切碎的蔬菜，炒至变软。取一个锅，将豆子和蔬菜一起倒入锅中，放入香肠，小火再煮20分钟。或者，将其放入烤箱，以 180°C/350°F 的温度烘烤 30 分钟。这道菜第二天再加热效果更好。"},{"id":"53056","n":"Croatian lamb peka","a":"Croatian","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/pn59o51628769837.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=K0ipnz4fwJI","i":[["Potatoes","600g"],["Courgettes","1 chopped"],["Carrots","1 chopped"],["Green Pepper","1 chopped"],["Aubergine","1 small"],["Onion","1 Large Chopped"],["Lamb Shoulder","800g"],["Garlic Sauce","1 tbs"],["Tomato Puree","1 tbs"],["Olive Oil","80 ml"],["Thyme","Sprinking"],["White Wine","250ml"],["Pepper","Pinch"]],"s":"Preheat oven to 200°C fan / 220°C / 425°F / Gas mark 7\r\nIf you have not bought diced lamb, cut your lamb shoulder or leg into large chunks and place to one side.\r\nChunks of chopped lamb of a red chopping board\r\nMake oil marinade -\r\nMix 80ml of olive oil in a bowl with garlic puree, sundried tomato puree ,black pepper and salt.\r\nolive oil, gia sundried tomato puree and gia garlic puree and black pepper mixed together in a silver bowl to make Croatian peka\r\nAdd potatoes and vegetables into a large lidded casserole dish.\r\nChopped up vegetables which consist of chopped up red onion, courgette, potatoes red peppers in a cast iron pan\r\nPlace diced lamb on top of the vegetables, pour the marinade and wine over the top.\r\nChunks of lamb covered in in a sundried tomato oil sauce which is on top of chopped red onion, aubergine, courgette and potatoes in a cast iron pan\r\nAdd the rosemary, thyme and sage, trying to keep the herbs on top.\r\nSo you can easily remove the herb stalks once cooked.\r\nChunks of lamb coated in a sundried tomato oil sauce and covered with thyme, rosemary and sage which is on top of chopped red onion, aubergine, courgette and potatoes in a cast iron pan\r\nPlace lid on the casserole dish and cook for 1hr 30 minute\r\nIf you do not have a lid cover very well with kitchen foil\r\nCast iron dish with lid on in the oven\r\nTake the lid off, remove any thick herb stems. Stir in 2 tbsp of olive oil.\r\nCook for a further 20-30 mins.\r\nCooked Croatian Lamb Peka in a cast iron pan in the oven\r\nServe with fresh homemade bread to dip into the juices.","z":"将烤箱预热至 200°C 风扇 / 220°C / 425°F / 气体标记 7\r\n如果您没有购买羊肉丁，请将羊肩或羊腿切成大块并放在一侧。\r\n红色砧板上切碎的羊肉块\r\n做油腌料——\r\n将 80 毫升橄榄油与大蒜泥、晒干的番茄泥、黑胡椒和盐混合在一个碗中。\r\n橄榄油、gia 晒干番茄泥、gia 大蒜泥和黑胡椒在银碗中混合在一起，制成克罗地亚佩卡\r\n将土豆和蔬菜放入一个带盖的大砂锅中。\r\n切碎的蔬菜，包括切碎的红洋葱、西葫芦、土豆、红辣椒，放入铸铁锅中\r\n将切好的羊肉放在蔬菜上，将腌料和酒倒在上面。\r\n羊肉块裹上晒干的番茄油酱，放在铸铁锅中切碎的红洋葱、茄子、西葫芦和土豆上\r\n加入迷迭香、百里香和鼠尾草，尽量让香草留在上面。\r\n因此，煮熟后您可以轻松去除药草茎。\r\n羊肉块涂上晒干的番茄油酱，上面覆盖百里香、迷迭香和鼠尾草，放在铸铁锅中切碎的红洋葱、茄子、西葫芦和土豆上\r\n盖上砂锅盖，煮 1 小时 30 分钟\r\n如果您没有盖子，请用厨房箔纸很好地盖住\r\n带盖的铸铁盘放入烤箱中\r\n取下盖子，除去粗大的药草茎。加入2汤匙橄榄油搅拌。\r\n再煮20-30分钟。\r\n在烤箱的铸铁锅中煮熟的克罗地亚羊肉佩卡\r\n与新鲜的自制面包一起食用，沾上果汁。"},{"id":"53061","n":"Fresh sardines","a":"Croatian","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/nv5lf31628771380.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DDaZoXP1Mdc","i":[["Sardines","500g"],["Vegetable Oil","Dash"],["Flour","To Glaze"],["Salt","Dash"]],"s":"Wash the fish under the cold tap. Roll in the flour and deep fry in oil until crispy. Lay on kitchen towel to get rid of the excess oil and serve hot or cold with a slice of lemon.","z":"在冷水龙头下清洗鱼。滚入面粉，放入油中炸至酥脆。铺在厨房毛巾上，除去多余的油，然后与一片柠檬一起热食或冷食。"},{"id":"53059","n":"Mushroom soup with buckwheat","a":"Croatian","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/1ngcbf1628770793.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M1ok7mG9-Qc","i":[["Mushrooms","150g"],["Buckwheat","50g"],["Vegetable Oil","4 tbs"],["Onion","40g"],["Garlic","2 cloves"],["Bay Leaf","1"],["Vegetable Stock Cube","1tbsp"],["Sour Cream","50 ml"],["White Wine Vinegar","Dash"],["Parsley","Top"]],"s":"Chop the onion and garlic, slice the mushrooms and wash the buckwheat. Heat the oil and lightly sauté the onion. Add the mushrooms and the garlic and continue to sauté. Add the salt, vegetable seasoning, buckwheat and the bay leaf and cover with water. Simmer gently and just before it is completely cooked, add pepper, sour cream mixed with flour, the chopped parsley and vinegar to taste.","z":"将洋葱和大蒜切碎，蘑菇切片，荞麦洗净。加热油并轻轻炒洋葱。加入蘑菇和大蒜，继续炒​​。加入盐、蔬菜调味料、荞麦和月桂叶，盖上水。文火慢炖，在完全煮熟之前，加入胡椒粉、酸奶油和面粉、切碎的欧芹和醋调味。"},{"id":"53057","n":"Traditional Croatian Goulash","a":"Croatian","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/n1hcou1628770088.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ipEz5u2T7KM","i":[["Beef","500g"],["Onions","2 chopped"],["Carrots","2 chopped"],["Garlic","2 cloves"],["Bay Leaf","2"],["Red Wine","200ml"],["Water","2 Litres"],["Mustard","3 tbs"],["Salt","1tbsp"],["Pepper","1/2 tsp"],["Paprika","1/2 tsp"],["Vegetable Oil","2 tbs"]],"s":"Clean the meat from the veins if there are some and cut it into smaller pieces, 3 × 3 cm. Marinate the meat in the mustard and spices and let it sit in the refrigerator for one hour\r\nHeat one tablespoon of pork fat or vegetable oil in a pot and fry the meat on all sides until it gets browned. Once the meat is cooked, transfer it to a plate and add another tablespoon of fat to the pot\r\nCut the onions very fine, peel the carrots and shred it using a grater. Cook the onions and carrots over low heat for 15 minutes. You can salt the vegetables a little to make them soften faster\r\nOnce the vegetables have browned and become slightly mushy, add the meat and bay leaves and garlic. Pour over with wine and simmer for 10-15 minutes to allow the alcohol to evaporate. Now is the right time to add 2/3 the amount of liquid\r\nCover the pot and cook over low heat for an hour, stirring occasionally. After the first hour, pour over the rest of the water or stock and cook for another 30-45 minutes\r\nAllow the stew to cool slightly and serve it with a sprinkle of chopped parsley and few slices of fresh hot pepper if you like to spice it up a bit\r\nSlice ​​some fresh bread, season the salad and simply enjoying these wonderful flavors","z":"如果有的话，将肉从静脉中清理干净，切成小块，3×3厘米。将肉用芥末和香料腌制，然后放入冰箱冷藏一小时\r\n在锅中加热一汤匙猪油或植物油，将肉各面煎至焦黄。肉煮熟后，将其转移到盘子中，然后在锅中加入另一汤匙脂肪\r\n将洋葱切得很细，胡萝卜去皮，用刨丝器切碎。用小火煮洋葱和胡萝卜 15 分钟。你可以在蔬菜上加一点盐，让它们软得更快\r\n一旦蔬菜变成褐色并变得稍微糊状，加入肉、月桂叶和大蒜。倒入酒，小火煮 10-15 分钟，让酒精蒸发。现在是添加 2/3 液体量的最佳时机\r\n盖上锅盖，用小火煮一个小时，偶尔搅拌一下。第一小时后，倒入剩余的水或高汤，再煮 30-45 分钟\r\n让炖菜稍微冷却，如果你想调味的话，撒上切碎的欧芹和几片新鲜的辣椒\r\n切片一些新鲜面包，给沙拉调味，享受这些美妙的味道"},{"id":"53062","n":"Walnut Roll Gužvara","a":"Croatian","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/u9l7k81628771647.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Q_akngSJVrQ","i":[["Flour","450g"],["Caster Sugar","55g"],["Yeast","2 parts"],["Salt","1/2 tsp"],["Milk","6 oz"],["Eggs","2 Beaten"],["Butter","30g"],["Walnuts","140g"],["Butter","85g"],["Brown Sugar","85g"],["Cinnamon","1 tsp"],["Milk","To Glaze"],["Icing Sugar","To Glaze"]],"s":"Mix all the ingredients for the dough together and knead well. Cover the dough and put to rise until doubled in size which should take about 2 hours. Knock back the dough and knead lightly.\r\n\r\nDivide the dough into two equal pieces; roll each piece into an oblong about 12 inches by 8 inches. Mix the filling ingredients together and divide between the dough, spreading over each piece. Roll up the oblongs as tightly as possible to give two 12 inch sausages. Place these side by side, touching each other, on a greased baking sheet. Cover and leave to rise for about 40 minutes. Heat oven to 200ºC (425ºF). Bake for 30-35 minutes until well risen and golden brown. Bread should sound hollow when the base is tapped.\r\n\r\nRemove from oven and brush the hot bread top with milk. Sift with a generous covering of icing sugar.","z":"将面团的所有成分混合在一起并揉匀。盖上面团，发酵至两倍大，大约需要2小时。将面团敲回并轻轻揉捏。\r\n\r\n将面团分成均等的两块；将每块卷成约 12 英寸 x 8 英寸的椭圆形。将馅料混合在一起，然后将面团分开，铺在每一块面团上。将长方形尽可能紧紧地卷起来，得到两根 12 英寸的香肠。将它们并排放置在涂有油脂的烤盘上，彼此接触。盖上盖子，发酵约 40 分钟。将烤箱加热至 200°C (425°F)。烘烤 30-35 分钟，直至充分发酵并呈金黄色。轻敲面包底部时，面包听起来应该是空心的。\r\n\r\n从烤箱中取出，在热面包顶部刷上牛奶。筛入大量糖粉。"},{"id":"53031","n":"Egyptian Fatteh","a":"Egyptian","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/rlwcc51598734603.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WLuOHkDE4A4","i":[["Beef","1lb"],["Onion","1"],["Chicken Stock Cube","1"],["Tomatoes","2"],["Garlic Clove","4"],["Tomato Puree","1 tbs"],["Rice","2 cups"],["Noodles","1/4 cup"],["Butter","1/4 cup"],["Olive Oil","2 cups"],["Pita Bread","1"],["Cumin","1 tbs"],["White Wine Vinegar","3 tbs"],["Salt","To taste"],["Pepper","To taste"]],"s":"To prepare bread for bottom of dish: Take pita bread and rip into bite size pieces. In a frying pan, add about a 1/4 stick of butter, add bread pieces and fry until golden brown and crisp. Put these pieces in a glass baking dish, preferably a square sized dish. Set aside.\r\nThen add to same pan, a little more butter, salt, approximately 2 cloves of crushed fresh garlic, and a teaspoon or so of cumin stir around a bit until you can smell aroma, then add fried bread pieces to this mixture, stir to coat bread and put back into glass baking dish. Set aside.\r\nTo prepare meat: put some butter in a pot, stir fry meat until brown, add 1 onion quartered, salt & pepper, 1 cube of chicken bouillon and water to cover meat. Bring to a boil, turn down to simmer, cover and cook until tender, approximately 2 hours. After meat has cooled, take out chunks of meat and put in a bowl, set aside. Reserve soup from the meat separately.\r\nTo prepare the rice: Put some butter into a pot, add shareya (fideo noodles) like a handful or so, keep stirring until golden brown, not too dark, but very golden. Then add two cups of rice, stir a little bit until some of the rice turns an opaque white. Add 2-1/4 cups of water and salt to taste. Bring to a boil, cover and turn down to simmer, cook until tender. Test the rice tenderness after about 35 minutes.\r\nNow take some of the soup from meat and add to the top of the bread pieces in baking dish to saturate.Add cooked rice on top of bread pieces. Slowly spoon remainder of soup onto rice, looking at glass dish sides to see level of soup, should reach just to top of rice, don’t worry, this doesn’t have to be exact. Now you’re ready to make the sauce and fry the meat to put on top.\r\nTo prepare red sauce: In a pan, add a little oil or butter, crushed tomato, a half teaspoon of tomato paste, salt & pepper, 2 cloves of fresh crushed garlic and cumin. Add also approximately 3 tablespoons of vinegar, stir this until you smell aroma and it is a bit smooth. It should be a bit thick, not watery, but if too thick you can add a bit of water. Spread with a wooden spoon atop the rice to cover.\r\nTo fry meat: In a pan add a bit of butter or oil, the meat, just a touch of tomato paste, about a tablespoon of fresh crushed garlic, salt & pepper, a teaspoon of cumin. Cook until meat is golden fried.\r\nSpoon this atop the rice and serve. Enjoy!","z":"准备盘底面包：取皮塔饼面包，撕成一口大小的碎片。在煎锅中加入约 1/4 块黄油，加入面包片，煎至金黄色酥脆。将这些碎片放入玻璃烤盘中，最好是方形大小的烤盘。放在一边。\r\n然后在同一个平底锅中加入少许黄油、盐、大约2瓣压碎的新鲜大蒜和一茶匙左右的小茴香，搅拌一下，直到闻到香味，然后将炸面包片加入到混合物中，搅拌均匀，使面包裹上一层，然后放回玻璃烤盘中。放在一边。\r\n准备肉：在锅中放入一些黄油，将肉炒至棕色，加入 1 个切成四等分的洋葱、盐和胡椒、1 块鸡汤和水，盖过肉。煮沸，转小火，盖上锅盖，煮至变软，大约需要 2 小时。肉冷却后，取出肉块，放入碗中，备用。汤和肉分开备用。\r\n准备米饭：将一些黄油放入锅中，加入一把左右的shareya（fideo面条），不断搅拌直至呈金黄色，不是太深，而是非常金黄。然后加入两杯米，稍微搅拌，直到一些米变成不透明的白色。添加 2-1/4 杯水和盐调味。大火烧开，盖上锅盖，转小火，煮至软。约35分钟后测试米饭的嫩度。\r\n现在从肉中取出一些汤，将其添加到烤盘中的面包片的顶部，使其饱和。在面包片的顶部添加煮熟的米饭。慢慢地将剩余的汤舀到米饭上，看着玻璃盘的侧面看汤的高度，应该刚好到达米饭的顶部，不用担心，这不必是精确的。现在你可以准备酱汁了，然后把肉煎一下放在上面。\r\n准备红酱：在平底锅中加入少许油或黄油、碎番茄、半茶匙番茄酱、盐和胡椒、2 瓣新鲜碎大蒜和小茴香。加入大约3汤匙醋，搅拌直至闻到香味并且有点光滑。应该有点稠，不是水，但如果太稠可以加一点水。用木勺铺在米饭上盖住。\r\n煎肉：在平底锅中加入一点黄油或油、肉、一点番茄酱、大约一汤匙新鲜碎大蒜、盐和胡椒、一茶匙小茴香。煮至肉炸至金黄。\r\n将其舀到米饭上即可食用。享受！"},{"id":"53030","n":"Feteer Meshaltet","a":"Egyptian","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/9f4z6v1598734293.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-mW1unsVhFU","i":[["Flour","4 cups"],["Water","1 1/2 cups"],["Salt","1/4 tsp"],["Unsalted Butter","1 cup"],["Olive Oil","1/4 cup"]],"s":"Mix the flour and salt then pour one cup of water and start kneading.\r\nIf you feel the dough is still not coming together or too dry, gradually add the remaining water until you get a dough that is very elastic so that when you pull it and it won’t be torn.\r\nLet the dough rest for just 10 minutes then divide the dough into 6-8 balls depending on the size you want for your feteer.\r\nWarm up the butter/ghee or oil you are using and pour into a deep bowl.\r\nImmerse the dough balls into the warm butter. Let it rest for 15 to 20 minutes.\r\nPreheat oven to 550F.\r\nStretch the first ball with your hands on a clean countertop. Stretch it as thin as you can, the goal here is to see your countertop through the dough.\r\nFold the dough over itself to form a square brushing in between folds with the butter mixture.\r\nSet aside and start making the next ball.\r\nStretch the second one thin as we have done for the first ball.\r\nPlace the previous one on the middle seam side down. Fold the outer one over brushing with more butter mixture as you fold. Set aside.\r\nKeep doing this for the third and fourth balls. Now we have one ready, place on a 10 inch baking/pie dish seam side down and brush the top with more butter.\r\nRepeat for the remaining 4 balls to make a second one. With your hands lightly press the folded feteer to spread it on the baking dish.\r\nPlace in preheated oven for 10 minutes when the feteer starts puffing turn on the broiler to brown the top.\r\nWhen it is done add little butter on top and cover so it won’t get dry.","z":"将面粉和盐混合，然后倒入一杯水并开始揉捏。\r\n如果你觉得面团还没有粘在一起或者太干，就逐渐加入剩余的水，直到面团很有弹性，这样拉的时候就不会撕裂。\r\n让面团静置 10 分钟，然后根据您想要的鞋垫尺寸将面团分成 6-8 个球。\r\n加热您正在使用的黄油/酥油或油，然后倒入一个深碗中。\r\n将面团球浸入温热的黄油中。让它休息 15 到 20 分钟。\r\n将烤箱预热至 550F。\r\n双手放在干净的台面上拉伸第一个球。把它尽可能地拉伸，目标是透过面团看到你的工作台面。\r\n将面团折叠起来，在折叠之间涂上黄油混合物，形成方形。\r\n放在一边并开始制作下一个球。\r\n像我们对第一个球所做的那样，将第二个球拉伸得较薄。\r\n将前一个放在中缝一侧朝下。将外面的一层折叠起来，在折叠时刷上更多的黄油混合物。放在一边。\r\n对第三个和第四个球继续这样做。现在我们已经准备好了一个，放在一个 10 英寸的烘焙/馅饼盘上，接缝面朝下，并在顶部刷上更多黄油。\r\n对剩下的 4 个球重复上述步骤，制作第二个球。用手轻轻按压折叠好的脚垫，将其铺在烤盘上。\r\n放入预热的烤箱中烤 10 分钟，当 Feteer 开始膨胀时，打开烤炉，使顶部变成棕色。\r\n完成后在上面加一点黄油并盖上，这样就不会变干。"},{"id":"53025","n":"Ful Medames","a":"Egyptian","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/lvn2d51598732465.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ixpCabILuxw","i":[["Broad Beans","2 cups"],["Parsley","1/3 cup"],["Olive Oil","Dash"],["Lemons","3"],["Garlic Clove","4"],["Cumin","Sprinking"]],"s":"As the cooking time varies depending on the quality and age of the beans, it is good to cook them in advance and to reheat them when you are ready to serve. Cook the drained beans in a fresh portion of unsalted water in a large saucepan with the lid on until tender, adding water to keep them covered, and salt when the beans have softened. They take 2–2 1/2 hours of gentle simmering. When the beans are soft, let the liquid reduce. It is usual to take out a ladle or two of the beans and to mash them with some of the cooking liquid, then stir this back into the beans. This is to thicken the sauce.\r\nServe the beans in soup bowls sprinkled with chopped parsley and accompanied by Arab bread.\r\nPass round the dressing ingredients for everyone to help themselves: a bottle of extra-virgin olive oil, the quartered lemons, salt and pepper, a little saucer with the crushed garlic, one with chili-pepper flakes, and one with ground cumin.\r\nThe beans are eaten gently crushed with the fork, so that they absorb the dressing.\r\nOptional Garnishes\r\nPeel hard-boiled eggs—1 per person—to cut up in the bowl with the beans.\r\nTop the beans with a chopped cucumber-and-tomato salad and thinly sliced mild onions or scallions. Otherwise, pass round a good bunch of scallions and quartered tomatoes and cucumbers cut into sticks.\r\nServe with tahina cream sauce (page 65) or salad (page 67), with pickles and sliced onions soaked in vinegar for 30 minutes.\r\nAnother way of serving ful medames is smothered in a garlicky tomato sauce (see page 464).\r\nIn Syria and Lebanon, they eat ful medames with yogurt or feta cheese, olives, and small cucumbers.\r\nVariations\r\nA traditional way of thickening the sauce is to throw a handful of red lentils (1/4 cup) into the water at the start of the cooking.\r\nIn Iraq, large brown beans are used instead of the small Egyptian ones, in a dish called badkila, which is also sold for breakfast in the street.","z":"由于烹饪时间根据豆子的质量和年龄而有所不同，因此最好提前煮熟，并在准备食用时重新加热。将沥干的豆子放在一个大平底锅中，盖上盖子，用新鲜的无盐水煮至变软，加水以盖住豆子，当豆子变软时加盐。它们需要文火慢炖 2-2 1/2 小时。当豆子变软时，让液体减少。通常会取出一勺或两勺豆子，用一些烹饪液将它们捣碎，然后将其搅拌回豆子中。这是为了让酱汁变稠。\r\n将豆子放入汤碗中，撒上切碎的欧芹，并佐以阿拉伯面包。\r\n将调味料分发给每个人，让他们自己享用：一瓶特级初榨橄榄油、切成四等份的柠檬、盐和胡椒、一小碟装有碎大蒜的碟子、一个装有辣椒片的碟子和一个带有孜然粉的碟子。\r\n吃的时候用叉子轻轻地压碎豆子，以便它们吸收调料。\r\n可选装饰\r\n将煮熟的鸡蛋剥皮（每人 1 个），与豆子一起放入碗中。\r\n在豆子上放上切碎的黄瓜和番茄沙拉和切成薄片的淡洋葱或大葱。否则，传递一大堆葱、切成四等分的西红柿和切成条的黄瓜。\r\n搭配芝麻酱奶油酱（第 65 页）或沙拉（第 67 页），搭配泡菜和在醋中浸泡 30 分钟的洋葱片。\r\n另一种提供丰盛美达梅的方法是用大蒜番茄酱闷住（见第 464 页）。\r\n在叙利亚和黎巴嫩，人们吃丰盛的麦达梅饼，搭配酸奶或羊奶酪、橄榄和小黄瓜。\r\n变化\r\n使酱汁变稠的传统方法是在烹饪开始时将一把红扁豆（1/4 杯）放入水中。\r\n在伊拉克，人们用大的棕色豆代替埃及的小豆，制作出一种名为“badkila”的菜肴，这种菜也可以在街上当早餐出售。"},{"id":"53027","n":"Koshari","a":"Egyptian","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/4er7mj1598733193.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=y0d2ZMZBW4Y","i":[["Brown Lentils","1 1/2 cups"],["Rice","1 1/2 cups"],["Coriander","1/2 tsp"],["Macaroni","2 cups"],["Chickpeas","Can"],["Onion","1 large"],["Salt","Sprinking"],["Vegetable Oil","1/2 cup"]],"s":"Cook the lentils. Bring lentils and 4 cups of water to a boil in a medium pot or saucepan over high heat. Reduce the heat to low and cook until lentils are just tender (15-17 minutes). Drain from water and season with a little salt. (Note: when the lentils are ready, they should not be fully cooked. They should be only par-cooked and still have a bite to them as they need to finish cooking with the rice).\r\nNow, for the rice. Drain the rice from its soaking water. Combine the par-cooked lentils and the rice in the saucepan over medium-high heat with 1 tbsp cooking oil, salt, pepper, and coriander. Cook for 3 minutes, stirring regularly. Add warm water to cover the rice and lentil mixture by about 1 1/2 inches (you’ll probably use about 3 cups of water here). Bring to a boil; the water should reduce a bit. Now cover and cook until all the liquid has been absorbed and both the rice and lentils are well cooked through (about 20 minutes).  Keep covered and undisturbed for 5 minutes or so.\r\nNow make the pasta. While the rice and lentils are cooking, make the pasta according to package instructions by adding the elbow pasta to boiling water with a dash of salt and a little oil. Cook until the pasta is al dente. Drain.\r\nCover the chickpeas and warm in the microwave briefly before serving.\r\n\r\nMake the crispy onion topping. \r\n\r\nSprinkle the onion rings with salt, then toss them in the flour to coat. Shake off excess flour.\r\nIn a large skillet, heat the cooking oil over medium-high heat, cook the onion rings, stirring often, until they turn a nice caramelized brown. Onions must be crispy, but not burned (15-20 minutes).","z":"煮扁豆。将扁豆和 4 杯水放入中型锅或平底锅中，用高温煮沸。把火调小，煮至扁豆变软（15-17 分钟）。沥干水并加少许盐调味。 （注意：当扁豆准备好时，它们不应该完全煮熟。它们应该只是半熟，并且仍然有一口咬下去的感觉，因为它们需要和米饭一起煮完）。\r\n现在，吃米饭。将米从浸泡水中沥干。将半熟的扁豆和米饭放入平底锅中，用中火加热，加入 1 汤匙食用油、盐、胡椒粉和香菜。煮 3 分钟，定期搅拌。添加温水以覆盖大米和扁豆混合物约 1 1/2 英寸（这里您可能会使用约 3 杯水）。煮沸；水应该减少一点。现在盖上锅盖，煮至所有液体都被吸收，并且米饭和扁豆都煮熟（约 20 分钟）。  保持覆盖并不受干扰 5 分钟左右。\r\n现在做意大利面。煮米饭和扁豆时，根据包装说明制作意大利面，将肘形意大利面加入加有少许盐和少许油的沸水中。煮至意大利面有嚼劲。流走。\r\n食用前，盖上鹰嘴豆并在微波炉中短暂加热。\r\n\r\n制作脆洋葱配料。 \r\n\r\n在洋葱圈上撒上盐，然后将它们放入面粉中裹上。抖掉多余的面粉。\r\n在一个大煎锅中，用中火加热食用油，煮洋葱圈，经常搅拌，直到它们变成漂亮的焦糖棕色。洋葱必须酥脆，但不能烧焦（15-20 分钟）。"},{"id":"53029","n":"Mulukhiyah","a":"Egyptian","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/x372ug1598733932.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vWc5JzgAkIQ","i":[["Mulukhiyah","800g"],["Onion","1 chopped"],["Beef","300g"],["Salt","1 tsp"],["Water","1 Litre"],["Garlic Clove","1"],["Olive Oil","1/2 cup"]],"s":"Saute the onions in the 3-4 tablespoons olive oil\r\nAdd the beef cubes or the chicken cutlets, sear for 3-4 min on each side\r\nAdd 1 liter of water or just enough to cover the meat\r\nCook over medium heat until the meat is done (I usually do this in the pressure cooker and press them for 5 min)\r\n\r\nAdd the frozen mulukhyia and stir until it thaws completely and then comes to a boil\r\n\r\nIn another pan add the 1/4 to 1/2 cup of olive oil and the cloves of garlic and cook over medium low heat until you can smell the garlic (don’t brown it, it will become bitter)\r\n\r\nAdd the oil and garlic to the mulukhyia and lower the heat and simmer for 5-10 minutes\r\nAdd salt to taste\r\n\r\nServe with a generous amount of lemon juice.\r\n\r\nYou can serve it with some short grain rice or some pita bread","z":"用3-4汤匙橄榄油炒洋葱\r\n加入牛肉块或鸡排，每面煎 3-4 分钟\r\n添加 1 升水或刚好覆盖肉\r\n中火煮至肉熟（我通常用高压锅煮，压5分钟）\r\n\r\n加入冷冻的 mulukhyia 并搅拌直至完全解冻，然后煮沸\r\n\r\n在另一个锅中加入 1/4 至 1/2 杯橄榄油和蒜瓣，用中低火煮，直到闻到大蒜味（不要变成棕色，会变苦）\r\n\r\n将油和大蒜加入 mulukhyia 中，小火煮 5-10 分钟\r\n加盐调味\r\n\r\n与大量柠檬汁一起食用。\r\n\r\n你可以搭配一些短粒米饭或一些皮塔饼面包"},{"id":"52963","n":"Shakshuka","a":"Egyptian","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/g373701551450225.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C-3_jYrfdBU","i":[["Olive Oil","1 tbs"],["Red Onions","2 chopped"],["Red Chilli","1 finely chopped"],["Garlic","1 clove"],["Coriander","Chopped"],["Cherry Tomatoes","800g"],["Caster Sugar","1 tbs"],["Eggs","4"],["Feta","Spinkling"]],"s":"Heat the oil in a frying pan that has a lid, then soften the onions, chilli, garlic and coriander stalks for 5 mins until soft. Stir in the tomatoes and sugar, then bubble for 8-10 mins until thick. Can be frozen for 1 month.\r\n\r\nUsing the back of a large spoon, make 4 dips in the sauce, then crack an egg into each one. Put a lid on the pan, then cook over a low heat for 6-8 mins, until the eggs are done to your liking. Scatter with the coriander leaves and serve with crusty bread.","z":"在有盖的煎锅中加热油，然后将洋葱、辣椒、大蒜和香菜茎软化 5 分钟直至变软。加入番茄和糖，搅拌 8-10 分钟直至浓稠。可冷冻1个月。\r\n\r\n用大勺子的背面蘸上酱汁 4 次，然后在每一个中打入一个鸡蛋。盖上锅盖，小火煮6-8分钟，直到鸡蛋熟透为止。撒上香菜叶，搭配硬皮面包。"},{"id":"53028","n":"Shawarma","a":"Egyptian","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/kcv6hj1598733479.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3lxUIeKDgic","i":[["Chicken Thighs","1 kg"],["Coriander","1 tbs"],["Cumin","1 tbs"],["Cardamom","1 tbs"],["Cayenne Pepper","1 tsp"],["Paprika","2 tsp"],["Lemon Juice","2 tbs"],["Olive Oil","3 tbs"],["Greek Yogurt","1 cup"],["Garlic Clove","1"],["Cumin","1 tsp"],["Lemon Juice","Splash"],["Lettuce","Sliced"],["Tomato","Sliced"],["Pita Bread","6"]],"s":"Combine the marinade ingredients in a large ziplock bag (or bowl).\r\nAdd the chicken and use your hands to make sure each piece is coated. If using a ziplock bag, I find it convenient to close the bag then massage the bag to disperse the rub all over each chicken piece.\r\nMarinate overnight or up to 24 hours.\r\nCombine the Yoghurt Sauce ingredients in a bowl and mix. Cover and put in the fridge until required (it will last for 3 days in the fridge).\r\nHeat grill/BBQ (or large heavy based pan on stove) on medium high. You should not need to oil it because the marinade has oil in it and also thigh fillets have fat. But if you are worried then oil your hotplate/grill. (See notes for baking)\r\nPlace chicken on the grill and cook the first side for 4 to 5 minutes until nicely charred, then turn and cook the other side for 3 to 4 minutes (the 2nd side takes less time).\r\nRemove chicken from the grill and cover loosely with foil. Set aside to rest for 5 minutes.\r\nTO SERVE\r\nSlice chicken and pile onto platter alongside flatbreads, Salad and the Yoghurt Sauce.\r\nTo make a wrap, get a piece of flatbread and smear with Yoghurt Sauce. Top with a bit of lettuce and tomato and Chicken Shawarma. Roll up and enjoy!","z":"将腌料放入一个大的自封袋（或碗）中。\r\n添加鸡肉并用手确保每一块都涂有涂层。如果使用自封袋，我发现关闭袋子然后按摩袋子以将摩擦分散到每个鸡肉块上很方便。\r\n腌制过夜或长达 24 小时。\r\n将酸奶酱成分放入碗中并混合。盖上盖子并放入冰箱直至需要为止（在冰箱中可保存 3 天）。\r\n用中高火加热烤架/烧烤（或炉子上的大型重型平底锅）。你不需要给它加油，因为腌料里有油，大腿鱼片也有脂肪。但如果您担心，请给您的电炉/烤架上油。 （烘焙注意事项见）\r\n将鸡肉放在烤架上，将第一面煮 4 至 5 分钟，直至完全烧焦，然后翻转并煮另一面 3 至 4 分钟（第二面所需时间较短）。\r\n将鸡肉从烤架上取出，并用箔纸松松地覆盖。搁置休息5分钟。\r\n服务\r\n将鸡肉切片，与小面包、沙拉和酸奶酱一起堆放在盘子上。\r\n要制作包裹，请取一块大面包并涂上酸奶酱。上面放一点生菜、番茄和鸡肉沙瓦玛。卷起来即可享用！"},{"id":"53026","n":"Tamiya","a":"Egyptian","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/n3xxd91598732796.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mulqW-J3Yy4","i":[["Broad Beans","3 cups"],["Spring Onions","6"],["Garlic Clove","4"],["Parsley","1/4 cup"],["Cumin","2 tsp"],["Baking Powder","1 tsp"],["Cayenne Pepper","1/2 tsp"],["Flour","Spinkling"],["Vegetable Oil","As required"]],"s":"oak the beans in water to cover overnight.Drain. If skinless beans are unavailable, rub to loosen the skins, then discard the skins. Pat the beans dry with a towel.\r\nGrind the beans in a food mill or meat grinder.If neither appliance is available, process them in a food processor but only until the beans form a paste. (If blended too smoothly, the batter tends to fall apart during cooking.) Add the scallions, garlic, cilantro, cumin, baking powder, cayenne, salt, pepper, and coriander, if using.  Refrigerate for at least 30 minutes.\r\nShape the bean mixture into 1-inch balls.Flatten slightly and coat with flour.\r\nHeat at least 1½-inches of oil over medium heat to 365 degrees.\r\nFry the patties in batches, turning once, until golden brown on all sides, about 5 minutes.Remove with a wire mesh skimmer or slotted spoon. Serve as part of a meze or in pita bread with tomato-cucumber salad and tahina sauce.","z":"将豆子放入水中浸泡过夜。沥干。如果没有去皮的豆子，请揉搓以松开皮，然后丢弃皮。用毛巾将豆子拍干。\r\n在食品磨机或绞肉机中研磨豆子。如果这两种设备都不可用，请在食品加工机中加工它们，但只能直到豆子形成糊状。 （如果搅拌得太顺利，面糊在烹饪过程中往往会散开。）加入葱、大蒜、香菜、小茴香、泡打粉、辣椒、盐、胡椒和香菜（如果使用）。  冷藏至少 30 分钟。\r\n将豆子混合物揉成 1 英寸大小的球。稍微压扁并涂上面粉。\r\n用中火将至少 1.5 英寸的油加热至 365 度。\r\n将肉饼分批煎炸，翻面一次，直至各面呈金黄色，约 5 分钟。用钢丝网撇油器或漏勺捞出。作为开胃菜的一部分或皮塔面包中搭配番茄黄瓜沙拉和芝麻酱。"},{"id":"53071","n":"Beef Asado","a":"Filipino","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/pkopc31683207947.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lNlK8DVhXXA","i":[["Beef","1.5kg"],["Beef Stock Concentrate","1"],["Tomato Puree","8 ounces"],["Water","3 cups"],["Soy Sauce","6 tablespoons"],["White Wine Vinegar","1 tbs"],["Pepper","2 tbs"],["Bay Leaf","4"],["Lemon","1/2"],["Tomato Sauce","2 tbs"],["Butter","3 tbs"],["Olive Oil","1/2 cup"],["Onion","1 chopped"],["Garlic","4 cloves"]],"s":"0.\tCombine beef, crushed peppercorn, soy sauce, vinegar, dried bay leaves, lemon, and tomato sauce. Mix well. Marinate beef for at least 30 minutes.\r\n1.\tPut the marinated beef in a cooking pot along with remaining marinade. Add water. Let boil.\r\n2.\tAdd Knorr Beef Cube. Stir. Cover the pot and cook for 40 minutes in low heat.\r\n3.\tTurn the beef over. Add tomato paste. Continue cooking until beef tenderizes. Set aside.\r\n4.\tHeat oil in a pan. Fry the potato until it browns. Turn over and continue frying the opposite side. Remove from the pan and place on a clean plate. Do the same with the carrots.\r\n5.\tSave 3 tablespoons of cooking oil from the pan where the potato was fried. Saute onion and garlic until onion softens.\r\n6.\tPour-in the sauce from the beef stew. Let boil. Add the beef. Cook for 2 minutes.\r\n7.\tAdd butter and let it melt. Continue cooking until the sauce reduces to half.","z":"0. 将牛肉、碎花椒、酱油、醋、干月桂叶、柠檬和番茄酱混合。搅拌均匀。将牛肉腌至少30分钟。\r\n1.将腌制好的牛肉和剩余的腌料一起放入锅中。加水。煮沸。\r\n2. 添加家乐牛肉块。搅拌。盖上锅盖，小火煮40分钟。\r\n3.把牛肉翻过来。添加番茄酱。继续煮直到牛肉变软。放在一边。\r\n4.在锅中加热油。将土豆煎至焦黄。翻过来继续煎另一面。从锅中取出并放在干净的盘子上。对胡萝卜也做同样的事情。\r\n5. 煎土豆的锅里留3汤匙食用油。炒洋葱和大蒜，直至洋葱变软。\r\n6.倒入炖牛肉的酱汁。煮沸。添加牛肉。煮2分钟。\r\n7.加入黄油并使其融化。继续煮，直到酱汁减半。"},{"id":"53070","n":"Beef Caldereta","a":"Filipino","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/41cxjh1683207682.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yI7hTz0ft5k","i":[["Beef","2kg cut cubes"],["Beef Stock","1"],["Soy Sauce","1 tbs"],["Water","2 cups"],["Green Pepper","1 sliced"],["Red Pepper","1 sliced"],["Potatoes","1 sliced"],["Carrots","1 sliced"],["Tomato Puree","8 ounces"],["Peanut Butter","3  tablespoons"],["Chilli Powder","5"],["Onion","1 chopped"],["Garlic","5 cloves"],["Olive Oil","3 tbs"]],"s":"0.\tHeat oil in a cooking pot. Saute onion and garlic until onion softens\r\n1.\tAdd beef. Saute until the outer part turns light brown.\r\n2.\tAdd soy sauce. Pour tomato sauce and water. Let boil.\r\n3.\tAdd Knorr Beef Cube. Cover the pressure cooker. Cook for 30 minutes.\r\n4.\tPan-fry carrot and potato until it browns. Set aside.\r\n5.\tAdd chili pepper, liver spread and peanut butter. Stir.\r\n6.\tAdd bell peppers, fried potato and carrot. Cover the pot. Continue cooking for 5 to 7 minutes.\r\n7.\tSeason with salt and ground black pepper. Serve.\r\n","z":"0. 在锅中加热油。将洋葱和大蒜炒至洋葱变软\r\n1.加入牛肉。炒至外部变成浅棕色。\r\n2.加入酱油。倒入番茄酱和水。煮沸。\r\n3. 加入家乐牛肉块。盖上高压锅盖。煮30分钟。\r\n4. 将胡萝卜和土豆煎至焦黄。放在一边。\r\n5. 加入辣椒、肝酱和花生酱。搅拌。\r\n6.加入青椒、炸土豆和胡萝卜。盖上锅盖。继续煮5到7分钟。\r\n7. 用盐和黑胡椒粉调味。服务。"},{"id":"53068","n":"Beef Mechado","a":"Filipino","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/cgl60b1683206581.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jxW3Lj8VjyE","i":[["Garlic","3 cloves"],["Onion","1 sliced"],["Beef","2 Lbs"],["Tomato Puree","8 ounces"],["Water","1 cup"],["Olive Oil","3 tbs"],["Lemon","1 Slice"],["Potatoes","1 large"],["Soy Sauce","1/4 cup"],["Black Pepper","1/2 tsp"],["Bay Leaves","2"],["Salt","To taste"]],"s":"0.\tMake the beef tenderloin marinade by combining soy sauce, vinegar, ginger, garlic, sesame oil, olive oil, sugar, salt, and ground black pepper in a large bowl. Mix well.\r\n1.\tAdd the cubed beef tenderloin to the bowl with the beef tenderloin marinade. Gently toss to coat the beef. Let it stay for 1 hour.\r\n2.\tUsing a metal or bamboo skewer, assemble the beef kebob by skewering the vegetables and marinated beef tenderloin.\r\n3.\tHeat-up the grill and start grilling the beef kebobs for 3 minutes per side. This will give you a medium beef that is juicy and tender on the inside. Add more time if you want your beef well done, but it will be less tender.\r\n4.\tTransfer to a serving plate. Serve with Saffron rice.\r\n5.\tShare and enjoy!\r\n","z":"0. 将酱油、醋、生姜、大蒜、芝麻油、橄榄油、糖、盐和黑胡椒粉放入一个大碗中，制成牛里脊肉腌料。搅拌均匀。\r\n1. 将切块的牛里脊肉放入装有牛里脊肉腌料的碗中。轻轻地搅拌，让牛肉裹上一层。让它停留1小时。\r\n2. 使用金属或竹签，将蔬菜和腌制的牛里脊肉串起来，组成牛肉串。\r\n3. 加热烤架，开始烤牛肉串，每面烤 3 分钟。这将为您提供中等程度的牛肉，内部多汁且嫩滑。如果你想让牛肉熟透，就多加点时间，但会不太嫩。\r\n4. 转移到盘子中。与藏红花米饭一起食用。\r\n5.分享并享受！"},{"id":"53069","n":"Bistek","a":"Filipino","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/4pqimk1683207418.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xOQON5_S7as","i":[["Beef","1 lb"],["Soy Sauce","5 tablespoons"],["Lemon","1"],["Garlic","3 cloves"],["Onion","3 parts"],["Olive Oil","4 tbs"],["Water","1 cup"],["Salt","1 pinch"]],"s":"0.\tMarinate beef in soy sauce, lemon (or calamansi), and ground black pepper for at least 1 hour. Note: marinate overnight for best result\r\n1.\tHeat the cooking oil in a pan then pan-fry half of the onions until the texture becomes soft. Set aside\r\n2.\tDrain the marinade from the beef. Set it aside. Pan-fry the beef on the same pan where the onions were fried for 1 minute per side. Remove from the pan. Set aside\r\n3.\tAdd more oil if needed. Saute garlic and remaining raw onions until onion softens.\r\n4.\tPour the remaining marinade and water. Bring to a boil.\r\n5.\tAdd beef. Cover the pan and simmer until the meat is tender. Note: Add water as needed.\r\n6.\tSeason with ground black pepper and salt as needed. Top with pan-fried onions.\r\n7.\tTransfer to a serving plate. Serve hot. Share and Enjoy!\r\n","z":"0. 将牛肉用酱油、柠檬（或柠檬）和黑胡椒粉腌制至少 1 小时。注意：腌制过夜以获得最佳效果\r\n1. 在锅中加热食用油，然后将一半洋葱煎至质地变软。放在一边\r\n2.将牛肉中的腌料沥干。把它放在一边。将牛肉和洋葱放在同一个平底锅上煎，每面煎 1 分钟。从锅中取出。放在一边\r\n3. 如果需要，添加更多油。炒大蒜和剩余的生洋葱，直至洋葱变软。\r\n4.倒入剩余的腌料和水。煮沸。\r\n5.加入牛肉。盖上锅盖，小火煮至肉变软。注意：根据需要加水。\r\n6. 根据需要加入黑胡椒粉和盐调味。上面放上煎洋葱。\r\n7. 转移到盘子中。趁热食用。分享并享受！"},{"id":"53072","n":"Crispy Eggplant","a":"Filipino","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/c7lzrl1683208757.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4mINk5d2hto","i":[["Egg Plants","1 large"],["Breadcrumbs","1 cup"],["Sesame Seed","50g"],["Eggs","2"],["Salt","To taste"],["Pepper","To taste"],["Vegetable Oil","For frying"]],"s":"Slice eggplant into 1 cm (0.4-inch) slices. Place them in a bowl and sprinkle them with salt. allow them to sit for 30 minutes to render some of their liquid and bitterness.\r\n2. After 30 minutes wash eggplant slices from salt and pat dry with a kitchen towel.\r\n3. In a large bowl/plate place breadcrumbs and sesame seeds. In another bowl beat 2 eggs with pinch salt and pepper.\r\n4. Heal oil in a large skillet over high heat.\r\n5. Dip eggplant slices in egg, then in crumbs, and place in hot oil. Fry 2 to 3 minutes on each side, or until golden brown. Drain on a paper towel. \r\n","z":"将茄子切成 1 厘米（0.4 英寸）的片。将它们放入碗中，撒上盐。让它们静置 30 分钟，以去除一些液体和苦味。\r\n2. 30分钟后，将茄子片洗净，用厨房纸巾擦干。\r\n3. 在一个大碗/盘中放入面包屑和芝麻。在另一个碗中打入 2 个鸡蛋，加入少许盐和胡椒粉。\r\n4. 在大煎锅中用高温加热油。\r\n5.茄子片沾上鸡蛋液，再沾上面包屑，放入热油中。每面煎 2 至 3 分钟，或直至呈金黄色。用纸巾沥干水分。"},{"id":"53073","n":"Eggplant Adobo","a":"Filipino","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/y7h0lq1683208991.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pKXACYjwMns","i":[["Egg Plants","1 lb"],["Sugar","2 tbs"],["Salt","1 tsp"],["Pepper","1 tsp"],["Garlic","1 whole"],["Olive Oil","3 tbs"],["Ground Pork","4 oz"],["Rice Vinegar","3 tbs"],["Soy Sauce","2 tbs"],["Bay Leaf","2"]],"s":"1.\tSlice 1 lb. small Japanese or Italian eggplant (about 3) into quarters lengthwise, then cut crosswise into 2\"-wide pieces. Place in a medium bowl. Add 1 Tbsp. sugar, 1 tsp. Diamond Crystal or ½ tsp. Morton kosher salt, and ½ tsp. freshly ground black pepper. Toss to evenly coat eggplant and let sit at room temperature at least 20 minutes and up to 2 hours.\r\n2.\tPeel and thinly slice 8 garlic cloves. Add 3 Tbsp. vegetable oil and half of garlic to a medium Dutch oven or other heavy pot. Cook over medium-high heat, stirring constantly with a wooden spoon, until light golden and crisp, about 5 minutes. Using a slotted spoon, transfer garlic chips to a plate; season lightly with salt.\r\n3. Place 4 oz. ground pork in same pot and break up into small pieces with wooden spoon. Season with ¼ tsp. Diamond Crystal or Morton kosher salt and cook, undisturbed, until deeply browned underneath, about 5 minutes. Using a slotted spoon, transfer to another plate, leaving fat behind in the pot.\r\n4. Place eggplant on a clean kitchen towel and blot away any moisture the salt has drawn out.\r\n5. Working in batches and adding more oil if needed, cook eggplant in the same pot until lightly browned, about 3 minutes per side. Transfer to a plate with pork.\r\n6. Pour 1½ cups of water into the pot and scrape up browned bits from the bottom with a wooden spoon. Add remaining garlic, 3 Tbsp. coconut vinegar or unseasoned rice vinegar, 2 Tbsp. soy sauce, 2 bay leaves, 1 tsp. freshly ground black pepper, and remaining 1 Tbsp. sugar. Bring to a simmer, then return pork and eggplant to pot. Reduce heat to medium-low, partially cover, and simmer until eggplant is tender and silky and sauce is reduced by half, 20–25 minutes. Taste and season with more salt and pepper and add a little more sugar if needed.\r\n7. Top with garlic chips and serve with cooked white rice.\r\n","z":"1. 将 1 磅日本或意大利小茄子（约 3 个）纵向切成四等分，然后横向切成 2 英寸宽的块。放入一个中等大小的碗中。加入 1 汤匙糖、1 茶匙钻石水晶或 ½ 茶匙莫顿粗盐和 ½ 茶匙现磨黑胡椒。搅拌均匀，使茄子均匀裹上一层，在室温下静置至少 20 分钟，最多 2小时。\r\n2. 8 瓣大蒜去皮并切成薄片。添加 3 汤匙。将植物油和一半大蒜放入中型荷兰烤箱或其他重锅中。用中高火煮，用木勺不断搅拌，直至呈浅金黄色，酥脆，大约需要 5 分钟。用有槽勺将蒜片转移到盘子上；用盐轻轻调味。\r\n3. 放置 4 盎司。将猪肉末放入同一锅中，用木勺切成小块。用 ¼ 茶匙调味。钻石水晶或莫顿粗盐，静置煮约 5 分钟，直到底部变成深棕色。使用有槽勺，转移到另一个盘子，将脂肪留在锅中。\r\n4. 将茄子放在干净的厨房毛巾上，吸干盐吸走的水分。\r\n5. 分批工作，如有需要，可添加更多油，将茄子放入同一锅中煮至浅棕色，每面约 3 分钟。转移到装有猪肉的盘子中。\r\n6. 将 1.5 杯水倒入锅中，用木勺刮去底部的褐色碎片。添加剩余的大蒜，3 汤匙。椰子醋或未调味的米醋，2 汤匙。酱油，2片月桂叶，1茶匙。现磨黑胡椒粉和剩余的 1 汤匙。糖。煮沸，然后将猪肉和茄子放回锅中。将火调至中低，盖上部分盖子，小火煮 20-25 分钟，直至茄子变软、丝滑，酱汁减半。用更多的盐和胡椒调味并调味，如果需要的话可以再加一点糖。\r\n7. 撒上蒜片，配上煮熟的白米饭。"},{"id":"53074","n":"Grilled eggplant with coconut milk","a":"Filipino","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/bopa2i1683209167.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ourC5IhljB4","i":[["Egg Plants","6"],["Coconut Milk","1 can"],["Lemon Juice","1 tbs"],["Salt","1 tsp"],["Red Pepper Flakes","To taste"],["Onions","4 Sticks"]],"s":".  Prepare the eggplants for grilling by pricking them all over with a fork.  This is so it won’t burst during the grilling process as the natural water in it heats up.\r\n2.  Grill the eggplants, turning them over frequently to ensure even cooking.  Grill until the skins are dark brown, even black and the eggplant is soft when you touch it.\r\n3.  Soak the grilled eggplant in a bowl of water to cool it down.  Peel the skin off the eggplant.  Place the whole eggplants in a shallow dish (my mom actually cuts the eggplant into small, bite-sized pieces).\r\n 4.  In a small mixing bowl, mix together the coconut milk or cream, lemon powder, salt and hot pepper.  Mix until the lemon powder and salt dissolve.  Taste, then adjust the amount of lemon powder, salt and hot pepper to your liking.  Pour the mixture over the eggplant.  Sprinkle the green onions over the eggplant and coconut milk.  Stir gently to combine. \r\n","z":"。  准备烤茄子，用叉子在茄子上扎满小孔。  这样，在烧烤过程中，随着其中的天然水升温，它就不会爆裂。\r\n2. 烤茄子时，经常翻面，以确保受热均匀。  烤至茄子皮呈深褐色，甚至呈黑色，摸起来软软的。\r\n3.将烤好的茄子放入一碗水中浸泡冷却。  把茄子的皮剥掉。  把整个茄子放在一个浅盘里（我妈妈实际上把茄子切成小块，一口大小）。\r\n 4. 在一个小碗中，将椰奶或奶油、柠檬粉、盐和辣椒混合在一起。  混合直至柠檬粉和盐溶解。  尝尝味道，然后根据自己的喜好调整柠檬粉、盐和辣椒的用量。  将混合物倒在茄子上。  将葱撒在茄子和椰奶上。  轻轻搅拌混合。"},{"id":"53075","n":"Tortang Talong","a":"Filipino","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/va668f1683209318.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eLl8ekOu1MM","i":[["Egg Plants","4"],["Eggs","2"],["Salt","1 tsp"],["Olive Oil","4 tsp"]],"s":"0.\tGrill the eggplant until the color of skin turns almost black\r\n1.\tLet the eggplant cool for a while then peel off the skin. Set aside.\r\n2.\tCrack the eggs and place in a bowl\r\n3.\tAdd salt and beat\r\n4.\tPlace the eggplant on a flat surface and flatten using a fork.\r\n5.\tDip the flattened eggplant in the beaten egg mixture\r\n6.\tHeat the pan and pour the cooking oil\r\n7.\tFry the eggplant (that was dipped in the beaten mixture). Make sure that both sides are cooked. Frying time will take you about 3 to 4 minutes per side on medium heat. \r\n","z":"0.将茄子烤至表皮颜色接近黑色\r\n1.将茄子晾凉一会儿，然后剥去皮。放在一边。\r\n2.鸡蛋打散，放入碗中\r\n3.加入盐，搅打\r\n4. 将茄子放在平坦的表面上，用叉子压平。\r\n5.将压扁的茄子浸入打散的鸡蛋液中\r\n6.将锅烧热，倒入食用油\r\n7. 炒茄子（浸入打好的混合物中）。确保两面都煮熟。中火煎每面大约需要 3 到 4 分钟。"},{"id":"52904","n":"Beef Bourguignon","a":"France","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/vtqxtu1511784197.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SQnr4Z-7rok","i":[["Goose Fat","3 tsp"],["Beef Shin","600g"],["Bacon","100g"],["Challots","350g"],["Chestnut Mushroom","250g"],["Garlic Clove","2 sliced"],["Bouquet Garni","1"],["Tomato Puree","1 tbs"],["Red Wine","750 ml"],["Celeriac","600g"],["Olive Oil","2 tbs"],["Thyme","sprigs of fresh"],["Rosemary","sprigs of fresh"],["Bay Leaf","2"],["Cardamom","4"]],"s":"Heat a large casserole pan and add 1 tbsp goose fat. Season the beef and fry until golden brown, about 3-5 mins, then turn over and fry the other side until the meat is browned all over, adding more fat if necessary. Do this in 2-3 batches, transferring the meat to a colander set over a bowl when browned.\r\nIn the same pan, fry the bacon, shallots or pearl onions, mushrooms, garlic and bouquet garni until lightly browned. Mix in the tomato purée and cook for a few mins, stirring into the mixture. This enriches the bourguignon and makes a great base for the stew. Then return the beef and any drained juices to the pan and stir through.\r\nPour over the wine and about 100ml water so the meat bobs up from the liquid, but isn’t completely covered. Bring to the boil and use a spoon to scrape the caramelised cooking juices from the bottom of the pan – this will give the stew more flavour.\r\nHeat oven to 150C/fan 130C/gas 2. Make a cartouche: tear off a square of foil slightly larger than the casserole, arrange it in the pan so it covers the top of the stew and trim away any excess foil. Then cook for 3 hrs. If the sauce looks watery, remove the beef and veg with a slotted spoon, and set aside. Cook the sauce over a high heat for a few mins until the sauce has thickened a little, then return the beef and vegetables to the pan.\r\nTo make the celeriac mash, peel the celeriac and cut into cubes. Heat the olive oil in a large frying pan. Tip in the celeriac and fry for 5 mins until it turns golden. Season well with salt and pepper. Stir in the rosemary, thyme, bay and cardamom pods, then pour over 200ml water, enough to nearly cover the celeriac. Turn the heat to low, partially cover the pan and leave to simmer for 25-30 mins.\r\nAfter 25-30 mins, the celeriac should be soft and most of the water will have evaporated. Drain away any remaining water, then remove the herb sprigs, bay and cardamom pods. Lightly crush with a potato masher, then finish with a glug of olive oil and season to taste. Spoon the beef bourguignon into serving bowls and place a large spoonful of the celeriac mash on top. Garnish with one of the bay leaves, if you like.","z":"加热一个大砂锅，加入 1 汤匙鹅油。将牛肉调味，煎至金黄色，大约 3-5 分钟，然后翻面煎另一面，直至肉全部变成棕色，必要时添加更多脂肪。分 2-3 批进行此操作，当肉变成棕色时，将其转移到放在碗上的漏勺中。\r\n在同一个锅中，将培根、青葱或珍珠洋葱、蘑菇、大蒜和香草束煎至浅棕色。加入番茄泥，煮几分钟，搅拌到混合物中。这可以丰富布吉尼翁酒的味道，并为炖菜打下良好的基础。然后将牛肉和沥干的汁液放回锅中搅拌。\r\n倒入酒和约 100 毫升的水，使肉从液体中浮起，但不会完全覆盖。煮沸，用勺子刮去锅底的焦糖烹饪汁——这会让炖菜更有味道。\r\n将烤箱加热至 150C/风扇 130C/煤气 2. 制作漩涡花饰：撕下一块比砂锅稍大的方形箔片，将其放在锅中，使其覆盖炖菜的顶部，并修剪掉多余的箔片。然后煮3小时。如果酱汁看起来很稀，则用漏勺取出牛肉和蔬菜，放在一边。用大火将酱汁煮几分钟，直到酱汁稍微变稠，然后将牛肉和蔬菜放回锅中。\r\n制作块根芹泥时，将块根芹去皮并切成方块。在大煎锅中加热橄榄油。倒入块根芹，煎 5 分钟直至呈金黄色。用盐和胡椒调味。加入迷迭香、百里香、月桂和小豆蔻荚，然后倒入 200 毫升水，水量足以几乎覆盖块根芹。把火调小，盖上锅盖，小火煮 25-30 分钟。\r\n25-30分钟后，块根芹应该变软，大部分水分已经蒸发。沥干剩余的水，然后取出药草小枝、月桂叶和豆蔻荚。用土豆捣碎器轻轻压碎，然后加入一大口橄榄油并调味。将布吉尼翁牛肉舀入碗中，然后在上面放一大勺块根芹泥。如果您愿意，可以用一片月桂叶装饰。"},{"id":"52914","n":"Boulangère Potatoes","a":"France","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/qywups1511796761.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gcXPruv1Mjg","i":[["Onions","2 finely chopped"],["Thyme","sprigs of fresh"],["Olive Oil","2 tbs"],["Potatoes","1.5kg"],["Vegetable Stock","425g"]],"s":"Heat oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6. Fry the onions and thyme sprigs in the oil until softened and lightly coloured (about 5 mins).\r\nSpread a layer of potatoes over the base of a 1.5-litre oiled gratin dish. Sprinkle over a few onions (see picture, above) and continue layering, finishing with a layer of potatoes. Pour over the stock and bake for 50-60 mins until the potatoes are cooked and the top is golden and crisp.","z":"将烤箱加热至 200C/风扇 180C/煤气 6. 将洋葱和百里香小枝在油中煎至软化并呈浅色（约 5 分钟）。\r\n在 1.5 升涂油烤盘的底部铺上一层土豆。撒上一些洋葱（见上图）并继续分层，最后撒上一层土豆。倒在高汤上，烘烤 50-60 分钟，直至土豆煮熟，顶部金黄酥脆。"},{"id":"52913","n":"Brie wrapped in prosciutto & brioche","a":"France","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/qqpwsy1511796276.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FzNPPD8lbWg","i":[["Plain Flour","375g"],["Caster Sugar","50g"],["Yeast","7g"],["Milk","75g"],["Eggs","3 Large"],["Eggs","To Glaze"],["Butter","180g"],["Brie","250g"],["Prosciutto","8 slices"]],"s":"Mix the flour, 1 tsp salt, caster sugar, yeast, milk and eggs together in a mixer using the dough attachment for 5 mins until the dough is smooth. Add the butter and mix for a further 4 mins on medium speed. Scrape the dough bowl and mix again for 1 min. Place the dough in a container, cover with cling film and leave in the fridge for at least 6 hrs before using.\r\nWrap the Brie in the prosciutto and set aside. Turn out the dough onto a lightly floured surface. Roll into a 25cm circle. Place the wrapped Brie in the middle of the circle and fold the edges in neatly. Put the parcel onto a baking tray lined with baking parchment and brush with beaten egg. Chill in the fridge for 30 mins, then brush again with beaten egg and chill for a further 30 mins. Leave to rise for 1 hr at room temperature. Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6, then bake for 22 mins. Serve warm.","z":"将面粉、1 茶匙盐、细砂糖、酵母、牛奶和鸡蛋放入搅拌机中，使用面团附件混合 5 分钟，直至面团光滑。加入黄油并中速再搅拌 4 分钟。刮掉面团碗并再次混合 1 分钟。将面团放入容器中，盖上保鲜膜，并在使用前在冰箱中放置至少 6 小时。\r\n将布里干酪包裹在火腿中，放在一边。将面团翻到撒有少许面粉的表面上。擀成25厘米的圆。将包好的布里干酪放在圆圈中间，然后将边缘折叠整齐。将包裹放在衬有烘焙羊皮纸的烤盘上，并刷上打散的鸡蛋。放入冰箱冷藏30分钟，然后再次刷上打散的鸡蛋，再冷藏30分钟。室温下发酵 1 小时。将烤箱加热至 200C/180C 风扇/煤气 6，然后烘烤 22 分钟。趁热食用。"},{"id":"52934","n":"Chicken Basquaise","a":"France","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/wruvqv1511880994.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=emfm6TwsVhg","i":[["Chicken","1.5kg"],["Butter","25g"],["Olive Oil","6 tblsp"],["Red Onions","2 sliced"],["Red Pepper","3 Large"],["Chorizo","130g"],["Sun-Dried Tomatoes","8"],["Garlic","6 cloves sliced"],["Basmati Rice","300g"],["Tomato Puree","drizzle"],["Paprika","½ tsp"],["Bay Leaves","4"],["Thyme","Handful"],["Chicken Stock","350ml"],["Dry White Wine","180g"],["Lemons","2"],["Black Olives","100g"],["Salt","to serve"],["Pepper","to serve"]],"s":"Preheat the oven to 180°C/Gas mark 4. Have the chicken joints ready to cook. Heat the butter and 3 tbsp olive oil in a flameproof casserole or large frying pan. Brown the chicken pieces in batches on both sides, seasoning them with salt and pepper as you go. Don't crowd the pan - fry the chicken in small batches, removing the pieces to kitchen paper as they are done.\r\n\r\nAdd a little more olive oil to the casserole and fry the onions over a medium heat for 10 minutes, stirring frequently, until softened but not browned. Add the rest of the oil, then the peppers and cook for another 5 minutes.\r\n\r\nAdd the chorizo, sun-dried tomatoes and garlic and cook for 2-3 minutes. Add the rice, stirring to ensure it is well coated in the oil. Stir in the tomato paste, paprika, bay leaves and chopped thyme. Pour in the stock and wine. When the liquid starts to bubble, turn the heat down to a gentle simmer. Press the rice down into the liquid if it isn't already submerged and place the chicken on top. Add the lemon wedges and olives around the chicken.\r\n\r\nCover and cook in the oven for 50 minutes. The rice should be cooked but still have some bite, and the chicken should have juices that run clear when pierced in the thickest part with a knife. If not, cook for another 5 minutes and check again.","z":"将烤箱预热至 180°C/煤气标记 4. 准备好烹饪鸡块。在防火砂锅或大煎锅中加热黄油和 3 汤匙橄榄油。将鸡块两面分批煎成褐色，边吃边用盐和胡椒调味。不要挤在锅里——小批量地煎鸡肉，完成后将鸡肉块移到厨房用纸上。\r\n\r\n在砂锅中再加一点橄榄油，用中火将洋葱煎 10 分钟，期间经常搅拌，直至洋葱变软但不会变成褐色。加入剩下的油，然后加入辣椒，再煮 5 分钟。\r\n\r\n加入香肠、晒干的西红柿和大蒜，煮 2-3 分钟。加入米饭，搅拌以确保其充分裹上油。加入番茄酱、辣椒粉、月桂叶和切碎的百里香。倒入高汤和酒。当液体开始冒泡时，将火调低至小火慢炖。如果米饭尚未浸没，请将其压入液体中，然后将鸡肉放在上面。在鸡肉周围添加柠檬片和橄榄。\r\n\r\n盖上盖子并在烤箱中烘烤 50 分钟。米饭应该煮熟了，但仍有一定的口感，鸡肉用刀刺入最厚的部分时，应该有清澈的汁液。如果没有，再煮 5 分钟并再次检查。"},{"id":"52920","n":"Chicken Marengo","a":"France","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/qpxvuq1511798906.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U33HYUr-0Fw","i":[["Olive Oil","1 tbs"],["Mushrooms","300g"],["Chicken Legs","4"],["Passata","500g"],["Chicken Stock Cube","1"],["Black Olives","100g"],["Parsley","Chopped"]],"s":"Heat the oil in a large flameproof casserole dish and stir-fry the mushrooms until they start to soften. Add the chicken legs and cook briefly on each side to colour them a little.\r\nPour in the passata, crumble in the stock cube and stir in the olives. Season with black pepper – you shouldn’t need salt. Cover and simmer for 40 mins until the chicken is tender. Sprinkle with parsley and serve with pasta and a salad, or mash and green veg, if you like.","z":"在一个大的防火砂锅中加热油，炒蘑菇直到它们开始软化。加入鸡腿，每面稍微煮一下，给它们上色。\r\n倒入帕萨塔，碾碎汤块，拌入橄榄。用黑胡椒调味——你不需要盐。盖上锅盖，煮 40 分钟，直至鸡肉变软。撒上欧芹，搭配意大利面和沙拉，或者土豆泥和绿色蔬菜，如果你喜欢的话。"},{"id":"52879","n":"Chicken Parmentier","a":"France","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/uwvxpv1511557015.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tiG-xlmeyjg","i":[["Potatoes","1.5kg"],["Butter","30g"],["Double Cream","5 tblsp"],["Egg Yolks","2"],["Butter","30g"],["Shallots","7"],["Carrots","3 chopped"],["Celery","2 sticks"],["Garlic Clove","1 finely chopped"],["White Wine","4 tbsp"],["Tomato Puree","1 tbls"],["Tinned Tomatos","400g"],["Chicken Stock","350ml"],["Chicken","600g"],["Black Olives","16"],["Parsley","2 tbs"],["Gruyere cheese","50g"]],"s":"For the topping, boil the potatoes in salted water until tender. Drain and push through a potato ricer, or mash thoroughly. Stir in the butter, cream and egg yolks. Season and set aside.\r\nFor the filling, melt the butter in a large pan. Add the shallots, carrots and celery and gently fry until soft, then add the garlic. Pour in the wine and cook for 1 minute. Stir in the tomato purée, chopped tomatoes and stock and cook for 10–15 minutes, until thickened. Add the shredded chicken, olives and parsley. Season to taste with salt and pepper.\r\nPreheat the oven to 180C/160C Fan/Gas 4.\r\nPut the filling in a 20x30cm/8x12in ovenproof dish and top with the mashed potato. Grate over the Gruyère. Bake for 30–35 minutes, until piping hot and the potato is golden-brown.","z":"制作配料时，将土豆放入盐水中煮至变软。沥干并推入马铃薯碾米机，或彻底捣碎。加入黄油、奶油和蛋黄。调味并放在一边。\r\n对于馅料，将黄油在大平底锅中融化。加入青葱、胡萝卜和芹菜，轻轻炒至变软，然后加入大蒜。倒入酒煮1分钟。加入番茄泥、切碎的番茄和高汤，煮 10-15 分钟，直至变稠。加入切碎的鸡肉、橄榄和欧芹。用盐和胡椒调味。\r\n将烤箱预热至 180C/160C 风扇/燃气 4.\r\n将馅料放入 20x30 厘米/8x12 英寸的耐热盘中，并在上面放上土豆泥。将格鲁耶尔奶酪磨碎。烘烤 30-35 分钟，直至滚烫且土豆呈金黄色。"},{"id":"52910","n":"Chinon Apple Tarts","a":"France","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/qtqwwu1511792650.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5dAW9HQgtCk","i":[["Puff Pastry","320g"],["Dark Brown Soft Sugar","4 tbs"],["Braeburn Apples","3"],["Red Wine Jelly","4 tbs"],["Creme Fraiche","100ml"],["Icing Sugar","1 tbs"],["Cardamom","3"]],"s":"To make the red wine jelly, put the red wine, jam sugar, star anise, clove, cinnamon stick, allspice, split vanilla pod and seeds in a medium saucepan. Stir together, then heat gently to dissolve the sugar. Turn up the heat and boil for 20 mins until reduced and syrupy. Strain into a small, sterilised jam jar and leave to cool completely. Will keep in the fridge for up to 1 month.\r\n\r\nTake the pastry out of the fridge and leave at room temperature for 10 mins, then unroll. Heat the grill to high and heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Cut out 2 x 13cm circles of pastry, using a plate as a guide, and place on a non-stick baking sheet. Sprinkle each circle with 1 tbsp sugar and grill for 5 mins to caramelise, watching carefully so that the sugar doesn’t burn. Remove from the grill. Can be done a few hours ahead, and left, covered, out of the fridge.\r\n\r\nPeel, quarter and core the apples, cut into 2mm-thin slices and arrange on top of the pastry. Sprinkle over the remaining sugar and pop in the oven for 20-25 mins until the pastry is cooked through and golden, and the apples are softened. Remove and allow to cool slightly. Warm 3 tbsp of the red wine jelly in a small pan over a low heat with 1 tsp water to make it a little more runny, then brush over the top of the tarts.\r\n\r\nTip the crème fraîche into a bowl, sift over the icing sugar and cardamom, and mix together. Carefully lift the warm tarts onto serving plates and serve with the cardamom crème fraîche.","z":"制作红酒果冻时，将红酒、果酱糖、八角茴香、丁香、肉桂棒、五香粉、香草荚和种子放入中型平底锅中。搅拌在一起，然后轻轻加热以溶解糖。把火调大，煮20分钟，直到汤汁变浓稠并呈糖浆状。滤入一个已消毒的小果酱罐中，然后完全冷却。可在冰箱中保存长达 1 个月。\r\n\r\n将糕点从冰箱中取出，在室温下放置 10 分钟，然后展开。将烤架加热至高温，并将烤箱加热至 180C/160C 风扇/燃气 4. 使用盘子作为引导，切出 2 x 13 厘米的糕点圆圈，然后放在不粘烤盘上。在每个圆圈上撒上 1 汤匙糖，烤 5 分钟使其焦糖化，仔细观察，以免糖烧焦。从烤架上取下。可以提前几个小时完成，然后盖上盖子，从冰箱里拿出来。\r\n\r\n苹果去皮、切成四瓣、去核，切成 2 毫米薄的片，放在糕点上。撒上剩余的糖，放入烤箱烤 20-25 分钟，直至糕点完全煮熟并呈金黄色，苹果变软。取出并稍微冷却。将 3 汤匙红酒果冻放入小平底锅中，加入 1 茶匙水，用小火加热，使其变得更稀，然后刷在馅饼的顶部。\r\n\r\n将法式鲜奶油倒入碗中，筛入糖粉和小豆蔻，然后混合在一起。小心地将温热的馅饼放到盘子上，并与小豆蔻鲜奶油一起食用。"},{"id":"52776","n":"Chocolate Gateau","a":"France","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/tqtywx1468317395.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dsJtgmAhFF4","i":[["Plain chocolate","250g"],["Butter","175g"],["Milk","2 tablespoons"],["Eggs","5"],["Granulated Sugar","175g"],["Flour","125g"]],"s":"Preheat the oven to 180°C/350°F/Gas Mark 4. Grease and line the base of an 8 in round spring form cake tin with baking parchment\r\nBreak the chocolate into a heatproof bowl and place over a saucepan of gently simmering water and stir until it melts. (or melt in the microwave for 2-3 mins stirring occasionally)\r\nPlace the butter and sugar in a mixing bowl and cream together with a wooden spoon until light and fluffy. Gradually beat in the eggs, adding a little flour if the mixture begins to curdle. Fold in the remaining flour with the cooled, melted chocolate and milk. Mix until smooth.\r\nSpread the mixture into the cake tin and bake for 50-55 mins or until firm in the centre and a skewer comes out cleanly. Cool for 10 minutes, then turn out and cool completely.","z":"将烤箱预热至 180°C/350°F/Gas Mark 4。在 8 英寸圆形弹簧蛋糕罐底部涂上油脂并铺上烘焙羊皮纸\r\n将巧克力放入耐热碗中，放在盛有小火的平底锅上，搅拌直至融化。 （或者放入微波炉加热2-3分钟，偶尔搅拌一下）\r\n将黄油和糖放入搅拌碗中，用木勺将奶油混合在一起，直至变得松软。逐渐打入鸡蛋，如果混合物开始凝结，则加入少许面粉。将剩余的面粉与冷却融化的巧克力和牛奶混合。混合直至光滑。\r\n将混合物倒入蛋糕罐中，烘烤 50-55 分钟，或直至中心变硬，并且可以干净地取出串。冷却10分钟，然后取出并完全冷却。"},{"id":"52905","n":"Chocolate Souffle","a":"France","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/twspvx1511784937.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FWqfkUEWOTg","i":[["Single Cream","142ml"],["Caster Sugar","25g"],["Dark Chocolate","100g"],["Butter","25g"],["Butter","drizzle"],["Caster Sugar","50g"],["Dark Chocolate","175g"],["Double Cream","2 tbs"],["Egg Yolks","4"],["Egg White","5"],["Double Cream","2 tbs"],["Icing Sugar","to serve"]],"s":"Heat oven to 220C/fan 200C/gas 7 and place a baking tray on the top shelf. For the sauce, heat the cream and sugar until boiling. Remove from the heat, stir in the chocolate and butter until melted, then keep warm.\r\nBrush 6 x 150ml ramekins with melted butter, sprinkle with the 2 tbsp caster sugar, then tip out any excess. Melt the chocolate and cream in a bowl over a pan of simmering water, cool, then mix in the egg yolks. Whisk the egg whites until they hold their shape, then add the sugar, 1 tbsp at a time, whisking back to the same consistency. Mix a spoonful into the chocolate, then gently fold in the rest.\r\nWorking quickly, fill the ramekins, wipe the rims clean and run your thumb around the edges. Turn oven down to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6, place the ramekins onto the baking tray, then bake for 8-10 mins until risen with a slight wobble. Don’t open the oven door too early as this may make them collapse.\r\nOnce the soufflés are ready, dust with icing sugar, scoop a small hole from their tops, then pour in some of the hot chocolate sauce. Replace the lids and serve straight away.","z":"将烤箱加热至 220C/风扇 200C/煤气 7，并将烤盘放在顶层架子上。对于酱汁，将奶油和糖加热直至沸腾。从火上移开，加入巧克力和黄油搅拌直至融化，然后保温。\r\n在 6 x 150 毫升小模子上刷上融化的黄油，撒上 2 汤匙细砂糖，然后倒掉多余的糖。将巧克力和奶油放入盛有沸水的碗中融化，冷却，然后加入蛋黄。搅拌蛋清直至其定型，然后加入糖，一次 1 汤匙，搅拌至相同的稠度。将一勺混入巧克力中，然后轻轻地拌入其余的。\r\n快速工作，填满模子，将边缘擦拭干净，然后用拇指抚摸边缘。将烤箱温度调低至 200C/风扇 180C/煤气 6，将模子放在烤盘上，然后烘烤 8-10 分钟，直至微微晃动。不要太早打开烤箱门，因为这可能会使烤箱门塌陷。\r\n舒芙蕾准备好后，撒上糖粉，在顶部挖一个小洞，然后倒入一些热巧克力酱。盖上盖子并立即食用。"},{"id":"52832","n":"Coq au vin","a":"France","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/qstyvs1505931190.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_ise46LADBs","i":[["Olive Oil","1½ tbsp"],["Bacon","3 rashers (100g) chopped dry-cured"],["Shallots","12 small"],["Chicken Legs","2 (460g)"],["Chicken Thighs","4 (650g)"],["Chicken Breasts","2 (280g)"],["Garlic","3 finely chopped"],["Brandy","3 tbsp"],["Red Wine","600ml"],["Chicken Stock","150ml"],["tomato puree","2 tsp"],["thyme","3 sprigs"],["Rosemary","2 sprigs"],["bay leaves","2"],["parsley","garnish"],["chestnut mushroom","250g"],["plain flour","2 tbsp"],["butter","1 tsp"]],"s":"Heat 1 tbsp of the oil in a large, heavy-based saucepan or flameproof dish. Tip in the bacon and fry until crisp. Remove and drain on kitchen paper. Add the shallots to the pan and fry, stirring or shaking the pan often, for 5-8 mins until well browned all over. Remove and set aside with the bacon.\r\nPat the chicken pieces dry with kitchen paper. Pour the remaining oil into the pan, then fry half the chicken pieces, turning regularly, for 5-8 mins until well browned. Remove, then repeat with the remaining chicken. Remove and set aside.\r\nScatter in the garlic and fry briefly, then, with the heat medium-high, pour in the brandy or Cognac, stirring the bottom of the pan to deglaze. The alcohol should sizzle and start to evaporate so there is not much left.\r\nReturn the chicken legs and thighs to the pan along with any juices, then pour in a little of the wine, stirring the bottom of the pan again. Stir in the rest of the wine, the stock and tomato purée, drop in the bouquet garni, season with pepper and a pinch of salt, then return the bacon and shallots to the pan. Cover, lower the heat to a gentle simmer, add the chicken breasts and cook for 50 mins-1hr.\r\nJust before ready to serve, heat the oil for the mushrooms in a large non-stick frying pan. Add the mushrooms and fry over a high heat for a few mins until golden. Remove and keep warm.\r\nLift the chicken, shallots and bacon from the pan and transfer to a warmed serving dish. Remove the bouquet garni. To make the thickener, mix the flour, olive oil and butter in a small bowl using the back of a teaspoon. Bring the wine mixture to a gentle boil, then gradually drop in small pieces of the thickener, whisking each piece in using a wire whisk. Simmer for 1-2 mins. Scatter the mushrooms over the chicken, then pour over the wine sauce. Garnish with chopped parsley.","z":"在一个大的厚底平底锅或防火盘中加热 1 汤匙油。倒入培根，煎至酥脆。取出并用厨房纸吸干水分。将青葱放入锅中，经常搅拌或摇动锅煎 5-8 分钟，直至全部变成棕色。取出并与培根一起放在一边。\r\n用厨房用纸将鸡块拍干。将剩余的油倒入锅中，然后将一半的鸡块煎5-8分钟，直至呈褐色。取出，然后对剩下的鸡肉重复上述步骤。取出并放在一边。\r\n撒入大蒜并短暂煎炸，然后用中高火倒入白兰地或干邑白兰地，搅拌锅底以脱釉。酒精应该发出嘶嘶声并开始蒸发，这样就没有剩下多少了。\r\n将鸡腿和大腿连同汁液一起放回锅中，然后倒入少许酒，再次搅拌锅底。加入剩余的酒、高汤和番茄泥，加入加尼花束，用胡椒粉和少许盐调味，然后将培根和青葱放回锅中。盖上锅盖，小火慢炖，加入鸡胸肉，煮 50 分钟至 1 小时。\r\n准备食用之前，在一个大的不粘煎锅中加热蘑菇油。加入蘑菇，用大火煎几分钟直至呈金黄色。取出并保温。\r\n将鸡肉、青葱和培根从锅中取出，放入温热的盘子中。取出花束。制作增稠剂时，用茶匙背面将面粉、橄榄油和黄油放入小碗中混合。将葡萄酒混合物轻轻煮沸，然后逐渐滴入小块增稠剂，用钢丝搅拌器搅拌每一块。煮1-2分钟。将蘑菇撒在鸡肉上，然后倒在酒汁上。用切碎的欧芹装饰。"},{"id":"52907","n":"Duck Confit","a":"France","c":"Miscellaneous","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/wvpvsu1511786158.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MHhLJqghY-o","i":[["Sea Salt","Handful"],["Bay Leaf","4"],["Garlic","4 cloves"],["Thyme","Handful"],["Duck Legs","4"],["White Wine","100ml"]],"s":"The day before you want to make the dish, scatter half the salt, half the garlic and half of the herbs over the base of a small shallow dish. Lay the duck legs, skin-side up, on top, then scatter over the remaining salt, garlic and herbs. Cover the duck and refrigerate overnight. This can be done up to 2 days ahead.\r\nPour the wine into a saucepan that will snugly fit the duck legs in a single layer. Brush the salt off the duck legs and place them, skin-side down, in the wine. Cover the pan with a lid and place over a medium heat. As soon as the wine starts to bubble, turn the heat down to the lowest setting and cook for 2 hours, checking occasionally that the liquid is just barely simmering. (If you own a heat diffuser, it would be good to use it here.) After 2 hours, the duck legs should be submerged in their own fat and the meat should feel incredibly tender when prodded. Leave to cool.\r\nThe duck legs are now cooked and can be eaten immediately – or you can follow the next step if you like them crisp. If you are preparing ahead, pack the duck legs tightly into a plastic container or jar and pour over the fat, but not the liquid at the bottom of the pan. Cover and leave in the fridge for up to a month, or freeze for up to 3 months. The liquid you are left with makes a tasty gravy, which can be chilled or frozen until needed.\r\nTo reheat and crisp up the duck legs, heat oven to 220C/fan 200C/gas 7. Remove the legs from the fat and place them, skin-side down, in an ovenproof frying pan. Roast for 30-40 mins, turning halfway through, until brown and crisp. Serve with the reheated gravy, a crisp salad and some crisp golden ptoatoes.","z":"在做这道菜的前一天，将一半的盐、一半的大蒜和一半的香草撒在一个小浅盘的底部。将鸭腿放在上面，带皮的一面朝上，然后撒上剩余的盐、大蒜和香草。盖上鸭子并冷藏过夜。这最多可以提前 2 天完成。\r\n将酒倒入锅中，将鸭腿单层紧贴。刷去鸭腿上的盐，然后将鸭腿带皮的一面朝下放入酒中。盖上锅盖，用中火加热。一旦酒开始冒泡，就把火调到最低，煮 2 小时，偶尔检查一下液体是否刚刚沸腾。 （如果您有散热器，最好在这里使用它。） 2 小时后，鸭腿应该浸没在它们自己的脂肪中，并且刺痛时肉应该感觉非常嫩。让它冷却。\r\n鸭腿现已煮熟，可以立即食用——如果您喜欢脆的，也可以执行下一步。如果您提前准备，请将鸭腿紧紧地装入塑料容器或罐子中，然后倒在脂肪上，但不要倒在锅底的液体上。盖上盖子并在冰箱中保存最多一个月，或冷冻最多 3 个月。剩下的液体可以制成美味的肉汁，可以在需要时冷藏或冷冻。\r\n要重新加热鸭腿并使鸭腿酥脆，请将烤箱加热至 220C/风扇 200C/煤气 7. 将鸭腿从脂肪中取出，将鸭腿皮面朝下放入耐热煎锅中。烤 30-40 分钟，中途翻面，直至变成棕色且酥脆。与重新加热的肉汁、脆沙拉和一些脆金土豆一起食用。"},{"id":"52919","n":"Fennel Dauphinoise","a":"France","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/ytttsv1511798734.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tXBzZm2kkh8","i":[["Potatoes","225g"],["Fennel","1 small"],["Garlic","1 clove finely chopped"],["Milk","75 ml"],["Double Cream","100ml"],["Butter","For Greasing"],["Parmesan Cheese","to serve"]],"s":"Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Put potatoes, fennel, and garlic in a medium non-stick pan. Pour in milk and double cream, season well and simmer gently, covered, for 10 mins, stirring halfway through, until potatoes are just tender.\r\nDivide the mixture between 2 small (about 150ml) buttered ramekins and scatter with Parmesan. Bake for 40 mins until the potatoes are golden and tender when pierced with a knife. Snip the reserved fennel fronds over before serving.","z":"将烤箱加热至 180C/160C 风扇/燃气 4. 将土豆、茴香和大蒜放入中型不粘锅中。倒入牛奶和双份奶油，充分调味，盖上锅盖，小火煮 10 分钟，中途搅拌，直至土豆变软。\r\n将混合物分成 2 个涂有黄油的小模子（约 150 毫升），并撒上帕尔马干酪。烘烤 40 分钟，直至用刀刺穿土豆时，土豆呈金黄色且变软。食用前将保留的茴香叶剪掉。"},{"id":"52918","n":"Fish Stew with Rouille","a":"France","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/vptqpw1511798500.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fp9Lqx2EUco","i":[["Prawns","6 large"],["Olive Oil","3 tbs"],["Dry White Wine","150ml"],["Fish Stock","200ml"],["Fennel","1 small finely diced"],["Onion","1 small finely diced"],["Garlic","3 cloves Chopped"],["Potatoes","1 large"],["Orange","1"],["Star Anise","1"],["Bay Leaf","1"],["Harissa Spice","1 1/2 tsp"],["Tomato Puree","2 tbs"],["Chopped Tomatoes","400g"],["Mussels","Handful"],["White Fish","200g"],["Thyme","2"],["Bread","to serve"]],"s":"Twist the heads from the prawns, then peel away the legs and shells, but leave the tails intact. Devein each prawn. Fry the shells in 1 tbsp oil for 5 mins, until dark pink and golden in patches. Add the wine, boil down by two thirds, then pour in the stock. Strain into a jug, discarding the shells.\r\nHeat the rest of the oil in a deep frying pan or casserole. Add the fennel, onion and garlic, season, then cover and gently cook for 10 mins until softened. Meanwhile, peel the potato and cut into 2cm-ish chunks. Put into a pan of cold water, bring to the boil and cook for 5 mins until almost tender. Drain in a colander.\r\nPeel a strip of zest from the orange. Put the zest, star anise, bay and ½ tsp harissa into the pan. Fry gently, uncovered, for 5-10 mins, until the vegetables are soft, sweet and golden.\r\nStir in the tomato purée, cook for 2 mins, then add the tomatoes and stock. Simmer for 10 mins until the sauce thickens slightly. Season to taste. The sauce can be made ahead, then reheated later in the day. Meantime, scrub the mussels or clams and pull away any stringy beards. Any that are open should be tapped sharply on the worktop – if they don’t close after a few seconds, discard them.\r\nReheat the sauce if necessary, then stir the potato, chunks of fish and prawns very gently into the stew. Bring back to the boil, then cover and gently simmer for 3 mins. Scatter the mussels or clams over the stew, then cover and cook for 2 mins more or until the shells have opened wide. Discard any that remain closed. The chunks of fish should flake easily and the prawns should be pink through. Scatter with the thyme leaves.\r\nTo make the quick rouille, stir the rest of the harissa through the mayonnaise. Serve the stew in bowls, topped with spoonfuls of rouille, which will melt into the sauce and enrich it. Have some good bread ready, as you’ll definitely want to mop up the juices.","z":"将虾头扭开，然后剥去虾腿和虾壳，但保留虾尾完好无损。每只虾都去虾线。将贝壳放入 1 汤匙油中煎 5 分钟，直至呈深粉色和金黄色。加入酒，煮至三分之二，然后倒入高汤。滤入罐中，丢弃壳。\r\n在深煎锅或砂锅中加热剩余的油。加入茴香、洋葱和大蒜，调味，然后盖上锅盖，轻轻煮 10 分钟直至变软。同时，将土豆去皮，切成2厘米左右的块。放入冷水锅中，煮沸并煮5分钟直至变软。用漏勺沥干。\r\n从橙子上剥下一条皮。将热情、八角、月桂叶和 ½ 茶匙哈里萨辣酱放入锅中。不盖锅盖，轻轻煎 5-10 分钟，直至蔬菜变软、变甜、呈金黄色。\r\n加入番茄泥，煮 2 分钟，然后加入番茄和高汤。煮10分钟，直到酱汁稍微变稠。调味。酱汁可以提前做好，然后在当天晚些时候重新加热。与此同时，擦洗贻贝或蛤，并除去任何粘稠的胡须。任何打开的容器都应该在工作台上剧烈敲击——如果几秒钟后它们没有关闭，请将其丢弃。\r\n如有必要，重新加热酱汁，然后将土豆、鱼块和虾轻轻搅拌到炖菜中。重新煮沸，然后盖上锅盖，小火煮 3 分钟。将贻贝或蛤蜊撒在炖菜上，然后盖上锅盖，再煮 2 分钟或直到贝壳张开。丢弃所有保持关闭的状态。鱼块应该很容易剥落，虾应该是粉红色的。撒上百里香叶。\r\n制作快速肉酱时，将剩余的哈里萨辣酱与蛋黄酱搅拌。将炖菜盛入碗中，上面放上几勺肉酱，肉酱会融化到酱汁中并使其丰富。准备好一些好的面包，因为你肯定会想擦掉果汁。"},{"id":"52906","n":"Flamiche","a":"France","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/wssvvs1511785879.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vT0q5c880Rg","i":[["Butter","75g"],["Leek","1kg"],["Salt","½ tsp"],["Creme Fraiche","300ml"],["Egg","1"],["Egg Yolks","3"],["Nutmeg","¼ teaspoon"],["Plain Flour","225g"],["Salt","½ tsp"],["Butter","60g"],["Lard","60g"],["Cheddar Cheese","50g"],["Water","2 tbs"]],"s":"For the pastry, sift the flour and salt into the bowl of a food processor, add the butter and lard, then whizz together briefly until the mixture looks like fine breadcrumbs. Tip the mixture into a bowl, then stir in the cheese and enough of the water for the mixture to come together. Tip out onto a lightly floured surface and knead briefly until smooth. Roll out thinly and line a 23cm x 4cm loose-?bottomed fluted flan tin. Prick the base with a fork. Chill for 20 minutes.\r\n02.Melt the 75g butter in a saucepan over a low heat, then add the leeks and the salt. Cover and cook for ?10 minutes until soft. Uncover the pan, increase the heat and cook ?for 2 minutes, stirring occasionally, until the liquid has evaporated. Spoon onto a plate and leave to cool.\r\n03.Preheat the oven to 200°C/fan180°C/gas 6. Line the pastry case with baking paper and baking beans or rice and blind bake for 15-20 minutes until the edges are biscuit-coloured. Remove the paper and beans/rice and return the case to the oven for 7-10 minutes until the base is crisp and lightly golden. Remove and set aside. Reduce the oven temperature to 190°C/fan170°C/gas 5.\r\n04.Put the crème fraîche into a bowl with the whole egg, egg yolks and nutmeg. Lightly beat together, then season. Stir in the leeks. Spoon ?the mixture into the tart case and bake for 35-40 minutes until set ?and lightly golden. Remove from ?the oven and leave for 10 minutes. Take out of the tin and serve.","z":"制作糕点时，将面粉和盐筛入食品加工机的碗中，加入黄油和猪油，然后一起搅拌，直到混合物看起来像细面包屑。将混合物倒入碗中，然后加入奶酪和足够的水，使混合物混合在一起。将其倒在撒有少许面粉的表面上，短暂揉捏直至光滑。擀薄，并在 23 厘米 x 4 厘米的松底凹槽馅饼罐上铺上线条。用叉子刺破底部。冷却20分钟。\r\n02.将75克黄油放入平底锅中，用小火融化，然后加入韭菜和盐。盖上锅盖煮约 10 分钟直至变软。揭开锅盖，加大火力，煮 2 分钟，偶尔搅拌，直至液体蒸发。用勺子舀到盘子上，然后冷却。\r\n03.将烤箱预热至200°C/风扇180°C/煤气 6.在糕点盒中铺上烘焙纸和烘焙豆或大米，盲烤15-20分钟，直至边缘呈饼干色。取出纸和豆子/大米，然后将盒子放回烤箱烘烤 7-10 分钟，直至底部变脆并呈浅金黄色。取出并放在一边。将烤箱温度降低至 190°C/风扇170°C/气体 5.\r\n04.将法式鲜奶油与全蛋、蛋黄和肉豆蔻一起放入碗中。轻轻搅拌在一起，然后调味。拌入韭菜。将混合物倒入馅饼盒中，烘烤 35-40 分钟，直至凝固并呈浅金黄色。从烤箱中取出并放置 10 分钟。从罐中取出即可食用。"},{"id":"52815","n":"French Lentils With Garlic and Thyme","a":"France","c":"Miscellaneous","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/vwwspt1487394060.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CrlTS1mJQMA","i":[["Olive Oil","3 tablespoons"],["Onion","1"],["Garlic","2 cloves"],["Carrots","1"],["French Lentils","2 1/4 cups"],["Thyme","1 teaspoon"],["Bay Leaf","3"],["Salt","1 tablespoon"],["Celery","2 sticks"]],"s":"Place a large saucepan over medium heat and add oil. When hot, add chopped vegetables and sauté until softened, 5 to 10 minutes.\r\nAdd 6 cups water, lentils, thyme, bay leaves and salt. Bring to a boil, then reduce to a fast simmer.\r\nSimmer lentils until they are tender and have absorbed most of the water, 20 to 25 minutes. If necessary, drain any excess water after lentils have cooked. Serve immediately, or allow them to cool and reheat later.\r\nFor a fuller taste, use some chicken stock and reduce the water by the same amount.","z":"将一个大平底锅放在中火上并加油。热时，加入切碎的蔬菜，炒至软化，持续 5 至 10 分钟。\r\n添加 6 杯水、扁豆、百里香、月桂叶和盐。煮沸，然后转小火慢炖。\r\n将扁豆煮 20 至 25 分钟，直至扁豆变软并吸收大部分水分。如有必要，扁豆煮熟后沥干多余的水。立即食用，或者让它们冷却并稍后再加热。\r\n为了获得更饱满的味道，可以使用一些鸡汤并减少相同量的水。"},{"id":"52915","n":"French Omelette","a":"France","c":"Miscellaneous","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/yvpuuy1511797244.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qXPhVYpQLPA","i":[["Eggs","3"],["Butter","2 knobs"],["Parmesan","1 tsp"],["Tarragon Leaves","3 chopped"],["Parsley","1 tbs chopped"],["Chives","1 tbs chopped"],["Gruyère","4 tbs"]],"s":"Get everything ready. Warm a 20cm (measured across the top) non-stick frying pan on a medium heat. Crack the eggs into a bowl and beat them with a fork so they break up and mix, but not as completely as you would for scrambled egg. With the heat on medium-hot, drop one knob of butter into the pan. It should bubble and sizzle, but not brown. Season the eggs with the Parmesan and a little salt and pepper, and pour into the pan.\r\nLet the eggs bubble slightly for a couple of seconds, then take a wooden fork or spatula and gently draw the mixture in from the sides of the pan a few times, so it gathers in folds in the centre. Leave for a few seconds, then stir again to lightly combine uncooked egg with cooked. Leave briefly again, and when partly cooked, stir a bit faster, stopping while there’s some barely cooked egg left. With the pan flat on the heat, shake it back and forth a few times to settle the mixture. It should slide easily in the pan and look soft and moist on top. A quick burst of heat will brown the underside.\r\nGrip the handle underneath. Tilt the pan down away from you and let the omelette fall to the edge. Fold the side nearest to you over by a third with your fork, and keep it rolling over, so the omelette tips onto a plate – or fold it in half, if that’s easier. For a neat finish, cover the omelette with a piece of kitchen paper and plump it up a bit with your fingers. Rub the other knob of butter over to glaze. Serve immediately.","z":"把一切准备好。用中火加热 20 厘米（从顶部测量）的不粘煎锅。将鸡蛋打入碗中，然后用叉子搅打，使它们破碎并混合，但不像炒鸡蛋那样完全混合。用中火加热，将一小块黄油放入锅中。它应该起泡并发出嘶嘶声，但不是棕色的。用帕尔马干酪、少许盐和胡椒调味鸡蛋，然后倒入锅中。\r\n让鸡蛋稍微起泡几秒钟，然后用木叉或抹刀轻轻地将混合物从锅的两侧吸入几次，使其在中心聚集成褶皱。静置几秒钟，然后再次搅拌，将生鸡蛋与熟鸡蛋轻轻混合。再次短暂离开，当部分煮熟时，搅拌得更快一点，在剩下一些未煮熟的鸡蛋时停止搅拌。将平底锅平放在火上，来回摇动几次以使混合物沉淀。它应该很容易在锅中滑动，并且顶部看起来柔软湿润。快速爆发的热量会使底面变成棕色。\r\n抓住下面的把手。将平底锅向远离您的方向倾斜，让煎蛋卷落到边缘。用叉子将离你最近的一侧折叠三分之一，并保持滚动，这样煎蛋卷就会倒在盘子上——或者将其对折，如果这样更容易的话。为了获得整洁的表面效果，可以用一张厨房用纸盖住煎蛋卷，然后用手指将其弄得鼓鼓的。将另一块黄油擦到釉面上。立即上菜。"},{"id":"52903","n":"French Onion Soup","a":"France","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/xvrrux1511783685.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-DLDMQucqDI","i":[["Butter","50g"],["Olive Oil","1 tbs"],["Onion","1 kg"],["Sugar","1 tsp"],["Garlic Clove","4 sliced"],["Plain Flour","2 tbs"],["Dry White Wine","250ml"],["Beef Stock","1L"],["Bread","4 sliced"],["Gruyère","140g"]],"s":"Melt the butter with the oil in a large heavy-based pan. Add the onions and fry with the lid on for 10 mins until soft. Sprinkle in the sugar and cook for 20 mins more, stirring frequently, until caramelised. The onions should be really golden, full of flavour and soft when pinched between your fingers. Take care towards the end to ensure that they don’t burn.\r\nAdd the garlic for the final few mins of the onions’ cooking time, then sprinkle in the flour and stir well. Increase the heat and keep stirring as you gradually add the wine, followed by the hot stock. Cover and simmer for 15-20 mins.\r\nTo serve, turn on the grill, and toast the bread. Ladle the soup into heatproof bowls. Put a slice or two of toast on top of the bowls of soup, and pile on the cheese. Grill until melted. Alternatively, you can complete the toasts under the grill, then serve them on top.","z":"在一个大的厚底锅中将黄油和油一起融化。加入洋葱，盖上盖子煎 10 分钟直至变软。撒上糖，再煮 20 分钟，经常搅拌，直至焦糖化。洋葱应该是金黄色的，味道浓郁，用手指捏时柔软。最后要小心，确保它们不会烧焦。\r\n在洋葱烹饪的最后几分钟加入大蒜，然后撒入面粉并搅拌均匀。增加热量并不断搅拌，逐渐加入酒，然后加入热汤。盖上锅盖，煮 15-20 分钟。\r\n食用时，打开烤架，烤面包。将汤舀入耐热碗中。将一两片吐司放在汤碗上，然后堆上奶酪。烤至融化。或者，您可以在烤架下完成吐司，然后将其放在上面。"},{"id":"52916","n":"Pear Tarte Tatin","a":"France","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/rxvxrr1511797671.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8U1tKWKDeWA","i":[["Pears","8"],["Caster Sugar","100g"],["Butter","100g"],["Star Anise","2"],["Cardamom","3 Pods"],["Cinnamon","1 large"],["Brandy","2 tbs"],["Puff Pastry","500g"]],"s":"Core the pears, then peel as neatly as possible and halve. If you like, they can be prepared up to a day ahead and kept in the fridge, uncovered, so that they dry out.\r\nTip the sugar, butter, star anise, cardamom and cinnamon into an ovenproof frying pan, about 20cm wide, and place over a high heat until bubbling. Shake the pan and stir the buttery sauce until it separates and the sugar caramelises to a toffee colour.\r\nLay the pears in the pan, then cook in the sauce for 10-12 mins, tossing occasionally, until completely caramelised. Don’t worry about them burning – they won’t – but you want to caramelise them as much as possible. Splash in the brandy and let it flambé, then set the pears aside.\r\nHeat oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6. Roll the pastry out to the thickness of a £1 coin. Using a plate slightly larger than the top of the pan, cut out a circle, then press the edges of the circle of pastry to thin them out.\r\nWhen the pears have cooled slightly, arrange them in the pan, cut side up, in a floral shape, with the pears around the edge pointing inwards. Rest the cinnamon stick on the top in the centre, with the cardamom pods scattered around.\r\nDrape the pastry over the pears, then tuck the edges down the pan sides and under the fruit (see Gordon’s guide). Pierce the pastry a few times, then bake for 15 mins. If a lot of juice bubbles up the side of the pan, pour it off at this stage (see guide). Reduce oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4 and bake for 15 mins more until the pastry is golden. Leave the tart to stand for 10 mins, then invert it carefully onto a serving dish.","z":"将梨去核，然后尽可能整齐地去皮并切成两半。如果您愿意，可以提前一天准备好，然后将其放在冰箱中，不盖盖子，以便干燥。\r\n将糖、黄油、八角茴香、豆蔻和肉桂倒入约 20 厘米宽的耐热煎锅中，然后用大火加热直至冒泡。摇动锅并搅拌黄油酱，直至其分离并且糖焦糖化为太妃糖颜色。\r\n将梨放入锅中，然后在酱汁中煮 10-12 分钟，偶尔翻动一下，直至完全焦糖化。不要担心它们会燃烧——它们不会——但你想尽可能地将它们焦糖化。倒入白兰地并使其燃烧，然后将梨放在一边。\r\n将烤箱加热至 200C/风扇 180C/煤气 6. 将糕点擀成 1 英镑硬币的厚度。使用比平底锅顶部稍大的盘子，切出一个圆圈，然后按压糕点圆圈的边缘，使其变薄。\r\n当梨稍微冷却后，将它们放入锅中，切面朝上，呈花朵形状，梨的边缘朝内。将肉桂棒放在顶部中央，小豆蔻荚散落在周围。\r\n将糕点覆盖在梨上，然后将边缘塞入平底锅两侧和水果下方（参见戈登的指南）。在糕点上刺几个孔，然后烘烤15分钟。如果大量果汁在锅边冒泡，请在这个阶段将其倒掉（参见指南）。将烤箱温度降至 180C/风扇 160C/煤气 4，再烘烤 15 分钟，直至糕点呈金黄色。将馅饼静置 10 分钟，然后小心地将其倒扣到盘子上。"},{"id":"52847","n":"Pork Cassoulet","a":"France","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/wxuvuv1511299147.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MEdHMTD0VCA","i":[["Goose Fat","4 tbsp"],["Pork","350g"],["Onion","1 large"],["Garlic","10"],["Carrots","1 thinly sliced"],["Fennel Seeds","1 tsp"],["Red Wine Vinegar","2 tblsp"],["Vegetable Stock","600ml"],["Tomato Puree","1 tblsp"],["Rosemary","2 sticks"],["Parsley","Handful"],["Haricot Beans","400g"],["Breadcrumbs","2 tblsp"],["Oil","drizzle"],["Bread","to serve"],["Broccoli","to serve"]],"s":"Heat oven to 140C/120C fan/gas 1. Put a large ovenproof pan (with a tight-fitting lid) on a high heat. Add your fat and diced meat, cook for a few mins to seal the edges, giving it a quick stir to cook evenly. Reduce the heat to low, add the sliced onion, whole garlic cloves, carrot and fennel seeds, and cook gently to soften the veg for a few mins.\r\nPour over the red wine vinegar, scraping any meaty bits off the bottom of the pan. Add the stock, tomato purée, and half the rosemary and parsley. Bring to the boil and simmer for 10 mins, then season, cover with a lid and put into the oven for 2 hrs, removing the lid for the final hour of cooking. Stir occasionally and add the beans with 30 mins to go.\r\nRemove the pan from the oven and heat the grill. Scatter the top with the remaining herbs and breadcrumbs, drizzle a little oil over the top, and return to the oven for 5-10 mins, until the breadcrumbs are golden. Serve with crusty bread and green veg.","z":"将烤箱加热至 140C/120C 风扇/燃气 1. 将一个大的耐热锅（带有紧密配合的盖子）放在高温上。加入脂肪和肉丁，煮几分钟以密封边缘，快速搅拌以均匀烹饪。把火调小，加入切好的洋葱、整个蒜瓣、胡萝卜和茴香籽，轻轻煮几分钟，使蔬菜软化。\r\n倒入红酒醋，刮掉锅底的肉块。加入高汤、番茄泥、一半迷迭香和欧芹。煮沸后小火煮 10 分钟，然后调味，盖上盖子，放入烤箱烤 2 小时，最后一小时取下盖子。偶尔搅拌一下，并在还剩 30 分钟时加入豆子。\r\n从烤箱中取出平底锅并加热烤架。将剩余的香草和面包屑撒在顶部，在顶部淋上少许油，然后返回烤箱烤 5-10 分钟，直到面包屑呈金黄色。与硬皮面包和绿色蔬菜一起食用。"},{"id":"52922","n":"Prawn & Fennel Bisque","a":"France","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/rtwwvv1511799504.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4thpMbDakgM","i":[["Tiger Prawns","450g"],["Olive Oil","4 tbs"],["Onion","1 large"],["Fennel","1 large"],["Carrots","2 chopped"],["Dry White Wine","150ml"],["Brandy","1 tbs"],["Chopped Tomatoes","400g"],["Fish Stock","1L"],["Paprika","2 pinches"],["Double Cream","150ml"],["Prawns","8"]],"s":"Shell the prawns, then fry the shells in the oil in a large pan for about 5 mins. Add the onion, fennel and carrots and cook for about 10 mins until the veg start to soften. Pour in the wine and brandy, bubble hard for about 1 min to drive off the alcohol, then add the tomatoes, stock and paprika. Cover and simmer for 30 mins. Meanwhile, chop the prawns.\r\nBlitz the soup as finely as you can with a stick blender or food processor, then press through a sieve into a bowl. Spend a bit of time really working the mixture through the sieve as this will give the soup its velvety texture.\r\nTip back into a clean pan, add the prawns and cook for 10 mins, then blitz again until smooth. You can make and chill this a day ahead or freeze it for 1 month. Thaw ovenight in the fridge. To serve, gently reheat in a pan with the cream. If garnishing, cook the 8 prawns in a little butter. Spoon into small bowls and top with the prawns and snipped fennel fronds.","z":"将虾去壳，然后在大锅中将虾壳放入油中煎约5分钟。加入洋葱、茴香和胡萝卜，煮约 10 分钟，直至蔬菜开始变软。倒入葡萄酒和白兰地，用力泡约 1 分钟以去除酒精，然后加入西红柿、高汤和辣椒粉。盖上锅盖，煮 30 分钟。同时，将虾切碎。\r\n用棒式搅拌机或食品加工机将汤尽可能细地搅拌，然后通过筛子压入碗中。花一些时间将混合物过筛，因为这将使汤具有天鹅绒般的质地。\r\n倒回干净的锅中，加入虾煮 10 分钟，然后再次快速搅拌直至光滑。您可以提前一天制作并冷藏，也可以冷冻 1 个月。在冰箱中解冻过夜。食用时，将奶油放入平底锅中轻轻重新加热。如果装饰的话，用少许黄油煮 8 只大虾。用勺子舀进小碗里，上面放上虾和剪下来的茴香叶。"},{"id":"52921","n":"Provençal Omelette Cake","a":"France","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/qwtrtp1511799242.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=B7isFo2uP2k","i":[["Eggs","10"],["Olive Oil","1 tbs"],["Courgettes","2 finely chopped"],["Spring Onions","3 finely chopped"],["Red Pepper","4"],["Garlic Clove","1 clove peeled crushed"],["Red Chilli","1"],["Cream Cheese","300g"],["Milk","6 tblsp"],["Chives","4 tbs"],["Basil","2 tbs"],["Rocket","to serve"],["Parmesan","to serve"]],"s":"Break the eggs into two bowls, five in each. Whisk lightly and season with salt and pepper. Heat the oil in a pan, add the courgettes and spring onions, then fry gently for about 10 mins until softened. Cool, then stir into one bowl of eggs with a little salt and pepper. Add the roasted peppers to the other bowl of eggs with the garlic, chilli, salt and pepper.\r\nHeat a little oil in a 20-23cm frying pan, preferably non-stick. Pour the eggs with courgette into a measuring jug, then pourabout one-third of the mixture into the pan, swirling it to cover the base of the pan. Cook until the egg is set and lightly browned underneath, then cover the pan with a plate and invert the omelette onto it. Slide it back into the pan to cook the other side. Repeat with the remaining mix to make two more omelettes, adding a little oil to the pan each time. Stack the omelettes onto a plate. Make three omelettes in the same way with the red pepper mixture, then stack them on a separate plate.\r\nNow make the filling. Beat the cheese to soften it, then beat in the milk to make a spreadable consistency. Stir in the herbs, salt and pepper. Line a deep, 20-23cm round cake tin with cling film (use a tin the same size as the frying pan). Select the best red pepper omelette and place in the tin, prettiest side down. Spread with a thin layer of cheese filling, then cover with a courgette omelette. Repeat, alternating the layers, until all the omelettes and filling are in the tin, finishing with an omelette. Flip the cling film over the omelette, then chill for up to 24 hrs.\r\nTo serve, invert the omelette cake onto a serving plate and peel off the cling film. Pile rocket on the top and scatter over the cheese, a drizzle of olive oil and a little freshly ground black pepper. Serve cut into wedges.","z":"将鸡蛋打入两个碗中，每碗五个。轻轻搅拌并用盐和胡椒调味。锅中加热油，加入西葫芦和葱，然后轻轻煎约10分钟直至变软。冷却，然后加入一碗鸡蛋，加入少许盐和胡椒粉搅拌。将烤辣椒与大蒜、辣椒、盐和胡椒一起加入另一碗鸡蛋中。\r\n20-23厘米的煎锅中烧热少许油，最好是不粘锅。将鸡蛋和西葫芦倒入量杯中，然后将大约三分之一的混合物倒入锅中，旋转以覆盖锅底。煮至鸡蛋凝固并在下面呈浅棕色，然后用盘子盖住锅，并将煎蛋卷倒扣在上面。将其滑回锅中煮另一面。重复剩余的混合物，再制作两个煎蛋卷，每次在锅中加入一点油。将煎蛋卷堆放在盘子上。用红辣椒混合物以同样的方式制作三个煎蛋卷，然后将它们叠放在单独的盘子上。\r\n现在做馅料。搅打奶酪使其软化，然后加入牛奶搅打至可涂抹的稠度。拌入香草、盐和胡椒。在20-23厘米深的圆形蛋糕罐中铺上保鲜膜（使用与煎锅大小相同的罐子）。选择最好的红辣椒煎蛋卷，将最漂亮的一面朝下放入罐中。涂上一层薄薄的奶酪馅，然后盖上西葫芦煎蛋卷。重复此操作，交替分层，直到所有煎蛋卷和馅料都放入罐中，最后煎蛋卷。将保鲜膜翻转到煎蛋卷上，然后冷藏 24 小时。\r\n食用时，将煎蛋蛋糕倒扣到盘子上，然后撕掉保鲜膜。将芝麻菜堆在上面，撒在奶酪上，撒上一点橄榄油和一点现磨的黑胡椒。切成楔形即可食用。"},{"id":"52908","n":"Ratatouille","a":"France","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/wrpwuu1511786491.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BFdQUgAFtGU","i":[["Aubergine","2 large"],["Courgettes","4"],["Yellow Pepper","2"],["Tomato","4 large"],["Olive Oil","5 tbs"],["Basil","Bunch"],["Onion","1 medium"],["Garlic Clove","3 finely chopped"],["Red Wine Vinegar","1 tsp"],["Sugar","1 tsp"]],"s":"Cut the aubergines in half lengthways. Place them on the board, cut side down, slice in half lengthways again and then across into 1.5cm chunks. Cut off the courgettes ends, then across into 1.5cm slices. Peel the peppers from stalk to bottom. Hold upright, cut around the stalk, then cut into 3 pieces. Cut away any membrane, then chop into bite-size chunks.\r\nScore a small cross on the base of each tomato, then put them into a heatproof bowl. Pour boiling water over the tomatoes, leave for 20 secs, then remove. Pour the water away, replace the tomatoes and cover with cold water. Leave to cool, then peel the skin away. Quarter the tomatoes, scrape away the seeds with a spoon, then roughly chop the flesh.\r\nSet a sauté pan over medium heat and when hot, pour in 2 tbsp olive oil. Brown the aubergines for 5 mins on each side until the pieces are soft. Set them aside and fry the courgettes in another tbsp oil for 5 mins, until golden on both sides. Repeat with the peppers. Don’t overcook the vegetables at this stage, as they have some more cooking left in the next step.\r\nTear up the basil leaves and set aside. Cook the onion in the pan for 5 mins. Add the garlic and fry for a further min. Stir in the vinegar and sugar, then tip in the tomatoes and half the basil. Return the vegetables to the pan with some salt and pepper and cook for 5 mins. Serve with basil.","z":"将茄子纵向切成两半。将它们放在板上，切面朝下，再次纵向切成两半，然后切成 1.5 厘米的块。切掉西葫芦的末端，然后切成1.5厘米的片。将辣椒从茎部到底部剥皮。直立，围绕茎切，然后切成3块。切掉所有薄膜，然后切成一口大小的块。\r\n在每个番茄的底部划一个小十字，然后将它们放入耐热碗中。将沸水倒在西红柿上，放置 20 秒，然后取出。倒掉水，更换西红柿并用冷水覆盖。待冷却，然后剥去外皮。将西红柿切成四等分，用勺子刮去种子，然后粗略地切碎果肉。\r\n将炒锅置于中火上，热时倒入 2 汤匙橄榄油。将茄子每面煎 5 分钟，直至茄子变软。将它们放在一边，用另一汤匙油将西葫芦煎 5 分钟，直至两面金黄。对辣椒重复上述步骤。在这个阶段不要把蔬菜煮过头，因为下一步还需要煮更多的菜。\r\n撕下罗勒叶并放在一边。将洋葱放入锅中煮 5 分钟。加入大蒜，再炒一分钟。加入醋和糖，然后加入西红柿和一半罗勒。将蔬菜放回锅中，加入一些盐和胡椒，煮 5 分钟。与罗勒一起食用。"},{"id":"52935","n":"Steak Diane","a":"France","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/vussxq1511882648.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9rWZNHkrsNg","i":[["Canola Oil","2 tbs"],["Beef Fillet","4"],["Beef Stock","1 1/2 cup"],["Butter","2 tbs"],["Garlic","2 cloves minced"],["Challots","1 medium finely diced"],["Mushrooms","4 oz"],["Brandy","¼ cup"],["Heavy Cream","¼ cup"],["Dijon Mustard","1 tbs"],["Worcestershire Sauce","1 tbs"],["Tabasco Sauce","Dash"],["Parsley","1 tbs minced"],["Chives","1 tbs minced"],["Salt","to taste"],["Pepper","to taste"]],"s":"Heat oil in a 12\" skillet over medium-high heat. Season steaks with salt and pepper, and add to skillet; cook, turning once, until browned on both sides and cooked to desired doneness, about 4 to 5 minutes for medium-rare. Transfer steaks to a plate, and set aside.\r\nReturn skillet to high heat, and add stock; cook until reduced until to 1⁄2 cup, about 10 minutes. Pour into a bowl, and set aside. Return skillet to heat, and add butter; add garlic and shallots, and cook, stirring, until soft, about 2 minutes. Add mushrooms, and cook, stirring, until they release any liquid and it evaporates and mushrooms begin to brown, about 2 minutes. Add cognac, and light with a match to flambée; cook until flame dies down. Stir in reserved stock, cream, Dijon, Worcestershire, and hot sauce, and then return steaks to skillet; cook, turning in sauce, until warmed through and sauce is thickened, about 4 minutes. Transfer steak to serving plates and stir parsley and chives into sauce; pour sauce over steaks to serve.","z":"在 12 英寸煎锅中用中高火加热油。用盐和胡椒调味牛排，然后放入煎锅中；煮，翻转一次，直至两面都变成棕色并煮至所需的熟度，约 4 至 5 分钟，达到三分熟。将牛排转移到盘子中，放在一边。\r\n将煎锅重新加热，加入高汤；煮约 10 分钟，直至减少至 1⁄2 杯。倒入碗中，放在一边。将煎锅重新加热，加入黄油；加入大蒜和青葱，搅拌约 2 分钟直至变软。加入蘑菇，边煮边搅拌，直到蘑菇释放出液体并蒸发，蘑菇开始变成棕色，大约需要 2 分钟。加入干邑白兰地，并用火柴点燃火焰；煮至火焰熄灭。加入保留的高汤、奶油、第戎酱、伍斯特酱和辣酱，然后将牛排放回煎锅；煮约 4 分钟，加入酱汁，直至热透且酱汁变稠。将牛排转移到盘子中，将欧芹和细香葱搅拌成酱汁；将酱汁淋在牛排上即可食用。"},{"id":"52911","n":"Summer Pistou","a":"France","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/rqtxvr1511792990.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fyeqZJKEXp0","i":[["Rapeseed Oil","1 tbs"],["Leek","2 finely chopped"],["Courgettes","1 large"],["Vegetable Stock","1L"],["Cannellini Beans","400g"],["Green Beans","200g"],["Tomatoes","3 chopped"],["Garlic Clove","3 chopped"],["Basil","Small pack"],["Parmesan","40g"]],"s":"Heat the oil in a large pan and fry the leeks and courgette for 5 mins to soften. Pour in the stock, add three-quarters of the haricot beans with the green beans, half the tomatoes, and simmer for 5-8 mins until the vegetables are tender.\r\nMeanwhile, blitz the remaining beans and tomatoes, the garlic and basil in a food processor (or in a bowl with a stick blender) until smooth, then stir in the Parmesan. Stir the sauce into the soup, cook for 1 min, then ladle half into bowls or pour into a flask for a packed lunch. Chill the remainder. Will keep for a couple of days.","z":"在大平底锅中加热油，将韭菜和西葫芦炒5分钟使其变软。倒入高汤，加入四分之三的扁豆和青豆，一半的西红柿，煮5-8分钟，直到蔬菜变软。\r\n与此同时，将剩余的豆子和西红柿、大蒜和罗勒放入食品加工机（或带有棒式搅拌机的碗中），搅拌至光滑，然后加入帕尔马干酪。将酱汁拌入汤中，煮 1 分钟，然后将一半舀入碗中或倒入烧瓶中，作为盒装午餐。将剩余的部分冷却。将保留几天。"},{"id":"52909","n":"Tarte Tatin","a":"France","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/ryspuw1511786688.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8xDM8U6h9Pw","i":[["Puff Pastry","300g"],["Plain Flour","Dusting"],["Braeburn Apples","6"],["Caster Sugar","100g"],["Butter","85g"],["Creme Fraiche","to serve"]],"s":"Roll the pastry to a 3mm-thick round on a lightly floured surface and cut a 24cm circle, using a plate as a guide. Lightly prick all over with a fork, wrap in cling film on a baking sheet and freeze while preparing the apples.\r\nHeat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Peel, quarter and core the apples. Put the sugar in a flameproof 20cm ceramic Tatin dish or a 20cm ovenproof heavy-based frying pan and place over a medium-high heat. Cook the sugar for 5-7 mins to a dark amber caramel syrup that’s starting to smoke, then turn off the heat and stir in the 60g diced chilled butter.\r\nTo assemble the Tarte Tatin, arrange the apple quarters very tightly in a circle around the edge of the dish first, rounded-side down, then fill in the middle in a similar fashion. Gently press with your hands to ensure there are no gaps. Brush the fruit with the melted butter.\r\nBake in the oven for 30 mins, then remove and place the disc of frozen puff pastry on top – it will quickly defrost. Tuck the edges down the inside of the dish and, with a knife, prick a few holes in the pastry to allow steam to escape. Bake for a further 40-45 mins until the pastry is golden brown and crisp.\r\nAllow to cool to room temperature for 1 hr before running a knife around the edge of the dish and inverting it onto a large serving plate that is deep enough to contain the juices. Serve with crème fraîche or vanilla ice cream.","z":"在撒了少许面粉的表面上将糕点擀成 3 毫米厚的圆形，然后用盘子作为引导，切出 24 厘米的圆形。用叉子轻轻地刺破整个苹果，用保鲜膜包裹在烤盘上，然后在准备苹果时冷冻。\r\n用风扇/燃气将烤箱加热至 180C/160C 4. 将苹果去皮、切成四块并去核。将糖放入 20 厘米防火陶瓷 Tatin 盘或 20 厘米耐热厚底煎锅中，中火加热。将糖煮 5-7 分钟，直至变成开始冒烟的深琥珀色焦糖糖浆，然后关掉火，加入 60 克切块的冷冻黄油搅拌。\r\n要组装塔丁，首先将苹果块紧紧地围绕盘子边缘排列成一圈，圆角朝下，然后以类似的方式填入中间。用手轻轻按压，确保没有缝隙。在水果上刷上融化的黄油。\r\n在烤箱中烘烤 30 分钟，然后取出冷冻酥皮糕点并将其放在上面 - 它会很快解冻。将边缘塞进盘子内部，然后用刀在糕点上扎几个洞，让蒸汽逸出。再烘烤 40-45 分钟，直至糕点呈金黄色且酥脆。\r\n冷却至室温 1 小时，然后用刀在盘子边缘划一圈，然后将其倒置到一个足够深以容纳果汁的大盘子上。与法式酸奶油或香草冰淇淋一起食用。"},{"id":"52912","n":"Three-cheese souffles","a":"France","c":"Miscellaneous","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/sxwquu1511793428.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mS_gbQpBvZo","i":[["Butter","50g"],["Parmesan","25g"],["Milk","300ml"],["Bay Leaves","2"],["Plain Flour","5 tbs"],["English Mustard","½ tsp"],["Cayenne Pepper","Pod of"],["Gruyère","140g"],["Eggs","3"],["Goats Cheese","8 slices"],["Double Cream","150ml"],["Spinach","to serve"]],"s":"Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/ gas 6 and butter 4 small (about 200ml) ramekins. Sprinkle the Parmesan into the ramekins, turning until all sides are covered. Place the milk and bay leaves in a large saucepan over a gentle heat and bring to the boil. Turn off the heat and leave to infuse for 15 mins.\r\nDiscard the bay leaves, add the butter and flour, and return to a low heat. Very gently simmer, stirring continuously with a balloon whisk, for about 6 mins until you get a smooth, thick white sauce. Make sure that you get right into the corners of the pan to stop the sauce from catching or becoming lumpy.\r\nOnce thickened, transfer the sauce to a large bowl and stir in the mustard powder, cayenne pepper, Gruyère and egg yolks until fully combined.\r\nIn a spotlessly clean bowl and with a clean whisk, beat the egg whites just until peaks begin to form.\r\nCarefully fold the egg whites into the cheese sauce in three stages making sure you fold, rather than stir, to keep the egg whites light and airy. Fill the prepared ramekins with the soufflé mix.\r\nTop each soufflé with a slice of goat’s cheese, then place on a baking tray. Bake for 20-25 mins or until springy and well risen but cooked through.\r\nLeave to cool, then run a knife around the edge of each dish and remove the soufflés. If preparing in advance, place soufflés upside down (for neat presentation), on a tray. Cover tray in cling film. Chill for a few days or freeze for up to 1 month.\r\nWhen ready to re-bake, heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Place the upside-down soufflés in a shallow baking dish, top with the remaining goat’s cheese slices and pour over the cream (this stops them from drying out when baked for the second time). Cook for 8-10 mins until golden. Serve immediately alongside some simply dressed salad.","z":"将烤箱加热至 200C/180C 风扇/煤气 6 和黄油 4 个小模子（约 200 毫升）。将帕尔马干酪撒入小模子中，翻转直至所有面都被覆盖。将牛奶和月桂叶放入大平底锅中，用小火煮沸。关掉火，静置 15 分钟。\r\n丢弃月桂叶，加入黄油和面粉，然后重新调小火。轻轻地煮约 6 分钟，用气球搅拌器不断搅拌，直到得到光滑浓稠的白酱。确保你正好进入平底锅的角落，以防止酱汁粘住或结块。\r\n一旦变稠，将酱汁转移到一个大碗中，加入芥末粉、辣椒、格鲁耶尔干酪和蛋黄，搅拌直至完全混合。\r\n在一个一尘不染的碗中，用干净的搅拌器，搅打蛋白，直至开始形成峰状。\r\n分三个阶段小心地将蛋白拌入奶酪酱中，确保折叠而不是搅拌，以保持蛋白轻盈和透气。将舒芙蕾混合物填入准备好的小模子中。\r\n在每个舒芙蕾上放一片山羊奶酪，然后放在烤盘上。烘烤 20-25 分钟或直至有弹性且充分发酵但已煮熟。\r\n待冷却，然后用刀在每道菜的边缘划一圈，取出蛋奶酥。如果提前准备，请将蛋奶酥倒置（为了整齐地展示）放在托盘上。用保鲜膜盖住托盘。冷藏几天或冷冻最多 1 个月。\r\n准备重新烘烤时，将烤箱加热至 200C/180C 风扇/燃气 6. 将颠倒的舒芙蕾放入浅烤盘中，上面放上剩余的山羊奶酪片，然后倒在奶油上（这样可以防止第二次烘烤时它们变干）。煮8-10分钟直至金黄。立即与一些简单的沙拉一起食用。"},{"id":"52852","n":"Tuna Nicoise","a":"France","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/yypwwq1511304979.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3_UAxkx0u6U","i":[["Potatoes","450g"],["Olive Oil","2 tblsp"],["Eggs","4"],["Red Wine Vinegar","1 tbls"],["Capers","2 tblsp"],["Sunflower Oil","50g"],["Red Onions","½"],["Spinach","100g"],["Tuna","400g"]],"s":"Heat oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6. Toss the potatoes with 2 tsp oil and some seasoning. Tip onto a large baking tray, then roast for 20 mins, stirring halfway, until crisp, golden and cooked through.\r\nMeanwhile, put eggs in a small pan of water, bring to the boil, then simmer for 8-10 mins, depending on how you like them cooked. Plunge into a bowl of cold water to cool for a few mins. Peel away the shells, then cut into halves.\r\nIn a large salad bowl, whisk together the remaining oil, red wine vinegar, capers and chopped tomatoes. Season, tip in the onion, spinach, tuna and potatoes, then gently toss together. Top with the eggs, then serve straight away.","z":"将烤箱加热至 200C/风扇 180C/煤气 6. 将土豆与 2 茶匙油和一些调味料搅拌。倒在一个大烤盘上，然后烤 20 分钟，中途搅拌，直至酥脆、金黄并煮熟。\r\n与此同时，将鸡蛋放入一小锅水中，煮沸，然后煮8-10分钟，具体取决于您喜欢的煮法。放入一碗冷水中冷却几分钟。剥去壳，然后切成两半。\r\n在一个大沙拉碗中，将剩余的油、红酒醋、刺山柑和切碎的西红柿搅拌在一起。调味，加入洋葱、菠菜、金枪鱼和土豆，然后轻轻搅拌在一起。上面撒上鸡蛋，然后立即食用。"},{"id":"52917","n":"White chocolate creme brulee","a":"France","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/uryqru1511798039.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LmJ0lsPLHDc","i":[["Double Cream","568ml"],["White Chocolate Chips","100g"],["Vanilla","Pod of"],["Egg Yolks","6"],["Caster Sugar","2 tbs"],["Caster Sugar","Top"]],"s":"Heat the cream, chocolate and vanilla pod in a pan until the chocolate has melted. Take off the heat and allow to infuse for 10 mins, scraping the pod seeds into the cream. If using the vanilla extract, add straight away. Heat oven to 160C/fan 140C/gas 3.\r\nBeat yolks and sugar until pale. stir in the chocolate cream. Strain into a jug and pour into ramekins. Place in a deep roasting tray and pour boiling water halfway up the sides. Bake for 15-20 mins until just set with a wobbly centre. Chill in the fridge for at least 4 hrs.\r\nTo serve, sprinkle some sugar on top of the brûlées and caramelise with a blowtorch or briefly under a hot grill. Leave caramel to harden, then serve.","z":"将奶油、巧克力和香草荚放入平底锅中加热，直至巧克力融化。关掉火，浸泡 10 分钟，将豆荚籽刮入奶油中。如果使用香草精，请立即添加。将烤箱加热至 160C/风扇 140C/燃气 3.\r\n将蛋黄和糖搅打至发白。拌入巧克力奶油。滤入罐中并倒入小模子中。放入深烤盘中，将沸水倒入两侧的一半处。烘烤 15-20 分钟，直至中心稍微凝固。在冰箱中冷藏至少 4 小时。\r\n食用时，在布丁上撒一些糖，然后用喷灯或在热烤架下短暂焦糖化。让焦糖变硬，然后上桌。"},{"id":"53011","n":"Chicken Quinoa Greek Salad","a":"Greek","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/k29viq1585565980.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=akcrkXYr61M","i":[["Quinoa","225g"],["Butter","25g"],["Red Chilli","1 chopped"],["Garlic","1 clove finely chopped"],["Chicken Breast","400g"],["Olive Oil","2 tbs"],["Black Olives","Handful"],["Red Onions","1 chopped"],["Feta","100g"],["Mint","Chopped"],["Lemon","Juice of 1/2"]],"s":"Cook the quinoa following the pack instructions, then rinse in cold water and drain thoroughly.\r\n\r\nMeanwhile, mix the butter, chilli and garlic into a paste. Toss the chicken fillets in 2 tsp of the olive oil with some seasoning. Lay in a hot griddle pan and cook for 3-4 mins each side or until cooked through. Transfer to a plate, dot with the spicy butter and set aside to melt.\r\n\r\nNext, tip the tomatoes, olives, onion, feta and mint into a bowl. Toss in the cooked quinoa. Stir through the remaining olive oil, lemon juice and zest, and season well. Serve with the chicken fillets on top, drizzled with any buttery chicken juices.","z":"按照包装说明煮藜麦，然后用冷水冲洗并彻底沥干。\r\n\r\n同时，将黄油、辣椒和大蒜混合成糊状。将鸡柳放入 2 茶匙橄榄油中，加入一些调味料。放入热煎锅中，每面煎 3-4 分钟或直至熟透。转移到盘子上，撒上辣黄油，放在一边融化。\r\n\r\n接下来，将西红柿、橄榄、洋葱、羊乳酪和薄荷倒入碗中。倒入煮熟的藜麦。将剩余的橄榄油、柠檬汁和柠檬皮碎搅拌均匀，然后调味。将鸡肉片放在上面，淋上黄油鸡汁即可食用。"},{"id":"52764","n":"Garides Saganaki","a":"Greek","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/wuvryu1468232995.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uO0ejc85zSE","i":[["Raw king prawns","500g"],["Olive oil","3 tablespoons"],["Chopped onion","1"],["Freshly chopped parsley","pinch"],["White wine","250ml"],["Chopped tomatoes","1 (400g) tin"],["Minced garlic","1/2 teaspoon"],["Cubed Feta cheese","1 (200g) pack"]],"s":"Place the prawns in a pot and add enough water to cover. Boil for 5 minutes. Drain, reserving the liquid, and set aside.\r\nHeat 2 tablespoons of oil in a saucepan. Add the onion; cook and stir until soft. Mix in the parsley, wine, tomatoes, garlic and remaining olive oil. Simmer, stirring occasionally, for about 30 minutes, or until the sauce is thickened.\r\nWhile the sauce is simmering, the prawns should become cool enough to handle. First remove the legs by pinching them, and then pull off the shells, leaving the head and tail on.\r\nWhen the sauce has thickened, stir in the prawns. Bring to a simmer again if the sauce has cooled with the prawns, and cook for about 5 minutes. Add the feta and remove from the heat. Let stand until the cheese starts to melt. Serve warm with slices of crusty bread.\r\nThough completely untraditional, you can add a few tablespoons of stock or passata to this recipe to make a delicious pasta sauce. Toss with pasta after adding the feta, and serve.","z":"将虾放入锅中，加入足够的水覆盖虾。煮5分钟。沥干，保留液体，放在一边。\r\n在平底锅中加热 2 汤匙油。加入洋葱；煮并搅拌直至变软。加入欧芹、葡萄酒、西红柿、大蒜和剩余的橄榄油。煮约 30 分钟，偶尔搅拌，或直至酱汁变稠。\r\n当酱汁在煮的时候，虾应该已经冷却到可以处理的程度了。首先捏住腿，把腿去掉，然后把壳剥下来，留下头和尾。\r\n当酱汁变稠时，加入虾搅拌。如果酱汁和虾一起冷却，再次煮沸，煮约 5 分钟。添加羊乳酪并从火上移开。静置直至奶酪开始融化。与硬皮面包片一起趁热食用。\r\n虽然完全不传统，但您可以在这个食谱中添加几汤匙高汤或帕萨塔，制成美味的意大利面酱。添加羊乳酪后，与意大利面一起搅拌，即可食用。"},{"id":"53012","n":"Gigantes Plaki","a":"Greek","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/b79r6f1585566277.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=e-2K2iyPASA","i":[["Butter Beans","400g"],["Olive Oil","3 tbs"],["Onion","1 chopped"],["Garlic Clove","2 chopped"],["Tomato Puree","2 tbs"],["Tomatoes","800g"],["Sugar","1 tbs"],["Dried Oregano","1 tbs"],["Cinnamon","Pinch"],["Chopped Parsley","2 tbs"]],"s":"Soak the beans overnight in plenty of water. Drain, rinse, then place in a pan covered with water. Bring to the boil, reduce the heat, then simmer for approx 50 mins until slightly tender but not soft. Drain, then set aside.\r\n\r\nHeat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Heat the olive oil in a large frying pan, tip in the onion and garlic, then cook over a medium heat for 10 mins until softened but not browned. Add the tomato purée, cook for a further min, add remaining ingredients, then simmer for 2-3 mins. Season generously, then stir in the beans. Tip into a large ovenproof dish, then bake for approximately 1 hr, uncovered and without stirring, until the beans are tender. The beans will absorb all the fabulous flavours and the sauce will thicken. Allow to cool, then scatter with parsley and drizzle with a little more olive oil to serve.","z":"将豆子在大量水中浸泡过夜。沥干、冲洗，然后放入装有水的锅中。煮沸，调小火，然后小火煮约 50 分钟，直至稍微变软但不软。沥干，然后放在一边。\r\n\r\n将烤箱加热至 180C/160C 风扇/燃气 4. 在大煎锅中加热橄榄油，倒入洋葱和大蒜，然后用中火煮 10 分钟，直至变软但不会变成褐色。加入番茄泥，再煮一分钟，加入剩余的原料，然后煮 2-3 分钟。充分调味，然后拌入豆子。倒入一个耐热的大盘中，然后不盖盖子且不搅拌地烘烤约 1 小时，直至豆子变软。豆子会吸收所有美妙的味道，酱汁也会变稠。待冷却，然后撒上欧芹，再淋上一点橄榄油即可食用。"},{"id":"53007","n":"Honey Yogurt Cheesecake","a":"Greek","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/y2irzl1585563479.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JE8crtueXs8","i":[["Digestive Biscuits","100g"],["Almonds","85g"],["Butter","85g"],["Greek Yogurt","250ml"],["Mascarpone","750g"],["Eggs","2"],["Lemon","Zest of 1"],["Orange","Zest of 1"],["Honey","250ml"],["Fruit Mix","To serve"]],"s":"Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3. Crush the biscuits and most of the almonds inside a plastic food bag using a rolling pin. Mix with the butter, then press into the bottom of a deep, oval, 23cm dish (or something similar in size – a roasting tin, baking dish or cake tin will work). Bake for 10 mins until crisp.\r\n\r\nStir or mash together the yogurt and mascarpone, then whisk in the eggs, one at a time. Stir in the lemon and orange zests, then stir in most of the honey, reserving about 3 tbsp. Spread over the biscuit base, cover loosely with foil and cook for 1 hr. Remove the foil and cook for 15 mins more until lightly golden and the top is firm with just the slightest wobble in the middle. Leave to cool. Can be kept in the fridge for up to 2 days.\r\n\r\nTo serve, scatter with almonds, drizzle over the remaining honey, and hand around fresh fruit to go with it.","z":"将烤箱加热至 160C/140C 风扇/燃气 3. 用擀面杖将饼干和大部分杏仁压碎，放入塑料食品袋中。与黄油混合，然后压入 23 厘米深椭圆形盘子（或类似尺寸的东西 - 烤盘、烤盘或蛋糕盘都可以）的底部。烘烤 10 分钟直至酥脆。\r\n\r\n将酸奶和马斯卡彭搅拌或捣碎，然后加入鸡蛋，一次一个。加入柠檬皮和橙皮碎，然后加入大部分蜂蜜，保留约 3 汤匙。铺在饼干底上，用箔纸松松地覆盖，煮 1 小时。去掉箔纸，再煮 15 分钟，直到表面呈浅金黄色，顶部变硬，中间只有轻微的晃动。让它冷却。可在冰箱中保存长达 2 天。\r\n\r\n食用时，撒上杏仁，淋上剩余的蜂蜜，然后递上新鲜水果来搭配。"},{"id":"53010","n":"Lamb Tzatziki Burgers","a":"Greek","c":"Lamb","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/k420tj1585565244.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=s7_TF4ZHjPc","i":[["Bulgur Wheat","25g"],["Lamb Mince","500g"],["Cumin","1 tsp"],["Coriander","1 tsp"],["Paprika","1 tsp"],["Garlic","1 clove finely chopped"],["Olive Oil","For frying"],["Bun","4"],["Cucumber","Grated"],["Greek Yogurt","200g"],["Mint","2 tbs"]],"s":"Tip the bulghar into a pan, cover with water and boil for 10 mins. Drain really well in a sieve, pressing out any excess water.\r\n\r\nTo make the tzatziki, squeeze and discard the juice from the cucumber, then mix into the yogurt with the chopped mint and a little salt.\r\n\r\nWork the bulghar into the lamb with the spices, garlic (if using) and seasoning, then shape into 4 burgers. Brush with a little oil and fry or barbecue for about 5 mins each side until cooked all the way through. Serve in the buns (toasted if you like) with the tzatziki, tomatoes, onion and a few mint leaves.","z":"将 bulghar 倒入锅中，加水盖住，煮 10 分钟。用筛子充分沥干，挤出多余的水。\r\n\r\n制作酸奶黄瓜酱时，将黄瓜汁挤出并丢弃，然后与切碎的薄荷和少许盐混合到酸奶中。\r\n\r\n将保加利亚肉与香料、大蒜（如果使用）和调味料一起放入羊肉中，然后制成 4 个汉堡。刷上少许油，每面煎或烧烤约 5 分钟，直至完全煮熟。与酸奶黄瓜酱、西红柿、洋葱和一些薄荷叶一起放入面包（如果您喜欢的话，可以烤）。"},{"id":"53009","n":"Lamb and Lemon Souvlaki","a":"Greek","c":"Lamb","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/rjhf741585564676.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=krR4rhjR75Y","i":[["Garlic","2 cloves"],["Sea Salt","2 tsp"],["Olive Oil","4 tbs"],["Lemon","Zest and juice of 1"],["Dill","1 tbs"],["Lamb Leg","750g"],["Pita Bread","To serve"]],"s":"Pound the garlic with sea salt in a pestle and mortar (or use a small food processor), until the garlic forms a paste. Whisk together the oil, lemon juice, zest, dill and garlic. Mix in the lamb and combine well. Cover and marinate for at least 2 hrs or overnight in the fridge. If you’re going to use bamboo skewers, soak them in cold water.\r\n\r\nIf you’ve prepared the lamb the previous day, take it out of the fridge 30 mins before cooking. Thread the meat onto the soaked or metal skewers. Heat the grill to high or have a hot griddle pan or barbecue ready. Cook the skewers for 2-3 mins on each side, basting with the remaining marinade. Heat the pitta or flatbreads briefly, then stuff with the souvlaki. Add Greek salad (see 'Goes well with', right) and Tzatziki (below), if you like.","z":"用杵和研钵（或使用小型食品加工机）将大蒜与海盐一起捣碎，直到大蒜形成糊状。将油、柠檬汁、热情、莳萝和大蒜搅拌在一起。拌入羊肉并充分混合。盖上盖子并在冰箱中腌制至少 2 小时或过夜。如果您要使用竹串，请将它们浸泡在冷水中。\r\n\r\n如果您前一天准备了羊肉，请在烹饪前 30 分钟将其从冰箱中取出。将肉串到浸泡过的肉串或金属串上。将烤架加热至高温或准备好热煎锅或烧烤架。将烤串每面煮 2-3 分钟，涂上剩余的腌料。短暂加热皮塔饼或大饼，然后塞入烤肉串。如果您愿意，可以添加希腊沙拉（参见右侧的“搭配”）和酸奶黄瓜酱（如下）。"},{"id":"53006","n":"Moussaka","a":"Greek","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/ctg8jd1585563097.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8U_29i9Qp5U","i":[["Beef","500g"],["Aubergine","1 large"],["Greek Yogurt","150g"],["Egg","1 beaten"],["Parmesan","3 tbs"],["Tomato","400g"],["Tomato Puree","4 tbs"],["Potatoes","350g"]],"s":"Heat the grill to high. Brown the beef in a deep ovenproof frying pan over a high heat for 5 mins. Meanwhile, prick the aubergine with a fork, then microwave on High for 3-5 mins until soft. Mix the yogurt, egg and parmesan together, then add a little seasoning.\r\n\r\nStir the tomatoes, purée and potatoes in with the beef with some seasoning and heat through. Smooth the surface of the beef mixture with the back of a spoon, then slice the cooked aubergine and arrange on top. Pour the yogurt mixture over the aubergines, smooth out evenly, then grill until the topping has set and turned golden.","z":"将烤架加热至高温。将牛肉放入耐热深煎锅中，用高温煎 5 分钟。同时，用叉子在茄子上扎孔，然后用微波炉高火加热 3-5 分钟直至茄子变软。将酸奶、鸡蛋和帕尔马干酪混合在一起，然后加入少许调味料。\r\n\r\n将西红柿、果泥和土豆与牛肉和一些调味料一起搅拌，然后加热。用勺子背面抹平牛肉混合物的表面，然后将煮熟的茄子切片并放在上面。将酸奶混合物倒在茄子上，均匀抹平，然后烤至茄子凝固并变成金黄色。"},{"id":"53008","n":"Stuffed Lamb Tomatoes","a":"Greek","c":"Lamb","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/u55lbp1585564013.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KfJp-QfrCz4","i":[["Tomatoes","4 large"],["Sugar","Pinch"],["Olive Oil","4 tbs"],["Onion","1 chopped"],["Garlic Clove","2 finely chopped"],["Lamb","200g"],["Cinnamon","1 tbs"],["Tomato Puree","2 tbs chopped"],["Rice","50g"],["Chicken Stock","100ml"],["Dill","4 tbs"],["Chopped Parsley","2 tbs"],["Mint","1 tbs"]],"s":"Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Slice the tops off the tomatoes and reserve. Scoop out most of the pulp with a teaspoon, being careful not to break the skin. Finely chop the pulp, and keep any juices. Sprinkle the insides of the tomatoes with a little sugar to take away the acidity, then place them on a baking tray.\r\n\r\nHeat 2 tbsp olive oil in a large frying pan, add the onion and garlic, then gently cook for about 10 mins until soft but not coloured. Add the lamb, cinnamon and tomato purée, turn up the heat, then fry until the meat is browned. Add the tomato pulp and juice, the rice and the stock. Season generously. Bring to the boil, then simmer for 15 mins or until the rice is tender and the liquid has been absorbed. Set aside to cool a little, then stir in the herbs.\r\n\r\nStuff the tomatoes up to the brim, top tomatoes with their lids, drizzle with 2 tbsp more olive oil, sprinkle 3 tbsp water into the tray, then bake for 35 mins. Serve with salad and crusty bread, hot or cold.","z":"将烤箱加热至 180C/160C 风扇/燃气 4. 将番茄顶部切掉并备用。用茶匙舀出大部分果肉，小心不要弄破皮肤。将果肉切碎，保留汁液。在西红柿内部撒上少许糖以去除酸味，然后将它们放在烤盘上。\r\n\r\n在大煎锅中加热 2 汤匙橄榄油，加入洋葱和大蒜，然后轻轻煮约 10 分钟，直至变软但不变色。加入羊肉、肉桂和番茄泥，将火调高，然后煎至肉变成棕色。加入番茄果肉和番茄汁、大米和高汤。慷慨地调味。煮沸，然后小火煮 15 分钟或直至米变软并且液体被吸收。放在一边稍微冷却，然后拌入香草。\r\n\r\n将西红柿填满，盖上西红柿的盖子，再淋上2汤匙橄榄油，在烤盘中撒上3汤匙水，然后烘烤35分钟。与沙拉和硬皮面包一起食用，冷热均可。"},{"id":"52807","n":"Baingan Bharta","a":"India","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/urtpqw1487341253.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-84Zz2EP4h4","i":[["Aubergine","1 large"],["Onion","½ cup"],["Tomatoes","1 cup"],["Garlic","6 cloves"],["Green Chilli","1"],["Red Chilli Powder","¼ teaspoon"],["Oil","1.5 tablespoon"],["Coriander Leaves","1 tablespoon chopped"],["salt","as required"]],"s":"Rinse the baingan (eggplant or aubergine) in water. Pat dry with a kitchen napkin. Apply some oil all over and\r\nkeep it for roasting on an open flame. You can also grill the baingan or roast in the oven. But then you won't get\r\nthe smoky flavor of the baingan. Keep the eggplant turning after a 2 to 3 minutes on the flame, so that its evenly\r\ncooked. You could also embed some garlic cloves in the baingan and then roast it.\r\n2. Roast the aubergine till its completely cooked and tender. With a knife check the doneness. The knife should slid\r\neasily in aubergines without any resistance. Remove the baingan and immerse in a bowl of water till it cools\r\ndown.\r\n3. You can also do the dhungar technique of infusing charcoal smoky flavor in the baingan. This is an optional step.\r\nUse natural charcoal for this method. Heat a small piece of charcoal on flame till it becomes smoking hot and red.\r\n4. Make small cuts on the baingan with a knife. Place the red hot charcoal in the same plate where the roasted\r\naubergine is kept. Add a few drops of oil on the charcoal. The charcoal would begin to smoke.\r\n5. As soon as smoke begins to release from the charcoal, cover the entire plate tightly with a large bowl. Allow the\r\ncharcoal smoke to get infused for 1 to 2 minutes. The more you do, the more smoky the baingan bharta will\r\nbecome. I just keep for a minute. Alternatively, you can also do this dhungar method once the baingan bharta is\r\ncooked, just like the way we do for Dal Tadka.\r\n6. Peel the skin from the roasted and smoked eggplant.\r\n7. Chop the cooked eggplant finely or you can even mash it.\r\n8. In a kadai or pan, heat oil. Then add finely chopped onions and garlic.\r\n9. Saute the onions till translucent. Don't brown them.\r\n10. Add chopped green chilies and saute for a minute.\r\n11. Add the chopped tomatoes and mix it well.\r\n12. Bhuno (saute) the tomatoes till the oil starts separating from the mixture.\r\n13. Now add the red chili powder. Stir and mix well.\r\n14. Add the chopped cooked baingan.\r\n15. Stir and mix the chopped baingan very well with the onion­tomato masala mixture.\r\n16. Season with salt. Stir and saute for some more 4 to 5 minutes more.\r\n17. Finally stir in the coriander leaves with the baingan bharta or garnish it with them. Serve Baingan Bharta with\r\nphulkas, rotis or chapatis. It goes well even with bread, toasted or grilled bread and plain rice or jeera rice.","z":"用水冲洗 baingan（茄子或茄子）。用厨房餐巾拍干。全身涂上一些油，然后\r\n将其放在明火上烘烤。您还可以烧烤 baingan 或在烤箱中烘烤。但那样你就不会得到\r\nbaingan 的烟熏味。大火烧2-3分钟后，继续翻动茄子，使其均匀\r\n煮熟了。你也可以在baingan中嵌入一些蒜瓣，然后烘烤。\r\n2. 将茄子烤至完全熟透。用刀检查熟度。刀应该滑动\r\n轻松地进入茄子，没有任何抵抗力。将baingan取出并浸入一碗水中直至冷却\r\n下来。\r\n3.您还可以采用dhungar技术，在baingan中注入木炭烟熏味。这是一个可选步骤。\r\n此方法使用天然木炭。将一小块木炭放在火焰上加热，直到它变得冒烟且呈红色。\r\n4.用刀在baingan上划一些小口。将烧红的木炭放在烤过的盘子里\r\n茄子被保留。在木炭上滴几滴油。木炭开始冒烟。\r\n5. 一旦木炭开始冒烟，就用一个大碗盖紧整个盘子。允许\r\n木炭烟雾注入1至2分钟。你做得越多，baingan bharta 的烟雾就越多\r\n成为。我只保留一分钟。或者，您也可以在 baingan bharta 完成后执行此 dhungar 方法。\r\n煮熟，就像我们做 Dal Tadka 的方式一样。\r\n6.将烤熏茄子剥皮。\r\n7. 煮熟的茄子切碎，也可以捣碎。\r\n8. 在卡代或平底锅中，加热油。然后加入切碎的洋葱和大蒜。\r\n9.将洋葱炒至半透明。不要把它们变成棕色。\r\n10.加入切碎的青辣椒，炒一分钟。\r\n11.加入切碎的西红柿，搅拌均匀。\r\n12. Bhuno（炒）西红柿，直到油开始从混合物中分离出来。\r\n13.现在加入红辣椒粉。搅拌并混合均匀。\r\n14.加入切碎的煮熟的baingan。\r\n15.将切碎的baingan与洋葱番茄玛莎拉混合物搅拌均匀。\r\n16.加盐调味。再搅拌并炒4至5分钟。\r\n17. 最后将香菜叶与 baingan bharta 一起搅拌或用香菜叶装饰。与 Baingan Bharta 一起享用\r\nphulkas、rotis 或 chapatis。它甚至可以搭配面包、烤面包或烤面包以及白米饭或吉拉米饭。"},{"id":"53359","n":"Beef Mandi","a":"India","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/1nalo51765188375.jpg","y":"","i":[["Basmati Rice","1 kg"],["Beef Stock","5 Cups"],["Onion","2 medium"],["Garlic","5 chopped cloves"],["Green Chilli","2"],["Tomato","1 small"],["Salt","2 1/2 Tsp"],["Oil","3  tablespoons"],["Turmeric Powder","1 ½ tsp"],["Cardamom","1/2 tsp"],["Cloves","1/2 tsp"],["Bay Leaf","1/2 tsp"]],"s":"1. Wash the beef and cut into large pieces. Season lightly with salt and turmeric.\r\n2. Heat ghee/oil in a large pot. Add sliced onions and sauté until light golden.\r\n3. Add garlic, green chilies, and tomato; cook until softened.\r\n4. Add the mandi spice mix: coriander, cumin, black pepper, cinnamon, cardamom, cloves, and bay leaves.\r\n5. Add beef pieces and stir on medium heat until the meat is well coated with spices.\r\n6. Pour in water or beef stock. Cover and simmer until beef is tender (about 1.5–2 hours depending on cut).\r\n7. Remove beef carefully and set aside. Strain and measure the broth.\r\n8. Add washed, soaked basmati rice to the broth (usually 1 cup rice = 1.5–2 cups liquid). Adjust seasoning and bring to a boil.\r\n9. Lower heat, cover, and cook the rice until fluffy.\r\n10. Place the beef pieces over the rice and steam on low heat for 10 minutes so flavors combine.\r\n11. Optional: For smoky flavor, place a small hot charcoal on foil in the pot, add 1 tsp butter/oil, immediately cover for 5 minutes. Remove coal before serving.\r\n12. Fluff rice and serve beef mandi with salad or chutney.\r\n","z":"1.牛肉洗净，切成大块。用盐和姜黄轻轻调味。\r\n2. 在大锅中加热酥油/油。加入洋葱片，炒至浅金黄色。\r\n3.加入大蒜、青辣椒、番茄；煮至软化。\r\n4. 加入曼迪香料混合物：香菜、小茴香、黑胡椒、肉桂、小豆蔻、丁香和月桂叶。\r\n5. 加入牛肉块，中火搅拌，直至肉充分裹上香料。\r\n6.倒入水或牛肉高汤。盖上锅盖，小火煮至牛肉变软（约 1.5-2 小时，具体取决于切割情况）。\r\n7.小心地取出牛肉并放在一边。过滤并测量肉汤。\r\n8. 将洗净、浸泡的印度香米加入肉汤中（通常 1 杯米 = 1.5-2 杯液体）。调整调味料并煮沸。\r\n9. 调小火，盖上盖子，煮米饭直至松软。\r\n10. 将牛肉片放在米饭上，小火蒸 10 分钟，使味道融合。\r\n11. 可选：如需烟熏味，可在锅中的箔纸上放一小块热木炭，加入 1 茶匙黄油/油，立即盖上盖子煮 5 分钟。食用前先除去煤炭。\r\n12. 将米饭弄松，然后将牛肉曼迪与沙拉或酸辣酱一起食用。"},{"id":"53076","n":"Bread omelette","a":"India","c":"Breakfast","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/hqaejl1695738653.jpg","y":"","i":[["Bread","2"],["Egg","2"],["Salt","0.5"]],"s":"Make and enjoy","z":"制作并享受"},{"id":"52795","n":"Chicken Handi","a":"India","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/wyxwsp1486979827.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IO0issT0Rmc","i":[["Chicken","1.2 kg"],["Onion","5 thinly sliced"],["Tomatoes","2 finely chopped"],["Garlic","8 cloves chopped"],["Ginger paste","1 tbsp"],["Vegetable oil","¼ cup"],["Cumin seeds","2 tsp"],["Coriander seeds","3 tsp"],["Turmeric powder","1 tsp"],["Chilli powder","1 tsp"],["Green chilli","2"],["Yogurt","1 cup"],["Cream","¾ cup"],["fenugreek","3 tsp Dried"],["Garam masala","1 tsp"],["Salt","To taste"]],"s":"Take a large pot or wok, big enough to cook all the chicken, and heat the oil in it. Once the oil is hot, add sliced onion and fry them until deep golden brown. Then take them out on a plate and set aside.\r\nTo the same pot, add the chopped garlic and sauté for a minute. Then add the chopped tomatoes and cook until tomatoes turn soft. This would take about 5 minutes.\r\nThen return the fried onion to the pot and stir. Add ginger paste and sauté well.\r\nNow add the cumin seeds, half of the coriander seeds and chopped green chillies. Give them a quick stir.\r\nNext goes in the spices – turmeric powder and red chilli powder. Sauté the spices well for couple of minutes.\r\nAdd the chicken pieces to the wok, season it with salt to taste and cook the chicken covered on medium-low heat until the chicken is almost cooked through. This would take about 15 minutes. Slowly sautéing the chicken will enhance the flavor, so do not expedite this step by putting it on high heat.\r\nWhen the oil separates from the spices, add the beaten yogurt keeping the heat on lowest so that the yogurt doesn’t split. Sprinkle the remaining coriander seeds and add half of the dried fenugreek leaves. Mix well.\r\nFinally add the cream and give a final mix to combine everything well.\r\nSprinkle the remaining kasuri methi and garam masala and serve the chicken handi hot with naan or rotis. Enjoy!","z":"拿一个大锅或炒锅，足够大，可以煮所有的鸡肉，然后在里面加热油。油热后，加入切好的洋葱，炒至深金黄色。然后将它们取出放在盘子上并放在一边。\r\n在同一个锅中，加入切碎的大蒜，炒一分钟。然后加入切碎的西红柿，煮至西红柿变软。这大约需要 5 分钟。\r\n然后将炸好的洋葱放回锅中并搅拌。加入姜酱并炒匀。\r\n现在加入小茴香籽、一半香菜籽和切碎的青辣椒。快速搅拌一下。\r\n接下来是香料——姜黄粉和红辣椒粉。将香料炒几分钟。\r\n将鸡肉块放入锅中，加盐调味，然后用中小火将鸡肉煮至鸡肉几乎熟透。这大约需要 15 分钟。慢慢炒鸡肉会增强风味，所以不要通过高温来加快这一步。\r\n当油与香料分离时，加入打好的酸奶，保持最低温度，这样酸奶就不会分裂。撒上剩余的香菜籽，加入一半干胡芦巴叶。搅拌均匀。\r\n最后加入奶油并进行最终混合，使所有成分充分混合。\r\n撒上剩余的 kasuri methi 和 garam masala，然后将鸡肉 Handi 与印度烤饼或烤肉一起上桌。享受！"},{"id":"53358","n":"Chicken Mandi","a":"India","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/er4d081765186828.jpg","y":"","i":[["Chicken","1"],["Basmati Rice","2 cups"],["Water","4 cups"],["Onion","1 large"],["Garlic","4 cloves"],["Green Chilli","2"],["Salt","1 ½ tsp"],["Oil","3 tablespoons"],["Turmeric Powder","1 tablespoon"],["Coriander","1 teaspoon"],["Cardamom","½ tbsp"],["Cloves","¼ teaspoon"],["Cinnamon","1/2 tsp"],["Pepper","1 tsp"],["Bay Leaf","2"]],"s":"1. Clean and cut the chicken; marinate briefly with salt, turmeric and a little oil.\r\n2. Rinse and soak basmati rice 20–30 minutes.\r\n3. In a large pot, heat ghee/oil. Fry chopped onion until golden. Add minced garlic and green chillies and fry 1–2 min.\r\n4. Add whole spices (cardamom, cloves, cinnamon, bay leaves) and ground spices (coriander, cumin). Stir until fragrant.\r\n5. Add chicken pieces, brown lightly and add enough water/chicken stock to cover. Simmer until chicken is nearly cooked.\r\n6. Remove chicken; measure remaining liquid and add soaked rice. Bring to a boil, then reduce heat, cover and cook rice until almost done.\r\n7. Return the chicken to the rice pot on top, cover tightly and steam on low for 10–15 min so flavors meld.\r\n8. (Optional) For authentic smoky aroma: heat a small charcoal until red hot, place it on a small foil cup in the centre of the pot, add a tsp of butter/oil on the coal then cover immediately to trap smoke for 5–10 minutes. Remove coal.\r\n9. Garnish with fried onions, chopped coriander and serve with chutney or raita.\r\n","z":"1、将鸡肉洗净切块；用盐、姜黄和少许油短暂腌制。\r\n2. 冲洗印度香米并浸泡 20-30 分钟。\r\n3. 在一个大锅中，加热酥油/油。将切碎的洋葱炒至金黄色。加入蒜末和青辣椒，炒 1-2 分钟。\r\n4. 加入整粒香料（小豆蔻、丁香、肉桂、月桂叶）和碎香料（香菜、小茴香）。搅拌至香味四溢。\r\n5. 加入鸡块，煎至浅棕色，加入足够的水/鸡汤盖过鸡块。煮至鸡肉几乎煮熟。\r\n6.取出鸡肉；测量剩余的液体并加入浸泡过的米。煮沸，然后调小火，盖上盖子，煮米饭直至几乎煮熟。\r\n7. 将鸡肉放回顶部的电饭锅中，盖紧盖子，小火蒸 10-15 分钟，使味道融合。\r\n8.（可选）要获得真正的烟熏香气：将小木炭加热至红热，将其放在锅中央的小铝箔杯上，在煤上添加一茶匙黄油/油，然后立即盖上盖子以捕获烟雾5-10分钟。除去煤炭。\r\n9. 用炸洋葱、切碎的香菜装饰，并与酸辣酱或莱塔一起食用。"},{"id":"52785","n":"Dal fry","a":"India","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/wuxrtu1483564410.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=J4D855Q9-jg","i":[["Toor dal","1 cup"],["Water","2-1/2 cups"],["Salt","1 tsp"],["Turmeric","1/4 tsp"],["Ghee","3 tbs"],["Chopped tomatoes","1 cup"],["Cumin seeds","1/2 tsp"],["Mustard Seeds","1/2 tsp"],["Bay Leaf","2"],["Green Chilli","1 tbs chopped"],["Ginger","2 tsp shredded"],["Cilantro","2 tbs"],["Red Pepper","1/2 tsp"],["Salt","1/2 tsp"],["Sugar","1 tsp"],["Garam Masala","1/4 tsp"]],"s":"Wash and soak toor dal in approx. 3 cups of water, for at least one hours. Dal will be double in volume after soaking. Drain the water.\r\nCook dal with 2-1/2 cups water and add salt, turmeric, on medium high heat, until soft in texture (approximately 30 mins) it should be like thick soup.\r\nIn a frying pan, heat the ghee. Add cumin seeds, and mustard seeds. After the seeds crack, add bay leaves, green chili, ginger and chili powder. Stir for a few seconds.\r\nAdd tomatoes, salt and sugar stir and cook until tomatoes are tender and mushy.\r\nAdd cilantro and garam masala cook for about one minute.\r\nPour the seasoning over dal mix it well and cook for another minute.\r\nServe with Naan.","z":"将木豆清洗并浸泡在大约 100 毫升的水中。 3杯水，至少一小时。浸泡后，木豆的体积会增加一倍。沥干水。\r\n用 2-1/2 杯水煮木豆，加入盐、姜黄，用中火煮至质地变软（约 30 分钟），就像浓汤一样。\r\n在煎锅中，加热酥油。加入小茴香籽和芥菜籽。种子破裂后，加入月桂叶、青辣椒、生姜和辣椒粉。搅拌几秒钟。\r\n加入西红柿、盐和糖，搅拌煮至西红柿变软呈糊状。\r\n加入香菜和加拉姆马萨拉煮约一分钟。\r\n将调味料倒在木豆上，搅拌均匀，再煮一分钟。\r\n与馕一起食用。"},{"id":"52868","n":"Kidney Bean Curry","a":"India","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/sywrsu1511463066.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Tp_PMWvIKzo","i":[["Vegetable Oil","1 tbls"],["Onion","1 finely chopped"],["Garlic","2 cloves chopped"],["Ginger","1 part"],["Coriander","1 Packet"],["Cumin","1 tsp"],["Paprika","1 tsp"],["Garam Masala","2 tsp"],["Chopped Tomatoes","400g"],["Kidney Beans","400g"],["Basmati Rice","to serve"]],"s":"Heat the oil in a large frying pan over a low-medium heat. Add the onion and a pinch of salt and cook slowly, stirring occasionally, until softened and just starting to colour. Add the garlic, ginger and coriander stalks and cook for a further 2 mins, until fragrant.\r\n\r\nAdd the spices to the pan and cook for another 1 min, by which point everything should smell aromatic. Tip in the chopped tomatoes and kidney beans in their water, then bring to the boil.\r\n\r\nTurn down the heat and simmer for 15 mins until the curry is nice and thick. Season to taste, then serve with the basmati rice and the coriander leaves.","z":"在大煎锅中用中低火加热油。加入洋葱和少许盐，慢慢煮，偶尔搅拌，直到洋葱变软并开始变色。加入大蒜、生姜和香菜茎，再煮 2 分钟，直至散发出香味。\r\n\r\n将香料加入锅中，再煮 1 分钟，此时所有东西都应该闻起来芳香四溢。将切碎的西红柿和芸豆放入水中，然后煮沸。\r\n\r\n关小火，煮 15 分钟，直到咖喱变浓稠。调味，然后与印度香米和香菜叶一起食用。"},{"id":"52805","n":"Lamb Biryani","a":"India","c":"Lamb","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/xrttsx1487339558.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r7SYVSG5nxo","i":[["Cashew nuts","12"],["Khus khus","½ tbsp"],["Cumin seeds","½ tbsp"],["Onions","3 sliced thinly"],["Ginger garlic paste","2 tsp"],["Garlic","4 whole"],["Mint","Leaves"],["Cilantro","Leaves"],["Saffron","½ tsp dissolved in ½ cup warm milk"],["Ghee","2 tbsp"],["Basmati rice","2 Cups"],["Full fat yogurt","½ cup"],["Cumin Seeds","1 tbsp"],["Bay leaf","½"],["Cinnamon","1 thin piece"],["Cloves","3"],["Cardamom","2"],["Lamb","1 lb"],["Red Chilli powder","1 tsp"],["Biryani masala","1 tbsp"]],"s":"Grind the cashew, poppy seeds and cumin seeds into a smooth paste, using as little water as possible. Set aside. \r\n\r\nDeep fry the sliced onions when it is hot. Don’t overcrowd the oil. When the onions turn light brown, remove from oil and drain on paper towel. The fried onion will crisp up as it drains. Also fry the cashewnuts till golden brown. Set aside.\r\n\r\nWash the rice and soak in water for twenty minutes.\r\nMeanwhile, take a big wide pan, add oil in medium heat, add the sliced onions, add the blended paste, to it add the green chillies, ginger garlic paste and garlic and fry for a minute.\r\nThen add the tomatoes and sauté them well till they are cooked and not mushy.\r\n\r\nThen to it add the red chilli powder, biryani powder, mint, coriander leaves and sauté them well.\r\nAdd the yogurt and mix well. I always move the skillet away from the heat when adding yogurt which prevents it from curdling.\r\n\r\nNow after returning the skillet back to the stove, add the washed lamb and salt and ½ cup water and mix well. Cook for 1 hour and cook it covered in medium low heat or put it in a pressure cooker for 6 whistles. If the water is not drained totally, heat it by keeping it open.\r\n\r\nTake another big pan, add thrice the cup of rice you use, and boil it. When it is boiling high, add the rice, salt and jeera and mix well. After 7 minutes exact or when the rice is 80% done. Switch off and drain the rice.\r\n\r\nNow, the layering starts. To the lamb, pat and level it. Add the drained hot rice on the top of it. Garnish with fried onions, ghee, mint, coriander leaves and saffron dissolved in milk.\r\n\r\nCover the dish and bake in a 350f oven for 15 minutes or till the cooked but not mushy. Or cook in the stove medium heat for 12 minutes and lowest heat for 5 minutes. And switch off. Mix and serve hot!\r\nNotes\r\n1. If you are cooking in oven, do make sure to cook in a big oven safe pan and cover it tight and then keep in oven for the final step.\r\n2. You can skip biryani masala if you don’t have and add just garam masala (1 tsp and red chilli powder – 3 tsp instead of 1 tsp)\r\n3. If it is spicy in the end, squeeze some lemon, it will reduce the heat and enhance the flavors also.","z":"将腰果、罂粟籽和孜然籽磨成光滑的糊状，尽可能少用水。放在一边。 \r\n\r\n热时将切好的洋葱油炸。油不要太满。当洋葱变成浅棕色时，将其从油中取出并用纸巾沥干。炸洋葱沥干后会变脆。另外，将腰果煎至金黄色。放在一边。\r\n\r\n将米洗净，用水浸泡二十分钟。\r\n同时，取一个大平底锅，中火加入油，加入切好的洋葱，加入混合酱，加入青辣椒、姜蒜酱和大蒜，炒一分钟。\r\n然后加入西红柿，炒至煮熟且不糊状。\r\n\r\n然后加入红辣椒粉、印度香饭粉、薄荷、香菜叶，炒匀。\r\n加入酸奶并搅拌均匀。添加酸奶时我总是将煎锅移离火源，以防止酸奶凝结。\r\n\r\n现在，将煎锅放回炉子后，加入洗净的羊肉、盐和 ½ 杯水，搅拌均匀。煮1小时后加盖中小火煮或放入高压锅6响即可。如果水没有完全排出，请保持打开状态加热。\r\n\r\n另取一个大锅，加入三倍于你所用的米，然后煮沸。当水沸腾时，加入米、盐和jeera，搅拌均匀。正好 7 分钟后，即米饭熟了 80% 时。关掉电源并沥干米饭。\r\n\r\n现在，分层开始了。将羔羊拍打并弄平。将沥干的热米饭放在上面。用煎洋葱、酥油、薄荷、香菜叶和溶解在牛奶中的藏红花装饰。\r\n\r\n盖上盘子并在 350 华氏度的烤箱中烘烤 15 分钟或直至煮熟但不糊状。或者在炉子上中火煮12分钟，最低火煮5分钟。并关闭。混合并趁热食用！\r\n注释\r\n1. 如果您在烤箱中烹饪，请确保在一个大的烤箱安全锅中烹饪，并盖紧盖子，然后放在烤箱中进行最后一步。\r\n2. 如果没有的话，可以跳过 Biryani masala，只添加 garam masala（1 茶匙和红辣椒粉 - 3 茶匙而不是 1 茶匙）\r\n3.如果最后吃辣的话，可以挤点柠檬，既可以降低辣味，又可以提味。"},{"id":"52808","n":"Lamb Rogan josh","a":"India","c":"Lamb","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/vvstvq1487342592.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NZVo32n7iS8","i":[["Onion","2 quartered"],["Sunflower Oil","4 tbsp"],["Garlic","4 cloves"],["Ginger","Thumb sized peeled and very finely grated"],["Madras Paste","2 tbsp"],["Paprika","2 tsp"],["cinnamon stick","1"],["Cardamom","6 bashed to break shells"],["Cloves","4"],["Bay Leaf","2"],["Tomato Purée","1 tbsp"],["Lamb","1kg cubed"],["Greek yogurt","150ml"],["Coriander","Garnish chopped"]],"s":"\r\nPut the onions in a food processor and whizz until very finely chopped. Heat the oil in a large heavy-based pan, then fry the onion with the lid on, stirring every now and then, until it is really golden and soft. Add the garlic and ginger, then fry for 5 mins more.\r\nTip the curry paste, all the spices and the bay leaves into the pan, with the tomato purée. Stir well over the heat for about 30 secs, then add the meat and 300ml water. Stir to mix, turn down the heat, then add the yogurt.\r\nCover the pan, then gently simmer for 40-60 mins until the meat is tender and the sauce nice and thick. Serve scattered with coriander, with plain basmati or pilau rice.","z":"将洋葱放入食品加工机中，搅拌直至切碎。在一个大的厚底锅中加热油，然后盖上盖子煎洋葱，时不时地搅拌，直到洋葱变成金黄色且柔软。加入大蒜和姜，再炒5分钟。\r\n将咖喱酱、所有香料和月桂叶与番茄泥一起倒入锅中。大火搅拌约 30 秒，然后加入肉和 300 毫升水。搅拌混合，关小火，然后加入酸奶。\r\n盖上锅盖，小火煮 40-60 分钟，直至肉变软，酱汁浓稠。撒上香菜，搭配普通印度香米或肉饭。"},{"id":"52865","n":"Matar Paneer","a":"India","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/xxpqsy1511452222.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wlseYNqwLNs","i":[["Sunflower Oil","1 tbls"],["Paneer","225g"],["Ginger","2"],["Cumin","1 tsp"],["Turmeric","1 tsp"],["Coriander","1 tsp"],["Green Chilli","1"],["Tomato","4 large"],["Peas","150g"],["Garam Masala","1 tsp"],["Coriander","Small bunch"],["Naan Bread","to serve"]],"s":"Heat the oil in a frying pan over high heat until it’s shimmering hot. Add the paneer, then turn the heat down a little. Fry until it starts to brown at the edges, then turn it over and brown on each side – the paneer will brown faster than you think, so don’t walk away. Remove the paneer from the pan and drain on kitchen paper.\r\nPut the ginger, cumin, turmeric, ground coriander and chilli in the pan, and fry everything for 1 min. Add the tomatoes, mashing them with the back of a spoon and simmer everything for 5 mins until the sauce smells fragrant. Add a splash of water if it’s too thick. Season well. Add the peas and simmer for a further 2 mins, then stir in the paneer and sprinkle over the garam masala. Divide between two bowls, top with coriander leaves and serve with naan bread, roti or rice.","z":"将煎锅中的油用高温加热，直至油变热。加入芝士，然后把火调低一点。煎至边缘开始变褐色，然后将其翻过来，每一面都变成褐色——芝士变褐色的速度比你想象的要快，所以不要走开。从锅中取出芝士，用厨房用纸吸干水分。\r\n将生姜、小茴香、姜黄、香菜末和辣椒放入锅中，煎 1 分钟。加入西红柿，用勺背捣碎，然后煮 5 分钟，直到酱汁散发出香味。如果太稠就加一点水。调味好。加入豌豆，再煮 2 分钟，然后拌入芝士，撒在加拉姆马沙拉上。分成两个碗，上面放上香菜叶，搭配馕饼、烤肉或米饭。"},{"id":"52851","n":"Nutty Chicken Curry","a":"India","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/yxsurp1511304301.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nSQNfZxOdeU","i":[["Red Chilli","1 large"],["Ginger","0.5"],["Garlic","1 large"],["Coriander","Bunch"],["Sunflower Oil","1 tbsp"],["Chicken Breasts","4"],["Peanut Butter","5 tblsp"],["Chicken Stock","150ml"],["Greek Yogurt","200g"]],"s":"Finely slice a quarter of the chilli, then put the rest in a food processor with the ginger, garlic, coriander stalks and one-third of the leaves. Whizz to a rough paste with a splash of water if needed.\r\nHeat the oil in a frying pan, then quickly brown the chicken chunks for 1 min. Stir in the paste for another min, then add the peanut butter, stock and yogurt. When the sauce is gently bubbling, cook for 10 mins until the chicken is just cooked through and sauce thickened. Stir in most of the remaining coriander, then scatter the rest on top with the chilli, if using. Eat with rice or mashed sweet potato.","z":"将四分之一的辣椒切成细丝，然后将其余的与生姜、大蒜、香菜茎和三分之一的叶子一起放入食品加工机中。如果需要的话，加一点水搅拌成粗糊状。\r\n在煎锅中加热油，然后将鸡块快速煎至棕色1分钟。将糊状物再搅拌一分钟，然后加入花生酱、高汤和酸奶。当酱汁轻轻冒泡时，煮10分钟，直到鸡肉熟透且酱汁变稠。拌入大部分剩余的香菜，然后将剩余的香菜撒在上面，如果使用辣椒的话。与米饭或红薯泥一起食用。"},{"id":"52809","n":"Recheado Masala Fish","a":"India","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/uwxusv1487344500.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FXtCris37nE","i":[["Mackerel","4"],["Red Chilli","18 dried"],["Ginger","1 inch"],["Garlic","8 cloves"],["Pepper","1.5 tsp"],["Cumin","1 tsp"],["Turmeric","½ tsp"],["Cinnamon stick",""],["Cloves","4"],["Cardamom","2"],["Sugar","1 tbsp"],["Tamarind ball","2 marble sized"],["Vinegar","2.5 tbsp"],["Oil","for frying"]],"s":"Soak all the spices, ginger, garlic, tamarind pulp and kashmiri chilies except oil in vinegar.\r\nAdd sugar and salt.\r\nAlso add turmeric powder.\r\nCombine all nicely and marinate for 35-40 mins.\r\nGrind the mixture until soft and smooth. Add more vinegar if required but ensure the paste has to be thick so add vinegar accordingly. If the masala paste is thin then it would not stick to the fish.\r\nRinse the fish slit from the center and give some incision from the top. You could see the fish below for clarity.\r\nNow stuff the paste into the center and into the incision. Coat the entire fish with this paste. Marinate the fish for 30 mins.\r\nPlace oil in a shallow pan, once oil is quite hot shallow fry the stuffed mackerels.\r\nFry until golden brown from both sides\r\nServe the recheado mackerels hot with salad, lime wedges, rice and curry.\r\nNotes\r\n1. Ensure the masala paste is thick else the result won't be good.\r\n2. If you aren't able to find kashmiri chilies then use bedgi chilies or kashmiri red chili powder.\r\n3. You could use white vinegar or coconut vinegar.\r\n4. Any left over paste could be stored in the fridge for future use.\r\n5. Cinnamon could be avoided as it's a strong spice used generally for meat or chicken.","z":"将所有香料、生姜、大蒜、罗望子果肉和克什米尔辣椒（油除外）浸泡在醋中。\r\n添加糖和盐。\r\n还添加姜黄粉。\r\n充分混合并腌制 35-40 分钟。\r\n将混合物研磨至柔软光滑。如果需要，可以添加更多的醋，但要确保糊状物必须浓稠，因此要相应地添加醋。如果马萨拉酱很薄，那么它就不会粘在鱼上。\r\n将鱼从中心冲洗干净，并从顶部切开一些切口。为了清楚起见，您可以看到下面的鱼。\r\n现在将糊状物塞入中心和切口中。将这种糊涂在整条鱼上。将鱼腌30分钟。\r\n浅锅中放油，油热后将酿鲭鱼小火煎。\r\n煎至两面金黄\r\n将雷卡多鲭鱼趁热与沙拉、酸橙角、米饭和咖喱一起上桌。\r\n注释\r\n1.确保马萨拉酱很稠，否则效果不好。\r\n2.如果您找不到克什米尔辣椒，请使用bedgi辣椒或克什米尔红辣椒粉。\r\n3.你可以用白醋或椰子醋。\r\n4. 剩余的糊状物可以存放在冰箱中以备将来使用。\r\n5. 可以避免使用肉桂，因为它是一种强烈的香料，通常用于肉类或鸡肉。"},{"id":"52964","n":"Smoked Haddock Kedgeree","a":"India","c":"Breakfast","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/1550441275.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QqdzDCWS4gQ","i":[["Butter","50g"],["Onion","1 chopped"],["Cardamom","3 Pods"],["Turmeric","1/4 tsp"],["Cinnamon Stick","1 small"],["Bay Leaf","Sprigs of fresh"],["Basmati Rice","450g"],["Chicken Stock","1 Litre"],["Smoked Haddock","750g"],["Eggs","3"],["Parsley","3 tblsp chopped"],["Lemon","1 chopped"]],"s":"Melt 50g butter in a large saucepan (about 20cm across), add 1 finely chopped medium onion and cook gently over a medium heat for 5 minutes, until softened but not browned.\r\n\r\nStir in 3 split cardamom pods, ¼ tsp turmeric, 1 small cinnamon stick and 2 bay leaves, then cook for 1 minute.\r\n\r\nTip in 450g basmati rice and stir until it is all well coated in the spicy butter.\r\n\r\nPour in 1 litre chicken or fish stock, add ½ teaspoon salt and bring to the boil, stir once to release any rice from the bottom of the pan. Cover with a close-fitting lid, reduce the heat to low and leave to cook very gently for 12 minutes.\r\n\r\nMeanwhile, bring some water to the boil in a large shallow pan. Add 750g un-dyed smoked haddock fillet and simmer for 4 minutes, until the fish is just cooked. Lift it out onto a plate and leave until cool enough to handle.\r\n\r\nHard-boil 3 eggs for 8 minutes.\r\n\r\nFlake the fish, discarding any skin and bones. Drain the eggs, cool slightly, then peel and chop. \r\n\r\nUncover the rice and remove the bay leaves, cinnamon stick and cardamom pods if you wish to. Gently fork in the fish and the chopped eggs, cover again and return to the heat for 2-3 minutes, or until the fish has heated through.\r\n\r\nGently stir in almost all the 3 tbsp chopped fresh parsley, and season with a little salt and black pepper to taste. Serve scattered with the remaining parsley and garnished with 1 lemon, cut into wedges.","z":"将 50 克黄油放入大平底锅（直径约 20 厘米）中融化，加入 1 个切碎的中等洋葱，中火轻轻煮 5 分钟，直至软化但不变成棕色。\r\n\r\n加入 3 个切开的小豆蔻荚、1/4 茶匙姜黄、1 根小肉桂棒和 2 片月桂叶，然后煮 1 分钟。\r\n\r\n倒入 450 克印度香米，搅拌直至全部裹上辛辣黄油。\r\n\r\n倒入 1 升鸡肉或鱼汤，加入 ½ 茶匙盐煮沸，搅拌一次以释放锅底的米饭。盖上盖子，将火调至小火，轻轻煮 12 分钟。\r\n\r\n同时，在一个大浅锅中将一些水煮沸。加入750克未染色的烟熏黑线鳕鱼片，煮4分钟，直到鱼刚刚煮熟。将其取出放到盘子上，直到冷却到可以处理为止。\r\n\r\n将 3 个鸡蛋煮 8 分钟。\r\n\r\n将鱼切成薄片，丢弃任何鱼皮和鱼骨。将鸡蛋沥干，稍微冷却，然后剥皮并切碎。 \r\n\r\n如果你愿意的话，揭开米饭并去掉月桂叶、肉桂棒和豆蔻荚。轻轻地用叉子放入鱼和切碎的鸡蛋，再次盖上锅盖，再加热 2-3 分钟，或直到鱼热透。\r\n\r\n轻轻拌入几乎所有 3 汤匙切碎的新鲜欧芹，并用少许盐和黑胡椒调味。撒上剩余的欧芹，饰以 1 个切成楔形的柠檬。"},{"id":"52806","n":"Tandoori chicken","a":"India","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/qptpvt1487339892.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-CKvt1KNU74","i":[["lemons","2 Juice"],["paprika","4 tsp"],["red onions","2 finely chopped"],["chicken thighs","16 skinnless"],["vegetable oil","For brushing"],["Greek yogurt","300ml"],["ginger","large piece"],["garlic clove","4"],["garam masala","¾ tsp"],["ground cumin","¾ tsp"],["chilli powder","½ tsp"],["turmeric","¼ tsp"]],"s":"Mix the lemon juice with the paprika and red onions in a large shallow dish. Slash each chicken thigh three times, then turn them in the juice and set aside for 10 mins.\r\nMix all of the marinade ingredients together and pour over the chicken. Give everything a good mix, then cover and chill for at least 1 hr. This can be done up to a day in advance.\r\nHeat the grill. Lift the chicken pieces onto a rack over a baking tray. Brush over a little oil and grill for 8 mins on each side or until lightly charred and completely cooked through.","z":"将柠檬汁、辣椒粉和红洋葱放入一个大浅盘中混合。每只鸡腿切三刀，然后放入汁中，搁置10分钟。\r\n将所有腌料混合在一起，倒在鸡肉上。将所有材料充分混合，然后盖上盖子并冷却至少 1 小时。这最多可以提前一天完成。\r\n加热烤架。将鸡块放在烤盘上的架子上。刷上少许油，每面烤 8 分钟或直至轻微烧焦并完全煮熟。"},{"id":"53036","n":"Boxty Breakfast","a":"Irish","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/naqyel1608588563.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=80W0mCFDIP0","i":[["Potatoes","4 large"],["Spring Onions","1  bunch"],["Plain Flour","100g"],["Egg White","1"],["Milk","150ml"],["Bicarbonate Of Soda","1 tsp"],["Butter","3 tbs"],["Vegetable Oil","2 tbs"],["Cherry Tomatoes","6"],["Bacon","12"],["Egg","6"]],"s":"STEP 1\r\nBefore you start, put your oven on its lowest setting, ready to keep things warm. Peel the potatoes, grate 2 of them, then set aside. Cut the other 2 into large chunks, then boil for 10-15 mins or until tender. Meanwhile, squeeze as much of the liquid from the grated potatoes as you can using a clean tea towel. Mash the boiled potatoes, then mix with the grated potato, spring onions and flour.\r\n\r\nSTEP 2\r\nWhisk the egg white in a large bowl until it holds soft peaks. Fold in the buttermilk, then add the bicarbonate of soda. Fold into the potato mix.\r\n\r\nSTEP 3\r\nHeat a large non-stick frying pan over a medium heat, then add 1 tbsp butter and some of the oil. Drop 3-4 spoonfuls of the potato mixture into the pan, then gently cook for 3-5 mins on each side until golden and crusty. Keep warm on a plate in the oven while you cook the next batch, adding more butter and oil to the pan before you do so. You will get 16 crumpet-size boxty from the mix. Can be made the day ahead, drained on kitchen paper, then reheated in a low oven for 20 mins.\r\n\r\nSTEP 4\r\nHeat the grill to medium and put the tomatoes in a heavy-based pan. Add a good knob of butter and a little oil, then fry for about 5 mins until softened. Grill the bacon, then pile onto a plate and keep warm. Stack up the boxty, bacon and egg, and serve the tomatoes on the side.","z":"步骤1\r\n开始之前，将烤箱调至最低温度，准备保温。将土豆去皮，将其中 2 个切碎，然后放在一边。将另外 2 个切成大块，然后煮 10-15 分钟或直至变软。与此同时，用干净的茶巾尽可能多地挤出磨碎的土豆中的液体。将煮好的土豆捣碎，然后与磨碎的土豆、葱和面粉混合。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n在一个大碗中搅拌蛋清，直至形成软峰。拌入酪乳，然后加入碳酸氢钠。拌入土豆泥中。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n用中火加热一个大的不粘煎锅，然后加入 1 汤匙黄油和一些油。将 3-4 勺土豆混合物放入锅中，然后每面轻轻煮 3-5 分钟，直至呈金黄色并结皮。在烹饪下一批食品时，请在烤箱中的盘子上保持温暖，然后在锅中添加更多黄油和油。您将从混合物中得到 16 个松饼大小的 Boxty。可以提前一天制作，用厨房纸吸干水分，然后在低烤箱中重新加热 20 分钟。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n将烤架加热至中火，然后将西红柿放入厚底锅中。加入一大块黄油和少许油，然后煎约 5 分钟直至软化。烤培根，然后堆到盘子上并保温。把盒子、培根和鸡蛋叠起来，把西红柿放在一边。"},{"id":"53037","n":"Coddled pork with cider","a":"Irish","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/7vpsfp1608588991.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ftn_4mc-65o","i":[["Butter","Knob"],["Pork Chops","2"],["Bacon","4"],["Potatoes","2"],["Carrots","1"],["Swede","1/2"],["Cabbage","1/2"],["Bay Leaf","1"],["Cider","100ml"],["Chicken Stock","100g"]],"s":"STEP 1\r\nHeat the butter in a casserole dish until sizzling, then fry the pork for 2-3 mins on each side until browned. Remove from the pan.\r\n\r\nSTEP 2\r\nTip the bacon, carrot, potatoes and swede into the pan, then gently fry until slightly coloured. Stir in the cabbage, sit the chops back on top, add the bay leaf, then pour over the cider and stock. Cover the pan, then leave everything to gently simmer for 20 mins until the pork is cooked through and the vegetables are tender.\r\n\r\nSTEP 3\r\nServe at the table spooned straight from the dish.","z":"步骤1\r\n将黄油放入砂锅中加热，直至发出嘶嘶声，然后将猪肉每面煎 2-3 分钟，直至变成棕色。从锅中取出。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将培根、胡萝卜、土豆和瑞典菜倒入锅中，然后轻轻煎至稍微变色。拌入卷心菜，将排骨放回上面，加入月桂叶，然后倒在苹果酒和高汤上。盖上锅盖，然后将所有材料轻轻煮 20 分钟，直至猪肉煮熟且蔬菜变软。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n直接用勺子从盘子里舀出来上桌。"},{"id":"52998","n":"Corned Beef and Cabbage","a":"Irish","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/xb97a81583266727.jpg","y":"","i":[["Beef Brisket","3 Lbs"],["Small Potatoes","10"],["Carrots","5"],["Cabbage","1 head"]],"s":"1\r\n\r\nPlace corned beef in large pot or Dutch oven and cover with water. Add the spice packet that came with the corned beef. Cover pot and bring to a boil, then reduce to a simmer. Simmer approximately 50 minutes per pound or until tender.\r\n\r\n2\r\n\r\nAdd whole potatoes and peeled and cut carrots, and cook until the vegetables are almost tender. Add cabbage and cook for 15 more minutes. Remove meat and let rest 15 minutes.\r\n\r\n3\r\n\r\nPlace vegetables in a bowl and cover. Add as much broth (cooking liquid reserved in the Dutch oven or large pot) as you want. Slice meat across the grain.","z":"1\r\n\r\n将咸牛肉放入大锅或荷兰烤箱中，并盖上水。添加咸牛肉附带的香料包。盖上锅盖，煮沸，然后转小火慢炖。每磅煮约 50 分钟或直至变软。\r\n\r\n2\r\n\r\n加入整个土豆和去皮切好的胡萝卜，煮至蔬菜几乎变软。加入卷心菜，再煮 15 分钟。取出肉并静置 15 分钟。\r\n\r\n3\r\n\r\n将蔬菜放入碗中并盖上盖子。根据需要添加尽可能多的肉汤（荷兰烤箱或大锅中保留的烹饪液体）。将肉顺着纹理切成片。"},{"id":"52999","n":"Crispy Sausages and Greens","a":"Irish","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/st1ifa1583267248.jpg","y":"","i":[["Kale","1  bunch"],["Italian Fennel Sausages","8"],["Cabbage","1 Head chopped"],["Garlic Clove","8"],["Onion","Sliced"],["Shiitake Mushrooms","Sliced"],["Chicken Stock","1 cup"],["Salt",""],["Pepper",""]],"s":"Preheat the oven to 350°. Remove the stems from one bunch of Tuscan kale and tear the leaves into 1\" pieces (mustard greens, collards, spinach, and chard are great, too). Coarsely chop half a head of green cabbage. Combine the greens in a large baking dish and add 4 cloves of thinly sliced garlic. Adding some sliced onions and shiitake mushrooms at this point is optional, but highly recommended (I'll sauté the onions and mushrooms in a cast iron baking dish right on the stove before adding to the greens). Coat the greens with some olive oil and pour ½ cup chicken stock or broth over everything. Cover the dish with foil and bake until the greens are wilted, about 15 minutes. Remove foil and season with salt and pepper. Continue to bake until cabbage is tender, about 20-25 minutes more.\r\n\r\nMeanwhile, heat a little olive oil in a large skillet over medium-high. Prick four sweet Italian sausages with a fork and cook until browned on all sides and cooked through, 10 to 12 minutes. When the greens are done, slice the sausage and toss into the greens with a splash of your favorite vinegar (I like sherry or red wine).","z":"将烤箱预热至 350°。把一束托斯卡纳羽衣甘蓝的茎去掉，把叶子撕成1英寸的片（芥菜、羽衣甘蓝、菠菜和甜菜也很棒）。粗切半颗青甘蓝。将青菜放入一个大烤盘中，加入4瓣切成薄片的大蒜。此时添加一些切片洋葱和香菇是可选的，但强烈建议（我会在锅中炒洋葱和蘑菇）将铸铁烤盘放在炉子上，然后将一些橄榄油涂在蔬菜上，然后用箔纸盖住盘子，烘烤约 15 分钟，然后取出箔纸，用盐和胡椒调味，继续烘烤约 20-25 分钟。\r\n\r\n与此同时，在大煎锅中用中高火加热少许橄榄油。用叉子刺穿四根意大利甜香肠，煮 10 到 12 分钟，直至各面变成棕色并煮熟。蔬菜完成后，将香肠切成薄片，拌入蔬菜中，撒上你最喜欢的醋（我喜欢雪利酒或红酒）。"},{"id":"53035","n":"Ham hock colcannon","a":"Irish","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/n41ny81608588066.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aQJAU2iJ730","i":[["Floury Potatoes","800g"],["Butter","50g"],["Garlic Clove","3 chopped"],["Cabbage","1 chopped"],["Spring Onions","8"],["Double Cream","100ml"],["Mustard","2 tbs"],["Ham","180g"],["Eggs","4"]],"s":"STEP 1\r\nPeel and cut the potatoes into even, medium-sized chunks. Put in a large pan filled with cold salted water, bring to the boil and cook for 10-15 mins until a knife can be inserted into the potatoes easily.\r\n\r\nSTEP 2\r\nMeanwhile, melt the butter in a large sauté pan over a medium heat. Add the garlic, cabbage, spring onions and some seasoning. Stir occasionally until the cabbage is wilted but still retains a little bite, then set aside.\r\n\r\nSTEP 3\r\nDrain the potatoes, leave to steam-dry for a couple of mins, then mash with the cream, mustard and seasoning in the same saucepan. Stir in the cabbage and ham hock. Keep warm over a low heat.\r\n\r\nSTEP 4\r\nReheat the pan you used to cook the cabbage (no need to wash first), add a splash of oil, crack in the eggs and fry to your liking. To serve, divide the colcannon between bowls and top each with a fried egg.","z":"步骤1\r\n将土豆去皮并切成均匀的中等大小的块。放入一个装满冷盐水的大锅中，煮沸并煮10-15分钟，直到刀可以轻松插入土豆。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n与此同时，在大煎锅中用中火融化黄油。加入大蒜、卷心菜、葱和一些调味料。偶尔搅拌一下，直到卷心菜枯萎，但仍保留一点味道，然后放在一边。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n将土豆沥干，蒸干几分钟，然后在同一个平底锅中与奶油、芥末和调味料一起捣碎。拌入卷心菜和火腿。用小火保持温暖。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n重新加热用来煮卷心菜的锅（无需先清洗），加入少许油，打入鸡蛋，然后根据您的喜好煎炸。食用时，将大炮分装在碗中，并在每个碗上放一个煎鸡蛋。"},{"id":"52781","n":"Irish stew","a":"Irish","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/sxxpst1468569714.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kYH2qJXnSMo","i":[["whole wheat","300g soaked overnight in water"],["lamb loin chops","2kg cut into 3cm cubes"],["olive oil","120ml"],["shallots","24 Skinned"],["Carrots","4 large"],["turnips","2"],["celeriac","1"],["charlotte potatoes","350g"],["white wine","150ml"],["caster sugar","1 tsp"],["fresh thyme","4 sprigs"],["oregano","4 sprigs"],["chicken stock","450ml"]],"s":"Heat the oven to 180C/350F/gas mark 4. Drain and rinse the soaked wheat, put it in a medium pan with lots of water, bring to a boil and simmer for an hour, until cooked. Drain and set aside.\r\n\r\nSeason the lamb with a teaspoon of salt and some black pepper. Put one tablespoon of oil in a large, deep sauté pan for which you have a lid; place on a medium-high heat. Add some of the lamb – don't overcrowd the pan – and sear for four minutes on all sides. Transfer to a bowl, and repeat with the remaining lamb, adding oil as needed.\r\n\r\nLower the heat to medium and add a tablespoon of oil to the pan. Add the shallots and fry for four minutes, until caramelised. Tip these into the lamb bowl, and repeat with the remaining vegetables until they are all nice and brown, adding more oil as you need it.\r\n\r\nOnce all the vegetables are seared and removed from the pan, add the wine along with the sugar, herbs, a teaspoon of salt and a good grind of black pepper. Boil on a high heat for about three minutes.\r\n\r\nTip the lamb, vegetables and whole wheat back into the pot, and add the stock. Cover and boil for five minutes, then transfer to the oven for an hour and a half.\r\n\r\nRemove the stew from the oven and check the liquid; if there is a lot, remove the lid and boil for a few minutes.","z":"将烤箱加热至 180C/350F/煤气标记 4. 将浸泡好的小麦沥干并冲洗，将其放入装有大量水的中型锅中，煮沸并小火煮一小时，直至煮熟。沥干并放在一边。\r\n\r\n用一茶匙盐和一些黑胡椒给羊肉调味。将一汤匙油放入一个有盖子的大而深的炒锅中；放在中高火上。加入一些羊肉——不要把锅挤得太满——然后在各面煎四分钟。转移到碗中，对剩下的羊肉重复上述步骤，根据需要添加油。\r\n\r\n将火调至中火，然后在锅中加入一汤匙油。加入青葱，炒四分钟，直至焦糖化。将它们倒入羊肉碗中，然后对剩余的蔬菜重复此操作，直到它们全部变成棕色，根据需要添加更多的油。\r\n\r\n一旦所有蔬菜都烤熟并从锅中取出，加入酒、糖、香草、一茶匙盐和磨碎的黑胡椒。用大火煮约三分钟。\r\n\r\n将羊肉、蔬菜和全麦倒回锅中，然后加入高汤。盖上盖子煮五分钟，然后转移到烤箱一个半小时。\r\n\r\n将炖菜从烤箱中取出并检查液体；如果很多，请打开盖子煮几分钟。"},{"id":"53038","n":"Mustard champ","a":"Irish","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/o7p9581608589317.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_iKllHSC978","i":[["Potatoes","1kg"],["Milk","200ml"],["Butter","50g"],["Mustard","2 tbs"],["Spring Onions","Bunch"],["Spring Onions","Bunch"]],"s":"STEP 1\r\nBoil the potatoes for 15 mins or until tender. Drain, then mash.\r\n\r\nSTEP 2\r\nHeat the milk and half the butter in the corner of the pan, then beat into the mash, along with the wholegrain mustard.\r\n\r\nSTEP 3\r\nGently fry the spring onions in the remaining butter for 2 mins until just soft but still a perky green. Fold into the mash and serve. Great with gammon or to top a fish pie.","z":"步骤1\r\n将土豆煮 15 分钟或直至变软。沥干，然后捣碎。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n在锅角加热牛奶和一半黄油，然后与全麦芥末一起搅拌成糊状。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n将葱放入剩余的黄油中轻轻煎 2 分钟，直至洋葱变软但仍呈鲜绿色。拌入糊状即可食用。非常适合搭配火腿或鱼馅饼。"},{"id":"53000","n":"Vegetable Shepherds Pie","a":"Irish","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/w8umt11583268117.jpg","y":"","i":[["Potatoes","3 Lbs"],["Small Potatoes","3 Lbs"],["Salted Butter","1/2 cup"],["Mushrooms","1 oz"],["Brown Lentils","3/4 cup"],["Garlic","6 cloves"],["Kosher Salt","1 tsp"],["Onion","3 cups"],["Tomato Puree","2 tbsp"],["Bay Leaves",""],["Olive Oil",""],["Dry White Wine","2 cups"],["Vegetable Stock","8 cups"],["Cornstarch","2 tbsp"],["Soy Sauce","2 tsp"],["Rosemary","2 sprigs"],["Parsley",""],["Sage",""],["Chives",""]],"s":"Add Ingredients:\r\n\r\n12 cups chopped mixed vegetables\r\n1   cup chopped fresh mushrooms \r\n1   cup pearl onions\r\n\r\nTOPPING:\r\n\r\nPreheat oven to 450°. Bake potatoes on a foil-lined baking sheet until tender, about 45 minutes. Let cool slightly, then peel. Press potatoes through a ricer, food mill, or colander into a large bowl. Add butter; stir until well blended. Stir in milk. Season to taste with salt.\r\n\r\nFILLING:\r\n\r\nSoak dried porcini in 3 cups hot water; set aside. Combine lentils, 1 garlic clove, 1 tsp. salt, and 4 cups water in a medium saucepan. Bring to a boil; reduce heat and simmer, stirring occasionally, until lentils are tender but not mushy, 15–20 minutes. Drain lentils and discard garlic.\r\n\r\nHeat 3 Tbsp. oil in a large heavy pot over medium heat. Add onions and cook, stirring occasionally, until soft, about 12 minutes. Add chopped garlic and cook for 1 minute. Stir in tomato paste. Cook, stirring constantly, until tomato paste is caramelized, 2–3 minutes.\r\n\r\nAdd bay leaves and wine; stir, scraping up any browned bits. Stir in porcini, slowly pouring porcini soaking liquid into pan but leaving any sediment behind. Bring to a simmer and cook until liquid is reduced by half, about 10 minutes. Stir in broth and cook, stirring occasionally, until reduced by half, about 45 minutes.\r\n\r\nStrain mixture into a large saucepan and bring to a boil; discard solids in strainer. Stir cornstarch and 2 Tbsp. water in a small bowl to dissolve. Add cornstarch mixture; simmer until thickened, about 5 minutes. Whisk in miso. Season sauce with salt and pepper. Set aside.\r\n\r\nPreheat oven to 450°. Toss vegetables and pearl onions with remaining 2 Tbsp. oil, 5 garlic cloves, and rosemary sprigs in a large bowl; season with salt and pepper. Divide between 2 rimmed baking sheets. Roast, stirring once, until tender, 20–25 minutes. Transfer garlic cloves to a small bowl; mash well with a fork and stir into sauce. Discard rosemary. DO AHEAD: Lentils, sauce, and vegetables can be made 1 day ahead. Cover separately; chill.\r\nArrange lentils in an even layer in a 3-qt. baking dish; set dish on a foil-lined rimmed baking sheet. Toss roasted vegetables with fresh mushrooms and chopped herbs; layer on top of lentils. Pour sauce over vegetables. Spoon potato mixture evenly over.\r\n\r\nBake until browned and bubbly, about 30 minutes. Let stand for 15 minutes before serving.","z":"添加成分：\r\n\r\n12 杯切碎的混合蔬菜\r\n1 杯切碎的新鲜蘑菇 \r\n1 杯 珍珠洋葱\r\n\r\n浇头：\r\n\r\n将烤箱预热至 450°。将土豆放在衬有箔纸的烤盘上烘烤约 45 分钟，直至变软。稍微冷却，然后剥皮。将土豆通过碾米机、食品磨或漏勺压入一个大碗中。加入黄油；搅拌直至充分混合。加入牛奶搅拌。加盐调味。\r\n\r\n灌装：\r\n\r\n将干牛肝菌放入3杯热水中浸泡；放在一边。将扁豆、1 瓣蒜、1 茶匙混合。盐和 4 杯水放入中型平底锅中。煮沸；将火调小，煮 15-20 分钟，偶尔搅拌，直至扁豆变软但不糊状。沥干扁豆并丢弃大蒜。\r\n\r\n加热 3 汤匙。在一个大锅中用中火加热油。加入洋葱，煮约 12 分钟，偶尔搅拌，直至变软。加入切碎的大蒜，煮 1 分钟。拌入番茄酱。不断搅拌，煮 2-3 分钟，直至番茄酱焦糖化。\r\n\r\n加入月桂叶和酒；搅拌，刮掉任何褐色的碎片。拌入牛肝菌，慢慢地将浸泡牛肝菌的液体倒入锅中，但留下任何沉淀物。小火煮约 10 分钟，直至液体减少一半。拌入肉汤，煮约 45 分钟，期间不时搅拌，直至汤汁减半。\r\n\r\n将混合物滤入大平底锅中并煮沸；丢弃过滤器中的固体。搅拌玉米淀粉和 2 汤匙。在小碗中加水溶解。加入玉米淀粉混合物；煮约5分钟，直至变稠。加入味噌搅拌。用盐和胡椒调味酱汁。放在一边。\r\n\r\n将烤箱预热至 450°。将蔬菜和珍珠洋葱与剩余的 2 汤匙一起搅拌。将油、5瓣大蒜和迷迭香小枝放入一个大碗中；用盐和胡椒调味。将两张带边烤盘分开。烘烤并搅拌一次，直至变软，持续 20-25 分钟。将蒜瓣转移到一个小碗中；用叉子捣碎并搅拌成酱汁。丢弃迷迭香。提前做：扁豆、酱汁和蔬菜可以提前 1 天制作。单独盖上；寒意。\r\n将扁豆均匀地排列成 3 夸脱。烤盘；将盘子放在衬有箔纸的镶边烤盘上。将烤蔬菜与新鲜蘑菇和切碎的香草拌匀；铺在扁豆上面。将酱汁倒在蔬菜上。将土豆混合物均匀地舀到上面。\r\n\r\n烘烤约 30 分钟，直至变成棕色并起泡。静置 15 分钟即可食用。"},{"id":"52961","n":"Budino Di Ricotta","a":"Italian","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/1549542877.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6dzd6Ra6sb4","i":[["Ricotta","500g"],["Eggs","4 large"],["Flour","3 tbs"],["Sugar","250g"],["Cinnamon","1 tsp"],["Lemons","Grated Zest of 2"],["Dark Rum","5 tbs"],["Icing Sugar","sprinking"]],"s":"Mash the ricotta and beat well with the egg yolks, stir in the flour, sugar, cinnamon, grated lemon rind and the rum and mix well. You can do this in a food processor. Beat the egg whites until stiff, fold in and pour into a buttered and floured 25cm cake tin. Bake in the oven at 180ºC/160ºC fan/gas 4 for about 40 minutes, or until it is firm.\r\n\r\nServe hot or cold dusted with icing sugar.","z":"将乳清干酪捣碎，与蛋黄搅拌均匀，加入面粉、糖、肉桂、磨碎的柠檬皮和朗姆酒，搅拌均匀。您可以在食品加工机中执行此操作。将蛋白打至硬性发泡，拌入并倒入涂有黄油和面粉的 25 厘米蛋糕罐中。在烤箱中以 180°C/160°C 风扇/燃气 4 烘烤约 40 分钟，或直至其变硬。\r\n\r\n热食或冷食，撒上糖粉。"},{"id":"52796","n":"Chicken Alfredo Primavera","a":"Italian","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/syqypv1486981727.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qCIbq8HywpQ","i":[["Butter","2 tablespoons"],["Olive Oil","3 tablespoons"],["Chicken","5 boneless"],["Salt","1 teaspoon"],["Squash","1 cut into 1/2-inch cubes"],["Broccoli","1 Head chopped"],["mushrooms","8-ounce sliced"],["Pepper","1 red"],["onion","1 chopped"],["garlic","3 cloves"],["red pepper flakes","1/2 teaspoon"],["white wine","1/2 cup"],["milk","1/2 cup"],["heavy cream","1/2 cup"],["Parmesan cheese","1 cup grated"],["bowtie pasta","16 ounces"],["Salt","pinch"],["Pepper","pinch"],["Parsley","chopped"]],"s":"Heat 1 tablespoon of butter and 2 tablespoons of olive oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat. Season both sides of each chicken breast with seasoned salt and a pinch of pepper. Add the chicken to the skillet and cook for 5-7 minutes on each side, or until cooked through.  While the chicken is cooking, bring a large pot of water to a boil. Season the boiling water with a few generous pinches of kosher salt. Add the pasta and give it a stir. Cook, stirring occasionally, until al dente, about 12 minutes. Reserve 1/2 cup of  pasta water before draining the pasta.  Remove the chicken from the pan and transfer it to a cutting board; allow it to rest. Turn the heat down to medium and dd the remaining 1 tablespoon of butter and olive oil to the same pan you used to cook the chicken. Add the veggies (minus the garlic) and red pepper flakes to the pan and stir to coat with the oil and butter (refrain from seasoning with salt until the veggies are finished browning). Cook, stirring often, until the veggies are tender, about 5 minutes. Add the garlic and a generous pinch of salt and pepper to the pan and cook for 1 minute.  Deglaze the pan with the white wine. Continue to cook until the wine has reduced by half, about 3 minutes. Stir in the milk, heavy cream, and reserved pasta water. Bring the mixture to a gentle boil and allow to simmer and reduce for 2-3 minutes. Turn off the heat and add the Parmesan cheese and cooked pasta. Season with salt and pepper to taste. Garnish with Parmesan cheese and chopped parsley, if desired. ","z":"将 1 汤匙黄油和 2 汤匙橄榄油放入大煎锅中，用中高火加热。用调味盐和少许胡椒调味每个鸡胸肉的两面。将鸡肉放入煎锅中，每面煎 5-7 分钟，或直至煮熟。  当鸡肉煮的时候，将一大锅水烧开。用几撮粗盐给沸水调味。加入意大利面并搅拌。煮约 12 分钟，偶尔搅拌，直到有嚼劲。沥干意大利面之前，保留 1/2 杯意大利面水。  将鸡肉从锅中取出并转移到切菜板上；让它休息。将火调至中火，将剩下的 1 汤匙黄油和橄榄油放入煮鸡肉的同一个锅中。将蔬菜（不包括大蒜）和红辣椒片放入锅中，搅拌以涂上油和黄油（在蔬菜完全变成褐色之前不要加盐调味）。煮约 5 分钟，经常搅拌，直至蔬菜变软。将大蒜、适量盐和胡椒粉放入锅中，煮 1 分钟。  用白葡萄酒给锅脱釉。继续煮大约3分钟，直到酒减半。加入牛奶、浓奶油和保留的意大利面水。将混合物慢慢煮沸，然后小火煮 2-3 分钟。关掉火，加入帕尔马干酪和煮熟的意大利面。用盐和胡椒调味。如果需要，可以用帕尔马干酪和切碎的欧芹装饰。"},{"id":"52839","n":"Chilli prawn linguine","a":"Italian","c":"Pasta","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/usywpp1511189717.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SC17Mc70Db0","i":[["Linguine Pasta","280g"],["Sugar Snap Peas","200g"],["Olive Oil","2 tblsp"],["Garlic Clove","2 cloves chopped"],["Red Chilli","1 large"],["King Prawns","24 Skinned"],["Cherry Tomatoes","12"],["Basil Leaves","Handful"],["Lettuce","Leaves"],["Bread","to serve"],["Fromage Frais","2 tbsp"],["Lime","Grated Zest of 2"],["Caster Sugar","2 tsp"]],"s":"Mix the dressing ingredients in a small bowl and season with salt and pepper. Set aside.\r\n\r\nCook the pasta according to the packet instructions. Add the sugar snap peas for the last minute or so of cooking time.\r\n\r\nMeanwhile, heat the oil in a wok or large frying pan, toss in the garlic and chilli and cook over a fairly gentle heat for about 30 seconds without letting the garlic brown. Tip in the prawns and cook over a high heat, stirring frequently, for about 3 minutes until they turn pink.\r\n\r\nAdd the tomatoes and cook, stirring occasionally, for 3 minutes until they just start to soften. Drain the pasta and sugar snaps well, then toss into the prawn mixture. Tear in the basil leaves, stir, and season with salt and pepper.\r\n\r\nServe with salad leaves drizzled with the lime dressing, and warm crusty bread.","z":"将调料混合在一个小碗中，用盐和胡椒调味。放在一边。\r\n\r\n根据包装说明煮意大利面。在烹饪的最后一分钟左右加入糖豌豆。\r\n\r\n与此同时，在炒锅或大煎锅中加热油，加入大蒜和辣椒，用小火煮约 30 秒，不要让大蒜变成棕色。倒入虾，用大火煮约 3 分钟，期间不断搅拌，直到虾变成粉红色。\r\n\r\n加入西红柿，煮 3 分钟，偶尔搅拌，直至西红柿开始软化。将意大利面和糖沥干，然后放入虾混合物中。撕下罗勒叶，搅拌，用盐和胡椒调味。\r\n\r\n与淋上酸橙酱的沙拉叶和热硬皮面包一起食用。"},{"id":"53064","n":"Fettuccine Alfredo","a":"Italian","c":"Pasta","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/0jv5gx1661040802.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LPPcNPdq_j4","i":[["Fettuccine","1 lb"],["Heavy Cream","1/2 cup"],["Butter","1/2 cup"],["Parmesan","1/2 cup"],["Parsley","2 tbsp"],["Black Pepper",""]],"s":"Cook pasta according to package instructions in a large pot of boiling water and salt. Add heavy cream and butter to a large skillet over medium heat until the cream bubbles and the butter melts. Whisk in parmesan and add seasoning (salt and black pepper). Let the sauce thicken slightly and then add the pasta and toss until coated in sauce. Garnish with parsley, and it's ready.","z":"根据包装说明在一大锅沸水和盐中煮意大利面。将浓奶油和黄油放入大煎锅中，用中火加热，直至奶油起泡且黄油融化。加入帕尔马干酪搅拌，加入调味料（盐和黑胡椒）。让酱汁稍微变稠，然后加入意大利面，搅拌直至沾上酱汁。撒上欧芹，就可以了。"},{"id":"52835","n":"Fettucine alfredo","a":"Italian","c":"Pasta","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/uquqtu1511178042.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FLEnwZvGzOE","i":[["Clotted Cream","227g"],["Butter","25g"],["Corn Flour","1 tsp"],["Parmesan Cheese","100g"],["Nutmeg","Grated"],["Fettuccine","250g"],["Parsley","Chopped"]],"s":"In a medium saucepan, stir the clotted cream, butter and cornflour over a low-ish heat and bring to a low simmer. Turn off the heat and keep warm.\r\nMeanwhile, put the cheese and nutmeg in a small bowl and add a good grinding of black pepper, then stir everything together (don’t add any salt at this stage).\r\nPut the pasta in another pan with 2 tsp salt, pour over some boiling water and cook following pack instructions (usually 3-4 mins). When cooked, scoop some of the cooking water into a heatproof jug or mug and drain the pasta, but not too thoroughly.\r\nAdd the pasta to the pan with the clotted cream mixture, then sprinkle over the cheese and gently fold everything together over a low heat using a rubber spatula. When combined, splash in 3 tbsp of the cooking water. At first, the pasta will look wet and sloppy: keep stirring until the water is absorbed and the sauce is glossy. Check the seasoning before transferring to heated bowls. Sprinkle over some chives or parsley, then serve immediately.","z":"在一个中等大小的平底锅中，用小火搅拌凝结的奶油、黄油和玉米粉，然后小火慢炖。关掉暖气并保暖。\r\n与此同时，将奶酪和肉豆蔻放入一个小碗中，加入磨碎的黑胡椒，然后将所有东西搅拌在一起（此阶段不要添加任何盐）。\r\n将意大利面放入另一个锅中，加入 2 茶匙盐，倒入一些沸水，然后按照包装说明烹饪（通常 3-4 分钟）。煮熟后，将一些烹饪水舀入耐热壶或马克杯中，然后将意大利面沥干，但不要太彻底。\r\n将意大利面与凝结的奶油混合物一起放入锅中，然后撒在奶酪上，并用橡皮抹刀在小火上轻轻地将所有东西折叠在一起。混合后，倒入 3 汤匙烹饪水。一开始，意大利面看起来又湿又稀：不断搅拌，直到水被吸收并且酱汁有光泽。在转移到加热的碗之前检查调味料。撒上一些细香葱或欧芹，然后立即食用。"},{"id":"52844","n":"Lasagne","a":"Italian","c":"Pasta","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/wtsvxx1511296896.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gfhfsBPt46s","i":[["Olive Oil","1 tblsp"],["Bacon","2"],["Onion","1 finely chopped"],["Celery","1 Stick"],["Carrots","1 medium"],["Garlic","2 cloves chopped"],["Minced Beef","500g"],["Tomato Puree","1 tbls"],["Chopped Tomatoes","800g"],["Honey","1 tblsp"],["Lasagne Sheets","500g"],["Creme Fraiche","400ml"],["Mozzarella Balls","125g"],["Parmesan Cheese","50g"],["Basil Leaves","Topping"]],"s":"Heat the oil in a large saucepan. Use kitchen scissors to snip the bacon into small pieces, or use a sharp knife to chop it on a chopping board. Add the bacon to the pan and cook for just a few mins until starting to turn golden. Add the onion, celery and carrot, and cook over a medium heat for 5 mins, stirring occasionally, until softened.\r\nAdd the garlic and cook for 1 min, then tip in the mince and cook, stirring and breaking it up with a wooden spoon, for about 6 mins until browned all over.\r\nStir in the tomato purée and cook for 1 min, mixing in well with the beef and vegetables. Tip in the chopped tomatoes. Fill each can half full with water to rinse out any tomatoes left in the can, and add to the pan. Add the honey and season to taste. Simmer for 20 mins.\r\nHeat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. To assemble the lasagne, ladle a little of the ragu sauce into the bottom of the roasting tin or casserole dish, spreading the sauce all over the base. Place 2 sheets of lasagne on top of the sauce overlapping to make it fit, then repeat with more sauce and another layer of pasta. Repeat with a further 2 layers of sauce and pasta, finishing with a layer of pasta.\r\nPut the crème fraîche in a bowl and mix with 2 tbsp water to loosen it and make a smooth pourable sauce. Pour this over the top of the pasta, then top with the mozzarella. Sprinkle Parmesan over the top and bake for 25–30 mins until golden and bubbling. Serve scattered with basil, if you like.","z":"在一个大平底锅中加热油。用厨房剪刀将培根剪成小块，或者用锋利的刀在案板上切碎。将培根放入锅中，煮几分钟，直至开始变成金黄色。加入洋葱、芹菜和胡萝卜，中火煮 5 分钟，偶尔搅拌，直至变软。\r\n加入大蒜，煮 1 分钟，然后倒入肉末，用木勺搅拌并打碎，煮约 6 分钟，直至全部变成棕色。\r\n加入番茄泥，煮 1 分钟，与牛肉和蔬菜充分混合。倒入切碎的西红柿。将每个罐子装满水，冲洗掉罐子里剩下的西红柿，然后放入锅中。加入蜂蜜并调味。煮20分钟。\r\n将烤箱加热至 200C/180C 风扇/燃气 6. 要制作千层面，将少许肉酱舀入烤盘或砂锅菜的底部，将酱汁涂满底部。将两片千层面放在酱汁上，重叠以使其适合，然后重复更多酱汁和另一层意大利面。再涂上两层酱汁和意大利面，最后涂上一层意大利面。\r\n将法式酸奶油放入碗中，与 2 汤匙水混合，使其松散，制成光滑的可倾倒酱汁。将其倒在意大利面上，然后在上面放上马苏里拉奶酪。在顶部撒上帕尔马干酪，烘烤 25-30 分钟，直至呈金黄色并冒泡。如果您愿意，可以撒上罗勒。"},{"id":"52777","n":"Mediterranean Pasta Salad","a":"Italian","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/wvqpwt1468339226.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=e52IL8zYmaE","i":[["mozzarella balls","200 g"],["baby plum tomatoes","250 g"],["fresh basil","1  bunch"],["farfalle","350 g"],["extra virgin olive oil","3  tablespoons"],["Green Olives","40 g"],["tuna","200 g"],["salt","to taste"],["pepper","to taste"]],"s":"Bring a large saucepan of salted water to the boil\r\nAdd the pasta, stir once and cook for about 10 minutes or as directed on the packet.\r\nMeanwhile, wash the tomatoes and cut into quarters. Slice the olives. Wash the basil.\r\nPut the tomatoes into a salad bowl and tear the basil leaves over them. Add a tablespoon of olive oil and mix.\r\nWhen the pasta is ready, drain into a colander and run cold water over it to cool it quickly.\r\nToss the pasta into the salad bowl with the tomatoes and basil.\r\nAdd the sliced olives, drained mozzarella balls, and chunks of tuna. Mix well and let the salad rest for at least half an hour to allow the flavours to mingle.\r\nSprinkle the pasta with a generous grind of black pepper and drizzle with the remaining olive oil just before serving.","z":"将一大锅盐水煮沸\r\n加入意大利面，搅拌一次，煮约 10 分钟或按照包装上的说明煮。\r\n同时，将西红柿洗净并切成四等份。将橄榄切片。洗净罗勒。\r\n将西红柿放入沙拉碗中，然后将罗勒叶撕在上面。添加一汤匙橄榄油并混合。\r\n意大利面准备好后，将其排入滤锅中，并用冷水冲洗以使其快速冷却。\r\n将意大利面与西红柿和罗勒一起放入沙拉碗中。\r\n加入切片橄榄、沥干的马苏里拉奶酪球和金枪鱼块。充分混合，让沙拉静置至少半小时，让味道混合。\r\n在意大利面上撒上大量的黑胡椒粉，并在食用前淋上剩余的橄榄油。"},{"id":"52810","n":"Osso Buco alla Milanese","a":"Italian","c":"Miscellaneous","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/wwuqvt1487345467.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9GUTC2Qwrf0","i":[["Veal","4 meaty shanks"],["Flour","½ cup"],["Olive Oil","2 tablespoons"],["Butter","3 tablespoons"],["Onion","1 medium chopped into ½-inch pieces"],["Carrots","1 chopped into ½-inch pieces"],["Celery","1 chopped into ½-inch pieces"],["Fennel","1 bulb chopped into ½-inch pieces"],["Garlic","3 cloves"],["Orange Zest","2 strips"],["Marjoram","1 ½ teaspoons"],["Bay Leaf","1"],["Dry White Wine","1 cup"],["Chicken Stock","½ cup"],["Tomatoes","1 cup chopped with juice"],["Parsley","2 tablespoons chopped"],["Garlic","1 teaspoon minced"],["Lemon Zest","1 teaspoon grated"]],"s":"Heat the oven to 300 degrees.\r\nDredging the shanks: pour the flour into a shallow dish (a pie plate works nicely). Season the veal shanks on all sides with salt and pepper. One at a time, roll the shanks around in the flour coat, and shake and pat the shank to remove any excuses flour. Discard the remaining flour.\r\nBrowning the shanks: put the oil and 1 tablespoon of the butter in a wide Dutch oven or heavy braising pot (6 to 7 quart) and heat over medium-high heat. When the butter has melted and the oil is shimmering, lower the shanks into the pot, flat side down; if the shanks won’t fit without touching one another, do this in batches. Brown the shanks, turning once with tongs, until both flat sides are well caramelized, about 5 minutes per side. If the butter-oil mixture starts to burn, lower the heat just a bit. Transfer the shanks to a large platter or tray and set aside.\r\nThe aromatics: pour off and discard the fat from the pot. Wipe out any burnt bits with a damp paper towel, being careful not to remove any delicious little caramelized bits. Ad the remaining 2 tablespoons butter to the pot and melt it over medium heat. When the butter has stopped foaming, add the onion, carrot, celery, and fennel. Season with salt and pepper, stir, and cook the vegetables until they begin to soften but do not brown, about 6 minutes. Stir in the garlic, orange zest, marjoram, and bay leaf, and stew for another minute or two.\r\nThe braising liquid: add the wine, increase the heat to high, and bring to a boil. Boil, stirring occasionally, to reduce the wine by about half, 5 minutes. Add the stock and tomatoes, with their juice, and boil again to reduce the liquid to about 1 cup total, about 10 minutes.\r\nThe braise: Place the shanks in the pot so that they are sitting with the exposed bone facing up, and pour over any juices that accumulated as they sat. Cover with parchment paper, pressing down so the parchment nearly touches the veal and the edges hang over the sides of the pot by about an inch. Cover tightly with the lid, and slide into the lower part of the oven to braise at a gentle simmer. Check the pot after the first 15 minutes, and if the liquid is simmering too aggressively, lower the oven heat by 10 or 15 degrees. Continue braising, turning the shanks and spooning some pan juices over the top after the first 40 minutes, until the meat is completely tender and pulling away from the bone, about 2 hours.\r\nThe gremolata: While the shanks are braising, stir together the garlic, parsley, and lemon zest in a small bowl. Cover with plastic wrap and set aside in a cool place (or the refrigerator, if your kitchen is very warm.)\r\nThe finish: When the veal is fork-tender and falling away from the bone, remove the lid and sprinkle over half of the gremolata. Return the veal to the oven, uncovered, for another 15 minutes to caramelize it some.\r\nUsing a slotted spatula or spoon, carefully lift the shanks from the braising liquid, doing your best to keep them intact. The shanks will be very tender and threatening to fall into pieces, and the marrow will be wobbly inside the bones, so this can be a bit tricky. But if they do break apart, don’t worry, the flavor won’t suffer at all. Arrange the shanks on a serving platter or other large plate, without stacking, and cover with foil to keep warm.\r\nFinishing the sauce: Set the braising pot on top of the stove and evaluate the sauce: if there is a visible layer of fat floating on the surface, use a large spoon to skim it off and discard it. Taste the sauce for concentration of flavor. If it tastes a bit weak or flat, bring it to a boil over high heat, and boil to reduce the volume and intensify the flavor for 5 to 10 minutes. Taste again for salt and pepper. If the sauce wants more zip, stir in a teaspoon or two of the remaining gremolata.\r\nPortioning the veal shanks: if the shanks are reasonably sized, serve one per person. If the shanks are gargantuan or you’re dealing with modest appetites, pull apart the larger shanks, separating them at their natural seams, and serve smaller amounts. Be sure to give the marrow bones to whomever prizes them most.\r\nServing: Arrange the veal shanks on warm dinner plates accompanied by the risotto, if serving. Just before carrying the plates to the table, sprinkle on the remaining gremolata and then spoon over a generous amount of sauce – the contact with the hot liquid will aromatize the gremolata and perk up everyone’s appetite with the whiff of garlic and lemon.","z":"将烤箱加热至 300 度。\r\n疏通小腿：将面粉倒入一个浅盘中（馅饼盘效果很好）。用盐和胡椒给小牛腿各面调味。一次一个，将小腿在面粉层中滚动，然后摇动并拍打小腿，以除去任何借口面粉。丢弃剩余的面粉。\r\n将小腿煎成褐色：将油和 1 汤匙黄油放入宽的荷兰烤箱或重型炖锅（6 至 7 夸脱）中，然后用中高温加热。当黄油融化并且油闪闪发光时，将柄放入锅中，平的一面朝下；如果柄部在不相互接触的情况下无法安装，请分批进行。将柄部煎成棕色，用钳子转动一次，直到两侧均完全焦糖化，每侧约 5 分钟。如果黄油-油混合物开始燃烧，请稍微降低热量。将小腿转移到一个大浅盘或托盘中并放在一边。\r\n芳香剂：倒出并丢弃锅中的脂肪。用湿纸巾擦掉所有烧焦的碎片，小心不要去除任何美味的小焦糖碎片。将剩余的2汤匙黄油加入锅中，中火融化。当黄油停止起泡时，加入洋葱、胡萝卜、芹菜和茴香。用盐和胡椒调味，搅拌，然后煮蔬菜，直到它们开始变软但不会变成棕色，大约需要 6 分钟。加入大蒜、橙皮碎、马郁兰和月桂叶，再炖一两分钟。\r\n焖液：加入料酒，大火煮沸。煮沸，偶尔搅拌，使酒量减少约一半，即 5 分钟。加入高汤和西红柿及其汁液，再次煮沸约 10 分钟，将液体总量减少到约 1 杯。\r\n红烧：将小腿放入锅中，使裸露的骨头朝上，然后倒在它们坐下时积聚的汁液上。盖上羊皮纸，向下压，使羊皮纸几乎接触小牛肉，边缘悬在锅边约一英寸处。盖紧盖子，滑入烤箱下部，小火慢炖。前 15 分钟后检查锅，如果液体煮得太猛，请将烤箱温度降低 10 或 15 度。继续炖，在前 40 分钟后转动小腿，用勺子舀一些锅汁在上面，直到肉完全变软并脱离骨头，大约需要 2 小时。\r\ngremolata：在炖小腿的同时，将大蒜、欧芹和柠檬皮放入一个小碗中搅拌。用保鲜膜盖住并放在阴凉处（或冰箱，如果您的厨房非常温暖。）\r\n收尾：当小牛肉变软并与骨头分离时，打开盖子，撒上一半的格雷莫拉塔。将小牛肉放回烤箱，不盖盖子，再烤 15 分钟，使其焦糖化。\r\n使用有槽的抹刀或勺子，小心地从炖液中取出小腿，尽力保持它们完好无损。小腿会非常柔软，有可能会碎成碎片，而且骨髓会在骨头内摇晃，所以这可能有点棘手。但如果它们确实破裂了，不用担心，味道根本不会受到影响。将小腿放在盘子或其他大盘子上，不要堆叠，并用箔纸覆盖以保暖。\r\n完成酱汁：将炖锅放在炉子上并评估酱汁：如果表面浮着一层可见的脂肪，请用大勺将其撇去并丢弃。尝一下酱汁，让味道更浓。如果味道有点淡或平淡，可以用大火煮沸，煮5到10分钟以减少体积和增强味道。再次品尝盐和胡椒。如果酱汁想要更多，可加入一茶匙或两茶匙剩余的格雷莫拉塔。\r\n分配小牛腿：如果小牛腿的大小合理，则每人一份。如果小腿很大，或者您的胃口不大，请将较大的小腿拉开，在自然接缝处将它们分开，并提供少量的食物。一定要把骨髓送给最珍惜的人。\r\n食用：将小牛腿放在温暖的餐盘上，如果食用的话，还可以配上意大利调味饭。在将盘子端上桌之前，撒上剩余的格雷莫拉塔，然后用勺子舀上大量的酱汁——与热液体的接触将使格雷莫拉塔香气四溢，并通过大蒜和柠檬的味道提振每个人的食欲。"},{"id":"52837","n":"Pilchard puttanesca","a":"Italian","c":"Pasta","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/vvtvtr1511180578.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wqZzLAPmr9k","i":[["Spaghetti","300g"],["Olive Oil","1 tbls"],["Onion","1 finely chopped"],["Garlic","2 cloves minced"],["Red Chilli","1"],["Tomato Puree","1 tbls"],["Pilchards","425g"],["Black Olives","70g"],["Parmesan","Shaved"]],"s":"Cook the pasta following pack instructions. Heat the oil in a non-stick frying pan and cook the onion, garlic and chilli for 3-4 mins to soften. Stir in the tomato purée and cook for 1 min, then add the pilchards with their sauce. Cook, breaking up the fish with a wooden spoon, then add the olives and continue to cook for a few more mins.\r\n\r\nDrain the pasta and add to the pan with 2-3 tbsp of the cooking water. Toss everything together well, then divide between plates and serve, scattered with Parmesan.","z":"按照包装说明煮意大利面。在不粘煎锅中加热油，将洋葱、大蒜和辣椒煮3-4分钟至软化。加入番茄泥，煮 1 分钟，然后加入沙丁鱼及其酱汁。煮，用木勺把鱼打碎，然后加入橄榄，继续煮几分钟。\r\n\r\n将意大利面沥干，加入 2-3 汤匙煮水。将所有东西搅拌均匀，然后分装在盘子中，撒上帕尔马干酪即可食用。"},{"id":"53014","n":"Pizza Express Margherita","a":"Italian","c":"Miscellaneous","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/x0lk931587671540.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mt5lgUZRoUg","i":[["Water","150ml"],["Sugar","1 tsp"],["Yeast","15g"],["Plain Flour","225g"],["Salt","1 1/2 tsp"],["Olive Oil","Drizzle"],["Passata","80g"],["Mozzarella","70g"],["Oregano","Peeled and Sliced"],["Basil","Leaves"],["Black Pepper","Pinch"]],"s":"1 Preheat the oven to 230°C.\r\n\r\n2 Add the sugar and crumble the fresh yeast into warm water.\r\n\r\n3 Allow the mixture to stand for 10 – 15 minutes in a warm place (we find a windowsill on a sunny day works best) until froth develops on the surface.\r\n\r\n4 Sift the flour and salt into a large mixing bowl, make a well in the middle and pour in the yeast mixture and olive oil.\r\n\r\n5 Lightly flour your hands, and slowly mix the ingredients together until they bind.\r\n\r\n6 Generously dust your surface with flour.\r\n\r\n7 Throw down the dough and begin kneading for 10 minutes until smooth, silky and soft.\r\n\r\n8 Place in a lightly oiled, non-stick baking tray (we use a round one, but any shape will do!)\r\n\r\n9 Spread the passata on top making sure you go to the edge.\r\n\r\n10 Evenly place the mozzarella (or other cheese) on top, season with the oregano and black pepper, then drizzle with a little olive oil.\r\n\r\n11 Cook in the oven for 10 – 12 minutes until the cheese slightly colours.\r\n\r\n12 When ready, place the basil leaf on top and tuck in!","z":"1 将烤箱预热至 230°C。\r\n\r\n2 加入糖，将新鲜酵母捣碎，放入温水中。\r\n\r\n3 让混合物在温暖的地方静置 10 – 15 分钟（我们发现晴天的窗台效果最好），直到表面出现泡沫。\r\n\r\n4 将面粉和盐筛入一个大碗中，在中间挖一个洞，倒入酵母混合物和橄榄油。\r\n\r\n5 在手上轻轻撒上面粉，然后慢慢地将成分混合在一起，直至它们粘合在一起。\r\n\r\n6 在表面撒上大量面粉。\r\n\r\n7 将面团放下，开始揉捏10分钟，直至光滑、丝滑、柔软。\r\n\r\n8 放入抹了少许油的不粘烤盘中（我们用的是圆形的，但任何形状都可以！）\r\n\r\n9 将帕萨塔铺在上面，确保铺到边缘。\r\n\r\n10 将马苏里拉奶酪（或其他奶酪）均匀地放在上面，用牛至和黑胡椒调味，然后淋上少许橄榄油。\r\n\r\n11 在烤箱中煮 10 – 12 分钟，直至奶酪稍微变色。\r\n\r\n12 准备好后，将罗勒叶放在上面，然后塞进去！"},{"id":"52780","n":"Potato Gratin with Chicken","a":"Italian","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/qwrtut1468418027.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=p3u8eiy3yHI","i":[["Potatoes","800g"],["Onions","3"],["Olive Oil","2 tblsp"],["Chicken Stock","100ml"],["Creme Fraiche","1 pot"],["Parmesan","Topping"],["Chicken Breasts","4"],["Bacon","4"],["Spinach","Topping"],["Peas","Topping"]],"s":"15 minute potato gratin with chicken and bacon greens: a gratin always seems more effort and more indulgent than ordinary boiled or roasts, but it doesn't have to take 45mins, it's nice for a change and you can control the calorie content by going with full fat to low fat creme fraiche. (It's always tastes better full fat though obviously!) to serve 4: use 800g of potatoes, finely slice and boil in a pan for about 5-8 mins till firmish, not soft. Finely slice 3 onions and place in an oven dish with 2 tblsp of olive oil and 100ml of chicken stock. Cook till the onions are soft then drain the potatoes and pour onto the onions. Season and spoon over cream or creme fraiche till all is covered but not swimming. Grate Parmesan over the top then finish under the grill till nicely golden. serve with chicken and bacon, peas and spinach.","z":"15 分钟烤土豆配鸡肉和培根蔬菜：烤土豆似乎总是比普通的煮或烤更省力、更丰盛，但不一定要花 45 分钟，这是很好的改变，你可以通过从全脂到低脂鲜奶油来控制卡路里含量。 （显然，全脂的味道总是更好！） 4 份：使用 800 克土豆，切成薄片，在锅中煮约 5-8 分钟，直至变硬，而不是变软。将 3 个洋葱切成薄片，放入装有 2 汤匙橄榄油和 100 毫升鸡汤的烤盘中。煮至洋葱变软，然后将土豆沥干，倒在洋葱上。调味并用勺子浇上奶油或鲜奶油，直至全部被覆盖，但不要溢出。将帕尔马干酪磨碎，放在上面，然后在烤架下烤至金黄色。与鸡肉、培根、豌豆和菠菜一起食用。"},{"id":"52811","n":"Ribollita","a":"Italian","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/xrrwpx1487347049.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BiQUYTBb6eQ","i":[["Olive Oil","5 tablespoons"],["Onion","1 chopped"],["Carrots","1 chopped"],["Celery","1 stalk chopped"],["Garlic","1 tablespoon minced"],["Cannellini Beans","2 cups"],["Canned tomatoes","1"],["Water","4 cups"],["Rosemary","1 fresh sprig"],["Thyme","1 fresh sprig"],["Kale","1 pound chopped"],["Wholegrain Bread","4 thick slices"],["Red Onions","1 thinly sliced"],["Parmesan","½ cup freshly grated"]],"s":"Put 2 tablespoons of the oil in a large pot over medium heat. When it’s hot, add onion, carrot, celery and garlic; sprinkle with salt and pepper and cook, stirring occasionally, until vegetables are soft, 5 to 10 minutes.\r\nHeat the oven to 500 degrees. Drain the beans; if they’re canned, rinse them as well. Add them to the pot along with tomatoes and their juices and stock, rosemary and thyme. Bring to a boil, then reduce heat so the soup bubbles steadily; cover and cook, stirring once or twice to break up the tomatoes, until the flavors meld, 15 to 20 minutes.\r\nFish out and discard rosemary and thyme stems, if you like, and stir in kale. Taste and adjust seasoning. Lay bread slices on top of the stew so they cover the top and overlap as little as possible. Scatter red onion slices over the top, drizzle with the remaining 3 tablespoons oil and sprinkle with Parmesan.\r\nPut the pot in the oven and bake until the bread, onions and cheese are browned and crisp, 10 to 15 minutes. (If your pot fits under the broiler, you can also brown the top there.) Divide the soup and bread among 4 bowls and serve.","z":"将 2 汤匙油放入大锅中，用中火加热。热时加入洋葱、胡萝卜、芹菜和大蒜；撒上盐和胡椒，煮 5 到 10 分钟，偶尔搅拌，直到蔬菜变软。\r\n将烤箱加热至 500 度。沥干豆子；如果是罐装的，也要冲洗干净。将它们与西红柿及其汁液、高汤、迷迭香和百里香一起放入锅中。煮沸，然后关小火，使汤不断冒泡；盖上锅盖，煮 15 到 20 分钟，搅拌一两次以打碎西红柿，直至味道融合。\r\n如果你喜欢的话，捞出并丢弃迷迭香和百里香茎，然后拌入羽衣甘蓝。品尝并调整调味料。将面包片放在炖菜上，使它们覆盖顶部并尽可能少地重叠。将红洋葱片撒在上面，淋上剩余的 3 汤匙油，撒上帕尔马干酪。\r\n将锅放入烤箱烘烤 10 至 15 分钟，直至面包、洋葱和奶酪变成棕色且酥脆。 （如果你的锅适合放在烤肉机下面，你也可以将顶部煎成棕色。）将汤和面包分装在 4 个碗中即可食用。"},{"id":"52783","n":"Rigatoni with fennel sausage sauce","a":"Italian","c":"Lamb","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/qtqvys1468573168.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=45dpOfESxr8","i":[["olive oil","2½ tbsp"],["Italian fennel sausages","6 cut into 1.5cm-thick slices"],["onion","1 large peeled and chopped"],["fennel bulb","1 trimmed and roughly chopped; reserve any fronds to garnish"],["smoky paprika","½ tsp"],["garlic","1 clove, peeled and sliced"],["fennel seeds","2 tsp lightly toasted and then gently crushed"],["red wine","100ml"],["chopped tomatoes","400g tinned"],["caster sugar","½ tsp"],["pitted black olives","50g cut in half lengthways"],["rigatoni","500g"],["pecorino","30g roughly crumbled into 0.5cm pieces"],["anchovy fillet","1  rinsed and patted dry"],["garlic","1 clove, peeled and crushed"],["olive oil","60ml"],["basil leaves","50g torn"]],"s":"Heat a tablespoon of oil in a large saute pan for which you have a lid. Add the sausage pieces and fry on a medium-high heat for 10 minutes, stirring regularly, until golden-brown all over. Transfer the sausages to a plate, then add the onion and fennel to the hot pan and fry for 15 minutes, stirring once in a while, until soft and caramelised; if the pan goes a bit dry, add a teaspoon or so of extra oil. Stir in the paprika, garlic and half the fennel seeds, fry for two minutes more, then pour on the wine and boil for 30 seconds, to reduce by half. Add the tomatoes, sugar, 100ml water, the seared sausage and half a teaspoon of salt, cover and simmer for 30 minutes; remove the lid after 10 minutes, and cook until the sauce is thick and rich. Remove from the heat, stir through the olives and remaining fennel seeds and set aside until you’re ready to serve.\r\n\r\nBring a large pot of salted water to a boil, add the pasta and cook for 12-14 minutes (or according to the instructions on the packet), until al dente. Meanwhile, reheat the sauce. Drain the pasta, return it to the pot, stir in a tablespoon of oil, then divide between the bowls. \r\n\r\nPut all the pesto ingredients except the basil in the small bowl of a food processor. Add a tablespoon of water and blitz to a rough paste. Add the basil, then blitz until just combined (the pesto has a much better texture if the basil is not overblended).\r\n\r\nSpoon over the ragù and top with a spoonful of pesto. Finish with a sprinkling of chopped fennel fronds, if you have any, and serve at once.","z":"在一个有盖子的大煎锅中加热一汤匙油。加入香肠片，中高火煎 10 分钟，期间不断搅拌，直至全部呈金黄色。将香肠放入盘中，然后将洋葱和茴香放入热锅中煎 15 分钟，期间不时搅拌，直至变软并焦糖化；如果锅有点干，再加一茶匙左右的油。加入辣椒粉、大蒜和一半茴香籽，再炒两分钟，然后倒入酒煮30秒，减半。加入西红柿、糖、100毫升水、煎好的香肠和半茶匙盐，盖上锅盖，煮30分钟； 10分钟后打开盖子，煮至酱汁浓稠。从火上移开，搅拌橄榄和剩余的茴香籽，放在一边，直到准备好上桌。\r\n\r\n将一大锅盐水烧开，加入意大利面，煮 12-14 分钟（或按照包装上的说明），直至有嚼劲。同时，重新加热酱汁。将意大利面沥干，放回锅中，加入一汤匙油搅拌，然后分装在两个碗中。 \r\n\r\n将除罗勒以外的所有香蒜酱原料放入食品加工机的小碗中。添加一汤匙水并快速搅拌成粗糊状。添加罗勒，然后快速搅拌直至完全混合（如果罗勒没有过度混合，香蒜酱的质地会更好）。\r\n\r\n用勺子舀到肉酱上，然后在上面放一勺香蒜沙司。最后撒上切碎的茴香叶（如果有的话），然后立即上桌。"},{"id":"52823","n":"Salmon Prawn Risotto","a":"Italian","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/xxrxux1503070723.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V2PMvBv52IE","i":[["butter","50g/2oz"],["onion","1 finely chopped"],["rice","150g"],["white wine","125ml"],["vegetable stock","1 litre hot"],["lemon","The juice and zest of one"],["King Prawns","240g large"],["salmon","150g"],["asparagus","100g tips blanched briefly in boiling water"],["black pepper","ground"],["Parmesan","50g shavings"]],"s":"Melt the butter in a thick-based pan and gently cook the onion without colour until it is soft.\r\nAdd the rice and stir to coat all the grains in the butter\r\nAdd the wine and cook gently stirring until it is absorbed\r\nGradually add the hot stock, stirring until each addition is absorbed. Keep stirring until the rice is tender\r\nSeason with the lemon juice and zest, and pepper to taste. (there will probably be sufficient saltiness from the salmon to not need to add salt) Stir gently to heat through\r\nServe scattered with the Parmesan and seasonal vegetables.\r\nGrill the salmon and gently place onto the risotto with the prawns and asparagus","z":"在厚底锅中融化黄油，轻轻煮洋葱，直至变软。\r\n加入米饭并搅拌，使所有谷物都沾上黄油\r\n加入酒，轻轻搅拌直至吸收\r\n逐渐加入热汤，搅拌直至每次添加都被吸收。继续搅拌直至米饭变软\r\n加入柠檬汁、柠檬皮碎和胡椒粉调味。 （三文鱼可能有足够的咸味，不需要加盐）轻轻搅拌至热透\r\n与帕尔马干酪和时令蔬菜一起食用。\r\n烤三文鱼，轻轻地放在配有虾和芦笋的烩饭上"},{"id":"52770","n":"Spaghetti Bolognese","a":"Italian","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/sutysw1468247559.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-gF8d-fitkU","i":[["onions","2"],["olive oil","1tbsp"],["garlic","1 clove"],["lean minced beef","500g"],["mushrooms","90g"],["dried oregano","1tsp"],["tomatoes","400g can"],["hot beef stock","300ml"],["tomato puree","1tbsp"],["worcestershire sauce","1tbsp"],["spaghetti","350g"],["parmesan","Topping"]],"s":"Put the onion and oil in a large pan and fry over a fairly high heat for 3-4 mins. Add the garlic and mince and fry until they both brown. Add the mushrooms and herbs, and cook for another couple of mins.\r\n\r\nStir in the tomatoes, beef stock, tomato ketchup or purée, Worcestershire sauce and seasoning. Bring to the boil, then reduce the heat, cover and simmer, stirring occasionally, for 30 mins.\r\n\r\nMeanwhile, cook the spaghetti in a large pan of boiling, salted water, according to packet instructions. Drain well, run hot water through it, put it back in the pan and add a dash of olive oil, if you like, then stir in the meat sauce. Serve in hot bowls and hand round Parmesan cheese, for sprinkling on top.","z":"将洋葱和油放入大锅中，用相当高的火煎3-4分钟。加入大蒜，切碎，炒至两者都变成棕色。加入蘑菇和香草，再煮几分钟。\r\n\r\n加入西红柿、牛肉高汤、番茄酱或果泥、伍斯特沙司和调味料。煮沸，然后调小火，盖上锅盖，小火煮 30 分钟，偶尔搅拌。\r\n\r\n与此同时，根据包装说明，在一大锅沸腾的盐水中煮意大利面。沥干水分，倒入热水，放回锅中，如果愿意的话，加入少许橄榄油，然后拌入肉酱。盛入热碗中，将帕尔马干酪搓圆，撒在上面。"},{"id":"52982","n":"Spaghetti alla Carbonara","a":"Italian","c":"Pasta","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/llcbn01574260722.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_T6jkRvhlkk","i":[["Spaghetti","320g"],["Egg Yolks","6"],["Salt","As required"],["Bacon","150g"],["Pecorino","50g"],["Black Pepper","As required"]],"s":"STEP 1\r\nPut a large saucepan of water on to boil.\r\n\r\nSTEP 2\r\nFinely chop the 100g pancetta, having first removed any rind. Finely grate 50g pecorino cheese and 50g parmesan and mix them together.\r\n\r\nSTEP 3\r\nBeat the 3 large eggs in a medium bowl and season with a little freshly grated black pepper. Set everything aside.\r\n\r\nSTEP 4\r\nAdd 1 tsp salt to the boiling water, add 350g spaghetti and when the water comes back to the boil, cook at a constant simmer, covered, for 10 minutes or until al dente (just cooked).\r\n\r\nSTEP 5\r\nSquash 2 peeled plump garlic cloves with the blade of a knife, just to bruise it.\r\n\r\nSTEP 6\r\nWhile the spaghetti is cooking, fry the pancetta with the garlic. Drop 50g unsalted butter into a large frying pan or wok and, as soon as the butter has melted, tip in the pancetta and garlic.\r\n\r\nSTEP 7\r\nLeave to cook on a medium heat for about 5 minutes, stirring often, until the pancetta is golden and crisp. The garlic has now imparted its flavour, so take it out with a slotted spoon and discard.\r\n\r\nSTEP 8\r\nKeep the heat under the pancetta on low. When the pasta is ready, lift it from the water with a pasta fork or tongs and put it in the frying pan with the pancetta. Don’t worry if a little water drops in the pan as well (you want this to happen) and don’t throw the pasta water away yet.\r\n\r\nSTEP 9\r\nMix most of the cheese in with the eggs, keeping a small handful back for sprinkling over later.\r\n\r\nSTEP 10\r\nTake the pan of spaghetti and pancetta off the heat. Now quickly pour in the eggs and cheese. Using the tongs or a long fork, lift up the spaghetti so it mixes easily with the egg mixture, which thickens but doesn’t scramble, and everything is coated.\r\n\r\nSTEP 11\r\nAdd extra pasta cooking water to keep it saucy (several tablespoons should do it). You don’t want it wet, just moist. Season with a little salt, if needed.\r\n\r\nSTEP 12\r\nUse a long-pronged fork to twist the pasta on to the serving plate or bowl. Serve immediately with a little sprinkling of the remaining cheese and a grating of black pepper. If the dish does get a little dry before serving, splash in some more hot pasta water and the glossy sauciness will be revived.","z":"步骤1\r\n将一大锅水放入煮沸。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将 100 克薄煎饼切碎，首先去除外皮。将 50 克佩科里诺奶酪和 50 克帕尔玛干酪磨碎，然后将它们混合在一起。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n将 3 个大鸡蛋打入一个中等大小的碗中，并用少许新鲜磨碎的黑胡椒调味。把一切都放在一边。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n在沸水中加入 1 茶匙盐，加入 350 克意大利面，当水再次沸腾时，盖上锅盖，小火煮 10 分钟或直至有嚼劲（刚刚煮熟）。\r\n\r\n步骤5\r\n用刀刃将 2 颗去皮的饱满蒜瓣压扁，使其碰伤。\r\n\r\n步骤6\r\n煮意大利面的同时，用大蒜炒薄肉。将 50 克无盐黄油放入大煎锅或炒锅中，黄油融化后立即倒入薄肉和大蒜。\r\n\r\n第7步\r\n用中火煮约 5 分钟，经常搅拌，直到薄肉呈金黄色且酥脆。大蒜现在已经散发出味道，所以用漏勺将其取出并丢弃。\r\n\r\n步骤8\r\n将薄肉下面的热量保持在较低的温度。意大利面准备好后，用意大利面叉或钳子将其从水中提起，然后将其与意大利薄肉一起放入煎锅中。如果锅里也有一点水滴，不要担心（你希望这种情况发生），也不要把意大利面水倒掉。\r\n\r\n第9步\r\n将大部分奶酪与鸡蛋混合，保留一小把，以便稍后撒在上面。\r\n\r\n第10步\r\n将装有意大利面条和薄肉的锅从火上取下。现在快速倒入鸡蛋和奶酪。用钳子或长叉子夹起意大利面，使其与鸡蛋混合物轻松混合，鸡蛋混合物变稠但不会搅乱，所有东西都涂上了一层。\r\n\r\n第11步\r\n添加额外的意大利面煮水以保持其美味（几汤匙即可）。你不想让它潮湿，只是潮湿。如果需要的话，加一点盐调味。\r\n\r\n第12步\r\n使用长叉叉将意大利面拧到盘子或碗上。立即上桌，撒上少许剩余的奶酪和黑胡椒粉。如果菜在上菜前变得有点干，再泼一些热意大利面水，光滑的酱汁就会恢复。"},{"id":"52771","n":"Spicy Arrabiata Penne","a":"Italian","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/ustsqw1468250014.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1IszT_guI08","i":[["penne rigate","1 pound"],["olive oil","1/4 cup"],["garlic","3 cloves"],["chopped tomatoes","1 tin"],["red chilli flakes","1/2 teaspoon"],["italian seasoning","1/2 teaspoon"],["basil","6 leaves"],["Parmigiano-Reggiano","sprinkling"]],"s":"Bring a large pot of water to a boil. Add kosher salt to the boiling water, then add the pasta. Cook according to the package instructions, about 9 minutes.\r\nIn a large skillet over medium-high heat, add the olive oil and heat until the oil starts to shimmer. Add the garlic and cook, stirring, until fragrant, 1 to 2 minutes. Add the chopped tomatoes, red chile flakes, Italian seasoning and salt and pepper to taste. Bring to a boil and cook for 5 minutes. Remove from the heat and add the chopped basil.\r\nDrain the pasta and add it to the sauce. Garnish with Parmigiano-Reggiano flakes and more basil and serve warm.","z":"将一大锅水烧开。在沸水中加入粗盐，然后加入意大利面。按照包装说明煮约 9 分钟。\r\n在一个大煎锅中，用中火加热，加入橄榄油并加热，直到油开始闪烁。加入大蒜，搅拌，煮 1 至 2 分钟，直至散发出香味。加入切碎的西红柿、红辣椒片、意大利调味料、盐和胡椒调味。煮沸并煮 5 分钟。从火上移开，加入切碎的罗勒。\r\n沥干意大利面并将其添加到酱汁中。用帕尔马干酪片和更多罗勒装饰，趁热享用。"},{"id":"52849","n":"Spinach & Ricotta Cannelloni","a":"Italian","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/wspuvp1511303478.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rYGaEJjyLQA","i":[["Olive Oil","3 tbsp"],["Garlic","8 cloves chopped"],["Caster Sugar","3 tbsp"],["Red Wine Vinegar","2 tblsp"],["Chopped Tomatoes","3 400g Cans"],["Basil Leaves","Bunch"],["Mascarpone","2 tubs"],["Milk","3 tbsp"],["Parmesan","85g"],["Mozzarella","2 sliced"],["Spinach","1kg"],["Parmesan","100g"],["Ricotta","3 tubs"],["Nutmeg","pinch"],["Cannellini Beans","400g"]],"s":"First make the tomato sauce. Heat the oil in a large pan and fry the garlic for 1 min. Add the sugar, vinegar, tomatoes and some seasoning and simmer for 20 mins, stirring occasionally, until thick. Add the basil and divide the sauce between 2 or more shallow ovenproof dishes (see Tips for freezing, below). Set aside. Make a sauce by beating the mascarpone with the milk until smooth, season, then set aside.\r\n\r\nPut the spinach in a large colander and pour over a kettle of boiling water to wilt it (you may need to do this in batches). When cool enough to handle squeeze out the excess water. Roughly chop the spinach and mix in a large bowl with 100g Parmesan and ricotta. Season well with salt, pepper and the nutmeg.\r\n\r\nHeat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Using a piping bag or plastic food bag with the corner snipped off, squeeze the filling into the cannelloni tubes. Lay the tubes, side by side, on top of the tomato sauce and spoon over the mascarpone sauce. Top with Parmesan and mozzarella. You can now freeze the cannelloni, uncooked, or you can cook it first and then freeze. Bake for 30-35 mins until golden and bubbling. Remove from oven and let stand for 5 mins before serving.","z":"首先制作番茄酱。在大锅中加热油，炒大蒜 1 分钟。加入糖、醋、西红柿和一些调味料，煮20分钟，偶尔搅拌，直至浓稠。添加罗勒，并将酱汁分装在两个或多个耐热浅盘中（请参阅下面的冷冻技巧）。放在一边。将马斯卡彭奶酪与牛奶一起搅拌至光滑，调味，然后放在一边制成酱汁。\r\n\r\n将菠菜放入一个大漏勺中，倒入一壶沸水使其枯萎（您可能需要分批进行）。当冷却到足以处理时，挤出多余的水。将菠菜粗略切碎，放入一个大碗中，与 100 克帕尔马干酪和意大利乳清干酪混合。用盐、胡椒和肉豆蔻调味。\r\n\r\n将烤箱加热至 200C/180C 风扇/燃气 6. 使用裱花袋或塑料食品袋，将角剪掉，将馅料挤入卷筒中。将管子并排放在番茄酱上，然后用勺子浇在马斯卡彭酱上。上面放上帕尔马干酪和马苏里拉奶酪。现在，您可以冷冻未煮熟的意大利肉卷，也可以先煮熟然后冷冻。烘烤 30-35 分钟直至呈金黄色并冒泡。从烤箱中取出，静置 5 分钟即可食用。"},{"id":"52866","n":"Squash linguine","a":"Italian","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/wxswxy1511452625.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xHZ-PoGwTLQ","i":[["Butternut Squash","350g"],["Garlic","3 parts"],["Olive Oil","3 tbs"],["Linguine Pasta","350g"],["Sage","Small bunch"]],"s":"Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Put the squash and garlic on a baking tray and drizzle with the olive oil. Roast for 35-40 mins until soft. Season.\r\nCook the pasta according to pack instructions. Drain, reserving the water. Use a stick blender to whizz the squash with 400ml cooking water. Heat some oil in a frying pan, fry the sage until crisp, then drain on kitchen paper. Tip the pasta and sauce into the pan and warm through. Scatter with sage.","z":"将烤箱加热至 200C/180C 风扇/燃气 6. 将南瓜和大蒜放在烤盘上，淋上橄榄油。烤 35-40 分钟直至变软。季节。\r\n根据包装说明煮意大利面。沥干水分，备用。使用棒式搅拌机将南瓜与 400 毫升烹饪水一起搅拌。煎锅中烧热少许油，将鼠尾草煎至酥脆，然后用厨房用纸吸干水分。将意大利面和酱汁倒入锅中并加热。撒以鼠尾草。"},{"id":"52775","n":"Vegan Lasagna","a":"Italian","c":"Vegan","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/rvxxuy1468312893.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VU8cXvlGbvc","i":[["green red lentils","1 cups"],["Carrots","1"],["onion","1"],["zucchini","1 small"],["coriander","sprinking"],["spinach","150g"],["lasagne sheets","10"],["vegan butter","35g"],["flour","4 tablespoons"],["soya milk","300ml"],["mustard","1.5 teaspoons"],["vinegar","1 teaspoon"]],"s":"1) Preheat oven to 180 degrees celcius. \r\n2) Boil vegetables for 5-7 minutes, until soft. Add lentils and bring to a gentle simmer, adding a stock cube if desired. Continue cooking and stirring until the lentils are soft, which should take about 20 minutes. \r\n3) Blanch spinach leaves for a few minutes in a pan, before removing and setting aside. \r\n4) Top up the pan with water and cook the lasagne sheets. When cooked, drain and set aside.\r\n5) To make the sauce, melt the butter and add the flour, then gradually add the soya milk along with the mustard and the vinegar. Cook and stir until smooth and then assemble the lasagne as desired in a baking dish. \r\n6) Bake in the preheated oven for about 25 minutes.","z":"1) 将烤箱预热至180摄氏度。 \r\n2) 将蔬菜煮5-7分钟，直至变软。加入扁豆，小火慢炖，如果需要，可加入汤块。继续烹饪和搅拌，直到扁豆变软，这大约需要 20 分钟。 \r\n3）将菠菜叶放入锅中焯几分钟，然后取出并放在一边。 \r\n4) 将锅加满水，煮千层面。煮熟后，沥干并放在一边。\r\n5）制作酱汁时，将黄油融化并加入面粉，然后逐渐加入豆浆、芥末和醋。煮并搅拌直至光滑，然后根据需要将烤宽面条放入烤盘中。 \r\n6）放入预热好的烤箱，烤约25分钟。"},{"id":"52838","n":"Venetian Duck Ragu","a":"Italian","c":"Pasta","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/qvrwpt1511181864.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oWQDVgjB_Lw","i":[["Olive Oil","1 tbls"],["Duck Legs","4"],["Onions","2 finely chopped"],["Garlic","2 cloves minced"],["Cinnamon","2 tsp ground"],["Plain Flour","2 tsp"],["Red Wine","250ml"],["Chopped Tomatoes","800g"],["Chicken Stock Cube","1"],["Rosemary","3 sprigs"],["Bay Leaves","2"],["Sugar","1 tsp"],["Milk","2 tbs"],["Paccheri Pasta","600g"],["Parmesan Cheese","Grated"]],"s":"Heat the oil in a large pan. Add the duck legs and brown on all sides for about 10 mins. Remove to a plate and set aside. Add the onions to the pan and cook for 5 mins until softened. Add the garlic and cook for a further 1 min, then stir in the cinnamon and flour and cook for a further min. Return the duck to the pan, add the wine, tomatoes, stock, herbs, sugar and seasoning. Bring to a simmer, then lower the heat, cover with a lid and cook for 2 hrs, stirring every now and then.\r\nCarefully lift the duck legs out of the sauce and place on a plate – they will be very tender so try not to lose any of the meat. Pull off and discard the fat, then shred the meat with 2 forks and discard the bones. Add the meat back to the sauce with the milk and simmer, uncovered, for a further 10-15 mins while you cook the pasta.\r\nCook the pasta following pack instructions, then drain, reserving a cup of the pasta water, and add the pasta to the ragu. Stir to coat all the pasta in the sauce and cook for 1 min more, adding a splash of cooking liquid if it looks dry. Serve with grated Parmesan, if you like.","z":"在大锅中加热油。加入鸭腿，各面煎至棕色约 10 分钟。移至盘子上并放在一边。将洋葱放入锅中，煮 5 分钟直至变软。加入大蒜，再煮一分钟，然后加入肉桂和面粉，再煮一分钟。将鸭子放回锅中，加入酒、西红柿、高汤、香草、糖和调味料。煮至沸腾，然后调小火，盖上盖子煮2小时，期间不时搅拌。\r\n小心地将鸭腿从酱汁中取出并放在盘子上——它们会很嫩，所以尽量不要失去任何肉。拉下并丢弃脂肪，然后用两把叉子将肉切碎并丢弃骨头。将肉放回带有牛奶的酱汁中，不盖盖子继续煮 10-15 分钟，同时煮意大利面。\r\n按照包装说明煮意大利面，然后沥干，保留一杯意大利面水，然后将意大利面添加到拉古中。搅拌使所有意大利面都沾上酱汁，再煮 1 分钟，如果看起来很干，则加入一点烹饪液。如果您愿意，可与磨碎的帕尔马干酪一起食用。"},{"id":"52940","n":"Brown Stew Chicken","a":"Jamaican","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/sypxpx1515365095.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_gFB1fkNhXs","i":[["Chicken","1 whole"],["Tomato","1 chopped"],["Onions","2 chopped"],["Garlic Clove","2 chopped"],["Red Pepper","1 chopped"],["Carrots","1 chopped"],["Lime","1"],["Thyme","2 tsp"],["Allspice","1 tsp"],["Soy Sauce","2 tbs"],["Cornstarch","2 tsp"],["Coconut Milk","2 cups"],["Vegetable Oil","1 tbs"]],"s":"Squeeze lime over chicken and rub well. Drain off excess lime juice.\r\nCombine tomato, scallion, onion, garlic, pepper, thyme, pimento and soy sauce in a large bowl with the chicken pieces. Cover and marinate at least one hour.\r\nHeat oil in a dutch pot or large saucepan. Shake off the seasonings as you remove each piece of chicken from the marinade. Reserve the marinade for sauce.\r\nLightly brown the chicken a few pieces at a time in very hot oil. Place browned chicken pieces on a plate to rest while you brown the remaining pieces.\r\nDrain off excess oil and return the chicken to the pan. Pour the marinade over the chicken and add the carrots. Stir and cook over medium heat for 10 minutes.\r\nMix flour and coconut milk and add to stew, stirring constantly. Turn heat down to minimum and cook another 20 minutes or until tender.","z":"将酸橙挤在鸡肉上并揉匀。沥干多余的酸橙汁。\r\n将番茄、葱、洋葱、大蒜、胡椒、百里香、多椒和酱油与鸡块一起放入一个大碗中。盖上盖子腌制至少一小时。\r\n在荷兰锅或大平底锅中加热油。从腌料中取出每块鸡肉时，抖掉调味料。保留酱汁的腌料。\r\n在非常热的油中一次将几块鸡肉轻轻煎成棕色。将褐色的鸡肉块放在盘子上休息，同时将剩余的鸡肉块变成褐色。\r\n沥干多余的油，然后将鸡肉放回锅中。将腌料倒在鸡肉上，然后加入胡萝卜。搅拌并用中火煮10分钟。\r\n将面粉和椰奶混合，加入炖菜中，不断搅拌。将火调至最低，再煮 20 分钟或直至变软。"},{"id":"52939","n":"Callaloo Jamaican Style","a":"Jamaican","c":"Miscellaneous","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/ussyxw1515364536.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bCr3GasJWwE","i":[["Kale","1  bunch"],["Bacon","2 strips"],["Garlic","3 cloves Chopped"],["Onion","1 medium"],["Paprika","1/2 tsp"],["Thyme","1 Sprig"],["Tomato","1"],["Red Pepper","1"],["Banana","4"],["Vegetable Oil","Splash"]],"s":"Cut leaves and soft stems from the kale branches, them soak in a bowl of cold water for about 5-10 minutes or until finish with prep.\r\nProceed to slicing the onions, mincing the garlic and dicing the tomatoes. Set aside\r\nRemove kale from water cut in chunks.\r\nPlace bacon on saucepan and cook until crispy. Then add onions, garlic, thyme, stir for about a minute or more\r\nAdd tomatoes; scotch bonnet pepper, smoked paprika. Sauté for about 2-3 more minutes.\r\nFinally add vegetable, salt, mix well, and steamed for about 6-8 minutes or until leaves are tender. Add a tiny bit of water as needed. Adjust seasonings and turn off the heat.\r\nUsing a sharp knife cut both ends off the plantain. This will make it easy to grab the skin of the plantains. Slit a shallow line down the long seam of the plantain; peel only as deep as the peel. Remove plantain peel by pulling it back.\r\nSlice the plantain into medium size lengthwise slices and set aside.\r\nCoat a large frying pan with cooking oil spray. Spray the tops of the plantains with a generous layer of oil spray and sprinkle with salt, freshly ground pepper.\r\nLet the plantains \"fry\" on medium heat, shaking the frying pan to redistribute them every few minutes.\r\nAs the plantains brown, continue to add more cooking oil spray, salt and pepper (if needed) until they have reached the desired color and texture.\r\nRemove and serve with kale","z":"从羽衣甘蓝树枝上切下叶子和软茎，将它们浸泡在一碗冷水中约 5-10 分钟或直至准备完成。\r\n继续将洋葱切片，大蒜切碎，西红柿切丁。放在一边\r\n将羽衣甘蓝从水中取出，切成块。\r\n将培根放在平底锅上煮至酥脆。然后加入洋葱、大蒜、百里香，搅拌约一分钟或更长时间\r\n加入西红柿；苏格兰帽胡椒，烟熏辣椒粉。再炒约2-3分钟。\r\n最后加入蔬菜、盐，拌匀，蒸约6-8分钟或直至叶子变软。根据需要添加少量水。调整调味料并关火。\r\n用一把锋利的刀把车前草的两端切掉。这样可以很容易地抓住车前草的皮。沿着车前草的长缝划一条浅线；剥皮深度应与果皮一样深。将车前草皮向后拉，将其去除。\r\n将车前草纵向切成中等大小的切片并放在一边。\r\n在大煎锅上涂上食用油喷雾。在车前草的顶部喷上一层厚厚的油雾，并撒上盐和现磨的胡椒粉。\r\n让车前草用中火“煎”，每隔几分钟摇动煎锅，使它们重新分布。\r\n当车前草变成棕色时，继续添加更多的食用油喷雾、盐和胡椒（如果需要），直到达到所需的颜色和质地。\r\n取出并与羽衣甘蓝一起食用"},{"id":"53361","n":"Callaloo and SaltFish","a":"Jamaican","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/73o3vq1765317873.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=n1fRCk-zTRM","i":[["Salt Cod","1/2 lb"],["Bacon","4"],["Callaloo","525g"],["Onion","1 chopped"],["Spring Onions","2 chopped"],["Garlic","2 cloves minced"],["Scotch Bonnet","1 chopped"],["Plum Tomatoes","2 chopped"],["Thyme","2 sprigs"],["Black Pepper","1/4 tsp"]],"s":"Soak salted fish in water overnight. Next, heat salted fish in water on stove until water boils. You should see a foam on top. Remove from heat and drain. Set aside and shred salted fish once it cools.\r\nCook bacon in skillet over medium heat until crispy. Remove bacon from heat and drain the majority of the bacon grease, leaving about 1 tablespoon in the skillet. \r\nAdd yellow onion, green onion, scotch bonnet pepper, and garlic to the skillet and stir. Cook for about 2 minutes or until onions soften. Add salted fish to skillet and stir. Cook for about a minute. \r\nNext, add callaloo, roma tomatoes, thyme, and black pepper. Stir to combine and cook until heated through, about 2 minutes.\r\nEnjoy ","z":"将咸鱼浸泡在水中过夜。接下来，将咸鱼放入水中，在炉子上加热直至水沸腾。您应该会看到顶部有泡沫。从火上移开并沥干。待凉后将咸鱼切碎放在一边。\r\n将培根放入煎锅中，用中火煮至酥脆。将培根从火上移开，沥干大部分培根油脂，在煎锅中留下约 1 汤匙。 \r\n将黄洋葱、葱、苏格兰帽辣椒和大蒜放入煎锅中，搅拌。煮约 2 分钟或直至洋葱变软。将咸鱼加入煎锅中并搅拌。煮约一分钟。 \r\n接下来，加入卡拉卢、罗马番茄、百里香和黑胡椒。搅拌混合并煮至热透，约 2 分钟。\r\n享受"},{"id":"53360","n":"Caribbean Tamarind balls","a":"Jamaican","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/z1hz7z1765316430.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=adRA-90CHUE","i":[["Tamarind Pulp","16 ounces"],["Sugar","1 1/2 cups"]],"s":"Add tamarind pulp and 1 cup granulated sugar to a bowl and mash together with a spoon or fork. Take small amounts of the tamarind and sugar mix and shape them into small balls by rolling them in your hands. Make them the size of a marble or slightly bigger, as you like.\r\nAdd the remaining sugar to a flat surface, like a plate or a sheet pan. Roll the tamarind balls in granulated sugar until they're well-coated.\r\nYou can eat the tamarind balls immediately, or you can let them set for a few hours or overnight. Allowing them to set will give them a firmer texture and more crystallized sugar coating. Enjoy.","z":"将罗望子果肉和 1 杯砂糖放入碗中，用勺子或叉子捣碎。取少量罗望子和糖的混合物，在手中滚动，将它们形成小球。根据您的喜好，将它们制作为弹珠大小或稍大一些。\r\n将剩余的糖添加到平坦的表面上，例如盘子或平底锅。将罗望子球放入砂糖中滚动，直至裹上一层糖。\r\n您可以立即食用罗望子球，也可以将其放置几个小时或过夜。让它们凝固会让它们的质地更坚硬，糖衣更结晶。享受。"},{"id":"53350","n":"Corned Beef and Cabbage – Jamaican Style","a":"Jamaican","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/kdz63q1764793442.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Bxjz-q2hioA","i":[["Olive Oil","1 tablespoon"],["Cabbage","1/2"],["Green Pepper","1 chopped"],["Onion","1 chopped"],["Garlic","2 cloves minced"],["Corned Beef","12 ounces"],["Plum Tomatoes","2 chopped"],["Thyme","2 sprigs"],["Tomato Ketchup","1 tablespoon"],["Salt","To taste"],["Pepper","To taste"]],"s":"Heat olive oil in a skillet or Dutch pot over medium-high heat. Add onion and green pepper and sauté for about 3-5 minutes.\r\nAdd garlic and stir for about 1 minute.\r\nAdd shredded cabbage and stir. Cook for about about 3-5 minutes, stirring often until softened.\r\nAdd corned beef, Roma tomatoes, and thyme and stir. Add ketchup and scotch bonnet pepper sauce and stir. Reduce heat and cook on medium for about 3-5 minutes, until the corned beef is heated through. Remove from heat.\r\nServe with white rice, bread, or on its own.","z":"在煎锅或荷兰锅中用中高火加热橄榄油。加入洋葱和青椒，炒约3-5分钟。\r\n加入大蒜并搅拌约1分钟。\r\n加入切碎的卷心菜并搅拌。煮约 3-5 分钟，经常搅拌直至变软。\r\n加入咸牛肉、罗马番茄和百里香，搅拌。加入番茄酱和苏格兰帽辣椒酱并搅拌。调小火，用中火煮约 3-5 分钟，直到咸牛肉热透。从火上移开。\r\n与白米饭、面包一起食用，或单独食用。"},{"id":"52944","n":"Escovitch Fish","a":"Jamaican","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/1520084413.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nF6DOtGE6k8","i":[["Red Snapper","2 Pounds"],["Vegetable Oil","1/2 cup"],["Garlic","1 clove peeled crushed"],["Ginger","1/2 tsp"],["Thyme","2 sprigs"],["Bay Leaf","1"],["Red Pepper","0.5"],["Yellow Pepper","0.5"],["Onion","1 sliced"],["Carrots","1 chopped"],["Sugar","1 tbs"],["Allspice","1/2 tsp"],["Worcestershire Sauce","1 tsp"],["Scotch Bonnet","1"],["Lime","1"],["Malt Vinegar","3/4 cup"],["Pepper","pinch"]],"s":"Rinse fish; rub with lemon or lime, seasoned with salt and pepper or use your favorite seasoning. I used creole seasoning. Set aside or place in the oven to keep it warm until sauce is ready.\r\n\r\nIn large skillet heat oil over medium heat, until hot, add the fish, cook each side- for about 5-7 minutes until cooked through and crispy on both sides. Remove fish and set aside. Drain oil and leave about 2-3 tablespoons of oil\r\nAdd, bay leave, garlic and ginger, stir-fry for about a minute making sure the garlic does not burn\r\nThen add onion, bell peppers, thyme, scotch bonnet, sugar, all spice-continue stirring for about 2-3 minutes. Add vinegar, mix an adjust salt and pepper according to preference. Let it simmer for about 2 more minutes. \r\n\r\nDiscard bay leave, thyme spring and serve over fish with a side of this bammy. You may make the sauce about 2 days in advance.","z":"将鱼洗净；用柠檬或酸橙擦拭，用盐和胡椒调味或使用您最喜欢的调味料。我用克里奥尔调味料。放在一边或放入烤箱保温，直到酱汁准备好。\r\n\r\n在大煎锅中用中火加热油，直至热，加入鱼，每面煎约 5-7 分钟，直至两面都熟透且酥脆。取出鱼并放在一边。沥干油，留下约2-3汤匙油\r\n加入月桂叶、大蒜和生姜，炒约一分钟，确保大蒜不会烧焦\r\n然后加入洋葱、青椒、百里香、苏格兰威士忌帽、糖和所有香料，继续搅拌约 2-3 分钟。加入醋，根据喜好混合盐和胡椒粉。再煮约 2 分钟。 \r\n\r\n丢弃月桂叶、百里香泉，将这道面包放在鱼上。酱汁可以提前2天左右做好。"},{"id":"53346","n":"Grape Nut Ice Cream","a":"Jamaican","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/1xscby1764790242.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZxKA2bGkIa8","i":[["Heavy Cream","2 cups"],["Condensed Milk","1 1/4 oz"],["Vanilla Extract","1 tsp"],["Grape Nut Cereal","1 cup"]],"s":"In a large bowl, use an electric mixer to whip the cold heavy cream until stiff peaks form. Gently fold in the sweetened condensed milk and vanilla extract until well combined.\r\nFold in the cereal and stir until evenly distributed throughout the mixture.\r\nPour the mixture into a freezer-safe container (such as a loaf pan). Lay plastic wrap on top of the ice cream to avoid freezer burn. Cover the container and freeze for at least 6 hours or until solid.\r\nOnce frozen, let the ice cream sit at room temperature for a few minutes to soften slightly before scooping and serving.","z":"在一个大碗中，使用电动搅拌机搅打冷浓奶油，直至形成硬峰。轻轻拌入甜炼乳和香草精，直至充分混合。\r\n拌入麦片并搅拌直至均匀分布在混合物中。\r\n将混合物倒入可冷冻的容器（例如面包盘）中。在冰淇淋上面铺上保鲜膜，以免被冻伤。盖上容器并冷冻至少 6 小时或直至凝固。\r\n冷冻后，让冰淇淋在室温下放置几分钟，使其稍微软化，然后舀出并食用。"},{"id":"53351","n":"Jamaican Banana Fritters","a":"Jamaican","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/ul2uy31764794321.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/I3wZ04FgW0I","i":[["Banana","3 Medium"],["Vanilla Extract","1 tsp"],["Cinnamon","1/2 tsp"],["Nutmeg","1/4 tsp"],["Brown Sugar","3  tablespoons"],["Salt","Pinch"],["All purpose flour","1 cup"],["Oil","For frying"]],"s":"Mash bananas with fork in bowl.\r\nAdd brown sugar, vanilla, extract, cinnamon, nutmeg and a pinch of salt. Sift in flour and stir with spoon until fully combined.\r\nAdd oil to a 10 inch skillet over medium-high heat. Once oil is hot, drop banana fritter batter in oil by the spoonful. Once one side is golden and bubbles appear on the top, flip fritter and cook until the other side is browned as well.\r\nRemove fritters and drain on paper towels. Enjoy","z":"用叉子将香蕉放入碗中捣碎。\r\n加入红糖、香草、提取物、肉桂、肉豆蔻和少许盐。筛入面粉，用勺子搅拌直至完全混合。\r\n在 10 英寸煎锅中加入油，用中高火加热。油热后，将香蕉油条面糊一勺一勺地倒入油中。一旦一面呈金黄色且顶部出现气泡，翻转油条并煮至另一面也变成棕色。\r\n取出油条并用纸巾吸干水分。享受"},{"id":"52938","n":"Jamaican Beef Patties","a":"Jamaican","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/wsqqsw1515364068.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ypQjoiZiTac","i":[["Plain Flour","4 cups"],["Salt","1 tsp"],["Curry Powder","1 tsp"],["Butter","250g"],["Water","1 cup"],["Minced Beef","900g"],["Allspice","1 tsp"],["Black Pepper","1/2 tsp"],["Vegetable Oil","2 tbs"],["Onions","1 cup"],["Red Pepper","Ground"],["Garlic","2 tsp ground"],["Thyme","1 tbs"],["Salt","1/4 tsp"],["Tomato Ketchup","2 tbs"],["Water","2 cups"],["Onions","1/2 cup"],["Egg","1 beaten"],["Water","1 tbs"],["Water","1/4 cup"]],"s":"Make the Pastry Dough\r\n\r\nTo a large bowl, add flour, 1 teaspoon salt, and turmeric and mix thoroughly.\r\nRub shortening into flour until there are small pieces of shortening completely covered with flour.\r\nPour in 1/2 cup of the ice water and mix with your hands to bring the dough together. Keep adding ice water 2 to 3 tablespoons at a time until the mixture forms a dough.\r\nAt this stage, you can cut the dough into 2 large pieces, wrap in plastic and refrigerate for 30 minutes before using it.\r\nAlternatively, cut the dough into 10 to 12 equal pieces, place on a platter or baking sheet, cover securely with plastic wrap and let chill for 30 minutes while you make the filling.\r\nMake the Filling\r\n\r\nAdd ground beef to a large bowl. Sprinkle in allspice and black pepper. Mix together and set aside.\r\nHeat oil in a skillet until hot.\r\nAdd onions and sauté until translucent. Add hot pepper, garlic and thyme and continue to sauté for another minute. Add 1/4 teaspoon salt.\r\nAdd seasoned ground beef and toss to mix, breaking up any clumps, and let cook until the meat is no longer pink.\r\nAdd ketchup and more salt to taste.\r\nPour in 2 cups of water and stir. Bring the mixture to a boil then reduce heat and let simmer until most of the liquid has evaporated and whatever is remaining has reduced to a thick sauce.\r\nFold in green onions. Remove from heat and let cool completely.\r\nAssemble the Patties\r\n\r\nBeat the egg and water together to make an egg wash. Set aside.\r\nNow you can prepare the dough in two ways.\r\nFirst Method: Flour the work surface and rolling pin. If you had cut it into 2 large pieces, then take one of the large pieces and roll it out into a very large circle. Take a bowl with a wide rim (about 5 inches) and cut out three circles.\r\n\r\nPlace about 3 heaping tablespoons of the filling onto 1/2 of each circle. Dip a finger into the water and moisten the edges of the pastry. Fold over the other half and press to seal. \r\n\r\nTake a fork and crimp the edges. Cut off any extra to make it look neat and uniform. Place on a parchment-lined baking sheet and continue to work until you have rolled all the dough and filled the patties.\r\nSecond Method: If you had pre-cut the dough into individual pieces, work with one piece of dough at a time. Roll it out on a floured surface into a 5-inch circle or a little larger. Don’t worry if the edges are not perfect.\r\n\r\nPlace 3 heaping tablespoons of the filling on one side of the circle. Dip a finger into the water and moisten the edges of the pastry. Fold over the other half and press to seal.\r\n\r\nTake a fork and crimp the edges. Cut off any extra to make it look neat and uniform. Place on a parchment-lined baking sheet and continue work until you have rolled all the dough and filled the patties.\r\n\r\nFrying and Serving the Patties\r\n\r\nAfter forming the patties, place the pans in the refrigerator while you heat the oven to 350 F.\r\nJust before adding the pans with the patties to the oven, brush the patties with egg wash.\r\nBake patties for 30 minutes or until golden brown.\r\nCool on wire racks.\r\nServe warm.","z":"制作糕点面团\r\n\r\n在一个大碗中加入面粉、1 茶匙盐和姜黄，并充分混合。\r\n将起酥油揉入面粉中，直至小块起酥油完全被面粉覆盖。\r\n倒入 1/2 杯冰水，用手将面团混合在一起。继续加入冰水，每次 2 到 3 汤匙，直到混合物形成面团。\r\n在此阶段，您可以将面团切成2大块，用保鲜膜包裹并冷藏30分钟后再使用。\r\n或者，将面团切成 10 到 12 个相等的块，放在盘子或烤盘上，用保鲜膜牢固地覆盖，并在制作馅料时冷却 30 分钟。\r\n制作馅料\r\n\r\n将碎牛肉放入一个大碗中。撒上五香粉和黑胡椒。混合在一起并放在一边。\r\n将煎锅中的油加热至热。\r\n加入洋葱，炒至半透明。加入辣椒、大蒜和百里香，继续炒一分钟。添加 1/4 茶匙盐。\r\n加入调味过的碎牛肉，搅拌均匀，打碎任何结块，煮至肉不再呈粉红色。\r\n添加番茄酱和更多的盐调味。\r\n倒入2杯水并搅拌。将混合物煮沸，然后调小火，小火慢炖，直到大部分液体蒸发，剩下的东西变成浓稠的酱汁。\r\n拌入葱。从火上移开并完全冷却。\r\n组装馅饼\r\n\r\n将鸡蛋和水一起搅拌，制成蛋液。放在一边。\r\n现在你可以用两种方法准备面团。\r\n第一种方法：在工作表面和擀面杖上撒面粉。如果你把它切成两块大块，那么拿一块大块，把它擀成一个很大的圆圈。取一个宽边（约5英寸）的碗，切出三个圆圈。\r\n\r\n将大约 3 汤匙馅料放在每个圆圈的 1/2 上。将手指浸入水中并弄湿糕点的边缘。折叠另一半并按压密封。 \r\n\r\n拿一把叉子，卷曲边缘。剪掉多余的部分，使其看起来整洁、统一。放在衬有羊皮纸的烤盘上，继续工作，直到卷完所有面团并填满馅饼。\r\n第二种方法：如果您已将面团预先切成单独的块，请一次处理一块面团。在撒了面粉的表面上将其擀成 5 英寸或稍大的圆圈。如果边缘不完美，请不要担心。\r\n\r\n将 3 汤匙馅料放在圆圈的一侧。将手指浸入水中并弄湿糕点的边缘。折叠另一半并按压密封。\r\n\r\n拿一把叉子，卷曲边缘。剪掉多余的部分，使其看起来整洁、统一。放在衬有羊皮纸的烤盘上，继续工作，直到卷完所有面团并填满馅饼。\r\n\r\n煎炸和供应肉饼\r\n\r\n形成肉饼后，将平底锅放入冰箱，同时将烤箱加热到 350 F。\r\n在将装有肉饼的平底锅放入烤箱之前，在肉饼上刷上蛋液。\r\n将肉饼烘烤 30 分钟或直至呈金黄色。\r\n放在金属架上冷却。\r\n趁热食用。"},{"id":"53353","n":"Jamaican Boiled Dumplings","a":"Jamaican","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/tsdbcq1764795636.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RhUxdkYIHPY","i":[["Water","8 cups"],["Salt","1/2 tbs"],["All purpose flour","2 cups"],["Salt","1 tsp"],["Water","1/2 cup"]],"s":"Instructions\r\n \r\nIn a large pot, bring water and salt to a boil to boil the dumplings.\r\nIn a large mixing bowl, combine the all-purpose flour and salt, stirring to distribute the salt evenly throughout the flour. Gradually add water to the flour mixture, mixing with your hands until a dough forms.\r\nDivide the dough into equal-sized pieces, rolling each into a smooth ball. Flatten each ball slightly with the palm of your hand to form a round, circular dumpling. It should look like a thick disk.\r\nCarefully drop the dumplings into the boiling water, one at a time, ensuring that they don't stick together. You can use a wooden spoon to stir the dumplings in the water.\r\nBoil the dumplings for 15-20 minutes, or until they are cooked through and have risen to the surface of the water. Stir occasionally to prevent sticking.\r\nUse a slotted spoon to remove the cooked dumplings from the pot, allowing any excess water to drain.\r\nServe with your favorite recipes.","z":"使用说明\r\n \r\n在一个大锅中，将水和盐煮沸，煮饺子。\r\n在一个大搅拌碗中，将通用面粉和盐混合，搅拌使盐均匀分布在面粉中。逐渐将水加入面粉混合物中，用手搅拌直至形成面团。\r\n将面团分成大小相等的块，将每个块擀成光滑的球。用手掌将每个球稍微压扁，形成一个圆形的饺子。它应该看起来像一个厚圆盘。\r\n小心地将饺子放入沸水中，一次一个，确保它们不会粘在一起。可以用木勺在水里搅拌饺子。\r\n将饺子煮15-20分钟，或直到饺子煮熟并浮出水面。偶尔搅拌以防止粘连。\r\n用漏勺将煮熟的饺子从锅中取出，沥干多余的水。\r\n与您最喜欢的食谱一起食用。"},{"id":"53363","n":"Jamaican Cornmeal Porridge","a":"Jamaican","c":"Breakfast","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/sng9bm1765320170.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NACm9tDACRc","i":[["Water","4 cups"],["Coconut Milk","380g"],["Fine Yellow Cornmeal","1 cup"],["Vanilla Extract","1 1/2 tsp"],["Ground Cinnamon","1/2 tsp"],["Ground Nutmeg","1/2 tsp"],["Ground Allspice","1/4 tsp"],["Sweetened Condensed Milk","1/2 cup"]],"s":"Add 2 ½ cups water, 1 can coconut milk to a 4 QT heavy bottomed pot. Bring to a boil over medium-high heat.\r\nMeanwhile, add 1 cup cornmeal and 1 ½ cup water to a large mixing cup and whisk until smooth.\r\nOnce the pot begins to boil, whisk in cornmeal mixture and continue to whisk for about 1 minute, ensuring there are no lumps. Reduce heat to low and cover with a tight fitting lid.\r\nCook over low heat for 15-20 minutes, stirring occasionally. When there is about 5 minutes left, stir in vanilla extract, cinnamon, nutmeg, and all-spice. Remove from heat and sweeten with condensed milk.\r\nServe and enjoy.","z":"将 2 ½ 杯水、1 罐椰奶加入 4 夸脱的厚底锅中。用中高火煮沸。\r\n同时，将 1 杯玉米粉和 1 ½ 杯水放入一个大搅拌杯中，搅拌至光滑。\r\n一旦锅开始沸腾，加入玉米粉混合物，继续搅拌约1分钟，确保没有结块。将热量降至最低并盖上紧密的盖子。\r\n用小火煮 15-20 分钟，偶尔搅拌。还剩大约 5 分钟时，加入香草精、肉桂、肉豆蔻和五香粉。从火上移开并用炼乳增甜。\r\n服务并享受。"},{"id":"53345","n":"Jamaican Curry Chicken Recipe","a":"Jamaican","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/o5fuq51764789643.jpg","y":"","i":[["Chicken Thighs","2 Lbs"],["Curry Powder","2 1/2 Tbs"],["All-purpose Seasoning","1 tsp"],["Onion","1 chopped"],["Spring Onions","3 chopped"],["Green Pepper","1/2"],["Garlic","4 Cloves Chopped"],["Scotch Bonnet","1 chopped"],["Thyme","3 sprigs"],["Olive Oil","3  tablespoons"],["Water","1/4 cup"],["Russet Potato","1 large"],["Salt","To taste"],["Pepper","To taste"]],"s":"Equipment\r\n\r\nDutch Oven\r\n\r\nInstructions\r\n \r\nAdd chicken thighs, all-purpose seasoning, 1 tablespoon of curry powder, onion, green onions, green pepper, garlic cloves, scotch bonnet pepper (if using), and thyme to a large bowl and combine, making sure all chicken pieces are covered with the seasoning. Cover and refrigerate for at least 1 hour or up to overnight.\r\nOne the chicken is done marinating, remove onions, peppers, and garlic cloves from chicken and set aside.\r\nHeat olive oil in a large heavy bottom pot over medium heat. Add remaining curry powder and stir, cooking for about 20-30 seconds. Add onions, green pepper, garlic cloves, thyme, and scotch bonnet pepper (if using) to pot and stir until onions have softened, about 3-5 minutes. If your onions and peppers are looking dry, add about 1 tablespoon of water.\r\nAdd chicken and ¼ cup of water to the pot. Cover and reduce heat to medium low. Cook, stirring occasionally, for 30-35 minutes.\r\nWhen there is about 15 minutes remaining, stir in potato and continue to cook covered.\r\nOnce chicken is cooked and potatoes are softened, remove from heat. Salt and pepper to taste.","z":"设备\r\n\r\n荷兰烤箱\r\n\r\n使用说明\r\n \r\n将鸡大腿、通用调味料、1 汤匙咖喱粉、洋葱、葱、青椒、蒜瓣、苏格兰帽胡椒（如果使用）和百里香放入一个大碗中，混合，确保所有鸡块都被调味料覆盖。盖上盖子并冷藏至少 1 小时或最多过夜。\r\n鸡肉腌制完成后，去掉鸡肉上的洋葱、辣椒和蒜瓣，放在一边。\r\n在一个大的重底锅中用中火加热橄榄油。加入剩余的咖喱粉，搅拌，煮约 20-30 秒。将洋葱、青椒、蒜瓣、百里香和苏格兰帽胡椒（如果使用）放入锅中，搅拌约 3-5 分钟，直至洋葱变软。如果洋葱和辣椒看起来很干，请添加约 1 汤匙水。\r\n将鸡肉和 1/4 杯水加入锅中。盖上盖子并将热量降至中低。煮 30-35 分钟，偶尔搅拌。\r\n还剩15分钟左右时，拌入土豆，盖上锅盖继续煮。\r\n鸡肉煮熟且土豆变软后，将其从火上移开。盐和胡椒调味。"},{"id":"53354","n":"Jamaican Curry Goat","a":"Jamaican","c":"Goat","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/uc9qp11764796575.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SrX2KMsWbF4","i":[["Goat Meat","3 Lbs"],["Jamaican Curry Powder","2.5 tbsp"],["Ground Ginger","1/2 tsp"],["All-purpose Seasoning","1/2 tsp"],["Allspice","1/4 tsp"],["Onion","1 chopped"],["Garlic","6 cloves sliced"],["Thyme","3 sprigs"],["Oil","2 tablespoons"],["Water","1 1/4 cup"],["Scotch Bonnet","1"],["Russet Potato","1 large"],["Salt","To taste"],["Pepper","To taste"]],"s":"Equipment\r\n\r\n6QT Pressure cooker\r\n\r\nInstructions\r\n \r\nRinse goat meat with vinegar and water.\r\nSeason goat meat with 1 ½ tablespoon curry powder, all-purpose seasoning, ground ginger, allspice, onion, garlic cloves, and thyme. Marinate for at least 4 hours or up to overnight.\r\nRemove onion and garlic from goat and set aside.\r\nSet an electric pressure cooker, like an Instant Pot, on high sauté and add oil. Add goat meat and brown, about 2-3 minutes per side. Remove goat from insert and add 1 tablespoon oil and remaining curry powder and sauté for about 10 seconds. Then add onions and garlic and sauté until softened. About 4 minutes. If the onions look dry, add a little water and continue to sauté.\r\nAdd goat and water to the pressure cooker and cover the pressure cooker. Cook for 40 minutes on high pressure. Allow to naturally release for 10 minutes, then release the remaining pressure.\r\nOnce all the pressure has been released, open the pressure cooker. Place on sauté for 10-15 minutes, add potatoes and a whole scotch bonnet pepper. Cook until potatoes have softened. Remove scotch bonnet pepper.","z":"设备\r\n\r\n6QT高压锅\r\n\r\n使用说明\r\n \r\n用醋和水冲洗山羊肉。\r\n用 1 ½ 汤匙咖喱粉、通用调味料、姜末、五香粉、洋葱、蒜瓣和百里香给山羊肉调味。腌制至少 4 小时或最长过夜。\r\n从山羊身上取出洋葱和大蒜，放在一边。\r\n将电压力锅（例如速溶锅）放在高火上炒，然后加油。添加山羊肉和棕色，每面约 2-3 分钟。将山羊肉从插入物中取出，加入 1 汤匙油和剩余的咖喱粉，炒约 10 秒。然后加入洋葱和大蒜，炒至变软。大约4分钟。如果洋葱看起来很干，加一点水，继续炒。\r\n将山羊和水加入高压锅中，盖上高压锅盖。高压煮40分钟。使其自然释放 10 分钟，然后释放剩余压力。\r\n释放所有压力后，打开高压锅。炒 10-15 分钟，加入土豆和整个苏格兰帽辣椒。煮至土豆变软。去掉苏格兰帽辣椒。"},{"id":"53362","n":"Jamaican Curry Shrimp Recipe","a":"Jamaican","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/n7h5zs1765318909.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Lnaj4duQ7hs","i":[["Jumbo Shrimp","1 lb"],["Jamaican Curry Powder","2.5 tbsp"],["All-purpose Seasoning","1 tsp"],["Olive Oil","2 tablespoons"],["Onion","1 sliced"],["Red Pepper","1 sliced"],["Green Pepper","1 sliced"],["Scotch Bonnet","1 sliced"],["Garlic","3 cloves Chopped"],["Unsweetened Coconut Milk","380g"],["Tomato Ketchup","1/2 tbs"],["Thyme","4 sprigs"],["Salt","To taste"],["Pepper","To taste"]],"s":"Season shrimp with 1 Tablespoon of curry powder and all-purpose seasoning and set aside for about 10 minutes while you prepare the other ingredients like chopping your onions, peppers, and garlic.\r\nHeat 2 Tablespoons of olive oil in a large skillet over medium heat. Add sliced yellow onion, red bell pepper, green bell pepper, scotch bonnet pepper, if using, and chopped garlic and stir for 5 minutes, until peppers are slightly softened.\r\nAdd 1.5 Tablespoons of curry powder to the skillet and stir for an additional minute.\r\nThen add coconut milk, seasoned shrimp, ketchup, and thyme, making sure the shrimp is covered in the sauce.\r\nAllow the sauce to come to a simmer and continue to cook over medium heat, stirring occasionally and flipping the shrimp halfway, until the shrimp is fully cooked on both sides. This should take about 5-6 minutes. Salt and pepper to taste.","z":"用 1 汤匙咖喱粉和通用调味料给虾调味，放置约 10 分钟，同时准备其他配料，如切碎洋葱、辣椒和大蒜。\r\n在大煎锅中用中火加热 2 汤匙橄榄油。加入黄洋葱片、红甜椒、青甜椒、苏格兰帽椒（如果使用）和切碎的大蒜，搅拌 5 分钟，直至辣椒稍微软化。\r\n将 1.5 汤匙咖喱粉加入煎锅中，再搅拌一分钟。\r\n然后加入椰奶、调味虾、番茄酱和百里香，确保虾被酱汁覆盖。\r\n让酱汁煮沸，继续用中火煮，偶尔搅拌并翻动虾，直到虾两面都完全煮熟。这大约需要 5-6 分钟。盐和胡椒调味。"},{"id":"53355","n":"Jamaican Festival (Sweet Dumpling)","a":"Jamaican","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/g6xb8m1764875029.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=N270k22MPWk","i":[["All purpose flour","1 1/2 cups"],["Cornmeal","1/2 cup"],["Sugar","6 tablespoons"],["Baking Powder","2 tsp"],["Vanilla Extract","1 tsp"],["Salt","1/2 tsp"],["Milk","3/4 cup"],["Oil","For frying"]],"s":"Heat a heavy bottom pot of oil that has at least 3 inches of oil in it or use a deep fryer if you have one. Turn the heat over medium heat until the temperature reaches 350 degrees Fahrenheit.\r\nAdd the all-purpose flour, cornmeal, granulated sugar, baking powder, and salt to a large bowl and stir to combine.\r\nAdd the vanilla extract and milk and stir until the dough comes together. Then use your hands to lightly form the mixture into a ball.\r\nPinch off pieces of dough and roll them into long oval shapes. Make about 12 dumplings.\r\nOnce the oil has reached the temperature of 350 degrees Fahrenheit, fry the dough on all sides, until golden brown. This should take about 4-6 minutes.\r\nRemove dough and drain off any excess grease. Serve and enjoy.","z":"加热一锅油，其中至少有 3 英寸厚的油，或者使用油炸锅（如果有的话）。将热量转为中火，直至温度达到 350 华氏度。\r\n将通用面粉、玉米粉、砂糖、发酵粉和盐放入一个大碗中，搅拌混合。\r\n加入香草精和牛奶，搅拌直至面团混合在一起。然后用手将混合物轻轻地形成一个球。\r\n把面团捏下来，擀成长椭圆形。包大约12个饺子。\r\n一旦油的温度达到 350 华氏度，将面团各面煎至金黄色。这大约需要 4-6 分钟。\r\n取出面团并沥干多余的油脂。服务并享受。"},{"id":"53356","n":"Jamaican Fried Dumplings","a":"Jamaican","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/dd7t4d1764877271.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=W5AJhsW-X44","i":[["All purpose flour","2 cups"],["Baking Powder","2 tsp"],["Salt","1 tsp"],["Milk","3/4 cup"],["Oil","1 1/2 cup"]],"s":"Add flour, baking powder, and salt in a large bowl and stir to combine. Pour in the milk and stir until combined. Then roll the mixture into a ball and lightly knead until it comes together.\r\nBreak off about 10 pieces of dough and form them into balls. Set them aside.\r\nIn a 10-inch skillet, heat enough oil over medium heat to fry the dumplings, until the oil is about 350 degrees.\r\nOnce the dumplings are browned on one side, flip them and cook until both sides are browned, about 2-3 minutes each.\r\nOnce done, remove the dumplings from the oil and place them on paper towels or a cooling rack to drain off any excess oil.\r\nServe and enjoy.\r\n","z":"在一个大碗中加入面粉、泡打粉和盐，搅拌混合。倒入牛奶并搅拌直至混合。然后将混合物滚成球并轻轻揉捏直至混合在一起。\r\n将面团分成约10块，然后搓成​​球状。把它们放在一边。\r\n在10英寸的煎锅中，用中火加热足够的油，将饺子煎至约350度。\r\n一旦饺子的一面变成褐色，将其翻转并煮至两面变成褐色，每面约2-3分钟。\r\n完成后，将饺子从油中取出，并将其放在纸巾或冷却架上，以沥干多余的油。\r\n服务并享受。"},{"id":"53352","n":"Jamaican Instant Pot Rice and Beans","a":"Jamaican","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/11bvtm1764795135.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iJm1F-TE8Sk","i":[["Olive Oil","1 tablespoon"],["Onion","1 chopped"],["Garlic","1 clove finely chopped"],["Spring Onions","2 chopped"],["Rice","2 cups"],["Coconut Milk","3/4 cup"],["Water","3/4 cup"],["Salt","1 1/2 tsp"],["Allspice","1/2 tsp"],["Black Pepper","1/4 tsp"],["Kidney Beans","450g"],["Thyme","2 sprigs"]],"s":"Instructions\r\n \r\nSet Instant Pot to \"Sauté.\" Once Hot, add olive oil. Then add yellow onion and stir until softened, about 3 minutes. Add garlic and green onions and stir for about 30 more seconds.\r\nPress “Cancel” on the Instant Pot. Add rice, coconut milk, water, salt, allspice, and black pepper and stir.\r\nPour undrained kidney beans on top of the rice mixture. Do not stir. Lay sprigs of thyme on top. Cover the Instant Pot, ensuring the valve is set to “Sealing.”\r\nPress “Manual” or “Pressure Cook” on the Instant Pot and set for High pressure for 6 minutes.\r\nOnce the pressure cooking time is done, allow it to natural release for 10 minutes, then quick release any remaining pressure by moving valve to \"Venting\"\r\nOpen lid and remove thyme sprigs. Fluff rice with fork and Enjoy!\r\n\r\nStove Top Instructions\r\nHeat olive oil in a large pot over medium heat. Add yellow onion and stir until softened, about 3 minutes. Add garlic and green onions and stir for about 30 more seconds.\r\nAdd rice, undrained kidney beans, coconut milk, water, salt, allspice, and black pepper and stir until combined. Lay thyme on top. Bring mixture to a simmer.\r\nCover with a lid and reduce heat to low. Allow to cook for 18 minutes over low heat, then remove from heat. Leave the lid on for an additional 5 minutes.\r\nOpen the lid and remove the thyme. Fluff rice with fork. Enjoy.","z":"使用说明\r\n \r\n将速溶锅设置为“炒”。一旦热，加入橄榄油。然后加入黄洋葱，搅拌约3分钟直至变软。加入大蒜和葱，再搅拌约 30 秒。\r\n按速溶锅上的“取消”。加入米饭、椰奶、水、盐、五香粉和黑胡椒，搅拌。\r\n将未沥干的芸豆倒在米饭混合物上。不要搅拌。将百里香小枝放在上面。盖上速溶锅，确保阀门设置为“密封”。\r\n按速溶锅上的“手动”或“压力烹饪”并设置为高压 6 分钟。\r\n压力烹饪时间结束后，使其自然释放 10 分钟，然后将阀门移至“排气”位置，快速释放剩余压力\r\n打开盖子并取出百里香小枝。用叉子把米饭弄松，然后享用吧！\r\n\r\n炉灶说明\r\n在一个大锅中用中火加热橄榄油。加入黄洋葱，搅拌约 3 分钟直至变软。加入大蒜和葱，再搅拌约 30 秒。\r\n加入米饭、未沥干的芸豆、椰奶、水、盐、五香粉和黑胡椒，搅拌直至混合。将百里香放在上面。将混合物煮沸。\r\n盖上盖子并将热量降至最低。用小火煮 18 分钟，然后离火。盖上盖子再静置 5 分钟。\r\n打开盖子，取出百里香。用叉子把米饭弄松。享受。"},{"id":"53349","n":"Jamaican Pepper Shrimp","a":"Jamaican","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/bx07m71764792853.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ILCmxtCp8jc","i":[["Shrimp","1 lb"],["Scotch Bonnet","2 chopped"],["All-purpose Seasoning","1 tablespoon"],["Ground Annatto","2 tsp"],["Allspice","2 tsp"],["Shrimp Stock","3/4 cup"],["Onion","1/4 cup"],["Garlic","2 cloves minced"],["White Vinegar","2 tablespoons"],["Thyme","3 sprigs"],["Salt","To taste"]],"s":"\r\nIn a medium bowl, combine shrimp with minced Scotch Bonnet peppers, all-purpose seasoning, ground annatto, and grounf allspice. Toss well to coat evenly and let marinate for 10 minutes.\r\nHeat a large pan over medium heat. Add the shrimp stock and bring to a gentle simmer. Stir in the diced onion and garlic, cooking until softened and fragrant, about 2 minutes.\r\nAdd the seasoned shrimp and thyme sprigs, spreading the shrimp in the pan. Cover and cook for about 5–7 minutes, stirring occasionally, until the shrimp turn bright orange and are cooked through.\r\nAdd the white vinegar, stir, and cook for another minute. Taste; add salt to taste. Using a slotted spoon, transfer the shrimp to a plate. Serve hot with some cooking liquid drizzled on top.","z":"在一个中等大小的碗中，将虾与切碎的苏格兰帽辣椒、通用调味料、红木粉和五香粉混合。搅拌均匀，腌制 10 分钟。\r\n用中火加热一个大平底锅。加入虾汤，小火慢炖。加入切碎的洋葱和大蒜，煮约2分钟，直至变软并散发出香味。\r\n加入调味虾和百里香小枝，将虾铺在锅中。盖上锅盖，煮约 5-7 分钟，偶尔搅拌，直至虾变成亮橙色并煮熟。\r\n加入白醋，搅拌，再煮一分钟。品尝;加盐调味。用漏勺将虾转移到盘子上。趁热享用，上面淋上一些烹饪液。"},{"id":"53357","n":"Jamaican Rice and Peas","a":"Jamaican","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/pkyvrn1764878267.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=swVY-6tUK5g","i":[["Rice","2 cups"],["Coconut Milk","380g"],["Kidney Beans","450g"],["Water","1 cup"],["Kosher Salt","2 tsp"],["Ground Allspice","1/2 tsp"],["Black Pepper","1/4 tsp"],["Spring Onions","3"],["Thyme","2 sprigs"],["Scotch Bonnet","1"]],"s":"Equipment\r\nDutch oven\r\n\r\nAdd rice, coconut milk, kidney beans, water, kosher salt, allspice, and black pepper to a large pot and stir until combined. Lay green onions, thyme and Scotch bonnet pepper on top. Bring mixture to a boil.\r\nOnce boiling, reduce heat to low and cover with a lid. Allow to cook covered for 18 minutes over low heat, then remove from heat. Leave the lid on for an additional 5 minutes.\r\nOpen the lid and remove the green onion, Scotch bonnet pepper, and thyme. Fluff the rice and peas with a fork. Serve and enjoy.","z":"设备\r\n荷兰烤箱\r\n\r\n将大米、椰奶、芸豆、水、粗盐、五香粉和黑胡椒放入大锅中，搅拌直至混合。将葱、百里香和苏格兰帽胡椒放在上面。将混合物煮沸。\r\n沸腾后，将火调小并盖上盖子。盖上锅盖，小火煮 18 分钟，然后离火。盖上盖子再静置 5 分钟。\r\n打开盖子，取出葱、苏格兰帽胡椒和百里香。用叉子将米饭和豌豆弄松。服务并享受。"},{"id":"53348","n":"Jamaican Spice Bun Recipe","a":"Jamaican","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/08c5f41764791918.jpg","y":"","i":[["All purpose flour","380g"],["Baking Powder","2 tsp"],["Ground Cinnamon","2 tsp"],["Salt","1/2 tsp"],["Egg","1 large"],["Brown Sugar","150g"],["Beer","250g"],["Milk","1/3 cup"],["Honey","1/4 cup"],["Unsalted Butter","4 tablespoons"],["Molasses","1 tablespoon"],["Caramelized Sugar Sauce","1 tsp"],["Vanilla Extract","1 tsp"],["Dried cranberries","1/2 cup"],["Raisins","1/2 cup"],["Dried Cherries","1/2 cup"]],"s":"Soak the craisins, raisins, and cherries in the 1 cup of beer. Set aside and allow to soak for 30 minutes.\r\nPreheat the oven to 325 degrees Fahrenheit. Grease an 8x4 loaf pan. Set aside.\r\nCombine all-purpose flour, baking powder, ground cinnamon, salt, in a large bowl and set aside.\r\nIn another bowl, combine brown sugar, egg, milk, honey, melted butter, molasses, browning, vanilla extract, and the beer that’s soaking the fruit. Do not pour the fruit in at this time, just the beer. Mix to combine.\r\nRemove 2 tablespoon of flour from the flour mixture and toss the fruit in it. Set aside.\r\nMake a well in the middle of the bowl of dry ingredients and pour in wet mixture, stirring until fully combined. And the fruits to the mixture and stir until incpororated.\r\nPour mixture into prepared loaf pan and bake in the preheated oven for 50-60 minutes or until a toothpick comes out clean.\r\nCool for 5 minutes in the pan and then move to a cooling rack to finish cooling. Serve with slices of cheddar cheese.","z":"将蔓越莓干、葡萄干和樱桃浸泡在 1 杯啤酒中。放在一边并浸泡 30 分钟。\r\n将烤箱预热至 325 华氏度。在 8x4 面包盘上涂抹油脂。放在一边。\r\n将通用面粉、泡打粉、肉桂粉、盐混合在一个大碗中，备用。\r\n在另一个碗中，将红糖、鸡蛋、牛奶、蜂蜜、融化的黄油、糖蜜、褐变剂、香草精和浸泡水果的啤酒混合在一起。此时不要倒入水果，只需倒入啤酒即可。混合混合。\r\n从面粉混合物中取出 2 汤匙面粉，然后将水果放入其中。放在一边。\r\n在装有干原料的碗中间挖一个洞，倒入湿混合物，搅拌直至完全混合。将水果加入混合物中，搅拌直至混合。\r\n将混合物倒入准备好的面包盘中，在预热的烤箱中烘烤 50-60 分钟或直至牙签拔出时干净。\r\n在锅中冷却 5 分钟，然后移至冷却架上完成冷却。与切达干酪片一起食用。"},{"id":"53364","n":"Jamaican Steamed Cabbage","a":"Jamaican","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/paejva1765321314.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=amEkrC9rzgM","i":[["Cabbage","1/2"],["Carrots","2 sliced"],["Plum Tomatoes","1 chopped"],["Onion","1 chopped"],["Garlic","4 Cloves Chopped"],["Spring Onions","4 Chopped"],["Thyme","4 sprigs"],["Scotch Bonnet","1/2"],["Water","2 tablespoons"],["Olive Oil","2 tablespoons"],["Unsalted Butter","4 tablespoons"],["Kosher Salt","2 tsp"],["Black Pepper","1 tsp"]],"s":"Add all the ingredients to a large pan over medium heat and cover with a lid.\r\nCook on medium heat for 10 minutes, stirring occasionally.\r\nAfter 10 minutes, reduce the heat to low and continue to cook for an additional 5 minutes, until the cabbage is soft and tender. Remove from the heat and remove the stalks of thyme before serving.","z":"将所有原料放入大锅中，用中火加热，盖上盖子。\r\n用中火煮 10 分钟，偶尔搅拌。\r\n10分钟后，将火调小，继续煮5分钟，直到卷心菜变软。食用前，将火从火上移开并去除百里香的茎。"},{"id":"53344","n":"Jamaican Sweet Potato Pudding","a":"Jamaican","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/xj9sa81764788866.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8W8hZeGuiOc","i":[["Sweet Potatoes","2 Lbs"],["Coconut Milk","1 1/2 cup"],["Brown Sugar","1 1/2 cup"],["All purpose flour","1/2 cup"],["Vanilla Extract","1 tablespoon"],["Allspice","1 teaspoon"],["Ground Cinnamon","1 tsp"],["Ground Nutmeg","1 tsp"],["Ground Ginger","1/2 tsp"],["Salt","1/4 tsp"],["Raisins","1/2 cup"],["Coconut Milk","3/4 cup"],["Brown Sugar","1 tablespoon"],["Ground Cinnamon","1/8 teaspoon"],["Ground Nutmeg","1/8 teaspoon"]],"s":"Preheat oven to 350°F (175°C). Grease and line a 9-inch round pan or loaf pan with parchment paper.\r\nPlace your cut sweet potatoes in the bowl of a food processor and process until finely grated. In a small bowl, toss raisins in 2 teaspoons flour from the ½ cup. Set aside.\r\nIn a large bowl, combine grated sweet potatoes, light brown sugar, all-purpose flour, vanilla extract, allspice, cinnamon, nutmeg, ginger, and salt. Stir in 1½ cups of coconut milk until a batter forms. Fold in the raisins that were tossed in the flour.\r\nPour the batter into the prepared pan and smooth the top. Bake uncovered for 1 hour 30 minutes, until mostly set but still slightly soft in the center","z":"将烤箱预热至 350°F (175°C)。在 9 英寸圆盘或面包盘上涂上油脂并铺上羊皮纸。\r\n将切好的红薯放入食品加工机的碗中，加工直至磨碎。在一个小碗中，将葡萄干放入 ½ 杯中的 2 茶匙面粉中。放在一边。\r\n在一个大碗中，混合磨碎的红薯、淡红糖、通用面粉、香草精、五香粉、肉桂、肉豆蔻、生姜和盐。加入 1½ 杯椰奶，搅拌直至形成面糊。将拌入面粉中的葡萄干拌入。\r\n将面糊倒入准备好的平底锅中，并抹平顶部。不盖盖子烘烤 1 小时 30 分钟，直至基本凝固，但中心仍稍软"},{"id":"52937","n":"Jerk chicken with rice & peas","a":"Jamaican","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/tytyxu1515363282.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qfchrS2D_v4","i":[["Chicken Thighs","12"],["Lime","1/2"],["Spring Onions","1  bunch"],["Ginger","1 tbs chopped"],["Garlic","3 cloves"],["Onion","1/2"],["Red Chilli","3 chopped"],["Thyme","1/2 teaspoon"],["Lime","Juice of 1"],["Soy Sauce","2 tbs"],["Vegetable Oil","2 tbs"],["Brown Sugar","3 tbs"],["Allspice","1 tbs"],["Basmati Rice","200g"],["Coconut Milk","400g"],["Spring Onions","1  bunch"],["Thyme","2 sprigs"],["Garlic","2 cloves chopped"],["Allspice","1 tbs"],["Kidney Beans","800g"]],"s":"To make the jerk marinade, combine all the ingredients in a food processor along with 1 tsp salt, and blend to a purée. If you’re having trouble getting it to blend, just keep turning off the blender, stirring the mixture, and trying again. Eventually it will start to blend up – don’t be tempted to add water, as you want a thick paste.\r\n\r\nTaste the jerk mixture for seasoning – it should taste pretty salty, but not unpleasantly, puckering salty. You can now throw in more chillies if it’s not spicy enough for you. If it tastes too salty and sour, try adding in a bit more brown sugar until the mixture tastes well balanced.\r\n\r\nMake a few slashes in the chicken thighs and pour the marinade over the meat, rubbing it into all the crevices. Cover and leave to marinate overnight in the fridge.\r\n\r\nIf you want to barbecue your chicken, get the coals burning 1 hr or so before you’re ready to cook. Authentic jerked meats are not exactly grilled as we think of grilling, but sort of smoke-grilled. To get a more authentic jerk experience, add some wood chips to your barbecue, and cook your chicken over slow, indirect heat for 30 mins. To cook in the oven, heat to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Put the chicken pieces in a roasting tin with the lime halves and cook for 45 mins until tender and cooked through.\r\n\r\nWhile the chicken is cooking, prepare the rice & peas. Rinse the rice in plenty of cold water, then tip it into a large saucepan with all the remaining ingredients except the kidney beans. Season with salt, add 300ml cold water and set over a high heat. Once the rice begins to boil, turn it down to a medium heat, cover and cook for 10 mins.\r\n\r\nAdd the beans to the rice, then cover with a lid. Leave off the heat for 5 mins until all the liquid is absorbed. Squeeze the roasted lime over the chicken and serve with the rice & peas, and some hot sauce if you like it really spicy.","z":"制作肉干腌料时，将所有原料与 1 茶匙盐一起放入食品加工机中，搅拌成泥。如果您在混合时遇到困难，只需关闭搅拌机，搅拌混合物，然后重试即可。最终它会开始混合——不要试图加水，因为你想要浓稠的糊状物。\r\n\r\n尝尝肉干混合物的味道——它的味道应该很咸，但不会令人不快，咸得皱巴巴的。如果你觉得不够辣，你现在可以加入更多的辣椒。如果味道太咸和太酸，可以尝试加入更多的红糖，直到混合物的味道达到平衡。\r\n\r\n在鸡大腿上划几道口子，然后将腌料倒在肉上，将其擦到所有缝隙中。盖上盖子并在冰箱中腌制过夜。\r\n\r\n如果您想烧烤鸡肉，请在准备做饭之前先将煤燃烧 1 小时左右。正宗的肉干并不完全是我们想象中的烧烤，而是烟烤。为了获得更真实的混蛋体验，请在烧烤中添加一些木片，然后用慢速间接加热方式将鸡肉煮 30 分钟。要在烤箱中烹饪，用风扇/煤气加热至 180C/160C 4. 将鸡块与半个青柠一起放入烤盘中，煮 45 分钟，直至变软并煮熟。\r\n\r\n煮鸡肉的同时，准备米饭和豌豆。用大量冷水冲洗大米，然后将其与除芸豆之外的所有剩余成分一起放入大锅中。加盐调味，加入300毫升冷水，大火加热。一旦米饭开始沸腾，将其调至中火，盖上盖子煮10分钟。\r\n\r\n将豆子加入米饭中，然后盖上盖子。关火 5 分钟，直至所有液体被吸收。将烤酸橙挤在鸡肉上，配上米饭和豌豆，如果你喜欢辣的话，还可以加一些辣酱。"},{"id":"53347","n":"No-Churn Rum Raisin Ice Cream","a":"Jamaican","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/s9qyzd1764790772.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6WpzVZrOwIs","i":[["Dark Rum","1/2 cup"],["Raisins","1 cup"],["Vanilla Extract","1 tsp"],["Condensed Milk","14 oz jar"],["Brown Sugar","2 tablespoons"],["Ground Cinnamon","1/4 tsp"],["Allspice","1/8 teaspoon"],["Heavy Cream","2 cups"],["Salt","Pinch"]],"s":"Heat the rum in a small saucepan over medium heat until warm (do not boil). Remove from heat and stir in the raisins and vanilla extract. Let the mixture sit for at least 30 minutes. After soaking, drain off the extra rum, but keep ¼ cup of the rum and reserve it to mix into your ice cream base.\r\nIn a large bowl, whisk together the sweetened condensed milk, dark brown sugar, cinnamon, allspice, salt, and reserved rum (¼ cup). Stir until the brown sugar is fully dissolved.\r\nIn a separate bowl, whip the cold heavy cream with an electric mixer until stiff peaks form.\r\nGently fold the whipped cream into the condensed milk mixture until fully combined, being careful not to deflate the cream. Fold in the drained rum-soaked raisins to distribute them evenly.\r\nPour the mixture into a loaf pan or freezer-safe container. Smooth the top and cover with plastic wrap or an airtight lid. Freeze for at least 6 hours, or until firm.\r\nLet the ice cream sit at room temperature for 5–10 minutes before scooping for the best texture.","z":"将朗姆酒放入小平底锅中，用中火加热至温热（不要煮沸）。从火上移开，加入葡萄干和香草精搅拌。让混合物静置至少 30 分钟。浸泡后，沥干多余的朗姆酒，但保留 1/4 杯朗姆酒并保留以混合到冰淇淋底料中。\r\n在一个大碗中，将甜炼乳、深红糖、肉桂、五香粉、盐和备用朗姆酒（1/4 杯）搅拌在一起。搅拌直至红糖完全溶解。\r\n在另一个碗中，用电动搅拌器搅打冷浓奶油，直至形成硬性峰状。\r\n轻轻地将鲜奶油拌入炼乳混合物中，直至完全混合，小心不要让奶油泄气。拌入沥干朗姆酒浸泡的葡萄干，使其分布均匀。\r\n将混合物倒入面包盘或冷冻容器中。将顶部弄平并用保鲜膜或密封盖盖住。冷冻至少 6 小时，或直至变硬。\r\n让冰淇淋在室温下静置 5-10 分钟，然后舀出以获得最佳质地。"},{"id":"52943","n":"Oxtail with broad beans","a":"Jamaican","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/1520083578.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DIhxk-98Hz8","i":[["Oxtail","450g"],["Onion","1 chopped"],["Spring Onions","1"],["Garlic","2 cloves minced"],["Ginger","1 tsp"],["Scotch Bonnet","1 chopped"],["Soy Sauce","2 tbs"],["Fresh Thyme","1 chopped"],["Vegetable Oil","2 tbs"],["Water","350ml"],["Broad Beans","200g"],["Corn Flour","1 tbs"],["Water","2 tbs"]],"s":"Toss the oxtail with the onion, spring onion, garlic, ginger, chilli, soy sauce, thyme, salt and pepper. Heat the vegetable oil in a large frying pan over medium-high heat. Brown the oxtail in the pan until browned all over, about 10 minutes. Place into a pressure cooker, and pour in 375ml water. Cook at pressure for 25 minutes, then remove from heat, and remove the lid according to manufacturer's directions.\r\nAdd the broad beans and pimento berries, and bring to a simmer over medium-high heat. Dissolve the cornflour in 2 tablespoons water, and stir into the simmering oxtail. Cook and stir a few minutes until the sauce has thickened, and the broad beans are tender.","z":"将牛尾与洋葱、葱、大蒜、生姜、辣椒、酱油、百里香、盐和胡椒一起搅拌。在大煎锅中用中高火加热植物油。将牛尾放入锅中煎至全焦，大约需要 10 分钟。放入高压锅中，倒入375毫升水。在压力下煮 25 分钟，然后离火，并根据制造商的说明取下盖子。\r\n加入蚕豆和多椒浆果，用中高火煮沸。将玉米粉溶解在2汤匙水中，然后拌入正在煮沸的牛尾中。煮并搅拌几分钟，直到酱汁变稠，蚕豆变软。"},{"id":"52941","n":"Red Peas Soup","a":"Jamaican","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/sqpqtp1515365614.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1ogCfDXotMw","i":[["Kidney Beans","2 cups"],["Carrots","1 large"],["Spring Onions","2 chopped"],["Thyme","4 sprigs"],["Onion","1 Diced"],["Black Pepper","1/2 tsp"],["Red Pepper","2 chopped"],["Garlic Clove","4 Mashed"],["Allspice","1 tbs"],["Beef","2 Lbs"],["Water","2L"],["Potatoes","4"],["Plain Flour","1 cup"],["Water","1/4 cup"],["Coconut Milk","1 cup"]],"s":"Wash and rinse the dried kidney beans.. then cover with water in a deep bowl. Remember as they soak they will expand to at least triple the size they were originally so add a lot of water to the bowl. Soak them overnight or for at least 2 hrs to make the cooking step go quicker. I tossed out the water they were soaked in after it did the job.\r\n\r\nHave your butcher cut the salted pigtail into 2 inch pieces as it will be very difficult to cut with an ordinary kitchen knife. Wash, then place a deep pot with water and bring to a boil. Cook for 20 minutes, then drain + rinse and repeat (boil again in water). The goal is to make the pieces of pig tails tender and to remove most of the salt it was cured in.\r\n\r\nTime to start the soup. Place everything in the pot (except the flour and potato), then cover with water and place on a high flame to bring to a boil. As it comes to a boil, skim off any scum/froth at the top and discard. Reduce the heat to a gentle boil and allow it to cook for 1 hr and 15 mins.. basically until the beans are tender and start falling apart.\r\n\r\nIt’s now time to add the potato (and Yams etc if you’re adding it) as well as the coconut milk and continue cooking for 15 minutes.\r\n\r\nNow is a good time to start making the basic dough for the spinner dumplings. Mix the flour and water (add a pinch of salt if you want) until you have a soft/smooth dough. allow it to rest for 5 minutes, then pinch of a tablespoon at a time and roll between your hands to form a cigarette shape.\r\n\r\nAdd them to the pot, stir well and continue cooking for another 15 minutes on a rolling boil.\r\n\r\nYou’ll notice that I didn’t add any salt to the pot as the remaining salt from the salted pigtails will be enough to properly season this dish. However you can taste and adjust accordingly. Lets recap the timing part of things so you’re not confused. Cook the base of the soup for 1 hr and 15 minute or until tender, then add the potatoes and cook for 15 minutes, then add the dumplings and cook for a further 15 minutes. Keep in mind that this soup will thicken quite a bit as it cools.\r\n\r\nWhile this is not a traditional recipe to any one specific island, versions of this soup (sometimes called stewed peas) can be found throughout the Caribbean, Latin America and Africa. A hearty bowl of this soup will surely give you the sleepies (some may call it ethnic fatigue). You can certainly freeze the leftovers and heat it up another day.","z":"清洗并冲洗干芸豆..然后在深碗中倒入水。请记住，当它们浸泡时，它们会膨胀到至少原来尺寸的三倍，因此请在碗中添加大量水。将它们浸泡过夜或至少 2 小时，以使烹饪步骤更快。完成工作后我把浸泡它们的水倒掉了。\r\n\r\n让屠夫将咸辫子切成 2 英寸的小块，因为用普通菜刀很难切。洗净，然后将水放入深锅中煮沸。煮20分钟，然后沥干+冲洗并重复（再次在水中煮沸）。目的是使猪尾变软并去除腌制过程中的大部分盐分。\r\n\r\n是时候开始喝汤了。将所有东西放入锅中（面粉和土豆除外），然后加水盖过锅，放在大火上煮沸。当它沸腾时，撇去顶部的浮渣/泡沫并丢弃。将火调至微沸，煮 1 小时 15 分钟.. 基本上直到豆子变软并开始散开。\r\n\r\n现在是时候添加土豆（如果要添加山药等）和椰奶，继续煮 15 分钟。\r\n\r\n现在是开始制作旋转饺子的基本面团的好时机。将面粉和水混合（如果需要，可以添加少许盐），直到形成柔软/光滑的面团。静置 5 分钟，然后每次捏一汤匙，在双手之间滚动，形成香烟形状。\r\n\r\n将它们放入锅中，搅拌均匀，然后继续煮 15 分钟。\r\n\r\n你会注意到我没有在锅里加任何盐，因为咸辫子里剩下的盐足以适当地给这道菜调味。不过，您可以相应地品尝和调整。让我们回顾一下事情的时间部分，这样你就不会感到困惑。将汤底煮1小时15分钟或直至变软，然后加入土豆煮15分钟，然后加入饺子再煮15分钟。请记住，这汤冷却后会变稠。\r\n\r\n虽然这不是任何特定岛屿的传统食谱，但这种汤的版本（有时称为炖豌豆）可以在整个加勒比海、拉丁美洲和非洲找到。一碗丰盛的汤肯定会让你昏昏欲睡（有些人可能称之为民族疲劳）。你当然可以把剩菜冷冻起来，改天再加热。"},{"id":"52936","n":"Saltfish and Ackee","a":"Jamaican","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/vytypy1511883765.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nbfNyZbdn2I","i":[["Salt Cod","450g"],["Ackee","400g"],["Onion","1 chopped"],["Paprika","1 tsp"],["Curry Powder","2 tsp"],["Jerusalem Artichokes","2 tsp"],["Hotsauce","1 tsp"],["Red Pepper","1 sliced"],["Yellow Pepper","1 sliced"],["Tomatoes","200g"],["Salt","to taste"],["Pepper","to taste"],["Self-raising Flour","250g"],["Suet","30g"],["Salt","pinch"],["Olive Oil","for frying"]],"s":"For the saltfish, soak the salt cod overnight, changing the water a couple of times.\r\nDrain, then put the cod in a large pan of fresh water and bring to the boil. Drain again, add fresh water and bring to the boil again.\r\nSimmer for about five minutes, or until cooked through, then drain and flake the fish into large pieces. Discard any skin or bones.\r\nFor the dumplings, mix the flour and suet with a pinch of salt and 250ml/9fl oz water to make a dough.\r\nWrap the mixture in clingfilm and leave in the fridge to rest.\r\nOpen the can of ackee, drain and rinse, then set aside.\r\nHeat a tablespoon of olive oil in a pan and fry the onion until softened but not brown.\r\nAdd the spices, seasoning, pepper sauce and sliced peppers and continue to fry until the peppers are tender.\r\nAdd the chopped tomatoes, then the salt cod and mix together. Lastly stir in the ackee very gently and leave to simmer until ready to serve.\r\nWhen you’re almost ready to eat, heat about 1cm/½in vegetable oil in a frying pan and heat until just smoking.\r\nShape the dumpling mix into plum-size balls and shallow-fry until golden-brown. (CAUTION: hot oil can be dangerous. Do not leave the pan unattended.)\r\nDrain the dumplings on kitchen paper and serve with the saltfish and ackee.","z":"对于咸鱼，将咸鳕鱼浸泡过夜，换水几次。\r\n沥干水分，然后将鳕鱼放入一大锅清水中煮沸。再次沥干水分，加入清水，再次煮沸。\r\n煮约五分钟，或直至煮熟，然后沥干鱼并将其切成大块。丢弃任何皮肤或骨头。\r\n制作饺子时，将面粉、羊油、少许盐和 250 毫升/9 液量盎司水混合，制成面团。\r\n将混合物用保鲜膜包裹并放入冰箱中静置。\r\n打开西非荔枝果罐头，沥干并冲洗，然后放在一边。\r\n在平底锅中加热一汤匙橄榄油，将洋葱煎至变软但不变成棕色。\r\n加入香料、调味料、辣椒酱和辣椒片，继续炒至辣椒变软。\r\n加入切碎的西红柿，然后加入盐鳕鱼，混合在一起。最后轻轻地搅拌西非荔枝果，然后小火煮至准备上菜。\r\n当你快要吃的时候，在煎锅中加热约 1 厘米/½ 的植物油，加热至冒烟。\r\n将饺子混合物捏成李子大小的球状，然后煎至金黄色。 （注意：热油可能很危险。请勿让锅无人看管。）\r\n将饺子放在厨房纸上沥干，与咸鱼和西非荔枝果一起食用。"},{"id":"52831","n":"Chicken Karaage","a":"Japanese","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/tyywsw1505930373.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XivddFddthc","i":[["Chicken","450 grams Boneless skin"],["Ginger","1 tablespoon"],["Garlic","1 clove"],["Soy sauce","2 tablespoons"],["Sake","1 tablespoon"],["Granulated sugar","2 teaspoon"],["Potato starch","1/3 cup"],["Vegetable oil","1/3 cup"],["Lemon","1/3 cup"]],"s":"Add the ginger, garlic, soy sauce, sake and sugar to a bowl and whisk to combine. Add the chicken, then stir to coat evenly. Cover and refrigerate for at least 1 hour.\r\n\r\nAdd 1 inch of vegetable oil to a heavy bottomed pot and heat until the oil reaches 360 degrees F. Line a wire rack with 2 sheets of paper towels and get your tongs out. Put the potato starch in a bowl\r\n\r\nAdd a handful of chicken to the potato starch and toss to coat each piece evenly.\r\n\r\nFry the karaage in batches until the exterior is a medium brown and the chicken is cooked through. Transfer the fried chicken to the paper towel lined rack. If you want the karaage to stay crispy longer, you can fry the chicken a second time, until it's a darker color after it's cooled off once. Serve with lemon wedges.","z":"将生姜、大蒜、酱油、清酒和糖放入碗中，搅拌均匀。加入鸡肉，然后搅拌均匀。盖上盖子并冷藏至少 1 小时。\r\n\r\n在厚底锅中加入 1 英寸植物油，加热直至油达到 360 华氏度。在金属架上铺上 2 张纸巾，然后取出夹子。将土豆淀粉放入碗中\r\n\r\n将一把鸡肉加入土豆淀粉中，搅拌均匀，使每一块鸡肉都均匀地裹上一层土豆淀粉。\r\n\r\n分批煎炸炸鸡块，直至外部呈中等棕色且鸡肉煮熟。将炸鸡转移到衬有纸巾的架子上。如果你想让炸鸡块的脆度保持得更久，可以把鸡肉炸第二遍，直到冷却后颜色变深。与柠檬角一起食用。"},{"id":"52773","n":"Honey Teriyaki Salmon","a":"Japanese","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/xxyupu1468262513.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4MpYuaJsvRw","i":[["Salmon","1 lb"],["Olive oil","1 tablespoon"],["Soy Sauce","2 tablespoons"],["Sake","2 tablespoons"],["Sesame Seed","4 tablespoons"]],"s":"Mix all the ingredients in the Honey Teriyaki Glaze together. Whisk to blend well. Combine the salmon and the Glaze together.\r\n\r\nHeat up a skillet on medium-low heat. Add the oil, Pan-fry the salmon on both sides until it’s completely cooked inside and the glaze thickens.\r\n\r\nGarnish with sesame and serve immediately.","z":"将蜂蜜照烧釉中的所有成分混合在一起。搅拌均匀。将鲑鱼和釉料混合在一起。\r\n\r\n用中低火加热煎锅。加入油，将三文鱼两面煎至里面完全熟透，釉面变稠。\r\n\r\n撒上芝麻即可食用。"},{"id":"53034","n":"Japanese Katsudon","a":"Japanese","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/d8f6qx1604182128.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=voE-MBJqBVk","i":[["Vegetable Oil","1 tbs"],["Onion","1 large"],["Pork","1 chopped"],["Vegetable Stock","150ml"],["Soy Sauce","1 tbs"],["Mirin","1 tsp"],["Sugar","1 tsp"],["Eggs","2 Beaten"],["Sushi Rice","200g"],["Chives","Chopped"]],"s":"STEP 1\r\nHeat the oil in a pan, fry the sliced onion until golden brown, then add the tonkatsu (see recipe here), placing it in the middle of the pan. Mix the dashi, soy, mirin and sugar together and tip three-quarters of the mixture around the tonkatsu. Sizzle for a couple of mins so the sauce thickens a little and the tonkatsu reheats.\r\n\r\nSTEP 2\r\nTip the beaten eggs around the tonkatsu and cook for 2-3 mins until the egg is cooked through but still a little runny. Divide the rice between two bowls, then top each with half the egg and tonkatsu mix, sprinkle over the chives and serve immediately, drizzling with a little more soy if you want an extra umami kick.","z":"步骤1\r\n在锅中加热油，将洋葱片煎至金黄色，然后加入炸猪排（参见此处的食谱），将其放在锅的中间。将高汤、酱油、味醂和糖混合在一起，然后将四分之三的混合物倒在炸猪排周围。发出嘶嘶声几分钟，使酱汁变稠，炸猪排重新加热。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将打好的鸡蛋倒在炸猪排周围，煮 2-3 分钟，直到鸡蛋煮熟，但仍然有点流淌。将米饭分装在两个碗中，然后在每个碗上放上一半的鸡蛋和炸猪排混合物，撒上香葱，立即上桌，如果你想要额外的鲜味，可以再淋上一点酱油。"},{"id":"53033","n":"Japanese gohan rice","a":"Japanese","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/kw92t41604181871.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rZO86_-MIp0","i":[["Sushi Rice","300g"],["Mirin","1 tbs"],["Pickle Juice","Garnish"],["Spring Onions","Garnish"]],"s":"STEP 1\r\nRinsing and soaking your rice is key to achieving the perfect texture. Measure the rice into a bowl, cover with cold water, then use your fingers to massage the grains of rice – the water will become cloudy. Drain and rinse again with fresh water. Repeat five more times until the water stays clear.\r\n\r\nSTEP 2\r\nTip the rinsed rice into a saucepan with 400ml water, or 200ml dashi and 200ml water, bring to the boil, then turn down the heat to a low simmer, cover with a tight-fitting lid with a steam hole and cook for 15 mins. Remove from the heat and leave to sit for another 15 mins, then stir through the mirin. Remove the lid and give it a good stir. Serve with any or all of the optional toppings.","z":"步骤1\r\n冲洗和浸泡大米是获得完美质地的关键。将米量入碗中，倒入冷水，然后用手指按摩米粒，水会变得浑浊。沥干并再次用清水冲洗。再重复五次，直到水保持清澈。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将洗净的米倒入锅中，加入400毫升水，或200毫升高汤和200毫升水，煮沸，然后转小火，盖上有蒸汽孔的紧密盖子，煮15分钟。从火上移开，再静置 15 分钟，然后搅拌味醂。取下盖子并充分搅拌。与任何或所有可选配料一起食用。"},{"id":"52820","n":"Katsu Chicken curry","a":"Japanese","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/vwrpps1503068729.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MWzxDFRtVbc","i":[["chicken breast","4 pounded to 1cm thickness"],["plain flour","2 tablespoons"],["egg","1 beaten"],["breadcrumbs","100g fine"],["vegetable oil","230ml frying"],["sunflower oil","2 tablespoons"],["onions","2 sliced"],["garlic","5 chopped cloves"],["carrot","2 sliced"],["plain flour","2 tablespoons"],["curry powder","4 teaspoons"],["chicken stock","600ml"],["honey","2 teaspoons"],["soy sauce","4 teaspoons"],["bay leaf","1"],["garam masala","1 teaspoon"]],"s":"Prep:15min  ›  Cook:30min  ›  Ready in:45min \r\n\r\nFor the curry sauce: Heat oil in medium non-stick saucepan, add onion and garlic and cook until softened. Stir in carrots and cook over low heat for 10 to 12 minutes.\r\nAdd flour and curry powder; cook for 1 minute. Gradually stir in stock until combined; add honey, soy sauce and bay leaf. Slowly bring to the boil.\r\nTurn down heat and simmer for 20 minutes or until sauce thickens but is still of pouring consistency. Stir in garam masala. Pour the curry sauce through a sieve; return to saucepan and keep on low heat until ready to serve.\r\nFor the chicken: Season both sides of chicken breasts with salt and pepper. Place flour, egg and breadcrumbs in separate bowls and arrange in a row. Coat the chicken breasts in flour, then dip them into the egg, then coat in breadcrumbs, making sure you cover both sides.\r\nHeat oil in large frying pan over medium-high heat. Place chicken into hot oil and cook until golden brown, about 3 or 4 minutes each side. Once cooked, place on kitchen paper to absorb excess oil.\r\nPour curry sauce over chicken, serve with white rice and enjoy!","z":"准备：15 分钟 › 烹饪：30 分钟 › 准备时间：45 分钟 \r\n\r\n咖喱酱：在中型不粘锅中加热油，加入洋葱和大蒜，煮至软化。拌入胡萝卜，小火煮10至12分钟。\r\n加入面粉和咖喱粉；煮1分钟。逐渐搅拌高汤直至混合；加入蜂蜜、酱油和月桂叶。慢慢煮沸。\r\n关小火，煮 20 分钟或直至酱汁变稠，但仍保持稠度。拌入加拉姆马沙拉。将咖喱酱过筛倒入；返回锅中并保持小火直至准备好上菜。\r\n对于鸡肉：用盐和胡椒调味鸡胸肉的两面。将面粉、鸡蛋和面包屑分别放入不同的碗中并排成一排。将鸡胸肉裹上面粉，然后将其浸入鸡蛋中，然后裹上面包屑，确保两面都被覆盖。\r\n在大煎锅中用中高温加热油。将鸡肉放入热油中，煎至金黄色，每面约 3 或 4 分钟。煮好后，放在厨房用纸上吸去多余的油。\r\n将咖喱酱倒在鸡肉上，配上白米饭即可享用！"},{"id":"53065","n":"Sushi","a":"Japanese","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/g046bb1663960946.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ub68OxEypaY","i":[["Sushi Rice","300ml"],["Rice wine","100ml"],["Caster Sugar","2 tbs"],["Mayonnaise","3 tbs"],["Rice wine","1 tbs"],["Soy Sauce","1 tbs"],["Cucumber","1"]],"s":"STEP 1\r\nTO MAKE SUSHI ROLLS: Pat out some rice. Lay a nori sheet on the mat, shiny-side down. Dip your hands in the vinegared water, then pat handfuls of rice on top in a 1cm thick layer, leaving the furthest edge from you clear.\r\n\r\nSTEP 2\r\nSpread over some Japanese mayonnaise. Use a spoon to spread out a thin layer of mayonnaise down the middle of the rice.\r\n\r\nSTEP 3\r\nAdd the filling. Get your child to top the mayonnaise with a line of their favourite fillings – here we’ve used tuna and cucumber.\r\n\r\nSTEP 4\r\nRoll it up. Lift the edge of the mat over the rice, applying a little pressure to keep everything in a tight roll.\r\n\r\nSTEP 5\r\nStick down the sides like a stamp. When you get to the edge without any rice, brush with a little water and continue to roll into a tight roll.\r\n\r\nSTEP 6\r\nWrap in cling film. Remove the mat and roll tightly in cling film before a grown-up cuts the sushi into thick slices, then unravel the cling film.\r\n\r\nSTEP 7\r\nTO MAKE PRESSED SUSHI: Layer over some smoked salmon. Line a loaf tin with cling film, then place a thin layer of smoked salmon inside on top of the cling film.\r\n\r\nSTEP 8\r\nCover with rice and press down. Press about 3cm of rice over the fish, fold the cling film over and press down as much as you can, using another tin if you have one.\r\n\r\nSTEP 9\r\nTip it out like a sandcastle. Turn block of sushi onto a chopping board. Get a grown-up to cut into fingers, then remove the cling film.\r\n\r\nSTEP 10\r\nTO MAKE SUSHI BALLS: Choose your topping. Get a small square of cling film and place a topping, like half a prawn or a small piece of smoked salmon, on it. Use damp hands to roll walnut-sized balls of rice and place on the topping.\r\n\r\nSTEP 11\r\nMake into tight balls. Bring the corners of the cling film together and tighten into balls by twisting it up, then unwrap and serve.","z":"步骤1\r\n制作寿司卷：拍出一些米饭。将紫菜片放在垫子上，光面朝下。将手浸入醋水中，然后将一把米拍在上面，形成 1 厘米厚的一层，让离你最远的边缘保持干净。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n涂上一些日本蛋黄酱。用勺子在米饭中间铺上一层薄薄的蛋黄酱。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n添加馅料。让您的孩子在蛋黄酱上放上一系列他们最喜欢的馅料——这里我们用的是金枪鱼和黄瓜。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n把它卷起来。将垫子的边缘提起到米饭上，施加一点压力，使所有东西都紧紧地卷起来。\r\n\r\n步骤5\r\n像邮票一样把两边粘下来。到了边缘没有米的时候，刷上一点水，继续擀成紧实的卷。\r\n\r\n步骤6\r\n用保鲜膜包起来。取下垫子，用保鲜膜紧紧地卷起来，然后大人将寿司切成厚片，然后拆开保鲜膜。\r\n\r\n第7步\r\n制作压制寿司： 铺上一些熏鲑鱼。在面包罐上铺上保鲜膜，然后在保鲜膜上放一层薄薄的熏鲑鱼。\r\n\r\n步骤8\r\n盖上米饭并按下去。将大约 3 厘米的米饭压在鱼上，将保鲜膜折叠起来，尽可能压紧，如果有的话，可以使用另一个罐子。\r\n\r\n第9步\r\n像沙堡一样把它倒掉。将寿司块放在砧板上。让大人把手指切成小口，然后撕掉保鲜膜。\r\n\r\n第10步\r\n制作寿司球：选择您的配料。取一小块保鲜膜，在上面放上配料，比如半只虾或一小块熏鲑鱼。用湿手搓成核桃大小的饭团，放在上面。\r\n\r\n第11步\r\n做成紧密的球。将保鲜膜的角放在一起，并通过扭转将其收紧成球，然后打开并食用。"},{"id":"52772","n":"Teriyaki Chicken Casserole","a":"Japanese","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/wvpsxx1468256321.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4aZr5hZXP_s","i":[["soy sauce","3/4 cup"],["water","1/2 cup"],["brown sugar","1/4 cup"],["ground ginger","1/2 teaspoon"],["minced garlic","1/2 teaspoon"],["cornstarch","4 Tablespoons"],["chicken breasts","2"],["stir-fry vegetables","1 (12 oz.)"],["brown rice","3 cups"]],"s":"Preheat oven to 350° F. Spray a 9x13-inch baking pan with non-stick spray.\r\nCombine soy sauce, ½ cup water, brown sugar, ginger and garlic in a small saucepan and cover. Bring to a boil over medium heat. Remove lid and cook for one minute once boiling.\r\nMeanwhile, stir together the corn starch and 2 tablespoons of water in a separate dish until smooth. Once sauce is boiling, add mixture to the saucepan and stir to combine. Cook until the sauce starts to thicken then remove from heat.\r\nPlace the chicken breasts in the prepared pan. Pour one cup of the sauce over top of chicken. Place chicken in oven and bake 35 minutes or until cooked through. Remove from oven and shred chicken in the dish using two forks.\r\n*Meanwhile, steam or cook the vegetables according to package directions.\r\nAdd the cooked vegetables and rice to the casserole dish with the chicken. Add most of the remaining sauce, reserving a bit to drizzle over the top when serving. Gently toss everything together in the casserole dish until combined. Return to oven and cook 15 minutes. Remove from oven and let stand 5 minutes before serving. Drizzle each serving with remaining sauce. Enjoy!","z":"将烤箱预热至 350° F。在 9x13 英寸烤盘上喷洒不粘喷雾。\r\n将酱油、½ 杯水、红糖、生姜和大蒜放入小平底锅中，盖上盖子。用中火煮沸。沸腾后取下盖子煮一分钟。\r\n同时，将玉米淀粉和 2 汤匙水在另一个盘子中搅拌直至光滑。一旦酱汁沸腾，将混合物加入锅中并搅拌混合。煮至酱汁开始变稠，然后离火。\r\n将鸡胸肉放入准备好的平底锅中。将一杯酱汁倒在鸡肉上。将鸡肉放入烤箱烤 35 分钟或直至熟透。从烤箱中取出，用两把叉子将鸡肉切碎放入盘中。\r\n*同时，根据包装说明蒸或煮蔬菜。\r\n将煮熟的蔬菜和米饭与鸡肉一起放入砂锅中。添加大部分剩余的酱汁，保留一点，以便在食用时淋在上面。将所有东西轻轻地放入砂锅中搅拌直至混合。返回烤箱煮 15 分钟。从烤箱中取出，静置 5 分钟即可享用。在每份上淋上剩余的酱汁。享受！"},{"id":"53032","n":"Tonkatsu pork","a":"Japanese","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/lwsnkl1604181187.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aASr5x0d3Ys","i":[["Pork Chops","4"],["Flour","100g"],["Eggs","2 Beaten"],["Breadcrumbs","100g"],["Vegetable Oil","Fry"],["Tomato Ketchup","2 tbs"],["Worcestershire Sauce","2 tbs"],["Oyster Sauce","1 tbs"],["Caster Sugar","2 tblsp"]],"s":"STEP 1\r\nRemove the large piece of fat on the edge of each pork loin, then bash each of the loins between two pieces of baking parchment until around 1cm in thickness – you can do this using a meat tenderiser or a rolling pin. Once bashed, use your hands to reshape the meat to its original shape and thickness – this step will ensure the meat is as succulent as possible.\r\n\r\nSTEP 2\r\nPut the flour, eggs and panko breadcrumbs into three separate wide-rimmed bowls. Season the meat, then dip first in the flour, followed by the eggs, then the breadcrumbs.\r\n\r\nSTEP 3\r\nIn a large frying or sauté pan, add enough oil to come 2cm up the side of the pan. Heat the oil to 180C – if you don’t have a thermometer, drop a bit of panko into the oil and if it sinks a little then starts to fry, the oil is ready. Add two pork chops and cook for 1 min 30 secs on each side, then remove and leave to rest on a wire rack for 5 mins. Repeat with the remaining pork chops.\r\n\r\nSTEP 4\r\nWhile the pork is resting, make the sauce by whisking the ingredients together, adding a splash of water if it’s particularly thick. Slice the tonkatsu and serve drizzled with the sauce.","z":"步骤1\r\n去除每块猪腰肉边缘的大块脂肪，然后将每块猪腰肉夹在两片烘焙羊皮纸之间，敲打至约 1 厘米厚——您可以使用嫩肉剂或擀面杖来完成此操作。敲碎后，用手将肉重塑至原来的形状和厚度——这一步将确保肉尽可能多汁。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将面粉、鸡蛋和panko面包屑放入三个单独的宽边碗中。将肉调味，然后先沾上面粉，然后沾上鸡蛋，最后沾上面包屑。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n在一个大煎锅或炒锅中，加入足够的油，油量应达到锅边 2 厘米。将油加热至180摄氏度——如果你没有温度计，可以在油中滴一点面包屑，如果它稍微下沉然后开始煎，油就准备好了。添加两块猪排，每面煮 1 分 30 秒，然后取出并放在金属架上放置 5 分钟。对剩下的猪排重复上述步骤。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n当猪肉静置时，将所有原料搅拌在一起制成酱汁，如果酱汁特别稠，则加一点水。将炸猪排切片，淋上酱汁即可食用。"},{"id":"52871","n":"Yaki Udon","a":"Japanese","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/wrustq1511475474.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5Iy0MCowSvA","i":[["Udon Noodles","250g"],["Sesame Seed Oil","2 tbs"],["Onion","1 sliced"],["Cabbage","0.25"],["Shiitake Mushrooms","10"],["Spring Onions","4"],["Mirin","4 tbsp"],["Soy Sauce","2 tbs"],["Caster Sugar","1 tblsp"],["Worcestershire Sauce","1 tblsp"]],"s":"Boil some water in a large saucepan. Add 250ml cold water and the udon noodles. (As they are so thick, adding cold water helps them to cook a little bit slower so the middle cooks through). If using frozen or fresh noodles, cook for 2 mins or until al dente; dried will take longer, about 5-6 mins. Drain and leave in the colander.\r\nHeat 1 tbsp of the oil, add the onion and cabbage and sauté for 5 mins until softened. Add the mushrooms and some spring onions, and sauté for 1 more min. Pour in the remaining sesame oil and the noodles. If using cold noodles, let them heat through before adding the ingredients for the sauce – otherwise tip in straight away and keep stir-frying until sticky and piping hot. Sprinkle with the remaining spring onions.","z":"在一个大平底锅中煮一些水。加入250毫升冷水和乌冬面。 （因为它们太厚了，加入冷水可以帮助它们煮得慢一点，这样中间就可以煮熟了）。如果使用冷冻或新鲜面条，煮 2 分钟或直至有嚼劲；干燥需要更长的时间，大约5-6分钟。沥干并留在漏勺中。\r\n加热 1 汤匙油，加入洋葱和卷心菜，炒 5 分钟直至变软。加入蘑菇和一些葱，再炒 1 分钟。倒入剩余的香油和面条。如果使用冷面，请先将其加热，然后再添加酱汁成分，否则请立即倒入并继续炒至粘稠且滚烫。撒上剩余的葱。"},{"id":"52967","n":"Home-made Mandazi","a":"Kenyan","c":"Breakfast","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/thazgm1555350962.jpg","y":"","i":[["Self-raising Flour","750g"],["Sugar","6 tablespoons"],["Eggs","2"],["Milk","1 cup"]],"s":"This is one recipe a lot of people have requested and I have tried to make it as simple as possible and I hope it will work for you. Make sure you use the right flour which is basically one with raising agents. Adjust the amount of sugar to your taste and try using different flavours to have variety whenever you have them.\r\nYou can use Coconut milk instead of regular milk, you can also add desiccated coconut to the dry flour or other spices like powdered cloves or cinnamon.\r\nFor “healthy looking” mandazis do not roll the dough too thin before frying and use the procedure I have indicated above.\r\n\r\n1. Mix the flour,cinnamon and sugar in a suitable bowl.\r\n2. In a separate bowl whisk the egg into the milk\r\n3. Make a well at the centre of the flour and add the milk and egg mixture and slowly mix to form a dough.\r\n4. Knead the dough for 3-4 minutes or until it stops sticking to the sides of the bowl and you have a smooth surface.\r\n5. Cover the dough with a damp cloth  and allow to rest for 15 minutes.\r\n6. Roll the dough on a lightly floured surface into a 1cm thick piece.\r\n7. Using a sharp small knife, cut the dough into the desired size setting aside ready for deep frying.\r\n8. Heat your oil in a suitable pot and gently dip the mandazi pieces to cook until light brown on the first side then turn to cook on the second side.\r\n9. Serve them warm or cold","z":"这是很多人要求的一个食谱，我尽力让它尽可能简单，我希望它对你有用。确保使用正确的面粉，这种面粉基本上是含有膨松剂的面粉。根据自己的口味调整糖的用量，并尝试使用不同的口味，以保证每次吃时都有不同的口味。\r\n您可以使用椰奶代替普通牛奶，也可以在干面粉或其他香料（如丁香粉或肉桂粉）中添加干椰子。\r\n为了“看起来健康”的曼达齐，在油炸前不要将面团擀得太薄，并使用我上面指出的程序。\r\n\r\n1. 将面粉、肉桂和糖放入合适的碗中混合。\r\n2.在另一个碗中将鸡蛋搅入牛奶中\r\n3.在面粉中心挖一个洞，加入牛奶和鸡蛋混合物，慢慢搅拌形成面团。\r\n4. 揉捏面团 3-4 分钟，或直至其不再粘在碗的两侧且表面光滑。\r\n5. 将面团盖上湿布，静置15分钟。\r\n6. 将面团放在撒了少许面粉的表面上，擀成1厘米厚的面片。\r\n7. 用锋利的小刀，将面团切成所需的大小，放在一边准备油炸。\r\n8. 在合适的锅中加热油，轻轻浸入曼达兹片，煮至第一面呈浅棕色，然后翻转煮第二面。\r\n9. 热食或冷食"},{"id":"53112","n":"Kenyan Beef Curry","a":"Kenyan","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/lqampv1762325397.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NxrOueTLiqA","i":[["Water","4 cups"],["Sirloin Steak tips","2 Lbs"],["Garlic Clove","4"],["Ground Ginger","2 teaspoons"],["Oil","2 tblsp"],["Red Onions","2 medium"],["Tomato","4"],["Paprika","2 tblsp"],["Black Pepper","1/2 teaspoon"],["Curry Powder","2 teaspoons"],["Tomato Puree","4 tablespoons"],["Salt","Dash"],["Chilli","1"],["Cilantro","Leaves"]],"s":"Bring the 4 cups of water to a boil in a Dutch oven or soup pot. Add the beef, garlic, and ginger, and stir well. Bring to a gentle simmer, cover, and cook, stirring occasionally, for 20 minutes. If you get any foamy scum on the top, not to worry, simply spoon it away or stir it back in.\r\nRemove from the heat, and drain, but reserve the excess water for later.\r\nReturn the pot or Dutch oven to medium heat with the 2 tablespoons of cooking oil. Once the oil is shimmering, add the onions and cook, stirring occasionally, until softened, 5 to 7 minutes.\r\nAdd the tomatoes to the onions, and continue cooking, stirring occasionally, until the tomatoes are falling apart, 3 to 5 minutes.\r\nAdd the drained beef to the tomato and onion mixture, and stir well. Continue cooking over medium heat for 5 minutes, stirring occasionally.\r\nAdd the paprika, pepper, curry powder, tomato paste, and salt to taste, and stir well.\r\nAdd back the excess water that was used for cooking the beef, along with enough extra water to cover. Bring to a boil, reduce heat, and simmer, uncovered, stirring occasionally, for about 1 hour, or until the meat is tender and the sauce is thickened. Add additional water if your beef curry begins to dry and stick, or if would like your curry to have more of a soupy consistency.\r\nWhen the beef curry is ready, remove from the heat, give it a taste, and adjust the seasonings as desired. Garnish with fresh chilis and cilantro.","z":"将 4 杯水放入荷兰烤箱或汤锅中煮沸。加入牛肉、大蒜和生姜，搅拌均匀。用文火慢炖，盖上锅盖，煮 20 分钟，偶尔搅拌。如果顶部有任何泡沫状浮渣，不用担心，只需将其舀走或重新搅拌即可。\r\n从火上移开，沥干水分，但保留多余的水供以后使用。\r\n将锅或荷兰烤箱放回中火，加入 2 汤匙食用油。一旦油开始闪烁，加入洋葱，煮5到7分钟，偶尔搅拌，直到软化。\r\n将西红柿加入洋葱中，继续煮 3 到 5 分钟，偶尔搅拌，直到西红柿散开。\r\n将沥干的牛肉加入番茄和洋葱的混合物中，搅拌均匀。继续用中火煮 5 分钟，偶尔搅拌。\r\n加入辣椒粉、胡椒粉、咖喱粉、番茄酱和盐调味，搅拌均匀。\r\n添加用于烹饪牛肉的多余水，以及足够的额外水以覆盖。煮沸，调小火，不加盖地煮约1小时，偶尔搅拌，或直至肉变软且酱汁变稠。如果您的咖喱牛肉开始变干并粘在一起，或者希望您的咖喱具有更多的汤稠度，请添加额外的水。\r\n咖喱牛肉做好后，离火，尝一尝，然后根据需要调整调味料。用新鲜辣椒和香菜装饰。"},{"id":"52968","n":"Mbuzi Choma (Roasted Goat)","a":"Kenyan","c":"Goat","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/cuio7s1555492979.jpg","y":"","i":[["Goat Meat","1 kg"],["Corn Flour","1 kg"],["Tomatoes","2"],["Salt","Pinch"],["Onion","1"],["Green Chilli","1"],["Coriander Leaves","1  bunch"]],"s":"1. Steps for the Meat: \r\n Roast meat over medium heat for 50 minutes and salt it as you turn it.\r\n\r\n2. Steps for Ugali:\r\nBring the water and salt to a boil in a heavy-bottomed saucepan. Stir in the cornmeal slowly, letting it fall through the fingers of your hand.\r\n\r\n3. Reduce heat to medium-low and continue stirring regularly, smashing any lumps with a spoon, until the mush pulls away from the sides of the pot and becomes very thick, about 10 minutes.\r\n\r\n4.Remove from heat and allow to cool.\r\n\r\n5. Place the ugali into a large serving bowl. Wet your hands with water, form a ball and serve.\r\n\r\n6. Steps for Kachumbari: Mix the tomatoes, onions, chili and coriander leaves in a bowl.\r\n\r\n7. Serve and enjoy!\r\n\r\n","z":"1. 肉的步骤： \r\n 用中火将肉烤 50 分钟，边翻边加盐。\r\n\r\n2.乌加利的步骤：\r\n将水和盐放入厚底锅中煮沸。慢慢地搅拌玉米粉，让它从你的手指间滑落。\r\n\r\n3. 将火调至中低，继续定期搅拌，用勺子捣碎任何块状物，直到糊状物从锅壁上脱落并变得非常浓稠，大约需要 10 分钟。\r\n\r\n4.离火并冷却。\r\n\r\n5. 将乌加利放入一个大碗中。用水弄湿双手，形成球并发球。\r\n\r\n6. Kachumbari步骤：将西红柿、洋葱、辣椒和香菜叶放入碗中混合。\r\n\r\n7. 上菜并享用！"},{"id":"53113","n":"Sukuma Wiki","a":"Kenyan","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/60o82j1762341177.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=02hHtPDAxOs","i":[["Oil","2 tablespoons"],["Red Onions","2 medium"],["Kale","1 lb"],["Salt","Dash"],["Double Cream","1 cup"]],"s":"Heat the 2 tablespoons of oil in a large skillet or pot over medium heat until shimmering. Add the onions and cook, stirring occasionally, until softened, 5 to 7 minutes.\r\nAdd the shredded kale to the onions and mix well. Turn the heat to medium-low, cover and cook for 5 minutes.\r\nAfter 5 minutes, remove the lid, add salt to taste, and stir in the cream. Continue cooking for another 5 minutes, uncovered, stirring occasionally. The cream will thicken slightly, making for a deliciously rich creamed kale and onions. Yumm!\r\nServe it up with your favorite Kenyan stew, and a side of ugali!","z":"将 2 汤匙油放入大煎锅或锅中，用中火加热直至闪烁。加入洋葱，煮 5 到 7 分钟，偶尔搅拌，直至变软。\r\n将切碎的羽衣甘蓝加入洋葱中，搅拌均匀。将火调至中低，盖上锅盖煮 5 分钟。\r\n5分钟后，取下盖子，加盐调味，然后拌入奶油。继续煮 5 分钟，不盖盖子，偶尔搅拌。奶油会稍微变稠，形成美味浓郁的奶油羽衣甘蓝和洋葱。嗯！\r\n与您最喜欢的肯尼亚炖菜和乌加利一起上桌！"},{"id":"53114","n":"Ugali – Kenyan cornmeal","a":"Kenyan","c":"Breakfast","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/smoa3h1762341142.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yjue2KTETdE","i":[["Water","2 cups"],["White Cornmeal","1 1/2 cups"]],"s":"Bring the water to a boil in a medium saucepan.\r\nReduce the heat to low, and stirring constantly with a whisk, slowly add the cornmeal to the boiling water. The ugali will begin to thicken quite quickly.\r\nContinue cooking on low heat, stirring constantly with a sturdy wooden spoon, until the ugali begins to pull away from the sides of the pan, hold together, and takes on the aroma of roasted corn. Turn it out immediately onto a serving plate. If you would like, using a spoon or spatula, quickly shape it into a thick disk or round.\r\nThe ugali will continue to firm as it cools and will be thick enough to cut with a knife (similar to firm polenta).","z":"在中型平底锅中将水煮沸。\r\n把火调小，用搅拌器不断搅拌，慢慢地将玉米粉加入沸水中。乌加利很快就会开始变厚。\r\n继续用小火烹饪，用坚固的木勺不断搅拌，直到乌加利开始从锅的两侧拉开，粘在一起，并散发出烤玉米的香味。立即将其放在盘子上。如果您愿意，可以用勺子或抹刀快速将其塑造成厚盘或圆形。\r\n乌加利在冷却时会继续变硬，并且足够厚，可以用刀切割（类似于坚硬的玉米粥）。"},{"id":"53049","n":"Apam balik","a":"Malaysian","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/adxcbq1619787919.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6R8ffRRJcrg","i":[["Milk","200ml"],["Oil","60ml"],["Eggs","2"],["Flour","1600g"],["Baking Powder","3 tsp"],["Salt","1/2 tsp"],["Unsalted Butter","25g"],["Sugar","45g"],["Peanut Butter","3 tbs"]],"s":"Mix milk, oil and egg together. Sift flour, baking powder and salt into the mixture. Stir well until all ingredients are combined evenly.\r\n\r\nSpread some batter onto the pan. Spread a thin layer of batter to the side of the pan. Cover the pan for 30-60 seconds until small air bubbles appear.\r\n\r\nAdd butter, cream corn, crushed peanuts and sugar onto the pancake. Fold the pancake into half once the bottom surface is browned.\r\n\r\nCut into wedges and best eaten when it is warm.","z":"将牛奶、油和鸡蛋混合在一起。将面粉、泡打粉和盐筛入混合物中。充分搅拌直至所有成分混合均匀。\r\n\r\n将一些面糊铺在烤盘上。在锅边铺上一层薄薄的面糊。盖上锅盖30-60秒，直至出现小气泡。\r\n\r\n在煎饼上加入黄油、奶油玉米、碎花生和糖。一旦底面变成棕色，将煎饼对折。\r\n\r\n切成楔形，趁热吃效果最佳。"},{"id":"53050","n":"Ayam Percik","a":"Malaysian","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/020z181619788503.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9ytR28QK6I8","i":[["Chicken Thighs","6"],["Challots","16"],["Ginger","1 1/2"],["Garlic Clove","6"],["Cayenne Pepper","8"],["Turmeric","2 tbs"],["Cumin","1 1/2"],["Coriander","1 1/2"],["Fennel","1 1/2"],["Tamarind Paste","2 tbs"],["Coconut Milk","1 can"],["Sugar","1 tsp"],["Water","1 cup"]],"s":"In a blender, add the ingredients for the spice paste and blend until smooth.\r\nOver medium heat, pour the spice paste in a skillet or pan and fry for 10 minutes until fragrant. Add water or oil 1 tablespoon at a time if the paste becomes too dry. Don't burn the paste. Lower the fire slightly if needed.\r\nAdd the cloves, cardamom, tamarind pulp, coconut milk, water, sugar and salt. Turn the heat up and bring the mixture to boil. Turn the heat to medium low and simmer for 10 minutes. Stir occasionally. It will reduce slightly. This is the marinade/sauce, so taste and adjust seasoning if necessary. Don't worry if it's slightly bitter. It will go away when roasting.\r\nWhen the marinade/sauce has cooled, pour everything over the chicken and marinate overnight to two days.\r\nPreheat the oven to 425 F.\r\nRemove the chicken from the marinade. Spoon the marinade onto a greased (or aluminum lined) baking sheet. Lay the chicken on top of the sauce (make sure the chicken covers the sauce and the sauce isn't exposed or it'll burn) and spread the remaining marinade on the chicken. Roast for 35-45 minutes or until internal temp of the thickest part of chicken is at least 175 F.\r\nLet chicken rest for 5 minutes. Brush the chicken with some of the oil. Serve chicken with the sauce over steamed rice (or coconut rice).","z":"在搅拌机中，加入香料酱的成分，搅拌至光滑。\r\n用中火将香料酱倒入煎锅或平底锅中，煎 10 分钟直至散发出香味。如果糊状物太干，则一次加水或油一汤匙。不要烧糊状物。如果需要的话，稍微降低火势。\r\n加入丁香、小豆蔻、罗望子果肉、椰奶、水、糖和盐。把火调高，将混合物煮沸。将火调至中低，煮 10 分钟。偶尔搅拌一下。会略有减少。这是腌料/酱汁，因此请品尝并根据需要调整调味料。如果有点苦也不用担心。烘烤时它会消失。\r\n当腌料/酱汁冷却后，将所有东西倒在鸡肉上，腌制过夜至两天。\r\n将烤箱预热至 425 F。\r\n将鸡肉从腌料中取出。将腌料舀到涂有油脂（或铝箔）的烤盘上。将鸡肉放在酱汁上（确保鸡肉覆盖酱汁并且酱汁不暴露，否则会烧焦），然后将剩余的腌料涂在鸡肉上。烤 35-45 分钟或直到鸡肉最厚部分的内部温度至少为 175 F。\r\n让鸡肉休息 5 分钟。在鸡肉上刷一些油。将鸡肉和酱汁放在蒸米饭（或椰子饭）上。"},{"id":"53053","n":"Beef Rendang","a":"Malaysian","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/bc8v651619789840.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ot-dmfBaZrA","i":[["Beef","1lb"],["Vegetable Oil","5 tbs"],["Cinnamon Stick","1"],["Cloves","3"],["Star Anise","3"],["Cardamom","3"],["Coconut Cream","1 cup"],["Water","1 cup"],["Tamarind Paste","2 tbs"],["Lime","6"],["Sugar","1 tbs"],["Challots","5"]],"s":"Chop the spice paste ingredients and then blend it in a food processor until fine.\r\nHeat the oil in a stew pot, add the spice paste, cinnamon, cloves, star anise, and cardamom and stir-fry until aromatic. Add the beef and the pounded lemongrass and stir for 1 minute. Add the coconut milk, tamarind juice, water, and simmer on medium heat, stirring frequently until the meat is almost cooked. Add the kaffir lime leaves, kerisik (toasted coconut), sugar or palm sugar, stirring to blend well with the meat.\r\nLower the heat to low, cover the lid, and simmer for 1 to 1 1/2 hours or until the meat is really tender and the gravy has dried up. Add more salt and sugar to taste. Serve immediately with steamed rice and save some for overnight.","z":"将香料酱原料切碎，然后放入食品加工机中搅拌至细腻。\r\n在炖锅中加热油，加入香料酱、肉桂、丁香、八角和小豆蔻，炒至芳香。加入牛肉和捣碎的柠檬草，搅拌 1 分钟。加入椰奶、罗望子汁、水，用中火煮，经常搅拌，直到肉几乎煮熟。加入柠檬叶、kerisik（烤椰子）、糖或棕榈糖，搅拌使其与肉充分混合。\r\n将火调至小火，盖上盖子，小火煮 1 至 1 1/2 小时，或直至肉变软且肉汁收干。添加更多的盐和糖来调味。立即与米饭一起食用，并保存一些过夜。"},{"id":"52821","n":"Laksa King Prawn Noodles","a":"Malaysian","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/rvypwy1503069308.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OcarztU8cYo","i":[["Olive Oil","1 tbsp"],["Red Chilli","1 finely sliced"],["Thai red curry paste","2 ½ tbsp"],["vegetable stock cube","1"],["coconut milk","400ml can"],["fish sauce","2 tsp"],["rice noodles","100g"],["lime","2 juice of 1, the other halved"],["king prawns","150g"],["coriander","½ small pack"]],"s":"Heat the oil in a medium saucepan and add the chilli. Cook for 1 min, then add the curry paste, stir and cook for 1 min more. Dissolve the stock cube in a large jug in 700ml boiling water, then pour into the pan and stir to combine. Tip in the coconut milk and bring to the boil.\r\nAdd the fish sauce and a little seasoning. Toss in the noodles and cook for a further 3-4 mins until softening. Squeeze in the lime juice, add the prawns and cook through until warm, about 2-3 mins. Scatter over some of the coriander.\r\nServe in bowls with the remaining coriander and lime wedges on top for squeezing over.","z":"在中型平底锅中加热油，加入辣椒。煮1分钟，然后加入咖喱酱，搅拌并再煮1分钟。将汤块放入大壶中，加入 700 毫升沸水溶解，然后倒入锅中搅拌混合。倒入椰奶并煮沸。\r\n加入鱼露和少许调味料。加入面条，再煮3-4分钟直至变软。挤入酸橙汁，加入虾，煮至温热，约 2-3 分钟。撒上一些香菜。\r\n盛入碗中，将剩余的香菜和酸橙块放在上面，以便挤在上面。"},{"id":"53048","n":"Mee goreng mamak","a":"Malaysian","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/xquakq1619787532.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pOJEmDBgtSk","i":[["Peanuts","50g"],["Chilli","15g"],["Prawns","10g"],["Oil","5 tbs"],["Water","750 ml"],["Tamarind Paste","1/2 tbs"],["Potatoes","250g"],["Red Onions","2"],["Garlic Clove","4"],["Cabbage","30g"],["Chinese Broccoli","30g"],["Tofu","1"],["Soy Sauce","1 tbs"],["Noodles","4"],["Egg","1"]],"s":"Heat oil in a pan at medium heat. Then, add peanuts, dried chilies, dried shrimps and dhal. Fry the aromatics until fragrant. Remove from pan and leave aside.\r\n\r\nBlend fried ingredients with tamarind paste and water until fine. Then, sauté the blended ingredients in oil heated over low heat. Continue cooking until the oil separates from the paste and turns a darker shade.\r\n\r\nSkin and cut potatoes into small chunks and boil them in a pot of water until knife-tender. Once ready, remove them from the pot and leave aside. Discard water.\r\n\r\nSlice onion and fried tofu, mince garlic, cut some cabbage and Chinese flowering cabbage (choi sam). Prepare prawn fritters and cut them. Boil noodles to soften them if bought dried. Also mix black soy sauce with water.\r\n\r\nTo fry one portion of mee goreng mamak, heat oil and add 1/4 of the following ingredients in this order: garlic, onion, paste. Sauté until fragrant. Optionally, add prawns.\r\n\r\nAdd in 1/4 amount of tofu, boiled potatoes, cabbage, Chinese flowering cabbage and prawn fritters. Sauté for another 30 seconds.\r\n\r\nAdd noodles to the wok. Add 3 tablespoons of dark soy sauce mixture. Mix evenly for the next 1 minute. Then, move the noodles to the side of the wok. Stir in an egg. Garnish with a slice of lime and slices of green chilies. To cook another plate of noodles, repeat from step 5 onwards.","z":"在锅中用中火加热油。然后，加入花生、干辣椒、干虾和木豆。将香料炒香。从锅中取出并放在一边。\r\n\r\n将油炸原料与罗望子酱和水混合直至细腻。然后，将混合好的材料放入加热的油中，用小火炒香。继续烹饪，直到油从糊状物中分离出来并变成更深的颜色。\r\n\r\n将土豆去皮并切成小块，然后在锅中煮至刀嫩。准备好后，将它们从锅中取出并放在一边。倒掉水。\r\n\r\n将洋葱和炸豆腐切片，蒜切末，切一些卷心菜和菜心。准备好虾油条，切好。如果买的是干面条，请将面条煮软。还将黑酱油与水混合。\r\n\r\n炒一份马来炒面，加热油并按顺序加入 1/4 的以下材料：大蒜、洋葱、酱。炒香。可以选择添加虾。\r\n\r\n加入1/4量的豆腐、煮土豆、白菜、白菜和虾条。再炒30秒。\r\n\r\n将面条加入锅中。添加3汤匙黑酱油混合物。接下来 1 分钟混合均匀。然后，将面条移至锅的一侧。拌入一个鸡蛋。用一片酸橙和几片青辣椒装饰。要煮另一盘面条，请从步骤 5 开始重复。"},{"id":"53051","n":"Nasi lemak","a":"Malaysian","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/wai9bw1619788844.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IUIs4C86Ilo","i":[["Coconut Milk","2 cups"],["Water","2 cups"],["Ginger Paste","1/4 tsp"],["Ginger","1"],["Bay Leaf","1"],["Rice","2 cups"],["Eggs","4"],["Cucumber","1"],["Peanuts","1 cup"],["Anchovy Fillet","4 oz"],["Vegetable Oil","2 tbs"],["Onion","1"],["Garlic","3 cloves"],["Shallots","3"],["Chilli Powder","2 tsp"],["Anchovy Fillet","4 oz"],["Sugar","3 tbs"],["Tamarind Paste","1/3 cup"]],"s":"In a medium saucepan over medium heat, stir together coconut milk, water, ground ginger, ginger root, salt, bay leaf, and rice. Cover, and bring to a boil. Reduce heat, and simmer for 20 to 30 minutes, or until done.\r\n\r\n Step 2\r\nPlace eggs in a saucepan, and cover with cold water. Bring water to a boil, and immediately remove from heat. Cover, and let eggs stand in hot water for 10 to 12 minutes. Remove eggs from hot water, cool, peel and slice in half. Slice cucumber.\r\n\r\n Step 3\r\nMeanwhile, in a large skillet or wok, heat 1 cup vegetable oil over medium-high heat. Stir in peanuts and cook briefly, until lightly browned. Remove peanuts with a slotted spoon and place on paper towels to soak up excess grease. Return skillet to stove. Stir in the contents of one package anchovies; cook briefly, turning, until crisp. Remove with a slotted spoon and place on paper towels. Discard oil. Wipe out skillet.\r\n\r\n Step 4\r\nHeat 2 tablespoons oil in the skillet. Stir in the onion, garlic, and shallots; cook until fragrant, about 1 or 2 minutes. Mix in the chile paste, and cook for 10 minutes, stirring occasionally. If the chile paste is too dry, add a small amount of water. Stir in remaining anchovies; cook for 5 minutes. Stir in salt, sugar, and tamarind juice; simmer until sauce is thick, about 5 minutes.\r\n\r\n Step 5\r\nServe the onion and garlic sauce over the warm rice, and top with peanuts, fried anchovies, cucumbers, and eggs.","z":"在中型平底锅中，用中火将椰奶、水、姜末、姜根、盐、月桂叶和大米搅拌在一起。盖上盖子，煮沸。减少热量，煮 20 至 30 分钟，或直至煮熟。\r\n\r\n 步骤2\r\n将鸡蛋放入锅中，盖上冷水。将水煮沸，然后立即离火。盖上盖子，让鸡蛋在热水中静置 10 到 12 分钟。将鸡蛋从热水中取出，冷却，剥皮并切成两半。黄瓜切片。\r\n\r\n 步骤3\r\n与此同时，在一个大煎锅或炒锅中，用中高火加热 1 杯植物油。拌入花生并短暂煮至浅棕色。用漏勺取出花生，放在纸巾上吸收多余的油脂。将煎锅放回炉子上。加入一包凤尾鱼的内容物搅拌；短暂烹饪，翻转，直至酥脆。用有槽勺取出并放在纸巾上。丢弃油。擦掉煎锅。\r\n\r\n 步骤4\r\n在煎锅中加热 2 汤匙油。加入洋葱、大蒜和青葱，搅拌；煮至香味四溢，大约1或2分钟。加入智利酱，煮 10 分钟，偶尔搅拌。如果智利酱太干，请添加少量水。拌入剩余的凤尾鱼；煮5分钟。加入盐、糖和罗望子汁搅拌；煮至酱汁浓稠，约5分钟。\r\n\r\n 步骤5\r\n将洋葱和大蒜酱放在温热的米饭上，上面放上花生、炸凤尾鱼、黄瓜和鸡蛋。"},{"id":"53052","n":"Roti john","a":"Malaysian","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/hx335q1619789561.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cl4YH8wblRs","i":[["Minced Beef","1/4 lb"],["Onion","1"],["Eggs","3"],["Chilli","1 tbs"],["Baguette","1/2"],["Salt","To taste"],["Pepper","To taste"],["Mayonnaise","Top"]],"s":"Mix all the ingredients in a bowl.\r\nHeat a pan or griddle with a little vegetable oil.\r\nPour the mixture onto the pan and place a piece of open-faced baguette on top.\r\nPress on the bread with a spatula and grill for 2 minutes.\r\nTurn the bread over to make it a little crispy.\r\nRemove from pan and cut the bread into small portions.\r\nAdd mayonnaise and/or Sambal before cutting the sandwich (optional).","z":"将所有成分混合在一个碗中。\r\n用少许植物油加热平底锅或煎锅。\r\n将混合物倒入锅中，并在上面放一块开面法棍面包。\r\n用抹刀按压面包并烤 2 分钟。\r\n将面包翻个面，使其稍微酥脆。\r\n从锅中取出，将面包切成小块。\r\n在切三明治之前添加蛋黄酱和/或参巴酱（可选）。"},{"id":"53054","n":"Seri muka kuih","a":"Malaysian","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/6ut2og1619790195.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_NJtCfqgaBo","i":[["Rice","400g"],["Coconut Milk","150ml"],["Water","100ml"],["Salt","1 tsp"],["Corn Flour","5 tbs"],["Flour","3 tbs"],["Eggs","3"],["Coconut Cream","200ml"],["Sugar","140g"]],"s":"Soak glutinous rice with water for at least 1 ½ hours prior to using. Drain.\r\nPrepare a 9-inch round or square cake pan and spray with cooking spray or line with plastic wrap.\r\nMix coconut milk, water, salt and the rice. Pour it into cake pan, topped with the pandan knots.\r\nSteam for 30 minutes.\r\nAfter 30 minutes, fluff up the rice and remove pandan knots. Then, using a greased spatula, flatten the steamed rice. Make sure there are no holes/air bubbles and gaps in the rice, especially the sides.\r\nSteam for another 10 minutes.\r\n\r\nCombine pandan juice, coconut milk, all purpose flour, cornflour, and sugar. Mix well.\r\nAdd eggs and whisk well then strain into a medium sized metal bowl or pot.\r\nPlace pandan mixture over simmering water (double boiler or bain-marie)\r\nStir continuously and cook till custard starts to thicken. (15 minutes)\r\nPour pandan custard into glutinous rice layer, give it a little tap (for air bubbles) and continue to steam for 30 minutes.\r\nRemove kuih seri muka from the steamer and allow to cool completely before cutting into rectangles or diamond shapes.","z":"使用前将糯米用水浸泡至少 1.5 小时。流走。\r\n准备一个9英寸的圆形或方形蛋糕盘，喷上烹饪喷雾或铺上保鲜膜。\r\n将椰奶、水、盐和米混合。将其倒入蛋糕盘中，上面铺上班兰结。\r\n蒸30分钟。\r\n30分钟后，将米饭弄松并去除班兰结。然后，用涂了油的抹刀将蒸好的米饭压平。确保米饭上没有孔洞/气泡和间隙，尤其是侧面。\r\n再蒸10分钟。\r\n\r\n将香兰汁、椰奶、通用面粉、玉米粉和糖混合。搅拌均匀。\r\n加入鸡蛋并搅拌均匀，然后滤入中等大小的金属碗或锅中。\r\n将班兰混合物放在煮沸的水中（双锅或蒸锅）\r\n不断搅拌并煮至蛋奶冻开始变稠。 （15 分钟）\r\n将香兰奶冻倒入糯米层中，轻轻拍打（消除气泡），继续蒸30分钟。\r\n将 kuih seri muka 从蒸锅中取出并完全冷却，然后切成矩形或菱形。"},{"id":"52826","n":"Braised Beef Chilli","a":"Mexican","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/uuqvwu1504629254.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=z4kSoJgsu6Y","i":[["Beef","1kg"],["Onions","3"],["Garlic","4 cloves"],["Olive oil","Dash"],["Chorizo","300g"],["Cumin","2 tsp"],["Allspice","2 tsp"],["Cloves","1 tsp"],["Cinnamon stick","1 large"],["Bay Leaves","3"],["Oregano","2 tsp dried"],["Ancho Chillies","2 ancho"],["Balsamic Vinegar","3 tbsp"],["Plum Tomatoes","2 x 400g"],["Tomato Ketchup","2 tbsp"],["Dark Brown Sugar","2 tbsp"],["Borlotti Beans","2 x 400g tins"]],"s":"Preheat the oven to 120C/225F/gas mark 1.\r\n\r\nTake the meat out of the fridge to de-chill. Pulse the onions and garlic in a food processor until finely chopped. Heat 2 tbsp olive oil in a large casserole and sear the meat on all sides until golden.\r\n\r\nSet to one side and add another small slug of oil to brown the chorizo. Remove and add the onion and garlic, spices, herbs and chillies then cook until soft in the chorizo oil. Season with salt and pepper and add the vinegar, tomatoes, ketchup and sugar.\r\n\r\nPut all the meat back into the pot with 400ml water (or red wine if you prefer), bring up to a simmer and cook, covered, in the low oven.\r\n\r\nAfter 2 hours, check the meat and add the beans. Cook for a further hour and just before serving, pull the meat apart with a pair of forks.","z":"将烤箱预热至 120C/225F/气体标记 1。\r\n\r\n把肉从冰箱里拿出来解冻。将洋葱和大蒜放入食品加工机中搅拌直至切碎。在大砂锅中加热 2 汤匙橄榄油，将肉各面煎至金黄色。\r\n\r\n放在一侧，再加入一小块油，使香肠变成棕色。取出并加入洋葱、大蒜、香料、香草和辣椒，然后在香肠油中煮至软。用盐和胡椒调味，然后加入醋、西红柿、番茄酱和糖。\r\n\r\n将所有肉放回锅中，加入 400 毫升水（或红酒，如果您愿意），用小火煮，盖上锅盖，在低烤箱中烹调。\r\n\r\n2小时后，检查肉并添加豆子。再煮一个小时，上桌前用叉子将肉分开。"},{"id":"52819","n":"Cajun spiced fish tacos","a":"Mexican","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/uvuyxu1503067369.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=N4EdUt0Ou48","i":[["cajun","2 tbsp"],["cayenne pepper","1 tsp"],["white fish","4 fillets"],["vegetable oil","1 tsp"],["flour tortilla","8"],["avocado","1 sliced"],["little gem lettuce","2 shredded"],["Spring Onions","4 shredded"],["salsa","1 x 300ml"],["sour cream","1 pot"],["lemon","1"],["garlic","1 clove finely chopped"]],"s":"Cooking in a cajun spice and cayenne pepper marinade makes this fish super succulent and flavoursome. Top with a zesty dressing and serve in a tortilla for a quick, fuss-free main that's delightfully summery.\r\n\r\nOn a large plate, mix the cajun spice and cayenne pepper with a little seasoning and use to coat the fish all over.\r\n\r\nHeat a little oil in a frying pan, add in the fish and cook over a medium heat until golden. Reduce the heat and continue frying until the fish is cooked through, about 10 minutes. Cook in batches if you don’t have enough room in the pan.\r\n\r\nMeanwhile, prepare the dressing by combining all the ingredients with a little seasoning.\r\nSoften the tortillas by heating in the microwave for 5-10 seconds. Pile high with the avocado, lettuce and spring onion, add a spoonful of salsa, top with large flakes of fish and drizzle over the dressing.","z":"用卡真香料和辣椒腌料烹饪使这种鱼变得超级多汁且味道鲜美。上面撒上辛辣的调料，然后放入玉米饼中，这是一道快速、无忧无虑的主菜，充满了令人愉悦的夏日气息。\r\n\r\n在一个大盘子上，将卡真香料和辣椒与少许调味料混合，然后将鱼全身覆盖起来。\r\n\r\n煎锅中倒入少许油，烧热后放入鱼，中火煎至金黄。关小火，继续煎至鱼熟透，大约需要 10 分钟。如果锅里没有足够的空间，请分批烹饪。\r\n\r\n同时，将所有原料与少许调味料混合，准备调料。\r\n在微波炉中加热 5-10 秒，使玉米饼变软。将牛油果、生菜和葱堆得高高的，加入一勺莎莎酱，上面放上大片鱼片，淋上调料。"},{"id":"52765","n":"Chicken Enchilada Casserole","a":"Mexican","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/qtuwxu1468233098.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EtVkwVKLc_M","i":[["Enchilada sauce","14 oz jar"],["shredded Monterey Jack cheese","3 Cups"],["corn tortillas","6"],["chicken breasts","2"]],"s":"Cut each chicken breast in about 3 pieces, so that it cooks faster and put it in a small pot. Pour Enchilada sauce over it and cook covered on low to medium heat until chicken is cooked through, about 20 minutes. No water is needed, the chicken will cook in the Enchilada sauce. Make sure you stir occasionally so that it doesn't stick to the bottom.\r\nRemove chicken from the pot and shred with two forks.\r\nPreheat oven to 375 F degrees.\r\nStart layering the casserole. Start with about ¼ cup of the leftover Enchilada sauce over the bottom of a baking dish. I used a longer baking dish, so that I can put 2 corn tortillas across. Place 2 tortillas on the bottom, top with ⅓ of the chicken and ⅓ of the remaining sauce. Sprinkle with ⅓ of the cheese and repeat starting with 2 more tortillas, then chicken, sauce, cheese. Repeat with last layer with the remaining ingredients, tortillas, chicken, sauce and cheese.\r\nBake for 20 to 30 minutes uncovered, until bubbly and cheese has melted and started to brown on top.\r\nServe warm.","z":"将每块鸡胸肉切成3块左右，这样熟得更快，然后放入小锅中。将玉米卷饼酱倒在上面，盖上锅盖，用小火到中火煮，直到鸡肉煮熟，大约需要 20 分钟。不需要水，鸡肉会在辣酱玉米饼馅中煮熟。确保偶尔搅拌，以免粘在底部。\r\n将鸡肉从锅中取出，用两把叉子切碎。\r\n将烤箱预热至 375 华氏度。\r\n开始将砂锅分层。首先将大约 1/4 杯剩余的玉米卷饼酱放在烤盘的底部。我用了一个较长的烤盘，这样我就可以放两个玉米饼了。将 2 个玉米饼放在底部，上面放 ⅓ 鸡肉和 ⅓ 剩余的酱汁。撒上 ⅓ 的奶酪，然后从另外 2 个玉米饼开始重复，然后是鸡肉、酱汁和奶酪。用剩余的原料、玉米饼、鸡肉、酱汁和奶酪重复最后一层。\r\n不盖盖子烘烤 20 到 30 分钟，直到起泡和奶酪融化并在顶部开始变成棕色。\r\n趁热食用。"},{"id":"52870","n":"Chickpea Fajitas","a":"Mexican","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/tvtxpq1511464705.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LGY3V7EGpT0","i":[["Chickpeas","400g"],["Olive Oil","1 tblsp"],["Paprika","pinch"],["Tomatoes","2 small cut chunks"],["Red Onions","1 finely sliced"],["Red Wine Vinegar","2 tsp"],["Avocado","1"],["Lime","Juice of 1"],["Lime","Chopped"],["Sour Cream","100g"],["Harissa Spice","2 tsp"],["Corn Tortillas","4"],["Coriander","to serve"]],"s":"Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6 and line a baking tray with foil. Drain the chickpeas, pat dry and tip onto the prepared baking tray. Add the oil and paprika, toss to coat, then roast for 20-25 mins until browned and crisp, shaking halfway through cooking.\r\n\r\nMeanwhile, put the tomatoes and onion in a small bowl with the vinegar and set aside to pickle. Put the avocado in another bowl and mash with a fork, leaving some larger chunks. Stir in the lime juice and season well. Mix the soured cream with the harissa and set aside until ready to serve.\r\n\r\nHeat a griddle pan until nearly smoking. Add the tortillas , one at a time, charring each side until hot with griddle lines. \r\n\r\nPut everything on the table and build the fajitas : spread a little of the harissa cream over the tortilla, top with roasted chickpeas, guacamole, pickled salsa and coriander, if you like. Serve with the lime wedges for squeezing over.","z":"将烤箱加热至 200C/180C 风扇/燃气 6，并在烤盘上铺上箔纸。将鹰嘴豆沥干，拍干并倒在准备好的烤盘上。加入油和辣椒粉，搅拌均匀，然后烤 20-25 分钟，直至变成棕色且酥脆，中途摇晃。\r\n\r\n与此同时，将西红柿和洋葱放入装有醋的小碗中，放在一边腌制。将牛油果放入另一个碗中，用叉子捣碎，留下一些大块。加入酸橙汁并充分调味。将酸奶油与哈里萨辣酱混合，放在一边备用。\r\n\r\n将煎锅加热至几乎冒烟。添加玉米饼，一次一个，用煎锅线将每一面烧焦直至变热。 \r\n\r\n把所有东西都放在桌子上，制作法加它：在玉米饼上涂一点哈里萨辣酱奶油，如果你喜欢的话，上面放上烤鹰嘴豆、鳄梨酱、腌制莎莎酱和香菜。与酸橙块一起食用，挤在上面。"},{"id":"52830","n":"Crock Pot Chicken Baked Tacos","a":"Mexican","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/ypxvwv1505333929.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oqL0mLDBzS4","i":[["Chicken Breasts","4 - 6"],["Vinaigrette Dressing","1 bottle"],["Cumin","1½ tablespoon"],["Smoked Paprika","1 tablespoon"],["Garlic","1 teaspoon"],["Refried Beans","1 can"],["Hard Taco Shells","12"],["Shredded Mexican Cheese","2 cups"],["Grape Tomatoes","Halved"],["Jalapeno","Sliced and Seeded"],["Avocado","Peeled and Sliced"],["Green Salsa","2 tablespoons"],["Sour Cream","3 tablespoons"],["Milk","1 tablespoon"]],"s":"Put the uncooked chicken breasts in the crock pot. Pour the full bottle of salad dressing over the chicken. Sprinkle the rest of the ingredients over the top and mix them in a bit with a spoon.\r\nCover your crock pot with the lid and cook on high for 4 hours.\r\nRemove all the chicken breasts from the crock pot and let cool.\r\nShred the chicken breasts and move to a glass bowl.\r\nPour most of the liquid over the shredded chicken.\r\nFOR THE TACOS:\r\nMake the guacamole sauce by mixing the avocado and green salsa together. Pour the guacamole mixture through a strainer until smooth and transfer to a squeeze bottle. Cut the tip off the lid of the squeeze bottle to make the opening more wide if needed.\r\nMake the sour cream sauce by mixing the sour cream and milk together until you get a more liquid sour cream sauce. Transfer to a squeeze bottle.\r\nIn a 9x 13 glass baking dish, fill all 12+ tacos with a layer of refried beans, cooked chicken and shredded cheese.\r\nBake at 450 for 10-15 minutes just until the cheese is melted and bubbling.\r\nOut of the oven top all the tacos with the sliced grape tomaotes, jalapeno and cilantro.\r\nFinish with a drizzle of guacamole and sour cream.\r\nEnjoy!","z":"将未煮熟的鸡胸肉放入锅中。将整瓶沙拉酱倒在鸡肉上。将其余成分撒在上面，然后用勺子稍微混合。\r\n盖上锅盖，高火煮 4 小时。\r\n将所有鸡胸肉从锅中取出并冷却。\r\n将鸡胸肉切碎并移至玻璃碗中。\r\n将大部分液体倒在切碎的鸡肉上。\r\n对于炸玉米饼：\r\n将鳄梨和绿色莎莎酱混合在一起制成鳄梨酱。将鳄梨酱混合物倒入过滤器中直至光滑，然后转移到挤压瓶中。如果需要的话，切掉挤压瓶盖的尖端，使开口更宽。\r\n将酸奶油和牛奶混合在一起制成酸奶油酱，直到得到更多液体的酸奶油酱。转移到挤压瓶中。\r\n在 9x 13 的玻璃烤盘中，将所有 12 个以上的玉米饼填入一层炸豆泥、煮熟的鸡肉和切碎的奶酪。\r\n在 450 度的温度下烘烤 10-15 分钟，直到奶酪融化并冒泡。\r\n从烤箱中取出后，在所有炸玉米饼上放上切好的葡萄西红柿、墨西哥辣椒和香菜。\r\n最后撒上一点鳄梨酱和酸奶油。\r\n享受！"},{"id":"53067","n":"Stuffed Bell Peppers with Quinoa and Black Beans","a":"Mexican","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/b66myb1683207208.jpg","y":"","i":[["Green Pepper","4 whole"],["Olive Oil","1 tablespoon"],["Onion","1 small finely diced"],["Garlic","2 cloves minced"],["Quinoa","1 cups"],["Black Beans","1 can"],["Sweetcorn","1 cup"],["Diced Tomatoes","1 can"],["Cumin","1 teaspoon"],["Chili Powder","½ tsp"],["Smoked Paprika","½ tsp"],["Salt","To taste"],["Pepper","To taste"],["Shredded Mexican Cheese","1 1/2 cup"],["Cilantro","Chopped"]],"s":"1. Preheat your oven to 375°F (190°C). Lightly grease a 9x13-inch baking dish or a similar-sized casserole dish.\r\n2. Place the bell pepper halves in the prepared baking dish, cut side up. Bake for 15-20 minutes, or until slightly softened.\r\n3. While the bell peppers are baking, prepare the filling. In a large skillet, heat the olive oil over medium heat. Add the chopped onion, and cook for 3-4 minutes, until softened. Add the garlic, and cook for another 1 minute, until fragrant.\r\n4. Stir in the cooked quinoa, black beans, corn, diced tomatoes, ground cumin, chili powder, smoked paprika, salt, and pepper. Cook for 5-7 minutes, until heated through. Remove the skillet from heat, and stir in 1 cup of the shredded cheese, if using.\r\n5. Remove the bell peppers from the oven, and carefully stuff each pepper half with the quinoa and black bean mixture. Top the stuffed peppers with the remaining 1/2 cup of shredded cheese, if using.\r\n6. Return the stuffed peppers to the oven, and bake for another 15-20 minutes, until the cheese is melted and the peppers are tender.\r\n7. Remove from the oven, and allow the stuffed peppers to cool for 5 minutes before serving. Garnish with fresh chopped cilantro.","z":"1. 将烤箱预热至 375°F (190°C)。在 9x13 英寸的烤盘或类似尺寸的砂锅盘上涂上少许油脂。\r\n2. 将切半的甜椒放入准备好的烤盘中，切面朝上。烘烤 15-20 分钟，或直至稍微软化。\r\n3. 烤青椒的同时，准备馅料。在一个大煎锅中，用中火加热橄榄油。加入切碎的洋葱，煮3-4分钟，直至变软。加入大蒜，再煮 1 分钟，直至散发出香味。\r\n4. 加入煮熟的藜麦、黑豆、玉米、西红柿丁、孜然粉、辣椒粉、烟熏辣椒粉、盐和胡椒粉。煮5-7分钟，直至热透。将煎锅从火上移开，加入 1 杯切碎的奶酪（如果需要）搅拌。\r\n5. 将青椒从烤箱中取出，小心地将藜麦和黑豆混合物塞进每个青椒的一半。如果使用的话，在填充辣椒上放上剩余的 1/2 杯切碎的奶酪。\r\n6. 将酿好的辣椒放回烤箱，再烤15-20分钟，直至奶酪融化、辣椒变软。\r\n7. 从烤箱中取出，让酿好的辣椒冷却 5 分钟，然后食用。用新鲜切碎的香菜装饰。"},{"id":"52850","n":"Chicken Couscous","a":"Moroccan","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/qxytrx1511304021.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GZQGy9oscVk","i":[["Olive Oil","1 tbsp"],["Onion","1 chopped"],["Chicken Breast","200g"],["Ginger","pinch"],["Harissa Spice","2 tblsp"],["Dried Apricots","10"],["Chickpeas","220g"],["Couscous","200g"],["Chicken Stock","200ml"],["Coriander","Handful"]],"s":"Heat the olive oil in a large frying pan and cook the onion for 1-2 mins just until softened. Add the chicken and fry for 7-10 mins until cooked through and the onions have turned golden. Grate over the ginger, stir through the harissa to coat everything and cook for 1 min more.\r\n\r\nTip in the apricots, chickpeas and couscous, then pour over the stock and stir once. Cover with a lid or tightly cover the pan with foil and leave for about 5 mins until the couscous has soaked up all the stock and is soft. Fluff up the couscous with a fork and scatter over the coriander to serve. Serve with extra harissa, if you like.","z":"在大煎锅中加热橄榄油，煮洋葱 1-2 分钟直至变软。加入鸡肉，炒 7-10 分钟直至熟透，洋葱变成金黄色。将生姜磨碎，搅拌哈里萨辣酱，将所有东西都裹上，再煮 1 分钟。\r\n\r\n倒入杏子、鹰嘴豆和蒸粗麦粉，然后倒在高汤上并搅拌一次。盖上盖子或用箔纸紧紧盖住锅，静置约 5 分钟，直至粗麦粉吸收所有汤料并变软。用叉子将蒸粗麦粉弄松，撒在香菜上即可食用。如果你喜欢的话，可以加点哈里萨辣酱。"},{"id":"52843","n":"Lamb Tagine","a":"Moroccan","c":"Lamb","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/yuwtuu1511295751.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bR5Cqu84S_k","i":[["Olive Oil","2 tblsp"],["Onion","1 finely sliced"],["Carrots","2 chopped"],["Lamb Leg","500g"],["Garlic","2 cloves minced"],["Cumin","½ tsp"],["Ginger","½ tsp"],["Saffron","¼ tsp"],["Cinnamon","1 tsp"],["Honey","1 tblsp"],["Apricot","100g"],["Vegetable Stock Cube","1"],["Butternut Squash","1 medium chopped"],["Couscous","Steamed"],["Parsley","Chopped"]],"s":"Heat the olive oil in a heavy-based pan and add the onion and carrot. Cook for 3- 4 mins until softened.\r\n\r\nAdd the diced lamb and brown all over. Stir in the garlic and all the spices and cook for a few mins more or until the aromas are released.\r\n\r\nAdd the honey and apricots, crumble in the stock cube and pour over roughly 500ml boiling water or enough to cover the meat. Give it a good stir and bring to the boil. Turn down to a simmer, put the lid on and cook for 1 hour.\r\n\r\nRemove the lid and cook for a further 30 mins, then stir in the squash. Cook for 20 – 30 mins more until the squash is soft and the lamb is tender. Serve alongside rice or couscous and sprinkle with parsley and pine nuts, if using.","z":"在厚底锅中加热橄榄油，加入洋葱和胡萝卜。煮 3-4 分钟直至变软。\r\n\r\n加入羊肉丁，将其全部煎成棕色。加入大蒜和所有香料，再煮几分钟或直至香气散发出来。\r\n\r\n加入蜂蜜和杏子，在高汤块中捣碎，倒入大约 500 毫升的沸水或足以覆盖肉的水。充分搅拌并煮沸。转小火，盖上盖子，煮1小时。\r\n\r\n取下盖子，再煮 30 分钟，然后拌入南瓜。再煮 20 – 30 分钟，直到南瓜变软、羊肉变软。与米饭或蒸粗麦粉一起食用，如果使用的话，撒上欧芹和松子。"},{"id":"52782","n":"Lamb tomato and sweet spices","a":"Moroccan","c":"Lamb","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/qtwtss1468572261.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vaZb1MnFBgA","i":[["olive oil","2 tbsp"],["ginger","4cm piece finely chopped"],["garlic","2 cloves peeled and chopped"],["tomatoes","800g peeled and chopped"],["lemon juice","2 tbsp"],["caster sugar","1 tsp"],["vine leaves","50"],["fennel bulb","1 large"],["lamb mince","400g"],["onion","1 medium"],["potatoes","1 small peeled and coarsely grated"],["basmati rice","2 tbsp"],["chopped parsley","2 tbsp"],["coriander","2 tbsp chopped"],["lemon juice","1 tbsp"],["garlic","2 cloves"],["clove","½ tsp ground"],["cinnamon","½ tsp ground"],["tomatoes","2 medium"]],"s":"Use pickled vine leaves here, preserved in brine. Small delicate leaves are better than the large bristly ones but, if only large leaves are to hand, then trim them to roughly 12 by 12 cms so that you don't get too many layers of leaves around the filling. And remove any stalks. Drain the preserved leaves, immerse them in boiling water for 10 minutes and then leave to dry on a tea towel before use. \r\nBasmati rice with butter and pine nuts is an ideal accompaniment. Couscous is great, too. Serves four.\r\nFirst make the filling. Put all the ingredients, apart from the tomatoes, in a bowl. Cut the tomatoes in half, coarsely grate into the bowl and discard the skins. Add half a teaspoon of salt and some black pepper, and stir. Leave on the side, or in the fridge, for up to a day. Before using, gently squeeze with your hands and drain away any juices that come out.\r\nTo make the sauce, heat the oil in a medium pan. Add the ginger and garlic, cook for a minute or two, taking care not to burn them, then add the tomato, lemon juice and sugar. Season, and simmer for 20 minutes.\r\nWhile the sauce is bubbling away, prepare the vine leaves. Use any torn or broken leaves to line the base of a wide, heavy saucepan. Trim any leaves from the fennel, cut it vertically into 0.5cm-thick slices and spread over the base of the pan to cover completely.\r\nLay a prepared vine leaf (see intro) on a work surface, veiny side up. Put two teaspoons of filling at the base of the leaf in a 2cm-long by 1cm-wide strip. Fold the sides of the leaf over the filling, then roll it tightly from bottom to top, in a cigar shape. Place in the pan, seam down, and repeat with the remaining leaves, placing them tightly next to each other in lines or circles (in two layers if necessary).\r\nPour the sauce over the leaves (and, if needed, add water just to cover). Place a plate on top, to weigh the leaves down, then cover with a lid. Bring to a boil, reduce the heat and cook on a bare simmer for 70 minutes. Most of the liquid should evaporate. Remove from the heat, and leave to cool a little - they are best served warm. When serving, bring to the table in the pan - it looks great. Serve a few vine leaves and fennel slices with warm rice. Spoon the braising juices on top and garnish with coriander.","z":"这里使用腌制的藤叶，用盐水保存。小而精致的叶子比大而有毛的叶子更好，但是，如果手头上只有大叶子，请将它们修剪到大约 12 x 12 厘米，这样馅料周围就不会出现太多层叶子。并除去任何茎。将腌制的叶子沥干，将其浸入沸水中 10 分钟，然后在使用前在茶巾上晾干。 \r\n印度香米配黄油和松子是理想的搭配。库斯库斯也很棒。四人份。\r\n首先做馅料。将除西红柿外的所有原料放入碗中。将西红柿切成两半，粗磨碎放入碗中，然后丢弃皮。加入半茶匙盐和一些黑胡椒，搅拌。放在一边或冰箱里最多可以保存一天。使用前，用手轻轻挤压，沥干流出的汁液。\r\n制作酱汁时，在中型平底锅中加热油。加入生姜和大蒜，煮一两分钟，注意不要烧焦，然后加入番茄、柠檬汁和糖。调味，煮20分钟。\r\n当酱汁冒泡时，准备藤叶。使用任何撕裂或折断的叶子排列在宽而重的平底锅的底部。修剪掉茴香的叶子，垂直切成 0.5 厘米厚的片，铺在锅底，完全覆盖。\r\n将准备好的藤叶（参见简介）放在工作台面上，有纹理的一面朝上。将两茶匙馅料放在叶子底部，形成 2 厘米长、1 厘米宽的条状。将叶子的两侧折叠到馅料上，然后从下到上紧紧卷成雪茄形状。放入锅中，缝合，然后对剩余的叶子重复此操作，将它们紧密地排列成直线或圆圈（如果需要，可以分成两层）。\r\n将酱汁倒在叶子上（如果需要，加水刚好覆盖叶子）。在上面放一个盘子，压下叶子的重量，然后盖上盖子。煮沸，调小火，小火煮 70 分钟。大部分液体应该蒸发。从火上移开，稍稍冷却——最好趁热食用。上菜时，将其放在平底锅中带到餐桌上 - 看起来很棒。将几片藤叶和茴香片与热米饭一起食用。将炖汁舀在上面，并用香菜装饰。"},{"id":"53047","n":"Moroccan Carrot Soup","a":"Moroccan","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/jcr46d1614763831.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7tDWOpnIhok","i":[["Carrots","6 chopped"],["Onion","1 sliced"],["Garlic Clove","4"],["Cumin","1 tsp"],["Coriander","1/2 tsp"],["Olive Oil","1 tbs"],["Garam Masala","1/4 tsp"],["Lemon Juice","1 tsp"]],"s":"Step 1\r\nPreheat oven to 180° C.\r\nStep 2\r\nCombine carrots, onion, garlic, cumin seeds, coriander seeds, salt and olive oil in a bowl and mix well. Transfer on a baking tray.\r\nStep 3\r\nPut the baking tray in preheated oven and roast for 10-12 minutes or till carrots soften. Remove from heat and cool.\r\nStep 4\r\nGrind the baked carrot mixture along with some water to make a smooth paste and strain in a bowl.\r\nStep 5\r\nHeat the carrot mixture in a non-stick pan. Add two cups of water and bring to a boil. Add garam masala powder and mix. Add salt and mix well.\r\nStep 6\r\nRemove from heat, add lemon juice and mix well.\r\nStep 7\r\nServe hot.","z":"步骤1\r\n将烤箱预热至180°C。\r\n步骤2\r\n将胡萝卜、洋葱、大蒜、小茴香籽、芫荽籽、盐和橄榄油放入碗中，搅拌均匀。转移到烤盘上。\r\n步骤3\r\n将烤盘放入预热的烤箱中，烤 10-12 分钟或直至胡萝卜变软。远离热源并冷却。\r\n步骤4\r\n将烤好的胡萝卜混合物与一些水一起研磨成光滑的糊状物，然后滤入碗中。\r\n步骤5\r\n在不粘锅中加热胡萝卜混合物。添加两杯水并煮沸。添加加拉姆马沙拉粉并混合。加盐并搅拌均匀。\r\n步骤6\r\n从火上移开，加入柠檬汁并搅拌均匀。\r\n步骤7\r\n趁热食用。"},{"id":"52797","n":"Spicy North African Potato Salad","a":"Moroccan","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/urtwux1486983078.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zxBzwJvTK4g","i":[["Small Potatoes","650g/1lb 8 oz"],["Harissa Spice","1 tsp"],["olive oil","2 tsp"],["Lemon","juice of half"],["Spring onions","4"],["Rocket","150g/6oz"],["Feta","80g/3oz"],["Mint","20 chopped"],["Pine nuts","2 tablespoons"],["Salt","Pinch"],["Pepper","Pinch"]],"s":"Cook potatoes - place potatoes in a pot of cold water, and bring to the boil. Boil 20 minutes, or until potatoes are tender. You know they are cooked when you can stick a knife in them and the knife goes straight through.\r\nCombine harissa spice, olive oil, salt and pepper and lemon juice in a small bowl and whisk until combined.\r\nOnce potatoes are cooked, drain water and roughly chop potatoes in half.\r\nAdd harissa mix and spring onions/green onions to potatoes and stir.\r\nIn a large salad bowl, lay out arugula/rocket.\r\nTop with potato mix and toss.\r\nAdd fetta, mint and sprinkle over pine nuts.\r\nAdjust salt and pepper to taste.","z":"煮土豆 - 将土豆放入一锅冷水中，煮沸。煮20分钟，或直到土豆变软。当你把刀插进去并且刀直接穿过时，你就知道它们已经煮熟了。\r\n将哈里萨辣酱香料、橄榄油、盐、胡椒和柠檬汁放入一个小碗中，搅拌直至混合。\r\n土豆煮熟后，沥干水，将土豆大致切成两半。\r\n将哈里萨辣酱混合物和葱/葱加入土豆中并搅拌。\r\n在一个大沙拉碗中，放入芝麻菜/火箭。\r\n上面放上土豆混合物并搅拌。\r\n加入羊乳酪、薄荷，撒在松子上。\r\n调整盐和胡椒粉的味道。"},{"id":"52869","n":"Tahini Lentils","a":"Moroccan","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/vpxyqt1511464175.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8kRlmz8pW0I","i":[["Tahini","50g"],["Lemon","zest and juice of 1"],["Olive Oil","2 tblsp"],["Red Onions","1 chopped"],["Garlic","1 clove peeled crushed"],["Yellow Pepper","1 thinly sliced"],["Green Beans","200g"],["Courgettes","1 sliced"],["Kale","100g shredded"],["Lentils","250g pack"]],"s":"In a jug, mix the tahini with the zest and juice of the lemon and 50ml of cold water to make a runny dressing. Season to taste, then set aside.\r\nHeat the oil in a wok or large frying pan over a medium-high heat. Add the red onion, along with a pinch of salt, and fry for 2 mins until starting to soften and colour. Add the garlic, pepper, green beans and courgette and fry for 5 min, stirring frequently.\r\nTip in the kale, lentils and the tahini dressing. Keep the pan on the heat for a couple of mins, stirring everything together until the kale is wilted and it’s all coated in the creamy dressing.","z":"在壶中，将芝麻酱、柠檬皮碎和柠檬汁以及 50 毫升冷水混合，制成流动调料。调味，然后放在一边。\r\n在炒锅或大煎锅中用中高火加热油。加入红洋葱和少许盐，炒 2 分钟直至开始变软并变色。加入大蒜、胡椒、青豆和西葫芦，炒 5 分钟，经常搅拌。\r\n加入羽衣甘蓝、扁豆和芝麻酱。将锅放在火上加热几分钟，将所有东西搅拌在一起，直到羽衣甘蓝枯萎并涂上奶油酱。"},{"id":"53389","n":"Apple Potato Mash (Hete bliksem) ","a":"Netherlands","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/pa03n41777540582.jpg","y":"","i":[["Apples","250g"],["Potatoes","250g"],["Cinnamon Stick","1"],["Maple Syrup","1 tsp"],["Ground Cinnamon","Sprinkling"],["Bacon","4"],["Cheese","200g"],["Salt","Pinch"],["Egg","1"],["Sesame Seed","50g"]],"s":"Clean and peel the potatoes and cut them into even size chunks. Boil them in salted water for about 10 min and then add the cleaned and chopped apples into the boiling water. Add the cinnamon stick as well. Leave to boil for another 10 minutes or until both apples and potatoes are to your liking. I like mine to be fairly chunky but that is a personal preference\r\nIn the mean time bake the streaky bacon in a dry frying pan until crispy and set aside to drain on paper towels.\r\nSlice a few apple pieces and melt a little butter in a fryin pan. Add the apple slices to it and add a bit of maple syrup into the pan as well as some cinnamon. Let it simmer until the apple is soft.\r\nPrepare a plate with one whisked egg and one plate with sesame seeds. Cut your cheese into the required size. The smaller it is, the easier it is too handle.\r\nDip the cheese into the egg and make sure it coats all sides. Then dip the cheese into the sesame seeds and make sure it is covered everywhere.\r\nHeat a non stick frying pan on high until nice and hot. Put the cheese slice in and bake until the sesame seeds are brown. You have to do this rather quickly or the cheese will melt completely. Turn and bake the other side.\r\nDrain the apples and potatoes and mash them together. Taste and add cinnamon and salt where needed. Remove the cinnamon stick before mashing","z":"将土豆洗净去皮，切成大小均匀的块。在盐水中煮约10分钟，然后将洗净切碎的苹果放入沸水中。也加入肉桂棒。再煮 10 分钟或直到苹果和土豆都符合您的口味。我喜欢我的比较粗，但这是个人喜好\r\n与此同时，将五花培根放入干煎锅中烘烤至酥脆，放在一边用纸巾沥干。\r\n将几片苹果切成片，在煎锅中融化少许黄油。将苹果片加入其中，然后在锅中加入一点枫糖浆和一些肉桂。让它煮至苹果变软。\r\n准备一盘，放一个打散的鸡蛋，一盘放芝麻。将奶酪切成所需的大小。它越小，就越容易处理。\r\n将奶酪浸入鸡蛋中，并确保其覆盖所有侧面。然后将奶酪浸入芝麻中，并确保芝麻遍布各处。\r\n将不粘煎锅高火加热直至变热。将奶酪片放入，烘烤至芝麻变成棕色。你必须很快地做到这一点，否则奶酪会完全融化。翻转并烘烤另一面。\r\n将苹果和土豆沥干，然后将它们捣碎在一起。品尝并根据需要添加肉桂和盐。捣碎前取出肉桂棒"},{"id":"53380","n":"Apple cake","a":"Netherlands","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/c0gmo31766594751.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vZy-7UyPdjM","i":[["Eggs","4"],["Sugar","200g"],["Self-raising Flour","200g"],["Melted Butter","200g"],["Vanilla Extract","1 tsp"],["Ground Cinnamon","1 tsp"],["Apples","3"],["Salt","Pinch"],["Ground Sugar","Sprinkling"]],"s":"Preheat the oven to 180°C. (350˚F) Grease a cake pan and line it with baking paper.\r\nIn a large bowl, break the four eggs with the sugar and beat until they have tripled in volume and become fluffy.\r\nSift the self-rising baking flour and add it to your egg mixture. Fold this over, preserving as much air as possible. Add the melted (and slightly cooled) butter and mix until combined.\r\nAdd cinnamon, pinch of salt and vanilla extract.\r\nAdd the diced apple to the batter and gently fold them into the batter so that the apple pieces are evenly distributed. You can roll the apple pieces through some more cinnamon.\r\nPour the batter into the prepared cake pan and smooth the top with a spatula.\r\nPlace the apple slices on top of the batter and press lightly. Sprinkle optionally with some almond shavings.\r\nBake the apple cake in the preheated oven for about 45-50 minutes, or until a wooden skewer comes out clean when inserted into the center of the cake.\r\nRemove the cake from the oven and let it cool in the mold for a few minutes. Then carefully remove the cake from the mold and let cool completely on a wire rack.\r\nSprinkle the cooled apple cake with powdered sugar","z":"将烤箱预热至 180°C。 (350°F) 在蛋糕盘上涂抹油脂并铺上烘焙纸。\r\n在一个大碗中，将四个鸡蛋与糖打碎，搅拌直至体积增加两倍并变得蓬松。\r\n筛入自发发酵面粉并将其添加到鸡蛋混合物中。将其折叠起来，保留尽可能多的空气。加入融化（并稍微冷却）的黄油，搅拌直至混合。\r\n加入肉桂、少许盐和香草精。\r\n将苹果丁加入面糊中，轻轻拌入面糊中，使苹果块均匀分布。你可以在苹果片上再撒上一些肉桂。\r\n将面糊倒入准备好的蛋糕盘中，用抹刀抹平顶部。\r\n将苹果片放在面糊上，轻轻按压。可选地撒上一些杏仁屑。\r\n将苹果蛋糕放入预热的烤箱中烘烤约 45-50 分钟，或直至将木串插入蛋糕中心，取出时干净为止。\r\n将蛋糕从烤箱中取出，在模具中冷却几分钟。然后小心地将蛋糕从模具中取出，放在金属架上完全冷却。\r\n在冷却的苹果蛋糕上撒上糖粉"},{"id":"52979","n":"Bitterballen (Dutch meatballs)","a":"Netherlands","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/lhqev81565090111.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=q8AKfYUtDuM","i":[["Butter","100g"],["Flour","150g"],["Beef Stock","700ml"],["Onion","30g"],["Parsley","1 tbs"],["Beef","400g"],["Salt","Pinch"],["Pepper","Pinch"],["Nutmeg","Pinch"],["Flour","50g"],["Eggs","2 Beaten"],["Breadcrumbs","50g"]],"s":"Melt the butter in a skillet or pan. When melted, add the flour little by little and stir into a thick paste. Slowly stir in the stock, making sure the roux absorbs the liquid. Simmer for a couple of minutes on a low heat while you stir in the onion, parsley and the shredded meat. The mixture should thicken and turn into a heavy, thick sauce.\r\n\r\nPour the mixture into a shallow container, cover and refrigerate for several hours, or until the sauce has solidified.\r\n\r\nTake a heaping tablespoon of the cold, thick sauce and quickly roll it into a small ball. Roll lightly through the flour, then the egg and finally the breadcrumbs. Make sure that the egg covers the whole surface of the bitterbal. When done, refrigerate the snacks while the oil in your fryer heats up to 190C (375F). Fry four bitterballen at a time, until golden.\r\n\r\nServe on a plate with a nice grainy or spicy mustard. \r\n","z":"在煎锅或平底锅中融化黄油。融化后，一点一点地加入面粉，搅拌成浓稠的糊状。慢慢搅拌高汤，确保面糊吸收液体。小火煮几分钟，同时拌入洋葱、欧芹和肉丝。混合物应该变稠并变成浓稠的酱汁。\r\n\r\n将混合物倒入浅容器中，盖上盖子并冷藏几个小时，或直到酱汁凝固。\r\n\r\n取一大汤匙冷浓酱汁，快速将其滚成一个小球。轻轻地滚动面粉，然后是鸡蛋，最后是面包屑。确保鸡蛋覆盖了苦味的整个表面。完成后，将零食冷藏，同时将炸锅中的油加热至 190C (375F)。一次煎四个苦瓜，直至金黄。\r\n\r\n与美味的粒状或辛辣芥末放在盘子上。"},{"id":"53385","n":"Boterkoek (Dutch Butter Cake)","a":"Netherlands","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/tkwxmv1777540463.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IwAfFVjPVl4","i":[["Butter","200g"],["Sugar","200g"],["All purpose flour","250g"],["Salt","1"],["Dulce de leche","200g"],["Dark Chocolate","75g"],["Egg","1 beaten"]],"s":"Preheat the oven to 180°C/350˚F (conventional oven).\r\n\r\nPlace the softened butter and sugar in the bowl of a stand mixer and whisk until creamy.\r\nAdd the flour and salt and knead by hand until you have a smooth dough. Divide into two pieces.\r\nLine the base of a square or round cake tin with baking parchment (not a springform tin) and place the first half of the pastry on top. Flatten with your fingers and a spoon.\r\nUsing a teaspoon, sprinkle dollops of dulce de leche over the base. Sprinkle with the chopped chocolate and cover with the second half of the pastry.\r\nThis is a bit trickier, but if you don’t get it right, don’t worry, it’ll be fine once it’s baked! Brush the pastry with the beaten egg.\r\nBake in the oven for about 30 minutes or until golden brown. It will be wobbly. That's because butter cake only firms up when it cools.\r\nCut into small pieces when it has cooled completely!\r\nNotes\r\nStoring: Store in an airtight container outside of the fridge for about 2-3 days or in the fridge for 5 days. Freeze for up to three months.","z":"将烤箱预热至 180°C/350°F（传统烤箱）。\r\n\r\n将软化的黄油和糖放入立式搅拌机的碗中，搅拌直至呈奶油状。\r\n加入面粉和盐，用手揉捏直至形成光滑的面团。分成两块。\r\n在方形或圆形蛋糕罐的底部铺上烘焙纸（不是弹簧罐），然后将糕点的前半部分放在上面。用手指和勺子压平。\r\n用茶匙将牛奶汁撒在底座上。撒上切碎的巧克力，然后盖上另一半糕点。\r\n这有点棘手，但如果你做得不对，别担心，一旦烤了就没事了！在糕点上刷上打好的鸡蛋。\r\n在烤箱中烘烤约 30 分钟或直至呈金黄色。它会摇摇欲坠。那是因为黄油蛋糕只有在冷却时才会变硬。\r\n完全冷却后切成小块！\r\n注释\r\n储存：密封容器中，在冰箱外可保存约2-3天，在冰箱中可保存5天。冷冻最多三个月。"},{"id":"53386","n":"Dutch Apple Pie","a":"Netherlands","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/zy4fs51777540384.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MgI-_e4R53Y","i":[["Butter","175g"],["Egg Yolks","2"],["Flour","300g"],["Sugar","200g"],["Salt","Pinch"],["Cinnamon","1"],["Raisins","100g"],["Apples","6"],["Cold Water","1 tablespoon"]],"s":"Add the flour, 150 gr of the sugar, pinch of salt and 1 egg yolk in the bowl of a food processor. Cut the butter into small cubes and add to the bowl. Turn this into a firm dough. Don't over process, you do not want the dough to turn warm. Check if it sticks by pinching it between your fingers.\r\nTurn out onto a piece of plastic wrap. Make a round ball of it by using your hands and roll it into the plastic. Place into the fridge for half an hour to cool.\r\nTake a round baking tin of 22 cm diameter and cover this with baking paper. Brush the sides with butter.\r\nPreheat the oven to 170˚C (340˚F)\r\nCut the apple into cubes and mix this with the raisins, the left over sugar and the cinnamon.\r\nPlace the cooled dough on a flat surface sprinkled with flour and roll out into a thin sheet. Place this into the baking tin and cover the bottom and the sides well. I usually just press it into the tin without rolling it out. I find that the easiest way but it is less smooth. Just do whatever works for you.\r\nMake sure you keep 1/4 of the dough separate to form the strips on the top.\r\n\r\nOnce the bottom and sides are covered with the dough, take the rusks and crumble them over the bottom. You can use breadcrumbs for this as well. Shake it a bit so it is divided equally across the bottom.\r\nAdd the apple mixture and divide well over the tin. Rol out the rest of the dough and cut into strips. Place that over the top of the pie in a diamond shaped pattern. Brush the strokes and sides with the other egg yolk and place in the preaheated oven.\r\nBake the apple pie for about 1 hour or until golden and cooked through. Leave to cool in the tin and make sure the sides are loose before opening the tin.","z":"将面粉、150 克糖、少许盐和 1 个蛋黄放入食品加工机的碗中。将黄油切成小块并放入碗中。把它变成坚硬的面团。不要过度加工，你不想让面团变热。用手指捏住它来检查它是否粘住。\r\n变成一块保鲜膜。用手将其制成圆球并将其滚入塑料中。放入冰箱冷藏半小时即可。\r\n取一个直径22厘米的圆形烤盘，盖上烤纸。在侧面刷上黄油。\r\n将烤箱预热至 170°C (340°F)\r\n将苹果切成方块，与葡萄干、剩下的糖和肉桂混合。\r\n将冷却的面团放在撒有面粉的平面上，然后擀成薄片。将其放入烤模中，并盖好底部和侧面。我通常只是将其压入罐中而不将其推出。我发现这是最简单的方法，但不太顺利。做任何对你有用的事情。\r\n确保将 1/4 的面团分开，以便在顶部形成条状。\r\n\r\n一旦底部和侧面都覆盖了面团，取出面包干并将其压碎在底部。您也可以使用面包屑来实现此目的。稍微摇晃一下，使其均匀地分布在底部。\r\n加入苹果混合物并在罐子上充分分开。将剩下的面团擀开并切成条。将其以菱形图案放在馅饼的顶部。在笔画和侧面刷上另一个蛋黄，然后放入预热的烤箱中。\r\n将苹果派烘烤约 1 小时或直至呈金黄色并煮熟。在罐子中冷却，并在打开罐子之前确保侧面松动。"},{"id":"53387","n":"Dutch Spiced Breakfast Cake (Ontbijtkoek)","a":"Netherlands","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/uwq8001777540502.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/3NIRQ3KMorw","i":[["Self-raising Flour","250g"],["Dark Brown Soft Sugar","250g"],["Milk","250g"],["Sugar","4"],["Ginger","1 tablespoon"],["Cardamom","1/2 tsp"],["Baking Powder","1 tsp"],["Salt","Pinch"]],"s":"Preheat the oven to 160˚C (320˚F) Line a cake pan with parchment paper and set aside.\r\n\r\nMix all the dry ingredients together in a large bowl. Place the milk in a small saucepan and heat it until it is almost boiling but not quite.\r\nPour the milk slowly into the dry ingredients while whisking. Don't overmix! As soon as it is combined to a smooth batter you pour it into the cake pan. Sprinkle the pearl sugar over the top and bake it in the oven for about 1 hour.\r\nCheck after about 50 minutes how the cake is progressing. If a cake tester comes out clean the cake it cooked. If not let it cook for a little longer.","z":"将烤箱预热至 160°C (320°F)，在蛋糕盘上铺上羊皮纸并放在一边。\r\n\r\n将所有干成分混合在一个大碗中。将牛奶放入小平底锅中，加热至几乎沸腾但尚未完全沸腾。\r\n将牛奶慢慢倒入干原料中，同时搅拌。不要过度混合！一旦混合成光滑的面糊，就将其倒入蛋糕盘中。将珍珠糖撒在上面，然后放入烤箱烘烤约1小时。\r\n大约 50 分钟后检查蛋糕的进展情况。如果蛋糕测试员出来时，它煮熟的蛋糕是干净的。如果没有就让它煮久一点。"},{"id":"53379","n":"Dutch poffertjes (mini pancakes)","a":"Netherlands","c":"Breakfast","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/oaqz9f1766593912.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gK1b5gymAUY","i":[["Flour","125g"],["Buckwheat Flour","125g"],["Eggs","2"],["Butter","1 knob"],["Milk","300ml"],["Yeast","10g"],["vanilla sugar","1tsp"],["Butter","To serve"],["Icing Sugar","To serve"]],"s":"Mix the dry yeast with some of the luke warm milk en stir until dissolved.\r\nPlace buckwheat and the flour together in a bowl and make a small circle in the middle. Add the yeast mixture into it. Add the milk and stir until you have a smooth batter.\r\nAdd the eggs, salt and vanille sugar and stir through. Leave to stand and rise for about 45 minutes.\r\nHeat the poffertjespan and add a bit of butter into each hole. Fill halfway with batter and first bake one side until you can see the top dry out a little. Turn the poffertjes around with a small fork and bake the other side until cooked and golden brown.\r\nServe the poffertjes with butter and icing sugar","z":"将干酵母与一些温牛奶混合，搅拌直至溶解。\r\n将荞麦和面粉一起放入碗中，并在中间画一个小圆圈。将酵母混合物加入其中。加入牛奶并搅拌直至形成光滑的面糊。\r\n加入鸡蛋、盐和香草糖，搅拌均匀。静置并醒发约 45 分钟。\r\n加热 poffertjespan 并在每个孔中加入一点黄油。将面糊填满一半，然后先烘烤一侧，直到看到顶部稍微变干。用小叉子将 poffertjes 翻过来，将另一面烘烤至煮熟并呈金黄色。\r\n将 poffertjes 与黄油和糖粉一起食用"},{"id":"53382","n":"Dutch stroopwafel","a":"Netherlands","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/8cvkcz1766596315.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3zCrERE0kbc","i":[["Milk","15 ml"],["Instant Yeast","10g"],["All purpose flour","250g"],["Unsalted Butter","120g"],["Sugar","80g"],["Egg","1"],["Salt","Pinch"],["Dutch Stroop","200g"],["Brown Sugar","120g"],["Unsalted Butter","80g"],["Cinnamon","1 tsp"]],"s":"Combine milk and yeast in a bowl. Let stand for a moment to allow the yeast to dissolve.\r\nIn another bowl, combine flour, butter, sugar, egg, and salt. Pour in the yeast mixture and knead until smooth. Cover the bowl and let the dough rise for one hour.\r\nWhen the dough is almost ready, make the stroop filling. Combine all the ingredients in a saucepan and stir until the butter is melted and the sugar is dissolved. Let it simmer for a while. The stroop will continue to thicken as it cools.\r\nShape the dough into balls weighing about 35 grams each. Make a total of 14. Turn your stroopwafel iron on the highest setting.\r\nPlace a ball of dough in the iron and close the iron. Don’t flatten the waffle too much; you should still be able to cut through it. Bake for 1-2 minutes until the waffle is nicely golden brown.\r\nWhen the waffle is done, work quickly. Remove the waffle from the iron and immediately use a round cutter to cut out a nice circle of about 8 to 9 cm (3 to 3.5 inches).\r\nPlace the hot waffle on a cutting board and cut horizontally with a sharp knife. The stroopwafel is very hot, so use an oven mitt to hold it in place.\r\nTake half a waffle and spread the (hot!) stroop on it. Place the other half on top, pressing gently if necessary, and place the waffle on a wire rack to cool. Repeat for all the balls.","z":"将牛奶和酵母放入碗中混合。静置片刻，让酵母溶解。\r\n在另一个碗中，混合面粉、黄油、糖、鸡蛋和盐。倒入酵母混合物，揉至光滑。盖上碗，让面团发酵一小时。\r\n当面团快准备好时，制作斯特罗馅料。将所有成分放入平底锅中，搅拌直至黄油融化，糖溶解。让它煮一会儿。当它冷却时，斯特罗会继续变厚。\r\n将面团揉成每个重约35克的球。总共制作 14 个。将 stroopwafel 熨斗调至最高设置。\r\n将一团面团放入熨斗中，然后关闭熨斗。不要把华夫饼压得太平；你应该仍然能够穿过它。烘烤 1-2 分钟，直至华夫饼呈金黄色。\r\n华夫饼做好后，就快点干吧。将华夫饼从熨斗中取出，立即使用圆刀切出约 8 至 9 厘米（3 至 3.5 英寸）的漂亮圆圈。\r\n将热华夫饼放在切菜板上，用锋利的刀水平切割。 Stroopwafel 非常热，因此请使用烤箱手套将其固定到位。\r\n取半个华夫饼，将（热的！）斯特鲁铺在上面。将另一半放在上面，必要时轻轻按压，然后将华夫饼放在金属架上冷却。对所有球重复上述步骤。"},{"id":"53381","n":"Gevulde speculaas","a":"Netherlands","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/rw64di1766595573.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1BYSZIkLOHc","i":[["Self-raising Flour","300g"],["Brown Sugar","150g"],["Speculaas Spice Mix","10g"],["Salt","Pinch"],["Butter","125g"],["Milk","10 tblsp"],["Almond Paste","300g"],["Egg","1"],["Milk","For brushing"],["Almonds","Garnish"]],"s":"Mix the self-rising flour, sugar, speculaas spice mix and salt. Add the butter and milk and knead into a firm ball of dough. Start with 6 tablespoons of milk, if the dough is too stiff you can add more milk.\r\nWrap the dough in plastic wrap and refrigerate overnight. You can process and bake it immediately, but the flavor will be much better if you let it rest.\r\nMix the almond paste with half of the beaten egg and knead well. This makes it easier to work with and gives it a better and tastier texture.\r\nTake half of the dough and roll it out to 20 x 20 cm. Place in a baking pan lined with parchment paper. Spread the almond paste mixture evenly. Roll out the remaining dough and place on top of the almond paste.\r\nBrush the top with the remaining beaten egg. Garnish with almonds and top with another layer of egg wash.\r\nBake the filled speculaas for 40 minutes at 180°C/350℉ (conventional oven) or until done.","z":"将自发面粉、糖、窥镜香料混合物和盐混合。加入黄油和牛奶，揉成坚硬的面团。从6汤匙牛奶开始，如果面团太硬可以添加更多牛奶。\r\n用保鲜膜包裹面团并冷藏过夜。您可以立即加工并烘烤，但如果放置一段时间，味道会更好。\r\n将杏仁糊与一半打散的鸡蛋混合并揉匀。这使得它更容易加工，并赋予它更好、更美味的质地。\r\n取一半面团，擀成 20 x 20 厘米。放入衬有羊皮纸的烤盘中。将杏仁糊混合物均匀涂抹。将剩余的面团擀开，放在杏仁酱上。\r\n在顶部刷上剩余的打好的鸡蛋。用杏仁装饰，并在上面再涂一层蛋液。\r\n将填充好的窥镜在 180°C/350°F（传统烤箱）下烘烤 40 分钟或直至完成。"},{"id":"52769","n":"Kapsalon","a":"Netherlands","c":"Lamb","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/sxysrt1468240488.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UIcuiU1kV8I","i":[["Fries","250 Grams"],["Doner Meat","500 Grams"],["Garlic sauce","Topping"],["Hotsauce","Topping"],["Lettuce","1 Bulb"],["Tomato","1"],["Cucumber","3rd"],["Gouda cheese","100 Grams"]],"s":"Cut the meat into strips. Heat oil in a pan and fry the strips for 6 minutes until it's ready.\r\nBake the fries until golden brown in a deep fryrer. When ready transfer to a backing dish. Make sure the fries are spread over the whole dish.\r\nCover the fries with a new layer of meat and spread evenly.\r\nAdd a layer of cheese over the meat. You can also use grated cheese. When done put in the oven for a few minutes until the cheese is melted.\r\nChop the lettuce, tomato and cucumber in small pieces and mix together. for a basic salad. As extra you can add olives jalapenos and a red union.\r\nDived the salad over the dish and Serve with garlicsauce and hot sauce","z":"将肉切成条。在锅中加热油，将条煎 6 分钟直至熟。\r\n在油炸锅中将薯条烘烤至金黄色。准备好后转移到支撑盘上。确保薯条铺满整道菜。\r\n在薯条上覆盖一层新的肉并均匀地铺开。\r\n在肉上加一层奶酪。您也可以使用磨碎的奶酪。完成后放入烤箱几分钟直至奶酪融化。\r\n将生菜、番茄和黄瓜切成小块并混合在一起。一份基本的沙拉。作为额外的，您可以添加橄榄墨西哥胡椒和红联盟。\r\n将沙拉铺在盘子上，搭配蒜蓉酱和辣酱食用"},{"id":"53388","n":"Runner Bean Mash (Snijbonen Stamppot)","a":"Netherlands","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/urq5w21777540535.jpg","y":"","i":[["Runner Beans","400g"],["Garlic","1 clove"],["Onion","1 chopped"],["Potatoes","800g"],["Butter","25g"],["Mustard","1 tablespoon"],["Milk","1 dash"],["Cheese","100g"],["Bacon","75g"],["Salt","Pinch"]],"s":"Wash and chop the runner beans. Place in a saucepan with salted water and bring to a boil.\r\nCook the beans for about 10 minutes or until al dente. Drain and set aside.\r\nMeanwhile, add the potatoes and cook until tender.\r\nHeat a small skillet with a little butter and sauté the onion until translucent. Add the garlic and cook briefly. Add the runner beans to the pan and stir-fry for a few minutes.\r\nMeanwhile, mash the potatoes with a masher. Add a knob of butter and a splash of milk. Add the bean mixture and grated cheese. Season with salt, pepper and mustard.\r\nFry the bacon and serve with the bean mash.","z":"将红花菜豆洗净并切碎。放入装有盐水的平底锅中，煮沸。\r\n将豆子煮约 10 分钟或直至变硬。沥干并放在一边。\r\n同时，加入土豆煮至变软。\r\n用少许黄油加热小煎锅，将洋葱炒至半透明。加入大蒜并稍微煮一下。将红花菜豆放入锅中，炒几分钟。\r\n同时，用捣碎器将土豆捣碎。添加一小块黄油和少许牛奶。加入豆类混合物和磨碎的奶酪。用盐、胡椒和芥末调味。\r\n煎培根并与豆泥一起食用。"},{"id":"52981","n":"Snert (Dutch Split Pea Soup)","a":"Netherlands","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/9ptx0a1565090843.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5YV0sJLtLt8","i":[["Water","2L"],["Peas","300g"],["Pork","100g"],["Vegetable Stock Cube","1"],["Celery","2"],["Carrots","2"],["Potatoes","1 large"],["Onion","1 small"],["Leek","1 small"],["Celeriac","1 cup"],["Sausages","1 pound"]],"s":"Gather the ingredients.\r\n\r\nIn a large soup pot, bring water, split peas, pork belly or bacon, pork chop, and bouillon cube to a boil. Reduce the heat to a simmer, cover and let cook for 45 minutes, stirring occasionally and skimming off any foam that rises to the top. \r\n\r\nRemove the pork chop, debone, and thinly slice the meat. Set aside.\r\n\r\nAdd the celery, carrots, potato, onion, leek, and celeriac to the soup. Return to the boil, reduce the heat to a simmer and let cook, uncovered, for another 30 minutes, adding a little extra water if the ingredients start to stick to the bottom of the pot.\r\n\r\nAdd the smoked sausage for the last 15 minutes of cooking time. When the vegetables are tender, remove the bacon and smoked sausage, slice thinly and set aside.\r\n\r\nIf you prefer a smooth consistency, purée the soup with a stick blender. Season to taste with salt and pepper. Add the meat back to the soup, setting some slices of rookworst aside.\r\n\r\nServe in heated bowls or soup plates, garnished with slices of rookworst and chopped celery leaf.\r\n\r\nEnjoy!","z":"收集原料。\r\n\r\n在一个大汤锅中，将水、豌豆、五花肉或培根、猪排和肉汤块煮沸。将火调至小火，盖上锅盖煮 45 分钟，偶尔搅拌并撇去浮在顶部的泡沫。 \r\n\r\n取出猪排，去骨，然后将肉切成薄片。放在一边。\r\n\r\n将芹菜、胡萝卜、土豆、洋葱、韭菜和块根芹加入汤中。再次煮沸，将火调至小火，不盖锅盖再煮 30 分钟，如果原料开始粘在锅底，则再加一点水。\r\n\r\n在烹饪的最后 15 分钟加入熏香肠。当蔬菜变软时，取出培根和熏香肠，切成薄片备用。\r\n\r\n如果您喜欢光滑的稠度，请用棒式搅拌机将汤打成泥。用盐和胡椒调味。将肉放回汤中，将一些最烂的肉片放在一边。\r\n\r\n盛入加热的碗或汤盘中，饰以罗克沃斯特片和切碎的芹菜叶。\r\n\r\n享受！"},{"id":"52980","n":"Stamppot","a":"Netherlands","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/hyarod1565090529.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hTrSXryX31A","i":[["Potatoes","1.5kg"],["Bay Leaf","2 leaves"],["Shallots","2"],["Butter","3 tbs"],["Kale","750g"],["Sausages","2"],["Milk","500ml"],["Nutmeg","Grated"],["Salt","Pinch"],["Pepper","Pinch"]],"s":"\r\nWash and peel the potatoes and cut into similarly sized pieces for even cooking.\r\n\r\nIn a large soup pot, boil the potatoes and the bay leaves in salted water for 20 minutes. Discard the bay leaves.\r\n\r\nIf you're not using a bag of ready-cut curly kale, wash the bunches thoroughly under cool running water to get rid of all soil—you wouldn't want that gritty texture in your finished dish. Trim any coarse stems and discard any brown leaves. With a sharp knife, cut the curly kale into thin strips.\r\n\r\nPeel and chop the shallots.\r\n\r\nIn a frying pan or skillet, melt 1 tbsp. of butter and saute the shallots for a few minutes before adding the curly kale and 2 tbsp. of water. Season and cook for about 10 minutes, or until tender.\r\n\r\nWarm the milk on the stove or in the microwave.\r\n\r\nDrain, shake and dry the potatoes with kitchen towels before mashing with a potato masher or ricer. Working quickly, add the warm milk and the remaining butter. Season to taste with nutmeg, salt, and pepper. \r\n\r\nMix the cooked curly kale through the cooked mashed potato mixture.\r\n\r\nTop with slices of the smoked sausage and serve hot with your favorite mustard or gravy.\r\n\r\nServe and enjoy!","z":"将土豆洗净并去皮，切成相似大小的块，以便均匀烹饪。\r\n\r\n在一个大汤锅中，将土豆和月桂叶放入盐水中煮 20 分钟。丢弃月桂叶。\r\n\r\n如果您不使用一袋现切的卷羽衣甘蓝，请在凉爽的自来水下彻底清洗羽衣甘蓝，以除去所有土壤 - 您不会希望成品菜中有那种坚韧的质地。修剪任何粗茎并丢弃任何棕色叶子。用锋利的刀将羽衣甘蓝切成细条。\r\n\r\n将青葱去皮并切碎。\r\n\r\n在煎锅或煎锅中，融化 1 汤匙。黄油，将青葱炒几分钟，然后加入羽衣甘蓝和 2 汤匙。水。调味并煮约 10 分钟，或直至变软。\r\n\r\n在炉子或微波炉中加热牛奶。\r\n\r\n将土豆沥干、摇匀并用厨房毛巾擦干，然后用土豆捣碎机或碾米机捣碎。快速操作，加入温牛奶和剩余的黄油。用肉豆蔻、盐和胡椒调味。 \r\n\r\n将煮熟的羽衣甘蓝与煮熟的土豆泥混合物混合。\r\n\r\n上面放上几片熏香肠，搭配您最喜欢的芥末或肉汁趁热享用。\r\n\r\n服务并享受！"},{"id":"53127","n":"Authentic Norwegian Kransekake","a":"Norway","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/yk78uc1763075719.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fE85ioKQ7ew","i":[["Almonds","3 Cups"],["Egg White","4"],["Powdered Sugar","4 cups"],["Powdered Sugar","2 cups"],["Egg White","1"],["Lemon Juice","1/2 teaspoon"]],"s":"Grind almonds in an almond grinder or food processor.\r\n▢\r\nMix almonds and powdered sugar together in a large mixing bowl. Add three of the egg whites and knead the dough together with your hands until it comes together in a ball. Wrap in cling film and leave in the fridge for at least an hour, preferably until the next day.\r\n▢\r\nGrease the kransekake forms thoroughly and coat with semolina, flour, or bread crumbs.\r\n▢\r\nPreheat oven to 210°C (410°F) top and bottom heat. Divide the dough into six sections.\r\n▢\r\nSlowly add the remaining egg white to the dough and knead it until you can roll it into long sausages about as thick as your index finger. Fill the forms with the dough sausages, pinching the ends together to make rings.\r\n▢\r\nSet the forms on a baking sheet and back in the middle of the oven for about 10 – 12 minutes, until the tops are golden brown.","z":"在杏仁研磨机或食品加工机中研磨杏仁。\r\n▢\r\n将杏仁和糖粉放入一个大搅拌碗中混合。加入三个蛋白，用手将面团揉捏在一起，直到形成一个球。用保鲜膜包起来，放在冰箱里至少一个小时，最好等到第二天。\r\n▢\r\n彻底润滑 kransekake 形状，并涂上粗面粉、面粉或面包屑。\r\n▢\r\n将烤箱预热至 210°C (410°F)，顶部和底部加热。将面团分成六部分。\r\n▢\r\n将剩余的蛋清慢慢加入面团中，揉捏至可以擀成食指粗的长香肠。用面团香肠填充模具，将两端捏在一起形成环。\r\n▢\r\n将模具放在烤盘上，然后放回烤箱中间约 10 - 12 分钟，直至顶部呈金黄色。"},{"id":"53126","n":"Brun Lapskaus (Norwegian Beef Vegetable Stew)","a":"Norway","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/6vi2cv1763075785.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VuLnP0Yu84o","i":[["Olive Oil","2 tblsp"],["Beef","2 Lbs"],["Onion","1"],["Beef Stock","3 Cups"],["Swede","1 small"],["Celery","1"],["Carrots","4"],["Parsley","4"],["Potatoes","1 lb"],["Leek","1/2"],["Parsley","Garnish"]],"s":"▢\r\nHeat olive oil in a large pot. Cut beef into 1 inch (2.5 cm) cubes and brown in oil.\r\n▢\r\nDice the onion and add to browning beef. Add the stock and bring to a boil, then lower the heat, cover, and let simmer for about 30 minutes.\r\n▢\r\nPeel and cut the rutabaga and celery root into 1 inch (2.5 cm) cubes. Add to the pot, cover, and continue simmering for another 30 minutes.\r\n▢\r\nPeel and chop the rest of the vegetables into 1 inch (2.5 cm) cubes and add to the pot. Slice the leek into rings. Cover and continue simmering for about 20 minutes. Stir as little as possible.\r\n▢\r\nTop with fresh parsley.","z":"▢\r\n在一个大锅中加热橄榄油。将牛肉切成 1 英寸（2.5 厘米）的方块，并在油中煎至棕色。\r\n▢\r\n将洋葱切成丁，加入到褐变的牛肉中。加入高汤，煮沸，然后调小火，盖上锅盖，小火煮约 30 分钟。\r\n▢\r\n将芜菁甘蓝和芹菜根去皮并切成 1 英寸（2.5 厘米）的方块。加入锅中，盖上盖子，继续煮 30 分钟。\r\n▢\r\n将其余蔬菜去皮并切成 1 英寸（2.5 厘米）的方块，然后放入锅中。将韭葱切成圈。盖上盖子，继续煮约20分钟。尽可能少地搅拌。\r\n▢\r\n上面撒上新鲜欧芹。"},{"id":"53116","n":"Cinnamon buns","a":"Norway","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/as88dq1762772486.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wNiyp89pTi0","i":[["Unsalted Butter","100g"],["Milk","200ml"],["Salt","1 teaspoon"],["Flour","250g"],["Strong White Flour","250g"],["Fast action yeast","1 1/2 tsp"],["Cardamom","1 teaspoon"],["Caster Sugar","1 tblsp"],["Egg","2"],["Olive Oil","Dash"],["Unsalted Butter","75g"],["Caster Sugar","100g"],["Cinnamon","2 tbsp"],["Egg","1"]],"s":"In a small saucepan heat the butter, milk and salt until the butter is melted. Allow the mixture to cool until it is lukewarm.\r\n\r\nIn a large bowl, stir together the flours, yeast, cardamom and sugar until combined.\r\n\r\nMake a well in the centre and crack in the eggs. Pour in the lukewarm milk mixture and stir everything together to form a sticky dough. You may have to use your hands as the dough becomes stiffer.\r\n\r\nOil the work surface with a teaspoon of olive oil. Turn the dough out onto the oiled surface and knead vigorously for 5–8 minutes, using a plastic scraper as needed to prise the dough from the work surface. Don’t be tempted to add flour, as this will make the buns dry and tough. Keep kneading until the dough is considerably less sticky, smoother and more elastic.\r\n\r\nShape into a ball, and put into a large, greased bowl. Cover the bowl with a clean tea towel and set aside in a warm place to prove for an hour, or until doubled in size.\r\n\r\nMeanwhile, for the filling and topping, mix the softened butter in a bowl with half the sugar and 1 tablespoon cinnamon. Use a fork to mix the sugar and spice into the butter until it is completely combined.\r\n\r\nMix the remaining sugar and cinnamon in a separate bowl and set aside.\r\n\r\nWhen the dough has risen, turn out onto a floured work surface and gently roll out into a 36x24cm/14x9½in rectangle. Spread the cinnamon-sugar-butter evenly over the dough with a table or palette knife.\r\n\r\nWith the longest edge closest to you, roll the dough up into a cylinder. Cut into 12 even slices.\r\n\r\nPlace each slice onto a flattened out paper cupcake case on a baking tray, or into a greased muffin tin. (Baking in a muffin tin will make your cinnamon buns taller and domed.)\r\n\r\nCover with a clean tea towel and set aside to prove again for 30–45 minutes, or until risen.\r\n\r\nPreheat the oven to 200C/180C Fan/Gas 6.\r\n\r\nBrush the tops of the buns with beaten egg and dust liberally with the cinnamon sugar. Bake for 12 minutes until the buns are dark golden-brown. Enjoy warm with a cup of coffee.","z":"在小平底锅中加热黄油、牛奶和盐，直至黄油融化。让混合物冷却直至微温。\r\n\r\n在一个大碗中，将面粉、酵母、豆蔻和糖搅拌直至混合。\r\n\r\n在中心挖一个洞，打入鸡蛋。倒入温热的牛奶混合物，将所有东西搅拌在一起，形成粘稠的面团。当面团变硬时，您可能必须用手。\r\n\r\n用一茶匙橄榄油在工作表面上油。将面团翻到涂了油的表面上，用力揉捏 5-8 分钟，根据需要使用塑料刮刀将面团从工作表面撬开。不要试图添加面粉，因为这会使面包变得又干又硬。继续揉捏，直到面团明显不那么粘、更光滑、更有弹性。\r\n\r\n形成一个球，然后放入一个涂有油脂的大碗中。用干净的茶巾盖住碗，放在温暖的地方发酵一个小时，或直到体积增加一倍。\r\n\r\n与此同时，对于馅料和浇头，将软化的黄油与一半的糖和一汤匙肉桂混合在碗中。用叉子将糖和香料混合到黄油中，直至完全混合。\r\n\r\n将剩余的糖和肉桂混合在另一个碗中并放在一边。\r\n\r\n面团发酵后，将其放在撒有面粉的工作台上，轻轻擀成 36x24 厘米/14x9½ 英寸的矩形。用餐刀或调色刀将肉桂糖黄油均匀地涂抹在面团上。\r\n\r\n将最长的边靠近您，将面团卷成圆柱体。切成均匀的12片。\r\n\r\n将每片蛋糕放在烤盘上压平的纸杯蛋糕盒上，或放入涂有油脂的松饼罐中。 （在松饼罐中烘烤会让你的肉桂面包更高、呈圆顶状。）\r\n\r\n用干净的茶巾盖住，放在一边再次发酵 30-45 分钟，或直至发酵。\r\n\r\n将烤箱预热至 200C/180C 风扇/燃气 6.\r\n\r\n在面包顶部刷上打散的鸡蛋，并撒上肉桂糖。烘烤 12 分钟，直至面包呈深金棕色。配上一杯咖啡，享受温暖。"},{"id":"53122","n":"Fiskesuppe (Creamy Norwegian Fish Soup)","a":"Norway","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/raqjbj1762773035.jpg","y":"https://www.bing.com/videos/riverview/relatedvideo?&q=Fiskesuppe+(Creamy+Norwegian+Fish+Soup)+youtube&qpvt=Fiskesuppe+(Creamy+Norwegian+Fish+Soup)+youtube&mid=BA1D06D0C6BB703F9960BA1D06D0C6BB703F9960&&mcid=1B82C46C54684D60AEB9F663316D725F&FORM=VRDGAR","i":[["Fish fillet","1 lb"],["Garlic","1 clove"],["Potatoes","2 medium"],["Carrots","2"],["Leek","1"],["Butter","3  tablespoons"],["Flour","5 tablespoons"],["Fish Stock","4 cups"],["Milk","1 cup"],["Creme Fraiche","1 1/4 cup"],["Shrimp","1 cup"],["Chives","1 tablespoon"]],"s":"▢\r\nCut the fish fillets in cubes or strips. Crush or chop the garlic. Rinse the vegetables and cut into thin strips.\r\n▢\r\nHeat the butter in a pot and add the garlic. Once the garlic starts to turn golden add the flour, whisking well.\r\n▢\r\nAdd the fish stock and continue to whisk until there are no lumps.\r\n▢\r\nAdd the vegetables and milk and bring to a boil. Cook for about 10 minutes.\r\n▢\r\nAdd the crème fraîche (or sour cream). Bring the soup back to a simmer and once the soup begins to bubble again turn off the heat. Keep the soup on the burner and add the fish. Let the fish cook in the hot soup for 5 minutes. If using shrimp, add right before serving.\r\n▢\r\nSprinkle with chives (or dill or parsley) before serving.","z":"▢\r\n将鱼片切成方块或条。压碎或切碎大蒜。将蔬菜冲洗干净，切成细条。\r\n▢\r\n在锅中加热黄油并加入大蒜。一旦大蒜开始变成金黄色，加入面粉，搅拌均匀。\r\n▢\r\n加入鱼汤，继续搅拌直至没有结块。\r\n▢\r\n加入蔬菜和牛奶，煮沸。煮约10分钟。\r\n▢\r\n添加法式酸奶油（或酸奶油）。把汤重新煮沸，一旦汤再次开始冒泡，就关掉火。将汤放在炉子上，然后加入鱼。让鱼在热汤中煮5分钟。如果使用虾，请在食用前添加。\r\n▢\r\n食用前撒上香葱（或莳萝或欧芹）。"},{"id":"53131","n":"Fyrstekake – Norwegian Prince Cake","a":"Norway","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/9zqrod1763075574.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MBh7sQcdzwo","i":[["Granulated Sugar","3/4 cup"],["Vanilla Extract","1 teaspoon"],["Butter","2/3 Cup"],["Egg Yolks","4"],["Flour","2 cups"],["Baking Powder","1 teaspoon"],["Almonds","1 1/2 cups"],["Brown Sugar","3/4 cup"],["Melted Butter","2 tbsp"],["Egg","2 medium"],["Brandy","2 tablespoons"],["Almond Extract","5 drops"],["Egg","1"]],"s":"Crust\r\n▢\r\nMix together sugar, vanilla and butter until light and fluffy. Mix in the egg yolks. Add in the flour and baking powder and knead with hands until the dough is smooth.\r\n▢\r\nPack the dough in plastic wrap and chill in refrigerator for at least 30 minutes.\r\n\r\nAlmond filling\r\n▢\r\nRun the almonds and sugar together in a food processor until the almonds are finely ground (you can decide for yourself how coarse or fine you want them).\r\n▢\r\nStir in the butter, egg, cognac and/or almond extract (if using).\r\nAssembly\r\n▢\r\nLine the bottom of your cake form with baking paper and grease the sides of the form.\r\n▢\r\nPreheat oven to 350°F (175°C).\r\n▢\r\nCut 2/3 of the crust dough into slices and press down into the cake form. Cover the bottom of the cake form with the dough and bring the dough 2-3 cm (1 inch) up the sides of the form, pressing until even.\r\n▢\r\nScoop the almond filling on top of the crust, spreading it evenly across the cake form.\r\n▢\r\nRoll out of the rest of the dough and slice into long strips. Lay the strips of dough across the cake in a grid. Don't worry of the strips break – simply press them back together on the cake.\r\n▢\r\nGently brush the dough with egg wash.\r\n▢\r\nBake for about 45 minutes. The top of the cake should be golden brown while the almond filling will remain soft.","z":"地壳\r\n▢\r\n将糖、香草精和黄油混合在一起，直至变得松软。拌入蛋黄。加入面粉和泡打粉，用手揉捏至面团光滑。\r\n▢\r\n将面团用保鲜膜包起来，放入冰箱冷藏至少 30 分钟。\r\n\r\n杏仁馅\r\n▢\r\n将杏仁和糖一起放入食品加工机中，直到杏仁磨得很细（您可以自己决定想要多粗或多细）。\r\n▢\r\n加入黄油、鸡蛋、白兰地和/或杏仁提取物（如果使用）。\r\n组装\r\n▢\r\n在蛋糕模的底部铺上烘焙纸，并在蛋糕模的两侧涂上油脂。\r\n▢\r\n将烤箱预热至 350°F (175°C)。\r\n▢\r\n将2/3的饼皮切成片，压入蛋糕形状。用面团覆盖蛋糕模的底部，并将面团从蛋糕模的两侧向上拉 2-3 厘米（1 英寸），压至均匀。\r\n▢\r\n将杏仁馅舀到饼皮上，将其均匀地铺在蛋糕上。\r\n▢\r\n将剩下的面团擀开，切成长条。将面团条放在蛋糕上，形成网格。不用担心条带断裂——只需将它们按回到蛋糕上即可。\r\n▢\r\n轻轻地在面团上刷上蛋液。\r\n▢\r\n烘烤约 45 分钟。蛋糕的顶部应呈金黄色，而杏仁馅料将保持柔软。"},{"id":"53123","n":"Fårikål (Norwegian National Dish)","a":"Norway","c":"Lamb","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/ttfxxn1762773067.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/2mMT71Knp8E","i":[["Lamb","3 Lbs"],["White Cabbage","1 head"],["Whole black peppercorns","3  tablespoons"],["Salt","3 tsp"],["Water","1 1/2 cups"],["Flour","5 tablespoons"]],"s":"▢\r\nCut the lamb into large pieces.\r\n▢\r\nSlice the cabbage into large wedges, keeping the core attached.\r\n▢\r\nAdd a layer of lamb pieces to the bottom of a large pot, fatty side down. Sprinkle with peppercorns and salt. Add a layer of cabbage wedges on top. Repeat with more layers of lamb, peppercorns, and cabbage, ending with cabbage on top.\r\n▢\r\nOptional: Sprinkle a couple of tablespoons on top of the lamb for a thicker stew.\r\n▢\r\nAdd water to the pot and bring to a boil. Cover and reduce heat. Cook on low heat for 2 – 3 hours, until the lamb gently falls away from the bone.\r\n▢\r\nServe with boiled potatoes and fresh parsley, covering generously with the fårikål broth.","z":"▢\r\n将羊肉切成大块。\r\n▢\r\n将卷心菜切成大楔形，保持核心相连。\r\n▢\r\n在大锅的底部放一层羊肉片，肥肉的一面朝下。撒上胡椒粒和盐。在上面加一层卷心菜角。重复铺上更多层羊肉、花椒和卷心菜，最后在上面放上卷心菜。\r\n▢\r\n可选：在羊肉上撒几汤匙，以获得更浓的炖菜。\r\n▢\r\n将水加入锅中并煮沸。盖上盖子并减少热量。小火煮2-3小时，直到羊肉轻轻地从骨头上脱落。\r\n▢\r\n与煮土豆和新鲜欧芹一起食用，并涂上大量的 fårikål 肉汤。"},{"id":"53125","n":"Karbonader (Lean Beef Patties) with Caramelized Onions","a":"Norway","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/0bpjb11763075817.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HDWgGMJqvgw","i":[["Onion","2"],["Butter","1 tablespoon"],["Ground Beef","1 lb"],["Salt","1/2 teaspoon"],["Pepper","1/2 teaspoon"],["Nutmeg","1/2 teaspoon"],["Cornstarch","1/2 tbs"],["Water","50 ml"],["Butter","2 tblsp"]],"s":"Grate half an onion and set aside. Slice the rest of the onions and fry in butter on low/medium heat until caramelized.\r\n▢\r\nIn a bowl, mix together ground beef, grated onion, salt, pepper, nutmeg, potato/corn starch, and water.\r\n▢\r\nForm into a sausage and cut 6 patties. Using a knife make a light grid pattern in each patty.\r\n▢\r\nBrown both sides of the karbonader in butter on high heat, then turn down to low heat and fry for another 2 – 3 minutes.\r\n▢\r\nServe the karbonader and onions with potatoes, stewed peas, and brown sauce for dinner, or on a slice of bread for lunch or a snack.","z":"将半个洋葱磨碎，放在一边。将剩下的洋葱切片，用低/中火在黄油中煎至焦糖化。\r\n▢\r\n在一个碗中，将碎牛肉、磨碎的洋葱、盐、胡椒、肉豆蔻、土豆/玉米淀粉和水混合在一起。\r\n▢\r\n形成香肠并切成6块肉饼。用刀在每个肉饼上制作一个网格图案。\r\n▢\r\n用黄油将碳烤鱼的两面煎至棕色，然后转小火，再煎 2 - 3 分钟。\r\n▢\r\n晚餐将卡波纳德和洋葱与土豆、炖豌豆和棕色酱汁一起食用，或者将其放在一片面包上作为午餐或小吃。"},{"id":"53128","n":"Kvæfjord Cake “Verdens Beste” (World’s Best Cake)","a":"Norway","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/gdn1ot1763075684.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FjQRhFS3aZU","i":[["Egg Yolks","2 large"],["Cornstarch","2 tblsp"],["Granulated Sugar","1/4 cup"],["Heavy Cream","2/3 Cup"],["Milk","3/4 cup"],["vanilla pod","1"],["Butter","2/3 Cup"],["Granulated Sugar","3/4 cup"],["Egg Yolks","5 Large"],["Flour","1 1/4 cup"],["Baking Powder","1.5 tsp"],["Milk","1/2 cup"],["Egg White","7"],["Granulated Sugar","1 1/2 cups"],["Almonds","Sliced"],["Whipping Cream","1 1/4 cup"]],"s":"Vanilla custard\r\n▢\r\nSeparate the egg yolks and set aside the whites to use in the meringue.\r\n▢\r\nWhisk together the egg yolks, cornstarch and sugar in a bowl.\r\n▢\r\nHeat the cream and milk in a saucepan. Split open the vanilla pod and add the beans to the saucepan. Once the milk begins to bubble pour about half of it into the bowl with the egg mixture, whisking constantly. Then return the saucepan to the heat and pour the egg mixture back into the saucepan with remaining milk, whisking constantly. Once the mixture thickens lower the heat and continue whisking for about 30 seconds.\r\n▢\r\nPour the custard into a clean bowl and cover with plastic wrap, placing the plastic directly on the top layer of the custard. Chill in the fridge.\r\nCake\r\n▢\r\nMix together butter and sugar until light and fluffy. Add egg yolks one at a time, setting aside the egg whites for the meringue. Add the flour mixed with baking powder. Stir in the milk, beating until smooth (you can use an electric mixer if you prefer).\r\n▢\r\nPreheat oven to 320°F (160°C). Cover a baking sheet with baking paper and spread out the batter into a large, even rectangle.\r\nMeringue topping\r\n▢\r\nWhisk together the egg whites and sugar until you get glossy, stiff peaks. The meringue should hold its form – if it still melts continue whisking.\r\n▢\r\nSpread out the meringue on top of the cake batter. Use a spatula to form light waves with the meringue. Sprinkle almonds on top of the meringue. Bake for about 30 minutes, until the meringue and almonds are golden.\r\nCream filling\r\n▢\r\nWhisk the cream into stiff peaks. Carefully fold in the vanilla custard.\r\nAssembly\r\n▢\r\nOnce the cake has cooled, cut it in half. You can use scissors for this, or a knife on a cutting board, slicing through the baking paper as well.\r\n▢\r\nPlace half of the cake on a serving platter with the meringue side down and peel off the baking paper.\r\n▢\r\nSpread the cream filling across the cake. Then carefully remove the other half of the cake from the baking paper and place it over the cream filling, meringue side up.\r\n▢\r\nServe with fresh berries.\r\n\r\n","z":"香草奶油冻\r\n▢\r\n将蛋黄分离，将蛋白放在一边，用于制作蛋白酥皮。\r\n▢\r\n将蛋黄、玉米淀粉和糖放入碗中搅拌。\r\n▢\r\n在平底锅中加热奶油和牛奶。打开香草荚，将豆子放入锅中。一旦牛奶开始起泡，将大约一半的牛奶倒入盛有鸡蛋混合物的碗中，不断搅拌。然后将锅重新加热，将鸡蛋混合物与剩余的牛奶一起倒入锅中，不断搅拌。一旦混合物变稠，降低热量并继续搅拌约 30 秒。\r\n▢\r\n将蛋奶冻倒入干净的碗中，盖上保鲜膜，将塑料直接放在蛋奶冻的顶层。放入冰箱冷藏。\r\n蛋糕\r\n▢\r\n将黄油和糖混合在一起，直至变得松软。一次添加一个蛋黄，将蛋清放在一边做蛋白酥皮。加入与发酵粉混合的面粉。加入牛奶，搅拌至光滑（如果您愿意，可以使用电动搅拌机）。\r\n▢\r\n将烤箱预热至 320°F (160°C)。在烤盘上盖上烘焙纸，然后将面糊摊成一个大而均匀的矩形。\r\n酥皮配料\r\n▢\r\n将蛋白和糖搅拌在一起，直至形成有光泽、坚硬的峰。蛋白酥皮应保持其形状——如果仍然融化，请继续搅拌。\r\n▢\r\n将蛋白霜铺在蛋糕糊上。用抹刀与蛋白酥皮形成光波。在蛋白酥皮上撒上杏仁。烘烤约30分钟，直至蛋白酥皮和杏仁呈金黄色。\r\n奶油馅\r\n▢\r\n将奶油搅打成硬性发泡。小心地拌入香草蛋奶冻。\r\n组装\r\n▢\r\n蛋糕冷却后，将其切成两半。您可以使用剪刀或切菜板上的刀，也可以切开烘焙纸。\r\n▢\r\n将一半蛋糕放在盘子上，蛋白酥皮面朝下，然后撕掉烘焙纸。\r\n▢\r\n将奶油馅涂在蛋糕上。然后小心地从烘焙纸上取下蛋糕的另一半，将其放在奶油馅上，蛋白霜面朝上。\r\n▢\r\n与新鲜浆果一起食用。"},{"id":"53132","n":"Mazariner – Scandinavian Almond Tartlets","a":"Norway","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/uh1n5u1763075545.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZpZ_8mcmNLI","i":[["Flour","3 Cups"],["Powdered Sugar","1 1/4 cup"],["Butter","200g"],["Egg","1"],["Egg","3"],["Powdered Sugar","1 1/4 cup"],["Butter","100g"],["Vanilla Extract","2 teaspoons"],["Flour","2 tblsp"],["Almond Flour","2 cups"],["Almond Extract","1 teaspoon"],["Powdered Sugar","2 cups"],["Heavy Cream","3  tablespoons"],["Almond Extract","1/4 tsp"]],"s":"Shells\r\n▢\r\nCombine the flour and powdered sugar in a food processor. Add the butter and pulse until it's evenly distributed. Add the egg and pulse until the dough comes together.\r\n▢\r\nRoll out the dough on a floured surface. Cut the dough in circles with a large mug. Press the circles down into a greased muffin pan. Put the pan of shells in the fridge while you prepare the almond filling.\r\nAlmond filling\r\n▢\r\nPreheat oven to 355°F (180°C).\r\n▢\r\nWhisk the egg and powdered sugar together until thick and airy. Melt the butter and stir it into the egg mixture. Stir in the vanilla, flour, and almond extract. Stir in the almond flour.\r\n▢\r\nPipe or spoon the almond filling onto the shells, filling the shells about 3/4 full.\r\n▢\r\nBake the mazariner for 20 – 25 minutes, until light golden brown. Cool on a wire rack.\r\nGlaze\r\n▢\r\nMix together the powdered sugar and liquid until you get a spreadable glaze. Spread the glaze on top of the mazariner and if you wish, decorate with sprinkles, or anything you like.","z":"贝壳\r\n▢\r\n将面粉和糖粉放入食品加工机中混合。加入黄油和豆类，直至均匀分布。加入鸡蛋并搅拌直至面团混合在一起。\r\n▢\r\n将面团放在撒了面粉的表面上擀开。用大杯子将面团切成圆形。将圆圈压入涂有油脂的松饼盘中。准备杏仁馅时，将装有贝壳的盘放入冰箱。\r\n杏仁馅\r\n▢\r\n将烤箱预热至 355°F (180°C)。\r\n▢\r\nWhisk the egg and powdered sugar together until thick and airy.将黄油融化并搅拌到鸡蛋混合物中。加入香草、面粉和杏仁精。加入杏仁粉搅拌。\r\n▢\r\n将杏仁馅用管子或勺子舀到蛋壳上，将蛋壳填满约 3/4。\r\n▢\r\n将 mazariner 烘烤 20 - 25 分钟，直至呈浅金黄色。放在金属架上冷却。\r\n釉\r\n▢\r\nMix together the powdered sugar and liquid until you get a spreadable glaze. Spread the glaze on top of the mazariner and if you wish, decorate with sprinkles, or anything you like."},{"id":"53117","n":"Nordic smørrebrød with asparagus and horseradish cream","a":"Norway","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/8a8fu01762772651.jpg","y":"","i":[["Creme Fraiche","150ml"],["Horseradish","2 tblsp"],["Lemon Juice","1 teaspoon"],["Salt","Pinch"],["Pepper","Pinch"],["Vegetable Oil","Dash"],["Shallots","2"],["Salt","Pinch"],["White Asparagus","8"],["Asparagus","8"],["Rye Bread","4 slices"],["Butter","1 tblsp"],["västerbottensost cheese","100g"],["Dill","Sprinking"],["Salt","Pinch"],["Black Pepper","Pinch"]],"s":"To make the horseradish cream, mix the crème fraîche, grated horseradish, lemon juice, salt and white pepper in a bowl. Refrigerate until serving.\r\n\r\nTo make the crispy shallots, heat some vegetable oil in a frying pan over a medium heat. Add the sliced shallots and fry until golden brown and crispy.\r\n\r\nRemove with a slotted spoon and drain on a plate lined with kitchen paper. Season with a pinch of salt.\r\n\r\nTo make the open sandwich, bring a large saucepan of salted water to the boil, then blanch half of the asparagus (four white and four green) until tender-crisp, about 2–3 minutes.\r\n\r\nAdd ice to a bowl of cold water. Use a slotted spoon to remove the asparagus from the boiling water and immediately transfer to the iced water to stop cooking. Thinly slice the remaining asparagus lengthwise to serve raw.\r\n\r\nPre-heat the grill until hot. Spread the rye bread with butter and grill until golden and crisp.\r\n\r\nTo serve, place the grilled bread slices on serving plates. Arrange both the blanched and raw asparagus on the bread. Drizzle with horseradish cream, then sprinkle grated cheese over the top. Garnish with the crispy shallots and some fresh dill to finish.","z":"制作辣根奶油时，将法式酸奶油、磨碎的辣根、柠檬汁、盐和白胡椒粉放入碗中混合。冷藏直至食用。\r\n\r\n为了制作酥脆的葱，请在煎锅中用中火加热一些植物油。加入切好的青葱，炒至金黄色酥脆。\r\n\r\n用漏勺取出，放在铺有厨房用纸的盘子上沥干水分。加少许盐调味。\r\n\r\n制作开放式三明治时，将一大锅盐水煮沸，然后将一半芦笋（四根白芦笋和四根绿芦笋）焯水约 2-3 分钟，直至变脆。\r\n\r\n将冰块加入一碗冷水中。用漏勺将芦笋从沸水中取出，立即放入冰水中停止烹饪。将剩余的芦笋纵向切成薄片，生吃。\r\n\r\n将烤架预热至热。在黑麦面包上涂上黄油，然后烤至金黄酥脆。\r\n\r\n食用时，将烤面包片放在盘子上。将焯过的芦笋和生芦笋放在面包上。淋上辣根奶油，然后在上面撒上磨碎的奶酪。用脆葱和一些新鲜莳萝装饰即可完成。"},{"id":"53129","n":"Norwegian Krumkake","a":"Norway","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/z9g8011763075640.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7JXuI2V2MLg","i":[["Egg","3 Large"],["Sugar","3/4 cup"],["Butter","2/3 Cup"],["Cardamom","1 teaspoon"],["Nutmeg","1 pinch"],["Salt","1/2 teaspoon"],["Flour","1 1/4 cup"],["Water","Splash"]],"s":"▢\r\nWhisk the egg and sugar until the mixture thickens.\r\n▢\r\nMelt the butter and let it cool slightly, then add the butter to the egg mixture.\r\n▢\r\nMix in spices and then slowly add the flour while stirring to avoid lumps. \r\n▢\r\nLet the batter rest for at least 30 minutes. This improves the texture of the krumkaker.\r\n▢\r\nSpoon about one heaping tablespoon of batter onto iron and bake. If the batter is too thick, add some water to it.\r\n▢\r\nWhile still hot, shape the krumkake with a wooden krumkake roller or over a cup (if using a cup, make them a bit thicker). The krumkaker harden quickly, so you can just let them sit on the roller/cup until the next krumkake is ready to be shaped. \r\n▢\r\nAfter completely cooled, store the krumkaker in a metal or glass tin lined with paper towels at the bottom. You can also freeze them!","z":"▢\r\n搅拌鸡蛋和糖直至混合物变稠。\r\n▢\r\n将黄油融化并稍微冷却，然后将黄油加入鸡蛋混合物中。\r\n▢\r\n混合香料，然后在搅拌的同时慢慢加入面粉，以避免结块。 \r\n▢\r\n让面糊静置至少 30 分钟。这改善了克鲁姆卡克的质地。\r\n▢\r\n将大约一汤匙面糊舀到熨斗上并烘烤。如果面糊太稠，可以加一些水。\r\n▢\r\n趁热，用木制克鲁姆卡克滚筒或在杯子上塑造克鲁姆卡克形状（如果使用杯子，请将其厚一点）。克鲁姆卡克很快就会变硬，因此您可以将它们放在滚筒/杯子上，直到下一个克鲁姆卡克准备好成型。 \r\n▢\r\n完全冷却后，将克鲁姆卡克存放在底部垫有纸巾的金属或玻璃罐中。你也可以冷冻它们！"},{"id":"53121","n":"Norwegian Potato Lefse","a":"Norway","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/hxcuj01762772827.jpg","y":"https://www.bing.com/videos/riverview/relatedvideo?q=Norwegian+Potato+Lefse+youtube&mid=72F7D5C128519ADD66CA72F7D5C128519ADD66CA&mcid=A586185F283B4580BF51AB66165F8D94&FORM=VIRE","i":[["Potatoes","3 Lbs"],["Salt","1 teaspoon"],["Sugar","1 teaspoon"],["Melted Butter","1/4 cup"],["Heavy Cream","1/4 cup"],["All purpose flour","1 1/2 cups"],["Flour","1/2 cup"],["Butter","14 tablespoons"],["Granulated Sugar","3/4 cup"],["Heavy Cream","1 tablespoon"]],"s":"Boil the potatoes. Peel the potatoes while still warm and run them through a potato ricer twice.\r\n▢\r\nLet the potatoes cool in an uncovered bowl in the fridge.\r\n▢\r\nStir the salt, sugar, melted butter, and cream into the riced potatoes.\r\n▢\r\nSlowly add the flour and knead by hand until you get a good consistency. Don't add more flour than necessary! Roll the dough into a long sausage and divide into about 7 or 8 pieces if using an 18 inch griddle. If using a smaller griddle or frying pan, divide the dough into 10 – 12 pieces.\r\n▢\r\nRoll each piece into a ball and then press into a flat circle, using the edges of your hands to form the dough into a nice circle shape without any cracks. This is important, otherwise you won't get round lefser.\r\n▢\r\nHeat up your griddle on medium/high heat.\r\n▢\r\nFlour your rolling surface and roll the lefse dough into a large circle slightly smaller than your griddle or frying pan. Begin rolling with a smooth rolling pin, then switch to a corrugated rolling pin as the lefse gets thinner. Don't use too much flour, as then the edges can become hard.\r\n▢\r\nRoll the lefse onto your lefse stick and then gently unroll it onto your griddle. After a minute or two check the underside of the lefse for brown spots and then use the lefse stick to flip the lefse and cook on the other side.\r\n▢\r\nUse the lefse stick to remove the lefse from the griddle and place it in a folded damp sheet or tablecloth.","z":"煮土豆。趁热将土豆剥皮，然后将其通过土豆碾米机两次。\r\n▢\r\n将土豆放入冰箱中不加盖的碗中冷却。\r\n▢\r\n将盐、糖、融化的黄油和奶油倒入土豆泥中搅拌。\r\n▢\r\n慢慢加入面粉并用手揉捏，直到获得良好的稠度。不要添加不必要的面粉！将面团擀成长香肠，如果使用18英寸的煎锅，则分成大约7或8块。如果使用较小的煎锅或煎锅，请将面团分成 10 - 12 块。\r\n▢\r\n将每块面团擀成球状，然后用双手的边缘将面团压成扁平的圆形，将面团形成漂亮的圆形，没有任何裂缝。这一点很重要，否则你就无法绕过leser。\r\n▢\r\n用中/高温加热煎锅。\r\n▢\r\n在滚动表面撒上面粉，然后将剩余的面团擀成比煎锅或煎锅稍小的大圆圈。开始用光滑的擀面杖擀，然后当面团变薄时改用波纹擀面杖。不要使用太多面粉，否则边缘会变硬。\r\n▢\r\n将左手卷到左手棒上，然后轻轻地将其展开到煎锅上。一两分钟后，检查左面的底面是否有棕色斑点，然后使用左面棒翻转左面并在另一面烹饪。\r\n▢\r\n使用左手棒将左手从煎锅中取出，并将其放在折叠的湿床单或桌布上。"},{"id":"53124","n":"Raspeballer (Norwegian Potato Dumplings)","a":"Norway","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/hhm7xy1763075871.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2NFNabRkF04","i":[["Pork knuckle","1"],["Sausages","1"],["Potatoes","1 lb"],["Red Potatoes","2 Lbs"],["Flour","1 1/4 cup"],["All purpose flour","2 tblsp"],["Salt","1 teaspoon"],["Bouillon Cubes","4"],["Freshly Chopped Parsley","Pinch"],["Swede","1"],["Carrots","2"],["Cream","1/4 cup"],["Butter","1 tblsp"],["Nutmeg","1 teaspoon"]],"s":"Raspeballer & (Optional) Salted Meat\r\n▢\r\nIf you're making pork knuckle, cook it in simmering water for about 3 hours, until the meat falls from the bone. Remove the pork and save the broth to cook the raspeballer.\r\n▢\r\nBoil the boiled potatoes and peel once cooled. Also peel the raw potatoes, and then grate them or run them through a food processor. Use a paper towel to remove some of the moisture from the grated potatoes.\r\n▢\r\nMash the boiled potatoes in a potato ricer or with a masher. Make sure there are no lumps. Add the grated raw potatoes to the mashed potatoes in a large mixing bowl and stir together. Add the barley flour, all purpose flour, and salt and mix together with your hands until the mixture is fully blended.\r\n▢\r\nYou can cook the raspeballer in either vegetable or beef broth, or if you're making pork knuckle, cook them in the broth from the pork knuckle. Bring the broth to a very light simmer – you don't want it to fully boil because then the raspeballer might break apart.\r\n▢\r\nUse a tablespoon dipped in cold water to shape each raspeball in your hand. Try to make them as smooth as possible and then gently drop them into the simmering broth. Dip the tablespoon in a bowl of cold water between each raspeball.\r\n▢\r\nLet the raspeballer simmer for about 30 minutes. If you're making smoked sausage, you can heat the sausage in the same pot with the raspeballer. Top with fresh chopped parsley.\r\n\r\nMashed Rutabaga\r\n▢\r\nPeel the rutabaga and carrots and cut into small pieces. Boil in water for about 30 minutes, or until tender. Then drain the water, add the cream/milk, butter and nutmeg and mash until smooth.\r\n▢\r\nServe alongside the raspeballer and meat.","z":"Raspeballer 和（可选）咸肉\r\n▢\r\n如果你做猪肘，请在沸水中煮约3小时，直到肉从骨头上掉下来。取出猪肉并保留肉汤来煮树莓派。\r\n▢\r\n将煮熟的土豆煮沸，冷却后剥皮。还要将生土豆削皮，然后磨碎或通过食品加工机处理。用纸巾除去磨碎的土豆中的一些水分。\r\n▢\r\n将煮好的土豆放入土豆碾米机或捣碎器中捣碎。确保没有肿块。将磨碎的生土豆加入到大搅拌碗中的土豆泥中，搅拌在一起。加入大麦粉、通用面粉和盐，用手搅拌直至混合物完全混合。\r\n▢\r\n你可以用蔬菜汤或牛肉汤来煮raspeballer，或者如果你要做猪肘，就用猪肘的汤来煮。将肉汤小火慢炖——你不希望它完全沸腾，因为这样树莓派可能会破裂。\r\n▢\r\n用汤匙浸入冷水中，在手中塑造每个树莓球的形状。尽量让它们变得光滑，然后轻轻地将它们放入沸腾的肉汤中。将汤匙浸入每个树莓球之间的一碗冷水中。\r\n▢\r\n让 rapeballer 小火煮约 30 分钟。如果您要制作熏香肠，则可以将香肠与 Raspeballer 放在同一个锅中加热。上面撒上新鲜切碎的欧芹。\r\n\r\n芜菁甘蓝泥\r\n▢\r\n将芜菁甘蓝和胡萝卜去皮，切成小块。在水中煮约30分钟，或直至变软。然后沥干水，加入奶油/牛奶、黄油和肉豆蔻，捣碎至光滑。\r\n▢\r\n与 raspeballer 和肉一起食用。"},{"id":"53115","n":"Red onion pickle","a":"Norway","c":"Vegan","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/ppodrp1762325183.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3z2jTcsL28g","i":[["Red Onions","3 Large"],["Sea Salt","2 tsp"],["Cider Vinegar","200ml"],["Granulated Sugar","50g"],["Black Pepper","1 tsp"],["Bay Leaves","4"]],"s":"Peel the onions, cut them in half from top to bottom and finely slice into half-moon pieces. Put in a colander placed over a bowl and sprinkle with salt, lightly turning over the onion pieces with your hands so the surfaces are all covered. Set aside for an hour or so to brine.\r\n\r\nMeanwhile put the vinegar, 50ml/2fl oz water and the sugar in a saucepan. Bring to a simmer, stirring to help the sugar dissolve, and cook for a couple of minutes. Set aside.\r\n\r\nPack the onions into the sterilised jars, sprinkling in a little pepper as you go. Cover with the warm vinegar and finish by tucking a couple of bay leaves down the side of the jars. Seal. The onions are best kept in the fridge and used within to 4 weeks.","z":"将洋葱去皮，从上到下切成两半，然后切成半月形的薄片。将滤锅放在碗上，撒上盐，用手轻轻翻转洋葱片，使表面全部覆盖。静置一个小时左右，用盐水腌制。\r\n\r\n同时将醋、50 毫升/2 液量盎司水和糖放入平底锅中。煮沸，搅拌以帮助糖溶解，煮几分钟。放在一边。\r\n\r\n将洋葱装进消毒过的罐子里，边撒上一点胡椒粉。盖上温醋，最后将几片月桂叶塞到罐子的侧面。海豹。洋葱最好保存在冰箱中，并在 4 周内使用。"},{"id":"53118","n":"Rømmegrøt – Norwegian Sour Cream Porridge","a":"Norway","c":"Breakfast","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/hyk47c1762772689.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=v4rIJOWXM3w","i":[["Full fat sour cream","2 cups"],["Flour","3/4 cup"],["Milk","2 cups"],["Salt","1 tsp"],["Sugar","Sprinkling"],["Cinnamon","Sprinkling"],["Butter","To taste"]],"s":"▢\r\nCook the sour cream in a covered saucepan on medium heat for about 5 minutes.\r\n▢\r\nTurn down the heat and add half of the flour and stir well with a whisk. Once the flour is fully incorporated, let the mixture continue to cook, stirring occasionally, until fat starts to release. Use a spoon to gather as much of the fat as you can in a small bowl, saving for later. (Don't worry if you can't get any fat – in that case you can add butter later.)\r\n▢\r\nWhisk in the rest of the flour and then slowly add the milk, whisking constantly to avoid lumps. Let the porridge continue to cook on low heat for 5 minutes and then add salt.\r\n▢\r\nServe with sugar, cinnamon, and the fat from the porridge. If you're using lower fat sour cream you can top the rømmegrøt with some butter instead.","z":"▢\r\n将酸奶油放入有盖的平底锅中，中火煮约 5 分钟。\r\n▢\r\n关小火，加入一半面粉，用搅拌器搅拌均匀。一旦面粉完全混合，让混合物继续煮，偶尔搅拌，直到脂肪开始释放。用勺子将尽可能多的脂肪收集到一个小碗中，以备后用。 （如果你得不到任何脂肪，请不要担心——在这种情况下，你可以稍后添加黄油。）\r\n▢\r\n加入剩余的面粉，然后慢慢加入牛奶，不断搅拌以避免结块。让粥继续小火煮5分钟，然后加入盐。\r\n▢\r\n与糖、肉桂和粥中的脂肪一起食用。如果您使用低脂酸奶油，则可以在 rømmegrøt 上撒上一些黄油。"},{"id":"53130","n":"Suksessterte (Norwegian almond “success cake”)","a":"Norway","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/de83k51763075604.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LgIQXxkOrMM","i":[["Almonds","2 cups"],["Egg","3"],["Granulated Sugar","1 1/4 cup"],["Flour","2 tblsp"],["Baking Powder","1 teaspoon"],["Egg Yolks","5"],["Heavy Cream","1/2 cup"],["Granulated Sugar","1/3 cup"],["Vanilla Extract","1 teaspoon"],["Butter","100g"]],"s":"Almond base\r\n▢\r\nPreheat oven to 345°F (175°C) and grease cake form (I use a 27 cm spring form) – you can line the bottom with baking paper if you like.\r\n▢\r\nGrind almonds in an almond grinder or food processor. I like to keep them a bit coarse.\r\n▢\r\nGently whisk the eggs and sugar together until combined (no longer). Stir in the ground almonds, flour, and baking powder.\r\n▢\r\nPour batter into cake form and bake for about 45 – 50 minutes, monitoring to make sure the top doesn't burn.\r\nYellow egg cream\r\n▢\r\nAdd egg yolks, heavy cream, sugar, and vanilla to a saucepan. Heat over low/medium heat while stirring constantly until the mixture thickens – about 15 minutes. Turn up the heat if the mixture doesn't thicken, but be careful not to boil.\r\n▢\r\nLet the mixture cool to room temperature and then add the butter. You can use an electric mixer for a fluffy egg cream.\r\nAssembly\r\n▢\r\nWait for the cake to cool completely before removing from form and frosting.","z":"杏仁底座\r\n▢\r\n将烤箱预热至 345°F (175°C) 并制作油蛋糕形状（我使用 27 厘米弹簧形状）——如果您愿意，可以在底部铺上烘焙纸。\r\n▢\r\n在杏仁研磨机或食品加工机中研磨杏仁。我喜欢让它们有点粗糙。\r\n▢\r\n轻轻地将鸡蛋和糖搅拌在一起，直至混合（不再混合）。加入杏仁粉、面粉和泡打粉。\r\n▢\r\n将面糊倒入蛋糕模中，烘烤约 45 - 50 分钟，注意确保顶部不会烧焦。\r\n黄色鸡蛋奶油\r\n▢\r\n将蛋黄、浓奶油、糖和香草精放入平底锅中。用低/中火加热，同时不断搅拌，直到混合物变稠——大约 15 分钟。如果混合物没有变稠，请调高热量，但小心不要沸腾。\r\n▢\r\n让混合物冷却至室温，然后加入黄油。您可以使用电动搅拌机打出蓬松的鸡蛋奶油。\r\n组装\r\n▢\r\n等待蛋糕完全冷却，然后再从模具中取出并撒上糖霜。"},{"id":"53119","n":"Tall Skoleboller","a":"Norway","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/xihiu41762773169.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3LvxDuZuPkU","i":[["Milk","1 cup"],["Instant Yeast","3 tsp"],["Granulated Sugar","1-⅓ cups"],["Cardamom","1 tsp"],["Vanilla Extract","1 teaspoon"],["Flour","2 1/4 cups"],["Butter","5 tblsp"],["Milk","1 1/4 cup"],["Granulated Sugar","1-⅓ cups"],["Egg Yolks","3"],["Cornstarch","2 tblsp"],["vanilla pod","1"],["Powdered Sugar","2 cups"],["Water","3  tablespoons"],["Shredded Coconut","1 cup"]],"s":"▢\r\nHeat the milk until it's lukewarm. Add the yeast and dissolve.\r\n▢\r\nAdd the sugar, cardamom, vanilla, and about 2/3 of the flour.\r\n▢\r\nMix the dough together either by hand or in a mixer with a dough hook, slowly adding the rest of the flour. You might need a bit more or less flour to form dough that isn't too sticky to knead. When the dough forms a nice ball, add the softened butter and continue to knead the dough for about ten minutes.\r\n▢\r\nRoll the dough into a cylinder and cut into six equal parts. Roll each piece into a round bun and set them in a greased muffin/cake tin. Cover and let rise until doubled in size (about an hour).","z":"▢\r\n将牛奶加热至微温。添加酵母并溶解。\r\n▢\r\n加入糖、小豆蔻、香草精和约 2/3 的面粉。\r\n▢\r\n用手或在带有面团钩的搅拌机中将面团混合在一起，慢慢加入其余的面粉。您可能需要多一点或少一点面粉来形成不会太粘而无法揉捏的面团。当面团形成漂亮的球时，加入软化的黄油，继续揉面团约十分钟。\r\n▢\r\n将面团擀成圆柱体并切成六等份。将每块卷成圆形面包，然后放入涂有油脂的松饼/蛋糕罐中。盖上盖子，发酵至两倍大（约一小时）。"},{"id":"53307","n":"Beetroot & red cabbage sauerkraut","a":"Polish","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/ra2k8a1764365055.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ly1UeAjydEg","i":[["Beetroot","320g"],["Red Cabbage","450g"],["Onion","1 small"],["Caraway Seed","2 tsp"],["Sea Salt","1 tsp"]],"s":"step 1\r\nTip all the ingredients into a large bowl, add 1-1½ tsp freshly ground black pepper, then scrunch it all together with your hands for 5 mins. You might want to wear gloves to avoid staining your skin with the beetroot juices.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nPress the veg down in the bowl with your hands, then cover the surface and up the side of the bowl with a large sheet of compostable cling film or something reusable like a beeswax wrap. Now place another similar-sized bowl on top. Press down hard and add anything heavy (packs of rice or cans work well) to weigh it down so the juices rise to cover the surface. Cover again.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nLeave to ferment at room temperature for at least five days, but for maximum flavour, leave for one-five weeks (until the bubbling subsides).\r\n\r\nstep 4\r\nCheck the sauerkraut. After a few days, you will see bubbles that have built up as it ferments. Give it a stir, then cover and weigh it down again as before. The cabbage will become increasingly sour the longer it’s fermented, so taste it now and again. When you like the flavour, transfer it to sterilised jars and keep chilled. Will keep chilled for up to six months.","z":"步骤1\r\n将所有原料倒入一个大碗中，加入 1-1½ 茶匙现磨黑胡椒，然后用手将其全部揉碎 5 分钟。您可能需要戴上手套，以免甜菜根汁弄脏皮肤。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n用手将蔬菜压入碗中，然后用一大片可堆肥保鲜膜或可重复使用的东西（如蜂蜡包装）覆盖碗的表面和侧面。现在将另一个类似大小的碗放在上面。用力按下并添加任何重物（一包米或罐头效果很好）来压下它，这样汁液就会上升并覆盖表面。再盖上。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n在室温下发酵至少五天，但为了获得最大的风味，请放置一到五周（直到冒泡消退）。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n检查酸菜。几天后，您会看到发酵过程中形成的气泡。搅拌一下，然后像以前一样盖上盖子并再次称重。卷心菜发酵时间越长，就会越酸，所以要时不时地尝尝。当您喜欢这种味道时，将其转移到消毒罐中并冷藏。可以冷藏长达六个月。"},{"id":"53018","n":"Bigos (Hunters Stew)","a":"Polish","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/md8w601593348504.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Oqg_cO4s8ik","i":[["Bacon","2 sliced"],["Kielbasa","1 lb"],["Pork","1 lb"],["Flour","1/4 cup"],["Garlic","3 chopped"],["Onion","1 Diced"],["Mushrooms","1 1/2 cup"],["Cabbage","4 cups"],["Sauerkraut","1 Jar"],["Red Wine","1/4 cup"],["Bay Leaf","1"],["Basil","1 tsp"],["Marjoram","1 tsp"],["Paprika","1 tbs"],["Caraway Seed","1/8 teaspoon"],["Hotsauce","1 dash"],["Beef Stock","5 Cups"],["Tomato Puree","2 tbs"],["Diced Tomatoes","1 cup"],["Worcestershire Sauce","1 dash"]],"s":"Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).\r\n\r\nHeat a large pot over medium heat. Add the bacon and kielbasa; cook and stir until the bacon has rendered its fat and sausage is lightly browned. Use a slotted spoon to remove the meat and transfer to a large casserole or Dutch oven.\r\n\r\nCoat the cubes of pork lightly with flour and fry them in the bacon drippings over medium-high heat until golden brown. Use a slotted spoon to transfer the pork to the casserole. Add the garlic, onion, carrots, fresh mushrooms, cabbage and sauerkraut. Reduce heat to medium; cook and stir until the carrots are soft, about 10 minutes. Do not let the vegetables brown.\r\n\r\nDeglaze the pan by pouring in the red wine and stirring to loosen all of the bits of food and flour that are stuck to the bottom. Season with the bay leaf, basil, marjoram, paprika, salt, pepper, caraway seeds and cayenne pepper; cook for 1 minute.\r\n\r\nMix in the dried mushrooms, hot pepper sauce, Worcestershire sauce, beef stock, tomato paste and tomatoes. Heat through just until boiling. Pour the vegetables and all of the liquid into the casserole dish with the meat. Cover with a lid.\r\n\r\nBake in the preheated oven for 2 1/2 to 3 hours, until meat is very tender.","z":"将烤箱预热至 350 华氏度（175 摄氏度）。\r\n\r\n用中火加热一个大锅。加入培根和熏肠；煮并搅拌，直到培根呈现出脂肪并且香肠呈浅棕色。用有槽勺取出肉，然后转移到大砂锅或荷兰烤箱中。\r\n\r\n将猪肉块裹上薄薄一层面粉，放入培根汁中，中高火煎至金黄色。用漏勺将猪肉转移到砂锅中。加入大蒜、洋葱、胡萝卜、新鲜蘑菇、卷心菜和酸菜。将热量降至中等；煮约 10 分钟，搅拌直至胡萝卜变软。不要让蔬菜变成褐色。\r\n\r\n倒入红酒并搅拌以松开粘在底部的所有食物和面粉，从而使锅脱釉。用月桂叶、罗勒、马郁兰、辣椒粉、盐、胡椒、香菜籽和辣椒调味；煮1分钟。\r\n\r\n加入干蘑菇、辣椒酱、伍斯特酱、牛肉高汤、番茄酱和番茄。加热直至沸腾。将蔬菜和所有液体与肉一起倒入砂锅中。盖上盖子。\r\n\r\n在预热的烤箱中烘烤 2 1/2 至 3 小时，直至肉变得非常嫩。"},{"id":"53300","n":"Bigos (Polish hunter's stew)","a":"Polish","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/fl4brj1764361323.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Oqg_cO4s8ik","i":[["White Cabbage","1 sliced"],["Beef Stock","250ml"],["Mushrooms","100g"],["Lard","2 tablespoons"],["German Sausages","400g"],["Bacon","250g"],["Onion","2 chopped"],["Beef","750g"],["Prunes","200g"],["Bay Leaf","1"],["Cloves","2"],["Peppercorns","12"],["Juniper Berries","4"],["Allspice Berries","4"],["Red Wine","90 ml"],["Tomato Puree","2 tablespoons"]],"s":"step 1\r\nPut the cabbage in a heavy casserole dish, add the stock and cook over a low heat for about 50 mins, until tender.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nCut the soaked mushrooms into strips and save the soaking water. Heat the lard and fry the sausages and bacon, then scoop out, leaving the fat in the pan. Fry the onion in the same pan for 5-8 mins until lightly browned.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nAdd the mushrooms and their liquid along with all the cooked meat, onions and prunes, then cover and cook for 20 mins. Add the spices, red wine and tomato purée and bring to a simmer, then cover and cook for 1 hr. Season well and leave to cool. Will keep covered and chilled for up to two days. Bigos improves in flavour over a couple of days. Leave to cool first. Reheat until piping hot before serving.","z":"步骤1\r\n将卷心菜放入厚底砂锅中，加入高汤，小火煮约 50 分钟，直至变软。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n泡好的香菇切条，泡水留着。加热猪油，煎香肠和培根，然后舀出，将脂肪留在锅中。在同一锅中煎洋葱 5-8 分钟，直至呈浅棕色。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n加入蘑菇及其液体以及所有煮熟的肉、洋葱和李子，然后盖上锅盖煮 20 分钟。加入香料、红酒和番茄泥，小火煮，然后盖上锅盖煮 1 小时。充分调味并冷却。将被遮盖并冷藏最多两天。 Bigos 的味道在几天内得到改善。先让其冷却。食用前重新加热直至滚烫。"},{"id":"53305","n":"Braised stuffed cabbage","a":"Polish","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/z267f71764364072.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RNrZpQaj5us","i":[["Cabbage Leaves","6 large"],["Olive Oil","2 tablespoons"],["Onion","1 chopped"],["Rosemary","2 tsp"],["Celery","1 chopped"],["Basmati Rice","140g"],["Cooked Chestnut","140g"],["Cranberry","50g"],["Vegetable Stock","300ml"],["Balsamic Vinegar","1 tablespoon"],["Clear Honey","1 tsp"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4. Remove the tough central stalk from the cabbage leaves. Bring a large pan of salted water to the boil, add the cabbage, then cook for just 1-2 mins until the leaves are starting to wilt. Drain and refresh under cold running water. Drain well, then pat dry with a tea towel.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nHeat the oil in a pan, add the onion, then fry for 5 mins until slightly browned. Add the rosemary and celery, then cook for 8 mins more. Stir in the rice, then cook for a min or so until the grains are glistening. Remove from the heat, stir in the chestnuts and cranberries, then season.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nSpoon a little stuffing onto a cabbage leaf, roll up and fold in the sides to enclose the filling. Put in a single layer in a large, oiled, shallow ovenproof dish with the join underneath. Fill the remaining leaves in the same way. Mix the stock, vinegar and honey, then pour over the cabbage. Cover the dish tightly with foil, bake for 1 hr, uncover, then cook for a further 15 mins.","z":"步骤1\r\n将烤箱加热至 180C/风扇 160C/煤气 4. 从卷心菜叶子上去除坚硬的中央茎。将一大锅盐水烧开，加入卷心菜，然后煮 1-2 分钟，直到叶子开始枯萎。在冷水下沥干并刷新。沥干水分，然后用茶巾拍干。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n在锅中加热油，加入洋葱，然后煎5分钟，直至略呈棕色。加入迷迭香和芹菜，然后再煮 8 分钟。拌入米饭，然后煮一分钟左右，直到米粒闪闪发光。从火上移开，拌入栗子和蔓越莓，然后调味。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n用勺子舀一点馅料到卷心菜叶上，卷起并折叠两侧以包住馅料。将单层放入一个大的、涂了油的浅耐热盘中，连接处位于下方。以同样的方式填充剩余的叶子。将高汤、醋和蜂蜜混合，然后倒在卷心菜上。用箔纸紧紧盖住盘子，烘烤 1 小时，揭开盖子，然后再煮 15 分钟。"},{"id":"53310","n":"Challah","a":"Polish","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/fm01ky1764366365.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RAYv3n4q-Wc","i":[["Strong white bread flour","500g"],["Caster Sugar","70g"],["Yeast","10g"],["Egg","2 Beaten"],["Sunflower Oil","70 ml"],["Poppy Seeds","1 tablespoon"]],"s":"step 1\r\nCombine the yeast, a pinch of the sugar and a couple tablespoons of lukewarm water in a small bowl. Stir to dissolve the yeast, then leave for 10 mins until foamy.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nMeanwhile, combine the flour, the remaining sugar and 2 tsp fine salt in a large bowl. Make a well in the centre, then add half the beaten egg, the yeast mixture and the oil. Pour in 200ml lukewarm water (it should feel slightly warm to the touch) and stir with a spoon, then mix using one hand, keeping the other clean while you bring the dough together. If there are a lot of very dry bits, gradually add a little water to just bring it together – you don't want it to get too wet and sticky. The dough should be moist, but not soggy.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nOnce the dough has come together, turn it out onto a lightly floured surface. Knead using both hands for 10 mins until smooth and a bit springy. If it gets very sticky, add a very small amount of flour – as little as possible. A dough scraper is useful if the dough is sticking to the work surface. Stretch the sides of the dough down and pull together to form a ball. Lightly oil a bowl, then lightly roll the dough ball around the bowl so it's coated in the oil. Cover with a clean tea towel and leave in a warm place for 1 hr, or until dough has doubled in size.\r\n\r\nstep 4\r\nLine a baking sheet with baking parchment. Turn the dough out onto a clean work surface and divide into three equal pieces, weighing for accuracy, if you like. Roll each piece into a long sausage shape about 25cm long, tapering them slightly at both ends. Lay the pieces out in front of you, parallel to one another with a couple centimetres between each. Bring the sausages together at the top end, then plait them down the length, tucking in the ends when you reach the bottom. Carefully transfer the loaf to the prepared baking sheet and loosely cover with a clean tea towel. Leave to rise until puffy and billowy, about 40 mins.\r\n\r\nstep 5\r\nMeanwhile, heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Gently brush the rest of the beaten egg all over the challah, getting it into all the crevices, and sprinkle with the poppy or sesame seeds, if using. Bake on a middle shelf of the oven for 25-30 mins, until the loaf is golden brown underneath and sounds hollow when tapped. Check after about 15 mins – if the top of the loaf has started to get too dark, cover it with foil. Leave to cool on a wire rack, then serve.","z":"步骤1\r\n将酵母、少许糖和几汤匙温水混合在一个小碗中。搅拌以溶解酵母，然后静置 10 分钟直至形成泡沫。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n同时，将面粉、剩余的糖和 2 茶匙细盐放入一个大碗中。在中心挖一个洞，然后加入一半打好的鸡蛋、酵母混合物和油。倒入 200 毫升温水（摸起来应该有点温热），用勺子搅拌，然后用一只手搅拌，在将面团放在一起的同时保持另一只手清洁。如果有很多非常干燥的碎片，请逐渐添加一点水，将它们混合在一起 - 你不希望它变得太湿和粘。面团应该是湿润的，但不能湿透。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n面团混合在一起后，将其放在撒有少许面粉的表面上。用双手揉捏10分钟，直至光滑且有点弹性。如果它变得很粘，请添加很少量的面粉 - 尽可能少。如果面团粘在工作表面上，则可以使用面团刮刀。将面团的两侧向下拉伸并拉在一起形成一个球。在碗里涂上少许油，然后将面团轻轻地绕着碗滚动，使其沾上油。盖上干净的茶巾，放在温暖的地方 1 小时，或直到面团体积增加一倍。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n在烤盘上铺上烤羊皮纸。将面团放在干净的工作台面上，然后分成三等份，如果您愿意，可以称重以确保准确性。将每块卷成约25厘米长的长香肠形状，两端稍微变细。将碎片放在您面前，彼此平行，每块之间间隔几厘米。将香肠的顶端放在一起，然后将它们沿着长度编成辫子，到达底部时将末端塞进去。小心地将面包转移到准备好的烤盘上，并用干净的茶巾松松地覆盖。发酵约 40 分钟，直至变得蓬松且呈波浪状。\r\n\r\n步骤5\r\n同时，将烤箱加热至 200C/180C 风扇/燃气 6. 将剩余的打散的鸡蛋轻轻地刷在白面包上，使其进入所有缝隙，并撒上罂粟籽或芝麻（如果使用）。在烤箱的中间架子上烘烤 25-30 分钟，直到面包下面呈金黄色，敲击时发出空心的声音。大约 15 分钟后检查——如果面包顶部开始变得太黑，请用箔纸覆盖。放在金属架上冷却，然后食用。"},{"id":"53309","n":"Cucumber & fennel salad","a":"Polish","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/ei21r61764365935.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gfNjne0AMb0","i":[["Cucumber","1 large"],["Sugar","1 tsp"],["Fennel Bulb","1 sliced"],["Sour Cream","150ml"],["Lemon","Juice of 1"],["White Wine Vinegar","1 tablespoon"],["Dill","Bunch"]],"s":"step 1\r\nPut cucumber in a sieve. Sprinkle with 1 tsp salt and the sugar, then leave for 10 mins. Add fennel.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nMix soured cream, lemon juice, vinegar and dill, then season with black pepper and add to fennel mix.","z":"步骤1\r\n将黄瓜放入筛子中。撒上1茶匙盐和糖，然后静置10分钟。添加茴香。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将酸奶油、柠檬汁、醋和莳萝混合，然后用黑胡椒调味，加入茴香混合物中。"},{"id":"53021","n":"Golabki (cabbage roll)","a":"Polish","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/q8sp3j1593349686.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rBrTkDdoPYg","i":[["Cabbage","1"],["Butter","2 tbs"],["Onion","1 chopped"],["Ground Beef","1 lb"],["Ground Pork","1/2 lb"],["Rice","1 1/2 cups"],["Garlic","1 tsp"],["Salt","1 tsp"],["Black Pepper","1/4 tsp"],["Tomato Puree","3 cans"]],"s":"Bring a large pot of lightly salted water to a boil. Place cabbage head into water, cover pot, and cook until cabbage leaves are slightly softened enough to remove from head, 3 minutes. Remove cabbage from pot and let cabbage sit until leaves are cool enough to handle, about 10 minutes.\r\n\r\nRemove 18 whole leaves from the cabbage head, cutting out any thick tough center ribs. Set whole leaves aside. Chop the remainder of the cabbage head and spread it in the bottom of a casserole dish.\r\n\r\nMelt butter in a large skillet over medium-high heat. Cook and stir onion in hot butter until tender, 5 to 10 minutes. Cool.\r\n\r\nStir onion, beef, pork, rice, garlic, 1 teaspoon salt, and 1/4 teaspoon pepper together in a large bowl.\r\n\r\nPreheat oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).\r\n\r\nPlace about 1/2 cup beef mixture on a cabbage leaf. Roll cabbage around beef mixture, tucking in sides to create an envelope around the meat. Repeat with remaining leaves and meat mixture. Place cabbage rolls in a layer atop the chopped cabbage in the casserole dish; season rolls with salt and black pepper.\r\n\r\nWhisk tomato soup, tomato juice, and ketchup together in a bowl. Pour tomato soup mixture over cabbage rolls and cover dish wish aluminum foil.\r\n\r\nBake in the preheated oven until cabbage is tender and meat is cooked through, about 1 hour.","z":"将一大锅淡盐水煮沸。将卷心菜头放入水中，盖上锅盖，煮 3 分钟，直至卷心菜叶稍微变软，可以从头中取出。将卷心菜从锅中取出，静置约 10 分钟，直至叶子冷却到可以处理。\r\n\r\n从卷心菜头上取下 18 片完整的叶子，切掉任何厚而坚韧的中心肋骨。将整片叶子放在一边。将剩下的卷心菜头切碎，铺在砂锅底部。\r\n\r\n在大煎锅中用中高温融化黄油。在热黄油中煮洋葱并搅拌直至变软，持续 5 至 10 分钟。凉爽的。\r\n\r\n将洋葱、牛肉、猪肉、大米、大蒜、1 茶匙盐和 1/4 茶匙胡椒粉放入一个大碗中搅拌。\r\n\r\n将烤箱预热至 350 华氏度（175 摄氏度）。\r\n\r\n将约 1/2 杯牛肉混合物放在卷心菜叶上。将卷心菜卷在牛肉混合物周围，塞入两侧，在肉周围形成一个信封。对剩余的叶子和肉混合物重复上述步骤。将卷心菜卷铺在砂锅菜中切碎的卷心菜上；用盐和黑胡椒调味卷。\r\n\r\n将番茄汤、番茄汁和番茄酱一起放入碗中搅拌。将番茄汤混合物倒在卷心菜卷上，并盖上铝箔纸。\r\n\r\n在预热的烤箱中烘烤约 1 小时，直至卷心菜变软且肉熟透。"},{"id":"53304","n":"Mini bundt cakes","a":"Polish","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/tzt3it1764363293.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4agkoGMcL2w","i":[["Butter","150g"],["Plain Flour","175g"],["Caster Sugar","125g"],["Egg","3"],["Baking Powder","1 tsp"],["Cocoa Powder","2 tsp"],["Milk","3  tablespoons"],["Icing Sugar","1 tablespoon"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Melt 25g butter and generously brush into the holes of a mini bundt tins. Tip a little flour into each hole and shake to coat, then tip out the excess. Beat the butter, caster sugar and a pinch of salt together using an electric whisk. Add the eggs, one at a time, beating well after each addition. Combine the flour and baking powder in a separate bowl, then sift this into the wet ingredients and stir until smooth. Combine the cocoa powder and milk in a small bowl until smooth.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nSpoon 1 tbsp of the plain batter into each hole of the bundt tin. Mix the remaining plain batter with the cocoa powder mixture, then divide this between the holes. Bake for 15-18 mins, or until a skewer inserted into the cakes comes out clean. Leave to cool in the tin for 5 mins, then turn out onto a wire rack and leave to cool completely. Dust with icing sugar to serve.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nPour 1 tablespoon of light batter into each mold. Mix the remaining batter with the stirred cocoa mixture and then fill the molds with a tablespoon.\r\n\r\nstep 4\r\nBake the mini Bundt cakes in the preheated oven for 15-18 minutes , depending on the size of the molds. After 15 minutes of baking time, use a toothpick to test with a skewer and, if necessary, bake for another 3 minutes. Let the mini Bundt cakes cool down completely in the tin. Then carefully remove from the mold. Dust with some icing sugar and serve. Enjoy your meal!","z":"步骤1\r\n将烤箱加热至 180C/160C 风扇/燃气 4. 融化 25 克黄油，然后将其刷入迷你罐头的孔中。在每个孔中倒入少许面粉，摇动以覆盖，然后倒出多余的面粉。用电动搅拌器将黄油、细砂糖和少许盐搅拌在一起。加入鸡蛋，一次一个，每次加入后搅拌均匀。将面粉和泡打粉放入一个单独的碗中，然后将其筛入湿配料中，搅拌直至光滑。将可可粉和牛奶放入小碗中，搅拌至光滑。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将 1 汤匙原味面糊舀入模具的每个孔中。将剩余的原味面糊与可可粉混合物混合，然后将其分入孔中。烘烤 15-18 分钟，或直至用竹签插入蛋糕，取出时是干净的。在罐中冷却 5 分钟，然后放在金属架上完全冷却。撒上糖粉即可食用。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n将 1 汤匙淡面糊倒入每个模具中。将剩余的面糊与搅拌的可可混合物混合，然后用汤匙填充模具。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n将迷你外滩蛋糕放入预热的烤箱中烘烤 15-18 分钟，具体取决于模具的大小。烘烤15分钟后，用牙签串试，如有必要，再烘烤3分钟。让迷你邦特蛋糕在罐中完全冷却。然后小心地从模具中取出。撒上一些糖粉即可食用。请享用！"},{"id":"53017","n":"Paszteciki (Polish Pasties)","a":"Polish","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/c9a3l31593261890.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qANmR6BBJpQ","i":[["Flour","1 cup"],["Salt","1/4 tsp"],["Egg","1 Yolk"],["Egg","1"],["Butter","5 tbs"],["Butter","6 tblsp"],["Onion","1/3 cup"],["Swede","1/2 cup"],["Beef Brisket","1/2 lb"],["Eggs","2 Beaten"],["Salt","1 tsp"],["Pepper","1/4 tsp"]],"s":"Sift flour and salt into a large mixing bowl.\r\nUse a spoon to push the egg yolk through a fine sieve into the flour.\r\nAdd the raw egg and mix well.\r\nBeat in butter 1 tablespoon at a time.\r\nPlace dough on a floured surface and knead until smooth and elastic, then wrap in waxed paper and refrigerate until firm (at least 30 minutes).\r\nIn a heavy skillet, melt 2 tablespoons butter over medium heat; saute the onion and rutabaga until the onion is soft and transparent (5 minutes).\r\nPut the onions, rutabaga, and beef through a meat grinder twice if you have one, if not just chop them up as fine as possible.\r\nMelt the remaining 4 tablespoons butter over medium heat, and add the meat mixture.\r\nCook over low heat, stirring occasionally, until all of the liquid has evaporated and the mixture is thick enough to hold its shape.\r\nRemove from heat and let cool, then stir in 1 egg, and season with salt and pepper.\r\nPreheat oven to 350°F.\r\nOn a lightly floured surface, roll the dough out into a 13x8\" rectangle (1/8\" thick).\r\nSpoon the filling down the center of the rectangle lengthwise, leaving about an inch of space on each end.\r\nLightly brush the long sides with cold water, then fold one of the long sides over the filling and the other side over the top of that.\r\nBrush the short ends with cold water and fold them over the top, enclosing the filling.\r\nPlace pastry seam side down on a baking sheet and brush the top evenly with the remaining scrambled egg.\r\nBake in preheated oven until rich golden brown (30 minutes).\r\nSlice pastry diagonally into 1.5\" long pieces and serve as an appetizer or with soup.","z":"将面粉和盐筛入一个大碗中。\r\n用勺子将蛋黄通过细筛推入面粉中。\r\n加入生鸡蛋并搅拌均匀。\r\n一次加入一汤匙黄油。\r\n将面团放在撒了面粉的表面上，揉至光滑且有弹性，然后用蜡纸包裹并冷藏直至变硬（至少 30 分钟）。\r\n在一个重煎锅中，用中火融化 2 汤匙黄油；将洋葱和芜菁甘蓝炒至洋葱变软且透明（5 分钟）。\r\n如果有的话，将洋葱、芜菁甘蓝和牛肉放入绞肉机中两次，如果没有，则尽可能切碎。\r\n用中火融化剩余的 4 汤匙黄油，然后加入肉混合物。\r\n用小火煮，偶尔搅拌，直到所有液体蒸发并且混合物足够稠以保持其形状。\r\n从火上移开并冷却，然后加入 1 个鸡蛋，用盐和胡椒调味。\r\n将烤箱预热至 350°F。\r\n在撒了少许面粉的表面上，将面团擀成 13x8 英寸的矩形（1/8 英寸厚）。\r\n将馅料沿着长方形的中心纵向舀入，在两端留出大约一英寸的空间。\r\n用冷水轻轻刷长边，然后将长边的一侧折叠到馅料上，将另一侧折叠到填充物的顶部。\r\n用冷水刷短端，然后将它们折叠到顶部，包住馅料。\r\n将糕点接缝面朝下放在烤盘上，并在顶部均匀地刷上剩余的炒鸡蛋。\r\n在预热的烤箱中烘烤直至呈金黄色（30 分钟）。\r\n将糕点斜切成 1.5 英寸长的块，作为开胃菜或配汤。"},{"id":"53292","n":"Piernik (Polish gingerbread)","a":"Polish","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/kwmdk41764120884.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SGkMAlrTu6g","i":[["Unsalted Butter","140g"],["Clear Honey","300g"],["Brown Sugar","100g"],["Self-raising Flour","375g"],["Ground Ginger","3 tsp"],["Ground Cinnamon","1 tsp"],["Ground Clove","1/2 teaspoon"],["Ground Nutmeg","1/4 tsp"],["Pepper","1/4 tsp"],["Egg","3 Large"],["Plum Jam","200g"],["Double Cream","225ml"],["Dark Chocolate","140g"],["Clear Honey","3  tablespoons"]],"s":"Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3. Grease and line the base and sides of a deep 20cm cake tin with baking parchment. Put the honey, sugar and butter in a medium saucepan and cook over a medium heat until fully melted. Remove from the heat and allow to cool. Put the flour and spices in a large bowl and mix everything together.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nOnce the liquid ingredients have cooled, whisk in the eggs. Pour over the dry ingredients, whisking them together to form a smooth batter – be careful not to overmix as this can lead to a dry cake. Pour into the prepared tin and bake for 50-55 mins or until risen and a skewer inserted into the middle of the cake comes out clean. Allow the cake to cool in the pan for 20 mins before turning out onto a wire rack to cool completely.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nOnce cooled, use a large serrated knife to slice the cake into 3 layers. Spread the jam across the 2 bottom cake layers, then reassemble the cake and set aside while you make the glaze. Put the cream, chocolate and honey in a medium pan and cook over a low-medium heat until the chocolate is melted and you have a smooth, pourable mixture. Put the cake on a wire rack set over a parchment-lined baking tray and pour over the glaze, making sure to cover the entire cake. Use a fish slice to carefully transfer the cake to a serving plate and allow the glaze to set. To decorate, dust with a little edible gold powder, if you like. Uniced, this cake will keep for up to 5 days. Once iced, enjoy within 3 days – just keep in the fridge, but remove before serving and eat at room temperature.","z":"将烤箱加热至 160C/140C 风扇/燃气 3. 在 20 厘米深的蛋糕罐的底部和侧面涂上油脂并铺上烘焙羊皮纸。将蜂蜜、糖和黄油放入中型平底锅中，用中火煮至完全融化。从火上移开并冷却。将面粉和香料放入一个大碗中，然后将所有东西混合在一起。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n液体成分冷却后，加入鸡蛋搅拌。倒在干原料上，搅拌在一起形成光滑的面糊——小心不要过度混合，因为这会导致蛋糕变干。倒入准备好的烤盘中，烘烤 50-55 分钟，或直至蛋糕膨胀，用叉子插入蛋糕中间，取出时是干净的。让蛋糕在锅中冷却 20 分钟，然后放在金属架上完全冷却。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n冷却后，用大锯齿刀将蛋糕切成三层。将果酱涂在底部的两层蛋糕上，然后重新组装蛋糕并放在一边，同时制作釉料。将奶油、巧克力和蜂蜜放入中型平底锅中，用中低火烹饪，直至巧克力融化，形成光滑、可倾倒的混合物。将蛋糕放在铺有羊皮纸的烤盘上的金属架上，然后倒在釉料上，确保覆盖整个蛋糕。用鱼片小心地将蛋糕转移到盘子上，让釉料凝固。如果您愿意，可以撒上少许食用金粉进行装饰。统一后，这款蛋糕最多可保存 5 天。冰镇后，请在 3 天内享用——只需放入冰箱即可，但食用前取出并在室温下食用。"},{"id":"53019","n":"Pierogi (Polish Dumplings)","a":"Polish","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/45xxr21593348847.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lyqDmUroZrI","i":[["Butter","2 tbs"],["Chopped Onion","1/3 cup"],["Sauerkraut","1 1/2 cups"],["Butter","3 tbs"],["Chopped Onion","1/2 cup"],["Potatoes","2 cups"],["Eggs","3"],["Sour Cream","1 pot"],["Flour","3 cups"],["Salt","1/4 tsp"],["Baking Powder","1 tbs"]],"s":"To prepare the sauerkraut filling, melt the butter in a skillet over medium heat. Stir in the onion, and cook until translucent, about 5 minutes. Add the drained sauerkraut and cook for an additional 5 minutes. Season to taste with salt and pepper, then remove to a plate to cool.\r\n\r\nFor the mashed potato filling, melt the butter in a skillet over medium heat. Stir in the onion, and cook until translucent, about 5 minutes. Stir into the mashed potatoes, and season with salt and white pepper.\r\n\r\nTo make the dough, beat together the eggs and sour cream until smooth. Sift together the flour, salt, and baking powder; stir into the sour cream mixture until dough comes together. Knead the dough on a lightly floured surface until firm and smooth. Divide the dough in half, then roll out one half to 1/8 inch thickness. Cut into 3 inch rounds using a biscuit cutter.\r\n\r\nPlace a small spoonful of the mashed potato filling into the center of each round. Moisten the edges with water, fold over, and press together with a fork to seal. Repeat procedure with the remaining dough and the sauerkraut filling.\r\n\r\nBring a large pot of lightly salted water to a boil. Add perogies and cook for 3 to 5 minutes or until pierogi float to the top. Remove with a slotted spoon.","z":"准备酸菜馅料时，将黄油放入煎锅中，用中火融化。拌入洋葱，煮至半透明，约 5 分钟。加入沥干的酸菜，再煮 5 分钟。用盐和胡椒调味，然后移至盘中冷却。\r\n\r\n对于土豆泥馅料，将黄油放入煎锅中，用中火融化。拌入洋葱，煮至半透明，约 5 分钟。拌入土豆泥，用盐和白胡椒调味。\r\n\r\n制作面团时，将鸡蛋和酸奶油搅拌均匀。将面粉、盐和泡打粉一起过筛；搅拌至酸奶油混合物中，直至面团混合在一起。将面团放在撒有少许面粉的表面上揉捏，直至坚硬光滑。将面团分成两半，然后将其中一半擀成 1/8 英寸厚。用饼干切刀切成3英寸的圆形。\r\n\r\n将一小勺土豆泥馅料放入每个圆形的中心。用水润湿边缘，折叠起来，然后用叉子压在一起密封。对剩余的面团和酸菜馅重复此过程。\r\n\r\n将一大锅淡盐水煮沸。加入饺子并煮 3 至 5 分钟或直至饺子浮到顶部。用有槽勺取出。"},{"id":"53293","n":"Pistachio cake","a":"Polish","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/xvgpng1764121726.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ACpikfieDP0","i":[["Butter","250g"],["Pistachio","200g"],["Plain Flour","80g"],["Baking Powder","1 tsp"],["Caster Sugar","225g"],["Egg","4"],["Vanilla Extract","1 tsp"],["Icing Sugar","100g"],["Mascarpone","250g"],["Double Cream","200ml"],["Pistachio Paste","100g"],["Raspberries","400g"],["Unwaxed Lime","1"]],"s":"Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Butter and line a 23cm springform cake tin. Tip 150g of the pistachios into a food processor and blitz until finely ground. Tip into a bowl and mix in the flour, baking powder and pinch of salt. Beat the butter and sugar in a separate bowl until fluffy and pale, around 5 mins. Crack in the eggs one at a time, beating well for 1 min after each addition, until they have all been added. Beat in the vanilla, then fold in the flour mixture gently. Carefully spoon into the prepared tin and bake for 35-40 mins until a skewer inserted into the middle comes out clean. Set aside to cool completely on a wire rack in the tin.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nMeanwhile, sift the icing sugar into a bowl, then tip in the mascarpone, double cream and pistachio paste. Beat until well combined, then set aside in the fridge for 20-30 mins to thicken to a spooning consistency.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nCut the cooled cake in half horizontally using a serrated knife, so you have two layers. Put the bottom layer on a plate or cake stand and spread over a generous spoonful of the pistachio cream. Top with a generous handful of the raspberries so the cake is covered. Top with the other sponge half, then cover the top and sides of the cake with the remaining cream. Scatter over the last of the raspberries, the remaining pistachios and the lime zest to serve. Will keep chilled in an airtight container for two days.","z":"将烤箱加热至 180C/160C 风扇/燃气 4. 在 23 厘米弹簧蛋糕罐中涂上黄油并铺上衬里。将 150 克开心果放入食品加工机中，快速搅拌直至磨细。倒入碗中，加入面粉、泡打粉和少许盐。将黄油和糖放入另一个碗中，搅拌约 5 分钟，直至变得蓬松且苍白。一次打入一个鸡蛋，每次添加后充分搅拌 1 分钟，直至全部添加完毕。加入香草精，然后轻轻拌入面粉混合物。小心地将勺子放入准备好的罐子中，烘烤 35-40 分钟，直到用叉子插入中间，取出时是干净的。放在罐中的金属架上完全冷却。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n与此同时，将糖粉筛入碗中，然后倒入马斯卡彭奶酪、双层奶油和开心果酱。搅拌直至充分混合，然后在冰箱中放置 20-30 分钟，使其变稠至勺状稠度。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n用锯齿刀将冷却的蛋糕水平切成两半，这样就有两层了。将底层放在盘子或蛋糕架上，然后涂上一大勺开心果奶油。上面放上一大把覆盆子，这样蛋糕就被覆盖了。在上面放上另一半海绵，然后用剩余的奶油覆盖蛋糕的顶部和侧面。撒上最后的覆盆子、剩余的开心果和酸橙皮即可食用。将在密封容器中冷藏两天。"},{"id":"53295","n":"Polish chocolate & walnut cake","a":"Polish","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/e8ihjp1764123021.jpg","y":"","i":[["Plain Flour","150g"],["Coco Sugar","50g"],["Egg","8"],["Caster Sugar","200g"],["Egg White","5"],["Caster Sugar","200g"],["Walnuts","250g"],["Plain Flour","1 tablespoon"],["Potato Starch","1 tablespoon"],["Double Cream","100g"],["Chocolate Chips","100g"]],"s":"Heat the oven to 170C/150C fan/gas 3½. Line a 30 x 22cm shallow baking tin with baking parchment. Sift the flour and mix it with cocoa, then set aside. Beat the egg whites until stiff, then add the sugar to them in small batches. Add the egg yolks, one by one, whisking constantly. Tip in the flour mixture and gently fold everything together with a spatula. Pour the prepared batter into the lined tin and bake for 35 mins. Cool for 5 mins, remove from the tin and re-line the tin with baking parchment.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nTo make the meringue, whisk the whites until stiff, then gradually whisk in the sugar, one tablespoon at a time. When you have a stiff and shiny meringue, fold in the finely chopped walnuts, flour and startch. Spread the mixture into the re-lined tin and cook for 40 mins on the same heat. Remove from the oven and leave to cool.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nFor the chocolate glaze, heat the cream over low heat, then remove from the heat, pour the chopped chocolate into it and mix it until it melts and becomes shiny.\r\n\r\nstep 4\r\nCut the cooled chocolate sponge cake and meringue into two layers. Put the nut meringue on top of the bottom layer of sponge and sprinkle on some of the reserved walnuts. Add another layer of meringue and then the upper layer of chocolate sponge cake and cover the top with chocolate glaze. Decorate with walnuts. Put the finished cake in the fridge for 1-2 hrs before serving.","z":"将烤箱加热至 170C/150C 风扇/燃气 3½。在 30 x 22 厘米浅烤盘上铺上烘焙羊皮纸。筛入面粉并与可可粉混合，然后放在一边。将蛋白打至硬性发泡，然后分小批加入糖。一个接一个地加入蛋黄，不断搅拌。倒入面粉混合物，然后用抹刀轻轻地将所有东西折叠在一起。将准备好的面糊倒入铺有衬里的烤盘中，烘烤35分钟。冷却 5 分钟，从罐中取出，并在罐中重新铺上烘焙羊皮纸。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n制作蛋白酥皮时，将蛋白搅拌至变硬，然后逐渐加入糖，一次一汤匙。当你得到又硬又闪亮的蛋白酥皮时，拌入切碎的核桃、面粉和淀粉。将混合物倒入重新铺好衬里的罐子中，用同样的火煮 40 分钟。从烤箱中取出并冷却。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n对于巧克力釉，用小火加热奶油，然后离火，将切碎的巧克力倒入其中并混合直至融化并变得有光泽。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n将冷却的巧克力海绵蛋糕和蛋白酥皮切成两层。将坚果酥皮放在最底层的海绵上，撒上一些保留的核桃。添加另一层蛋白酥皮，然后添加上层巧克力海绵蛋糕，并在顶部覆盖巧克力釉。用核桃装饰。将做好的蛋糕放入冰箱冷藏 1-2 小时即可食用。"},{"id":"53298","n":"Polish doughnuts (Pączki)","a":"Polish","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/x6jqog1764359857.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=17jL5nZrgPw","i":[["Yeast","10g"],["Caster Sugar","1 tsp"],["Flour","1 tablespoon"],["Milk","125ml"],["Egg Yolks","7"],["Sugar","15g"],["Caster Sugar","10g"],["Vanilla Extract","1 tsp"],["Flour","500g"],["Double Cream","200ml"],["Butter","15g"],["Jam","125ml"],["Ground Almonds","10g"],["Oil","For frying"],["Icing Sugar","75g"],["Lemon","Juice of 1/2"],["Almond Essence","Dash"],["Almonds","50g"]],"s":"step 1\r\nTo make the leaven, mix the yeast with the sugar and flour, and stir in the warm milk. Set aside in a warm place for 30 minutes.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nFor the dough, put egg yolks into a heatproof bowl and add the sugar and vanilla sugar. Set the bowl over a pan of simmering water and whisk until smooth and thick.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nSift the flour into the bowl of a stand mixer, add the beaten yolks and the warm cream, mix thoroughly, then add a pinch of salt and the leaven. Bring together to make a dough and knead for 10 minutes (or 15-20 if doing this by hand).\r\n\r\nstep 4\r\nWhen the dough stops sticking to your hands, pour in the cooled melted butter and knead for a few more minutes. Cover with a cloth and leave in a warm place to rise for at least 1 hr-1 hr 30 mins.\r\n\r\nstep 5\r\nMix the jam with the ground almonds and spoon into a piping bag or jam syringe. Divide the dough into 16 pieces and shape them into doughnuts. Cover and leave to rise for 30 mins.\r\n\r\nstep 6\r\nFill a deep pan or a deep fat fryer one third full of oil or melted lard and heat it until it is 180C – if you don’t have a thermometer, drop in a small chunk of bread. The oil is ready when it browns in about 30 secs. Add the doughnuts and fry, turning them once for about 1-2 mins on each side (a thin lighter ring should form in the middle). After removing, drain the doughnuts of excess fat on some kitchen paper.","z":"步骤1\r\n制作发酵剂时，将酵母与糖和面粉混合，然后加入温牛奶搅拌。放在温暖的地方30分钟。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n对于面团，将蛋黄放入耐热碗中，加入糖和香草糖。将碗放在一锅沸水中，搅拌直至光滑且浓稠。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n将面粉筛入立式搅拌机的碗中，加入打好的蛋黄和温热的奶油，充分混合，然后加入少许盐和酵母。将它们放在一起制成面团并揉捏 10 分钟（如果用手揉捏，则揉捏 15-20 分钟）。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n当面团不再粘在手上时，倒入冷却的融化黄油，再揉几分钟。用布盖住，放在温暖的地方发酵至少 1 小时至 1 小时 30 分钟。\r\n\r\n步骤5\r\n将果酱与杏仁粉混合，然后用勺子放入裱花袋或果酱注射器中。将面团分成16份，然后做成甜甜圈。盖上盖子，醒发 30 分钟。\r\n\r\n步骤6\r\n在深锅或深油炸锅中倒入三分之一的油或融化的猪油，加热至 180°C - 如果没有温度计，可放入一小块面包。大约 30 秒后油变成褐色，油就准备好了。加入甜甜圈并煎炸，每面翻转一次约 1-2 分钟（中间应形成较薄的较亮的环）。取出后，用厨房纸吸干甜甜圈多余的脂肪。"},{"id":"53299","n":"Polish patties (kotlety)","a":"Polish","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/vvn5f71764360273.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/0XrToCi-U1c","i":[["Bread Rolls","1"],["Milk","120ml"],["Onion","1 chopped"],["Vegetable Oil","100 ml"],["Ground Beef","500g"],["Egg","1"],["Garlic Clove","1"],["Marjoram","Pinch"],["Breadcrumbs","75g"]],"s":"step 1\r\nSoak the bread roll in the milk so it softens completely. Meanwhile, fry the onion in the oil for around 8 mins or until soft and golden. Add the fried onion to the beef mince along with the egg, garlic, marjoram and some seasoning. Squeeze the excess milk from the bread roll and add it to the mince mixture. Mix everything together and season well.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nDivide the meat into 8 patties. Tip the dried breadcrumbs into a shallow bowl and coat the patties in it, all over. Heat some oil in a deep frying pan and fry the patties in batches on both sides until browned and cooked through, about 6-7 mins on each side.","z":"步骤1\r\n将面包卷浸泡在牛奶中，使其完全软化。与此同时，将洋葱放入油中煎约 8 分钟或直至洋葱变软并呈金黄色。将炸洋葱与鸡蛋、大蒜、马郁兰和一些调味料一起加入牛肉末中。从面包卷中挤出多余的牛奶，并将其添加到肉末混合物中。将所有东西混合在一起并调味。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将肉分成8块。将干面包屑倒入一个浅碗中，然后将肉饼全部裹在里面。在深煎锅中加热一些油，将肉饼分批煎至两面焦黄并熟透，每面约6-7分钟。"},{"id":"53022","n":"Polskie Nalesniki (Polish Pancakes)","a":"Polish","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/58bkyo1593350017.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EZS4ev2crHc","i":[["Flour","1 cup"],["Eggs","2"],["Milk","1 cup"],["Water","3/4 cup"],["Salt","Pinch"],["Sugar","1 tsp"],["Butter","3 tbs"]],"s":"Add flour, eggs, milk, water, and salt in a large bowl then mix with a hand mixer until you have a smooth, lump-free batter.\r\nAt this point, mix in the butter or the vegetable oil. Alternatively, you can use them to grease the pan before frying each pancake.\r\nHeat a non-stick pan over medium heat, then pour in the batter, swirling the pan to help it spread.\r\nWhen the pancake starts pulling away a bit from the sides, and the top is no longer wet, flip it and cook shortly on the other side as well.\r\nTransfer to a plate. Cook the remaining batter until all used up.\r\nServe warm, with the filling of your choice.","z":"将面粉、鸡蛋、牛奶、水和盐放入一个大碗中，然后用手动搅拌机搅拌，直至形成光滑、无块状的面糊。\r\n此时，加入黄油或植物油。或者，您可以在煎每个煎饼之前用它们给锅涂油。\r\n用中火加热不粘锅，然后倒入面糊，旋转锅以帮助其铺开。\r\n当煎饼开始从侧面拉开一点，并且顶部不再湿时，将其翻转并在另一侧也煮一会儿。\r\n转移到盘子上。将剩余的面糊煮至全部用完。\r\n趁热享用，搭配您选择的馅料。"},{"id":"53297","n":"Pomegranate salad","a":"Polish","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/fqpqml1764359125.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wTqashUAid8","i":[["Olive Oil","60 ml"],["Lemon Juice","2 tablespoons"],["Honey","1 tablespoon"],["Thyme","2 sprigs"],["Baby Lettuce Leaves","100g"],["Cherry Tomatoes","250g"],["Spring Onions","3 chopped"],["Red Chilli","1 chopped"],["Pomegranate","1"],["Feta","50g"]],"s":"step 1\r\nCombine the olive oil, lemon juice, honey and thyme leaves in a large bowl. Season well, then tip in the lettuce, tomatoes, spring onions and chilli, and toss to combine.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nScoop out the pomegranate seeds over a bowl and remove any white membrane. Arrange the dressed salad on a platter, then scatter over the pomegranate seeds and feta.","z":"步骤1\r\n将橄榄油、柠檬汁、蜂蜜和百里香叶放入一个大碗中。充分调味，然后加入生菜、西红柿、葱和辣椒，搅拌均匀。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将石榴籽舀到碗里，除去白色的薄膜。将拌好的沙拉放在盘子上，然后撒上石榴籽和羊乳酪。"},{"id":"53301","n":"Pork & sauerkraut goulash","a":"Polish","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/cyuhwp1764362103.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=91FM8lHEGbQ","i":[["Lard","3  tablespoons"],["Onion","4 Chopped"],["Cumin Seeds","1 tablespoon"],["Pork Shoulder","800g"],["Garlic","4 Cloves Crushed"],["Plain Flour","2 tablespoons"],["Paprika","2 tablespoons"],["Beef Stock","1 1/2 L"],["Bay Leaves","4"],["White Sauerkraut","400g"],["Whipping Cream","200ml"],["Sour Cream","4 tablespoons"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat the lard in a saucepan over a medium heat and fry the finely chopped onion until golden, around 5-8 mins. Tip in the cumin and pork, and fry for 10 mins all over until browned. Add the garlic, season well and scatter over the flour. Cook for about a minute, then add the paprika and cook for 1 min more.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nPour in half of the stock, add the bay leaves, and simmer with the lid on over a low heat for 30 mins.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nAdd the sauerkraut, remaining stock and a drizzle of the sauerkraut pickling juices. Simmer with the lid for 30 mins, stirring occasionally, until the meat is tender. Stir in the cream and simmer for 5 mins to combine the flavours. Season to taste, the serve garnished with a spoonful of soured cream.\r\n\r\nThis recipe has been provided by Apetit Online and not been re-tested by us.","z":"步骤1\r\n在平底锅中用中火加热猪油，将切碎的洋葱煎至金黄色，大约需要 5-8 分钟。倒入孜然和猪肉，煎10分钟直至变成棕色。加入大蒜，调味均匀，撒在面粉上。煮约一分钟，然后加入辣椒粉，再煮一分钟。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n倒入一半高汤，加入月桂叶，盖上盖子小火煮30分钟。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n加入酸菜、剩余的高汤和少许酸菜腌汁。盖上盖子煮30分钟，偶尔搅拌，直到肉变软。拌入奶油，小火煮 5 分钟，使味道混合。调味，用一勺酸奶油装饰。\r\n\r\n此食谱由 Apetit Online 提供，未经我们重新测试。"},{"id":"53306","n":"Pork rib bortsch","a":"Polish","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/om5hsl1764364721.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SqRP4xYS6wA","i":[["Pork Back Ribs","1kg"],["Bay Leaves","2"],["Dried white beans","1 tablespoon"],["Carrots","1 large"],["Onion","1 sliced"],["Garlic Clove","3 sliced thinly"],["Red Pepper","1 chopped"],["Red Chilli","2 chopped"],["Beetroot","2"],["Potatoes","3 chopped"],["Tomato Puree","3  tablespoons"],["White Cabbage","1/2"],["Parsley","Handful"],["Dill","Handful"],["Sour Cream","300g"]],"s":"step 1\r\nCut the meat into large pieces, put in your largest saucepan and cover with 5 litres water. Bring to the boil over a high heat, skimming away any foam that rises to the surface. Add the bay leaves. Season. Turn the heat down to a simmer and cook for 1 hr, or until the meat is soft and falls off the bone. Add the beans if using dried.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nTurn the heat up. Bring back to the boil, then reduce the heat and simmer for another 20 mins – the beans should still be slightly raw. Add the carrots, onions, garlic and pepper. Stir well, then add the chillies, if using. Cook for 15 mins more.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nStir in the beetroot and cook for 10 mins before adding the potatoes. After 15 mins, add the tomato purée to taste and beans, if using canned, and bring to the boil. Cook for 5 mins, add the cabbage and cook for 5 mins more. Season, then garnish with the parsley and dill. Turn off the heat and leave to stand for 5 mins. Serve with soured cream on the side.","z":"步骤1\r\n将肉切成大块，放入最大的平底锅中，并倒入 5 升水。用高温煮沸，撇去浮在表面的泡沫。添加月桂叶。季节。将火调小，煮 1 小时，或直至肉变软并从骨头上脱落。如果使用干豆，请添加豆子。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n把火调高。重新煮沸，然后调小火，再煮 20 分钟——豆子应该还是有点生的。加入胡萝卜、洋葱、大蒜和胡椒。搅拌均匀，然后添加辣椒（如果使用）。再煮15分钟。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n加入甜菜根，煮 10 分钟，然后加入土豆。 15 分钟后，加入番茄泥和豆子（如果使用罐装豆子），煮沸。煮5分钟，加入卷心菜，再煮5分钟。调味，然后用欧芹和莳萝装饰。关掉火，静置 5 分钟。与酸奶油一起食用。"},{"id":"53303","n":"Raspberry mousse","a":"Polish","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/v5jrnn1764362830.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YbFsvvwcSCw","i":[["Gelatine Leafs","2"],["Raspberries","350g"],["Caster Sugar","60g"],["Lemon","Juice of 1"],["Whipping Cream","500ml"]],"s":"step 1\r\nPut the gelatine leaves in a bowl, cover with warm water and leave to soak for 5 mins. Drain and squeeze out any excess water.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nTip the raspberries into a pan over a medium-low heat along with the sugar and lemon juice. Cook for 5-6 mins until the berries have completely broken down. Push the mixture through a sieve set over a bowl, discarding the seeds. Stir in the gelatine leaves until dissolved (if they don’t dissolve, pour the mixture into a clean saucepan and heat gently until dissolved). Set aside to cool for 15 mins.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nWhip the cream to soft peaks using an electric whisk, then gently fold this into the raspberry mixture. Spoon into the ramekins or moulds and chill overnight, or for at least 6 hrs. Serve with raspberries scattered over the top.","z":"步骤1\r\n将吉利丁片放入碗中，倒入温水，浸泡 5 分钟。沥干并挤出多余的水。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将覆盆子与糖和柠檬汁一起倒入锅中，用中低火加热。煮 5-6 分钟，直至浆果完全分解。将混合物推过碗上的筛子，丢弃种子。加入明胶叶搅拌直至溶解（如果不溶解，将混合物倒入干净的平底锅中，轻轻加热直至溶解）。搁置冷却 15 分钟。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n使用电动搅拌器将奶油搅打至软峰，然后轻轻地将其拌入覆盆子混合物中。用勺子舀入模子或模具中，冷藏过夜或至少 6 小时。与撒在上面的覆盆子一起食用。"},{"id":"53024","n":"Rogaliki (Polish Croissant Cookies)","a":"Polish","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/7mxnzz1593350801.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VAR10T9mfhU","i":[["Butter","1 cup"],["Egg Yolks","3"],["Cream Cheese","8 oz"],["Baking Powder","1 tsp"],["Flour","3 cups"],["Jam","1 Jar"]],"s":"In a medium bowl mix egg yolks, philly cheese and baking powder using a hand held mixer. Carefully start adding the flour. When the mixture will not be mixing well, and will look like wood chips, put away the blending mixer and using your hands knead the dough.\r\nCreate a roll and cover in foil and freeze for 15 minutes. At this time preheat the oven to 375.\r\nTake the dough out and separate into two. Roll and cut out 3 inch trangles.\r\nMake as many as you can and on centre of each put a small spoon of jam. Roll them into a croissant shape.\r\nPlace the croissants onto a greased cookie sheet, and bake for 10-12 minutes or until golden.\r\nRepeat with the rest of the dough.\r\nWhen you take them out, put aside and sprinkle with powdered sugar on top.\r\nThis makes about 3 batches of 20 cookies each.\r\nTotal count about 60 cookies.","z":"在一个中等大小的碗中，用手持式搅拌机混合蛋黄、费城奶酪和泡打粉。小心地开始添加面粉。当混合物搅拌不好并且看起来像木片时，请将搅拌机收起并用手揉捏面团。\r\n卷成一个卷，盖上箔纸，冷冻 15 分钟。此时烤箱预热至375度。\r\n将面团取出，分成两份。卷起并剪出3英寸的三角形。\r\n尽可能多地制作，并在每个的中心放一小勺果酱。将它们卷成牛角面包形状。\r\n将牛角面包放在涂有油脂的烤盘上，烘烤 10-12 分钟或直至呈金黄色。\r\n对其余的面团重复上述步骤。\r\n当你把它们拿出来时，放在一边并在上面撒上糖粉。\r\n这样大约可以制作 3 批，每批 20 块饼干。\r\n总共约 60 块饼干。"},{"id":"53020","n":"Rosol (Polish Chicken Soup)","a":"Polish","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/lx1kkj1593349302.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AU60fxyxXGw","i":[["Chicken Legs","4 Chopped"],["Onions","2 large"],["Carrots","5 chopped"],["Leek","1 chopped"],["Celery","1 small"],["Cabbage","1/4"],["Cloves","1 whole"],["Allspice","1tsp"],["Bay Leaf","2"],["Parsley","4 sprigs"],["Dill","4 sprigs"],["Pepper","1 tsp"],["Salt","1 tbs"]],"s":"Add chicken to a large Dutch oven or stock pot \r\nCover with water\r\nBring to a boil and simmer for 2 to 2 1/2 hours, skimming any impurities off the top to insure a clear broth\r\nIf your pot is big enough, add the vegetables and spices for the last hour of the cooking time\r\nMy Dutch oven wasn’t big enough to hold everything, just the chicken and other bones filled the pot, so I cooked the meat/bones for the full cooking time, then removed them, and cooked the vegetables and spices separately\r\nStrain everything out of the broth\r\nBone the chicken, pulling the meat into large chunks\r\nSlice the carrots\r\nReturn the chicken and carrots to the broth\r\nCook noodles according to package instructions if you’re using them\r\nAdd noodles to bowl and then top with hot soup","z":"将鸡肉放入大型荷兰烤箱或汤锅中 \r\n用水盖住\r\n煮沸并小火煮 2 至 2 1/2 小时，撇去顶部的杂质以确保肉汤清澈\r\n如果你的锅足够大，请在烹饪时间的最后一个小时添加蔬菜和香料\r\n我的荷兰烤箱不够大，无法容纳所有东西，只有鸡肉和其他骨头装满了锅，所以我将肉/骨头煮了整个烹饪时间，然后将它们取出，分别煮蔬菜和香料\r\n将肉汤中的所有东西滤出\r\n将鸡肉去骨，把肉切成大块\r\n将胡萝卜切片\r\n将鸡肉和胡萝卜放回肉汤中\r\n如果您使用面条，请按照包装说明煮面条\r\n将面条放入碗中，然后淋上热汤"},{"id":"53308","n":"Rye bread","a":"Polish","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/lmc6r51764365554.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bP7m7xx0GpM","i":[["Rye","200g"],["Strong white bread flour","200g"],["Yeast","10g"],["Salt","1/2 tsp"],["Honey","1 tablespoon"],["Caraway Seed","1 tsp"]],"s":"step 1\r\nTip the flours, yeast and salt into a bowl. In a jug, mix the honey with 250ml warm water, pour the liquid into the bowl and mix to form a dough. Rye flour can be quite dry and absorbs lots of water, if the dough looks too dry add more warm water until you have a soft dough Tip out onto your work surface and knead for 10 mins until smooth. Rye contains less gluten than white flour so the dough will not feel as springy as a conventional white loaf.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nPlace the dough in a well oiled bowl, cover with cling film and leave to rise in a warm place for 1-2 hrs, or until roughly doubled in size. Dust a 2lb/900g loaf tin with flour.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nTip the dough back onto your work surface and knead briefly to knock out any air bubbles. If using caraway seeds work these in to the dough. Shape into a smooth oval loaf and pop into your tin. Cover the tin with oiled cling film and leave to rise somewhere warm for a further 1 – 1.5 hr, or until doubled in size.\r\n\r\nstep 4\r\nHeat oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Remove the cling film and dust the surface of the loaf with rye flour. Slash a few incisions on an angle then bake for 30 mins until dark brown and hollow sounding when tapped. Transfer to a wire cooling rack and leave to cool for at least 20 mins before serving","z":"步骤1\r\n将面粉、酵母和盐倒入碗中。在壶中，将蜂蜜与 250 毫升温水混合，将液体倒入碗中，搅拌形成面团。黑麦面粉可能很干，会吸收大量水分，如果面团看起来太干，请添加更多温水，直到面团变软。将面团倒在工作面上，揉捏 10 分钟直至光滑。黑麦的面筋含量比白面粉少，因此面团不会像传统的白面包那样有弹性。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将面团放入抹了油的碗中，盖上保鲜膜，放在温暖的地方发酵 1-2 小时，或直至尺寸大约增加一倍。在 2 磅/900 克的面包罐上撒上面粉。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n将面团倒回工作台上并短暂揉捏以消除气泡。如果使用香菜籽，请将它们放入面团中。形成光滑的椭圆形面包并放入罐中。用涂了油的保鲜膜盖住罐头，并在温暖的地方再发酵 1 – 1.5 小时，或直至尺寸增加一倍。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n将烤箱加热至 220C/200C 风扇/燃气 7. 取下保鲜膜，并在面包表面撒上黑麦面粉。以一定角度切几个切口，然后烘烤 30 分钟，直至呈深棕色，敲击时发出中空的声音。转移到金属丝冷却架上，冷却至少 20 分钟，然后食用"},{"id":"53296","n":"Sauerkraut pierogi","a":"Polish","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/ckbx1h1764123606.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eVWBJt2jaPU","i":[["Sunflower Oil","1 tablespoon"],["Shallots","2"],["Sauerkraut","150g"],["Hispi (sweetheart) Cabbage","150g"],["Egg","1 large"],["Vegetable Oil","1/2 tbs"],["Plain Flour","350g"],["Vegetable Oil","For frying"],["Shallots","2"],["Plain Flour","Dusting"],["Butter","45g"],["Sour Cream","60 ml"]],"s":"step 1\r\nFirst, make the crispy shallots. Heat the oil in a saucepan to 180C (a cube of bread will turn golden in 15 secs). Toss the shallots in a little flour and deep-fry for 1 min or until light golden and crispy. Drain on kitchen paper. Can be made up to two days before and kept in an airtight container.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nTo make the filling, heat the oil in a medium non-stick frying pan and gently fry the shallots for 10 mins until starting to turn golden.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nAdd the sauerkraut and cabbage, and cook for 5-10 mins until the cabbage has softened. Taste and add a little salt if under-seasoned, or sugar if stringent. Scrape into a bowl and leave to cool completely.\r\n\r\nstep 4\r\nTo make the dough, mix the eggs and oil with 125ml water, then gradually add in the flour, mixing well with your hands. Knead it on a well-floured surface until the dough stops sticking to your hands. You should end up with firm, elastic dough. Wrap it in cling film and rest in the fridge for at least 30 mins, or overnight.\r\n\r\nstep 5\r\nFlour your work surface generously. Roll out the dough to a 40cm circle or until the dough is as thick as £1 coin.\r\n\r\nstep 6\r\nUsing a 9cm cookie cutter, cut out discs in the dough – you should end up with about 25 discs. Do not throw away the off-cuts – we throw them in with the pierogi when boiling to minimise any waste.\r\n\r\nstep 7\r\nHave a well-floured tray ready. Put 1 tsp of the filling into the centre of each disc. In your hand, fold in half around the filling and seal to create half-moon shapes. Put them on the floured tray, making sure they don’t touch each other.\r\n\r\nstep 8\r\nBring a large saucepan of salted water to the boil and carefully lower the pierogi in. Boil them for 2 mins or until they float to the top.\r\n\r\nstep 9\r\nDrain and serve with a knob of butter and some soured cream. Finish by sprinkling the crispy shallots on top to serve.","z":"步骤1\r\n首先，制作脆葱。将平底锅中的油加热至 180°C（一块面包将在 15 秒内变成金黄色）。将青葱拌入少许面粉中，炸 1 分钟或直至呈浅金黄色。用厨房纸吸干水分。最多可在两天前配制并保存在密封容器中。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n制作馅料时，在中号不粘煎锅中加热油，然后将青葱轻轻煎 10 分钟，直至开始变成金黄色。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n加入酸菜和卷心菜，煮5-10分钟，直到卷心菜变软。尝一尝，如果调味不足，加一点盐，如果严格的话，加糖。刮入碗中并使其完全冷却。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n制作面团时，将鸡蛋和油与125毫升水混合，然后逐渐加入面粉，用手搅拌均匀。将其放在撒有面粉的表面上揉捏，直到面团不再粘在手上。最后你应该得到坚硬、有弹性的面团。用保鲜膜包起来，放入冰箱冷藏至少 30 分钟，或过夜。\r\n\r\n步骤5\r\n在工作表面撒上大量面粉。将面团擀成 40 厘米的圆形，或直至面团厚度为 1 英镑硬币。\r\n\r\n步骤6\r\n使用 9 厘米的饼干切割机，在面团中切出圆片 - 最终应该得到大约 25 个圆片。不要扔掉边角料——我们在煮饺子时将它们与饺子一起扔掉，以最大程度地减少浪费。\r\n\r\n步骤7\r\n准备好撒满面粉的托盘。将 1 茶匙馅料放入每个圆盘的中心。在手中，将馅料周围对折并密封，形成半月形。将它们放在撒了面粉的托盘上，确保它们不会互相接触。\r\n\r\n步骤8\r\n将一大锅盐水烧开，小心地放入饺子。煮 2 分钟或直到它们浮到顶部。\r\n\r\n步骤9\r\n沥干水分，与一小块黄油和一些酸奶油一起食用。最后撒上香脆的青葱即可上桌。"},{"id":"53023","n":"Sledz w Oleju (Polish Herrings)","a":"Polish","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/7ttta31593350374.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=v6I3GZlBkOM","i":[["Herring","8"],["Onion","1 sliced"],["Olive Oil","1/2 cup"],["Allspice","1 tsp"],["Pepper","1 tsp"],["Bay Leaf","1"]],"s":"Soak herring in cold water for at least 1 hour. If very salty, repeat, changing the water each time.\r\n\r\nDrain thoroughly and slice herring into bite-size pieces.\r\n\r\nPlace in a jar large enough to accommodate the pieces and cover with oil, allspice, peppercorns, and bay leaf. Close the jar.\r\n\r\nRefrigerate for 2 to 3 days before eating. This will keep refrigerated up to 2 weeks.\r\n\r\nServe with finely chopped onion or onion slices, lemon, and parsley or dill.","z":"将鲱鱼浸泡在冷水中至少1小时。如果很咸，重复一次，每次换水。\r\n\r\n彻底沥干鲱鱼，切成一口大小的块。\r\n\r\n放入一个足以容纳碎片的罐子中，并用油、五香粉、花椒和月桂叶覆盖。关闭罐子。\r\n\r\n食用前冷藏2至3天。这将冷藏最多 2 周。\r\n\r\n与切碎的洋葱或洋葱片、柠檬、欧芹或莳萝一起食用。"},{"id":"53302","n":"Slow-roasted ham with lemon, garlic & sage","a":"Polish","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/w36ets1764362474.jpg","y":"","i":[["Garlic","5 chopped cloves"],["Lemon","Zest of 1"],["Salt","15g"],["Black Pepper","10g"],["Vegetable Oil","50 ml"],["Pork Shoulder","2kg"],["Dry White Wine","500ml"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Bash the garlic, sage, lemon zest, salt and pepper together using a pestle and mortar until the mixture becomes a paste. Stir in the oil, then spread the mixture over the pork shoulder, avoiding the skin on top. Score the skin using a sharp knife, then rub a large pinch of salt into the skin. Tie the pork together using kitchen string.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nLine a large baking tray with a double layer of foil and put the pork on top, skin-side up. Bring the sides of the foil up around the pork to create a parcel, then pour the wine into the tray around the sides. Transfer to the oven and reduce the temperature to 140C/120C fan/gas 1. Roast for 4-5 hrs, or until a meat thermometer inserted into the thickest part of the pork reads 70C.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nTurn the oven up to 240C/220C fan/gas 9. Carefully spoon the pork roasting juices from the pan into a saucepan and cook over a medium heat for 10-15 mins, or until reduced by a third. Season to taste.\r\n\r\nstep 4\r\nMeanwhile, arrange the foil around the meat so only the skin is exposed, then return to the oven for 10-15 mins until the skin is puffed up and browned all over. Leave to rest for 20 mins before slicing. Serve with the sauce drizzled over.","z":"步骤1\r\n将烤箱加热至 200C/180C 风扇/燃气 6. 用杵和研钵将大蒜、鼠尾草、柠檬皮、盐和胡椒一起捣碎，直至混合物变成糊状。拌入油，然后将混合物涂在猪肩上，避开上面的皮肤。用锋利的刀在皮肤上划痕，然后将一大撮盐擦到皮肤上。用厨房绳子把猪肉绑在一起。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n在一个大烤盘上铺上双层箔纸，将猪肉放在上面，带皮的一面朝上。将箔纸的侧面放在猪肉周围，形成一个包裹，然后将酒倒入侧面周围的托盘中。转移到烤箱，将温度降至 140C/120C 风扇/燃气 1. 烤 4-5 小时，或直至插入猪肉最厚部分的肉类温度计读数为 70C。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n将烤箱温度调至 240C/220C 风扇/燃气 9. 小心地将烤猪肉汁从锅中舀入平底锅中，中火煮 10-15 分钟，或直至减少三分之一。调味。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n同时，将箔纸放在肉周围，只露出皮肤，然后返回烤箱烤 10-15 分钟，直到皮肤膨胀并全身变成棕色。切片前静置 20 分钟。淋上酱汁即可食用。"},{"id":"53294","n":"Zapiekanki","a":"Polish","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/72lmpt1764122511.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uely-neGHLM","i":[["Baguette","2"],["Butter","1 tablespoon"],["Vegetable Oil","2 tsp"],["Onion","1 chopped"],["Mushrooms","300g"],["Garlic","1 clove"],["Mayonnaise","1 tablespoon"],["Cheddar Cheese","50g"],["Ham","75g"],["Polish Kabanos","75g"],["Mozzarella","50g"],["Dill","2"],["Chives","1 tablespoon"],["Tomato Ketchup","Drizzle"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Bake the baguettes on a baking tray for 8-10 mins, then leave to cool.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nHeat 2 tsp of the butter and 1 tsp of the oil in a pan over a low heat and cook the chopped onion for 5 mins until soft. Stir in the mushrooms, turn the heat to medium and cook for 5-10 mins more until the veg is soft and the mushroom liquid has evaporated. Stir in the garlic and cook for 1-2 mins until soft. Season, then stir in the mayonnaise and remove from the heat.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nHalve the baguettes lengthways, then return to the baking tray, cut-side up and spread over the mushroom mixture, then sprinkle over the cheddar, ham, kabanos and mozzarella. Bake for 8-10 mins, or until the cheese has melted and turned golden.\r\n\r\nstep 4\r\nMeanwhile, heat the remaining butter and oil in a pan over a medium heat and fry the sliced onions for 5 mins until golden and soft. Remove from the heat and set aside. Once the pizzas are cooked, top with the caramelised onions, dill pickles (if using), the chives and a zig-zag drizzle of ketchup.","z":"步骤1\r\n将烤箱加热至 200C/180C 风扇/燃气 6. 将法棍面包放在烤盘上烘烤 8-10 分钟，然后冷却。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将 2 茶匙黄油和 1 茶匙油放入锅中，用小火加热，将切碎的洋葱煮 5 分钟直至变软。加入蘑菇，将火调至中火，再煮 5-10 分钟，直至蔬菜变软且蘑菇液蒸发。拌入大蒜，煮 1-2 分钟直至变软。调味，然后拌入蛋黄酱并离火。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n将法棍面包纵向切成两半，然后放回烤盘，切面朝上，铺在蘑菇混合物上，然后撒在切达干酪、火腿、卡巴诺奶酪和马苏里拉奶酪上。烘烤 8-10 分钟，或直至奶酪融化并变成金黄色。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n与此同时，将剩余的黄油和油放入平底锅中，用中火加热，将切好的洋葱煎 5 分钟，直至呈金黄色并变软。从火上移开并放在一边。披萨煮熟后，在上面放上焦糖洋葱、莳萝泡菜（如果使用的话）、韭菜和锯齿状的番茄酱。"},{"id":"53043","n":"Fish fofos","a":"Portuguese","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/a15wsa1614349126.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YXUZHK2PrV8","i":[["Haddock","600g"],["Potatoes","300g"],["Green Chilli","1 chopped"],["Coriander","3 tbs"],["Cumin Seeds","1 tsp"],["Pepper","1/2 tsp"],["Garlic","3 cloves"],["Ginger","2 pieces"],["Flour","2 tbs"],["Eggs","3"],["Breadcrumbs","75g"],["Vegetable Oil","For frying"]],"s":"STEP 1\r\n\r\nPut the fish into a lidded pan and pour over enough water to cover. Bring to a simmer and gently poach for 10 minutes over a low heat with the lid on. Drain and flake the fish.\r\n\r\nSTEP 2\r\n\r\nPut the fish, potato, green chilli, coriander, cumin, black pepper, garlic and ginger in a large bowl. Season, add the rice flour, mix well and break in 1 egg. Stir the mixture and divide into 15, then form into small logs. Break the remaining eggs into a bowl and whisk lightly. Put the breadcrumbs into another bowl. Dip each fofo in the beaten egg followed by the breadcrumb mixture. Chill for 20 minutes.\r\n\r\nSTEP 3\r\n\r\nHeat 1cm of oil in a large frying pan over a medium heat. Fry the fofos in batches for 2 minutes on each side, turning gently to get an even golden brown colour all over. Drain on kitchen paper and repeat with the remaining fofos.\r\n\r\nSTEP 4\r\n\r\nFor the onion salad, mix together the onion, coriander and lemon juice with a pinch of salt. Serve with the fofos and mango chutney.","z":"步骤1\r\n\r\n将鱼放入有盖的锅中，倒入足够的水以覆盖鱼。盖上盖子，小火煮 10 分钟。将鱼沥干并切成薄片。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n\r\n将鱼、土豆、青辣椒、香菜、小茴香、黑胡椒、大蒜和生姜放入一个大碗中。调味，加入米粉，搅拌均匀，打入1个鸡蛋。搅拌混合物并分成15份，然后形成小圆木。将剩余的鸡蛋打入碗中并轻轻搅拌。将面包屑放入另一个碗中。将每个 fofo 浸入打好的鸡蛋中，然后浸入面包屑混合物中。冷却20分钟。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n\r\n在大煎锅中用中火加热 1 厘米的油。将 fofo 分批煎炸，每面煎 2 分钟，轻轻翻动，使整体呈均匀的金棕色。用厨房用纸吸干水分，然后用剩下的 fofo 重复上述步骤。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n\r\n制作洋葱沙拉时，将洋葱、香菜、柠檬汁和少许盐混合在一起。与 fofos 和芒果酸辣酱一起食用。"},{"id":"53041","n":"Grilled Portuguese sardines","a":"Portuguese","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/lpd4wy1614347943.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JYtMjKa6cdY","i":[["Sardines","8"],["Olive Oil","2 tbs"],["Garlic","3 cloves"],["Paprika","1 tbs"],["Lemon","1/2"],["Rosemary","4 sprigs"],["Red Chilli","1"]],"s":"STEP 1\r\n\r\nPut all of the ingredients, except the sardines, into a bowl and mix together with some seasoning. Pour into a baking dish, add the sardines and toss really well. Cover and chill for a few hours.\r\n\r\nSTEP 2\r\n\r\nHeat a BBQ or griddle pan until hot. Cook the sardines for 4-5 minutes on each side or until really caramelised and charred. Put onto a serving plate, drizzle with oil, sprinkle with a little more paprika and squeeze over the lemon wedges.","z":"步骤1\r\n\r\n将除沙丁鱼以外的所有原料放入碗中，与一些调味料混合。倒入烤盘中，加入沙丁鱼，搅拌均匀。盖上盖子并冷藏几个小时。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n\r\n将烧烤锅或煎锅加热至热。将沙丁鱼每面煮 4-5 分钟，或直至完全焦糖化并烧焦。放在盘子上，淋上油，再撒上一点辣椒粉，然后挤在柠檬片上。"},{"id":"53039","n":"Piri-piri chicken and slaw","a":"Portuguese","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/hglsbl1614346998.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_RKwKjskopk","i":[["Chicken","1.5kg"],["Red Chilli","3 chopped"],["Garlic","2 cloves"],["Ginger","1 tsp"],["Dried Oregano","1 tsp"],["Coriander","1 tsp"],["Paprika","1 tsp"],["Red Wine Vinegar","2 tbs"],["Oil","2 tbs"],["Red Onions","1 sliced"],["Carrots","2"],["Beetroot","1"],["Cabbage","4 leaves"],["Mayonnaise","2 tbs"],["Greek Yogurt","2 tbs"],["Red Wine Vinegar","2 tbs"],["Cumin Seeds","1 tsp"]],"s":"STEP 1\r\n\r\nWhizz together all of the marinade ingredients in a small food processor. Rub the marinade onto the chicken and leave for 1 hour at room temperature.\r\n\r\nSTEP 2\r\n\r\nHeat the oven to 190C/fan 170C/gas 5. Put the chicken in a roasting tray and cook for 1 hour 20 minutes. Rest under loose foil for 20 minutes. While the chicken is resting, mix together the slaw ingredients and season. Serve the chicken with slaw, fries and condiments.","z":"步骤1\r\n\r\n在小型食品加工机中将所有腌料成分搅拌在一起。将腌料涂抹在鸡肉上，并在室温下放置 1 小时。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n\r\n将烤箱加热至 190C/风扇 170C/煤气 5. 将鸡肉放入烤盘中，煮 1 小时 20 分钟。在松散的箔纸下休息 20 分钟。当鸡肉休息时，将沙拉配料混合在一起并调味。将鸡肉与沙拉、薯条和调味品一起食用。"},{"id":"53044","n":"Portuguese barbecued pork (Febras assadas)","a":"Portuguese","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/cybyue1614349443.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tVpsZaejyYU","i":[["Pork","2"],["White Wine","200ml"],["Paprika","1/2 tsp"],["Lemon","2"],["Lemon Juice","1/2"],["Olive Oil","Dash"],["Mayonnaise","To serve"],["Potatoes","1 kg"],["Vegetable Oil","For frying"]],"s":"STEP 1\r\n\r\nCut the tenderloins into 5 equal-size pieces leaving the tail ends a little longer. Take a clear plastic bag and slip one of the pieces in. Bash it into an escalope the size of a side-plate with a rolling pin and repeat with the remaining pieces.\r\n\r\nSTEP 2\r\n\r\nPut the wine, paprika, some salt and pepper and the juice of ½ a lemon in a bowl and add the pork. Leave to marinate for 20-30 minutes, while you get your barbecue to the stage where the coals are glowing but there are no flames.\r\n\r\nSTEP 3\r\n\r\nTo make the chips, fill a basin with cool water and cut the potatoes into 3cm-thick chips. Soak them in the water for 5 minutes and then change the water. Leave for 5 more minutes. Drain and then pat dry on a towel or with kitchen paper.\r\n\r\nSTEP 4\r\n\r\nHeat the oil in a deep fryer or a deep heavy-based pan with a lid to 130C and lower the chips into the oil (in batches). Blanch for 8-10 minutes. Remove from the oil and drain well. Place on a tray to cool. Reheat the oil to 180C (make sure it’s hot or your chips will be soggy) and lower the basket of chips into the oil (again, do this in batches). Leave to cook for 2 minutes and then give them a little shake. Cook for another minute or so until they are well coloured and crisp to the touch. Drain well for a few minutes, tip into a bowl and sprinkle with sea salt.\r\n\r\nSTEP 5\r\n\r\nThe pork will cook quickly so do it in 2 batches. Take the pieces out of the marinade, rub them with oil, and drop them onto the barbecue (you could also use a chargrill). Cook for 1 minute on each side – they may flare up as you do so. This should really be enough time as they will keep on cooking. Take them off the barbecue and pile onto a plate. Repeat with the remaining batch.\r\n\r\nSTEP 6\r\n\r\nServe by piling a plate with chips, drop the pork on top of each pile and pouring the juices from the plate over so the chips take up the flavours. Top with a spoon of mayonnaise and a wedge of lemon.","z":"步骤1\r\n\r\n将里脊肉切成大小相等的 5 块，让尾部留长一点。取一个透明塑料袋，将其中一块放进去。用擀面杖将其敲成侧板大小的烤肉片，然后对其余的块重复上述步骤。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n\r\n将酒、辣椒粉、一些盐和胡椒粉以及 ½ 个柠檬汁放入碗中，然后加入猪肉。腌制 20 至 30 分钟，直至烧烤至煤炭燃烧但没有火焰的阶段。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n\r\n制作土豆片时，将盆装满冷水，然后将土豆切成 3 厘米厚的土豆片。将它们浸泡在水中5分钟，然后换水。再等待 5 分钟。沥干水分，然后用毛巾或厨房用纸拍干。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n\r\n将油炸锅或带盖的厚底锅中的油加热至 130°C，然后将薯条放入油中（分批）。焯8-10分钟。从油中取出并沥干。放在托盘上冷却。将油重新加热至 180°C（确保油很热，否则薯片会湿透），然后将一篮子薯片放入油中（再次分批进行）。煮 2 分钟，然后稍微摇晃一下。再煮一分钟左右，直到它们颜色鲜艳且触感酥脆。沥干几分钟，倒入碗中，撒上海盐。\r\n\r\n步骤5\r\n\r\n猪肉会很快煮熟，所以分两批进行。从腌料中取出碎片，涂上油，然后将它们放在烧烤架上（您也可以使用烧烤炉）。每面煮 1 分钟——这样做时它们可能会燃烧。这时间应该足够了，因为他们会继续做饭。把它们从烧烤架上取下来，堆到盘子上。对剩余批次重复此操作。\r\n\r\n第6步\r\n\r\n将盘子里堆满薯条，将猪肉放在每堆上面，然后将盘子里的汁液倒在上面，这样薯片就可以吸收味道。上面放一勺蛋黄酱和一块柠檬。"},{"id":"53046","n":"Portuguese custard tarts","a":"Portuguese","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/vmz7gl1614350221.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lWLCxui1Mw8","i":[["Plain Flour","2 tbs"],["Icing Sugar","2 tbs"],["Puff Pastry","375g"],["Caster Sugar","250g"],["Lemon Zest","2 strips"],["Cinnamon","1 Stick"],["Eggs","2"],["Egg Yolks","4"],["Corn Flour","50g"],["Whole Milk","500ml"],["Vanilla","Pod of"],["Cinnamon","To serve"]],"s":"STEP 1\r\nRoll the pastry\r\nMix the flour and icing sugar, and use this to dust the work surface. Roll the pastry out to make a 45 x 30cm rectangle. Roll up lengthways to create a long sausage shape.\r\n\r\nSTEP 2\r\nCutting pastry into rounds\r\nCut the pastry into 24 wheels, about 1-2cm thick.\r\n\r\nSTEP 3\r\nRoll out each pastry portion\r\nRoll each wheel lightly with the rolling pin to fit 2 x 12-hole non-stick fairy cake tins.\r\n\r\nSTEP 4\r\nPress pastry into the tin\r\nPress the pastry circles into the tins and mould into the tins to make thin cases. Chill until needed.\r\n\r\nSTEP 5\r\nMake the infused syrup\r\nHeat the oven to 220C/fan 200C/gas 7. Make a sugar syrup by bringing the sugar, 200ml water, lemon zest and cinnamon stick to the boil. Reduce until syrupy, allow to cool, then remove the cinnamon and lemon. Whisk the eggs, egg yolks and cornflour until smooth in another large pan.\r\n\r\nSTEP 6\r\nMaking custard\r\nHeat the milk and vanilla pod seeds in a separate pan until just below the boil. Gradually pour the hot milk over the eggs and cornflour, then cook on a low heat, continually whisking.\r\n\r\nSTEP 7\r\nAdd syrup to custard\r\nAdd the cooled sugar syrup to the custard and whisk until thickened slightly.\r\n\r\nSTEP 8\r\nPour custard into the tins\r\nPour the custard through a sieve. Pour into the pastry cases and bake for 15 minutes until the pastry is golden and the custard has darkened.\r\n\r\nSTEP 9\r\ncool and dust with icing sugar\r\nCool completely in the tins then sift over icing sugar and ground cinnamon to serve.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n ","z":"步骤1\r\n把糕点卷起来\r\n将面粉和糖粉混合，然后用它来除尘工作表面。将糕点擀成 45 x 30 厘米的矩形。纵向卷起，形成长香肠形状。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将糕点切成圆形\r\n将油酥皮切成24片，厚约1-2厘米。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n将每个糕点部分擀开\r\n用擀面杖轻轻滚动每个轮子，以适合 2 x 12 孔不粘仙女蛋糕罐。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n将糕点压入罐中\r\n将糕点圈压入罐中，然后模入罐中以制成薄盒。冷却直至需要。\r\n\r\n步骤5\r\n制作注入糖浆\r\n将烤箱加热至 220C/风扇 200C/煤气 7. 将糖、200 毫升水、柠檬皮和肉桂棒煮沸，制成糖浆。浓缩至糖浆状，冷却，然后取出肉桂和柠檬。在另一个大平底锅中将鸡蛋、蛋黄和玉米粉搅拌至光滑。\r\n\r\n步骤6\r\n制作蛋奶冻\r\n将牛奶和香草荚种子放入另一个锅中加热，直至沸腾。逐渐将热牛奶倒在鸡蛋和玉米粉上，然后用小火煮，不断搅拌。\r\n\r\n第7步\r\n将糖浆加入蛋奶冻中\r\n将冷却的糖浆加入蛋奶冻中，搅拌至稍微变稠。\r\n\r\n步骤8\r\n将卡仕达酱倒入罐中\r\n将蛋奶冻倒入筛子中。倒入糕点盒中，烘烤 15 分钟，直至糕点呈金黄色且蛋奶冻颜色变深。\r\n\r\n第9步\r\n冷却并撒上糖粉\r\n在罐中完全冷却，然后筛入糖粉和肉桂粉即可食用。"},{"id":"53045","n":"Portuguese fish stew (Caldeirada de peixe)","a":"Portuguese","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/do7zps1614349775.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=utv-GpSJypk","i":[["Onions","2 finely chopped"],["Red Pepper","1 Diced"],["Coriander","Small bunch"],["Red Chilli","1 small"],["Garlic","3 cloves"],["Dry White Wine","400ml"],["Saffron","Pinch"],["Bay Leaf","1"],["Potatoes","300g"],["Plum Tomatoes","400g"],["Cod","600g"],["Squid","300g"],["Tiger Prawns","8"],["Clams","500g"],["Mussels","500g"],["Baguette","1 sliced"]],"s":"STEP 1\r\n\r\nHeat a drizzle of oil in a large, deep-sided frying pan, and fry the onion and pepper on a medium heat until softened but not browned. Finely chop the coriander stalks (keep the leaves for later), and add to the pan with the chilli and chopped garlic. Fry for another few minutes. Add the wine, saffron and bay leaf and let it simmer until reduced by half.\r\n\r\nSTEP 2\r\n\r\nAdd the potatoes, tomatoes, and 300ml water and bring to a gentle boil. Break up the tomatoes with a spoon on the side of the pan and simmer for 20-25 minutes until the potatoes are just tender, and the tomatoes have broken down.\r\n\r\nSTEP 3\r\n\r\nSeason well, then gently push the fish into the sauce, and arrange the squid, prawns, clams and mussels on the surface. Put the lid on and cook for 6-8 minutes until the mussel and clam shells have opened, the prawns are cooked and the fish is flaky. Toast the bread, rub lightly with the halved garlic clove and drizzle with olive oil. Serve the stew scatted with chopped coriander leaves, and the toasts for dunking.","z":"步骤1\r\n\r\n在一个大的深煎锅中加热毛毛雨，用中火将洋葱和辣椒煎至软化但不要变成棕色。将香菜茎切碎（叶子留着稍后使用），然后与辣椒和切碎的大蒜一起放入锅中。再煎几分钟。加入酒、藏红花和月桂叶，小火煮至汤汁减半。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n\r\n加入土豆、西红柿和 300 毫升水，轻轻煮沸。用勺子在锅边将西红柿打碎，小火煮 20-25 分钟，直至土豆变软，西红柿完全分解。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n\r\n调味均匀，然后将鱼轻轻推入酱汁中，将鱿鱼、虾、蛤蜊和贻贝摆在表面。盖上盖子，煮 6-8 分钟，直至贻贝和蛤壳打开、虾煮熟、鱼片变脆。烤面包，用切半的蒜瓣轻轻擦拭，淋上橄榄油。将炖菜撒上切碎的芫荽叶，然后将吐司浸泡在水中。"},{"id":"53042","n":"Portuguese prego with green piri-piri","a":"Portuguese","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/ewcikl1614348364.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FbIKfcDEPLA","i":[["Garlic","1 clove"],["Beef Fillet","2 small"],["Olive Oil","2 tbs"],["Vinegar","1 tbs"],["Parsley","Leaves"],["Ciabatta","2"],["Rocket","2 handfulls"],["Basil Leaves","Small bunch"],["Parsley","Small bunch"],["Jalapeno","1"],["Vinegar","1 tbs"],["Spring Onions","2 chopped"],["Garlic","1/2"],["Caster Sugar","1/2 tsp"]],"s":"STEP 1\r\n\r\nRub the garlic over the steaks then put in a sandwich bag and tip in the olive oil, sherry vinegar and parsley stalks. Smoosh everything together, then use a rolling pin to bash the steaks a few times. Leave for 1-2 hours.\r\n\r\nSTEP 2\r\n\r\nTo make the sauce, put all the ingredients into a blender with 1 tbsp water and whizz until as smooth as possible. This will make more than you’ll need for the recipe but will keep for a week in an airtight jar.\r\n\r\nSTEP 3\r\n\r\nHeat a griddle or frying pan to high. Brush away the garlic and parsley stalks from the steaks and season well. Sear the steaks for 2 minutes on each side then rest on a plate. Put the ciabatta halves onto the plate, toasted-side down, to soak up any juices.\r\n\r\nSTEP 4\r\n\r\nSlice the steaks then stuff into the rolls with the green sauce and rocket.","z":"步骤1\r\n\r\n将大蒜擦在牛排上，然后放入三明治袋中，倒入橄榄油、雪利酒醋和欧芹茎。将所有东西搅拌在一起，然后用擀面杖将牛排敲击几次。放置 1-2 小时。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n\r\n制作酱汁时，将所有原料与 1 汤匙水一起放入搅拌机中，搅拌至尽可能光滑。这将比您的食谱所需的量多，但可以在密封罐中保存一周。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n\r\n将煎锅或煎锅加热至高温。刷掉牛排上的大蒜和欧芹茎，并充分调味。将牛排每面煎 2 分钟，然后放在盘子上。将夏巴塔面包半块放在盘子上，烤面朝下，以吸收汁液。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n\r\n将牛排切成片，然后将青酱和芝麻菜塞入卷中。"},{"id":"53040","n":"Spring onion and prawn empanadas","a":"Portuguese","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/1c5oso1614347493.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Q24haJU-1dI","i":[["Spring Onions","1  bunch"],["Olive Oil","Dash"],["Red Chilli","1 finely sliced"],["Garlic","1 clove"],["Prawns","350g"],["Feta","75g"],["Butter","15g"],["Plain Flour","250g"],["Egg","1 Seperated"],["White Wine Vinegar","1/2 tsp"]],"s":"STEP 1\r\n\r\nTo make the dough, rub the butter into the flour and then add the egg white and half the yolk (keep the rest), vinegar, a pinch of salt and enough cold water to make a soft dough. Knead on a floured surface until smooth and then wrap and rest for 30 minutes.\r\n\r\nSTEP 2\r\n\r\nHeat the oven to 180c/fan 160c/gas 4. Trim the green ends of the spring onions and then finely slice the rest. Heat a little oil in a pan and fry them gently until soft but not browned. Add the chilli and garlic, stir and then add the prawns and cook until they are opaque. Season well. Scoop out the prawns and bubble the juices until they thicken, then add back the prawns.\r\n\r\nSTEP 3\r\n\r\nDivide the empanada dough into eight balls and roll out to thin circles on a floured surface. Put some filling on one half of the dough, sprinkle the feta on top and fold the other half over. Trim the edge and then fold and crimp the dough together so the empanada is tightly sealed, put it on an oiled baking sheet either on its side or sitting on its un-crimped edge like a cornish pasty. Repeat with the remaining dough and mixture. Mix the leftover egg yolk with a splash of water and brush the top of the empanadas.\r\n\r\nSTEP 4\r\n\r\nBake for 30 minutes or until golden and slightly crisp around the edges.","z":"步骤1\r\n\r\n制作面团时，将黄油揉入面粉中，然后加入蛋白和一半蛋黄（保留其余部分）、醋、少许盐和足够的冷水，形成柔软的面团。在撒了面粉的表面上揉至光滑，然后包起来静置 30 分钟。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n\r\n将烤箱加热至 180 摄氏度/风扇 160 摄氏度/燃气 4. 修剪葱的绿色末端，然后将其余部分切成细丝。在锅中加热少许油，然后将它们轻轻煎至变软但不要变成棕色。加入辣椒和大蒜，搅拌，然后加入虾，煮至不透明。调味好。将虾捞出，将汁液搅打至变稠，然后将虾放回原处。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n\r\n将肉馅卷饼面团分成八个球，然后在撒了面粉的表面上擀成薄薄的圆圈。在一半面团上放一些馅料，在上面撒上羊乳酪，然后将另一半折叠起来。修剪边缘，然后将面团折叠并卷曲在一起，使肉馅卷饼紧密密封，将其放在涂了油的烤盘上，可以侧面放置，也可以像康沃尔馅饼一样放在未卷曲的边缘上。对剩余的面团和混合物重复上述步骤。将剩下的蛋黄与少许水混合，然后刷在肉馅卷饼的顶部。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n\r\n烘烤 30 分钟或直至边缘呈金黄色且稍脆。"},{"id":"52834","n":"Beef stroganoff","a":"Russian","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/svprys1511176755.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PQHgQX1Ss74","i":[["Olive Oil","1 tbls"],["Onions","1"],["Garlic","1 clove"],["Butter","1 tbsp"],["Mushrooms","250g"],["Beef Fillet","500g"],["Plain Flour","1tbsp"],["Creme Fraiche","150g"],["English Mustard","1 tbsp"],["Beef Stock","100ml"],["Parsley","Topping"]],"s":"Heat the olive oil in a non-stick frying pan then add the sliced onion and cook on a medium heat until completely softened, so around 15 mins, adding a little splash of water if they start to stick at all. Crush in the garlic and cook for a 2-3 mins further, then add the butter. Once the butter is foaming a little, add the mushrooms and cook for around 5 mins until completely softened. Season everything well, then tip onto a plate.\r\nTip the flour into a bowl with a big pinch of salt and pepper, then toss the steak in the seasoned flour. Add the steak pieces to the pan, splashing in a little oil if the pan looks particularly dry, and fry for 3-4 mins, until well coloured. Tip the onions and mushrooms back into the pan. Whisk the crème fraîche, mustard and beef stock together, then pour into the pan. Cook over a medium heat for around 5 mins. Scatter with parsley, then serve with pappardelle or rice.","z":"在不粘煎锅中加热橄榄油，然后加入切好的洋葱，用中火煮至完全软化，大约需要 15 分钟，如果它们开始粘在一起，则加一点水。压碎大蒜，再煮2-3分钟，然后加入黄油。黄油起泡后，加入蘑菇，煮约 5 分钟直至完全软化。将所有东西调味好，然后倒在盘子上。\r\n将面粉倒入碗中，加入一大撮盐和胡椒，然后将牛排放入调味面粉中。将牛排块放入锅中，如果锅看起来特别干，可淋入少许油，煎3-4分钟，直至上色。将洋葱和蘑菇倒回锅中。将法式酸奶油、芥末和牛肉汤一起搅拌，然后倒入锅中。用中火煮约5分钟。撒上欧芹，然后搭配宽面条或米饭。"},{"id":"53080","n":"Blini Pancakes","a":"Russian","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/0206h11699013358.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GsB8ZI5vREA","i":[["Buckwheat","1/2 cup"],["Flour","2/3 Cup"],["Salt","1/2 tsp"],["Yeast","1 tsp"],["Milk","1 cup"],["Butter","2 tbs"],["Egg","1 Seperated"]],"s":"In a large bowl, whisk together 1/2 cup buckwheat flour, 2/3 cup all-purpose flour, 1/2 teaspoon salt, and 1 teaspoon yeast.\r\n\r\nMake a well in the center and pour in 1 cup warm milk, whisking until the batter is smooth.\r\n\r\nCover the bowl and let the batter rise until doubled, about 1 hour.\r\n\r\nEnrich and Rest the Batter\r\nStir 2 tablespoons melted butter and 1 egg yolk into the batter.\r\n\r\nIn a separate bowl, whisk 1 egg white until stiff, but not dry.\r\n\r\nFold the whisked egg white into the batter.\r\n\r\nCover the bowl and let the batter stand 20 minutes.\r\n\r\nPan-Fry the Blini\r\nHeat butter in a large nonstick skillet over medium heat.\r\n\r\nDrop quarter-sized dollops of batter into the pan, being careful not to overcrowd the pan. Cook for about 1 minute or until bubbles form.\r\n\r\nTurn and cook for about 30 additional seconds.\r\n\r\nRemove the finished blini onto a plate and cover them with a clean kitchen towel to keep warm. Add more butter to the pan and repeat the frying process with the remaining batter.","z":"在一个大碗中，将 1/2 杯荞麦粉、2/3 杯通用面粉、1/2 茶匙盐和 1 茶匙酵母搅拌在一起。\r\n\r\n在中心挖一个洞，倒入 1 杯温牛奶，搅拌直至面糊光滑。\r\n\r\n盖上碗，让面糊发酵至两倍大，即约 1 小时。\r\n\r\n丰富并休息面糊\r\n将2汤匙融化的黄油和1个蛋黄加入面糊中搅拌。\r\n\r\n在另一个碗中，搅拌 1 个蛋白直至变硬，但不要干燥。\r\n\r\n将打发好的蛋清倒入面糊中。\r\n\r\n盖上碗，让面糊静置 20 分钟。\r\n\r\n用平底锅煎薄饼\r\n在一个大的不粘锅中用中火加热黄油。\r\n\r\n将四分之一大小的面糊放入锅中，小心不要将锅挤得太满。煮约 1 分钟或直至形成气泡。\r\n\r\n翻转并再煮约 30 秒。\r\n\r\n将完成的薄饼移到盘子上，并用干净的厨房毛巾覆盖以保暖。在锅中加入更多黄油，然后用剩余的面糊重复煎炸过程。"},{"id":"53077","n":"Cabbage Soup (Shchi)","a":"Russian","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/60oc3k1699009846.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lTjlbqGc_Y8","i":[["Unsalted Butter","3 tbs"],["Onion","1 large"],["Cabbage","1 medium"],["Carrots","1"],["Celery","1"],["Bay Leaf","1"],["Vegetable Stock","8 cups"],["Potatoes","2 large"],["Tomatoes","2 large"],["Sour Cream","Garnish"],["Dill","Garnish"]],"s":"Add the butter to a large Dutch oven or other heavy-duty pot over medium heat. When the butter has melted, add the onion and sauté until translucent.\r\nAdd the cabbage, carrot, and celery. Sauté until the vegetables begin to soften, stirring frequently, about 3 minutes.\r\nAdd the bay leaf and vegetable stock and bring to a boil over high heat. Reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, until the vegetables are crisp-tender, about 15 minutes.\r\nAdd the potatoes and bring it back to a boil over high heat. Reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, until the potatoes are tender, about 10 minutes.\r\nAdd the tomatoes (or undrained canned tomatoes) and bring the soup back to a boil over high heat. Reduce the heat to low and simmer, uncovered, for 5 minutes. Season to taste with salt and pepper.\r\nemove and discard the bay leaf from the pot.\r\nServe topped with fresh sour cream and fresh dill.","z":"将黄油加入大型荷兰烤箱或其他重型锅中，用中火加热。黄油融化后，加入洋葱，炒至半透明。\r\n加入卷心菜、胡萝卜和芹菜。炒至蔬菜开始变软，经常搅拌，大约 3 分钟。\r\n加入月桂叶和蔬菜高汤，用大火煮沸。将火调至小火，盖上锅盖，小火煮约 15 分钟，直至蔬菜变脆。\r\n加入土豆，用大火将其重新煮沸。将火调至小火，盖上锅盖，小火煮约 10 分钟，直至土豆变软。\r\n加入西红柿（或未沥干的罐装西红柿），然后用大火将汤重新煮沸。将火调至小火，不盖锅盖，小火煮 5 分钟。用盐和胡椒调味。\r\n从锅中取出并丢弃月桂叶。\r\n上面撒上新鲜酸奶油和新鲜莳萝。"},{"id":"53079","n":"Fish Soup (Ukha)","a":"Russian","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/7n8su21699013057.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cS3Yn-y5uVg","i":[["Olive Oil","2 tbs"],["Onion","1 sliced"],["Carrots","2 medium"],["Fish Stock","3 cups"],["Water","3 cups"],["Potatoes","4 large"],["Bay Leaf","3"],["Cod","1"],["Salmon","1"]],"s":"In a medium pot, heat the olive oil over medium-high heat. Add the onions and cook, stirring occasionally until the onions start to caramelize. Add the carrots and cook until the carrots start to soften, about 4 more minutes.\r\nAdd the stock, water, potatoes, bay leaves, and black peppercorns. Season with salt and bring to a boil. Reduce heat, cover and cook for 10 minutes. Add the millet and cook for 15 more minutes until millet and potatoes are cooked.\r\nGently add the fish cubes. Stir and bring the soup to a simmer. The fish will cook through very fast, so make sure to not overcook them. They are done when the flesh is opaque and flakes easily.\r\nGarnish the soup with chopped fresh dill or parsley before serving.","z":"在一个中型锅中，用中高火加热橄榄油。加入洋葱，煮，偶尔搅拌，直到洋葱开始焦糖化。加入胡萝卜，再煮大约 4 分钟，直到胡萝卜开始变软。\r\n加入高汤、水、土豆、月桂叶和黑胡椒。加盐调味并煮沸。减少热量，盖上锅盖煮 10 分钟。加入小米，再煮 15 分钟，直至小米和土豆煮熟。\r\n轻轻地加入鱼块。搅拌并将汤煮沸。鱼会很快煮熟，所以一定不要煮过头。当果肉不透明且容易剥落时，它们就完成了。\r\n上菜前用切碎的新鲜莳萝或欧芹装饰汤。"},{"id":"53083","n":"Lamb Pilaf (Plov)","a":"Russian","c":"Lamb","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/kos9av1699014767.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rllQsUw1hFQ","i":[["Lamb","50g"],["Prunes","120g"],["Lemon Juice","1 tbs"],["Butter","2 tbs"],["Onion","1 chopped"],["Lamb","450g"],["Garlic","2 cloves"],["Vegetable Stock","600ml"],["Rice","2 cups"],["Saffron","Pinch"],["Parsley","Garnish"]],"s":"Place the raisins and prunes into a small bowl and pour over enough water to cover. Add lemon juice and let soak for at least 1 hour. Drain. Roughly chop the prunes.\r\n\r\nMeanwhile, heat the butter in a large pan, add the onion, and cook for 5 minutes. Add cubed lamb, ground lamb, and crushed garlic cloves. Fry for 5 minutes, stirring constantly until browned.\r\n\r\nPour 2/3 cup (150 milliliters) of stock into the pan. Bring to a boil, then lower the heat, cover, and simmer for 1 hour, or until the lamb is tender.\r\n\r\nAdd the remaining stock and bring to a boil. Add rinsed long-grain white rice and a large pinch of saffron. Stir, then cover, and simmer for 15 minutes, or until the rice is tender.\r\n\r\nAdd the drained raisins, drained chopped prunes, and salt and pepper to taste. Heat through for a few minutes, then turn out onto a warmed serving dish and garnish with sprigs of flat-leaf parsley.","z":"将葡萄干和李子放入小碗中，倒入足够的水覆盖。加入柠檬汁，浸泡至少 1 小时。流走。将李子大致切碎。\r\n\r\n同时，在大锅中加热黄油，加入洋葱，煮 5 分钟。加入羊肉块、羊肉末和压碎的蒜瓣。煎5分钟，不断搅拌直至变成棕色。\r\n\r\n将 2/3 杯（150 毫升）高汤倒入锅中。煮沸，然后调小火，盖上锅盖，煮1小时，或直至羊肉变软。\r\n\r\n加入剩余的汤料并煮沸。加入洗净的长粒白米和一大撮藏红花。搅拌，然后盖上盖子，小火煮 15 分钟，或直至米饭变软。\r\n\r\n加入沥干的葡萄干、沥干的切碎的李子、盐和胡椒粉调味。加热几分钟，然后盛到温热的盘子上，并用平叶欧芹小枝装饰。"},{"id":"53081","n":"Potato Salad (Olivier Salad)","a":"Russian","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/ebvuir1699013665.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RnsWwHcpKiY","i":[["Potatoes","4"],["Carrots","3"],["Salt","1 tbs"],["White Wine Vinegar","1/2 tbs"],["Eggs","4"],["Sausages","7 oz"],["Dill","4 oz"],["Peas","1 can"],["Onions","4"],["Mayonnaise","1 cup"]],"s":"Cut the potatoes and carrots into small uniform cubes.\r\nPlace them in a large pot and fill with water.\r\nAdd salt and vinegar. Bring it to a boil over medium high heat, and then reduce the heat to medium and continue to cook until the potatoes are cooked through, about 15 minutes. Drain the potatoes and let it cool to room temperature.\r\nMeanwhile, cut the sausage and pickles into small cubes, and chop the green onions.\r\nCut the hard-boiled eggs into small cubes as well.\r\nIf using fresh dill, chop them as well.\r\nIn a large bowl, combine potatoes, carrots, sausage, pickles, peas and green onions.\r\nAdd mayo and dill and mix until well combined.\r\nSalt and pepper to taste. Cover with a plastic wrap and refrigerate for at least 1 hour before serving.","z":"将土豆和胡萝卜切成均匀的小方块。\r\n将它们放入一个大锅中并装满水。\r\n加入盐和醋。用中火将其煮沸，然后将火调至中火，继续煮至土豆熟透，大约需要 15 分钟。将土豆沥干并冷却至室温。\r\n与此同时，将香肠和泡菜切成小方块，然后切碎葱。\r\n将煮熟的鸡蛋也切成小方块。\r\n如果使用新鲜莳萝，也将其切碎。\r\n在一个大碗中，将土豆、胡萝卜、香肠、泡菜、豌豆和葱混合在一起。\r\n加入蛋黄酱和莳萝，搅拌直至充分混合。\r\n盐和胡椒调味。食用前盖上保鲜膜并冷藏至少 1 小时。"},{"id":"53082","n":"Strawberries Romanoff","a":"Russian","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/oe8rg51699014028.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ybWHc4Vi-xU","i":[["Strawberries","2 pint"],["Sugar","4 tbs"],["Grand Marnier","4 tbs"],["Cream","1 cup"],["Sour Cream","1/4 cup"]],"s":"In a medium bowl, combine hulled and quartered strawberries, 4 Tbsp sugar and 4 Tbsp liqueur, stir to combine then cover and refrigerate at least 1 hour and up to 2 hours, stirring once or twice.\r\n\r\nTwo photos of cut strawberries in a bowl with one having sugar being added to the bowl Two photos of cut up strawberries for Strawberry Romanoff \r\n\r\nJust before serving, in a large mixing bowl, combine 1 cup cold heavy cream and 1/4 cup powdered sugar, and beat with an electric mixer until stiff peaks form. Using a spatula, fold in 1/4 cup sour cream just until well blended.\r\n\r\nTo serve, stir strawberries then divide between 6 serving glasses or bowls. You can spoon a little syrup over the berries if you like. You can also use this syrup to soak a cake. Spoon cream over strawberries, dividing evenly. You can also use an ice cream scoop with trigger release for a nice rounded puff of cream. Serve right away or chill and enjoy within 2 hours of assembly.\r\n\r\n","z":"在一个中等大小的碗中，将去壳并切成四等份的草莓、4 汤匙糖和 4 汤匙利口酒混合，搅拌混合，然后盖上盖子，冷藏至少 1 小时至 2 小时，搅拌一到两次。\r\n\r\n两张切好的草莓放入碗中的照片，其中一张在碗中添加了糖 两张切好的草莓的照片供草莓罗曼诺夫使用 \r\n\r\n食用前，在一个大搅拌碗中，将 1 杯冷浓奶油和 1/4 杯糖粉混合，用电动搅拌机搅拌直至形成硬性发泡。使用抹刀拌入 1/4 杯酸奶油，直至充分混合。\r\n\r\n食用时，搅拌草莓，然后分装在 6 个玻璃杯或碗中。如果你愿意的话，你可以在浆果上舀一点糖浆。您也可以使用这种糖浆来浸泡蛋糕。将奶油舀在草莓上，均匀分布。您还可以使用带有扳机释放装置的冰淇淋勺来制作漂亮的圆形奶油泡芙。立即上桌或在组装后 2 小时内冷藏并享用。"},{"id":"53218","n":"Chicken Shawarma with homemade garlic herb yoghurt sauce","a":"Saudi Arabian","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/hcg6l91763596970.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TROZvPHqP1g","i":[["Chicken Breast","1kg"],["Garlic","2 cloves minced"],["Ground Coriander","1 tblsp"],["Ground Cumin","1 tblsp"],["Ground Cardomom","1 tblsp"],["Cayenne Pepper","1 tsp"],["Smoked Paprika","2 tsp"],["Salt","2 tsp"],["Lemon Juice","2 tblsp"],["Olive Oil","3 tablespoons"],["Greek Yogurt","1 cup"],["Garlic","1 clove peeled crushed"],["Cumin","1 tsp"],["Lemon Juice","Splash"]],"s":"1\r\nStart by cutting your chicken up into reasonably small slices. Grab your ziplock bag and dump the freshly sliced chicken inside.\r\n2\r\nAdd garlic, coriander, cumin, cardomom, cayenne pepper, paprika, salt, pepper, lemon juice and olive oil to the bag. Close the bag and mix thoroughly. Place in fridge for 10-12 hours (shorter is fine but longer is better).\r\n3\r\nOnce ready to cook, heat your fry pan to medium-high and add a tiny bit of olive oil. Fry one side of all of your flatbreads until slightly toasty. Remove from pan, add enough oil to coat the fry pan. Put crumble fries into air fryer on 180 for 15 minutes shaking occasionally.\r\n4\r\nThe pan should be pretty hot by now, add the chicken in 2 batches (unless you have a big fry pan) to avoid overcrowding. The chicken should get a nice sear and darker colour which is perfect. Cook for a further 5-8 minutes or until cooked through. Repeat with next chicken batch.\r\n5\r\nWhile chicken is cooking, place your Greek yoghurt into a bowl. Combine garlic, finely chopped mint and parsley, squeeze or so of lemon and cumin. Combine and add salt to taste. In a small bowl, combine 1tsp garlic powder, paprika, cumin, onion powder, oregano, dried parsley, cayenne pepper (optional) mix and leave aside for fries.\r\n6\r\nSeason fries immediately once cooked and add salt to taste. Once the chicken is complete, serve immediately by laying out your flatbread, spreading the sauce evenly over the bread, add lettuce, onion, tomato, fries, chicken, feta and more sauce on top. Serve immediately.","z":"1\r\n首先将鸡肉切成相当小的片。拿起你的自封袋，把刚切好的鸡肉倒进去。\r\n2\r\n将大蒜、香菜、小茴香、小豆蔻、辣椒、辣椒粉、盐、胡椒、柠檬汁和橄榄油放入袋子中。关闭袋子并充分混合。放入冰箱10-12小时（时间越短越好，但时间越长越好）。\r\n3\r\n准备好烹饪后，将煎锅加热至中高并加入少量橄榄油。将所有大饼的一侧煎至稍微烤熟。从锅中取出，加入足够的油覆盖煎锅。将碎薯条放入空气炸锅中，180 度，15 分钟，偶尔摇晃。\r\n4\r\n现在锅应该很热，分两批加入鸡肉（除非你有一个大煎锅）以避免过度拥挤。鸡肉应该有很好的烤焦效果和较深的颜色，这是完美的。再煮 5-8 分钟或直至熟透。对下一批鸡肉重复上述步骤。\r\n5\r\n当鸡肉烹饪时，将希腊酸奶放入碗中。将大蒜、切碎的薄荷和欧芹混合，挤上柠檬和小茴香。混合并加盐调味。在一个小碗中，将 1 茶匙大蒜粉、辣椒粉、小茴香、洋葱粉、牛至、干欧芹、辣椒（可选）混合，放在一边用于炸薯条。\r\n6\r\n炸好后立即调味，并加盐调味。鸡肉完成后，立即将面包摆好，将酱汁均匀地涂在面包上，然后在上面添加生菜、洋葱、番茄、薯条、鸡肉、羊乳酪和更多酱汁。立即上菜。"},{"id":"53216","n":"Knafeh","a":"Saudi Arabian","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/76nffj1763593933.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3EF_R7__xu4","i":[["Knafeh","400g"],["Unsalted Butter","6 tablespoons"],["Yellow Food Colouring","1 pinch"],["Mozzarella","1 cup"],["Cream Cheese","1/4 cup"],["Milk","1 1/2 cup"],["Sugar","4 tablespoons"],["Corn Flour","2 tablespoons"],["Sugar","1 cup"],["Water","1 cup"],["Rose water","1 tsp"],["Lemon Juice","1/2 teaspoon"]],"s":"1\r\nTake kanfhe in a bowl and roughly cut them. Pour melted butter, yellow food color and mix well with your hands.\r\nIn a separate bowl mix milk, cream cheese, sugar, cornstarch well.\r\n2\r\nTurn on the flame and boil the liquid, when it gets thick turn off the flame let it cool down a little bit.\r\nAdd mozzarella in it and mix it well.\r\nNow make a base with half of the kanfhe in a dish, gently press it to level the dough well.\r\nPour the cheese mixture on the top and level it with a spoon.\r\n3\r\nCover it with the other half of the kanfhe.\r\nPut the dish in a preheated oven at 200 degree for about 20-25 minutes.\r\nIt's ready when kunafa is golden and crunchy in the surface.\r\n4\r\nBoil water in a pan and dissolve sugar in it for 4–5 minutes. OR cook it until slightly thicken and keep on stirring. Add lemon juice with rose water, mix well.\r\nEvenly pour the syrup over the kunafa as soon as it comes out of the oven.\r\nYour kunafa is ready to serve.","z":"1\r\n将kanfhe放入碗中，粗切。倒入融化的黄油、黄色食用色素，用手搅拌均匀。\r\n在另一个碗中将牛奶、奶油干酪、糖、玉米淀粉充分混合。\r\n2\r\n开火，将液体煮沸，当液体变稠时，关火，让其冷却一点。\r\n加入马苏里拉奶酪并搅拌均匀。\r\n现在用一半的kanfhe在盘子里做一个底料，轻轻地按压它，使面团平整。\r\n将奶酪混合物倒在上面，并用勺子将其弄平。\r\n3\r\n用另一半的 kanfhe 盖住它。\r\n将盘子放入预热好的烤箱中，200度，烤约20-25分钟。\r\n当 kunafa 表面呈金黄色且松脆时，就完成了。\r\n4\r\n将水放入锅中煮沸，然后将糖放入其中，煮 4-5 分钟。或者煮至稍微变稠并继续搅拌。加入柠檬汁和玫瑰水，搅拌均匀。\r\n库纳法从烤箱中出来后，立即将糖浆均匀地倒在库纳法上。\r\n您的 kunafa 已准备好上桌。"},{"id":"53221","n":"Mamoul (Eid biscuits)","a":"Saudi Arabian","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/35kejr1763599712.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RqBeOaXvqGM","i":[["Plain Flour","300g"],["Semolina","200g"],["Sunflower Oil","25g"],["Unsalted Butter","250g"],["Milk","50 ml"],["Icing Sugar","60g"]],"s":"1\r\nMix butter with sugar until creamy.\r\n2\r\nAdd oil flour and semolina and mix.\r\n3\r\nAdd warm milk and don't knead too much\r\n4\r\nCover and leave aside for an hour or less until you prepare the filling\r\n5\r\nFor the dates filling, fry some sesame in a pan then add butter. Add the dates paste and mixed well with sesame and butter. Then add a little bit of water until it's mushy. Be careful don't make it too mushy.\r\n6\r\nTake it of the pan, put in a plate until it's cool. Then start to shape balls that weigh 15 gm.\r\n7\r\nRefrigerate for 1/2 an hour.\r\n8\r\nGet back to the dough and shape it as balls that weigh 30 gm.\r\n9\r\nTake the date filling out of the fridge and start to stuff each dough ball with dates ball.\r\nThen use the mamoul mould to give it this shape.\r\n10\r\nIn a preheated oven 180 degrees, put it for 20 minutes until golden from below and little bit golden from above.","z":"1\r\n将黄油与糖混合直至呈奶油状。\r\n2\r\n添加油面粉和粗面粉并混合。\r\n3\r\n加入温牛奶，不要揉太多\r\n4\r\n盖上盖子并放置一小时或更短时间，直到准备好馅料\r\n5\r\n对于枣馅，在锅中炒一些芝麻，然后加入黄油。加入枣泥，与芝麻和黄油混合均匀。然后加一点点水，直到变成糊状。小心别弄得太糊状。\r\n6\r\n将其从锅中取出，放入盘子中直至冷却。然后开始塑造重15克的球。\r\n7\r\n冷藏 1/2 小时。\r\n8\r\n回到面团上，将其塑造成重 30 克的球。\r\n9\r\n把枣馅从冰箱里拿出来，开始在每个面团里塞上枣球。\r\n然后用mamoul模具给它这个形状。\r\n10\r\n放入预热好的烤箱，180度，烤20分钟，直到下层金黄，上层有点金黄。"},{"id":"53223","n":"Mutabbaq","a":"Saudi Arabian","c":"Miscellaneous","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/i5o2b61763739053.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xzu8XswXqcs","i":[["Mincemeat","500g"],["Garlic","1.5 tbs minced"],["Ginger","1.5 tbs minced"],["Egg","1"],["Tomato","1 large"],["Spring Onions","4"],["Filo Pastry","12"],["Melted Butter","1 1/2 cups"],["Salt","1 tsp"],["Paprika","1 tsp"],["Cumin","1 tsp"],["Allspice","1 tsp"],["Turmeric","1 tsp"],["Black Pepper","1 tsp"],["Sugar","1 tsp"]],"s":"1\r\nHeat the frying pan and add in some oil. Fry the mashed garlic and ginger first and then add in the minced meat and all seasoning. When the meat is cooked, set aside to cool down.\r\n2\r\nGet another big bowl. Add in egg, chopped tomato, chopped spring onion and minced meat.\r\n3\r\nGet one 2 sheets of filo pastry or 1 sheet spring roll wrap. Brush it with some butter and then put some filling in the middle. Fold the pastry and brush more butter on the seal part.\r\n4\r\nHeat a frying pan and add in some oil to cook the parcel until its both sides and 4 edges all turn into golden brown. (Or brush melted butter all over the parcel and bake it in 180°C oven for 10-15 minutes)\r\n5\r\nEnjoy \r\n\r\n","z":"1\r\n将煎锅加热并加入一些油。先将蒜末和姜末炒香，然后加入肉末和所有调味料。肉煮熟后，放在一边冷却。\r\n2\r\n再来一个大碗。加入鸡蛋、切碎的番茄、切碎的葱和肉末。\r\n3\r\n准备一份 2 片费洛糕点或 1 片春卷皮。刷上一些黄油，然后在中间放一些馅料。将糕点折叠起来，在密封部分刷上更多黄油。\r\n4\r\n烧热平底锅，加入少许油，将包子煎至两面及四边均呈金黄色。 （或者在包裹上刷上融化的黄油，然后放入180°C的烤箱中烘烤10-15分钟）\r\n5\r\n享受"},{"id":"53224","n":"Pistachio Kunafa Chocolate Cake and Cupcakes","a":"Saudi Arabian","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/yh3sg71763741307.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vINcKAS7Ig8","i":[["White Chocolate","6 tablespoons"],["Unsalted Pistachio","1 cup"],["Condensed Milk","3  tablespoons"],["Milk","5 tablespoons"],["Oreo Cream Biscuits","25"],["Milk","1/2 cup"],["Baking Powder","1/2 teaspoon"],["Vinegar","1/2 teaspoon"],["Salt","1 pinch"],["Sevaiiya","150g"],["Ghee","1 tablespoon"],["Dark Chocolate","120ml"],["Malai","4 tablespoons"]],"s":"1\r\nFor Chocolate Cake:Ready all the ingredients. Powder the oreo biscuits, pinch salt and mix warm milk as needed and make a cake batter. Add in baking powder and vinegar and mix.\r\n2\r\nGrease a loose bottomed tin. Pour a 1cm thick layer of the batter.\r\n3\r\nBake in a preheated oven @160°C for 7-8 minutes or until the knife comes out clean. Cool on wire rack.\r\n4\r\nFor Homemade Pistachio Paste:Ready all the pistachio paste ingredients. Slightly melt white chocolate on a double boiler.(else the mixer blade may break) Coarsely powder the pistachio in mixer. Add in condensed milk.\r\n5\r\nAdd in slightly warmed and slightly melted white chocolate and milk as required and crush to a smooth paste.(Green food colour can be add. I haven't.)\r\n6\r\nFor Kunafa: In a kadhaai take ghee and roast the sevaiiya on slow gas. Keep stirring until a pleasant roasted aroma releases. Cool it. Add in the Homemade pistachio paste.Mix well.\r\n7\r\nLip smacking Kunafa is ready. Spread a 2 cm layer on the cooled chocolate cake.\r\n8\r\nMelt dark chocolate and strained malai and prepare the chocolate ganache. Cool and pour on the Kunafa layer.\r\n9\r\nGarnish Pistachio Kunafa Chocolate Cake with chopped pistachio and silver balls. Keep in fridge for 2-3 hours. Then unmould the Kunafa Cake.\r\n10\r\nI also prepared Kunafa cupcakes. Cut and enjoy. The cake looked so pretty that we could either save it or have it!! ☺\r\n11\r\nCross sectional view of the Pistachio Kunafa Chocolate Cake.\r\n12\r\nEnjoy with a new sweet delicacy this festive season with family and friends. ","z":"1\r\n巧克力蛋糕：准备好所有材料。将奥利奥饼干打成粉，捏碎盐，根据需要混合温牛奶，制成蛋糕糊。加入发酵粉和醋并混合。\r\n2\r\n在松底罐上涂上油脂。倒入一层1厘米厚的面糊。\r\n3\r\n在预热的烤箱中以 160°C 烘烤 7-8 分钟，或直至刀取出时是干净的。放在金属架上冷却。\r\n4\r\n自制开心果酱：准备好所有开心果酱成分。在双锅上稍微融化白巧克力。（否则搅拌机刀片可能会破裂）在搅拌机中将开心果打成粗粉。加入炼乳。\r\n5\r\n根据需要加入稍微加热并稍微融化的白巧克力和牛奶，压碎成光滑的糊状。（可以添加绿色食用色素。我没有。）\r\n6\r\n对于 Kunafa：在 kadhaai 中加入酥油，然后用慢速燃气烘烤 sevaiiya。继续搅拌直至释放出令人愉悦的烘烤香气。冷却吧。加入自制开心果酱，搅拌均匀。\r\n7\r\n咂嘴库纳法已经准备好了。在冷却的巧克力蛋糕上铺上2厘米厚的一层。\r\n8\r\n融化黑巧克力和滤过的马来，准备巧克力甘纳许。冷却并倒在 Kunafa 层上。\r\n9\r\n用切碎的开心果和银球装饰开心果 Kunafa 巧克力蛋糕。放入冰箱冷藏2-3小时。然后将库纳法蛋糕脱模。\r\n10\r\n我还准备了库纳法纸杯蛋糕。切好即可享用。蛋糕看起来很漂亮，我们要么保存它，要么吃它！ ☺\r\n11\r\n开心果 Kunafa 巧克力蛋糕的横截面视图。\r\n12\r\n在这个节日与家人和朋友一起享受新的甜蜜美食。"},{"id":"53215","n":"Shakshouka","a":"Saudi Arabian","c":"Miscellaneous","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/crd1jz1763592990.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=618QsMaVXp8","i":[["Tomato","250g"],["Extra Virgin Olive Oil","40 ml"],["Egg","4"],["Garlic Clove","4 sliced"],["Black Pepper","To taste"],["Salt","To taste"]],"s":"1\r\nFirst, pan fry the black pepper and garlic over a dry medium heat until fragrant.\r\n2\r\nAdd a good amount of extra virgin olive oil and infuse for a minute.\r\n3\r\nOnce the oil heats up, add the tomatoes and salt, and cover with a lid. Simmer for 5 minutes.\r\n4\r\nRemove the lid and mash the tomatoes. Reduce until you reach the desired consistency of choice.\r\n5\r\nMake craters for the eggs and lower the heat. Carefully crack the eggs into the craters, making sure it touches the pan and not the tomato sauce.\r\n6\r\nCover the eggs and leave it for 5 minutes without lifting the lid.\r\n7\r\nRemove from the heat and let the residual heat steam the eggs for 1-2 minutes.\r\n8\r\nServe with flatbread. Enjoy!","z":"1\r\n首先，用干中火将黑胡椒和大蒜炒香。\r\n2\r\n添加大量特级初榨橄榄油并浸泡一分钟。\r\n3\r\n油加热后，加入西红柿和盐，盖上盖子。煮5分钟。\r\n4\r\n取下盖子，将西红柿捣碎。减少直至达到选择所需的稠度。\r\n5\r\n为鸡蛋打坑并降低温度。小心地将鸡蛋打入弹坑中，确保它接触到锅而不是番茄酱。\r\n6\r\n盖上鸡蛋并放置 5 分钟，不要打开盖子。\r\n7\r\n关火，让余热将鸡蛋蒸1-2分钟。\r\n8\r\n与大饼一起食用。享受！"},{"id":"53219","n":"Shakshuka Feta Cheese","a":"Saudi Arabian","c":"Miscellaneous","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/wpkfin1763597958.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xaBo3BxKzp8","i":[["Egg","4 large"],["Tomato Sauce","3  tablespoons"],["Olive Oil","1 tablespoon"],["Shallots","1 chopped"],["Celery","1"],["Garlic","1 clove peeled crushed"],["Spinach","1 cup"],["Feta","1/2 cup"],["Red Pepper","1/2"],["Ground Cumin","1 tsp"],["Salt","1/2 teaspoon"],["Black Pepper","1/2 teaspoon"]],"s":"1\r\nIn a pan heat the oil medium to high heat, with a tablespoon of olive oil\r\n2\r\nAdd the chopped vegetables as onions, garlic, celery and red pepper. Stir all together for 5 mins.\r\n3\r\nAdd the cumin powder and salt and pepper and the tomato sauce and let it cook for another 7 mins.\r\n4\r\nAdd the eggs, cover and leave to coo for 8 mins. Add the fresh spinach and feta cheese at the end.\r\n5\r\nServe with fresh bread.","z":"1\r\n在平底锅中用中火加热油，加入一汤匙橄榄油\r\n2\r\n加入切碎的蔬菜，如洋葱、大蒜、芹菜和红辣椒。一起搅拌 5 分钟。\r\n3\r\n加入孜然粉、盐、胡椒粉和番茄酱，再煮 7 分钟。\r\n4\r\n加入鸡蛋，盖上盖子，静置 8 分钟。最后添加新鲜菠菜和羊奶酪。\r\n5\r\n与新鲜面包一起食用。"},{"id":"53226","n":"Shawarma bread","a":"Saudi Arabian","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/i8l2fu1763742525.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ndkTbgsTCeI","i":[["Flour","1 cup"],["Salt","1 tsp"],["Sugar","1/2 tsp"],["Baking Powder","1/2 tsp"],["Oil","1 tablespoon"],["Water","Splash"]],"s":"1\r\nSieve flour and add baking powder,salt,sugar,oil nd mix together\r\n2\r\nAdd water nd knead the dough for like 10mins\r\n3\r\nCover the mixture and allow it to rise\r\n4\r\nAfter it rised transfer it to a work surface and form a round (you can use a plate or pot's lid)\r\n5\r\nHeat ur pan and put it\r\n6\r\nIt'll start puffing then you turn it\r\n7\r\nAnd lastly put it in in a warm place, then you'll see it has pocket","z":"1\r\n将面粉过筛，加入泡打粉、盐、糖、油，搅拌均匀\r\n2\r\n加入水，揉成面团10分钟左右\r\n3\r\n盖上混合物并使其发酵\r\n4\r\n升起后，将其转移到工作台面上并形成圆形（可以使用盘子或锅盖）\r\n5\r\n将锅加热并放入\r\n6\r\n它会开始冒烟，然后你转动它\r\n7\r\n最后把它放在温暖的地方，然后你会看到它有口袋"},{"id":"53217","n":"Shawarma chuck roast wrap","a":"Saudi Arabian","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/swo87v1763595282.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/YLhyRjyLkcE","i":[["Chuck Roast","1kg"],["Beef Stock","1 cup"],["Lemon Juice","3  tablespoons"],["Ground Cumin","1 tablespoon"],["Paprika","2 tsp"],["Salt","1 tsp"],["Ground Ginger","1 tsp"],["Turmeric","1 tsp"],["Cayenne Pepper","1/2 teaspoon"],["Ground Cinnamon","1/2 teaspoon"],["Ground Coriander","1/2 teaspoon"],["Ground Clove","1/4 tsp"]],"s":"1\r\nIn a dutch oven or slow cooker, add all the spices, beef broth and lemon juice. Stir to combine..\r\n2\r\nAdd the beef and turn to coat, spoon some sauce over the top.\r\n3\r\nCover and cook on low for 8-10 hours.\r\n4\r\nAfter cooking, remove beef and use two forks to shred. Discard any excess fat.\r\n5\r\nSkim fat off of the top of the liquid remaining.\r\n6\r\nMix shredded beef into sauce. Keep warm until you are ready to serve.\r\n7\r\nBuild wrap by spreading garlic sauce on the pita. Top with beef and add garnishes to your liking.\r\n8\r\nFold it burrito style.\r\n9\r\nHeat a grill pan and grill the wrap.","z":"1\r\n在荷兰烤箱或慢炖锅中，加入所有香料、牛肉汤和柠檬汁。搅拌均匀..\r\n2\r\n加入牛肉，翻面，用勺子舀一些酱汁在上面。\r\n3\r\n盖上锅盖，小火煮 8-10 小时。\r\n4\r\n煮熟后，取出牛肉并用两把叉子切碎。丢弃多余的脂肪。\r\n5\r\n从剩余液体顶部撇去脂肪。\r\n6\r\n将牛肉丝拌入酱汁中。保持温暖，直到准备好上菜。\r\n7\r\n将蒜酱涂在皮塔饼上，形成包裹。上面放上牛肉，然后根据自己的喜好添加装饰。\r\n8\r\n将其折叠成墨西哥卷饼风格。\r\n9\r\n加热烤盘并烧烤卷饼。"},{"id":"53222","n":"Vegetarian Shakshuka","a":"Saudi Arabian","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/eo0yfb1763600916.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZNEos6ybryg","i":[["Red Onions","1/2"],["Red Pepper","1/2"],["Tomato","400g"],["Cumin","1/2 teaspoon"],["Garlic Granules","1/2 tsp"],["Cayenne Pepper","1/2 teaspoon"],["Paprika","1 tsp"],["Egg","2"],["Parsley","Garnish"],["Chilli Flakes","Garnish"],["Toast","2 sliced"]],"s":"1\r\nFry onion and pepper together on medium heat until onion is soft\r\n2\r\nAdd garlic granules, cook for a minute\r\n3\r\nAdd chopped tomatoes and remaining spices, stir well\r\n4\r\nSimmer for about 20 minutes\r\n5\r\nMake indents for in the sauce and crack an egg into each one\r\n6\r\nOnce egg whites are cooked through, garnish and serve with toast","z":"1\r\n用中火将洋葱和辣椒一起炒至洋葱变软\r\n2\r\n加入蒜粒，煮一分钟\r\n3\r\n加入切碎的西红柿和剩余的香料，搅拌均匀\r\n4\r\n煮约20分钟\r\n5\r\n在酱汁上划出凹痕，然后在每个凹痕中打入一个鸡蛋\r\n6\r\n蛋白煮熟后，装饰并与吐司一起食用"},{"id":"53225","n":"Yemeni Lahsa (Elite Shakshuka)","a":"Saudi Arabian","c":"Breakfast","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/30s7vf1763741844.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/1QX-KBX6tmM","i":[["Egg","5"],["Onion","1 Diced"],["Tomato","1 Diced"],["Olive Oil","2 tablespoons"],["Allspice","1/4 tsp"],["Black Pepper","1/4 tsp"],["Liquid Cheese","3  tablespoons"]],"s":"1\r\nFirst, On medium heat, heat the olive oil and add the diced onion until it wethers. Next, add the tomatoes and cook for another 4-5 min. Lastly, add the all spice, salt, and cracked pepper.\r\n2\r\nAdd the eggs and mix throughly for 2 minutes and cover to cook 5-6 minutes until top is solidified. Lastly, spread the liquid cheese and have it covered for a minute.\r\n3\r\nI served mine Mediterranean style with hash-browns, Egyptian fava beans, Turkish salami and olives, cheese wedges, and greek feta.","z":"1\r\n首先，用中火加热橄榄油，加入洋葱丁直至变干。接下来，加入西红柿，再煮 4-5 分钟。最后，加入所有香料、盐和胡椒粉。\r\n2\r\n加入鸡蛋，搅拌 2 分钟，盖上锅盖煮 5-6 分钟，直至顶部凝固。最后，铺上液体奶酪并盖上一分钟。\r\n3\r\n我用的是地中海风格的薯饼、埃及蚕豆、土耳其萨拉米香肠和橄榄、奶酪块和希腊羊乳酪。"},{"id":"53220","n":"kabse","a":"Saudi Arabian","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/utqnjv1763598650.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lrcUixJEPK0","i":[["Chicken","400g"],["Rice","1 cup"],["Green Pepper","1"],["Red Pepper","1"],["Mushrooms","2"],["Sweetcorn","1"],["Carrots","2"],["Raisins","Handful"],["Turmeric","1 tsp"],["Kabse Spice","1 tsp"],["Salt","Pinch"],["Black Pepper","Pinch"]],"s":"1\r\nCaramelize the chicken with olive oil then add a maggi cube and boil it for around 30 minutes.\r\n2\r\nIn another pot, add all the veggies and caramelize them till they are soft.\r\n3\r\nOnce everything is done, add the rice, raisins & spices to the veggies and add 2 and a half cups of water for the rice to cook.\r\n4\r\nOnce the rice is done put everything in the oven.","z":"1\r\n用橄榄油将鸡肉焦糖化，然后加入美极块，煮约 30 分钟。\r\n2\r\n在另一个锅中，加入所有蔬菜并将其焦糖化直至变软。\r\n3\r\n一切完成后，将米饭、葡萄干和香料加入蔬菜中，然后加入两杯半水煮米饭。\r\n4\r\n米饭做好后，将所有东西放入烤箱。"},{"id":"53190","n":"Bryndzové Halušky","a":"Slovakia","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/g33c901763365484.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/IPF_VpH7FzI","i":[["Potatoes","500g"],["Plain Flour","200g"],["Egg","1"],["Salt","1 teaspoon"],["Bryndza cheese","250g"],["Bacon","200g"],["Chives","Garnish"]],"s":"1. Prepare the Dough\r\nGrate the potatoes finely using a hand grater or food processor. Place the grated potatoes in a bowl and mix them with flour, egg, and salt until a sticky dough forms. The consistency should be thick but pliable.\r\n\r\n2. Cook the Dumplings\r\nBring a large pot of salted water to a boil. Using a halušky maker (similar to a spaetzle maker), press the dough directly into the boiling water. If you don’t have one, use a tilted cutting board and a knife to scrape small pieces of dough into the water.\r\n\r\nLet the dumplings cook until they float to the surface, usually within 2-3 minutes. Scoop them out with a slotted spoon and set aside in a large bowl.\r\n\r\n3. Prepare the Toppings\r\nChop the bacon into small pieces and fry in a skillet over medium heat until crispy. If using a bryndza substitute, mix crumbled feta with a dollop of sour cream to mimic the tangy flavour of traditional Slovak sheep cheese.\r\n\r\n4. Assemble the Dish\r\nToss the cooked dumplings with the bryndza cheese (or substitute) until they’re well-coated and creamy. Top with the crispy bacon and its drippings. Garnish with chopped chives or parsley for an extra touch of colour and flavour.","z":"1.准备面团\r\n使用手动刨丝器或食品加工机将土豆磨碎。将磨碎的土豆放入碗中，与面粉、鸡蛋和盐混合，直至形成粘稠的面团。稠度应该浓稠但柔韧。\r\n\r\n2. 煮饺子\r\n将一大锅盐水煮沸。使用 halušky 机（类似于面疙瘩机），将面团直接压入沸水中。如果没有，请使用倾斜的切菜板和刀将小块面团刮入水中。\r\n\r\n让饺子煮至浮到表面，通常需要 2-3 分钟。用漏勺把它们舀出来，放在一个大碗里。\r\n\r\n3.准备配料\r\n将培根切成小块，放入平底锅中用中火煎至酥脆。如果使用bryndza替代品，请将碎羊乳酪与一团酸奶油混合，以模仿传统斯洛伐克羊奶酪的浓郁风味。\r\n\r\n4. 组装盘子\r\n将煮熟的饺子与bryndza奶酪（或替代品）一起搅拌，直到它们涂上一层厚厚的奶油。上面放上脆皮培根及其滴汁。用切碎的香葱或欧芹装饰，增添色彩和味道。"},{"id":"53188","n":"Fašírky","a":"Slovakia","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/gtpvwp1763363947.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ecBMVy3p6Ns","i":[["Ground Pork","500g"],["Onion","1 medium chopped"],["Garlic","2 cloves minced"],["Bread","2 sliced"],["Milk","1 shot"],["Egg","1"],["Salt","1 teaspoon"],["Black Pepper","1/2 teaspoon"],["Marjoram","1 teaspoon"],["Mustard","1 tsp"],["Parsley","1 tablespoon chopped"],["Flour","1/2 cup"],["Egg","1 beaten"],["Breadcrumbs","1 cup"],["Vegetable Oil","For frying"]],"s":"1. Prepare the Bread Mixture\r\nSoak the bread slices in milk or water until soft.\r\nSqueeze out excess liquid and mash into small crumbs.\r\n2. Mix the Ingredients\r\nIn a large bowl, combine ground meat, chopped onions, garlic, soaked bread, egg, and seasonings.\r\nMix well until evenly combined.\r\n3. Shape the Meat Patties\r\nTake portions of the mixture and shape them into palm-sized patties.\r\nFlatten slightly to help with even cooking.\r\n4. Coat the Patties\r\nLightly dust each patty with flour.\r\nDip into beaten egg, then coat with breadcrumbs for a crispy finish.\r\n5. Fry the Fašírky\r\nHeat vegetable oil in a pan over medium heat.\r\nFry the patties for 4-5 minutes per side until golden brown and fully cooked.\r\nTransfer to a paper towel-lined plate to drain excess oil.\r\n6. Serve and Enjoy\r\nServe Fašírky hot with mashed potatoes, cabbage salad, or fresh bread.\r\nEnjoy with mustard, pickles, or garlic sauce for extra flavor.","z":"1.准备面包混合物\r\n将面包片浸泡在牛奶或水中直至变软。\r\n挤出多余的液体并捣碎成小面包屑。\r\n2. 混合配料\r\n在一个大碗中，将碎肉、切碎的洋葱、大蒜、浸泡的面包、鸡蛋和调味料混合。\r\n充分混合直至混合均匀。\r\n3. 塑造肉饼形状\r\n取一部分混合物，将其塑造成手掌大小的肉饼。\r\n稍微压平以帮助均匀烹饪。\r\n4.给肉饼涂上一层涂层\r\n在每个馅饼上轻轻撒上面粉。\r\n浸入打散的鸡蛋中，然后涂上面包屑，以获得酥脆的口感。\r\n5. 煎Fašírky\r\n在平底锅中用中火加热植物油。\r\n将肉饼每面煎 4-5 分钟，直至呈金黄色并完全煮熟。\r\n转移到衬有纸巾的盘子上，沥干多余的油。\r\n6. 服务和享受\r\nFašírky 趁热与土豆泥、卷心菜沙拉或新鲜面包一起食用。\r\n与芥末、泡菜或蒜酱一起享用，增添风味。"},{"id":"53189","n":"Zemiakové Placky","a":"Slovakia","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/0umm891763364625.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WfpE70EIw2w","i":[["Potatoes","1 kg"],["Onion","1 medium chopped"],["Garlic","2 cloves minced"],["Egg","4 large"],["All purpose flour","4 tablespoons"],["Marjoram","1 teaspoon"],["Salt","To taste"],["Black Pepper","To taste"],["Oil","For frying"]],"s":"1. Prepare the Potatoes\r\nStart by peeling and finely grating the potatoes. To ensure extra crispiness, use a clean kitchen towel to squeeze out as much moisture as possible.\r\n\r\n2. Mix the Ingredients\r\nIn a large mixing bowl, combine the grated potatoes, chopped onion, minced garlic, eggs, flour, marjoram, salt, and black pepper. Stir well until the mixture forms a thick, consistent batter.\r\n\r\n3. Heat the Oil\r\nIn a large frying pan, heat a generous amount of oil over medium heat. The oil should be hot but not smoking.\r\n\r\n4. Fry the Pancakes\r\nSpoon portions of the batter into the pan, flattening each into a thin pancake. Fry until golden brown and crispy on one side, then flip and cook the other side until equally golden and crispy.\r\n\r\n5. Drain & Serve\r\nTransfer the cooked pancakes onto a plate lined with paper towels to remove excess oil. Serve immediately while hot, with sour cream, garlic dip, or as a side dish.","z":"1.准备土豆\r\n首先将土豆去皮并磨碎。为了确保额外的酥脆，请使用干净的厨房毛巾尽可能挤出水分。\r\n\r\n2. 混合配料\r\n在一个大碗中，将磨碎的土豆、切碎的洋葱、切碎的大蒜、鸡蛋、面粉、马郁兰、盐和黑胡椒混合。充分搅拌直至混合物形成浓稠、一致的面糊。\r\n\r\n3.加热油\r\n在一个大煎锅中，用中火加热大量的油。油应该是热的但不冒烟。\r\n\r\n4.煎薄饼\r\n将面糊的一部分舀入锅中，将每份面糊压平成薄煎饼。将一侧煎至金黄色酥脆，然后翻转并煎另一面，直至同样金黄酥脆。\r\n\r\n5. 沥干并上桌\r\n将煮熟的煎饼转移到衬有纸巾的盘子上，以除去多余的油。趁热立即食用，搭配酸奶油、大蒜酱或作为配菜。"},{"id":"53187","n":"Šúĺlance s Makom","a":"Slovakia","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/d6o4nu1763362422.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/gUS-__P4nW0","i":[["Potatoes","700g"],["All purpose flour","300g"],["Semolina","100g"],["Salt","Pinch"],["Ground Poppy seeds","150g"],["Powdered Sugar","100g"],["Butter","100g"]],"s":"1. Prepare the Potatoes\r\n\r\nBoil the potatoes with their skins on until tender.\r\nLet them cool completely (preferably overnight), then peel and mash them finely.\r\n2. Make the Dough\r\n\r\nIn a bowl, combine mashed potatoes, flour, semolina, and salt.\r\nKnead the mixture until you get a smooth, non-sticky dough.\r\n3. Shape the Šúĺlance\r\n\r\nDivide the dough into portions and roll each into a thin rope (about 1.5 cm in diameter).\r\nCut into 3 cm-long pieces and roll between your palms to shape small dumplings.\r\n4. Cook the Dumplings\r\n\r\nBring a pot of salted water to a boil.\r\nDrop in the dumplings in batches and cook until they float to the surface (about 2-3 minutes).\r\nDrain and transfer to a bowl.\r\n5. Prepare the Topping\r\n\r\nIn a separate bowl, mix ground poppy seeds and powdered sugar.\r\nMelt the butter and keep it ready.\r\n6. Assemble the Dish\r\n\r\nDrizzle the cooked dumplings with melted butter.\r\nToss them in the poppy seed-sugar mixture until evenly coated.\r\n7. Serve and Enjoy\r\n\r\nServe warm, optionally with a dusting of extra powdered sugar or a drizzle of honey.","z":"1.准备土豆\r\n\r\n将带皮的土豆煮至变软。\r\n让它们完全冷却（最好过夜），然后剥皮并捣碎。\r\n2. 制作面团\r\n\r\n在一个碗中，将土豆泥、面粉、粗面粉和盐混合。\r\n揉捏混合物直至得到光滑、不粘的面团。\r\n3. 塑造 Šúĺlance\r\n\r\n将面团分成几份，然后将每一份擀成细绳（直径约1.5厘米）。\r\n切成3厘米长的块，在手掌之间滚动，形成小饺子。\r\n4. 煮饺子\r\n\r\n将一锅盐水煮沸。\r\n分批放入饺子，煮至浮出水面（约2-3分钟）。\r\n沥干并转移到碗中。\r\n5.准备配料\r\n\r\n在另一个碗中，混合磨碎的罂粟籽和糖粉。\r\n将黄油融化并备用。\r\n6. 组装盘子\r\n\r\n在煮熟的饺子上淋上融化的黄油。\r\n将它们放入罂粟籽和糖的混合物中，直至均匀覆盖。\r\n7. 服务和享受\r\n\r\n趁热食用，可选择撒上额外的糖粉或细雨蜂蜜。"},{"id":"53158","n":"Air fryer patatas bravas","a":"Spanish","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/3m8yae1763257951.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kzLaw6PG2UY","i":[["Potatoes","900g"],["Olive Oil","3  tablespoons"],["Onion","1 chopped"],["Garlic","1 clove peeled crushed"],["Paprika","1 tblsp"],["Tomato Puree","1 tblsp"],["Tinned Tomatos","225g"],["Basil Leaves","To serve"]],"s":"step 1\r\nSoak the potatoes in just-boiled water for 30 mins, then drain and leave to air-dry for 5 mins. Heat the air fryer to 200C. Tip the potatoes into a bowl and drizzle over 1 tbsp of the oil and add 1/2 tsp each of salt and freshly ground black pepper. Mix to coat the potatoes all over, then tip into the air fryer basket and cook for 20-30 mins until crisp and golden.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nMeanwhile, heat the remaining oil in a small pan over a medium-low heat and fry the onion for 8-10 mins until softened but not golden. Stir in the garlic and cook for a minute before adding the paprika and cooking for 30 seconds more. Stir in the tomato purée, cook for 1 min, then tip in the chopped tomatoes. Cook for 5-10 mins over a medium heat until thickened slightly.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nOnce the potatoes are cooked, tip out onto a platter and pour over the tomato sauce. Sprinkle with the basil leaves, then serve.","z":"步骤1\r\n将土豆放入刚煮沸的水中浸泡 30 分钟，然后沥干并风干 5 分钟。将空气炸锅加热至200C。将土豆放入碗中，淋上 1 汤匙油，然后加入 1/2 茶匙盐和现磨黑胡椒。混合均匀，将土豆裹满，然后放入空气炸锅炸篮中，煮 20-30 分钟，直至土豆酥脆、呈金黄色。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n与此同时，在小锅中用中低火加热剩余的油，将洋葱煎8-10分钟，直至洋葱变软但不是金黄色。拌入大蒜，煮一分钟，然后加入辣椒粉，再煮 30 秒。加入番茄泥，煮 1 分钟，然后加入切碎的番茄。用中火煮5-10分钟，直至稍微变稠。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n土豆煮熟后，倒在盘子上，淋上番茄酱。撒上罗勒叶，然后上桌。"},{"id":"53169","n":"Ajo blanco","a":"Spanish","c":"Starter","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/5jdtie1763289302.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AS2mSRtWyW0","i":[["White bread","150g"],["Almonds","200g"],["Extra Virgin Olive Oil","50 ml"],["Garlic Clove","1"],["Red Wine Vinegar","1 ½ tbsp"]],"s":"step 1\r\nTip the bread into a bowl and pour over 350ml water. Leave to soak for 10 mins.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nBlend the ingredients together with 350ml water and 1 tsp salt.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nLet the soup cool in the fridge for 1 hr or so, then serve with a drizzle of oil and some black pepper.","z":"步骤1\r\n将面包放入碗中，倒入 350 毫升水。浸泡 10 分钟。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将所有成分与 350 毫升水和 1 茶匙盐混合。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n让汤在冰箱中冷却1小时左右，然后淋上少许油和一些黑胡椒即可食用。"},{"id":"53156","n":"Arroz al horno (baked rice)","a":"Spanish","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/qt4i0n1763256454.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=f-waAIrn2iA","i":[["Extra Virgin Olive Oil","2 tbsp"],["Pork belly slices","800g"],["Black Pudding","150g"],["Bacon lardon","100g"],["Onion","1 chopped"],["Red Pepper","2"],["Plum Tomatoes","1 chopped"],["Garlic Clove","8"],["Paprika","4 teaspoons"],["Chilli Flakes","1/2 teaspoon"],["Dried white beans","200g"],["Chicken Stock","1 1/2 L"],["Thyme","6 parts"],["Paella Rice","375g"],["Lemon Juice","1"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat oven to 200C/180C/gas 6. Heat half the oil in a deep frying or sauté pan (or shallow casserole dish) measuring around 30cm in diameter. Over a high heat, colour the pork belly slices on each side in several batches, then transfer to a bowl. Add the remaining oil to the pan and lower the heat to medium, then add the black pudding and bacon and fry all over for several mins. Remove with a slotted spoon. Fry the onion and peppers for around 10 mins until soft and pale gold, then add the tomato and cook until soft. Add the garlic, smoked paprika and chilli flakes and cook for another 2 mins, then put the pork, black pudding and bacon back in the pan. Add the beans, stock and whichever herb you're using, and bring everything to the boil.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nSprinkle the rice around the pork belly, pushing it underneath the stock. Let the stock come to the boil again, season well, then transfer to the oven (leave it uncovered). Cook for 20 mins without stirring, then check to see how the rice is doing. The rice should be tender and the stock absorbed. If it’s not ready, put back in the oven for another 5 mins, then check again. Taste for seasoning.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nSqueeze lemon juice over the top and drizzle over some extra virgin olive oil just before serving, if you like.","z":"步骤1\r\n将烤箱加热至 200C/180C/煤气 6. 在直径约 30 厘米的深煎锅或炒锅（或浅砂锅）中加热一半油。用大火将五花肉片的每一面分几次上色，然后转移到碗中。将剩余的油加入锅中，将火调至中火，然后加入黑布丁和培根，煎几分钟。用有槽勺取出。将洋葱和辣椒炒约 10 分钟，直至变软并呈浅金黄色，然后加入番茄，煮至变软。加入大蒜、烟熏辣椒粉和辣椒片，再煮 2 分钟，然后将猪肉、黑布丁和培根放回锅中。加入豆子、高汤和任何你正在使用的香草，然后将所有东西煮沸。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将米饭撒在五花肉周围，将其推到高汤下面。让高汤再次沸腾，充分调味，然后转移到烤箱（不盖盖子）。在不搅拌的情况下煮 20 分钟，然后检查米饭的表现。米饭应该很嫩并且汤汁被吸收。如果还没准备好，请放回烤箱再烤 5 分钟，然后再次检查。尝尝调味。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n如果您愿意，可以在食用前将柠檬汁挤在上面，然后淋上一些特级初榨橄榄油。"},{"id":"53147","n":"Arroz con gambas y calamar","a":"Spanish","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/jc6oub1763196663.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nFFp0ebOlOo","i":[["Raw King Prawns","24"],["Olive Oil","2 tbsp"],["Onion","1 small"],["Bay Leaf","1"],["Saffron","1 pinch"],["Paella Rice","450g"],["Tomato Puree","2 teaspoons"],["White Wine","200ml"],["Seafood stock","650ml"],["Squid","3 Medium"]],"s":"step 1\r\nPeel and devein most of the prawns (a fishmonger should be able to do this for you), keeping a few whole for decoration, if you like. Heat the olive oil in a large frying pan or shallow flameproof casserole over a medium-low heat and fry the onion for 5 mins until softened. Add the bay leaf, saffron, rice and tomato purée, and cook for 1-2 mins more, stirring.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nPour in the wine and bubble for 1-2 mins, then pour in the seafood stock and 150ml water. Cook for 5 mins, then add the squid, season well and stir to combine. Bring to the boil, then cover and reduce the heat to a gentle simmer. Cook for 12 mins more, adding a little more water if the mixture starts to look dry.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nUncover the pan and stir through the peeled prawns, then arrange any whole prawns on top of the rice mixture. Cover again and simmer for a further 5-6 mins until the prawns are pink and cooked through. Leave to stand for a couple of minutes before serving from the pan.","z":"步骤1\r\n将大部分虾去皮、去虾线（鱼贩应该可以为你做这件事），如果你愿意的话，保留一些完整的用于装饰。在大煎锅或浅防火砂锅中用中低火加热橄榄油，煎洋葱 5 分钟直至变软。加入月桂叶、藏红花、大米和番茄泥，再煮 1-2 分钟，同时搅拌。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n倒入酒，泡1-2分钟，然后倒入海鲜高汤和150毫升水。煮5分钟，然后加入鱿鱼，充分调味并搅拌均匀。煮沸，然后盖上锅盖，将火调至小火慢炖。再煮 12 分钟，如果混合物开始变干，则再加一点水。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n打开锅盖，搅拌去皮的虾，然后将整只虾放在米饭混合物上。再次盖上盖子，再煮 5-6 分钟，直到虾变成粉红色并煮熟。静置几分钟，然后从锅中食用。"},{"id":"53161","n":"Chicken & chorizo rice pot","a":"Spanish","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/fk80jp1763280767.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CiY6ZOYRMI4","i":[["Oil","1 tblsp"],["Chicken","1 whole"],["Onion","1 Large Chopped"],["Red Pepper","1 chopped"],["Garlic","3 Cloves Crushed"],["Chorizo","225g"],["Tomato Puree","1 tblsp"],["Thyme","1 tablespoon chopped"],["White Wine","150ml"],["Chicken Stock","800ml"],["Rice","400g"],["Parsley","2 tbs chopped"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat the oil in a large flameproof casserole dish and brown the chicken pieces on all sides – you may have to do this in batches. Remove from the dish and put to one side.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nLower the heat, add the onion and pepper, and gently cook for 10 mins until softened. Add the garlic and chorizo, and cook for a further 2 mins until the chorizo has released some of its oils into the dish. Stir in the tomato purée and cook for 1 min more.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nReturn the chicken pieces to the dish along with the thyme, white wine and stock. Bring the liquid to a boil, cover the dish with a tight-fitting lid and lower the heat. Cook for 30 mins.\r\n\r\nstep 4\r\nTip in the rice and stir everything together. Cover, set over a low heat and cook for a further 15 mins, or until the rice is cooked and has absorbed most of the cooking liquid. Remove from the heat and leave the dish to sit for 10 mins to absorb any remaining liquid. Season to taste and scatter with parsley to serve.","z":"步骤1\r\n在一个大的防火砂锅中加热油，将鸡块四面煎黄——你可能需要分批进行。从盘子中取出并放在一侧。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n降低热量，加入洋葱和胡椒，轻轻煮 10 分钟直至变软。加入大蒜和香肠，再煮 2 分钟，直到香肠将一些油释放到盘子中。加入番茄泥，再煮 1 分钟。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n将鸡块与百里香、白葡萄酒和高汤一起放回盘子中。将液体煮沸，盖上盖子并降低热量。煮30分钟。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n倒入米饭并将所有东西搅拌在一起。盖上锅盖，用小火再煮 15 分钟，或直到米饭煮熟并吸收大部分煮液。将锅从火上移开，静置 10 分钟以吸收剩余的液体。调味并撒上欧芹即可食用。"},{"id":"53186","n":"Chicken with saffron, raisins & pine nuts","a":"Spanish","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/4mhr3u1763481087.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uKWjI2DNq0Q","i":[["Chicken","1.25kg"],["Olive Oil","2 tblsp"],["Garlic","3 cloves Chopped"],["Saffron","Pinch"],["Dry sherry","125ml"],["Chicken Stock","200ml"],["Thyme","1 tbsp"],["Raisins","50g"],["Pine Nuts","2 tbsp"],["Parsley","Handful"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat a large frying pan on a high heat and season the chicken. Add the olive oil to the pan, then the chicken. Brown for about 5 mins on each side, remove onto a plate, then set aside.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nLower the heat to medium. In the remaining fat, fry the onions for 3 mins, then add the garlic and saffron. Cook for 3-4 mins more. Add the sherry, then simmer for 3-5 mins until syrupy.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nPut the chicken leg pieces back into the pan, tip in the stock, thyme and raisins, cover, then gently cook on a low heat for 20 mins. Add the breast meat and any juices left on the plate. Simmer for 10 mins more until cooked through and the sauce in the pan has reduced.\r\n\r\nstep 4\r\nWhile the chicken is cooking, heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Scatter the pine nuts over a baking sheet, then roast for 10 mins until golden and toasted. Once the chicken has cooked through, season to taste, scatter with pine nuts and parsley, then serve with rice.","z":"步骤1\r\n用大火加热一个大煎锅，给鸡肉调味。将橄榄油加入锅中，然后加入鸡肉。每面煎约 5 分钟，取出放在盘子上，然后放在一边。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将热量降低至中等。在剩余的脂肪中，将洋葱炒 3 分钟，然后加入大蒜和藏红花。再煮3-4分钟。加入雪利酒，然后煮 3-5 分钟直至呈糖浆状。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n将鸡腿块放回锅中，倒入高汤、百里香和葡萄干，盖上锅盖，小火煮 20 分钟。添加胸肉和盘子上剩下的汁液。再煮10分钟，直至熟透，锅中的酱汁收干。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n烹饪鸡肉时，将烤箱加热至 200C/180C 风扇/煤气 6. 将松子撒在烤盘上，然后烤 10 分钟直至金黄并烤熟。鸡肉煮熟后，调味，撒上松子和欧芹，然后与米饭一起食用。"},{"id":"53166","n":"Chickpea, chorizo & spinach stew","a":"Spanish","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/xvnx8j1763287209.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nI2Sm4B3gWU","i":[["Extra Virgin Olive Oil","4 tablespoons"],["Onion","1 chopped"],["Carrots","1 Diced"],["Celery","1 Diced"],["Thyme","3"],["Bay Leaves","2"],["Garlic","2 cloves chopped"],["Chorizo","200g"],["Cinnamon","1/4 tsp"],["Paprika","1 teaspoon"],["Chickpeas","800g"],["Sherry vinegar","2 tblsp"],["Spinach","400g"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat the oil in a large pan, then gently fry the onion for 3-4 mins until it begins to soften. Stir in the carrot, celery, thyme and bay leaves. Season, then cook for 2-3 mins, stirring occasionally. Add the garlic, chorizo, cinnamon and smoked paprika. Gently fry until the vegetables soften and the chorizo starts to release its oils and crisp up.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nStir in the chickpeas, vinegar and 150ml water, then bring to a simmer for 1-2 mins until the chickpeas have heated up. Add the spinach, then stir through the chickpeas until it wilts a little. Remove from the heat, season to taste, then serve warm with crusty bread.","z":"步骤1\r\n在大锅中加热油，然后轻轻煎洋葱 3-4 分钟，直至洋葱开始软化。加入胡萝卜、芹菜、百里香和月桂叶。调味，然后煮 2-3 分钟，偶尔搅拌。加入大蒜、香肠、肉桂和烟熏辣椒粉。轻轻煎至蔬菜变软，香肠开始释放油脂并变脆。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n加入鹰嘴豆、醋和 150 毫升水，然后小火煮 1-2 分钟，直至鹰嘴豆变热。加入菠菜，然后搅拌鹰嘴豆，直至其稍微枯萎。从火上移开，调味，然后与硬皮面包一起温热食用。"},{"id":"53170","n":"Chocolate churros with chocolate & salted caramel sauce","a":"Spanish","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/erzs951763296201.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=J45Y5olZCuo","i":[["Sunflower Oil","For frying"],["Ice Cream","To serve"],["Muscovado Sugar","120g"],["Butter","60g"],["Double Cream","250ml"],["Dark Chocolate","100g"],["Golden Caster Sugar","100g"],["Cinnamon","2 teaspoon"],["Plain Flour","200g"],["Cocoa Powder","50g"],["Baking Powder","1 teaspoon"],["Vanilla Extract","1 teaspoon"],["Melted Butter","50g"]],"s":"step 1\r\nTo make the sauce, tip the sugar and butter into a saucepan and bring to a simmer until the sugar has melted, then stir in the cream and simmer until you have a smooth sauce, about 2-3 mins. Remove from the heat, stir through a pinch of sea salt and the chocolate, and continue to stir for 2-3 mins, or until it has completely melted. Keep warm or leave to cool for reheating later. For the coating, mix the sugar with the cinnamon and a small pinch of fine sea salt and set aside.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nFor the churros, tip the flour, cocoa, baking powder and a large pinch of salt into a bowl. Add the vanilla extract and melted butter, then carefully pour in 250-300ml boiling water and whisk to make a smooth, very thick batter. Leave to cool for a few minutes, then scrape the mixture into a piping bag fitted with a medium star nozzle.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nTip sunflower oil into a deep-fat fryer following the manufacturer’s instructions, or a heavy-based pan, ensuring it is no more than a third full. Heat to 170C, or until a cube of bread dropped in browns in 30 seconds. Pipe 12-15cm lengths of dough into the oil, snipping off the end of each one with a pair of scissors as you go. Pipe four or five at a time and cook for around 4 mins, or until golden and crisp, turning them with tongs or a slotted spoon as they cook. Remove from the oil and place on a wire rack. Repeat with the rest of the dough. Leave to cool if reheating later, otherwise roll the churros in the cinnamon sugar and serve immediately with the warm chocolate sauce and ice cream. To reheat the churros, put on a tray and bake for 5-8 mins, then roll in the sugar coating. Meanwhile, warm the sauce in a pan and serve alongside for dipping.","z":"步骤1\r\n制作酱汁时，将糖和黄油倒入平底锅中，小火煮至糖融化，然后加入奶油，小火煮约 2-3 分钟，直至酱汁变得光滑。从火上移开，加入少许海盐和巧克力，继续搅拌 2-3 分钟，或直至其完全融化。保持温暖或冷却以便稍后重新加热。对于涂层，将糖与肉桂和一小撮细海盐混合并放在一边。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n制作西班牙油条时，将面粉、可可粉、泡打粉和一大撮盐倒入碗中。加入香草精和融化的黄油，然后小心地倒入 250-300 毫升沸水，搅拌成光滑、浓稠的面糊。冷却几分钟，然后将混合物刮入装有中型星形喷嘴的裱花袋中。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n按照制造商的说明将葵花籽油倒入深油炸锅或厚底锅中，确保不超过三分之一。加热至 170°C，或直至一块面包在 30 秒内变成棕色。将12-15厘米长的面团放入油中，边剪边用剪刀剪掉每个面团的末端。一次放四到五个，煮大约 4 分钟，或者直到金黄酥脆，一边煮一边用钳子或漏勺转动它们。从油中取出并放在金属架上。对其余的面团重复上述步骤。如果稍后重新加热，请冷却，否则将油条卷入肉桂糖中，立即与热巧克力酱和冰淇淋一起食用。要重新加热油条，请将其放在托盘上烘烤 5-8 分钟，然后裹上糖衣。与此同时，将酱汁放入平底锅中加热，然后一起食用。"},{"id":"53168","n":"Chorizo & chickpea soup","a":"Spanish","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/kggfo91763288633.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=I_oZ8r6VxL4","i":[["Tinned Tomatos","400g"],["Chorizo","110g"],["Savoy Cabbage","140g"],["Chilli Flakes","Sprinkling"],["Chickpeas","400g can"],["Chicken Stock","1"],["Crusty Bread","To serve"]],"s":"step 1\r\nPut a medium pan on the heat and tip in the tomatoes, followed by a can of water. While the tomatoes are heating, quickly chop the chorizo into chunky pieces (removing any skin) and shred the cabbage.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nPile the chorizo and cabbage into the pan with the chilli flakes and chickpeas, then crumble in the stock cube. Stir well, cover and leave to bubble over a high heat for 6 mins or until the cabbage is just tender. Ladle into bowls and eat with crusty or garlic bread.","z":"步骤1\r\n将一个中等大小的平底锅放在火上，倒入西红柿，然后倒入一罐水。当西红柿加热时，快速将香肠切成大块（去除任何皮肤）并将卷心菜切碎。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将香肠和卷心菜与辣椒片和鹰嘴豆一起放入锅中，然后在高汤块中碾碎。搅拌均匀，盖上锅盖，大火煮 6 分钟或直至卷心菜变软。舀入碗中，与硬皮面包或大蒜面包一起食用。"},{"id":"53157","n":"Chorizo & soft-boiled egg salad","a":"Spanish","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/v8eaed1763257313.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PfAjfn5dYHE","i":[["Baby New Potatoes","500g"],["Egg","4"],["Green Beans","225g"],["Chorizo","225g"],["Garlic Clove","1 sliced"],["Sherry vinegar","2 tbsp"],["Parsley","2 tbsp chopped"]],"s":"step 1\r\nCook the potatoes in a large pan of boiling salted water for 12 mins, adding the eggs after 6 mins, and the beans for the final 2 mins. Drain everything and cool the eggs under cold running water.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nMeanwhile fry chorizo slices for 1-2 mins, until beginning to crisp. Remove from the pan with a slotted spoon and set aside, leaving the oil from the chorizo in the pan. Add the garlic to the pan and cook gently for 1 min.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nRemove the pan from the heat, stir in the vinegar and parsley, then toss with the potatoes, beans, chorizo and seasoning. Shell the eggs, cut into quarters and add to the salad.","z":"步骤1\r\n将土豆放入一大锅沸腾的盐水中煮 12 分钟，6 分钟后加入鸡蛋，最后 2 分钟加入豆子。沥干所有东西，然后在冷水下冷却鸡蛋。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n同时将香肠片煎 1-2 分钟，直至开始变脆。用漏勺从锅中取出，放在一边，将香肠中的油留在锅中。将大蒜放入锅中，轻轻煮 1 分钟。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n将锅从火上移开，拌入醋和欧芹，然后与土豆、豆类、香肠和调味料一起搅拌。将鸡蛋去壳，切成四等份，加入沙拉中。"},{"id":"53185","n":"Chorizo & tomato salad","a":"Spanish","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/6cskio1763338156.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RFlENguMJNA","i":[["Beef tomatoes","3"],["Red Onions","1/2"],["Thyme","Sprigs of fresh"],["Sherry vinegar","1 tablespoon"],["Extra Virgin Olive Oil","2 tblsp"],["Chorizo","100g"]],"s":"step 1\r\nPut the tomatoes in a bowl with the onion and thyme. Season, then drizzle with the vinegar and oil. Let the flavours mingle while you cook the chorizo.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nIn a hot, dry pan, fry the chorizo slices until browned on both sides. Serve the tomatoes with the fried chorizo, drizzled with a little oil from the pan.","z":"步骤1\r\n将西红柿与洋葱和百里香一起放入碗中。调味，然后淋上醋和油。煮香肠时让各种味道混合在一起。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n在热干锅中，将香肠片煎至两面焦黄。将西红柿与炸香肠一起食用，淋上锅中的少许油。"},{"id":"53159","n":"Chorizo, potato & cheese omelette","a":"Spanish","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/0y6uvc1763258983.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=K2Ba5BWYXUU","i":[["Potatoes","1 small"],["Olive Oil","1 teaspoon"],["Chorizo","50g"],["Egg","3"],["Parsley","Chopped"],["Cheddar Cheese","25g"]],"s":"step 1\r\nCook the potato in boiling water for 8-10 mins or until tender. Drain and allow to steam-dry. Heat oil in an omelette pan, add chorizo and cook for 2 mins. Add the potato and cook for a further 5 mins until the potato starts to crisp. Spoon pan contents out, wipe pan and cook a 2 or 3-egg omelette in the same pan. When almost cooked, scatter with the chorizo and potato, parsley and cheese. Fold the omelette in the pan and cook for 1 min more to melt the cheese.","z":"步骤1\r\n将土豆放入沸水中煮 8-10 分钟或直至变软。沥干并蒸汽干燥。在煎蛋锅中加热油，加入香肠，煮 2 分钟。加入土豆，再煮 5 分钟，直到土豆开始变脆。用勺子舀出锅中的内容物，擦拭锅并在同一个锅中煮 2 或 3 个鸡蛋的煎蛋卷。快熟时，撒上香肠、土豆、欧芹和奶酪。将煎蛋卷放入锅中，再煮 1 分钟，使奶酪融化。"},{"id":"53153","n":"Churros","a":"Spanish","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/nxnny61763250596.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=453mpKHVaBs","i":[["Butter","50g"],["Vanilla Extract","1/2 teaspoon"],["Plain Flour","250g"],["Baking Powder","1 teaspoon"],["Sunflower Oil","1 L"],["Bread","2 chopped"],["Dark Chocolate","200g"],["Double Cream","100 ml"],["Milk","100 ml"],["Golden Syrup","3  tablespoons"],["Vanilla Extract","1/2 teaspoon"],["Caster Sugar","100g"],["Cinnamon","2 teaspoon"]],"s":"step 1\r\nBoil the kettle, then measure 300ml boiling water into a jug and add the melted butter and vanilla extract. Sift the flour and baking powder into a big mixing bowl with a big pinch of salt. Make a well in the centre, then pour in the contents of the jug and very quickly beat into the flour with a wooden spoon until lump-free. Rest for 10-15 mins while you make the sauce.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nPut all the sauce ingredients into a pan and gently melt together, stirring occasionally until you have a smooth shiny sauce. Keep warm on a low heat.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nFill a large deep saucepan one-third full of oil. Cooking with hot oil can be dangerous – before you start, read up on how to deep-fry safely to avoid accidents in the kitchen. Heat until a cube of bread browns in 45 seconds to 1 min. Cover a tray with kitchen paper and mix the caster sugar and cinnamon together.\r\n\r\nstep 4\r\nFit a star nozzle to a piping bag – 1.5-2cm wide is a good size. Fill with the rested dough, then pipe 2-3 strips directly into the pan, snipping off each dough strip with a pair of kitchen scissors. Fry until golden brown and crisp. Be very careful here – if air bubbles form in the churros they can explode, especially if the oil overheats or you use old flour. Cooking with hot oil can be dangerous – before you start, read up on how to deep-fry safely to avoid accidents in the kitchen. Keep children out of the kitchen and protect yourself by wearing long sleeves and eye protection, and keeping your face away from the pan.\r\n\r\nstep 5\r\nOnce the churros are crisp and golden brown, remove them from the oil with a slotted spoon and drain on the kitchen paper-lined tray. Carry on cooking the rest of the dough in batches, sprinkling the cooked churros with some cinnamon sugar as you go. When you’ve cooked all the churros, toss with any remaining cinnamon sugar and serve with the chocolate sauce, for dipping.\r\nTo see a video of how to prepare churros, take a look at our churros ice cream sandwich recipe.","z":"步骤1\r\n将水壶煮沸，然后将 300 毫升沸水倒入壶中，加入融化的黄油和香草精。将面粉和泡打粉筛入一个大碗中，加入一大撮盐。在中心挖一个洞，然后倒入罐中的内容物，并用木勺快速搅拌面粉，直至无结块。制作酱汁时休息 10-15 分钟。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将所有酱料放入锅中，轻轻融化，偶尔搅拌，直到酱汁变得光滑闪亮。用小火保持温暖。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n在一个大的深平底锅中倒入三分之一的油。用热油烹饪可能很危险 - 在开始之前，请阅读如何安全油炸以避免厨房发生事故。加热直至一块面包在 45 秒至 1 分钟内变成棕色。用厨房用纸盖住托盘，将细砂糖和肉桂混合在一起。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n在裱花袋上安装一个星形喷嘴——1.5-2厘米宽的尺寸比较合适。将松弛好的面团填满，然后将 2-3 条直接放入锅中，用厨房剪刀剪掉每条面团。炸至金黄色酥脆。这里要非常小心——如果油条中形成气泡，它们就会爆炸，特别是如果油过热或者你使用旧面粉。用热油烹饪可能很危险 - 在开始之前，请阅读如何安全油炸以避免厨房发生事故。让儿童远离厨房，并穿长袖衣服和护目镜，并让脸远离锅来保护自己。\r\n\r\n步骤5\r\n一旦油条变脆并呈金黄色，用漏勺将其从油中取出，然后放在铺有厨房纸的托盘上沥干。继续分批烹饪剩余的面团，边煮边在煮熟的油条上撒上一些肉桂糖。当你煮完所有的油条后，与剩余的肉桂糖一起搅拌，并与巧克力酱一起食用，以供浸渍。\r\n要观看如何准备油条的视频，请查看我们的油条冰淇淋三明治食谱。"},{"id":"53154","n":"Clam, chorizo & white bean stew","a":"Spanish","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/92wbmf1763252334.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IoRuT7TxDAo","i":[["Chorizo","50g"],["Onion","1 chopped"],["Garlic Clove","1"],["Parsley","Bunch"],["Vegetable Stock","200ml"],["Tinned Tomatos","400g"],["Butter Beans","400g"],["Sherry vinegar","1 teaspoon"],["Clams","600g"],["Crusty Bread","To serve"]],"s":"step 1\r\nFry the chorizo in a large frying pan with a lid, over a medium heat until it is starting to crisp up and release its oil. Add the onion and cook for 5 mins until starting to soften. Then add the garlic and finely chopped parsley, and fry for 1 min more.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nPour on the stock and tomatoes. Bring to the boil, reduce the heat, then add the beans and sherry vinegar. Simmer for 10 mins until the liquid is slightly reduced.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nScatter over the clams, cover with the lid and steam for 2-4 mins, shaking the pan occasionally until the clams are open. Have a little taste before seasoning, as the clams can be quite salty. Then scatter over the chopped parsley. Eat with lots of crusty bread.","z":"步骤1\r\n在一个带盖的大煎锅中用中火煎香肠，直到它开始变脆并释放出油。加入洋葱，煮 5 分钟直至开始变软。然后加入大蒜和切碎的欧芹，再炒 1 分钟。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n倒在高汤和西红柿上。煮沸，降低热量，然后加入豆子和雪利酒醋。小火煮 10 分钟，直至液体稍微减少。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n撒在蛤蜊上，盖上盖子，蒸2-4分钟，偶尔摇动锅，直到蛤蜊张开。调味前先尝尝味道，因为蛤蜊可能很咸。然后撒上切碎的欧芹。与大量硬皮面包一起食用。"},{"id":"53148","n":"Crema Catalana","a":"Spanish","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/x73ll91763247842.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5aw5Ba0PCa0","i":[["Milk","400ml"],["Double Cream","150ml"],["Cinnamon Stick","1"],["Orange Zest","1"],["Lemon Zest","1"],["Egg Yolks","7"],["Caster Sugar","100g"],["Caster Sugar","6 tablespoons"],["Corn Flour","45g"]],"s":"step 1\r\nPut the milk, cream, cinnamon stick and all the citrus zest in a saucepan set over a medium heat. Cook, stirring often, until the milk is just steaming but not boiling, about 3-5 mins. Remove from the heat, cover with a plate and leave to infuse for at least 30 mins.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nWhen the cream mixture has infused, whisk the egg yolks, sugar and cornflour together in a separate bowl for 3-5 mins, or until light and pale in colour. Pour the infused milk through a sieve into the egg mixture, whisking continuously. Return the mixture to the saucepan.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nPut the saucepan over a medium-high heat and whisk for around 10-12 mins. The mixture should start thickening to a custard-like consistency – you can tell it’s ready by dipping a wooden spoon in the mixture, then running a finger through the mixture on the back of the spoon. If the line holds, it's ready. Sieve the mixture into a jug to remove any froth.\r\n\r\nstep 4\r\nDivide the custard between six 150ml ramekins or small terracotta dishes, then leave to cool for 1 hr at room temperature until set with a slight wobble. Chill overnight.\r\n\r\nstep 5\r\nJust before serving, sprinkle 1 tbsp caster sugar over the top of each ramekin and caramelise using a kitchen blowtorch. Alternatively, slide the ramekins under a hot grill until the sugar turns golden and starts to bubble. Serve straightaway.","z":"步骤1\r\n将牛奶、奶油、肉桂棒和所有柑橘皮放入平底锅中，中火加热。煮时经常搅拌，直到牛奶刚刚冒热气但未沸腾，大约需要 3-5 分钟。离火，盖上盘子，浸泡至少 30 分钟。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n奶油混合物注入后，将蛋黄、糖和玉米粉放入另一个碗中搅拌 3-5 分钟，或直至颜色变淡。将注入的牛奶通过筛子倒入鸡蛋混合物中，不断搅拌。将混合物放回锅中。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n将平底锅置于中高火上，搅拌约 10-12 分钟。混合物应该开始变稠，达到类似蛋奶冻的稠度——你可以通过将木勺浸入混合物中，然后用手指穿过勺子背面的混合物来判断它已经准备好了。如果线路保持住，则已准备就绪。将混合物筛入罐中以除去泡沫。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n将蛋奶冻分装在六个 150 毫升的模子或小陶盘中，然后在室温下冷却 1 小时，直至稍微晃动凝固。冷却过夜。\r\n\r\n步骤5\r\n食用前，在每个模子的顶部撒上 1 汤匙细砂糖，然后使用厨房喷灯将其焦糖化。或者，将模子滑到热烤架下，直到糖变成金黄色并开始冒泡。立即上菜。"},{"id":"53143","n":"Easy Spanish chicken","a":"Spanish","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/kzxflc1763194887.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EusTpzrqYK4","i":[["Extra Virgin Olive Oil","2 tbsp"],["Onion","1"],["Chorizo","150g"],["Red Pepper","1"],["Yellow Pepper","1"],["sweet smoked paprika","1 teaspoon"],["Garlic","4 cloves"],["Tinned Tomatos","400g"],["Green Olives","150g"],["Butter Beans","400g"],["Chicken Thighs","8"],["Parsley","1 Handfull"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Heat the olive oil in a large ovenproof frying pan over a medium heat and fry the onion, chorizo and peppers along with a pinch of salt and pepper for 15 mins until the veg has softened and the chorizo has released its oils. Add the paprika and garlic, and cook for another few minutes until fragrant.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nTip in the chopped tomatoes, olives and butter beans, stir to combine and season. Nestle in the chicken thighs and season well. Transfer to the oven and bake for 40 mins until the chicken skin is crisp and the meat cooked through and tender. Scatter with the parsley and serve.\r\n\r\nWatch after ad (0.04):\r\n3 Budget Egg Ideas\r\n\r\n","z":"步骤1\r\n将烤箱加热到 200C/180C 风扇/煤气 6. 在一个大的耐热煎锅中用中火加热橄榄油，然后将洋葱、香肠和辣椒以及少许盐和胡椒一起煎 15 分钟，直到蔬菜变软并且香肠释放出油脂。加入辣椒粉和大蒜，再煮几分钟直至散发出香味。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n加入切碎的西红柿、橄榄和黄油豆，搅拌混合并调味。放入鸡腿中，调味均匀。转移到烤箱烤 40 分钟，直到鸡皮酥脆，肉熟透变软。撒上欧芹即可食用。\r\n\r\n广告后观看 (0.04)：\r\n3 个预算鸡蛋创意"},{"id":"53149","n":"Ensaimada","a":"Spanish","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/1ugsho1763248007.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_Quo9Tgxih4","i":[["Yeast","5g"],["Caster Sugar","200g"],["Egg","2 medium"],["Strong white bread flour","600g"],["Vegetable Oil","Drizzle"],["Lard","100g"]],"s":"step 1\r\nPour 230ml lukewarm water into a bowl and add the yeast. Leave to stand for 3 mins, then add the caster sugar, eggs, flour and 1 tsp sea salt flakes. Mix together to form a dough, then knead for 10 mins in stand mixer using a dough hook (or 15 mins by hand) until the dough is elastic enough to be almost see-through when stretched. Cover and set aside to rest for 30 mins, then cut into four equal pieces. Transfer to a baking tray lined with baking parchment. Leave to rest for another 30 mins.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nOil the work surface and a rolling pin with vegetable oil. Working with one portion of dough at a time, flatten it against the surface using the palm of your hand, then roll it out into a thin rectangle, about 30 x 50cm. Let it rest for 2 mins while you spread a quarter of the lard over the top. (If you want to fill your pastry with sobrasada de Mallorca, mix 50g lard with the sobrasada, and spread this over the dough instead.) Pull one corner of the flattened dough and stretch it out as far as it will go without breaking. Repeat every 10cm or so around the dough rectangle in every direction until it reaches about 50 x 70cm.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nCut a strip from each of the shorter sides and lay these beside each other along one of the longer sides of the rectangle; this is what we call the heart of the ensaimada. From there, begin rolling the dough until you have a long pastry snake. Repeat with the remaining portions of dough.\r\n\r\nstep 4\r\nTake the first roll of dough and stretch it until it is over a metre long. Then, roll it up into a spiral, leaving 1cm between each turn of the spiral so the dough can expand. Flatten a little and transfer to a baking sheet lined with baking parchment. Repeat with the remaining dough. Leave to rise in a warm place for at least 12 hrs, or ideally 24 hrs.\r\n\r\nstep 5\r\nHeat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Put the ensaimadas in the top third of the oven and immediately reduce the temperature to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Bake for 18 mins until dark golden. Leave to cool on a wire rack. To fill your ensaimada with whipped cream, slice and open, then spread over the cream and close. Dust with a generous amount of icing sugar, if you like and cut into pieces to serve.\r\n\r\n","z":"步骤1\r\n将230毫升温水倒入碗中，加入酵母。静置 3 分钟，然后加入细砂糖、鸡蛋、面粉和 1 茶匙海盐片。混合在一起形成面团，然后用面团钩在立式搅拌机中揉捏 10 分钟（或用手揉捏 15 分钟），直到面团有足够的弹性，拉伸时几乎透明。盖上盖子静置30分钟，然后切成四等份。转移到衬有烘焙羊皮纸的烤盘上。再休息 30 分钟。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n在工作表面和擀面杖上涂上植物油。一次处理一份面团，用手掌将其压平，然后将其擀成约 30 x 50 厘米的薄矩形。让它休息 2 分钟，同时在上面涂上四分之一的猪油。 （如果你想在糕点中加入 sobrasada de Mallorca 馅料，可将 50 克猪油与 sobrasada 混合，然后将其铺在面团上。）拉动压平的面团的一个角，将其尽可能地拉伸而不破裂。在面团矩形的各个方向上每隔 10 厘米左右重复一次，直到达到约 50 x 70 厘米。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n从每条较短的边上切一条条，并将它们沿着矩形的一条较长的边并排放置；这就是我们所说的 ensaimada 的核心。从那里开始滚动面团，直到形成一条长长的糕点蛇。对面团的其余部分重复上述步骤。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n取出第一卷面团，将其拉伸至一米多长。然后，将其卷成螺旋状，每圈螺旋之间留出1厘米，以便面团可以膨胀。稍微压平并转移到衬有烘焙羊皮纸的烤盘上。对剩余的面团重复上述步骤。在温暖的地方发酵至少 12 小时，最好是 24 小时。\r\n\r\n步骤5\r\n将烤箱加热至 200C/180C 风扇/燃气 6. 将 ensaimadas 放入烤箱的顶部三分之一，立即将温度降至 180C/160C 风扇/燃气 4. 烘烤 18 分钟直至呈深金黄色。放在金属架上冷却。要将生奶油填入 ensaimada，请切片并打开，然后涂在奶油上并关闭。如果您愿意，可以撒上大量糖粉，然后切成块即可食用。"},{"id":"53178","n":"Fried calamari","a":"Spanish","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/yhi46r1763330279.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VcxMq33G-Do","i":[["Squid","300g"],["Plain Flour","200g"],["Capers","2 tblsp"],["Garlic","1 clove peeled crushed"],["Mayonnaise","5 tblsp"],["Vegetable Oil","For frying"],["Lemon","To serve"]],"s":"step 1\r\nCut the squid into rings about ½cm thick. Tip the flour into a freezer bag and season well. Add the capers, then give everything a good shake to mix together. Tip the squid into the bag, then shake again until all the rings are well coated. Mix together the garlic and mayonnaise, then place in a serving bowl.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nPour some oil into a large pan until it comes about 7cm up the sides, but the pan is no more than a third full. Place over a medium heat and let the oil warm up. To test that the oil is ready, place a small piece of bread in the pan – it should sizzle when it touches the oil.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nRemove a handful of squid from the flour and shake off any excess. Gently drop into the oil, then cook for about 3 mins until crisp. Remove with a slotted spoon and place on kitchen paper. Repeat with the remaining squid. Serve straight away with the mayonnaise and lemon wedges.","z":"步骤1\r\n将鱿鱼切成约 1/2 厘米厚的环。将面粉倒入冷冻袋中并充分调味。添加刺山柑，然后将所有东西充分摇匀以混合在一起。将鱿鱼倒入袋子中，然后再次摇动，直到所有的环都涂好。将大蒜和蛋黄酱混合在一起，然后放入碗中。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将一些油倒入一个大平底锅中，直到油位达到边缘约 7 厘米，但不要超过平底锅的三分之一。用中火加热，让油升温。要测试油是否已准备好，请将一小块面包放入锅中 - 当接触到油时，面包应该发出嘶嘶声。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n从面粉中取出一把鱿鱼，抖掉多余的部分。轻轻放入油中，煮约3分钟至酥脆。用有槽勺取出并放在厨房用纸上。对剩下的鱿鱼重复上述步骤。立即与蛋黄酱和柠檬角一起食用。"},{"id":"53144","n":"Gambas al ajillo","a":"Spanish","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/ze8uwg1763196123.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2tZlO8vNMtk","i":[["Raw King Prawns","12"],["Garlic Clove","3"],["Olive Oil","100 ml"],["Cayenne Pepper","3"],["Parsley","1 tablespoon chopped"]],"s":"step 1\r\nPeel the prawns, leaving the tails intact, and, using a cocktail stick, remove the digestive tracts. Or, if you are using a frying pan rather than a terracotta pot, you can cook the prawns in their shells. Season with a little sea salt.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nPut the garlic, olive oil and chillies in a flameproof terracotta pot or frying pan and set over a high heat. When the garlic starts to turn golden, add the prawns and cook for 1-2 mins on each side until just pink. Sprinkle over the chopped parsley and some freshly cracked black pepper, and serve immediately. If using a terracotta pot, you can take that straight to the table, but be careful with it as the oil and terracotta will remain hot for several minutes.","z":"步骤1\r\n将虾剥皮，保留尾部完整，然后使用鸡尾酒棒去除消化道。或者，如果您使用煎锅而不是赤土锅，则可以将带壳的虾煮熟。加少许海盐调味。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将大蒜、橄榄油和辣椒放入防火陶罐或煎锅中，然后用高温加热。当大蒜开始变成金黄色时，加入虾，每面煮 1-2 分钟，直到变成粉红色。撒上切碎的欧芹和一些新鲜的黑胡椒，然后立即食用。如果使用陶土锅，您可以直接将其带到桌子上，但要小心，因为油和陶土会保持几分钟的热度。"},{"id":"53180","n":"Garlicky prawns with sherry","a":"Spanish","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/u2lhqb1763331899.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2hf2xltFbxQ","i":[["Olive Oil","3  tablespoons"],["Garlic","3 cloves Chopped"],["Prawns","400g"],["Dry sherry","2 tbsp"],["Parsley","Handful"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat the olive oil in a large frying pan. Tip in the garlic slices and cook for a few secs. Then stir through the prawns and cook for a couple of mins until they start to turn pink.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nPour over the sherry and cook for a few mins more, just until the prawns are cooked through. Sprinkle with parsley before serving.","z":"步骤1\r\n在大煎锅中加热橄榄油。放入大蒜片，煮几秒钟。然后搅拌虾，煮几分钟，直到它们开始变成粉红色。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n倒在雪利酒上，再煮几分钟，直到虾煮熟。食用前撒上欧芹。"},{"id":"53179","n":"Ham croquetas","a":"Spanish","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/6dpa7m1763331105.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/nT8MGiWldHk","i":[["Plain Flour","75g"],["Egg","2 large"],["Breadcrumbs","75g"],["Sunflower Oil","For frying"],["Extra Virgin Olive Oil","4 tbsp"],["Leek","1/2"],["jamón ibérico","70g"],["Plain Flour","60g"],["Vegetable Stock","75 ml"],["Milk","330ml"],["Nutmeg","Grated"]],"s":"step 1\r\nTo make the filling, heat the olive oil in a pan until it starts to shimmer. Add the leek and sauté until soft but not coloured. Stir in the ham with a wooden spoon, fry for 1 min, then stir in the flour and fry over a medium heat, stirring occasionally, until the mixture is golden but not burnt – this will take about 5 mins.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nMeanwhile, combine the stock and milk in a small pan and heat until steaming but not boiling. Season with a few scrapes of nutmeg. Gradually add the liquid, a few tbsp at a time, stirring constantly.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nOnce you’ve incorporated all the milk stock, continue to cook the filling over a medium heat for about 10 mins or until it thickens and leaves the sides of the pan when you stir it.\r\n\r\nstep 4\r\nSeason with black pepper, taste and adjust the salt if necessary – the ham can be very salty to start with. The filling is now done: it has to be really thick because you don’t want the croquetas to turn into pancakes.\r\n\r\nstep 5\r\nSmooth the mixture onto a baking tray (30 x 20cm is fine). Once it has stopped steaming, cover with cling film to stop it drying out. Leave to cool before putting it in the fridge for 1 hr.\r\n\r\nstep 6\r\nWhen you're ready for the next stage, line up three bowls: the first filled with the flour, the second with beaten egg and the third with breadcrumbs. Take the ham mixture out of the fridge. Put a little bit of olive oil on your hands to make it easier to roll the croquetas.\r\n\r\nstep 7\r\nRoll a spoonful of the mixture between your palms. The size and shape of the croquetas is up to you, but the easiest is a walnut-sized ball. Then begin coating as follows.\r\n\r\nstep 8\r\nDunk the croquetas into the flour – you want a dusting – followed by the egg, then the breadcrumbs. Put them on a tray and, when you’ve used up all the mixture, place in the fridge for 30 mins.\r\n\r\nstep 9\r\nIf you have a deep-fat fryer, heat the oil to 180C and fry for a couple of mins. If not, heat the oil in a deep, heavy-bottomed saucepan until it starts to shimmer. Then add 5-6 croquetas at a time and fry until golden all over. Once cooked, drain on kitchen paper and eat straight away.","z":"步骤1\r\n制作馅料时，在平底锅中加热橄榄油，直至开始闪烁。加入韭葱，炒至变软但未变色。用木勺搅拌火腿，煎1分钟，然后加入面粉，中火煎，偶尔搅拌，直到混合物呈金黄色但不烧焦——这需要大约5分钟。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n同时，将高汤和牛奶放入小锅中，加热至冒蒸汽但不要沸腾。用几片肉豆蔻调味。逐渐加入液体，一次几汤匙，不断搅拌。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n一旦你加入了所有的奶汤，继续用中火煮馅料大约10分钟，或者直到它变稠并在搅拌时离开锅的侧面。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n用黑胡椒调味，品尝并根据需要调整盐——火腿一开始可能会很咸。现在馅料已经做好了：它必须非常厚，因为你不想让炸丸子变成煎饼。\r\n\r\n步骤5\r\n将混合物抹平到烤盘上（30 x 20 厘米即可）。停止蒸后，盖上保鲜膜以防止其干燥。待冷却后再放入冰箱 1 小时。\r\n\r\n步骤6\r\n当你准备好进入下一阶段时，将三个碗排成一行：第一个碗装满面粉，第二个碗装满鸡蛋，第三个碗装满面包屑。将火腿混合物从冰箱中取出。在手上涂一点橄榄油，这样卷炸丸子就更容易了。\r\n\r\n步骤7\r\n将一勺混合物在手掌之间滚动。炸丸子的大小和形状由您决定，但最简单的是核桃大小的球。然后按如下方式开始涂覆。\r\n\r\n步骤8\r\n将炸丸子浸入面粉中——你需要撒上灰尘——然后是鸡蛋，然后是面包屑。将它们放在托盘上，用完所有混合物后，放入冰箱 30 分钟。\r\n\r\n步骤9\r\n如果您有深油炸锅，请将油加热至 180°C，煎几分钟。如果没有，请在深底厚底锅中加热油，直至其开始闪烁。然后一次加入5-6个炸丸子，煎至金黄色。煮熟后，用厨房纸吸干水分，即可食用。"},{"id":"53145","n":"Jamon & wild garlic croquetas","a":"Spanish","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/zc9cwz1763196177.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YFMDkUsMazw","i":[["Wild Garlic Leaves","150g"],["Milk","350g"],["Olive Oil","45g"],["Flour","65g"],["manchego","35g"],["jamón ibérico","80g"],["Egg","1"],["Breadcrumbs","75g"],["Vegetable Oil","1 L"]],"s":"step 1\r\nWash the wild garlic leaves well in a colander, then pour over boiling water from the kettle until just wilted. Immediately rinse under cold running water, then squeeze out the excess water and finely chop.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nWarm the milk in a pan over a low heat until just steaming. Heat the oil or butter in a second pan and, once warm or melted, stir in the flour for a couple of minutes until it starts to brown a little. Gradually add the warm milk, a little at a time, until you have a thick, silky sauce. Bubble for a minute or two, stirring to make sure all the flour has cooked out. Season.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nAdd the manchego, jamón and wild garlic to the pan, and beat to combine. Tip out onto a lightly oiled baking tray or plate, spread out then cover and chill for at least 1 hr. Will keep chilled for up to 24 hrs.\r\n\r\nstep 4\r\nLightly oil your hands and shape the mixture into 18-20 even-sized balls. Arrange on a baking tray and freeze for 30 mins to firm up.\r\n\r\nstep 5\r\nBeat the egg in a shallow dish with a little seasoning. Tip the panko into a second dish. Dip each of the croquetas in the egg, then turn to coat in the breadcrumbs. At this point, the raw croquetas can be frozen for up to three months. Pour the oil into a large, deep pan ensuring it is no more than a third full and heat to 170C, or until a cube of bread browns lightly in 30 seconds. Fry the croquetas in batches for 2-3 mins until deeply golden. To cook from frozen, fry at 160C for a few minutes longer until they’re piping hot inside. Remove to a sheet of kitchen paper using a slotted spoon and leave to drain. Serve warm with a glass of sherry.","z":"步骤1\r\n将野蒜叶放入滤锅中清洗干净，然后倒入水壶中的沸水直至枯萎。立即用冷水冲洗，然后挤出多余的水并切碎。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将牛奶放入平底锅中，用小火加热，直至冒蒸汽。在第二个平底锅中加热油或黄油，一旦温热或融化，加入面粉搅拌几分钟，直到它开始稍微变褐色。逐渐加入温牛奶，一次一点，直到形成浓稠丝滑的酱汁。起泡一两分钟，搅拌以确保所有面粉都煮熟了。季节。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n将曼切戈、火腿和野蒜放入锅中，搅拌均匀。倒在涂有少许油的烤盘或盘子上，摊开，然后盖上盖子，冷却至少 1 小时。可冷藏长达 24 小时。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n在手上涂上少许油，将混合物揉成 18-20 个大小均匀的球。放在烤盘上，冷冻 30 分钟使其变硬。\r\n\r\n步骤5\r\n将鸡蛋放入浅盘中，加少许调味料打散。将panko倒入第二个盘子中。将每个炸丸子浸入鸡蛋中，然后翻转以涂上面包屑。此时，生炸丸子最多可以冷冻三个月。将油倒入一个大而深的平底锅中，确保油量不超过三分之一，然后加热至 170°C，或直至一块面包在 30 秒内变成浅棕色。将炸丸子分批煎 2-3 分钟，直至呈深金黄色。要从冷冻状态下烹饪，请在 160°C 下再煎几分钟，直到内部滚烫。用有槽的勺子将其取出，放在一张厨房用纸上，然后沥干。搭配一杯雪利酒趁热享用。"},{"id":"53086","n":"Migas","a":"Spanish","c":"Miscellaneous","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/xd9aj21740432378.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GSvFVBpqMKI","i":[["Bread","1 large"],["Olive Oil","1 1/2 L"],["Garlic","Half"],["Pork","1 Handfull"]],"s":"Crumble the bread into small pieces. Sprinkle with cold water, cover with a damp cloth and leave for 30 minutes.\r\nHeat 2 tsp of olive oil in a deep pan. Add the garlic cloves separated, skins on; just make a small cut with a knife to open them and keep frying for 5 minutes. Set the garlic aside.\r\nIn the same oil, where we fried everything, simmer the bread, stirring constantly for 15 minutes and add a grinding of black pepper.\r\nAdd the garlic, continue stirring for about 20 minutes. It will be ready when the bread is soft and golden.","z":"把面包弄碎成小块。撒上冷水，盖上湿布，静置 30 分钟。\r\n在深锅中加热 2 茶匙橄榄油。加入分开的蒜瓣，带皮；只需用刀切一个小口，将其打开，然后继续煎5分钟。将大蒜放在一边。\r\n在我们炸过所有东西的同一油中，将面包煮沸，不断搅拌15分钟，然后加入磨碎的黑胡椒。\r\n加入大蒜，继续搅拌约20分钟。当面包变软、呈金黄色时就可以了。"},{"id":"53150","n":"Padron peppers","a":"Spanish","c":"Vegan","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/0ljvc51763248075.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wD6NE3cMKBY","i":[["Olive Oil","1 tablespoon"],["Padron peppers","500g"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat the olive oil in a large frying pan over a high heat, or if using an air-fryer, heat to 205C for 3 mins. Fry the peppers, stirring frequently, for 5 mins until blistered and wilted. The peppers should be soft and slightly charred.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nTransfer the peppers to a serving plate and season with some sea salt. Serve with dips or as part of a tapas spread, if you like.","z":"步骤1\r\n在大煎锅中用高温加热橄榄油，或者如果使用空气炸锅，加热至 205°C 3 分钟。将辣椒煎 5 分钟，经常搅拌，直至起泡并枯萎。辣椒应该是软的并且稍微烧焦。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将辣椒转移到盘子中，并用一些海盐调味。如果您愿意，可以搭配蘸酱或作为小吃酱的一部分。"},{"id":"53151","n":"Paella","a":"Spanish","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/9bl20p1763248192.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vNBuXsTY15E","i":[["Olive Oil","3 tablespoons"],["Raw tiger prawns","10"],["Parsley","Bunch"],["Dry sherry","100 ml"],["Mussels","500g"],["Saffron","Pinch"],["Chorizo","150g"],["Onion","1 chopped"],["Garlic","3 cloves"],["Squid","1 medium"],["Tomato","2"],["Paella Rice","250g"],["Broad Beans","100g"],["Lemon Zest","1"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat 1 tbsp of the oil in a wide, shallow pan. Add the prawn heads and parsley stalks and sizzle until the heads turn pink, then mash with a potato masher. Pour over the sherry or wine and 300ml water, season with salt and simmer for 10 mins to make a stock, mashing the prawn heads as they cook.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nScatter the mussels into the pan, cover the pan loosely with a lid or tea towel, then put over a high heat for 3-4 mins until the mussels just open. Stir to release the mussel juices, then pour the contents of the pan into a colander set over a large bowl containing the saffron. Let the saffron steep in the stock – you will need 700ml in total, so top up with water if needed and give everything a good stir. Pick the mussels out from the colander, then set aside.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nWipe out the pan and add the rest of the olive oil. Sizzle the chorizo until it releases its oil, then add the onion and garlic and cook until softened. Add the squid and turn over until it turns white. Add the tomatoes and cook down for a minute, then pour over most of the stock, give everything a good stir and bring to the boil. Scatter the rice over the stock, stir well once, then boil vigorously for 5 mins. Reduce the heat to the lowest setting and slowly simmer for 10 mins without stirring until the rice has absorbed most of the liquid.\r\n\r\nstep 4\r\nTuck the prawn tails into the rice and simmer for 5 mins, turning them over until cooked through. Stir through the mussels and broad beans or peas. Taste the rice – if it is still a little raw but the pan is dry, add a splash more stock and continue to cook; if it’s too soupy, then increase the heat to cook off the last of the stock.\r\n\r\nstep 5\r\nOnce the rice is just cooked, turn off the heat and cover with a tea towel for a few minutes. Scatter over the parsley leaves and lemon zest, then season with smoked salt if you like. Stir everything once, then serve straight from the pan, with lemon wedges on the side.","z":"步骤1\r\n在宽而浅的平底锅中加热 1 汤匙油。加入虾头和欧芹茎，发出嘶嘶声，直到虾头变成粉红色，然后用土豆捣碎器捣碎。倒入雪利酒或葡萄酒和300毫升水，加盐调味，煮10分钟制成高汤，煮时将虾头捣碎。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将贻贝撒入锅中，用盖子或茶巾松松地盖住锅，然后大火煮3-4分钟，直至贻贝刚刚张开。搅拌以释放贻贝汁，然后将锅中的内容物倒入滤锅中，滤锅放在装有藏红花的大碗上。让藏红花浸泡在高汤中——总共需要 700 毫升，所以如果需要的话加水，并充分搅拌。从漏勺中取出贻贝，然后放在一边。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n把锅擦干净，加入剩下的橄榄油。将香肠炒至出油，然后加入洋葱和大蒜，煮至变软。加入鱿鱼，翻面直至其变白。加入西红柿，煮一分钟，然后倒入大部分汤料，充分搅拌并煮沸。将米撒在高汤上，搅拌均匀，然后大火煮 5 分钟。将火调至最低，慢慢煮 10 分钟（不要搅拌），直到米饭吸收大部分液体。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n将虾尾塞入米饭中，煮5分钟，翻面直至熟透。搅拌贻贝和蚕豆或豌豆。尝尝米饭的味道——如果米饭还是有点生，但锅已经干了，就加一点汤继续煮；如果太汤，则增加热量以煮掉最后的高汤。\r\n\r\n步骤5\r\n米饭刚煮熟后，关掉火，盖上茶巾几分钟。撒上欧芹叶和柠檬皮，然后根据需要用烟熏盐调味。将所有东西搅拌一次，然后直接从锅中盛出，旁边放上柠檬片。"},{"id":"53152","n":"Pan-fried hake, white bean & chorizo broth","a":"Spanish","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/4yjart1763248459.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6hcNBBob_xI","i":[["Dried white beans","450g"],["Garlic","4 cloves"],["Bay Leaves","2"],["Thyme","1 teaspoon"],["Olive Oil","6 tablespoons"],["Bread","100g"],["Chorizo","100g"],["Onion","1"],["Paprika","3 tsp"],["Chicken Stock","1 L"],["Parsley","Handful"],["Hake","6"]],"s":"step 1\r\nDrain the beans, then tip into a large pan with 2 litres of water. Simmer with the whole garlic cloves, bay leaves and thyme for 30 mins or until cooked and tender. Remove from the heat and set aside.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nMeanwhile, heat 2 tbsp oil in a frying pan. Fry the bread with the remaining garlic clove. When golden and crisp, scoop out and drain on kitchen paper. Add the chorizo to the pan, fry until crisp, tip out and keep warm with the bread.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nAdd another 2 tbsp oil and the onion to the pan, and cook for 5 mins until softened. Stir in the paprika. Drain the beans and add to the onions with the chicken stock and 2 tsp salt. Cook for 5-10 mins. Stir through the parsley and keep warm.\r\n\r\nstep 4\r\nSeason the hake and heat the remaining 2 tbsp oil in the frying pan. Put the hake, skin-side down, in the pan and cook for 3-5 mins over a mediumhigh heat to crisp up the skin. Flip the fish over and cook for a further 3-5 mins until cooked through. Spoon the white bean mix into bowls, place the hake on top and finish with the fried bread, chorizo and a little more thyme.","z":"步骤1\r\n将豆子沥干，然后倒入装有 2 升水的大锅中。与整个蒜瓣、月桂叶和百里香一起煮 30 分钟或直至煮熟变软。从火上移开并放在一边。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n同时，在煎锅中加热 2 汤匙油。用剩下的蒜瓣炒面包。当金黄酥脆时，捞出并用厨房用纸吸干。将香肠放入锅中，煎至酥脆，倒出并与面包一起保温。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n再加入 2 汤匙油和洋葱，煮 5 分钟直至变软。拌入辣椒粉。沥干豆子，加入洋葱、鸡汤和 2 茶匙盐。煮5-10分钟。搅拌欧芹并保持温暖。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n将鳕鱼调味，然后在煎锅中加热剩余的 2 汤匙油。将鳕鱼皮面朝下放入锅中，中高火煮 3-5 分钟，使皮变脆。将鱼翻过来，再煮 3-5 分钟直至熟透。将白豆混合物舀入碗中，将鳕鱼放在上面，最后撒上炸面包、香肠和一点百里香。"},{"id":"53172","n":"Patatas bravas","a":"Spanish","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/bvg8sn1763298713.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2Hup2nypG2w","i":[["Olive Oil","3  tablespoons"],["Onion","1 small finely diced"],["Garlic","2 cloves chopped"],["Tinned Tomatos","225g"],["Tomato Puree","1 tablespoon"],["Paprika","2 teaspoon"],["Chilli Powder","Pinch"],["Sugar","Pinch"],["Parsley","Chopped"],["Potatoes","900g"],["Olive Oil","2 tbsp"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat the oil in a pan and fry the onion for about 5 mins until softened. Add the garlic, chopped tomatoes, tomato purée, sweet paprika, chilli powder, sugar and a pinch of salt, then bring to the boil, stirring occasionally. Lower to a simmer and cook for 10 mins until pulpy. Can be kept chilled for up to 24 hrs.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nHeat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Pat the potatoes dry with kitchen paper, then tip into a roasting tin and toss in the olive oil and some seasoning. Roast for 40-50 mins until crisp and golden. Tip the potatoes into serving dishes and spoon over the tomato sauce. Sprinkle with some fresh parsley to serve.","z":"步骤1\r\n在锅中加热油，将洋葱炒约5分钟直至变软。加入大蒜、切碎的番茄、番茄泥、甜辣椒粉、辣椒粉、糖和少许盐，然后煮沸，偶尔搅拌。转小火煮 10 分钟直至变成浆状。可以冷藏长达 24 小时。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将烤箱加热至 200C/180C 风扇/燃气 6. 用厨房用纸将土豆拍干，然后倒入烤盘中，拌入橄榄油和一些调味料。烤 40-50 分钟直至酥脆、呈金黄色。将土豆放入盘中，然后用勺子浇上番茄酱。撒上一些新鲜欧芹即可食用。"},{"id":"53160","n":"Pisto con huevos","a":"Spanish","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/0nswfe1763279040.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/T43aUS9bG_0","i":[["Olive Oil","2 tblsp"],["Onion","2"],["Garlic Clove","4 Chopped"],["Mixed peppers","5"],["Oregano","1 teaspoon"],["Thyme","Sprigs of fresh"],["Bay Leaves","4 leaves"],["Courgettes","2 chopped"],["Aubergine","1 chopped"],["Tomato","4 large"],["Egg","4 large"],["Parsley","Handful"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat the oil in a large flameproof casserole dish or a cast-iron skillet over a low heat. Add the onions and a sprinkle of salt, cover and cook gently for 15 mins, stirring occasionally. Add the garlic and cook for another 2 mins.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nNext, throw in the peppers and cook over a medium heat, covered, for about 5 mins, stirring every so often, until the peppers are just tender.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nMix in the oregano, thyme, bay leaves, some black pepper and a little salt, if needed. Tip in the courgettes and aubergine, combine thoroughly, and cook over a medium heat, covered, for 10 mins. Stir in the tomatoes, cover and cook for 20 mins, stirring occasionally.\r\n\r\nstep 4\r\nCarefully crack the eggs over the pisto – try not to break the yolks. Cook in the sauce on a medium heat for 5-6 mins until the eggs are cooked through but still a little soft, then scatter with parsley before serving","z":"步骤1\r\n在一个大的防火砂锅或铸铁煎锅中用小火加热油。加入洋葱和少许盐，盖上锅盖，轻轻煮 15 分钟，偶尔搅拌。加入大蒜，再煮 2 分钟。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n接下来，放入辣椒，盖上锅盖，中火煮约 5 分钟，期间不时搅拌，直至辣椒变软。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n如果需要的话，加入牛至、百里香、月桂叶、一些黑胡椒和一点盐。倒入西葫芦和茄子，充分混合，盖上锅盖，中火煮 10 分钟。拌入西红柿，盖上盖子煮20分钟，偶尔搅拌一下。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n小心地在皮斯托上敲碎鸡蛋——尽量不要打破蛋黄。用中火将酱汁煮5-6分钟，直到鸡蛋煮熟但仍然有点软，然后撒上欧芹即可食用"},{"id":"53162","n":"Pollo en pepitoria","a":"Spanish","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/li30ck1763281992.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dam5k5HCE1Y","i":[["Saffron","Pinch"],["Extra Virgin Olive Oil","4 tbsp"],["Garlic Clove","6"],["Almonds","35g"],["Stale bread","30g"],["Parsley","2 tbs chopped"],["Chicken Thighs","8"],["Onion","1 chopped"],["Carrots","1 chopped"],["Celery","1 chopped"],["Dry sherry","250ml"],["Chicken Stock","350ml"],["Cinnamon Stick","1"],["Cloves","Pinch"],["Bay Leaves","2"],["Egg","2"],["Almonds","2 tblsp"]],"s":"step 1\r\nPut the saffron in a small bowl with 75ml of just-boiled water. Stir and set aside. Heat 2 tbsp of the oil in a broad, shallow casserole dish. Cook the garlic until pale gold in colour, then add the blanched almonds and bread, and continue to fry until everything is golden. Tip into a food processor with some salt and pepper and the parsley, and whizz together.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nHeat 2 more tbsp of the oil in the pan and brown the chicken all over, seasoning as you cook. Put in a bowl and set aside.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nRemove all but about 2 tbsp of chicken fat from the pan and cook the onion, carrot and celery until golden. Add the sherry, stirring to dislodge any brown bits that have stuck to the pan. Pour in the stock and the saffron (with its water), and bring to the boil, then turn the heat down to a simmer. Add the spices and bay leaves, and put the chicken back in the pan with any juices. Season and gently cook the chicken for about 40 mins with the lid on.\r\n\r\nstep 4\r\nTransfer the chicken to a bowl again, leaving the sauce in the pan, and cover with foil to keep warm. Remove the yolks from the eggs and roughly chop the whites. Mash the egg yolks in a small bowl and gradually mix in a couple of tbsp of the sauce. Bring the remaining sauce to the boil to reduce a bit (you want it to just coat the chicken), then turn the heat down. Remove the bay and cinnamon stick. Add the egg yolks and cook for a few mins until the mixture has thickened. Stir in the almond mixture that you made earlier (this will thicken the sauce, too). Put the chicken back in the pan and heat it for about 3 mins, spooning the sauce over it. Season to taste.\r\n\r\nstep 5\r\nScatter over the extra parsley, the almonds pieces and the chopped egg whites (if you’re going to use them). You can serve this straight from the dish with some rice, if you like.","z":"步骤1\r\n将藏红花放入装有 75 毫升刚烧开的水的小碗中。搅拌并放在一边。在宽而浅的砂锅中加热 2 汤匙油。将大蒜煮至浅金黄色，然后加入焯过的杏仁和面包，继续煎至所有东西都变成金黄色。将一些盐、胡椒和欧芹倒入食品加工机中，然后一起搅拌。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n在锅中再加热 2 汤匙油，将鸡肉全部煎至棕色，烹饪时调味。放入碗中并放在一边。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n从锅中取出大约 2 汤匙鸡油，然后将洋葱、胡萝卜和芹菜煮至金黄色。加入雪利酒，搅拌以除去粘在锅上的棕色碎片。倒入高汤和藏红花（连同水），煮沸，然后将火调小火煮。加入香料和月桂叶，然后将鸡肉和汁液一起放回锅中。盖上盖子，将鸡肉调味并轻轻煮约 40 分钟。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n再次将鸡肉转移到碗中，将酱汁留在锅中，并用箔纸覆盖以保暖。从鸡蛋中取出蛋黄，粗略地切碎蛋白。将蛋黄放入小碗中捣碎，然后逐渐加入几汤匙酱汁混合。将剩余的酱汁煮沸以减少一点（你想让它只覆盖鸡肉），然后把火调低。取出海湾和肉桂棒。加入蛋黄，煮几分钟直至混合物变稠。拌入你之前制作的杏仁混合物（这也会使酱汁变稠）。将鸡肉放回锅中，加热约3分钟，用勺子将酱汁浇在上面。调味。\r\n\r\n步骤5\r\n撒上多余的欧芹、杏仁片和切碎的蛋白（如果你要用的话）。如果你喜欢的话，你可以直接从盘子里拿出来和米饭一起上桌。"},{"id":"53174","n":"Prawns with Romesco sauce","a":"Spanish","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/u03xhi1763308917.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=miqfHkE6rJY","i":[["Red Pepper","1"],["Garlic Clove","3 Large"],["Red Chilli","1 large"],["Tomato","1 large"],["Shelled Hazelnuts","10"],["Almonds","10"],["Parsley","3 sprigs"],["Bread","1 sliced"],["Olive Oil","120ml"],["Red Wine Vinegar","2 tblsp"],["Tiger Prawns","400g"]],"s":"step 1\r\nPrepare ahead - halve the pepper lengthways and remove the seeds and stalk. Line a grill pan with foil and put the pepper halves, skin side up, on the grill pan with the whole garlic cloves, chilli and tomato. Grill for 2 minutes, turn the tomato, then grill for a further 2 minutes. Remove the tomato with a large spoon, then peel, quarter and remove the seeds. Then chop the tomato roughly.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nContinue grilling the pepper, chilli and garlic for 4-5 minutes, until the pepper and chilli skins have blackened and the garlic is starting to soften (the garlic skin will start to split when it is ready). When cool enough to handle, peel and halve the chilli, and scrape out and discard the seeds. Peel the pepper and roughly chop both the pepper and chilli.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nSpread nuts over the foil and grill until toasted. Finely chop the nuts and parsley in a food processor. Tip into a small bowl.\r\n\r\nstep 4\r\nHeat 3 tablespoons of oil in a frying pan, add the pepper, garlic and chilli and fry for 3 minutes. Tear up the bread and add to the pan, turning it in the oil until lightly browned. Pulse in food processor with the tomatoes, salt, vinegar and oil until roughly chopped. Tip into a bowl. Leave to cool and store in fridge for up to 3 days.\r\n\r\nstep 5\r\nOn the day add the nuts and parsley to the sauce and mix. Serve in a small bowl on a plate with the peeled prawns. Supply cocktail sticks for spearing the prawns.","z":"步骤1\r\n提前准备——将辣椒纵向切成两半，去掉种子和茎。在烤盘上铺上箔纸，然后将半个辣椒（带皮的一面朝上）与整个蒜瓣、辣椒和番茄一起放在烤盘上。烤2分钟，翻动番茄，然后再烤2分钟。用大勺子取出番茄，然后去皮、切成四瓣并去除种子。然后将番茄大致切碎。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n继续烤辣椒、辣椒和大蒜 4-5 分钟，直到辣椒和辣椒皮变黑，大蒜开始软化（准备好后蒜皮会开始裂开）。当冷却到可以处理时，将辣椒去皮并切成两半，刮出并丢弃种子。将胡椒去皮，粗略地切碎胡椒和辣椒。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n将坚果铺在箔纸上，然后烤至烤熟。在食品加工机中将坚果和欧芹切碎。倒入一个小碗中。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n在煎锅中加热 3 汤匙油，加入胡椒、大蒜和辣椒，炒 3 分钟。将面包撕碎并放入锅中，在油中翻动直至呈浅棕色。将西红柿、盐、醋和油放入食品加工机中搅拌，直至粗略切碎。倒入碗中。待冷却并在冰箱中保存最多 3 天。\r\n\r\n步骤5\r\n当天将坚果和欧芹加入酱汁中并混合。与去皮的虾一起盛在盘子上的小碗中。提供用于刺虾的鸡尾酒棒。"},{"id":"53173","n":"Quick gazpacho","a":"Spanish","c":"Starter","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/h5qmn31763304965.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sJzHIxlDTHc","i":[["Passata","250g"],["Red Pepper","1 chopped"],["Red Chilli","1 chopped"],["Garlic","1 clove peeled crushed"],["Sherry vinegar","1 teaspoon"],["Lime","Juice of 1/2"]],"s":"step 1\r\nIn a blender (or with a stick blender), whizz together the passata, red pepper, chilli, garlic, sherry vinegar and lime juice until smooth. Season to taste, then serve with ice cubes","z":"步骤1\r\n在搅拌机（或棒式搅拌机）中，将帕萨塔、红辣椒、辣椒、大蒜、雪利酒醋和酸橙汁搅拌均匀。调味，然后与冰块一起食用"},{"id":"52942","n":"Roast fennel and aubergine paella","a":"Spanish","c":"Vegan","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/1520081754.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=H5SmjR-fxUs","i":[["Baby Aubergine","6 small"],["Fennel","4 small"],["Red Pepper","1 thinly sliced"],["Courgettes","1 medium"],["Onion","1 finely chopped"],["Paella Rice","300g"],["Paprika","1 tsp"],["Saffron","pinch"],["White Wine","200ml"],["Vegetable Stock","700ml"],["Frozen Peas","100g"],["Lemon","1 chopped"],["Parsley","Handful"],["Salt","pinch"],["Black Pepper","pinch"]],"s":"1 Put the fennel, aubergine, pepper and courgette in a roasting tray. Add a glug of olive oil, season with salt and pepper and toss around to coat the veggies in the oil. Roast in the oven for 20 minutes, turning a couple of times until the veg are pretty much cooked through and turning golden.\r\n\r\n2 Meanwhile, heat a paella pan or large frying pan over a low– medium heat and add a glug of olive oil. Sauté the onion for 8–10 minutes until softened. Increase the heat to medium and stir in the rice, paprika and saffron. Cook for around 1 minute to start toasting the rice, then add the white wine. Reduce by about half before stirring in two-thirds of the stock. Reduce to a simmer and cook for 10 minutes without a lid, stirring a couple of times.\r\n\r\n3 Stir in the peas, add some seasoning, then gently mix in the roasted veg. Pour over the remaining stock, arrange the lemon wedges on top and cover with a lid or some aluminium foil. Cook for a further 10 minutes.\r\n\r\n4 To ensure you get the classic layer of toasted rice at the bottom of the pan, increase the heat to high until you hear a slight crackle. Remove from the heat and sit for 5 minutes before sprinkling over the parsley and serving.","z":"1 将茴香、茄子、胡椒和西葫芦放入烤盘中。加入一杯橄榄油，用盐和胡椒调味，然后搅拌，让蔬菜裹上油。在烤箱中烤 20 分钟，翻转几次，直到蔬菜几乎煮熟并变成金黄色。\r\n\r\n2 同时，用中低火加热西班牙海鲜饭锅或大煎锅，并加入一杯橄榄油。将洋葱炒 8-10 分钟直至变软。将火调至中火，拌入米饭、辣椒粉和藏红花。煮约 1 分钟以开始烘烤米饭，然后加入白葡萄酒。在搅拌三分之二的原料之前，减少约一半的量。转小火，不盖盖子煮 10 分钟，搅拌几次。\r\n\r\n3 拌入豌豆，加入一些调味料，然后轻轻拌入烤蔬菜。倒在剩余的汤上，将柠檬角放在上面，盖上盖子或一些铝箔。再煮 10 分钟。\r\n\r\n4 为了确保锅底有一层经典的烤米饭，请将火调至最高，直到听到轻微的爆裂声。从火上移开，静置 5 分钟，然后撒上欧芹即可食用。"},{"id":"53171","n":"Salt cod tortilla","a":"Spanish","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/njj1681763297231.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ga7YoAjGgnA","i":[["Olive Oil","4 tbsp"],["Onion","1 Large Chopped"],["Jersey Royal Potatoes","300g"],["Garlic","2 cloves chopped"],["Egg","8"],["Parsley","2 1/2 Tbs"],["Salt Cod","300g"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat half the oil in a frying pan, and sauté the onion over a medium heat until soft and pale gold – this will take about 8 mins. Remove from the pan, set aside, and add the potatoes to the pan. Cook until they are tender but not falling apart, carefully turning every so often. Cover the pan some of the time to help the slices cook through. Add the onions back to the pan along with the garlic and cook for another 4 mins. Tip into a bowl with the eggs, parsley and some seasoning and mix together. Leave to sit for half an hour.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nMeanwhile, put the cod in a saucepan and cover with water. Bring up to a simmer. Remove from the heat, cover and leave for 10 mins. Drain, leave to cool and remove the skin and any bones. Break into large flakes and add to the potato and egg mixture.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nHeat the rest of the oil in a non-stick frying pan. Pour in the tortilla mix and cook over a medium-low heat until it is just set and coming away from the sides of the pan. You might need to cover it to help the centre set. Be careful not to overcook it. Put a spatula underneath the tortilla every so often to make sure it isn’t sticking. Slide the tortilla onto a plate, then put the pan on top and flip the tortilla into it, uncooked side-down. Cook over a low heat until golden, or grill until just set. Leave to cool a little before serving.","z":"步骤1\r\n在煎锅中加热一半的油，用中火将洋葱炒至变软并呈浅金黄色，这需要大约 8 分钟。从锅中取出，放在一边，然后将土豆放入锅中。煮至它们变软但不会散开，时不时小心地翻动。有时盖上锅盖以帮助切片煮熟。将洋葱和大蒜一起放回锅中，再煮 4 分钟。将鸡蛋、欧芹和一些调味料倒入碗中，搅拌均匀。静置半小时。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n与此同时，将鳕鱼放入锅中，加水盖过鳕鱼。煮沸。从火上移开，盖上盖子，静置 10 分钟。沥干水分，冷却并去除皮肤和骨头。切成大片，加入土豆和鸡蛋的混合物中。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n在不粘煎锅中加热剩余的油。倒入玉米饼混合物，用中低火煮，直到它刚刚凝固并脱离锅的两侧。您可能需要覆盖它以帮助中心固定。小心不要煮过头。经常在玉米饼下面放一把抹刀，以确保它不会粘在一起。将玉米饼滑到盘子上，然后将平底锅放在上面，将玉米饼翻入其中，未煮熟的一面朝下。用小火煮至金黄色，或烤至刚刚凝固。食用前稍微冷却一下。"},{"id":"52836","n":"Seafood fideuà","a":"Spanish","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/wqqvyq1511179730.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=itsFEc8W468","i":[["Mussels","400g"],["Prawns","8"],["Saffron","2 pinches"],["Vermicelli Pasta","350g"],["Olive Oil","5 tblsp"],["Onions","1 large"],["Garlic","3 cloves"],["Paprika","2 tbs"],["Monkfish","1 tail"],["Baby Squid","4"],["Fish Stock","650ml"],["Tomatoes","2 large"],["Lemon","Juice of 1"],["Parsley","Topping"]],"s":"Boil the kettle. Empty the mussels into a colander and run under cold water. Throw away any with broken shells. Pick through the shells, tapping each one on the side of the sink – they should be closed or should slowly close when tapped – if they stay open, throw them away. If any of the shells still have barnacles or stringy beards attached, pull them off with a cutlery knife and rinse the shells well. Keep in the colander, covered with a cold, damp cloth, until you’re ready to cook. Peel the prawn shells on the body section only – leave the heads and tails intact. Score down the backs and pull out any gritty entrails. Chill until you’re ready to cook.\r\nPut the saffron in a small cup, cover with 50ml kettle-hot water and set aside for 10 mins. If using vermicelli, put in a bowl and crush to little pieces (about 1cm long) with your hands.\r\nHeat the oil in a large frying pan with at least a 3cm lip, or a 40cm paella pan. Add the onion and stir around the pan for 5 mins until soft. Add the garlic and cook for 1 min more, then tip in the vermicelli and cook for 5 mins, stirring from time to time, until the vermicelli is toasted brown. Stir in the paprika.\r\nKeeping the heat moderate, stir through the monkfish, squid and saffron with its water, seasoning well. Spread the ingredients out in an even layer, then pour over the hot stock and scatter the tomatoes on top. Bring to a simmer, then cover the whole dish with a tight-fitting lid (or foil). Turn the heat to medium and cook for 6 mins.\r\nUncover and stir to incorporate the dry top layer of pasta. Push the mussels into the pasta so the hinges are buried in the bottom of the dish, and they stand straight up. Arrange the prawns on top, cover tightly and cook for another 6 mins or until the mussels are open, the prawns are pink and the pasta is cooked through. Leave to simmer for another 2-3 mins to cook off most of the remaining liquid (leave a little in the pan to prevent the pasta from sticking together). Allow to sit for 2-3 mins, then squeeze over the lemon juice and arrange the wedges on top. Scatter with parsley before serving.","z":"将水壶烧开。将贻贝倒入漏勺中，然后用冷水冲洗。扔掉任何有破损贝壳的东西。挑出贝壳，敲击水槽一侧的每个贝壳——它们应该关闭，或者敲击时应该慢慢关闭——如果它们保持打开状态，请将它们扔掉。如果任何贝壳上仍然附着藤壶或丝状胡须，请用餐具刀将其拉下来，然后将贝壳冲洗干净。放在滤锅中，盖上冷的湿布，直到准备好做饭为止。只剥掉虾身部分的壳——保留头部和尾部完好无损。在背上划几刀，取出里面有砂砾的内脏。冷却直到准备好做饭。\r\n将藏红花放入小杯中，倒入 50 毫升热水，放置 10 分钟。如果使用粉丝，放入碗中，用手压成小块（约1厘米长）。\r\n在一个至少有 3 厘米边缘的大煎锅或一个 40 厘米海鲜饭平底锅中加热油。加入洋葱，在锅周围搅拌 5 分钟直至变软。加入大蒜，再煮1分钟，然后倒入粉丝，煮5分钟，不时搅拌，直到粉丝烤成棕色。拌入辣椒粉。\r\n保持火候适中，将安康鱼、鱿鱼和藏红花与水一起搅拌，调味均匀。将原料铺成均匀的一层，然后倒在热汤上，并在上面撒上西红柿。煮沸，然后用紧密的盖子（或箔纸）盖住整个盘子。将火调至中火，煮 6 分钟。\r\n揭开并搅拌以合并干面食的顶层。将贻贝推入意大利面中，使铰链埋在盘子底部，并且它们直立。将虾放在上面，盖紧盖子，再煮 6 分钟或直到贻贝张开、虾呈粉红色、意大利面煮熟。再煮 2-3 分钟，煮掉大部分剩余的液体（在锅中留一点，以防止意大利面粘在一起）。静置 2-3 分钟，然后挤上柠檬汁，将楔子放在上面。食用前撒上欧芹。"},{"id":"53167","n":"Seafood rice","a":"Spanish","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/5r5rvx1763287943.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Dr8Nsod20yg","i":[["Olive Oil","1 tbsp"],["Leek","1 sliced"],["Chorizo","110g"],["Turmeric","1 teaspoon"],["Rice","300g"],["Fish Stock","1 L"],["Peas","200g"],["Frozen Seafood mix","400g"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat the oil in a deep frying pan, then soften the leek for 5 mins without browning. Add the chorizo and fry until it releases its oils. Stir in the turmeric and rice until coated by the oils, then pour in the stock. Bring to the boil, then simmer for 15 mins, stirring occasionally.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nTip in the peas and cook for 5 mins, then stir in the seafood to heat through for a final 1-2 mins cooking or until rice is cooked. Check for seasoning and serve immediately with lemon wedges.","z":"步骤1\r\n在深煎锅中加热油，然后将韭菜软化5分钟，不要变褐。加入香肠，炒至出油。加入姜黄和米饭，搅拌至被油覆盖，然后倒入高汤。煮沸，然后小火煮 15 分钟，偶尔搅拌。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n加入豌豆煮 5 分钟，然后加入海鲜加热，最后煮 1-2 分钟或直至米饭煮熟。检查调味料并立即与柠檬角一起食用。"},{"id":"53177","n":"Spaghetti with Spanish flavours","a":"Spanish","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/vpcqn01763335688.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BukrisTBv00","i":[["Chorizo","80g"],["Spaghetti","300g"],["Parsley","20g"],["Red Pepper","2"],["Olive Oil","2 tbsp"],["Parmesan Cheese","50g"]],"s":"step 1\r\nPut a pan of water on over a high heat to boil. Meanwhile, snip the chorizo into strips with scissors, and chop the parsley and peppers (check for stray seeds first).\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nWhen the water is boiling briskly, add the spaghetti with a good measure of salt, stir and return to the boil. Cook for 3 minutes.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nIn a large frying pan, heat the oil, add the chorizo and peppers and plenty of black pepper. Cook for a minute or so, until heated through and the juices are stained red from the paprika in the chorizo. Scoop half a mugful of pasta water from the pan, drain the remainder and tip the spaghetti into the frying pan.\r\n\r\nstep 4\r\nAdd the parsley and parmesan, toss well and splash in the pasta water, to moisten. Hand round extra parmesan at the table.","z":"步骤1\r\n将一锅水放在大火上煮沸。与此同时，用剪刀将香肠剪成条，然后将欧芹和辣椒切碎（首先检查是否有散落的种子）。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n当水快速沸腾时，加入意大利面条和适量的盐，搅拌并重新煮沸。煮3分钟。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n在一个大煎锅中，加热油，加入香肠、辣椒和大量黑胡椒。煮一分钟左右，直到热透并且汁液被香肠中的辣椒粉染成红色。从锅中舀出半杯意大利面水，沥干剩余的水，然后将意大利面放入煎锅中。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n加入欧芹和帕尔马干酪，搅拌均匀，然后倒入意大利面水中，使其湿润。在餐桌上递上额外的帕尔马干酪。"},{"id":"53164","n":"Spanish Chicken","a":"Spanish","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/pqulvm1763282839.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fKqSOn5NCrk","i":[["Chicken Thighs","8"],["Onion","3 sliced thinly"],["Paprika","2 teaspoons"],["Lemon","Zest and juice of 1"],["Parsley","Handful"],["Chicken Stock","150ml"],["Olive Oil","1 tablespoon"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. Put all the ingredients into a large, wide ovenproof dish. Mix everything together with your hands and season.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nBake for 45 mins, stirring the onions after 20 mins, until the chicken is golden and the onions tender. Serve with rice.","z":"步骤1\r\n将烤箱加热至 190C/170C 风扇/燃气 5. 将所有原料放入一个大而宽的耐热盘中。用手将所有东西混合在一起并调味。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n烤45分钟，20分钟后搅拌洋葱，直到鸡肉呈金黄色，洋葱变软。与米饭一起食用。"},{"id":"52872","n":"Spanish Tortilla","a":"Spanish","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/quuxsx1511476154.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JceGMNG7rpU","i":[["Onion","1 sliced"],["Olive Oil","4 tbsp"],["Butter","25g"],["Potatoes","400g"],["Garlic","6 cloves"],["Eggs","8"],["Parsley","Handful"],["Baguette","1"],["Vine Tomatoes","4"],["Olive Oil","drizzle"]],"s":"Put a large non-stick frying pan on a low heat. Cook the onion slowly in the oil and butter until soft but not brown – this should take about 15 mins. Add the potatoes, cover the pan and cook for a further 15-20 mins, stirring occasionally to make sure they fry evenly.\r\nWhen the potatoes are soft and the onion is shiny, crush 2 garlic cloves and stir in, followed by the beaten eggs.\r\nPut the lid back on the pan and leave the tortilla to cook gently. After 20 mins, the edges and base should be golden, the top set but the middle still a little wobbly. To turn it over, slide it onto a plate and put another plate on top, turn the whole thing over and slide it back into the pan to finish cooking. Once cooked, transfer to a plate and serve the tortilla warm or cold, scattered with the chopped parsley.\r\nTo accompany, take slices of warmed baguette, stab all over with a fork and rub with the remaining garlic, pile on grated tomatoes and season with sea salt and a drizzle of olive oil.","z":"将一个大的不粘煎锅放在小火上。将洋葱在油和黄油中慢慢煮至变软但不变成棕色——这大约需要 15 分钟。加入土豆，盖上锅盖，再煮 15-20 分钟，偶尔搅拌以确保它们煎得均匀。\r\n当土豆变软、洋葱发亮时，压碎 2 瓣大蒜并搅拌，然后加入打散的鸡蛋。\r\n把盖子放回锅上，让玉米饼慢慢地煮。 20分钟后，边缘和底部应该变成金黄色，顶部已经凝固，但中间仍然有点摇晃。要将其翻过来，请将其滑到一个盘子上，然后将另一个盘子放在上面，将整个东西翻过来，然后将其滑回锅中以完成烹饪。煮熟后，转移到盘子里，将玉米饼热食或冷食，撒上切碎的欧芹。\r\n搭配时，取一片温热的法棍面包，用叉子将其全部刺破，并用剩余的大蒜擦拭，堆上磨碎的西红柿，用海盐和少许橄榄油调味。"},{"id":"53181","n":"Spanish beans with chicken & chorizo","a":"Spanish","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/bpkxtw1763332446.jpg","y":"","i":[["Pinto Beans","300g"],["Onion","1 chopped"],["Paprika","1 tablespoon"],["Thyme","Sprigs of fresh"],["Bay Leaves","Pinch"],["Parsley","Bunch"],["Chicken Thighs","4"],["Jersey Royal Potatoes","250g"],["Chorizo","250g"],["Spinach","100g"]],"s":"step 1\r\nSoak the beans for at least 4 hrs or overnight in a large bowl with plenty of water to cover. Next day, rinse and drain, then put in a large heavy based pan with the onion, paprika, herb bundle and chicken. Pour over enough water or stock to cover, bring to the boil, then reduce the heat, cover and simmer for 45 mins.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nRemove the chicken to a plate, then add the potatoes and chorizo to the pan. Continue cooking for 30 mins until the beans and potatoes are tender.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nDiscard the skin and bones from the chicken and tear into large chunks. Return the chicken to the pan with the spinach and simmer for 5 mins.","z":"步骤1\r\n将豆子放入一个大碗中浸泡至少 4 小时或过夜，并用大量水覆盖。第二天，冲洗并沥干，然后将洋葱、辣椒粉、香草束和鸡肉放入一个大的厚底锅中。倒入足够的水或高汤盖住，煮沸，然后关小火，盖上盖子煮45分钟。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将鸡肉放入盘中，然后将土豆和香肠放入锅中。继续煮 30 分钟，直到豆子和土豆变软。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n去掉鸡肉的皮和骨头，撕成大块。将鸡肉和菠菜一起放回锅中，煮 5 分钟。"},{"id":"53155","n":"Spanish chicken pie","a":"Spanish","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/8ovxf41763253962.jpg","y":"","i":[["Potatoes","1 kg"],["Paprika","3 tsp"],["Olive Oil","2 teaspoons"],["Onion","2 sliced"],["Garlic","2 cloves minced"],["Tinned Tomatos","800g"],["Chicken","300g"],["Roasted pepper","140g"],["Green Olives","Handful"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6. Boil the potatoes for 15-20 mins until tender. Drain, return to the pan, then mash with some seasoning and 2 tsp of the paprika.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nMeanwhile, heat the oil in a large pan, then fry the onions and garlic for a few mins until softened. Stir in the remaining paprika for 1 min, add the tomatoes , then, bring to a simmer. Tip into a large ovenproof dish, then stir in the chicken, peppers, olives and some seasoning.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nSpoon over the mash, then bake for 15 mins until the mash is golden on top and the sauce is bubbling.","z":"步骤1\r\n将烤箱加热至 200C/风扇 180C/煤气 6. 将土豆煮 15-20 分钟直至变软。沥干水分，放回锅中，然后与一些调味料和 2 茶匙辣椒粉一起捣碎。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n与此同时，在大锅中加热油，然后将洋葱和大蒜炒几分钟直至变软。加入剩余的辣椒粉搅拌1分钟，加入西红柿，然后小火煮。倒入一个耐热的大盘子中，然后拌入鸡肉、辣椒、橄榄和一些调味料。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n用勺子浇在土豆泥上，然后烘烤 15 分钟，直到土豆泥顶部呈金黄色且酱汁冒泡。"},{"id":"53163","n":"Spanish fig & almond balls","a":"Spanish","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/si2rty1763282314.jpg","y":"","i":[["Almonds","100g"],["Figs","500g"],["Dried Apricots","85g"],["Dried cranberries","50g"],["Brandy","1 tablespoon"],["Clear Honey","1 tblsp"],["Cloves","1 teaspoon"],["Sesame Seed","100g"]],"s":"step 1\r\nWhizz the almonds in a food processor until most are finely chopped, then tip into a large bowl. Roughly chop the figs, then whizz to a smooth sticky paste. Scrape onto the almonds then, using your hands, mix together well with the dried fruit, brandy, honey and cloves.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nDivide the mixture into 6 and roll into balls. Tip the sesame seeds onto a tray, then roll the balls in them until covered. Cover the tray loosely with a clean tea towel, then leave the fig balls to dry for a week before packaging. Will keep in a cool place for 2 months.","z":"步骤1\r\n在食品加工机中搅拌杏仁，直到大部分杏仁被切碎，然后倒入一个大碗中。将无花果大致切碎，然后搅拌成光滑的粘糊状。然后用手刮到杏仁上，与干果、白兰地、蜂蜜和丁香充分混合。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将混合物分成 6 份并滚成球。将芝麻倒在托盘上，然后将球放入其中滚动直至覆盖。用干净的茶巾松松地盖住托盘，然后将无花果球晾干一周，然后再包装。将在阴凉处保存2个月。"},{"id":"53183","n":"Spanish meatballs with clams, chorizo & squid","a":"Spanish","c":"Miscellaneous","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/2wt8721763334199.jpg","y":"","i":[["Butter","25g"],["Shallots","3 diced"],["Smoked Paprika","1 teaspoon"],["Garlic","2 cloves minced"],["Garlic","1 clove finely chopped"],["Dry sherry","2 tblsp"],["Breadcrumbs","50g"],["Pork","300g"],["Egg Yolks","1"],["Olive Oil","50 ml"],["Chorizo","300g"],["Squid","300g"],["White Wine","100 ml"],["Tomato","300g"],["Clams","400g"],["Parsley","Handful"],["Extra Virgin Olive Oil","Drizzle"]],"s":"step 1\r\nMelt the butter in a heavy-based casserole, then soften the shallots for 5 mins. Add the paprika and crushed garlic and cook for 1 min until the paprika becomes fragrant. Splash in the sherry, then pour the whole lot into a bowl with the breadcrumbs. Season and cool.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nAdd the pork mince and the egg yolk to the bowl, then beat well. Shape into 18 small meatballs. Wipe the pan, put on a medium-high heat, then add the oil. Fry the meatballs for 5 mins, just to colour, then lift onto a plate, but keep the oil in the pan. Sizzle the chorizo with the sliced garlic. Add the squid and fry to give a little colour. Now tip in the white wine and bring to the boil, scraping the bottom. Stir in the pulped tomatoes, bring to the boil, then add the meatballs and the clams. Cover and cook for 5 mins until the clam shells open. Discard any that stay shut. Sprinkle with the chopped parsley, drizzle with the extra virgin oil, then serve with crusty bread.","z":"步骤1\r\n将黄油放入厚底砂锅中融化，然后将青葱软化 5 分钟。加入辣椒粉和碎大蒜，煮 1 分钟，直至辣椒粉散发出香味。倒入雪利酒，然后将所有东西倒入装有面包屑的碗中。调味并冷却。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将猪肉末和蛋黄加入碗中，然后搅拌均匀。搓成18个小肉丸。擦净锅，中高火，然后加入油。将肉丸煎 5 分钟，上色，然后将其放在盘子上，但不要将油留在锅中。用蒜片炒香肠。加入鱿鱼，炒至变色。现在倒入白葡萄酒，煮沸，刮掉底部。加入番茄浆，煮沸，然后加入肉丸和蛤蜊。盖上锅盖煮 5 分钟，直至蛤壳打开。丢弃任何保持关闭的状态。撒上切碎的欧芹，淋上特级初榨油，然后搭配硬皮面包。"},{"id":"53184","n":"Spanish rice & prawn one-pot","a":"Spanish","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/sl6vqv1763335988.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fhz1QjO1tB0","i":[["Onion","1 sliced"],["Red Pepper","1 sliced"],["Green Pepper","1 sliced"],["Chorizo","50g"],["Garlic","2 cloves minced"],["Olive Oil","1 tblsp"],["Basmati Rice","250g"],["Tinned Tomatos","400g"],["Prawns","200g"]],"s":"step 1\r\nBoil the kettle. In a non-stick frying or shallow pan with a lid, fry the onion, peppers, chorizo and garlic in the oil over a high heat for 3 mins. Stir in the rice and chopped tomatoes with 500ml boiling water, cover, then cook over a high heat for 12 mins.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nUncover, then stir – the rice should be almost tender. Stir in the prawns, with a splash more water if the rice is looking dry, then cook for another min until the prawns are just pink and rice tender.","z":"步骤1\r\n将水壶烧开。在不粘煎锅或带盖浅锅中，将洋葱、辣椒、香肠和大蒜放入油中，高火煎 3 分钟。将米饭和切碎的西红柿与500毫升开水一起搅拌，盖上锅盖，大火煮12分钟。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n揭开盖子，然后搅拌——米饭应该几乎变软了。拌入虾，如果米饭看起来很干，就多加点水，然后再煮一分钟，直到虾变成粉红色，米饭变软。"},{"id":"53182","n":"Spanish seafood rice","a":"Spanish","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/c6ghxm1763335584.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jA-G6k1wT9M","i":[["Olive Oil","1 tblsp"],["Onion","1 chopped"],["Red Pepper","1"],["Yellow Pepper","1"],["Garlic Clove","2 sliced"],["Paella Rice","250g"],["Vegetable Stock","800ml"],["Saffron","Pinch"],["Frozen Seafood mix","400g"],["Lemon","Juice of 1/2"],["Parsley","Handful"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat the oil in a large saucepan and soften the onion for 6-7 mins. Add the pepper and garlic, cook for 2 mins more, then stir in the paella rice and cook for 1 min, stirring to coat.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nPour in the stock, add the saffron and bring to the boil. Cook, uncovered, at a gentle bubble, for 20 mins, stirring occasionally until the rice is tender.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nStir in the seafood and lemon juice and cook for 2 mins or until piping hot and completely cooked through. Serve in warm bowls scattered with the parsley.","z":"步骤1\r\n在大平底锅中加热油，软化洋葱 6-7 分钟。加入胡椒和大蒜，再煮2分钟，然后加入西班牙海鲜饭，煮1分钟，搅拌均匀。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n倒入高汤，加入藏红花，煮沸。不盖盖子，用小火煮 20 分钟，偶尔搅拌直至米饭变软。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n加入海鲜和柠檬汁，煮 2 分钟或直至滚烫并完全煮熟。盛入撒有欧芹的温热碗中。"},{"id":"53176","n":"Spanish tomato bread with jamón Serrano","a":"Spanish","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/hsp1fo1763327867.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OG9zuXJht7I","i":[["Tomato","4 Chopped"],["Garlic","1 clove finely chopped"],["Olive Oil","3  tablespoons"],["Salt","Pinch"],["Pepper","Pinch"],["Baguette","20 slices"],["Serrano Ham","5 Slices"]],"s":"step 1\r\nMix together the chopped tomatoes, garlic clove, olive oil, salt and pepper. Keep in the fridge until needed.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nTo serve, toast 20 slices of baguette. Spoon a little tomato topping on to each piece of toast. Tear 5-6 slices of jamón Serrano into pieces and put one piece on each slice of bread.","z":"步骤1\r\n将切碎的西红柿、蒜瓣、橄榄油、盐和胡椒混合在一起。保存在冰箱中直到需要为止。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n食用时，烤 20 片法棍面包。在每片吐司上舀一点番茄。将 5-6 片塞拉诺火腿撕成碎片，然后将一片放在每片面包上。"},{"id":"53175","n":"Spanish-style slow-cooked lamb shoulder & beans","a":"Spanish","c":"Lamb","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/9kwatm1763327074.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=D35ByGgKNaY","i":[["Lamb Shoulder","2.5kg"],["Olive Oil","1 tblsp"],["Onion","2 chopped"],["Carrots","4 Chopped"],["Garlic Bulb","1"],["Chicken Stock","500ml"],["Butter Beans","1200g"],["Roasted pepper","450g"],["Black Olives","300g"],["Parsley","4 tablespoons"],["Garlic","4 Cloves Crushed"],["Hot smoked paprika","1 tablespoon"],["Olive Oil","4 tablespoons"],["Rosemary","1/2 teaspoon"]],"s":"step 1\r\nTo make the spice mix, combine all of the ingredients together with a large pinch of salt. Slash the lamb shoulder all over with a sharp knife and rub in. If you have the time, marinate for up to 24 hrs, but this is not essential.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nHeat the oven to 150C/130C fan/gas 2. Heat the oil in a large flameproof casserole dish or roasting tin over a medium-high heat, add the onions, carrots and garlic and sizzle for 5 mins until the onions and carrots are softened. Pour over the stock, then bring to the boil. Nestle the lamb in the pan and cover, then transfer to the oven and roast for 2 hrs.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nUncover and transfer the lamb to a plate using tongs. Stir the beans, peppers and olives through the stock in the pan, sit the lamb back on top and return to the oven, uncovered, for 1 hr 30 mins until the lamb is cooked through. Transfer the lamb to a board and shred using two forks. Stir the parsley through the braised beans before serving.","z":"步骤1\r\n为了制作香料混合物，将所有成分与一大撮盐混合在一起。用锋利的刀将羊肩肉切开，然后揉搓。如果有时间，可以腌制长达 24 小时，但这不是必需的。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将烤箱加热至 150C/130C 风扇/煤气 2. 在大型防火砂锅或烤盘中用中高火加热油，加入洋葱、胡萝卜和大蒜，嘶嘶作响 5 分钟，直至洋葱和胡萝卜变软。倒在汤上，然后煮沸。将羊肉放入锅中并盖上盖子，然后转移到烤箱中烤 2 小时。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n用钳子将羊肉揭开并转移到盘子上。将豆子、辣椒和橄榄与锅中的高汤一起搅拌，将羊肉放回上面，然后返回烤箱，不盖盖子，烤 1 小时 30 分钟，直至羊肉煮熟。将羊肉转移到板上并用两把叉子切碎。上菜前将欧芹拌入红烧豆中。"},{"id":"53142","n":"Spiced tortilla","a":"Spanish","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/7b862e1763194846.jpg","y":"","i":[["Sunflower Oil","1 tbsp"],["Onion","1"],["Red Chilli","1"],["Curry Powder","2 teaspoon"],["Cherry Tomatoes","300g"],["Potatoes","500g"],["Coriander","Bunch"],["Egg","8"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat the oil in a large frying pan. Fry the onion and half the chilli for 5 mins until softened. Tip in the spices, fry for 1 min more, then add the cherry tomatoes, potatoes and coriander stalks to the pan. Season the eggs well, pour over the top of the veg and leave to cook gently for 8-10 mins until almost set.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nHeat the grill and flash the tortilla underneath for 1-2 mins until the top is set. Scatter the coriander leaves and remaining chilli over the top, slice into wedges and serve with a green salad.","z":"步骤1\r\n在大煎锅中加热油。将洋葱和一半辣椒炒 5 分钟直至变软。加入香料，再煎 1 分钟，然后将樱桃番茄、土豆和香菜茎放入锅中。将鸡蛋充分调味，倒在蔬菜顶部，轻轻煮 8-10 分钟，直至几乎凝固。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n加热烤架，将玉米饼放在下面煎 1-2 分钟，直至顶部凝固。将香菜叶和剩余的辣椒撒在上面，切成楔形，搭配蔬菜沙拉。"},{"id":"53165","n":"Torrijas with sherry","a":"Spanish","c":"Breakfast","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/f3ee3y1763309332.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RGUp1N5KAGY","i":[["Egg","2 medium"],["Double Cream","2 tbsp"],["Milk","2 tblsp"],["Golden Caster Sugar","3 tsp"],["Sweet Sherry","3  tablespoons"],["Bread","4 thick slices"],["Olive Oil","For frying"],["Icing Sugar","To serve"],["Creme Fraiche","To serve"]],"s":"step 1\r\nIn a wide, shallow bowl, beat the eggs with the cream, milk, golden caster sugar and sherry. Cut each slice of bread in two and dip them into the egg mix, turning to make sure they get a good coating on either side. Soak bread in egg mixture for 10 mins to absorb the liquid (carefully turn them over from time to time and make sure they don’t get too soggy).\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nHeat 1½ tbsp olive oil in a large frying pan and cook the bread for about 3 mins on each side until dark golden and crisp on the edge. Keep the slices warm in a low oven as you cook the rest.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nDivide the torrijas between plates and dust with the icing sugar. Serve with crème fraîche or Greek yogurt on the side.","z":"步骤1\r\n在一个宽而浅的碗中，将鸡蛋与奶油、牛奶、金砂糖和雪利酒一起搅拌。将每片面包切成两半，然后将它们浸入鸡蛋混合物中，转动以确保它们的两面都有良好的涂层。将面包浸泡在鸡蛋混合物中 10 分钟以吸收液体（时不时小心地翻动面包，确保它们不会太湿）。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n在大煎锅中加热 1½ 汤匙橄榄油，将面包每面煎约 3 分钟，直至边缘呈深金黄色且酥脆。煮其余部分时，将切片放在低温烤箱中保温。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n将托里哈分装在盘子中，撒上糖粉。佐以法式酸奶油或希腊酸奶。"},{"id":"53094","n":"Baba Ghanoush","a":"Syrian","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/dlmh401760524897.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/Mz-ZVfOA_ig","i":[["Egg Plants","4 large"],["Garlic","2 cloves"],["Kosher Salt","2 teaspoons"],["Lemon","1"],["Tahini","3  tablespoons"],["Extra Virgin Olive Oil","3  tablespoons"],["Greek Yogurt","2 tablespoons"],["Cayenne Pepper","1 pinch"],["Mint","1 Leaf"],["Parsley","2 tablespoons"]],"s":"Preheat an outdoor grill for medium-high heat and lightly oil the grate. Prick the surface of the skin of eggplants several times with the tip of a knife.\r\n\r\nPlace eggplants directly on grill. Turn frequently with tongs while skin chars. Cook until eggplants have collapsed and are very soft, 25 to 30 minutes. Transfer to a bowl and cover tightly with aluminum foil and allow to cool, about 15 minutes.\r\n\r\nWhen eggplants are cool enough to handle, split them in half and scrape flesh into a colander placed over a bowl. Drain 5 or 10 minutes.\r\n\r\nTransfer eggplant to mixing bowl. Add crushed garlic and salt; mash until creamy but with a little texture, about 5 minutes. Whisk in lemon juice, tahini, olive oil, and cayenne pepper. Stir in yogurt.\r\n\r\nCover bowl with plastic wrap and refrigerate until completely chilled. Stir in mint and parsley, and taste to adjust seasonings before serving.","z":"将户外烤架预热至中高火，并在烤架上涂上少许油。用刀尖在茄子皮表面刺几下。\r\n\r\n将茄子直接放在烤架上。当皮肤烧焦时，经常用钳子转动。煮 25 至 30 分钟，直至茄子塌陷且变软。转移到碗中并用铝箔盖紧并冷却约 15 分钟。\r\n\r\n当茄子冷却到可以处理时，将其切成两半，然后将茄子刮入放在碗上的漏勺中。沥干5或10分钟。\r\n\r\n将茄子转移到搅拌碗中。加入蒜末和盐；捣碎直至呈奶油状但有一点质感，大约需要 5 分钟。加入柠檬汁、芝麻酱、橄榄油和辣椒，搅拌。加入酸奶搅拌。\r\n\r\n用保鲜膜盖住碗并冷藏直至完全冷却。拌入薄荷和欧芹，并在食用前品尝以调整调味料。"},{"id":"53091","n":"Falafel Pita Sandwich with Tahini Sauce","a":"Syrian","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/ae6clc1760524712.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wt8nApxP5fE","i":[["Falafel","12"],["Tahini","1/4 cup"],["Water","1/4 cup"],["Lemon Juice","2 tablespoons"],["Garlic","2 cloves"],["Paprika","1/4 tsp"],["Pita Bread","6"],["Lettuce","1"],["Tomato","1"],["Cucumber","1/2"],["Dill Pickles","1"],["Red Onions","1/4"],["Harissa Spice","3 tsp"]],"s":"Preheat the oven to 450 degrees F (230 degrees C). Place falafel on a baking sheet.\r\n\r\nBake in the preheated oven until heated through, 8 to 10 minutes.\r\n\r\nWhile falafel bake, whisk tahini, water, lemon juice, garlic, and paprika together in a bowl.\r\n\r\nCut about 1 inch from the top of each pita to form a pocket. Add 2 falafel to each pita with equal amounts lettuce, tomato, cucumber, pickle, and red onion. Drizzle each with about 1 tablespoon tahini sauce and some harissa.","z":"将烤箱预热至 450 华氏度（230 摄氏度）。将沙拉三明治放在烤盘上。\r\n\r\n在预热的烤箱中烘烤 8 至 10 分钟，直至热透。\r\n\r\n烘烤沙拉三明治时，将芝麻酱、水、柠檬汁、大蒜和辣椒粉一起放入碗中搅拌。\r\n\r\n从每个皮塔饼的顶部切出约 1 英寸，形成一个口袋。在每个皮塔饼中加入 2 个沙拉三明治和等量的生菜、番茄、黄瓜、泡菜和红洋葱。每个淋上大约一汤匙芝麻酱和一些哈里萨辣酱。"},{"id":"53092","n":"Fasoliyyeh Bi Z-Zayt (Syrian Green Beans with Olive Oil)","a":"Syrian","c":"Vegan","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/21yc5s1760524759.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_EadiEPxQI0","i":[["Green Beans","16 ounces"],["Olive Oil","1/4 cup"],["Salt","Dash"],["Garlic","1 clove"],["Cilantro","1/4 cup"]],"s":"Place the green beans into a large pot, and drizzle with olive oil. Season with salt to taste, and put the lid on the pot. Cook over medium-high heat, stirring occasionally, until beans are cooked to your desired doneness. Syrians like it cooked until the green beans are turning brownish in color. The idea is not to saute them, but to let them steam in the moisture released by the ice crystals.\r\n\r\nAdd cilantro and garlic to the beans, and continue to cook just until the cilantro has started to wilt. Eat as a main course by scooping up with warm pita bread or serve as a side dish.","z":"将青豆放入大锅中，淋上橄榄油。加盐调味，然后盖上锅盖。用中高火煮，偶尔搅拌，直到豆子煮到你想要的熟度。叙利亚人喜欢将其煮至青豆变成棕色。这个想法不是炒它们，而是让它们在冰晶释放的水分中蒸发。\r\n\r\n将香菜和大蒜加入豆子中，继续煮，直到香菜开始枯萎。与热皮塔饼一起舀起作为主菜食用，或作为配菜。"},{"id":"53089","n":"Syrian Bread","a":"Syrian","c":"Miscellaneous","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/54xzk31760524666.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Pjzj0dws0Yk","i":[["Water","1 and 1/8 cup"],["Vegetable Oil","2 tblsp"],["Sugar","1/2 teaspoon"],["Salt","1 1/2 tsp"],["Flour","3 Cups"],["Yeast","1 1/2 tsp"]],"s":"Place ingredients in the pan of the bread machine in the order recommended by the manufacturer. Select Dough cycle; press Start.\r\n\r\nWhen the Dough cycle is almost complete, preheat the oven to 475 degrees F (245 degrees C).\r\n\r\nTurn dough out onto a lightly floured surface. Divide into eight equal pieces and form into rounds. Cover the rounds with a damp cloth and let rest.\r\n\r\nRoll dough into thin flat circles, about 8 inches in diameter. Cook two at a time on preheated baking sheets or a baking stone until puffed up and golden brown, about 5 minutes. Repeat for remaining loaves.","z":"按照制造商推荐的顺序将原料放入面包机的烤盘中。选择面团周期；按开始。\r\n\r\n当面团循环几乎完成时，将烤箱预热至 475 华氏度（245 摄氏度）。\r\n\r\n将面团翻到撒有少许面粉的表面上。分成八等份并搓成圆形。用湿布盖住子弹并让其休息。\r\n\r\n将面团擀成薄扁的圆形，直径约8英寸。在预热的烤盘或烤石上一次煮两个，直至膨胀并呈金黄色，大约 5 分钟。对剩余的面包重复上述步骤。"},{"id":"53095","n":"Syrian Rice with Meat","a":"Syrian","c":"Miscellaneous","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/zg2b9l1760524940.jpg","y":"","i":[["Butter","1/4 cup"],["Ground Beef","2 Pounds"],["Salt","2 teaspoons"],["Allspice","1/2 teaspoon"],["Cinnamon","1/2 teaspoon"],["Black Pepper","1/2 teaspoon"],["Chicken Stock","5 Cups"],["Rice","2 cups"],["Butter","2 tablespoons"],["Pine Nuts","1/2 cup"]],"s":"Heat 1/4 cup butter in a large saucepan over medium-high heat. Add ground beef and season with salt, allspice, cinnamon, and black pepper. Cook and stir until beef is browned and crumbly, 7 to 10 minutes.\r\n\r\nStir chicken broth and rice into beef in the saucepan; bring to a boil. Reduce heat to low, cover, and cook until liquid is absorbed, about 20 minutes.\r\n\r\nMeanwhile, melt 2 tablespoons butter in a small skillet over medium heat. Cook and stir pine nuts in hot butter until lightly browned, 3 to 5 minutes.\r\n\r\nMix pine nuts into beef-rice mixture before serving.","z":"在大平底锅中用中高火加热 1/4 杯黄油。加入碎牛肉，用盐、五香粉、肉桂和黑胡椒调味。煮并搅拌 7 至 10 分钟，直至牛肉变成棕色且易碎。\r\n\r\n将鸡汤和米饭倒入锅中的牛肉中搅拌；煮沸。将火调小，盖上锅盖，煮约 20 分钟，直至液体被吸收。\r\n\r\n与此同时，在小煎锅中用中火融化 2 汤匙黄油。将松子放入热黄油中煮 3 至 5 分钟，直至呈浅棕色。\r\n\r\n食用前将松子混入牛肉米饭混合物中。"},{"id":"53093","n":"Syrian Spaghetti","a":"Syrian","c":"Pasta","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/5fu4ew1760524857.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MGmaX9Uv_Gs","i":[["Spaghetti","16 ounces"],["Tomato Sauce","8 ounces"],["Tomato Puree","6 oz"],["Cinnamon","1 teaspoon"],["Vegetable Oil","1/4 cup"],["Salt","Dash"],["Pepper","Dash"]],"s":"Preheat oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Grease a 9x13 inch baking dish.\r\n\r\nBring a large pot of lightly salted water to a boil. Add spaghetti and cook for 8 to 10 minutes or until al dente; drain and stir in tomato sauce, tomato paste, cinnamon, oil, salt and pepper. Transfer to prepared dish.\r\n\r\nBake in preheated oven for 1 hour, or until top is crunchy.","z":"将烤箱预热至 350 华氏度（175 摄氏度）。在 9x13 英寸的烤盘上涂上油脂。\r\n\r\n将一大锅淡盐水煮沸。加入意大利面条，煮 8 至 10 分钟或直至变得有嚼劲；沥干并拌入番茄酱、番茄酱、肉桂、油、盐和胡椒。转移到准备好的盘子里。\r\n\r\n在预热的烤箱中烘烤 1 小时，或直至顶部松脆。"},{"id":"53193","n":"Drunken noodles (pad kee mao)","a":"Thai","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/2wx8cm1763373419.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eJ3w2iJB4x8","i":[["Flat Rice Noodles","200g"],["Vegetable Oil","2 tblsp"],["Garlic","3 cloves Chopped"],["Birds-eye Chillies","3 chopped"],["Sirloin steak","225g"],["Broccoli","100g"],["Basil Leaves","Handful"],["Soy Sauce","4 tbsp"],["Oyster Sauce","4 tbsp"],["Fish Sauce","1 teaspoon"],["Sugar","1 tblsp"]],"s":"step 1\r\nPrepare the noodles following pack instructions, then drain and set aside. Combine all the ingredients for the sauce in a small bowl or jug, and set aside.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nHeat the oil in a large wok or frying pan over a high heat and stir-fry the garlic and chilli for 20 seconds until just starting to turn golden. Add the steak and stir-fry for 1 minute until seared and starting to brown. Add the broccoli and stir-fry for another minute, then tip in the noodles and add the sauce. Stir-fry for another 1-2 mins until well combined and piping hot.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nStir through the basil and turn off the heat. Serve immediately to avoid overcooking.","z":"步骤1\r\n按照包装说明准备面条，然后沥干并放在一边。将酱汁的所有成分混合在一个小碗或壶中，然后放在一边。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n在大锅或煎锅中用大火加热油，将大蒜和辣椒炒20秒，直至开始变成金黄色。加入牛排，炒 1 分钟，直至烤焦并开始变成棕色。加入西兰花，再炒一分钟，然后加入面条，加入酱汁。再炒1-2分钟，直至充分混合并滚烫。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n搅拌罗勒并关火。立即食用，以免煮过头。"},{"id":"53211","n":"Lemongrass beef stew with noodles","a":"Thai","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/ntafxw1763586291.jpg","y":"","i":[["Ginger","1 tablespoon chopped"],["Garlic Clove","2 chopped"],["Lemongrass Stalks","3"],["Coriander Leaves","2 tblsp"],["Red Chilli","2 sliced"],["Vegetable Oil","2 tblsp"],["Beef","250g"],["Soy Sauce","2 tblsp"],["Five Spice Powder","1 tsp"],["Brown Sugar","1 tsp"],["Beef Stock","400ml"],["Rice Noodles","100g"],["Lime","To serve"]],"s":"step 1\r\nPut the ginger, garlic, lemongrass, coriander and 1 chilli in a food processor, then pulse until puréed. Heat the oil in a pan over a low heat. Add the purée and cook for 5 mins. Stir in the beef, soy, five-spice, sugar and stock. Put on a lid and bring to the boil, then lower heat and simmer for 1 hr 15 mins. Remove the lid and cook for a further 15 mins until the beef is tender.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nJust before serving, prepare noodles following pack instructions. Drain well, then divide between 2 bowls and spoon over the beef stew. Serve sprinkled with the remaining chilli and coriander leaves, with lime wedges for squeezing over.","z":"步骤1\r\n将生姜、大蒜、柠檬草、香菜和 1 个辣椒放入食品加工机中，然后搅拌直至打成泥。用小火将锅中的油加热。加入果泥并煮 5 分钟。加入牛肉、酱油、五香、糖和高汤搅拌。盖上盖子，煮沸，然后小火煮 1 小时 15 分钟。取下盖子，再煮 15 分钟，直至牛肉变软。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n食用前，按照包装说明准备面条。沥干水分，然后分成两个碗，用勺子浇在炖牛肉上。撒上剩余的辣椒和香菜叶，撒上酸橙块即可食用。"},{"id":"52827","n":"Massaman Beef curry","a":"Thai","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/tvttqv1504640475.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mVxgZSCU9_g","i":[["Peanuts","85g"],["Coconut cream","400ml can"],["Massaman curry paste","4 tbsp"],["Beef","600g stewing cut into strips"],["Potatoes","450g waxy"],["Onion","1 cut thin wedges"],["Lime","4 leaves"],["Cinnamon stick","1"],["Tamarind paste","1 tbsp"],["Brown sugar","1 tbsp palm or soft light"],["Fish Sauce","1 tbsp"],["chilli","1 red deseeded and finely sliced, to serve"],["Jasmine Rice","to serve"]],"s":"Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6, then roast the peanuts on a baking tray for 5 mins until golden brown. When cool enough to handle, roughly chop. Reduce oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nHeat 2 tbsp coconut cream in a large casserole dish with a lid. Add the curry paste and fry for 1 min, then stir in the beef and fry until well coated and sealed. Stir in the rest of the coconut with half a can of water, the potatoes, onion, lime leaves, cinnamon, tamarind, sugar, fish sauce and most of the peanuts. Bring to a simmer, then cover and cook for 2 hrs in the oven until the beef is tender.\r\nSprinkle with sliced chilli and the remaining peanuts, then serve straight from the dish with jasmine rice.","z":"将烤箱加热至 200C/180C 风扇/煤气 6，然后将花生放在烤盘上烤 5 分钟直至呈金黄色。当冷却到可以处理时，大致切碎。将烤箱温度降至 180C/160C 风扇/燃气 4.\r\n在一个带盖的大砂锅中加热 2 汤匙椰子奶油。加入咖喱酱炒 1 分钟，然后加入牛肉炒至均匀裹上并密封。将剩下的椰子和半罐水、土豆、洋葱、酸橙叶、肉桂、罗望子、糖、鱼露和大部分花生搅拌在一起。用文火煮，然后盖上锅盖，在烤箱中煮 2 小时，直至牛肉变软。\r\n撒上辣椒片和剩余的花生，然后直接从盘子里与茉莉香米一起上桌。"},{"id":"52774","n":"Pad See Ew","a":"Thai","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/uuuspp1468263334.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ohy1DELF4is","i":[["rice stick noodles","6oz/180g"],["dark soy sauce","2 tbsp"],["oyster sauce","2 tbsp"],["soy sauce","2 tsp"],["white vinegar","2 tsp"],["sugar","2 tsp"],["water","2 tbsp"],["peanut oil","2 tbsp"],["garlic","2 cloves"],["Chicken","1 cup"],["Egg","1"],["Chinese broccoli","4 cups"]],"s":"Mix Sauce in small bowl.\r\nMince garlic into wok with oil. Place over high heat, when hot, add chicken and Chinese broccoli stems, cook until chicken is light golden.\r\nPush to the side of the wok, crack egg in and scramble. Don't worry if it sticks to the bottom of the wok - it will char and which adds authentic flavour.\r\nAdd noodles, Chinese broccoli leaves and sauce. Gently mix together until the noodles are stained dark and leaves are wilted. Serve immediately!","z":"将酱汁放入小碗中混合。\r\n锅里放油，将蒜切碎。大火烧热，加入鸡肉和西兰花茎，煮至鸡肉呈浅金黄色。\r\n推到锅边，打入鸡蛋，炒匀。如果它粘在锅底，不用担心——它会烧焦，从而增加正宗的味道。\r\n加入面条、西兰花叶和酱汁。轻轻地混合在一起，直到面条变黑并且叶子枯萎。立即上菜！"},{"id":"53191","n":"Pad Thai","a":"Thai","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/rg9ze01763479093.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=F86GfZIph8o","i":[["Rice Noodles","125g"],["Lime","Juice of 3"],["Cayenne Pepper","1/2 teaspoon"],["Muscovado Sugar","2 teaspoons"],["Fish Sauce","2 tablespoons"],["Vegetable Oil","2 tablespoons"],["Tiger Prawns","200g"],["Spring Onions","4 finely sliced"],["Bean Sprouts","140g"],["Peanuts","25g"],["Coriander","Handful"],["Lime","2"],["sweet chilli sauce","To serve"]],"s":"step 1\r\nPut the noodles in a large heatproof bowl, pour boiling water over them and leave for 4 minutes, then drain and refresh under cold running water.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nPut the lime juice, cayenne, sugar and fish sauce in a bowl and mix well. Have all the other ingredients ready by the cooker.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nHeat the oil and fry the prawns until warmed through. Add the spring onions and noodles and toss around. Tip in the lime juice mixture, then stir in the beansprouts and half the peanuts and coriander. Cook for 1 minute until everything is heated through.\r\n\r\nstep 4\r\nPile into a large dish, scatter with the rest of the peanuts and coriander, and serve with lime wedges and sweet chilli sauce.","z":"步骤1\r\n将面条放入耐热大碗中，倒入沸水并放置 4 分钟，然后沥干并在冷水下冲洗。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将酸橙汁、辣椒粉、糖和鱼露放入碗中，搅拌均匀。将所有其他原料准备好。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n加热油，将虾煎至热透。加入葱和面条，搅拌均匀。倒入酸橙汁混合物，然后拌入豆芽、一半花生和香菜。煮 1 分钟，直到所有东西都热透。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n堆入一个大盘子中，撒上剩余的花生和香菜，搭配酸橙角和甜辣椒酱。"},{"id":"53192","n":"Panang chicken curry (kaeng panang gai)","a":"Thai","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/0dhtwr1763371444.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dYZHzK7YfYI","i":[["Coconut Milk","400ml"],["Panang Curry Paste","1-2tbsp"],["Chicken Breast","200g"],["Green Beans","100g"],["Fish Sauce","2-3 tbsp"],["Brown Sugar","1-2tbsp"],["makrut lime leaves","2"],["Basil Leaves","Handful"],["Jasmine Rice","Boiled"],["Red Chilli","6"],["Dried Red Chillies","4"],["Shrimp Paste","1 teaspoon"],["Garlic","4 Cloves Chopped"],["Galangal","1 tblsp"],["Lemongrass","1 tblsp"],["Lime","Zest of 2"],["Ground Nutmeg","1 teaspoon"],["Ground Coriander","1 tsp"],["Ground Cumin","1 teaspoon"],["Peanuts","2 tblsp"]],"s":"step 1\r\nFirst, make the curry paste. Use a pestle and mortar to pound together the dried and fresh chillies, shrimp paste, garlic, galangal, lemongrass, lime zest, white pepper, coriander, cumin, nutmeg and peanuts, plus 1 tsp salt. You should have a rough paste. Alternatively, add all the ingredients to a food processor along with 2-3 tbsp of coconut milk and pulse until you have a paste. Store in a lidded jar in the fridge. Will keep for up to two weeks.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nAdd 2-3 tbsp of the thick part of the coconut milk into a saucepan over a medium-high heat. When the coconut milk starts bubbling, add 1-2 tbsp of the curry paste and stir well for about 1 min, until fragrant.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nStir in the chicken and let it cook for about 3-4 mins until beginning to brown all over. Follow with the French beans and stir well.\r\n\r\nstep 4\r\nSeason with the fish sauce and sugar, then add the rest of coconut milk. Mix well, add half the makrut lime leaves and simmer for 3-5 mins until the chicken is cooked through. Taste and add more sugar or fish sauce if necessary – it should be salty and nutty, and the sweetness should come through. Add the Thai basil leaves, give it a quick mix and take off the heat. Serve with steamed jasmine rice, garnished with the sliced chilli and the rest of the makrut lime leaves.","z":"步骤1\r\n首先，制作咖喱酱。用研杵和研钵将干辣椒和新鲜辣椒、虾酱、大蒜、高良姜、柠檬草、酸橙皮、白胡椒、香菜、小茴香、肉豆蔻和花生，加 1 茶匙盐一起捣碎。你应该有一个粗糙的糊状物。或者，将所有原料与 2-3 汤匙椰奶一起加入食品加工机中，搅拌直至形成糊状。存放在冰箱中的有盖罐子中。最多可保存两周。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将 2-3 汤匙椰奶浓稠部分放入平底锅中，用中高火加热。当椰奶开始冒泡时，加入1-2汤匙咖喱酱，搅拌约1分钟，直至散发出香味。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n拌入鸡肉，煮约 3-4 分钟，直至全身开始变成棕色。然后加入四季豆并搅拌均匀。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n用鱼露和糖调味，然后加入剩余的椰奶。搅拌均匀，加入一半的 makrut 酸橙叶，小火煮 3-5 分钟，直至鸡肉煮熟。如果需要的话，品尝并添加更多的糖或鱼露——它应该是咸的和坚果味的，并且应该有甜味。加入泰国罗勒叶，快速混合，然后关火。与蒸茉莉香米一起食用，饰以切好的辣椒片和其余的酸橙叶。"},{"id":"53200","n":"Prawn stir-fry","a":"Thai","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/96lt871763480970.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DddM8OGb4Jc","i":[["Raw tiger prawns","200g"],["Green Chilli","1 chopped"],["Garlic","3 Cloves Crushed"],["Coriander","1  bunch"],["Caster Sugar","1 tblsp"],["Lime","Juice of 1"],["Fish Sauce","3 tbsp"],["Ground Nut Oil","2 tablespoons"],["Ginger","3cm piece"],["Spring Onions","8 slices"],["Red Pepper","1 sliced"],["Water Chestnut","85g"],["Bean Sprouts","100g"],["Soy Sauce","1 tablespoon"],["Rice Noodles","To serve"],["Lime","To serve"]],"s":"step 1\r\nPut the prawns in a bowl. Put the chilli, garlic, coriander stalks (snip these up using scissors first) and caster sugar in a spice grinder or small food processor and whizz together. Add half of the lime juice and the fish sauce, then pour this over the prawns.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nHeat 1 tbsp oil in a wok, add the ginger and spring onions and fry for 1 min. Add the red pepper and fry for 1 min, until the pepper starts to soften. Add the water chestnuts and bean sprouts, and toss together until the bean sprouts start to wilt. Add the soy sauce and a really good grind of black pepper, then tip the lot into a serving dish.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nHeat the remaining oil in the wok and add the prawns, lifting them out of their juices. Toss for 1-2 mins until they turn pink, add the marinade and swirl the wok quickly, then tip the lot onto the veg. Snip over the coriander leaves and sprinkle on the remaining lime. Serves over noodles with extra lime for squeezing over.","z":"步骤1\r\n将虾放入碗中。将辣椒、大蒜、香菜茎（先用剪刀剪断）和细砂糖放入香料研磨机或小型食品加工机中，然后一起搅拌。加入一半的酸橙汁和鱼露，然后倒在虾上。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n锅中烧热1汤匙油，加入姜和葱，炒1分钟。加入红辣椒，炒 1 分钟，直到辣椒开始软化。加入荸荠和豆芽，搅拌直至豆芽开始枯萎。加入酱油和磨碎的黑胡椒，然后将其倒入盘中。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n将锅中剩余的油加热，加入虾，将虾从汁液中捞出。搅拌 1-2 分钟，直到它们变成粉红色，加入腌料并快速旋转锅，然后将其倒在蔬菜上。剪掉香菜叶，撒上剩余的酸橙。配在面条上，再加上额外的酸橙，可以挤在上面。"},{"id":"53204","n":"Red curry chicken kebabs","a":"Thai","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/prjve31763486864.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XJscdFRT8_8","i":[["Chicken Breasts","2"],["Thai Red Curry Paste","2 tblsp"],["Coconut Milk","2 tblsp"],["Red Pepper","1 chopped"],["Courgettes","1 chopped"],["Red Onions","1 cut thin wedges"],["Lime","To serve"]],"s":"step 1\r\nFire up the barbecue or heat a griddle pan to high. Tip chicken, curry paste and coconut milk into a bowl, then mix well until the chicken is evenly coated. Thread vegetables and chicken onto skewers. Cook the skewers on the barbecue or griddle for 5-8 mins, turning every so often, until the chicken is cooked through and charred. Serve with herby rice, salad and a lime half to squeeze over.","z":"步骤1\r\n点燃烧烤炉或将煎锅加热至高温。将鸡肉、咖喱酱和椰奶倒入碗中，搅拌均匀，直至均匀地裹上鸡肉。将蔬菜和鸡肉串在串上。将烤串放在烤架或煎锅上煮 5-8 分钟，期间经常翻动，直到鸡肉煮熟并烧焦。与香草米饭、沙拉和半个酸橙一起食用。"},{"id":"53209","n":"Spicy Thai prawn noodles","a":"Thai","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/568t931763584227.jpg","y":"","i":[["Rice Noodles","200g"],["Sesame Seed Oil","1 tablespoon"],["Egg","2 Beaten"],["Red Chilli","1 chopped"],["Ginger","3cm piece"],["Prawns","450g"],["Soy Sauce","1 tablespoon"],["Coriander","Bunch"],["Mint","1/2 handful"],["Lime","Zest and juice of 1"],["Peanuts","Handful"]],"s":"step 1\r\nCook the noodles following the pack instructions, drain and set aside for later. Heat the oil in a large frying pan and pour in the beaten egg. Swirl around the pan to make a thin omelette, cook for 1-2 mins, then flip over and cook the other side for 1 min. Tip out and slice into thin strips.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nAdd the chilli and ginger to the pan, fry for 1-2 mins then tip in the noodles, prawns and egg. Splash in the soy sauce and stir-fry for 1 min more. Throw in the chopped herbs and pour over the lime juice and zest, then sprinkle over the chopped peanuts and serve.","z":"步骤1\r\n按照包装说明煮面条，沥干备用。在大煎锅中加热油，倒入打散的鸡蛋。绕锅旋转，制成薄煎蛋卷，煮 1-2 分钟，然后翻转，将另一面煮 1 分钟。倒出并切成细条。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将辣椒和姜放入锅中，炒1-2分钟，然后倒入面条、虾和鸡蛋。倒入酱油，再炒1分钟。放入切碎的香草，倒入酸橙汁和热情，然后撒在切碎的花生上即可食用。"},{"id":"53201","n":"Stir-fried chicken with chillies & basil","a":"Thai","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/el64dy1763483009.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fF4GpyiZL8Q","i":[["Vegetable Oil","2 tablespoons"],["Chicken","450g"],["Garlic","3 tblsp chopped"],["Shallots","3 tblsp chopped"],["Red Chilli","3"],["Fish Sauce","2 tablespoons"],["Soy Sauce","2 tsp"],["Sugar","2 tsp"],["Basil Leaves","Handful"]],"s":"Heat a wok or large frying pan until it is very hot, then add 1 tbsp of the oil. When it is very hot, add the chicken and stir-fry over a high heat for 8-10 minutes, until browned all over. Using a slotted spoon, take the chicken from the pan and set aside.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nReheat the wok and add the remaining oil. Toss in the garlic and shallots and stir fry for 3 minutes, until golden brown.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nReturn the chicken to the wok and add the chillies, fish sauce, dark soy sauce and sugar. Stir fry over a high heat for a further 8-10 minutes or until the chicken is cooked through. Stir in the basil leaves and serve at once.","z":"将炒锅或大煎锅加热至非常热，然后加入 1 汤匙油。当温度很热时，加入鸡肉，用大火炒8-10分钟，直至全部变成棕色。用漏勺将鸡肉从锅中取出放在一边。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n重新加热炒锅并加入剩余的油。加入大蒜和青葱，炒3分钟，直至呈金黄色。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n将鸡肉放回锅中，加入辣椒、鱼露、老抽和糖。再用大火炒8-10分钟或直至鸡肉熟透。拌入罗勒叶，立即食用。"},{"id":"52814","n":"Thai Green Curry","a":"Thai","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/sstssx1487349585.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LIbKVpBQKJI","i":[["Potatoes","225g new"],["green beans","100g"],["sunflower oil","1 tbsp"],["garlic","1 clove"],["Thai green curry paste","4 tsp"],["coconut milk","400ml"],["Thai fish sauce","2 tsp"],["Sugar","1 tsp"],["Chicken","450g boneless"],["lime","2 fresh kaffir leaves"],["basil","handfull"],["Rice","Boiled"]],"s":"Put the potatoes in a pan of boiling water and cook for 5 minutes. Throw in the beans and cook for a further 3 minutes, by which time both should be just tender but not too soft. Drain and put to one side.\r\nIn a wok or large frying pan, heat the oil until very hot, then drop in the garlic and cook until golden, this should take only a few seconds. Don’t let it go very dark or it will spoil the taste. Spoon in the curry paste and stir it around for a few seconds to begin to cook the spices and release all the flavours. Next, pour in the coconut milk and let it come to a bubble.\r\nStir in the fish sauce and sugar, then the pieces of chicken. Turn the heat down to a simmer and cook, covered, for about 8 minutes until the chicken is cooked.\r\nTip in the potatoes and beans and let them warm through in the hot coconut milk, then add a lovely citrussy flavour by stirring in the shredded lime leaves (or lime zest). The basil leaves go in next, but only leave them briefly on the heat or they will quickly lose their brightness. Scatter with the lime garnish and serve immediately with boiled rice.","z":"将土豆放入装有沸水的锅中煮5分钟。放入豆子，再煮 3 分钟，此时两者都应该变软，但不要太软。沥干并放在一侧。\r\n在炒锅或大煎锅中，将油加热至非常热，然后放入大蒜，煮至金黄色，这只需要几秒钟。不要让它变得很黑，否则会破坏味道。用勺子舀入咖喱酱，搅拌几秒钟，开始烹饪香料并释放所有味道。接下来，倒入椰奶，让它起泡。\r\n加入鱼露和糖，然后加入鸡肉块。把火调小，盖上锅盖，煮约 8 分钟，直至鸡肉煮熟。\r\n倒入土豆和豆子，让它们在热椰奶中加热，然后加入切碎的酸橙叶（或酸橙皮）搅拌，增添可爱的柑橘味。接下来放入罗勒叶，但只能将其短暂加热，否则它们很快就会失去光泽。撒上酸橙装饰，立即与米饭一起食用。"},{"id":"53199","n":"Thai beef stir-fry","a":"Thai","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/kyuxew1763479470.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=N3OI_7zu5sA","i":[["Vegetable Oil","2 tbsp"],["Beef","400g"],["Red Chilli","1 sliced"],["Oyster Sauce","2 tblsp"],["Basil Leaves","Handful"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat a wok or large frying pan until smoking hot. Pour in the oil and swirl around the pan, then tip in the beef strips and chilli. Cook, stirring all the time, until the meat is lightly browned, about 3 mins, then pour over the oyster sauce. Cook until heated through and the sauce coats the meat. stir in the basil leaves and serve with plain rice.","z":"步骤1\r\n将炒锅或大煎锅加热直至冒烟。倒入油，绕锅旋转，然后倒入牛肉条和辣椒。煮时不断搅拌，直到肉变成浅棕色，大约 3 分钟，然后倒在蚝油上。煮至热透，酱汁覆盖在肉上。拌入罗勒叶，与白米饭一起食用。"},{"id":"53206","n":"Thai chicken cakes with sweet chilli sauce","a":"Thai","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/6s3i3p1763488540.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pT0WoqUZXw0","i":[["Chicken Breast","2 large"],["Garlic","1 clove"],["Ginger","1 small"],["Onion","1 chopped"],["Coriander","4 tbs"],["Green Chilli","1 chopped"],["Olive Oil","2 tblsp"],["sweet chilli sauce","To serve"],["Lime","To serve"],["Spring Onions","Chopped"],["Red Chilli","Chopped"]],"s":"step 1\r\nToss the chicken, garlic, ginger, onion, coriander and chilli into a food processor and season well. Blitz until the chicken is finely ground and everything is well mixed. Use your hands to shape six small cakes.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nHeat the oil in a frying pan, then fry the cakes over a medium heat for about 6-8 mins, turning once. Serve hot, with sweet chilli sauce, lime wedges, coriander, shredded spring onion and red chilli.","z":"步骤1\r\n将鸡肉、大蒜、生姜、洋葱、香菜和辣椒放入食品加工机中并充分调味。闪电战，直到鸡肉磨得很细，所有东西都混合均匀。用手塑造六个小蛋糕。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n煎锅中倒入油，将油烧热，然后用中火将饼煎约6-8分钟，中间翻动一次。趁热搭配甜辣椒酱、酸橙角、香菜、葱丝和红辣椒一起享用。"},{"id":"53208","n":"Thai coconut & veg broth","a":"Thai","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/4k8nzy1763583384.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1OeM2sdLOPk","i":[["Thai Red Curry Paste","1 ½ tbsp"],["Vegetable Oil","1 tsp"],["Vegetable Stock","1 L"],["Coconut Milk","400ml"],["Brown Sugar","2 tsp"],["Egg Noodles","175g"],["Carrots","2"],["Chinese Leaf","1/2"],["Bean Sprouts","150g"],["Cherry Tomatoes","6"],["Lime","Juice of 1"],["Spring Onions","3 sliced thinly"],["Coriander","Handful"]],"s":"step 1\r\nPlace the curry paste in a large saucepan or wok with the oil. Fry for 1 min until fragrant. Tip in the vegetable stock, coconut milk and brown sugar. Simmer for 3 mins.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nAdd the noodles, carrots and Chinese leaf and simmer for 4-6 mins, until all are tender. Mix in beansprouts and tomatoes. Add lime juice to taste and some extra seasoning, if you like. Spoon into bowls and sprinkle with spring onions and coriander.","z":"步骤1\r\n将咖喱酱放入大平底锅或炒锅中，加入油。炒1分钟至香。加入蔬菜高汤、椰奶和红糖。煮3分钟。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n加入面条、胡萝卜和中国叶子，煮 4-6 分钟，直至全部变软。加入豆芽和西红柿。如果您愿意，可以添加酸橙汁和一些额外的调味料。用勺子盛入碗中，撒上葱和香菜。"},{"id":"53195","n":"Thai curry noodle soup","a":"Thai","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/118oj61763423896.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FN8tcugjCFs","i":[["Vegetable Oil","1 teaspoon"],["Thai Green Curry Paste","1 tbsp"],["Stir-fry Vegetables","220g"],["Raw King Prawns","150g"],["Coconut Milk","150ml"],["Vegetable Stock","225ml"],["Udon Noodles","250g"],["Coriander","10g"],["Basil","10g"],["Red Chilli","1 sliced"],["Spring Onions","1 sliced"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat the oil in a saucepan over a medium heat and cook the curry paste for 1 min before adding the stir-fry veg and prawns. Cook for 3 mins until the prawns are mostly pink, then add the coconut milk, veg stock and noodles.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nBring to the boil, then reduce the heat to a simmer and cook for 5 mins until the noodles are cooked through and the veg is tender but still has a bite. Divide between two bowls and sprinkle over the herbs, chilli and spring onion.","z":"步骤1\r\n在平底锅中用中火加热油，将咖喱酱煮1分钟，然后加入炒蔬菜和虾。煮3分钟，直到虾大部分呈粉红色，然后加入椰奶、蔬菜高汤和面条。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n煮沸，然后将火调小，煮5分钟，直到面条煮熟，蔬菜变软但仍有咬力。分成两个碗，撒上香草、辣椒和葱。"},{"id":"53212","n":"Thai drumsticks","a":"Thai","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/ittake1763586925.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lv1tj9FK3f0","i":[["sweet chilli sauce","2 tablespoons"],["Orange","Zest of 1"],["Orange","2 tblsp"],["Garlic","1 clove peeled crushed"],["Thai Red Curry Paste","1 tblsp"],["Chicken drumsticks","8"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6 and line a baking tray with foil. Mix the chilli sauce with the orange zest and juice, garlic, curry paste and ¼ tsp salt. Add the chicken and coat really well.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nArrange the drumsticks on the foil, spaced apart. Coat the chicken with any marinade left in the bowl, then roast for 35-40 mins until tender. Wrap in foil or pack into a food container.","z":"步骤1\r\n将烤箱加热至 200C/180C 风扇/燃气 6，并在烤盘上铺上箔纸。将辣椒酱、橙皮碎、橙汁、大蒜、咖喱酱和 1/4 茶匙盐混合。添加鸡肉和外套。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将鸡腿放在箔纸上，间隔开。将碗中剩余的腌料涂在鸡肉上，然后烤 35-40 分钟直至变软。用箔纸包裹或装入食品容器中。"},{"id":"53198","n":"Thai fried rice with prawns & peas","a":"Thai","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/hblwvg1763478203.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9wZAYbPcF-I","i":[["Vegetable Oil","2 tbsp"],["Red Onions","1 sliced"],["Garlic Clove","2 sliced"],["Red Chilli","1 sliced"],["Raw King Prawns","250g"],["Brown Rice","140g"],["Frozen Peas","75g"],["Soy Sauce","1 tablespoon"],["Fish Sauce","1 tablespoon"],["Coriander","Bunch"],["Egg","4 large"],["Hotsauce","To serve"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat 1 tbsp of the oil in a wok, add the onion, garlic and chilli, and cook for 2-3 mins until golden. Add the prawns and cook for 1 min. Tip in the rice and peas, and keep tossing until very hot. Add the soy and fish sauce, then stir through the chopped coriander. Keep warm while you fry the eggs.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nHeat the remaining oil in a frying pan and fry the eggs with some seasoning. Divide the fried rice mix between 4 bowls and top each with a fried egg. Serve scattered with coriander, with chilli sauce, if you like.","z":"步骤1\r\n在锅中加热1汤匙油，加入洋葱、大蒜和辣椒，煮2-3分钟至金黄色。加入虾，煮 1 分钟。倒入米饭和豌豆，继续搅拌直至非常热。加入酱油和鱼露，然后加入切碎的香菜搅拌。煎鸡蛋时要保持温暖。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将煎锅中剩余的油加热，加入一些调味料煎鸡蛋。将炒饭分成 4 个碗，并在每个碗上放一个煎鸡蛋。如果你喜欢的话，撒上香菜和辣椒酱即可。"},{"id":"53214","n":"Thai green chicken soup","a":"Thai","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/7kb44y1763589084.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3s4Yitd546w","i":[["Sunflower Oil","2 tblsp"],["Onion","1 chopped"],["Chicken Thighs","500g"],["Garlic Clove","4 sliced"],["Thai Green Curry Paste","280g"],["Coconut Milk","400ml"],["Chicken Stock","2 Litres"],["Lime Leaves","5"],["Fish Sauce","2 tblsp"],["Spring Onions","1  bunch"],["Green Beans","280g"],["Bamboo Shoot","150g"],["Lime","Juice of 2"],["Basil","Bunch"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat the oil in your largest pan, add the onion and fry for 3 mins to soften. Add the chicken and garlic, and cook until the chicken changes colour.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nAdd the curry paste, coconut milk, stock, lime leaves and fish sauce, then simmer for 12 mins. Add the chopped onion tops, green beans and bamboo shoots and cook for 4-6 mins, until the beans are just tender.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nMeanwhile, put the lime juice and basil in a narrow jug and blitz with a hand blender to make a smooth green paste. Pour into the soup with the sliced spring onion and heat through. Serve with lime wedges for a light lunch or supper or as a make-ahead starter.","z":"步骤1\r\n在最大的平底锅中加热油，加入洋葱，炒 3 分钟使其软化。加入鸡肉和大蒜，煮至鸡肉变色。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n加入咖喱酱、椰奶、高汤、酸橙叶和鱼露，然后煮 12 分钟。加入切碎的洋葱头、青豆和竹笋，煮 4-6 分钟，直到豆子变软。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n与此同时，将酸橙汁和罗勒放入一个窄壶中，用手动搅拌机搅拌，制成光滑的绿色糊状物。将切好的葱倒入汤中，加热。与酸橙角一起享用，作为清淡的午餐或晚餐，或作为提前开胃菜。"},{"id":"53197","n":"Thai pork & peanut curry","a":"Thai","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/snmtd61763426568.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cxryD8ZHCdQ","i":[["Vegetable Oil","1 tablespoon"],["Spring Onions","Bunch"],["Coriander","Bunch"],["Pork Tenderloin","400g"],["Thai Red Curry Paste","4 tablespoons"],["Peanut Butter","4 tablespoons"],["Brown Sugar","1 tablespoon"],["Soy Sauce","1 tbsp"],["Coconut Milk","400ml"],["Sweetcorn","175g"],["Lime","Juice of 1"],["Jasmine Rice","Steamed"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat the oil in a large saucepan or flameproof casserole. Add the spring onions and coriander stalks and cook for 1 min. Add the pork slices and cook for 5 mins until starting to brown.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nStir in the curry paste and peanut butter. After 30 secs, add the sugar, soy and coconut milk, plus ½ can of water. Mix well, put a lid on and leave to simmer for 15 mins, stirring occasionally.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nRemove the lid, add the baby corn and increase the heat. Bubble for 3 mins until the corn is cooked and the sauce has thickened a little. Stir in the lime juice and check the seasoning. Can now be frozen for up to 2 months. To cook from frozen: thoroughly defrost, then heat in a pan on the hob until curry is hot all the way through. Serve scattered with the coriander leaves and rice.","z":"步骤1\r\n在大平底锅或防火砂锅中加热油。加入葱和香菜茎，煮 1 分钟。加入猪肉片，煮 5 分钟直至变成棕色。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n加入咖喱酱和花生酱搅拌。 30 秒后，加入糖、大豆和椰奶，以及 ½ 罐水。充分混合，盖上盖子，煮 15 分钟，偶尔搅拌。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n取下盖子，加入小玉米并增加热量。冒泡3分钟，直到玉米煮熟并且酱汁稍微变稠。加入酸橙汁并检查调味料。现在可以冷冻长达 2 个月。冷冻烹饪：彻底解冻，然后在炉灶上的平底锅中加热，直至咖喱完全变热。撒上香菜叶和米饭一起食用。"},{"id":"53205","n":"Thai prawn curry","a":"Thai","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/qqlwv91763501559.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dEMPVKQXSYA","i":[["Vegetable Oil","1 tbls"],["Onion","1 chopped"],["Ginger","1 tsp"],["Thai Red Curry Paste","2 tsp"],["Tinned Tomatos","400g"],["Coconut Cream","50g"],["Raw Frozen Prawns","400g"],["Coriander","Chopped"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat the oil in a medium saucepan. Tip in the onion and ginger, then cook for a few mins until softened. Stir in the curry paste, then cook for 1 min more. Pour over the chopped tomatoes and coconut cream. Bring to the boil, then leave to simmer for 5 mins, adding a little boiling water if the mixture gets too thick.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nTip in the prawns, then cook for 5-10 mins more, depending on how large they are. Serve alongside some plain rice and sprinkle with a little chopped coriander, if you like.","z":"步骤1\r\n在中型平底锅中加热油。加入洋葱和姜，煮几分钟直至变软。拌入咖喱酱，然后再煮1分钟。倒在切碎的西红柿和椰子奶油上。煮沸，然后小火煮5分钟，如果混合物太稠，则加入少量沸水。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n倒入虾，然后再煮 5-10 分钟，具体取决于虾的大小。如果您愿意，可以与一些白米饭一起食用，并撒上一点切碎的香菜。"},{"id":"53210","n":"Thai pumpkin soup","a":"Thai","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/1brbso1763585098.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=X3BxTRAhgTc","i":[["Pumpkin","1.5kg"],["Sunflower Oil","4 tsp"],["Onion","1 sliced"],["Ginger","1 tbsp grated"],["Lemongrass","1"],["Thai Red Curry Paste","4 tablespoons"],["Coconut Milk","400ml"],["Vegetable Stock","800ml"],["Lime juice","To taste"],["Sugar","To taste"],["Red Chilli","To serve"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Toss the pumpkin or squash in a roasting tin with half the oil and seasoning, then roast for 30 mins until golden and tender.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nMeanwhile, put the remaining oil in a pan with the onion, ginger and lemongrass. Gently cook for 8-10 mins until softened. Stir in the curry paste for 1 min, followed by the roasted pumpkin, all but 3 tbsp of the coconut milk and the stock. Bring to a simmer, cook for 5 mins, then fish out the lemongrass. Cool for a few mins, then whizz until smooth with a hand blender, or in a large blender in batches. Return to the pan to heat through, seasoning with salt, pepper, lime juice and sugar, if it needs it. Serve drizzled with the remaining coconut milk and scattered with chilli, if you like.","z":"步骤1\r\n将烤箱加热至 200C/180C 风扇/煤气 6. 将南瓜或南瓜放入烤盘中，加入一半的油和调味料，然后烤 30 分钟，直至金黄变软。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n同时，将剩余的油与洋葱、姜和柠檬草一起放入锅中。轻轻煮 8-10 分钟直至变软。加入咖喱酱搅拌 1 分钟，然后加入烤南瓜、除 3 汤匙椰奶和高汤外的所有原料。用文火煮5分钟，然后捞出柠檬草。冷却几分钟，然后用手动搅拌机或大型搅拌机分批搅拌直至光滑。返回锅中加热，如果需要的话，用盐、胡椒、酸橙汁和糖调味。如果您喜欢的话，淋上剩余的椰奶，撒上辣椒即可。"},{"id":"53203","n":"Thai rice noodle salad","a":"Thai","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/6g3rso1763486069.jpg","y":"","i":[["Vermicelli Rice Noodles","1/2 bag"],["Bean Sprouts","200g"],["Lime","Zest and juice of 2"],["Fish Sauce","2-3 tbsp"],["Muscovado Sugar","1 tsp"],["Red Onions","1 sliced"],["Lettuce","2 small"],["Minced Pork","500g"],["Ginger","Knob"],["Cayenne Pepper","Pinch"],["Sunflower Oil","1 tsp"],["Sesame Seed","2 tblsp"],["Oil","1 tsp"],["Sirloin steak","4"],["Red Chilli","1 sliced"]],"s":"step 1\r\nPlace the noodles and beansprouts in a heatproof bowl and cover with boiling water. Leave for 4 mins, or until the noodles are tender. Drain, then cool under cold running water and drain again. Return to the bowl.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nStir together the lime zest and juice, fish or soy sauce and sugar. Stir into the noodles with the red onion and lettuce.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nTo make with mince, heat a little oil in a non-stick frying pan and stir-fry 500g minced pork, a small knob of grated ginger and pinch cayenne pepper or chilli powder for 10 mins, until the mince is browned and cooked through. Mix into the noodles, divide between four bowls and serve warm.\r\n\r\nstep 4\r\nTo make with steak, make the rice noodle salad. Heat 1 tsp sunflower oil in a frying pan. Tip 2 tbsp sesame seeds onto a plate. Rub 1 tsp oil into 4 x 175g sirloin steaks and press into sesame seeds. Fry for 5 mins for medium rare, turning halfway. Leave to rest for 5 mins, then thinly slice. Toss 1 deseeded and shredded red chilli, and a handful mint leaves into noodles. Top with steak to serve.","z":"步骤1\r\n将面条和豆芽放入耐热碗中，盖上沸水。静置 4 分钟，或直至面条变软。沥干，然后在冷水下冷却并再次沥干。回到碗里。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将酸橙皮和果汁、鱼或酱油和糖搅拌在一起。与红洋葱和生菜一起搅拌到面条中。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n制作肉末时，在不粘锅中加热少许油，将500克肉末、一小块姜末、捏入辣椒粉或辣椒粉炒10分钟，直至肉末变成褐色并煮熟。拌入面条，分成四个碗，趁热食用。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n要做牛排，就做米粉沙拉。在煎锅中加热 1 茶匙葵花籽油。将 2 汤匙芝麻倒在盘子上。将 1 茶匙油抹入 4 x 175 克沙朗牛排中，然后压入芝麻。煎 5 分钟，中分熟，中途翻面。静置 5 分钟，然后切成薄片。将 1 个去籽切丝的红辣椒和一把薄荷叶放入面条中。上面放上牛排即可上桌。"},{"id":"53213","n":"Thai-style fish broth with greens","a":"Thai","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/a2ec961763587756.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rRwnwCd5om8","i":[["Brown Rice Noodle","100g"],["Chicken Stock","500ml"],["Thai Red Curry Paste","1 tblsp"],["Lime Leaves","4"],["Fish Sauce","1 tblsp"],["White Fish","200g"],["Raw King Prawns","100g"],["Pak Choi","2"],["Coriander Leaves","Handful"]],"s":"step 1\r\nCook the noodles following pack instructions. Refresh in cold water and drain well.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nPut the stock in a large saucepan and stir in the curry paste, lime leaves, fish sauce and 250ml cold water. Bring to a simmer and cook for 5 mins.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nCut the fish into roughly 3cm cubes and add to the pan. Return to a simmer, then cook for 2 mins uncovered.\r\n\r\nstep 4\r\nStir in the noodles, prawns and pak choi, and simmer for 2-3 mins or until the fish and prawns are just cooked. Serve in bowls scattered with coriander.","z":"步骤1\r\n按照包装说明煮面条。用冷水浸泡并沥干。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将高汤放入大平底锅中，加入咖喱酱、酸橙叶、鱼露和 250 毫升冷水，搅拌。用文火煮 5 分钟。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n将鱼切成约3厘米的方块，放入锅中。返回小火，然后不盖锅盖煮 2 分钟。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n加入面条、虾和白菜，煮2-3分钟或直到鱼和虾刚刚煮熟。盛入撒有香菜的碗中。"},{"id":"53202","n":"Thai-style steamed fish","a":"Thai","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/yx8j1i1763484612.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KQ-dl8fuBlQ","i":[["Trout","2"],["Ginger","Knob"],["Garlic Clove","1 small finely diced"],["Red Chilli","1 small finely diced"],["Lime","Juice/zest of one"],["Baby Pak Koi","3"],["Soy Sauce","2 tblsp"]],"s":"step 1\r\nNestle the fish fillets side by side on a large square of foil and scatter the ginger, garlic, chilli and lime zest over them. Drizzle the lime juice on top and then scatter the pieces of pak choi around and on top of the fish. Pour the soy sauce over the pak choi and loosely seal the foil to make a package, making sure you leave space at the top for the steam to circulate as the fish cooks.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nSteam for 15 minutes. (If you haven’t got a steamer, put the parcel on a heatproof plate over a pan of gently simmering water, cover with a lid and steam.)","z":"步骤1\r\n将鱼片并排放在一大块箔纸上，然后撒上生姜、大蒜、辣椒和酸橙皮。将酸橙汁淋在上面，然后将小白菜撒在鱼周围和上面。将酱油倒在小白菜上，然后松松地密封箔纸以制成包装，确保顶部留出空间，以便在鱼烹饪时蒸汽流通。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n蒸15分钟。 （如果你没有蒸锅，请将包裹放在耐热板上，放在一锅小火上，盖上盖子，然后蒸。）"},{"id":"53207","n":"Tom kha gai","a":"Thai","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/ol2xxt1763582263.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2BbIZwmIP7Q","i":[["Chicken Stock","800ml"],["Coconut Milk","800g"],["Galangal Paste","2 tablespoons"],["Lemongrass Stalks","2"],["Lime Leaves","8"],["Chicken Thighs","500g"],["Oyster Mushrooms","300g"],["Birds-eye Chillies","6"],["Caster Sugar","1 tablespoon"],["Fish Sauce","5 tablespoons"],["Lime","Juice of 3"],["Coriander Leaves","To serve"],["Rice","To serve"]],"s":"step 1\r\nPour the chicken stock and coconut milk into a large saucepan set over a medium heat. Tip in the galangal, lemongrass and lime leaves, and bring to a gentle simmer, around 6-8 mins. Keeping at a gentle simmer, add the chicken. Cook for 8-10 mins until tender and cooked through.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nStir in the mushrooms and chillies, and simmer for a further 3-5 mins until everything is cooked through. Sprinkle in the sugar and 3 tbsp each of the fish sauce and lime juice. Taste and add the remaining if required.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nRemove the galangal, lemongrass and lime leaves before serving using a slotted spoon. Ladle into bowls and serve with coriander leaves sprinkled over and steamed rice on the side. Will keep chilled for up to three days. Leave to cool first.","z":"步骤1\r\n将鸡汤和椰奶倒入大平底锅中，中火加热。倒入高良姜、柠檬草和酸橙叶，小火慢炖约 6-8 分钟。保持小火慢炖，加入鸡肉。煮8-10分钟直至变软并煮熟。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n加入蘑菇和辣椒，再煮3-5分钟，直到所有东西都煮熟。撒上糖、鱼露和酸橙汁各 3 汤匙。品尝并根据需要添加剩余的。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n食用前，用漏勺取出高良姜、柠檬草和酸橙叶。用勺子盛入碗中，撒上香菜叶，旁边放上蒸米饭。最多可冷藏三天。先让其冷却。"},{"id":"53196","n":"Tom yum (hot & sour) soup with prawns","a":"Thai","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/9c5nlx1763424766.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FJer_Cutb2I","i":[["Chicken Stock","700ml"],["Lemongrass","1"],["Galangal","5 Slices"],["Coriander","6"],["makrut lime leaves","3"],["King Prawns","6"],["Fish Sauce","3  tablespoons"],["Green Chilli","6 small"],["Lime juice","4 tablespoons"]],"s":"step 1\r\nBring the stock to a boil in a medium-sized saucepan. Add the lemongrass, galangal, coriander roots and lime leaves, then simmer for 2 mins.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nAdd the prawns, fish sauce, chillies and lime juice, then return to the boil. Taste and adjust the seasoning with either more lime juice or fish sauce, then garnish with coriander leaves and serve.","z":"步骤1\r\n在一个中等大小的平底锅中将高汤煮沸。加入柠檬草、高良姜、香菜根和酸橙叶，然后煮 2 分钟。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n加入虾、鱼露、辣椒和酸橙汁，然后再次煮沸。品尝并加入更多酸橙汁或鱼露调整调味料，然后用香菜叶装饰即可食用。"},{"id":"53194","n":"Tom yum soup with prawns","a":"Thai","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/l50vz41763422681.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fvLcZg9gNnE","i":[["Onion","200g"],["Tomato","150g"],["Red Chilli","20g"],["Galangal","15g"],["Lemongrass Stalks","2"],["Raw King Prawns","250g"],["Chicken Stock Cube","1"],["Oyster Mushrooms","120g"],["makrut lime leaves","8"],["Fish Sauce","25 ml"],["Lime juice","25 ml"],["Coconut Milk","70 ml"],["Thai Chilli Jam","1 tblsp"],["Coriander","Handful"]],"s":"step 1\r\nPour 1.3 litres water into a large saucepan over a high heat. Add the onion, tomato, chilli, galangal, lemongrass, prawn heads and chicken stock cube. Stir and bring to a boil, then reduce the heat to medium and simmer for 20 mins until the liquid has reduced.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nCarefully strain the hot broth into a large heatproof bowl or jug, then discard the prawn heads. Return the strained veg and herb mixture to the saucepan and pour over the broth. Stir through the mushrooms and lime leaves, then cook for 3 mins until the mushrooms are tender.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nAdd 1 tbsp sugar, the fish sauce, lime juice, coconut milk and prawns. Bring to the boil and cook until the prawns are cooked through, about 1-2 mins. Remove from the heat. Remove the lemongrass, then stir in the Thai chilli jam, if using. Scatter over the coriander to finish, if you like, and serve.","z":"步骤1\r\n将 1.3 升水倒入大平底锅中，用大火加热。加入洋葱、番茄、辣椒、高良姜、柠檬草、虾头和鸡汤块。搅拌并煮沸，然后将火调至中火，煮 20 分钟直至液体减少。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n小心地将热汤滤入一个大的耐热碗或壶中，然后丢弃虾头。将滤过的蔬菜和香草混合物放回锅中，倒在肉汤上。搅拌蘑菇和酸橙叶，然后煮 3 分钟，直至蘑菇变软。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n加入 1 汤匙糖、鱼露、酸橙汁、椰奶和虾。煮沸，煮约1-2分钟，直至虾熟透。从火上移开。取出柠檬草，然后加入泰式辣椒酱（如果使用）。如果您喜欢的话，撒上香菜即可食用。"},{"id":"52976","n":"Cashew Ghoriba Biscuits","a":"Tunisian","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/t3r3ka1560461972.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IqXEZUk4hWI","i":[["Cashew Nuts","250g"],["Icing Sugar","100g"],["Egg Yolks","2"],["Orange Blossom Water","2 tbs"],["Icing Sugar","To Glaze"],["Almonds","100g"]],"s":"Preheat the oven at 180 C / Gas 4. Line a baking tray with greaseproof paper.\r\nIn a bowl, mix the cashews and icing sugar. Add the egg yolks and orange blossom water and mix to a smooth homogeneous paste.\r\nTake lumps of the cashew paste and shape into small balls. Roll the balls in icing sugar and transfer to the baking tray. Push an almond in the centre of each ghribia.\r\nBake until the biscuits are lightly golden, about 20 minutes. Keep an eye on them, they burn quickly.","z":"将烤箱预热至 180 C/煤气 4. 在烤盘上铺上防油纸。\r\n在碗中，混合腰果和糖粉。加入蛋黄和橙花水，搅拌成光滑均匀的糊状物。\r\n取一块腰果酱，捏成小球。将球放入糖粉中滚动，然后转移到烤盘上。将一颗杏仁推入每个 ghribia 的中心。\r\n烘烤约 20 分钟，直至饼干呈浅金黄色。留意它们，它们燃烧得很快。"},{"id":"52969","n":"Chakchouka ","a":"Tunisian","c":"Miscellaneous","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/gpz67p1560458984.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EHKNu93MSx4","i":[["Tomatoes","4"],["Olive Oil","2 tbs"],["Onion","1 Diced"],["Red Pepper","1 sliced"],["Green Pepper","1 sliced"],["Garlic","3 Cloves Crushed"],["Cumin","1 tsp"],["Paprika","1 tsp"],["Salt","3/4 teaspoon"],["Chili Powder","1/2 teaspoon"],["Eggs","4"]],"s":"In a large cast iron skillet or sauté pan with a lid, heat oil over medium high heat. Add the onion and sauté for 2-3 minutes, until softened. Add the peppers and garlic, and sauté for an additional 3-5 minutes. Add the tomatoes, cumin, paprika, salt, and chili powder. Mix well and bring the mixture to a simmer. Reduce the heat to medium low and continue to simmer, uncovered, 10-15 minutes until the mixture has thickened to your desired consistency. (Taste the sauce at this point and adjust for salt and spice, as desired.) Using the back of a spoon, make four craters in the mixture, large enough to hold an egg. Crack one egg into each of the craters. Cover the skillet and simmer for 5-7 minutes, until the eggs have set. Serve immediately with crusty bread or pita.","z":"在一个大铸铁煎锅或带盖的炒锅中，用中高温加热油。加入洋葱，炒2-3分钟，直至变软。加入辣椒和大蒜，再炒 3-5 分钟。加入西红柿、小茴香、辣椒粉、盐和辣椒粉。充分混合并将混合物煮沸。将火调至中低，不加盖继续小火煮 10-15 分钟，直至混合物变稠至您想要的稠度。 （此时品尝酱汁，并根据需要调整盐和香料。）用勺子背面在混合物中打出四个坑，大到足以容纳一个鸡蛋。在每个弹坑中打入一颗鸡蛋。盖上锅盖，煮5-7分钟，直到鸡蛋凝固。立即与硬皮面包或皮塔饼一起食用。"},{"id":"52971","n":"Kafteji","a":"Tunisian","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/1bsv1q1560459826.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-TFf-Zu-xQU","i":[["Potatoes","5 Large"],["Olive Oil","2 tbs"],["Green Pepper","1"],["Onions","5"],["Ras el hanout","1 tbs"],["Pumpkin","500g"],["Eggs","24 Skinned"],["Salt","Pinch"],["Pepper","Pinch"]],"s":"Peel potatoes and cut into 5cm cubes.\r\nPour 1-2 cm of olive oil into a large pan and heat up very hot. Fry potatoes until golden brown for 20 minutes, turning from time to time. Place on kitchen paper to drain.\r\nCut the peppers in half and remove seeds. Rub a little olive oil on them and place the cut side down on a baking tray. Place them under the grill. Grill until the skin is dark and bubbly. While the peppers are still hot, put them into a plastic sandwich bag and seal it. Take them out after 15 minutes and remove skins.\r\nIn the meantime, heat more olive oil another pan. Peel the onions and cut into thin rings. Fry for 15 minutes until golden brown, turning them often. Add the Ras el hanout at the end.\r\nCut the pumpkin into 5cm cubes and fry in the same pan you used for the potatoes for 10-15 minutes until it is soft and slightly browned. Place on kitchen paper.\r\nPour the remaining olive oil out of the pan and put all the cooked vegetables into the pan and mix. Whisk eggs and pour them over the vegetables. Put the lid on the pan so that the eggs cook. Put the contents of the pan onto a large chopping board, add salt and pepper and chopped and mix everything with a big knife.","z":"土豆去皮，切成5厘米的方块。\r\n将 1-2 厘米厚的橄榄油倒入大锅中，加热至非常热。将土豆煎20分钟至金黄色，期间不时翻面。放在厨房用纸上沥干水分。\r\n将辣椒切成两半并去除种子。在上面抹一点橄榄油，然后将切面朝下放在烤盘上。将它们放在烤架下。烤至外皮变黑并起泡。趁辣椒还热的时候，将它们放入塑料三明治袋中并密封。 15分钟后取出，去掉皮。\r\n与此同时，在另一个锅中加热更多橄榄油。将洋葱去皮并切成细环。煎 15 分钟直至金黄色，经常翻面。最后添加 Ras el hanout。\r\n将南瓜切成 5 厘米见方的方块，放入煮土豆的同一个锅中煎 10-15 分钟，直至南瓜变软并呈浅棕色。放在厨房用纸上。\r\n将锅中剩余的橄榄油倒出，将所有煮熟的蔬菜放入锅中搅拌。搅拌鸡蛋并将其倒在蔬菜上。盖上锅盖，让鸡蛋煮熟。将锅中的内容物放在大砧板上，加入盐和胡椒，然后用大刀切碎并混合所有内容。"},{"id":"52974","n":"Keleya Zaara","a":"Tunisian","c":"Lamb","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/8x09hy1560460923.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=u_OSIChzuL0","i":[["Olive Oil","4 tbs"],["Lamb","750g"],["Saffron","1 1/2 tsp"],["Onion","1 Large Chopped"],["Water","25 ml"],["Parsley","30g"],["Butter","1 tbs"],["Lemon","1"]],"s":"Heat the vegetable oil in a large frying pan over medium-high heat. Add the lamb and cook until browned on all sides, about 5 minutes. Season with saffron, salt and pepper to taste; stir in all but 4 tablespoons of the onion, and pour in the water. Bring to the boil, then cover, reduce heat to medium-low, and simmer until the lamb is tender, about 15 minutes.\r\nUncover the pan, stir in the butter and allow the sauce reduce 5 to 10 minutes to desired consistency. Season to taste with salt and pepper, then pour into a serving dish. Sprinkle with the remaining chopped onions and parsley. Garnish with lemon wedges to serve.\r\n","z":"在大煎锅中用中高火加热植物油。加入羊肉，煮约 5 分钟，直至各面变成棕色。用藏红花、盐和胡椒调味；加入除了 4 汤匙洋葱之外的所有洋葱，然后倒入水。煮沸，然后盖上锅盖，将火调至中低，小火煮约 15 分钟，直至羊肉变软。\r\n揭开锅盖，加入黄油，搅拌 5 至 10 分钟，直至酱汁达到所需稠度。用盐和胡椒调味，然后倒入盘子中。撒上剩余的切碎的洋葱和欧芹。用柠檬片装饰即可食用。"},{"id":"52973","n":"Leblebi Soup","a":"Tunisian","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/x2fw9e1560460636.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BgRifcCwinY","i":[["Olive Oil","2 tbs"],["Onion","1 medium finely diced"],["Chickpeas","250g"],["Vegetable Stock","1.5L"],["Cumin","1 tsp"],["Garlic","5 cloves"],["Salt","1/2 tsp"],["Harissa Spice","1 tsp"],["Pepper","Pinch"],["Lime","1/2"]],"s":"Heat the oil in a large pot. Add the onion and cook until translucent.\r\nDrain the soaked chickpeas and add them to the pot together with the vegetable stock. Bring to the boil, then reduce the heat and cover. Simmer for 30 minutes.\r\nIn the meantime toast the cumin in a small ungreased frying pan, then grind them in a mortar. Add the garlic and salt and pound to a fine paste.\r\nAdd the paste and the harissa to the soup and simmer until the chickpeas are tender, about 30 minutes.\r\nSeason to taste with salt, pepper and lemon juice and serve hot.","z":"在一个大锅里加热油。加入洋葱，煮至半透明。\r\n将浸泡好的鹰嘴豆沥干，与蔬菜高汤一起放入锅中。煮沸，然后减少热量并盖上盖子。煮30分钟。\r\n与此同时，在一个不抹油的小煎锅中烘烤小茴香，然后在研钵中研磨。加入大蒜和盐，捣成细糊。\r\n将糊状物和哈里萨辣酱加入汤中，小火煮约 30 分钟，直至鹰嘴豆变软。\r\n用盐、胡椒和柠檬汁调味，趁热享用。"},{"id":"52975","n":"Tuna and Egg Briks","a":"Tunisian","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/2dsltq1560461468.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C5n1fN8TGHs","i":[["Olive Oil","2 tbs"],["Spring Onions","8"],["Spinach","200g"],["Filo Pastry","4"],["Tuna","1 can"],["Eggs","2"],["Hotsauce","Dash"],["Tomatoes","4 Chopped"],["Cucumber","1/4"],["Lemon Juice","1 tbs"],["Apricot Jam","4 tbs"]],"s":"Heat 2 tsp of the oil in a large saucepan and cook the spring onions over a low heat for 3 minutes or until beginning to soften. Add the spinach, cover with a tight-fitting lid and cook for a further 2–3 minutes or until tender and wilted, stirring once or twice. Tip the mixture into a sieve or colander and leave to drain and cool.\r\nUsing a saucer as a guide, cut out 24 rounds about 12.5 cm (5 in) in diameter from the filo pastry, cutting 6 rounds from each sheet. Stack the filo rounds in a pile, then cover with cling film to prevent them from drying out.\r\nWhen the spinach mixture is cool, squeeze out as much excess liquid as possible, then transfer to a bowl. Add the tuna, eggs, hot pepper sauce, and salt and pepper to taste. Mix well.\r\nPreheat the oven to 200°C (400°F, gas mark 6). Take one filo round and very lightly brush with some of the remaining oil. Top with a second round and brush with a little oil, then place a third round on top and brush with oil.\r\nPlace a heaped tbsp of the filling in the middle of the round, then fold the pastry over to make a half-moon shape. Fold in the edges, twisting them to seal, and place on a non-stick baking sheet. Repeat with the remaining pastry and filling to make 8 briks in all.\r\nLightly brush the briks with the remaining oil. Bake for 12–15 minutes or until the pastry is crisp and golden brown.\r\nMeanwhile, combine the tomatoes and cucumber in a bowl and sprinkle with the lemon juice and seasoning to taste. Serve the briks hot with this salad and the chutney.","z":"在大平底锅中加热 2 茶匙油，用小火将葱煮 3 分钟或直至开始变软。加入菠菜，盖上盖子，再煮 2-3 分钟，或直至菠菜变软枯萎，搅拌一两次。将混合物倒入筛子或漏勺中，然后沥干并冷却。\r\n使用碟子作为引导，从费罗糕点上切出 24 个直径约 12.5 厘米（5 英寸）的圆形，每张切下 6 个圆形。将费罗圆堆成一堆，然后用保鲜膜覆盖以防止它们变干。\r\n当菠菜混合物冷却后，挤出尽可能多的多余液体，然后转移到碗中。加入金枪鱼、鸡蛋、辣椒酱、盐和胡椒调味。搅拌均匀。\r\n将烤箱预热至 200°C（400°F，气体标记 6）。取一费罗圆，轻轻刷上一些剩余的油。在上面放第二个圆，刷上一点油，然后将第三个圆放在上面，刷上油。\r\n将一汤匙馅料放在圆形中间，然后将糕点折叠成半月形。将边缘折叠起来，扭转以密封，然后放在不粘烤盘上。对剩余的糕点和馅料重复上述步骤，总共制作 8 个砖块。\r\n用剩余的油轻轻地刷砖块。烘烤 12-15 分钟或直至糕点变脆并呈金黄色。\r\n同时，将西红柿和黄瓜放入碗中，撒上柠檬汁和调味料。趁热将砖块与沙拉和酸辣酱一起上桌。"},{"id":"52972","n":"Tunisian Lamb Soup","a":"Tunisian","c":"Lamb","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/t8mn9g1560460231.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=w1qgTQmLRe4","i":[["Lamb Mince","500g"],["Garlic","2 cloves minced"],["Onion","1"],["Spinach","300g"],["Tomato Puree","3 tbs"],["Cumin","1 tbs"],["Chicken Stock","1 Litre"],["Harissa Spice","3 tsp"],["Chickpeas","400g"],["Lemon Juice","1/2"],["Macaroni","150g"],["Salt","Pinch"],["Pepper","Pinch"]],"s":"Add the lamb to a casserole and cook over high heat. When browned, remove from the heat and set aside.\r\nKeep a tablespoon of fat in the casserole and discard the rest. Reduce to medium heat then add the garlic, onion and spinach and cook until the onion is translucent and the spinach wilted or about 5 minutes.\r\nReturn the lamb to the casserole with the onion-spinach mixture, add the tomato puree, cumin, harissa, chicken, chickpeas, lemon juice, salt and pepper in the pan. Simmer over low heat for about 20 minutes.\r\nAdd the pasta and cook for 15 minutes or until pasta is cooked.","z":"将羊肉放入砂锅中，用大火煮。当变成棕色时，从火上移开并放在一边。\r\n在砂锅中保留一汤匙脂肪，然后丢弃其余的。调至中火，然后加入大蒜、洋葱和菠菜，煮至洋葱半透明、菠菜枯萎或煮约 5 分钟。\r\n将羊肉与洋葱菠菜混合物一起放回砂锅中，在锅中加入番茄泥、小茴香、哈里萨辣酱、鸡肉、鹰嘴豆、柠檬汁、盐和胡椒。小火煮约20分钟。\r\n加入意大利面，煮 15 分钟或直至意大利面煮熟。"},{"id":"52970","n":"Tunisian Orange Cake","a":"Tunisian","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/y4jpgq1560459207.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rCUxg866Ea4","i":[["Orange","1 large"],["Caster Sugar","300g"],["Olive Oil","75 ml"],["Flour","280g"],["Baking Powder","1 tbs"],["Eggs","4 large"],["Vanilla Extract","2 tsp"]],"s":"Preheat oven to 190 C / Gas 5. Grease a 23cm round springform tin.\r\nCut off the hard bits from the top and bottom of the orange. Slice the orange and remove all seeds. Puree the orange with its peel in a food processor. Add one third of the sugar and the olive oil and continue to mix until well combined.\r\nSieve together flour and baking powder.\r\nBeat the eggs and the remaining sugar with an electric hand mixer for at least five minutes until very fluffy. Fold in half of the flour mixture, then the orange and the vanilla, then fold in the remaining flour. Mix well but not for too long.\r\nPour cake mixture into prepared tin and smooth out. Bake in preheated oven for 20 minutes. Reduce the oven temperature to 160 C / Gas 2 and bake again for 30 minutes Bake until the cake is golden brown and a skewer comes out clean. Cool on a wire cake rack.","z":"将烤箱预热至 190 C/燃气 ​​5. 在 23 厘米圆形弹簧模上涂上油脂。\r\n切掉橙子顶部和底部的硬块。将橙子切片并去除所有种子。将橙子连皮放入食品加工机中打成泥。加入三分之一的糖和橄榄油，继续搅拌直至充分混合。\r\n将面粉和泡打粉一起过筛。\r\n用电动手动搅拌机将鸡蛋和剩余的糖搅拌至少五分钟，直至非常蓬松。拌入一半的面粉混合物，然后拌入橙子和香草，最后拌入剩余的面粉。搅拌均匀但不要搅拌太久。\r\n将蛋糕混合物倒入准备好的罐子中并抹平。在预热的烤箱中烘烤20分钟。将烤箱温度降低至 160 C/Gas 2，再次烘烤 30 分钟，直至蛋糕呈金黄色且穿串时干净。放在金属丝蛋糕架上冷却。"},{"id":"53262","n":"Adana kebab","a":"Turkish","c":"Lamb","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/04axct1763793018.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Wj7sXu9B_ME","i":[["Romano Pepper","2 large"],["Lamb Mince","800g"],["Red Pepper Paste","3  tablespoons"],["Pul Biber","1 tablespoon"],["Sunflower Oil","3  tablespoons"]],"s":"step 1\r\nFinely chop the peppers in a food processor, then tip them in a sieve and press into the sieve so that the peppers release all of their juices. Tip into a bowl along with the mince, red pepper paste, pul biber, 1½ tsp flaky sea salt, and 2 tbsp of the oil. Mix together, kneading well for at least 2-3 mins. If you need to, wet your hands with cold water to prevent the mixture from sticking. The mixture should be sticky when ready. Cover and chill for at least 2 hrs, or up to 12 hrs.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nWhen ready to cook, heat the grill to high or an oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 6. Divide the mixture into 12 equal portions, around 85g each. If you’d like to skewer them, divide into 8 equal portions and roll into balls. Using wet hands, thread the balls onto the end of the skewers, massaging the mixture down the skewers in between the palms of your hands, until evenly distributed. Ensure that the mixture is fully wrapped tightly around the skewers without any exposed metal. Alternatively, lay them on a large baking tray lined with parchment paper if cooking in the oven, or foil if cooking under the grill. Shape into 20cm-long köfte. Wet your fingers with a little cold water and make indents all along the köfte for the traditional shape.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nGently brush each köfte with the remaining 1 tbsp oil and cook under the grill, on the top shelf for 10-12 mins, turning regularly, or cook in the oven for 16-18 mins, until crispy on the outside and juicy in the middle","z":"步骤1\r\n在食品加工机中将辣椒切碎，然后将它们放入筛子中并压入筛子，以便辣椒释放出所有汁液。将肉末、红辣椒酱、pul biber、1½ 茶匙片状海盐和 2 汤匙油倒入碗中。混合在一起，揉捏至少 2-3 分钟。如果需要，请用冷水弄湿双手，以防止混合物粘连。准备好的混合物应该是粘稠的。盖上盖子并冷藏至少 2 小时，或最多 12 小时。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n准备烹饪时，将烤架加热至高温或将烤箱加热至 220C/200C 风扇/燃气 6. 将混合物分成 12 等份，每份约 85 克。如果你想串起来，分成8等份，然后滚成球。用湿手将球串到串的末端，将混合物在手掌之间沿着串按摩，直至均匀分布。确保混合物完全紧紧包裹在串肉串上，没有任何裸露的金属。或者，如果在烤箱中烹饪，则将它们放在一个衬有羊皮纸的大烤盘上，如果在烤架下烹饪，则将它们放在衬有箔纸的大烤盘上。做成20厘米长的köfte。用少许冷水润湿手指，并在肉丸上刻出传统形状的凹痕。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n在每个 köfte 上轻轻刷上剩余的 1 汤匙油，然后在烤架下、最上面的架子上煮 10-12 分钟，定期翻动，或在烤箱中煮 16-18 分钟，直至外部酥脆、中间多汁"},{"id":"53276","n":"Apricot & Turkish delight mess","a":"Turkish","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/p277uc1764109195.jpg","y":"","i":[["Mascarpone","100g"],["Greek Yogurt","50g"],["Icing Sugar","25g"],["Orange Blossom Water","2 tablespoons"],["Meringue Nests","1"],["Apricot","3"],["Turkish Delight","2 pieces"],["Almonds","25g"],["Mint","4"]],"s":"step 1\r\nPlace the mascarpone, yogurt, sugar and orange flower water into a large bowl and whisk until thickened. Fold the remaining ingredients through, then divide the mix between 2 dessert glasses or bowls and decorate with extra mint, if you like.","z":"步骤1\r\n将马斯卡彭奶酪、酸奶、糖和橙花水放入一个大碗中，搅拌直至变稠。将剩余的原料折叠起来，然后将混合物分装在两个甜点杯或碗中，如果您愿意，可以用额外的薄荷装饰。"},{"id":"53278","n":"Aubergine & hummus grills","a":"Turkish","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/zub3s91764110535.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=P5LD03XptB8","i":[["Aubergine","2"],["Vegetable Oil","2 tablespoons"],["Bread","3 sliced thinly"],["Hummus","300g"],["Walnuts","100g"],["Parsley","40g"],["Cherry Tomatoes","200g"],["Lemon","Juice of 1/2"],["Extra Virgin Olive Oil","Splash"]],"s":"step 1\r\nLay the aubergine out in one layer on a large baking sheet. Brush sparingly with vegetable oil, then season generously. Grill for 15 mins, turning twice and brushing with oil until the slices are softened and cooked through. Meanwhile, whizz the bread into crumbs. Add 2 tsp oil and whizz briefly again, to coat.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nSpread a couple of tsps of hummus on top of each slice of aubergine. Tip the breadcrumbs onto a large plate, then press the hummus side of the aubergines into the crumbs to coat. Grill again, crumb-side up, for about 3 mins until golden.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nToss the walnuts, parsley and cherry tomatoes in a bowl, season, then add the lemon juice and olive oil and toss again. Serve the grills with the salad, a dollop more hummus and some pitta bread.","z":"步骤1\r\n将茄子铺成一层，放在一张大烤盘上。少量刷上植物油，然后充分调味。烤 15 分钟，翻转两次，刷上油，直至切片变软并煮熟。同时，将面包搅拌成面包屑。加入 2 茶匙油，再次短暂搅拌，涂上一层油。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n在每片茄子上撒上几茶匙鹰嘴豆泥。将面包屑倒在一个大盘子上，然后将茄子的鹰嘴豆泥一侧压入面包屑中以覆盖。再次烤约 3 分钟，面包屑面朝上，直至呈金黄色。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n将核桃、欧芹和樱桃番茄放入碗中，调味，然后加入柠檬汁和橄榄油，再次搅拌。将沙拉、一块鹰嘴豆泥和一些皮塔面包放在烤架上。"},{"id":"53267","n":"Aubergine couscous salad","a":"Turkish","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/02s6gc1763799560.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/8ws2Ohy__CQ","i":[["Aubergine","1 sliced"],["Olive Oil","3  tablespoons"],["Couscous","140g"],["Vegetable Stock","225g"],["Cherry Tomatoes","200g"],["Mint","Handful"],["Goats Cheese","100g"],["Lemon","Juice of 1/2"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat grill to high. Put the aubergine on a baking sheet, brush with oil and season. Grill for about 15 mins, turning and brushing with more oil halfway, until browned and softened.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nMeanwhile, tip the couscous into a large bowl, pour over the stock, then cover and leave for 10 mins. Mix the tomatoes, mint, goat’s cheese and remaining oil together. Fluff the couscous up with a fork, then stir in the aubergines, tomato mixture and lemon juice.","z":"步骤1\r\n将烤架加热至高温。将茄子放在烤盘上，刷上油并调味。烤约 15 分钟，中途翻转并刷上更多油，直至变成棕色并变软。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n与此同时，将蒸粗麦粉倒入一个大碗中，倒在高汤上，然后盖上盖子静置 10 分钟。将西红柿、薄荷、山羊奶酪和剩余的油混合在一起。用叉子将蒸粗麦粉弄松，然后拌入茄子、番茄混合物和柠檬汁。"},{"id":"53279","n":"Baklava with spiced nuts, ricotta & chocolate","a":"Turkish","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/ytme8t1764111401.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yK_sSFDvsT0","i":[["Sugar","500g"],["Lemon Juice","To taste"],["Walnuts","300g"],["Pecan Nuts","200g"],["Almonds","100g"],["Ground Cinnamon","2 tablespoons"],["Ground Cardomom","1 tablespoon"],["Ricotta","500g"],["Lemon","Zest of 1"],["Orange","Zest of 1"],["Vanilla Bean Paste","1 tablespoon"],["Unsalted Butter","250g"],["Filo Pastry","500g"],["Ground Pistachios","100g"]],"s":"step 1\r\nFirst, make the syrup. Tip the sugar into a large saucepan with 650ml water. Stir over a low heat until the sugar has dissolved, then turn up the heat and bring to the boil. Reduce the heat to a simmer and cook for 15 mins, then squeeze in a few drops of lemon juice and simmer for a further 5 mins. Remove from the heat and leave to cool. Meanwhile, for assembling the baklava later, melt the butter in a small pan over a low heat for 5 mins, skimming and discarding any froth that rises to the surface.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nFor the filling, crush all of the nuts in a pestle and mortar, or blitz in a food processor – you want a mixture of finely ground nuts with a few chunky pieces. Tip into a bowl, stir through the spices and set aside.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nIn a separate bowl, mix the ricotta with the lemon and orange zests and vanilla. Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Brush the bottom of a large baking tray (about 35 x 47cm) with some of the melted butter. Working with one sheet of filo at a time (covering the rest with a damp tea towel to prevent it drying out), lay the sheet out on a board so one of the short ends is facing you. Sprinkle 30g of the nut mixture evenly over the whole sheet, then spoon 1 tbsp of the ricotta mixture across the end closest to you. Fold this end over to enclose the filling, then lay a long, thin skewer next to the folded edge and roll the pastry around it to create a long roll. When it’s fully rolled up, it should be roughly the thickness of a chipolata sausage. While holding one end of the rolling pin or skewer, gently scrunch the filo roll like an accordion and carefully push it off the skewer and onto the prepared tray. Repeat with the rest of the filo and fillings – you should get about 12 rolls. Cut each roll into four to make 48 large baklava, or eight to make 96 mini.\r\n\r\nstep 4\r\nBrush with the remaining melted butter. Bake for 20-25 mins until evenly golden, turning the tray around halfway through. While still hot, immediately pour over 5-6 ladlefuls of the syrup. You should hear the syrup sizzle as it hits the hot baklava. Set aside to cool and absorb.\r\n\r\nstep 5\r\nMelt the dark chocolate in a heatproof bowl set over a pan of simmering water, ensuring the bowl doesn’t touch the water, or in the microwave in short bursts. Drizzle this over the cooled baklava and sprinkle with the ground pistachios.","z":"步骤1\r\n首先，制作糖浆。将糖倒入装有 650 毫升水的大平底锅中。用小火搅拌直至糖溶解，然后调高热量并煮沸。将火调小，煮15分钟，然后挤入几滴柠檬汁，再煮5分钟。从火上移开并冷却。同时，为了稍后组装果仁蜜饼，将黄油在小锅中用小火融化 5 分钟，撇去并丢弃浮到表面的泡沫。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n对于馅料，用研杵和研钵碾碎所有坚果，或者在食品加工机中快速搅拌——你需要磨细的坚果和一些大块的混合物。倒入碗中，搅拌香料并放在一边。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n在另一个碗中，将乳清干酪与柠檬、橙皮和香草混合。将烤箱加热至 180C/160C 风扇/燃气 4. 在大烤盘（约 35 x 47cm）的底部刷上一些融化的黄油。一次使用一张费罗（用湿茶巾盖住其余部分以防止其干燥），将其放在木板上，使短端之一面向您。将 30 克坚果混合物均匀地撒在整张纸上，然后用勺子将 1 汤匙乳清干酪混合物涂抹在离您最近的一端。将这一端折叠起来，包住馅料，然后在折叠边缘旁边放一根细长的串，将糕点绕着它卷起来，形成一个长卷。当它完全卷起来时，它的厚度应该大约是Chipolata香肠的厚度。握住擀面杖或烤肉串的一端，像手风琴一样轻轻地揉搓费罗卷，然后小心地将其从烤肉串上推到准备好的托盘上。对其余的费罗和馅料重复上述步骤——你应该得到大约 12 卷。将每卷切成四份，制成 48 个大果仁蜜饼，或切成八份，制成 96 个迷你果仁蜜饼。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n刷上剩余的融化黄油。烘烤 20-25 分钟直至均匀呈金黄色，中途翻转托盘。趁热，立即倒入 5-6 勺糖浆。当糖浆碰到热果仁蜜饼时，您应该会听到嘶嘶声。放置一边冷却并吸收。\r\n\r\n步骤5\r\n将黑巧克力放入耐热碗中，置于一锅沸水中融化，确保碗不接触水，或放入微波炉中短时间融化。将其淋在冷却的果仁蜜饼上，并撒上碎开心果。"},{"id":"53256","n":"Cacik","a":"Turkish","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/16zbeu1763789342.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eIDgcvpAvf8","i":[["Natural Yoghurt","500g"],["Lemon Juice","2 tsp"],["Extra Virgin Olive Oil","1 tablespoon"],["Dried Mint","1 tablespoon"],["Cucumber","1"],["Garlic","2 cloves minced"]],"s":"step 1\r\nPut a sieve over a large bowl, line it with a thick sheet of non-dyed kitchen paper or a clean muslin cloth, and spoon in the yogurt. Cover with another sheet of kitchen paper and leave to strain in the fridge for a minimum of 12 hrs.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nAdd the lemon juice, most of the olive oil and the dried mint to a bowl and stir well for the dried mint to soften and soak up the juices. Mix in the strained yogurt, then pour away the strained yogurt liquid and leave that bowl to one side.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nHalve the cucumber(s) lengthways and remove the seeds by running a teaspoon from the top to the bottom of the flesh, halve the cucumbers widthways to make them shorter and easier to handle, then coarsely grate each one into the bowl the yogurt was straining over. Using clean hands (or a clean muslin cloth), squeeze as much of the liquid out of the cucumber as possible.\r\n\r\nstep 4\r\nAdd the strained, grated cucumber, garlic and ¾ tsp flaky salt to the rest of the ingredients and mix well. Garnish with a drizzle of extra virgin olive oil and a sprinkling of dried mint.","z":"步骤1\r\n在一个大碗上放一个筛子，在上面铺上厚厚的未染色的厨房用纸或干净的平纹细布，然后用勺子倒入酸奶。再盖上一张厨房用纸，放入冰箱过滤至少 12 小时。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将柠檬汁、大部分橄榄油和干薄荷放入碗中，搅拌均匀，使干薄荷软化并吸收果汁。加入滤过的酸奶，然后倒掉滤过的酸奶液体，并将碗放在一侧。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n将黄瓜纵向切成两半，用一茶匙从果肉的顶部到底部刮去种子，将黄瓜横向切成两半，使它们更短且更容易处理，然后将每个黄瓜粗磨碎，放入过滤酸奶的碗中。用干净的手（或干净的平纹细布），尽可能多地从黄瓜中挤出液体。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n将滤过的磨碎的黄瓜、大蒜和 3/4 茶匙片状盐加入其余成分中，搅拌均匀。用细雨特级初榨橄榄油和干薄荷装饰。"},{"id":"53261","n":"Chicken wings with cumin, lemon & garlic","a":"Turkish","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/4hzyvq1763792564.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hmJPOVzMvK4","i":[["Chicken Wings","12"],["Garlic","2 cloves minced"],["Lemon","Zest and juice of 1"],["Cumin Seeds","1 tsp"],["Olive Oil","2 tablespoons"],["Honey","1 tablespoon"]],"s":"step 1\r\nUsing a pair of sharp kitchen scissors, cut each wing at the knuckle into two pieces. Mix the garlic, lemon zest and juice, cumin and oil with plenty of seasoning, then tip into a dish with the chicken wings and toss to coat. Cover and put in the fridge to marinate for at least 1 hr, or overnight if you have time.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nHeat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6, or heat an outdoor barbecue. Bake the chicken wings on an oven tray for 45-50 mins until crisp, or barbecue for 20 mins, drizzling over the honey for the final 10 mins of each method. Serve on a platter with plenty of paper napkins. Fill small bowls with olives, pistachios or almonds, dates and pickled chillies and flatbreads to serve alongside, along with the dishes below.","z":"步骤1\r\n使用一把锋利的厨房剪刀，将指关节处的每个翅膀切成两段。将大蒜、柠檬皮碎和果汁、小茴香和油与大量调味料混合，然后倒入装有鸡翅的盘子中，搅拌均匀。盖上盖子，放入冰箱腌制至少1小时，如果有时间的话也可以腌制过夜。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将烤箱加热至 200C/180C 风扇/燃气 6，或加热户外烧烤。将鸡翅放在烤箱托盘上烘烤 45-50 分钟直至变脆，或烧烤 20 分钟，在每种方法的最后 10 分钟淋上蜂蜜。放在盛有大量餐巾纸的盘子上。在小碗里装满橄榄、开心果或杏仁、枣子、腌辣椒和小面包，与下面的菜肴一起食用。"},{"id":"53265","n":"Chilli ginger lamb chops","a":"Turkish","c":"Lamb","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/8xuvhj1763794991.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MNrNHToyvtI","i":[["Garlic","4 Cloves Crushed"],["Ginger","1 tblsp"],["Lemon Juice","1 tblsp"],["Olive Oil","1 tblsp"],["Chili Powder","1/2 tsp"],["Cumin","1 tsp"],["Lamb Loin Chops","8"]],"s":"step 1\r\nPut the garlic in a bowl with the ginger, lemon juice, oil, spices and seasoning. Blitz with a hand blender until smooth, then use to coat the lamb chops on both sides. Leave to marinate in the fridge for a couple of hours or overnight.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nHeat a barbecue until hot. Barbecue the chops over the coals for 3 mins on each side until cooked but still pink and juicy in the centre.","z":"步骤1\r\n将大蒜与生姜、柠檬汁、油、香料和调味料一起放入碗中。用手动搅拌机搅拌至光滑，然后用它在羊排两面涂上一层。在冰箱中腌制几个小时或过夜。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将烤肉加热至热。将排骨在炭火上每面烧烤 3 分钟，直至煮熟，但中心仍呈粉红色且多汁。"},{"id":"52977","n":"Corba","a":"Turkish","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/58oia61564916529.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VVnZd8A84z4","i":[["Lentils","1 cup"],["Onion","1 large"],["Carrots","1 large"],["Tomato Puree","1 tbs"],["Cumin","2 tsp"],["Paprika","1 tsp"],["Mint","1/2 tsp"],["Thyme","1/2 tsp"],["Black Pepper","1/4 tsp"],["Red Pepper Flakes","1/4 tsp"],["Vegetable Stock","4 cups"],["Water","1 cup"],["Sea Salt","Pinch"]],"s":"Pick through your lentils for any foreign debris, rinse them 2 or 3 times, drain, and set aside.  Fair warning, this will probably turn your lentils into a solid block that you’ll have to break up later\r\nIn a large pot over medium-high heat, sauté the olive oil and the onion with a pinch of salt for about 3 minutes, then add the carrots and cook for another 3 minutes.\r\nAdd the tomato paste and stir it around for around 1 minute. Now add the cumin, paprika, mint, thyme, black pepper, and red pepper as quickly as you can and stir for 10 seconds to bloom the spices. Congratulate yourself on how amazing your house now smells.\r\nImmediately add the lentils, water, broth, and salt. Bring the soup to a (gentle) boil.\r\nAfter it has come to a boil, reduce heat to medium-low, cover the pot halfway, and cook for 15-20 minutes or until the lentils have fallen apart and the carrots are completely cooked.\r\nAfter the soup has cooked and the lentils are tender, blend the soup either in a blender or simply use a hand blender to reach the consistency you desire. Taste for seasoning and add more salt if necessary.\r\nServe with crushed-up crackers, torn up bread, or something else to add some extra thickness.  You could also use a traditional thickener (like cornstarch or flour), but I prefer to add crackers for some texture and saltiness.  Makes great leftovers, stays good in the fridge for about a week.","z":"剔除小扁豆中的任何异物，冲洗 2 或 3 次，沥干并放在一边。  公平警告，这可能会让你的扁豆变成一个固体块，你稍后必须将其打碎\r\n在一个大锅中，用中高火将橄榄油和洋葱加少许盐炒约 3 分钟，然后加入胡萝卜，再煮 3 分钟。\r\n加入番茄酱，搅拌约 1 分钟。现在尽快加入小茴香、辣椒粉、薄荷、百里香、黑胡椒和红辣椒，搅拌 10 秒钟，让香料充分绽放。祝贺你自己，你的房子现在闻起来多么美妙。\r\n立即加入扁豆、水、肉汤和盐。将汤（温和）煮沸。\r\n煮沸后，将火调至中低，盖上锅盖，煮15-20分钟，或直至扁豆散开、胡萝卜完全煮熟。\r\n汤煮熟且扁豆变软后，将汤放入搅拌机中搅拌，或仅使用手动搅拌机达到您想要的稠度。品尝调味料，必要时添加更多盐。\r\n与压碎的饼干、撕碎的面包或其他东西一起食用，以增加额外的厚度。  您也可以使用传统的增稠剂（如玉米淀粉或面粉），但我更喜欢添加饼干以获得一些质地和咸味。  可以做很棒的剩菜，在冰箱里可以保存一周左右。"},{"id":"53254","n":"Ezme","a":"Turkish","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/pb6mj11763788331.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Z1mX-C2fAuc","i":[["Tomato","3 Large"],["Romano Pepper","1 medium"],["Green Chilli","1 medium"],["Onion","1 small"],["Garlic","2 cloves minced"],["Parsley","25g"],["Red Pepper Paste","2 tablespoons"],["Tomato Puree","1 tablespoon"],["Pomegranate Molasses","2 tablespoons"],["Pul Biber","1 tablespoon"],["Sumac","2 tsp"],["Dried Mint","1 tablespoon"],["Extra Virgin Olive Oil","60 ml"]],"s":"step 1\r\nPut the tomatoes and all of the peppers in a food processor and blitz until finely chopped. Tip out into a sieve, set over a bowl and leave to strain. Add the onions, garlic and parsley to the food processor and blitz until finely chopped, then set aside.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nAdd red pepper paste, tomato purée, pomegranate molasses, pul biber, sumac, dried mint and most of the extra virgin olive oil to a serving bowl and whisk well so everything comes together as a sauce. Tip in the blitzed onion mixture and the strained pepper mixture along with 1 tsp flaky sea salt . Stir well, then drizzle with the remaining extra virgin olive oil to serve.","z":"步骤1\r\n将西红柿和所有辣椒放入食品加工机中，快速搅拌直至切碎。倒入筛子中，放在碗上，然后过滤。将洋葱、大蒜和欧芹放入食品加工机中，快速搅拌直至切碎，然后放在一边。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将红辣椒酱、番茄泥、石榴糖蜜、红辣椒、漆树、干薄荷和大部分特级初榨橄榄油放入碗中，搅拌均匀，使所有东西混合在一起成为酱汁。加入闪电洋葱混合物和滤过的胡椒混合物以及 1 茶匙片状海盐。搅拌均匀，然后淋上剩余的特级初榨橄榄油即可食用。"},{"id":"53266","n":"Falafel","a":"Turkish","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/u5e9qq1763795441.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NZcWedPKysk","i":[["Sunflower Oil","2 tablespoons"],["Onion","1 chopped"],["Garlic","1 clove peeled crushed"],["Chickpeas","400g"],["Ground Cumin","1 tsp"],["Ground Coriander","1 tsp"],["Parsley","Handful"],["Egg","1 beaten"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat 1 tbsp oil in a large pan, then fry the onion and garlic over a low heat for 5 mins until softened. Tip into a large mixing bowl with the chickpeas and spices, then mash together with a fork or potato masher until the chickpeas are totally broken down. Stir in the parsley or dried herbs, with seasoning to taste. Add the egg, then squish the mixture together with your hands.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nMould the mix into 6 balls, then flatten into patties. Heat the remaining oil in the pan, then fry the falafels on a medium heat for 3 mins on each side, until golden brown and firm. Serve hot or cold with couscous, pitta bread or salad.","z":"步骤1\r\n在大锅中加热 1 汤匙油，然后用小火将洋葱和大蒜炒 5 分钟直至变软。将鹰嘴豆和香料倒入一个大碗中，然后用叉子或土豆捣碎器捣碎，直到鹰嘴豆完全分解。拌入欧芹或干香草，并根据口味调味。加入鸡蛋，然后用手将混合物压碎。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将混合物模制成 6 个球，然后压扁成肉饼。将锅中剩余的油加热，然后用中火将沙拉三明治每面煎 3 分钟，直至呈金黄色并变硬。热食或冷食可搭配蒸粗麦粉、皮塔面包或沙拉。"},{"id":"53274","n":"Griddled aubergines with sesame dressing","a":"Turkish","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/yoj48r1763817100.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=332VIeW67VM","i":[["Aubergine","2 large"],["Olive Oil","2 tablespoons"],["Greek Yogurt","250g"],["Tahini Paste","3  tablespoons"],["Garlic","1 clove peeled crushed"],["Lemon","Juice of 1"],["Coriander","Handful"],["Parsley","Handful"],["Mint","Handful"]],"s":"step 1\r\nBrush each aubergine slice with some oil, then season. Heat a griddle pan or barbecue. When hot, griddle the aubergine slices for 2-3 mins on each side until golden brown and tender.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nMix the yogurt with the tahini, garlic, lemon juice and herbs, then season. Top the aubergines with the dressing and scatter over extra herb leaves.","z":"步骤1\r\n在每片茄子片上刷上一些油，然后调味。加热煎锅或烧烤架。热时，将茄子片每面煎 2-3 分钟，直至呈金黄色并变软。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将酸奶与芝麻酱、大蒜、柠檬汁和香草混合，然后调味。在茄子上撒上调料，然后撒在额外的香草叶上。"},{"id":"53272","n":"Griddled flatbreads","a":"Turkish","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/8825lo1763815264.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=s_ilia2LZ4U","i":[["Strong Wholemeal Flour","250g"],["Strong white bread flour","250g"],["Yeast","15g"],["Sugar","1 tsp"],["Olive Oil","2 tablespoons"]],"s":"step 1\r\nTip the flours into a food processor. Add the yeast, sugar and 1tsp salt, then mix well. Pour in 350ml warm water and the oil, then process to a soft dough. Mix for 1 min, then leave until doubled in size, about 1 hour.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nPulse the dough a couple of times just to knock out the air, then tip onto a floured surface. Cut the dough in half and roll out one half to a rectangle about 20 x 40cm. Trim the edges using a large sharp knife, then cut into eight 10cm squares. Line a large tray or two baking sheets with non-stick paper and arrange the bread rectangles over the tray in one layer. Repeat with the other half of the dough. Leave in a warm place for about 30 mins until the dough is just starting to rise.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nPlace bread directly onto the BBQ racks and cook for a couple of mins until they puff up, then flip over and cook on the other side. Tip into a basket and serve with the dips.","z":"步骤1\r\n将面粉倒入食品加工机中。加入酵母、糖和1茶匙盐，然后搅拌均匀。倒入350毫升温水和油，揉成柔软的面团。混合 1 分钟，然后静置约 1 小时，直至体积翻倍。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将面团搅拌几次，排出空气，然后倒在撒了面粉的表面上。将面团切成两半，并将其中一半擀成约 20 x 40 厘米的矩形。用大锋利的刀修剪边缘，然后切成八个 10 厘米的正方形。在一个大托盘或两张烤盘上铺上不粘纸，然后将长方形面包放在托盘上一层。对另一半面团重复上述步骤。放在温暖的地方约 30 分钟，直到面团开始发酵。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n将面包直接放在烧烤架上，煮几分钟，直到它们膨胀，然后翻转并在另一面煮。倒入篮子中并与蘸酱一起食用。"},{"id":"53255","n":"Grilled aubergines with spicy chickpeas & walnut sauce","a":"Turkish","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/ctw3ba1763788978.jpg","y":"","i":[["Olive Oil","4 tablespoons"],["Onion","1 chopped"],["Red Chilli","1 chopped"],["Ginger","2cm piece"],["Ground Cumin","1/2 teaspoon"],["Chickpeas","400g"],["Tomato","200g"],["Lemon","Juice of 1/2"],["Aubergine","2"],["Greek Yogurt","200g"],["Garlic Clove","1"],["Walnuts","25g"],["Coriander","Handful"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat 2 tbsp oil in a pan, add the onion and fry until soft and lightly browned, about 10 mins. Add the chilli, ginger and spices and mix well. Stir in the chickpeas, tomatoes and 5 tbsp water, bring to the boil, then simmer for 10 mins. Add a little salt and pepper and the lemon juice.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nArrange the aubergines over a grill pan. Brush lightly with oil, sprinkle with salt and pepper, then grill until golden. Flip them over, brush again with oil, season and grill again until tender and golden.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nMix the yogurt with the garlic, most of the walnuts and coriander and a little salt and pepper. Arrange the aubergine slices over a warm platter and spoon over the chickpea mix. Drizzle with the walnut sauce and scatter with the remaining walnuts and coriander.","z":"步骤1\r\n在锅中加热 2 汤匙油，加入洋葱，炒至变软并呈浅棕色，约 10 分钟。加入辣椒、生姜和香料，搅拌均匀。加入鹰嘴豆、西红柿和5汤匙水，煮沸，然后煮10分钟。加入少许盐、胡椒粉和柠檬汁。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将茄子放在烤盘上。轻轻刷上油，撒上盐和胡椒，然后烤至金黄色。将它们翻过来，再次刷上油，调味并再次烧烤，直至变软并呈金黄色。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n将酸奶与大蒜、大部分核桃、香菜以及少许盐和胡椒粉混合。将茄子片放在温暖的盘子上，然后用勺子浇在鹰嘴豆混合物上。淋上核桃酱，撒上剩余的核桃和香菜。"},{"id":"53258","n":"Hot cumin lamb wrap with crunchy slaw & spicy mayo","a":"Turkish","c":"Lamb","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/jyylmo1763790808.jpg","y":"","i":[["Lamb Leg","4 small"],["Olive Oil","2 tsp"],["Ground Cumin","1 tsp"],["Sugar","1 tablespoon"],["White Wine Vinegar","3  tablespoons"],["Carrots","2"],["Spring Onions","2 sliced"],["White Cabbage","400g"],["Sweet Peppadew Peppers","5"],["Mayonnaise","3  tablespoons"],["Pita Bread","4 large"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat a griddle pan. Rub the lamb steaks with the oil, cumin and some seasoning. Griddle for about 3-4 mins on each side or until cooked to your liking. Place to one side on a plate to rest.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nIn a large bowl, stir the sugar into the vinegar until dissolved. Add the carrots, spring onions, cabbage and some seasoning, and toss together.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nBlitz the whole peppers and the mayo in a food processor. Add a heap of the salad to each flatbread. Slice the lamb, trimming off any excess fat and lay on top of the salad, drizzling with the resting juices. Spoon over the mayo and scatter with a few of the sliced peppers. Roll up and eat. If using pitta, split and stuff. Serve any extra salad on the side.","z":"步骤1\r\n加热煎锅。用油、小茴香和一些调味料擦羊排。每面煎约 3-4 分钟或直至熟至您喜欢的程度。将一侧放在盘子上休息。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n在一个大碗中，将糖放入醋中搅拌直至溶解。加入胡萝卜、葱、卷心菜和一些调味料，搅拌均匀。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n将整个辣椒和蛋黄酱放入食品加工机中快速搅拌。在每个小面包上加入一堆沙拉。将羊肉切片，去掉多余的脂肪，放在沙拉上，淋上剩下的汁液。用勺子舀在蛋黄酱上，撒上一些切好的辣椒。卷起来就可以吃了。如果使用皮塔饼，则分开等等。将多余的沙拉放在一边。"},{"id":"53269","n":"Hummus","a":"Turkish","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/gpon5u1763801180.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EsZFJEjANiA","i":[["Chickpeas","400g"],["Tahini Paste","1 tablespoon"],["Garlic Clove","1 large"],["Greek Yogurt","3  tablespoons"],["Lemon","Juice of half"]],"s":"step 1\r\nDrain the chickpeas into a sieve set over a bowl or jug to catch the liquid. Tip the chickpeas, tahini, garlic and yogurt into a food processor or blender and whizz to smooth.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nWhizz in a tbsp of the chickpea liquid at a time until you have a nice consistency, then scrape into a bowl.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nStir in a squeeze of lemon juice and season to taste.","z":"步骤1\r\n将鹰嘴豆沥干，放入碗或壶上方的筛子中，以收集液体。将鹰嘴豆、芝麻酱、大蒜和酸奶放入食品加工机或搅拌机中，搅拌至光滑。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n一次加入一汤匙鹰嘴豆液，搅拌直至达到良好的稠度，然后刮入碗中。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n挤入柠檬汁，搅拌并调味。"},{"id":"53253","n":"Imam bayildi with BBQ lamb & tzatziki","a":"Turkish","c":"Lamb","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/ampz9v1763787134.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k8ZMZtdu6Ac","i":[["Aubergine","3"],["Olive Oil","2 tablespoons"],["Onion","1 chopped"],["Garlic","2 cloves chopped"],["Cinnamon","1 tsp"],["Tomato","8"],["Parsley","Bunch"],["Lamb Loin Chops","12"],["Paprika","Pinch"],["Lemon","1"],["Greek Yogurt","150g"],["Cucumber","1/2"],["Mint","2 tbs chopped"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. Halve the aubergines lengthways and score the flesh side deeply, brush with a good layer of olive oil and put on a baking sheet. Roast for 20 mins or until the flesh is soft enough to scoop out.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nFry the onion in a little oil until soft, add the garlic and cinnamon and fry for 1 min. Once the aubergines are cool enough to handle, scoop out the centres. Roughly chop the flesh and add it to the onions. Halve the tomatoes, scoop the seeds and juice into a sieve set over a bowl, then chop the flesh. Add the chopped tomatoes to the pan and cook everything for 10 mins until nice and soft. Add a little more oil if you need to. Stir in the parsley, leaving a little for scattering at the end.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nLay the aubergine halves in a baking dish and divide the tomato mixture between them. Pour over the juice from the tomatoes, drizzle with more olive oil and bake for 30 mins until the aubergines have collapsed.\r\n\r\nstep 4\r\nMeanwhile, mix the tzatziki ingredients together and put in a small serving bowl.\r\n\r\nstep 5\r\nSeason the lamb with salt, black pepper and a pinch of paprika. Griddle, grill or barbecue for 3 mins on each side or until the fat is nicely browned, then put in a serving dish and squeeze over the lemon halves. Scatter the aubergines with parsley, then serve with the lamb and tzatziki.","z":"步骤1\r\n将烤箱加热至 190C/170C 风扇/燃气 5. 将茄子纵向切成两半，在果肉一侧深深划痕，刷上一层橄榄油，然后放在烤盘上。烤 20 分钟或直到果肉变软，可以舀出。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n用少许油将洋葱炒至变软，加入大蒜和肉桂，炒 1 分钟。一旦茄子冷却到可以处理的程度，就挖出中心。大致切碎肉并将其添加到洋葱中。将西红柿切半，将种子和汁液舀入碗上的筛子中，然后切碎果肉。将切碎的西红柿放入锅中，煮 10 分钟，直至变软。如果需要的话，再加一点油。加入欧芹搅拌，最后留一点散开。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n将茄子两半放入烤盘中，将番茄混合物分在两半之间。倒在西红柿汁上，淋上更多橄榄油，烘烤 30 分钟，直至茄子塌陷。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n与此同时，将酸奶黄瓜酱的原料混合在一起，放入一个小碗中。\r\n\r\n步骤5\r\n用盐、黑胡椒和少许辣椒粉给羊肉调味。煎锅、烧烤或烤肉每面 3 分钟，或直至脂肪变成漂亮的棕色，然后放入盘中，挤在柠檬片上。在茄子上撒上欧芹，然后与羊肉和酸奶黄瓜一起食用。"},{"id":"52978","n":"Kumpir","a":"Turkish","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/mlchx21564916997.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IEDEtZ4UVtI","i":[["Potatoes","2 large"],["Butter","2 tbs"],["Cheese","150g"],["Onion","1 large"],["Red Pepper","1 large"],["Red Chilli Flakes","Pinch"]],"s":"If you order kumpir in Turkey, the standard filling is first, lots of butter mashed into the potato, followed by cheese. There’s then a row of other toppings that you can just point at to your heart’s content – sweetcorn, olives, salami, coleslaw, Russian salad, allsorts – and you walk away with an over-stuffed potato because you got ever-excited by the choices on offer.\r\n\r\nGrate (roughly – you can use as much as you like) 150g of cheese.\r\nFinely chop one onion and one sweet red pepper.\r\nPut these ingredients into a large bowl with a good sprinkling of salt and pepper, chilli flakes (optional).","z":"如果你在土耳其点 kumpir，标准的馅料是首先将大量黄油捣碎到土豆中，然后是奶酪。然后还有一排其他配料，你可以随心所欲地点着——甜玉米、橄榄、萨拉米香肠、凉拌卷心菜、俄罗斯沙拉、各种什锦菜——然后你会带着一个塞满了的土豆离开，因为你对所提供的选择感到非常兴奋。\r\n\r\n将 150 克奶酪磨碎（粗略地——你可以随意使用）。\r\n将一个洋葱和一个甜红辣椒切碎。\r\n将这些原料放入一个大碗中，撒上盐、胡椒粉、辣椒片（可选）。"},{"id":"53277","n":"Lamb & apricot meatballs","a":"Turkish","c":"Lamb","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/72fgzj1764109947.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=o0UbzRZw-GQ","i":[["Olive Oil","2 tablespoons"],["Red Onions","2 chopped"],["Garlic","4 Cloves Crushed"],["Ground Cumin","2 tsp"],["Ground Coriander","2 tsp"],["Tinned Tomatos","400g"],["Sugar","1/2 teaspoon"],["Mint","10g"],["Lamb Mince","500g"],["Dried Apricots","8"],["Breadcrumbs","50g"],["Pita Bread","To serve"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat 2 tsp oil in a pan and soften the onions for 5 mins. Add the garlic and spices and cook for a few mins more. Spoon half the onion mixture into a bowl and set aside to cool. Add the tomatoes, sugar and seasoning to the remaining onions in the pan and simmer for about 10 mins until reduced.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nMeanwhile, add the mint, lamb, apricots and breadcrumbs to the cooled onions, season and mix well with your hands. Shape into little meatballs.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nHeat the rest of the oil in a non-stick pan and fry the meatballs until golden (in batches if you need to). Stir in the sauce with a splash of water and gently cook everything for a few mins until the meatballs are cooked through. Serve with pitta bread and salad.","z":"步骤1\r\n在锅中加热 2 茶匙油，将洋葱软化 5 分钟。加入大蒜和香料，再煮几分钟。将一半洋葱混合物倒入碗中，放在一边冷却。将西红柿、糖和调味料加入锅中剩余的洋葱中，煮约 10 分钟直至收干。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n与此同时，将薄荷、羊肉、杏子和面包屑加入冷却的洋葱中，调味并用手搅拌均匀。捏成小肉丸。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n在不粘锅中加热剩余的油，将肉丸煎至金黄色（如果需要，可以分批煎）。加入酱汁，加水搅拌，轻轻煮几分钟，直到肉丸煮熟。与皮塔饼面包和沙拉一起食用。"},{"id":"53273","n":"Roast aubergine with goat's cheese & toasted flatbread","a":"Turkish","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/iydbwy1763816111.jpg","y":"","i":[["Aubergine","2 sliced"],["Extra Virgin Olive Oil","3  tablespoons"],["Cherry Tomatoes","12"],["Pita Bread","1"],["Balsamic Vinegar","3  tablespoons"],["Mint","Handful"],["Shallots","1 chopped"],["Shallots","1 sliced"],["Red Chilli","1 chopped"],["Goats Cheese","50g"],["Rocket","Handful"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Brush the aubergine slices with 1 tbsp of the oil, then season. Arrange on a baking tray or sheet and roast for 20 mins until browned, popping the tomatoes on the tray for the final 5 mins. Tear the flatbread into pieces and place on a separate baking sheet. Brown in the oven for 8 mins, or until crisp, then remove.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nFor the dressing, in a small bowl, mix the vinegar, mint, chopped shallots, chilli, remaining oil and some salt and pepper.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nScatter the aubergine slices, tomatoes, sliced shallot and crisp flatbread into a serving bowl. Pour over the dressing, sprinkle with the goat’s cheese and scatter over a little rocket.","z":"步骤1\r\n将烤箱加热至 200C/180C 风扇/燃气 6. 在茄子片上刷上 1 汤匙油，然后调味。放在烤盘或烤盘上，烤 20 分钟直至变成棕色，最后 5 分钟将番茄放在烤盘上。将大饼撕成碎片，放在单独的烤盘上。在烤箱中烤 8 分钟，或直至变脆，然后取出。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n对于调料，在一个小碗中混合醋、薄荷、切碎的青葱、辣椒、剩余的油以及一些盐和胡椒。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n将茄子片、西红柿、葱片和脆饼撒入碗中。倒在调料上，撒上山羊奶酪，撒上一点芝麻菜。"},{"id":"53268","n":"Roasted chicken with creamy walnut sauce","a":"Turkish","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/ro8mzj1763800655.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=e8Bn3V3kmpM","i":[["Chicken Thighs","8"],["Cumin","1 tsp"],["Paprika","1/2 tsp"],["Olive Oil","2 tablespoons"],["Pita Bread","6"],["Chicken Stock","150ml"],["Walnuts","175g"],["Onion","1 chopped"],["Garlic","2 cloves chopped"],["Single Cream","50 ml"],["Lemon","Juice of 1"],["Coriander","Handful"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. In a roasting tin, toss together the chicken, cumin, paprika, 1 tbsp olive oil and seasoning. Cook for 40 mins until the chicken is crisp and cooked through.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nMeanwhile, tear up 1 pitta bread and place in a small bowl. Pour over a couple of tbsp chicken stock and leave to soak. Dry-fry the walnuts in a frying pan for about 3 mins until golden and toasted. Set aside. Heat the remaining oil in the pan and cook the onion and garlic until softened. Place the softened pitta bread, onion mixture and most of the nuts into a blender. Pour over the rest of the chicken stock and whizz together until a rough paste forms. Return the mixture to the pan. Add the cream and lemon juice, season and keep warm.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nWhen the chicken is cooked, arrange on a platter. Stir the coriander through the sauce and spoon into a bowl. Roughly chop the remaining walnuts and scatter over the chicken. Toast the pittas, cut into wedges and serve alongside","z":"步骤1\r\n将烤箱加热至 200C/180C 风扇/燃气 6. 在烤盘中，将鸡肉、小茴香、辣椒粉、1 汤匙橄榄油和调味料搅拌在一起。煮 40 分钟，直到鸡肉变脆并煮熟。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n同时，撕下 1 个皮塔面包，放入小碗中。倒入几汤匙鸡汤，然后浸泡。将核桃放入煎锅中干煎约 3 分钟，直至呈金黄色并烤熟。放在一边。将锅中剩余的油加热，将洋葱和大蒜煮至变软。将软化的皮塔面包、洋葱混合物和大部分坚果放入搅拌机中。倒在剩下的鸡汤上，一起搅拌，直到形成粗糊状。将混合物放回锅中。加入奶油和柠檬汁，调味并保温。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n鸡肉煮熟后，盛入盘中。将香菜与酱汁搅拌，然后用勺子放入碗中。将剩余的核桃大致切碎，撒在鸡肉上。烤皮塔饼，切成楔形并与一起食用"},{"id":"53260","n":"Slow-roast lamb with cinnamon, fennel & citrus","a":"Turkish","c":"Lamb","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/gr4lo51763791826.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4_mbvxabtJc","i":[["Lamb Leg","1"],["Lemon","Zest and juice of 1"],["Olive Oil","4 tablespoons"],["Clear Honey","2 tablespoons"],["Cinnamon","1 tablespoon"],["Fennel Seeds","1 tablespoon"],["Ground Cumin","1 tablespoon"],["Garlic","3 Cloves Crushed"]],"s":"step 1\r\nPut the lamb into a large food bag with all the juice and marinate overnight.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nThe next day, take the lamb out of the fridge 1 hr before you want to cook it. Heat oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Take the lamb out of the marinade (reserve remaining marinade) and pat dry. Rub with half the oil and roast for 15-20 mins until browned. Remove lamb and reduce oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nMix the zests, remaining oil, honey, spices and garlic with plenty of seasoning. Lay a large sheet of baking parchment on a large sheet of foil. Sit the lamb leg on top, rub all over with the paste and pull up the sides of the foil. Drizzle marinade into base, and scrunch foil to seal.\r\n\r\nstep 4\r\nRoast for 4 hrs, until very tender. Rest, still wrapped, for 30 mins. Unwrap and serve with juices.","z":"步骤1\r\n将羊肉与所有汁液一起放入一个大食品袋中，腌制过夜。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n第二天，在烹饪之前 1 小时将羊肉从冰箱中取出。将烤箱加热至 220C/200C 风扇/燃气 7. 将羊肉从腌料中取出（保留剩余的腌料）并拍干。用一半的油擦，烤15-20分钟直至变成棕色。取出羊肉，将烤箱温度降至 160C/140C 风扇/燃气 3.\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n将果皮、剩余的油、蜂蜜、香料和大蒜与大量调味料混合。将一大张烘焙羊皮纸放在一大张箔纸上。将羊腿放在上面，用糊状物擦拭全身，然后拉起箔纸的两侧。将腌料淋入底座中，然后揉搓箔纸以密封。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n烤4小时，直到非常软。仍然包裹着，休息 30 分钟。打开包装并与果汁一起食用。"},{"id":"53259","n":"Smoked aubergine purée","a":"Turkish","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/8c8m4q1763791156.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JOXBWo37wWU","i":[["Aubergine","2 medium"],["Lemon","Juice of 1"],["Garlic","3 Cloves Crushed"],["Yogurt","150ml"],["Dill","Bunch"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat grill to very hot. Slice the aubergines in half lengthways, then grill for 25 mins, turning occasionally, until soft – the skin will remain firm, but the flesh will soften. Lift the aubergines off the grill and leave until cool enough to handle.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nUsing a sharp knife, score the grilled flesh and scoop out the flesh with a spoon. Tip into a bowl and mash with a fork until you get a thick pulp. Beat in the lemon juice and garlic. Add the yogurt and dill, and season. Serve while still warm.","z":"步骤1\r\n将烤架加热至非常热。将茄子纵向切成两半，然后烤 25 分钟，偶尔翻动，直至变软 - 茄子皮会保持紧实，但果肉会变软。将茄子从烤架上提起，直到冷却到可以处理为止。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n用一把锋利的刀在烤肉上划出一条线，然后用勺子把肉挖出来。倒入碗中，用叉子捣碎，直到得到浓稠的果肉。加入柠檬汁和大蒜。加入酸奶和莳萝，调味。趁热食用。"},{"id":"53264","n":"Smoky chicken skewers","a":"Turkish","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/3um6il1763794322.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vNDTGF4ppu8","i":[["Chicken Thighs","6"],["Olive Oil","2 tablespoons"],["Fennel Seeds","1 tsp"],["Ground Cumin","1 tsp"],["sweet smoked paprika","1 tsp"],["Garlic","1 clove peeled crushed"],["Red Wine Vinegar","1 tsp"],["Smoky Aïoli","To serve"]],"s":"step 1\r\nYou need 15 skewers: if wooden, soak in water for 10 mins. Cut chicken into 3cm pieces and place in a bowl. Add 1 tbsp olive oil, the spices, garlic and vinegar, toss well and season. You can do this up to a day before and refrigerate.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nThread 2-3 pieces on each skewer. Pour remaining oil in a frying pan or rub onto a griddle pan. Get the pan hot and sear the chicken for 3-4 mins on each side – you may have to do this in batches, keeping the cooked skewers warm in a low oven. Serve with smoky aïoli if you like.","z":"步骤1\r\n您需要 15 个串：如果是木串，则在水中浸泡 10 分钟。将鸡肉切成3厘米见方的块，放入碗中。加入 1 汤匙橄榄油、香料、大蒜和醋，搅拌均匀并调味。您最多可以提前一天进行此操作并冷藏。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n每个串上穿 2-3 根线。将剩余的油倒入煎锅中或擦到平底锅上。将平底锅烧热，将鸡肉每面煎 3-4 分钟——你可能需要分批煎，并在低烤箱中保持煮熟的串的温度。如果您愿意，可以搭配烟熏蒜泥蛋黄酱一起食用。"},{"id":"53275","n":"Sweet potato salad","a":"Turkish","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/z458v91763817681.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RkiKSO0IuVQ","i":[["Sweet Potatoes","1200g"],["Olive Oil","1 tablespoon"],["Shallots","2"],["Spring Onions","4 sliced"],["Chives","Bunch"],["Sherry vinegar","5 tablespoons"],["Extra Virgin Olive Oil","2 tablespoons"],["Honey","2 tablespoons"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Toss the sweet potato chunks with the olive oil and some seasoning, and spread on a baking parchment-lined baking sheet. Roast for 30 - 35 mins until tender and golden. Cool at room temperature.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nWhen just about cool whisk together all the dressing ingredients with a little more seasoning and gently toss through the potato chunks – use your hands to avoid breaking them up.","z":"步骤1\r\n将烤箱加热至 200C/180C 风扇/燃气 6. 将红薯块与橄榄油和一些调味料拌匀，然后铺在衬有羊皮纸的烤盘上。烤 30 - 35 分钟直至变软并呈金黄色。在室温下冷却。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n当快凉的时候，将所有调料与更多的调味料搅拌在一起，然后轻轻地搅拌土豆块——用手避免将它们弄碎。"},{"id":"53263","n":"Turkish lamb pilau","a":"Turkish","c":"Lamb","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/cr2kyr1763793839.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FXaQK06pMBI","i":[["Pine Nuts","Handful"],["Olive Oil","1 tablespoon"],["Onion","1 Large Chopped"],["Cinnamon","2"],["Lamb","500g"],["Basmati Rice","250g"],["Lamb Stock","1"],["Dried Apricots","12"],["Mint","Handful"]],"s":"step 1\r\nDry-fry the pine nuts or almonds in a large pan until lightly toasted, then tip onto a plate. Add the oil to the pan, then fry the onion and cinnamon together until starting to turn golden. Turn up the heat, stir in the lamb, fry until the meat changes colour, then tip in the rice and cook for 1 min, stirring all the time.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nPour in 500ml boiling water, crumble in the stock cube, add the apricots, then season to taste. Turn the heat down, cover and simmer for 12 mins until the rice is tender and the stock has been absorbed. Toss in the pine nuts and mint and serve.","z":"步骤1\r\n将松子或杏仁放入大平底锅中干煎，直至稍微烤熟，然后倒在盘子上。将油加入锅中，然后将洋葱和肉桂一起煎至开始变成金黄色。把火调大，加入羊肉，炒至肉变色，然后倒入米饭，煮1分钟，期间不断搅拌。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n倒入500毫升沸水，将高汤块捣碎，加入杏子，然后调味。把火调低，盖上锅盖，煮12分钟，直到米饭变软，汤汁被吸收。拌入松子和薄荷即可食用。"},{"id":"53252","n":"Turkish rice (vermicelli rice)","a":"Turkish","c":"Miscellaneous","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/xw1ruy1763786501.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gY6PZzjO53M","i":[["Rice","300g"],["Vegetable Oil","3  tablespoons"],["Vermicelli Pasta","70g"],["Unsalted Butter","30g"],["Chicken Stock","600ml"]],"s":"step 1\r\nPour the rice into a very large bowl under cold running water and carefully drain the water out of the bowl through a sieve. Repeat a few times until the water in the bowl is clear, then fill the bowl up with cold water and leave rice to soak for 10 mins while you cook the vermicelli.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nPut the oil into a medium pan over medium heat. Add the vermicelli and stir continuously until the strands turn a rich golden brown, 2-3 mins. Remove from the heat, stir through the butter until it melts and allow the vermicelli to cool for 1-2 mins.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nDrain the rice thoroughly through a sieve. Add the rice to the pan and stir well. Pour the hot stock into the pan, sprinkle in ½ tsp salt, stir well then return the pan to the hob over a high heat. Bring to the boil, then reduce the heat to the lowest it will go, put the lid on the pan and simmer for 7-9 mins. Remove the pan from the heat, cover with a couple of sheets of kitchen paper or a light tea towel and the pan lid, and let the rice sit in the pan for 10 mins. Fluff up with a fork before serving.","z":"步骤1\r\n将大米倒入一个非常大的碗中，用冷水冲洗，然后小心地通过筛子将水从碗中排出。重复几次，直到碗里的水清澈为止，然后在碗里装满冷水，让米浸泡10分钟，同时煮粉丝。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将油放入中型平底锅中，用中火加热。加入粉丝，持续搅拌 2-3 分钟，直至粉丝变成金黄色。离火，搅拌黄油直至融化，然后让粉丝冷却 1-2 分钟。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n通过筛子彻底沥干大米。将米饭加入锅中并搅拌均匀。将热汤倒入锅中，撒上 ½ 茶匙盐，搅拌均匀，然后将锅放回炉灶上，用大火加热。煮沸，然后将火调至最低，盖上锅盖，煮7-9分钟。将锅从火上移开，盖上几张厨房用纸或轻茶巾和锅盖，然后将米饭放在锅中放置 10 分钟。食用前用叉子将其弄松。"},{"id":"53270","n":"Turkish-style lamb","a":"Turkish","c":"Lamb","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/0p7l6b1763813981.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RSXfGtom4RQ","i":[["Lamb Leg","4"],["Seasoning","2 tsp"],["Dried Oregano","1 tsp"],["Mint","Bunch"],["Yogurt","300g"],["Pita Bread","4"],["Iceberg Lettuce","1/2"],["Red Onions","1 sliced"],["Lemon","1"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat grill to high. Season the lamb, then grill for 2 mins on each side until browned, but still very rare. Meanwhile, mix the seasoning, oregano and half of the mint into one of the tubs of yogurt, smother this over the lamb, then return to the grill for another 2-3 mins or until the yogurt is blistered and the meat is cooked to your liking.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nLeave the meat to rest on a board for a few mins while you toast the pittas, shred the lettuce and thinly slice the red onion. Stir the rest of the mint into the second tub of yogurt. Thickly slice the meat and stuff into the pitta bread with the salad and minted yogurt. Squeeze over lemon juice before tucking in, if you like.","z":"步骤1\r\n将烤架加热至高温。将羊肉调味，然后每面烤 2 分钟直至变成棕色，但仍然非常罕见。与此同时，将调味料、牛至和一半薄荷混合到一桶酸奶中，盖在羊肉上，然后返回烤架再烤 2-3 分钟，或者直到酸奶起泡，肉也煮到您喜欢的程度。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将肉放在板上几分钟，同时烤皮塔饼，将生菜切碎，将红洋葱切成薄片。将剩余的薄荷搅拌到第二桶酸奶中。将肉切成厚片，与沙拉和薄荷酸奶一起塞入皮塔面包中。如果你愿意的话，在吃之前挤上柠檬汁。"},{"id":"53271","n":"Walnut, date & honey cake","a":"Turkish","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/towo9c1763814590.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ivR-YRcQk08","i":[["Self-raising Flour","225g"],["Ground Cinnamon","1/2 teaspoon"],["Butter","175g"],["Muscovado Sugar","100g"],["Clear Honey","3  tablespoons"],["Egg","2 Beaten"],["Banana","2 medium"],["Stoned Dates","100g"],["Walnuts","50g"]],"s":"step 1\r\nPreheat the oven to 160C/Gas 3/fan oven 140C. Line the base and long sides of a 900g/2lb loaf tin with greaseproof paper, buttering the tin and paper.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nTip the flour, cinnamon, butter, sugar, 2 tablespoons of the honey and the eggs into a large mixing bowl. Mash the bananas and chop the dates (kitchen scissors are easiest for this) and add to the bowl. Beat the mixture for 2-3 minutes, using a wooden spoon or hand-held mixer, until well blended.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nSpoon into the prepared tin and level the top. Scatter the walnut pieces over. Bake for 1 hour, then lightly press the top – it will feel firm if cooked. If not, bake for a further 10 minutes.\r\n\r\nstep 4\r\nCool for 15 minutes, then lift out of the tin using the paper. When cold, drizzle the remaining honey over. Cut into thick slices.","z":"步骤1\r\n将烤箱预热至 160C/燃气 3/风扇烤箱 140C。在 900 克/2 磅面包罐的底部和长边铺上防油纸，在罐子和纸上涂抹黄油。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将面粉、肉桂、黄油、糖、2 汤匙蜂蜜和鸡蛋倒入一个大搅拌碗中。将香蕉捣碎，将枣子切碎（厨房剪刀最容易做到这一点），然后放入碗中。使用木勺或手持式搅拌机将混合物搅拌 2-3 分钟，直至充分混合。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n用勺子舀入准备好的罐子中，并将顶部弄平。将核桃片撒在上面。烤1小时，然后轻轻按压顶部——熟了就会感觉很硬。如果没有，请再烘烤 10 分钟。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n冷却 15 分钟，然后用纸将其从罐中取出。冷时，淋上剩余的蜂蜜。切成厚片。"},{"id":"53257","n":"kofta burgers","a":"Turkish","c":"Lamb","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/lgmnff1763789847.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/4OsDpyaTKk0","i":[["Lamb","1kg"],["Onion","2"],["Garlic Bulb","1"],["Garam Masala","6 tablespoons"],["Coriander","Bunch"],["Chilli Sauce","1 tablespoon"],["Pita Bread","8"],["Tomato","4 sliced"],["Red Cabbage","1/2"],["Red Onions","1 sliced"],["Yogurt","Small pack"]],"s":"step 1\r\nTip the mince into a large bowl (use a clean washing-up bowl if you don’t have anything big enough) with all the other burger ingredients and a good pinch of salt. Roll up your sleeves, get your hands into the mix and squelch everything together through your fingers until completely mixed. Pat the mix into 16 small burgers. These may now be frozen for up to 1 month or chilled up to a day ahead.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nTo cook, heat grill to its highest setting and lay the burgers in a single layer on a baking tray (you may need to do this in batches, depending on how big your tray is). Grill on the highest shelf for 5-6 mins on each side until browned and cooked through. Pile burgers onto a platter and serve with all the accompaniments, so everyone can construct their own sandwich.","z":"步骤1\r\n将肉末倒入一个大碗中（如果没有足够大的东西，请使用干净的洗碗），与所有其他汉堡配料和一小撮盐一起放入。卷起袖子，将双手放入混合物中，用手指将所有东西压在一起，直至完全混合。将混合物拍成 16 个小汉堡。这些现在可以冷冻长达 1 个月或提前冷藏一天。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n烹饪时，将烤架加热到最高温度，然后将汉堡单层放在烤盘上（您可能需要分批执行此操作，具体取决于您的烤盘有多大）。在最高的架子上每面烤 5-6 分钟，直至变成棕色并煮熟。将汉堡堆放在盘子上并与所有配菜一起上桌，这样每个人都可以制作自己的三明治。"},{"id":"53078","n":"Beetroot Soup (Borscht)","a":"Ukrainian","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/zadvgb1699012544.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6CXgPVw_-0g","i":[["Beetroot","3"],["Olive Oil","4 tbs"],["Chicken Stock Cube","1"],["Water","6 cups"],["Potatoes","3"],["Cannellini Beans","1 can"],["Dill","Garnish"]],"s":"Chop the beetroot, add water and stock cube and cook for 15mins. Add the other ingredients and boil until soft. Finally add the beans and cook for 5mins. Serve in the soup pot.","z":"将甜菜根切碎，加入水和高汤块，煮 15 分钟。添加其他成分并煮至软。最后加入豆子煮5分钟。盛入汤锅中。"},{"id":"53313","n":"Beetroot latkes","a":"Ukrainian","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/qwicc91764368097.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pRLuLYQnPiM","i":[["Rapeseed Oil","1 tablespoon"],["Greek Yogurt","4 tablespoons"],["Mint","1/2 bag"],["Rocket","150g"],["Cherry Tomatoes","130g"],["Beetroot","400g"],["Egg","1 beaten"],["Plain Flour","1 tablespoon"],["Garlic","1 clove finely chopped"],["Caraway Seed","1 tsp"],["Ground Cumin","1/2 teaspoon"],["Lemon","Zest of 1"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Make the latkes by combining all of the ingredients.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nHeat the oil in a large non-stick pan. Spoon in the mixture to make six round latkes. Fry for 4-5 mins on each side, then transfer to a baking sheet and bake for 10 mins.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nCombine the yogurt and mint in a small bowl. Toss the salad leaves and tomatoes together, then serve the latkes with the mint yogurt and salad.","z":"步骤1\r\n将烤箱加热至 180C/160C 风扇/燃气 4. 将所有原料混合在一起制作马铃薯饼。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n在一个大的不粘锅中加热油。用勺子舀入混合物，制成六个圆形马铃薯饼。每面煎 4-5 分钟，然后转移到烤盘上烘烤 10 分钟。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n将酸奶和薄荷混合在一个小碗中。将沙拉叶和西红柿搅拌在一起，然后将马铃薯饼与薄荷酸奶和沙拉一起食用。"},{"id":"53316","n":"Beetroot pancakes","a":"Ukrainian","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/xlqqhw1764369924.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HzQT0rHKCWM","i":[["Beetroot","3"],["Milk","50 ml"],["Self-raising Flour","200g"],["Baking Powder","1 tsp"],["Maple Syrup","2 tablespoons"],["Vanilla Extract","1/2 teaspoon"],["Egg","3"],["Butter","25g"],["Frozen Mixed Berries","200g"],["Blackcurrant Jam","2 tablespoons"],["Greek Yogurt","100g"]],"s":"step 1\r\nPut the beetroot in a jug with the milk and blend with a stick blender until smooth. Pour into a bowl with the rest of the pancake ingredients and whisk until smooth and vibrant purple.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nPut a small knob of butter in a large non-stick frying pan and heat over a medium-low heat until melted and foamy. Now create 3 or 4 pancakes each made from 2 tbsp of the batter. Cook for 2-3 mins then flip over and cook for a further minute until cooked through. Repeat with any remaining batter. Heat oven to lowest setting and keep the pancakes warm in there until needed.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nServe with your favourite pancake toppings or make a simple compote by simmering frozen berries in with 1 tbsp blackcurrant jam until bubbling and syrupy (about 5-10 mins). In a small bowl stir together the remaining jam and the yogurt. Stack the cooked pancakes with the yogurt and pour the warm berry compote over the top.","z":"步骤1\r\n将甜菜根与牛奶一起放入罐中，用棒式搅拌机搅拌至光滑。将煎饼的其余原料倒入碗中，搅拌至光滑、呈鲜艳的紫色。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将一小块黄油放入一个大的不粘煎锅中，用中低火加热直至融化并起泡沫。现在制作 3 或 4 个煎饼，每个煎饼用 2 汤匙面糊制成。煮2-3分钟，然后翻面再煮一分钟直至熟透。对剩余的面糊重复上述步骤。将烤箱加热到最低温度，并在需要时将煎饼放在里面保温。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n与您最喜欢的煎饼配料一起食用，或者将冷冻浆果与 1 汤匙黑醋栗果酱一起煮至冒泡并呈糖浆状（约 5-10 分钟），制作简单的蜜饯。在一个小碗中将剩余的果酱和酸奶搅拌在一起。将煮熟的煎饼与酸奶叠在一起，然后将温热的浆果蜜饯倒在上面。"},{"id":"53311","n":"Borsch","a":"Ukrainian","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/804v1j1764367088.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6CXgPVw_-0g","i":[["Beef Shin","1kg"],["Onion","1"],["Bay Leaf","1"],["Potatoes","2.5kg"],["Sunflower Oil","2 tablespoons"],["Onion","1 Diced"],["Carrots","1"],["Beetroot","200g"],["Red Pepper","1 chopped"],["Tinned Tomatos","200g"],["Prunes","6"],["White Cabbage","1/2"],["Kidney Beans","400g"],["Creme Fraiche","100 ml"],["Dill","Bunch"],["Crusty Bread","To serve"]],"s":"step 1\r\nTo make the stock, put the meat, whole onion, bay leaf and 2 litres of lightly salted cold water in a large saucepan. Cook over a very low heat for 1 hr 30 mins or until the beef shin is soft and falls apart easily – this can take up to 3 hrs. Skim off the scum with a spoon from time to time. Break up any larger pieces of beef into the broth, remove the whole onion and discard.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nAdd the potatoes to the borscht, season well with salt and pepper and cook for 10-15 mins until tender. Meanwhile, heat the sunflower oil in a large, deep frying pan. Add the diced onion and carrot, and cook over a medium heat, stirring, until the carrot is soft and is about to start caramelising.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nAdd the beetroot and cook for around 5 mins, stirring occasionally. Add the red pepper, if using, and cook for another 2 mins, then add the tomatoes and prunes, stir, then increase the heat and boil to reduce slightly, before adding everything to the borscht.\r\n\r\nstep 4\r\nAdd the shredded cabbage and the kidney beans, and cook for 7-10 mins or until tender. Serve with a dollop of sour cream or crème fraîche, lots of chopped dill and some crusty bread.","z":"步骤1\r\n制作高汤时，将肉、整个洋葱、月桂叶和 2 升淡盐冷水放入大平底锅中。用非常低的热量煮 1 小时 30 分钟，或者直到牛胫骨变软并容易分解 - 这可能需要长达 3 小时。时不时用勺子撇去浮沫。将较大的牛肉块放入肉汤中，取出整个洋葱并丢弃。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将土豆加入罗宋汤中，用盐和胡椒调味，煮 10-15 分钟直至变软。与此同时，在一个大的深煎锅中加热葵花籽油。加入切碎的洋葱和胡萝卜，用中火煮，搅拌，直到胡萝卜变软并且即将开始焦糖化。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n加入甜菜根，煮约 5 分钟，偶尔搅拌。如果使用的话，加入红辣椒，再煮 2 分钟，然后加入西红柿和李子，搅拌，然后增加热量并稍微煮沸，然后将所有东西加入罗宋汤中。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n加入切碎的卷心菜和芸豆，煮 7-10 分钟或直至变软。与一块酸奶油或法式酸奶油、大量切碎的莳萝和一些硬皮面包一起食用。"},{"id":"53315","n":"Rosemary braised red cabbage with kabanos","a":"Ukrainian","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/s1jxzl1764369317.jpg","y":"","i":[["Red Cabbage","1/2"],["Olive Oil","1 tablespoon"],["Butter","Knob"],["Red Onions","1 sliced"],["Red Wine Vinegar","125ml"],["Brown Sugar","140g"],["Red Chilli","1 chopped"],["Rosemary","2 sprigs"],["Bramley Apples","1 chopped"],["Kabanos Sausages","8"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHalve the cabbage, remove the tough stem and thinly slice. Place in a large pan with all the other ingredients apart from the sausages, then mix in 300ml water and some salt and pepper.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nBring to a simmer, then reduce the heat, cover with a well-fitting lid and gently cook for 1½ hrs, stirring frequently. If too dry, you can add a little more water.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nAdd the kabanos to the cabbage mixture, place a lid on the pan and gently simmer for 20 mins. Remove the lid and cook for a further 10 mins. Serve alongside some simple mash or boiled potatoes.","z":"步骤1\r\n将卷心菜切半，去掉坚硬的茎，切成薄片。将除香肠以外的所有其他原料放入大锅中，然后加入 300 毫升水以及一些盐和胡椒粉。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n用文火煮，然后调小火，盖上盖子，轻轻煮 1.5 小时，经常搅拌。如果太干，可以再加一点水。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n将卡巴诺斯加入卷心菜混合物中，盖上锅盖，小火煮 20 分钟。取下盖子，再煮 10 分钟。与一些简单的土豆泥或煮土豆一起食用。"},{"id":"53314","n":"Sauerkraut pierogii","a":"Ukrainian","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/gqlxgc1764368767.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eVWBJt2jaPU","i":[["Sunflower Oil","1 tablespoon"],["Shallots","2 chopped"],["Sauerkraut","150g"],["Hispi (sweetheart) Cabbage","150g"],["Egg","1 beaten"],["Vegetable Oil","1/2 tbs"],["Plain Flour","350g"],["Vegetable Oil","For frying"],["Shallots","2 sliced"],["Plain Flour","Dusting"],["Butter","45g"],["Sour Cream","60 ml"]],"s":"step 1\r\nFirst, make the crispy shallots. Heat the oil in a saucepan to 180C (a cube of bread will turn golden in 15 secs). Toss the shallots in a little flour and deep-fry for 1 min or until light golden and crispy. Drain on kitchen paper. Can be made up to two days before and kept in an airtight container.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nTo make the filling, heat the oil in a medium non-stick frying pan and gently fry the shallots for 10 mins until starting to turn golden.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nAdd the sauerkraut and cabbage, and cook for 5-10 mins until the cabbage has softened. Taste and add a little salt if under-seasoned, or sugar if stringent. Scrape into a bowl and leave to cool completely.\r\n\r\nstep 4\r\nTo make the dough, mix the eggs and oil with 125ml water, then gradually add in the flour, mixing well with your hands. Knead it on a well-floured surface until the dough stops sticking to your hands. You should end up with firm, elastic dough. Wrap it in cling film and rest in the fridge for at least 30 mins, or overnight.\r\n\r\nstep 5\r\nFlour your work surface generously. Roll out the dough to a 40cm circle or until the dough is as thick as £1 coin.\r\n\r\nstep 6\r\nUsing a 9cm cookie cutter, cut out discs in the dough – you should end up with about 25 discs. Do not throw away the off-cuts – we throw them in with the pierogi when boiling to minimise any waste.\r\n\r\nstep 7\r\nHave a well-floured tray ready. Put 1 tsp of the filling into the centre of each disc. In your hand, fold in half around the filling and seal to create half-moon shapes. Put them on the floured tray, making sure they don’t touch each other.\r\n\r\nstep 8\r\nBring a large saucepan of salted water to the boil and carefully lower the pierogi in. Boil them for 2 mins or until they float to the top.\r\n\r\nstep 9\r\nDrain and serve with a knob of butter and some soured cream. Finish by sprinkling the crispy shallots on top to serve.","z":"步骤1\r\n首先，制作脆葱。将平底锅中的油加热至 180°C（一块面包将在 15 秒内变成金黄色）。将青葱拌入少许面粉中，炸 1 分钟或直至呈浅金黄色。用厨房纸吸干水分。最多可在两天前配制并保存在密封容器中。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n制作馅料时，在中号不粘煎锅中加热油，然后将青葱轻轻煎 10 分钟，直至开始变成金黄色。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n加入酸菜和卷心菜，煮5-10分钟，直到卷心菜变软。尝一尝，如果调味不足，加一点盐，如果严格的话，加糖。刮入碗中并使其完全冷却。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n制作面团时，将鸡蛋和油与125毫升水混合，然后逐渐加入面粉，用手搅拌均匀。将其放在撒有面粉的表面上揉捏，直到面团不再粘在手上。最后你应该得到坚硬、有弹性的面团。用保鲜膜包起来，放入冰箱冷藏至少 30 分钟，或过夜。\r\n\r\n步骤5\r\n在工作表面撒上大量面粉。将面团擀成 40 厘米的圆形，或直至面团厚度为 1 英镑硬币。\r\n\r\n步骤6\r\n使用 9 厘米的饼干切割机，在面团中切出圆片 - 最终应该得到大约 25 个圆片。不要扔掉边角料——我们在煮饺子时将它们与饺子一起扔掉，以最大程度地减少浪费。\r\n\r\n步骤7\r\n准备好撒满面粉的托盘。将 1 茶匙馅料放入每个圆盘的中心。在手中，将馅料周围对折并密封，形成半月形。将它们放在撒了面粉的托盘上，确保它们不会互相接触。\r\n\r\n步骤8\r\n将一大锅盐水烧开，小心地放入饺子。煮 2 分钟或直到它们浮到顶部。\r\n\r\n步骤9\r\n沥干水分，与一小块黄油和一些酸奶油一起食用。最后撒上香脆的青葱即可上桌。"},{"id":"53312","n":"Tangy cabbage slaw","a":"Ukrainian","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/e2g2r21764367568.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oVuAky9HTlM","i":[["Mayonnaise","250ml"],["Lemon","Zest and juice of 1"],["Cider Vinegar","2 tablespoons"],["Wholegrain Mustard","2 tablespoons"],["Celery Salt","1 tsp"],["White Cabbage","1/4"],["Red Cabbage","1/4"],["Carrots","2"],["Onion","1 Diced"],["Celery","2 sliced"]],"s":"step 1\r\nWhisk together mayonnaise, lemon zest and juice, vinegar, mustard and celery salt in a small bowl, then season generously.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nAdd cabbage, carrots, onion and celery. Mix well and refrigerate. Can be made up to 1 day ahead.","z":"步骤1\r\n将蛋黄酱、柠檬皮碎和果汁、醋、芥末和芹菜盐放入小碗中搅拌，然后充分调味。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n加入卷心菜、胡萝卜、洋葱和芹菜。充分混合并冷藏。最多可提前 1 天补足。"},{"id":"52995","n":"BBQ Pork Sloppy Joes","a":"United States","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/atd5sh1583188467.jpg","y":"","i":[["Potatoes","2"],["Red Onions","1"],["Garlic","2 cloves"],["Lime","1"],["Bread","2"],["Pork","1 lb"],["Barbeque Sauce",""],["Hotsauce",""],["Tomato Ketchup",""],["Sugar",""],["Vegetable Oil",""],["Salt",""],["Pepper",""]],"s":"1\r\n\r\nPreheat oven to 450 degrees. Wash and dry all produce. Cut sweet potatoes into ½-inch-thick wedges. Toss on a baking sheet with a drizzle of oil, salt, and pepper. Roast until browned and tender, 20-25 minutes.\r\n\r\n2\r\n\r\nMeanwhile, halve and peel onion. Slice as thinly as possible until you have ¼ cup (½ cup for 4 servings); finely chop remaining onion. Peel and finely chop garlic. Halve lime; squeeze juice into a small bowl. Halve buns. Add 1 TBSP butter (2 TBSP for 4) to a separate small microwave-safe bowl; microwave until melted, 30 seconds. Brush onto cut sides of buns.\r\n\r\n3\r\n\r\nTo bowl with lime juice, add sliced onion, ¼ tsp sugar (½ tsp for 4 servings), and a pinch of salt. Stir to combine; set aside to quick-pickle.\r\n\r\n4\r\n\r\nHeat a drizzle of oil in a large pan over medium-high heat. Add chopped onion and season with salt and pepper. Cook, stirring, until softened, 4-5 minutes. Add garlic and cook until fragrant, 30 seconds more. Add pork and season with salt and pepper. Cook, breaking up meat into pieces, until browned and cooked through, 4-6 minutes.\r\n\r\n5\r\n\r\nWhile pork cooks, in a third small bowl, combine BBQ sauce, pickling liquid from onion, 3 TBSP ketchup (6 TBSP for 4 servings), ½ tsp sugar (1 tsp for 4), and ¼ cup water (⅓ cup for 4). Once pork is cooked through, add BBQ sauce mixture to pan. Cook, stirring, until sauce is thickened, 2-3 minutes. Taste and season with salt and pepper.\r\n\r\n6\r\n\r\nMeanwhile, toast buns in oven or toaster oven until golden, 3-5 minutes. Divide toasted buns between plates and fill with as much BBQ pork as you’d like. Top with pickled onion and hot sauce. Serve with sweet potato wedges on the side.","z":"1\r\n\r\n将烤箱预热至450度。清洗并干燥所有产品。将红薯切成 1/2 英寸厚的楔形。在烤盘上撒上油、盐和胡椒粉。烤 20-25 分钟，直至变成棕色并变软。\r\n\r\n2\r\n\r\n同时，将洋葱切半并去皮。尽可能切成薄片，直到达到 ¼ 杯（½ 杯，4 人份）；将剩余的洋葱切碎。大蒜去皮并切碎。石灰减半；将果汁挤入小碗中。馒头减半。将 1 汤匙黄油（4 人份 2 汤匙）添加到一个单独的微波炉专用小碗中；微波炉加热 30 秒直至融化。刷在面包的切边上。\r\n\r\n3\r\n\r\n将青柠汁放入碗中，加入切好的洋葱、1/4 茶匙糖（1/2 茶匙，适合 4 人份）和少许盐。搅拌混合；放在一边快速腌制。\r\n\r\n4\r\n\r\n在大平底锅中用中高火加热毛毛雨。加入切碎的洋葱，用盐和胡椒调味。边搅拌边煮 4-5 分钟，直至变软。加入大蒜，再煮 30 秒，直至散发出香味。加入猪肉，用盐和胡椒调味。将肉切成块，煮 4-6 分钟，直至变成褐色并煮熟。\r\n\r\n5\r\n\r\n煮猪肉的同时，在第三个小碗中混合烧烤酱、洋葱腌制液、3 汤匙番茄酱（4 人份 6 汤匙）、½ 茶匙糖（4 人份 1 茶匙）和 ¼ 杯水（4 人份 ⅓ 杯）。猪肉煮熟后，将烧烤酱混合物加入锅中。边煮边搅拌，直到酱汁变稠，持续 2-3 分钟。品尝并用盐和胡椒调味。\r\n\r\n6\r\n\r\n同时，将面包放入烤箱或烤面包机中烘烤 3-5 分钟，直至呈金黄色。将烤面包分装在盘子中，并根据需要填入尽可能多的烤猪肉。上面放上腌洋葱和辣酱。与红薯角一起食用。"},{"id":"52855","n":"Banana Pancakes","a":"United States","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/sywswr1511383814.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kSKtb2Sv-_U","i":[["Banana","1 large"],["Eggs","2 medium"],["Baking Powder","pinch"],["Vanilla Extract","spinkling"],["Oil","1 tsp"],["Pecan Nuts","25g"],["Raspberries","125g"]],"s":"In a bowl, mash the banana with a fork until it resembles a thick purée. Stir in the eggs, baking powder and vanilla.\r\nHeat a large non-stick frying pan or pancake pan over a medium heat and brush with half the oil. Using half the batter, spoon two pancakes into the pan, cook for 1-2 mins each side, then tip onto a plate. Repeat the process with the remaining oil and batter. Top the pancakes with the pecans and raspberries.","z":"在碗中，用叉子将香蕉捣碎，直至其像浓稠的果泥。加入鸡蛋、泡打粉和香草精。\r\n用中火加热一个大的不粘煎锅或煎饼锅，并刷上一半的油。用一半的面糊，将两块煎饼舀入锅中，每面煎 1-2 分钟，然后倒在盘子上。用剩下的油和面糊重复这个过程。在煎饼上放上山核桃和覆盆子。"},{"id":"52812","n":"Beef Brisket Pot Roast","a":"United States","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/ursuup1487348423.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gh48wM6bPWQ","i":[["Beef Brisket","4-5 pound"],["Salt","Dash"],["Onion","3"],["Garlic","5 cloves"],["Thyme","1 Sprig"],["Rosemary","1 sprig"],["Bay Leaves","4"],["beef stock","2 cups"],["Carrots","3 Large"],["Mustard","1 Tbsp"],["Potatoes","4 Mashed"]],"s":"1 Prepare the brisket for cooking: On one side of the brisket there should be a layer of fat, which you want. If there are any large chunks of fat, cut them off and discard them. Large pieces of fat will not be able to render out completely.\r\nUsing a sharp knife, score the fat in parallel lines, about 3/4-inch apart. Slice through the fat, not the beef. Repeat in the opposite direction to make a cross-hatch pattern.\r\nSalt the brisket well and let it sit at room temperature for 30 minutes.\r\n \r\n2 Sear the brisket: You'll need an oven-proof, thick-bottomed pot with a cover, or Dutch oven, that is just wide enough to hold the brisket roast with a little room for the onions.\r\nPat the brisket dry and place it, fatty side down, into the pot and place it on medium high heat. Cook for 5-8 minutes, lightly sizzling, until the fat side is nicely browned. (If the roast seems to be cooking too fast, turn the heat down to medium. You want a steady sizzle, not a raging sear.)\r\nTurn the brisket over and cook for a few minutes more to brown the other side.\r\n\r\n3 Sauté the onions and garlic: When the brisket has browned, remove it from the pot and set aside. There should be a couple tablespoons of fat rendered in the pot, if not, add some olive oil.\r\nAdd the chopped onions and increase the heat to high. Sprinkle a little salt on the onions. Sauté, stirring often, until the onions are lightly browned, 5-8 minutes. Stir in the garlic and cook 1-2 more minutes.\r\n \r\n4 Return brisket to pot, add herbs, stock, bring to simmer, cover, cook in oven: Preheat the oven to 300°F. Use kitchen twine to tie together the bay leaves, rosemary and thyme.\r\nMove the onions and garlic to the sides of the pot and nestle the brisket inside. Add the beef stock and the tied-up herbs. Bring the stock to a boil on the stovetop.\r\nCover the pot, place the pot in the 300°F oven and cook for 3 hours. Carefully flip the brisket every hour so it cooks evenly.\r\n \r\n5 Add carrots, continue to cook: After 3 hours, add the carrots. Cover the pot and cook for 1 hour more, or until the carrots are cooked through and the brisket is falling-apart tender.\r\n6 Remove brisket to cutting board, tent with foil: When the brisket is falling-apart tender, take the pot out of the oven and remove the brisket to a cutting board. Cover it with foil. Pull out and discard the herbs.\r\n7 Make sauce (optional): At this point you have two options. You can serve as is, or you can make a sauce with the drippings and some of the onions. If you serve as is, skip this step.\r\nTo make a sauce, remove the carrots and half of the onions, set aside and cover them with foil. Pour the ingredients that are remaining into the pot into a blender, and purée until smooth. If you want, add 1 tablespoon of mustard to the mix. Put into a small pot and keep warm.\r\n8 Slice the meat across the grain: Notice the lines of the muscle fibers of the roast. This is the \"grain\" of the meat. Slice the meat perpendicular to these lines, or across the grain (cutting this way further tenderizes the meat), in 1/4-inch to 1/2-inch slices.\r\nServe with the onions, carrots and gravy. Serve with mashed, roasted or boiled potatoes, egg noodles or polenta.","z":"1准备烹饪用的牛胸肉：牛胸肉的一侧应该有一层你想要的脂肪。如果有大块的脂肪，将其切掉并丢弃。大块的脂肪将无法完全消失。\r\n使用一把锋利的刀，在脂肪上划出平行线，间隔约 3/4 英寸。切开脂肪，而不是牛肉。以相反方向重复此操作以制作交叉影线图案。\r\n将牛胸肉充分加盐，并在室温下静置 30 分钟。\r\n \r\n2烤牛胸肉：你需要一个适合烤箱的、带盖的厚底锅，或者荷兰烤箱，它的宽度足以容纳烤牛胸肉，并为洋葱留出一点空间。\r\n将牛胸肉拍干，将脂肪面朝下放入锅中，中火加热。煮 5-8 分钟，轻轻发出嘶嘶声，直到脂肪面变成漂亮的棕色。 （如果烤肉看起来煮得太快，请将火调至中火。你想要稳定的嘶嘶声，而不是剧烈的烤焦声。）\r\n将牛胸肉翻过来，再煮几分钟，使另一面变成棕色。\r\n\r\n3炒洋葱和大蒜：当牛胸肉变成棕色时，将其从锅中取出并放在一边。锅里应该有几汤匙脂肪，如果没有，加一些橄榄油。\r\n加入切碎的洋葱并将热量调至最高。在洋葱上撒一点盐。炒5-8分钟，经常搅拌，直到洋葱变成浅棕色。加入大蒜，再煮 1-2 分钟。\r\n \r\n4将牛胸肉放回锅中，加入香草、高汤，小火煮，盖上盖子，在烤箱中烹饪：将烤箱预热至300°F。用厨房麻线将月桂叶、迷迭香和百里香绑在一起。\r\n将洋葱和大蒜移到锅的两侧，然后将牛胸肉放入其中。加入牛肉高汤和捆绑的香草。将高汤在炉灶上煮沸。\r\n盖上锅盖，将锅放入 300°F 的烤箱中，煮 3 小时。每小时小心地翻转牛胸肉，使其受热均匀。\r\n \r\n5加入胡萝卜，继续煮：3小时后，加入胡萝卜。盖上锅盖，再煮 1 小时，或直至胡萝卜煮熟且牛胸肉变软。\r\n6将牛胸肉移至切菜板上，用箔纸帐篷：当牛胸肉变软时，将锅从烤箱中取出，并将牛胸肉移至切菜板上。用箔纸盖住它。拉出并丢弃草药。\r\n7 制作酱汁（可选）：此时你有两个选择。您可以按原样食用，也可以用滴水和一些洋葱制成酱汁。如果您按原样使用，请跳过此步骤。\r\n制作酱汁时，取出胡萝卜和一半洋葱，放在一边并用箔纸覆盖。将锅中剩余的原料倒入搅拌机中，打成泥直至光滑。如果需要，可在混合物中添加 1 汤匙芥末。放入小锅中并保温。\r\n8将肉横切：注意烤肉的肌肉纤维的线条。这就是肉的“颗粒”。将肉垂直于这些线切成 1/4 英寸至 1/2 英寸的片，或横过纹理（以这种方式切割可进一步使肉变嫩）。\r\n与洋葱、胡萝卜和肉汁一起食用。与捣碎的、烤的或煮的土豆、鸡蛋面或玉米粥一起食用。"},{"id":"53013","n":"Big Mac","a":"United States","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/urzj1d1587670726.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C5J39YnnPsg","i":[["Minced Beef","400g"],["Olive Oil","2 tbs"],["Sesame Seed Burger Buns","2"],["Onion","Chopped"],["Iceberg Lettuce","1/4"],["Cheese","2 sliced"],["Dill Pickles","2 large"],["Mayonnaise","1 cup"],["White Wine Vinegar","2 tsp"],["Pepper","Pinch"],["Mustard","2 tsp"],["Onion Salt","1 1/2 tsp"],["Garlic Powder","1 1/2 tsp"],["Paprika","1/2 tsp"]],"s":"For the Big Mac sauce, combine all the ingredients in a bowl, season with salt and chill until ready to use.\r\n2. To make the patties, season the mince with salt and pepper and form into 4 balls using about 1/3 cup mince each. Place each onto a square of baking paper and flatten to form into four x 15cm circles. Heat oil in a large frypan over high heat. In 2 batches, cook beef patties for 1-2 minutes each side until lightly charred and cooked through. Remove from heat and keep warm. Repeat with remaining two patties.\r\n3. Carefully slice each burger bun into three acrossways, then lightly toast.\r\n4. To assemble the burgers, spread a little Big Mac sauce over the bottom base. Top with some chopped onion, shredded lettuce, slice of cheese, beef patty and some pickle slices. Top with the middle bun layer, and spread with more Big Mac sauce, onion, lettuce, pickles, beef patty and then finish with more sauce. Top with burger lid to serve.\r\n5. After waiting half an hour for your food to settle, go for a jog.","z":"对于巨无霸酱，将所有原料混合在一个碗中，用盐调味并冷却直至可以使用。\r\n2. 制作肉饼时，用盐和胡椒调味肉末，然后将肉饼分成 4 个球，每个球使用约 1/3 杯肉末。将每个放在一张正方形的烘焙纸上，压平形成四个 x 15 厘米的圆圈。在大煎锅中用高温加热油。分 2 批将牛肉饼每面煎 1-2 分钟，直至轻微烧焦并煮熟。远离热源并保暖。对剩下的两个肉饼重复上述步骤。\r\n3. 小心地将每个汉堡包横切成三片，然后轻轻烘烤。\r\n4. 组装汉堡时，在底部涂上一点巨无霸酱。上面放一些切碎的洋葱、切碎的生菜、一片奶酪、牛肉饼和一些泡菜片。上面放上中间的面包层，再涂上更多的巨无霸酱、洋葱、生菜、泡菜、牛肉饼，最后再涂上更多的酱。盖上汉堡盖即可食用。\r\n5. 等待半小时让食物稳定后，去慢跑。"},{"id":"53016","n":"Chick-Fil-A Sandwich","a":"United States","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/sbx7n71587673021.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1WDesu7bUDM","i":[["Chicken Breast","1"],["Pickle Juice","1/4 cup"],["Egg","1"],["Milk","1/4 cup"],["Flour","1/2 cup"],["Icing Sugar","1 tbs"],["Paprika","1/2 tsp"],["Salt","1/2 tsp"],["Black Pepper","1/4 tsp"],["Garlic Powder","1/4 tsp"],["Celery Salt","1/4 tsp"],["Cayenne Pepper","1/2 tsp"],["Olive Oil","1 cup"],["Sesame Seed Burger Buns","1"]],"s":"Wrap the chicken loosely between plastic wrap and pound gently with the flat side of a meat tenderizer until about 1/2 inch thick all around.\r\nCut into two pieces, as even as possible.\r\nMarinate in the pickle juice for 30 minutes to one hour (add a teaspoon of Tabasco sauce now for a spicy sandwich).\r\nBeat the egg with the milk in a bowl.\r\nCombine the flour, sugar, and spices in another bowl.\r\nDip the chicken pieces each into the egg on both sides, then coat in flour on both sides.\r\nHeat the oil in a skillet (1/2 inch deep) to about 345-350.\r\nFry each cutlet for 2 minutes on each side, or until golden and cooked through.\r\nBlot on paper and serve on toasted buns with pickle slices.","z":"将鸡肉松松地包在保鲜膜中，然后用嫩肉剂的平坦面轻轻敲打，直到周围约 1/2 英寸厚。\r\n切成两块，尽可能均匀。\r\n在泡菜汁中腌制 30 分钟到一小时（现在添加一茶匙塔巴斯科酱，即可制作辣三明治）。\r\n将鸡蛋和牛奶放入碗中打散。\r\n将面粉、糖和香料放入另一个碗中。\r\n将鸡块两面沾上鸡蛋液，然后两面裹上面粉。\r\n将煎锅（1/2 英寸深）中的油加热至约 345-350 度。\r\n将每块肉排每面煎 2 分钟，或直至呈金黄色并煮熟。\r\n吸干纸上的水分，然后与泡菜片一起放在烤面包上。"},{"id":"52818","n":"Chicken Fajita Mac and Cheese","a":"United States","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/qrqywr1503066605.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bwTSmLTZKNg","i":[["macaroni","500g"],["chicken stock","2 cups"],["heavy cream","1/2 cup"],["fajita seasoning","1 packet"],["salt","1 tsp"],["chicken breast","3 diced"],["olive oil","2 tbsp"],["onion","1 small finely diced"],["red pepper","2 finely diced"],["garlic","2 cloves minced"],["cheddar cheese","1 cup"],["parsley","garnish chopped"]],"s":"Fry your onion, peppers and garlic in olive oil until nicely translucent. Make a well in your veg and add your chicken. Add your seasoning and salt. Allow to colour slightly.\r\nAdd your cream, stock and macaroni.\r\nCook on low for 20 minutes. Add your cheeses, stir to combine.\r\nTop with roasted peppers and parsley.","z":"用橄榄油将洋葱、辣椒和大蒜煎至半透明。在你的蔬菜上挖一个洞，然后加入鸡肉。添加调味料和盐。允许稍微着色。\r\n添加奶油、高汤和通心粉。\r\n小火煮 20 分钟。添加奶酪，搅拌混合。\r\n上面放上烤辣椒和欧芹。"},{"id":"52856","n":"Choc Chip Pecan Pie","a":"United States","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/rqvwxt1511384809.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fDpoT0jvg4Y","i":[["Plain Flour","300g"],["Butter","75g"],["Cream Cheese","100g"],["Icing Sugar","1 tbls"],["Butter","150g"],["Maple Syrup","200ml"],["Light Brown Soft Sugar","250g"],["Dark Brown Soft Sugar","100g"],["Eggs","4"],["Vanilla Extract","1 tsp"],["Pecan Nuts","400g"],["Dark Chocolate Chips","200g"]],"s":"First, make the pastry. Tip the ingredients into a food processor with 1 /4 tsp salt. Blend until the mixture resembles breadcrumbs. Drizzle 2-3 tsp cold water into the funnel while the blade is running – the mixture should start to clump together. Tip onto a work surface and bring together, kneading briefly into a ball. Pat into a disc, wrap in cling film, and chill for at least 20 mins. Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\n\r\nRemove the pastry from the fridge and leave at room temperature for 5 mins to soften. Flour the work surface, then unwrap the pastry and roll to a circle the thickness of a £1 coin. Use the pastry to line a deep, 23cm round fluted tin – mine was about 3cm deep. Press the pastry into the corners and up the sides, making sure there are no gaps. Leave 1cm pastry overhanging (save some of the pastry scraps for later). Line with baking parchment (scrunch it up first to make it more pliable) and fill with baking beans. Blind-bake for 15-20 mins until the sides are set, then remove the parchment and beans and return to the oven for 5 mins until golden brown. Trim the pastry so it’s flush with the top of the tin – a small serrated knife is best for this. If there are any cracks, patch them up with the pastry scraps.\r\n\r\nMeanwhile, weigh the butter, syrup and sugars into a pan, and add 1 /4 tsp salt. Heat until the butter has melted and the sugar dissolved, stirring until smooth. Remove from the heat and cool for 10 mins. Reduce oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3.\r\n\r\nBeat the eggs in a bowl. Add the syrup mixture, vanilla and pecans, and mix until well combined. Pour half the mixture into the tart case, scatter over half the chocolate chips, then cover with the remaining filling and chocolate chips. Bake on the middle shelf for 50-55 mins until set. Remove from the oven and leave to cool, then chill for at least 2 hrs before serving.","z":"首先，制作糕点。将原料倒入食品加工机中，加入 1 /4 茶匙盐。搅拌直至混合物类似于面包屑。当刀片运转时，将 2-3 茶匙冷水淋入漏斗 - 混合物应开始凝结在一起。倒在工作表面上并放在一起，短暂揉成一个球。拍成圆盘，用保鲜膜包起来，冷却至少 20 分钟。将烤箱加热至 200C/180C 风扇/燃气 6.\r\n\r\n将糕点从冰箱中取出，在室温下放置 5 分钟使其软化。在工作表面撒上面粉，然后打开糕点并擀成 1 英镑硬币厚度的圆形。用糕点在一个深 23 厘米的圆形凹槽锡上划线——我的锡大约是 3 厘米深。将糕点压入角落并向上压入两侧，确保没有间隙。留下 1 厘米的糕点悬垂（保留一些糕点碎片供以后使用）。铺上烘焙羊皮纸（先将其揉皱以使其更柔韧）并填充烘焙豆。盲烤 15-20 分钟，直至侧面凝固，然后取出羊皮纸和豆子，返回烤箱烤 5 分钟，直至呈金黄色。修剪糕点，使其与罐头顶部齐平——最好使用小锯齿刀。如果有任何裂缝，用糕点碎片修补它们。\r\n\r\n同时，将黄油、糖浆和糖放入锅中称重，然后加入 1 /4 茶匙盐。加热直至黄油融化并且糖溶解，搅拌直至光滑。从火上移开并冷却 10 分钟。将烤箱温度降至 160C/140C 风扇/燃气 3.\r\n\r\n将鸡蛋打入碗中。加入糖浆混合物、香草和山核桃，搅拌直至充分混合。将一半混合物倒入挞皮中，撒上一半巧克力片，然后盖上剩余的馅料和巧克力片。在中间架子上烘烤 50-55 分钟直至凝固。从烤箱中取出并冷却，然后在食用前冷却至少 2 小时。"},{"id":"52860","n":"Chocolate Raspberry Brownies","a":"United States","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/yypvst1511386427.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Pi89PqsAaAg","i":[["Dark Chocolate","200g"],["Milk Chocolate","100g"],["Salted Butter","250g"],["Light Brown Soft Sugar","400g"],["Eggs","4 large"],["Plain Flour","140g"],["Cocoa","50g"],["Raspberries","200g"]],"s":"Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Line a 20 x 30cm baking tray tin with baking parchment. Put the chocolate, butter and sugar in a pan and gently melt, stirring occasionally with a wooden spoon. Remove from the heat.\r\nStir the eggs, one by one, into the melted chocolate mixture. Sieve over the flour and cocoa, and stir in. Stir in half the raspberries, scrape into the tray, then scatter over the remaining raspberries. Bake on the middle shelf for 30 mins or, if you prefer a firmer texture, for 5 mins more. Cool before slicing into squares. Store in an airtight container for up to 3 days.","z":"将烤箱加热至 180C/160C 风扇/燃气 4. 在 20 x 30cm 烤盘罐上铺上烘焙羊皮纸。将巧克力、黄油和糖放入锅中，轻轻融化，偶尔用木勺搅拌。从火上移开。\r\n将鸡蛋一颗一颗地搅拌到融化的巧克力混合物中。筛入面粉和可可，然后搅拌。拌入一半的覆盆子，刮入托盘，然后撒在剩余的覆盆子上。在中间架子上烘烤 30 分钟，如果您喜欢更坚硬的质地，则可再烘烤 5 分钟。冷却后切成方块。在密封容器中最多可保存 3 天。"},{"id":"52840","n":"Clam chowder","a":"United States","c":"Starter","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/rvtvuw1511190488.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fEN_fm6kX6k","i":[["Clams","1½ kg"],["Butter","50g"],["Bacon","150g"],["Onion","1 finely chopped"],["Thyme","sprigs of fresh"],["Bay Leaf","1"],["Plain Flour","1 tbls"],["Milk","150ml"],["Double Cream","150ml"],["Potatoes","2 medium"],["Parsley","Chopped"]],"s":"Rinse the clams in several changes of cold water and drain well. Tip the clams into a large pan with 500ml of water. Cover, bring to the boil and simmer for 2 mins until the clams have just opened. Tip the contents of the pan into a colander over a bowl to catch the clam stock. When cool enough to handle, remove the clams from their shells – reserving a handful of empty shells for presentation if you want. Strain the clam stock into a jug, leaving any grit in the bottom of the bowl. You should have around 800ml stock.\r\nHeat the butter in the same pan and sizzle the bacon for 3-4 mins until it starts to brown. Stir in the onion, thyme and bay and cook everything gently for 10 mins until the onion is soft and golden. Scatter over the flour and stir in to make a sandy paste, cook for 2 mins more, then gradually stir in the clam stock then the milk and the cream.\r\nThrow in the potatoes, bring everything to a simmer and leave to bubble away gently for 10 mins or until the potatoes are cooked. Use a fork to crush a few of the potato chunks against the side of the pan to help thicken – you still want lots of defined chunks though. Stir through the clam meat and the few clam shells, if you've gone down that route, and simmer for a minute to reheat. Season with plenty of black pepper and a little salt, if needed, then stir through the parsley just before ladling into bowls or hollowed-out crusty rolls.","z":"用冷水冲洗蛤蜊几次，然后沥干。将蛤蜊放入盛有 500 毫升水的大锅中。盖上锅盖，煮沸后小火煮2分钟，直到蛤蜊刚刚张开。将锅中的内容物倒入碗上方的漏勺中，以接住蛤蜊汤。当冷却到可以处理时，将蛤从壳中取出 - 如果需要，可以保留一把空壳以供展示。将蛤汤滤入壶中，将粗砂留在碗底。你应该有800毫升左右的库存。\r\n在同一个平底锅中加热黄油，然后将培根煎 3-4 分钟，直至其开始变成棕色。加入洋葱、百里香和月桂叶，轻轻煮 10 分钟，直至洋葱变软并呈金黄色。将面粉撒在面粉上，搅拌成沙糊状，再煮 2 分钟，然后逐渐加入蛤蜊高汤，然后加入牛奶和奶油。\r\n放入土豆，将所有东西煮沸，然后轻轻煮 10 分钟或直至土豆煮熟。用叉子在锅边压碎一些土豆块，以帮助变稠——不过，你仍然需要很多确定的土豆块。如果你已经沿着这条路走了，搅拌蛤肉和一些蛤壳，然后煮一分钟重新加热。如果需要的话，用大量黑胡椒和少许盐调味，然后搅拌欧芹，然后舀入碗或空心硬皮卷中。"},{"id":"52779","n":"Cream Cheese Tart","a":"United States","c":"Starter","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/wurrux1468416624.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UhQPwO4uymo","i":[["Flour","250g"],["Butter","125g"],["Egg","1"],["Salt","Pinch"],["Cheese","300g"],["Milk","100ml milk"],["Eggs","3"],["Parmesan Cheese","100g"],["Plum tomatoes","350g"],["White Vinegar","3tbsp"],["Honey","1 tbsp"],["Basil","Topping"]],"s":"Crust: make a dough from 250g flour (I like mixing different flours like plain and wholegrain spelt flour), 125g butter, 1 egg and a pinch of salt, press it into a tart form and place it in the fridge. Filling: stir 300g cream cheese and 100ml milk until smooth, add in 3 eggs, 100g grated parmesan cheese and season with salt, pepper and nutmeg. Take the crust out of the fridge and prick the bottom with a fork. Pour in the filling and bake at 175 degrees C for about 25 minutes. Cover the tart with some aluminium foil after half the time. In the mean time, slice about 350g mini tomatoes. In a small pan heat 3tbsp olive oil, 3tbsp white vinegar, 1 tbsp honey, salt and pepper and combine well. Pour over the tomato slices and mix well. With a spoon, place the tomato slices on the tart, avoiding too much liquid on it. Decorate with basil leaves and enjoy","z":"饼皮：用250克面粉（我喜欢混合不同的面粉，如普通面粉和全麦斯佩尔特小麦面粉）、125克黄油、1个鸡蛋和少许盐制成面团，将其压成馅饼形状，然后放入冰箱。馅料：将300克奶油芝士和100毫升牛奶搅拌至光滑，加入3个鸡蛋、100克磨碎的帕玛森芝士，用盐、胡椒和肉豆蔻调味。将外壳从冰箱中取出，用叉子在底部刺破。倒入馅料，以175摄氏度烘烤约25分钟。一半时间后用铝箔盖住馅饼。同时，将约350克迷你番茄切片。在小锅中加热 3 汤匙橄榄油、3 汤匙白醋、1 汤匙蜂蜜、盐和胡椒，搅拌均匀。倒在番茄片上，搅拌均匀。用勺子将番茄片放在馅饼上，避免上面沾上太多液体。用罗勒叶装饰即可享用"},{"id":"52996","n":"French Onion Chicken with Roasted Carrots & Mashed Potatoes","a":"United States","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/b5ft861583188991.jpg","y":"","i":[["Chicken Breasts","2"],["Carrots","12 ounces"],["Potatoes","5"],["Onion","1"],["Beef Stock","1"],["Mozzarella","1 1/2 cup"],["Sour Cream","2 tbsp"],["Butter",""],["Sugar",""],["Vegetable Oil",""],["Salt",""],["Pepper",""]],"s":"1\r\n\r\nPreheat oven to 425 degrees. Wash and dry all produce. Trim, peel, and cut carrots on a diagonal into ¼-inch-thick pieces. Dice potatoes into ½-inch pieces. Halve, peel, and thinly slice onion.\r\n\r\n2\r\n\r\nToss carrots on a baking sheet with a drizzle of oil, salt, and pepper. Roast until browned and tender, 15-20 minutes.\r\n\r\n3\r\n\r\nMeanwhile, place potatoes in a medium pot with enough salted water to cover by 2 inches. Bring to a boil and cook until tender, 12-15 minutes. Drain and return potatoes to pot; cover to keep warm.\r\n\r\n4\r\n\r\nWhile potatoes cook, heat a drizzle of oil in a large pan over medium-high heat. Add onion and cook, stirring occasionally, until lightly browned and softened, 8-10 minutes. Sprinkle with 1 tsp sugar (2 tsp for 4 servings). Stir in stock concentrate and 2 TBSP water (¼ cup for 4); season with salt and pepper. Cook until jammy, 2-3 minutes more. Turn off heat; transfer to a small bowl. Wash out pan.\r\n\r\n5\r\n\r\nPat chicken dry with paper towels; season all over with salt and pepper. Heat a drizzle of oil in pan used for onion over medium-high heat. Add chicken and cook until browned and cooked through, 5-6 minutes per side. In the last 1-2 minutes of cooking, top with caramelized onion and cheese. Cover pan until cheese melts. (If your pan doesn’t have a lid, cover with a baking sheet!)\r\n\r\n6\r\n\r\nHeat pot with drained potatoes over low heat; mash with sour cream, 2 TBSP butter (4 TBSP for 4 servings), salt, pepper, and a splash of water (or milk, for extra richness) until smooth. Divide chicken, roasted carrots, and mashed potatoes between plates.","z":"1\r\n\r\n将烤箱预热至425度。清洗并干燥所有产品。将胡萝卜修剪、去皮并沿对角线切成 1/4 英寸厚的块。将土豆切成 1/2 英寸的块。将洋葱切半、去皮并切成薄片。\r\n\r\n2\r\n\r\n将胡萝卜放在烤盘上，淋上油、盐和胡椒。烤 15-20 分钟，直至变成棕色并变软。\r\n\r\n3\r\n\r\n与此同时，将土豆放入一个中等大小的锅中，加入足够的盐水，淹没土豆2英寸。煮沸并煮12-15分钟直至变软。将土豆沥干并放回锅中；盖住以保暖。\r\n\r\n4\r\n\r\n煮土豆时，在大平底锅中用中高温加热毛毛雨。加入洋葱，煮 8-10 分钟，偶尔搅拌，直至洋葱变浅并变软。撒上 1 茶匙糖（4 人份 2 茶匙）。加入浓缩汤料和 2 汤匙水（4 人用 1/4 杯）；用盐和胡椒调味。再煮 2-3 分钟，直至出现果酱。关掉暖气；转移到一个小碗里。洗净锅。\r\n\r\n5\r\n\r\n用纸巾将鸡肉拍干；用盐和胡椒调味。在用于洋葱的锅中用中高温加热毛毛雨。加入鸡肉，煮至褐色并煮熟，每面 5-6 分钟。在烹饪的最后 1-2 分钟，在上面放上焦糖洋葱和奶酪。盖上锅盖直至奶酪融化。 （如果你的平底锅没有盖子，请盖上烤盘！）\r\n\r\n6\r\n\r\n用小火将沥干的土豆放入锅中加热；加入酸奶油、2 汤匙黄油（4 人份 4 汤匙）、盐、胡椒粉和少许水（或牛奶，以增加浓稠度），捣碎至光滑。将鸡肉、烤胡萝卜和土豆泥分装在盘子中。"},{"id":"52957","n":"Fruit and Cream Cheese Breakfast Pastries","a":"United States","c":"Breakfast","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/1543774956.jpg","y":"","i":[["Cream Cheese","1 1/4 oz"],["Sugar","1 1/4 cup"],["Vanilla Extract","1 teaspoon"],["Flour",""],["Puff Pastry","2"],["Strawberries",""],["Raspberries",""],["Blackberries",""]],"s":"Preheat oven to 400ºF (200ºC), and prepare two cookie sheets with parchment paper. In a bowl, mix cream cheese, sugar, and vanilla until fully combined. Lightly flour the surface and roll out puff pastry on top to flatten. Cut each sheet of puff pastry into 9 equal squares. On the top right and bottom left of the pastry, cut an L shape approximately ½ inch (1 cm) from the edge.\r\nNOTE: This L shape should reach all the way down and across the square, however both L shapes should not meet at the ends. Your pastry should look like a picture frame with two corners still intact.\r\nTake the upper right corner and fold down towards the inner bottom corner. You will now have a diamond shape.\r\nPlace 1 to 2 teaspoons of the cream cheese filling in the middle, then place berries on top.\r\nRepeat with the remaining pastry squares and place them onto the parchment covered baking sheet.\r\nBake for 15-20 minutes or until pastry is golden brown and puffed.\r\nEnjoy!\r\n","z":"将烤箱预热至 400°F (200°C)，并准备两张带有羊皮纸的饼干片。在一个碗中，混合奶油干酪、糖和香草精，直至完全混合。在表面撒上少许面粉，然后将酥皮放在上面擀平。将每张酥皮切成 9 个相等的正方形。在糕点的右上角和左下角，从边缘切出约 1/2 英寸（1 厘米）的 L 形。\r\n注意：这个 L 形应该一直向下并穿过正方形，但是两个 L 形不应在末端相交。你的糕点应该看起来像一个相框，两个角仍然完好无损。\r\n抓住右上角并向内底角折叠。您现在将拥有菱形形状。\r\n将 1 到 2 茶匙奶油干酪馅料放在中间，然后将浆果放在上面。\r\n对剩余的糕点方块重复上述步骤，并将它们放在铺有羊皮纸的烤盘上。\r\n烘烤 15-20 分钟或直至糕点呈金黄色并膨化。\r\n享受！"},{"id":"52829","n":"Grilled Mac and Cheese Sandwich","a":"United States","c":"Pasta","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/xutquv1505330523.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PYq31xLj-DY","i":[["Macaroni","8 ounces (230 grams)"],["Plain Flour","1/3 cup"],["Mustard Powder","3/4 teaspoon"],["Garlic powder","1/2 teaspoon"],["Kosher salt","1/2 teaspoon"],["Black pepper","1/2 teaspoon"],["Cayenne pepper","1/8 teaspoon"],["Butter","6 tablespoons (85 grams)"],["Whole Milk","1 1/2 cups (360 milliliters)"],["Heavy Cream","1 cup (240 milliliters)"],["Monterey Jack Cheese","1 pound (455 grams)"],["Butter","4 tablespoons (55 grams)"],["garlic powder","1 teaspoon"],["Bread","16 slices square"],["Cheddar Cheese","8 slices mild"],["Colby Jack Cheese","8 slices"],["Butter","4 tablespoons (55 grams)"]],"s":"Make the mac and cheese\r\n\r\n1. Bring a medium saucepan of generously salted water (you want it to taste like seawater) to a boil. Add the pasta and cook, stirring occasionally, until al dente, 8 to 10 minutes, or according to the package directions. The pasta should be tender but still chewy.\r\n2. While the pasta is cooking, in a small bowl, whisk together the flour, mustard powder, garlic powder, salt, black pepper, and cayenne pepper.\r\n3. Drain the pasta in a colander. Place the empty pasta pan (no need to wash it) over low heat and add the butter. When the butter has melted, whisk in the flour mixture and continue to cook, whisking frequently, until the mixture is beginning to brown and has a pleasant, nutty aroma, about 1 minute. Watch carefully so it does not scorch on the bottom of the pan.\r\n4. Slowly whisk the milk and cream into the flour mixture until everything is really well combined. Cook, whisking constantly, until the sauce is heated through and just begins to thicken, about 2 minutes. Remove from the heat. Gradually add the cheese while stirring constantly with a wooden spoon or silicone spatula and keep stirring until the cheese has melted into the sauce. Then stir in the drained cooked pasta.\r\n5. Line a 9-by-13-inch (23-by-33-centimeter) rimmed baking sheet with parchment paper or aluminum foil. Coat the paper or foil with nonstick cooking spray or slick it with butter. Pour the warm mac and cheese onto the prepared baking sheet and spread it evenly with a spatula. Coat another piece of parchment paper with cooking spray or butter and place it, oiled or buttered side down, directly on the surface of the mac and cheese. Refrigerate until cool and firm, about 1 hour.\r\n\r\nMake the grilled cheese\r\n6. Heat a large cast-iron or nonstick skillet over medium-low heat.\r\n7. In a small bowl, stir together the 4 tablespoons (55 grams) butter and garlic powder until well blended.\r\n8. Remove the mac and cheese from the refrigerator and peel off the top layer of parchment paper. Carefully cut into 8 equal pieces. Each piece will make 1 grilled mac and cheese sandwich. (You can stash each individual portion in a double layer of resealable plastic bags and refrigerate for up to 3 days or freeze it for up to 1 month.)\r\n9. Spread 3/4 teaspoon garlic butter on one side of each bread slice. Place half of the slices, buttered-side down, on a clean cutting board. Top each with one slice of Cheddar, then 1 piece of the mac and cheese. (Transfer from the baking sheet by scooting your hand or a spatula under each piece of mac and cheese and then flipping it over onto a sandwich.) Place 1 slice of Jack on top of each. Finish with the remaining bread slices, buttered-side up.\r\n10. Using a wide spatula, place as many sandwiches in the pan as will fit without crowding it. Cover and cook until the bottoms are nicely browned, about 4 minutes. Turn and cook until the second sides are browned, the cheese is melted, and the mac and cheese is heated through, about 4 minutes more.\r\n11. Repeat with the remaining ingredients. Cut the sandwiches in half, if desired, and serve.","z":"做通心粉和奶酪\r\n\r\n1. 将一个中等大小的平底锅倒入大量盐水（你想让它尝起来像海水），将其煮沸。加入意大利面，煮 8 到 10 分钟，偶尔搅拌，直到有嚼劲，或按照包装说明煮。意大利面应该嫩但仍有嚼劲。\r\n2. 煮意大利面时，在一个小碗中，将面粉、芥末粉、大蒜粉、盐、黑胡椒和辣椒搅拌在一起。\r\n3. 将意大利面放入滤锅中沥干。将空的意大利面锅（无需清洗）放在小火上，加入黄油。黄油融化后，加入面粉混合物，继续煮，经常搅拌，直到混合物开始变成棕色，并散发出令人愉悦的坚果香味，大约需要 1 分钟。仔细观察，以免锅底烧焦。\r\n4.慢慢地将牛奶和奶油搅拌到面粉混合物中，直到所有东西都充分混合。不断搅拌，直到酱汁加热并开始变稠，大约需要 2 分钟。从火上移开。逐渐加入奶酪，同时用木勺或硅胶抹刀不断搅拌，不断搅拌直至奶酪融化到酱汁中。然后加入沥干的煮熟的意大利面。\r\n5. 在 9 x 13 英寸（23 x 33 厘米）的有边烤盘上铺上羊皮纸或铝箔。在纸或箔纸上涂上不粘烹饪喷雾或涂上黄油。将温热的通心粉和奶酪倒在准备好的烤盘上，用抹刀均匀涂抹。在另一张羊皮纸上涂上烹饪喷雾或黄油，然后将其涂油或涂黄油的一面朝下，直接放在通心粉和奶酪的表面上。冷藏约1小时，直至冷却并变硬。\r\n\r\n制作烤奶酪\r\n6. 用中低火加热一个大铸铁或不粘锅。\r\n7. 在一个小碗中，将 4 汤匙（55 克）黄油和大蒜粉搅拌均匀。\r\n8. 从冰箱中取出通心粉和奶酪，撕掉最上面一层羊皮纸。小心地切成8等份。每块可制作 1 个烤通心粉和奶酪三明治。 （您可以将每个单独的部分存放在双层可重新密封的塑料袋中，并冷藏最多 3 天或冷冻最多 1 个月。）\r\n9. 在每个面包片的一侧涂上 3/4 茶匙大蒜黄油。将一半切片，涂黄油的一面朝下，放在干净的切菜板上。在每个上面放一片切达干酪，然后放一块通心粉和奶酪。 （将手或抹刀放在每块通心粉和奶酪下面，然后将其翻转到三明治上，将其从烤盘上转移出来。）在每块奶酪上放 1 片杰克。最后把剩下的面包片涂上黄油，面朝上。\r\n10. 使用宽抹刀，将尽可能多的三明治放入锅中，但不要拥挤。盖上锅盖，煮约 4 分钟，直到底部变成漂亮的棕色。翻转并煮至第二面变成棕色，奶酪融化，通心粉和奶酪加热透，再煮约 4 分钟。\r\n11. 对其余成分重复上述步骤。如果需要，将三明治切成两半即可食用。"},{"id":"52993","n":"Honey Balsamic Chicken with Crispy Broccoli & Potatoes","a":"United States","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/kvbotn1581012881.jpg","y":"","i":[["Potatoes","5"],["Broccoli","1"],["Garlic","2 cloves"],["Chicken Breast","2"],["Balsamic Vinegar",""],["Honey",""],["Chicken Stock",""],["Butter","1 tbsp"],["Vegetable Oil","1 tbsp"],["Olive Oil","1 tbsp"]],"s":"2 Servings\r\n\r\n1. Preheat oven to 425 degrees. Wash and dry all produce. Cut potatoes into 1/2-inch-thick wedges. Toss on one side of a baking sheet with a drizzle of oil, salt, and pepper. (For 4 servings, spread potatoes out across entire sheet.) Roast on top rack for 5 minutes (we'll add the broccoli then). \r\n\r\n2. Meanwhile, cut broccoli florets into bite-size pieces, if necessary. Peel and finely chop garlic. In a small microwave-safe bowl, combine 1 TBSP olive oil (2 TBSP for 4 servings) and half the garlic. Microwave until garlic sizzles, 30 seconds. \r\n\r\n3. Once potatoes have roasted 5 minutes, remove sheet from oven and add broccoli to empty side; carefully toss with garlic oil, salt, and pepper. (For 4 servings, add broccoli to a second sheet.) Continue roasting until potatoes and broccoli are browned and crispy, 15-20 minutes more. \r\n\r\n4. While veggies roast, pat chicken dry with paper towels; season all over with salt and pepper. Heat a drizzle of oil in a large pan over medium-high heat. Add chicken and cook until browned and cooked through, 5-6 minutes per side. (If chicken browns too quickly, reduce heat to medium.) Turn off heat; set chicken aside to rest. Wash out pan. \r\n\r\n5. Heat pan used for chicken over medium-high heat. Add a drizzle of oil and remaining garlic; cook until fragrant, 30 seconds. Stir in vinegar, honey, stock concentrate, and 1/4 cup water (1/3 cup for 4 servings). Simmer until thick and glossy, 2-3 minutes. Remove from heat and stir in 1 TBSP butter (2 TBSP for 4). Season with salt and pepper. \r\n\r\n6. Return chicken to pan and turn to coat in glaze. Divide chicken, broccoli, and potatoes between plates. Spoon any remaining glaze over chicken and serve. ","z":"2 份\r\n\r\n1. 将烤箱预热至425度。清洗并干燥所有产品。将土豆切成 1/2 英寸厚的楔形。在烤盘的一侧撒上少许油、盐和胡椒。 （如果是 4 份，请将土豆铺在整张纸上。）在顶架上烤 5 分钟（然后加入西兰花）。 \r\n\r\n2. 同时，如有必要，将西兰花小朵切成一口大小的块。大蒜去皮并切碎。在一个可用于微波炉的小碗中，混合 1 汤匙橄榄油（4 人份 2 汤匙）和一半大蒜。用微波炉加热 30 秒，直至大蒜发出嘶嘶声。 \r\n\r\n3.土豆烤5分钟后，从烤箱中取出烤盘，将西兰花放入空的一侧；小心地加入大蒜油、盐和胡椒粉。 （如果是 4 份，请将西兰花放入第二片中。）继续烘烤 15-20 分钟，直至土豆和西兰花变成棕色且酥脆。 \r\n\r\n4. 烤蔬菜时，用纸巾拍干鸡肉；用盐和胡椒调味。在大平底锅中用中高火加热毛毛雨。加入鸡肉，煮至褐色并煮熟，每面 5-6 分钟。 （如果鸡肉变褐色太快，请将火调至中火。）关掉火；将鸡肉放在一边休息。洗净锅。 \r\n\r\n5. 用中高火加热鸡肉用的平底锅。加入少许油和剩余的大蒜；煮30秒直至香味四溢。加入醋、蜂蜜、浓缩高汤和 1/4 杯水（4 份量为 1/3 杯）。煮2-3分钟，直至浓稠且有光泽。离火并加入 1 汤匙黄油（4 人份 2 汤匙）搅拌。用盐和胡椒调味。 \r\n\r\n6. 将鸡肉放回锅中，然后涂上釉料。将鸡肉、西兰花和土豆分装在盘子中。将剩余的釉料舀到鸡肉上即可食用。"},{"id":"52787","n":"Hot Chocolate Fudge","a":"United States","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/xrysxr1483568462.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oJvbsVSblfk","i":[["Chocolate Chips","2 cups"],["Heavy Cream","2 tbs"],["Condensed Milk","1 – 14-ounce can"],["Vanilla Extract","1 tsp"],["White Chocolate Chips","1-⅓ cups"],["Miniature Marshmallows","1-½ cups"]],"s":"Line an 8-inch-square baking pan with wax paper or foil, and coat with non-stick spray.\r\nIn a microwave-safe bowl, combine the dark chocolate chips, heavy cream and half of the sweetened condensed milk. Microwave the dark chocolate mixture in 20-second intervals, stirring in between each interval, until the chocolate is melted.\r\nAdd the vanilla extract to the dark chocolate mixture and stir well until smooth.\r\nTransfer the dark chocolate mixture into the prepared pan and spread into an even layer.\r\nIn a separate bowl, combine the white chocolate chips with the remaining half of the sweetened condensed milk. Microwave the white chocolate mixture in 20-second intervals, stirring in between each interval, until the chocolate is melted.\r\nEvenly spread the white chocolate mixture on top of dark chocolate layer.\r\nTop the chocolate layers with the Mallow Bits or miniature marshmallows, and gently press them down.\r\nRefrigerate for 4 hours, or until set.\r\nRemove the fudge and wax paper from the pan. Carefully peel all of the wax paper from the fudge.\r\nCut the fudge into bite-sized pieces and serve.","z":"在 8 英寸见方的烤盘上铺上蜡纸或箔纸，并涂上不粘喷雾。\r\n在一个可用于微波炉的碗中，将黑巧克力片、浓奶油和一半甜炼乳混合。以 20 秒的间隔将黑巧克力混合物放入微波炉加热，每次间隔之间搅拌，直至巧克力融化。\r\n将香草精加入黑巧克力混合物中，搅拌均匀直至光滑。\r\n将黑巧克力混合物转移到准备好的平底锅中并铺成均匀的层。\r\n在另一个碗中，将白巧克力片与剩余的一半甜炼乳混合。以 20 秒的间隔将白巧克力混合物放入微波炉中加热，在每次间隔之间搅拌，直至巧克力融化。\r\n将白巧克力混合物均匀地铺在黑巧克力层上。\r\n在巧克力层上放上锦葵块或微型棉花糖，然后轻轻地按下它们。\r\n冷藏 4 小时，或直至凝固。\r\n从锅中取出软糖和蜡纸。小心地剥掉软糖上的所有蜡纸。\r\n将软糖切成一口大小的块即可食用。"},{"id":"52813","n":"Kentucky Fried Chicken","a":"United States","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/40r49m1763197022.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PTUxCvCz8Bc","i":[["Chicken","1 whole"],["Oil","2 quarts neutral frying"],["Egg White","1"],["Flour","1 1/2 cups"],["Brown Sugar","1 tablespoon"],["Salt","1 tablespoon"],["paprika","1 tablespoon"],["onion salt","2 teaspoons"],["chili powder","1 teaspoon"],["black pepper","1 teaspoon"],["celery salt","1/2 teaspoon"],["sage","1/2 teaspoon"],["garlic powder","1/2 teaspoon"],["allspice","1/2 teaspoon"],["oregano","1/2 teaspoon"],["basil","1/2 teaspoon"],["marjoram","1/2 teaspoon"]],"s":"Preheat fryer to 350°F. Thoroughly mix together all the spice mix ingredients.\r\nCombine spice mix with flour, brown sugar and salt.\r\nDip chicken pieces in egg white to lightly coat them, then transfer to flour mixture. Turn a few times and make sure the flour mix is really stuck to the chicken. Repeat with all the chicken pieces.\r\nLet chicken pieces rest for 5 minutes so crust has a chance to dry a bit.\r\nFry chicken in batches. Breasts and wings should take 12-14 minutes, and legs and thighs will need a few more minutes. Chicken pieces are done when a meat thermometer inserted into the thickest part reads 165°F.\r\nLet chicken drain on a few paper towels when it comes out of the fryer. Serve hot.","z":"将炸锅预热至 350°F。将所有香料混合成分彻底混合在一起。\r\n将香料与面粉、红糖和盐混合。\r\n将鸡块浸入蛋清中，轻轻裹上一层，然后转移到面粉混合物中。转动几次，确保面粉混合物真正粘在鸡肉上。对所有鸡块重复上述步骤。\r\n让鸡块静置 5 分钟，以便外皮有机会稍微干燥。\r\n分批炒鸡肉。胸部和翅膀需要 12-14 分钟，腿和大腿则需要几分钟。当插入最厚部分的肉类温度计读数为 165°F 时，鸡块就熟了。\r\n当鸡肉从油炸锅中出来时，让鸡肉在几张纸巾上沥干。趁热食用。"},{"id":"52859","n":"Key Lime Pie","a":"United States","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/qpqtuu1511386216.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=q4Rz7tUkX9A","i":[["Digestive Biscuits","300g"],["Butter","150g"],["Condensed Milk","400g"],["Egg Yolks","3"],["Lime","4"],["Double Cream","300ml"],["Icing Sugar","1 tbls"],["Lime","to serve"]],"s":"Heat the oven to 160C/fan 140C/gas 3. Whizz the biscuits to crumbs in a food processor (or put in a strong plastic bag and bash with a rolling pin). Mix with the melted butter and press into the base and up the sides of a 22cm loose-based tart tin. Bake in the oven for 10 minutes. Remove and cool.\r\nPut the egg yolks in a large bowl and whisk for a minute with electric beaters. Add the condensed milk and whisk for 3 minutes then add the zest and juice and whisk again for 3 minutes. Pour the filling into the cooled base then put back in the oven for 15 minutes. Cool then chill for at least 3 hours or overnight if you like.\r\nWhen you are ready to serve, carefully remove the pie from the tin and put on a serving plate. To decorate, softly whip together the cream and icing sugar. Dollop or pipe the cream onto the top of the pie and finish with extra lime zest.","z":"将烤箱加热至 160C/风扇 140C/煤气 3. 将饼干放入食品加工机中搅拌成面包屑（或放入坚固的塑料袋中，然后用擀面杖敲打）。与融化的黄油混合，压入 22 厘米松底挞罐的底部和两侧。在烤箱中烘烤 10 分钟。取出并冷却。\r\n将蛋黄放入一个大碗中，用电动搅拌器搅拌一分钟。加入炼乳，搅拌 3 分钟，然后加入热情和果汁，再次搅拌 3 分钟。将馅料倒入冷却的底座中，然后放回烤箱中烘烤 15 分钟。冷却后冷藏至少 3 小时或过夜（如果您愿意）。\r\n当您准备好上菜时，小心地将馅饼从罐中取出并放在盘子上。装饰时，将奶油和糖粉轻轻搅打在一起。将奶油涂抹或挤在馅饼的顶部，最后撒上额外的酸橙皮。"},{"id":"53015","n":"Krispy Kreme Donut","a":"United States","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/4i5cnx1587672171.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SamYg6IUGOI","i":[["Yeast","1/4 ounce"],["Water","1/4 cup"],["Water","1 1/2 cups"],["Sugar","1/2 cup"],["Salt","1 tsp"],["Eggs","2"],["Shortening","1/3 cup"],["Flour","5 drops"],["Canola Oil","Sprinking"],["Milk","1/2 cup"],["Sugar","2 cups"],["Vanilla","1 1/2 cups"],["Boiling Water","6 tablespoons"],["Butter","1/3 cup"]],"s":"Dissolve yeast in warm water in 2 1/2-quart bowl. Add milk, sugar, salt, eggs, shortening and 2 cups flour. Beat on low for 30 seconds, scraping bowl constantly. Beat on medium speed for 2 minutes, scraping bowl occasionally. Stir in remaining flour until smooth. Cover and let rise until double, 50-60 minutes. (Dough is ready when indentation remains when touched.) Turn dough onto floured surface; roll around lightly to coat with flour. Gently roll dough 1/2-inch thick with floured rolling pin. Cut with floured doughnut cutter. Cover and let rise until double, 30-40 minutes.\r\nHeat vegetable oil in deep fryer to 350°. Slide doughnuts into hot oil with wide spatula. Turn doughnuts as they rise to the surface. Fry until golden brown, about 1 minute on each side. Remove carefully from oil (do not prick surface); drain. Dip the doughnuts into creamy glaze set on rack.\r\n\r\n\r\nGlaze: \r\nHeat butter until melted. Remove from heat. Stir in powdered sugar and vanilla until smooth. Stir in water, 1 tablespoon at a time, until desired consistency.","z":"将酵母溶解在 2 1/2 夸脱碗中的温水中。添加牛奶、糖、盐、鸡蛋、起酥油和 2 杯面粉。低速搅拌 30 秒，不断刮擦碗。中速搅拌 2 分钟，偶尔刮擦碗。加入剩余的面粉搅拌至光滑。盖上盖子，醒发至两倍大，即 50-60 分钟。 （当触摸时留下凹痕时，面团就准备好了。）将面团放在撒了面粉的表面上；轻轻地滚动一下，涂上面粉。用撒了面粉的擀面杖轻轻地将面团擀成 1/2 英寸厚。用撒了面粉的甜甜圈刀切。盖上盖子，发酵 30-40 分钟，直至两倍大。\r\n将油炸锅中的植物油加热至 350°。用宽抹刀将甜甜圈滑入热油中。当甜甜圈浮出水面时转动它们。煎至金黄色，每面煎约 1 分钟。小心地除去油污（不要刺破表面）；流走。将甜甜圈浸入架子上的奶油釉中。\r\n\r\n\r\n釉色： \r\n将黄油加热直至融化。从火上移开。加入糖粉和香草精搅拌至光滑。加入水，一次一汤匙，搅拌直至达到所需的稠度。"},{"id":"52987","n":"Lasagna Sandwiches","a":"United States","c":"Pasta","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/xr0n4r1576788363.jpg","y":"","i":[["Sour Cream","1/4 cup"],["Chopped Onion","2 tbs"],["Dried Oregano","1/2 tbs"],["Salt","1/4 tsp"],["Bread","8 slices"],["Bacon","8 slices"],["Tomato","8 slices"],["Mozzarella","4 slices"],["Butter","2 1/2 Tbs"]],"s":"1. In a small bowl, combine the first four ingredients; spread on four slices of bread. Layer with bacon, tomato and cheese; top with remaining bread.\r\n\r\n2. In a large skillet or griddle, melt 2 tablespoons butter. Toast sandwiches until lightly browned on both sides and cheese is melted, adding butter if necessary.\r\n\r\nNutrition Facts\r\n1 sandwich: 445 calories, 24g fat (12g saturated fat), 66mg cholesterol, 1094mg sodium, 35g carbohydrate (3g sugars, 2g fiber), 21g protein.","z":"1. 在一个小碗中，将前四种成分混合；涂在四片面包上。铺上培根、番茄和奶酪；上面放上剩下的面包。\r\n\r\n2. 在一个大煎锅或煎锅中，融化 2 汤匙黄油。将三明治烤至两面浅棕色且奶酪融化，必要时添加黄油。\r\n\r\n营养成分\r\n1个三明治：445卡路里，24克脂肪（12克饱和脂肪），66毫克胆固醇，1094毫克钠，35克碳水化合物（3克糖，2克纤维），21克蛋白质。"},{"id":"52858","n":"New York cheesecake","a":"United States","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/swttys1511385853.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tspdJ6hxqnc","i":[["Butter","85g"],["Sour Cream","140g"],["Sugar","1tbsp"],["Cream Cheese","900g"],["Caster Sugar","250g"],["Plain Flour","3 tbs"],["Lemon Juice","1 ½ teaspoons"],["Eggs","3 Large"],["Sour Cream","250ml"],["Sour Cream","150ml"],["Caster Sugar","1 tbsp"],["Lemon Juice","2 tsp"]],"s":"Position an oven shelf in the middle of the oven. Preheat the oven to fan 160C/conventional 180C/gas 4. Line the base of a 23cm springform cake tin with parchment paper. For the crust, melt the butter in a medium pan. Stir in the biscuit crumbs and sugar so the mixture is evenly moistened. Press the mixture into the bottom of the pan and bake for 10 minutes. Cool on a wire rack while preparing the filling.\r\nFor the filling, increase the oven temperature to fan 200C/conventional 240C/gas 9. In a table top mixer fitted with the paddle attachment, beat the soft cheese at medium-low speed until creamy, about 2 minutes. With the mixer on low, gradually add the sugar, then the flour and a pinch of salt, scraping down the sides of the bowl and the paddle twice.\r\nSwap the paddle attachment for the whisk. Continue by adding the vanilla, lemon zest and juice. Whisk in the eggs and yolk, one at a time, scraping the bowl and whisk at least twice. Stir the 284ml carton of soured cream until smooth, then measure 200ml/7fl oz (just over 3⁄4 of the carton). Continue on low speed as you add the measured soured cream (reserve the rest). Whisk to blend, but don't over-beat. The batter should be smooth, light and somewhat airy.\r\nBrush the sides of the springform tin with melted butter and put on a baking sheet. Pour in the filling - if there are any lumps, sink them using a knife - the top should be as smooth as possible. Bake for 10 minutes. Reduce oven temperature to fan 90C/conventional 110C/gas 1⁄4 and bake for 25 minutes more. If you gently shake the tin, the filling should have a slight wobble. Turn off the oven and open the oven door for a cheesecake that's creamy in the centre, or leave it closed if you prefer a drier texture. Let cool in the oven for 2 hours. The cheesecake may get a slight crack on top as it cools.\r\nCombine the reserved soured cream with the 142ml carton, the sugar and lemon juice for the topping. Spread over the cheesecake right to the edges. Cover loosely with foil and refrigerate for at least 8 hours or overnight.\r\nRun a round-bladed knife around the sides of the tin to loosen any stuck edges. Unlock the side, slide the cheesecake off the bottom of the tin onto a plate, then slide the parchment paper out from underneath.","z":"将烤箱架放在烤箱中间。将烤箱预热至 160C/传统 180C/燃气 ​​4. 在 23 厘米弹簧蛋糕罐的底部铺上羊皮纸。对于外壳，将黄油在中型平底锅中融化。加入饼干屑和糖，使混合物均匀湿润。将混合物压入锅底，烘烤 10 分钟。准备馅料时，在金属架上冷却。\r\n对于馅料，将烤箱温度提高到风扇 200C/常规 240C/气体 9. 在配有桨叶附件的台式搅拌机中，以中低速搅拌软奶酪，直至呈奶油状，大约 2 分钟。将搅拌机调低，逐渐加入糖，然后加入面粉和少许盐，将碗和桨的侧面刮两次。\r\n将桨附件换成搅拌器。继续加入香草精、柠檬皮碎和果汁。加入鸡蛋和蛋黄，一次一个，刮擦碗并搅拌至少两次。将 284 毫升纸盒酸奶油搅拌至光滑，然后量出 200 毫升/7 液量盎司（刚好超过纸盒的 3⁄4）。继续低速添加量好的酸奶油（保留其余的）。搅拌混合，但不要过度搅拌。面糊应该光滑、轻盈、有点透气。\r\n在弹簧模的两侧刷上融化的黄油，然后放在烤盘上。倒入馅料 - 如果有任何结块，用刀将其沉入 - 顶部应尽可能光滑。烤10分钟。将烤箱温度降低至风扇 90C/传统 110C/气体 1⁄4，然后再烘烤 25 分钟。如果轻轻摇动罐子，馅料应该会轻微晃动。关闭烤箱并打开烤箱门，制作中间呈奶油状的芝士蛋糕，或者如果您喜欢干燥的质地，则将其关闭。放入烤箱冷却 2 小时。芝士蛋糕冷却时顶部可能会出现轻微裂纹。\r\n将保留的酸奶油与 142 毫升纸盒、糖和柠檬汁混合作为配料。铺在芝士蛋糕上，一直到边缘。用箔纸松松地覆盖并冷藏至少 8 小时或过夜。\r\n用圆刃刀在罐子的两侧划一圈，以松开卡住的边缘。打开侧面，将芝士蛋糕从罐子底部滑到盘子上，然后从下面滑出羊皮纸。"},{"id":"52854","n":"Pancakes","a":"United States","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/rwuyqx1511383174.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LWuuCndtJr0","i":[["Flour","100g"],["Eggs","2 large"],["Milk","300ml"],["Sunflower Oil","1 tbls"],["Sugar","to serve"],["Raspberries","to serve"],["Blueberries","to serve"]],"s":"Put the flour, eggs, milk, 1 tbsp oil and a pinch of salt into a bowl or large jug, then whisk to a smooth batter. Set aside for 30 mins to rest if you have time, or start cooking straight away.\r\nSet a medium frying pan or crêpe pan over a medium heat and carefully wipe it with some oiled kitchen paper. When hot, cook your pancakes for 1 min on each side until golden, keeping them warm in a low oven as you go.\r\nServe with lemon wedges and sugar, or your favourite filling. Once cold, you can layer the pancakes between baking parchment, then wrap in cling film and freeze for up to 2 months.","z":"将面粉、鸡蛋、牛奶、1 汤匙油和少许盐放入碗或大壶中，然后搅拌成光滑的面糊。如果有时间，请留出 30 分钟休息，或者立即开始烹饪。\r\n将中型煎锅或薄饼锅放在中火上，然后用一些涂油的厨房纸小心地擦拭。热时，将薄煎饼每面煎 1 分钟直至呈金黄色，边煮边在低烤箱中保持温暖。\r\n与柠檬片和糖或您最喜欢的馅料一起食用。冷却后，您可以将煎饼铺在烘焙羊皮纸之间，然后用保鲜膜包裹并冷冻最多 2 个月。"},{"id":"52862","n":"Peach & Blueberry Grunt","a":"United States","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/ssxvup1511387476.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SNeO28BCpsc","i":[["Corn Flour","1 tsp"],["Orange","Juice of 2"],["Orange","Zest of 1"],["Caster Sugar","2 tbs"],["Peaches","6"],["Blueberries","250g"],["Self-raising Flour","200g"],["Butter","50g"],["Muscovado Sugar","100g"],["Cinnamon","1 tsp"],["Milk","6 tblsp"]],"s":"Heat oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. Butter a wide shallow ovenproof dish. Blend the cornflour with the orange zest and juice, and put in a large pan with the sugar. Halve, stone and slice the peaches and add to the pan. Bring slowly to the boil, stirring gently until the sauce is shiny and thickened, about 3-4 mins. Remove from the heat, stir in the blueberries and tip into the prepared dish.\r\nTip the flour into a mixing bowl and add the 50g butter. Rub the butter into the flour until it resembles fine breadcrumbs, then stir in half the sugar. Mix the remaining sugar with the cinnamon and set aside.\r\nAdd the milk to the dry ingredients and mix to a soft dough. Turn out onto a lightly floured surface and knead briefly. Roll out to an oblong roughly 16 x 24cm. Brush with melted butter and sprinkle evenly with the spicy sugar. Roll up from one long side and cut into 12 slices. Arrange around the top of the dish, leaving the centre uncovered.\r\nBake for 20-25 mins, until the topping is crisp and golden. Serve warm.","z":"将烤箱加热至 190C/170C 风扇/燃气 5. 在宽浅耐热盘上涂黄油。将玉米粉与橙皮和果汁混合，然后与糖一起放入大锅中。将桃子切半、去核并切片，然后放入锅中。慢慢煮沸，轻轻搅拌，直到酱汁发亮且变稠，大约需要 3-4 分钟。从火上移开，拌入蓝莓，然后倒入准备好的盘子中。\r\n将面粉倒入搅拌碗中，加入 50 克黄油。将黄油揉入面粉中，直至其像细面包屑一样，然后加入一半糖搅拌。将剩余的糖与肉桂混合并放在一边。\r\n将牛奶加入干原料中，搅拌成柔软的面团。将其放在撒有少许面粉的表面上并短暂揉捏。擀成约 16 x 24 厘米的长方形。刷上融化的黄油，均匀地撒上辣糖。从一长边卷起，切成12片。围绕盘子的顶部排列，使中心不被覆盖。\r\n烘烤 20-25 分钟，直至配料变脆呈金黄色。趁热食用。"},{"id":"52861","n":"Peanut Butter Cheesecake","a":"United States","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/qtuuys1511387068.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QSTsturcyL0","i":[["Butter","50g"],["Peanut Cookies","175g"],["Gelatine Leafs","5"],["Ricotta","500g"],["Peanut Butter","175g"],["Golden Syrup","175g"],["Milk","150ml"],["Double Cream","275ml"],["Light Brown Soft Sugar","2 tblsp"],["Peanut Brittle","Crushed"]],"s":"Oil and line a 20cm round loose- bottomed cake tin with cling film, making it as smooth as possible. Melt the butter in a pan. Crush the biscuits by bashing them in a bag with a rolling pin, then stir them into the butter until very well coated. Press the mixture firmly into the base of the tin and chill.\r\nSoak the gelatine in water while you make the filling. Tip the ricotta into a bowl, then beat in the peanut butter and syrup. Ricotta has a slightly grainy texture so blitz until smooth with a stick blender for a smoother texture if you prefer.\r\nTake the soaked gelatine from the water and squeeze dry. Put it into a pan with the milk and heat very gently until the gelatine dissolves. Beat into the peanut mixture, then tip onto the biscuit base. Chill until set.\r\nTo freeze, leave in the tin and as soon as it is solid, cover the surface with cling film, then wrap the tin with cling film and foil.\r\nTo defrost, thaw in the fridge overnight.\r\nTo serve, carefully remove from the tin. Whisk the cream with the sugar until it holds its shape, then spread on top of the cheesecake and scatter with the peanut brittle.","z":"20厘米圆形活底蛋糕模上涂油并铺上保鲜膜，使其尽可能光滑。在锅中融化黄油。将饼干放入袋子中，用擀面杖敲碎，然后将其搅拌到黄油中，直至充分涂上黄油。将混合物用力压入罐底并冷却。\r\n制作馅料时，将明胶浸泡在水中。将乳清干酪放入碗中，然后加入花生酱和糖浆。乳清干酪具有轻微颗粒状的质地，因此如果您愿意，可以用棒式搅拌机搅拌至光滑，以获得更光滑的质地。\r\n将泡软的吉利丁片从水中取出，挤干水分。将其放入装有牛奶的平底锅中，轻轻加热直至明胶溶解。拌入花生混合物，然后倒在饼干底上。冷却直至凝固。\r\n要冷冻，请将其放入罐中，一旦凝固，用保鲜膜覆盖表面，然后用保鲜膜和箔纸包裹罐。\r\n要解冻，请在冰箱中解冻过夜。\r\n食用时，小心地从罐子中取出。将奶油和糖搅拌至定型，然后铺在芝士蛋糕上，撒上花生糖。"},{"id":"52958","n":"Peanut Butter Cookies","a":"United States","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/1544384070.jpg","y":"","i":[["Peanut Butter","1 cup"],["Sugar","1/2 cup"],["Egg","1"]],"s":"Preheat oven to 350ºF (180ºC).\r\nIn a large bowl, mix together the peanut butter, sugar, and egg.\r\nScoop out a spoonful of dough and roll it into a ball. Place the cookie balls onto a nonstick baking sheet.\r\nFor extra decoration and to make them cook more evenly, flatten the cookie balls by pressing a fork down on top of them, then press it down again at a 90º angle to make a criss-cross pattern.\r\nBake for 8-10 minutes or until the bottom of the cookies are golden brown.\r\nRemove from baking sheet and cool.\r\nEnjoy!","z":"将烤箱预热至 350°F (180°C)。\r\n在一个大碗中，将花生酱、糖和鸡蛋混合在一起。\r\n舀出一勺面团，将其搓成球状。将饼干球放在不粘烤盘上。\r\n为了获得额外的装饰并让它们烹饪得更均匀，用叉子在饼干球顶部压平饼干球，然后以 90 度角再次按下以形成十字形图案。\r\n烘烤 8-10 分钟或直至饼干底部呈金黄色。\r\n从烤盘中取出并冷却。\r\n享受！"},{"id":"52857","n":"Pumpkin Pie","a":"United States","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/usuqtp1511385394.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hpapqEeb36k","i":[["Pumpkin","750g"],["Shortcrust Pastry","350g"],["Plain Flour","Dusting"],["Caster Sugar","140g"],["Salt","½ tsp"],["Nutmeg","½ tsp"],["Cinnamon","1 tsp"],["Eggs","2 Beaten"],["Butter","25g"],["Milk","175g"],["Icing Sugar","1 tblsp"]],"s":"Place the pumpkin in a large saucepan, cover with water and bring to the boil. Cover with a lid and simmer for 15 mins or until tender. Drain pumpkin; let cool.\r\nHeat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Roll out the pastry on a lightly floured surface and use it to line a 22cm loose-bottomed tart tin. Chill for 15 mins. Line the pastry with baking parchment and baking beans, then bake for 15 mins. Remove the beans and paper, and cook for a further 10 mins until the base is pale golden and biscuity. Remove from the oven and allow to cool slightly.\r\nIncrease oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Push the cooled pumpkin through a sieve into a large bowl. In a separate bowl, combine the sugar, salt, nutmeg and half the cinnamon. Mix in the beaten eggs, melted butter and milk, then add to the pumpkin purée and stir to combine. Pour into the tart shell and cook for 10 mins, then reduce the temperature to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Continue to bake for 35-40 mins until the filling has just set.\r\nLeave to cool, then remove the pie from the tin. Mix the remaining cinnamon with the icing sugar and dust over the pie. Serve chilled.","z":"将南瓜放入大锅中，加水盖过南瓜，煮沸。盖上盖子，煮 15 分钟或直至变软。南瓜沥干水分；让其冷却。\r\n将烤箱加热至 180C/160C 风扇/燃气 4. 将糕点放在撒有少许面粉的表面上，然后将其铺在 22 厘米松底挞罐上。冷却 15 分钟。在糕点上铺上烘焙羊皮纸和烘焙豆，然后烘烤 15 分钟。取出豆子和纸，再煮 10 分钟，直至底部呈浅金黄色和饼干状。从烤箱中取出并稍微冷却。\r\n将烤箱温度升至 220C/200C 风扇/燃气 7. 将冷却的南瓜通过筛子推入一个大碗中。在另一个碗中，将糖、盐、肉豆蔻和一半肉桂混合。加入打散的鸡蛋、融化的黄油和牛奶，然后加入南瓜泥中搅拌均匀。倒入挞皮，煮10分钟，然后将温度降至180C/160C风扇/煤气 4. 继续烘烤35-40分钟，直至馅料刚刚凝固。\r\n待冷却，然后将馅饼从罐子中取出。将剩余的肉桂粉与糖粉混合，然后撒在馅饼上。冷藏后食用。"},{"id":"52816","n":"Roasted Eggplant With Tahini, Pine Nuts, and Lentils","a":"United States","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/ysqrus1487425681.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HkywCtna9t0","i":[["Olive Oil","2 tablespoons"],["Carrots","2 small cut into chunks"],["Celery","2 small stalks"],["Onion","1 medium finely diced"],["Garlic","6 medium cloves sliced"],["Brown Lentils","12 ounces (340g)"],["Bay Leaves","2"],["Water","4 cups"],["Salt","Pinch"],["Apple Cider Vinegar","2 teaspoons (10ml)"],["Pepper","Pinch"],["Egg Plants","2 large"],["Rosemary","4 sprigs"],["Pine nuts","1/4 cup"],["Parsley","2 tablespoons"]],"s":"\r\nFor the Lentils: Adjust oven rack to center position and preheat oven to 450°F to prepare for roasting eggplant. Meanwhile, heat 2 tablespoons olive oil in a medium saucepan over medium heat until shimmering. Add carrots, celery, and onion and cook, stirring, until softened but not browned, about 4 minutes. Add garlic and cook, stirring, until fragrant, about 30 seconds. Add lentils, bay leaves, stock or water, and a pinch of salt. Bring to a simmer, cover with the lid partially ajar, and cook until lentils are tender, about 30 minutes. (Top up with water if lentils are at any point not fully submerged.) Remove lid, stir in vinegar, and reduce until lentils are moist but not soupy. Season to taste with salt and pepper, cover, and keep warm until ready to serve.\r\n\r\n2.\r\nFor the Eggplant: While lentils cook, cut each eggplant in half. Score flesh with the tip of a paring knife in a cross-hatch pattern at 1-inch intervals. Transfer to a foil-lined rimmed baking sheet, cut side up, and brush each eggplant half with 1 tablespoon oil, letting each brushstroke be fully absorbed before brushing with more. Season with salt and pepper. Place a rosemary sprig on top of each one. Transfer to oven and roast until completely tender and well charred, 25 to 35 minutes. Remove from oven and discard rosemary.\r\n\r\n3.\r\nTo Serve: Heat 2 tablespoons olive oil and pine nuts in a medium skillet set over medium heat. Cook, tossing nuts frequently, until golden brown and aromatic, about 4 minutes. Transfer to a bowl to halt cooking. Stir half of parsley and rosemary into lentils and transfer to a serving platter. Arrange eggplant halves on top. Spread a few tablespoons of tahini sauce over each eggplant half and sprinkle with pine nuts. Sprinkle with remaining parsley and rosemary, drizzle with additional olive oil, and serve.","z":"对于扁豆：将烤箱架调整至中心位置，并将烤箱预热至 450°F，准备烤茄子。与此同时，在中型平底锅中用中火加热 2 汤匙橄榄油，直至闪烁。加入胡萝卜、芹菜和洋葱，搅拌约 4 分钟，直至变软但未变成褐色。加入大蒜，搅拌约 30 秒，直至散发出香味。加入扁豆、月桂叶、高汤或水，以及少许盐。将小火煮至半开，盖上盖子，煮约 30 分钟，直至扁豆变软。 （如果小扁豆未完全浸没，请加满水。）取下盖子，加入醋，搅拌，直至小扁豆湿润但不呈糊状。用盐和胡椒调味，盖上盖子，保温直至可以食用。\r\n\r\n2.\r\n茄子：煮扁豆时，将每个茄子切成两半。用削皮刀的刀尖以 1 英寸间隔以十字线方式在果肉上划痕。转移到衬有箔纸的镶边烤盘上，切面朝上，在每半个茄子上刷上一汤匙油，让每一笔刷子都被充分吸收，然后再刷更多的油。用盐和胡椒调味。在每个顶部放一根迷迭香小枝。转移到烤箱中烘烤 25 至 35 分钟，直至完全变软并充分烧焦。从烤箱中取出并丢弃迷迭香。\r\n\r\n3.\r\n食用方法：将 2 汤匙橄榄油和松子放入中型煎锅中，用中火加热。煮约 4 分钟，期间经常翻动坚果，直至呈金黄色并散发芳香。转移到碗中以停止烹饪。将一半欧芹和迷迭香拌入扁豆中，然后转移到盘子中。将茄子两半放在上面。在每半个茄子上涂上几汤匙芝麻酱，然后撒上松子。撒上剩余的欧芹和迷迭香，淋上额外的橄榄油，即可食用。"},{"id":"52786","n":"Rocky Road Fudge","a":"United States","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/vtxyxv1483567157.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=N1aJ3nEYXyg","i":[["Miniature Marshmallows","2 cups"],["Chocolate Chips","3 cups"],["Peanut Butter","½ cup"],["Vanilla Extract","1 tsp"],["Peanuts","1 ¼ cups"]],"s":"Line an 8-inch-square baking pan with wax paper or foil, and coat with non-stick spray.\r\nPour ½ cup of the miniature marshmallows into the bottom of the lined baking dish.\r\nIn a microwave-safe bowl, combine the chocolate chips and peanut butter. Microwave the chocolate mixture in 20-second intervals, stirring in between each interval, until the chocolate is melted.\r\nAdd the vanilla extract and stir well, until smooth.\r\nReserve 2 tablespoons of the chopped almonds or peanuts, and set aside.\r\nFold 1 ½ cups of the miniature marshmallows and the remaining chopped nuts into the chocolate mixture.\r\nTransfer the chocolate mixture into the prepared pan and spread into an even layer. Immediately top with the reserved chopped nuts and the mallow bits or additional miniature marshmallows, if using.\r\nRefrigerate for 4 hours, or until set.\r\nRemove the fudge and wax paper from the pan. Carefully peel all of wax paper from the fudge.\r\nCut the fudge into bite-sized pieces and serve.","z":"在 8 英寸见方的烤盘上铺上蜡纸或箔纸，并涂上不粘喷雾。\r\n将 ½ 杯微型棉花糖倒入有衬里的烤盘底部。\r\n在微波炉安全的碗中，将巧克力片和花生酱混合。以 20 秒的间隔将巧克力混合物放入微波炉加热，在每次间隔之间搅拌，直至巧克力融化。\r\n加入香草精，搅拌均匀，直至光滑。\r\n保留 2 汤匙切碎的杏仁或花生，放在一边。\r\n将 1 ½ 杯微型棉花糖和剩余的切碎坚果放入巧克力混合物中。\r\n将巧克力混合物转移到准备好的平底锅中并铺成均匀的层。立即在上面放上保留的切碎坚果和锦葵块或额外的微型棉花糖（如果使用）。\r\n冷藏 4 小时，或直至凝固。\r\n从锅中取出软糖和蜡纸。小心地从软糖上剥下所有蜡纸。\r\n将软糖切成一口大小的块即可食用。"},{"id":"52962","n":"Salmon Eggs Eggs Benedict","a":"United States","c":"Breakfast","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/1550440197.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Woiiet4vQ58","i":[["Eggs","4"],["White Wine Vinegar","2 tbs"],["English Muffins","2"],["Butter","To serve"],["Smoked Salmon","8 slices"],["Lemon Juice","2 tsp"],["White Wine Vinegar","2 tsp"],["Egg","3 Yolkes"],["Unsalted Butter","125g"]],"s":"First make the Hollandaise sauce. Put the lemon juice and vinegar in a small bowl, add the egg yolks and whisk with a balloon whisk until light and frothy. Place the bowl over a pan of simmering water and whisk until mixture thickens. Gradually add the butter, whisking constantly until thick – if it looks like it might be splitting, then whisk off the heat for a few mins. Season and keep warm.\r\n\r\nTo poach the eggs, bring a large pan of water to the boil and add the vinegar. Lower the heat so that the water is simmering gently. Stir the water so you have a slight whirlpool, then slide in the eggs one by one. Cook each for about 4 mins, then remove with a slotted spoon.\r\n\r\nLightly toast and butter the muffins, then put a couple of slices of salmon on each half. Top each with an egg, spoon over some Hollandaise and garnish with chopped chives.","z":"首先制作荷兰酱。将柠檬汁和醋放入小碗中，加入蛋黄，用气球搅拌器搅拌直至变轻并起泡。将碗放在一锅沸水中，搅拌直至混合物变稠。逐渐加入黄油，不断搅拌直至浓稠——如果看起来可能会裂开，然后关火搅拌几分钟。调味并保暖。\r\n\r\n煮鸡蛋时，将一大锅水烧开并加入醋。降低热量，使水慢慢地沸腾。搅拌水，使水产生轻微的漩涡，然后将鸡蛋一颗一颗地滑入。每个煮约 4 分钟，然后用漏勺取出。\r\n\r\n将松饼轻轻烤一下并涂上黄油，然后在每一半上放几片鲑鱼。在每个上面放一个鸡蛋，用勺子浇上一些荷兰酱，并用切碎的细香葱装饰。"},{"id":"52833","n":"Salted Caramel Cheescake","a":"United States","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/xqrwyr1511133646.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=q5dQp3qpmI4","i":[["Digestive Biscuits","250g"],["Pretzels","75g"],["Butter","135g"],["Cream Cheese","450g"],["Vanilla Extract","1tsp"],["Icing Sugar","100g"],["Caramel","150g"],["Sea Salt","1tsp"],["Double Cream","300ml"],["Caramel Sauce","drizzle"],["Toffee Popcorn","Top"],["Pretzels","Top"]],"s":"1) Blitz the biscuits and the pretzels in a food processor and mix the biscuits with the melted butter. Spread on the bottom of an 8″/20cm Deep Springform Tin and press down firmly. Leave to set in the fridge whilst you make the rest!\r\n\r\n2) Using an electric mixer, I use my KitchenAid with the whisk attachment, whisk together the cream cheese, vanilla, and icing sugar until smooth and then add the caramel and whisk again until smooth and lump free – this could take a couple of minutes, I whisk it at half speed so not too quick or slow!\r\n\r\n3) Pour in the double cream & Salt flakes and continue to whisk for a couple of minutes until its very thick and mousse like (I mix it on a medium speed, level 6/10) – Now this could take up to 5 minutes depending on your mixer, but you seriously have to stick at it – it will hold itself completely when finished mixing (like a meringue does!) If you don’t mix it enough it will not set well enough, but don’t get impatient and whisk it really quick because that’ll make it split! Spread over the biscuit base and leave to set in the fridge overnight.\r\n\r\n4) Remove the Cheesecake from the tin carefully and decorate the cheesecake – I drizzled over some of the spare caramel, and then some Toffee Popcorn and more Pretzels!","z":"1）将饼干和椒盐卷饼放入食品加工机中，将饼干与融化的黄油混合。铺在 8 英寸/20 厘米深弹簧罐的底部并用力按下。放在冰箱里，你就可以做剩下的了！\r\n\r\n2）使用电动搅拌机，我使用带有搅拌附件的KitchenAid，将奶油芝士、香草和糖粉搅拌在一起，直至光滑，然后加入焦糖，再次搅拌直至光滑且无结块——这可能需要几分钟，我以半速搅拌，所以不要太快或太慢！\r\n\r\n3）倒入双倍奶油和盐片，继续搅拌几分钟，直到它变得非常浓稠，像慕斯一样（我以中速混合，6/10级） - 现在这可能需要长达5分钟，具体取决于你的搅拌机，但你必须坚持下去 - 混合完成后它会完全固定（就像蛋白酥皮一样！）如果你搅拌得不够，它就不会凝固得足够好，但不要不耐烦，搅拌得太快，因为这会让它分裂！铺在饼干底上，放入冰箱过夜。\r\n\r\n4）小心地从罐子里取出芝士蛋糕，装饰芝士蛋糕——我淋上了一些备用的焦糖，然后是一些太妃糖爆米花和更多的椒盐卷饼！"},{"id":"52994","n":"Skillet Apple Pork Chops with Roasted Sweet Potatoes & Zucchini","a":"United States","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/h3ijwo1581013377.jpg","y":"","i":[["Potatoes","2"],["Apples","1"],["Garlic","2 cloves"],["Lemon","1"],["Pork","2"],["Zucchini","1"],["Chicken Stock","1"],["Vegetable Oil","1 tbsp"],["Sugar","1 1/2 tsp"],["Butter","2 tbsp"]],"s":"\r\nServes 2\r\n\r\n\r\n1. \r\n\r\nAdjust racks to top and middle positions and preheat oven to 450 degrees. Wash and dry all produce. Dice sweet potatoes into 1/2-inch pieces. Toss on a baking sheet with a drizzle of oil, salt, and pepper. Roast on top rack for 12 minutes (we'll roast the zucchini then). \r\n\r\n\r\n2. \r\n\r\nMeanwhile, halve and core apple; thinly slice into half-moons. Peel and finely chop garlic. Quarter lemon. Trim and halve zucchini lengthwise; cut crosswise into 1/2-inch-thick half-moons. Toss on a second baking sheet with a drizzle of oil and a pinch of salt and pepper. Set aside. \r\n\r\n\r\n3. \r\n\r\nPat pork dry with paper towels and season all over with salt and pepper. Heat a drizzle of oil in a large pan over medium-high heat. Add pork and cook until browned and cooked through, 4-5 minutes per side. Turn off heat; transfer to a plate. \r\n\r\n\r\n4. \r\n\r\nOnce sweet potatoes have roasted 12 minutes, transfer baking sheet with zucchini to middle rack and continue roasting until both veggies are browned and softened, 12-15 minutes more. \r\n\r\n\r\n5. \r\n\r\nMeanwhile, melt 1 TBSP butter (2 TBSP for 4 servings) in pan used for pork over medium-high heat. Add apple and season with salt and pepper. Cook, scraping up any browned bits from bottom of pan, until apple is slightly softened, 2-3 minutes. Add garlic; cook until fragrant, 30 seconds. Add 1/z cup water (3/4 cup for 4), stock concentrate, and 11/2 tsp sugar (3 tsp for 4). Cook, stirring, until sauce has thickened and apple is very tender, 3-5 minutes. Season with salt and pepper. \r\n\r\n\r\n6. \r\n\r\nRemove pan with apple from heat; stir in 1 TBSP butter (2 TBSP for 4 servings) and a squeeze of lemon juice. Divide pork, zucchini, and sweet potatoes between plates. Top pork with glazed apple sauce. Top zucchini with a squeeze of lemon juice. ","z":"2人份\r\n\r\n\r\n1. \r\n\r\n将架子调整至顶部和中间位置，并将烤箱预热至 450 度。清洗并干燥所有产品。将红薯切成 1/2 英寸的块。在烤盘上撒上油、盐和胡椒粉。在顶架上烤 12 分钟（然后我们将烤西葫芦）。 \r\n\r\n\r\n2. \r\n\r\n同时，将苹果切半并去核；切成半月形薄片。大蒜去皮并切碎。四分之一柠檬。将西葫芦纵向修剪并切成两半；横向切成 1/2 英寸厚的半月形。在第二张烤盘上撒上少许油、少许盐和胡椒粉。放在一边。 \r\n\r\n\r\n3. \r\n\r\n用纸巾将猪肉拍干，然后用盐和胡椒调味。在大平底锅中用中高火加热毛毛雨。加入猪肉，煮至褐色并煮熟，每面 4-5 分钟。关掉暖气；转移到盘子上。 \r\n\r\n\r\n4. \r\n\r\n红薯烤 12 分钟后，将带有西葫芦的烤盘转移到中间架上，继续烤 12-15 分钟，直到两种蔬菜都变成棕色并变软。 \r\n\r\n\r\n5. \r\n\r\n同时，将1汤匙黄油（4人份2汤匙）放入猪肉锅中，用中火融化。加入苹果，用盐和胡椒调味。煮2-3分钟，刮掉锅底的褐色碎片，直到苹果稍微软化。加入大蒜；煮30秒直至香味四溢。添加 1/z 杯水（4 人份 3/4 杯）、浓缩汤和 11/2 茶匙糖（4 人份 3 茶匙）。边煮边搅拌，直到酱汁变稠并且苹果变软，持续 3-5 分钟。用盐和胡椒调味。 \r\n\r\n\r\n6. \r\n\r\n将装有苹果的锅从火上移开；加入 1 汤匙黄油（4 人份 2 汤匙）和挤柠檬汁。将猪肉、西葫芦和红薯分装在盘子里。在猪肉上涂上釉面苹果酱。在西葫芦上挤上柠檬汁。"},{"id":"52992","n":"Soy-Glazed Meatloaves with Wasabi Mashed Potatoes & Roasted Carrots","a":"United States","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/o2wb6p1581005243.jpg","y":"","i":[["Potatoes","5"],["Carrots","12 ounces"],["Scallions","1"],["Garlic","2 cloves"],["Bread","1 Slice"],["Garlic Powder","1"],["Soy Sauce","2"],["Ground Beef","1"],["Vegetable Oil","1 tsp"],["Sugar","2 tsp"],["Butter","2 tbsp"]],"s":"1. Preheat oven to 425 degrees. Wash and dry all produce. Dice potatoes into 1/2-inch pieces. Trim, peel, and cut carrots on a diagonal into 1/2-inch-thick pieces. Trim and thinly slice scallions, separating whites from greens; finely chop whites. Peel and finely chop garlic.\r\n\r\n2. In a medium bowl, soak bread with 2 TBSP water (4 TBSP for 4 servings); break up with your hands until pasty. Stir in beef, sriracha, scallion whites, half the garlic, salt (we used 3/4 tsp kosher salt; 11/2 tsp for 4), and pepper. Form into two 1-inch-tall loaves (four loaves for 4). Place on one side of a baking sheet. Toss carrots on empty side of same sheet with a drizzle of oil, salt, and pepper. (For 4, spread meatloaves out across whole sheet and add carrots to a second sheet.) Bake for 20 minutes (we'll glaze the meatloaves then).\r\n\r\n3. Meanwhile, place potatoes in a medium pot with enough salted water to cover by 2 inches. Bring to a boil and cook until very\r\ntender, 12-15 minutes. Reserve 1/2 cup potato cooking liquid, then drain. While potatoes cook, in a small bowl, combine soy sauce, garlic powder, 1/4 cup ketchup (1/2 cup for 4 servings), and 2 tsp sugar (4 tsp for 4).\r\n\r\n4. Once meatloaves and carrots have baked 20 minutes, remove from oven. Spoon half the ketchup glaze over meatloaves (save\r\nthe rest for serving); return to oven until carrots are browned and tender, meatloaves are cooked through, and glaze is tacky, 4-5 minutes more.\r\n\r\n5. Meanwhile, melt 2 TBSP butter (4 TBSP for 4 servings) in pot used for potatoes over medium heat. Add remaining garlic and cook\r\nuntil fragrant, 30 seconds. Add potatoes and 1/4 tsp wasabi. Mash, adding splashes of reserved potato cooking liquid as necessary until smooth. Season with salt and pepper. (If you like things spicy, stir in more wasabi!)\r\n\r\n6. Divide meatloaves, mashed potatoes, and roasted carrots between plates. Sprinkle with scallion greens and serve with remaining ketchup glaze on the side for dipping.","z":"1. 将烤箱预热至425度。清洗并干燥所有产品。将土豆切成 1/2 英寸的块。将胡萝卜修剪、去皮并沿对角线切成 1/2 英寸厚的块。将葱修剪并切成薄片，将白葱和绿葱分开；将蛋白切碎。大蒜去皮并切碎。\r\n\r\n2. 在一个中等大小的碗中，用2汤匙水浸泡面包（4人份4汤匙）；用手掰开，直到变成糊状。加入牛肉、是拉差辣椒酱、葱白、一半大蒜、盐（我们用 3/4 茶匙犹太盐；4 人用 11/2 茶匙）和胡椒粉。形成两个 1 英寸高的面包（4 人做 4 个面包）。放在烤盘的一侧。将胡萝卜放在同一张纸的空面上，淋上油、盐和胡椒。 （对于 4 个人来说，将肉饼铺在整张纸上，然后将胡萝卜添加到第二张纸上。）烘烤 20 分钟（然后我们将给肉饼上釉）。\r\n\r\n3. 同时，将土豆放入一个中等大小的锅中，加入足够的盐水，淹没土豆 2 英寸。煮至沸腾并煮至非常\r\n温柔，12-15分钟。保留 1/2 杯土豆烹饪液，然后沥干。煮土豆时，在一个小碗中混合酱油、大蒜粉、1/4 杯番茄酱（1/2 杯适合 4 人份）和 2 茶匙糖（4 茶匙适合 4 人份）。\r\n\r\n4.肉饼和胡萝卜烤20分钟后，从烤箱中取出。用勺子将一半番茄酱淋在肉饼上（保存\r\n其余的用于服务）；返回烤箱，直至胡萝卜变褐色变软，肉饼煮熟，釉料发粘，再烤 4-5 分钟。\r\n\r\n5. 同时，将2汤匙黄油（4人份4汤匙）放入土豆锅中，用中火融化。加入剩余的大蒜并煮\r\n直到散发出香味，30秒。加入土豆和 1/4 茶匙芥末。捣碎，根据需要添加保留的马铃薯烹饪液直至光滑。用盐和胡椒调味。 （如果你喜欢吃辣的，可以多拌点芥末！）\r\n\r\n6. 将肉饼、土豆泥和烤胡萝卜分装在盘子中。撒上青葱，并在侧面涂上剩余的番茄酱釉，以供浸渍。"},{"id":"52817","n":"Stovetop Eggplant With Harissa, Chickpeas, and Cumin Yogurt","a":"United States","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/yqwtvu1487426027.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uYB-1xJp4lg","i":[["Olive Oil","4 tablespoons"],["Egg Plants","6 small"],["Harissa Spice","½ tablespoon"],["Chickpeas","1 can"],["Cherry Tomatoes","2 cups halved"],["Greek yogurt","1 1/2 cups"],["Ground cumin","1 tablespoon"],["Parsley","½ cup"]],"s":"Heat the oil in a 12-inch skillet over high heat until shimmering. Add the eggplants and lower the heat to medium. Season with salt and pepper as you rotate the eggplants, browning them on all sides. Continue to cook, turning regularly, until a fork inserted into the eggplant meets no resistance (you may have to stand them up on their fat end to finish cooking the thickest parts), about 20 minutes, lowering the heat and sprinkling water into the pan as necessary if the eggplants threaten to burn or smoke excessively.\r\n\r\n2.\r\nMix the harissa, chickpeas and tomatoes together, then add to the eggplants. Cook until the tomatoes have blistered and broken down, about 5 minutes more. Season with salt and pepper and add water as necessary to thin to a saucy consistency. Meanwhile, combine the yogurt and cumin in a serving bowl. Season with salt and pepper.\r\n\r\n3.\r\nTop the eggplant mixture with the parsley, drizzle with more extra virgin olive oil, and serve with the yogurt on the side.","z":"将油放入 12 英寸的煎锅中，用大火加热直至闪烁。加入茄子，将火调至中火。旋转茄子时用盐和胡椒调味，使茄子各面都变成棕色。继续煮，定期翻转，直到插入茄子的叉子没有阻力（你可能需要将它们直立起来，以完成最厚部分的烹饪），大约20分钟，如果茄子有烧焦或冒烟的危险，则降低热量并根据需要向锅中洒水。\r\n\r\n2.\r\n将哈里萨辣酱、鹰嘴豆和西红柿混合在一起，然后加入茄子中。再煮大约 5 分钟，直到西红柿起泡并破裂。用盐和胡椒调味，并根据需要加水稀释至粘稠度。与此同时，将酸奶和孜然混合在一个碗中。用盐和胡椒调味。\r\n\r\n3.\r\n在茄子混合物上撒上欧芹，淋上更多的特级初榨橄榄油，然后与酸奶一起食用。"},{"id":"52794","n":"Vegan Chocolate Cake","a":"United States","c":"Vegan","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/qxutws1486978099.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C3pAgB7pync","i":[["Self-raising Flour","1 1/4 cup"],["coco sugar","1/2 cup"],["cacao","1/3 cup raw"],["baking powder","1 tsp"],["flax eggs","2"],["almond milk","1/2 cup"],["vanilla","1 tsp"],["water","1/2 cup boiling"]],"s":"Simply mix all dry ingredients with wet ingredients and blend altogether. Bake for 45 min on 180 degrees. Decorate with some melted vegan chocolate ","z":"只需将所有干成分与湿成分混合并完全混合即可。 180度烤45分钟。用一些融化的纯素巧克力装饰"},{"id":"53317","n":"Beef Empanadas","a":"Uruguayan","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/dxpc7j1764370714.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RRNVLC6IAv4","i":[["Lard","60g"],["Water","340g"],["Salt","1 tsp"],["All purpose flour","600g"],["Tomato","3"],["Garlic","1 clove"],["Red Onions","1 large"],["Spring Onions","Bunch"],["Sirloin steak","750g"],["Dried Oregano","1 tablespoon"],["Paprika","1 tsp"],["Red Pepper Flakes","1 tsp"],["Parsley","1 tsp"],["Salt","To taste"],["Pepper","To taste"],["Egg","3"],["Egg Wash","Splash"],["Chimichurri sauce","Drizzle"]],"s":"For the dough place lard, warm water and salt in a large kneading bowl and stir. Add flour and oregano and either knead five miutes by hand or with the kneading function of your machine. Let rest covered for at least half an hour or overnight in the fridge.\r\n\r\n2\r\nFor the filling place tomatoes for about 30 seconds in boiling water, then cool with cold water and peel of skin and cut into cubes. Press garlic through garlic press, cut onions into cubes. Simmer garlic and onions in some olive oil until translucent. Take out onions and garlic and brown the meat at high heat from all sides. Season with all herbs and add the onions, garlic and tomatoes. Let simmer for a few minutes, add salt, pepper and additional spices to taste. You can prepare the meat the night before, chill in fridge if doing so. Boil eggs and also cut into cubes and mix with prepared meat.\r\n\r\n3\r\nCut dough into half and roll out one half thinnly on floured surface. Cut out circles about 12-15cm in diameter. Mine have a diameter of 12.5 cm. Place about 2-4 teaspoons of filling on one circle, put a bit of water all around the edges and fold over the other half so that you get half moons. Be sure to seal the edges with a fork. Repeat until you have no dough and filling left.\r\n\r\n4\r\nMeanwhile preheat oven to 200 degrees Celsius. Brush empanadas with egg wash and bake about 8 empanadas on a baking sheet lined with parchment paper for about 25min or until golden. Serve warm with chimichurri sauce.","z":"对于面团，将猪油、温水和盐放入一个大揉面碗中并搅拌。添加面粉和牛至，然后用手或机器的揉捏功能揉捏五分钟。盖上盖子静置至少半小时或在冰箱中过夜。\r\n\r\n2\r\n制作馅料时，将西红柿放入沸水中煮约 30 秒，然后用冷水冷却，剥皮并切成方块。通过压蒜器压蒜，将洋葱切成方块。在一些橄榄油中将大蒜和洋葱煮至半透明。取出洋葱和大蒜，用高温将肉的各个面煎至棕色。用所有香草调味，然后加入洋葱、大蒜和西红柿。煮几分钟，加入盐、胡椒和其他香料调味。你可以在前一天晚上准备好肉，如果这样做的话，可以放在冰箱里冷藏。煮鸡蛋，也切成方块并与准备好的肉混合。\r\n\r\n3\r\n将面团切成两半，并将其中一半在撒了面粉的表面上擀薄。剪出直径约12-15厘米的圆圈。我的直径为12.5厘米。在一个圆圈上放大约 2-4 茶匙的馅料，在边缘周围放一点水，然后将另一半折叠起来，这样就得到半个月亮。一定要用叉子密封边缘。重复直到没有面团和馅料。\r\n\r\n4\r\n同时将烤箱预热至200摄氏度。在肉馅卷饼上刷上蛋液，然后将约 8 个肉馅卷饼放在衬有羊皮纸的烤盘上烘烤约 25 分钟或直至呈金黄色。与 Chimichurri 酱一起趁热食用。"},{"id":"53319","n":"Chivito sandwich","a":"Uruguayan","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/j80gmw1764372176.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tX3fN9AG_ik","i":[["Milk","80g"],["Butter","60g"],["Molasses","1 tablespoon"],["Water","220g"],["Egg","9"],["Bread Flour","500g"],["Salt","10g"],["Yeast","10g"],["Egg Wash","Splash"],["Sesame Seed","Sprinkling"],["Onion","4"],["Sirloin steak","8"],["Garlic","To serve"],["Bacon","8"],["Ham","8 slices"],["Mozzarella","8 slices"],["Tomato","4"],["Lettuce","1/4"],["Mustard","To serve"],["Chimichurri sauce","To serve"]],"s":"For the brioche buns heat the milk with the butter and molasses until the butter has melted. Add the cold water and egg to this mix.\r\n\r\n2\r\nIn a large bowl place flour, salt and yeast and mix. Then add the milk and water mix and stir with a wooden spoon until combined. You don't have to knead the dough, it is perfectly fine to do this by hand with a wooden spoon, this doesn't need to be very thorough. Cover with a damp towel and stick in the fridge overnight.\r\n\r\n3\r\nThe next morning knead dough on a generously floured surface for a little and cut into eight equal pieces. Shape these into balls and place on a baking sheet lined with parchment paper. Cover again with damp towel and let rise for about an hour or until double in size.\r\n\r\n4\r\nHeat oven to 220 degrees Celsius. Brush the buns with either milk, heavy cream or egg wash and sprinkle with sesame seeds, if desired. Bake for about 15-20min or until golden. Let cool.\r\n\r\n5\r\nFor the toppings chop the onions and sauté in a bit of butter, let caramelize, this may take ten to 15 minutes, stir occasionally. Rub the steaks with a bit of garlic and then grill or fry the steaks, the bacon, and eggs with salt and pepper, toast the buns after having cut in half. Spread mustard on one bun half, layer each chivito with steak, a slice of ham, a slice of cheese, one bacon stripe, a tomato slice, and some lettuce. Place fried egg on top and sprinkle generously with chimichurri and some onions right before serving.","z":"对于奶油蛋卷面包，将牛奶与黄油和糖蜜一起加热，直至黄油融化。将冷水和鸡蛋加入此混合物中。\r\n\r\n2\r\n在一个大碗中放入面粉、盐和酵母并混合。然后加入牛奶和水混合物，用木勺搅拌直至混合。你不需要揉面团，用木勺手工揉捏就完全可以了，不需要揉得很彻底。用湿毛巾盖住并放入冰箱过夜。\r\n\r\n3\r\n第二天早上，将面团放在撒有大量面粉的表面上揉一点，然后切成八等份。将它们做成球状，放在衬有羊皮纸的烤盘上。再次盖上湿毛巾，发酵约一个小时或直至体积增加一倍。\r\n\r\n4\r\n将烤箱加热至220摄氏度。在面包上刷上牛奶、浓奶油或鸡蛋液，如果需要的话，撒上芝麻。烘烤约 15-20 分钟或直至呈金黄色。让其冷却。\r\n\r\n5\r\n对于配料，将洋葱切碎，用一点黄油炒，使其焦糖化，这可能需要 10 到 15 分钟，偶尔搅拌。在牛排上抹上一点大蒜，然后用盐和胡椒将牛排、培根和鸡蛋烤或煎，将面包切成两半后烤。将芥末涂在半个面包上，在每个 Chivito 上铺上牛排、一片火腿、一片奶酪、一条培根条、一片番茄片和一些生菜。将煎鸡蛋放在上面，在食用前撒上大量的 Chimichurri 和一些洋葱。"},{"id":"53063","n":"Chivito uruguayo","a":"Uruguayan","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/n7qnkb1630444129.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0PXbbL1QdaA&ab_channel=D%C3%ADadeCocina","i":[["Beef Brisket","2"],["Bread","2"],["Lettuce","1"],["Tomato","1"],["Ham","100g"],["Mozzarella","100g"],["Bacon","100g"],["Egg","1"],["Onion","1"],["Pepper","1"]],"s":"Crush the meat so that it is finite and we put it on a griddle to brown. Put the eggs, bacon and ham to fry.\r\nCut the bread in half, put the beef brisket, the fried eggs, the bacon, the ham, the mozzarella, the tomato and the lettuce. Cover with the other half of the bread and serve.","z":"将肉压碎，使其有限，然后将其放在煎锅上煎成棕色。把鸡蛋、培根和火腿放进去煎。\r\n将面包切成两半，放入牛腩、煎鸡蛋、培根、火腿、马苏里拉奶酪、番茄和生菜。盖上另一半面包即可食用。"},{"id":"53320","n":"Chocolate alfajores","a":"Uruguayan","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/k9o0xr1764373018.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ucBoYab5tXY","i":[["Butter","150g"],["Sugar","70g"],["Egg","1"],["Honey","25g"],["All purpose flour","175g"],["Cornstarch","80g"],["Unsweetened Cocoa","30g"],["Baking Powder","1 tsp"],["Baking Powder","1 tsp"],["Dulce de leche","400g"],["Milk Chocolate","500g"],["Butter","100g"],["Orange","Zest of 1"]],"s":"For the cookies cream the butter with the sugar for a few minutes. Then add the egg and honey and mix well. Add flour, cornstarch, cocoa, baking soda and baking powder and mix until you get a dough. Wrap in plastic wrap and chill for at least half an hour or overnight.\r\n\r\n2\r\nLine two baking sheets with parchment paper, preheat oven to 200 degrees Celsius.\r\n\r\n3\r\nDivide dough into two parts, put one part back in the fridge before using. Roll out second part to about 2 millimeters and cut out round cookies with 5-6 centimeters in diameter. This can be done with a cookie cutter or glass. You should get 30 cookies in total or even more, I get about 40. Bake one baking sheet at the time for about 8-10min. Let cookies cool.\r\n\r\n4\r\nFor the filling look for two cookies of the same size and place about one teaspoon of dulce de leche onto the bottom one before sandwiching together.\r\n\r\n5\r\nChop semi-sweet chocolate and melt with butter and orange zest on low heat. Dunk each sandwich cookie into the chocolate and let cool off on parchment paper before serving.","z":"制作饼干时，将黄油与糖一起搅拌几分钟。然后加入鸡蛋和蜂蜜，搅拌均匀。加入面粉、玉米淀粉、可可、小苏打和泡打粉，搅拌直至形成面团。用保鲜膜包裹并冷藏至少半小时或过夜。\r\n\r\n2\r\n在两张烤盘上铺上羊皮纸，将烤箱预热至200摄氏度。\r\n\r\n3\r\n将面团分成两份，一份在使用前放回冰箱。将第二部分擀成约2毫米，切出直径5-6厘米的圆形饼干。这可以用饼干切刀或玻璃杯来完成。你总共应该买30块饼干，甚至更多，我买了大约40块。一次烤一张烤盘，大约8-10分钟。让饼干冷却。\r\n\r\n4\r\n对于填充物，寻找两块相同大小的饼干，然后将大约一茶匙的焦糖牛奶放在底部的饼干上，然后夹在一起。\r\n\r\n5\r\n将半甜巧克力切碎，加入黄油和橙皮碎，小火融化。将每个三明治饼干浸入巧克力中，然后在食用前放在羊皮纸上冷却。"},{"id":"53324","n":"Chocolate empanadas","a":"Uruguayan","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/u9ezi21764375474.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Cdo14aXSHrA","i":[["Condensed Milk","400g"],["All purpose flour","250g"],["Unsweetened Cocoa","25g"],["Salt","Pinch"],["Butter","125g"],["Egg","1"],["Milk","3  tablespoons"],["Butter","30g"],["Sugar","30g"],["Cinnamon","1 tsp"]],"s":"For the filling place the can in a large pot and cover completely with water. Boil for two and a half hours, occassionally adding water. Let cool before opening. For further tips, please check here.\r\n\r\n2\r\nFor the dough combine the flour, cocoa powder, and salt in a large bowl. Add the cold butter in small pieces and rub into crumbs with your fingers Add the egg and work into a dough. You may have to add milk, a tablespoon at a time if it still is to dry. Wrap and chill for at least half an hour or overnight.\r\n\r\n3\r\nLine a baking sheeet with parchment paper and preheat the oven to 180 degrees Celsius.\r\n\r\n4\r\nRoll out the dough on a lightly floured surface, it should be thin. Cut out circles of 12cm either with a cookie cutter or with a smaller plate/dish. Put two to three teaspoons of the dulce de leche in the middle of each circle. Brush the edges with milk, I do this with my pinkie. Fold each circle in half so that you have a half moon and press down the edges with a fork. You can also turn the edges about half a centimeter inwards every centimeter or so to create a pattern.\r\n\r\n5\r\nPlace the prepared empanadas on the baking sheet and brush with egg wash. Bake for about 20-25min.\r\n\r\n6\r\nTowards the end of the baking time, melt the remaining butter and mix the sugar and cinnamon in a small bowl. Once you take the empanadas out, immediately brush with the butter and sprinkle with the sugar mix. Empanadas can be enjoyed either still warm or cold. If eating warm, be careful not to burn yourself with hot filling!","z":"为了填充，将罐子放入一个大锅中，并用水完全覆盖。煮两个半小时，期间不时加水。打开前先冷却。如需更多提示，请查看此处。\r\n\r\n2\r\n对于面团，将面粉、可可粉和盐混合在一个大碗中。将冷黄油切成小块，用手指揉成面包屑，加入鸡蛋，揉成面团。如果牛奶还是干的话，你可能需要添加牛奶，一次一汤匙。包裹并冷藏至少半小时或过夜。\r\n\r\n3\r\n在烤盘上铺上羊皮纸，并将烤箱预热至 180 摄氏度。\r\n\r\n4\r\n将面团放在撒了少许面粉的表面上擀开，面团应该很薄。用饼干切刀或较小的盘子/盘子切出 12 厘米的圆圈。在每个圆圈的中间放两到三茶匙牛奶汁。用牛奶刷边缘，我用我的小指这样做。将每个圆圈对折，形成半月形，然后用叉子压下边缘。您还可以每厘米左右将边缘向内转动约半厘米以创建图案。\r\n\r\n5\r\n将准备好的肉馅卷饼放在烤盘上，刷上蛋液。烘烤约20-25分钟。\r\n\r\n6\r\n烘烤时间快结束时，融化剩余的黄油，将糖和肉桂放入小碗中混合。一旦你把肉馅卷饼拿出来，立即刷上黄油，撒上糖粉。肉馅卷饼可以趁热享用，也可以冷食。如果趁热吃，小心别被热馅烫伤了！"},{"id":"53322","n":"Flan","a":"Uruguayan","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/0s80wo1764374393.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rpv_PXIoysE","i":[["Sugar","100g"],["Milk","350g"],["Sugar","45g"],["vanilla pod","1"],["Egg Yolks","4"],["Egg","2"],["Dulce de leche","To taste"]],"s":"For the caramel place 100 grams of sugar in a frying pan without any fat and melt on medium heat. Try not to stir with a spoon, but swirl the pan itself. Let melt until you have an amber color and sugar is fully melted. Fill the bottom of four flan containers with it. Caramel will harden immediately, so you need to be fast. My containers yield about 120 milliliters each.\r\n\r\n2\r\nPreheat oven to 150 degrees Celsius and look for a casserole or container all your four flan containers fit into.\r\n\r\n3\r\nHeat milk with 45 grams of sugar and the cut and scraped out vanilla pod. The milk does not need to boil, just needs to be heated. Take out vanilla pod after a few minutes. Meanwhile stir the egg yolks and eggs gently, try not to incorporate any air in it. Them pour milk-mix into egg-mix and again only stir very gently. Pour into prepared flan containers and place these into your casserole or container. Boil water and pour the water into the large casserole. Be sure not to touch the flan mixture. Place on middle rack in the oven and let bake for about 35-40 minutes. An inserted toothpick should come out clean.\r\n\r\n4\r\nLet cool inside the container for an hour before transferring to the fridge. Chill overnight. The next day gently release the rim and then turn upside down on a plate. Serve with some dulce de leche on the side.","z":"制作焦糖时，将 100 克糖放入无任何脂肪的煎锅中，中火融化。尽量不要用勺子搅拌，而是旋转锅本身。让其融化直至呈琥珀色并且糖完全融化。用它填充四个果馅饼容器的底部。焦糖会立即变硬，所以你需要快点。我的容器每个容量约为 120 毫升。\r\n\r\n2\r\n将烤箱预热至 150 摄氏度，然后寻找一个砂锅或容器，将所有四个果馅饼容器放入其中。\r\n\r\n3\r\n将牛奶与 45 克糖和切碎并刮出的香草豆荚一起加热。牛奶不需要煮沸，只需加热即可。几分钟后取出香草荚。同时轻轻搅拌蛋黄和鸡蛋，尽量不要混入空气。他们将牛奶混合物倒入鸡蛋混合物中，然后再次轻轻搅拌。倒入准备好的果馅饼容器中，然后将其放入砂锅或容器中。将水烧开，将水倒入大砂锅中。确保不要接触果馅饼混合物。将其放在烤箱的中间架上，烘烤约 35-40 分钟。插入的牙签拔出来时应该是干净的。\r\n\r\n4\r\n让容器内冷却一小时，然后转移到冰箱中。冷却过夜。第二天，轻轻地松开边缘，然后倒置在盘子上。配上一些焦糖牛奶一起食用。"},{"id":"53323","n":"Postre Chajá","a":"Uruguayan","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/wii0591764375062.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-O6MsNm39Yw","i":[["Egg","5"],["Sugar","100g"],["Salt","Pinch"],["All purpose flour","75g"],["Cornstarch","30g"],["Egg White","1"],["Sugar","50g"],["Dulce de leche","200g"],["Heavy Cream","400g"],["Vanilla Extract","1 tsp"],["Sugar","40g"],["Peaches","500g"],["Peach Juice","50 ml"],["Cornstarch","1 tsp"]],"s":"For the sponge cake preheat oven to 180 degrees Celsius and prepare either one or two 20cm/8 inch cake pan(s). Line bottom with parchment paper. Then divide the eggs into egg white and egg yolks. Use a bigger bowl for the egg yolks. If you have a glass or metal bowl, use that one for the egg whites. Be sure that bowl is free of fat/grease and that your mixer was properly cleaned. First beat the egg whites on medium speed with a pinch of salt until soft peaks form. Set aside. Without cleaning our mixer, beat the egg yolks with the sugar. Beat until the color becomes much paler and you have a creamy consistency. This usually takes several minutes.\r\n\r\n2\r\nGently pour one third of the egg whites on top of the mixed egg yolks and sift the flour and cornstarch on top. Don't skip this step. It is important that the flour mix was sifted. Gently mix all ingredients with a spatula. Try to incorperate the flour mix and egg whites without losing volume. Add the last two thirds of beaten egg whites and gently fold the mixture. Don't overmix. Put batter into the prepared cake pans and immediately bake. Don't let the batter sit for too long as it will quickly lose volume. Bake for 35 minutes if using one springform or 25 minutes if using two. Let cool a little before gently getting them out of the form. Tip: if making the day before, wrap in cling wrap, it is much easier to cut in half once cold.\r\n\r\n3\r\nFor the meringue beat egg white until soft peaks form, add pinch of salt and continue beating on high while adding the sugar. Beat for at least three more minutes until glossy and shiny. Pipe small stars or other shapes with the meringue on a baking sheet lined with parchment paper. Dry for about 45min at 100 degrees Celsius in the oven. Keep in airtight container until further use.\r\n\r\n4\r\nFor the filling beat heavy cream, vanilla extract and sugar until stiff peaks form, slice peaches in thin slices. Cut cake in four layers, this is much easier done once the cake layers are cold. Brush cake layer with some of the peach juice left, then pipe thin layer of whipped cream around the edges, place the peach slices in the middle on first layer on cake, on the second layer only spread the dulce de leche. Repeat layer with brushed peach juice, whipped cream and peaches for the third and final layer. Be sure to reserve enough peach slices for the top. Spread thin layer of whipped cream on the sides of the cake and pipe on some roses around the edges if desired. Heat the peach juice and mix the cornstarch with a bit of water until you see no lumps. Once juice is hot, add the cornstarch and stir until glaze thickenes. Pour over peaches of the top layer cake. Crush the meringue and pat around the sides. Serve immediately.\r\n\r\n","z":"制作海绵蛋糕时，将烤箱预热至 180 摄氏度，并准备一个或两个 20 厘米/8 英寸的蛋糕盘。用羊皮纸在底部划线。然后将鸡蛋分成蛋清和蛋黄。使用更大的碗盛蛋黄。如果您有玻璃或金属碗，请用它来盛蛋清。确保碗中没有脂肪/油脂，并且搅拌机已正确清洁。首先用少许盐中速搅打蛋白，直至形成软峰。放在一边。无需清洁搅拌机，用糖搅打蛋黄。搅拌直至颜色变得更浅并且具有奶油般的稠度。这通常需要几分钟。\r\n\r\n2\r\n轻轻地将三分之一的蛋白倒在混合蛋黄上，然后将面粉和玉米淀粉筛在上面。不要跳过这一步。重要的是面粉混合物要过筛。用抹刀轻轻混合所有成分。尝试在不损失体积的情况下混合面粉混合物和蛋清。加入最后三分之二打好的蛋白，轻轻搅拌混合物。不要过度混合。将面糊放入准备好的蛋糕盘中并立即烘烤。不要让面糊放置太久，因为它会很快失去体积。如果使用一个弹簧模，则烘烤 35 分钟；如果使用两个弹簧模，则烘烤 25 分钟。稍微冷却一下，然后轻轻地将它们从模具中取出。小贴士：如果是前一天做的，用保鲜膜包起来，冷了之后切成两半就容易多了。\r\n\r\n3\r\n对于蛋白酥皮，将蛋白搅打至形成软峰，加入少许盐，继续高速搅打，同时加入糖。再搅拌至少三分钟，直到有光泽。将蛋白酥皮放在衬有羊皮纸的烤盘上，用管子挤出小星形或其他形状。在100摄氏度的烤箱中干燥约45分钟。保存在密封容器中直至进一步使用。\r\n\r\n4\r\n制作馅料，将浓奶油、香草精和糖搅打至形成硬峰，将桃子切成薄片。将蛋糕切成四层，一旦蛋糕层冷了，这会更容易完成。在蛋糕层上刷上一些剩下的桃汁，然后在边缘涂上一层薄薄的鲜奶油，将桃片放在第一层蛋糕的中间，第二层上只涂上牛奶焦糖。重复涂上刷过的桃汁、生奶油和桃子，作为第三层，也是最后一层。一定要预留足够的桃片放在上面。在蛋糕的两侧涂上一层薄薄的生奶油，如果需要的话，可以在边缘涂上一些玫瑰花。加热桃汁，将玉米淀粉与少许水混合，直至看不到结块。果汁热后，加入玉米淀粉并搅拌直至釉料变稠。倒在顶层蛋糕的桃子上。将蛋白酥皮压碎并拍打两侧。立即上菜。"},{"id":"53318","n":"Torta de fiambre","a":"Uruguayan","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/okl9cm1764371087.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JIDdt3XPi9U","i":[["Cheddar Cheese","150g"],["Ham","200g"],["Egg","3"],["Vegetable Oil","100g"],["Milk","240g"],["All purpose flour","120g"],["Baking Powder","2 tsp"],["Salt","1 tsp"],["Dried Oregano","To taste"]],"s":"Line the bottom of a springform of 20-2cm (8-9inches) with parchment paper, I usually leave some overhang as the batter is very liquid and may spill a bit. Preheat oven to 220 degrees Celsius.\r\n\r\n2\r\nGrate the cheese and take out the ham.\r\n\r\n3\r\nMix all remaining ingredients in a large bowl for about one to two minutes.\r\n\r\n4\r\nPour half the batter into the prepared pan, it is going to be very liquid. Then place ham and cheese on top and pour the remaining batter on top.\r\n\r\n5\r\nBake for about 20-25 minutes or until top is golden. Wait for a few minutes before releasing from the pan and enjoy either hot or cold with some fresh herbs.","z":"在 20-2 厘米（8-9 英寸）的弹簧模底部铺上羊皮纸，我通常会留下一些悬垂部分，因为面糊非常液态，可能会溢出一点。将烤箱预热至220摄氏度。\r\n\r\n2\r\n将奶酪磨碎，取出火腿。\r\n\r\n3\r\n将所有剩余成分在一个大碗中混合约一到两分钟。\r\n\r\n4\r\n将一半面糊倒入准备好的平底锅中，它会变得非常流动。然后将火腿和奶酪放在上面，然后将剩余的面糊倒在上面。\r\n\r\n5\r\n烘烤约 20-25 分钟或直至顶部呈金黄色。等待几分钟，然后从锅中取出，与一些新鲜香草一起享用热食或冷食。"},{"id":"53321","n":"Vanilla alfajores","a":"Uruguayan","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/3wnyvh1764373818.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9MncGG2cH_g","i":[["Dulce de leche","150g"],["Coconut Flakes","50g"],["Butter","100g"],["Sugar","100g"],["Egg","1"],["Egg Yolks","1"],["Cornstarch","200g"],["All purpose flour","100g"],["Baking Powder","1 tsp"],["Vanilla Extract","1 tsp"],["Dulce de leche","150g"],["Coconut Flakes","50g"]],"s":"For the sandwich cookie cream the soft butter for about a minute, then add the sugar and cream for another two minutes. Incorporate the egg fully before mixing in the egg yolk. Once everything is nicely combined, add all remaining ingredients and mix one more time. Form dough into a ball and wrap in plastic wrap. Chill for at least half an hour or overnight.\r\n\r\n2\r\nPreheat oven to 180 degrees Celsius and line two baking sheets with parchment paper.\r\n\r\n3\r\nDivide dough in half, put one back in the fridge and roll out the other thickly on a lightly floured surface. Cut out cookies with either the bottom of a glass or a cookie cutter around 6cm in diameter. Repeat with all the dough.\r\n\r\n4\r\nBake for about 8-10min, the cookies will look very pale. Let cool off before filling half with each a teaspoon of dulce de leche. Place other half of cookies on top and roll the sides of each cookie in the coconut flakes (it helps if the dulce de leche was pressed down to the sides of the cookie). Enjoy.","z":"对于三明治饼干奶油，将软黄油搅拌约一分钟，然后加入糖和奶油再搅拌两分钟。在加入蛋黄之前将鸡蛋充分混合。一旦一切都很好地结合在一起，添加所有剩余的成分并再混合一次。将面团揉成球状并用保鲜膜包裹。冷却至少半小时或过夜。\r\n\r\n2\r\n将烤箱预热至 180 摄氏度，并在两张烤盘上铺上羊皮纸。\r\n\r\n3\r\n将面团分成两半，将一个放回冰箱，然后将另一个在撒了少许面粉的表面上厚厚地擀开。用玻璃杯底部或饼干切刀切出直径约 6 厘米的饼干。对所有面团重复上述步骤。\r\n\r\n4\r\n烘烤约8-10分钟，饼干看起来会很苍白。让其冷却，然后将每茶匙牛奶牛奶倒入一半。将另一半饼干放在上面，然后将每个饼干的侧面卷入椰子片中（如果将焦糖牛奶压到饼干的侧面会有所帮助）。享受。"},{"id":"53334","n":"Arepa Pabellón","a":"Venezuela","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/13fg4j1764441982.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/Tb1PPOyqthA","i":[["Corn Arepa Filled With Mozarella Cheese","2"],["Fried Ripe Bananas","1"],["Black Beans","1 Can"],["Pico De Gallo Sauce","1"],["Shredded Meat","2kg"],["Tomato","1 chopped"],["Salt","Pinch"],["Pepper","Pinch"]],"s":"Prepare the meat in a skillet and add salt and pepper to taste, heat the beans over medium heat in a pan, fry or grill the ripe plantains as indicated on its package and cut the tomato into small cubes. Reserve these ingredients until filling. \r\nPreheat the grill or pan and grill the arepa, putting it once on each side until they are golden brown. \r\nWith the help of a knife, open it by the edge through the middle, creating a space to fill it with the ripe plantain, the beans, meat and chopped tomato. \r\nServe with a little pico de gallo or guacamole dip sauce. ","z":"将肉放入煎锅中，加入盐和胡椒调味，在平底锅中用中火加热豆子，按照包装上的说明煎炸或烧烤成熟的车前草，然后将番茄切成小方块。保留这些原料直至填满。 \r\n预热烤架或平底锅，然后烤玉米饼，每面各放一次，直至呈金黄色。 \r\n用刀从边缘将其从中间打开，留出一个空间，将成熟的车前草、豆子、肉和切碎的番茄填满。 \r\n与少许加洛酱或鳄梨酱一起食用。"},{"id":"53329","n":"Arepa pelua","a":"Venezuela","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/jgl9qq1764437635.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bSWoRyWI6Fo","i":[["Beef","500g"],["Onion","1"],["Red Pepper","1"],["Garlic","2 cloves"],["Cumin","1 tsp"],["Oregano","1 tsp"],["Paprika","1 tsp"],["Beef Stock","1 L"],["Water","2 1/2 cups"],["Salt","Pinch"],["Cheese","200g"],["Extra Virgin Olive Oil","Pinch"]],"s":"Cook the meat: Place the flank steak in a pot with broth or water and salt. Cook over low heat for about 2 hours, until tender and easy to shred.\r\nShred the meat: Once cooked, drain and shred the meat using two forks.\r\nPrepare the vegetables: Sauté chopped onion, bell pepper, and garlic in a little oil. Add cumin, oregano, paprika, and salt. Stir in the meat and cook for a few minutes until the flavors are well combined.\r\nMake the dough: In a bowl, mix the cornmeal with warm water and salt until a soft dough forms. Let it rest for 5 minutes.\r\nForm the arepas: Divide the dough into 6 portions, shape into balls, and flatten into thick discs.\r\nCook: Cook the arepas on a griddle or skillet over medium heat for 2–3 minutes on each side until golden. You can then bake them for a few minutes if you prefer them crispier.\r\nFill: Slice the arepas open on one side, fill with the hot shredded beef, and top with grated cheese.","z":"煮肉：将侧腹牛排放入装有肉汤或水和盐的锅中。小火煮约2小时，直至变软且易于切丝。\r\n切碎肉：煮熟后，沥干并用两把叉子切碎肉。\r\n准备蔬菜：用少许油炒切碎的洋葱、甜椒和大蒜。加入小茴香、牛至、辣椒粉和盐。拌入肉，煮几分钟，直至味道充分混合。\r\n制作面团：在碗中，将玉米粉与温水和盐混合，直至形成柔软的面团。让它休息 5 分钟。\r\n制作玉米饼：将面团分成 6 份，搓成球状，然后压扁成厚片。\r\n烹饪：将玉米饼放在煎锅或煎锅上，用中火将玉米饼每面煎 2-3 分钟，直至呈金黄色。如果你喜欢更脆的话，你可以把它们烤几分钟。\r\n馅料：将玉米饼从一侧切开，填入热牛肉丝，然后在上面撒上磨碎的奶酪。"},{"id":"53330","n":"Cassava pizza","a":"Venezuela","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/lrfdwz1764438393.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3fK4zsa2AYM","i":[["Casabe","6 cut thick slices"],["Tomato Sauce","450g"],["Chorizo","225g"],["Turkey Ham","225g"],["Sweetcorn","75g"],["Green Olives","40g"],["Paprika","55g"],["Mozzarella","50g"]],"s":"Preheat the oven to 200ºC.\r\nCut the bacon or chorizo into medium pieces and the paprika into strips.\r\nSpread a little tomato sauce and mozzarella cheese on each portion of cassava.\r\nAdd the bacon or chorizo, corn, turkey ham, some olives and paprika.\r\nBake for 7 to 10 minutes.\r\nRemove from the oven and enjoy.","z":"将烤箱预热至 200°C。\r\n将培根或香肠切成中等大小的块，将辣椒粉切成条。\r\n在每份木薯上涂上一点番茄酱和马苏里拉奶酪。\r\n添加培根或香肠、玉米、火鸡火腿、一些橄榄和辣椒粉。\r\n烘烤 7 至 10 分钟。\r\n从烤箱中取出并享用。"},{"id":"53331","n":"Oatmeal pancakes","a":"Venezuela","c":"Breakfast","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/c400ok1764439058.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kkrRFWN4LG4","i":[["Egg","1 medium"],["Milk","80 ml"],["Sugar","1 tablespoon"],["Baking Powder","1 tsp"],["Salt","Pinch"],["Vanilla Extract","1 dash"],["Ground Oats","150g"],["Butter","150g"],["Sugar Syrup","1 tablespoon"],["Strawberries","3"]],"s":"Place all the ingredients in the glass and beat.\r\nLet the mixture stand for 10 minutes.\r\nGrease a hot frying pan with a little butter and pour a little of the mixture.\r\nWhen it starts to bubble on the surface, turn over with a spatula. Cook over medium-low heat so that they do not burn.\r\nFinally, add the caramel and strawberries.","z":"将所有原料放入玻璃杯中并搅拌。\r\n让混合物静置 10 分钟。\r\n在热煎锅上涂一点黄油，然后倒入一点混合物。\r\n当表面开始起泡时，用抹刀翻面。用中低火煮，这样它们就不会烧焦。\r\n最后，加入焦糖和草莓。"},{"id":"53333","n":"Passion fruit mousse","a":"Venezuela","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/gkcdpl1764441325.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=x5SRhOq3vfs","i":[["Unflavoured Gelatin","1 ½ tbsp"],["Passion Fruit Pulp","1"],["Sugar","1 cup"],["Condensed Milk","1 Can"],["Egg White","6"],["Mint","1 Sprig"]],"s":"Add gelatin and ¼ cup room-temperature water to small bowl; let sit until gelatin softens, about 5 minutes. In medium saucepan over medium-high heat, stir together passion fruit pulp, sugar and gelatin mixture. Cook, stirring occasionally, until mixture is thoroughly combined and smooth (mixture should not come to a boil). Remove from heat; cool completely. Stir in condensed milk.\r\nMeanwhile, in clean mixing bowl, using electric mixer, beat egg whites until stiff (peaks of egg whites will not droop, and egg whites will not move when bowl is tilted).\r\nStir 1/3 egg whites into cooled passion fruit mixture until combined. Using spatula, gently fold in remaining egg whites until combined. Divide mousse evenly among clear glass serving cups; cover. Refrigerate mousse until well chilled, at least 2 hrs.\r\nServe chilled. Garnish with mint, if desired.","z":"将明胶和 1/4 杯室温水放入小碗中；静置约 5 分钟，直至明胶软化。在中型平底锅中，用中高温将百香果肉、糖和明胶混合物搅拌在一起。煮，偶尔搅拌，直到混合物完全混合且光滑（混合物不应沸腾）。远离热源；完全冷却。加入炼乳搅拌。\r\n同时，在干净的搅拌碗中，用电动搅拌机将蛋白打至硬性发泡（蛋白峰不会下垂，倾斜碗时蛋白也不会移动）。\r\n将 1/3 蛋白加入冷却的百香果混合物中，搅拌直至混合。使用抹刀轻轻拌入剩余的蛋白直至混合。将慕斯均匀地分装在透明玻璃杯中；覆盖。将慕斯冷藏至少 2 小时，直至充分冷却。\r\n冷藏后食用。如果需要，可以用薄荷装饰。"},{"id":"53325","n":"Venezuelan Arepas","a":"Venezuela","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/3hcy191764376285.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kbvh5XaBpJk","i":[["Cornmeal","2 cups"],["Water","2 1/2 cups"],["Salt","1 tsp"],["Vegetable Oil","1 tablespoon"]],"s":"Preheat oven to 410° F.\r\nPour the water into a large bowl. Make sure it is room temperature.\r\nAdd the salt. Blend well with a mixer, fork or spatula to make sure it dissolves well.\r\nWhile you continue to beat the mixture, slowly add the corn meal—a little bit at a time.\r\nOnce all the flour is added, keep mixing until the corn meal, water and salt are thoroughly blended and dissolved.\r\nSet aside the masa in its bowl. Let it rest for 5 minutes so that the flour is thoroughly hydrated. This type of corn flour does not have any gluten, so it doesn’t need to be kneaded. The masa should be smooth, firm yet malleable.\r\nWhile waiting for the 5 minutes’ rest, heat your budare (or comal, griddle, cast-iron pan or non-stick pan) over medium heat. Coat with a little bit of the oil.\r\nFill a small bowl with water to wet your hands to make the arepas.\r\nTake about 2 Tbsp of the masa in your damp hands. The masa should fit easily in your palm so that it is easy to shape into a small ball.\r\n\r\nCross your hands, so that one is on top of the other, with the masa ball between them. Rotate your right hand in a circle, so that you are at the same time both pressing the masa into a flat disc and keeping its round shape.\r\narepa making\r\nThe last step in shaping your arepa is to quickly pass and lightly press the masa disc from one hand to the other until it is about ¾ of an inch thick and 4 inches wide. Smooth the edges with your fingertips (quickly dip them into the water bowl first) so that they stay as round as possible and without cracks.\r\narepa making\r\nPlace your arepas in batches on the preheated surface of your budare griddle or nonstick pan. Let each side turn golden, about 4 to 5 minutes per side. Check them often so that they don’t burn.\r\nOnce they are nicely browned on both sides, place the arepas on a baking sheet in your preheated oven for 10 minutes. They should be somewhat puffy, so that if you tap an arepa lightly on top, it will sound like you are tapping an empty box.\r\nServe arepas hot, whether you stuff with them with your choice of fillings or serve solo to accompany your favorite Venezuelan guiso or stew.","z":"将烤箱预热至 410° F。\r\n将水倒入一个大碗中。确保温度为室温。\r\n添加盐。用搅拌机、叉子或抹刀充分搅拌，确保其充分溶解。\r\n当你继续搅拌混合物时，慢慢加入玉米粉——一次一点点。\r\n添加所有面粉后，继续搅拌直至玉米粉、水和盐完全混合并溶解。\r\n将湿润粉糊放在碗里放在一边。静置 5 分钟，使面粉充分吸水。这种玉米粉没有麸质，所以不需要揉捏。湿润粉糊应该光滑、坚硬但有延展性。\r\n在等待 5 分钟休息的同时，用中火加热布达雷（或普通平底锅、煎锅、铸铁锅或不粘锅）。涂上一点点油。\r\n在一个小碗里装满水，弄湿双手，制作玉米饼。\r\n取约 2 汤匙湿润粉糊在湿手中。湿润粉糊应该很容易放在手掌中，这样很容易形成一个小球。\r\n\r\n双手交叉，一只手放在另一只手上面，玛莎球放在两只手之间。将右手旋转一圈，这样您就可以同时将湿润粉糊压成扁平的圆盘并保持其圆形。\r\n玉米饼制作\r\n塑造玉米饼形状的最后一步是快速传递并轻轻地从一只手向另一只手按压湿润粉糊盘，直到其厚度约为 3/4 英寸，宽度为 4 英寸。用指尖抚平边缘（先将其快速浸入水碗中），使其尽可能保持圆润且无裂纹。\r\n玉米饼制作\r\n将玉米饼分批放在布达雷煎锅或不粘锅的预热表面上。让每一面都变成金黄色，每面大约4到5分钟。经常检查，以免烧焦。\r\n一旦两面都变成漂亮的棕色，将玉米饼放在烤盘上，放入预热的烤箱中烤 10 分钟。它们应该有点浮肿，这样如果你轻轻敲击玉米饼的顶部，听起来就像你在敲击一个空盒子。\r\n无论您是用自己选择的馅料填充玉米饼，还是单独食用，搭配您最喜欢的委内瑞拉吉索或炖菜，都可以趁热享用玉米饼。"},{"id":"53327","n":"Venezuelan Coconut Chicken","a":"Venezuela","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/z2sw3o1764378271.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=32rCc85rZJA","i":[["Chicken Breasts","2"],["Onion","2 chopped"],["Garlic","1 clove peeled crushed"],["Bay Leaves","4"],["Black Pepper","Pinch"],["Turmeric","Pinch"],["Cumin","Pinch"],["Salt","Pinch"],["Sugar","1 tablespoon"],["Tomato","3"],["Ginger Paste","1 tablespoon"],["Olive Oil","1/3 cup"],["Coconut Milk","1 Can"],["Water","1/2 cup"]],"s":"Cut the chicken up into bite size pieces. Peel and cut the onions, mince the garlic.\r\nAssemble the rest of the ingredients and you are ready to start cooking.\r\nMake the Dish\r\nHeat up a fry pan over medium heat. Add the oil and when hot, sauté the onion until translucent. Remove from pan and transfer to a blender or food processor.\r\nAdd tomatoes, garlic, turmeric, cumin, sugar, ginger paste, coconut milk, water and blend smooth.\r\nIn the same pan you cooked the onion, add the chicken and brown all sides. This should take about 3 minutes.\r\nAdd the blender ingredients and bay leaves to the pan, bring to a simmer and cook until the chicken is white inside and the liquid is creamy. (15 to 20 minutes)\r\nRemove the bay leaves and serve with white rice.","z":"将鸡肉切成一口大小的块。洋葱去皮切碎，大蒜切碎。\r\n准备好其余的原料，就可以开始烹饪了。\r\n做菜\r\n用中火加热煎锅。加入油，热时将洋葱炒至半透明。从锅中取出并转移到搅拌机或食品加工机中。\r\n加入西红柿、大蒜、姜黄、小茴香、糖、姜酱、椰奶、水，搅拌均匀。\r\n在煮洋葱的同一个锅中，加入鸡肉，将各面煎至棕色。这大约需要 3 分钟。\r\n将搅拌机原料和月桂叶放入锅中，小火煮至鸡肉内部呈白色且液体呈奶油状。 （15至20分钟）\r\n取出月桂叶，与白米饭一起食用。"},{"id":"53326","n":"Venezuelan Sancocho","a":"Venezuela","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/8859m71764377470.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=w6KNOKkcRBs","i":[["Hind Shank","2 Lbs"],["Onion","2 small"],["Pepper","1/2"],["Garlic","4 Cloves Chopped"],["Garlic","4 Cloves Crushed"],["Leek","1"],["Beef Stock","8 cups"],["Sweet Red Peppers","1/2 cup"],["Scallions","1/2 cup"],["Sweetcorn","2"],["Cassaba","1/2 lb"],["Yautia","1/2 lb"],["White Yam","1/2 lb"],["Butternut Squash","1/2 lb"],["Salt","To taste"],["Pepper","To taste"],["Cilantro","Chopped"]],"s":"Add hind shank, 1 halved small onion, halved bell pepper, 4 whole garlic cloves, the dark green leaves of the leek, and stock to a large stockpot. Cook for 45-60 minutes until the meat is fork-tender. NOTE: the meat can take a bit longer to be fork-tender; that is okay, just add more cooking time if necessary.\r\nWhen the meat is tender, remove the big pieces of vegetables and bones. Discard.\r\nAdd diced onion, 2 minced garlic, mini sweet peppers, sliced leeks (light green part), scallions, yucca, and corn; Mix and simmer covered over medium heat for 5- 8 minutes, until the yucca is starting to soften. NOTE: the yuca can take a bit longer to start softening; that is okay, just add more cooking time if necessary.\r\nAdd yautia, white yam, and butternut squash. Mix to combine. Simmer covered over medium heat for 5 – 6 minutes, until all the root vegetables are tender. NOTE: Do not cook too much, or they will fall apart.\r\nTaste and add salt to your taste, if necessary. Add cilantro and the remaining 2 minced garlic cloves. Mix and let simmer for 2 more minutes.\r\nServe hot in large soup bowls, dividing the meat and vegetables evenly. Add a squish of lime juice and/or hot sauce, if desired. Serve along with arepas and or casabe (cassava bread).","z":"加入后腿肉、1 个半个小洋葱、半个甜椒、4 个完整的蒜瓣、深绿色的韭菜叶，然后将汤放入一个大汤锅中。煮 45-60 分钟，直至肉变软。注意：肉可能需要更长的时间才能用叉子嫩化；没关系，如有必要，只需增加烹饪时间即可。\r\n当肉变软时，去掉大块蔬菜和骨头。丢弃。\r\n加入洋葱丁、蒜末2颗、小甜椒、韭菜片（浅绿色部分）、葱、丝兰、玉米；混合并用中火煮 5-8 分钟，直到丝兰开始软化。注意：尤卡可能需要更长的时间才能开始软化；没关系，如有必要，只需增加烹饪时间即可。\r\n加入yautia、白山药和胡桃南瓜。混合混合。加盖中火煮 5-6 分钟，直至所有根类蔬菜变软。注意：不要煮太多，否则它们会散开。\r\n如有必要，品尝并根据您的口味添加盐。加入香菜和剩余的 2 瓣蒜末。混合并再煮 2 分钟。\r\n趁热盛在大汤碗中，将肉和蔬菜均匀分开。如果需要的话，添加一点酸橙汁和/或辣酱。与 arepas 和/或 casabe（木薯面包）一起食用。"},{"id":"53328","n":"Venezuelan Shredded Beef","a":"Venezuela","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/mq27gf1764436795.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TPn1BKS5Eio","i":[["Skirty Steak","2 Lbs"],["Garlic","2 cloves minced"],["Onion","1 chopped"],["Onion","1 sliced"],["Red Pepper","1 sliced"],["Tomato","3 sliced thinly"],["Beef Stock","4 cups"],["Worcestershire Sauce","2 tsp"],["Tomato Puree","1 tablespoon"],["Cumin","1 tsp"],["Tomato Ketchup","1/4 cup"],["Salt","To taste"],["Pepper","To taste"],["Olive Oil","1 tablespoon"]],"s":"Season beef with salt, pepper and minced garlic\r\nChop 1 onion in 4 big wedges\r\nPlace in the beef pressure cooker with the 4 wedges of onion and the stock\r\nPressure cook for 20 minutes\r\nRelease the pressure and open the lid\r\nRemove the beef and SAVE 2 cups of stock in another container\r\nWith 2 forks, shred the beef. Beef should be tender enough to so easily. If not, cook for another 10 minutes\r\nPress the saute button of the Instant pot. Add the olive oil\r\nWhen the machine beeps, add the sliced onion, pepper and tomatoes. Cook until tender\r\nAdd the shredded beef back in the pot and mix\r\nPour in 1 1/2 cups of the saved stock, the Worcestershire sauce, tomato paste, ketchup and cumin. Mix\r\nIf sauce seems to dry, add a tad more of stock\r\nSeason with salt and pepper\r\nServe!","z":"用盐、胡椒和蒜末给牛肉调味\r\n将 1 个洋葱切成 4 个大楔子\r\n将 4 块洋葱和高汤放入牛肉高压锅中\r\n高压锅煮20分钟\r\n释放压力并打开盖子\r\n取出牛肉并将 2 杯高汤放入另一个容器中\r\n用两把叉子，将牛肉切碎。牛肉应该足够嫩，这样很容易。如果没有，再煮10分钟\r\n按速溶锅的炒按钮。添加橄榄油\r\n当机器发出蜂鸣声时，加入切好的洋葱、胡椒和西红柿。煮至软烂\r\n将牛肉丝放回锅中，搅拌均匀\r\n倒入 1 1/2 杯保存的高汤、伍斯特沙司、番茄酱、番茄酱和小茴香。混合\r\n如果酱汁看起来干了，再加一点汤\r\n加盐和胡椒调味\r\n发球！"},{"id":"53332","n":"Venezuelan turnovers","a":"Venezuela","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/zjtfp31764440795.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OfuQf6sCycU","i":[["Ground Beef","450g"],["Pepper","Pinch"],["Ground Cumin","Pinch"],["Vegetable Oil","1 tablespoon"],["Onion","1 cup"],["Green Pepper","1/2 cup"],["Red Pepper","1/2 cup"],["Garlic Powder","1 tsp"],["Capers","1/4 cup"],["Tomato Sauce","1 Can"],["Sazon","1 Can"],["Yellow Masarepa","2"],["Vegetable Oil","For frying"]],"s":"Season meat with Adobo. In skillet, heat oil on medium high. Cook meat until pink is gone. Stir in onion, pepper, garlic, alcaparras, tomato sauce and Sazón. Cook, stirring often until most of the liquid has evaporated (about 20 minutes). Cool.\r\nPrepared dough should be moist and should hold together, but it should not stick to your fingers. Start with about ½ cup of dough and roll into a ball between palms of your hands. Working on a sheet of non-stick parchment paper, form the ball into a 5-inch circle about ⅛ inch thick. Place a generous tbsp. of filling on one half of circle and using parchment paper close dough over to form a semi-circle. To seal and trim edges of the empanada, press lip of inverted bowl over semi-circle shaped patty. Repeat for all the Empanadas.\r\nIn large skillet on medium high, heat ½ inch of oil until hot but not smoking. Cook empanadas in batches, turning once or twice until lightly browned. Drain on paper towel. Do not over crowd skillet or let oil get too hot.","z":"用阿多波给肉调味。在煎锅中，用中高火加热油。将肉煮至粉红色消失。拌入洋葱、胡椒、大蒜、阿尔卡帕拉斯、番茄酱和 Sazón。煮时经常搅拌，直至大部分液体蒸发（约 20 分钟）。凉爽的。\r\n准备好的面团应该是湿润的并且应该粘在一起，但不应该粘在手指上。从大约 ½ 杯面团开始，在手掌之间揉成一个球。在一张不粘羊皮纸上，将球形成一个 5 英寸、约 ⅛ 英寸厚的圆圈。放一大汤匙。在半个圆上填充馅料，然后用羊皮纸将面团包起来，形成半圆。为了密封和修剪肉馅卷饼的边缘，将倒置碗的边缘压在半圆形肉饼上。对所有肉馅卷饼重复上述步骤。\r\n在大煎锅中，用中火加热 ½ 英寸的油，直至热但不冒烟。分批煮肉馅卷饼，翻转一两次直至呈浅棕色。用纸巾沥干水分。不要过度拥挤煎锅或让油变得太热。"},{"id":"53239","n":"Bang bang prawn salad","a":"Vietnamese","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/4xcfai1763765676.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Na-6-lzs2wU","i":[["Rice Noodles","140g"],["Peanut Butter","3 tablespoons"],["Coconut Milk","4 tablespoons"],["sweet chilli sauce","3  tablespoons"],["Spring Onions","3 sliced thinly"],["Cucumber","1 sliced"],["Bean Sprouts","300g"],["Prawns","200g"]],"s":"step 1\r\nCook the noodles following pack instructions, then rinse under cold water and drain thoroughly. In a small saucepan melt together the peanut butter, coconut milk, sweet chilli sauce and half the spring onions, adding 1-2 tbsp of water to loosen the mixture to a drizzling consistency.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nMix the noodles, cucumber and beansprouts in a serving dish. Top with the prawns, drizzle over the peanut sauce and scatter over the remaining spring onions.","z":"步骤1\r\n按照包装说明煮面条，然后用冷水冲洗并彻底沥干。在一个小平底锅中，将花生酱、椰奶、甜辣椒酱和一半的葱融化在一起，加入 1-2 汤匙水，将混合物打散至细雨稠度。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将面条、黄瓜和豆芽放入盘中混合。上面放上虾，淋上花生酱，撒上剩下的葱。"},{"id":"53242","n":"Barbecue pork buns","a":"Vietnamese","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/tzsy461763769901.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=T3mBULRIcY8","i":[["Sugar","85g"],["White Bread Mix","500g"],["Sunflower Oil","1 tablespoon"],["Bacon","12"],["Ginger","Knob"],["Garlic","2 cloves chopped"],["Soy Sauce","2 tablespoons"],["Clear Honey","3  tablespoons"],["Tomato Puree","3  tablespoons"],["Egg","1 beaten"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat the oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas. Mix the sugar into the bread mix in a large bowl, then add water as instructed on the pack. Bring the dough together with a wooden spoon, then knead on a lightly floured surface for 5 mins until smooth. Put into a large bowl, cover with oiled cling film then leave in a warm place until doubled in size.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nMeanwhile, heat the oil in a pan, then fry the bacon until crisp, about 5 mins. Add the ginger and garlic and fry for 1 min until soft, then tip in the soy, honey and tomato purée and stir well. Can be made up to 3 days ahead.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nTurn out the dough and knead briefly, then pull into 12 even-sized balls. Flatten with your hands, then put a teaspoon-size blob of the filling in the middle. Draw the dough up and pinch it closed like a purse, then turn the bun over and sit it on a large baking sheet. Cover with oiled cling film and leave to rise for about 30 mins until the dough feels pillowy. Brush with egg and bake for 20 mins until golden. Serve warm with dipping sauce. Can be frozen after second rise for up to 1 month or baked up to a day ahead and re-warmed.","z":"步骤1\r\n将烤箱加热至 200C/风扇 180C/燃气。将糖混入大碗中的面包粉中，然后按照包装上的说明加水。用木勺将面团放在一起，然后在撒有少许面粉的表面上揉捏 5 分钟直至光滑。放入一个大碗中，盖上涂有油的保鲜膜，然后放置在温暖的地方，直至尺寸增加一倍。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n与此同时，在锅中加热油，然后将培根煎至酥脆，大约需要5分钟。加入生姜和大蒜，炒 1 分钟至变软，然后加入大豆、蜂蜜和番茄泥，搅拌均匀。最多可提前 3 天补足。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n把面团翻出来，稍微揉一下，然后分成12个大小均匀的球。用手压平，然后在中间放一茶匙大小的馅料。把面团拉起来，像钱包一样捏紧，然后把面包翻过来，放在一张大烤盘上。盖上涂了油的保鲜膜，发酵约 30 分钟，直到面团摸起来像枕头一样。刷上鸡蛋液，烘烤 20 分钟直至呈金黄色。趁热蘸酱食用。第二次发酵后可冷冻最多 1 个月，或提前一天烘烤并重新加热。"},{"id":"52997","n":"Beef Banh Mi Bowls with Sriracha Mayo, Carrot & Pickled Cucumber","a":"Vietnamese","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/z0ageb1583189517.jpg","y":"","i":[["Rice","White"],["Onion","1"],["Lime","1"],["Garlic Clove","3"],["Cucumber","1"],["Carrots","3 oz"],["Ground Beef","1 lb"],["Soy Sauce","2 oz"]],"s":"Add'l ingredients: mayonnaise, siracha\r\n\r\n1\r\n\r\nPlace rice in a fine-mesh sieve and rinse until water runs clear. Add to a small pot with 1 cup water (2 cups for 4 servings) and a pinch of salt. Bring to a boil, then cover and reduce heat to low. Cook until rice is tender, 15 minutes. Keep covered off heat for at least 10 minutes or until ready to serve.\r\n\r\n2\r\n\r\nMeanwhile, wash and dry all produce. Peel and finely chop garlic. Zest and quarter lime (for 4 servings, zest 1 lime and quarter both). Trim and halve cucumber lengthwise; thinly slice crosswise into half-moons. Halve, peel, and medium dice onion. Trim, peel, and grate carrot.\r\n\r\n3\r\n\r\nIn a medium bowl, combine cucumber, juice from half the lime, ¼ tsp sugar (½ tsp for 4 servings), and a pinch of salt. In a small bowl, combine mayonnaise, a pinch of garlic, a squeeze of lime juice, and as much sriracha as you’d like. Season with salt and pepper.\r\n\r\n4\r\n\r\nHeat a drizzle of oil in a large pan over medium-high heat. Add onion and cook, stirring, until softened, 4-5 minutes. Add beef, remaining garlic, and 2 tsp sugar (4 tsp for 4 servings). Cook, breaking up meat into pieces, until beef is browned and cooked through, 4-5 minutes. Stir in soy sauce. Turn off heat; taste and season with salt and pepper.\r\n\r\n5\r\n\r\nFluff rice with a fork; stir in lime zest and 1 TBSP butter. Divide rice between bowls. Arrange beef, grated carrot, and pickled cucumber on top. Top with a squeeze of lime juice. Drizzle with sriracha mayo.","z":"添加成分：蛋黄酱、西拉差酱\r\n\r\n1\r\n\r\n将大米放入细网筛中，冲洗直至水清澈。将 1 杯水（2 杯，4 人份）和少许盐放入小锅中。煮沸，然后盖上盖子并将热量降至最低。煮15分钟，直到米饭变软。盖上盖子，关火至少 10 分钟或直至准备食用。\r\n\r\n2\r\n\r\n同时，清洗并干燥所有产品。大蒜去皮并切碎。青柠皮碎并切成四分之一（4 份，将 1 个青柠皮碎并切成四分之一）。将黄瓜纵向修剪并切成两半；横向切成薄片，切成半月形。洋葱切半、去皮、切丁。胡萝卜修剪、去皮并磨碎。\r\n\r\n3\r\n\r\n在一个中等大小的碗中，混合黄瓜、半个酸橙汁、1/4 茶匙糖（1/2 茶匙，4 人份）和少许盐。在一个小碗中，混合蛋黄酱、少许大蒜、挤一点酸橙汁和尽可能多的拉差酱。用盐和胡椒调味。\r\n\r\n4\r\n\r\n在大平底锅中用中高火加热毛毛雨。加入洋葱，搅拌 4-5 分钟直至变软。加入牛肉、剩余的大蒜和 2 茶匙糖（4 人份 4 茶匙）。将肉切成块，煮 4-5 分钟，直至牛肉变成棕色并煮熟。拌入酱油。关掉暖气；品尝并用盐和胡椒调味。\r\n\r\n5\r\n\r\n用叉子把米饭弄松；加入酸橙皮碎和 1 汤匙黄油。将米饭分装在碗中。将牛肉、磨碎的胡萝卜和腌黄瓜放在上面。上面挤上柠檬汁。淋上是拉差蛋黄酱。"},{"id":"53238","n":"Beef pho","a":"Vietnamese","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/pbzcrx1763765096.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WlosNFMCnE4","i":[["Beef Stock","1 L"],["Onion","1 large"],["Ginger","1 Large Chopped"],["Cinnamon Stick","1"],["Star Anise","2"],["Coriander Seeds","1 tsp"],["Cloves","1/2 teaspoon"],["Sirloin steak","225g"],["Palm Sugar","1 tsp"],["Fish Sauce","1 tablespoon"],["Soy Sauce","1 ½ tbsp"],["Rice Noodles","200g"],["Spring Onions","2 sliced"],["Birds-eye Chillies","1 small"],["Basil","Handful"],["Coriander","Handful"],["Lime","1"]],"s":"step 1\r\nTip the beef stock along with 500ml of water into a large saucepan. Sit the onion and ginger in a frying pan over a high heat and char on all sides, around 3-5 mins (you can also do this under your grill). Once charred, add to the beef stock. In the same pan, toast the spices for 2-3 mins and once they begin to smell fragrant, add them to the beef stock as well. Bring the stock to the boil, then turn to a simmer and cook for 30mins before straining.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nMeanwhile, cut the fat from the steak and wrap in cling film, then put into the freezer for 15 mins – this will make your steak really easy to slice! Slice it thinly, then cover with cling film again and pop into the fridge.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nTaste the beef stock and use the palm sugar, fish sauce and soy to season. Cook the noodles according to package instructions and split between two bowls, topping each with the sliced beef. Bring the stock to the boil and then pour into the bowls (the heat will cook the beef). Top each with the spring onions, chilli slices and herbs. Serve with the lime wedges to squeeze over.","z":"步骤1\r\n将牛肉高汤与 500 毫升水一起倒入一个大平底锅中。将洋葱和生姜放入煎锅中，用高温将各面烧焦，大约 3-5 分钟（您也可以在烤架下进行此操作）。烧焦后，加入牛肉汤中。在同一个平底锅中，将香料烤 2-3 分钟，一旦它们开始散发出香味，将它们也添加到牛肉汤中。将高汤煮沸，然后转小火煮 30 分钟，然后过滤。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n同时，把牛排上的脂肪切掉，用保鲜膜包起来，然后放入冰箱冷冻15分钟——这样你的牛排就很容易切片了！切成薄片，然后再次盖上保鲜膜，放入冰箱。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n品尝牛肉汤，并用棕榈糖、鱼露和酱油调味。按照包装说明煮面条，然后分成两个碗，在每个碗上放上切片牛肉。将高汤煮沸，然后倒入碗中（热量会煮牛肉）。在上面放上葱、辣椒片和香草。与酸橙块一起食用，挤在上面。"},{"id":"53245","n":"Noodle bowl salad","a":"Vietnamese","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/zry07j1763779321.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7EAdKeikJ9o","i":[["Rice Noodles","125g"],["Sugar Snap Peas","200g"],["Sesame Seed Oil","2 tsp"],["Spring Onions","4 sliced"],["Coriander","Handful"],["Hot Smoked Flaked Salmon","150g"],["Pretzels","To serve"],["Soy Sauce","3  tablespoons"],["Clear Honey","1 tablespoon"],["Lemon Juice","1 tablespoon"],["Ground Nut Oil","1 tablespoon"],["Garlic","1 clove finely chopped"],["Ginger","Knob"]],"s":"step 1\r\nDrop the noodles into a large bowl, then pour over enough boiling water to cover. Tip in the sliced sugar snaps and leave for 4 minutes. Drain in a colander, put under cold running water to cool off, then drain again. Tip into a bowl and toss in the sesame oil.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nMix the dressing ingredients. Pile spring onions, coriander and salmon onto the noodles, pour over the dressing and toss everything together. Serve with a pretzel or bread roll.","z":"步骤1\r\n将面条放入一个大碗中，然后倒入足够的沸水以覆盖面条。倒入切好的糖片，静置 4 分钟。用漏勺沥干水分，放在冷自来水下冷却，然后再次沥干。倒入碗中，拌入芝麻油。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n混合调味料。将葱、香菜和三文鱼堆在面条上，倒在调料上，然后将所有东西搅拌在一起。与椒盐卷饼或面包卷一起食用。"},{"id":"53244","n":"Prawn & noodle salad with crispy shallots","a":"Vietnamese","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/0iryz91763778419.jpg","y":"","i":[["Rice Noodles","200g"],["Prawns","200g"],["Red Onions","1 sliced"],["Red Chilli","1 sliced"],["Cucumber","1 sliced"],["Coriander","Handful"],["Mint","Handful"],["Roasted Peanut","2 tablespoons"],["Lime","Juice of 3"],["Brown Sugar","1 tablespoon"],["Fish Sauce","2 tsp"],["Garlic","1 clove peeled crushed"],["Shallots","5 Slices"],["Vegetable Oil","For frying"],["Flour","Sprinkling"]],"s":"step 1\r\nFor the crispy shallots, heat 5cm of oil until hot in a wok. You will know the oil is hot enough when one piece of shallot sizzles as soon as it’s dropped in. Toss the shallot slices with flour, shake off excess and fry in the oil until golden. They fry quickly, about 1 min. Drain on kitchen paper, sprinkle with salt and set aside.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nTo make the dressing, mix the lime juice, sugar, fish sauce and garlic and set aside. In a large mixing bowl, pour boiling water over the noodles. Leave them for 2 mins or until they are just cooked, then rinse under cold water. Drain well, shaking the sieve numerous times to get out the excess water, then place back in the bowl. Add prawns, onion, chilli, cucumber and herbs. Pour the dressing over, mix, then sprinkle with the shallots and peanuts.","z":"步骤1\r\n为了炸脆葱，在锅中加热5厘米厚的油至热。当一片葱放入锅中发出嘶嘶声时，就说明油已经足够热了。将葱片撒上面粉，甩掉多余的面粉，然后在油中炸至金黄色。煎得很快，大约1分钟。用厨房纸吸干水分，撒上盐，放在一边。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n制作调料时，将酸橙汁、糖、鱼露和大蒜混合并放在一边。在一个大碗中，将沸水倒在面条上。将它们放置 2 分钟或直到它们刚刚煮熟，然后用冷水冲洗。沥干水分，多次摇动筛子以除去多余的水，然后放回碗中。加入虾、洋葱、辣椒、黄瓜和香草。倒入调料，混合，然后撒上青葱和花生。"},{"id":"53230","n":"Purple sprouting broccoli tempura with nuoc cham","a":"Vietnamese","c":"Miscellaneous","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/xnv4wf1763756529.jpg","y":"","i":[["Corn Flour","50g"],["Plain Flour","100g"],["Sesame Seed","1 tablespoon"],["Vegetable Oil","For frying"],["Soda Water","250ml"],["Purple Sprouting Broccoli","200g"],["Fish Sauce","2 tablespoons"],["Lime","Juice of 2"],["Birds-eye Chillies","1 chopped"],["Sugar","2 tablespoons"]],"s":"step 1\r\nFor the nuoc cham, whisk together all of the ingredients with 5 tbsp hot water in a small bowl. Set aside while you make the tempura.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nWhisk the cornflour, plain flour, sesame seeds (if using) and a large pinch of salt together. Fill a large, deep pan no more than a third full with the vegetable oil and heat until it reaches 180C or a cube of bread dropped in browns in 20 seconds.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nQuickly whisk the soda water into the flour mixture, being careful not to overmix, then dunk in the broccoli using tongs. Carefully lower into the hot oil and cook for 2-3 mins until crisp. Drain on kitchen paper, then serve with the nuoc cham on the side for dipping.","z":"步骤1\r\n对于 nuoc cham，将所有原料与 5 汤匙热水放在一个小碗中搅拌在一起。做天妇罗的时候放在一边。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将玉米粉、普通面粉、芝麻（如果使用）和一大撮盐一起搅拌。在一个大而深的平底锅中倒入不超过三分之一的植物油，加热至 180°C 或在 20 秒内将一块面包放入棕色中。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n快速将苏打水搅拌到面粉混合物中，小心不要过度混合，然后用钳子浸入西兰花中。小心地放入热油中，煮 2-3 分钟直至酥脆。用厨房用纸吸干水分，然后将 Nuoc Cham 放在一边蘸着吃。"},{"id":"53227","n":"Rice paper dumplings","a":"Vietnamese","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/sfahy01763752319.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/YU09jIusxo4","i":[["White Cabbage","1/4"],["Carrots","1"],["Shiitake Mushrooms","100g"],["Ground Pork","400g"],["Garlic","2 cloves minced"],["Ginger","20g"],["Soy Sauce","2 tsp"],["Sesame Seed Oil","2 tsp"],["Spring Onions","3 sliced thinly"],["Rice Paper Sheets","20"],["Vegetable Oil","75 ml"],["Soy Sauce","2 tablespoons"],["Rice Vinegar","2 tablespoons"],["Sesame Seed","1/2 tbs"],["Spring Onions","2 sliced"]],"s":"step 1\r\nTip the cabbage into a food processor and blitz until finely chopped. Season with ½ tsp salt, toss well and set aside for 15 mins. Tip into a clean tea towel and squeeze out as much water as you can. Tip into a bowl with the carrot, mushrooms, pork mince, garlic, ginger, soy sauce, sesame oil and spring onions. Season with black pepper. Scrunch everything together using your hands, mixing well until everything is combined.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nSoak the spring roll sheets for a couple of seconds in a shallow dish of warm water, then transfer to an oiled chopping board. Working with one sheet at a time, spoon 1 heaped tbsp of the filling into the middle, then fold the bottom up and over the filling. Fold down the top of the sheet, then the sides to fully encase and make a neat square. If the dumpling feels a little fragile, soak another sheet and wrap it again. Repeat with the remaining sheets and filling, transferring the dumplings to an oiled plate as you go.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nHeat the oil in a large, non-stick frying pan (ensuring it is no more than a third full) over a medium-high heat and fry the dumplings for 3-5 mins until golden brown. Use a slotted spoon or spider to turn them, then cover with a lid and cook for another 3-4 mins until golden. Remove the lid and cook for 1-2 mins.\r\n\r\nstep 4\r\nMeanwhile, combine all the dipping sauce ingredients in small bowl. Serve the dumplings with the dipping sauce on the side.","z":"步骤1\r\n将卷心菜放入食品加工机中，快速搅拌直至切碎。加 ½ 茶匙盐调味，搅拌均匀，放置 15 分钟。倒入干净的茶巾中，尽可能多地挤出水。将胡萝卜、蘑菇、猪肉末、大蒜、生姜、酱油、芝麻油和葱倒入碗中。用黑胡椒调味。用手将所有东西揉碎在一起，充分混合，直到所有东西都混合在一起。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将春卷片在装有温水的浅盘中浸泡几秒钟，然后转移到涂了油的砧板上。一次处理一张，将一汤匙馅料舀到中间，然后将底部向上折叠到馅料上。将纸张的顶部向下折叠，然后将两侧完全包住并形成整齐的正方形。如果感觉饺子有点脆弱，可以再泡一张纸，然后再包起来。对剩下的面片和馅料重复上述步骤，边做边将饺子转移到涂了油的盘子上。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n在一个大的不粘煎锅中用中高火加热油（确保油量不超过三分之一），将饺子煎3-5分钟，直至呈金黄色。用开槽勺或蜘蛛翻动它们，然后盖上盖子，再煮 3-4 分钟直至金黄。取下盖子，煮 1-2 分钟。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n同时，将所有蘸酱成分混合在小碗中。将饺子与蘸酱放在一起上桌。"},{"id":"53234","n":"Salmon noodle soup","a":"Vietnamese","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/ikizdm1763760862.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=__Kh1sizUAM","i":[["Chicken Stock","1 L"],["Thai Red Curry Paste","2 tsp"],["Rice Noodles","100g"],["Shiitake Mushrooms","150g"],["Sweetcorn","125g"],["Salmon","2"],["Lime","Juice of 2"],["Soy Sauce","1 tablespoon"],["Brown Sugar","Pinch"],["Coriander","Bunch"]],"s":"step 1\r\nPour the stock into a large pan, bring to the boil, then stir in the curry paste. Add the noodles and cook for 8 mins. Tip in the mushrooms and corn and cook for 2 mins more.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nAdd the salmon to the pan and cook for 3 mins or until cooked through. Remove from the heat and stir in the lime juice, soy sauce and a pinch of sugar. Ladle into 4 bowls and sprinkle over the coriander just before you serve.","z":"步骤1\r\n将高汤倒入大锅中，煮沸，然后加入咖喱酱搅拌。加入面条，煮8分钟。倒入蘑菇和玉米，再煮 2 分钟。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将三文鱼放入锅中，煮 3 分钟或直至熟透。从火上移开，加入酸橙汁、酱油和少许糖，搅拌。用勺子盛入 4 个碗中，并在食用前撒上香菜。"},{"id":"53248","n":"Salmon noodle wraps","a":"Vietnamese","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/prrirc1763781360.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9j2qftITN-Y","i":[["Rice Noodles","100g"],["Spring Onions","3 sliced thinly"],["Petit Pois","50g"],["Chilli","85g"],["Coriander","85g"],["Lime","85g"],["Salmon","300g"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6. Put the noodles in a bowl and pour over enough boiling water to just cover them. Leave for 2 mins, until they are bendable, but not too soft, then drain well. Return to the bowl with the spring onions, petit pois, salt and pepper and a third of the butter. Mix well until the butter has melted.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nPile the noodles and vegetables onto two large squares of baking parchment, then sit the salmon on top. Slice the remaining butter and arrange over the top of the salmon. Bring the ends of the paper over the fish, fold them together to seal, then tuck the ends of the paper underneath so there are no gaps. Put the parcels on a baking sheet and bake for 15-20 mins. Transfer to dinner plates and serve without delay.","z":"步骤1\r\n将烤箱加热至 200C/风扇 180C/煤气 6. 将面条放入碗中，倒入足够的沸水以刚好覆盖面条。静置 2 分钟，直到它们可弯曲，但不要太软，然后沥干。将葱、小豆、盐和胡椒以及三分之一的黄油放回碗中。充分搅拌直至黄油融化。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将面条和蔬菜堆放在两大块烘焙羊皮纸上，然后将鲑鱼放在上面。将剩余的黄油切成片，放在三文鱼的上面。将纸的两端放在鱼上，将它们折叠在一起密封，然后将纸的两端塞在下面，这样就没有间隙。将包裹放在烤盘上，烘烤 15-20 分钟。转移到餐盘并立即上桌。"},{"id":"53233","n":"Salt & pepper squid","a":"Vietnamese","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/yxiilf1763759428.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=l1Ik6k22s1I","i":[["Corn Flour","85g"],["Plain Flour","85g"],["Black Pepper","2 tsp"],["Szechuan Peppercorns","2 tsp"],["Sunflower Oil","For frying"],["Squid","400g"],["Spring Onions","Sliced"],["Green Chilli","Sliced"],["Red Chilli","1 chopped"],["Cucumber","1/2"],["Red Onions","1 chopped"],["Rice Vinegar","100 ml"],["Caster Sugar","1 tablespoon"],["Fish Sauce","2 tsp"]],"s":"step 1\r\nTo make the dipping sauce, mix all the ingredients in a small bowl until the sugar has dissolved, then set aside. Mix the cornflour and plain flour with both peppers and 2 tsp sea salt in a large bowl, then set aside. Line a tray with kitchen paper and make sure you have more salt to sprinkle with.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nHeat about 7cm of oil to 180C in a deep fryer, wok or deep pan. If you don’t have a thermometer, you can test it with a cube of bread – it should brown in 20 secs. Coat the squid well with the flour mix and fry in batches for about 2 mins each or until crisp. Use a slotted spoon to lift out the squid, then drain on the kitchen paper and sprinkle with a little more salt. Serve the squid scattered with the spring onion and chilli, with the dipping sauce on the side.","z":"步骤1\r\n制作蘸酱时，将所有原料混合在一个小碗中，直至糖溶解，然后放在一边。将玉米粉、普通面粉、辣椒和 2 茶匙海盐放入一个大碗中混合，然后放在一边。在托盘上铺上厨房用纸，并确保撒上更多的盐。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n在油炸锅、炒锅或深锅中将约 7 厘米厚的油加热至 180°C。如果你没有温度计，你可以用一块面包来测试——它应该在 20 秒内变成棕色。将鱿鱼均匀地裹上面粉混合物，然后分批煎炸，每批约 2 分钟或直至酥脆。用漏勺将鱿鱼捞出，然后用厨房纸吸干水分，撒上少许盐。将鱿鱼撒上葱和辣椒，配上蘸酱即可食用。"},{"id":"53247","n":"Sea bass with sizzled ginger, chilli & spring onions","a":"Vietnamese","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/tqd7s21763780609.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xzDYKZl50FQ","i":[["Sea Bass Fillets","6"],["Sunflower Oil","3  tablespoons"],["Ginger","Knob"],["Garlic Clove","3 sliced thinly"],["Red Chilli","3 Large"],["Spring Onions","Bunch"],["Soy Sauce","1 tablespoon"]],"s":"step 1\r\nSeason 6 sea bass fillets with salt and pepper, then slash the skin 3 times.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nHeat a heavy-based frying pan and add 1 tbsp sunflower oil.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nOnce hot, fry the sea bass fillets, skin-side down, for 5 mins or until the skin is very crisp and golden. The fish will be almost cooked through.\r\n\r\nstep 4\r\nTurn over, cook for another 30 seconds - 1 minute, then transfer to a serving plate and keep warm. You’ll need to fry the sea bass fillets in 2 batches.\r\n\r\nstep 5\r\nHeat 2 tbsp sunflower oil, then fry the large knob of peeled ginger, cut into matchsticks, 3 thinly sliced garlic cloves and 3 thinly shredded red chillies for about 2 mins until golden.\r\n\r\nstep 6\r\nTake off the heat and toss in the bunch of shredded spring onions. Splash the fish with 1 tbsp soy sauce and spoon over the contents of the pan.","z":"步骤1\r\n用盐和胡椒调味 6 片鲈鱼片，然后将鱼皮划 3 次。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n加热厚底煎锅，加入 1 汤匙葵花籽油。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n热后，将鲈鱼片煎 5 分钟，带皮的一面朝下，或直至鱼皮变得酥脆呈金黄色。鱼快要煮熟了。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n翻面，再煮 30 秒 - 1 分钟，然后转移到盘子中并保温。您需要分两批煎鲈鱼片。\r\n\r\n步骤5\r\n加热2汤匙葵花籽油，然后将去皮的大姜、切成火柴条、3瓣切成薄片的蒜瓣和3条切成薄片的红辣椒炒约2分钟至金黄色。\r\n\r\n步骤6\r\n把火关掉，加入一堆切碎的葱。在鱼上撒上 1 汤匙酱油，然后用勺子浇在锅里的东西上。"},{"id":"53229","n":"Steak & Vietnamese noodle salad","a":"Vietnamese","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/st9shl1763755808.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Lo4_GdyetEU","i":[["Brown Rice Noodle","85g"],["Rapeseed Oil","1 tsp"],["Fillet Of Steak","250g"],["Carrots","2"],["Chinese Cabbage","1/2"],["Spring Onions","4 finely sliced"],["Coriander","Handful"],["Red Chilli","1 sliced"],["Lime","Juice of 1"],["Brown Sugar","2 tsp"],["Rice Vinegar","1 tsp"],["Garlic Clove","1 chopped"],["Fish Sauce","1/2 tbs"]],"s":"step 1\r\nMix all the ingredients for the dressing together in a bowl with 1 tbsp water until the sugar has dissolved.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nCook the noodles following pack instructions, then plunge into a bowl of cold water to cool completely. Drain the noodles, then add the carrot, cabbage, spring onion and dressing, and toss to combine.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nHeat the oil in a frying pan over a high heat. Season the steak, then cook to your liking; 2-3 mins on each side for medium rare. Leave to rest for 5 mins, then slice. Divide the salad and steak slices between bowls and scatter over some coriander to serve.","z":"步骤1\r\n将调料的所有成分与 1 汤匙水一起放入碗中混合，直至糖溶解。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n按照包装说明煮面条，然后放入一碗冷水中完全冷却。将面条沥干，然后加入胡萝卜、卷心菜、葱和调料，搅拌均匀。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n在煎锅中用大火加热油。将牛排调味，然后根据您的喜好烹饪；每面 2-3 分钟，半熟。静置 5 分钟，然后切片。将沙拉和牛排片分装在碗中，撒上一些香菜即可食用。"},{"id":"53246","n":"Tangy carrot, cabbage & onion salad","a":"Vietnamese","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/dbazbg1763779999.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-BJWMkJMIns","i":[["Carrots","4 sliced"],["Red Cabbage","1/2"],["Red Onions","2 sliced"],["Mint","Handful"],["Coriander Leaves","Handful"],["Roasted Peanut","Handful"],["Lime","Juice of 2"],["Ground Nut Oil","1 tablespoon"],["Red Chilli","1 chopped"],["Brown Sugar","1 tablespoon"]],"s":"step 1\r\nTip the carrots, cabbage and onions into a bowl. Make the dressing by stirring the ingredients together until the sugar has dissolved. Pour over salad, tossing the vegetables in the dressing. Add the herbs, toss again, then scatter over the peanuts.","z":"步骤1\r\n将胡萝卜、卷心菜和洋葱放入碗中。将原料搅拌在一起直至糖溶解，制作调料。倒在沙拉上，将蔬菜拌入调料中。加入香草，再次搅拌，然后撒在花生上。"},{"id":"53240","n":"Tofu, greens & cashew stir-fry","a":"Vietnamese","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/minfsc1763766806.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=l8wuWeNy3J4","i":[["Vegetable Oil","1 tablespoon"],["Broccoli","1 head"],["Garlic Clove","4 sliced"],["Red Chilli","1 sliced"],["Spring Onions","1  bunch"],["Soya Bean","140g"],["Pak Choi","2 heads"],["Marinated Tofu","300g"],["Hoisin Sauce","1 ½ tbsp"],["Soy Sauce","1 tablespoon"],["Cashew Nuts","25g"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat the oil in a non-stick wok. Add the broccoli, then fry on a high heat for 5 mins or until just tender, adding a little water if it begins to catch. Add the garlic and chilli, fry for 1 min, then toss through the spring onions, soya beans, pak choi and tofu. Stir-fry for 2-3 mins. Add the hoisin, soy and nuts to warm through.","z":"步骤1\r\n在不粘锅中加热油。加入西兰花，然后高火煎 5 分钟或直至变软，如果开始凝固，则加入少量水。加入大蒜和辣椒，炒1分钟，然后加入葱、黄豆、小白菜和豆腐。炒2-3分钟。加入海鲜酱、大豆和坚果加热。"},{"id":"53249","n":"Turkey Bánh mì","a":"Vietnamese","c":"Miscellaneous","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/1wj8w31763781990.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=L-ItzFfVgos","i":[["Baguette","2 small"],["Chicken Liver","50g"],["Cucumber","1/4"],["Turkey","140g"],["Mayonnaise","1 tablespoon"],["Red Chilli","1 sliced"],["Mint","Handful"],["Carrots","2 small"],["Red Cabbage","75g"],["Ground Ginger","1/4 tsp"],["Rice Vinegar","½ tablespoon"],["Golden Caster Sugar","1/2 teaspoon"]],"s":"step 1\r\nTo make the pickled slaw, tip the carrots and cabbage into a large bowl. In a small bowl, combine the ginger, rice vinegar, sugar and a few pinches of salt. Pour over the vegetables and toss together. Set aside for at least 15 mins.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nHalve the baguettes lengthways and spread the pâté over the bottom half. Top with the pickled slaw, cucumber and turkey. Mix the mayonnaise with the chopped chilli and dollop over the top. Scatter over the mint leaves and sliced chilli. Sandwich together and dig in.","z":"步骤1\r\n制作腌制沙拉时，将胡萝卜和卷心菜放入一个大碗中。在一个小碗中，将生姜、米醋、糖和几撮盐混合在一起。倒在蔬菜上并搅​​拌在一起。放置至少 15 分钟。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将法棍面包纵向切成两半，然后将肉酱铺在下半部分。上面放上腌制的沙拉、黄瓜和火鸡。将蛋黄酱与切碎的辣椒混合，然后涂在上面。撒上薄荷叶和辣椒片。夹在一起，然后挖进去。"},{"id":"53251","n":"Turkish lahmacun","a":"Vietnamese","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/tqd3ac1763786065.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8HTa64s8RK8","i":[["Strong white bread flour","500g"],["Fast action yeast","10g"],["Corn Flour","Sprinkling"],["Tomato","2"],["Green Chilli","2"],["Spring Onions","4 Chopped"],["Parsley","Bunch"],["Ground Beef","250g"],["Chilli Flakes","2 tsp"],["Ground Cumin","Pinch"],["Allspice","1 tsp"],["Olive Oil","2 tablespoons"],["Lemon","1/2"],["Red Onions","1"]],"s":"step 1\r\nSift the flour into a large bowl, make a well in the middle and sprinkle in the yeast. Pour 125ml water over the yeast, then flick flour over the liquid to create a layer. Cover and leave to rise in a warm place for 15 mins until cracks appear on the surface of that layer.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nUse your hands to mix in 250ml more water along with 1 tsp salt and knead the dough for about 10 mins until elastic and no longer sticky. Add a little more flour if you need to. Cover and leave to rise again in a warm place for 30 mins until doubled in size.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nHeat the oven to as high as it will go (about 240C/220C fan/gas 9) and sprinkle one or two baking trays thinly with cornmeal.\r\n\r\nstep 4\r\nPour boiling water from the kettle over the tomatoes, leave to stand briefly, then drain and slip off the skins. Cut the tomatoes in half, cut out the stalks, scoop out the seeds and discard, then chop the flesh.\r\n\r\nstep 5\r\nHalve the chillies lengthways, cut out the stalks, seeds and white inner membrane, then rinse. Cut lengthwise into fine strips, then crosswise into fine dice.\r\n\r\nstep 6\r\nPut the tomatoes, chillies, spring onions, finely chopped parsley, beef mince, spices, 1 tsp salt and ½ tsp freshly ground black pepper into a bowl and mix well.\r\n\r\nstep 7\r\nTake the dough and knead it briefly, then divide into four pieces and shape each into a ball. Roll each ball into a thin circle, place on the prepared baking trays. Spread with a thin layer of the meat mixture.\r\n\r\nstep 8\r\nBake each flatbread for 10-15 mins until the edges begin to darken. After removing from the oven, sprinkle the lahmacun with the roughly chopped parsley and sliced onion, then squeeze over a few drops of lemon juice. Serve straightaway.","z":"步骤1\r\n将面粉筛入一个大碗中，在中间挖一个洞，撒上酵母。将 125 毫升水倒在酵母上，然后将面粉撒在液体上形成一层。盖上盖子，在温暖的地方发酵15分钟，直到该层表面出现裂纹。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n用手再加入250毫升水和1茶匙盐，揉捏面团约10分钟，直至面团有弹性且不再粘手。如果需要的话，再加一点面粉。盖上盖子，在温暖的地方再次发酵 30 分钟，直至体积翻倍。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n将烤箱加热到最高温度（大约 240C/220C 风扇/煤气 9），然后在一两个烤盘上薄薄地撒上玉米粉。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n将水壶中的沸水倒在西红柿上，短暂静置，然后沥干并剥去皮。将西红柿切成两半，切掉蒂，挖出种子并丢弃，然后切碎果肉。\r\n\r\n步骤5\r\n将辣椒纵向切半，切去蒂、籽和白色内膜，然后冲洗干净。纵向切成细条，然后横向切成细丁。\r\n\r\n步骤6\r\n将西红柿、辣椒、葱、切碎的欧芹、牛肉末、香料、1 茶匙盐和 1/2 茶匙现磨黑胡椒放入碗中，搅拌均匀。\r\n\r\n步骤7\r\n取出面团，稍微揉捏，然后分成四块，每块搓成球状。将每个球滚成薄圆形，放在准备好的烤盘上。涂上一层薄薄的肉混合物。\r\n\r\n步骤8\r\n将每个大饼烘烤 10-15 分钟，直到边缘开始变黑。从烤箱中取出后，在lahmacun上撒上切碎的欧芹和洋葱片，然后挤上几滴柠檬汁。立即上菜。"},{"id":"53250","n":"Vegan banh mi","a":"Vietnamese","c":"Vegan","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/sonirb1763782831.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=i0_C3eRTbgg","i":[["Raw Vegetables","150g"],["Vegan White Wine Vinegar","3  tablespoons"],["Golden Caster Sugar","1 tsp"],["Baguette","1 large"],["Hummus","100g"],["Tempeh","175g"],["Coriander","Handful"],["Mint","Handful"],["Hotsauce","To serve"]],"s":"step 1\r\nPut the shredded veg in a bowl and add the vinegar, sugar and 1 tsp salt. Toss everything together, then set aside to pickle quickly while you prepare the rest of the sandwich.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nHeat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Cut the baguette into four, then slice each piece horizontally in half. Put the baguette pieces in the oven for 5 mins until lightly toasted and warm. Spread each piece with a layer of hummus, then top four pieces with the tempeh slices and pile the pickled veg on top. To serve, sprinkle over the herbs and squeeze over some hot sauce, then top with the other baguette pieces to make sandwiches.","z":"步骤1\r\n将切碎的蔬菜放入碗中，加入醋、糖和 1 茶匙盐。将所有东西搅拌在一起，然后放在一边快速腌制，同时准备三明治的其余部分。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将烤箱加热至 180C/160C 风扇/燃气 4. 将法棍面包切成四份，然后将每块水平切成两半。将法棍面包放入烤箱烤 5 分钟，直至轻烤并变热。在每块上铺上一层鹰嘴豆泥，然后在四块上面放上豆豉片，然后将腌菜堆在上面。食用时，撒上香草，挤上一些辣酱，然后在上面放上其他法棍面包片，制成三明治。"},{"id":"52828","n":"Vietnamese Grilled Pork (bun-thit-nuong)","a":"Vietnamese","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/qqwypw1504642429.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Q3qcQcENzbU","i":[["Pork","1.5 pounds sliced"],["Rice Vermicelli","1 package thin"],["Egg Rolls","4-6"],["Challots","3 tablespoons minced"],["Garlic","1.5 tablespoons minced garlic"],["Sugar","¼ cup"],["Fish Sauce","1 tablespoon"],["Soy sauce","½ tablespoon thick"],["Pepper","½ tablespoon"],["Olive Oil","3 tablespoons"],["Cucumber","Sliced"],["Mint","Leaves"],["Peanuts","Crushed"]],"s":"Slice the uncooked pork thinly, about ⅛\". It helps to slightly freeze it (optional).\r\nMince garlic and shallots. Mix in a bowl with sugar, fish sauce, thick soy sauce, pepper, and oil until sugar dissolves.\r\nMarinate the meat for 1 hour, or overnight for better results.\r\nBake the pork at 375F for 10-15 minutes or until about 80% cooked. Finish cooking by broiling in the oven until a nice golden brown color develops, flipping the pieces midway.\r\nAssemble your bowl with veggies, noodles, and garnish. Many like to mix the whole bowl up and pour the fish sauce on top, but I like to make individual bites and sauce it slowly.","z":"将生猪肉切成薄片，大约⅛英寸。稍微冷冻一下会有所帮助（可选）。\r\n将大蒜和青葱切碎。在碗中加入糖、鱼露、浓酱油、胡椒粉和油，搅拌直至糖溶解。\r\n将肉腌制1小时，或过夜以获得更好的效果。\r\n将猪肉在 375 华氏度下烘烤 10-15 分钟或直至约 80% 煮熟。通过在烤箱中烘烤直至呈现漂亮的金棕色来完成烹饪，中途翻转碎片。\r\n将蔬菜、面条和装饰放入碗中。许多人喜欢将整个碗混合起来，然后将鱼露倒在上面，但我喜欢单独咬一口，慢慢地调味。"},{"id":"53228","n":"Vietnamese caramel trout","a":"Vietnamese","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/p02vq41763754350.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3MBbvrUtn74","i":[["Golden Caster Sugar","50g"],["Fish Sauce","1 tablespoon"],["Red Chilli","1 sliced"],["Ginger","large piece"],["Rainbow Trout","2"],["Bok Choi","2 heads"],["Lemon","Juice of 1/2"],["Coriander","Sprigs of fresh"],["Rice","Steamed"]],"s":"step 1\r\nPut the sugar in a large shallow pan, along with a small splash of water. Heat gently, swirling the pan, until the sugar has dissolved. Increase the heat and bubble the syrup until it turns a dark amber colour. Add the fish sauce, most of the chilli and ginger, then splash in 1 tbsp water to dilute. Boil again until syrupy, then add the fish fillets, skin-side down, and the bok choi, cut-side down.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nCover the pan with a lid and simmer for 4-5 mins until the fish is cooked and the bok choi has wilted. Turn off the heat, squeeze over the lemon and scatter with the remaining chilli, ginger and the coriander sprigs. Serve with rice.","z":"步骤1\r\n将糖放入一个大浅锅中，并加入少量水。轻轻加热，旋转锅，直到糖溶解。增加热量并使糖浆起泡，直至变成深琥珀色。加入鱼露、大部分辣椒和姜，然后倒入一汤匙水稀释。再次煮至糖浆状，然后加入鱼片（带皮的一面朝下）和白菜（切面朝下）。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n盖上锅盖，小火煮 4-5 分钟，直至鱼煮熟且白菜枯萎。关掉火，挤上柠檬，撒上剩下的辣椒、生姜和香菜小枝。与米饭一起食用。"},{"id":"53232","n":"Vietnamese chicken salad","a":"Vietnamese","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/pk8wtn1763758591.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=behSkhzKpHI","i":[["Rice Noodles","140g"],["Carrots","1"],["Cucumber","1/2"],["Chicken Breasts","2"],["Radish","50g"],["Red Onions","1/2"],["Mint","Bunch"],["Peanuts","25g"],["Red Chilli","1 chopped"],["Lime","Zest and juice of 1"],["Fish Sauce","1 ½ tbsp"],["Soy Sauce","1 ½ tbsp"],["Sesame Seed Oil","1 ½ tbsp"]],"s":"step 1\r\nTo make the dressing, whisk all the ingredients together in a large serving bowl. Cook the noodles following pack instructions, then drain and add to the bowl with the dressing.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nPeel the carrot into long strips using a vegetable peeler. Do the same for the cucumber, until you reach the seeds (discard them). Add the carrot and cucumber to the noodle mixture along with the shredded chicken, radishes, red onion and mint. Toss well to coat in the dressing, scatter over the peanuts and serve.","z":"步骤1\r\n制作调料时，将所有原料放入一个大碗中搅拌。按照包装说明煮面条，然后沥干并与调料一起放入碗中。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n使用蔬菜削皮器将胡萝卜削皮成长条。对黄瓜进行同样的操作，直到到达种子（丢弃它们）。将胡萝卜和黄瓜以及切碎的鸡肉、萝卜、红洋葱和薄荷一起加入面条混合物中。充分搅拌均匀，裹上调料，撒在花生上即可食用。"},{"id":"53231","n":"Vietnamese lamb shanks with sweet potatoes","a":"Vietnamese","c":"Lamb","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/7xte3u1763757761.jpg","y":"https://www.tiktok.com/@shanice_and_lima/video/7280471655959383297","i":[["Ground Nut Oil","2 tablespoons"],["Lamb Shanks","4"],["Onion","2"],["Ginger","2 tbs chopped"],["Garlic Clove","3 sliced thinly"],["Red Chilli","1 chopped"],["Red Chilli","1 sliced"],["Brown Sugar","1 tablespoon"],["Brown Sugar","1 tsp"],["Star Anise","3"],["Lemongrass Stalks","2"],["Lamb Stock","1L"],["Tomato Puree","1 ½ tbsp"],["Sweet Potatoes","4"],["Fish Sauce","2 tablespoons"],["Lime","Juice of 2"],["Mint","Handful"],["Basil Leaves","Handful"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3. Heat 1 tbsp oil in a heavy-bottomed casserole, season the shanks, then brown them 2 at a time on all sides, adding the remaining oil for the second batch. Remove the lamb and add the onions. Fry them quite briskly, about 30 secs, add the ginger, garlic and chopped chilli, then turn the heat down and cook for 1 min. Add 1 tbsp sugar, stir, then add the star anise, lemongrass, stock, purée and seasoning. Bring to the boil.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nCover and cook in the oven for 1½ hrs, then add the sweet potatoes and cook for 1 hr more. The lamb should be completely tender and almost falling off the bones. Stir in the fish sauce, lime juice and 1 tsp sugar to just lift the flavour, then scatter with the mint, basil and the sliced chilli to serve.","z":"步骤1\r\n将烤箱加热至 160C/140C 风扇/煤气 3. 在厚底砂锅中加热 1 汤匙油，给小腿调味，然后将其各面一次煎至 2 个，最后加入剩余的油作为第二批。取出羊肉，加入洋葱。用大火炒约30秒，加入姜、蒜和切碎的辣椒，然后关小火煮1分钟。加入 1 汤匙糖，搅拌，然后加入八角、柠檬草、高汤、果泥和调味料。煮沸。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n盖上盖子，在烤箱中煮 1.5 小时，然后加入红薯，再煮 1 小时。羊肉应该完全变嫩，几乎从骨头上掉下来。加入鱼露、酸橙汁和 1 茶匙糖提味，然后撒上薄荷、罗勒和辣椒片即可食用。"},{"id":"53237","n":"Vietnamese pork salad","a":"Vietnamese","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/g7jomp1763763994.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_DCJNrNTTB4","i":[["Golden Caster Sugar","1 tsp"],["Lime","Juice of 2"],["Red Chilli","1 chopped"],["Coriander","Handful"],["Sesame Seed Oil","1 tablespoon"],["Fish Sauce","1 tablespoon"],["Soy Sauce","1 tablespoon"],["Pork Tenderloin","500g"],["Vegetable Oil","For brushing"],["White Cabbage","1/4"],["Cucumber","1 chopped"],["Celery","5 chopped"],["Spring Onions","3 sliced thinly"],["Red Chilli","1 chopped"],["Lemongrass Stalks","2 chopped"],["Lime","Zest of 1"],["Coriander","Handful"],["Mint","Handful"]],"s":"step 1\r\nThe day before: make the dressing. Put the sugar and lime juice in a pan with 1 tbsp water and bring to the boil to dissolve the sugar. Add the chilli and coriander and stir well, then pulse in a blender until smooth. Tip into a bowl, then stir in the sesame oil, fish sauce, soy sauce and sesame seeds to make a dressing. Cover and chill until needed.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nTwo hours before serving: heat a griddle pan. Preheat the oven to 200C/gas 6/fan 180C. Brush the pork with oil and griddle on all sides for a few minutes until seared. Transfer to a baking tray and put in the oven for about 10-12 minutes until cooked through. Cool, thinly slice against the grain of the meat. Tip into a bowl and pour over half the dressing.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nTo serve: toss the remaining salad ingredients in a bowl with the remaining dressing. Pile on to a platter, top with the pork slices and spoon over any juices.","z":"步骤1\r\n前一天：做敷料。将糖和酸橙汁放入锅中，加入 1 汤匙水，煮沸以溶解糖。加入辣椒和香菜，搅拌均匀，然后在搅拌机中搅拌直至光滑。倒入碗中，然后拌入芝麻油、鱼露、酱油和芝麻，制成调料。盖上盖子并冷却直至需要。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n食用前两小时：加热煎锅。将烤箱预热至 200C/煤气 6/风扇 180C。在猪肉上刷上油，然后在各面煎几分钟直至烤焦。转移到烤盘上，放入烤箱烤约 10-12 分钟直至熟透。冷却，沿着肉粒切成薄片。倒入碗中，倒入一半的调料。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n食用：将剩余的沙拉原料与剩余的调料一起放入碗中。堆放在盘子上，上面放上猪肉片，然后用勺子浇上果汁。"},{"id":"53243","n":"Vietnamese prawn spiralized rolls","a":"Vietnamese","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/9r2xrg1763771238.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lNU0LKVtHC4","i":[["Lime","Juice of 1/2"],["Rice Vinegar","2 tablespoons"],["Palm Sugar","1 tablespoon"],["Fish Sauce","3  tablespoons"],["Birds-eye Chillies","1 chopped"],["Rice Paper Sheets","6"],["Mint","Small bunch"],["Coriander","Small bunch"],["King Prawns","12"],["Carrots","1 large"],["Courgettes","1"]],"s":"step 1\r\nMix all the ingredients for the dipping sauce along with 50ml water in a bowl and set aside to allow the sugar to dissolve and flavour to infuse.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nTo assemble the rolls, fill a wide bowl with warm water and grab a clean damp tea towel to work on. Dip a rice paper wrapper into the water for a few seconds until it softens then carefully place onto the tea towel.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nPut a few mint and coriander leaves in the centre of the wrapper then top with two prawns and a small handful of the spiralized veg, which may need to be cut up if the spirals are too long.\r\n\r\nstep 4\r\nFold the sides of the wrapper into the centre, over the filling, then fold in the edges, so that the filling is completely encased, then tightly roll. Repeat until all of the wrappers and filling have been used. To serve, slice on a diagonal and eat with the dipping sauce.","z":"步骤1\r\n将蘸酱的所有原料与 50 毫升水混合在一个碗中，放在一边，让糖溶解并注入风味。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n要组装面包卷，请在一个大碗中装满温水，然后拿一块干净的湿茶巾进行操作。将米纸包装浸入水中几秒钟直至其变软，然后小心地放在茶巾上。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n在包装纸的中央放一些薄荷叶和香菜叶，然后在上面放上两只虾和一小把螺旋蔬菜，如果螺旋太长，可能需要将其切碎。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n将包装纸的两侧折叠到中心，盖住馅料，然后折叠边缘，使馅料完全包住，然后紧紧地卷起来。重复此操作，直到使用完所有包装纸和馅料。食用时，沿对角线切片，搭配蘸酱食用。"},{"id":"53241","n":"Vietnamese veg parcels","a":"Vietnamese","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/f698g91763768731.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k3ciVdNBuK0","i":[["Rice Flour Pancakes","100g"],["Rice Noodles","50g"],["Chicken Breast","1"],["Carrots","1 sliced"],["Cucumber","1 sliced"],["Red Pepper","1 sliced"],["Lettuce","To serve"],["Coriander","To serve"],["Mint","To serve"],["Fish Sauce","4 tablespoons"],["Rice Vinegar","2 tablespoons"],["Lime","Juice of 1/2"],["Red Chilli","1 sliced"]],"s":"step 1\r\nSoak the rice fl our pancakes according to pack instructions or in boiling water for 30 secs. Remove and cool on kitchen paper. Soak the rice noodles according to pack instructions, then drain and cut them into 2cm strips.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nLay a rice pancake on a board and arrange some rice noodles, chicken, vegetables and herb leaves about a third of the way up, leaving a 1cm edge at the side. Fold the sides over the vegetables and then roll up lengthways to make a cigar. Store in the fridge, covered with moist kitchen paper for up to 1 day.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nMix together the ingredients for the dipping sauce and put into a bowl. To serve, arrange the rolls on a plate along with the leaves and herbs. To eat, wrap each roll in a piece of lettuce with a herb sprig and dunk into the sauce.","z":"步骤1\r\n根据包装说明将米粉浸泡在沸水中 30 秒。取出并放在厨房用纸上冷却。按照包装说明将米粉浸泡，然后沥干并切成2厘米的条。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将煎饼放在案板上，将米粉、鸡肉、蔬菜和香草叶放在大约三分之一处，旁边留1厘米的边缘。将两侧折叠到蔬菜上，然后纵向卷起来制成雪茄。放入冰箱中，用湿润的厨房用纸覆盖，最多可保存 1 天。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n将蘸酱的原料混合在一起，放入碗中。食用时，将面包卷与叶子和香草一起放在盘子上。吃时，将每个卷包裹在一片生菜和香草小枝中，然后浸入酱汁中。"},{"id":"53235","n":"Vietnamese-style caramel pork","a":"Vietnamese","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/4mzt101763761546.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qmQe0Qxvyzc","i":[["Ground Nut Oil","1 ½ tbsp"],["Pork Shoulder Steaks","500g"],["Shallots","2 chopped"],["Ground Ginger","1 tablespoon"],["Red Chilli","1 chopped"],["Brown Sugar","75g"],["Fish Sauce","1 tablespoon"],["Chilli Sauce","2 tsp"],["Spring Onions","4"],["Rice","Steamed"],["Pak Choi","To serve"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat 1 tbsp of the oil in a wok over a high heat and stir-fry the pork in batches until browned all over. Remove with a slotted spoon and set aside.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nTurn the heat right down and add the remaining oil, then stir in the shallots, ginger and chilli. Cook over a low heat for a couple of mins until just starting to soften. Add the sugar, fish sauce and 200ml water to the pan and stir everything together. Bring to the boil, stirring, so that the sugar dissolves, then return the pork to the pan. Bubble vigorously for 8-10 mins until the sauce thickens to coat the meat and become glossy. Taste and stir in a little more fish sauce, if needed, along with the chilli sauce. Sprinkle with the spring onions and serve with steamed rice and pak choi.","z":"步骤1\r\n炒锅中大火烧热1汤匙油，将猪肉分批炒至焦黄。用有槽勺取出并放在一边。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n把火关小，加入剩余的油，然后加入青葱、姜和辣椒。用小火煮几分钟，直到开始软化。将糖、鱼露和 200 毫升水加入锅中，搅拌均匀。煮沸，搅拌，使糖溶解，然后将猪肉放回锅中。剧烈冒泡 8-10 分钟，直至酱汁变稠，覆盖在肉上并变得有光泽。如果需要的话，尝尝并加入一点鱼露和辣椒酱。撒上葱，搭配米饭和白菜。"},{"id":"53236","n":"Vietnamese-style veggie hotpot","a":"Vietnamese","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/4uje7l1763762276.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OR6jC9gw_Hw","i":[["Vegetable Oil","2 tsp"],["Ginger","4cm finely chopped"],["Garlic Clove","2 chopped"],["Butternut Squash","1/2"],["Soy Sauce","2 tsp"],["Brown Sugar","2 tsp"],["Vegetable Stock","200ml"],["Green Beans","100g shredded"],["Spring Onions","4 sliced"],["Coriander Leaves","To serve"],["Jasmine Rice","To serve"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat the oil in a medium-size, lidded saucepan. Add the ginger and garlic, then stir-fry for about 5 mins. Add the squash, soy sauce, sugar and stock. Cover, then simmer for 10 mins. Remove the lid, add the green beans, then cook for 3 mins more until the squash and beans are tender. Stir the spring onions through at the last minute, then sprinkle with coriander and serve with rice.","z":"步骤1\r\n在一个中等大小的带盖平底锅中加热油。加入姜和大蒜，然后炒约5分钟。加入南瓜、酱油、糖和高汤。盖上盖子，然后煮10分钟。取下盖子，加入青豆，再煮 3 分钟，直至南瓜和青豆变软。最后一刻将葱搅拌均匀，然后撒上香菜，与米饭一起食用。"},{"id":"53483","n":"Acaraje black-eyed pea fritters with shrimp filling","a":"","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/dxs5t71782678369.jpg","y":"","i":[["Black Eyed Peas","800g"],["Garlic","1 clove"],["Green Chilli","1"],["Red Onions","1 small finely diced"],["Plain Flour","2 tablespoons"],["Salt","1 tsp"],["Chilli Powder","1 tsp"],["Baking Powder","1 tsp"],["Vegetable Oil","For frying"],["Red Onions","1 sliced"],["Ginger","1 tablespoon chopped"],["Garlic","2 cloves"],["Red Chilli","1 chopped"],["Raw tiger prawns","150g"],["Vegetable Oil","1 tablespoon"],["Plum Tomatoes","2"],["Coriander","1 tablespoon chopped"],["Lime","Juice of 1"]],"s":"step 1\r\nMake the filling by placing the onion, ginger, garlic, chilli, and some salt into food processor. Purée until smooth. Heat the oil in a frying pan and pour the purée into it. Fry for 5 mins or until cooked through. Add the prawns, tomatoes and chopped coriander. Squeeze in the lime and add salt to taste. Cook for 3 mins, or until the prawns have cooked through. Remove from the heat.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nDrain and rinse the black-eyed peas. Pour into a food processor with the garlic and chili. Purée until smooth. Scrape into a bowl and add the onion, flour, salt, chilli powder and baking powder. Mix and roll into 16 balls.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nHeat the oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. Heat 8cm of the palm or vegetable oil in a wok or small heavy pan. When a small piece of bread sizzles, drop 4-5 balls into the oil. Fry until golden and crisp, about 4-5 mins. Drain on kitchen paper and repeat until they are all finished. You can keep them warm in the oven while you finish. Slice the fritters open down the centre and spoon the prawn filling in. Serve with hot sauce.","z":"步骤1\r\n将洋葱、姜、大蒜、辣椒和一些盐放入食品加工机中制成馅料。打成泥直至光滑。将煎锅中的油加热，然后将果泥倒入其中。煎 5 分钟或直至熟透。加入虾、西红柿和切碎的香菜。挤入酸橙并加盐调味。煮 3 分钟，或直至虾煮熟。从火上移开。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n沥干并冲洗黑眼豌豆。将大蒜和辣椒倒入食品加工机中。打成泥直至光滑。刮入碗中，加入洋葱、面粉、盐、辣椒粉和发酵粉。混合并滚成 16 个球。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n将烤箱加热至 190C/170C 风扇/燃气 5. 在炒锅或小而重的平底锅中加热 8 厘米的棕榈油或植物油。当一小片面包发出嘶嘶声时，将 4-5 个面包球放入油中。煎至金黄酥脆，约 4-5 分钟。用厨房纸吸干水分，重复上述步骤，直到全部完成。完成后，您可以将它们放在烤箱中保温。将油条从中间切开，用勺子舀入虾馅，配上辣酱即可食用。"},{"id":"53527","n":"Achiote Oil (Aceite Achiotado) Recipe","a":"","c":"Miscellaneous","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/iuws3q1783801530.jpg","y":"","i":[["Vegetable Oil","2 cups"],["Achiote Seeds","4 tablespoons"]],"s":"Heat the vegetable or olive oil and Achiote seeds in a small skillet over medium heat for about 2 to 3 minutes.\r\nDon't let the seeds turn black. Remove the skillet from the heat and let stand for 5 minutes more. Strain the oil and store for up to 15 days at room temperature in a jar with a tight lid.","z":"将蔬菜或橄榄油和 Achiote 种子放入小煎锅中，用中火加热约 2 至 3 分钟。\r\n不要让种子变黑。将煎锅从火上移开，再静置 5 分钟。过滤油并在室温下在盖紧盖子的罐子中保存最多 15 天。"},{"id":"53525","n":"Ají de Aguacate Recipe (Colombian Spicy Avocado Sauce)","a":"","c":"Miscellaneous","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/jyvy8u1783800448.jpg","y":"","i":[["Avocado","2"],["Habanero Pepper","1"],["Egg","1"],["Lime","Juice of 2"],["Salt","To taste"],["Vinegar","2 tablespoons"],["Onion","1 chopped"],["Scallions","2 chopped"],["Cilantro","4 tablespoons"]],"s":"Place all the ingredients in a food processor. Process until the mixture is well combined.\r\nIf the mixture is too thick, add more lime juice until you reach the desired consistency.","z":"将所有原料放入食品加工机中。加工直至混合物充分混合。\r\n如果混合物太稠，请添加更多酸橙汁，直至达到所需的稠度。"},{"id":"53529","n":"Almojábanas (Colombian Cheese Bread)","a":"","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/ymk7gt1783803106.jpg","y":"","i":[["Cornmeal","1 1/4 cup"],["Queso Fresco","3 Cups"],["Mozzarella","1 cup"],["Butter","2 tablespoons"],["Baking Powder","1 tsp"],["Salt","1/4 tsp"],["Eggs","2"],["Milk","4 tablespoons"]],"s":"Preheat the oven to 400° F.\r\nMix the masarepa and cheese in a food processor.\r\nAdd the remaining ingredients and mix well.\r\nDivide into 8 equal-size portions and shape into a ball.\r\nPlace on a greased baking sheet and bake for about 25 to 30 minutes, or until they are golden. Serve warm.","z":"将烤箱预热至 400° F。\r\n在食品加工机中混合马萨雷帕和奶酪。\r\n添加剩余成分并搅拌均匀。\r\n分成8等份，搓成球状。\r\n放在涂有油脂的烤盘上，烘烤约 25 至 30 分钟，或直至呈金黄色。趁热食用。"},{"id":"53495","n":"Amok Trey – Cambodian Fish Curry","a":"","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/diuub11782687570.jpg","y":"","i":[["Fish fillet","1 lb"],["Coconut Milk","1 Can"],["Red Curry Paste","2 tablespoons"],["Fish Sauce","1 tablespoon"],["Brown Sugar","1 tsp"],["Chicken Stock","1 cup"],["Egg","1"],["Kaffir Lime Leaves","2"],["Vegetable Oil","1 tablespoon"],["Banana Leaves","Handful"],["Cilantro","Garnish"],["Lime","Garnish"]],"s":"1. In a medium bowl, combine the coconut milk, red curry paste, fish sauce, palm sugar, and broth, whisking until smooth—this ensures no lumps in the sauce.\r\n2. Heat the vegetable oil in a large skillet over medium heat (about 350°F) for 30 seconds until shimmering.\r\n3. Pour the coconut milk mixture into the skillet and bring it to a gentle simmer, stirring occasionally, which should take about 3-4 minutes.\r\n4. Add the fish cubes and kaffir lime leaves to the skillet, submerging them fully in the sauce.\r\n5. Reduce the heat to low, cover the skillet, and let it cook for 10 minutes until the fish is opaque and flakes easily with a fork—avoid overcooking to keep it tender.\r\n6. Stir in the beaten egg slowly, cooking for 2 more minutes until the sauce thickens slightly, which adds a rich, custard-like texture.\r\n7. While the curry simmers, prepare the banana leaves by briefly passing them over a gas flame for 10 seconds to make them pliable, or use parchment paper as a handy alternative.\r\n8. Spoon the curry into the center of each banana leaf square, folding the edges to form a tight packet to trap steam.\r\n9. Place the packets in a steamer basket over boiling water and steam for 10 minutes until heated through and fragrant.\r\n10. Carefully unwrap the packets and garnish with fresh cilantro and lime wedges before serving","z":"1. 在一个中等大小的碗中，将椰奶、红咖喱酱、鱼露、棕榈糖和肉汤混合，搅拌至光滑——这样可以确保酱汁中没有结块。\r\n2. 在大煎锅中用中火（约 350°F）加热植物油 30 秒，直至闪烁。\r\n3. 将椰奶混合物倒入煎锅中，小火慢炖，偶尔搅拌，大约需要 3-4 分钟。\r\n4. 将鱼块和柠檬叶放入煎锅中，将它们完全浸入酱汁中。\r\n5. 将火调至小火，盖上煎锅，煮 10 分钟，直至鱼变得不透明，并用叉子轻松剥落，避免煮过头以保持鲜嫩。\r\n6. 慢慢加入打散的鸡蛋，再煮2分钟，直到酱汁稍微变稠，增加浓郁的蛋奶冻般的口感。\r\n7. 煮咖喱时，准备香蕉叶，将其在煤气火焰上短暂加热 10 秒钟，使其变得柔韧，或者使用羊皮纸作为方便的替代品。\r\n8. 将咖喱舀入每个香蕉叶方块的中心，折叠边缘以形成紧密的包以保留蒸汽。\r\n9. 将包放入蒸笼中，加沸水，蒸10分钟至热透并散发出香味。\r\n10. 食用前小心打开包装并用新鲜香菜和酸橙角装饰"},{"id":"53430","n":"Antiguan Breakfast (Chop Up and ‘Saltfish’)","a":"","c":"Breakfast","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/jvjnoh1780086318.jpg","y":"","i":[["Egg Plants","4"],["Callaloo","8 oz"],["Pumpkin","1 lb"],["Garlic","3 cloves Chopped"],["Onion","1 Diced"],["Butter","2 oz"],["Salt","1/2 tsp"],["Black Pepper","1/4 tsp"]],"s":"Peel and chop eggplant and pumpkin into medium-sized pieces.\r\n\r\nHeat butter and add onions and garlic in a medium sized pot set to medium to high heat. Sauté for 2 minutes until softened but not browned.\r\nAdd pumpkin and eggplant. Sauté for an additional two to three minutes.\r\nAdd water just to cover the vegetables. Bring to a boil, reduce heat to a simmer and cook until the vegetables are soft.\r\nAdd the chopped spinach, stir and cook for an additional 3 minutes.\r\nPour the vegetable mixture into a colander and let drain.\r\nAfter vegetable mixture has been drained return it to the pot and mash vigorously with a potato masher or a thick whisk.\r\nAdd salt and pepper. Adjust seasoning to taste.","z":"将茄子和南瓜去皮并切成中等大小的块。\r\n\r\n在中等大小的锅中加热黄油，加入洋葱和大蒜，中火至高温。炒2分钟直至变软但未变成褐色。\r\n加入南瓜和茄子。再炒两到三分钟。\r\n加水刚好没过蔬菜。煮沸，小火煮至蔬菜变软。\r\n加入切碎的菠菜，搅拌并再煮 3 分钟。\r\n将蔬菜混合物倒入漏勺中，沥干。\r\n蔬菜混合物沥干后，将其放回锅中，用土豆捣碎器或粗搅拌器剧烈捣碎。\r\n添加盐和胡椒。根据口味调整调味料。"},{"id":"53575","n":"Apple Pie","a":"","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/stnxzp1784835840.jpg","y":"","i":[["Apples","4"],["Eggs","2"],["Sugar","125ml"],["Flour","1 1/2 cups"],["Salt","1/2 tsp"],["Bicarbonate Of Soda","1 tsp"],["Sour Milk","250ml"]],"s":"Peel and clean apples/rhubarb, cut in to a slices\r\nbeat eggs and sugar together into a light foam\r\nMix together flour, salt and baking powder\r\nAdd  the dry ingredients to the egg mixture and add sour milk gradually while stirring,  Add berries.\r\nPour dough in to a butter greased pan. Sprinkle over sugar (and cinnamon). Bake at 180 C for 30 minute","z":"苹果/大黄去皮洗净，切成片\r\n将鸡蛋和糖一起打成轻质泡沫\r\n将面粉、盐和泡打粉混合在一起\r\n将干原料加入鸡蛋混合物中，边搅拌边逐渐加入酸牛奶，加入浆果。\r\n将面团倒入涂有黄油的平底锅中。撒上糖（和肉桂）。 180度烤30分钟"},{"id":"53568","n":"Apple pie pops","a":"","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/ax643t1784731109.jpg","y":"","i":[["Sugar","1 tablespoon"],["All purpose flour","1 1/2 cups"],["Salt","1 tsp"],["Unsalted Butter","4 oz"],["Shortening","1 tablespoon"],["Cold Water","1/4 cup"],["Apples","1 lb"],["Brown Sugar","1/4 cup"],["Cinnamon","1 tsp"],["Unsalted Butter","3  tablespoons"],["Ground Nutmeg","1/2 tsp"],["Salt","1/2 tsp"],["Lemon Juice","3/4 teaspoon"],["Sugar","Topping"],["Egg","1"],["Water","2 tsp"]],"s":"Need Lollipop sticks\r\n\r\nInstructions for crust\r\nCombine the flour, sugar, and salt to a food processor bowl. Mix using the pulse setting.\r\nAdd butter and shortening and pulse about 10 -12 times until the texture is changed to small pebbles.\r\nAdd ¾ of the ice water and pulse a few more times until the dough takes the shape of a ball. Add more water as needed. Don't overmix. Don't worry if the dough isn't completely blended. You will use your rolling pin to finish creating the crust.\r\nPlace dough ball onto the counter and flatten into a flat disc. Wrap it in plastic wrap and refrigerate for at least an hour or overnight.\r\nInstructions for pie filling\r\nHeat butter over medium heat, until just golden brown\r\nAdd brown sugar, spices, salt and lemon juice. Stir to combine ingredients\r\nAdd diced apples and stir.\r\nAllow apples to cook for about 5-7 minutes, over medium heat\r\nRemove from heat and let the apple mixture cool. You can place apples in the refrigerator to speed up the process.\r\nMix egg and water for an egg wash.\r\nRoll out pie dough to 1/8 inch thickness.\r\nCut out rounds of 2 ½ to 3 inches and place them on parchment paper. You will need to roll out the extra dough left over scraps from cutting.\r\nIn half of the rounds, cut out shapes or holes for ventilation purposes\r\nOn the other half of the rounds, gently press one lollipop stick about halfway up each round.\r\nPlace one tablespoon of apple mixture in the center of each round.\r\nPlace each round on top of apples seal the edges.\r\nBrush each pie pop with egg wash and sprinkle sugar on top.\r\nBake 15-20 minutes or until golden brown.\r\nEnjoy!","z":"需要棒棒糖棒\r\n\r\n地壳使用说明\r\n将面粉、糖和盐放入食品加工机碗中。使用脉冲设置进行混合。\r\n加入黄油和起酥油，搅拌约 10 -12 次，直至质地变成小卵石。\r\n加入 3/4 冰水，再搅拌几次，直至面团呈球状。根据需要添加更多的水。不要过度混合。如果面团没有完全混合，请不要担心。您将使用擀面杖完成外壳的制作。\r\n将面团球放在柜台上，压平成扁平的圆盘。用保鲜膜包裹并冷藏至少一个小时或过夜。\r\n馅饼馅料说明\r\n用中火加热黄油，直至呈金黄色\r\n加入红糖、香料、盐和柠檬汁。搅拌以混合成分\r\n加入苹果丁并搅拌。\r\n用中火将苹果煮约 5-7 分钟\r\n从火上移开，让苹果混合物冷却。您可以将苹果放入冰箱以加快该过程。\r\n将鸡蛋和水混合，用于洗蛋。\r\n将馅饼面团擀成 1/8 英寸厚。\r\n剪出 2.5 至 3 英寸的圆形，并将它们放在羊皮纸上。您需要将切割时留下的多余面团擀开。\r\n在一半的圆形中，切出形状或孔以用于通风目的\r\n在另一半回合中，轻轻地将一根棒棒糖棒按到每回合的中间位置。\r\n将一汤匙苹果混合物放在每轮的中心。\r\n将每一圆放在苹果顶部密封边缘。\r\n在每个馅饼上刷上蛋液，并在上面撒上糖。\r\n烘烤 15-20 分钟或直至金黄色。\r\n享受！"},{"id":"53439","n":"Arepa","a":"","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/ejht7k1780092390.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/n6h5GwO6UpQ","i":[["Salt","1 tsp"],["Corn Flour","1 cup"],["Warm Water","1 1/4 cup"]],"s":"Put the corn flour in a bowl and add the salted water little by little, mixing with the flour until all the water has been used and the flour has become a dough. Let it rest for five minutes. Now, shape the dough into round rolls about 3 inches in diameter and 1/2 inch thick. In a lightly greased skillet, slowly cook the arepas until a crust forms on each side. Now place them into a casserole and bake in the oven at 350 degrees for approximately 20 minutes, until the arepas sound hollow when tapped.\r\n\r\nTo enhance taste: instead of using just water, use chicken or beef broth.","z":"将玉米粉放入碗中，一点点加入盐水，与面粉混合，直至水用完，面粉成为面团。让它休息五分钟。现在，将面团塑造成直径约 3 英寸、厚度约 1/2 英寸的圆卷。在抹了少许油脂的煎锅中，慢慢地煮玉米饼，直到每一面都形成外壳。现在将它们放入砂锅中，在 350 度的烤箱中烘烤约 20 分钟，直到敲击玉米饼时发出空心的声音。\r\n\r\n为了增强味道：不要只使用水，而是使用鸡汤或牛肉汤。"},{"id":"53392","n":"Arnhemse meisjes","a":"","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/y4t9zg1777628842.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AFJm15R4YYw","i":[["Puff Pastry","5 Slices"],["vanilla sugar","100g"],["Cinnamon","1/2 tsp"],["Cardamom","1/2"],["Lime","Zest of 1"]],"s":"Take your puff pastry from the freezer and defrost.\r\nSprinkle some flour on the kitchen counter. Stack the sheets of puff pastry on top of each other and roll them out with a rolling pin. You want those five sheets to end up being as thin as one sheet.\r\n\r\nUsing a round or oval form press into the puff pastry and try to be as economical doing that as possible. You want to have as many cookies as you can.\r\nMix the vanilla sugar with the cinnamon, cardemom and limezest in a little bowl\r\nRemove the flour from the counter and sprinkle with a bit of the sugar mix.\r\nBrush your puff pastry with a little bit of eggwash and than dip into the sugar mix and roll them softly to press the sugar in.\r\nPut your sugary puff pastry on a baking sheet (greased or with baking paper) and leave the dough to rest for about 20 to 25 minutes. this will make the cookies even crisper.\r\nPreheat the oven in the meantime to 180 C and put the baking tray in the oven.\r\nbake the cookies golden brown in about 25 minutes and make sure the sugar is caramelised nicely\r\nAnd voila, Girls from Arnhem with an Almeerse twist\r\nVoila, Arnhemse Meisjes met een Almeerse twist.","z":"从冰箱中取出酥皮并解冻。\r\n在厨房柜台上撒一些面粉。将千层酥皮叠放在一起，然后用擀面杖擀开。您希望这五张纸最终像一张纸一样薄。\r\n\r\n使用圆形或椭圆形压入酥皮，并尽可能经济地这样做。你想要尽可能多的饼干。\r\n将香草糖、肉桂、小豆蔻和柠檬皮放入小碗中混合\r\n从柜台上取出面粉，撒上一点糖混合物。\r\n在酥皮上刷上一点蛋液，然后浸入糖混合物中，轻轻滚动以将糖压入其中。\r\n将含糖酥皮放在烤盘上（涂油或铺有烤纸），然后将面团静置约 20 至 25 分钟。这会让饼干更脆。\r\n同时将烤箱预热至180°C，并将烤盘放入烤箱。\r\n大约 25 分钟内将饼干烤成金黄色，并确保糖充分焦糖化\r\n瞧，来自阿纳姆的女孩与阿尔米尔风格\r\n瞧，Arnhemse Meisjes 遇到了阿尔米尔的扭曲。"},{"id":"53406","n":"Arra të Mbushura me Fik Walnut Stuffed Figs (with Fig Syrup)","a":"","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/dokbyt1779645030.jpg","y":"","i":[["Figs","4"],["Walnuts","4"],["Water","150ml"],["Sugar","60g"]],"s":"1\r\nPrepare the Figs\r\nCut off the hard bits of stalk and then cut the figs in half length ways.\r\n2\r\nPlace the figs in a small frying pan / saute pan with the cut side face up and add the water around them.\r\n3\r\nCooking\r\nLeave the figs on a medium heat to cook through, once they become soft remove them from the pan and place onto a serving dish. This will take around 10 - 15 minutes.\r\n4\r\nPrepare the Syrup\r\nIn the pan there will be a red water juice left from the figs. Add the sugar while remaining on a medium heat. Stir continuously for a couple of minutes until the juice has turned to a thick syrup. Remove from the heat.\r\n5\r\nServing\r\nPush one half of walnut into every fig and then drizzle the syrup over the top.\r\n6\r\nServe warm or cooled.","z":"1\r\n准备无花果\r\n切掉茎上坚硬的部分，然后将无花果切成两半。\r\n2\r\n将无花果放入小煎锅/炒锅中，切面朝上，然后在无花果周围加水。\r\n3\r\n烹饪\r\n将无花果放在中火上煮透，一旦它们变软，将它们从锅中取出并放在盘子上。这将需要大约 10 - 15 分钟。\r\n4\r\n准备糖浆\r\n锅里会有无花果留下的红色水汁。加入糖，同时保持中火。连续搅拌几分钟，直到果汁变成浓稠的糖浆。从火上移开。\r\n5\r\n服务\r\n将一半核桃放入每个无花果中，然后将糖浆淋在上面。\r\n6\r\n趁热或冷却后食用。"},{"id":"53522","n":"Arroz con Leche Recipe","a":"","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/jp09191782856005.jpg","y":"","i":[["Rice","1 cup"],["Cinnamon Stick","4"],["Water","2 cups"],["Milk","4 cups"],["Salt","Pinch"],["Butter","2 tablespoons"],["Vanilla Extract","2 tablespoons"],["Sugar","1 cup"],["Condensed Milk","12 ounces"]],"s":"In a small pot, add water and cinnamon sticks, bring to a boil and cook for 10 minutes. Set aside and discard cinnamon sticks.\r\nPlace the rice and the cinnamon water in a large saucepan, over medium heat and cook for 5 minutes.\r\nAdd salt, butter, vanilla extract, 2 cups of milk, and sugar. Stir well to mix and cook uncovered for approximately 15 minutes.\r\nReduce heat to medium low. Add the remaining milk and condensed milk. Stir with a wooden spoon. Cook for 1 hour and 15 minutes, or until the rice pudding thickens to desire consistency.\r\n\r\nStir well and remove from heat, and let it cool at room temperature. The consistency should be very creamy. Refrigerate for a least 1 hour or overnight.","z":"在小锅中加入水和肉桂棒，煮沸并煮 10 分钟。放在一边并丢弃肉桂棒。\r\n将大米和肉桂水放入大平底锅中，中火煮 5 分钟。\r\n添加盐、黄油、香草精、2 杯牛奶和糖。搅拌均匀，不盖盖子煮约 15 分钟。\r\n将热量降低至中低。加入剩余的牛奶和炼乳。用木勺搅拌。煮 1 小时 15 分钟，或直至八宝粥变稠至所需稠度。\r\n\r\n充分搅拌并远离火源，并在室温下冷却。稠度应该非常奶油状。冷藏至少 1 小时或过夜。"},{"id":"53425","n":"Authentic Laos Tapioca Pudding with Bananas","a":"","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/5pmn0g1779813285.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JbcrpAHmk3s","i":[["Warm Water","1 cup"],["Water","4 cups"],["Tapioca","3  tablespoons"],["Coconut Milk","14 oz jar"],["Sugar","2 tablespoons"],["Banana","3 Cups"],["Water","4 cups"],["Salt","To taste"]],"s":"In a bowl of warm water, add tapioca pearls and allow them to soak for 20 minutes.\r\nPrepare bananas by peeling them and cutting them into ½ inch slices. Set the slices aside\r\nOn a stove, pour in 4 cups of water and bring it to a boil. Add in the banana slices.\r\nAfter 20 minutes, drain the tapioca pearls in cold water to allow the pearls to separate from each other.\r\nAdd the tapioca pearls into the the pot. Allow to simmer for 3 minutes or until the tapioca pearls turn clear.\r\nNext, add in sugar and pour in the coconut cream. Stir the ingredients gently for 3 minutes to incorporate the flavors.\r\nAdd salt to taste.","z":"在一碗温水中加入木薯珍珠，浸泡 20 分钟。\r\n准备香蕉，将其去皮并切成 1/2 英寸的片。将切片放在一边\r\n在炉子上倒入 4 杯水并煮沸。加入香蕉片。\r\n20 分钟后，将木薯珍珠放入冷水中沥干，使珍珠彼此分离。\r\n将木薯珍珠加入锅中。小火煮 3 分钟或直至木薯珍珠变透明。\r\n接下来，加入糖，倒入椰奶。轻轻搅拌原料 3 分钟，使味道融合。\r\n加盐调味。"},{"id":"53421","n":"BEEF LOK LAK (Lok Lak Sach Ko)","a":"","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/t2b8bn1779737789.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3oWgjFhQQW0","i":[["Beef Tenderloin","1 kg"],["Garlic","5 cloves"],["Oil","2 tablespoons"],["Palm Sugar","1.5 tablespoon"],["Sea Salt","1 tsp"],["White Wine","2 tablespoons"],["Oyster Sauce","2 tablespoons"],["Soy Sauce","2 tablespoons"],["Sesame Seed Oil","1.5 tablespoon"],["Lettuce","500g"],["Tomato","400g"],["Onion","200g"],["Eggs","4"],["Sea Salt","1.5 tablespoon"],["Kampot Pepper","1 tablespoon"],["Lime juice","1 tablespoon"]],"s":"Fry the eggs sunny-side up and set aside. Finely chop the garlic. Wash the lettuce leaves and drain well. Thinly slice the onion and tomatoes.\r\nCut the beef tenderloin into 2–3 cm cubes. Marinate with sea salt, palm sugar, Chinese cooking wine, oyster sauce, soy sauce, and sesame oil. Mix well.\r\nHeat a frying pan on high heat with cooking oil. Add chopped garlic and stir until the garlic browns lightly. Add the marinated beef (with all the marinade) and cook for 5–7 minutes, depending on how rare you want the beef.\r\nDry roast the black Kampot peppercorns in a frying pan over medium-low heat for 2–3 minutes until fragrant. Grind the roasted pepper, place it in a bowl, then add sea salt and lime juice. Mix well.\r\nOn a serving plate, arrange a bed of lettuce, then layer tomatoes, then onions. Spoon the cooked beef over the vegetables and place fried eggs on top. Serve with the Kampot pepper sauce and fragrant steamed rice.\r\nSear hot and fast, Lok Lak is at its best when the beef stays tender and juicy, with a bold, bright dipping sauce to cut through the richness.","z":"将鸡蛋煎至单面朝上，放在一边。将大蒜切碎。洗净生菜叶并沥干。将洋葱和西红柿切成薄片。\r\n将牛里脊肉切成2-3厘米的方块。用海盐、棕榈糖、料酒、蚝油、酱油和香油腌制。搅拌均匀。\r\n用高温加热煎锅，加入食用油。加入切碎的大蒜，搅拌直至大蒜呈浅棕色。加入腌制好的牛肉（连同所有腌料），煮 5-7 分钟，具体取决于您想要牛肉的稀有程度。\r\n将贡布黑花椒放入煎锅中，中低火干烤 2-3 分钟，直至散发出香味。将烤辣椒磨碎，放入碗中，然后加入海盐和酸橙汁。搅拌均匀。\r\n在盘子上放一层生菜，然后铺上西红柿，然后铺上洋葱。将煮熟的牛肉舀到蔬菜上，然后将煎鸡蛋放在上面。搭配贡布辣椒酱和香喷喷的米饭。\r\n当牛肉保持鲜嫩多汁时，Lok Lak 煎得又热又快，味道最佳，再配上浓郁、明亮的蘸酱，打破牛肉的浓郁口感。"},{"id":"53396","n":"Baghlaw-e-Khanagi","a":"","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/bjtjyl1779552068.jpg","y":"","i":[["Flour","600g"],["Eggs","3"],["Milk","450ml"],["Vegetable Oil","75 ml"],["Baking Powder","1 tsp"],["Ground Walnuts","50g"],["Cardamom","10g"],["Sugar","300g"],["Water","1 L"]],"s":"Place flour in a bowl, and create a hole in the middle of the flour. Whisk eggs, and then pour whisked eggs into the well. \r\nAdd milk, and combine. Then, stir in the ground walnuts, baking powder and cardamom, and add to the mixture. Fold ingredients into the mixture until it forms an elastic dough consistency. \r\nTake dough and with a rolling pin, roll out into a thin rectangle on a clean surface. Then, from the longest side of the rectangle, fold the dough into 3cm-wide lines, until the dough is fully rolled in a long line. Cut folded dough horizontally into 3cm pieces\r\nHeat a deep pan of the vegetable oil, and wait till it reaches frying temperature. Whilst you are waiting. Fill a deep pan with 1 litre of water, and bring to the boil.  Then, pour in the sugar, and stir gently until it becomes thick and syrup-like. Turn down the heat and leave to simmer.\r\nCarefully lower each piece of dough into the frying oil. Fry until golden brown.\r\nWhen golden brown, take the Baghlaw pieces out of the oil, and place them into the sugar syrup to coat.\r\nRemove from the syrup and whilst still warm, sprinkle with ground walnuts, so they stick to the Baghlaw.\r\nLeave to cool. Then, enjoy with your friends and family!","z":"将面粉放入碗中，并在面粉中间挖一个洞。搅拌鸡蛋，然后将搅拌好的鸡蛋倒入井中。 \r\n添加牛奶，并混合。然后，加入碎核桃、泡打粉和小豆蔻，然后添加到混合物中。将配料拌入混合物中，直至形成有弹性的面团稠度。 \r\n取出面团，用擀面杖在干净的表面上擀成薄薄的矩形。然后，从长方形的最长边开始，将面团折成3厘米宽的线，直到面团完全卷成一条长线。将折叠好的面团横向切成3厘米见方的块\r\n加热深锅植物油，等到达到煎炸温度。当你在等待的时候。在深锅中加入 1 升水，煮沸。  然后倒入糖，轻轻搅拌，直至变成浓稠糖浆状。关小火，继续煮。\r\n小心地将每块面团放入煎炸油中。炸至金黄色。\r\n当金黄色时，将巴格劳片从油中取出，放入糖浆中裹上一层。\r\n从糖浆中取出，趁热撒上碎核桃，这样它们就会粘在巴格劳上。\r\n让它冷却。然后，与您的朋友和家人一起享受吧！"},{"id":"53481","n":"Bahia-style Moqueca prawn stew","a":"","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/e2kcut1782591669.jpg","y":"","i":[["Raw King Prawns","450g"],["Lime juice","75 ml"],["Garlic","3 cloves Chopped"],["Coconut Oil","3  tablespoons"],["Spring Onions","4 Chopped"],["Onion","1"],["Red Pepper","1 chopped"],["Chilli Flakes","1 tsp"],["Paprika","2 tsp"],["Plum Tomatoes","3 chopped"],["Coconut Milk","400ml"],["Coriander","2 tbs chopped"],["Rice","To serve"]],"s":"step 1\r\nPlace the prawns in a bowl with 2 tbsp of the lime juice, 1 tsp of salt and 1 tbsp of the chopped garlic. Chill for 1 hr.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nHeat the coconut oil in a large saucepan. Add the spring onion and onion and fry for 5 mins, then add the red pepper, chilli flakes, paprika and remaining garlic.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nPour in the tomatoes, coconut milk and a little salt. Bring to a simmer and let reduce for 10 mins. Add the prawns, all the marinade and remaining lime juice. Gently simmer until the prawns turn white, about 3 mins. Serve with the fresh coriander and rice.","z":"步骤1\r\n将虾放入碗中，加入 2 汤匙酸橙汁、1 茶匙盐和 1 汤匙切碎的大蒜。冷却1小时。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n在一个大平底锅中加热椰子油。加入葱和洋葱，炒 5 分钟，然后加入红辣椒、辣椒片、辣椒粉和剩余的大蒜。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n倒入西红柿、椰奶和少许盐。小火煮 10 分钟。加入虾、所有腌料和剩余的酸橙汁。小火煮约3分钟，直至虾变白。与新鲜香菜和米饭一起食用。"},{"id":"53496","n":"Bai Sach Chrouk – Grilled Pork with Rice","a":"","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/f0cdwk1782688162.jpg","y":"","i":[["Pork Shoulder","650g"],["Coconut Milk","1/4 cup"],["Soy Sauce","3  tablespoons"],["Oyster Sauce","2 tablespoons"],["Honey","2 tablespoons"],["Garlic","4 cloves"],["Black Pepper","1 tsp"],["Jasmine Rice","2 cups"],["Water","4 cups"],["Vegetable Oil","1 tablespoon"],["Cucumber","1 sliced"],["Cilantro Leaves","Garnish"]],"s":"1. In a large bowl, combine the coconut milk, soy sauce, oyster sauce, honey, minced garlic, and black pepper to make the marinade.\r\n2. Add the thinly sliced pork shoulder to the marinade, ensuring each piece is fully coated, then cover and refrigerate for at least 30 minutes to allow the flavors to penetrate.\r\n3. While the pork marinates, rinse the jasmine rice under cold water until the water runs clear to remove excess starch, which helps prevent clumping.\r\n4. In a medium pot, combine the rinsed rice and 4 cups of water, bring to a boil over high heat, then reduce to a simmer, cover, and cook for 15 minutes until the water is absorbed and the rice is tender.\r\n5. Heat a grill pan or outdoor grill to medium-high heat (about 400°F) and lightly brush with vegetable oil to prevent sticking.\r\n6. Remove the pork from the marinade, shaking off any excess, and place it on the hot grill, cooking for 3-4 minutes per side until nicely charred and cooked through with an internal temperature of 145°F.\r\n7. Tip: Avoid overcrowding the grill pan to ensure even browning and proper caramelization of the marinade.\r\n8. Once the pork is grilled, let it rest for 5 minutes before slicing to retain its juices and tenderness.\r\n9. Tip: If you prefer a saucier dish, simmer the leftover marinade in a small saucepan for 5 minutes until slightly thickened and drizzle it over the pork.\r\n10. Fluff the cooked rice with a fork to separate the grains and serve it warm alongside the grilled pork slices.\r\n11. Arrange the thinly sliced cucumber and fresh cilantro leaves on top as a refreshing garnish.\r\n12. Tip: For an extra kick, serve with a side of pickled vegetables or a squeeze of lime juice to balance the rich, savory flavors.","z":"1. 在一个大碗中，将椰奶、酱油、蚝油、蜂蜜、蒜末和黑胡椒混合制成腌料。\r\n2. 将切成薄片的猪肩肉加入腌料中，确保每块猪肩肉都完全裹上酱汁，然后盖上盖子，冷藏至少 30 分钟，让味道渗透进去。\r\n3. 腌制猪肉的同时，用冷水冲洗茉莉香米直至水清澈，以除去多余的淀粉，这有助于防止结块。\r\n4. 在中锅中，将淘洗好的米和 4 杯水混合，用大火煮沸，然后转小火，盖上锅盖，煮 15 分钟，直至水被吸收且米变软。\r\n5. 将烤盘或户外烤架加热至中高温（约 400°F），并轻轻刷上植物油以防止粘连。\r\n6. 将猪肉从腌料中取出，抖掉多余的部分，然后将其放在热烤架上，每面烹饪 3-4 分钟，直至完全烧焦并煮熟，内部温度为 145°F。\r\n7. 提示：避免烤盘过度拥挤，以确保腌料均匀褐变和适当焦糖化。\r\n8. 猪肉烤好后，放置5分钟后再切片，以保留肉汁和嫩度。\r\n9. 提示：如果您喜欢酱汁较多的菜肴，请将剩余的腌料在小锅中煮 5 分钟，直至稍微变稠，然后淋在猪肉上。\r\n10. 用叉子将煮熟的米饭弄松，将米粒分开，然后与烤猪肉片一起趁热食用。\r\n11. 将切成薄片的黄瓜和新鲜的香菜叶放在上面作为清爽的装饰。\r\n12. 小贴士：如果想要更美味，可以配上腌菜或挤一点酸橙汁，以平衡浓郁的咸味。"},{"id":"53456","n":"Bajan Salt Bread Recipe","a":"","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/sr7chd1780264758.jpg","y":"","i":[["Yeast","2 tubs"],["Sugar","2 tsp"],["Salt","1 tsp"],["Vegetable Oil","2 tablespoons"],["Flour","6 cups"],["Warm Water","2 1/2 cups"]],"s":"Sift half the flour, mix with salt and yeast in a large mixing bowl, and slowly add warm water until the mixture forms a stiff dough. Add more sifted flour until you have a stiff enough dough to knead.\r\nLightly flour the work surface, knead the dough for 10 minutes until it is smooth and elastic, and then place it in a greased bowl. Now place the bowl warmly for 40-50 minutes until it has doubled. You know the dough is ready when you poke a finger, and the indentation remains.\r\nPreheat oven to 425 degrees F or 220 degrees C.\r\nNow divide the dough into 12 equal portions, roll each into a fist size ball, and place on a greased baking sheet. Now place in a warm place again for a further 40 minutes or again until the dough has doubled in size.\r\nNow place in the oven’s center and bake for 25-30 minutes until golden brown rolls sound hollow when tapped.","z":"筛入一半面粉，在一个大搅拌碗中与盐和酵母混合，然后慢慢加入温水，直至混合物形成硬面团。添加更多过筛的面粉，直到面团足够硬，可以揉捏。\r\n在工作面上撒上少许面粉，揉捏面团 10 分钟，直至其光滑且有弹性，然后将其放入已涂油的碗中。现在将碗加热 40-50 分钟，直至其膨胀至两倍大。当你用手指戳一下并且留下压痕时，你就知道面团已经准备好了。\r\n将烤箱预热至 425 华氏度或 220 摄氏度。\r\n现在将面团分成12等份，将每个面团擀成拳头大小的球，然后放在涂有油脂的烤盘上。现在再次放在温暖的地方再发酵 40 分钟，或者再次发酵，直到面团变大一倍。\r\n现在将其放入烤箱中央，烘烤 25-30 分钟，直至金黄色的面包卷敲击时发出空心的声音。"},{"id":"53460","n":"Bajan Sweet Bread","a":"","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/5vhbzt1782239221.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZrVAFmPQaZ0","i":[["Coconut","2 1/2 cups"],["Melted Butter","1/2 cup"],["Flour","4 cups"],["Shortening","1 tablespoon"],["Baking Powder","1 tablespoon"],["Salt","1 tsp"],["Sugar","3/4 cup"],["Raisins","1 cup"],["Egg","1 beaten"],["Evaporated Milk","1 1/4 cup"],["Almond Essence","1 tsp"]],"s":"Add all the flour, baking powder, and salt to a large mixing bowl.\r\nMelt the butter in a saucepan.\r\nMix the coconut and most of the sugar in another bowl – leave some back to cover the loaves later, raisins, egg, milk, almond essence, vanilla essence, and melted butter.\r\nMix well until you have a creamy paste.\r\nAdd this to the bowl with the flour, baking powder, and salt. Mix until you form a stiff dough.\r\nNow divide the mixture between the baking tins.\r\nNow boil the water.\r\nMix two tablespoons of sugar with some hot water and brush the top of each loaf.\r\nBake in the center of the oven for 1 hour.\r\nLeave to cool in tins before serving; slice and serve with a fresh pot of tea.","z":"将所有面粉、泡打粉和盐放入一个大搅拌碗中。\r\n在平底锅中融化黄油。\r\n将椰子和大部分糖放入另一个碗中混合——留下一些，稍后覆盖面包，加入葡萄干、鸡蛋、牛奶、杏仁精、香草精和融化的黄油。\r\n充分搅拌直至形成奶油状糊状物。\r\n将其与面粉、发酵粉和盐一起放入碗中。混合直至形成坚硬的面团。\r\n现在将混合物分装在烤盘之间。\r\n现在把水烧开。\r\n将两汤匙糖与一些热水混合，然后刷在每个面包的顶部。\r\n在烤箱中央烘烤 1 小时。\r\n食用前先放入罐中冷却；切片并与一壶新鲜茶一起食用。"},{"id":"53548","n":"Baked Yuca Fries","a":"","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/j223gc1784579841.jpg","y":"","i":[["Yuca","2 large"],["Extra Virgin Olive Oil","2 tablespoons"],["Chilli Powder","1 tsp"],["Kosher Salt","Pinch"],["Ground Black Pepper","Pinch"],["Avocado","1 large"],["Sour Cream","1/4 cup"],["Lime","Juice of 1"],["Cilantro","1/4 cup"]],"s":"Step 1\r\nPreheat oven to 450°. Bring a large pot of water to a boil. Trim ends of yuca and cut each one in half, widthwise. Stand them on their ends and use a sharp knife to cut the waxy peel off. Cut each piece in half lengthwise and then cut in half lengthwise one more time to create 16 pieces total. Trim the fibrous center out of each piece. \r\nStep 2\r\nPlace cut yuca into boiling water and let boil until fork tender, 8 to 10 minutes. Using a slotted spoon, remove from pot and place on a paper towel lined cutting board. Pat dry with another paper towel. \r\nStep 3\r\nPlace dried yuca into a large bowl and toss with oil. Season with chili powder, salt, and pepper and toss again to evenly coat. Place yuca on a large baking sheet in an even layer. \r\nStep 4\r\nBake until golden and crispy, about 25 minutes, tossing halfway through. \r\nStep 5\r\nMeanwhile make dipping sauce: In a small food processor or blender, combine avocado, sour cream, lime juice, and cilantro and blend until smooth. Season with salt and pepper. \r\nStep 6\r\nServe fries immediately with dipping sauce.","z":"步骤1\r\n将烤箱预热至 450°。将一大锅水烧开。修剪尤卡的末端，将每一根横向切成两半。将它们立起来，用锋利的刀切掉蜡质的果皮。将每块纵向切成两半，然后再纵向切成两半，总共 16 块。修剪每块的纤维中心。 \r\n步骤2\r\n将切好的尤卡放入沸水中煮 8 至 10 分钟，直至叉子变软。使用有槽勺从锅中取出并放在衬有纸巾的切板上。用另一张纸巾拍干。 \r\n步骤3\r\n将干尤卡放入一个大碗中，拌入油。用辣椒粉、盐和胡椒调味，然后再次搅拌均匀。将尤卡均匀地放在一个大烤盘上。 \r\n步骤4\r\n烘烤约25分钟，直至金黄酥脆，中途翻动。 \r\n步骤5\r\n同时制作蘸酱：在小型食品加工机或搅拌机中，将鳄梨、酸奶油、酸橙汁和香菜混合，搅拌至光滑。用盐和胡椒调味。 \r\n步骤6\r\n立即将薯条与蘸酱一起食用。"},{"id":"53559","n":"Baked brie with sorrel jam","a":"","c":"Starter","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/fg7d641784666908.jpg","y":"","i":[["Dried Sorrel","1 cup"],["Brown Sugar","2 cups"],["Ground Ginger","1 tsp"],["Cinnamon","1/4 cup"],["vanilla pod","1"],["Orange","Zest of 1"],["Water","Boiled"],["Egg","1 beaten"],["Puff Pastry","1 Slice"],["Brie","2 Lbs"],["Sorrel Jam","To serve"],["Water","1 tsp"]],"s":"Sorrel jam instructions\r\nCombine sugar, sorrel, lemon zest, water in a medium sized pot.\r\nBring to a boil as petal becomes soft\r\nReduce heat, and cook until thickened.\r\nLet it rest before using on brie\r\nBaked brie instructions\r\nYou can slice the brie in half to create a sandwich-like effect. Or you can leave the brie wheel intact and just trim the top rind of the wheel.\r\nAdd a generous portion of jam to the top of the wheel, or one side of the sandwich\r\nRoll dough out with a rolling pin on a floured surface\r\nTrim excess dough. You can also use it to decorate .\r\nWrap the pastry up around the sides and over the top of cheese wheel, wrapping completely and pressing the edges of dough together to form a tightly sealed package.\r\nCarefully flip the dough-wrapped cheese over, so that the gathered dough is on the bottom.Place the package, seam side down, on a baking sheet sprayed with non-stick cooking spray.\r\nThe brie can be prepared up to this point and refrigerated for 2 days before baking.\r\nBe sure to bring the brie to room temperature before baking.\r\nPreheat the oven to 400° F.\r\nCombine the egg and water and brush the mixture over the top and sides of the pastry.\r\nAdd design from leftover dough if you'd like, and brush with egg mixture\r\n\r\nYou can use leftover sorrel pulp from your juice to make the jam. It will be  a little less acidic and the color will be a brighter red instead of darker red.\r\nMake my jam a day ahead, so I don’t feel rushed and the jam will have time to settle.\r\nAdd the jam to the center of the brie by slicing the brie in half and having the jam as a filler.\r\nNext time, I’ll use a larger pot, so that I don’t need to add water frequently to tenderize the sorrel.","z":"酸模果酱使用说明\r\n将糖、酢浆草、柠檬皮和水放入一个中等大小的锅中。\r\n当花瓣变软时煮沸\r\n减少热量，煮至变稠。\r\n在用于布里干酪之前先让它休息一下\r\n烤布里干酪说明\r\n您可以将布里干酪切成两半，以产生类似三明治的效果。或者你可以保持布里干酪轮完好无损，只修剪轮的顶部外皮。\r\n在轮子顶部或三明治的一侧添加大量果酱\r\n将面团放在撒了面粉的表面上，用擀面杖擀开\r\n修剪多余的面团。您还可以用它来装饰。\r\n将糕点包裹在奶酪轮的两侧和顶部，完全包裹并将面团的边缘压在一起，形成紧密密封的包装。\r\n小心地将包裹着奶酪的面团翻转过来，使聚集的面团位于底部。将包装，接缝面朝下，放在喷有不粘烹饪喷雾的烤盘上。\r\n布里干酪可以准备好并在烘烤前冷藏2天。\r\n烘烤前务必将布里干酪恢复至室温。\r\n将烤箱预热至 400° F。\r\n将鸡蛋和水混合，然后将混合物刷在糕点的顶部和侧面。\r\n如果您愿意，可以添加剩余面团的图案，然后刷上鸡蛋混合物\r\n\r\n您可以使用果汁中剩下的酸模果肉来制作果酱。它的酸性会稍弱一些，颜色会是更亮的红色而不是更深的红色。\r\n提前一天做好果酱，这样我就不会感到匆忙，果酱也有时间稳定下来。\r\n将布里干酪切成两半，然后用果酱作为填充物，将果酱添加到布里干酪的中心。\r\n下次我会用一个大一点的锅，这样我就不需要经常加水来让酢浆草变嫩了。"},{"id":"53440","n":"Balchi di Pisca","a":"","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/qqwhw51780093126.jpg","y":"","i":[["Salt Cod","1"],["Potatoes","3 Medium"],["Tomato","1"],["Green Pepper","1/2"],["Onion","1 medium"],["Garlic","1 clove peeled sliced"],["Tobasco Sauce","1/2 tsp"],["Nutmeg","Dash"],["Salt","To taste"],["Pepper","To taste"],["Egg","1"]],"s":"These delectable fish balls can also be made with salmon or fish fillets. Substitute one large can of salmon or one pound of any white fish for the cod.\r\n\r\nSoak for twenty-four hours:\r\n1 salted cod, or bakijow Discard the water.\r\n\r\nPlace cod in saucepan with fresh water to cover. Simmer gently until the fish flakes easily when tested with the tines of a fork. Strain, reserving a bit of the broth. De bone the cod and set it aside for later use. In a saucepan, bring to boil in water to cover: 3 medium potatoes, peeled and diced When the potatoes are tender, drain them well. Add the cod and mash the two ingredients thoroughly together.\r\n\r\nPlace in the container of an electric blender:\r\n1 tomato, peeled and chopped\r\n1/2 green pepper, chopped\r\n1 medium onion, peeled and chopped\r\n1 clove garlic, slivered\r\n1/2 tsp. Tabasco sauce, or minced hot pepper\r\nDash of nutmeg\r\nSalt and pepper to taste\r\n\r\nBlend for a few seconds and pour the sauce over the mashed fish mixture. Combine these ingredients well and add 1 egg, beaten Mixture should be stiff enough to mold into balls about one and a half inches in diameter, If it's too dry, add the fish stock a tablespoon at a time. Fry the balls in hot, deep fat until golden brown.","z":"这些美味的鱼丸也可以用鲑鱼或鱼片制成。用一大罐鲑鱼或一磅任何白鱼代替鳕鱼。\r\n\r\n浸泡二十四小时：\r\n1 条咸鳕鱼或 bakijow 倒掉水。\r\n\r\n将鳕鱼放入锅中，加清水盖过鳕鱼。慢慢地煮，直到用叉子的尖齿测试时，鱼很容易剥落。过滤，保留一点肉汤。将鳕鱼去骨，放在一边备用。在平底锅中，将水煮沸，盖住： 3 个中等大小的土豆，去皮并切块。当土豆变软时，沥干水分。加入鳕鱼并将两种成分彻底捣碎在一起。\r\n\r\n放入电动搅拌机的容器中：\r\n1 个番茄，去皮并切碎\r\n1/2 个青椒，切碎\r\n1 个中等大小的洋葱，去皮并切碎\r\n1 瓣大蒜，切丝\r\n1/2 茶匙。塔巴斯科酱或切碎的辣椒\r\n肉豆蔻少许\r\n盐和胡椒调味\r\n\r\n搅拌几秒钟，然后将酱汁倒在鱼泥混合物上。将这些成分充分混合，加入 1 个鸡蛋，打散。混合物应该足够硬，可以形成直径约一英寸半的球。如果太干，一次加入一汤匙鱼汤。将球放入热的深油中煎至金黄色。"},{"id":"53441","n":"Banana den Forno","a":"","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/6v583k1780093743.jpg","y":"","i":[["Banana","4"],["Ground Cinnamon","2 tablespoons"],["Vanilla Extract","3  tablespoons"],["Sugar","1 cup"],["Water","4 cups"]],"s":"Peal the bananas and boil them together with the cinnamon, vanilla extract, sugar and water for about 20 minutes. Bake the bananas in the oven at 275°F for 10 minutes. Serve with favorite ice cream.","z":"将香蕉去皮，与肉桂、香草精、糖和水一起煮约 20 分钟。将香蕉放入 275°F 的烤箱中烘烤 10 分钟。与最喜欢的冰淇淋一起食用。"},{"id":"53451","n":"Bangladeshi fish curry with daikon","a":"","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/r7mcjm1780261264.jpg","y":"","i":[["White Fish","450g"],["Daikon Radish","450g"],["Vegetable Oil","4 tablespoons"],["Garlic","4 cloves"],["Onion","1 medium"],["Salt","2 tsp"],["Ground Turmeric","1 tsp"],["Ground Coriander","2 tsp"],["Chilli Powder","2 tsp"],["Green Chilli","2"],["Coriander Leaves","Handful"],["Lime","1"]],"s":"If you are using rohu fish it will usually be frozen. Soak it in cold water for 30-45 minutes to defrost and while still a little firm, descale and cut each steak into quarters and wash in cold saltwater a few times. Drain and set aside. If using an alternative such as cod, cut into 2 ½ inch chunks then rinse, drain and set aside\r\n2\r\nTop and tail the daikon and peel using a potato peeler. Cut in half widthways then cut each half down the middle, lengthways. Now slice into 2cm-thick half-moon pieces. Rinse and set aside\r\n3\r\nPlace a large, shallow saucepan over a medium heat and add the oil. When the oil is hot add the crushed garlic and stir for a minute until pale golden\r\n4\r\nAdd the onion paste and salt and cook for 3-5 minutes, until the onion softens and becomes translucent, stirring occasionally\r\n5\r\nPour in 200ml of water then cover and cook for 10 minutes, stirring once or twice\r\n6\r\nAfter 10 minutes add the ground spices and stir for a couple of minutes so that the spices cook through. Cover and cook for 5 minutes over a low heat then stir in the daikon. After a minute or so add 200ml of water. Cover and cook for 10 minutes on a medium heat\r\n7\r\nAdd the fish pieces to the pan and mix thoroughly so that the fish is coated in the spices. Gently shake the pan and cover and cook for 5 minutes on medium heat. It is very important not to stir the pot after this stage\r\n8\r\nMeanwhile, boil some water. After the 5 minutes are over carefully pour 500ml hot water into the pan. When doing this pour into the sides of the pan so that you don’t pour boiling water directly onto the fish\r\n9\r\nGive the pan a gentle shake then cover and simmer over high heat for 15 minutes. Add the chopped coriander and chillies and continue cooking for another 5 minutes then turn off the heat. Serve immediately with rice and the lime wedges","z":"如果您使用南亚野鲮鱼，它通常会被冷冻。将其在冷水中浸泡 30-45 分钟以解冻，趁其仍有点硬的同时，除鳞，将每块牛排切成四等份，然后在冷盐水中清洗几次。沥干并放在一边。如果使用鳕鱼等替代品，切成 2 ½ 英寸的块，然后冲洗、沥干并放在一边\r\n2\r\n将白萝卜的顶部和尾部切掉，然后用土豆削皮器削皮。横向切成两半，然后将每一半从中间纵向切成两半。现在切成2厘米厚的半月形片。冲洗并放在一边\r\n3\r\n将一个大的浅平底锅放在中火上，然后加入油。当油热时，加入碎大蒜，搅拌一分钟直至呈浅金黄色\r\n4\r\n加入洋葱酱和盐，煮 3-5 分钟，直至洋葱变软并变成半透明，偶尔搅拌\r\n5\r\n倒入200毫升水，盖上盖子煮10分钟，搅拌一到两次\r\n6\r\n10 分钟后，加入磨碎的香料，搅拌几分钟，使香料煮熟。盖上锅盖，小火煮 5 分钟，然后拌入白萝卜。大约一分钟后，加入200毫升水。盖上锅盖，中火煮10分钟\r\n7\r\n将鱼块放入锅中，充分搅拌，使鱼裹上香料。轻轻摇动锅并盖上盖子，中火煮 5 分钟。这个阶段之后不要搅锅，这一点很重要\r\n8\r\n同时，煮一些水。 5分钟结束后，小心地将500毫升热水倒入锅中。这样做时，将水倒入锅的两侧，这样就不会将沸水直接倒在鱼上\r\n9\r\n轻轻摇晃锅，然后盖上锅盖，用大火煮 15 分钟。加入切碎的香菜和辣椒，继续煮5分钟，然后关火。立即与米饭和酸橙角一起食用"},{"id":"53457","n":"Barbados Pepperpot","a":"","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/5tf8j11782236249.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9L2nQEBRPdg","i":[["Pigs Trotters","2"],["Oxtail","2 Lbs"],["Lime juice","Splash"],["Garlic","3 cloves"],["Scotch Bonnet","2"],["Onion","1 large"],["Cinnamon Stick","1"],["Cloves","2"],["Sugar","Pinch"],["Salt","Pinch"],["Basil","Sprinkling"],["Thyme","Sprinkling"],["Beef","2 Lbs"]],"s":"Wash the stewing steak and place it in the mixing bowl with the lemon or lime juice.\r\nSet that to one side; while you slice the garlic into tiny slices, slice the onion. Chop the basil and thyme.\r\nNow you need to be very careful when you slice the scotch bonnet peppers; you want these in fine pieces, which you can either do with a long knife trying not to touch the pepper, or you can wear rubber gloves to cut it up. Wash your hands straight afterward and do not touch your eyes; these peppers really burn your hands and eyes if they make contact with the skin!\r\nNow rinse the lime or lemon juice off the stewing steak. And cut the meat into cubes.\r\nAlso, chop the pig’s trotters and the oxtail into cubes.\r\nFill the large saucepan with water and bring to a boil.\r\nAdd the pig’s trotters.\r\nWhen the pig’s trotters have boiled, drain the excess water, and now add the stewing steak and cover with fresh hot water.\r\nNow add your chopped garlic, onion, and peppers.\r\nNow add the cinnamon stick, cloves, basil, and thyme and a pinch of salt and sugar to taste.\r\nNow simmer until the meat is tender. The flavor of this dish comes out over a few days and therefore gets tastier each time you reheat it; make sure you always reheat the entire pot to boiling point.","z":"将炖牛排洗净，放入装有柠檬汁或酸橙汁的主锅中。\r\n将其设置在一侧；当你把大蒜切成小片时，把洋葱切成薄片。将罗勒和百里香切碎。\r\n现在你在切苏格兰帽辣椒时需要非常小心；你想要把它们切成小块，你可以用一把长刀，尽量不要接触辣椒，也可以戴上橡胶手套把它切碎。之后立即洗手，不要触摸眼睛；如果这些辣椒接触到皮肤，真的会灼伤你的手和眼睛！\r\n现在冲洗炖牛排上的酸橙或柠檬汁。并将肉切成方块。\r\n另外，将猪蹄和牛尾切成丁。\r\n将大平底锅装满水并煮沸。\r\n加入猪蹄。\r\n猪蹄煮沸后，沥干多余的水，然后加入正在炖的牛排，盖上新鲜的热水。\r\n现在加入切碎的大蒜、洋葱和辣椒。\r\n现在加入肉桂棒、丁香、罗勒、百里香以及少许盐和糖调味。\r\n现在煮至肉变软。这道菜的味道会在几天内显现出来，因此每次重新加热都会变得更美味；确保始终将整个锅重新加热至沸点。"},{"id":"53469","n":"Beef pumpkin Stew","a":"","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/k07k271782502861.jpg","y":"","i":[["Beef","3 Lbs"],["All purpose flour","1/2 cup"],["Butter","3  tablespoons"],["Onion","1 cup"],["Garlic","1 clove peeled crushed"],["Beef Stock","4 cups"],["Pumpkin Puree","3 Cups"],["Worcestershire Sauce","1 tablespoon"],["Kosher Salt","1 tablespoon"],["Black Pepper","1 teaspoon"],["Potatoes","3 Lbs"],["Carrots","1 lb"],["Thyme","4 sprigs"]],"s":"Cut the beef into 1-inch chunks. Dredge the beef in the flour until all of the beef sides are covered.\r\nIn a large soup pot, melt the butter over medium high-heat. In small quantities, brown the beef on all sides, removing the browned beef and setting it aside in a large bowl as you go. When the beef is browned, add the onion and the garlic to the pot. Sauté the onion and garlic for one minute, scraping the bottom of the pot as you stir.\r\nReturn the browned beef to the pot and add the beef stock, pumpkin puree, Worcestershire sauce, salt, and pepper. Stir well and bring to a boil. Once the liquid is boiling, reduce heat to medium-low and simmer for 3 hours, stirring occasionally.\r\nAdd the potatoes, carrots and thyme sprigs to the pot and increase heat to medium. Cook for an additional 30 minutes. Salt to taste and serve.","z":"将牛肉切成1英寸的块。将牛肉放入面粉中，直到所有的牛肉面都被覆盖。\r\n在一个大汤锅中，用中高温融化黄油。少量地将牛肉各面煎成棕色，取出棕色牛肉，然后将其放在一个大碗中。当牛肉变成棕色时，将洋葱和大蒜加入锅中。将洋葱和大蒜炒一分钟，搅拌时刮擦锅底。\r\n将褐色牛肉放回锅中，加入牛肉高汤、南瓜泥、伍斯特沙司、盐和胡椒。充分搅拌并煮沸。液体沸腾后，将火调至中低，煮 3 小时，偶尔搅拌。\r\n将土豆、胡萝卜和百里香小枝放入锅中，将火调至中火。再煮 30 分钟。加盐调味即可食用。"},{"id":"53463","n":"Belgian Meatballs in Liège Syrup Sauce","a":"","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/gjjlzc1782496055.jpg","y":"","i":[["Minced Beef","300g"],["Minced Pork","300g"],["Onion","1 chopped"],["Garlic","1 clove peeled crushed"],["Egg","1"],["Breadcrumbs","4 tablespoons"],["Mustard","1 tablespoon"],["Parsley","1 tablespoon"],["Salt","Pinch"],["Pepper","Pinch"],["Oil","Splash"],["Onion","2 sliced"],["Butter","1 tablespoon"],["Brown Sugar","1 tablespoon"],["White Wine Vinegar","2 tablespoons"],["Mustard","2 tablespoons"],["Sirop De Liège","4 tablespoons"],["Beef Stock","1 cup"],["Bay Leaf","1"],["Beer","Splash"]],"s":"Make the meatballs\r\n1) Mix the minced meat with the onion, garlic, egg, breadcrumbs, mustard, parsley, salt, and pepper.\r\n\r\n2) Shape into meatballs. Traditionally, Liège restaurants serve **one or two very large meatballs**, depending on appetite.\r\n\r\n3) For weeknight cooking, I keep mine smaller so they brown faster and cook through quickly.\r\n\r\nBrown the meatballs\r\n4) Heat butter or oil in a large pan.\r\n\r\n5) Brown the meatballs on all sides until they have a nice crust.\r\n\r\n6) Remove them from the pan and set aside.\r\n\r\nStart the sauce\r\n7) In the same pan, melt 1 tbsp butter.\r\n\r\n8) Add the sliced onions and cook until soft and lightly caramelised.\r\n\r\n9) Sprinkle in the brown sugar and let it melt into the onions.\r\n\r\nDeglaze and add the stock\r\n10) Add the vinegar and scrape up all the browned bits from the pan.\r\n\r\n11) Stir in the mustard and Liège syrup.\r\n\r\n12) Pour in the beef stock (and beer if using).\r\n\r\n13) Add the bay leaf.\r\n\r\n14) Stir until the syrup dissolves and the sauce looks glossy.\r\n\r\nSimmer and adjust\r\n15) Return the meatballs to the pan.\r\n\r\n16) Cover and simmer gently for 25–30 minutes (less if your meatballs are small, longer if they’re traditional large boulets). Stir occasionally and let the sauce thicken naturally.\r\n\r\n17) Taste and adjust: more syrup for sweetness, more vinegar for tang, more mustard for depth. The sauce should be sweet‑sour, rich, and velvety.\r\n\r\n18) Serve with fries or mashed potatoes.","z":"做肉丸\r\n1）将肉末与洋葱、大蒜、鸡蛋、面包屑、芥末、欧芹、盐和胡椒粉混合。\r\n\r\n2）搓成丸子状。传统上，列日餐厅根据胃口提供**一个或两个非常大的肉丸**。\r\n\r\n3）对于周末晚上做饭，我把我的锅弄小一点，这样它们就可以更快地变褐色并很快煮熟。\r\n\r\n把肉丸煎成棕色\r\n4）在大锅中加热黄油或油。\r\n\r\n5）将肉丸各面煎至焦黄，直至形成漂亮的外皮。\r\n\r\n6) 将它们从锅中取出并放在一边。\r\n\r\n开始打酱油\r\n7）在同一个锅中，融化1汤匙黄油。\r\n\r\n8) 加入切好的洋葱，煮至软化并呈浅焦糖状。\r\n\r\n9）撒上红糖，让其融化到洋葱中。\r\n\r\n去釉并添加高汤\r\n10）加入醋，刮去锅中所有褐色的碎片。\r\n\r\n11) 加入芥末和列日糖浆搅拌。\r\n\r\n12）倒入牛肉高汤（如果使用的话，还可以加入啤酒）。\r\n\r\n13）加入月桂叶。\r\n\r\n14) 搅拌直至糖浆溶解并且酱汁看起来有光泽。\r\n\r\n煮沸并调整\r\n15）将肉丸放回锅中。\r\n\r\n16) 盖上锅盖，小火煮 25-30 分钟（如果肉丸很小，则时间要短一些，如果是传统的大丸子，则时间要长一些）。偶尔搅拌一下，让酱汁自然变稠。\r\n\r\n17) 品尝和调整：加点糖浆增加甜味，加点醋增加味道，加点芥末增加深度。酱汁应该酸甜、浓郁、柔滑。\r\n\r\n18) 与薯条或土豆泥一起食用。"},{"id":"53468","n":"Belgian Stoemp","a":"","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/byolko1782500400.jpg","y":"","i":[["Sausages","2"],["Potatoes","450g"],["Savoy Cabbage","200g"],["Garlic","3 cloves"],["Parsley","1 Handfull"],["Onion","1 small finely diced"],["Unsalted Butter","3  tablespoons"],["Beer","1 cup"],["Whole Milk","60ml"],["Nutmeg","Pinch"],["Pepper","Pinch"],["Salt","Pinch"]],"s":"1. Add the chopped potatoes and garlic to a high pan and fill it with tap water until the potatoes are fully submerged.\r\n\r\n2. Add some salt. Then place the pan over high heat and bring the potatoes to a boil. Cook them until tender. In the meantime rinse and drain the savoy cabbage. Slice it up finely.\r\n\r\n3. Add a tablespoon of butter to a large non-stick pan. Place it over medium-high heat. Once melted, add the savoy cabbage. Season with a pinch of pepper and salt.\r\n\r\n4. Stir fry the cabbage for 15 to 20 minutes or until the cabbage is soft and tender. Then turn the heat off and take the cabbage off the heat. In the meantime, pan fry the sausages (or sliced bacon if you are using both) in a non-stick pan in a tablespoon of butter or oil until golden brown and cooked through.\r\n\r\n5. Transfer the sausages (and bacon) to a plate and cover with a lid or tinfoil to keep the meat warm. In the same greasy pan, add the sliced onion and extra butter and cook it gently over medium heat for 10 minutes until softened. (I often add diced bacon as well, if I only serve the stoemp with sausages.)\r\n\r\n6. Then add the beer and turn the heat up. Let the beer reduce until you get a nice beer and onion sauce (you can add a little flour or sauce thickener if you like). Add the pan fried meat back to the pan and cover to keep warm.\r\n\r\n7. Drain the cooked potatoes and garlic, add them back to the pan you cooked them in together with the pan fried cabbage and chopped parsley. Sprinkle with some pepper, salt and nutmeg. Also add the milk and the rest of the unsalted butter.\r\n\r\n8. Mash the potatoes, parsley and cabbage up. Add extra butter or milk if necessary. Also check the seasoning and add extra pepper, nutmeg or salt to taste if necessary. Scoop the cabbage mash onto plates and top with the pan fried sausages (and bacon). Drizzle with the beer and onion sauce. Serve hot.","z":"1. 将切碎的土豆和大蒜放入高锅中，倒入自来水，直至完全淹没土豆。\r\n\r\n2.加少许盐。然后将锅放在高温下，将土豆煮沸。将它们煮至变软。与此同时，将皱叶甘蓝冲洗并沥干。把它切成细丝。\r\n\r\n3. 在一个大的不粘锅中加入一汤匙黄油。将其放在中高火上。一旦融化，加入皱叶甘蓝。用少许胡椒粉和盐调味。\r\n\r\n4. 将卷心菜炒15至20分钟或直至卷心菜变软。然后关掉火，把卷心菜从火上移开。与此同时，在不粘锅中加入一汤匙黄油或油，将香肠（或切片培根，如果您同时使用两者）煎至金黄色并煮熟。\r\n\r\n5. 将香肠（和培根）转移到盘子上，盖上盖子或锡纸以保持肉的温度。在同一个油锅中，加入切好的洋葱和额外的黄油，中火轻轻煮 10 分钟，直至变软。 （如果我只把香肠和香肠一起上桌的话，我也经常添加培根丁。）\r\n\r\n6.然后加入啤酒并加热。让啤酒减少，直到得到美味的啤酒和洋葱酱（如果您愿意，可以添加一点面粉或酱汁增稠剂）。将煎好的肉放回锅中，盖上盖子保温。\r\n\r\n7. 沥干煮熟的土豆和大蒜，将它们与煎卷心菜和切碎的欧芹一起放回锅中。撒上一些胡椒、盐和肉豆蔻。还添加牛奶和其余的无盐黄油。\r\n\r\n8. 将土豆、欧芹和卷心菜捣碎。如有必要，添加额外的黄油或牛奶。还要检查调味料，必要时添加额外的胡椒、肉豆蔻或盐来调味。将卷心菜泥舀到盘子上，上面放上煎香肠（和培根）。淋上啤酒和洋葱酱。趁热食用。"},{"id":"53466","n":"Belgian Waterzooi Chicken","a":"","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/nmxec11782498644.jpg","y":"","i":[["Chicken Legs","1"],["Chicken Breast","1"],["Water","3 Cups"],["Carrots","1 small"],["Leek","2"],["Celery","1"],["Potatoes","100g"],["Garlic","2 cloves"],["Rosemary","1 Sprig"],["Cream","1 1/2 cups"],["Bay Leaf","2"],["Unsalted Butter","1 tablespoon"],["Egg Yolks","1"],["Pepper","Pinch"],["Salt","Pinch"]],"s":"Put the chicken, water and one garlic clove in a large saucepan. Place it over medium-high heat until boiling. Then turn the heat low, cover the pan and simmer the chicken for 10 minutes. Remove the chicken leg and breast. Keep the fresh chicken stock for later.\r\n\r\nLet the chicken cool. Then dice the chicken breast up. Pick the meat off the leg. Discard any bones and skin. Slice the leek, celery and carrot finely (julienne). Add the butter, rosemary and bay leaves to a large pan and place it over medium heat until melted.\r\n\r\nThen add the sliced vegetables. Season with pepper and salt.\r\n\r\nStir and cook the vegetables for 3 minutes. Then add the shredded and diced chicken.\r\n\r\nCover the pan and cook the chicken and vegetables for 5 minutes. Then add the cream and ½ cup (120 ml) of the fresh chicken stock.\r\nLook at this delicious waterzooi recipe! Do try out my chunky chicken stew with fresh leeks, celery, carrots and lots of cream... This is Belgian comfort food!\r\n\r\nCover the pan and cook the stew for 20 minutes until the potatoes are tender. Add the egg yolk and 2 tablespoons of the warm cream from the pan to a cup. Whisk and add it back to the pan to thicken the sauce.\r\n\r\nStir all the ingredients and then turn the heat very low. Check the seasoning and add extra pepper or salt to taste. Remove the rosemary and bay leaves. Divide the stew over deep plates and drizzle with the remaining cream sauce. Serve hot.","z":"将鸡肉、水和一瓣蒜放入大锅中。将其放在中火上直至沸腾。然后把火调低，盖上锅盖，把鸡肉煮10分钟。取出鸡腿和鸡胸肉。保留新鲜鸡汤以备后用。\r\n\r\n让鸡肉冷却。然后将鸡胸肉切丁。把腿上的肉挑下来。丢弃所有骨头和皮肤。将韭菜、芹菜和胡萝卜切成细丝（切丝）。将黄油、迷迭香和月桂叶放入大锅中，中火加热直至融化。\r\n\r\n然后加入切好的蔬菜。用胡椒和盐调味。\r\n\r\n将蔬菜搅拌并煮 3 分钟。然后加入切碎和切丁的鸡肉。\r\n\r\n盖上锅盖，将鸡肉和蔬菜煮 5 分钟。然后加入奶油和 ½ 杯（120 毫升）新鲜鸡汤。\r\n看看这个美味的水动物园食谱！一定要尝尝我用新鲜韭菜、芹菜、胡萝卜和大量奶油炖的大块鸡肉……这是比利时的舒适食物！\r\n\r\n盖上锅盖，煮20分钟，直到土豆变软。将蛋黄和 2 汤匙热奶油从锅中倒入杯子中。搅拌并将其放回锅中以使酱汁变稠。\r\n\r\n搅拌所有成分，然后把火调得很低。检查调味料并添加额外的胡椒或盐来调味。去掉迷迭香和月桂叶。将炖菜分装在深盘子上，淋上剩余的奶油酱。趁热食用。"},{"id":"53453","n":"Bengali Chicken Curry with Potatoes","a":"","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/9ya6o71780262651.jpg","y":"","i":[["Olive Oil","2 tablespoons"],["Onion","2 diced"],["Ginger Garlic Paste","1 tablespoon"],["Tomato","2 diced"],["Cayenne Pepper","1 tsp"],["Curry Powder","1 tsp"],["Garam Masala","1 tsp"],["Ground Turmeric","1 tsp"],["Ground Cumin","1 tsp"],["Chicken Breast","4"],["Red Potatoes","2 large"],["Cilantro","1/2 cup"]],"s":"Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat. Cook and stir the onions in the hot oil until translucent, about 5 minutes. Add the ginger-garlic paste and continue cooking another 5 minutes. Reduce heat to medium; stir the tomatoes into the mixture and cook until the tomatoes are pulpy, 5 to 10 minutes. Season with the cayenne pepper, curry powder, garam masala, turmeric, and cumin; cook and stir another 5 minutes.\r\n\r\nAdd the chicken and potatoes to the mixture in the skillet; simmer, stirring occasionally, until the potatoes are tender and the chicken is no longer pink in the center, about 20 minutes. Sprinkle the cilantro over the mixture and continue simmering another 10 minutes. Serve hot.","z":"在大煎锅中用中高火加热橄榄油。在热油中煮洋葱并搅拌直至半透明，大约需要 5 分钟。加入姜蒜酱，继续煮 5 分钟。将热量降至中等；将番茄放入混合物中搅拌，煮 5 到 10 分钟，直至番茄变成浆状。用辣椒、咖喱粉、印度香料、姜黄和小茴香调味；再煮5分钟并搅拌。\r\n\r\n将鸡肉和土豆加入煎锅中的混合物中；小火煮约 20 分钟，偶尔搅拌，直至土豆变软且鸡肉中心不再呈粉红色。将香菜撒在混合物上，继续煮 10 分钟。趁热食用。"},{"id":"53580","n":"Biss Jaggery Modak","a":"","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/gl92ih1789802951.jpg","y":"","i":[["Coconut Flakes","2 cups"],["Brown Sugar","1 cups"],["Dried Fruit",""]],"s":"Jaggery Modak\n\n1. Take the grated coconut in a bowl.\n2. Add jaggery to the grated coconut.\n3. Mix the coconut and jaggery thoroughly until they are evenly combined.\n4. Take small portions of the mixture and shape them into modaks using your hands or a modak mould.\n5. Repeat until all the mixture has been used.\n6. Serve the freshly prepared jaggery coconut modaks.\n","z":"贾格里·莫达克\n\n1. 将磨碎的椰子放入碗中。\n2. 将粗糖加入磨碎的椰子中。\n3. 将椰子和粗糖充分混合直至均匀。\n4. 取一小部分混合物，用手或莫达克模具将其成型为莫达克。\n5. 重复此操作，直至用完所有混合物。\n6. 享用新鲜准备的粗糖椰子莫达克。"},{"id":"53546","n":"Black Bean soup","a":"","c":"Starter","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/x0mreq1784577446.jpg","y":"","i":[["Extra Virgin Olive Oil","2 tablespoons"],["Red Onions","1 medium"],["Jalapeno","1"],["Garlic","2 cloves minced"],["Tomato Puree","1 tablespoon"],["Kosher Salt","Pinch"],["Black Pepper","Pinch"],["Ground Cumin","1/2 tsp"],["Chilli Powder","1 tsp"],["Black Beans","3 cans"],["Chicken Stock","3 Cups"],["Bay Leaf","1"],["Sour Cream","Garnish"],["Avocado","Garnish"],["Cilantro","Garnish"],["Lime","To serve"]],"s":"Step 1\r\nIn a large pot over medium heat, heat oil. Add onion and cook until soft and translucent, about 5 minutes. Add jalapeños and garlic and cook until fragrant, about 2 minutes. Add tomato paste, stir to coat vegetables, and cook about a minute more. Season with salt, pepper, cumin, and chili powder and stir to coat.\r\nStep 2\r\nAdd black beans and broth. Stir soup, add bay leaf, and bring to a boil. Immediately reduce to a simmer and let simmer until slightly reduced and thickened, 15 to 20 minutes. (If a thinner soup is desired, add more broth as needed.)\r\nStep 3\r\nRemove bay leaf and let cool slightly. Using an immersion blender or food processor, blend soup to desired consistency.\r\nStep 4\r\nServe with a dollop of sour cream, sliced avocado, and cilantro.","z":"步骤1\r\n在一个大锅中，用中火加热油。加入洋葱，煮约 5 分钟，直至洋葱变软、半透明。加入墨西哥辣椒和大蒜，煮约 2 分钟直至散发出香味。加入番茄酱，搅拌以覆盖蔬菜，再煮约一分钟。用盐、胡椒、小茴香和辣椒粉调味，搅拌均匀。\r\n步骤2\r\n加入黑豆和肉汤。搅拌汤，加入月桂叶，煮沸。立即转小火，小火煮 15 至 20 分钟，直至汤汁稍微变稠并变稠。 （如果需要更稀的汤，请根据需要添加更多肉汤。）\r\n步骤3\r\n取出月桂叶并稍微冷却。使用浸入式搅拌机或食品加工机，将汤搅拌至所需的稠度。\r\n步骤4\r\n与一块酸奶油、鳄梨片和香菜一起食用。"},{"id":"53536","n":"Black Beans Hotpot","a":"","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/81ahfr1784394567.jpg","y":"","i":[["Black Beans","400g"],["Onion","1 large"],["Green Pepper","1"],["Red Pepper","1"],["Celery","1/3 cup"],["Garlic","4 Cloves Crushed"],["Ground Cumin","1 1/2 tsp"],["Oregano","1 tablespoon"],["Salt","1 1/2 tsp"],["Black Pepper","2 tsp"],["Water","5 Cups"]],"s":"Add all the ingredients in the Instant pot, Lock the lid on and set the Instant Pot to High Pressure for 35 minutes. Once the beans are done cooking, let the pressure release naturally for 20 minutes before releasing the remaining pressure. Open and serve! \r\nLet the beans get cool completely before saving them in the fridge or freezer. ","z":"将所有原料加入速溶锅中，锁上盖子并将速溶锅设置为高压 35 分钟。豆子煮熟后，让压力自然释放 20 分钟，然后释放剩余压力。打开并服务！ \r\n先让豆子完全冷却，然后再将其放入冰箱或冰柜中。"},{"id":"53482","n":"Black bean & meat stew - feijoada","a":"","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/xrxz7h1782592711.jpg","y":"","i":[["Black Beans","250g"],["Bacon","100g"],["Pork Back Ribs","500g"],["Chorizo","3"],["Pork Shoulder","500g"],["Onion","3 chopped"],["Garlic","4 Cloves Chopped"],["Chilli Flakes","Pinch"],["Oil","Drizzle"],["Bay Leaf","2"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat a large heavy-based saucepan with a fitted lid, add the bacon and fry until crisp. Remove and keep the oil in the pan. In batches sear the ribs, sausages and pork shoulder. Season each batch with salt and pepper.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nRemove the meat and set aside. Add the onion, garlic and chilli to the pan. Pour in a little olive oil if it needs more. Season with salt and pepper and fry for 8 mins or until soft.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nAdd the meat, bay leaves, white wine vinegar and drained beans. Cover with just enough water to cover, about 650ml. Bring to a boil and reduce the heat to a low simmer. Cover and cook for 2 hrs, or until the beans are soft and the meat is tender. If there is too much liquid in the pot take the lid off in the last hr. You can also use a slow cooker on the short method (4 hr) or make a quick version using a pressure cooker in batches for 30 mins each. Another method is to cook it in the oven for 3-4 hrs at 160C/140C fan/gas 3.\r\n\r\nstep 4\r\nServe with rice, a sprinkle of parsley or coriander, hot pepper sauce and orange slices.","z":"步骤1\r\n加热一个带盖的大平底锅，加入培根，煎至酥脆。将油取出并保留在锅中。分批煎排骨、香肠和猪肩肉。用盐和胡椒调味每批。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n把肉取出放在一边。将洋葱、大蒜和辣椒加入锅中。如果需要更多的话，倒入一点橄榄油。用盐和胡椒调味，煎 8 分钟或直至变软。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n加入肉、月桂叶、白葡萄酒醋和沥干的豆子。加入足够的水覆盖，大约650ml。煮沸并把火调至小火慢炖。盖上锅盖煮 2 小时，或直至豆子变软、肉变软。如果锅里的液体太多，请在最后一小时内打开盖子。您还可以使用慢炖锅进行短时间烹饪（4 小时），或者使用压力锅分批制作快速烹饪版本，每次 30 分钟。另一种方法是在烤箱中以 160C/140C 风扇/燃气 3 烘烤 3-4 小时。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n与米饭、撒上欧芹或香菜、辣椒酱和橙片一起食用。"},{"id":"53401","n":"Bolani with Potato Filling","a":"","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/de0sns1779555283.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bvrUPtEs_Uk","i":[["Plain Flour","450g"],["Water","225ml"],["Salt","3 tsp"],["Potatoes","900g"],["Spring Onions","50g"],["Black Pepper","1 tsp"],["Vegetable Oil","For frying"]],"s":"Put the flour and teaspoon of salt in a mixing bowl. Slowly adding as much water as is required. Mix to form a stiff dough.\r\nPlace the dough on a clean work surface and knead for about 5-10 minutes until the dough is elastic, smooth and shiny. Form the dough into a ball, cover with a damp cloth and set aside for at least half an hour.\r\nPeel and wash the potatoes and boil them in salted water until soft. Drain off the water and mash thoroughly. Add the spring onions, salt and black pepper. \r\nDivide the dough into 3 or 4 balls. Roll out each ball as thinly as possible on a lightly floured surface (the thickness should be no more than 1.5mm - if the dough is too thick the Bolani will be tough)\r\nTake a round cutter of 13-15cm (I often use a pan lid or tid lid), and cut as many rounds as possible. On each round spread 1-2 tablespoons of the mashed potato. Moisten the edges of the dough, fold over and seal shut.\r\nThe Bolani should be spread out on a lightly floured surface until ready to fry. Heat enough vegetable oil in a frying-pan and shallow fry one or two Bolani at a time, browning on both sides. \r\nMake sure to keep the fried Bolani warm until all are finished, and serve straight away.","z":"将面粉和茶匙盐放入搅拌碗中。缓慢添加所需量的水。混合形成硬面团。\r\n将面团放在干净的工作台面上，揉捏约 5-10 分钟，直至面团富有弹性、光滑且有光泽。将面团揉成球状，盖上湿布，放置至少半小时。\r\n将土豆去皮并清洗，然后在盐水中煮至变软。沥干水并彻底捣碎。加入葱、盐和黑胡椒。 \r\n将面团分成 3 或 4 个球。在撒了少许面粉的表面上将每个球尽可能擀薄（厚度不应超过 1.5 毫米 - 如果面团太厚，博拉尼会变硬）\r\n取一把13-15厘米的圆刀（我经常用平底锅盖或锅盖），尽可能多地切圆。每轮撒上 1-2 汤匙土豆泥。润湿面团的边缘，折叠并密封。\r\nBolani 应该铺在撒有少许面粉的表面上，直到准备煎炸。在煎锅中加热足够的植物油，一次浅煎一两个博拉尼，两面煎黄。 \r\n确保炸好的 Bolani 保持温暖，直到全部完成，然后立即食用。"},{"id":"53438","n":"Bolita di Keshi","a":"","c":"Miscellaneous","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/skzd0x1780091674.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WovQkxxrUeE","i":[["Cheddar Cheese","1 lb"],["Feta","1 lb"],["Eggs","1 beaten"],["Cornstarch","5 tablespoons"]],"s":"Grate finely and toss together.\r\n1 lb. sharp yellow cheese (cheddar or oude boerenkaas)\r\n1 lb. keshi di buriko (or any white cheese such as fromage blanc, queso blanco, ricotto, feta etc.)\r\n\r\nStir in:\r\n6 eggs, beaten\r\n5 Tbs. Cornstarch\r\n\r\nShape the mixture into small balls. These may be kept indefinitely in the freezer. Drop the balls into deep, hot fat and fry until golden. Serve piping hot on toothpicks.","z":"磨碎并一起搅拌。\r\n1磅尖黄奶酪（切达干酪或oude boerenkaas）\r\n1 磅 keshi di buriko（或任何白奶酪，如 fromage blanc、queso blanco、ricotto、feta 等）\r\n\r\n搅拌：\r\n6 个鸡蛋，打散\r\n5 汤匙。玉米淀粉\r\n\r\n将混合物揉成小球。这些可以无限期地保存在冰箱中。将球放入热油中，煎至金黄色。趁热用牙签享用。"},{"id":"53485","n":"Brazilian carrot cake","a":"","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/h68o161782679437.jpg","y":"","i":[["Vegetable Oil","250ml"],["Plain Flour","260g"],["Caster Sugar","400g"],["Baking Powder","1 tsp"],["Carrots","2 medium"],["Eggs","2"],["Milk","250ml"],["Cocoa Powder","30g"],["Caster Sugar","60g"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat the oven to 180C/160C fan/ gas 4. Oil and line the base of a 20cm springform cake tin. Mix the flour, sugar and baking powder together in a large bowl and set aside. Tip the oil, carrots and eggs in a blender and blitz until smooth. Pour the wet ingredients into the dry, stirring until smooth.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nPour the batter into the cake tin and give it a shake to get rid of air bubbles. Bake for 45 mins to 1 hr, until a clean knife or skewer inserted into the middle comes out clean. If the middle is sticky, put back in the oven for a further 5 mins. Remove from the oven and leave to cool in the tin.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nFor the drizzle, heat the milk, cocoa and sugar in a saucepan over a low heat. Stir until the sugar dissolves (about 5 mins), creating a thick, shiny drizzle.\r\n\r\nstep 4\r\nRemove the cake from the tin and level the top using a serrated knife, then flip so the bottom becomes the top. Pierce all over using a knife or toothpick and put on a wire rack with a tray or large bowl underneath. Pour the drizzle over the cake in batches until it’s all absorbed. You can reuse any drizzle caught in the tray or bowl. Most of the drizzle should be absorbed.","z":"步骤1\r\n将烤箱加热至 180C/160C（风扇/燃气） 4. 在 20 厘米弹簧蛋糕罐底部涂油并铺上衬里。将面粉、糖和泡打粉放入一个大碗中混合，放在一边。将油、胡萝卜和鸡蛋倒入搅拌机中，搅拌至光滑。将湿成分倒入干成分中，搅拌直至光滑。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将面糊倒入蛋糕模中，摇匀以除去气泡。烘烤 45 分钟到 1 小时，直到用干净的刀或叉子插入中间，取出来时是干净的。如果中间发粘，放回烤箱再烤5分钟。从烤箱中取出并在罐中冷却。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n制作毛毛雨时，将牛奶、可可和糖放入平底锅中，用小火加热。搅拌直至糖溶解（约 5 分钟），形成浓密、闪亮的细雨。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n将蛋糕从罐中取出，用锯齿刀将顶部弄平，然后翻转，使底部成为顶部。用刀或牙签将其全部刺穿，然后放在金属架上，下面放一个托盘或大碗。将毛毛雨分批倒在蛋糕上，直至全部吸收。您可以重复使用托盘或碗中的任何毛毛雨。大部分毛毛雨应该被吸收。"},{"id":"53476","n":"Brazilian cheese bread (pão de queijo)","a":"","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/sl7cr91782588539.jpg","y":"","i":[["Oil","Drizzle"],["Whole Milk","250ml"],["Unsalted Butter","125g"],["Salt","1 tsp"],["Tapioca","300g"],["Eggs","2"],["Parmesan","100g"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Oil or butter a baking sheet and set aside.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nHeat the milk, butter and salt in a medium saucepan and bring to a boil. Remove from the heat and add the tapioca flour. Stir vigorously, then leave to cool a little.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nPour the dough into a standing mix to beat the dough until its cool, or use a wooden spoon and beat by hand. Beat the eggs in one at a time, waiting until each is completely incorporated before adding the next. When the dough is glossy and mixed, add the parmesan. Beat again until mixed.\r\n\r\nstep 4\r\nSpoon the dough onto the baking sheet in 1 tbsp balls, 5cm apart. Bake for 30 mins until crisp and golden. Remove from the oven and eat while still warm.","z":"步骤1\r\n将烤箱加热至 220C/200C 风扇/燃气 7. 在烤盘上涂油或黄油并放在一边。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将牛奶、黄油和盐放入中型平底锅中加热，煮沸。从火上移开，加入木薯粉。剧烈搅拌，然后稍微冷却。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n将面团倒入静置混合物中，将面团搅打至冷却，或使用木勺手动搅打。一次打一个鸡蛋，等到每个鸡蛋完全混合后再添加下一个。当面团有光泽并混合时，加入帕尔马干酪。再次搅拌直至混合。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n将面团以 1 汤匙的形式舀到烤盘上，间距 5 厘米。烘烤 30 分钟直至酥脆并呈金黄色。从烤箱中取出，趁热食用。"},{"id":"53475","n":"Brazilian chocolate truffles - brigadeiro","a":"","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/dg7tad1782588053.jpg","y":"","i":[["Unsalted Butter","3  tablespoons"],["Condensed Milk","400g"],["Cocoa Powder","4 tablespoons"],["Vanilla Extract","1 tsp"],["Pistachio","50g"],["Almonds","50g"],["Desiccated Coconut","50g"]],"s":"step 1\r\nIn a medium heavy-based saucepan, heat the butter, condensed milk, a pinch of salt and the cocoa, to boiling, stirring constantly with a wooden spoon. Reduce the heat to medium-low; cook for 10-15 mins, stirring constantly, until the mixture is thick and shiny and starts to pull away from the bottom.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nStir in the vanilla and vigorously mix again. Pour the mixture onto a buttered plate. Chill for at least 2 hrs.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nButter your hands and pinch off some of the dough to make 2.5cm balls. Place your toppings into small bowls and roll the balls of one of the decorations. Place in mini paper baking cups or on a tray lined with non-stick baking paper","z":"步骤1\r\n在一个中等厚底的平底锅中，将黄油、炼乳、少许盐和可可加热至沸腾，并用木勺不断搅拌。将热量降至中低；煮10-15分钟，不断搅拌，直到混合物变稠、有光泽并开始从底部脱离。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n加入香草精，再次剧烈搅拌。将混合物倒入涂有黄油的盘子上。冷却至少 2 小时。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n手上抹黄油，捏掉一些面团，做成2.5厘米的球。将配料放入小碗中，然后滚动其中一种装饰物的球。放入迷你纸烤杯或内衬不粘烤纸的托盘上"},{"id":"53533","n":"Breaded Steak Recipe (Lomo de Res Apanado)","a":"","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/lmwaf61783805434.jpg","y":"","i":[["Beef","2 Lbs"],["Alinos Sauce","1 cup"],["All purpose flour","1 cup"],["Breadcrumbs","2 cups"],["Ground Cumin","1 tsp"],["Eggs","3"],["Salt","To taste"],["Black Pepper","To taste"],["Parsley","2 tablespoons"],["Oil","For frying"]],"s":"Place each piece of steak in between two large pieces of plastic and using a mallet, pound it until it is about ¼″ to ½″ thick. Place the pounded steak in a glass container, add the aliños sauce and let it rest for about 3 hours or overnight in the fridge.\r\nAdd the flour, bread crumbs, spices and parsley to a plate or bowl.\r\nCover the steak on all sides with the flour mixture, then the eggs, and finally the flour mixture again.\r\nOnce the pieces of steak are coated, you can either add them right to a pan with oil for cooking or layer them on parchment paper until ready to fry.\r\n\r\nAdd the oil to a large skillet over medium heat. As soon as it begins to smoke lightly, add the breaded steak and cook it for about 3 to 4 minutes per side or until golden brown. Take them out of the oil and place on a plate lined with paper towels to drain off any excess oil and serve.","z":"将每块牛排放在两块大塑料片之间，然后用木槌敲击，直到其厚度约为 1/4 英寸至 1/2 英寸。将捣碎的牛排放入玻璃容器中，加入 aliños 酱，然后在冰箱中放置约 3 小时或过夜。\r\n将面粉、面包屑、香料和欧芹放入盘子或碗中。\r\n用面粉混合物覆盖牛排的各个侧面，然后是鸡蛋，最后再次覆盖面粉混合物。\r\n一旦牛排片被涂上涂层，您可以将它们直接放入装有油的平底锅中烹饪，也可以将它们放在羊皮纸上直至准备煎炸。\r\n\r\n将油加入大煎锅中，用中火加热。一旦开始轻微冒烟，加入面包屑牛排，每面煎约 3 至 4 分钟或直至呈金黄色。将它们从油中取出，放在衬有纸巾的盘子上，沥干多余的油即可食用。"},{"id":"53562","n":"Breadfruit Tacos","a":"","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/dk70uv1784670127.jpg","y":"","i":[["Breadfruit","1"],["Water","1 pot"],["Codfish Bulljaw","As required"],["Lettuce","As required"],["Oil","For frying"]],"s":"Place a large pot of water to boil, add breadfruit, and let it cook for around 30 minutes\r\nRemove breadfruit from pot and let it cool for a few minutes\r\nHold the breadfruit firmly and using a large sharp knife slice into thin rounds\r\nSlice as many as you need\r\nThen cut off skin and core (You may leave the core on if you like)\r\nGently fold to shape like a taco shell, use two toothpicks to hold it in place.\r\nPlace on a large plate or tray and repeat this process for all breadfruit slices\r\nHeat oil for deep frying, using a pair of tongs submerge breadfruit slices in pan,\r\nYou can guide slices with tongs if you need to\r\nYou can leave the small toothpicks in the taco shells and remove them after they're cooked. Or, you can do like I did. If your'e using larger toothpicks, you may need to remove them safely. Be very careful as you need to adjust it in the hot oil.\r\nRemove when golden brown\r\nSet over tissue paper\r\nRepeat this for the rest of the shells\r\nStuff the shell with your favorite filling. I chose codfish/ salt fish","z":"将一大锅水烧开，加入面包果，煮约30分钟\r\n将面包果从锅中取出，冷却几分钟\r\n牢牢握住面包果，然后用锋利的大刀切成薄圆片\r\n根据需要切片\r\n然后切掉皮和芯（如果你愿意，可以保留芯）\r\n轻轻折叠成墨西哥玉米卷壳的形状，用两根牙签将其固定到位。\r\n放在一个大盘子或托盘上，对所有面包果片重复此过程\r\n热油煎炸，用钳子将面包果片浸入锅中，\r\n如果需要，您可以用钳子引导切片\r\n您可以将小牙签留在炸玉米饼壳中，并在煮熟后将其取出。或者，你也可以像我一样做。如果您使用较大的牙签，则可能需要安全地将其取出。要非常小心，因为您需要在热油中进行调整。\r\n呈金黄色时取出\r\n放在薄纸上\r\n对其余的外壳重复此操作\r\n用你最喜欢的馅料填满外壳。我选择了鳕鱼/咸鱼"},{"id":"53458","n":"Breadfruit in Butter Sauce","a":"","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/6utn1w1782237402.jpg","y":"","i":[["Breadfruit","1/2"],["Onion","1/2"],["Olive Oil","1 tablespoon"],["Butter","125g"],["Onions","3 Medium"],["Garlic","1 tablespoon chopped"],["Tinned Tomatos","500ml"],["Parsley","3  tablespoons"],["Lime juice","1 tablespoon"],["Salt","To taste"],["Pepper","To taste"],["Water","250ml"],["Red Pepper Sauce","To taste"],["Parsley","Garnish"]],"s":"Cut the breadfruit, remove the seeds in the core, and peel. Boil in salted water with a little onion and oil, over high heat until tender and drain.\r\n\r\nMeanwhile, melt the butter in a frying pan and lightly brown the onion rings. Add the garlic, tomatoes, parsley, lime juice, salt, and pepper. Continue to sauté for a couple of minutes. Add the water, bring to the boil and simmer for 5-10 minutes.\r\n\r\nSlice the cooled breadfruit and place it in a serving dish. Pour the butter sauce over the breadfruit.\r\n\r\nGarnish with chopped fresh parsley.\r\n\r\nServes 4","z":"切开面包果，去掉核心的种子，然后去皮。在盐水中加入少许洋葱和油，用大火煮至变软并沥干。\r\n\r\n与此同时，在煎锅中融化黄油，将洋葱圈煎成浅棕色。加入大蒜、西红柿、欧芹、酸橙汁、盐和胡椒。继续炒几分钟。添加水，煮沸并煮5-10分钟。\r\n\r\n将冷却的面包果切片并放入盘中。将黄油酱倒在面包果上。\r\n\r\n用切碎的新鲜欧芹装饰。\r\n\r\n4人份"},{"id":"53454","n":"Breadfruit in Butter Sauce Recipe","a":"","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/z672jx1780263633.jpg","y":"","i":[["Breadfruit","1/2"],["Onion","1/2"],["Olive Oil","1 tablespoon"],["Butter","125g"],["Onion","3"],["Garlic","1 tablespoon"],["Tinned Tomatos","500ml"],["Parsley","3  tablespoons"],["Lime juice","1 tablespoon"],["Salt","To taste"],["Pepper","To taste"],["Water","250ml"],["Red Pepper Paste","To taste"],["Parsley","Garnish"]],"s":"\r\nCaptain William Bligh was chosen to lead an expedition to the South Seas to bring the breadfruit to the Caribbean.\r\n\r\nHis devotion to the breadfruit saplings and neglect of his crew’s water needs lead to the famous “Mutiny on the Bounty” on his first attempt. Cast overboard; Captain Bligh made his way hundreds of miles to safety in an open boat.\r\n\r\nOn his second attempt in 1793, he sailed into Jamaica’s Port Royal Harbour with a ship so crowded with beautiful leafy breadfruit saplings that the Jamaicans rowed out toward “the ship that has bush.”\r\n\r\nToday large, lush breadfruit trees grow throughout the Caribbean, bearing the football-like starchy staple that has kept hunger away from many a door. Breadfruit may be difficult to find outside the Caribbean.\r\n\r\nYou will need the following ingredients:\r\n1/2 medium breadfruit\r\n1/2 small onion\r\n1 tablespoon olive oil\r\n4 oz/125g butter\r\n3 medium onions, cut into rings\r\n1 tablespoon garlic finely chopped\r\n1 medium 16floz/500ml tin whole tomatoes, drained and sliced\r\n1/4 cup or 3 tablespoons parsley, diced\r\n1 tablespoon lime juice\r\nSalt and pepper to taste\r\n1 cup 8oz or 250ml water\r\nRed pepper sauce to taste.\r\nGarnish: fresh parsley, chopped.\r\nInstructions:\r\nCut the breadfruit, remove the seeds in the core, and peel. Boil in salted water with a little onion and oil, over high heat until tender and drain.\r\n\r\nMeanwhile, melt the butter in a frying pan and lightly brown the onion rings. Add the garlic, tomatoes, parsley, lime juice, salt, and pepper. Continue to sauté for a couple of minutes. Add the water, bring to the boil and simmer for 5-10 minutes.\r\n\r\nSlice the cooled breadfruit and place it in a serving dish. Pour the butter sauce over the breadfruit.\r\n\r\nGarnish with chopped fresh parsley.\r\n\r\nServes 4","z":"威廉·布莱船长被选中率领一支远征队前往南海，将面包果带到加勒比海。\r\n\r\n他对面包果树苗的热爱和对船员用水需求的忽视导致了他第一次尝试时著名的“赏金叛变”。落水；布莱船长乘坐一艘敞篷船，航行数百英里到达安全地带。\r\n\r\n1793 年，他第二次尝试，驾驶一艘船驶入牙买加的皇家港港口，船上挤满了美丽的多叶面包果树苗，以至于牙买加人划向“有灌木丛的船”。\r\n\r\n如今，高大茂盛的面包果树遍及加勒比海地区，结出像足球一样的淀粉类主食，让许多人远离饥饿。面包果在加勒比海以外地区可能很难找到。\r\n\r\n您将需要以下成分：\r\n1/2 个中等面包果\r\n1/2 个小洋葱\r\n1汤匙橄榄油\r\n4 盎司/125 克黄油\r\n3 个中等大小的洋葱，切成圈\r\n1汤匙大蒜，切碎\r\n1 个中等大小的 16floz/500ml 罐装完整番茄，沥干并切片\r\n1/4 杯或 3 汤匙欧芹，切丁\r\n1汤匙酸橙汁\r\n盐和胡椒调味\r\n1 杯 8 盎司或 250 毫升水\r\n红辣椒酱调味。\r\n装饰：新鲜欧芹，切碎。\r\n说明：\r\n切开面包果，去掉核心的种子，然后去皮。在盐水中加入少许洋葱和油，用大火煮至变软并沥干。\r\n\r\n与此同时，在煎锅中融化黄油，将洋葱圈煎成浅棕色。加入大蒜、西红柿、欧芹、酸橙汁、盐和胡椒。继续炒几分钟。添加水，煮沸并煮5-10分钟。\r\n\r\n将冷却的面包果切片并放入盘中。将黄油酱倒在面包果上。\r\n\r\n用切碎的新鲜欧芹装饰。\r\n\r\n4人份"},{"id":"53492","n":"Bulgarian Green Salad","a":"","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/6awyvm1782685205.jpg","y":"","i":[["Lettuce","1/2"],["Radish","7"],["Cucumber","1 sliced"],["Scallions","4 Chopped"],["Salt","To taste"],["Apple Cider Vinegar","2 tablespoons"],["Olive Oil","1/8 cup"],["Dill","Garnish"],["Parsley","Garnish"]],"s":"Place sliced lettuce in a large bowl.\r\nAdd radishes, cucumber, and scallions.\r\nDrizzle with vinegar and olive oil.\r\nSeason with salt and gently toss to combine.\r\nTop with sliced hard-boiled eggs, olives, dill and (or) parsley if using and serve immediately.","z":"将切片生菜放入一个大碗中。\r\n加入萝卜、黄瓜和葱。\r\n淋上醋和橄榄油。\r\n加盐调味，轻轻搅拌混合。\r\n如果使用的话，在上面放上切片的煮鸡蛋、橄榄、莳萝和（或）欧芹，并立即食用。"},{"id":"53493","n":"Bulgarian Honey Cookies","a":"","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/y75q5j1782685779.jpg","y":"","i":[["Eggs","2 large"],["Powdered Sugar","1 cup"],["Honey","1/4 cup"],["Vanilla Extract","1 tsp"],["Vegetable Oil","3 Cups"],["All purpose flour","4 cups"],["Salt","1/4 tsp"],["Ground Cinnamon","1 tsp"],["Baking Powder","1 tsp"],["Chocolate Chips","2 cups"],["Vegetable Oil","2 tsp"]],"s":"Preheat oven to 350 F. Line 2-3 baking sheets with parchment paper. \r\nIn a bowl, combine flour, salt, cinnamon and baking soda.\r\nIn the bowl of a stand mixer, fitted with the paddle attachment, beat together eggs and powdered sugar for3 minutes. Add vanilla extract and honey. Mix to combine, then add oil.\r\nAdd the flour mixture in two increments and beat to incorporate. Let the dough rest for 5-10 minutes.\r\nShape 2 tbsp balls, place on baking sheets and press flat. Bake for 12-15 minutes, until golden. Let the cookies cool down completely.\r\nMelt white and semi-sweet chocolate separately with 1 tbsp vegetable oil each.\r\nDip cookies halfway into chocolate. Let it set. Keep in a air tight container or wrapped in cellophane bags for up to 2 weeks in room temperature or refrigerated.","z":"将烤箱预热至 350 F。在 2-3 个烤盘上铺上羊皮纸。 \r\n在一个碗中，将面粉、盐、肉桂和小苏打混合。\r\n在配有桨叶附件的立式搅拌机的碗中，将鸡蛋和糖粉搅拌 3 分钟。加入香草精和蜂蜜。混合均匀，然后加入油。\r\n分两次加入面粉混合物，搅拌均匀。让面团静置 5-10 分钟。\r\n塑造 2 汤匙球状，放在烤盘上并压平。烘烤 12-15 分钟，直至呈金黄色。让饼干完全冷却。\r\n将白巧克力和半甜巧克力分别用 1 汤匙植物油融化。\r\n将饼干浸入巧克力中一半。让它固定。保存在密封容器中或用玻璃纸袋包裹，在室温或冷藏下最多可保存 2 周。"},{"id":"53544","n":"CAFE LA LLAVE ESPRESSO ICE CREAM","a":"","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/9kecho1784575366.jpg","y":"","i":[["Heavy Cream","2 cups"],["Milk","1 cup"],["Salt","1/4 tsp"],["Sugar","1/2 cup"],["Egg Yolks","5"],["Vanilla Extract","1/2 tsp"],["Cafe La Llave","3 shots"]],"s":"A note about the espresso: I like using the fine ground espresso brick and making the coffee in a regular moka pot, but you can certainly also use the Nespresso style capsules if you have that type of espresso maker. FULL DISCLOSURE: I personally prefer the decaf espresso, which the Cafe La Llave brand makes to perfection. The ice cream flavor holds either way.\r\n\r\nIn a medium saucepan, heat the cream, milk, sugar and salt over medium heat; whisking to dissolve the sugar (this should take about 4 to 5 minutes).\r\nIn a separate bowl, whisk the egg yolks.\r\nGradually pour about 1 cup of the hot milk mixture into the egg yolk bowl, while continually whisking. Do this carefully to temper the eggs. (You’re not cooking them.)\r\nAdd the tempered egg yolk mix back into the pan while whisking until it just comes to a simmer.\r\nRemove the pan from the heat, then add the vanilla extract and espresso.\r\n\r\n you can use any ice cream maker. It doesn’t have to be fancy.\r\n\r\nUse between 2 and 4 shots of espresso (regular or decaf) depending on how strong you like the coffee flavor in the ice cream. I think about 3 shots is ideal.\r\nThis recipe will yield about 1 quart of ice cream.\r\n\r\nPlease sit back and enjoy your espresso ice cream. Also, stay cool. You’re welcome","z":"关于浓缩咖啡的说明：我喜欢使用细磨的浓缩咖啡砖并在普通的摩卡壶中煮咖啡，但如果您有这种类型的浓缩咖啡机，您当然也可以使用 Nespresso 式胶囊。全面披露：我个人更喜欢无咖啡因浓缩咖啡，Cafe La Llave 品牌制作的咖啡堪称完美。无论哪种方式，冰淇淋的味道都一样。\r\n\r\n在中型平底锅中，用中火加热奶油、牛奶、糖和盐；搅拌使糖溶解（这大约需要 4 到 5 分钟）。\r\n在另一个碗中，搅拌蛋黄。\r\n将约 1 杯热牛奶混合物逐渐倒入蛋黄碗中，同时不断搅拌。小心地这样做以调和鸡蛋。 （你没有煮它们。）\r\n将调温后的蛋黄混合物放回锅中，同时搅拌，直至沸腾。\r\n将锅从火上移开，然后加入香草精和浓缩咖啡。\r\n\r\n 您可以使用任何冰淇淋机。它不必很花哨。\r\n\r\n根据您喜欢冰淇淋中咖啡味的浓度，使用 2 到 4 杯浓缩咖啡（普通咖啡或无咖啡因咖啡）。我认为3次射击是最理想的。\r\n此配方可制作约 1 夸脱的冰淇淋。\r\n\r\n请坐下来享受您的浓缩咖啡冰淇淋。另外，保持冷静。不客气"},{"id":"53488","n":"Cabbage with Ground Beef","a":"","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/brmxra1782681940.jpg","y":"","i":[["Olive Oil","2 tablespoons"],["Ground Beef","1 lb"],["Onion","1 small"],["Carrots","2 medium"],["Red Pepper","1 medium"],["Tomato Puree","1 tablespoon"],["Garlic","2 cloves"],["Salt","1/2 tbs"],["Black Pepper","1/2 tbs"],["Smoked Paprika","1 tsp"],["Ground Cumin","1/4 tsp"],["Cabbage","1/2"],["Apple Cider Vinegar","1 tsp"],["Water","1 cup"],["Parsley","2 tbs chopped"]],"s":"Heat a large skillet or braiser over medium heat on the stovetop. Add the olive oil.\r\nA braiser with cooked ground beef \r\nCook the Meat:\r\nAdd the ground meat to the pan. Use a potato masher or wooden spoon to break it into small pieces. Cook for 3–4 minutes until browned.\r\nAdd Vegetables and Seasoning:\r\nStir in the onion, carrots, red pepper, garlic, and tomato paste. Season with salt, black pepper, smoked paprika, ground cumin, and Italian seasoning (if using). Cook for 2–3 minutes, stirring frequently.\r\nA braiser with cooked ground beef, carrots, onions, peppers, garlic and seasoning. \r\n\r\nAdd Cabbage and Liquid:\r\nAdd the chopped cabbage, apple cider vinegar or lemon juice (if using), and water. Stir well to combine. Reduce the heat to medium-low, cover, and cook for 30 minutes. Stir occasionally to prevent the cabbage from sticking to the bottom of the pan.\r\nA pot with cooked ground beef, vegetables and cabbage on a stove top \r\nCheck for Doneness:\r\nUncover and check the texture of the cabbage. If necessary, increase the heat to medium-high and cook for an additional 5–7 minutes to evaporate excess liquid and finish cooking.\r\nA braiser with cooked ground meat and cabbage dish on a stove top \r\nGarnish and Serve:\r\nSprinkle with chopped parsley or fresh herbs before serving.","z":"在炉灶上用中火加热大煎锅或炖锅。添加橄榄油。\r\n炖锅配煮熟的碎牛肉 \r\n煮肉：\r\n将碎肉加入锅中。用土豆捣碎器或木勺将其切成小块。煮 3-4 分钟直至变成棕色。\r\n添加蔬菜和调味料：\r\n加入洋葱、胡萝卜、红辣椒、大蒜和番茄酱。用盐、黑胡椒、烟熏辣椒粉、孜然粉和意大利调味料（如果使用）调味。煮 2-3 分钟，经常搅拌。\r\n用煮熟的碎牛肉、胡萝卜、洋葱、辣椒、大蒜和调味料炖锅。 \r\n\r\n添加卷心菜和液体：\r\n加入切碎的卷心菜、苹果醋或柠檬汁（如果使用）和水。搅拌均匀。将火调至中低，盖上锅盖，煮 30 分钟。偶尔搅拌一下，防止卷心菜粘在锅底。\r\n炉顶上放着煮熟的碎牛肉、蔬菜和卷心菜的锅 \r\n检查熟度：\r\n揭开并检查卷心菜的质地。如有必要，将火调至中火，再煮 5-7 分钟，以蒸发多余的液体并完成烹饪。\r\n炉顶上放有煮熟的碎肉和卷心菜的炖锅 \r\n装饰和食用：\r\n食用前撒上切碎的欧芹或新鲜香草。"},{"id":"53428","n":"Camaro Grelhado Com Molho Cru (Grilled Prawns with Green Onion Sauce)","a":"","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/jg4r991779916649.jpg","y":"","i":[["Prawns","1 lb"],["Garlic","2 cloves minced"],["Spring Onions","1/2 cup"],["Ground Cumin","1 tsp"],["Salt","1/4 tsp"],["White Vinegar","4 tablespoons"],["Water","4 tablespoons"]],"s":"Make the sauce by combining all the ingredients and grinding them into a paste.\r\nPut the prawns on the skewers and brush with sauce.\r\nGrill until done (they should lose their translucent color), about 3-4 minutes on each side.\r\nServe with extra sauce on the side.","z":"将所有成分混合并研磨成糊状，制成酱汁。\r\n将虾串在串上，刷上酱汁。\r\n烤至熟（它们应该失去半透明的颜色），每面约 3-4 分钟。\r\n与额外的酱汁一起食用。"},{"id":"53418","n":"Cambodian Stir-fried Morning Glory with Pork, Fermented Soybeans, and Garlic","a":"","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/wympxc1779734808.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_LsP1TP4P9Q","i":[["Morning Glory","1  bunch"],["Minced Pork","150g"],["Soya Bean","2 tablespoons"],["Garlic","4 Cloves Chopped"],["Oil","For frying"],["Fish Sauce","Dash"],["Sugar","Dash"],["Chilli","Sprinkling"]],"s":"In a wok or large pan, heat 1 tablespoon of vegetable oil over medium heat. Once the oil is hot, add the garlic and stir-fry for about 30 seconds, until fragrant but not burnt.\r\nAdd the minced pork to the pan and break it up with a spatula. Stir-fry until the pork is fully cooked and browned, about 2-3 minutes.\r\nStir in the fermented soy beans and cook for another minute, mixing it thoroughly with the pork.\r\nToss in the cut morning glory and stir-fry for 2-3 minutes to retain its bright green colour and crisp texture.\r\nCheck the seasoning and adjust with fish sauce or sugar if needed. Transfer to a serving dish and serve immediately with steamed rice.","z":"在炒锅或大平底锅中，用中火加热 1 汤匙植物油。油热后，加入大蒜，炒约30秒，直至散发出香味但不要烧焦。\r\n将切碎的猪肉放入锅中，用抹刀将其打碎。炒至猪肉完全煮熟并变成褐色，大约2-3分钟。\r\n加入发酵黄豆，再煮一分钟，与猪肉充分混合。\r\n加入切好的牵牛花，炒2-3分钟，以保留其鲜绿色和酥脆的质地。\r\n检查调味料，如果需要，用鱼露或糖进行调整。转移到盘子中，立即与米饭一起食用。"},{"id":"53420","n":"Cambodian Waffles (Num Poum)","a":"","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/h7zrys1779736460.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QAVOTHkYXLc","i":[["Rice Flour","1/2 cup"],["Wheat Flour","1/2 cup"],["Coconut Milk","1/2 cup"],["Palm Sugar","3/4 cup"],["Eggs","2"],["Salt","1/2 tsp"]],"s":"In a bowl, mix the flour, coconut milk, palm sugar and eggs and salt. Brush a waffle iron with oil pour in the batter and cook over an open fire until light brown and crispy.","z":"在一个碗中，混合面粉、椰奶、棕榈糖、鸡蛋和盐。在华夫饼熨斗上刷上油，倒入面糊，在明火上煮至浅棕色酥脆。"},{"id":"53576","n":"Carrot and Bean Fritters","a":"","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/xjii2g1784836867.jpg","y":"","i":[["Carrots","400g"],["Canned Beans","200g"],["Garlic","4 cloves"],["Flour","1 tablespoon"],["Breadcrumbs","1 cup"],["Thyme","Pinch"],["Parsley","Pinch"],["Salt","Pinch"],["Pepper","Pinch"],["Thyme","Pinch"],["Oil","Splash"]],"s":"Pour the beans into the sieve, remove liquid.\r\nGrate carrots and add beans, Mix and mash together. Season with garlic, thyme, salt and pepper.\r\nForm the dough into round buns, dip them slightly into the bread crumbs, and press the fritters.\r\nFry fritters in hot oil for a short time until the fritters are browned.  Place on the greased or /baking paper-lined oven plate and bake at 200C for 10 minutes.","z":"将豆子倒入筛子中，除去液体。\r\n将胡萝卜磨碎，加入豆子，混合并捣碎。用大蒜、百里香、盐和胡椒调味。\r\n将面团擀成圆饼，稍微沾上面包糠，压上油条。\r\n将油条放入热油中煎一会儿，直至油条变成褐色。  放在已涂油或铺有烘焙纸的烤盘上，以 200°C 烘烤 10 分钟。"},{"id":"53508","n":"Cassava Cake","a":"","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/2mrghf1782773422.jpg","y":"","i":[["Cassava","2 Lbs"],["Dark Brown Soft Sugar","1 lb"],["Coconut Milk","1 can"],["Nutmeg","1/4"],["Allspice","1/2 tsp"],["Cinnamon","1/2 tsp"]],"s":"Bring coconut milk to a boil. Add sugar, stirring until completely dissolved and continue to boil for about 45 minutes. Reserve ½ cup of the coconut milk/sugar mixture for later. Combine remaining ingredients in a large mixing bowl, stir until well blended. Add hot coconut milk mixture and stir well. Mixture should be of a thick liquid texture. Use 1 tablespoons of coconut milk mixture to grease baking pan. Pour batter into prepared baking pan and bake at 350°F (basting occasionally with reserved coconut milk mixture) for 2 to 3 hours or until knife inserted in centre comes out clean. Spread any remaining coconut milk mixture over top of cake. Place cake on top of stove to cool completely.","z":"将椰奶煮沸。加入糖，搅拌直至完全溶解，继续煮约45分钟。保留 ½ 杯椰奶/糖混合物供以后使用。将剩余成分放入一个大搅拌碗中，搅拌直至充分混合。加入热椰奶混合物并搅拌均匀。混合物应该是粘稠的液体质地。使用 1 汤匙椰奶混合物在烤盘上涂抹油脂。将面糊倒入准备好的烤盘中，在 350°F 的温度下烘烤（偶尔涂上保留的椰奶混合物）2 至 3 小时，或者直到插入中心的刀取出时是干净的。将剩余的椰奶混合物涂在蛋糕上。将蛋糕放在炉子上完全冷却。"},{"id":"53564","n":"Cassava bread","a":"","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/fnfnhi1784671116.jpg","y":"","i":[["Farine","3 Cups"],["Water","3 Cups"],["Cassava Flour","1 cup"],["Salt","Pinch"]],"s":"Mix dry ingredients in a bowl\r\nAdd water and mix well\r\nWhen mixture has achieved a doughy like consistency, roll into little balls\r\nRoll balls with the palm of your hands, and flatten slightly like s disk\r\nIn a plate, cover balls with the rest of the farine to create a very course texture\r\nPlace on a hot heavy cast iron griddle pressing down to flatten with and roast on both sides until lightly brown\r\nRemove and serve or add your special accompaniment","z":"将干成分放入碗中混合\r\n加水并搅拌均匀\r\n当混合物达到面团般的稠度时，滚成小球\r\n用手掌搓成球状，像s盘一样稍微压扁\r\n在盘子里，用剩余的粉覆盖球，以创造出非常粗糙的质感\r\n放在热的厚铸铁煎锅上，向下压平，然后将两面烤至浅棕色\r\n移除并上菜或添加您的特殊伴奏"},{"id":"53507","n":"Cayman Style Potato Salad","a":"","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/q21suk1782772956.jpg","y":"","i":[["Potatoes","10"],["Green Pepper","1/2"],["Red Pepper","1/4"],["Onion","1/2"],["Mayonnaise","1 cup"],["Mustard","1/4 cup"],["Sugar","1 tablespoon"],["Black Pepper","1/4 tsp"],["Beets","1 Can"],["Peas","1 Can"],["Eggs","3"]],"s":"Peel and cut potatoes in cubes, boil in salted water until tender. Chop peppers and onion and set aside. Mix together mayonnaise, mustard, sugar and black pepper and set aside. Drain potatoes once tender and place in large mixing bowl. Add remaining ingredients and mix well. The salad may be served warm, but is normally served after it has been refrigerated for 2 to 3 hours.","z":"土豆去皮切块，在盐水中煮至变软。将辣椒和洋葱切碎，放在一边。将蛋黄酱、芥末、糖和黑胡椒混合在一起，备用。土豆变软后沥干水分，放入大搅拌碗中。添加剩余成分并搅拌均匀。沙拉可以趁热食用，但通常在冷藏 2 至 3 小时后食用。"},{"id":"53510","n":"Cayman-Style Lobster","a":"","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/wkhwqr1782774765.jpg","y":"","i":[["Lobster","6"],["Chicken Stock","1/2 cup"],["Red Pepper","1/2 cup"],["Green Pepper","1/2 cup"],["Onion","1/2 cup"],["Garlic","2 cloves minced"],["Scotch Bonnet","1/2"],["Salt","To taste"],["Pepper","To taste"],["Thyme","To taste"],["Cornstarch","2 tsp"],["Olive Oil","2 tablespoons"]],"s":"Rinse lobster under cold running water. Bring water and salt to boil in a 12 quart pot. Quickly plunge lobsters, headfirst, into boiling water. Cover and boil for 20 minutes or until lobsters turn red.\r\n\r\nRemove lobster and allow it to cool. Remove lobster tails and cut shell down to middle to remove the meat. Cut the tail meat down the middle to remove the vein inside. Remove large claws and smaller legs by twisting them away from the body. A nut cracker can be used to crush the claw and legs to remove the meat inside.\r\n\r\nChop lobster meat. Heat butter or olive oil in large pan over low heat. Sauté red, green and scotch bonnet peppers, thyme and garlic. Add salt and chicken stock to pan. Then, add lobster meat and sauté for 10 to 15 minutes. Thicken sauce with the corn starch and water mixture.\r\n\r\nServe with your choice of vegetables, salad and/or rice.","z":"用冷水冲洗龙虾。将水和盐放入 12 夸脱的锅中煮沸。将龙虾头朝下快速放入沸水中。盖上锅盖煮 20 分钟或直至龙虾变红。\r\n\r\n取出龙虾并让它冷却。取出龙虾尾，将壳从中间切开，取出肉。将尾肉从中间切开，去掉里面的静脉。将大爪子和小腿从身体上扭转下来，将其移除。可以用坚果钳压碎爪子和腿，取出里面的肉。\r\n\r\n将龙虾肉切碎。在大平底锅中用小火加热黄油或橄榄油。炒红、绿、苏格兰帽辣椒、百里香和大蒜。将盐和鸡汤加入锅中。然后加入龙虾肉炒10至15分钟。用玉米淀粉和水的混合物使酱汁变稠。\r\n\r\n搭配您选择的蔬菜、沙拉和/或米饭。"},{"id":"53442","n":"Cheese Sticks","a":"","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/7i6csk1780094394.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/_RC2m-VGdP0","i":[["Flour","1 cup"],["Milk","1/2 cup"],["Butter","Knob"],["Egg","1"],["Mozzarella","1 kg"],["Sugar","1 tsp"],["Salt","1 tsp"],["Olive Oil","1 tsp"],["Oil","For frying"]],"s":"Cut the cheese and long strips and place in your fridge to prevent it becoming soft. Mix flour, butter and egg in a bowl, and add sugar, salt and olive oil to taste into the mix. Then gradually add milk and knead well for a suitable consistency.\r\n\r\nStretch out the dough with a rolling pin and cut into long strips (2 to 3 cm) and then roll the strips of dough around the cheese strips forming a spiral. Make sure the dough covers the cheese fully so that it doesn't melt out while frying. Roll the cheese & dough strips through flour to prevent them from sticking while frying. Heat oil in a frying pan until hot before placing the cheese sticks, and fry until golden in color.","z":"将奶酪切成长条并放入冰箱中以防止变软。将面粉、黄油和鸡蛋放入碗中混合，然后加入糖、盐和橄榄油调味。然后逐渐加入牛奶并充分揉捏至合适的稠度。\r\n\r\n用擀面杖将面团擀开，切成长条（2至3厘米），然后将面团条绕着奶酪条卷成螺旋状。确保面团完全覆盖奶酪，以免煎炸时奶酪融化。将奶酪和面团条在面粉中滚动，以防止它们在煎炸时粘在一起。在煎锅中将油烧热，然后放入奶酪棒，炸至金黄色。"},{"id":"53455","n":"Chicken Liver Pate Recipe","a":"","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/hob03q1780264260.jpg","y":"","i":[["Chicken Liver","1lb"],["Bacon","1/2 lb"],["Garlic","1 clove"],["Onion","1 large"],["Ground Mustard","2 tsp"],["Salt","To taste"],["Pepper","To taste"],["Milk","Splash"],["Sherry","1 tablespoon"]],"s":"Clean livers of sinews and gall.\r\nPut into a fireproof casserole with all other ingredients roughly chopped.\r\nSeason and cover with milk.\r\nPut the lid on the casserole and cook in a slow oven (300ºF) for 2 hours.\r\nLiquidize in a blender.\r\nAdjust seasoning.\r\nAdd sherry or brandy.\r\nPut in a dish and cover with melted butte","z":"清洁肝脏的筋和胆。\r\n将所有其他材料放入防火砂锅中，将其大致切碎。\r\n调味并盖上牛奶。\r\n盖上砂锅盖，在慢速烤箱 (300°F) 中煮 2 小时。\r\n在搅拌机中液化。\r\n调整调味料。\r\n添加雪利酒或白兰地。\r\n放入盘中，盖上融化的黄油"},{"id":"53565","n":"Chicken Lollipop","a":"","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/nz0lg71784671684.jpg","y":"","i":[["Chicken Wings","2 Lbs"],["Black Pepper","1 tablespoon"],["Paprika","1 tablespoon"],["Garlic","1 tablespoon"],["Salt","1 tablespoon"],["Cornstarch","4 tablespoons"]],"s":"Wash chicken with lemon\r\nDrain and season chicken\r\nUsing shears, cut through the meat at the tip of the drumettes\r\nAdd all seasoning ingredients to the drumettes\r\nPour oil into a deep fryer, or saucepan to the level of about 5 inches so that the chicken will be submerged\r\nFry until medium brown, add your favorite sauce (I used honey garlic barbecue sauce) to place in the oven\r\nOr fry until golden brown if you're not putting it in the oven\r\nUsing a silicon brush add sauce to chicken and place in the oven","z":"鸡肉用柠檬洗干净\r\n沥干鸡肉并调味\r\n使用剪刀，剪断小腿尖端的肉\r\n将所有调味料加入鸡腿中\r\n将油倒入油炸锅或平底锅中，油位约 5 英寸，淹没鸡肉\r\n煎至中棕色，加入你最喜欢的酱汁（我用的是蜂蜜大蒜烧烤酱）放入烤箱\r\n或者如果你不把它放进烤箱的话，煎至金黄色\r\n用硅刷将酱汁涂在鸡肉上，然后放入烤箱"},{"id":"53549","n":"Chicken Salad With Mushrooms and Bacon","a":"","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/t5rgav1784659936.jpg","y":"","i":[["Chicken Breast","300g"],["Shallots","1"],["Mayonnaise","3  tablespoons"],["Creme Fraiche","4 tablespoons"],["Dijon Mustard","3 tsp"],["Apple Cider Vinegar","1 tablespoon"],["Bacon","100g"],["Mushrooms","250g"],["Parsley","Sprigs of fresh"],["Salt","To taste"],["Pepper","To taste"]],"s":"Place chicken breast in a saucepan and cover with water. Bring to a boil, add 1 tsp salt and simmer for approximately 15 minutes. Allow chicken to cool and then shred meat with two forks.\r\nFinely chop shallot/red onion.\r\nStir mayonnaise, crème fraîche, Dijon mustard and apple cider vinegar to combine. Season with salt, pepper and extra Dijon mustard to taste. Combine with onion and chicken.\r\nFry bacon until crisp and transfer to plate lined with paper towels.\r\nRinse mushrooms, slice and fry in the same pan as bacon until golden (approximately 5 minutes). Season with a bit of salt and pepper.\r\nArrange your chicken salad in a serving dish, topped with crisp bacon, mushrooms and chopped parsley. Serve on a slice of light or dark bread.","z":"将鸡胸肉放入锅中，加水盖过鸡胸肉。煮沸，加入1茶匙盐，煮约15分钟。让鸡肉冷却，然后用两把叉子将肉切碎。\r\n将葱/红洋葱切碎。\r\n将蛋黄酱、法式鲜奶油、第戎芥末和苹果醋搅拌均匀。用盐、胡椒和额外的第戎芥末调味。与洋葱和鸡肉混合。\r\n将培根煎至酥脆，然后转移到衬有纸巾的盘子上。\r\n冲洗蘑菇，切片并在与培根相同的平底锅中煎至金黄色（约 5 分钟）。加一点盐和胡椒调味。\r\n将鸡肉沙拉放入盘中，上面放上脆培根、蘑菇和切碎的欧芹。搭配一片浅色或深色面包。"},{"id":"53459","n":"Chicken and Potato Roti","a":"","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/mp9z0i1782238092.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2ehdHb1rcAQ","i":[["Flour","1 lb"],["Shortening","3  tablespoons"],["Salt","Pinch"],["Water","Splash"],["Chicken Breast","6"],["Parsley","Pinch"],["Thyme","Pinch"],["Jerk","Pinch"],["Salt","Pinch"],["Sugar","Pinch"],["Black Pepper","Pinch"],["Onion","2 large"],["Garlic","4 cloves"],["Scotch Bonnet","1"],["Potatoes","1/2 lb"]],"s":"Add a pint of chicken stock to the simmer and put three tablespoons of sugar into a large saucepan on high; cook until the sugar caramelizes, then add the cubed chicken breasts and stir until the chicken browns.\r\nAdd chopped onions, garlic, parsley, thyme, jerk seasoning, salt, and the whole scotch bonnet pepper – do not cut up the pepper! Reduce the heat to low and let this simmer for 25 minutes.\r\nIn a large mixing bowl, sift the flour, and add a pinch of salt to taste.\r\nNow add the first tablespoon of shortening, and with your fingers, rub the flour into the shortening until it forms a breadcrumb-like consistency.\r\nThen add the second tablespoon of shortening and rub against the flour until it looks like breadcrumbs.\r\nNow add the third tablespoon of shortening and repeat the process.\r\nYou should by now have used all the flour. Your bowl should be all breadcrumb-like; if you still have fresh flour, use another tablespoon of shortening until your fresh flour is all used up.\r\nAdd a small amount of water and mix with a butter knife; keep adding small amounts until your mixture forms a soft dough.\r\nNow dust your surface with flour and roll out your pastry; you want to roll wafer-thin rounds – this mixture should make at least 12 roti skins.\r\nCover with a tea towel while returning to the pot.\r\nNow peel the potatoes and cube them into small bite-size pieces.\r\nAfter 25 minutes of simmering, add 1/2 pint of water and the potatoes to the pool.\r\nNow cover and cook for 30 minutes on low heat.\r\nTurn a flat baking tray upside down, lightly cover with foil, and place on the stovetop on high; cook each roti skin for 1 minute on each side until brown but not crisp.\r\nNow pile up your cooked roti skins, remove the pot after 30 minutes, and remove the whole scotch bonnet.\r\nTake the entire pot to the table with a pile of plates; each person assumes the roti skin, lays it flat on the scale, spoons some filling into the middle of the roti skin, and folds around the filling eats enjoy.","z":"加入一品脱鸡汤，将三汤匙糖放入大平底锅中，大火煮沸；煮至糖焦糖化，然后加入切块的鸡胸肉，搅拌直至鸡肉变成棕色。\r\n加入切碎的洋葱、大蒜、欧芹、百里香、肉干调味料、盐和整个苏格兰帽胡椒——不要切碎胡椒！把火调小，煮 25 分钟。\r\n在一个大搅拌碗中，筛入面粉，加入少许盐调味。\r\n现在加入第一汤匙起酥油，然后用手指将面粉揉入起酥油中，直至形成面包屑状的稠度。\r\n然后加入第二汤匙起酥油，并在面粉上摩擦，直到看起来像面包屑。\r\n现在添加第三汤匙起酥油并重复该过程。\r\n你现在应该已经用完所有的面粉了。你的碗应该像面包屑一样；如果你还有新鲜面粉，请再用一汤匙起酥油，直到新鲜面粉用完。\r\n加入少量水，用黄油刀搅拌均匀；继续少量添加，直到混合物形成柔软的面团。\r\n现在在表面撒上面粉，然后擀开糕点；如果你想卷成薄薄的圆片——这种混合物至少可以制作 12 块烤肉皮。\r\n返回锅中时盖上茶巾。\r\n现在将土豆削皮并切成小块。\r\n煮 25 分钟后，向池中加入 1/2 品脱水和土豆。\r\n现在盖上盖子，小火煮 30 分钟。\r\n将平坦的烤盘翻转过来，轻轻地盖上箔纸，然后放在炉灶上；将每个烤肉皮每面煮 1 分钟，直至变成棕色但不脆。\r\n现在将煮熟的罗蒂皮堆起来，30 分钟后取出锅，然后取下整个苏格兰帽子。\r\n把整个锅和一堆盘子一起端到桌子上；每个人拿起烤饼皮，将其平放在秤上，用勺子舀一些馅料到烤饼皮的中间，然后将馅料折叠起来即可享用。"},{"id":"53531","n":"Chicken in Orange Sauce Recipe (Pollo a la Naranja)","a":"","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/uuns781783804024.jpg","y":"","i":[["Chicken Legs","4"],["Olive Oil","2 tablespoons"],["Butter","2 tablespoons"],["Onion","1/2 cup"],["Red Pepper","1"],["Garlic","3 cloves Chopped"],["Salt","1 tsp"],["Black Pepper","1/2 tsp"],["Chicken Stock","1 cup"],["Orange Juice","1/2 cup"],["Brown Sugar","3  tablespoons"],["Cilantro","1/4 cup"]],"s":"Place the olive oil and butter in a large sauce pan over medium heat. Add the chopped onions, red bell pepper and garlic. Cook for about 3 minutes, stirring often until the vegetables are soft.\r\nAdd the chicken legs and season with salt and pepper. Cook for about 1 minute on each side.\r\n\r\nAdd the chicken broth, orange juice and cook for about 2 minutes scraping the bottom of the pan with a wooden spoon. Add the brown sugar and cover the pot. Reduce the heat to medium and cook for about 45 minutes or until chicken is cooked.\r\nSpoon the sauce over the chicken and serve over white rice. Garnish with fresh cilantro.","z":"将橄榄油和黄油放入大平底锅中，中火加热。加入切碎的洋葱、红甜椒和大蒜。煮约 3 分钟，经常搅拌直至蔬菜变软。\r\n加入鸡腿，用盐和胡椒调味。每面煮约 1 分钟。\r\n\r\n加入鸡汤、橙汁，煮约2分钟，用木勺刮去锅底。加入红糖，盖上锅盖。将火调至中火，煮约 45 分钟或直至鸡肉煮熟。\r\n将酱汁浇在鸡肉上，然后浇在白米饭上。用新鲜香菜装饰。"},{"id":"53516","n":"Chilean Dobladitas","a":"","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/p6hgrj1782851874.jpg","y":"","i":[["All purpose flour","4 cups"],["Melted Butter","1 cup"],["Milk","1/2 cup"],["Baking Powder","2 tsp"],["Salt","1 tsp"],["Melted Butter","3  tablespoons"]],"s":"Preheat the oven to 450 degrees F (230 degrees C). Grease a baking sheet.\r\n\r\nWhisk flour, 1 cup melted butter, milk, baking powder, and salt together in a bowl until begins to pull together. Turn dough out onto a lightly floured surface; knead until smooth and elastic.\r\n\r\nRoll dough out to ⅛-inch thickness; cut into 8-inch circles. Brush circles with remaining 3 tablespoons melted butter. Fold each circle in half, then fold in half again to form triangles. Press firmly to seal the layers; place on the prepared baking sheet.\r\n\r\nBake in the preheated oven until golden brown, about 15 minutes. Serve warm","z":"将烤箱预热至 450 华氏度（230 摄氏度）。在烤盘上涂油脂。\r\n\r\n将面粉、1 杯融化的黄油、牛奶、泡打粉和盐放入碗中，搅拌直至开始混合。将面团放在撒了少许面粉的表面上；揉至光滑有弹性。\r\n\r\n将面团擀成⅛英寸厚；切成8英寸的圆形。在圆圈上刷上剩余的 3 汤匙融化的黄油。将每个圆圈对折，然后再次对折以形成三角形。用力按压以密封各层；放在准备好的烤盘上。\r\n\r\n在预热的烤箱中烘烤约15分钟至金黄色。趁热食用"},{"id":"53514","n":"Chilean Empanada","a":"","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/q4xgij1782851193.jpg","y":"","i":[["Butter","1 tablespoon"],["Onion","1 large"],["Garlic","1 tsp minced"],["Dried Oregano","1 tsp"],["Cumin","1 tsp"],["Salt","1/2 tsp"],["Black Pepper","1/2 tsp"],["Ground Pork","1 lb"],["Raisins","1 cup"],["Black Olives","1 cup"],["Eggs","3 Large"],["Water","1 cup"],["Shortening","1 cup"],["All purpose flour","5 Cups"],["Salt","2 tsp"],["Eggs","2 Beaten"]],"s":"Make the filling: Melt butter in a large skillet over medium heat. Add onion, garlic, oregano, cumin, salt, and pepper; cook and stir until onion is golden brown, 5 to 7 minutes. Add pork and cook until completely browned and crumbly, 7 to 10 minutes more. Drain fat from the skillet. Stir in raisins, olives, and hard-cooked eggs.\r\n\r\nWhisk water and cornstarch together in a small bowl; pour into the skillet and stir until liquid thickens. Remove from the heat and set aside.\r\n\r\nMake the dough: Whisk milk and melted shortening together in a bowl until evenly blended. Stir flour and salt together in a separate large bowl. Pour milk mixture into flour mixture; whisk until well combined and a dough forms. Let rest for 10 minutes.\r\n\r\nPreheat the oven to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C). Line a baking sheet with parchment paper.\r\n\r\nRoll dough on a lightly floured surface to a thickness of 1/8 inch. Cut into 12 circles with a round cookie cutter or glass. Spoon filling into the center of each circle. Fold each circle in half and press the edges with a fork to seal. Brush the tops with beaten egg. Place empanadas onto the prepared baking sheet.\r\n\r\nBake in the preheated oven until golden brown, about 25 minutes.","z":"制作馅料：在大煎锅中用中火融化黄油。加入洋葱、大蒜、牛至、小茴香、盐和胡椒；煮5到7分钟，搅拌直至洋葱呈金黄色。加入猪肉，再煮 7 至 10 分钟，直至完全变成棕色且易碎。从煎锅中沥干脂肪。加入葡萄干、橄榄和煮熟的鸡蛋。\r\n\r\n将水和玉米淀粉放入小碗中搅拌；倒入煎锅中，搅拌直至液体变稠。从火上移开并放在一边。\r\n\r\n制作面团：将牛奶和融化的起酥油放入碗中搅拌直至均匀混合。在另一个大碗中将面粉和盐搅拌在一起。将牛奶混合物倒入面粉混合物中；搅拌直至充分混合并形成面团。休息 10 分钟。\r\n\r\n将烤箱预热至 400 华氏度（200 摄氏度）。在烤盘上铺上羊皮纸。\r\n\r\n在撒了少许面粉的表面上将面团擀成 1/8 英寸的厚度。用圆形饼干切刀或玻璃杯切成 12 个圆圈。用勺子将馅料填入每个圆圈的中心。将每个圆圈对折，然后用叉子按压边缘以密封。在顶部刷上打好的鸡蛋。将肉馅卷饼放在准备好的烤盘上。\r\n\r\n在预热好的烤箱中烘烤约25分钟至金黄色。"},{"id":"53513","n":"Chilean-Style Sopaipillas","a":"","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/45noa31782850540.jpg","y":"","i":[["Zapallo Squash","9 oz"],["All purpose flour","5 Cups"],["Baking Powder","1 tsp"],["Salt","1 tsp"],["Melted Butter","10 tblsp"],["Canola Oil","2 cups"]],"s":"Peel, seed, and cut zapallo into chunks. Place in a saucepan, cover with water, and bring to a boil over medium-high heat. Cook until zapallo is soft and easily pierced with a fork, 15 to 20 minutes. Drain and allow to cool slightly.\r\n\r\nMix flour, baking soda, and salt together in a mixing bowl, and set aside. Stir together squash and melted butter. Stir the flour mixture into the butter mixture until blended. Turn the dough out onto a lightly floured surface and knead until soft and satiny, adding a little more flour if necessary. Cover dough with a towel and allow to rest 15 minutes.\r\n\r\nRoll out the dough to 1/8-inch thick, and cut into 3-inch diameter circles. Poke each circle a few times with a fork to make holes and prevent rising.\r\n\r\nPour oil into a large, deep skillet and heat over medium-high heat until hot, 385 degrees F (195 degrees C). Place several of the dough circles into hot oil; cook until lightly browned, 3 to 4 minutes. Drain on paper towels. Cook remainder of dough circles in batches.","z":"萨帕洛去皮、去籽，然后切成块。放入锅中，加水盖住，用中高火煮沸。煮 15 到 20 分钟，直到 zapallo 变软并且可以用叉子轻松刺穿。沥干并稍微冷却。\r\n\r\n将面粉、小苏打和盐放入搅拌碗中混合，放在一边。将南瓜和融化的黄油搅拌在一起。将面粉混合物搅拌到黄油混合物中直至混合。将面团放在撒有少许面粉的表面上，揉捏至柔软光滑，必要时再加一点面粉。用毛巾盖住面团，静置 15 分钟。\r\n\r\n将面团擀成 1/8 英寸厚，然后切成直径 3 英寸的圆形。用叉子在每个圆圈上戳几次，以打孔并防止升起。\r\n\r\n将油倒入一个大而深的煎锅中，用中高火加热直至热至 385 华氏度（195 摄氏度）。将几个面团圈放入热油中；煮 3 至 4 分钟，直至呈浅棕色。用纸巾沥干水分。分批烹制剩余的面团圈。"},{"id":"53542","n":"Chorreadas","a":"","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/f9u0lk1784397769.jpg","y":"","i":[["Sweetcorn","2 cups"],["Flour","1/3 cup"],["Sugar","1/4 cup"],["Milk","1/3 cup"],["Eggs","2"],["Butter","2 tablespoons"],["Vanilla","1 tsp"],["Cinnamon","1/4 tsp"],["Salt","Pinch"]],"s":"Using a food processor or a blender, combine all the ingredients, don't overdo it, the mixture should be crumby. \r\n​\r\nHeat a lightly oiled pan over medium-high heat. Pour 1/4 cup of the batter onto the pan. Cook until lightly brown on each side, just like making pancakes ;)\r\n\r\nTraditionally you serve it with a spoon of sour cream on top. I just prefer to eat it plain. ","z":"使用食品加工机或搅拌机，将所有成分混合，不要过度，混合物应该是松脆的。 \r\n​\r\n用中高火加热涂有少许油的平底锅。将 1/4 杯面糊倒在烤盘上。煮至每一面呈浅棕色，就像做煎饼一样；）\r\n\r\n传统上，你会在上面放一勺酸奶油。我只是比较喜欢吃原味的。"},{"id":"53528","n":"Chuletas de Cerdo a la Criolla (Pork Chops in Creole Sauce)","a":"","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/087fu71783802698.jpg","y":"","i":[["Pork Chops","4"],["Vegetable Oil","2 tablespoons"],["Garlic","3 Cloves Crushed"],["Mustard","Melted"],["Ground Cumin","1 tablespoon"],["Tomato","3 diced"],["Onions","2 sliced"],["Cilantro","1/4 cup"],["Salt","To taste"],["Black Pepper","To taste"]],"s":"Place the pork chops in a zip lock plastic bag. Add the mustard, cumin, garlic, salt and pepper.\r\nRefrigerate for 1 hour or overnight. Be sure the pork chops are evenly covered.\r\nIn a large skillet, heat the oil over medium heat. Place the pork chops into the skillet and cook for 3 minutes per side. Remove the pork from the pan and keep aside on a warm plate.\r\n\r\nAdd the onions and tomatoes to the same skillet where the pork was browned, adding an additional tablespoon of oil if needed. Cook over high heat for about 5-7 minutes or until browned and softened, stirring frequently to avoid burning. Add the reserved cooked pork chops and cover, reduce the heat to medium-low and simmer until the pork is tender and barely pink in the center, about 15 minutes. Divide the chops among plates, spoon the sauce over the top, add the cilantro and serve immediately.","z":"将猪排放入拉链塑料袋中。加入芥末、小茴香、大蒜、盐和胡椒。\r\n冷藏1小时或过夜。确保猪排均匀地覆盖。\r\n在一个大煎锅中，用中火加热油。将猪排放入煎锅中，每面煎 3 分钟。将猪肉从锅中取出，放在温暖的盘子上。\r\n\r\n将洋葱和西红柿加入猪肉煎至棕色的同一个煎锅中，如果需要的话，再加一汤匙油。用大火煮约 5-7 分钟或直至变成棕色并软化，经常搅拌以避免烧焦。加入预留的煮熟的猪排，盖上锅盖，将火调至中低，煮约 15 分钟，直至猪肉变软且中心呈粉红色。将排骨分装在盘子中，用勺子将酱汁浇在上面，加入香菜即可立即食用。"},{"id":"53462","n":"Cinnamon Roll Cookies","a":"","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/txce0y1782494894.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/LZ6ra2I0Edo","i":[["Plain Flour","250g"],["Unsalted Butter","180g"],["Caster Sugar","85g"],["Egg","1 medium"],["Salt","Pinch"],["Ground Cinnamon","2 tsp"],["Brown Sugar","30g"]],"s":"1) In a large bowl, combine the butter and caster sugar until creamy. Add the egg and a pinch of salt.\r\n\r\n2) Stir into a buttery mixture. Add the sifted flour.\r\n\r\n3) Whisk well. You should end up with a smooth dough. Cover it with a piece of plastic wrap and put the dough in the fridge for 15 minutes to chill and set.\r\n\r\n4) In the meantime combine the cassonade (or brown sugar) and the cinnamon.\r\n\r\n5) Transfer the dough onto a floured surface and knead it for a minute. Add extra flour if necessary. Roll the dough out gently into a nice rectangle. It should be about ⅕-inch (5 mm) thick. Sprinkle with the sugary cinnamon mixture.\r\n\r\n6) Carefully start rolling the dough up. If it is too sticky, put it in the fridge again for a couple of minutes. Wrap it up tightly in plastic wrap.\r\n\r\n7) Put it in the fridge for 30 minutes to chill and set. After that, remove the cling film and cut the dough roll into even slices.\r\n\r\n8) Place the slices on a baking paper lined baking tray. Bake the cookies in a preheated oven at 356°F (180°C) for 14 to 16 minutes.\r\n\r\n9) Let the baked cinnamon roll cookies cool down fully before eating or wrapping them up.","z":"1）在一个大碗中，将黄油和细砂糖混合至奶油状。加入鸡蛋和少许盐。\r\n\r\n2）搅拌成黄油混合物。加入过筛的面粉。\r\n\r\n3）搅拌均匀。你最终应该得到一个光滑的面团。用一块保鲜膜盖住它，然后将面团放入冰箱中冷藏 15 分钟以使其冷却并凝固。\r\n\r\n4）同时将卡索纳德（或红糖）和肉桂混合。\r\n\r\n5）将面团转移到撒了面粉的表面上，揉一分钟。如有必要，添加额外的面粉。将面团轻轻擀成漂亮的矩形。它的厚度应约为 ⅕ 英寸（5 毫米）。撒上含糖肉桂混合物。\r\n\r\n6）小心地开始将面团卷起来。如果太粘，请再次放入冰箱几分钟。用保鲜膜将其紧紧包裹起来。\r\n\r\n7）放入冰箱冷藏30分钟，使其凝固。之后，去掉保鲜膜，将面团切成均匀的片。\r\n\r\n8）将切片放在铺有烘焙纸的烤盘上。将饼干放入已预热的烤箱中，以 356°F (180°C) 的温度烘烤 14 至 16 分钟。\r\n\r\n9) 让烤好的肉桂卷饼干充分冷却后再食用或包起来。"},{"id":"53555","n":"Classic Potato Salad","a":"","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/5q88l31784664151.jpg","y":"","i":[["New Potatoes","600g"],["Asparagus","150g"],["Chives","Bunch"],["Red Onions","1"],["Radish","8"],["Creme Fraiche","1/2 cup"],["Mayonnaise","1/2 cup"],["Dijon Mustard","2 tsp"],["Sugar","1 tsp"],["Apple Cider Vinegar","1 tablespoon"],["Salt","Pinch"],["Pepper","Pinch"]],"s":"Boil potatoes in lightly salted water for 10 to 12 minutes. Drain water when a potato speared with a fork and lifted out of the water easily glides off the fork and falls back into the pot. Let potatoes stand and cool.\r\nBreak off and discard the stringy ends of the asparagus spears, then chop into small pieces. You can pour boiling water over the chopped asparagus and let it soak for 2 minutes if you prefer a less raw taste.\r\nFinely chop chives, red onion and radish.\r\nStir the dressing ingredients together and season with salt and pepper.\r\nReserve some of the chives for garnish and combine the rest of the vegetables with the dressing.\r\nSeason with salt and pepper, garnish with chives and serve as a side dish.\r\nTip\r\nWhen in season, you can add fresh peas to this potato salad","z":"将土豆放入淡盐水中煮 10 至 12 分钟。当用叉子叉起土豆并从水中取出时，土豆很容易从叉子上滑落并落回锅中，然后沥干水。让土豆静置冷却。\r\n折断并丢弃芦笋矛的细丝末端，然后切成小块。如果您不喜欢生味，可以将沸水倒在切碎的芦笋上，浸泡 2 分钟。\r\n将细香葱、红洋葱和萝卜切碎。\r\n将调味料搅拌在一起，用盐和胡椒调味。\r\n保留一些细香葱作为装饰，并将其余的蔬菜与调料混合。\r\n用盐和胡椒调味，用细香葱装饰，作为配菜。\r\n提示\r\n当季节到来时，您可以在土豆沙拉中添加新鲜豌豆"},{"id":"53446","n":"Clear Soup with Semolina Dumplings","a":"","c":"Miscellaneous","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/qserum1780156275.jpg","y":"","i":[["Semolina","120g"],["Butter","60g"],["Egg","1"],["Salt","Pinch"],["Nutmeg","Pinch"],["Oil","Splash"],["Beef Stock","1 L"],["Parsley","Chopped"]],"s":"Step 1\r\nAllow butter to come to room temperature before beating in a bowl until creamed. Season with salt and a small, delicate pinch of nutmeg.\r\n\r\nStep 2\r\nAdd in the egg, stirring vigorously. Sprinkle the semolina over this, and mix it in well until the surface is smooth. Cover with saran wrap and leave to rest for 15 – 20 minutes.\r\n\r\nStep 3\r\nUse two spoons, dipped regularly into hot water throughout, to press or shape dumplings from the paste. You can also place these on a lightly oiled board or plate and again leave them to stand for a short while (this allows the dumplings to rise even more).\r\n\r\nStep 4\r\nHeat a generous quantity of salted water in a large pan. Place the dumplings into the water and bring them back to a boil before turning down the heat and leaving to simmer gently for 10 – 15 minutes (do not boil). Carefully turn the dumplings occasionally.\r\n\r\nStep 5\r\nRemove the semolina dumplings carefully and put them in the heated soup. Serve promptly, with a garnish of sprinkled parsley or chives.\r\n\r\nStep 6\r\nThe semolina dumplings can also be cooked in the beef broth, but this causes the soup to take on a slightly dull appearance. The cooked dumplings should never be left standing in the soup for too long, as they will “soak up” the soup and become softened.","z":"步骤1\r\n让黄油达到室温，然后在碗中搅拌直至奶油状。用盐和一小撮精致的肉豆蔻调味。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n加入鸡蛋，剧烈搅拌。将粗面粉撒在上面，搅拌均匀，直到表面光滑。盖上保鲜膜并静置 15 - 20 分钟。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n用两个勺子定期浸入热水中，将饺子糊压成或成型。您也可以将它们放在涂有少许油的木板或盘子上，然后再次将它们静置一会儿（这样可以使饺子升得更多）。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n在大锅中加热大量盐水。将饺子放入水中，重新煮沸，然后关小火，小火煮 10 – 15 分钟（不要煮沸）。时不时小心地翻动饺子。\r\n\r\n步骤5\r\n小心地取出粗面粉饺子，放入加热的汤中。立即上桌，撒上欧芹或细香葱装饰。\r\n\r\n步骤6\r\n粗面粉饺子也可以在牛肉汤中煮，但这会导致汤的外观略显暗淡。煮熟的饺子不应该在汤里放置太久，因为它们会“吸收”汤而变软。"},{"id":"53524","n":"Coconut Natilla Recipe","a":"","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/gp1sj51783799928.jpg","y":"","i":[["Milk","3 Cups"],["Cornstarch","1 cup"],["Cornstarch","2 tablespoons"],["Coconut Milk","1 cup"],["Coconut","1/2 cup"],["Cinnamon Stick","2"],["Condensed Milk","1 Can"],["Vanilla Extract","1/2 tsp"],["Sugar","1/3 cup"],["Salt","Pinch"],["Butter","1 tablespoon"],["Ground Cinnamon","To taste"]],"s":"Place 1 cup of milk in a small bowl, add the cornstarch and stir to dissolve it, then set aside.\r\nPlace the coconut milk and grated coconut in the blender and blend until smooth and set aside.\r\nPlace the rest of the milk and cinnamon sticks in a medium pot and bring the mixture to boil over medium-low heat. When the milk is a little warm, but not boiling, add the coconut mixture.\r\n\r\nWhen the milk starts boiling, add the condensed milk, sugar and salt. Stir well with a wooden spoon. Add the milk and cornstarch mixture and continue stirring constantly.\r\nAdd the vanilla extract. Reduce the heat to low and continue stirring until the Natilla thickens, about 10 to 20 minutes. Add the butter, stir and remove from the heat. Discard the cinnamon sticks. Ladle into a serving dish or individual custard cups. Sprinkle cinnamon powder on top and let it cool at room temperature for at least 2 hours. Refrigerate until ready to serve.","z":"将 1 杯牛奶放入小碗中，加入玉米淀粉并搅拌使其溶解，然后放在一边。\r\n将椰奶和磨碎的椰子放入搅拌机中，搅拌至光滑，备用。\r\n将剩余的牛奶和肉桂棒放入中型锅中，用中低火将混合物煮沸。当牛奶有点温热但没有沸腾时，加入椰子混合物。\r\n\r\n当牛奶开始沸腾时，加入炼乳、糖和盐。用木勺搅拌均匀。加入牛奶和玉米淀粉混合物，继续不断搅拌。\r\n添加香草精。把火调小，继续搅拌，直到 Natilla 变稠，大约需要 10 到 20 分钟。加入黄油，搅拌并从火上移开。丢弃肉桂棒。舀入盘子或单独的蛋奶冻杯中。在上面撒上肉桂粉，并在室温下冷却至少 2 小时。冷藏直至可以食用。"},{"id":"53477","n":"Coconut quindim","a":"","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/46uazv1782588877.jpg","y":"","i":[["Butter","2 tablespoons"],["Egg Yolks","10"],["Caster Sugar","100g"],["Coconut Milk","300ml"],["Desiccated Coconut","50g"],["Vanilla Extract","1 tsp"]],"s":"step 1\r\nHeat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Rub 4 ramekins, about 175ml capacity, or dariole moulds liberally with the soft butter. Sprinkle with the caster sugar to coat.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nIn a medium bowl, press the egg yolks through a wire sieve and mix with the coconut milk, sugar, coconut and vanilla. Pour into ramekins and place in a large roasting tin in the oven.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nPour water into the roasting tin to three-quarters up the ramekins so it acts like a bain marie or water bath for the quindim. Bake for 30-35 mins until the tops are golden. Take the ramekins out of the water and leave to cool for 5 mins.\r\n\r\nstep 4\r\nChill for 4 hrs and then run a knife around the edge. Place a plate on top and turn out the quindims to serve.","z":"步骤1\r\n将烤箱加热至 180C/160C 风扇/燃气 4. 将 4 个小模子（约 175 毫升容量）或 dariole 模具与软黄油充分涂抹。撒上细砂糖涂上。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n在一个中等大小的碗中，将蛋黄压过金属筛，并与椰奶、糖、椰子和香草混合。倒入小模子中，然后放入烤箱中的大烤罐中。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n将水倒入烤盘中，直至小模子的四分之三处，这样它就像一个蒸锅或水浴的奎丁姆。烘烤 30-35 分钟，直至顶部呈金黄色。将模子从水中取出并冷却 5 分钟。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n冷却 4 小时，然后用刀在边缘划一圈。在上面放一个盘子，然后把五丁鱼拿出来上桌。"},{"id":"53561","n":"Codfish deviled eggs","a":"","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/vayi021784668764.jpg","y":"","i":[["Eggs","12"],["Mayonnaise","7 tablespoons"],["Mustard","1 tsp"],["Pepper","To taste"],["Salt","To taste"],["Paprika","Pinch"],["Chives","Garnish"],["Black Pepper","Garnish"],["Codfish Bulljaw","Topping"]],"s":"Bring eggs to a boil for 15 minutes. Let eggs sit in the water for another 5. Run under cold water\r\nlet eggs further cool\r\nRest eggs\r\nPeel eggs\r\nCut eggs in half and remove egg yolks, place them in bowl\r\nMash egg yolks in a bowl\r\nCombine all ingredients except for chives and peppercorns\r\nPut the mixture in a piping bag or plastic bag\r\nFill egg slices with the mixture\r\nAdd codfish on the wider side of the egg\r\nGarnish with crushed peppercorn and chive","z":"将鸡蛋煮沸 15 分钟。让鸡蛋在水中再静置 5 个。在冷水下运行\r\n让鸡蛋进一步冷却\r\n休息鸡蛋\r\n剥鸡蛋\r\n将鸡蛋对半切开，去掉蛋黄，放入碗中\r\n将蛋黄放入碗中捣碎\r\n将除韭菜和花椒以外的所有原料混合在一起\r\n将混合物放入裱花袋或塑料袋中\r\n将混合物填满鸡蛋片\r\n将鳕鱼放在鸡蛋较宽的一侧\r\n用碎胡椒和香葱装饰"},{"id":"53523","n":"Colombian Buñuelos Recipe","a":"","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/bza0g51782856541.jpg","y":"","i":[["Vegetable Oil","For frying"],["Cornstarch","1 1/2 cup"],["Tapioca","1/4 cup"],["Feta","1 cup"],["Farmers Cheese","1 cup"],["Egg","1"],["Baking Powder","1/2 tsp"],["Sugar","2 tablespoons"],["Salt","Pinch"],["Milk","5 tablespoons"]],"s":"Place all the ingredients, except the oil in a medium bowl and mix well using your hands until soft and smooth dough is obtained.\r\nForm small balls using your hands.\r\nIn a deep pot, heat the vegetable oil to 300°F (Warm, not very hot). Carefully drop the balls in the warm oil and fry for about 3 to 4 minutes or until gilden brown.\r\nRemove from the oil and drain on a plate lined with paper towels. Serve.\r\n\r\nFrying Colombian buñuelos using the right temperature is very important. The oil can't be very hot or very cold. Be sure the oil is heated to 300 to 320 grades F.","z":"将除油外的所有原料放入一个中等大小的碗中，用手搅拌均匀，直至形成柔软光滑的面团。\r\n用手捏成小球。\r\n在深锅中，将植物油加热至 300°F（温热，不是很热）。小心地将球放入温热的油中，煎约 3 至 4 分钟或直至呈金黄色。\r\n从油中取出，放在衬有纸巾的盘子上沥干。服务。\r\n\r\n使用合适的温度煎炸哥伦比亚布努埃洛斯非常重要。油不能太热或太冷。确保油加热至 300 至 320 F 级。"},{"id":"53526","n":"Colombian Style Stuffed Potatoes","a":"","c":"Starter","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/zdyurx1783801146.jpg","y":"","i":[["Vegetable Oil","For frying"],["Potatoes","5"],["Salt","1/4 tsp"],["Olive Oil","1 tablespoon"],["Tomato","1 cup"],["Onion","1/3 cup"],["Scallions","1/3 cup"],["Garlic","1 clove peeled crushed"],["Ground Cumin","1/2 tsp"],["Sazon Goya With Azafran","1/2 tsp"],["Salt","1/4 tsp"],["Black Pepper","1/4 tsp"],["Ground Beef","1/2 lb"],["Egg","1"],["All purpose flour","1/4 cup"],["Salt","Pinch"],["Sazon Goya With Azafran","1/2 tbs"],["Milk","1/4 cup"]],"s":"Peel the potatoes and cut them into chunks, put them in a medium pot and cover with water and ¼ teaspoon of salt.\r\nBring the potatoes to a boil over medium high heat, then reduce the heat to medium and cook until fork tender about 20 minutes.\r\nDrain the potatoes and mash with a fork or masher and set aside.\r\nFilling:\r\nIn a large sauce pan, heat 1 tablespoon olive oil over medium heat and add the onion, tomato, scallions, garlic, cumin, azafran, pepper and salt. Cook for 5 minutes or until the onions are translucent, add the beef and cook stirring occasionally about 10 – 15 minutes. Set aside to cool.\r\nTo make the batter:\r\nIn a medium bowl place all the batter ingredients and whisk until smooth and set aside.\r\nTo Form the Stuffed Potatoes\r\nDivide the potato mash into 10 equal sized portions, about ⅓ cup each, and form each portion into a ball by rolling between the palms of your hands. Flatten into patties and place 1 ½ tablespoons of the filling in the center of each one. Shape the potato mixture with the filling into balls to enclose the filling completely.\r\nFill a large heavy pot with vegetable oil and heat over medium-high heat to 360° F.\r\n\r\nDip the stuffed potato into the batter and carefully place them in the hot oil and fry for about 4 minutes or until golden, turning over halfway through. Remove the potatoes from the oil using a slotted spoon and drain in a plate with paper towels. Transfer to a serving plate and serve with Ají.\r\n\r\nNotes\r\nFor a vegetarian version:Use the same ingredients in the meat filling except the beef and add 1 cup frozen carrots and peas","z":"将土豆去皮，切成块，放入一个中等大小的锅中，加入水和 1/4 茶匙盐。\r\n用中火将土豆煮沸，然后将火调至中火，煮约 20 分钟直至叉子变软。\r\n将土豆沥干，用叉子或捣碎器捣碎，放在一边。\r\n灌装：\r\n在一个大平底锅中，用中火加热 1 汤匙橄榄油，加入洋葱、番茄、葱、大蒜、小茴香、苦瓜、胡椒和盐。煮 5 分钟或直到洋葱半透明，加入牛肉，偶尔搅拌约 10 - 15 分钟。放在一边冷却。\r\n制作面糊：\r\n将所有面糊原料放入一个中等大小的碗中，搅拌至光滑并放在一边。\r\n制作酿土豆\r\n将土豆泥分成 10 等份，每份约 ⅓ 杯，然后将每份在手掌之间滚动，形成一个球。将其压扁成肉饼，并在每个肉饼的中心放入 1 ½ 汤匙馅料。将带有馅料的土豆混合物塑造成球状，以完全包住馅料。\r\n在一个大锅中倒入植物油，中高火加热至 360° F。\r\n\r\n将酿土豆浸入面糊中，小心地放入热油中，煎约 4 分钟或直至呈金黄色，中途翻面。用有槽的勺子将土豆从油中取出，然后用纸巾放在盘子中沥干。转移到盘子中，与 Ají 一起食用。\r\n\r\n注释\r\n素食版本：肉馅中使用除牛肉以外的相同成分，并添加 1 杯冷冻胡萝卜和豌豆"},{"id":"53505","n":"Conch Fritters","a":"","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/nmtq3n1782772031.jpg","y":"","i":[["Conchs","Can"],["Green Pepper","1/2"],["Red Pepper","1/2"],["Onion","2 large"],["Chilli","2"],["Lime","Juice of 2"],["Garlic","2 tbsp chopped"],["Black Pepper","1 tablespoon"],["Salt","1 tablespoon"],["Basil","1 tsp"],["Red Pepper Flakes","1 tsp"],["Egg","1"],["All purpose flour","10 tblsp"],["Vegetable Oil","For frying"]],"s":"Note: Make the conch mix the day before and store in the refrigerator to allow time for flavours to meld together. Tartar sauce can also be prepared beforehand. Just combine all the ingredients and mix well. Cover and refrigerate.\r\n\r\nUse your food grinder to grind together the conch pieces, red and green peppers, onions and hot peppers. Once done, add in your lime juice, minced garlic, black pepper, salt, dried basil, and red pepper flakes; make sure to mix it thoroughly. Then add your egg and mix again. Lastly, add your flour one tablespoon at a time and mix until combined. You can either plastic wrap it and let sit in the fridge for an hour or overnight. \r\n\r\nOnce you're ready to fry, fill the deep-frying pan with about 1 ½ to 2 inches of a high heat oil of your choice. Turn stove on to a medium-low heat.\r\n\r\nUse two spoons to form 1-inch balls and drop them into the hot oil one at a time. Each fritter should fry about 5-7 minutes or until golden brown and the inside is cooked. Repeat until you have used all the conch mixture. Serve with your tartar sauce and lime wedges.","z":"注意：前一天将海螺混合并存放在冰箱中，以便有时间让味道融合在一起。塔塔酱也可以提前准备好。只需将所有成分混合并搅拌均匀即可。盖上盖子并冷藏。\r\n\r\n使用食物研磨机将海螺片、红辣椒、青辣椒、洋葱和辣椒一起研磨。完成后，加入酸橙汁、蒜末、黑胡椒、盐、干罗勒和红辣椒片；确保充分混合。然后加入鸡蛋并再次混合。最后，一次加入一汤匙面粉，搅拌直至混合。您可以用保鲜膜包裹它并在冰箱中放置一个小时或过夜。 \r\n\r\n准备好煎炸后，在煎锅中倒入约 1 ½ 至 2 英寸厚的您选择的高温油。将炉子开至中低火。\r\n\r\n用两个勺子形成1英寸大小的球，然后将它们一次一个地放入热油中。每个油条应煎约 5-7 分钟或直至呈金黄色且内部煮熟。重复此操作，直到用完所有海螺混合物。与塔塔酱和酸橙块一起食用。"},{"id":"53512","n":"Conch Stew","a":"","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/mlkjeu1782775816.jpg","y":"","i":[["Conchs","2 Lbs"],["Onion","1"],["Green Pepper","1/2"],["Red Pepper","1/2"],["Scallions","2"],["Salt","1 tsp"],["Black Pepper","1/4 tsp"],["Seasoning","1/4 tsp"],["Coconut","1"],["Flour","1 tablespoon"],["Chilli","To taste"],["All purpose flour","1 cup"],["Vegetable Oil","1/2 tbs"],["Salt","Dash"],["Water","Splash"]],"s":"Conch Stew Cooking Directions\r\n\r\nClean conch meat and pound to tenderize. Boil conch for 2 - 3 hours or until tender. Make Sea Pie while conch cooks (instructions below). Once cool, cut conch in bite size pieces and season. Add all ingredients, except flour, to pan and simmer for 10 to 20 minutes. Mix flour with 1 cup water and pour into pan to thicken. Add Sea Pie pieces and continue to cook for an additional 10 minutes.\r\n\r\nSea Pie Cooking Directions\r\n\r\nMake dough with flour, pinch of salt and water so that you can roll out as thin as possible, then cut into 2 ½” x 2 ½” squares. Let set for 30 minutes then stretch squares to thin them out and add to conch stew mixture.\r\n\r\nServe with white rice, plantain, breadfruit or your choice of vegetables.","z":"海螺炖菜烹饪指南\r\n\r\n将海螺肉洗净，捣碎使其嫩化。将海螺煮 2 - 3 小时或直至变软。在煮海螺的同时制作海派（说明如下）。冷却后，将海螺切成一口大小的块并调味。将除面粉外的所有原料放入锅中，煮 10 至 20 分钟。将面粉与 1 杯水混合，倒入锅中勾芡。加入海派块，继续煮 10 分钟。\r\n\r\n海派烹饪指南\r\n\r\n用面粉、少许盐和水制作面团，以便擀得尽可能薄，然后切成 2 1/2” x 2 1/2” 方块。放置 30 分钟，然后拉伸方块使其变薄，然后加入海螺炖混合物中。\r\n\r\n与白米饭、车前草、面包果或您选择的蔬菜一起食用。"},{"id":"53431","n":"Corn on the cob with lime, green chilli and coconut butter","a":"","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/brhaoj1780086661.jpg","y":"","i":[["Vegetable Stock","1 L"],["Corn On The Cob","6"],["Coconut Milk","400ml"],["Lime","Zest and juice of 2"],["Green Chilli","1"],["Salt","Pinch"],["Black Pepper","Pinch"],["Butter","25g"],["Desiccated Coconut","100g"],["Shallots","100g"],["Coriander","10g"],["Parsley","10g"]],"s":"Bring the stock to a rolling boil in a big, deep pan. Slip in the cobs, leave to cook for about five minutes, then turn off the heat and leave the corn to sit in the stock as it cools.\r\n\r\nPut a heavy-based dry frying pan on a high heat and, once hot, lay the drained corn in the pan and char for a couple of minutes on each side – you’ll probably need to cook them two or three at a time, so you don’t overcrowd the pan. Put the coconut milk, lime juice and chillies in a small saucepan, season lightly, then bring up to a gentle simmer. Stir in the butter, turn off the heat and set aside.\r\n\r\nFor the topping, toast the coconut flakes in a hot dry frying pan – coconut burns very easily, so keep them moving and keep your eye on them. As soon as the coconut has a golden, burnished, toasted colour, tip it into a bowl, leave to cool, then mix with the crispy shallots and herbs, and season to taste.\r\n\r\nTo serve, spoon some of the coconut milk mixture over each cob, sprinkle with the toasted coconut mix and lime zest, and tuck in.","z":"将高汤在一个大而深的平底锅中煮沸。放入玉米棒子，煮约五分钟，然后关掉火，让玉米在冷却时留在高汤中。\r\n\r\n将厚底干煎锅放在高温上，热后将沥干的玉米放入锅中，每面煎几分钟——你可能需要一次煮两到三个，这样就不会把锅挤得太满。将椰奶、酸橙汁和辣椒放入小锅中，轻轻调味，然后小火慢炖。拌入黄油，关火，放在一边。\r\n\r\n对于浇头，在热干煎锅中烘烤椰子片——椰子很容易烧焦，所以要让它们移动并留意它们。一旦椰子呈现出金黄色、光亮的烤色，将其倒入碗中，冷却，然后与脆葱和香草混合，调味。\r\n\r\n食用时，将一些椰奶混合物舀到每个玉米棒子上，撒上烤椰子混合物和酸橙皮，然后塞进去。"},{"id":"53490","n":"Cottage Cheese And Feta Stuffed Peppers","a":"","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/w0rsga1782683912.jpg","y":"","i":[["Red Pepper","4"],["Feta","100g"],["Cottage Cheese","200g"],["Chives","1 tablespoon chopped"],["Parsley","1 tablespoon chopped"],["Salt","1/4 tsp"],["Lemon Juice","1 tablespoon"]],"s":"Cut the peppers lengthwise and remove the seeds.\r\nIn a bowl combine 3.5 oz (100 grams) Feta cheese, 7 oz (200 grams) cottage cheese, 1 tbsp chopped chives (optional), 1 tbsp chopped parsley (optional), 1/4 tsp salt (more or less to taste) and 1 tbsp lemon juice.\r\nFill the peppers with the mixture. Top with chopped chives and parsley.\r\nServe.","z":"将辣椒纵向切开并去除种子。\r\n在碗中混合 3.5 盎司（100 克）羊奶酪、7 盎司（200 克）干酪、1 汤匙切碎的香葱（可选）、1 汤匙切碎的欧芹（可选）、1/4 茶匙盐（或多或少地品尝）和 1 汤匙柠檬汁。\r\n将混合物填入辣椒中。上面撒上切碎的香葱和欧芹。\r\n服务。"},{"id":"53480","n":"Creamy Aji green sauce","a":"","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/81j8iu1782590903.jpg","y":"","i":[["Coriander","Bunch"],["Jalapeno","2"],["Spring Onions","2"],["Garlic","1 clove"],["White Wine Vinegar","1 tablespoon"],["Lime","Juice of 1"],["Cumin","Pinch"],["Mayonnaise","4 tablespoons"]],"s":"step 1\r\nPut all the ingredients in a blender or food processor and mix into a sauce. Add seasoning, then pour into a serving bowl.","z":"步骤1\r\n将所有原料放入搅拌机或食品加工机中，搅拌成酱汁。添加调味料，然后倒入碗中。"},{"id":"53532","n":"Creamy Corn Soup Recipe","a":"","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/yf5eyw1783804464.jpg","y":"","i":[["Corn On The Cob","4"],["Water","6 cups"],["Chicken Stock Cube","2"],["Garlic","2 cloves chopped"],["Salt","1/2 tsp"],["Pepper","1/2 tsp"],["Cilantro","2 tablespoons"],["Potatoes","1/2 cup"],["Scallions","1/2 cup"],["Heavy Cream","1 cup"]],"s":"Place the corn, water, chicken or vegetable bouillon, garlic, salt, pepper, cilantro, potatoes and scallions in a large pot and bring to a boil. Reduce heat to medium low and simmer for approximately 4 minutes or until the corn is tender.\r\nRemove from the heat. Puruée the soup in a blender and return to the pot, add the cream and heat over medium heat for 15 minutes, stirring occasionally.\r\nPour into bowls, garnish with cilantro and potato sticks.\r\nNotes\r\n\r\n*Fresh corn or frozen corn will work for this soup recipe. I usually use fresh corn, but I use organic corn kernels in the winter to make this soup.\r\n*To store: Place cooled corn soup in an airtight container and store in the fridge for up to 3 days.","z":"将玉米、水、鸡肉或蔬菜汤、大蒜、盐、胡椒、香菜、土豆和葱放入大锅中，煮沸。将火调至中低，煮约 4 分钟或直至玉米变软。\r\n从火上移开。将汤放入搅拌机打成泥，然后放回锅中，加入奶油，中火加热 15 分钟，偶尔搅拌。\r\n倒入碗中，用香菜和土豆条装饰。\r\n注释\r\n\r\n*新鲜玉米或冷冻玉米都适合此汤配方。我通常用新鲜玉米，但冬天我用有机玉米粒来做这个汤。\r\n*储存：将冷却的玉米汤放入密封容器中，并在冰箱中储存最多3天。"},{"id":"53530","n":"Creamy Mustard Chicken","a":"","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/4htbtm1783803558.jpg","y":"","i":[["Chicken Legs","8"],["Paprika","1 tsp"],["Salt","1 tsp"],["Black Pepper","1 tsp"],["Olive Oil","4 tablespoons"],["Garlic","3 Cloves Crushed"],["Onion","1/2 cup"],["Chicken Stock","2 cups"],["Mustard","2 tablespoons"],["Heavy Cream","1 cup"],["Honey","1 tablespoon"],["Parsley","Garnish"]],"s":"Pat the chicken dry and season the pieces with salt, pepper and paprika.\r\nHeat a saucepan over medium high heat and add the oil. Let the oil heat for a few seconds. Add the chicken and cook to sear all the sides turning the pieces a couple of times until they are golden browned about 10 minutes.\r\nTransfer the browned chicken to a plate and set a side. Add the onions and garlic to the skillet and cook for about 2 minutes or until soft. Add the chicken broth, mustard, honey and cream. Season with salt and black pepper.\r\n\r\nStir well and return the chicken pieces to the pan. Cover the pan and cook over medium low for about 45 minutes or until the chicken is cooked. The final temperature for chicken legs should be 170˚F.\r\nServe warm over white rice and garnish with chopped parsley.","z":"将鸡肉拍干，用盐、胡椒和辣椒粉调味。\r\n用中火加热平底锅并加入油。让油加热几秒钟。加入鸡肉，将鸡块各面煎焦，翻动几次，直到鸡块变成金黄色，大约需要 10 分钟。\r\n将褐色的鸡肉转移到盘子上并放在一边。将洋葱和大蒜放入煎锅中，煮约 2 分钟或直至变软。加入鸡汤、芥末、蜂蜜和奶油。用盐和黑胡椒调味。\r\n\r\n搅拌均匀，然后将鸡块放回锅中。盖上锅盖，用中低火煮约 45 分钟或直至鸡肉煮熟。鸡腿的最终温度应为 170°F。\r\n趁热与白米饭一起食用，并用切碎的欧芹装饰。"},{"id":"53569","n":"Creamy mango smoothie","a":"","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/pjbaq11784731571.jpg","y":"","i":[["Mango","3 Large"],["Vanilla Extract","1 tsp"],["Condensed Milk","1/2 cup"],["Ice Cubes","Large handful"]],"s":"Peel mangoes and slice\r\nCut two of the mangoes into chunks\r\nBlend all ingredients until smooth and creamy\r\nPour in a glass\r\nMango rose\r\nCut two of the largest opposite slices\r\nLay them down on a cutting board\r\nUsing a sharp knife, create small ¼ inch slices. Cut the mango slightly diagonally to get longer pieces.\r\nCreate a circular bud with one slice, build around it with the other slices, placing them individually the previous row to take on the form of a rose.\r\nRepeat this until you've arrived at your desired size.","z":"将芒果去皮并切片\r\n将两个芒果切成块\r\n将所有成分混合直至光滑且呈奶油状\r\n倒入玻璃杯中\r\n芒果玫瑰\r\n切两个最大的相对切片\r\n将它们放在切菜板上\r\n使用锋利的刀，切出 1/4 英寸的小片。将芒果稍微对角切开，以获得更长的块。\r\n用一片片制作一个圆形花蕾，用其他片围绕它构建，将它们分别放置在前一行以呈现玫瑰的形状。\r\n重复此操作，直到达到所需的尺寸。"},{"id":"53419","n":"Crispy fried fish with ginger and fermented soybeans (trey chien chuon)","a":"","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/9q1ci41779735714.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V0G3ODvMg0k","i":[["Ginger","2 cups"],["Fish fillet","1 lb"],["Tempura Flour","2 tablespoons"],["Oil","2 cups"],["Garlic","4 cloves"],["Soya Bean","800g"],["Sugar","1/2 tbs"],["Water","1/2 cup"],["Spring Onions","3"]],"s":"Fry the ginger in plenty of oil until golden and slightly crispy. Set aside for later.\r\nCut the fish into strips. Dredge the fish in a very thin layer of tempura flour.\r\nFry the fish in plenty of oil until golden brown and crispy. You can use the same oil as you were using to fry the ginger.\r\nCrush the garlic and chop it into small pieces. Chop the spring onion.\r\nDrain the fermented soybeans using a colander. If you are using salted beans (soybeans in a very salty brine), you need to wash the beans in water before you add them to the dish.\r\nAdd a tablespoon of oil to a deep pan or a large pot, and sauté the garlic until slightly golden.\r\nAdd the soybeans and stir fry for a few minutes. If the soybeans are very salty, add ¼- ½ tablespoon sugar to balance the flavor.\r\nAdd water and fry for a minute.\r\nJust before serving, stir in the fried ginger, the spring onion, and the crispy fish. Serve with steamed rice.","z":"用大量油将姜煎至金黄并略脆。留着以后用。\r\n将鱼切成条。将鱼裹上一层非常薄的天妇罗粉。\r\n用大量油将鱼煎至金黄色酥脆。您可以使用与炸姜相同的油。\r\n将大蒜压碎并切成小块。将葱切碎。\r\n用漏勺沥干发酵大豆。如果您使用的是咸豆（用非常咸的盐水浸泡的大豆），则需要先用水清洗豆子，然后再将其添加到菜肴中。\r\n在深锅或大锅中加入一汤匙油，将大蒜炒至略呈金黄色。\r\n加入大豆，炒几分钟。如果大豆很咸，可添加 1/4-1/2 汤匙糖来平衡味道。\r\n加水炒一分钟。\r\n上菜前，加入炸姜、葱和脆鱼。与米饭一起食用。"},{"id":"53547","n":"Cuban Sandwich","a":"","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/djdg8l1784578885.jpg","y":"","i":[["Pork Chops","1 lb"],["Kosher Salt","Pinch"],["Vegetable Oil","2 tablespoons"],["Orange","Juice/zest of one"],["Lime","Juice/zest of one"],["Dried Oregano","2 tsp"],["Ground Black Pepper","1 tsp"],["Garlic Powder","1 tsp"],["Dijon Mustard","2 tablespoons"],["Mayonnaise","2 tablespoons"],["Cuban Bread","8 oz"],["Unsalted Butter","1 tablespoon"],["Swiss Cheese","4 oz"],["Deli Ham","8 oz"],["Dill Pickles","2"]],"s":"Step 1\r\nPlace pork chops in a 3-qt. glass baking dish. Using a fork, poke holes into pork all over; season all over with 1 tsp. salt. Drizzle with oil and toss to coat.\r\nStep 2\r\nIn a small bowl, combine orange zest and juice, lime zest and juice, oregano, pepper, garlic powder, cumin, and onion powder. Add half of marinade to pork and let rest 10 to 15 minutes.\r\nStep 3\r\nMeanwhile, arrange a rack in center of oven; preheat to 425°. Add mustard and mayonnaise to remaining marinade and stir until smooth.\r\nStep 4\r\nTransfer pork to oven and roast until an instant-read thermometer inserted into thickest part registers 140°, 15 to 20 minutes.\r\nStep 5\r\nTo build sandwiches, cut loaf in half crosswise, then cut each piece in half lengthwise for 4 pieces total. Spread butter on outside of bread on the top and bottom. Spread mustard mixture on cut sides of bread. On 2 bread pieces, layer each with 2 oz. cheese, 4 oz. ham, half of roast pork, 4 pickle slices, and remaining 2 oz. cheese. Close with remaining bread pieces and wrap each sandwich in foil.\r\nStep 6\r\nHeat a large cast-iron skillet over medium heat. Place foil-wrapped sandwiches in skillet, then place another heavy skillet on top to create a homemade sandwich press. If you don’t have another heavy skillet, weigh the pan down with another lighter skillet or baking sheet, then top with couple of canned goods.\r\nStep 7\r\nGrill sandwiches, turning halfway through, until toasted and cheese is melted, 3 to 4 minutes per side. Cut each sandwich in half and serve.","z":"步骤1\r\n将猪排放入 3 夸脱的容器中。玻璃烤盘。用叉子在猪肉上戳洞；用 1 茶匙调味。盐。淋上油并搅拌均匀。\r\n步骤2\r\n在一个小碗中，将橙皮碎和果汁、酸橙皮碎和果汁、牛至、胡椒、大蒜粉、小茴香和洋葱粉混合。将一半腌料加入猪肉中，静置 10 至 15 分钟。\r\n步骤3\r\n同时，在烤箱中央放置一个架子；预热至425°。将芥末和蛋黄酱加入剩余的腌料中，搅拌至光滑。\r\n步骤4\r\n将猪肉转移到烤箱中烘烤 15 至 20 分钟，直至插入最厚部分的即时温度计显示 140°。\r\n步骤5\r\n要制作三明治，请将面包横向切成两半，然后将每块纵向切成两半，总共 4 块。在面包外面和底部涂上黄油。将芥末混合物涂在面包的切面上。在 2 片面包上，每片铺上 2 盎司。奶酪，4 盎司火腿，一半烤猪肉，4片泡菜，剩下2盎司。奶酪。关闭剩余的面包片，并用箔纸包裹每个三明治。\r\n步骤6\r\n用中火加热一个大铸铁煎锅。将铝箔包裹的三明治放入煎锅中，然后将另一个重煎锅放在上面，以制作自制的三明治压榨机。如果你没有另一个较重的煎锅，可以用另一个较轻的煎锅或烤盘来压平锅，然后在上面放一些罐头食品。\r\n步骤7\r\n烤三明治，中途翻面，直至烤熟且奶酪融化，每面 3 至 4 分钟。将每个三明治切成两半即可食用。"},{"id":"53473","n":"Curried Spinach from Botswana","a":"","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/lyr07q1782505714.jpg","y":"","i":[["Spinach","1  bunch"],["Tomato","2 medium"],["Onion","1 small"],["Oil","2 tablespoons"],["Curry Powder","2 tsp"],["Salt","To taste"],["Water","1/4 cup"]],"s":"Heat the oil in a skillet over medium heat. When hot, add the diced onion and cook until lightly browned.\r\nAdd the curry powder and salt to taste and toast for a few seconds.\r\nAdd the chopped tomatoes and the water, stir well, and cook until the tomatoes begin to break down, 5-7 minutes.\r\nAdd in the chopped (or baby) spinach and cook for 7-10 minutes more, until soft and wilted.","z":"在煎锅中用中火加热油。热时，加入洋葱丁，煮至浅棕色。\r\n加入咖喱粉和盐调味，然后烘烤几秒钟。\r\n加入切碎的西红柿和水，搅拌均匀，煮 5-7 分钟，直至西红柿开始分解。\r\n加入切碎的（或嫩菠菜），再煮 7-10 分钟，直至变软并枯萎。"},{"id":"53556","n":"Danish Rye Bread","a":"","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/hem6gk1784664868.jpg","y":"","i":[["Rye Grain","200g"],["Water","3/4 cup"],["Dark Beer","3/4 cup"],["Buttermilk","3/4 cup"],["Yeast","10g"],["Salt","1 tsp"],["Seeds","130g"],["All purpose flour","3/4 cup"],["Rye Flour","2 1/2 cups"]],"s":"Combine rye grain and water in a saucepan and bring to a boil. Cover and simmer for 2 to 3 minutes.\r\nTransfer the boiled rye grain to a mixing bowl and combine with beer, buttermilk and salt.\r\nDissolve the fresh yeast in this mixture and then add the seeds.\r\nAdd all-purpose flour and rye flour, and knead for about 10 minutes. You can also use a kitchen mixer to knead the dough.\r\nTransfer the dough to an oiled loaf pan (2.5 l) and smooth out with a spatula.\r\nPoke holes in the surface with a fork and cover loaf pan with plastic wrap. Let the dough rise for 1½ hours at room temperature, or for 24 hours in the refrigerator.\r\nPre-heat oven to 200°C / 392℉ (175°C / 347℉ on fan setting) and bake bread on the bottom rack for about 75 minutes. Test to make sure dry in centre, or if using an oven thermometer, set it to turn off when centre reaches 98°C / 208℉\r\nAllow the bread to cool completely before slicing.\r\nTIP\r\nIf you refrigerate the dough while rising, let it stand at room temperature for 1 hour before baking.","z":"将黑麦粒和水放入锅中煮沸。盖上锅盖，煮 2 至 3 分钟。\r\n将煮沸的黑麦粒转移到搅拌碗中，与啤酒、酪乳和盐混合。\r\n将新鲜酵母溶解在该混合物中，然后添加种子。\r\n加入中筋面粉和黑麦面粉，揉捏约 10 分钟。您也可以使用厨房搅拌机来揉面团。\r\n将面团转移到涂了油的烤盘（2.5 升）中，并用抹刀抹平。\r\n用叉子在表面戳孔，并用保鲜膜盖住烤盘。让面团在室温下发酵 1.5 小时，或在冰箱中发酵 24 小时。\r\n将烤箱预热至 200°C / 392°F（风扇设置为 175°C / 347°F），然后将面包放在底架上烘烤约 75 分钟。进行测试以确保中心干燥，或者如果使用烤箱温度计，请将其设置为在中心达到 98°C / 208°F 时关闭\r\n切片前让面包完全冷却。\r\n提示\r\n如果在发酵过程中将面团冷藏，请在烘烤前将其在室温下静置 1 小时。"},{"id":"53411","n":"Dolma Japrak Stuffed Vine Leaves","a":"","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/lqshrh1779648160.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=G7OLFDL63J4","i":[["Pickled Grape Leaves","600g"],["Lamb Mince","400g"],["Onion","5 chopped"],["Rice","75g"],["Pepper","1 tsp"],["Paprika","1 tsp"],["Vegetable Stock","1 tsp"],["Parsley","25g"],["Basil","1 tsp"],["Olive Oil","Splash"],["Salt","To taste"],["Boiling Water","2 Litres"]],"s":"\r\n1\r\nPreperation\r\nAdd the onions to a saute pan and fry for 5 minutes in olive oil until the onions start to brown.\r\n2\r\nTurn off the heat and add the meat, rice, pepper, paprika, dried vegetable stock, parsley and basil. Mix all the ingredients together.\r\n3\r\nCarefully unwrap the vine leaves. Place one vine leaf on your hand with the base on the bottom of your palm and the point pointing towards the top. Add a second vine leaf with the point pointing downwards and base of the leaf at the top of your fingers. there should be a good overlap. You can do this on a flat surface if preferred.\r\n4\r\nPlace a spoonful of the meat and rice mixture in the middle of the leaves. Fold the bottom of the leaf over the mixture, fold in both sides and the roll the leaf upwards sealing in the mixture into a parcel shape.\r\n5\r\nLayer a layer of vine leaves covering the bottom of a deep saucepan and then add the vine leaf parcel on top.\r\n6\r\nMake as many vine leaf parcels as the meat and rice mixture will make adding each one to the saucepan. Pack the parcels side by side util the saucepan is covered, then start another layer on top.\r\n7\r\nCooking\r\nPour into the saucepan enough boiling water to just cover the top of the vine leaves and bring to a boil. Leave to simmer with a lid on for 1.5 hours. All water should be absorbed however top up with a little extra boiling water if this happens before the time is up.\r\n8\r\nServing\r\nRemove from the saucepan and leave to cool for 10 minutes before serving.","z":"1\r\n准备工作\r\n将洋葱放入炒锅中，在橄榄油中煎 5 分钟，直至洋葱变成棕色。\r\n2\r\n关掉火，加入肉、米饭、胡椒、辣椒粉、干蔬菜高汤、欧芹和罗勒。将所有成分混合在一起。\r\n3\r\n小心地解开藤叶。将一片藤叶放在手上，基部位于手掌底部，尖端指向顶部。添加第二片藤叶，尖端朝下，叶子的基部位于手指的顶部。应该有很好的重叠。如果愿意，您可以在平坦的表面上执行此操作。\r\n4\r\n将一勺肉和米饭的混合物放在叶子中间。将叶子的底部折叠到混合物上，向两侧折叠，然后将叶子向上卷起，将混合物密封成包裹形状。\r\n5\r\n在深锅的底部铺上一层藤叶，然后将藤叶包放在上面。\r\n6\r\n将肉和米饭的混合物放入锅中，制作尽可能多的藤叶包。将包裹并排包装，直到盖住平底锅，然后在上面开始另一层。\r\n7\r\n烹饪\r\n将足够的沸水倒入锅中，刚好覆盖藤叶的顶部，煮沸。盖上盖子煮 1.5 小时。所有的水都应该被吸收，但是如果在时间结束之前发生这种情况，请补充一点额外的沸水。\r\n8\r\n服务\r\n从平底锅中取出，冷却 10 分钟即可食用。"},{"id":"53563","n":"Dominica mastiff bread","a":"","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/u1996p1784670686.jpg","y":"","i":[["Flour","3 Lbs"],["Brown Sugar","1 ½ tbsp"],["Salt","1 ½ tbsp"],["Instant Yeast","2 tablespoons"],["Shortening","1/2 cup"],["Water","3 cups"],["Flour","Dusting"]],"s":"Mix all dry ingredients in a large bowl (sugar, salt and instant yeast)\r\nMix with a large wooden spoon\r\nAdd shortening or lard and mix\r\nMix thoroughly with your hand\r\nAdd warm water and mix the dough until stiff\r\nAdd more flour so that dough doesn't stick\r\nYou can add dough onto a floured board to make sure that it's properly kneaded\r\nKnead for approximately 8-10 minutes\r\nShape dough into a large round shape and cover to rest for 45 minutes\r\nKnead dough again on a lightly floured surface (kneading is the most critical part of this recipe process.\r\nShape dough into your desired bread designs and place on a baking sheet or bread pan\r\nLet the breads rest for 25 minutes\r\nPreheat oven at 375°F\r\nBake until golden brown\r\nInstructions when using active yeast\r\nMix 3½ cups of warm water (115°F to 120°F), yeast and sugar\r\nAdd a pinch of salt and ½lb of sifted flour to the mixture\r\nStir the mixture with a wooden spoon\r\nSet in a warm place for approximately one hour\r\nMixture should look foamy with bubbles\r\nSift the rest of the flour in a large bowl\r\nPour yeast mixture into the large bowl over the flour\r\nAdd shortening or lard and mix\r\nAdd more flour so that dough doesn't stick\r\nYou can add dough onto a floured board to make sure that it's properly kneaded\r\nKnead for approximately 8-10 minutes\r\nShape dough into a large round shape and cover to rest for 45 minutes\r\nLet the breads rest for 25 minutes\r\nPreheat oven at 375°F\r\nBake until golden brown","z":"将所有干成分混合在一个大碗中（糖、盐和速溶酵母）\r\n用大木勺搅拌\r\n添加起酥油或猪油并混合\r\n用手充分搅拌\r\n加入温水，将面团搅拌至硬性发泡\r\n多加点面粉，这样面团就不会粘在一起了\r\n您可以将面团添加到撒有面粉的板上，以确保其正确揉捏\r\n揉捏约8-10分钟\r\n将面团擀成大圆形，盖上盖子松弛45分钟\r\n在撒有少许面粉的表面上再次揉捏面团（揉捏是此配方过程中最关键的部分。\r\n将面团塑造成您想要的面包设计，然后放在烤盘或面包盘上\r\n让面包静置 25 分钟\r\n将烤箱预热至 375°F\r\n烘烤至金黄色\r\n使用活性酵母的说明\r\n将 3½ 杯温水（115°F 至 120°F）、酵母和糖混合\r\n在混合物中加入少许盐和 ½ 磅过筛的面粉\r\n用木勺搅拌混合物\r\n放置温暖处约一小时\r\n混合物看起来应该是泡沫状的\r\n将剩余的面粉筛入一个大碗中\r\n将酵母混合物倒入大碗中，覆盖在面粉上\r\n添加起酥油或猪油并混合\r\n多加点面粉，这样面团就不会粘在一起了\r\n您可以将面团添加到撒有面粉的板上，以确保其正确揉捏\r\n揉捏约8-10分钟\r\n将面团擀成大圆形，盖上盖子松弛45分钟\r\n让面包静置 25 分钟\r\n将烤箱预热至 375°F\r\n烘烤至金黄色"},{"id":"53567","n":"Dominican Bakes","a":"","c":"Starter","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/cbfy1c1784672521.jpg","y":"","i":[["All purpose flour","4 cups"],["Baking Powder","1 tablespoon"],["Salt","1 tablespoon"],["Sugar","1/2 tbs"],["Milk","2 cups"],["Butter","1 ½ tbsp"],["Vegetable Oil","2 cups"]],"s":"Combine dry ingredients and mix (flour, salt, and baking powder)\r\nAdd lightly melted butter mix.\r\nGradually add lukewarm milk.\r\nGently knead the dough with hands.\r\nThe dough should not be firm but with a sticky consistency.\r\nSeparate into small portions in the shapes of balls based on the desired size.\r\nLet the balls rest for 15 – 20 minutes covered with a towel or saran wrap.\r\nFlatten dough using hands, using your thumb to press dough in\r\nDeep fry in a saucepan (I use a saucepan because the frying pan is too wide, and I'll need to use too much oil to deep fry). Use medium heat.\r\nTurn over on the other side when dough strarts getting brown, then turn over to brown the other side\r\nEnjoy with your favorite side","z":"将干成分混合并混合（面粉、盐和泡打粉）\r\n加入稍微融化的黄油混合物。\r\n逐渐加入温牛奶。\r\n用手轻轻揉面团。\r\n面团不应太硬，但应具有粘性。\r\n根据所需的大小分成球形状的小部分。\r\n用毛巾或保鲜膜盖住球，静置 15 - 20 分钟。\r\n用手将面团压扁，用大拇指将面团压进去\r\n用平底锅煎（我用平底锅，因为煎锅太宽，需要用太多的油来煎）。使用中火。\r\n当面团开始变褐色时，翻面，然后翻面，使另一面变褐色\r\n享受你最喜欢的一面"},{"id":"53571","n":"Dominica’s coconut rough cake","a":"","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/sgqy9d1784832045.jpg","y":"","i":[["Wheat Flour","4 cups"],["Oats","1 cup"],["Brown Sugar","1 1/2 cup"],["Coconut","2 cups"],["Vanilla Extract","1 tsp"],["Coconut Milk","2 1/2 cups"],["Bicarbonate Of Soda","1 tsp"],["Baking Powder","1/2 tsp"],["Ground Cinnamon","1 ½ tbsp"],["Nutmeg","1 ½ tsp"],["Lime","Zest of 1"],["Raisins","1/4 cup"]],"s":"Mix all dry ingredients in bowl\r\nAdd coconut milk to dry ingredients\r\nGrease baking pan with vegetable oil\r\nI use an ice cream scoop to form drops. I placed the scooped cake mixture on a baking sheet. I also used a cake mold and gently pressed the mixture in. You can use a baking pan as well.\r\nPreheat your over at 350°\r\nBake for 25 to 35 minutes or until brown","z":"将所有干成分放入碗中混合\r\n将椰奶添加到干成分中\r\n在烤盘上涂上植物油\r\n我用冰淇淋勺来形成水滴。我把舀出来的蛋糕混合物放在烤盘上。我还使用了蛋糕模具，轻轻地将混合物压入。你也可以使用烤盘。\r\n350°预热\r\n烘烤 25 至 35 分钟或直至变成棕色"},{"id":"53543","n":"Dulce de Leche Cheesecake with a Maria Cookie Crust.","a":"","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/f9qog11784574376.jpg","y":"","i":[["Maria Cookies","7 oz"],["Unsalted Butter","1/2 cup"],["Cream Cheese","16 oz"],["Cream Cheese","16 oz"],["Sweetened Condensed Milk","1 Can"],["Eggs","4"],["Vanilla Extract","1 ½ tbsp"],["Dulce de leche","Garnish"]],"s":"Heat oven to 325ºF.\r\nPlace cookies in bowl of food processor. Pulse 30 seconds, or until finely ground. (Or, crush them by hand by placing cookies in zip-top bag and using the bottom of a heavy skillet, pound cookies until finely crushed); transfer cookie crumbs to bowl.\r\nAdd softened butter, stirring until combined.\r\nTransfer cookie mixture to 9” spring form pan. Using your fingers, press cookie crumbs evenly onto bottom and sides of pan. Bake until firm and fragrant, about 10 minutes.\r\nAllow to cool.\r\nSet electric mixer on medium speed, beat cream cheese until fluffy, about 3 minutes.\r\nAdd condensed milk; beat until smooth, 1 minute.\r\nBeat in eggs, vanilla and 3 tbsp. dulce de leche (caramel) until combined, 3 minutes.\r\nPour filling into prepared crust. Bake until golden brown and set, but still a little wiggly in the middle, 45 – 55 minutes.\r\nTurn off oven; partially open oven door.\r\nLet cheesecake sit in oven until it come to room temperature, about 1 hour.\r\nTransfer cheesecake to refrigerator; cool completely, at least 4 hours.\r\nRemove cooled cheesecake from sprigform pan.\r\nPlace remaining dulce de leche in ziplock bag.\r\nUsing scissors, snip small hole in corner of bag. Applying even pressure on “pastry bag,” paint stripes on your finished cheesecake.","z":"将烤箱加热至 325°F。\r\n将饼干放入食品加工机的碗中。脉冲 30 秒，或直至精细研磨。 （或者，将饼干放入带拉链的袋子中，然后使用重煎锅的底部，将饼干捣碎，直至精细粉碎）；将饼干屑转移到碗中。\r\n加入软化的黄油，搅拌直至混合。\r\n将饼干混合物转移到 9” 弹簧烤盘中。用手指将饼干屑均匀地压在烤盘底部和侧面。烘烤约 10 分钟，直至变硬并散发出香味。\r\n让其冷却。\r\n将电动搅拌机调至中速，将奶油奶酪搅打至蓬松，约 3 分钟。\r\n加入炼乳；打至光滑，1分钟。\r\n加入鸡蛋、香草精和 3 汤匙。 dulce de leche（焦糖）直至混合，持续 3 分钟。\r\n将馅料倒入准备好的饼皮中。烘烤 45 - 55 分钟，直至呈金黄色并凝固，但中间仍然有点晃动。\r\n关闭烤箱；部分打开烤箱门。\r\n将芝士蛋糕放入烤箱中，直至达到室温，大约 1 小时。\r\n将芝士蛋糕转移到冰箱；完全冷却，至少4小时。\r\n从枝形盘中取出冷却的芝士蛋糕。\r\n将剩余的牛奶汁放入自封袋中。\r\n用剪刀在袋子的一角剪出一个小孔。在“糕点袋”上施加均匀的压力，在成品芝士蛋糕上画出条纹。"},{"id":"53393","n":"Dutch doughnuts","a":"","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/cz1d6v1777627421.jpg","y":"","i":[["Flour","500g"],["Milk","500ml"],["Instant Yeast","10g"],["Salt","10g"],["Sugar","25g"]],"s":"Place the flour in a large bowl and add the yeast and sugar. If the milk is cold make sure to heat it to lukewarm. Mix your flour mixture bit by bit with the milk until you have a smooth batter. Add the salt and mix with a wooden spoon till the batter is smooth and liquidy.\r\nCover with a clean tea towel and leave in a warm spot for about an hour to rise.\r\n\r\nHeat your deep fryer or add the oil to a large pot. The oil should be a t 180˚C (350˚F) for best results.\r\nBefore starting stir your batter through and scoop the batter with two spoons or with an ice cream scoop. Let it drop into the oil carefully. It is easiest to do this if you dip your spoons or scoop into the oil before dipping into the batter. That way it will slide of the spoons easily. Don't over crowd the fryer to prevent the oil cooling down too quickly and everything sticking together. Once one side is golden brown it usually turns around to the other side automatically. If not help it along with two forks.\r\nTake the balls out once golden brown and leave to drain on a piece of kitchen paper.","z":"将面粉放入一个大碗中，加入酵母和糖。如果牛奶是冷的，请务必将其加热至微温。将面粉混合物与牛奶一点一点混合，直到形成光滑的面糊。加入盐，用木勺搅拌，直至面糊光滑呈液态。\r\n盖上干净的茶巾，放在温暖的地方发酵约一个小时。\r\n\r\n加热油炸锅或将油加入大锅中。为获得最佳效果，油的温度应为 180°C (350°F)。\r\n在开始搅拌面糊之前，用两个勺子或冰淇淋勺舀出面糊。小心地将其滴入油中。如果您在浸入面糊之前将勺子或勺子浸入油中，则最容易做到这一点。这样它就可以轻松地从勺子上滑落。不要过度拥挤油炸锅，以防止油冷却得太快而所有东西都粘在一起。一旦一侧变成金黄色，它通常会自动转向另一侧。如果没有的话，用两把叉子帮助它。\r\n当球呈金黄色时，将其取出，放在一张厨房用纸上沥干。"},{"id":"53486","n":"Easy White Bean Soup","a":"","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/p5nzbk1782680889.jpg","y":"","i":[["Cannellini Beans","1 lb"],["Onions","2 medium"],["Vegetable Oil","2 tablespoons"],["Red Pepper","2 medium"],["Tomato Puree","1/3 cup"],["Carrots","2 medium"],["Water","6 cups"],["Dried Mint","1 tsp"],["Thyme","1/2 tsp"],["Summer Savoury","1 tsp"],["Black Pepper","1 tsp"],["Salt","1 tsp"],["Parsley","Garnish"]],"s":"Place beans in a large pot and cover with cold water. Soak for at least 4 hours or overnight. Drain and rinse, before you use in the soup.\r\nChop one of the onions and leave the other one whole. Chop carrots.\r\nHeat oil on a large pot over medium heat. Add the onion and carrots. Cook for 2 minutes. Add beans, water, peppers, head of onion, salt, pepper, summer savory, mint, thyme, Vegeta and tomato puree. Stir, bring to a boil, then reduce to a simmer and cook for 2 hours, or until the beans are tender.\r\nRemove the peppers and whole onion. Mash the onion. Peel peppers and chop. Return to the pot.\r\nAdd more salt and pepper, if needed. Garnish with chopped parsley. Serve.","z":"将豆子放入一个大锅中，并用冷水覆盖。浸泡至少4小时或过夜。在用于汤之前，沥干并冲洗。\r\n将其中一颗洋葱切碎，将另一颗洋葱完整保留。切胡萝卜。\r\n在大锅上用中火加热油。加入洋葱和胡萝卜。煮2分钟。加入豆类、水、辣椒、洋葱头、盐、胡椒、夏季香料、薄荷、百里香、蔬菜和番茄泥。搅拌，煮沸，然后转小火煮 2 小时，或直至豆子变软。\r\n取出辣椒和整个洋葱。将洋葱捣碎。将辣椒去皮并切碎。返回锅中。\r\n如果需要的话，添加更多的盐和胡椒。用切碎的欧芹装饰。发球。"},{"id":"53518","n":"Empanadas Fritas de Queso","a":"","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/9tllzd1782853513.jpg","y":"","i":[["All purpose flour","3 Cups"],["Baking Powder","1 tsp"],["Salt","1/2 tsp"],["Lard","2 tablespoons"],["Milk","1 cup"],["Egg","1 beaten"],["Swiss Cheese","1 cup"]],"s":"Sift the flour, baking powder, and salt into a large mixing bowl. Combine the lard and milk in a saucepan, and heat until the milk is hot. Pour the hot milk into the flour mixture, and stir until a dough forms. Turn out onto a floured surface, and knead until smooth and elastic. Cover, and allow to rest for 15 minutes.\r\n\r\nPreheat oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C).\r\n\r\nRoll the dough out on a floured surface 1/4-inch thick. Cut into 4-inch rounds. Brush the outer edges of each circle with beaten egg, and fill with a small mound of cheese. Fold each circle in half to form a half-moon; press the edges with your fingers or a fork to seal. Place the empanadas onto a parchment paper-lined baking sheet. Brush the tops with remaining egg.\r\n\r\nBake in preheated oven until golden-brown, about 20 minutes.\r\n\r\nAlternatively, the empanadas may be deep fried in 375 degrees F (190 degrees C) oil. If deep frying, do not brush the outsides of the empanadas with egg. Drain on paper towels.","z":"将面粉、泡打粉和盐筛入一个大碗中。将猪油和牛奶放入锅中，加热直至牛奶变热。将热牛奶倒入面粉混合物中，搅拌直至形成面团。将其放在撒有面粉的表面上，揉捏至光滑且有弹性。盖上盖子，静置 15 分钟。\r\n\r\n将烤箱预热至 375 华氏度（190 摄氏度）。\r\n\r\n将面团放在撒了面粉的表面上擀成 1/4 英寸厚。切成4英寸的圆片。在每个圆圈的外边缘刷上打好的鸡蛋，并填入一小堆奶酪。将每个圆圈对折，形成半月；用手指或叉子按压边缘以密封。将肉馅卷饼放在衬有羊皮纸的烤盘上。在顶部刷上剩余的鸡蛋。\r\n\r\n放入预热好的烤箱中烘烤约20分钟至金黄色。\r\n\r\n或者，也可以在 375 华氏度（190 摄氏度）的油中油炸肉馅卷饼。如果油炸，不要在肉馅卷饼的外面刷上鸡蛋。用纸巾沥干水分。"},{"id":"53557","n":"Extra crispy chicken wings","a":"","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/feh9k21784665694.jpg","y":"","i":[["Chicken Wings","2 Lbs"],["Salt","To taste"],["Black Pepper","1 tablespoon"],["Garlic Powder","1 tablespoon"],["Turmeric","1 tsp"],["Oil","For frying"],["Cassava","1 1/2 cup"]],"s":"Wash chicken and pat dry\r\nPlace in a large bowl\r\nSeason with garlic, salt, pepper and turmeric (you can expand your seasoning options if you'd like.\r\nMarinate for at least an hour\r\nPour some tapioca flour on a plate\r\nCoat the wings with the cassava flour and place them on a rack or plater to set. Leave them for at least 30minutes to an hour.\r\nHeat the oil in the saucepan until it’s hot.\r\nPlace wings in pan on medium heat, until light brown.\r\nDrain on a paper towel, and let the wings rest for at least 10 minutes, then return the wings to the hot pan on high heat and fry until golden brown.\r\nEnjoy!","z":"将鸡肉洗净并拍干\r\n放入一个大碗中\r\n用大蒜、盐、胡椒和姜黄调味（如果您愿意，您可以增加调味品的选择。\r\n腌制至少一个小时\r\n盘子里倒入一些木薯粉\r\n在鸡翅上涂上木薯粉，然后将其放在架子或盘子上放置。放置至少 30 分钟到一个小时。\r\n将锅中的油加热至热。\r\n将鸡翅放入平底锅中，中火加热，直至呈浅棕色。\r\n用纸巾吸干水分，让鸡翅静置至少 10 分钟，然后将鸡翅放回热锅中，用高火煎至金黄色。\r\n享受吧！"},{"id":"53399","n":"Firni","a":"","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/dm8kee1779553541.jpg","y":"https://www.bing.com/videos/riverview/relatedvideo?q=youtube+firni&&mid=5A8ED1B70031EFA59BF85A8ED1B70031EFA59BF8&churl=https%3a%2f%2fwww.youtube.com%2fchannel%2fUCoucq1SZiQoAL2KY5CT9ESg&FORM=VAMGZC","i":[["Whole Milk","6 cups"],["Cornstarch","5 tblsp"],["Sugar","1 1/2 cups"],["Ground Cardomom","1/2 tsp"],["Rose water","1 tsp"],["Almonds","Handful"],["Pistachio","Handful"]],"s":"Pour 1 cup of milk into a small bowl, add the cornstarch and whisk them well until smooth.\r\n\r\nPour the rest of the milk into a non-stick saucepan, adding the sugar and cardamom (and rosewater, if desired) whilst cooking over medium heat.\r\n\r\nBefore it starts to boil, slowly add the milk and cornstarch mixture to the pan, whisking constantly to avoid lumps. Keep stirring until the mixture increases in thickness.\r\n\r\nTake the pan off the heat and pour into a large shallow serving bowl. Let it cool at room temperature, and then put in the refrigerator for about 1 – 2 hours.\r\n\r\nFinally, sprinkle your Firni with sliced almonds and pistachios and serve!","z":"将 1 杯牛奶倒入小碗中，加入玉米淀粉，搅拌至光滑。\r\n\r\n将剩余的牛奶倒入不粘锅中，加入糖和小豆蔻（如果需要，还可以加入玫瑰水），同时用中火烹饪。\r\n\r\n在开始沸腾之前，将牛奶和玉米淀粉混合物慢慢加入锅中，不断搅拌以避免结块。继续搅拌直至混合物变稠。\r\n\r\n将锅从火上取下，倒入一个大的浅碗中。让它在室温下冷却，然后放入冰箱约1-2小时。\r\n\r\n最后，在 Firni 上撒上杏仁片和开心果即可食用！"},{"id":"53464","n":"Flemish Hutsepot","a":"","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/2lywl71782496853.jpg","y":"","i":[["Floury Potatoes","600g"],["Carrots","200g"],["Turnips","200g"],["Leek","250g"],["Sausages","4"],["Onion","1 small"],["Garlic","3 cloves"],["Bay Leaf","2"],["Thyme","4 sprigs"],["Chicken Stock","600ml"],["Mustard","1 tablespoon"],["Unsalted Butter","1 tablespoon"],["Salt","Pinch"],["Pepper","Pinch"]],"s":"1) Peel and chop the onion and garlic. Add both to a large pan with the butter and place it over medium heat.\r\n\r\n2) Let the onion and garlic sweat for 5 minutes. Then add the chopped potatoes, bay leaves and thyme and stir well. Cook for another 5 minutes.\r\n\r\n3) In the meantime peel and slice the carrots. Peel the turnip. Dice it into bite-size pieces. Slice the leek in half lengthwise. Rinse it well to remove any sand. Add the vegetables to the potatoes and onion. Also add the mustard and chicken stock and season with pepper and salt.\r\n\r\n4) Stir all the ingredients well and cover the pan with a lid. Cook the hutsepot for about 20 to 25 minutes or until all the vegetables and potatoes are tender. Stir regularly. Add extra water if necessary. In the meantime pan fry the sausages in a little oil or butter until golden brown and cooked through. Keep warm.\r\n\r\n5) Once the potatoes start to fall apart, stir and turn it all into a mushy and chunky vegetable stew. Check the seasoning and add extra pepper, salt or mustard to taste.\r\n\r\n6) Scoop the hutsepot onto deep plates and top with the sausage. Serve hot with an extra dollop of mustard if you like.","z":"1）洋葱和大蒜去皮切碎。将两者与黄油一起放入大平底锅中，然后用中火加热。\r\n\r\n2）让洋葱和大蒜发汗5分钟。然后加入切碎的土豆、月桂叶和百里香，搅拌均匀。再煮 5 分钟。\r\n\r\n3）同时将胡萝卜去皮切片。萝卜去皮。将其切成一口大小的块。将韭葱纵向切成两半。冲洗干净以除去沙子。将蔬菜加入土豆和洋葱中。还加入芥末和鸡汤，用胡椒和盐调味。\r\n\r\n4）将所有材料搅拌均匀，盖上锅盖。将 hutsepot 煮约 20 至 25 分钟，或直至所有蔬菜和土豆变软。定期搅拌。如有必要，添加额外的水。与此同时，用少许油或黄油将香肠煎至金黄色并煮熟。保持温暖。\r\n\r\n5）一旦土豆开始散开，搅拌并将其全部变成糊状的大块蔬菜炖菜。检查调味料，根据口味添加额外的胡椒、盐或芥末。\r\n\r\n6) 将 hutsepot 舀到深盘上，然后在上面放上香肠。如果你喜欢的话，可以趁热吃，再加一点芥末。"},{"id":"53413","n":"Flija Layered Pancake / Crepe","a":"","c":"Breakfast","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/eqnf3p1779649407.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=D2zlt4ZXAfA","i":[["Flour","1 kg"],["Water","1 L"],["Salt","1 tsp"],["Melted Butter","220g"],["Vegetable Oil","200ml"],["Greek Yogurt","5 tablespoons"],["Melted Butter","220g"],["Vegetable Oil","200ml"],["Clotted Cream","3  tablespoons"],["Melted Butter","220g"],["Sour Cream","500ml"],["Olive Oil","3  tablespoons"]],"s":"\r\n1\r\nPrepare the Flour Batter\r\nMix together the flour, water and salt ensuring all the lumps are dissolved. The mixture should be thick but still of a pouring consistency, add a little extra water if required. Put to one side.\r\n2\r\nPrepare the Batter Filling\r\nMix together the butter, oil and chosen yogurt / cream ensuring all the lumps are dissolved. The mixture should be runny, leave to rest for 10 minutes before given it another good mix. The consistency should be similar to custard. Put to one side.\r\n3\r\nBaking\r\nPreheat the gill to a medium setting (I use mark 4 of 6). Take a large deep baking tray or pie pan and rub some olive oil over the base. Make the first layer of flour batter using a squirty bottle or laydel, don't try to pour the batter as it will be too thick in the pan. You need to make a star effect by leaving triangles between each line of batter layers. Place under the grill until golden brown. This will take between 3 - 5 minutes.\r\n4\r\nRemove from under the grill and using a brush or the back of spoon rub over the whole pan (both battered and un-battered areas) a layer of the batter filling. Then, add a layer of the flour filling, use the same star effect this time placing the lines of batter through the gaps left from the previous layering. Also, leaving the same triangle shapes between each line. Place under the grill until golden brown. This will take between 3 - 5 minutes.\r\n5\r\nRepeat step 4 until all the mixture has been used and ensuring each triangle gap is filled with flour batter on each layer - this will take around 2 hours. After every couple of layers, use one layer just to fill up any spaces (large gaps between the batter stars) that may have started to show.\r\n6\r\nServing\r\nOnce the Flija is ready serve straight away with honey or yogurt.","z":"1\r\n准备面粉糊\r\n将面粉、水和盐混合在一起，确保所有块状物都溶解。混合物应该很稠，但仍具有倾倒稠度，如果需要，可添加一点额外的水。放在一侧。\r\n2\r\n准备面糊馅料\r\n将黄油、油和选定的酸奶/奶油混合在一起，确保所有块状物都溶解。混合物应该是流动的，静置 10 分钟，然后再进行一次充分的混合。稠度应该类似于蛋奶冻。放在一侧。\r\n3\r\n烘焙\r\n将鳃预热至中等温度（我使用第 4 个标记，共 6 个标记）。取一个大的深烤盘或馅饼盘，在底部涂上一些橄榄油。使用喷射瓶或laydel制作第一层面粉糊，不要尝试倒入面糊，因为它在锅中会太稠。您需要通过在面糊层的每行之间留下三角形来制作星形效果。放在烤架下直至金黄色。这将需要 3 - 5 分钟。\r\n4\r\n从烤架下方取出，用刷子或勺子背面在整个平底锅（包括面糊和未面糊的区域）上涂抹一层面糊馅料。然后，添加一层面粉馅，这次使用相同的星形效果，将面糊的线条穿过上一层留下的间隙。另外，在每条线之间留下相同的三角形。放在烤架下直至金黄色。这将需要 3 - 5 分钟。\r\n5\r\n重复步骤 4，直到所有混合物都用完，并确保每层上的每个三角形间隙都充满面粉糊 - 这将需要大约 2 小时。每涂几层后，使用一层来填充可能已经开始出现的任何空间（面糊星星之间的大间隙）。\r\n6\r\n服务\r\nFlija 准备好后，立即与蜂蜜或酸奶一起食用。"},{"id":"53509","n":"Fried Crab","a":"","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/rprcc51782774240.jpg","y":"","i":[["Crab Meay","1 lb"],["Onions","2 medium"],["Scotch Bonnet","1"],["Black Pepper","1/2 tsp"],["Salt","To taste"],["Oil","1/4 cup"]],"s":"Wash crabs and boil in large pot of water for 15 minutes, remove from boiling water and cool. Crack legs and open backs to remove all meat, set aside.\r\n\r\nRemove seeds from scotch bonnet pepper and dice pepper and onions. Sauté onions and scotch bonnet peppers in oil over medium heat until onions begin to get transparent. Add crab meat, black pepper and salt, stirring occasionally. Cook over medium heat for an additional 5 to 10 minutes.\r\n\r\nServe with “bread kind”, a local dish that consists of a variety of starchy vegetables including pumpkin, squash, plantain, potato, cassava and breadfruit.\r\n\r\nOptional: Seasoned crab meat may also be stuffed in cleaned crab backs and baked. Cover stuffed backs with foil paper and bake at 350 degrees for 30 minutes. ","z":"将螃蟹洗净，放入大锅水中煮15分钟，捞出冷却。敲开腿，打开背部，取出所有肉，放在一边。\r\n\r\n苏格兰帽辣椒去籽，将辣椒和洋葱切丁。用中火将洋葱和苏格兰帽辣椒炒至洋葱开始变透明。加入蟹肉、黑胡椒和盐，偶尔搅拌。用中火再煮 5 到 10 分钟。\r\n\r\n与“面包类”一起食用，这是一种当地菜肴，由各种淀粉类蔬菜组成，包括南瓜、南瓜、车前草、土豆、木薯和面包果。\r\n\r\n可选：调味过的蟹肉也可以填入干净的蟹背中烘烤。用箔纸盖住填充物的背面，并在 350 度的温度下烘烤 30 分钟。"},{"id":"53572","n":"Fried cocoy banana","a":"","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/u6wbby1784832845.jpg","y":"","i":[["Cinnamon","1 tablespoon"],["Cocoy Banana","7"],["Eggs","2"],["Breadcrumbs","1 1/2 cup"],["Vegetable Oil","5 Cups"]],"s":"Peel cocoys\r\nMix eggs and cinnamon in a bowl\r\nDip cocoy in mixture, then coat in the panko breadcrumbs\r\nHeat oil at medium heat\r\nPlace cocoy in hot oil\r\nTurn with a tong\r\nRemove from pan when golden brown","z":"剥椰壳\r\n将鸡蛋和肉桂粉放入碗中混合\r\n将椰子浸入混合物中，然后涂上panko面包屑\r\n用中火加热油\r\n将椰丝放入热油中\r\n用钳子转动\r\n当金黄色时从锅中取出"},{"id":"53553","n":"Frikadeller - Danish Meatballs","a":"","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/bnhfa71784662834.jpg","y":"","i":[["Onion","1 large"],["Garlic","1 clove"],["Minced Pork","500g"],["All purpose flour","1 tablespoon"],["Oats","1 tablespoon"],["Milk","1/2 cup"],["Egg","1"],["Salt","1 tablespoon"],["Ground Black Pepper","1 tsp"],["Butter","2 tablespoons"]],"s":"Finely chop onion and garlic.\r\nStir salt into minced meat. Add the dry ingredients, then onion and garlic, then the egg. and lastly the milk. Stir the meat mixture until it is firm. Refrigerate for at least 30 minutes. You can also make the mixture one day in advance and refrigerate.\r\nHeat a pan over medium heat. Add butter to the pan and use a spoon to form frikadeller (meatballs) in your preferred size. We recommend using about 2 tablespoons of mixture per frikadelle.\r\nFry until they develop a nice browned crust on both sides and are cooked all the way through.\r\nServe hot with a classic potato salad on the side.","z":"将洋葱和大蒜切碎。\r\n将盐拌入肉末中。加入干原料，然后加入洋葱和大蒜，然后加入鸡蛋。最后是牛奶。搅拌肉混合物直至变硬。冷藏至少 30 分钟。您也可以提前一天制作混合物并冷藏。\r\n用中火加热平底锅。在锅中加入黄油，然后用勺子将肉丸制成您喜欢的大小。我们建议每个炸薯条使用约 2 汤匙混合物。\r\n煎至两面都形成漂亮的棕色外皮并完全煮熟。\r\n趁热搭配经典的土豆沙拉。"},{"id":"53465","n":"Frog Legs Recipe in Garlic Butter","a":"","c":"Miscellaneous","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/qcprt21782497529.jpg","y":"","i":[["Frogs Legs","300g"],["Milk","3 Cups"],["Olive Oil","1 tablespoon"],["Garlic","1/2 tbs"],["Butter","2 tablespoons"],["Parsley","1 tablespoon"],["Salt","Pinch"],["Pepper","Pinch"]],"s":"1. Let the frog legs soak in the milk in the fridge for an hour (optional).\r\n\r\n2. Rinse the legs and pat them dry with kitchen paper.\r\n\r\n3. Add the olive oil and half of the garlic butter to a large wok or frying pan. Place it over high heat until the butter starts to foam. Don't let it burn.\r\n\r\n4. Add the frog legs to the pan. Pan fry them for about 10 minutes until they are golden brown on both sides. Turn the over regularly.\r\n\r\n5. Add the rest of the garlic butter right in the end together with the freshly chopped parsley. Season with a pinch of pepper and salt to taste.\r\n\r\n6. Divide the frog legs over plates. Serve with grilled bread and a green salad.","z":"1. 将青蛙腿放入冰箱的牛奶中浸泡一个小时（可选）。\r\n\r\n2.将腿洗净，用厨房用纸拍干。\r\n\r\n3. 将橄榄油和一半大蒜黄油放入大锅或煎锅中。将其放在高温下直至黄油开始起泡。不要让它燃烧。\r\n\r\n4. 将青蛙腿放入锅中。将它们煎约10分钟，直至两面金黄。定期翻面。\r\n\r\n5. 最后加入剩下的大蒜黄油和新鲜切碎的欧芹。用少许胡椒粉和盐调味。\r\n\r\n6. 将青蛙腿分放在盘子上。与烤面包和蔬菜沙拉一起食用。"},{"id":"53541","n":"Gallo pinto","a":"","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/ytogg31784397116.jpg","y":"","i":[["Black Beans","2/3 Cup"],["Rice","1 1/4 cup"],["Onion","2 tablespoons"],["Pepper","2 tablespoons"],["Cilantro","2 tablespoons"],["Salsa Lizano","1/2 tsp"],["Salt","1/2 tsp"],["Cumin","1/2 tsp"],["Pepper","1/4 tsp"]],"s":"Heat up a pan over medium high heat, add olive oil and let it get hot. Add onions, peppers, cilantro, garlic, cumin, salt and pepper, cook for 3 to 5 min until onion is translucent.  \r\nMix in the beans, stir and reduce heat to medium, add the Lizano sauce, stir and cook for 5 more minutes.\r\nAdd the rice, stir and cooked for a few more minutes, to incorporate all the flavors in the rice. The time to cook it I will depend of how you like your gallo pinto, some people like it a little wet and some other like it a little toasted or dry. \r\nI prefer it not too dry, so I cook it for about 5 to 7 min. ","z":"用中高火加热平底锅，加入橄榄油并加热。加入洋葱、辣椒、香菜、大蒜、小茴香、盐和胡椒，煮 3 至 5 分钟，直至洋葱半透明。  \r\n拌入豆子，搅拌并调至中火，加入 Lizano 酱，搅拌并再煮 5 分钟。\r\n加入米饭，搅拌并再煮几分钟，以将所有味道融入米饭中。煮它的时间我将取决于你喜欢你的加洛斑托，有些人喜欢有点湿，有些人喜欢有点烤或干。 \r\n我不喜欢太干，所以我煮了大约5到7分钟。"},{"id":"53578","n":"Gingerbread Waffles","a":"","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/0wmns51784837949.jpg","y":"","i":[["Flour","100ml"],["Dark Beer","200ml"],["Milk","50ml/2fl oz"],["Egg","1"],["Sugar","3  tablespoons"],["Salt","Pinch"],["Gingerbread Spice","1 teaspoon"],["Butter","1 tablespoon"]],"s":"beat egg and sugar into a light foam\r\nsift together flour, salt and gingerbread spice.\r\nAdd the dry ingredients to the wet mixture gradually while stirring\r\nAdd milk and beer while stirring\r\nadd melted butter\r\nLet set and bake waffles","z":"将鸡蛋和糖打成轻质泡沫\r\n将面粉、盐和姜饼香料一起过筛。\r\n将干成分逐渐添加到湿混合物中，同时搅拌\r\n边搅拌边加入牛奶和啤酒\r\n加入融化的黄油\r\n放置并烘烤华夫饼"},{"id":"53478","n":"Grilled corn with garlic mayo & grated cheese","a":"","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/k1if4d1782589892.jpg","y":"","i":[["Corn On The Cob","6"],["Garlic","2 cloves minced"],["Mayonnaise","6 tablespoons"],["Parmesan","4 tablespoons"],["Coriander","2 tablespoons"],["Lime","1"]],"s":"step 1\r\nBoil the corn cobs for 5 mins. Leave in the water until you’re ready to grill them. Mix the garlic and mayonnaise in a small bowl. Just before barbecuing, remove the cobs from the pan, pat dry and rub the mayonnaise into each one.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nSeason the cobs and grill them until marks appear, about 5 mins. Remove and scatter over the Parmesan and coriander. Squeeze lime over to serve.","z":"步骤1\r\n将玉米棒煮5分钟。留在水中直到你准备好烧烤它们。将大蒜和蛋黄酱放入一个小碗中混合。烧烤前，将玉米棒子从锅中取出，拍干并在每根玉米棒子上涂抹蛋黄酱。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将玉米棒子调味并烤至出现痕迹，大约需要 5 分钟。取出并撒上帕尔马干酪和香菜。挤上青柠即可食用。"},{"id":"53450","n":"Grits","a":"","c":"Breakfast","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/bfok4w1780242078.jpg","y":"","i":[["Grits","1/4 cup"],["Salt","1 tsp"],["Water","1 cup"]],"s":"Bring water with salt to a boil then add grits; reduce heat and cover. occasionally stirring. Cook approximately 15 minutes or until grits have desired consistency. Cool then serve","z":"将加盐的水煮沸，然后加入粗燕麦粉；减少热量并覆盖。偶尔搅拌。煮约 15 分钟或直至粗玉米粉达到所需的稠度。冷却即可食用"},{"id":"53397","n":"Haft Mewa Recipe","a":"","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/io2u3z1779551885.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mzv2JIg3TRA","i":[["Dried Apricots","110g"],["Light Raisins","50g"],["Raisins","110g"],["Walnuts","50g"],["Almonds","50g"],["Pistachio","50g"],["Cherry","50g"],["Rose water","Splash"]],"s":"Wash the apricots and both raisins and place in a bowl - cover with cold water to 5cm above the fruit.\r\n\r\nPut the walnuts, pistachos and almonds in another bowl or pan and add boiling water. Leave to soak, and then peel off all the skins as they soften. This is a fiddly job and make take some time - but it's definitely worth the effort! Throw away the water.\r\n\r\nCombine the fruits with the nuts and cherries, including the juice they have been soaking in. Add the rose water, cover the mixture and leave in the fridge to rest for two days. When you leave the mix, the juice will become sweeter and syrupy, giving the dish a really unique consistency.\r\n\r\nTo serve, spoon the fruit, nuts and juice into individual bowls or cups, and enjoy!","z":"将杏子和葡萄干洗净，放入碗中 - 用冷水覆盖至水果上方 5 厘米处。\r\n\r\n将核桃、开心果和杏仁放入另一个碗或锅中，加入沸水。浸泡，然后在软化时剥掉所有的皮。这是一项繁琐的工作，需要一些时间 - 但绝对值得付出努力！把水倒掉。\r\n\r\n将水果与坚果和樱桃混合，包括浸泡过的果汁。加入玫瑰水，盖上混合物，然后在冰箱中放置两天。当你离开混合物时，果汁会变得更甜和糖浆状，使这道菜具有真正独特的稠度。\r\n\r\n食用时，将水果、坚果和果汁舀入单独的碗或杯子中，然后享用！"},{"id":"53452","n":"Handesh – Bangladeshi rice flour and date molasses cakes","a":"","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/vfybi01780261706.jpg","y":"","i":[["Date Molasses","250g"],["Warm Water","400ml"],["Rice Flour","250g"],["Flour","150g"],["Ground Cinnamon","1/4 tsp"],["Ground Cardomom","1/4 tsp"]],"s":"Add the molasses to a large mixing bowl and begin by pouring 300ml of water to start with and whisk together. The texture of Bangladeshi molasses varies from a thick syrup to slightly set. I use brands such as Zilani or Akza. If the set is very syrupy (like golden syrup) you will only require 300–325ml of water\r\n2\r\nPour in the flours and spices (if using) and whisk for 3–5 minutes, until you have a smooth batter. You need to check carefully for lumps, as they prevent the handesh from rising and will cause them to split. Cover the batter and rest for 2 hours\r\n3\r\nAfter 2 hours, thoroughly whisk the batter until smooth, as the rice flour will have settled at the bottom of the bowl. The batter should have a fairly thick consistency, yet remain loose enough to pour – similar to thick pancake or waffle batter. It should form ribbons as you drag the whisk though it\r\n4\r\nTake a cast-iron korai or wok and add enough oil to half-fill the pan, or enough to deep-fry and turn the heat to high. Once the oil is hot reduce the heat to low–medium. Drop in a teaspoon of batter to test the oil – if it rises slowly to the surface the oil is ready\r\n5\r\nPour batter in a quick steady stream into the centre of the pan, preferably using a pyrex jug with a pouring spout (About 45ml of batter for each cake). It should rise to the surface in about 15–20 seconds and slowly puff up. If it rises too quickly, just turn the heat down slightly. Cook for 45 seconds, or until the underside is golden. Carefully turn over and cook for a further 30–45 seconds, until golden. Make sure to not let excess batter drip into the pan as this may prevent the cakes from rising and always fry one at a time\r\n6\r\nIf the batter splits while frying, whisk in 2 tablespoons of flour to the mixture and try again. You should be creating handesh which are about the size of a digestive biscuit\r\n7\r\nUse a slotted spoon to remove the handesh and place on kitchen towel with frilled edge facing down while you continue frying the reaming batter. This helps retain the shape of the cakes\r\n8\r\nEnjoy hot, fresh out of the pan. Once cool, place in an airtight container overnight and in the fridge for up to a week. Reheat in a warm oven for a few minutes to refresh or on a tawa or frying pan over a very low heat, turning a few times","z":"将糖蜜放入一个大搅拌碗中，首先倒入 300 毫升水并搅拌在一起。孟加拉国糖蜜的质地从浓稠糖浆到稍微凝固不等。我使用 Zilani 或 Akza 等品牌。如果套装非常糖浆（如金色糖浆），则只需要 300–325 毫升水\r\n2\r\n倒入面粉和香料（如果使用），搅拌 3-5 分钟，直至形成光滑的面糊。您需要仔细检查是否有肿块，因为它们会阻止手帕上升并导致手帕破裂。盖上面糊松弛2小时\r\n3\r\n2小时后，彻底搅拌面糊直至光滑，因为米粉会沉淀在碗底。面糊应该具有相当浓稠的稠度，但仍保持足够松散以便倒出——类似于厚煎饼或华夫饼面糊。当你拖动搅拌器穿过它时，它应该形成丝带\r\n4\r\n取一个铸铁高莱或炒锅，加入足够的油，将锅填满一半，或者足够油炸，然后将火调高。一旦油热，将热量降低至中低。倒入一茶匙面糊来测试油的情况——如果它慢慢上升到表面，说明油已经准备好了\r\n5\r\n将面糊快速稳定地倒入烤盘中央，最好使用带倾倒嘴的耐热玻璃壶（每个蛋糕约 45 毫升面糊）。它应该在大约 15-20 秒内升到表面并慢慢膨胀。如果它上升太快，只需将热量稍微调低即可。煮 45 秒，或直至底部呈金黄色。小心翻面，再煮 30-45 秒，直至呈金黄色。确保不要让多余的面糊滴入锅中，因为这可能会阻止蛋糕升起，并且每次只煎一个\r\n6\r\n如果面糊在煎炸时裂开，请在混合物中加入 2 汤匙面粉，然后再试一次。你应该制作大约消化饼干大小的handesh\r\n7\r\n用有槽的勺子取出手糊，放在厨房毛巾上，褶边朝下，同时继续煎铰孔面糊。这有助于保持蛋糕的形状\r\n8\r\n趁热享用，新鲜出锅。冷却后，放入密封容器中过夜，然后放入冰箱中最多一周。在温暖的烤箱中重新加热几分钟以恢复活力，或在塔瓦或煎锅上用非常低的热量重新加热，转动几次"},{"id":"53579","n":"Honey Cookies","a":"","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/yleo1y1784839077.jpg","y":"","i":[["Honey","50g"],["Rye Flour","300ml"],["Water","100ml"]],"s":"Dissolve honey into water\r\nAdd flour. Let set a few minutes. Knead the mixture for a short time. Using a teaspoon, form the dough into round buns/cakes and place on the greased or baking paper-lined oven plate\r\nBake at 200 C for 10-15 minutes","z":"将蜂蜜溶解在水中\r\n添加面粉。让我们设置几分钟。将混合物揉捏较短的时间。用茶匙将面团制成圆形面包/蛋糕，然后放在涂有油脂或衬有烘焙纸的烤盘上\r\n200℃烘烤10-15分钟"},{"id":"53552","n":"Hveder - Danish Wheat Buns","a":"","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/xceagx1784662211.jpg","y":"","i":[["Milk","1 cup"],["Yeast","25g"],["Eggs","2"],["Sugar","40g"],["Coarse Salt","1 tsp"],["Ground Cardomom","2 tsp"],["All purpose flour","500g"],["Butter","100g"],["Egg","For brushing"]],"s":"Heat milk in a saucepan until warm to the touch (25°C / 77℉). Transfer milk to a mixing bowl and dissolve the yeast in the milk.\r\nAdd the remaining ingredients except for the butter and knead thoroughly. Use a kitchen mixer to knead the dough if you have one.\r\nCut the butter into cubes and add to the dough. Knead for 5 to 10 minutes until the dough is elastic and smooth.\r\nCover the dough and let rise in a warm place for 45 minutes.\r\nTransfer the dough to a counter sprinkled with flour and divide into 10-12 pieces of equal size. Roll each piece into a round bun and arrange the buns close to each other on a lined roasting pan or oven-proof dish (approximately 20 x 30 cm). Cover the buns and let rise for approximately 1 hour until they double in size.\r\nHeat the oven to 180°C / 356℉ on fan setting.\r\nBeat the egg in a small bowl and brush the tops of the buns with egg. Bake on the middle oven rack for 14 to 16 minutes until the buns develop a nice golden surface. Serve warm or toasted with butter.","z":"在平底锅中加热牛奶，直至触感温热 (25°C / 77°F)。将牛奶转移到搅拌碗中，将酵母溶解在牛奶中。\r\n加入除黄油以外的其余成分并充分揉捏。如果有的话，可以使用厨房搅拌机来揉面团。\r\n将黄油切成方块并添加到面团中。揉捏5至10分钟，直至面团富有弹性且光滑。\r\n盖上面团并在温暖的地方发酵 45 分钟。\r\n将面团放到撒有面粉的案板上，分成大小相同的 10-12 块。将每块面包卷成圆形面包，然后将面包彼此靠近地放在有衬里的烤盘或耐热盘（约 20 x 30 厘米）上。盖上面包，发酵约 1 小时，直至体积加倍。\r\n在风扇设置下将烤箱加热至 180°C / 356°F。\r\n将鸡蛋打入小碗中，然后在面包顶部刷上鸡蛋液。在中间的烤架上烘烤 14 至 16 分钟，直到面包表面呈现出漂亮的金黄色。趁热食用或涂上黄油烤一下。"},{"id":"53436","n":"Jajek","a":"","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/8x0vgs1780090328.jpg","y":"","i":[["Yogurt","2 cups"],["Cold Water","1 cup"],["Garlic","1 clove peeled crushed"],["Salt","1/2 tsp"],["Dried Mint","1 tsp"],["Cucumber","1"]],"s":"Place yogurt, water, garlic and salt in food processor and process for a few seconds. Transfer to a bowl and mix with mint and cucumber.  Best served chilled for a few hours. \r\n\r\nWhen serving, add a few ice cubes to add additional refreshment!  Makes about four servings.","z":"将酸奶、水、大蒜和盐放入食品加工机中加工几秒钟。转移到碗中，与薄荷和黄瓜混合。  最好冷藏几个小时食用。 \r\n\r\n吃的时候，加几块冰块，更添清爽！  大约做四份。"},{"id":"53398","n":"Kadu Borani","a":"","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/walmi81779552709.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/DQmh54vl4LE","i":[["Squash","1 medium"],["Onion","5 chopped"],["Green Chilli","To taste"],["Oil","Splash"],["Turmeric","1 tsp"],["Garlic","1 Bulb"],["Sugar","7 tablespoons"],["Salt","1/2 tsp"],["Water","2 cups"],["Yogurt","4 tablespoons"]],"s":"Peel the squash and cut it into pieces 1cm wide. Deep fry it in oil until golden and set aside.\r\n\r\nUsing the same pan and oil, deep fry the onions until golden. Remove the onions and grind with the garlic (if using garlic paste, mix it into the onions once ground).\r\n\r\nAdd a small amount of oil to a pan on medium heat. Once hot, add the turmeric. Mix the salt into one cup of water and add it to the turmeric. Add a layer of squash, then a layer of onion and garlic. Repeat this step until the squash, onion and garlic have been used up.\r\n\r\nAdd the sugar and one cup of water. Turn the heat down and cook until the water has reduced.\r\n\r\nAdd 1-2 tablespoons of melted curd to a plate, add the squash on top with another layer of melted curd. At last, add some green chilli and serve!","z":"将南瓜去皮，切成1厘米宽的块。将其放入油中炸至金黄色，备用。\r\n\r\n使用相同的平底锅和油，将洋葱炸至金黄色。取出洋葱并与大蒜一起研磨（如果使用大蒜酱，则在研磨后将其与洋葱混合）。\r\n\r\n在平底锅中加入少量油，用中火加热。一旦热，加入姜黄。将盐混合到一杯水中，然后添加到姜黄中。添加一层南瓜，然后添加一层洋葱和大蒜。重复此步骤，直到南瓜、洋葱和大蒜用完。\r\n\r\n添加糖和一杯水。把火调低，煮至水减少。\r\n\r\n将 1-2 汤匙融化的凝乳放入盘子中，将南瓜与另一层融化的凝乳放在上面。最后撒上一些青辣椒就可以上桌啦！"},{"id":"53445","n":"Kaspressknödel - Cheese Dumplings","a":"","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/x26z3y1780155760.jpg","y":"","i":[["Bread","250g"],["Cheese","250g"],["Eggs","2"],["Salt","Pinch"],["Parsley","Pinch"],["Potatoes","3"],["Flour","100g"],["Milk","250ml"],["Onion","1 small"],["Butter","For frying"]],"s":"Step 1\r\nMix the cubed white bread with the milk, season with salt, and let the mixture rest for a while.\r\n\r\nStep 2\r\nNow add the shredded potatoes, the grated cheese, eggs, and parsley.\r\n\r\nStep 3\r\nMelt the butter and fry the cubed onions until golden brown in colour and put into the mixture.\r\n\r\nStep 4\r\nAdd the flour and gently knead the dough. Shape it into round dumplings, gently press them flat and fry them on both sides in butter until golden brown.\r\n\r\nStep 5\r\nServe in clear broth.","z":"步骤1\r\n将切块的白面包与牛奶混合，加盐调味，然后让混合物静置一会儿。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n现在加入土豆丝、磨碎的奶酪、鸡蛋和欧芹。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n融化黄油，将切好的洋葱煎至金黄色，然后放入混合物中。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n加入面粉并轻轻揉捏面团。将其捏成圆形的饺子，轻轻压平，用黄油将其两面煎至金黄色。\r\n\r\n步骤5\r\n盛入清汤中。"},{"id":"53449","n":"Kelem dolmasi","a":"","c":"Lamb","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/7vdtqi1780160088.jpg","y":"","i":[["Lamb Mince","500g"],["Cabbage","1 large"],["Onion","8 oz"],["Salt","Pinch"],["Pepper","Pinch"],["Turmeric","1/2 tsp"],["Cinnamon","1/2 tsp"],["Cilantro","2 tablespoons"],["Dill","2 tablespoons"],["Rice","2 oz"],["Chickpeas","2 oz"],["Lamb Fat","3 oz"],["Tomato Puree","1 tablespoon"],["Water","3  tablespoons"]],"s":"First boil the rice for eight minutes. Meanwhile, peel and finely chop the onion. Then chop the herbs.\r\n\r\nThe recipe didn't really say what to do with the chickpeas (also known of course as garbanzo beans), beyond soaking them overnight and rinsing them. I used canned chickpeas, since I've never actually seen them dried. I decided to chop/mash them slightly so they would better incorporate into the filling.\r\n\r\n\r\nChickpeas (or garbanzo beans) roughly chopped\r\n\r\n\r\nNow mince the lamb (I used my mini food processor). Here's where I ran into another problem: what to do with the lamb fat this recipe calls for? Mince it? Melt it? Does lamb fat even melt? I decided to mince mine. Thankfully, my husband doesn't actually read this blog because he'd be horrified if he knew I put fat in the dolma on purpose.\r\n\r\n\r\nMinced lamb and its good friend, minced fat. Ew.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThe ingredients for the dolma stuffing include onion, cilantro, chickpeas and turmeric.\r\n\r\n\r\nAnyway, now get your hands into all that slimy raw meat and mix in the onion, spices, chickpeas, rice, chopped herbs and fat. Add a little salt and pepper for good measure. In fact, based on my results I would say to err on the side of a little extra salt and pepper.\r\n\r\n\r\nMix well with your hands until the stuffing looks something like this.\r\n\r\n\r\nFill the biggest saucepan you own with salted water and bring it to a boil over high heat. Now pull the outer leaves off of the cabbage (save them) and drop the rest of it, whole, into the water. Let it boil for three or four minutes, turning it if the water level isn't quite high enough to completely cover it.\r\n\r\nThe reason you are doing this is because it's difficult to get whole cabbage leaves off of an American cabbage. The cabbages you typically buy in our supermarkets come in very tight round balls, and because the leaves are crispy they will snap and crack when you try to pull them off in an un-blanched state. Blanching them for a few minutes makes it so they will come right off without tearing.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nNow carefully take the cabbage out of the water (but keep the water boiling) and let it cool for a minute or two so you don't burn your fingers. Carefully pull the leaves off the cabbage, cutting them at the base if you have to do so to loosen them. Try to get them off in one piece. If the inner leaves are still crispy, return the cabbage to the boiling water for another three or four minutes. Repeat until all of the useable leaves are free.\r\n\r\n\r\nBlanched cabbage leaves\r\n\r\n\r\nNow put the leaves on a cutting board and cut out the tough stalks (save them). Cut the largest leaves in half.\r\n\r\nRemove the tough inner stalk and set aside. Cut larger leaves in two.\r\n\r\nPut a heaping tablespoon of the filling in the middle of each leaf, making a short cylinder shape. Fold the ends over the filling, then roll tightly (as if you are making a tiny burrito).\r\n\r\n\r\nThis is not much of a cylinder, but you get the idea.\r\n\r\n\r\nFold the edges over ...\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThen roll, as if you were making a really small burrito.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nYour finished dolma should look kind of like this, only without the hole in the middle.\r\n\r\n\r\nPut all of the discarded cabbage leaves, stalks etc. into the bottom of a stockpot. I know, this seems a little strange. What you're basically going to be doing is steaming the dolma, with the discarded cabbage pieces forming the base of your steamer. Carefully place the dolma on the bed of cabbage leaves.\r\n\r\n\r\nThese dolma are resting on top of discarded cabbage leaves.\r\n\r\n\r\nAdd water to the stockpot up to about the top of the discarded leaves. Don't cover the dolma.\r\n\r\nNow here's where you have to get a bit creative. The dolma needs to be weighted down so it doesn't unwrap during cooking. I used a metal pie pan, and then I put my mortar on top of it. You could also use a dessert plate with something heavy on top of it, but it would need to be an oven-safe one.\r\n\r\n\r\nThe dolma need to be weighted down during cooking so they don't unwrap. Just improvise.\r\n\r\n\r\nBring the water to a boil, then simmer for 25 minutes.You might have to use your ears to figure out if the water is actually boiling; I personally couldn't see what was in my pot after I weighted it down.\r\n\r\nMeanwhile, make a simple tomato sauce out of the tomato paste and water. Heat it up for a few minutes over a medium flame. After the dolma have been cooking for 25 minutes, pour the sauce over them and cook for another five minutes.","z":"先把大米煮八分钟。同时把洋葱去皮切碎，再把香草切碎。\n\n菜谱里其实没说鹰嘴豆（也就是garbanzo beans）要怎么处理，只说提前一晚泡好、再冲洗干净。我用的是罐头鹰嘴豆，因为我从来没见过干的。我决定把它们稍微切碎、压一压，这样更容易拌进馅里。\n\n鹰嘴豆（garbanzo beans）粗粗切碎\n\n现在把羊肉剁成肉馅（我用的是迷你食物料理机）。到这里我又遇到了一个难题：菜谱里要加的羊油到底该怎么处理？剁碎？化开？羊油到底能不能化？最后我决定把羊油也剁碎。好在我老公从来不看这个博客，不然他知道我是故意往dolma里加肥油，肯定要吓坏了。\n\n剁好的羊肉和它的好朋友——剁碎的羊油。咦。\n\ndolma馅料的配料包括洋葱、香菜、鹰嘴豆和姜黄。\n\n好了，现在直接上手，把那团黏糊糊的生肉和洋葱、香料、鹰嘴豆、大米、切碎的香草、羊油一起拌匀。再加一点盐和胡椒调味。说实话，以我这次成品的经验，盐和胡椒宁可多放一点也别少放。\n\n用手充分拌匀，直到馅料看起来像这样。\n\n拿你家最大的深锅装满淡盐水，大火烧开。把卷心菜最外层的叶子剥下来（留着别扔），剩下的整颗放进开水里，煮三四分钟；如果水没完全没过菜，就翻个面。\n\n之所以要这么做，是因为美式卷心菜很难剥下完整的叶子。我们超市里卖的卷心菜都是包得很紧实的圆球，叶子又脆，生剥的话一掰就断。焯水几分钟，叶子就能整片剥下来不会破。\n\n小心地把卷心菜从水里捞出来（水继续开着），晾一两分钟别烫到手。然后小心地把叶子一片片剥下来，根部不好剥就用刀切一下。尽量保持每片完整。如果里面的叶子还很脆，就把菜放回开水里再煮三四分钟。重复直到所有能用的叶子都剥下来。\n\n焯好水的卷心菜叶\n\n把叶子放在案板上，切掉硬的菜梗（留着）。最大的叶子对半切开。\n\n去掉硬的菜梗放一边，大叶子切成两半。\n\n在每片叶子中间放满满一勺馅，捏成短圆柱形。把两端向馅上折起，然后卷紧（就像在卷一个超小的burrito）。\n\n这捏得不太像圆柱，不过你懂我的意思。\n\n把边折过来……\n\n然后卷起来，就像在卷一个超小的burrito。\n\n卷好的dolma大概长这样，只是中间没有那个洞。\n\n把所有不要的卷心菜叶、菜梗都铺到深锅底。我知道，这听起来有点怪。其实你就是在蒸dolma，那些碎菜叶就是蒸架。把卷好的dolma小心地码在菜叶上。\n\n这些dolma正躺在碎菜叶上。\n\n往锅里加水，加到差不多和碎菜叶齐平就行，不要没过dolma。\n\n接下来就得发挥点创意了。dolma煮的时候要用重物压住，不然会散开。我用了一个金属派盘，上面再压一个研钵。你也可以用甜品盘压上重物代替，不过盘子得是能进烤箱的那种。\n\ndolma煮的时候要压住防止散开，随手找家伙什就行。\n\n把水烧开，然后小火煮25分钟。压上重物后你可能看不见锅里的情况，那就靠耳朵听水开没开；反正我是看不见了。\n\n同时用番茄膏和水调一个简单的番茄酱汁，中火加热几分钟。dolma煮了25分钟后，把酱汁浇上去，再煮五分钟。"},{"id":"53494","n":"Keto Banitsa","a":"","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/8wynv41782686271.jpg","y":"","i":[["Eggs","4"],["Melted Butter","80g"],["Mozzarella","120g"],["Cream Cheese","30g"],["Baking Powder","1 tsp"],["Feta","60g"],["Sesame Seed","Topping"]],"s":"Preheat oven to 360 F (180 C)\r\nBeat eggs in a bowl, using a whisk ( no mixer needed).\r\nSlowly add the melted butter, whisking to incorporate.\r\nAdd the cheeses (mozzarella, feta and cream cheese), stir to combine. Then add the baking powder and whisk.\r\nGrease a 8×8 -inch square baking dish with butter and pour the mixture inside. Top with sesame seeds (optional).\r\nBake for 20 minutes, until golden.\r\nLet it cool for 5-10 minutes inside the pan, then cut into pieces and serve.\r\nKeep in the fridge for up to 3 days.","z":"将烤箱预热至 360 F (180 C)\r\n用搅拌器将鸡蛋打入碗中（无需搅拌机）。\r\n慢慢加入融化的黄油，搅拌均匀。\r\n加入奶酪（马苏里拉奶酪、羊乳酪和奶油奶酪），搅拌混合。然后加入发酵粉并搅拌。\r\n在 8×8 英寸的方形烤盘上涂上黄油，然后将混合物倒入其中。上面撒上芝麻（可选）。\r\n烤20分钟，直至金黄。\r\n让它在锅里冷却5-10分钟，然后切成块即可食用。\r\n放入冰箱最多可保存 3 天。"},{"id":"53502","n":"Khmer Banh Xeo – Cambodian Savory Pancake","a":"","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/xrv78g1782769859.jpg","y":"","i":[["Rice Flour","1 cup"],["Cornstarch","1/4 cup"],["Coconut Milk","1 1/4 cup"],["Water","3/4 cup"],["Ground Turmeric","1/2 tsp"],["Pork belly slices","1/2 lb"],["Bean Sprouts","1 cup"],["Onion","1/2"],["Vegetable Oil","2 tablespoons"],["Fish Sauce","Splash"]],"s":"Whisk together rice flour, cornstarch, coconut milk, water, and turmeric in a bowl until smooth, then let rest for 15 minutes—this hydrates the flour for better texture.\r\nHeat a 10-inch non-stick skillet over medium-high heat (375°F) and add 1/2 tablespoon of vegetable oil.\r\nSauté pork belly slices for 3–4 minutes until lightly browned, then push to one side of the skillet.\r\nAdd onion slices and cook for 1 minute until slightly softened.\r\nStir the batter briefly and pour about 1/2 cup into the skillet, immediately swirling to coat the bottom thinly.\r\nScatter bean sprouts over half of the pancake and cover the skillet with a lid for 2 minutes to steam the sprouts.\r\nUncover and cook for another 3–4 minutes until the edges curl and turn golden brown and crispy.\r\nFold the pancake in half over the bean sprouts using a spatula, then transfer to a plate.\r\nRepeat steps 2–8 with remaining batter and ingredients, adding oil as needed to prevent sticking.\r\nServe immediately with fish sauce for dipping.","z":"将米粉、玉米淀粉、椰奶、水和姜黄放入碗中搅拌直至光滑，然后静置 15 分钟，这样可以使面粉水合，质地更好。\r\n用中高温 (375°F) 加热 10 英寸不粘锅，并加入 1/2 汤匙植物油。\r\n将五花肉片炒 3-4 分钟，直至呈浅棕色，然后推到煎锅的一侧。\r\n加入洋葱片，煮 1 分钟直至稍微变软。\r\n短暂搅拌面糊，将约 1/2 杯倒入煎锅中，立即旋转，在底部涂上一层薄薄的面糊。\r\n将豆芽撒在半个饼上，盖上锅盖蒸2分钟。\r\n揭开盖子，再煮 3-4 分钟，直至边缘卷曲、变成金黄色、酥脆。\r\n用抹刀将煎饼对折在豆芽上，然后转移到盘子上。\r\n对剩余的面糊和配料重复步骤 2-8，根据需要添加油以防止粘连。\r\n立即与鱼露一起食用。"},{"id":"53434","n":"Koulenje","a":"","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/xajyjk1780091885.jpg","y":"","i":[["Flour","6 cups"],["Eggs","6 large"],["Baking Powder","2 1/2 Tbs"],["Melted Butter","1 cup"],["Salt","1 tablespoon"],["Milk","1 cup"],["Sugar","1 cup"],["Ground Mahleb","1 tablespoon"],["Egg","1"]],"s":"Sift flour, baking powder, salt, and sugar together. In a separate bowl, beat 6 eggs, then blend in the butter and milk.\r\n\r\nSprinkle one tablespoon of sev dzandig (black seeds) and all the mahleb on top of the dry ingredients. Make a hole in the center of the dry ingredients and pour the wet ingredients in all at once, mixing with a few strokes until the dough can be turned out onto a floured board. Add more flour if necessary; it shouldn't be too sticky.\r\n\r\nKnead the mixture gently, just a few times, and then roll it out until it is ½\" thick. Cut it into diamond shapes, circles, or long strips which can be rolled and braided into loaves. Prick each piece several times with a fork.\r\n\r\nBeat the seventh egg with additional sev dzandig (black seeds) added. Brush each piece of koulenje with this glaze and place on cookie sheet covered with baking parchment.\r\n\r\nBake at 400° for 12-15 minutes until slightly golden. Cool on a rack. These are best eaten warm. You can reheat them by wrapping in foil. ","z":"将面粉、泡打粉、盐和糖一起过筛。在另一个碗中，打 6 个鸡蛋，然后加入黄油和牛奶。\r\n\r\n将一汤匙 sev dzandig（黑种子）和所有 mahleb 撒在干原料上。在干原料的中心挖一个洞，然后将湿原料一次性倒入，搅拌几次，直到面团可以翻到撒了面粉的板上。如有必要，添加更多面粉；它不应该太粘。\r\n\r\n将混合物轻轻揉捏几次，然后将其擀成 ½ 英寸厚。将其切成菱形、圆形或长条，可以卷起来并编成面包。用叉子在每块上刺几次。\r\n\r\n将第七个鸡蛋加入额外的 sev dzandig（黑种子）中，打散。在每块 koulenje 上刷上这种釉料，然后放在覆盖有烘焙羊皮纸的饼干片上。\r\n\r\n以 400° 烘烤 12-15 分钟，直至略呈金黄色。放在架子上冷却。这些最好趁热吃。您可以用箔纸包裹来重新加热它们。"},{"id":"53408","n":"Kulaç Soda Bread","a":"","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/9aia021779646058.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=h05_zOhGedo","i":[["Flour","450g"],["Greek Yogurt","500g"],["Salt","1/2 tsp"],["Baking Powder","1 tsp"],["Olive Oil","Splash"]],"s":"1\r\nPrepare\r\nOn a large baking tray or a clean work surface, mix together the dry ingredients - flour, baking soda and salt.\r\n2\r\nMake a well in the middle and add the yogurt. Using your hands slowly combined the ingredients together to start to form a dough.\r\n3\r\nKneed the dough on a floured surface, adding extra flour if you find the texture too sticky. The dough is ready when it is of a pizza dough texture and still very slightly sticky, this should only take a few minutes.\r\n4\r\nOn a baking tray add a little oil and put the dough on top. Shape and flatten the dough into a circle shape ensuring the height of the dough is about 5cm.\r\n5\r\nCover the dough with a little bit of olive oil, ensure it is fully covered.\r\n6\r\nYou can bake the Kulaç as it is or you can create patterns which also helps with even cooking. The most common patterns are using the back of a fork to slightly press down to create line dents all over or spiking the dough with the fork.\r\n7\r\nBaking\r\nPlace on the bottom shelf of a pre heated oven. Bake for 40 minutes or until the dough is golden and firm to touch.\r\n8\r\nCooling\r\nOnce removed from the oven, stand upright or place on a cooling rack to allow the Kulaç to cool.\r\n9\r\nServing\r\nCut the Kulaç the way you would a cake into 8 slices. If you are serving warm you may want to snap and pull apart the bread with your hands instead.","z":"1\r\n准备\r\n在一个大烤盘或干净的工作台面上，将干原料（面粉、小苏打和盐）混合在一起。\r\n2\r\n在中间挖一个洞，然后加入酸奶。用手慢慢地将原料混合在一起，开始形成面团。\r\n3\r\n将面团放在撒有面粉的表面上，如果发现质地太粘，请添加额外的面粉。当面团具有披萨面团质地并且仍然非常粘时，面团就准备好了，这应该只需要几分钟。\r\n4\r\n在烤盘上加少许油，然后将面团放在上面。将面团整形并压扁成圆形，确保面团的高度约为5厘米。\r\n5\r\n在面团上覆盖一点橄榄油，确保完全覆盖。\r\n6\r\n您可以按原样烘烤 Kulaç，也可以创建图案，这也有助于均匀烹饪。最常见的模式是使用叉子的背面稍微向下压以在整个面团上形成线条凹痕或用叉子在面团上打钉。\r\n7\r\n烘焙\r\n放在预热烤箱的底架上。烘烤 40 分钟或直至面团呈金黄色且触感坚硬。\r\n8\r\n冷却\r\n从烤箱中取出后，直立或放在冷却架上，让 Kulaç 冷却。\r\n9\r\n服务\r\n像将蛋糕切成 8 片一样将 Kulaç 切成 8 片。如果您是热着吃的，您可能需要用手将面包折断并拉开。"},{"id":"53414","n":"Kurabie Butter Cookies","a":"","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/qidask1779650423.jpg","y":"","i":[["Flour","650g"],["Greek Yogurt","275ml"],["Eggs","3"],["Sugar","200g"],["Melted Butter","120g"],["Baking Powder","1 tsp"],["Vanilla Extract","1 drop"],["Egg","1"],["Melted Butter","10g"]],"s":"\r\n1\r\nPrepare the Dough\r\nIn a large mixing bowl add all the ingredients and mix together until a dough is formed. The dough should be stick - add extra flour if you find the mixture too sticky to work with.\r\n2\r\nUsing the extra melted butter, rub some over your hands before breaking the dough into 20 equal sized pieces and roll each piece into a ball. Before rolling each ball rub melted butter over your hands each time.\r\n3\r\nPlace the balls of dough onto a greased / lined baking tray 5cm apart - you will need to split the balls into two batches cooking one batch at a time.\r\n4\r\nCooking\r\nBrush eat ball with beaten egg and place in the oven at 180 degree for 20 minutes. The Kurabie will be a light golden colour and slightly squishy in the middle. Place on a cooling rack to cool.","z":"1\r\n准备面团\r\n在一个大搅拌碗中添加所有成分并混合在一起直至形成面团。面团应该是粘的——如果你发现混合物太粘而无法使用，请添加额外的面粉。\r\n2\r\n使用多余的融化黄油，在手上擦一些，然后将面团分成 20 个大小相等的块，并将每块滚成一个球。每次滚动每个球之前，请在手上涂上融化的黄油。\r\n3\r\n将面团球放在涂有油脂/有衬里的烤盘上，间隔 5 厘米 - 您需要将面团球分成两批，一次烹饪一批。\r\n4\r\n烹饪\r\n吃球上刷上打散的鸡蛋液，放入烤箱180度烤20分钟。 Kurabie 呈浅金色，中间稍软。放在冷却架上冷却。"},{"id":"53412","n":"Lakra me Mish Cabbage and Meat Stew","a":"","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/mobh1l1779648766.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KAsoWvGbpGk","i":[["Beef","500g"],["Cabbage","1 Diced"],["Paprika","2 tsp"],["Tomato Puree","3 tsp"],["Red Pepper","2 diced"],["Onion","1 Diced"],["Chilli Flakes","1/4 tsp"],["Salt","Pinch"],["Pepper","Pinch"],["Olive Oil","Splash"],["Boiling Water","1 L"]],"s":"\r\n1\r\nCooking\r\nAdd some olive oil to a saute pan or saucepan (one with a lid). One heated add in the onions, diced beef, red peppers and fry for 5 minutes stirring occasionally. The meat should be fully browned.\r\n2\r\nAdd the paprika, tomato puree, chilli flakes and season with salt and pepper. Mix together and continue to fry for 2 minutes.\r\n3\r\nAdd the cabbage and stir the mixture together. Fry the mixture while stirring occasionally for 3-5 minutes. Most of the oil should have burned away.\r\n4\r\nPour the boiling water into the pan, ensuring that the water level completely covers the cabbage, plus about 1 inch above it. Put on the lid and bring to the boil.\r\n5\r\nLeave to simmer for 2.5 hours. The stew is ready when the cabbage is soft and meat tender.\r\n6\r\nServing\r\nServe into wide bowls and leave to cool for 5 minutes.","z":"1\r\n烹饪\r\n在炒锅或平底锅（带盖的）中加入一些橄榄油。加热后加入洋葱、牛肉丁、红辣椒，炒5分钟，偶尔搅拌。肉应该完全变成棕色。\r\n2\r\n加入辣椒粉、番茄泥、辣椒片，用盐和胡椒调味。混合在一起，继续煎2分钟。\r\n3\r\n加入卷心菜并将混合物搅拌在一起。将混合物煎炸 3-5 分钟，同时偶尔搅拌。大部分油应该已经烧掉了。\r\n4\r\n将沸水倒入锅中，确保水位完全覆盖卷心菜，并高出卷心菜约1英寸。盖上盖子，煮沸。\r\n5\r\n煮2.5小时。当卷心菜变软、肉质变嫩时，炖菜就做好了。\r\n6\r\n服务\r\n盛入大碗中，冷却 5 分钟。"},{"id":"53407","n":"Lakror me Kungull Summer Squash Pie","a":"","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/ae4rwb1779645576.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k4aYxqlevGQ","i":[["Squash","2"],["Eggs","2"],["Flour","300g"],["Baking Powder","1/4 tsp"],["Olive Oil","Splash"]],"s":"\r\n1\r\nPreparation\r\nIn a mixing bowl mix together the summer squash, sugar, eggs and baking soda. Add the flour and continue to mix, you are looking for a thick sticky mixture. Add a bit more flour if the mixture is still thin and slightly runny.\r\n2\r\nIn a large round baking tray (about 2 inches deep) rub some olive oil over the base and edges.\r\n3\r\nScoop the mixture onto the tray and spread out evenly, then pour a small amount of olive oil onto you hand and rub it in circles gently over the top of the mixture. This should flatten it and leave it with a slightly shiny glossing.\r\n4\r\nCooking\r\nBake in the oven for 40 minutes on 180 degrees – the top should be a golden brown once cooked.\r\n5\r\nServing\r\nLeave to cool before slicing into squares and serving.","z":"1\r\n准备工作\r\n在搅拌碗中将西葫芦、糖、鸡蛋和小苏打混合在一起。添加面粉并继续混合，您正在寻找浓稠的粘稠混合物。如果混合物仍然稀薄且有点稀，则再加一点面粉。\r\n2\r\n在一个大的圆形烤盘（约 2 英寸深）中，在底部和边缘涂上一些橄榄油。\r\n3\r\n将混合物舀到托盘上并均匀铺开，然后将少量橄榄油倒在手上，并在混合物顶部轻轻打圈摩擦。这应该会使它变平并留下轻微闪亮的光泽。\r\n4\r\n烹饪\r\n在烤箱中以 180 度烘烤 40 分钟 - 煮熟后顶部应呈金黄色。\r\n5\r\n服务\r\n待冷却后切成方块并食用。"},{"id":"53427","n":"Lao Naem Khao","a":"","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/0dypw51779817467.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qDWN61Ib4A4","i":[["Jasmine Rice","3 Cups"],["Coconut","1"],["Oil","Splash"],["Sour Pork Sausage","2 cups"],["Pickled Garlics","2 diced"],["Lime","Juice of 1"],["Fish Sauce","2 tablespoons"],["Sugar","1 tablespoon"],["Onion","1 sliced"],["Shallots","1 sliced"],["Spring Onions","3 finely chopped"],["Cilantro","1 cup"],["Hot Mint","1/2 cup"],["Mint","1/2 cup"],["Roasted Peanut","1/4 cup"],["Vegetables","To serve"],["Lettuce","To serve"]],"s":"Slice the onion and shallots thinly. Let them soak in a ice water bath while preparing the rest of the meal.\r\n\r\nGrate the coconut. Put in a large bowl.\r\n\r\nAdd the coconut in a large bowl. Add the rice. Using your hands, mix the coconut and rice together.\r\n\r\nRoll the mixture to form 2-inch rice ball croquettes. \r\n\r\nHeat up the cooking oil in a pot or pan.\r\n\r\nBeat two eggs and a large bowl. Dip the balls into the egg mixture. Then, drop the balls into the cooking oil.\r\n\r\nAllow the balls to turn a dark amber brown color. Deep fry until crispy, crunchy, and golden. Remove and set on paper towel to drain excess oil.\r\n\r\nOnce cooled, break apart the rice balls and add into a larger bowl.\r\n\r\nDrain the onion and the shallots.\r\n\r\nMake sure you tear the pork sausage up into small pieces. You can use a knife too, but the traditional method is tearing.\r\n\r\nIn the large bowl, add in the onion, shallots, sour pork sausage, pickled garlic, lime juice, fish sauce, sugar, cilantro, hot mint, regular mint.\r\n\r\nTop with peanuts. Serve with Lettuce, dry chilli, and other fresh vegetables.\r\n\r\nPreserving Naem Khao Recipe\r\nNaem Khao can be kept in the refrigerator for 4 days. It can then be served chilled.\r\n\r\nIt should not be frozen. \r\n\r\nServing Naem Khao\r\nNam Khao is generally served with lettuce leaves and a variety of different herbs like hot mint, mint, basil, and perilla. ","z":"将洋葱和青葱切成薄片。让他们浸泡在冰水浴中，同时准备剩下的饭菜。\r\n\r\n将椰子磨碎。放入一个大碗中。\r\n\r\n将椰子放入一个大碗中。添加米饭。用手将椰子和米饭混合在一起。\r\n\r\n将混合物擀成2英寸的饭团炸丸子。 \r\n\r\n在锅或平底锅中加热食用油。\r\n\r\n打两个鸡蛋和一个大碗。将球浸入鸡蛋混合物中。然后，将球放入食用油中。\r\n\r\n让球变成深琥珀棕色。炸至酥脆、金黄。取出并放在纸巾上以排出多余的油。\r\n\r\n冷却后，将饭团分开并放入一个更大的碗中。\r\n\r\n将洋葱和青葱沥干。\r\n\r\n确保将猪肉香肠撕成小块。你也可以用刀，但传统的方法是撕。\r\n\r\n在大碗中加入洋葱、青葱、酸猪肉香肠、腌蒜、酸橙汁、鱼露、糖、香菜、热薄荷、普通薄荷。\r\n\r\n上面撒上花生。与生菜、干辣椒和其他新鲜蔬菜一起食用。\r\n\r\n保存 Naem Khao 食谱\r\nNaem Khao 可在冰箱中保存 4 天。然后可以冷藏后食用。\r\n\r\n它不应该被冻结。 \r\n\r\n服务纳姆考\r\nNam Khao 通常搭配生菜叶和各种不同的香草，如热薄荷、薄荷、罗勒和紫苏。"},{"id":"53426","n":"Lao Som Pak Pickled Cabbage","a":"","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/44pjrn1779814409.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0dkBqf0zj6M","i":[["Cabbage","1 large"],["Spring Onions","10"],["Water","16 oz"],["Salt","2 tablespoons"]],"s":"Cut the cabbage and chop it into 1 inch pieces\r\n\r\nPut the cabbage in a large bowl and add cold water to rinse.\r\n\r\nWash the cabbage. Rinse and drain three times.\r\n\r\nIn a large clean bowl, pour in the bottle of water.\r\n\r\nPut the cabbage and green onion into the salt water mixture. \r\n\r\nAdd in the salt.","z":"将卷心菜切碎，切成1英寸的片\r\n\r\n将卷心菜放入一个大碗中，加入冷水冲洗。\r\n\r\n洗净卷心菜。冲洗三遍，沥干水分。\r\n\r\n在一个干净的大碗中，倒入一瓶水。\r\n\r\n将卷心菜和葱放入盐水混合物中。 \r\n\r\n添加盐。"},{"id":"53424","n":"Laos Plantain Coconut Bake (Flourless Muffin)","a":"","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/x7cbsp1779811798.jpg","y":"","i":[["Coconut Cream","450ml"],["Plantain","4 large"],["Sugar","4 tablespoons"]],"s":"Preheat oven to 350 degrees.\r\nMash the plantains until it has a paste consistency.\r\nMix togher the coconut cream and granulated sugar. Mix well.\r\nAdd muffin liners to muffin pan.\r\nFill the mixture into muffin pan.\r\nBake for 45 minutes until baked all the way through.","z":"将烤箱预热至350度。\r\n将车前草捣碎直至呈糊状。\r\n将椰子奶油和砂糖混合在一起。搅拌均匀。\r\n将松饼衬垫添加到松饼盘中。\r\n将混合物倒入松饼盘中。\r\n烘烤 45 分钟，直至完全烤透。"},{"id":"53570","n":"Layered mango custard","a":"","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/u1gisz1784732667.jpg","y":"","i":[["Custard","1 ½ tbsp"],["Whipping Cream","3 Cups"],["Milk","3 Cups"],["Sugar","1/3 cup"],["Water","6 tablespoons"],["Vanilla Extract","1 ½ tbsp"],["Mint","Garnish"],["Mango","Garnish"],["Mango","Topping"],["Water","5 tablespoons"],["Sugar","To taste"]],"s":"For the pudding custard\r\nCombine water and gelatin in a bowl\r\nLet it rest for about 7-10 minutes\r\nCombine cream, milk and sugar and heat for a few minutes until all the sugar melts. Do not boil.\r\nTake it off the stovetop and let it rest for about 5 minutes\r\nAdd gelatin mixture and stir. Add vanilla essence.\r\nPour mixture into small glasses at an angle. It's really rich so the smaller glasses will help reduce the serving.\r\nTransfer to refrigerator to chill for a minimum of 4 hours. ( I kept mine in the refrigerator overnight) Please don't put it in the freezer.\r\nFor the mango puree\r\nWhen you're ready to add the mango purée to the top of the pudding, you can then start the process of preparing the puree\r\nUsing a blender or hand help mixer, purée mango chunks/slices\r\nStrain purée for a finer consistency\r\nYou can use puree as is or you can add some sugar for a little more sweetness\r\nTo make the puree like pudding\r\nAdd sugar to puree\r\nTransfer to a stove top and stir until sugar is dissolved. Remove from stovetop\r\nAdd gelatin mixture and stir consistently\r\nRemove chilled creamy custard from refrigerator and add mango puree mixture to the top of it\r\nChill for a minimum of 2 hours (longer is better)\r\nGarnish with mint and small mango pieces and serve","z":"对于布丁蛋奶冻\r\n将水和明胶放入碗中混合\r\n让它休息大约7-10分钟\r\n将奶油、牛奶和糖混合，加热几分钟直至所有糖融化。不要煮沸。\r\n将其从炉灶上取下并静置约 5 分钟\r\n加入明胶混合物并搅拌。添加香草精。\r\n将混合物以一定角度倒入小玻璃杯中。它真的很丰富，所以较小的杯子将有助于减少份量。\r\n转移到冰箱冷藏至少 4 小时。 （我把它放在冰箱里过夜）请不要把它放进冰箱里。\r\n对于芒果泥\r\n当您准备好将芒果泥添加到布丁的顶部时，您就可以开始准备果泥的过程\r\n使用搅拌机或手动搅拌机，将芒果块/片打成泥\r\n过滤果泥以获得更细腻的稠度\r\n您可以直接使用果泥，也可以添加一些糖以增加一点甜味\r\n使果泥像布丁一样\r\n将糖加入果泥中\r\n转移到炉顶并搅拌直至糖溶解。从炉灶上取下\r\n加入明胶混合物并持续搅拌\r\n从冰箱中取出冷藏的奶油蛋奶冻，然后在其顶部添加芒果泥混合物\r\n冷藏至少2小时（时间越长越好）\r\n用薄荷和小芒果片装饰即可食用"},{"id":"53519","n":"Leche Asada","a":"","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/fnh40v1782853788.jpg","y":"","i":[["Milk","1 quart"],["Lemon","Zest of 1"],["Cinnamon Stick","2"],["Eggs","4"],["Sugar","1/2 cup"]],"s":"Preheat oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).\r\n\r\nPour the milk into a saucepan along with the lemon zest and cinnamon sticks. Bring to a simmer over medium-high heat, then reduce heat to low, and cook for 5 minutes. Turn heat off, and allow to steep for 15 minutes.\r\n\r\nGently beat the eggs and sugar together until the sugar has dissolved. Slowly beat in 1 cup of the hot milk, a little at a time, until it has been incorporated. Stir the egg mixture back into the hot milk, pour in the pisco, and mix until well combined.\r\n\r\nPour the custard through a fine mesh sieve into a 2-quart ceramic casserole dish to remove the lemon zest and cinnamon. Bake in preheated oven until set, and browned on top, about 30 minutes. Chill before serving.","z":"将烤箱预热至 350 华氏度（175 摄氏度）。\r\n\r\n将牛奶与柠檬皮和肉桂条一起倒入锅中。用中高火煮沸，然后将火调至小火，煮 5 分钟。关掉暖气，浸泡 15 分钟。\r\n\r\n轻轻地将鸡蛋和糖搅拌在一起，直至糖溶解。慢慢地加入一杯热牛奶，一次一点点，直到完全混合。将鸡蛋混合物重新倒入热牛奶中搅拌，倒入皮斯科酒，搅拌直至充分混合。\r\n\r\n将蛋奶冻通过细网筛倒入 2 夸脱的陶瓷砂锅中，除去柠檬皮和肉桂。在预热的烤箱中烘烤约 30 分钟，直至凝固，顶部变成棕色。食用前先冷却。"},{"id":"53437","n":"Leg of Lamb Armenian-Style","a":"","c":"Lamb","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/vy6k391780090969.jpg","y":"","i":[["Lamb Leg","1"],["Garlic","1 Bulb"],["Garlic","1 Bulb"],["Parsley","1 1/2 cup"],["Onion","1 cup"],["Black Pepper","1 tablespoon"],["Balsamic Vinegar","1 cup"],["Olive Oil","1/2 cup"],["Mint","1/4 cup"],["Salt","To taste"]],"s":"Place all of the above ingredients into your roaster pan at least two days before you want to eat.  Stir occasionally throughout the days to distribute marinade evenly. Bake at a 350-degree oven for 1 hour to 1 1/2 hours or until meat is not red when sliced.  \r\n\r\nYou can also make these on skewers if you wish to go through the process of spearing the meat with other veggies to grill. Freezes well.","z":"至少在您想吃东西的前两天将上述所有原料放入烤盘中。  整天偶尔搅拌，使腌料分布均匀。在 350 度的烤箱中烘烤 1 小时至 1 1/2 小时，或直至切片时肉不再变红。  \r\n\r\n如果您想将肉与其他蔬菜一起烧烤，您也可以将它们串在串上。冻结得很好。"},{"id":"53467","n":"Liegeoise Salad","a":"","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/ji3mho1782499823.jpg","y":"","i":[["Potatoes","350g"],["Green Beans","200g"],["Eggs","2"],["Bacon","125g"],["Onion","2 tbs chopped"],["Olive Oil","3  tablespoons"],["White Wine Vinegar","2 tablespoons"],["Mustard","1 tsp"],["Parsley","2 tablespoons"],["Pepper","Pinch"],["Salt","Pinch"]],"s":"Scrub the potatoes well but don't peel them. Cut them into bite-size pieces. Add them to a large pan water and a pinch of salt. Bring it to a good boil. Cook the potatoes until tender and then remove them using a slotted spoon. Keep the potatoes at room temperature.\r\n\r\nTrim and clean the green beans. Add them to the pan of hot water you boiled the potatoes in. Cook the green beans until nearly tender (keep them crunchy). Strain and refresh them immediately under cold running tap water to stop the cooking process.\r\n\r\nAdd the bacon to a large non-stick pan and place it over medium heat. Cook the bacon for a couple of minutes until cooked through. Then take the pan off the heat and let the bacon cool down a little.\r\n\r\nCombine the olive oil, vinegar and mustard. Transfer the cooked potatoes, green beans, bacon, chopped onion, parsley and vinaigrette. Season with pepper and salt.\r\n\r\nStir well. Check the seasoning and add extra vinegar, pepper or salt to taste. Transfer the salad to a large serving bowl or 2 deep plates and garnish with the boiled eggs. Serve lukewarm.","z":"充分擦洗土豆，但不要削皮。将它们切成一口大小的块。将它们添加到一个大锅中，加水和少许盐。把它煮沸。将土豆煮至变软，然后用漏勺将其取出。将土豆保持在室温下。\r\n\r\n将青豆修剪并清洗干净。将它们放入煮土豆的热水锅中。将青豆煮至接近变软（保持它们松脆）。立即在冷自来水下过滤并刷新以停止烹饪过程。\r\n\r\n将培根放入一个大的不粘锅中，然后用中火加热。将培根煮几分钟直至煮熟。然后把锅关火，让培根稍微冷却一下。\r\n\r\n将橄榄油、醋和芥末混合。倒入煮熟的土豆、青豆、培根、切碎的洋葱、欧芹和油醋汁。用胡椒和盐调味。\r\n\r\n搅拌均匀。检查调味料，根据口味添加额外的醋、胡椒或盐。将沙拉转移到一个大碗或两个深盘中，并用煮鸡蛋装饰。温热食用。"},{"id":"53461","n":"Macaroni Pie","a":"","c":"Pasta","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/kpiu4t1782242131.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=38dxvOH7Z-s","i":[["Macaroni","250g"],["Butter","1 tablespoon"],["Cheddar Cheese","375g"],["Egg","1"],["Milk","250ml"],["Ground Onion","2 tsp"],["Mustard","1 tsp"],["Pepper","1 tsp"],["Salt","1 tsp"],["Cayenne Pepper","1/2 tsp"],["Breadcrumbs","2 tablespoons"],["Butter","2 tsp"],["Cheddar Cheese","2 tablespoons"]],"s":"Bring water to a boil and add the broken-up macaroni, elbows, and salt. Cook uncovered until tender but not overcooked (about 8 minutes).\r\n\r\nPreheat a moderately hot oven to 350F, 180C, or Gas Mark 4.\r\n\r\nDrain the macaroni thoroughly, put it back into the same hot saucepan cooked in, and mix in the butter.\r\n\r\nGrate the cheese and mix it with the macaroni while it is still warm.\r\n\r\nWhisk the egg until fluffy, and add the milk, onion powder, white pepper, salt, pepper sauce, and mustard. Pour in with the macaroni and mix.\r\n\r\nPlace in a greased ovenproof casserole dish. Top with butter, some grated cheese, and fine breadcrumbs. Bake in the center of the oven for about 30-45 minutes, depending on the dish’s depth.","z":"将水烧开，加入切碎的通心粉、肘部和盐。不盖盖子煮至软，但不要煮过头（约 8 分钟）。\r\n\r\n将中等温度的烤箱预热至 350F、180C 或 Gas Mark 4。\r\n\r\n彻底沥干通心粉，将其放回煮熟的同一个热锅中，并与黄油混合。\r\n\r\n将奶酪磨碎，趁热将其与通心粉混合。\r\n\r\n将鸡蛋搅拌至蓬松，加入牛奶、洋葱粉、白胡椒、盐、胡椒酱和芥末。倒入通心粉并混合。\r\n\r\n放入涂有油脂的耐热砂锅中。上面撒上黄油、一些磨碎的奶酪和细面包屑。在烤箱中央烘烤约 30-45 分钟，具体取决于菜肴的深度。"},{"id":"53504","n":"Macaroni Pudding","a":"","c":"Pasta","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/hbte551782770868.jpg","y":"","i":[["Macaroni","4 cups"],["Evaporated Milk","4 cups"],["Water","1 cup"],["Sugar","3 Cups"],["Salt","2 tsp"],["Eggs","4"],["Butter","1/4 cup"],["Raisins","1 cup"],["Nutmeg","2 1/2 Tsp"],["Vanilla","2 tablespoons"]],"s":"Add macaroni to large pan with sufficient water to cover (approximately 4 cups). Add salt and bring to boil until tender (approximately 25 -30 minutes). Meanwhile, beat eggs and sugar together, then add vanilla and nutmeg. Mix well and set aside. In a separate medium sauce pan, heat evaporated milk plus 1 cup of water and butter to almost a boiling point. Remove from heat and add to sugar mixture. Drain cooked macaroni. Add macaroni and raisins to the milk mixture and stir well. (This mixture will have quite a bit of liquid, but this will form a nice custard textured pudding once baked.)\r\n\r\nGrease a large baking dish with butter or margarine, add the macaroni mixture and sprinkle with additional nutmeg. Bake at 350° F for 1 hour or until golden brown. (Pudding should be firm enough to cut, but moist and not dry).","z":"将通心粉放入大锅中，加入足够的水覆盖（大约 4 杯）。加入盐，煮至变软（约 25 -30 分钟）。同时，将鸡蛋和糖搅拌在一起，然后加入香草和肉豆蔻。充分混合并放在一边。在另一个中等大小的平底锅中，将淡奶加 1 杯水和黄油加热至几乎沸点。从火上移开并添加到糖混合物中。煮熟的通心粉沥干。将通心粉和葡萄干加入牛奶混合物中，搅拌均匀。 （这种混合物会有相当多的液体，但烘烤后会形成美味的蛋奶冻质地的布丁。）\r\n\r\n在一个大烤盘上涂上黄油或人造黄油，加入通心粉混合物，并撒上额外的肉豆蔻。在 350° F 下烘烤 1 小时或直至呈金黄色。 （布丁应该足够坚硬以便切割，但要湿润而不是干燥）。"},{"id":"53472","n":"Madombi: Dumplings from Botswana","a":"","c":"Miscellaneous","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/bjeq6g1782505296.jpg","y":"","i":[["Warm Water","1 1/4 cup"],["Sugar","2 tsp"],["Yeast","2 1/2 Tsp"],["All purpose flour","3 Cups"],["Salt","1 1/2 tsp"]],"s":"This recipe requires a stew to steam the dumplings on top of, at abour 180℃ or 350℉, give or take (it doesn't have to be specific, but can't be very high or very love heat). You will add the dumplings in during the last thirty minutes of your stew's cooking time, They need to steam covered, so the stew should be in a lidded pot that is oven-proof.\r\nMix the dumpling dough\r\nIn a measuring cup, combine the warm water, sugar, and yeast. Leave until foamy, about 5 minutes.\r\nTo a stand mixer bowl, or a large bowl if mixing by hand, add the flour and salt. Stream in the water-yeast mixture while kneading.\r\nKnead for several minutes after the dough comes together, until a smooth ball of dough forms.\r\nLeave the dumpling dough to rise\r\nPlace the ball of dough in an oiled dough, cover, and leave to rise until doubled, about 1 hour.\r\nShape the dumplings\r\nDivide the risen ball of dough into 10 equal portions for large dumplings, or 12-14 portions for smaller dumplings.\r\nShape each portion of dough into a smooth, round ball.\r\nSteam the dumplings\r\nIn the last thirty minutes of cooking a stew, place the shaped dumplings right atop the stew. Push them down gently into the stew. Cover tightly and return to the oven for 25-30 minutes. The dumplings are done when they're risen and light golden.","z":"这个食谱需要在上面蒸饺子，温度大约是180℃或350℉，给或拿（不必具体，但不能很高或很喜欢加热）。您将在炖菜烹饪时间的最后三十分钟内添加饺子，它们需要用蒸汽覆盖，因此炖菜应该放在耐热的有盖锅中。\r\n将饺子面团搅拌均匀\r\n在量杯中，将温水、糖和酵母混合。静置约 5 分钟，直至形成泡沫。\r\n将面粉和盐放入立式搅拌机碗或大碗（如果用手搅拌）中。揉捏时加入水-酵母混合物。\r\n面团混合后揉几分钟，直到形成光滑的面团。\r\n让饺子面团发酵\r\n将面团放入涂了油的面团中，盖上盖子，发酵约 1 小时，直至两倍大。\r\n包出饺子的形状\r\n对于大饺子，将发酵好的面团分成 10 等份；对于小饺子，将面团分成 12-14 份。\r\n将面团的每一部分塑造成光滑的圆球。\r\n蒸饺子\r\n在煮炖菜的最后三十分钟，将成型的饺子放在炖菜上。轻轻地将它们推入炖菜中。盖紧盖子并返回烤箱烘烤 25-30 分钟。当饺子发酵成浅金黄色时，饺子就熟了。"},{"id":"53474","n":"Magwinya: Doughnut Bites from Botswana","a":"","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/4ae5tp1782506270.jpg","y":"","i":[["All purpose flour","300g"],["Warm Water","1/4 cup"],["Sugar","2 tablespoons"],["Yeast","1 1/2 tsp"],["Salt","1/4 tsp"],["Vegetable Oil","1 1/2 tsp"],["Ground Sugar","1/2 cup"],["Vegetable Oil","2 cups"]],"s":"Mix the dough\r\nIn a stand mixer bowl. add the water, sugar, and yeast. Leave to get foamy, about 5 minutes.\r\nAdd in the flour, salt, and vegetable oil.\r\nKnead with a dough hook until a smooth dough forms, about 5 minutes.\r\nLeave the dough to rise\r\nRemove the dough from the mixer bowl and form into a ball. Lightly mist the bowl with oil and replace the ball of dough into it. Cover the bowl and let rise in a warm place, 1 to 1½ hours, until doubled.\r\nShape and fry the doughnuts\r\nPreheat about 5cm (2\") of vegetable oil in a pot to 180℃ / 350℉ – you can use a smaller pot needing less oil to fill but cooking less doughnuts at a time, or a larger one and cook more each batch. I also like to set up a drying rack set over a paper-towel-lined sheet pan to drain the doughnuts on, so they stay crispy. You can also prep a plate with paper towels if you don't want to bother.\r\nWhen the oil is at temperature, use a cookie scoop or two regular tablespoons to form a piece of dough into a rough ball shape and place in the oil. Repeat for as many doughnuts as will fit in your pot without overcrowding.\r\nFry each doughnut for about a minute on each side, turning halfway through. Drain on prepared rack or paper towels.\r\nWhen the doughnuts have cooled slightly, sprinkle with powdered sugar.","z":"混合面团\r\n在立式搅拌机碗中。添加水、糖和酵母。静置约 5 分钟，直至起泡。\r\n加入面粉、盐和植物油。\r\n用面团钩揉捏，直到形成光滑的面团，大约需要 5 分钟。\r\n让面团发酵\r\n将面团从搅拌机碗中取出并形成一个球。在碗中轻轻喷上油，然后将面团放入其中。盖上碗，在温暖的地方发酵 1 至 1.5 小时，直至发酵至两倍大。\r\n将甜甜圈成型并煎炸\r\n将锅中约 5 厘米（2 英寸）的植物油预热至 180℃ / 350°F – 您可以使用较小的锅，需要较少的油，但一次烹饪较少的甜甜圈，或者使用较大的锅，每批烹饪更多的甜甜圈。我还喜欢在铺有纸巾的平底锅上设置一个晾衣架，以沥干甜甜圈，使甜甜圈保持酥脆。如果您不想打扰，也可以准备一个带有纸巾的盘子。\r\n当油达到一定温度时，用饼干勺或两个普通汤匙将一块面团形成粗糙的球形，然后放入油中。重复此操作，制作尽可能多的甜甜圈，以适应锅中的情况，而不会过度拥挤。\r\n将每个甜甜圈每面煎约一分钟，中途翻面。放在准备好的架子或纸巾上沥干。\r\n当甜甜圈稍微冷却后，撒上糖粉。"},{"id":"53538","n":"Mango Tropical Salsa","a":"","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/ukeksq1784395551.jpg","y":"","i":[["Red Onions","1/4 cup"],["Red Pepper","1/4 cup"],["Tomato","2 1/2 cups"],["Mango","1 1/2 cups"],["Avocado","1 cup"],["Cilantro","1/4 cup"],["Lime juice","1/3 cup"],["Salt","1 tsp"],["Black Pepper","1 tsp"]],"s":"In a large bowl, combine all the ingredients together, mix well! Cover and refrigerate for at least 15 min before serving. Serve with chips \r\n\r\nI recommend to make this salsa just 15 to 20 minutes before serving, it you make it to early it will get a little to soupy. Have everything chopped and ready and just put it together when your guest arrive. ","z":"在一个大碗中，将所有成分混合在一起，搅拌均匀！食用前盖上盖子并冷藏至少 15 分钟。与薯条一起食用 \r\n\r\n我建议在上菜前 15 到 20 分钟制作这种莎莎酱，如果你制作得太早，它会变得有点粘稠。将所有东西切碎并准备好，并在客人到达时将其放在一起。"},{"id":"53433","n":"Mango chow","a":"","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/8hx4fi1780087744.jpg","y":"","i":[["Mango","1/2"],["Spring Onions","1 chopped"],["Scotch Bonnet","1"],["Coriander","2 tablespoons"],["Lime","Zest and juice of 1"],["Salt","To taste"],["Pepper","To taste"]],"s":"Simply combine everything in a bowl and serve alongside just about anything.","z":"只需将所有东西放入碗中，然后与任何东西一起食用即可。"},{"id":"53515","n":"Manjar (Dulce de Leche)","a":"","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/tmc6ai1782851531.jpg","y":"","i":[["Milk","1 quart"],["Sugar","1 cup"],["Vanilla Extract","1/2 tsp"],["Baking Powder","1/4 tsp"]],"s":"Bring milk, sugar, and vanilla extract to a boil in a saucepan over high heat. Reduce heat to medium-low, continue cooking, and continuously stirring until milk has thickened and turned a caramel color, about 1 hour or more.\r\n\r\nStir in baking soda. Continue cooking until caramelized milk has reached a pudding consistency. Pour manjar into a bowl and cool completely in the refrigerator.","z":"将牛奶、糖和香草精放入平底锅中，用高温煮沸。将火调至中低，继续煮，并不断搅拌，直至牛奶变稠并变成焦糖色，大约需要 1 小时或更长时间。\r\n\r\n加入小苏打搅拌。继续烹饪，直到焦糖牛奶达到布丁的稠度。将manjar倒入碗中并在冰箱中完全冷却。"},{"id":"53402","n":"Mantu Afghan Dumpling","a":"","c":"Starter","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/oemdp11779556068.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/KTgAOhsTTC8","i":[["Plain Flour","450g"],["Water","225ml"],["Lamb","450g"],["Green Chilli","1"],["Onions","450g"],["Black Pepper","2 tblsp"],["Vegetable Oil","1 tablespoon"],["Tomato Puree","1 tablespoon"],["Strained Yoghurt","425ml"],["Coriander","Pinch"]],"s":"1. To prepare the dough, sift the flour with 1tsp of salt into a mixing bowl. Slowly mix in as much of the water is required, until a stiff dough is formed. Knead on a clean work surface for 5-10 minutes, until the dough is elastic and shiny. Cover with a damp cloth and set aside for about an hour. \r\n\r\n2. Put the chopped lamb, onions, chilli, 1 tsp salt, ground pepper and spices in a bowl and mix thoroughly. \r\n\r\n3. Divide the dough into 4 small balls, and roll out to a thickness of 1.5mm, cutting into 10cm squares. Into each square, place 1 heaped teaspoon of the lamb mixture.\r\n\r\n4. Take two opposite corners and bring them to join in the centre by nipping together firmly between your fingers, and then bring together to other two corners in the same manner. Note that the mantu should not be entirely closed, as the steam has to be penetrate and cook the filling!\r\n\r\n5. Using fat to grease the shelves of the steamer, place your mantu so that there is a small space between each one. Steam for 30-45 minutes over a medium heat. \r\n\r\n6. Meanwhile, make the tomato sauce. Heat the oil in a pan, add tomato puree, and bring to the boil. Stir and simmer on a low heat until the mantu are ready.\r\n\r\n7. Remove the mantu carefully from the steamer and place on a large, warm dish. Spoon the tomato sauce over the top, followed by the strained yoghurt, and sprinkle with chopped coriander to garnish. ","z":"1.准备面团时，将面粉和1茶匙盐一起过筛到搅拌碗中。慢慢地加入所需量的水，直到形成硬面团。在干净的工作面上揉5-10分钟，直到面团富有弹性和光泽。盖上湿布并放置约一个小时。 \r\n\r\n2. 将切好的羊肉、洋葱、辣椒、1茶匙盐、胡椒粉和香料放入碗中，搅拌均匀。 \r\n\r\n3. 将面团分成4个小球，擀成1.5毫米厚，切成10厘米见方。在每个方格中放入一茶匙羊肉混合物。\r\n\r\n4. 将两个相对的角用手指紧紧捏在一起，将它们连接到中心，然后以相同的方式将其他两个角连接在一起。请注意，Mantu 不应完全关闭，因为蒸汽必须渗透并煮熟馅料！\r\n\r\n5. 用油脂在蒸笼的架子上涂油，然后放置馒头，使每个馒头之间有一个小空间。中火蒸30-45分钟。 \r\n\r\n6.同时，制作番茄酱。在锅中加热油，加入番茄泥，煮沸。搅拌并小火煮至曼图准备好。\r\n\r\n7. 小心地将馒头从蒸笼中取出，放在一个大的热盘子上。将番茄酱舀到上面，然后倒入过滤过的酸奶，撒上切碎的香菜作为装饰。"},{"id":"53400","n":"Mastawa Lamb and Rice","a":"","c":"Lamb","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/4kzx4d1779554755.jpg","y":"","i":[["Lamb","700g"],["Onion","3 Medium"],["Turmeric","1 tsp"],["Orange","1 large"],["Rice","150g"],["Natural Yoghurt","500g"],["Garlic Clove","4 Cloves Crushed"],["Vegetable Oil","1 tblsp"],["Dried Dill","1 tablespoon"],["Black Pepper","1 tablespoon"],["Chickpeas","1 Can"],["Salt","To taste"]],"s":"1. Place the meat cut into pieces, in a large pan with the onions. Add the turmeric and enough water to cover. Bring to the boil then cook gently until the meat is very tender and can easily be removed from the bones. \r\n\r\n2. While the meat is cooking, cut the orange peel into thin match style pieces, removing as much pith as possible. Leave to soak in a bowl of water. \r\n\r\n3. When the meat is tender, remove from the pan and when cool enough, remove the meat from the bones and shred the meat into strips with your hands. Return the meat to the pan.\r\n\r\n4. Wash the short grain rice and then add to the pan with salt according to taste. The juices should cover the rice by about 2cm, add more water if necessary. Bring back to the boil, then reduce the heat to medium and cook with the lid off, stirring from time to time until the rice is \"al dente\" and the liquid is absorbed. \r\n\r\n5. Add the natural yoghurt, and stir in well but carefully. Fry the crushed cloves of garlic in the oil and add to the dish along with the dill, black pepper, the chickpeas and extra salt to taste.\r\n\r\n6. Mix in well, then cover the top of the pan with a clean thick cloth and the lid. Leave on a low heat for about half an hour to allow the flavours to absorb. \r\n\r\nEnjoy with some warm nan bread for extra comfort. ","z":"1.将切块的肉与洋葱一起放入大锅中。添加姜黄和足够的水以覆盖。煮沸，然后轻轻煮，直到肉变软并且可以轻松地从骨头上取下。 \r\n\r\n2. 在煮肉的同时，将橙皮切成火柴般的薄片，尽可能去除果核。浸泡在一碗水中。 \r\n\r\n3. 当肉变软时，将其从锅中取出，待冷却后，将肉从骨头上取下，用手将肉切成条。将肉放回锅中。\r\n\r\n4. 将短粒米洗净，然后根据口味加入盐。汁液应覆盖米饭约2厘米，必要时再加水。重新煮沸，然后将火调至中火，盖上盖子煮，不时搅拌，直到米饭“有嚼劲”并且液体被吸收。 \r\n\r\n5. 加入天然酸奶，小心搅拌均匀。将压碎的大蒜放入油中煎炸，然后与莳萝、黑胡椒、鹰嘴豆和额外的盐一起放入盘中。\r\n\r\n6. 充分混合，然后用干净的厚布盖住锅的顶部和盖子。小火加热约半小时，让味道吸收。 \r\n\r\n搭配一些热馕面包享用，倍感舒适。"},{"id":"53423","n":"Meang Nem","a":"","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/5rk8vc1779740302.jpg","y":"","i":[["Dried Shrimp","50g"],["Rice","40g"],["Coconut","100g"],["Orange Zest","20g"],["Chilli","3"],["Peanuts","50g"],["Pickled Scallion Heads","100g"],["Pickled Scallion Head Brine","30 ml"],["Galangal","25g"],["Shallots","30g"],["Orange Juice","20 ml"],["Lime juice","50 ml"],["Fish Sauce","50 ml"],["Palm Sugar","50g"]],"s":"Rinse the rice, soak in water for about 10 minutes, then drain well. Heat a wok or large skillet over medium heat. Add the rice and stir constantly until evenly dark golden brown and very fragrant, about 5 minutes. Transfer to a bowl to cool. Grind finely using a spice grinder or mortar and pestle, then sift through a fine mesh strainer to remove any large pieces. Set aside.\r\nThinly slice the shallots lengthwise. Finely chop the galangal, pickled scallion heads, chili peppers, and bitter orange zest. Coarsely grind the roasted peanuts. Heat a frying pan over low heat, add shredded coconut, and toast, stirring, for 2–3 minutes. Set aside.\r\nIn a large bowl, combine lime juice, bitter orange juice, palm sugar, pickled scallion brine, and fish sauce. Stir until fully dissolved and well mixed.\r\nIn a mixing bowl, combine dried shrimp, toasted coconut, chopped aromatics, and dressing. Mix well. Add roasted rice powder and stir again. Top with coarsely ground roasted peanuts.\r\nPlace the salad on a large plate. Let each guest spoon a little onto their own small plate, wrap in leafy greens with vegetables, and enjoy in bite-size portions.\r\nFor a vegetarian version, omit the dried shrimp and fish sauce. Season to taste with soy sauce and a pinch of sea salt, keeping the sweet-sour balance.","z":"将大米淘洗干净，用水浸泡约10分钟，然后沥干。用中火加热炒锅或大煎锅。加入米饭并不断搅拌，直至均匀呈深金黄色且非常香，大约需要 5 分钟。转移到碗中冷却。使用香料研磨机或研钵和研杵精细研磨，然后通过细网过滤器筛选以除去任何大块。放在一边。\r\n将青葱纵向切成薄片。将高良姜、腌葱头、辣椒和苦橙皮切碎。将烤好的花生粗磨。用小火加热煎锅，加入椰丝，搅拌烤面包 2-3 分钟。放在一边。\r\n在一个大碗中，混合酸橙汁、苦橙汁、棕榈糖、腌葱盐水和鱼露。搅拌直至完全溶解并充分混合。\r\n在搅拌碗中，将干虾、烤椰子、切碎的香料和调料混合。搅拌均匀。加入炒米粉，再次搅拌。上面放上粗磨的烤花生。\r\n将沙拉放在一个大盘子上。让每位客人用勺子舀一点到自己的小盘子里，用绿叶蔬菜和蔬菜包裹起来，然后一口大小地享用。\r\n对于素食版本，省略虾米和鱼露。用酱油和少许海盐调味，保持酸甜平衡。"},{"id":"53560","n":"Mini butter buns","a":"","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/l6hj9a1784668199.jpg","y":"","i":[["Bread Flour","4-5 pound"],["Milk","6 cups"],["Sugar","3  tablespoons"],["Instant Yeast","1 ½ tbsp"],["Salt","2 1/2 Tsp"],["Unsalted Butter","10 tblsp"],["Egg","2"]],"s":"Combine the flour, the sugar, yeast, and salt in a mixing bowl or large bowl\r\nAdd warm milk and start kneading dough\r\nOnce the dough is smooth and elastic, add the butter and continue kneading\r\nAllow the dough to rise in a covered bowl until it’s doubled in bulk, about 90 minutes.\r\nTurn the dough out onto a lightly floured surface, divide dough and round all of the pieces into smooth balls.\r\nLightly grease pans\r\nPlace dough on pan\r\nCover the pans, and let the loaves rise until they're puffy and soft\r\nUsing a brush, add egg whites to loaves\r\nTowards the end of the rising time, preheat the oven to 375°F\r\nUncover the loaves, and bake them for 28 to 32 minutes, until their crust is golden brown\r\nRemove from oven and enjoy","z":"将面粉、糖、酵母和盐放入搅拌碗或大碗中混合\r\n加入温牛奶，开始揉面团\r\n面团光滑有弹性后，加入黄油，继续揉捏\r\n将面团放在有盖的碗中发酵约 90 分钟，直至体积翻倍。\r\n将面团放在撒有少许面粉的表面上，将面团分开，然后将所有面团揉成光滑的球。\r\n平底锅抹少许油\r\n将面团放在烤盘上\r\n盖上锅盖，让面包发酵直至变得蓬松柔软\r\n用刷子将蛋清加入面包中\r\n在上升时间即将结束时，将烤箱预热至 375°F\r\n揭开面包的盖子，烘烤 28 至 32 分钟，直至面包皮呈金黄色\r\n从烤箱中取出并享用"},{"id":"53403","n":"Muraba-E-Kadu (Pumpkin Jam)","a":"","c":"Miscellaneous","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/ug6bwk1779556566.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/0q1RvcqnVWA","i":[["Pumpkin","1 kg"],["Orange","1 kg"],["Sugar","750g"],["Cardamom","60g"]],"s":"1. Remove the skin of the pumpkin. Also remove the inner seeds.\r\n\r\n2. Cut the flesh into 2cm cubes.\r\n\r\n3. Take the zest off the oranges, with as little pith as possible, and cut into matchstick-sized strips.\r\n\r\n4. Extract the juice from the oranges. Remove the seeds from the cardamom pods and reserve.\r\n\r\n5. Place the pumpkin, orange juice, orange strips, sugar and whole cardamom pod seeds in a large pan, mix well and leave to marinate for about 10 hours or overnight. Stir occasionally.\r\n\r\n6. Bring the mixture to the boil, then reduce the heat and simmer until the liquid has thickened and become syrupy. This can take about an hour or a little bit longer.\r\n\r\nLeave to cool then place in clean, dry jars. Enjoy!","z":"1.将南瓜去皮。还要去掉里面的种子。\r\n\r\n2. 将果肉切成2厘米见方的块。\r\n\r\n3. 橙子去皮，尽量去掉果核，切成火柴棍大小的条。\r\n\r\n4.将橙子榨汁。从豆蔻荚中取出种子并保留。\r\n\r\n5. 将南瓜、橙汁、橙条、糖和整个小豆蔻种子放入大锅中，搅拌均匀，腌制约 10 小时或隔夜。偶尔搅拌一下。\r\n\r\n6. 将混合物煮沸，然后将火调小，煮至液体变稠并变成糖浆。这可能需要大约一个小时或更长时间。\r\n\r\n待冷却，然后放入干净、干燥的罐子中。享受！"},{"id":"53497","n":"Nom Banh Chok – Cambodian Noodle Soup","a":"","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/6g9gif1782688663.jpg","y":"","i":[["Water","8 cups"],["Chicken Thighs","1lb"],["Garlic","4 Cloves Crushed"],["Vegetable Oil","2 tablespoons"],["Fish Sauce","1 tablespoon"],["Salt","1 tsp"],["Sugar","1 tsp"],["Rice Noodles","8 oz"],["Bean Sprouts","2 cups"],["Mint","1 cup"],["Lime","1"],["Red Chilli","1"]],"s":"1. Heat the vegetable oil in a large pot over medium heat until it shimmers, about 2 minutes.\r\n2. Add the minced garlic and sauté until fragrant and lightly golden, about 1 minute, stirring constantly to prevent burning.\r\n3. Add the chicken pieces and cook until they turn opaque on all sides, about 5 minutes, stirring occasionally.\r\n4. Pour in the 8 cups of water and bring to a boil over high heat, which should take about 8 minutes.\r\n5. Reduce the heat to low, stir in the fish sauce, salt, and sugar, and simmer uncovered for 20 minutes to develop the flavors.\r\n6. While the broth simmers, cook the rice noodles according to package instructions until al dente, then drain and rinse under cold water to stop the cooking.\r\n7. Divide the cooked noodles evenly among four bowls.\r\n8. Ladle the hot broth and chicken over the noodles in each bowl.\r\n9. Top each bowl with bean sprouts, chopped mint leaves, and optional red chili slices.\r\n10. Serve immediately with lime wedges on the side for squeezing over the soup.","z":"1. 将植物油放入大锅中，用中火加热至闪烁，大约需要 2 分钟。\r\n2. 加入蒜末，炒香并呈浅金黄色，约1分钟，不断搅拌以防止烧焦。\r\n3. 加入鸡块，煮约 5 分钟，直至鸡块各面变得不透明，期间不时搅拌。\r\n4. 倒入8杯水，用大火煮沸，大约需要8分钟。\r\n5. 把火调小，加入鱼露、盐和糖，不盖锅盖煮20分钟以出味。\r\n6. 当肉汤煮沸时，根据包装说明将米粉煮至有嚼劲，然后沥干并用冷水冲洗以停止煮。\r\n7. 将煮熟的面条均匀地分在四个碗中。\r\n8. 将热汤和鸡肉舀到每个碗的面条上。\r\n9. 在每个碗上放上豆芽、切碎的薄荷叶和可选的红辣椒片。\r\n10. 立即上桌，旁边放上青柠角，挤在汤上。"},{"id":"53500","n":"Num Ansom – Sticky Rice Cake","a":"","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/fycrai1782690897.jpg","y":"","i":[["Glutinous Rice","2 cups"],["Coconut Milk","1 cup"],["Brown Sugar","1/2 cup"],["Salt","1/2 tsp"],["Banana Leaves","8"],["Mung Bean Paste","1 cup"]],"s":"1. Drain the soaked glutinous rice thoroughly in a fine-mesh strainer.\r\n2. In a medium bowl, combine the coconut milk, palm sugar, and salt, stirring until the sugar dissolves completely.\r\n3. Add the drained rice to the coconut milk mixture, mixing gently to coat every grain evenly. Let it sit for 15 minutes to absorb the liquid.\r\n4. Prepare a steamer by filling the bottom pot with 2 inches of water and bringing it to a boil over high heat.\r\n5. Lay a banana leaf square flat on your work surface, shiny side up. Spoon ¼ cup of the rice mixture into the center, spreading it into a 4-inch rectangle.\r\n6. Place 2 tablespoons of mung bean paste in a line down the middle of the rice rectangle.\r\n7. Fold the banana leaf over the filling lengthwise, then fold in the sides to create a tight parcel. Tip: Press firmly to compact the rice, which helps it hold its shape during steaming.\r\n8. Secure the parcel with kitchen twine, tying it firmly but not too tight to allow for expansion.\r\n9. Repeat steps 5–8 with the remaining ingredients to make 8 parcels total.\r\n10. Arrange the parcels in a single layer in the steamer basket, leaving small gaps between them for steam circulation.\r\n11. Cover the steamer and steam over medium heat for 90 minutes, checking halfway to ensure the water hasn’t boiled dry—add more hot water if needed. Tip: The parcels are done when the banana leaves turn a deep green and the rice feels firm to the touch.\r\n12. Carefully remove the parcels from the steamer and let them cool for 20 minutes before unwrapping. Tip: Cooling sets the texture, making slicing cleaner.\r\n13. Unwrap the banana leaves and slice each parcel into 1-inch thick rounds for serving.","z":"1. 将浸泡好的糯米放入细网筛中彻底滤干。\r\n2. 在一个中等大小的碗中，混合椰奶、棕榈糖和盐，搅拌直至糖完全溶解。\r\n3. 将沥干的米加入椰奶混合物中，轻轻搅拌，使每粒米均匀地裹上。让它静置 15 分钟以吸收液体。\r\n4.准备一个蒸锅，在底锅中倒入2英寸深的水，然后用大火将其煮沸。\r\n5. 将一片香蕉叶平放在工作台面上，光面朝上。将 ¼ 杯米饭混合物舀到中心，将其铺成 4 英寸的矩形。\r\n6. 将 2 汤匙绿豆酱沿着米长方形的中间排成一行。\r\n7. 将香蕉叶纵向折叠在馅料上，然后向两侧折叠以形成紧密的包裹。提示：用力按压米饭以压实米饭，这有助于米饭在蒸煮过程中保持形状。\r\n8. 用厨房麻线将包裹固定，系紧但不要太紧以免膨胀。\r\n9. 对剩余原料重复步骤 5-8，总共制作 8 包。\r\n10. 将包裹单层放入蒸笼中，之间留有小间隙，以便蒸汽循环。\r\n11. 盖上蒸锅，中火蒸90分钟，中途检查确保水没有烧干——如果需要的话可以添加更多热水。提示：当香蕉叶变成深绿色并且米饭摸起来很硬时，包裹就完成了。\r\n12. 小心地将包裹从蒸笼中取出，让其冷却 20 分钟，然后再打开包装。提示：冷却会凝固纹理，使切片更干净。\r\n13. 打开香蕉叶，将每个香蕉叶切成 1 英寸厚的圆形即可食用。"},{"id":"53422","n":"Num E (Sticky Rice Balls in Sugar Syrup and Coconut Cream)","a":"","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/5572yt1779739329.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RDlkKhMho90","i":[["Sticky Rice Flour","700g"],["Pandan Leaves","7"],["Beetroot","1/4"],["Pumpkin","100g"],["Taro","100g"],["Longan","100g"],["Coconut","200g"],["Water","2L"],["Water","1 L"],["Salt","1/2 tsp"],["Ginger","5 Slices"],["Coconut Cream","3 Cups"]],"s":"Place coconut cream in a small pot over low heat. Cut 3 pandan leaves into large strips and add to the pot with brown sugar, salt, and ginger. Bring to a boil, then cook 2 more minutes. Turn off the heat, remove the pandan leaves, and let cool.\r\nChop the remaining 4 pandan leaves, blend with ¼ cup water until very green, then strain well. In a bowl, place 200 g sticky rice flour, add a little pandan liquid, and knead until smooth.\r\nPeel and chop beetroot, blend with ¼ cup water until red, then strain well. In a bowl, place 200 g sticky rice flour, add a little beetroot liquid, and knead until smooth.\r\nBring 3 litres of water to a boil in a medium–large pot. Divide each dough into small pieces, roll into balls about ⅓ the size of a ping pong ball, then drop into boiling water. When they float, remove and place them into fresh, icy water to keep them separate.\r\nDrain well, then place the mixed colored balls into the cooled coconut sugar syrup and stir. Serve in small bowls (add longan and shredded coconut as desired).\r\nAdd the coloring liquids gradually—each flour absorbs differently. You want a dough that’s smooth and pliable, not sticky.","z":"将椰子奶油放入小锅中，用小火加热。将 3 片香兰叶切成大条，与红糖、盐和姜一起放入锅中。煮沸，然后再煮 2 分钟。关火，取出香兰叶，待凉。\r\n将剩余的 4 片班兰叶切碎，与 1/4 杯水混合直至呈绿色，然后滤干。将200克糯米粉放入碗中，加入少许香兰液，揉至光滑。\r\n甜菜根去皮切碎，与 1/4 杯水混合直至呈红色，然后过滤均匀。在碗中放入200克糯米粉，加入少许甜菜根液，揉至光滑。\r\n在中型锅中将 3 升水煮沸。将每个面团分成小块，搓成约⅓乒乓球大小的球，然后放入沸水中。当它们漂浮时，将它们取出并放入新鲜的冰水中以保持它们分开。\r\n沥干水分，然后将混合的彩色球放入冷却的椰子糖浆中并搅拌。盛入小碗中（根据需要添加龙眼和椰丝）。\r\n逐渐添加着色液体——每种面粉的吸收能力不同。你想要一个光滑、柔韧、不粘的面团。"},{"id":"53501","n":"Num Pang – Cambodian Baguette Sandwich","a":"","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/o93jur1782769321.jpg","y":"","i":[["Baguette","4"],["Chicken Thighs","1 lb"],["Soy Sauce","1/4 cup"],["Honey","2 tablespoons"],["Vegetable Oil","2 tablespoons"],["Carrots","1/2 cup"],["Daikon Radish","1/2 cup"],["Rice Vinegar","1/4 cup"],["Sugar","1 tablespoon"],["Mayonnaise","1/4 cup"],["Sriracha","1 tablespoon"],["Cilantro Leaves","1/2 cup"],["Cucumber","1/4 cup"]],"s":"1. In a medium bowl, whisk together the soy sauce and honey to create a marinade.\r\n2. Add the chicken thigh strips to the marinade, ensuring each piece is fully coated, and let it sit for 20 minutes at room temperature.\r\n3. While the chicken marinates, combine the julienned carrots, daikon radish, rice vinegar, and granulated sugar in a separate bowl, stirring until the sugar dissolves to pickle the vegetables.\r\n4. In a small bowl, mix the mayonnaise and sriracha sauce thoroughly to make a spicy aioli.\r\n5. Heat the vegetable oil in a large skillet or wok over medium-high heat until it shimmers, about 2 minutes.\r\n6. Add the marinated chicken strips to the hot skillet in a single layer, cooking for 4-5 minutes per side until they reach an internal temperature of 165°F and develop a golden-brown crust.\r\n7. While the chicken cooks, lightly toast the split baguettes in a toaster oven or under a broiler for 2-3 minutes until just crisp on the edges.\r\n8. Spread a generous layer of the spicy aioli on the inside of each toasted baguette.\r\n9. Drain the pickled carrots and daikon radish from their liquid, then layer them onto the bottom half of each baguette.\r\n10. Place the cooked chicken strips evenly over the pickled vegetables in each sandwich.\r\n11. Top the chicken with fresh cilantro leaves and thinly sliced cucumber.\r\n12. Close the sandwiches by pressing the top half of each baguette down gently.","z":"1. 在一个中等大小的碗中，将酱油和蜂蜜搅拌在一起，制成腌料。\r\n2. 将鸡腿条加入腌料中，确保每块鸡腿条都充分裹上腌料，并在室温下静置 20 分钟。\r\n3. 腌制鸡肉的同时，将切丝的胡萝卜、萝卜、米醋和砂糖放入另一个碗中，搅拌直至糖溶解以腌制蔬菜。\r\n4. 在一个小碗中，将蛋黄酱和是拉差酱充分混合，制成辣蒜泥蛋黄酱。\r\n5. 在大煎锅或炒锅中用中高火加热植物油，直至闪烁，大约 2 分钟。\r\n6. 将腌制好的鸡肉条单层放入热煎锅中，每面煎 4-5 分钟，直至内部温度达到 165°F 并形成金棕色外皮。\r\n7. 鸡肉煮熟时，将切开的法棍面包放入烤面包机或烤炉中轻轻烘烤 2-3 分钟，直至边缘变脆。\r\n8. 在每个烤法棍面包的内侧涂上一层厚厚的蒜泥蛋黄酱。\r\n9. 将腌好的胡萝卜和白萝卜沥干，然后将它们铺在每个法棍面包的下半部分上。\r\n10. 将煮熟的鸡肉条均匀地放在每个三明治的腌菜上。\r\n11. 在鸡肉上放上新鲜的香菜叶和切成薄片的黄瓜。\r\n12. 轻轻按下每个法棍面包的上半部分，将三明治闭合。"},{"id":"53551","n":"Old-fashioned Danish Apple Trifle","a":"","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/6aj3wy1784661564.jpg","y":"","i":[["Cooking Apples","800g"],["Water","1/4 cup"],["Vanilla Powder","1 tsp"],["Lemon Juice","1 tablespoon"],["Sugar","4 tablespoons"],["Butter","50g"],["Breadcrumbs","100g"],["Sugar","50g"],["Double Cream","3/4 cup"]],"s":"Peel and cut the apples into cubes. Discard the cores. Transfer apple cubes to a saucepan with water, vanilla and lemon juice. Bring apples to a boil, cover and reduce heat to medium-low.\r\nAdd the sugar to taste after the apples release their juices. The amount of sugar depends on the tartness of the apples and your preferred level of sweetness. Remember that the breadcrumb mixture and whipped cream are also sweet, so it is okay if the apple sauce is still a bit tart.\r\nCook the apples for about 15 minutes until you have a coarse apple sauce. If you prefer, cook the apples longer for a finer consistency.\r\nRefrigerate the applesauce.\r\nBreadcrumbs mixture:\r\n\r\nMelt butter in a pan. The butter must not brown. Add breadcrumbs and sugar and stir to combine.\r\nSlowly toast the mixture as you stir with a spatula. Do not heat the mixture for too long – it only takes a short time to make.\r\nOnce the breadcrumbs are lightly golden, remove from the pan and cool on a sheet of baking paper.\r\nAssembling the apple trifle:\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nDo not assemble the trifle until right before serving. Otherwise, the rasp will become soggy. Serve the trifle in individual small glasses or a large glass bowl.\r\nLightly whip the double cream.\r\nLayer the ingredients in the glasses or bowl, starting with breadcrumbs in the bottom, followed by chilled apple sauce and breadcrumbs again. You can make several layers of breadcrumbs and apple sauce, then top with a generous layer of whipped cream. Serve immediately.","z":"苹果去皮并切成方块。丢弃核心。将苹果块放入锅中，加入水、香草精和柠檬汁。将苹果煮沸，盖上盖子，将火调至中低。\r\n苹果出汁后加入糖调味。糖的用量取决于苹果的酸度和您喜欢的甜度。请记住，面包屑混合物和生奶油也是甜的，所以如果苹果酱仍然有点酸也没关系。\r\n将苹果煮约 15 分钟，直至形成粗苹果酱。如果您愿意，可以将苹果煮得更久，以获得更好的稠度。\r\n将苹果酱冷藏。\r\n面包屑混合物：\r\n\r\n在锅中融化黄油。黄油一定不能变成棕色。加入面包屑和糖，搅拌混合。\r\n用抹刀搅拌时慢慢烘烤混合物。不要将混合物加热太久——只需很短的时间即可完成。\r\n一旦面包屑呈浅金黄色，从锅中取出并在一张烘焙纸上冷却。\r\n组装苹果蛋糕：\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n上菜前不要组装蛋糕。否则，锉刀会变得潮湿。将小蛋糕放在单独的小玻璃杯或大玻璃碗中。\r\n轻轻搅打双倍奶油。\r\n将原料分层放入玻璃杯或碗中，从底部的面包屑开始，然后再次放入冷冻苹果酱和面包屑。您可以制作几层面包屑和苹果酱，然后在上面涂上一层厚厚的生奶油。立即上菜。"},{"id":"53554","n":"Open-faced Sandwich With Potato","a":"","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/wooxjq1784663522.jpg","y":"","i":[["New Potatoes","500g"],["Bacon","4 slices"],["Mayonnaise","4 tablespoons"],["Chives","Handful"],["Rye Bread","8 slices"],["Red Onions","2"],["All purpose flour","1/2 cup"],["Vegetable Oil","1 1/4 cup"],["Sea Salt","Pinch"]],"s":"Scrub the potatoes clean and place in a small saucepan with water and 1 tablespoon of salt. Bring to a boil and simmer the potatoes for about 10 minutes. Turn off the heat and let the potatoes stand in the water for 5 minutes. Drain the potatoes and allow to cool slightly. Remember that potatoes come in various sizes, so the cooking time may vary – if they do not easily glide off of a fork when speared and lifted out of the water, they are not done yet.\r\nFry bacon slices and transfer to a dish lined with paper towels.\r\nPeel the red onion and slice in thin rings.\r\nTransfer the flour to a bowl and toss the onions in the flour. Remove onions and shake off excess flour.\r\nHeat the oil in a saucepan over medium heat. You can test whether the oil is hot enough by adding a small piece of onion to the saucepan. If the oil bubbles around the onion, the oil is ready.\r\nTransfer as many onion rings to the saucepan as can fit in one layer. Do not add too many onion rings at once.\r\nFry the onions for a couple of minutes until they are golden brown. Transfer onions to a dish lined with paper towels and sprinkle with salt. Repeat the process until all onions are fried.\r\nButter a slice of dark rye bread and arrange round potato slices (or, if the potatoes are very small, halved potatoes) on top. Top your open potato sandwich with a good mayonnaise, crispy fried onions, fried bacon and sliced chives.","z":"将土豆擦洗干净，放入小锅中，加入水和一汤匙盐。煮沸后将土豆煮约 10 分钟。关掉火，让土豆在水中静置 5 分钟。将土豆沥干并稍微冷却。请记住，土豆有不同的大小，因此烹饪时间可能会有所不同 - 如果在用叉子刺入并从水中取出时它们不能轻易地从叉子上滑落，则它们还没有煮熟。\r\n煎培根片，然后转移到衬有纸巾的盘子中。\r\n将红洋葱去皮，切成薄圈。\r\n将面粉转移到碗中，然后将洋葱放入面粉中。取出洋葱并抖掉多余的面粉。\r\n在平底锅中用中火加热油。您可以通过在锅中加入一小块洋葱来测试油是否足够热。如果油在洋葱周围起泡，那么油就准备好了。\r\n将尽可能多的洋葱圈转移到平底锅中，尽可能多地放入一层。不要一次添加太多洋葱圈。\r\n将洋葱煎几分钟，直至呈金黄色。将洋葱转移到衬有纸巾的盘子中，撒上盐。重复这个过程，直到所有洋葱都炒熟。\r\n在一片黑麦面包上涂上黄油，然后在上面放上圆形土豆片（或者，如果土豆很小，则将土豆切成两半）。在开放式土豆三明治上放上美味的蛋黄酱、脆皮炸洋葱、炸培根和切细香葱。"},{"id":"53487","n":"Oyster Mushroom Soup","a":"","c":"Starter","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/0r7y5n1782681336.jpg","y":"","i":[["Oyster Mushrooms","1 lb"],["Butter","4 tablespoons"],["Salt","1 tsp"],["Water","1 cup"],["Flour","2 tablespoons"],["Milk","1 cup"],["Garlic","3 cloves"],["Red Wine Vinegar","1/3 cup"],["Red Pepper Flakes","Garnish"]],"s":"Clean mushrooms – I usually wash them under cold water, dry them and remove the stems.\r\nCut mushrooms into thin strips.\r\nMelt butter in a small pot. Add the mushrooms and cook for 10 minutes, until the mushrooms release liquid.\r\nCombine the flour and water, whisk to remove any lumps and add to the pot. Add the salt and milk.\r\nCook for 10 more minutes.\r\nIn a small bowl or jar combine the garlic and vinegar.\r\nServe the soup with 1-2 tablespoons (or more) of the garlic and vinegar mixture and hot red pepper.","z":"清洁蘑菇——我通常用冷水清洗它们，干燥并去除茎。\r\n将蘑菇切成细条。\r\n在小锅中融化黄油。加入蘑菇，煮 10 分钟，直到蘑菇释放液体。\r\n将面粉和水混合，搅拌除去任何结块，然后加入锅中。添加盐和牛奶。\r\n再煮10分钟。\r\n在一个小碗或罐子中将大蒜和醋混合。\r\n与 1-2 汤匙（或更多）大蒜和醋的混合物以及红辣椒一起上汤。"},{"id":"53417","n":"Pa Amb Tomaquet (Bread with Tomato)","a":"","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/lz9rw91779733434.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nFoQ5K-7_24","i":[["Bread","2 sliced"],["Garlic","2 cloves"],["Tomato","3 chopped"],["Extra Virgin Olive Oil","Splash"],["Sea Salt","To taste"]],"s":"Toast the bread slices -- either in a toaster, or by baking them in the oven at 400°F -- until crispy and golden.  (Toasting/baking time will totally depend on the type and thickness of your bread.)\r\n\r\nTake a clove of garlic and rub it cut-side-down all over the top of a slice of bread.\r\n\r\nTake a tomato half and rub it cut-side-down all over the top of the bread.\r\n\r\nDrizzle the bread evenly with a hint of olive oil.  Sprinkle with a pinch of salt.\r\n\r\nRepeat with the remaining slices of bread.  Then serve immediately while they're nice and warm!","z":"将面包片放入烤面包机或 400°F 的烤箱中烘烤，直至面包片变得酥脆金黄。  （烘烤/烘烤时间完全取决于面包的类型和厚度。）\r\n\r\n取一瓣大蒜，将其切面朝下涂抹在一片面包的顶部。\r\n\r\n取半个番茄，将其切面朝下涂抹在面包上。\r\n\r\n在面包上均匀地淋上少许橄榄油。  撒上少许盐。\r\n\r\n对剩下的面包片重复上述步骤。  然后趁它们又好又热的时候立即上桌！"},{"id":"53537","n":"Pan De Yucca","a":"","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/sumomx1784395153.jpg","y":"","i":[["Raw Yucca","3 Cups"],["Butter","1 knob"],["Sugar","3/4 cup"],["Eggs","3"],["Vanilla","1 tsp"],["Cream Cheese","1 cup"],["Flour","1 cup"],["Baking Powder","2 tsp"],["Salt","1/2 tsp"]],"s":"Preheat oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).\r\n​\r\nGrease and flour a 12 x 8' pyrex (you can use a smaller pyrex if you prefer the bread to be thicker). \r\nPeel and shred the yucca and set aside. In a medium bowl, combine flour, baking powder and salt and set aside. \r\n​\r\nIn a large bowl cream the butter with the sugar. Beat in the eggs, one at a time, then stir in the vanilla. \r\nAdd half of the dry ingredients and mix well, add cream cheese, mix well and, add the other half of the dry ingredients and mix well.\r\nWith a wooden spoon incorporate the shredded yucca, until well incorporated. \r\n\r\nPour or spoon batter into the prepared pan and cook for 45 to 55 min. ","z":"将烤箱预热至 350 华氏度（175 摄氏度）。\r\n​\r\n在 12 x 8' 耐热玻璃上涂上油脂并撒上面粉（如果您希望面包更厚，可以使用较小的耐热玻璃）。 \r\n将丝兰去皮并切碎，放在一边。在一个中等大小的碗中，将面粉、发酵粉和盐混合并放在一边。 \r\n​\r\n在一个大碗中，将黄油和糖打成奶油状。打入鸡蛋，一次一个，然后加入香草精搅拌。 \r\n加入一半的干原料，搅拌均匀，加入奶油芝士，搅拌均匀，加入另一半的干原料，搅拌均匀。\r\n用木勺将丝兰丝加入其中，直至充分混合。 \r\n\r\n将面糊倒入或用勺子倒入准备好的平底锅中，煮 45 至 55 分钟。"},{"id":"53534","n":"Papas Chorreadas Recipe (Potatoes with Cream and Cheese Sauce)","a":"","c":"Miscellaneous","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/v1n3cj1783805938.jpg","y":"","i":[["Red Potatoes","8"],["Chicken Stock Cube","1"],["Water","Splash"],["Butter","1 tablespoon"],["Vegetable Oil","1 tablespoon"],["Tomato","1 1/2 cup"],["Scallions","3"],["Garlic Powder","1/4 tsp"],["Cumin","1/4 tsp"],["Salt","1/4 tsp"],["Pepper","To taste"],["Whipping Cream","1 cup"],["Cilantro","1 tablespoon chopped"],["Mozzarella","1 cup"]],"s":"Place the potatoes and chicken bouillon in a medium saucepan. Cover with water and bring to a boil and cook about 30 minutes until tender. Drain and set a side.\r\nWhile the potatoes are cooking, heat the oil and butter in a frying pan over medium heat. Add onion and tomatoes, stir and cook about 7 minutes. Add garlic powder, cumin, salt and pepper. Stir and cook 2 minutes more.\r\n\r\nAdd cream, cilantro and cheese. Mix well and turn down the heat and cook for 3 minutes or until cheese has melted.\r\nIn a serving dish place the potatoes and pour the sauce on top. Serve them hot.","z":"将土豆和鸡汤放入中型平底锅中。加水盖住，煮沸约30分钟直至变软。沥干并放在一边。\r\n煮土豆的同时，在煎锅中用中火加热油和黄油。加入洋葱和西红柿，搅拌并煮约 7 分钟。加入大蒜粉、小茴香、盐和胡椒。搅拌并再煮 2 分钟。\r\n\r\n加入奶油、香菜和奶酪。搅拌均匀，关小火，煮 3 分钟或直至奶酪融化。\r\n将土豆放入盘子中，然后将酱汁倒在上面。趁热上桌。"},{"id":"53573","n":"Papaya salad","a":"","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/7ytdtz1784833420.jpg","y":"","i":[["Green Papaya","1/2"],["Lemon Juice","1 tablespoon"],["Salt","To taste"],["Carrots","1"],["Cherry Tomatoes","1 cup"],["Spring Onions","1/2 cup"],["Roasted Peanut","1/4 cup"],["Garlic","1 tablespoon"]],"s":"Cut, peel and shred papaya. I used a hand julienne shredder. If you don't have a shredder, use a grater.\r\n\r\nPeel and shred carrots.\r\n\r\nCut green onions really small\r\nSlice tomatoes down the middle\r\nI then combined all ingredients\r\nI topped it with the peanuts","z":"木瓜切块、去皮、切丝。我用的是手动切丝机。如果没有碎纸机，请使用刨丝器。\r\n\r\n胡萝卜去皮切丝。\r\n\r\n把大葱切得非常小\r\n将西红柿从中间切开\r\n然后我将所有成分混合在一起\r\n我在上面放了花生"},{"id":"53429","n":"Paracuca (Roasted Peanuts)","a":"","c":"Starter","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/vgsipt1779917593.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=G4OFO9c8jS8","i":[["Unsalted Peanuts","5 Cups"],["Sugar","1 cup"],["Water","1 cup"],["Salt","1/4 tsp"]],"s":"1\r\nIn a large heavy saucepan, combine the peanuts, sugar and water. Bring to a boil; cook until syrup has evaporated, about 10 minutes.\r\n2\r\nSpread peanuts in a single layer in a greased 15x10x1-in. baking pan; sprinkle with salt.\r\n3\r\nBake at 300° for 30-35 minutes or until dry and lightly browned. Cool completely. Store in an airtight container.","z":"1\r\n在一个大而重的平底锅中，将花生、糖和水混合。煮沸；煮约10分钟，直至糖浆蒸发。\r\n2\r\n将花生单层铺在涂有油脂的 15x10x1 英寸的容器中。烤盘；撒上盐。\r\n3\r\n在 300° 下烘烤 30-35 分钟或直至干燥并呈浅棕色。完全冷却。存放在密封容器中。"},{"id":"53520","n":"Pastel de Choclo","a":"","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/47abic1782854326.jpg","y":"","i":[["Eggs","2"],["Onions","2 chopped"],["Garlic","2 cloves minced"],["Salt","1 tsp"],["Paprika","1/2 tsp"],["Black Pepper","To taste"],["Ground Beef","1 lb"],["Chicken","1/2"],["Raisins","2 tablespoons"],["Green Olives","2 tablespoons"],["Sweetcorn","3 cans"],["Basil","2 tsp"],["Butter","1 tablespoon"],["Milk","1 cup"],["Sugar","2 tsp"],["Salt","To taste"]],"s":"Place eggs in a saucepan and cover with water. Bring to a boil, remove from heat, and let eggs stand in hot water for 15 minutes.\r\n\r\nMeanwhile, heat oil in a skillet over medium heat. Add onions, garlic, 1 pinch salt, ¼ teaspoon paprika, and black pepper; cook until fragrant, about 2 minutes. Add beef, remaining 1 teaspoon salt, remaining ¼ teaspoon paprika, and black pepper; cook and stir until beef mostly browned, about 5 minutes. Add chicken, raisins, and olives.\r\n\r\nRemove eggs from hot water, cool under cold running water, and peel. Roughly chop; add to beef mixture. Keep pino warm.\r\n\r\nCombine corn and basil in a blender or the bowl of a food processor; blend until smooth. Pour into a saucepan over medium heat. Add butter; cook and stir until thickened, 7 to 10 minutes. Stir in milk, 2 teaspoons sugar, and salt; cook until thickened to a paste, about 15 minutes more.\r\n\r\nPreheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).\r\n\r\nSpread pino into a baking dish. Cover with corn paste; sprinkle a little sugar on top.\r\n\r\nBake in the preheated oven until golden brown on top, about 20 minutes.","z":"将鸡蛋放入锅中，盖上水。煮沸，离火，让鸡蛋在热水中静置 15 分钟。\r\n\r\n与此同时，在平底锅中用中火加热油。加入洋葱、大蒜、1 撮盐、1/4 茶匙辣椒粉和黑胡椒；煮至香味四溢，约2分钟。加入牛肉、剩余的1茶匙盐、剩余的1/4茶匙辣椒粉和黑胡椒；煮并搅拌，直到牛肉大部分变成棕色，大约需要 5 分钟。加入鸡肉、葡萄干和橄榄。\r\n\r\n将鸡蛋从热水中取出，在冷水下冷却，然后剥皮。粗略地剁碎；添加到牛肉混合物中。保持皮诺温暖。\r\n\r\n将玉米和罗勒放入搅拌机或食品加工机的碗中混合；搅拌直至光滑。倒入平底锅中，用中火加热。加入黄油；煮7到10分钟，搅拌直至变稠。加入牛奶、2茶匙糖和盐，搅拌；再煮约15分钟，直至变稠成糊状。\r\n\r\n将烤箱预热至 350 华氏度（175 摄氏度）。\r\n\r\n将皮诺放入烤盘中。盖上玉米糊；在上面撒一点糖。\r\n\r\n放入预热好的烤箱中烘烤约20分钟，直至表面呈金黄色。"},{"id":"53517","n":"Pastel de Papas (Chilean Potato Pie)","a":"","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/h031jy1782853081.jpg","y":"","i":[["Potatoes","5 Cups"],["Butter","2 tablespoons"],["Salt","To taste"],["Eggs","2 Beaten"],["Vegetable Oil","1/2 cup"],["Onion","1 Diced"],["Garlic","1 clove peeled crushed"],["Tomato","2 diced"],["Tomato Puree","1 tablespoon"],["Ground Beef","1 lb"],["Panquehue Cheese","2 tablespoons"],["Parsley","1/2 tsp"],["Cayenne Pepper","1 pinch"],["Salt","To taste"],["Black Pepper","To taste"]],"s":"Place potatoes into a large pot and cover with salted water; bring to a boil. Reduce the heat to medium-low and simmer until tender, about 20 minutes.\r\n\r\nWhile the potatoes are cooking, heat oil in a large skillet over medium heat. Add onion; cook and stir until translucent, about 5 minutes, adding garlic for the last minute. Stir in diced tomatoes and tomato paste; cook until tomatoes soften and begin to lose their shape, 3 to 5 minutes.\r\n\r\nAdd ground beef to the skillet; cook and stir until browned and crumbly, about 10 minutes. Stir in Panquehue cheese, parsley, and cayenne pepper; season with salt and pepper. Turn off the heat and let sit until needed.\r\n\r\nPreheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Grease a 2-quart baking dish.\r\n\r\nDrain potatoes in a colander, then allow to steam dry for 1 to 2 minutes. Transfer potatoes back to the pot, add butter and salt, and mash until smooth. Let cool until just warm, 5 to 10 minutes, then stir in beaten egg.\r\n\r\nSpread 1/2 of the mashed potatoes over the bottom of the prepared baking dish. Layer ground beef mixture over top, then completely cover with remaining potatoes.\r\n\r\nBake in the preheated oven until potatoes are hot and lightly browned on top, about 40 minutes.","z":"将土豆放入大锅中，倒入盐水；煮沸。将火调至中低，煮约 20 分钟直至变软。\r\n\r\n煮土豆时，在大煎锅中用中火加热油。加入洋葱；煮约 5 分钟，搅拌直至半透明，最后一分钟加入大蒜。加入番茄丁和番茄酱搅拌；煮3到5分钟，直到西红柿变软并开始变形。\r\n\r\n将碎牛肉加入煎锅中；煮约 10 分钟，搅拌直至变成褐色且易碎。拌入 Panquehue 奶酪、欧芹和辣椒；用盐和胡椒调味。关掉暖气，静置直至需要为止。\r\n\r\n将烤箱预热至 350 华氏度（175 摄氏度）。在 2 夸脱的烤盘上涂上油脂。\r\n\r\n将土豆放入漏勺中沥干，然后蒸干 1 至 2 分钟。将土豆放回锅中，加入黄油和盐，捣碎至光滑。冷却 5 至 10 分钟，直至温热，然后拌入打散的鸡蛋。\r\n\r\n将 1/2 的土豆泥铺在准备好的烤盘底部。将碎牛肉混合物铺在上面，然后用剩余的土豆完全覆盖。\r\n\r\n在预热的烤箱中烘烤约 40 分钟，直至土豆变热且顶部呈浅棕色。"},{"id":"53471","n":"Phaphatha Flatbreads","a":"","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/um1phx1782504510.jpg","y":"","i":[["Flour","500g"],["Baking Powder","1 tablespoon"],["Salt","1 1/2 tsp"],["Sugar","2 tsp"],["Milk","1 cup"]],"s":"In a stand mixer bowl, combine the dry ingredients: flour, baking powder, salt, and sugar.\r\nWith the dough hook on low, drizzle in the milk.\r\nContinue to knead until a small ball of dough is formed.\r\nRemove the dough from the bowl, oil the bowl lightly, and return the ball of dough to the bowl. Cover and set aside to rest for 15-30 minutes.\r\nDivide the ball of dough into 12 portions, in roughly even lumps.\r\nHeat a small amount of oil in a large, flat skillet. Flatten a ball of dough with your palm and work it into a slightly larger round with the back of your hand, leaving it a thick round about 10cm (4\") in diameter. Place in the hot skillet. Repeat with as many rounds as will fit in your skillet.\r\nAfter 3-4 minutes, once the bottom is slightly browned in spots, flip and cook for another 1-2 minutes on the second side.","z":"在立式搅拌机碗中，混合干燥成分：面粉、泡打粉、盐和糖。\r\n将面团钩放在低处，淋上牛奶。\r\n继续揉捏，直到形成一个小面团。\r\n将面团从碗中取出，在碗上涂上少许油，然后将面团放回碗中。盖上盖子静置15-30分钟。\r\n将面团分成 12 份，大致均匀的块状。\r\n在一个大而平的煎锅中加热少量油。用手掌将面团压扁，然后用手背将其擀成稍大的圆形，使其成为直径约 10 厘米（4 英寸）的厚圆形。放入热煎锅中。根据煎锅的大小重复此操作。\r\n3-4分钟后，一旦底部有轻微的褐色斑点，翻转并在第二面再煮1-2分钟。"},{"id":"53539","n":"Picadillo de Vainicas (Green Beans Picadillo)","a":"","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/2ncui81784396094.jpg","y":"","i":[["Green Beans","1 lb"],["Flank Steak","2 cups"],["Onion","1/2 cup"],["Pepper","1/2 cup"],["Garlic","3 cloves"],["Thyme","1 tsp"],["Salt","1 tsp"],["Black Pepper","1/2 tsp"],["Water","1/2 cup"]],"s":"In a medium-size pot over medium heat add some olive oil, onions, pepper, and garlic and cook until onion is translucent.\r\nIn the meantime, finely chopped the green beans.\r\nAdd to the pot, the shredded meat, green beans, thyme, salt and pepper, and mix well. Add the water, cover and cook for 15 minutes, uncover and cook for 5 more minutes or until the green beans are soft. ","z":"在一个中等大小的锅中，用中火加入一些橄榄油、洋葱、胡椒和大蒜，煮至洋葱半透明。\r\n与此同时，将绿豆切碎。\r\n将肉丝、青豆、百里香、盐和胡椒加入锅中，搅拌均匀。加入水，盖上盖子煮 15 分钟，揭开盖子再煮 5 分钟或直至青豆变软。"},{"id":"53540","n":"Pollo en Salsa","a":"","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/4o13oe1784396585.jpg","y":"","i":[["Chicken Thighs","4"],["Oregano","1 tsp"],["Cumin","1 tsp"],["Salt","1 tsp"],["Pepper","1 tsp"],["Achiote Paste","1 1/2 tsp"],["Garlic","4 Cloves Crushed"],["Onion","1 medium"],["Tomato","1 large"],["Red Pepper","1/2"],["Chicken Stock","2 cups"]],"s":"Chopped pepper, onion and tomato and set aside. Turn on Instant Pot in sauteed setting for 8 minutes. Add a little bit of olive oil and add, onion, garlic, tomato, bell pepper, cumin, oregano salt and pepper and sauteed for 4 minutes.\r\n​\r\nAdd the chicken and cook for 2 minutes on each side often, mixing often. Add the chicken stock , cover and set the pressure cooker on high for 20 minutes. When done release the pressure and if need it, add a little bit more salt. I like to serve it with some of the juice over rice and beans. ","z":"切碎辣椒、洋葱和番茄，放在一边。打开速溶锅，以炒的方式煮 8 分钟。加入少许橄榄油，加入洋葱、大蒜、番茄、甜椒、小茴香、牛至盐和胡椒，炒4分钟。\r\n​\r\n加入鸡肉，每面煮 2 分钟，经常搅拌。加入鸡汤，盖上锅盖，高压锅煮20分钟。完成后释放压力，如果需要的话，再加一点盐。我喜欢把它和一些果汁一起放在米饭和豆子上。"},{"id":"53521","n":"Porotos Granados (Chilean Bean Stew)","a":"","c":"Miscellaneous","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/nimml81782855200.jpg","y":"","i":[["Olive Oil","1 tablespoon"],["Onion","1"],["Butternut Squash","2 cups"],["Great Northern Beans","1 Can"],["Lima Beans","1 cup"],["Chicken Stock","3 Cups"],["Sweetcorn","2 cups"],["Basil","2 tbs chopped"],["Banana Pepper","1"]],"s":"Heat the olive oil in a stock pot over medium heat; add the onion and cover. Cook the onions until soft and translucent, about 5 minutes. Stir the squash, great Northern beans, and lima beans into the pot; pour the chicken stock over the mixture. Cover and cook until the squash is tender and beginning to break apart, 30 to 45 minutes.\r\n\r\nStir the corn and basil into the stew; cook until the stew reaches the consistency of pancake batter, about 10 minutes more. Sprinkle the chopped banana pepper over individual portions to serve.","z":"将橄榄油放入汤锅中，用中火加热；加入洋葱并盖上盖子。将洋葱煮约 5 分钟，直至变软且半透明。将南瓜、北方豆和利马豆放入锅中搅拌；将鸡汤倒在混合物上。盖上锅盖，煮 30 至 45 分钟，直至南瓜变软并开始破裂。\r\n\r\n将玉米和罗勒放入炖菜中搅拌；再煮约10分钟，直至炖菜达到煎饼面糊的稠度。将切碎的香蕉辣椒撒在各个部分上即可食用。"},{"id":"53489","n":"Potato Moussaka Recipe","a":"","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/08ez421782683409.jpg","y":"","i":[["Vegetable Oil","1 tablespoon"],["Ground Beef","1 lb"],["Onion","1/3 cup"],["Garlic","1 clove peeled crushed"],["Tomato Sauce","1/4 cup"],["Tomato Puree","2 tablespoons"],["Salt","1 tsp"],["Black Pepper","1/4 tsp"],["Summer Savoury","1 tsp"],["Water","2 cups"],["Potatoes","2 Lbs"],["Carrots","1/4 cup"],["Milk","2 cups"],["Dried Mint","1/2 tsp"],["Butter","6 tablespoons"],["Flour","1/2 cup"],["Salt","1/2 tsp"],["Egg Yolks","3"],["Feta","1/2 cup"],["Ground Nutmeg","1/4 tsp"]],"s":"Preheat oven to 350 F.\r\nHeat oil in a skillet. Add the ground meat and cook, breaking it down with a wooden spoon for 6-7 minutes, until browned. Add onion and garlic. Add carrots (optional).Add salt, black pepper, dried mint, summer savory, thyme (optional), tomato sauce and tomato paste. Cook for 2-3 minutes, stirring frequently.\r\n\r\n\r\nGrease a 9×9 or 9×13 baking dish with oil.\r\nAdd in the drained potatoes and meat mixture. Stir to evenly distribute the meat into the potatoes.\r\nAdd cold water to the baking dish, so it just covers the top of the potatoes.\r\nBake for 40-50 minutes, until the water is absorbed by the potatoes and they are fully cooked.\r\nIn the mean time prepare the Bechamel sauce (or the Bulgarian Style Topping).\r\nFor the Bechamel:\r\nIn a bowl, swish egg yolks. Set aside.\r\nMelt butter in a saucepan. add flour. Cook for 3 minutes on medium heat, stirring frequently.\r\nSlowly add the milk, whisking to incorporate. Add salt and nutmeg. Cook for 3 minutes, until thickened. Let the mixture cool for 5 minutes. Add in the egg yolks (with feta). Let the sauce stand at room temperature, while the potatoes and meat are cooking.\r\nPour the sauce over the cooked potatoes. Top with cheese. Bake for 15 minutes, until golden. You can broil for 1-2 minutes, if the top is not getting to the desired golden color.\r\nFor the Bulgarian Moussaka topping:\r\nIn a bowl beat together eggs, yogurt, milk, flour, then add salt and baking soda.\r\n\r\n\r\nPour over the moussaka . Top with cheese. Bake for 10-15 minutes, until golden.","z":"将烤箱预热至 350 F。\r\n在煎锅中加热油。加入碎肉，用木勺将其打碎，煮 6-7 分钟，直至变成棕色。加入洋葱和大蒜。添加胡萝卜（可选）。添加盐、黑胡椒、干薄荷、夏香、百里香（可选）、番茄酱和番茄酱。煮2-3分钟，经常搅拌。\r\n\r\n\r\n在 9×9 或 9×13 烤盘上涂上油。\r\n加入沥干的土豆和肉混合物。搅拌使肉均匀地分布在土豆中。\r\n在烤盘中加入冷水，刚好没过土豆的顶部。\r\n烘烤 40-50 分钟，直至水分被土豆吸收并完全煮熟。\r\n同时准备调味酱（或保加利亚风格的配料）。\r\n对于调味酱：\r\n在碗中，倒入蛋黄。放在一边。\r\n在平底锅中融化黄油。添加面粉。用中火煮 3 分钟，经常搅拌。\r\n慢慢加入牛奶，搅拌均匀。添加盐和肉豆蔻。煮3分钟，直至变稠。让混合物冷却 5 分钟。加入蛋黄（和羊乳酪）。让酱汁在室温下静置，同时煮土豆和肉。\r\n将酱汁倒在煮熟的土豆上。上面放上奶酪。烘烤 15 分钟，直至呈金黄色。如果顶部没有达到所需的金黄色，您可以烤 1-2 分钟。\r\n保加利亚慕萨卡配料：\r\n在碗中将鸡蛋、酸奶、牛奶、面粉搅拌在一起，然后加入盐和小苏打。\r\n\r\n\r\n倒在慕萨卡上。上面放上奶酪。烘烤 10-15 分钟，直至呈金黄色。"},{"id":"53499","n":"Prahok Ktis – Pork and Coconut Dip","a":"","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/g80f4t1782690273.jpg","y":"","i":[["Ground Pork","1 lb"],["Coconut Milk","1 cup"],["Prahok","3  tablespoons"],["Vegetable Oil","2 tablespoons"],["Garlic","4 Cloves Crushed"],["Shallots","2 chopped"],["Chilli","2"],["Brown Sugar","1 tablespoon"],["Fish Sauce","2 tablespoons"],["Lime","Juice of 1"],["Cilantro","Garnish"]],"s":"1. Heat 2 tbsp vegetable oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat until shimmering, about 1 minute.\r\n2. Add 4 cloves minced garlic and 2 finely chopped shallots to the skillet, stirring constantly until fragrant and lightly golden, 2-3 minutes.\r\n3. Tip: Keep the heat medium to prevent burning—garlic can turn bitter if overcooked.\r\n4. Add 1 lb ground pork to the skillet, breaking it up with a spoon, and cook until no pink remains, 5-7 minutes.\r\n5. Stir in 3 tbsp prahok and cook for 1 minute to blend the flavors, mashing it slightly into the pork.\r\n6. Pour in 1 cup coconut milk, stirring to combine, then reduce heat to medium-low and simmer for 10 minutes until the mixture thickens slightly.\r\n7. Tip: Simmer gently to avoid curdling the coconut milk—a steady bubble is ideal.\r\n8. Add 2 tbsp fish sauce, 1 tbsp palm sugar, and 2 minced Thai chilies, stirring until the sugar dissolves, about 2 minutes.\r\n9. Remove the skillet from heat and stir in 2 tbsp lime juice, mixing thoroughly.\r\n10. Tip: Add lime juice off the heat to preserve its fresh, tangy flavor without cooking it out.\r\n11. Transfer the dip to a serving bowl and garnish with ¼ cup chopped fresh cilantro.\r\n12. Let the dip cool for 5 minutes before serving to allow the flavors to meld.","z":"1. 在大煎锅中用中高火加热 2 汤匙植物油，直至闪烁，约 1 分钟。\r\n2. 将 4 瓣蒜末和 2 颗切碎的青葱加入煎锅中，不断搅拌 2-3 分钟，直至散发出香味并呈浅金黄色。\r\n3. 提示：保持热介质以防烧焦——大蒜如果煮过头会变苦。\r\n4. 将 1 磅碎猪肉放入煎锅中，用勺子将其打碎，煮 5-7 分钟，直至没有粉红色残留。\r\n5. 加入3汤匙prahok煮1分钟以混合味道，将其稍微捣碎到猪肉中。\r\n6. 倒入1杯椰奶，搅拌混合，然后将火调至中低，煮10分钟，直至混合物稍微变稠。\r\n7. 提示：小火慢炖，以免椰奶凝结——稳定的泡沫是理想的选择。\r\n8. 加入2汤匙鱼露、1汤匙棕榈糖和2颗切碎的泰国辣椒，搅拌至糖溶解，约2分钟。\r\n9. 将煎锅从火上移开，加入 2 汤匙酸橙汁，充分搅拌。\r\n10. 提示：关火后加入酸橙汁，以保留其新鲜、浓郁的味道，而无需煮掉。\r\n11. 将酱汁倒入碗中，并用 1/4 杯切碎的新鲜香菜装饰。\r\n12. 食用前让酱汁冷却 5 分钟，让味道充分融合。"},{"id":"53410","n":"Presh me Oriz Leek and Rice Bake","a":"","c":"Lamb","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/sjfgbc1779647169.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=se2DU0httvg","i":[["Leek","500g"],["Lamb Mince","400g"],["Onion","1 Diced"],["Rice","200g"],["Lamb Stock","1 L"],["Salt","Pinch"],["Pepper","Pinch"],["Olive Oil","Splash"]],"s":"\r\n1\r\nCooking\r\nFry the leeks in a small dash of olive oil for a few minutes until they start to brown.\r\n2\r\nAdd the onions and mince and fry until everything is browned. Ensure you keep stirring to prevent the leeks catching and burning.\r\n3\r\nAdd the rice and stir together for a few minutes ensuring the rice is well blended and coated in any juices.\r\n4\r\nAdd the lamb stock, salt and pepper. Give it a good stir and leave it to come to the boil. Leave to boil for 2 minutes.\r\n5\r\nBaking\r\nPour the mixture into a large baking tray, place on the bottom self of a preheated oven at 180 degrees. Leave to bake for up to 1 hour. The dish is ready when all the liquid is evaporated and the rice is soft.\r\n6\r\nServing\r\nOnce cooked turn off the oven and keeping the door open leave the leek and rice bake to cool for 10 minutes before serving.","z":"1\r\n烹饪\r\n用少量橄榄油将韭葱煎几分钟，直至变成棕色。\r\n2\r\n加入洋葱，切碎，炒至所有东西都变成棕色。确保不断搅拌，以防止韭菜粘住并烧焦。\r\n3\r\n加入米饭并搅拌几分钟，确保米饭充分混合并涂上果汁。\r\n4\r\n加入羊肉高汤、盐和胡椒。充分搅拌并让它沸腾。煮沸 2 分钟。\r\n5\r\n烘焙\r\n将混合物倒入一个大烤盘中，放在预热烤箱180度的底部。烘烤最多 1 小时。当所有的液体都蒸发并且米饭变软时，这道菜就准备好了。\r\n6\r\n服务\r\n煮熟后，关闭烤箱并保持门打开，将韭葱和米饭烘烤冷却 10 分钟，然后食用。"},{"id":"53574","n":"Quark and Rhubarb Pie","a":"","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/s5o6521784834958.jpg","y":"","i":[["Milk","100ml"],["Yeast","10g"],["Sugar","1 tablespoon"],["Egg","1"],["Butter","25g"],["Salt","1/2 tsp"],["Cardamom","1/2 tsp"],["Flour","300ml"],["Sweet Quark","200g"],["Rhubarb","1 cup"],["Sugar","Pinch"],["Cinnamon","Pinch"]],"s":"All materials must be in room temperature\r\nDissolve yeast with lukewarm (37C) milk and sugar\r\nAdd about half of the quantity of flour, mixed with salt\r\nBeat the mixture for a short time. Sprinkle with a little flour , cover the bowl with a towel and place in a warm place to rise for ca 1 hour\r\nAdd additional flour, cardamom\r\nadd melted butter. Beat egg and leave ca 1 teaspoon for spreading.Add other beaten egg in to the dough\r\nKnead the dough properly, until it separates from the bowl.\r\nSprinkle with a little flour , cover the bowl with a towel and place in a warm place to rise for ca 1 hour until dough is doubled in size.\r\nRoll the dough to a square and put in centre quark. Turn edges on to the quark and roll again carefully  to a rectangle.\r\nPour on to the rectangle rhubarb, sugar and cinnamon. leave one edge ca 2 cm empty. Roll and cut in to the equal slices. You should get ca 6-7 rolls. Empty edge turn under the roll as bottom.\r\nPut roll in to the butter-spreaded springform pan, as flower. one roll in to the centre and others around. Let enough space to rise.\r\n\r\nCoat buns with beaten egg before putting into the oven. Bate at 180C 20-30 minutes .\r\nDecorate with icing sugar.","z":"所有材料必须处于室温\r\n用温（37C）牛奶和糖溶解酵母\r\n加入一半左右的面粉，加盐拌匀\r\n将混合物搅拌一小段时间。撒上少许面粉，用毛巾盖住碗，放在温暖的地方发酵约1小时\r\n添加额外的面粉、豆蔻\r\n加入融化的黄油。打散鸡蛋，留约 1 茶匙用于涂抹。将其他打散的鸡蛋加入面团中\r\n适当揉捏面团，直到它与碗分离。\r\n撒上少许面粉，用毛巾盖住碗，放在温暖的地方发酵约1小时，直至面团发酵至两倍大。\r\n将面团擀成正方形，放入中心夸克。将边缘转到夸克上，然后再次小心地滚动成矩形。\r\n倒在长方形大黄、糖和肉桂上。将一侧边缘留出约 2 厘米的空间。卷起并切成相等的片。你应该得到大约 6-7 卷。空边翻卷下方作为底部。\r\n将卷放入涂有黄油的弹簧盘中，作为花朵。一个滚到中心，其他滚到周围。留出足够的空间上升。\r\n\r\n在将面包放入烤箱之前，先涂上打散的鸡蛋。 180C 软化 20-30 分钟。\r\n用糖粉装饰。"},{"id":"53506","n":"Rice and Beans","a":"","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/j8c1d51782772399.jpg","y":"","i":[["Kidney Beans","1/2 bag"],["Coconut Milk","1 Can"],["Onion","1 Diced"],["Scotch Bonnet","3"],["Black Pepper","1 tablespoon"],["Salt","1/2 tbs"]],"s":"Cook beans until tender, add rice, coconut milk, onion, black pepper and salt, and add enough water to just cover the ingredients. Place Scotch Bonnet peppers on top, careful not to burst them. Simmer until rice is tender. Remove pepper before serving.","z":"将豆子煮至变软，加入米、椰奶、洋葱、黑胡椒和盐，并加入足够的水以刚好覆盖配料。将苏格兰帽辣椒放在上面，小心不要把它们弄碎。煮至米饭变软。食用前去掉胡椒粉。"},{"id":"53545","n":"Ropa Veija","a":"","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/thvft91784576451.jpg","y":"","i":[["Flank Steak","2 Lbs"],["Kosher Salt","3 tsp"],["Vegetable Oil","4 tablespoons"],["Red Pepper","1"],["Yellow Pepper","1"],["Onion","1"],["Garlic","6 cloves"],["Tomato Puree","2 tablespoons"],["Smoked Paprika","1 tablespoon"],["Cumin","2 tsp"],["Dried Oregano","2 tsp"],["Dry White Wine","1/2 cup"],["Tinned Tomatos","1 Can"],["Bay Leaf","2"],["Pimento Stuffed Olives","1 cup"],["Rice","To serve"],["Black Beans","To serve"],["Cilantro","1/4 cup"]],"s":"Step 1\r\nCut steak into 4 rectangular pieces. Pat dry with paper towels; season all over with 1 1/2 teaspoons salt. \r\nStep 2\r\nIn a large pot over medium-high heat, heat 2 tablespoons oil. Working in batches, cook steak until browned on both sides, 5 to 6 minutes. Transfer to a plate.\r\nStep 3\r\nIn same pot over medium heat, heat remaining 2 tablespoons oil. Cook bell peppers, onion, and 1 1/2 teaspoons salt, stirring occasionally, until slightly softened, 4 to 5 minutes. Add garlic, tomato paste, paprika, cumin, and oregano and cook, stirring occasionally, until vegetables are softened and spices are aromatic, 1 to 2 minutes more.\r\nStep 4\r\nAdd wine, scraping any browned bits from bottom of pan, and cook, stirring occasionally, until reduced by half, about 2 minutes. Add tomatoes with their juices and bay leaves. Mash down on tomatoes to break up, then nestle beef into stew. Add water to cover beef, if needed, and bring to a simmer. Reduce heat to medium-low; cover and simmer until steaks are tender enough to shred, 2 1/2 to 3 hours. Transfer steaks to a plate and finely shred with 2 forks.\r\nStep 5\r\nStir shredded steak back into stew. Bring to a simmer and cook, stirring, until liquid has reduced to a sauce that coats steak, 5 to 10 minutes. Stir in olives; season with salt.\r\nStep 6\r\nSpoon ropa vieja over rice and beans. Top with cilantro.","z":"步骤1\r\n将牛排切成4块长方形。用纸巾拍干；用 1 1/2 茶匙盐调味。 \r\n步骤2\r\n在一个大锅中，用中火加热 2 汤匙油。分批将牛排煎至两面焦黄，持续 5 至 6 分钟。转移到盘子上。\r\n步骤3\r\n在同一个锅中，用中火加热剩余的 2 汤匙油。煮青椒、洋葱和 1 1/2 茶匙盐，偶尔搅拌，直至稍微软化，持续 4 至 5 分钟。加入大蒜、番茄酱、辣椒粉、小茴香和牛至，偶尔搅拌，再煮 1 到 2 分钟，直到蔬菜变软、香料散发出芳香。\r\n步骤4\r\n加入酒，刮掉锅底的褐色残渣，煮，偶尔搅拌，直到酒量减半，大约需要 2 分钟。加入西红柿及其汁液和月桂叶。将西红柿捣碎，然后将牛肉放入炖菜中。如果需要的话，加水盖住牛肉，然后小火慢炖。将热量降至中低；盖上锅盖，小火煮 2 1/2 至 3 小时，直至牛排变软，可以切碎。将牛排转移到盘子上，用两把叉子切碎。\r\n步骤5\r\n将切碎的牛排重新放入炖菜中搅拌。用文火煮5到10分钟，边搅拌边煮，直到液体变成酱汁，覆盖在牛排上。拌入橄榄；加盐调味。\r\n步骤6\r\n将 ropa vieja 勺子浇在米饭和豆子上。上面撒上香菜。"},{"id":"53511","n":"Salt Beef and Beans","a":"","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/dnd87q1782775269.jpg","y":"","i":[["Corned Beef","1 lb"],["Kidney Beans","1 1/2 cup"],["Scotch Bonnet","1"],["Scallions","2"],["Thyme","1/4 tsp"],["Garlic","1 clove finely chopped"],["Water","2 cups"],["Coconut Milk","3 Cups"],["Bay Leaf","2"],["Allspice","6"],["Garlic","2 cloves"]],"s":"Cover the diced salt beef with water and bring to a boil. Repeat as necessary, draining and replacing water to eliminate some of the brine. In a separate pan, place beans in water, add coconut milk, bay leaves, pimento seeds, whole garlic, whole scotch bonnet pepper and scallions. Slowly bring to a boil and simmer for about 2 hours, or until beans are tender. Add salt beef, onions, thyme and crushed garlic and simmer for another 20 minutes. Adjust seasonings if necessary. Remove the bay leaves and scotch bonnet pepper, being careful not to burst the pepper. Serve with white rice and your choice of salad or vegetables.","z":"用水盖过盐牛肉丁，煮沸。根据需要重复，排出并更换水以消除一些盐水。在另一个锅中，将豆放入水中，加入椰奶、月桂叶、多椒种子、整颗大蒜、整颗苏格兰帽辣椒和葱。慢慢煮沸，小火煮约2小时，或直至豆子变软。加入盐牛肉、洋葱、百里香和碎大蒜，再煮 20 分钟。如有必要，调整调味料。取出月桂叶和苏格兰帽胡椒，小心不要让胡椒爆裂。与白米饭和您选择的沙拉或蔬菜一起食用。"},{"id":"53498","n":"Samlar Kari – Khmer Red Curry","a":"","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/k5qzdl1782689660.jpg","y":"","i":[["Vegetable Oil","1 tablespoon"],["Chicken Thighs","1 lb"],["Onion","1 medium chopped"],["Garlic","3 Cloves Crushed"],["Ginger","1 tablespoon"],["Red Curry Paste","2 tablespoons"],["Coconut Milk","1 can"],["Chicken Stock","1 cup"],["Fish Sauce","1 tablespoon"],["Brown Sugar","1 tablespoon"],["Bamboo Shoot","1 cup"],["Red Pepper","1 sliced"],["Basil","Pinch"],["Lime","To serve"]],"s":"1. Heat 1 tbsp vegetable oil in a large pot or Dutch oven over medium-high heat until it shimmers, about 2 minutes.\r\n2. Add 1 lb chicken pieces to the pot and cook until browned on all sides, approximately 5–7 minutes, stirring occasionally to prevent sticking.\r\n3. Remove the chicken from the pot and set it aside on a plate, leaving any oil and juices in the pot.\r\n4. Reduce the heat to medium and add 1 sliced onion to the pot, cooking until softened and translucent, about 4 minutes.\r\n5. Stir in 3 cloves minced garlic and 1 tbsp grated ginger, cooking for 1 minute until fragrant to avoid burning.\r\n6. Add 2 tbsp red curry paste to the pot and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly to toast the spices and deepen the flavor.\r\n7. Pour in 1 can coconut milk and 1 cup chicken broth, scraping the bottom of the pot to incorporate any browned bits for extra richness.\r\n8. Stir in 1 tbsp fish sauce and 1 tbsp palm sugar until fully dissolved, then return the browned chicken to the pot.\r\n9. Bring the mixture to a gentle boil, then reduce the heat to low, cover, and simmer for 15 minutes to allow the flavors to meld.\r\n10. Add 1 cup bamboo shoots and 1 sliced red bell pepper to the pot, simmering uncovered for an additional 5 minutes until the vegetables are tender-crisp.\r\n11. Remove the pot from the heat and stir in 1 cup Thai basil leaves until just wilted, about 1 minute, to preserve their fresh aroma.\r\n12. Serve the curry hot, garnished with lime wedges for a bright, acidic finish.\r\n\r\n","z":"1. 在大锅或荷兰烤箱中用中高火加热 1 汤匙植物油，直至闪烁，大约 2 分钟。\r\n2. 将 1 磅鸡肉块放入锅中，煮约 5-7 分钟，直至各面变成棕色，期间不时搅拌以防止粘连。\r\n3. 将鸡肉从锅中取出，放在盘子上，保留锅中的油和汁液。\r\n4. 将火调至中火，加入 1 片洋葱，煮约 4 分钟，直至洋葱变软并呈半透明状。\r\n5. 加入3瓣蒜末和1汤匙姜末，炒1分钟至香，以免烧焦。\r\n6. 将2汤匙红咖喱酱加入锅中，煮1分钟，不断搅拌以烘烤香料并加深风味。\r\n7. 倒入 1 罐椰奶和 1 杯鸡汤，刮擦锅底以加入任何褐色的碎片，以增加浓郁度。\r\n8. 加入1汤匙鱼露和1汤匙棕榈糖，搅拌至完全溶解，然后将褐色的鸡肉放回锅中。\r\n9. 将混合物慢慢煮沸，然后将火调小，盖上锅盖，小火煮 15 分钟，让味道融合。\r\n10. 将1杯竹笋和1片红灯笼椒放入锅中，不盖锅盖再煮5分钟，直至蔬菜嫩脆。\r\n11. 将锅从火上移开，加入 1 杯泰国罗勒叶，搅拌约 1 分钟直至枯萎，以保留其新鲜香气。\r\n12. 趁热享用咖喱，饰以酸橙片，呈现明亮的酸味。"},{"id":"53503","n":"Samlar Machu Kreung – Cambodian Sour Stew","a":"","c":"Chicken","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/bmbvjk1782770310.jpg","y":"","i":[["Chicken Thighs","1 lb"],["Vegetable Oil","1 tablespoon"],["Water","4 cups"],["Tamarind Paste","2 tablespoons"],["Fish Sauce","1 tablespoon"],["Sugar","1 tsp"],["Pineapple Chunks","1 cup"],["Cherry Tomatoes","1 cup"],["Green Beans","1 cup"],["Lemongrass","1 Stalk"],["Kaffir Lime Leaves","2"],["Chilli","1 sliced"]],"s":"1. Heat 1 tbsp vegetable oil in a large pot over medium-high heat until it shimmers, about 1 minute.\r\n2. Add 1 lb boneless, skinless chicken thighs to the pot and cook until browned on all sides, approximately 5-7 minutes, stirring occasionally to prevent sticking.\r\n3. Pour 4 cups water into the pot and bring to a boil, then reduce heat to a simmer.\r\n4. Stir in 2 tbsp tamarind paste, 1 tbsp fish sauce, and 1 tsp sugar until fully dissolved, about 1 minute.\r\n5. Add 1 stalk lemongrass and 2 kaffir lime leaves to the pot, then cover and simmer for 10 minutes to infuse the broth with flavor.\r\n6. Tip: Bruising the lemongrass before adding helps release its essential oils for a more aromatic stew.\r\n7. Add 1 cup pineapple chunks, 1 cup cherry tomatoes, and 1 cup green beans to the pot, stirring gently to combine.\r\n8. Simmer uncovered for 10-12 minutes, or until the green beans are tender but still crisp and the tomatoes start to soften.\r\n9. Tip: Avoid overcooking the vegetables to maintain their vibrant color and texture in the final dish.\r\n10. Stir in 1 Thai chili and simmer for an additional 2 minutes to incorporate the heat.\r\n11. Tip: Taste the broth and adjust with extra tamarind paste or fish sauce if desired, but do so gradually to avoid overpowering the balance.\r\n12. Remove the pot from heat and discard the lemongrass and kaffir lime leaves before serving.\r\n13. Present the stew hot in bowls, optionally garnished with fresh herbs like cilantro.","z":"1. 将 1 汤匙植物油放入大锅中，用中高火加热至闪烁，约 1 分钟。\r\n2. 将 1 磅去骨、去皮的鸡腿放入锅中，煮约 5-7 分钟，直至各面变成棕色，期间不时搅拌以防止粘连。\r\n3. 将4杯水倒入锅中煮沸，然后转小火煮。\r\n4. 加入2汤匙罗望子酱、1汤匙鱼露和1茶匙糖，搅拌约1分钟直至完全溶解。\r\n5. 将1枝柠檬草和2片柠檬叶放入锅中，盖上锅盖，煮10分钟，使汤汁充满风味。\r\n6. 提示：添加前将柠檬草捣碎有助于释放其精油，使炖菜更加芳香。\r\n7. 将 1 杯菠萝块、1 杯樱桃番茄和 1 杯青豆放入锅中，轻轻搅拌混合。\r\n8. 不盖锅盖，小火煮 10-12 分钟，或者直到青豆变软但仍然酥脆，西红柿开始变软。\r\n9. 提示：避免将蔬菜煮得太久，以保持最终菜肴鲜艳的颜色和质地。\r\n10. 加入 1 颗泰国辣椒，再煮 2 分钟以吸收热量。\r\n11. 提示：品尝肉汤，如果需要，可以加入额外的罗望子酱或鱼露进行调整，但要逐渐进行，以免破坏平衡。\r\n12. 将锅从火上移开，并在食用前丢弃柠檬草和柠檬叶。\r\n13. 将炖菜趁热放入碗中，可选用香菜等新鲜香草装饰。"},{"id":"53443","n":"Satee","a":"","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/dqxtlh1780153831.jpg","y":"","i":[["Onion","1 chopped"],["Garlic","2 cloves"],["Lemons","Juice of 2"],["Sugar","2 tablespoons"],["Soy Sauce","1 cup"],["Salt","1 tsp"],["Ground Coriander","1 tsp"],["Oil","1 cup"],["Beef","4-5 pound"],["Oil","1 cup"],["Soy Sauce","2 tablespoons"]],"s":"To make the marinade for the satee put in the container of an electric blender:\r\n\r\n1 large onion, coarsely chopped 2 cloves of garlic\r\nJuice of 2 lemons\r\n2Tbs. of sugar 1 cup of soy sauce\r\n1 tsp. salt 1 tsp. ground coriander for beef (or chicken) or 1 tsp. ground ginger for pork\r\n1 cup of oil\r\nBlend thoroughly and pour over:\r\n5 lbs. of beef or pork tenderloin, cubed\r\nDO NOT marinate overnight, but only for a few hours.\r\n\r\nPlace the meat on: 36 skewers\r\n\r\nBlend well:\r\n\r\n1 cup of oil\r\n2 Tbs. Soy sauce\r\nPour into a large shallow dish.\r\n\r\nTo keep meat from becoming dry, roll each skewer in seasoned oil before frying.\r\n\r\nSatee is also excellent when barbecued.","z":"将沙爹的腌料放入电动搅拌机的容器中：\r\n\r\n1 个大洋葱，粗略切碎 2 瓣大蒜\r\n2个柠檬汁\r\n2汤匙。糖 1 杯 酱油\r\n1 茶匙。盐 1 茶匙。牛肉（或鸡肉）香菜末或 1 茶匙。猪肉姜末\r\n1 杯油\r\n充分混合并倒在：\r\n5 磅。牛里脊肉或猪里脊肉，切成方块\r\n不要腌过夜，而只能腌几个小时。\r\n\r\n将肉放在：36 串上\r\n\r\n混合均匀：\r\n\r\n1 杯油\r\n2 汤匙。酱油\r\n倒入一个大的浅盘中。\r\n\r\n为了防止肉变干，请在煎炸前将每个串在调味油中滚一下。\r\n\r\n沙爹烧烤起来也很美味。"},{"id":"53577","n":"Sauerkraut and Fish Salad","a":"","c":"Seafood","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/2i0plx1784837241.jpg","y":"","i":[["Sauerkraut","200g"],["Smoked Haddock","100g"],["Egg","1"],["Rye Bread","2 sliced"],["Oil","200g"],["Honey","Drizzle"],["Salt","Pinch"]],"s":"1.Boil eggs and toast bread slices.\r\nmix together salad dressing. NB! you can serve this salad with sour cream dressing. It would be different but still very delicious\r\nMix together sauerkraut, sliced egg, fish and bread pieces. Serve","z":"1.煮鸡蛋，吐司面包片。\r\n将沙拉酱混合在一起。注意！你可以把这个沙拉配上酸奶油酱。会有所不同，但仍然非常美味\r\n将酸菜、鸡蛋片、鱼和面包片混合在一起。服务"},{"id":"53470","n":"Seswaa","a":"","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/p7eid81782503889.jpg","y":"","i":[["Beef","1 kg"],["Onion","1"],["Bay Leaf","3"],["Salt","To taste"],["Black Pepper","Sprinkling"],["Water","1 Litre"]],"s":"Pre heat the oven to 160 degrees Celsius. Cut the meat into large chunks then brown in a dish suitable for slow cooking in the oven such as a cast iron casserole dish.\r\nAdd the whole peeled onion, salt, cracked black pepper, water and bay leaves. Bring to the boil then cover and place into the oven for 4 hours.\r\nAfter 4 hours, remove from oven and place onto the stove burner in order to cook off most of the remaining liquid. Use a wooden spoon to pound or mash up the meat, the meat should fall apart quite easily. and will appear shredded. You may brown the meat further if desired.\r\nCheck seasoning then serve with polenta or the more traditional thick cornmeal porridge known as pap or sadza, and a side of green vegetables.","z":"将烤箱预热至160摄氏度。将肉切成大块，然后放入适合在烤箱中慢速烹饪的盘子（例如铸铁砂锅）中煎成褐色。\r\n加入去皮的整个洋葱、盐、碎黑胡椒、水和月桂叶。煮沸后盖上盖子放入烤箱烤4小时。\r\n4小时后，从烤箱中取出并放在炉灶上，以煮掉大部分剩余的液体。用木勺捣碎或捣碎肉，肉应该很容易散开。并且会出现切碎的情况。如果需要的话，你可以把肉进一步煎黄。\r\n检查调味料，然后搭配玉米粥或更传统的厚玉米粉粥（称为 pap 或 Sadza）以及一份绿色蔬菜。"},{"id":"53409","n":"Shendetlie Honey and Nut Cake","a":"","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/fx0exq1779646651.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LfeBW8ipt0w","i":[["Sugar","300g"],["Eggs","3"],["Melted Butter","180g"],["Flour","700g"],["Walnuts","100g"],["Honey","4 tablespoons"],["Baking Powder","1 tsp"],["Sugar","220g"],["Water","450ml"]],"s":"\r\n1\r\nPrepare\r\nIn a mixing bowl cream together the eggs, sugar and cooled melted butter then add the honey and soda.\r\n2\r\nAdd half the flour and the walnuts (you can add the walnuts whole or ground them) and mix well.\r\n3\r\nAdd the rest of the flour and using your hands kneed the mixture together until a firm dough is formed.\r\n4\r\nCoat a large baking tray (traditionally a circle tray is used about 30cm is best with a 2 - 3 inch height) with olive oil. Add the dough and press it down so that it fits the whole tray. Try and get the dough flat and equal in height all over.\r\n5\r\nBaking\r\nPlace on the bottom shelf of a cold oven and turn the temperture up to 180 degrees. Bake for 35 minutes and the dough has turned dark brown and is firm to touch.\r\n6\r\nRemove from the oven and leave to cool while making the syrup.\r\n7\r\nAdding the Syrup\r\nAdd the sugar and water to a saucepan and bring to the boil. Leave boiling for 10 minutes, mixing occasionally. Remove from the heat.\r\n8\r\nCut the Shendetlie into squares of diamond shapes and pour over the hot syrup. Use enough of the syrup to cover the cake plus 1 cm overflowing, sitting on top. This will soak into the cake while you leave it to cool for at least 1 hour before serving.","z":"1\r\n准备\r\n在搅拌碗中将鸡蛋、糖和冷却融化的黄油混合在一起，然后加入蜂蜜和苏打水。\r\n2\r\n加入一半面粉和核桃（可以添加整个核桃或磨碎的核桃）并搅拌均匀。\r\n3\r\n加入剩下的面粉，用手将混合物揉在一起，直到形成坚硬的面团。\r\n4\r\n在一个大烤盘（传统上使用圆形烤盘，最好是 30 厘米左右，高度为 2 - 3 英寸）涂上橄榄油。添加面团并按下，使其适合整个托盘。尝试将面团弄平并且各处高度相等。\r\n5\r\n烘焙\r\n放在冷烤箱的底架上，将温度调至 180 度。烘烤 35 分钟，面团变成深棕色，摸起来很硬。\r\n6\r\n从烤箱中取出并在制作糖浆时冷却。\r\n7\r\n添加糖浆\r\n将糖和水加入锅中，煮沸。煮沸 10 分钟，偶尔搅拌。从火上移开。\r\n8\r\n将 Shendetlie 切成菱形方块，倒在热糖浆上。使用足够的糖浆覆盖蛋糕并溢出1厘米，放在上面。这会渗透到蛋糕中，同时在食用前将其冷却至少 1 小时。"},{"id":"53491","n":"Shopska Salad","a":"","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/bqx8mc1782684286.jpg","y":"","i":[["Cucumber","1 sliced"],["Tomatoes","3 Cups"],["Red Onions","1/4"],["Green Pepper","1 chopped"],["Salt","1 tsp"],["Olive Oil","1/4 cup"],["Feta","1/3 cup"],["Parsley","2 tbs chopped"]],"s":"Combine vegetables in a bowl and sprinkle salt on top. Let it stand for 5 minutes. Add the oil. Top with feta and parsley. Serve.","z":"将蔬菜放入碗中，并在上面撒上盐。静置 5 分钟。添加油。上面撒上羊乳酪和欧芹。服务。"},{"id":"53484","n":"Simple heart of palm & tomato salad","a":"","c":"Starter","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/7whfgi1782678933.jpg","y":"","i":[["Palm Hearts","400g"],["Cherry Tomatoes","250g"],["Spring Onions","2 sliced"],["Sherry vinegar","1 tablespoon"],["Olive Oil","3  tablespoons"],["Parsley","Handful"]],"s":"step 1\r\nMix together the hearts of palm, tomatoes and spring onions. Whisk together the sherry vinegar and olive oil. Drizzle over the salad. Sprinkle with the parsley, toss everything together and serve.","z":"步骤1\r\n将棕榈心、西红柿和葱混合在一起。将雪利酒醋和橄榄油搅拌在一起。淋在沙拉上。撒上欧芹，将所有东西搅拌在一起即可食用。"},{"id":"53395","n":"Slagroomtaart","a":"","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/wxfmk41777628643.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=w6d3N2E_Vdo","i":[["Eggs","175g"],["Sugar","100g"],["vanilla sugar","10g"],["Flour","75g"],["Cornstarch","25g"],["Jam","6 tablespoons"],["Nougatine","100g"],["Whipping Cream","750 ml"],["Sugar","6 tablespoons"],["Fruit Mix","5"]],"s":"Beat the eggs, sugar and vanilla sugar until light and fluffy. I beat this in a stand mixer on medium-high speed for about 10 minutes.\r\nSift the flour and cornstarch and add to the mixture. Fold this gently into the mixture; you don’t want all the air you whipped in to disappear.\r\nPour the batter into a greased baking pan. Bake the cake base at 180°C/350°F (conventional oven) for 30 minutes. The cake is done when you press lightly on the top and it springs back. Allow the cake to cool in the pan for a few minutes before removing it to a cake rack.\r\nMeanwhile, prepare the nougatine and jam according to the recipe if you haven’t already.\r\nLet the cake cool completely before you cut it. If, like me, you used a 20 cm/8 inch spring form pan, cut the cake into three layers.","z":"将鸡蛋、糖和香草糖搅打至松软。我在立式搅拌机中以中高速搅拌大约 10 分钟。\r\n将面粉和玉米淀粉过筛并添加到混合物中。轻轻地将其拌入混合物中；你不希望你吸入的所有空气都消失。\r\n将面糊倒入涂有油脂的烤盘中。将蛋糕底在 180°C/350°F（传统烤箱）下烘烤 30 分钟。当你轻轻按压顶部，蛋糕弹回时，蛋糕就熟了。让蛋糕在锅中冷却几分钟，然后将其移至蛋糕架上。\r\n同时，如果您还没有准备好牛轧糖和果酱，请按照食谱准备。\r\n在切蛋糕之前让蛋糕完全冷却。如果你像我一样使用 20 厘米/8 英寸的弹簧盘，请将蛋糕切成三层。"},{"id":"53432","n":"Slow-cooked, Wadadli-spiced Cubano pork belly","a":"","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/t1hg8s1780087329.jpg","y":"","i":[["Olive Oil","175ml"],["Coriander","4 tablespoons"],["Parsley","4 tablespoons"],["Oregano","6 tablespoons"],["Mint","6 tablespoons"],["Red Chilli","2"],["Green Chilli","1"],["Orange","Zest and juice of 2"],["Lime","Zest and juice of 2"],["Grapefruit","Juice of 1"],["Garlic","40g"],["Ground Cumin","3 tsp"],["Ground Allspice","2 tablespoons"],["Salt","To taste"],["Black Pepper","To taste"]],"s":"Blitz all the marinade ingredients in a food processor or with a hand blender. Lay the pork in a large dish, pour over the marinade, then turn the meat in the mixture, rubbing in the marinade all over and making sure every bit of the belly is coated. Cover the dish and leave overnight in the fridge.\r\n\r\nThe next day, heat the oven to 140C (120C fan)/275F/gas 1. Lift the meat out of its marinade (don’t wipe off any that sticks to the joint, though; just leave most of the marinade behind in the dish) and transfer to a large roasting dish. Cover with foil, slip into the oven and roast for four and a half hours – every now and then (say, three or four times over the whole cooking period), take the dish out of the oven, lift off the foil lid and spoon the juices from the bottom of the dish over the meat. Return the foil lid, then put back in the oven.\r\n\r\nAfter the time is up, remove the foil, turn up the heat to 180C (160C fan)/350F/gas 4 and give the pork a final blast – after 15-20 minutes, the top will take on a lovely colour and the meat should be yielding and soft enough to cut with a spoon.\r\n\r\nTo make crackling shards to serve with the meat, heat the oven to 200C (180C fan)/390F/gas 6 and line a roasting tray with baking paper. Lightly score the skin from the pork belly with a sharp knife, then rub it with a three or four fat pinches of salt – I also like to add a few caraway, cumin or fennel seeds at this point (use anything that takes your fancy). Cut the skin into long strips and lay these fat side down on the lined tray (you can, of course, leave it whole, but I think its pleasing to dress the plate with long, golden shards of crackling). Lay a second sheet of baking paper on top of the skin, then put a second baking tray of the same size on top, and roast for 45 minutes to an hour (if by this point the crackling has not gone crisp, just put it back in the oven and carry on roasting it until it has).\r\n\r\nCut or pull the pork apart, top with finely chopped coriander and flat-leaf parsley and shards of crackling, if you have made them, and serve at once","z":"将所有腌料成分放入食品加工机或手动搅拌机中搅拌。将猪肉放在一个大盘子里，倒在腌料上，然后将肉放入混合物中，将腌料涂满，确保腹部的每一点都涂上。盖上盘子并在冰箱中放置过夜。\r\n\r\n第二天，将烤箱加热至 140C（120C 风扇）/275F/煤气 1. 将肉从腌料中取出（不过，不要擦掉粘在接缝上的任何东西；只需将大部分腌料留在盘中），然后转移到一个大烤盘中。用箔纸盖上，滑入烤箱烤四个半小时——时不时地（比如在整个烹饪过程中，烤三到四次），将盘子从烤箱中取出，揭开箔盖，用勺子将盘子底部的汁液浇在肉上。放回铝箔盖，然后放回烤箱。\r\n\r\n时间到后，取下箔纸，将热量调至 180C（160C 风扇）/350F/煤气 4，然后对猪肉进行最后的爆炸 - 15-20 分钟后，顶部会呈现出可爱的颜色，肉应该足够柔软，可以用勺子切。\r\n\r\n要制作与肉搭配的脆皮碎片，请将烤箱加热至 200C（180C 风扇）/390F/燃气 6，并在烤盘上铺上烤纸。用锋利的刀轻轻地从五花肉上切下皮肤，然后用三四撮肥大的盐擦拭它——我还喜欢在此时添加一些香菜、小茴香或茴香籽（使用任何你喜欢的东西）。将皮肤切成长条，然后将这些脂肪面朝下放在有衬里的托盘上（当然，你可以将其整个保留，但我认为用长长的金色裂纹碎片装饰盘子是令人愉快的）。在皮上铺上第二张烤纸，然后再放一个同样大小的烤盘，烤45分钟到一个小时（如果此时裂纹还没有变脆，就放回烤箱继续烤至变脆）。\r\n\r\n将猪肉切或拉开，上面撒上切碎的香菜、平叶欧芹和脆皮碎片（如果是你做的），然后立即上桌"},{"id":"53479","n":"Smoky tomato pepper salsa","a":"","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/hkz4k71782590338.jpg","y":"","i":[["Red Onions","1 small"],["Coriander","Bunch"],["Cherry Tomatoes","125g"],["Red Pepper","1/2"],["Extra Virgin Olive Oil","3  tablespoons"],["Red Wine Vinegar","2 tablespoons"],["Paprika","1 1/2 tsp"],["Sugar","Pinch"]],"s":"step 1\r\nPut all the ingredients in a food processor and pulse until chopped, but not too fine. Pour into a serving bowl and add seasoning and a pinch of sugar.\r\n\r\n","z":"步骤1\r\n将所有原料放入食品加工机中，搅拌直至切碎，但不要太细。倒入碗中，加入调味料和少许糖。"},{"id":"53550","n":"Strawberry tart","a":"","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/9kmyly1784660555.jpg","y":"","i":[["Marzipan","250g"],["Sugar","80g"],["Butter","7 oz"],["Eggs","4"],["All purpose flour","50g"],["Dark Chocolate","100g"],["vanilla sugar","3 tsp"],["Egg Yolks","3"],["Sugar","50g"],["Cornstarch","2 tablespoons"],["Milk","3/4 cup"],["Double Cream","1/2 cup"],["Strawberries","500g"],["Mint","Handful"]],"s":"Tart shell \r\n\r\nHeat oven to 175°C / 347 °F\r\nGrate the marzipan and mix thoroughly with the sugar. Whip the mixture with butter until fluffy. \r\nWhip the eggs into the mixture and then folk the flour into the dough. Line an approximately 24 cm springform pan with baking paper and grease with butter. Then roll out the dough and transfer to the pan. Bake in the middle of the oven for approximately 25 minutes. Prepare the vanilla custard while the dough bakes. \r\nFinely chop the chocolate and sprinkle over the shell after baking. Spread out the chocolate with a spatula as it melts. Allow the shell to cool to room temperature. \r\nVanilla custard \r\n\r\nMix vanilla sugar, egg yolks, sugar and corn starch in a saucepan. Turn the heat to medium and whisk in the milk. Heat the mixture while stirring until it thickens. Transfer the custard to a container and cool completely. \r\nWhip the double cream to a light foam and folk into the cooled vanilla custard. \r\nTart assembly\r\n\r\nRinse the strawberries, remove the stems and quarter from top to bottom \r\nSpread the vanilla custard in a thick layer on top of the tart shell. Top with the fresh strawberries and fresh mint (optional). Bon appétit!","z":"挞皮 \r\n\r\n将烤箱加热至 175°C / 347 °F\r\n将杏仁糖磨碎并与糖充分混合。用黄油搅打混合物直至蓬松。 \r\n将鸡蛋打入混合物中，然后将面粉揉入面团中。在大约 24 厘米的弹簧盘中铺上烘焙纸，并涂上黄油。然后将面团擀开并转移到烤盘上。在烤箱中间烘烤约 25 分钟。烘烤面团时准备香草蛋奶冻。 \r\n将巧克力切碎，烘烤后撒在巧克力壳上。当巧克力融化时，用抹刀将其摊开。让外壳冷却至室温。 \r\n香草奶油冻 \r\n\r\n在平底锅中混合香草糖、蛋黄、糖和玉米淀粉。将火调至中火，加入牛奶搅拌。边搅拌边加热混合物直至变稠。将蛋奶冻转移到容器中并完全冷却。 \r\n将双份奶油搅打成浅泡沫，然后倒入冷却的香草蛋奶冻中。 \r\n挞组装\r\n\r\n将草莓洗净，从上到下去除蒂和四分之一 \r\n将香草蛋奶冻厚厚地铺在挞皮上。上面放上新鲜草莓和新鲜薄荷（可选）。祝你胃口好！"},{"id":"53435","n":"Stuffed Grape Leaves","a":"","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/oga0ax1780089591.jpg","y":"","i":[["Rice","1 cup"],["Chicken Stock","2 cups"],["Tomato Sauce","1 cup"],["Olive Oil","1/4 cup"],["Ground Allspice","1/4 tsp"],["Cinnamon","1/2 tsp"],["Onion","1 chopped"],["Raisins","1/2 cup"],["Dill","1/2 cup"],["Pine Nuts","1/2 cup"],["Lemon","Juice of 1"],["Salt","To taste"],["Pepper","To taste"]],"s":"Wash rice in cold water until water runs clear.\r\nSauté onions in olive oil until tender.\r\nAdd spices and stir until fragrant.\r\nAdd remaining ingredients.\r\nBring to a gentle boil, then simmer for 30 minutes until all stock is absorbed and rice is tender.\r\nServe as a side dish or filling for dolmas.","z":"用冷水将米淘洗至水清澈为止。\r\n用橄榄油炒洋葱直至变软。\r\n加入香料并搅拌直至散发出香味。\r\n添加剩余成分。\r\n轻轻煮沸，然后小火煮 30 分钟，直至所有汤料被吸收且米饭变软。\r\n作为卓尔玛的配菜或馅料。"},{"id":"53558","n":"Stuffed plantain cups","a":"","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/s5d8ha1784666032.jpg","y":"","i":[["Plantain","3"],["Vegetable Oil","3 Cups"]],"s":"Peel and wash plantains\r\nPat them dry\r\nCut them into one and a half inch slices\r\nHeat oil to deep fry plantains\r\nToss in plantains into hot oil so they are submerged\r\nFry them for about 7 minutes\r\nPlace them on paper towel for about five minutes. You don't want them to be too dry\r\nUsing your citrus squeezer, press the plantain slices into cups\r\nPlace on paper towel or tray\r\nThen place cups in the deep fryer or sauce pan with enough oil to submerge them\r\nRemove when golden brown\r\nStuff with your favorite filling\r\nEnjoy!","z":"车前草去皮并清洗\r\n将它们拍干\r\n将它们切成一英寸半的片\r\n烧热油，将大蕉煎熟\r\n将车前草放入热油中，使它们被淹没\r\n煎约7分钟\r\n将它们放在纸巾上约五分钟。你不希望它们太干\r\n使用柑橘榨汁机，将车前草片压入杯子中\r\n放在纸巾或托盘上\r\n然后将杯子放入油炸锅或平底锅中，加入足够的油以淹没它们\r\n呈金黄色时取出\r\n加上你最喜欢的馅料\r\n享受吧！"},{"id":"53447","n":"Tafelspitz","a":"","c":"Beef","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/svf3d01780298321.jpg","y":"","i":[["Beef Brisket","1.5kg"],["Carrots","1  bunch"],["Celeriac","1"],["Parsnips","2"],["Parsley","Sprigs of fresh"],["Leek","1/2"],["Onion","1 large"],["Bay Leaf","2"],["Peppercorns","5"],["Salt","Pinch"]],"s":"Step 1\r\nSlice the unpeeled onion in half widthways and fry off the cut surfaces without fat until fairly well browned.\r\n\r\nStep 2\r\nPut around 3 litres of water into a large saucepan. Add the root vegetables, leek, halves of onion, bay leaves, and peppercorns and bring to a boil. Add the washed meat and bones and, depending on the type of meat, allow to cook until softened in gently simmering water, which will take around 2 1⁄2 – 3 hours. Add more water as required and skim off any foam from the surface. \r\n\r\nStep 3\r\nSeason well with salt, but only after a good 2 hours.\r\n\r\nStep 4\r\nOnce the meat has softened, remove it from the pan and keep it warm in some of the liquid from the soup. Season the remainder of the soup again with salt to taste, and strain it (optional). Serve with semolina dumplings or \"Frittaten\" (sliced pancakes - a traditional Austrian soup garnish) and freshly chopped chives as a starter. Afterwards, slice the boiled beef by cutting on the bias and arrange it on pre-heated plates, or serve in the hot soup in a decorative soup tureen.\r\n\r\nStep 5\r\nServe with roast potatoes, a bread and horseradish mix, green beans in a dill sauce, or creamed spinach and chive sauce. If the root vegetables are to be served at the same time, cook some of them separately to be served al dente.","z":"步骤1\r\n将未去皮的洋葱横向切成两半，然后将切面煎至无油，直至呈棕色。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将大约 3 升水放入一个大平底锅中。加入根类蔬菜、韭菜、半个洋葱、月桂叶和花椒，煮沸。加入洗净的肉和骨头，根据肉的类型，在小火中煮至软，大约需要 2 1⁄2 – 3 小时。根据需要添加更多的水，并撇去表面的泡沫。 \r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n加盐调味，但要在 2 小时后。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n肉软化后，将其从锅中取出，并在汤中的一些液体中保温。再次用盐调味剩余的汤，然后过滤（可选）。与粗面粉饺子或“Frittaten”（切片煎饼 - 一种传统的奥地利汤配菜）和新鲜切碎的细香葱作为开胃菜。然后，将煮熟的牛肉斜切成片，放在预热的盘子上，或者放在装饰性汤碗中的热汤中。\r\n\r\n步骤5\r\n搭配烤土豆、面包和辣根混合物、莳萝酱青豆或奶油菠菜香葱酱。如果要同时食用根类蔬菜，请将其中一些分开烹调，以便食用时更有嚼劲。"},{"id":"53535","n":"Tamal De Maicena","a":"","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/mjgl9z1784393681.jpg","y":"","i":[["Milk","4 cups"],["Butter","1 knob"],["Sugar","2 1/2 cups"],["Vanilla","2 tsp"],["Cornstarch","2 cups"],["Eggs","2 Beaten"]],"s":"Preheat the oven at 350F.\r\nIn a non-stick medium pot, add the milk, butter, sugar, and vanilla; bring to a boil, and reduce heat to low.\r\nIn a large bowl, add the eggs and the cornstarch and mix well. Slowly add 1 cup of the milk mixture, mixing constantly to temper the eggs. Keep adding more milk until the mixture is soft and has no lumps. \r\n​\r\nAdd the mixture to the pot SLOWLY and mix constantly using a wooden spoon.\r\nKeep cooking and mixing for a few more minutes until the mixture gets thick, you will know when it is ready when passing a spoon at the bottom of the pot creates a line that separates the mixture.\r\n\r\nRemove from heat and pour into the pyrex (no need to grease it ( I use an 11 by 8-inch pyrex).\r\nCover with foil and cook for approximately 50 min. Remove the foil after 30 min of cooking to allow the top to get a light brown color.  Let it cool completely before serving.","z":"将烤箱预热至 350 华氏度。\r\n在不粘锅中，加入牛奶、黄油、糖和香草精；煮沸，并将热量降至最低。\r\n在一个大碗中，加入鸡蛋和玉米淀粉，搅拌均匀。慢慢加入 1 杯牛奶混合物，不断搅拌以调和鸡蛋。继续添加更多牛奶，直到混合物变软并且没有结块。 \r\n​\r\n将混合物慢慢加入锅中，并用木勺不断搅拌。\r\n继续烹饪和混合几分钟，直到混合物变稠，当将勺子放在锅底时会形成一条将混合物分开的线，您就会知道它何时准备好。\r\n\r\n从火上移开并倒入耐热玻璃（无需润滑（我使用 11 x 8 英寸耐热玻璃）。\r\n盖上箔纸，煮约 50 分钟。烹饪 30 分钟后取下箔纸，使顶部变成浅棕色。  食用前让它完全冷却。"},{"id":"53404","n":"Tavë Kosi Baked Lamb and Yogurt","a":"","c":"Lamb","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/a1mi7t1779643816.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sinI-D-vhKU","i":[["Lamb","600g"],["Butter","20g"],["Olive Oil","2 tablespoons"],["Rice","70g"],["Oregano","2 tsp"],["Boiling Water","450ml"],["Garlic","2 cloves chopped"],["Salt","Pinch"],["Pepper","Pinch"],["Butter","50g"],["Flour","2 tablespoons"],["Greek Yogurt","750g"],["Eggs","6"],["Salt","Pinch"],["Pepper","Pinch"]],"s":"1\r\nBaking the Lamb\r\nIn a large pan (with a lid) melt the butter and olive oil together then add the diced lamb. Brown the lamb on a medium heat, this will take around 5 minutes.\r\n2\r\nAdd the garlic, oregano, 300ml of water and season with salt and pepper. Mix well before covering with the lid. Leave to simmer for 50 minutes mixing a couple of times ensuring the lamb doesn’t start to burn.\r\n3\r\nThe juices should have nearly all boiled away so another 150ml of water should be added along with the rice. Mix altogether, bring to the boil, place the lid on and leave for just 10 minutes. It’s advised to check at around 8 minutes – you want the liquid to be evaporated with just moist coating of oily water left over the lamb and rice.\r\n4\r\nPlace the lamb and rice into a casserole dish, the mixture should fully cover the base and have at least 2 inches spare for the yogurt. Alternatively you can split into four ceramic bowls.\r\n5\r\nMaking a Roux\r\nIn a small saucepan melt the butter over a medium heat and then add two tablespoons of flour while continuously stirring for two minutes (add a little extra flour if needed). The roux should not be thick but not too runny, the colour will darken slightly. Pour the roux into a bowl and keep to one side.\r\n6\r\nMaking the Yogurt Mixture\r\nIn a mixing bowl add the yogurt, eggs and season with salt and pepper. Mix together then add the roux continuing to mix fast for a minute to ensure the roux and yogurt are thoroughly combined.\r\n7\r\nPour the yogurt mixture over the baked lamb and rice and sprinkle on a little oregano.\r\n8\r\nCooking\r\nPlace on the bottom shelf of the oven on 180 degrees for 35 minutes then move it up to the middle for a further 10 minutes. The Tavë kosi is ready when the yogurt has risen up high and a golden crust formed.\r\n9\r\nLeave to cool for 5 – 10 minutes before serving.","z":"1\r\n烤羊肉\r\n在一个大平底锅（有盖）中将黄油和橄榄油融化在一起，然后加入羊肉丁。用中火将羊肉煎至棕色，大约需要 5 分钟。\r\n2\r\n加入大蒜、牛至、300 毫升水，用盐和胡椒调味。盖上盖子之前充分混合。小火煮 50 分钟，搅拌几次，确保羊肉不会烧焦。\r\n3\r\n汁液应该几乎全部煮沸，因此应与米饭一起添加 150 毫升水。混合均匀，煮沸，盖上盖子，煮 10 分钟。建议在 8 分钟左右检查——你希望液体蒸发，只在羊肉和米饭上留下一层潮湿的油水。\r\n4\r\n将羊肉和米饭放入砂锅中，混合物应完全覆盖底部，并留出至少 2 英寸的空间用于放置酸奶。或者，您可以分成四个陶瓷碗。\r\n5\r\n制作肉酱\r\n在一个小平底锅中，用中火融化黄油，然后加入两汤匙面粉，同时连续搅拌两分钟（如果需要，可以添加一点额外的面粉）。面糊不能太稠，但也不能太稀，颜色会稍微变深。将面粉糊倒入碗中并放在一侧。\r\n6\r\n制作酸奶混合物\r\n在搅拌碗中加入酸奶、鸡蛋，并用盐和胡椒调味。混合在一起，然后加入面糊，继续快速混合一分钟，以确保面糊和酸奶彻底混合。\r\n7\r\n将酸奶混合物倒在烤羊肉和米饭上，撒上一点牛至。\r\n8\r\n烹饪\r\n放入烤箱底层，180度烤35分钟，然后移至中间层再烤10分钟。当酸奶升得很高并形成金色外壳时，Tavë kosi 就准备好了。\r\n9\r\n食用前冷却 5 – 10 分钟。"},{"id":"53405","n":"Tavë me Presh ska Mish Meatless Leek Bake","a":"","c":"Vegetarian","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/p5m3w21779644533.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uRAmHFjVMEA","i":[["Leek","500g"],["Red Pepper","3 diced"],["Rice","200g"],["Garlic","1 clove finely chopped"],["Vegetable Stock","1 L"],["Paprika","1 tsp"],["Oregano","1 tsp"],["Parsley","1 tsp"],["Basil","1 tsp"],["Salt","Pinch"],["Pepper","Pinch"],["Olive Oil","Splash"]],"s":"1\r\nPrepare the dish\r\nFry the leeks in a small dash of olive oil for a few minutes until they start to brown.\r\n2\r\nPrepare the Dish\r\nAdd the roasted red peppers, garlic, stock, herbs, salt, pepper and paprika. Give it a good stir, add the rice and stir again.\r\n3\r\nLeave it to come to the boil. Leave to simmer for 2 minutes.\r\n4\r\nPour the mixture into a baking tray with a depth of 2 inches or more. Mix thoroughly and ensure equally levelled out.\r\n5\r\nCooking\r\nPlace on the bottom self of a preheated oven at 180 degrees. Leave to bake for 1 hour.\r\n6\r\nServing\r\nOnce cooked turn off the oven and keeping the door open leave the leek bake to cool for 10 minutes before serving.","z":"1\r\n准备菜\r\n用少量橄榄油将韭葱煎几分钟，直至变成棕色。\r\n2\r\n准备菜肴\r\n加入烤红辣椒、大蒜、高汤、香草、盐、胡椒和辣椒粉。充分搅拌，加入米饭并再次搅拌。\r\n3\r\n让它煮沸。煮 2 分钟。\r\n4\r\n将混合物倒入烤盘中，深度为2英寸或更深。充分混合并确保均匀平整。\r\n5\r\n烹饪\r\n放入预热好的烤箱底部，180度。烘烤 1 小时。\r\n6\r\n服务\r\n煮熟后，关闭烤箱并保持门打开，让韭葱烘烤冷却 10 分钟，然后食用。"},{"id":"53448","n":"Tendir Choreyi (Tandoori Bread)","a":"","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/5mfmh01780158856.jpg","y":"","i":[["Yeast","2 1/2 Tsp"],["Warm Water","1 1/2 cups"],["Salt","1 tsp"],["Flour","3 Cups"],["Egg Yolks","For brushing"],["Poppy Seeds","1 tsp"]],"s":"First a quick note about tandoori bread (or tandoori anything, really). The name comes from the clay oven, or \"tandoor\" that it is traditionally cooked in, and you will never be able to duplicate the flavor of any tandoori recipe without one of those ovens, no matter how hard you try. Now, a tandoor oven is actually a part of my dream kitchen (I love naan bread and tandoori chicken) but I don't have one in my current kitchen, so this bread just goes in a plain oven, which makes it not very authentic. However, this is how an Azerbaijani stranded in the US would make a tandoori bread, so I guess I don't feel too bad about including it in my meal.\r\n\r\nThe ingredients for this bread are roughly similar to the ingredients for a basic french bread, but the shape is different and it is topped with poppy seeds which actually makes it quite beautiful in appearance. In fact this bread is quite possibly the most beautiful thing I've ever baked (my cakes certainly don't fall into that category).\r\nSo as always I used my bread machine, but this time I didn't proof the yeast first. I just put it in the little yeast dispenser at the top of my machine, then added the water, flour and salt to the bucket. I put it on the dough cycle and then went and picked my kids up from school.\r\n\r\nThis bread uses very basic ingredients, including bread flour and salt.\r\n\r\nIf you want to do it the old-fashioned way:\r\n\r\nMix the yeast with the water and let stand for a few minutes. Then sift the flour with the salt into a large bowl. Gradually add the water and yeast and mix with your hand until the dough forms a ball.\r\nTurn out onto a lightly floured surface. Knead the dough for 8 to 10 minutes, or until it is smooth. Put it in a large bowl and cover, then let it rise in a warm spot until doubled (this typically takes 1 to 1 1/2 hours).\r\n\r\nThe dough after it has risen.\r\n\r\nPunch down and turn out onto a lightly floured surface. Stretch the dough until it is an oblong shape, then with a rolling pin roll it until it is about 1/2 inch thick. Transfer to a greased or non-stick baking sheet and let stand for another 15 minutes.\r\n\r\nAfter stretching and rolling, your dough should be roughly this shape.\r\n\r\nCut crosshatches in the top of the dough, about four in either direction. Brush with the beaten egg yolk (I mixed mine with a little bit of water to make it easier to work with) and sprinkle with poppy seeds.\r\n\r\nCrosshatches, egg wash and poppy seeds give this bread its distinctive look.\r\n\r\nBake in a preheated oven at about 400 degrees for 20 to 25 minutes, until golden on top","z":"首先简单介绍一下坦杜里面包（或者坦杜里任何东西，真的）。这个名字来自粘土烤箱，或传统上烹饪的“tandoori”，如果没有这些烤箱，无论你多么努力，你都永远无法复制任何tandoori食谱的味道。现在，泥炉实际上是我梦想厨房的一部分（我喜欢印度烤饼和泥炉烤鸡），但我现在的厨房里没有泥炉，所以这种面包只是放在普通烤箱中，这使得它不太正宗。然而，这就是滞留在美国的阿塞拜疆人制作唐杜里面包的方法，所以我想我对将其加入我的饭菜中并没有感到太难过。\r\n\r\n这款面包的成分和基本的法式面包的成分大致相似，但形状不同，而且上面还撒了罂粟籽，看起来相当漂亮。事实上，这种面包很可能是我烤过的最漂亮的东西（我的蛋糕当然不属于这一类）。\r\n所以和往常一样，我使用面包机，但这次我没有先发酵酵母。我只是将其放入机器顶部的小酵母分配器中，然后将水、面粉和盐添加到桶中。我把它放在面团循环中，然后去学校接我的孩子们。\r\n\r\n这种面包使用非常基本的成分，包括面包粉和盐。\r\n\r\n如果你想用老式的方式来做：\r\n\r\n将酵母与水混合，静置几分钟。然后将面粉和盐筛入一个大碗中。逐渐加入水和酵母，用手搅拌直至面团形成球状。\r\n放在撒了少许面粉的表面上。揉面团 8 至 10 分钟，或直至光滑。将其放入一个大碗中并盖上盖子，然后将其放在温暖的地方发酵至两倍大（通常需要 1 至 1 1/2 小时）。\r\n\r\n面团醒发后。\r\n\r\n向下打孔，然后放在撒有少许面粉的表面上。将面团拉伸至长方形，然后用擀面杖擀至约 1/2 英寸厚。转移到涂有油脂或不粘烤盘上，再静置 15 分钟。\r\n\r\n拉伸和擀压后，面团应该大致是这样的形状。\r\n\r\n在面团顶部切十字线，每个方向大约四个。刷上打好的蛋黄（我将蛋黄与一点水混合，以便更容易使用）并撒上罂粟籽。\r\n\r\n交叉线、蛋液和罂粟籽赋予这款面包独特的外观。\r\n\r\n放入预热好的烤箱，400度左右，烤20到25分钟，直至表面金黄"},{"id":"53444","n":"Tirolean Dumplings","a":"","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/jbw8m11780155348.jpg","y":"","i":[["Bread","200g"],["Milk","200ml"],["Smoked Ham","100g"],["Eggs","3"],["Shallots","2"],["Butter","Knob"],["Parsley","2 tablespoons"],["Flour","2 tablespoons"],["Salt","To taste"],["Pepper","To taste"],["Nutmeg","Pinch"],["Butter","Garnish"],["Parsley","Garnish"]],"s":"Step 1\r\nFinely chop the shallots, and dice the smoked ham or sausage into small cubes. Heat some butter or clarified butter in a pan and sweat the onions in it until translucent. Add the meat and the parsley and fry together briefly before removing from the heat.\r\n\r\nStep 2\r\nPlace the bread in a bowl. Beat the milk with the eggs and season well with salt, pepper and nutmeg. Pour over the bread. Stir in the sausage and onion paste and mix in the flour. Mix together to form a relatively firm paste (adding more bread or flour if necessary) and season again according to taste. Smooth the surface of the dough out and leave to stand for approx. 30 minutes.\r\n\r\nStep 3\r\nHeat up a good quantity of salted water in a large pan. Use the paste to form smaller dumplings (for use as a garnish in soups) or medium-sized dumplings, as required. Moisten the hands regularly with cold water during this stage so that the dumplings take on smooth forms.\r\n\r\nStep 4\r\nPlace in boiling water, bring back to the boil, turn down the heat, and simmer gently for 8-20 minutes, depending on the size.\r\n\r\nStep 5\r\nRemove from the water, dry off well and serve up garnished with chopped parsley and melted butter (which has been taken on a nut-brown colour).","z":"步骤1\r\n将青葱切碎，将熏火腿或香肠切成小方块。在锅中加热一些黄油或澄清黄油，然后将洋葱放入其中，直至半透明。加入肉和欧芹，一起煎一下，然后离火。\r\n\r\n步骤2\r\n将面包放入碗中。将牛奶与鸡蛋一起搅拌，并用盐、胡椒和肉豆蔻充分调味。倒在面包上。加入香肠和洋葱酱，然后加入面粉。混合在一起形成相对坚硬的糊状物（如有必要，添加更多面包或面粉），然后根据口味再次调味。将面团表面弄平，静置约 1 分钟。 30分钟。\r\n\r\n步骤3\r\n在一个大锅中加热大量盐水。根据需要，用糊剂包成较小的饺子（用作汤的装饰）或中等大小的饺子。在此阶段，经常用冷水润湿双手，使饺子的形状变得光滑。\r\n\r\n步骤4\r\n放入沸水中，重新煮沸，关小火，小火煮8-20分钟，具体取决于大小。\r\n\r\n步骤5\r\n从水中取出，充分干燥，并饰以切碎的欧芹和融化的黄油（已呈坚果棕色）。"},{"id":"53415","n":"Torrijas","a":"","c":"Breakfast","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/927vvp1779732018.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ympLYopSKow","i":[["Orange","1 medium"],["Lemon","1 medium"],["Whole Milk","4 cups"],["Sugar","1/2 cup"],["Cinnamon Stick","1"],["Dry sherry","1/3 cup"],["Baguette","1"],["Olive Oil","1 cup"],["Eggs","4 large"],["Honey","To serve"]],"s":"Finely grate the zest of 1 medium orange (about 2 teaspoons) and 1 medium lemon (about 1 teaspoon) into a medium saucepan.\r\nAdd 1 quart whole milk, 1/2 cup granulated sugar, and 1 (3-inch) cinnamon stick. Bring to a boil over medium heat. Remove the pan from the heat and add 1/3 cup dry sherry. Let sit until cool enough to handle. Meanwhile, cut 1 (12-ounce) day-old baguette crosswise into 1-inch-thick slices (about 16). Arrange in a single layer on a rimmed baking sheet.\r\nPour the milk mixture over the bread and let it soak for 5 minutes. Flip each slice of bread. Let the bread sit until it absorbs most of the liquid but isn't falling apart, about 5 minutes more.\r\nHeat 1 cup olive oil in a large frying pan over medium-high heat until shimmering. Meanwhile, whisk 4 eggs together in a medium bowl.\r\nWorking with 1 slice at a time, dip the bread in the egg mixture to coat. Let the excess drip off, then add to the pan. Repeat with as many slices as needed until the pan is filled with a single layer. Fry until golden-brown on the bottom, about 4 minutes. Flip the slices and fry until the second side until golden-brown, 3 to 4 minutes more. Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate or baking sheet. Repeat dipping and frying the remaining bread. Drizzle with honey to serve.","z":"将 1 个中等大小的橙子（约 2 茶匙）和 1 个中等大小的柠檬（约 1 茶匙）的皮碎放入中等大小的平底锅中。\r\n添加 1 夸脱全脂牛奶、1/2 杯砂糖和 1 根（3 英寸）肉桂棒。用中火煮沸。将锅从火上移开，加入 1/3 杯干雪利酒。静置直至冷却到可以处理。同时，将 1 个（12 盎司）日龄长棍面包横向切成 1 英寸厚的片（约 16 片）。在有边的烤盘上单层排列。\r\n将牛奶混合物倒在面包上，浸泡 5 分钟。翻转每片面包。让面包静置约 5 分钟，直至吸收大部分液体但不会散开。\r\n在大煎锅中用中高火加热 1 杯橄榄油，直至闪烁。同时，将 4 个鸡蛋放入一个中等大小的碗中，搅拌在一起。\r\n一次切一片，将面包浸入鸡蛋混合物中涂上一层。让多余的滴下来，然后添加到锅中。根据需要重复尽可能多的切片，直到平底锅充满单层。煎至底部呈金黄色，约4分钟。将切片翻转并煎至另一面呈金黄色，再煎 3 至 4 分钟。转移到衬有纸巾的盘子或烤盘上。重复浸渍和煎炸剩余的面包。淋上蜂蜜即可食用。"},{"id":"53391","n":"Traditional Dutch rice tart (rijstevlaai)","a":"","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/x8opo81777582259.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Od8EjjvwN_Y","i":[["Flour","200g"],["Coconut Oil","75g"],["Vegetable Millk","100g"],["Yeast","10g"],["Sugar","50g"],["Dessert Rice","150g"],["Sugar","100g"],["Vegetable Millk","700g"],["Vanilla Extract","1 tsp"],["Cardamom","2"],["Star Anise","2"],["Cinnamon Stick","1"],["Baking Powder","1/2 tsp"],["Lemon Juice","1/2 tsp"]],"s":"Heat the oven to 180°C. For the dough, mix flour and sugar in a bowl. Heat the 100 grams of milk to lukewarm and dissolve the yeast in it. Let stand for a while until it starts to bubble. Then add to the flour along with the coconut oil and mix into a smooth dough. Let rise for 30 minutes, covered, in a warm place.\r\nMeanwhile, make the rice pudding by putting the rice with sugar, milk and vanilla extract in a saucepan. Add the cardamom, star anise and cinnamon. Bring to a boil and cook, stirring constantly. Take out the spices. In a small bowl, mix baking soda with lemon juice/apple vinegar. Stir well until baking soda is dissolved, then mix into the rice pudding.\r\nRoll out the dough on a floured work surface (it is very sticky, but don’t stress it will be fine) and line the bottom and edges of a greased mold with it. Spread the rice pudding over the bottom and bake for about 25 to 30 minutes.","z":"将烤箱加热至 180°C。对于面团，将面粉和糖在碗中混合。将100克牛奶加热至微温，将酵母溶解在其中。静置一段时间，直到开始冒泡。然后与椰子油一起加入面粉中，搅拌成光滑的面团。盖上盖子，放在温暖的地方发酵 30 分钟。\r\n与此同时，将米饭与糖、牛奶和香草精一起放入平底锅中，制作米饭布丁。添加小豆蔻、八角茴香和肉桂。煮沸并煮，不断搅拌。取出香料。在一个小碗中，将小苏打与柠檬汁/苹果醋混合。充分搅拌直至小苏打溶解，然后混入八宝粥中。\r\n将面团在撒了面粉的工作台上擀开（它很粘，但不要用力，它会很好），然后将其放在涂有油脂的模具的底部和边缘上。将米饭布丁铺在底部，烘烤约 25 至 30 分钟。"},{"id":"53416","n":"Trinxat (Potato, Cabbage and Bacon Hash)","a":"","c":"Pork","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/khpso71779732715.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/Ro-S7zlFvN4","i":[["Cabbage","1/2"],["Russet Potato","2 medium"],["Bacon","4 Chopped"],["Garlic","2 cloves minced"],["Parsley","1 tablespoon"],["Salt","To taste"],["Pepper","To taste"]],"s":"Bring salted water to boil in a large pot.\r\nAdd in the cabbage and potatoes, cook until tender about 30-40 minutes\r\nWhen tender, drain, very well.\r\nReturn the vegetables to the pot and turn on the burner to low. Let steam\r\nMeanwhile cook up the bacon, reserving the fat for frying the hash.\r\nChop up the bacon, into small pieces.\r\nMash the potatoes and cabbage with a potato masher and add in the minced garlic.\r\nAdd in salt and pepper to taste.\r\nUsing a form for individual servings, press the hash mixture into the form with bacon on top, fry in the reserved bacon fat until golden brown, flip over and repeat on the other side.\r\nRemove form and garnish with chopped parsley.\r\nIf you want to make one big hash, just use a skillet, pressing the hash into the skillet with the bacon pieces and reserved fat, then flip over once golden brown. Cut into servings.\r\nGarnish with chopped parsley.","z":"将盐水放入大锅中煮沸。\r\n加入卷心菜和土豆，煮约30-40分钟至变软\r\n变软后，沥干，很好。\r\n将蔬菜放回锅中，然后将火开至小火。让蒸汽\r\n同时煮培根，保留脂肪用于煎炸土豆泥。\r\n将培根切碎，切成小块。\r\n用土豆捣碎器将土豆和卷心菜捣碎，然后加入蒜末。\r\n加入盐和胡椒调味。\r\n使用单独份量的模具，将哈希混合物压入模具中，上面放上培根，用保留的培根脂肪煎至金黄色，翻转并在另一侧重复。\r\n取出模具，用切碎的欧芹装饰。\r\n如果你想做一个大的哈希，只需使用煎锅，将哈希与培根片和保留的脂肪一起压入煎锅中，然后翻转一次呈金黄色。切成份。\r\n用切碎的欧芹装饰。"},{"id":"53394","n":"Zeeuwse bolussen","a":"","c":"Dessert","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/qawvoy1777627952.jpg","y":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ypXGr9NdMZU","i":[["Yeast","10g"],["Milk","200ml"],["Sugar","25g"],["Flour","400g"],["Egg","1 medium"],["Unsalted Butter","75g"],["Salt","1 tsp"],["Cinnamon","1 tablespoon"],["Cardamom","1 tablespoon"],["Brown Sugar","75g"],["Brown Sugar","250g"]],"s":"Place the dried yeast, milk and sugar in the bowl of your food processor. Mix and let stand for a few minutes until it begins to foam.\r\nThen add the flour, egg, butter, salt, 1 tsp of cinnamon and cardamom and process until smooth.\r\nForm the dough into a ball, cover the bowl and let it rise for 1 hour or until it has doubled in size.\r\nMix the caster sugar with 1 tablespoon of cinnamon, pour over the dough and roll it in.\r\nForm 10 equal balls (about 75 grams each) and let them “sweat” for a while. The sugar will dissolve a little. When you roll them again later, the rest of the dough will absorb the sugar better.\r\nThen roll the ball into a strand about 35-40 centimeters long while rolling through the powdered sugar.\r\nFold the strand around one end and tuck the other end under the bolus. Push something between the roll to secure the end.\r\nPlace on a baking sheet lined with a baking sheet, cover with plastic wrap and let them rise for ½-1 hour.\r\nMeanwhile, preheat the oven to 250 degrees Celsius/480 Fahrenheit top and bottom heat\r\nBake the Zeeland Boluses for about 8 minutes until done. Be careful – if you bake them too long, they will get dry and you will want something sticky 😉 .\r\nLet them cool out of the oven for 1 minute, then turn them over and let them cool further (on a wire rack if necessary). Enjoy!","z":"将干酵母、牛奶和糖放入食品加工机的碗中。混合并静置几分钟直至开始起泡。\r\n然后加入面粉、鸡蛋、黄油、盐、1 茶匙肉桂和小豆蔻，搅拌至光滑。\r\n将面团揉成球状，盖上碗，发酵 1 小时或直至其尺寸增加一倍。\r\n将细砂糖与 1 汤匙肉桂混合，倒在面团上，然后滚进去。\r\n揉成 10 个大小相等的球（每个约 75 克），让它们“出汗”一会儿。糖会稍微溶解。当你稍后再次滚动它们时，面团的其余部分会更好地吸收糖。\r\n然后将球滚成约35-40厘米长的线，同时滚过糖粉。\r\n将线绕一端折叠，并将另一端塞入丸剂下方。在卷筒之间推一些东西以固定末端。\r\n放在铺有烤盘的烤盘上，盖上保鲜膜，发酵 ½-1 小时。\r\n同时，将烤箱预热至 250 摄氏度/480 华氏度，顶部和底部加热\r\n将 Zeeland Boluses 烘烤约 8 分钟直至完成。小心——如果你烤得太久，它们会变干，你会想要一些粘的东西。\r\n让它们从烤箱中冷却 1 分钟，然后将它们翻过来，让它们进一步冷却（如有必要，可放在金属架上）。享受！"},{"id":"53566","n":"plantain rolls","a":"","c":"Side","t":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/6ebldy1784672108.jpg","y":"","i":[["Plantain","3"],["Vegetable Oil","1 cup"],["Codfish Bulljaw","1/2 lb"],["Parsley","1/4 cup"]],"s":"Peel plantains\r\nSlice them in ¼ inch slices (horizontally)\r\n\r\nHeat oil in the frying and add your plantain slices to the pan\r\nfried plantain rolls\r\nWhen they start getting golden brown, turn them over\r\nRemove from the frying pan when both sides are brown, and place them on a plater lined with paper towel to absorb the oil\r\nPlace codfish bulljaw on the end of your plantain slice and roll it\r\nSecure the roll with the toothpick or skewer (I like using knotted bamboo)\r\n\r\nGarnish and enjoy!\r\n","z":"剥车前草\r\n将它们切成 1/4 英寸的片（水平）\r\n\r\n将油加热，然后将车前草片放入锅中\r\n炸车前草卷\r\n当它们开始变成金黄色时，将它们翻过来\r\n煎至两面焦黄后取出，放在铺有纸巾的盘子上吸干油分\r\n将鳕鱼大颚放在车前草片的末端，然后卷起来\r\n用牙签或串子固定卷（我喜欢用打结的竹子）\r\n\r\n装饰并享用！"},{"id":"cn001","n":"Homestyle Kung Pao Chicken","a":"Chinese","c":"Chicken","t":"","y":"","i":[["Chicken Thighs","300 g"],["Dried Chillies","8"],["Szechuan Peppercorns","1 tsp"],["Roasted Peanut","50 g"],["Soy Sauce","1 tbsp"],["Rice Vinegar","1 tbsp"],["Sugar","1 tbsp"],["Starch","1 tbsp"],["Ginger","1 piece"],["Garlic","3 cloves"],["Vegetable Oil","3 tbsp"],["Salt","to taste"]],"s":"Cut the chicken thighs into 1.5cm cubes. Toss with 1 tbsp soy sauce, 1 tsp starch and 1 tsp oil; marinate 10 minutes.\n\nMix the sauce: 1 tbsp soy sauce, 1 tbsp vinegar, 1 tbsp sugar and 1 tsp starch with 2 tbsp water.\n\nHeat 3 tbsp oil in a wok over medium heat. Add the dried chillies and peppercorns; stir-fry until fragrant but not burnt.\n\nAdd ginger and garlic, then the chicken. Stir-fry over high heat until just cooked through.\n\nPour in the sauce and toss until it thickens and glazes the chicken.\n\nStir in the roasted peanuts, toss once more and serve hot.","z":"鸡腿去骨切成1.5厘米见方的丁，加1勺生抽、1小勺淀粉和1小勺油抓匀，腌10分钟。\n\n调一碗料汁：1勺生抽、1勺香醋、1勺糖、1小勺淀粉，加2勺水搅匀备用。\n\n热锅倒3勺油，中火下干辣椒段和花椒，小火煸出糊辣香味，注意别煸黑了。\n\n下姜末蒜末爆香，转大火倒入鸡丁快速滑炒，炒到鸡丁变色断生。\n\n把料汁搅匀淋入锅中，大火收汁，让每块鸡丁都裹上亮亮的芡汁。\n\n最后倒入花生米翻炒几下出锅，趁热吃最香。","x":"cn"},{"id":"cn002","n":"Homestyle Mapo Tofu","a":"Chinese","c":"Pork","t":"","y":"","i":[["Tofu","400 g"],["Ground Pork","100 g"],["Doubanjiang","2 tbsp"],["Sichuan pepper","1 tsp"],["Fermented Black Beans","1 tbsp"],["Garlic","3 cloves"],["Ginger","1 piece"],["Spring Onions","2"],["Soy Sauce","1 tbsp"],["Starch","1 tbsp"],["Vegetable Oil","3 tbsp"],["Salt","to taste"]],"s":"Cut the tofu into 2cm cubes. Blanch in salted boiling water for 2 minutes, then drain gently.\n\nHeat oil in a wok. Stir-fry the ground pork until it browns and releases its fat.\n\nAdd doubanjiang, fermented black beans, ginger and garlic; fry until the oil turns red and fragrant.\n\nPour in 250ml water and the tofu. Simmer 5 minutes so the tofu absorbs the flavor; season with soy sauce and salt.\n\nThicken with starch mixed in water, stirring gently so the cubes stay whole.\n\nPlate up, sprinkle with ground Sichuan pepper and chopped spring onions. Serve sizzling hot.","z":"豆腐切2厘米小块，放入加盐的开水里焯2分钟，轻轻捞出沥干，这样不容易碎。\n\n热锅倒油，下肉末煸炒到变色出油，炒出肉香味。\n\n加入豆瓣酱、豆豉、姜末、蒜末，小火炒出红油，满屋飘香。\n\n倒入250毫升清水，轻轻放入豆腐块，小火咕嘟5分钟让豆腐入味，加生抽和盐调味。\n\n分两次淋入水淀粉勾芡，用锅铲轻轻推动，别把豆腐推碎了。\n\n出锅装盘，撒上现磨的花椒粉和葱花，趁热上桌，麻辣鲜香烫。","x":"cn"},{"id":"cn003","n":"Twice-Cooked Pork","a":"Chinese","c":"Pork","t":"","y":"","i":[["Pork belly slices","300 g"],["Leek","2"],["Doubanjiang","2 tbsp"],["Fermented Black Beans","1 tbsp"],["Ginger","3 slices"],["Garlic","3 cloves"],["Soy Sauce","1 tbsp"],["Sugar","1 tsp"],["Shaoxing Wine","1 tbsp"],["Vegetable Oil","1 tbsp"],["Salt","to taste"]],"s":"Simmer the pork belly in boiling water with ginger slices and Shaoxing wine for 20 minutes until just cooked. Cool, then slice thinly.\n\nHeat 1 tbsp oil in a wok over medium-high heat. Fry the pork slices until they curl and the edges brown.\n\nPush the pork aside; fry the doubanjiang and fermented black beans in the rendered fat until red and fragrant.\n\nAdd garlic, then toss everything with the pork.\n\nAdd the leek cut into sections, soy sauce and sugar. Stir-fry 2 minutes until the leek softens.\n\nSeason with a pinch of salt if needed and serve hot with rice.","z":"五花肉冷水下锅，加姜片、料酒，大火煮开转中小火煮20分钟，筷子能扎透就行。捞出晾凉，切成薄薄的大片。\n\n热锅倒少许油，中火下肉片煸炒，炒到肉片卷曲、边缘微微焦黄，逼出多余油脂。\n\n把肉片拨到一边，用煸出的猪油炒豆瓣酱和豆豉，小火炒出红亮的油色。\n\n下蒜末和肉片一起翻炒均匀，让每片肉都裹上酱色。\n\n加入切段的蒜苗（或大葱）、生抽和糖，大火快炒2分钟，蒜苗断生即可。\n\n尝尝咸淡，淡了补点盐，出锅配米饭吃，香得跺脚。","x":"cn"},{"id":"cn004","n":"Sichuan Boiled Fish","a":"Chinese","c":"Seafood","t":"","y":"","i":[["White Fish Fillets","400 g"],["Dried Chillies","15"],["Szechuan Peppercorns","1 tbsp"],["Doubanjiang","2 tbsp"],["Ginger","1 piece"],["Garlic","5 cloves"],["Spring Onions","3"],["Bean Sprouts","200 g"],["Starch","1 tbsp"],["Salt","to taste"],["Shaoxing Wine","1 tbsp"],["Vegetable Oil","5 tbsp"]],"s":"Slice the fish fillets thinly against the grain. Marinate with salt, Shaoxing wine and starch for 15 minutes.\n\nBlanch the bean sprouts in boiling water for 1 minute; lay them in a large serving bowl.\n\nHeat 3 tbsp oil; fry the doubanjiang, half the chillies, ginger and garlic until fragrant. Add 800ml water and bring to a boil.\n\nSlide in the fish slices one by one. Poach 2-3 minutes until just opaque; pour fish and broth over the bean sprouts.\n\nTop with the remaining dried chillies, peppercorns, garlic and spring onions.\n\nHeat the remaining 2 tbsp oil until smoking and pour over the top — it should sizzle dramatically. Serve immediately.","z":"鱼片顶刀切薄片，加盐、料酒、淀粉抓匀，腌15分钟上浆。\n\n豆芽开水焯1分钟捞出，铺在大碗底打底。\n\n热锅倒3勺油，下豆瓣酱、一半干辣椒、姜蒜末炒出红油，加800毫升水大火烧开。\n\n一片片下入鱼片，用筷子轻轻拨散，煮2到3分钟鱼片变白卷曲，连汤一起倒进大碗里。\n\n表面铺上剩下的干辣椒、花椒、蒜末和葱花。\n\n另起锅烧2勺油到冒青烟，趁热“滋啦”一声浇上去，香味瞬间炸开，趁热吃。","x":"cn"},{"id":"cn005","n":"Fish with Pickled Mustard Greens","a":"Chinese","c":"Seafood","t":"","y":"","i":[["Fish fillet","400 g"],["Chinese Cabbage","250 g"],["Dried Chillies","8"],["Szechuan Peppercorns","1 tsp"],["Ginger","1 piece"],["Garlic","4 cloves"],["Spring Onions","2"],["Starch","1 tbsp"],["Salt","to taste"],["White Vinegar","1 tbsp"],["Vegetable Oil","3 tbsp"],["Chicken Bouillon Powder","1 tsp"]],"s":"Slice the fish thinly; marinate with salt and starch for 15 minutes. (Traditionally made with sour pickled mustard greens; Chinese cabbage plus a splash of vinegar gives a similar tang.)\n\nHeat oil; fry ginger, garlic, half the chillies and peppercorns until fragrant.\n\nAdd the cabbage and stir-fry 2 minutes. Pour in 800ml water, add white vinegar and bouillon powder; boil 5 minutes.\n\nSlide in the fish slices; poach 2-3 minutes until opaque.\n\nLadle into a bowl and top with remaining chillies, garlic and spring onions.\n\nHeat 1 tbsp oil until smoking and pour over to sizzle. Serve hot.","z":"鱼片切薄片，加盐和淀粉抓匀腌15分钟。（正宗酸菜鱼用酸菜，这里用白菜加少许白醋模拟酸香味，着急吃也够味。）\n\n热锅倒油，下姜片、蒜末、一半干辣椒和花椒爆香。\n\n倒入白菜丝翻炒2分钟，加800毫升水、一勺白醋和鸡精，大火煮5分钟出味。\n\n一片片下入鱼片，轻轻拨散，煮2到3分钟至鱼片发白。\n\n连汤盛入大碗，表面放上剩下的干辣椒、蒜末和葱花。\n\n烧一勺热油到冒烟，浇上去“滋啦”一声，酸辣开胃，趁热吃。","x":"cn"},{"id":"cn006","n":"Mao Xue Wang","a":"Chinese","c":"Pork","t":"","y":"","i":[["Pork belly slices","200 g"],["Wood Ear Mushrooms","50 g"],["Bean Sprouts","200 g"],["Doubanjiang","2 tbsp"],["Dried Chillies","12"],["Szechuan Peppercorns","1 tbsp"],["Ginger","1 piece"],["Garlic","4 cloves"],["Spring Onions","2"],["Starch","1 tsp"],["Salt","to taste"],["Vegetable Oil","4 tbsp"]],"s":"Soak the wood ear mushrooms until soft; tear into pieces. (Classic Mao Xue Wang uses duck blood and tripe; this home version keeps the same fiery broth.)\n\nBlanch bean sprouts and wood ear 2 minutes; lay in a serving bowl.\n\nHeat 3 tbsp oil; fry doubanjiang, ginger, garlic and half the chillies until the oil turns red. Add 700ml water; boil 5 minutes.\n\nAdd the pork slices; cook 3 minutes until done. Pour everything over the vegetables.\n\nTop with remaining chillies, peppercorns and spring onions.\n\nHeat 1 tbsp oil until smoking; pour over to sizzle and serve.","z":"木耳泡发撕小朵。（正宗毛血旺用鸭血、毛肚，家里做就用五花肉片配时蔬，同一锅麻辣汤底，照样过瘾。）\n\n豆芽和木耳开水焯2分钟，捞出铺在大碗底。\n\n热锅倒3勺油，下豆瓣酱、姜蒜末和一半干辣椒炒出红油，加700毫升水煮5分钟。\n\n下入五花肉片煮3分钟断生，连汤带肉倒进大碗。\n\n表面撒上剩下的干辣椒、花椒和葱花。\n\n烧1勺油到冒青烟，浇上去激出香味，趁热吃，越吃越香。","x":"cn"},{"id":"cn007","n":"Fish-Fragrant Shredded Pork","a":"Chinese","c":"Pork","t":"","y":"","i":[["Pork Tenderloin","300 g"],["Wood Ear Mushrooms","30 g"],["Bamboo Shoot","100 g"],["Doubanjiang","1 tbsp"],["Sugar","2 tbsp"],["Rice Vinegar","2 tbsp"],["Soy Sauce","1 tbsp"],["Ginger","1 piece"],["Garlic","3 cloves"],["Spring Onions","2"],["Starch","1 tbsp"],["Vegetable Oil","3 tbsp"]],"s":"Cut the pork into matchstick shreds; marinate with 1 tsp soy sauce and 1 tsp starch for 10 minutes. Shred the soaked wood ear and bamboo shoot.\n\nMix the fish-fragrant sauce: 2 tbsp sugar, 2 tbsp vinegar, 1 tbsp soy sauce, 1 tbsp doubanjiang and 1 tsp starch with 3 tbsp water.\n\nHeat oil in a wok over high heat. Stir-fry the pork until it just turns white; remove.\n\nIn the same wok, fry ginger, garlic and spring onion whites until fragrant.\n\nReturn the pork with wood ear and bamboo shoot; toss 1 minute.\n\nPour in the sauce; stir-fry until thickened and glossy. Serve hot.","z":"猪里脊切火柴粗细的丝，加1小勺生抽、1小勺淀粉抓匀腌10分钟。木耳泡发切丝，笋切丝。\n\n调鱼香汁：2勺糖、2勺醋、1勺生抽、1勺豆瓣酱、1小勺淀粉，加3勺水搅匀。\n\n热锅倒油，大火下肉丝快速滑炒到变白，盛出备用。\n\n原锅下姜蒜末和葱白爆香。\n\n回锅倒入肉丝、木耳丝、笋丝，大火翻炒1分钟。\n\n把鱼香汁搅匀淋入，炒到汤汁浓稠发亮，每根肉丝都裹上酸甜微辣的汁，装盘。","x":"cn"},{"id":"cn008","n":"Homestyle Mapo Aubergine","a":"Chinese","c":"Pork","t":"","y":"","i":[["Aubergine","2"],["Ground Pork","100 g"],["Doubanjiang","2 tbsp"],["Sichuan pepper","1 tsp"],["Fermented Black Beans","1 tbsp"],["Garlic","3 cloves"],["Ginger","1 piece"],["Spring Onions","2"],["Soy Sauce","1 tbsp"],["Sugar","1 tsp"],["Starch","1 tsp"],["Vegetable Oil","4 tbsp"]],"s":"Cut the aubergines into finger-length strips. Toss with 1 tsp salt; rest 10 minutes, then squeeze out the water.\n\nHeat oil in a wok; fry the aubergine over medium-high heat until golden and soft. Remove.\n\nFry the ground pork until browned. Add doubanjiang, fermented black beans, ginger and garlic; fry until fragrant.\n\nReturn the aubergine; add 100ml water, soy sauce and sugar. Simmer 3 minutes.\n\nThicken lightly with starch water, tossing to coat.\n\nPlate and dust with ground Sichuan pepper and spring onions.","z":"茄子切手指粗的长条，加1小勺盐拌匀腌10分钟，挤干水分，这样炒的时候少吸油。\n\n热锅多倒点油，中火把茄条煎到金黄变软，盛出。\n\n下肉末煸炒出油，加入豆瓣酱、豆豉、姜蒜末炒出红油。\n\n茄条回锅，加100毫升水、生抽和糖，小火煨3分钟入味。\n\n淋入薄芡翻匀，让酱汁裹住茄条。\n\n装盘撒上花椒粉和葱花，麻辣下饭。","x":"cn"},{"id":"cn009","n":"Dry-Fried Green Beans","a":"Chinese","c":"Pork","t":"","y":"","i":[["Green Beans","400 g"],["Ground Pork","80 g"],["Dried Chillies","6"],["Szechuan Peppercorns","1 tsp"],["Garlic","4 cloves"],["Ginger","1 piece"],["Soy Sauce","1 tbsp"],["Sugar","1 tsp"],["Salt","to taste"],["Vegetable Oil","4 tbsp"],["Spring Onions","1"]],"s":"Top and tail the green beans; pat completely dry — any water will make them soggy.\n\nHeat oil in a wok over medium heat. Fry the beans, stirring, 6-8 minutes until wrinkled and blistered.\n\nPush aside; add pork, dried chillies and peppercorns. Fry until the pork browns.\n\nAdd ginger and garlic; toss everything together 1 minute.\n\nSeason with soy sauce, sugar and salt.\n\nSprinkle with spring onion and serve.","z":"四季豆摘去两头，洗净后一定要晾干或擦干，带水下锅会发软不好吃。\n\n热锅倒油，中火把四季豆倒进去慢慢煸，煸6到8分钟，煸到表皮起皱发焦。\n\n拨到一边，下肉末、干辣椒段和花椒，炒到肉末变色出香。\n\n加入姜蒜末，所有材料大火合炒1分钟。\n\n加生抽、糖、盐调味炒匀。\n\n撒上葱花出锅，干香微辣，特别下饭。","x":"cn"},{"id":"cn010","n":"Mouth-Watering Chicken","a":"Chinese","c":"Starter","t":"","y":"","i":[["Chicken Legs","4"],["Ginger","1 piece"],["Spring Onions","3"],["Garlic","4 cloves"],["Dried Chillies","8"],["Szechuan Peppercorns","1 tsp"],["Soy Sauce","2 tbsp"],["Rice Vinegar","1 tbsp"],["Sugar","1 tbsp"],["Sesame Seed Oil","1 tbsp"],["Roasted Peanut","30 g"],["Salt","to taste"]],"s":"Simmer the chicken legs in boiling water with ginger and spring onions for 15 minutes. Turn off the heat; cover and rest 10 minutes.\n\nPlunge into iced water until cold — this keeps the skin springy. Drain and chop into pieces; arrange on a plate.\n\nToast the dried chillies and peppercorns in a dry pan until fragrant; crush coarsely.\n\nMix soy sauce, vinegar, sugar, minced garlic, sesame oil and 2 tbsp of the poaching broth into a sauce.\n\nSpoon the sauce over the chicken.\n\nTop with the crushed chilli-pepper mix and crushed peanuts. Serve cold or at room temperature.","z":"鸡腿冷水下锅，加姜片葱段，大火烧开转小火煮15分钟，关火加盖再焖10分钟。\n\n捞出立刻放进冰水里激凉，这样鸡皮爽脆，沥干后斩块装盘。\n\n干辣椒和花椒放干锅里小火焙香，擀成粗末。\n\n调料汁：生抽2勺、香醋1勺、糖1勺、蒜末、芝麻油，再加2勺煮鸡的原汤搅匀。\n\n把料汁均匀浇在鸡块上。\n\n撒上辣椒花椒末和压碎的花生米，拌匀就可以吃了，凉吃热吃都香，麻辣鲜香口水直流。","x":"cn"},{"id":"cn011","n":"Fuqi Feipian","a":"Chinese","c":"Starter","t":"","y":"","i":[["Beef","300 g"],["Ginger","1 piece"],["Star Anise","2"],["Dried Chillies","10"],["Szechuan Peppercorns","1 tbsp"],["Soy Sauce","2 tbsp"],["Rice Vinegar","1 tbsp"],["Sugar","1 tsp"],["Sesame Seed Oil","1 tbsp"],["Garlic","3 cloves"],["Spring Onions","2"],["Roasted Peanut","30 g"]],"s":"Simmer the beef in water with ginger and star anise for 40 minutes until tender. Cool completely, then slice paper-thin.\n\nToast dried chillies and peppercorns in a dry wok until fragrant; crush into a coarse mix with 3 tbsp hot oil poured over.\n\nWhisk soy sauce, vinegar, sugar, minced garlic, sesame oil and 2 tbsp beef broth into a dressing.\n\nArrange the beef slices on a plate.\n\nSpoon over the dressing.\n\nFinish with the chilli-pepper crunch, spring onions and crushed peanuts. Serve cold.","z":"牛肉冷水下锅，加姜片和八角，小火煮40分钟至软烂，捞出彻底晾凉后切成薄片，越薄越入味。\n\n干辣椒和花椒小火焙香，浇上3勺热油激出香味，擀成辣椒油酥。\n\n调汁：生抽、香醋、糖、蒜泥、芝麻油，加2勺牛肉原汤搅匀。\n\n牛肉片整齐码在盘中。\n\n均匀浇上调好的料汁。\n\n撒上辣椒油酥、葱花和花生碎，拌一拌，麻辣鲜香，越嚼越香，凉吃最地道。","x":"cn"},{"id":"cn012","n":"Dry Pot Cauliflower","a":"Chinese","c":"Vegetarian","t":"","y":"","i":[["Cauliflower","1"],["Doubanjiang","1 tbsp"],["Dried Chillies","8"],["Szechuan Peppercorns","1 tsp"],["Garlic","4 cloves"],["Ginger","1 piece"],["Spring Onions","2"],["Soy Sauce","1 tbsp"],["Sugar","1 tsp"],["Salt","to taste"],["Vegetable Oil","3 tbsp"]],"s":"Break the cauliflower into small florets.\n\nHeat oil in a wok over high heat. Sear the florets 4-5 minutes until charred at the edges.\n\nAdd dried chillies, peppercorns, ginger and garlic; fry until fragrant.\n\nStir in the doubanjiang; toss so every floret is coated.\n\nSeason with soy sauce, sugar and a pinch of salt.\n\nAdd spring onions, toss once more and serve — ideally still sizzling.","z":"花菜掰成小朵，洗净沥干。\n\n热锅倒油，大火下花菜煸炒4到5分钟，炒到边缘微微焦黄，带点锅气才香。\n\n下干辣椒、花椒、姜蒜片爆香。\n\n加入豆瓣酱翻炒，让每朵花菜都裹上红油。\n\n加生抽、糖和少许盐调味。\n\n撒入葱段大火翻匀出锅，干香麻辣，配米饭一绝。","x":"cn"},{"id":"cn013","n":"White Cut Chicken","a":"Chinese","c":"Chicken","t":"","y":"","i":[["Chicken","1"],["Ginger","1 piece"],["Spring Onions","4"],["Salt","1 tbsp"],["Sesame Seed Oil","1 tbsp"],["Vegetable Oil","2 tbsp"],["Shaoxing Wine","1 tbsp"]],"s":"Rub the chicken inside and out with salt and Shaoxing wine.\n\nBring a large pot of water to a boil with ginger and spring onions. Lower in the chicken, breast-side up.\n\nWhen it returns to a boil, turn the heat to the barest simmer; poach 20 minutes.\n\nTurn off the heat, cover and rest 15 minutes. Lift out and plunge into iced water until cold.\n\nDrain well and chop into serving pieces through the bone; arrange neatly on a plate.\n\nMince extra ginger and spring onion with a pinch of salt; pour over 2 tbsp smoking-hot oil and 1 tbsp sesame oil. Serve as the dipping sauce.","z":"整鸡里外抹上盐和料酒，腌15分钟去腥。\n\n大锅烧水，加姜片葱段，水开后把鸡提着脖子先烫一下鸡皮，再整只放入锅中。\n\n水再开后转最小火，保持微沸煮20分钟，鸡皮完整不破。\n\n关火加盖焖15分钟，捞出立刻浸入冰水激凉，鸡皮爽脆肉质嫩。\n\n沥干后斩块，整齐码盘。\n\n姜末葱末加少许盐，浇上2勺烧到冒烟的热油激香，再拌1勺芝麻油，就是经典的姜蓉蘸料，白切鸡的灵魂。","x":"cn"},{"id":"cn014","n":"Steamed Sea Bass","a":"Chinese","c":"Seafood","t":"","y":"","i":[["Sea Bass Fillets","400 g"],["Ginger","1 piece"],["Spring Onions","3"],["Soy Sauce","2 tbsp"],["Shaoxing Wine","1 tbsp"],["Salt","to taste"],["Sesame Seed Oil","1 tsp"],["Vegetable Oil","1 tbsp"]],"s":"Pat the fillets dry; rub with salt and Shaoxing wine. Lay half the ginger slices underneath and on top.\n\nBring the steamer to a full boil. Steam the fish 8-10 minutes until just opaque.\n\nCarefully pour off the liquid that collects on the plate — it tastes fishy.\n\nTop with fresh julienned ginger and spring onions.\n\nHeat 1 tbsp vegetable oil until smoking; pour over the aromatics so they sizzle.\n\nDrizzle with soy sauce and a few drops of sesame oil. Serve immediately.","z":"鱼身擦干，抹盐和料酒，盘底和鱼身上都铺姜片去腥。\n\n蒸锅水开后大火蒸8到10分钟，鱼肉刚熟不老，筷子能轻松拨开。\n\n小心倒掉盘子里蒸出的腥水，这是去腥的关键。\n\n重新铺上新鲜的姜丝和葱丝。\n\n烧1勺油到冒青烟，均匀浇在葱姜丝上，“滋啦”一声香味四溢。\n\n淋上蒸鱼豉油（或生抽）和几滴芝麻油，趁热吃，鱼肉鲜嫩。","x":"cn"},{"id":"cn015","n":"Homestyle Sweet and Sour Pork","a":"Chinese","c":"Pork","t":"","y":"","i":[["Pork Tenderloin","300 g"],["Rice Vinegar","3 tbsp"],["Sugar","3 tbsp"],["Soy Sauce","1 tbsp"],["Starch","3 tbsp"],["Egg","1"],["Salt","to taste"],["Vegetable Oil","500 ml"],["Ginger","2 slices"]],"s":"Cut the pork into 2cm cubes. Marinate with salt, 1 tsp soy sauce and ginger 10 minutes; toss with beaten egg then coat in starch.\n\nHeat oil to 170C. Fry the pork in batches 3-4 minutes until golden; drain. Re-fry 30 seconds for extra crunch.\n\nMix vinegar, sugar, soy sauce and 1 tsp starch with 4 tbsp water for the sauce.\n\nHeat 1 tbsp oil in a wok; pour in the sauce and simmer until thick and bubbling.\n\nToss in the crispy pork; coat every piece in the glossy sauce.\n\nServe immediately while the coating is still crunchy.","z":"猪里脊切2厘米小块，加盐、1小勺生抽和姜片腌10分钟，裹上蛋液再均匀沾满淀粉。\n\n油烧到七成热（170度左右），分批下肉块炸3到4分钟至金黄捞出，全部炸完再回锅复炸30秒，更酥脆。\n\n调糖醋汁：3勺醋、3勺糖、1勺生抽、1小勺淀粉，加4勺水搅匀。\n\n热锅倒1勺油，倒入糖醋汁小火熬到浓稠冒大泡。\n\n倒入炸好的肉块快速翻炒，让每块都裹上亮晶晶的糖醋汁。\n\n立刻装盘，趁着外壳还脆赶紧吃，酸甜开胃。","x":"cn"},{"id":"cn016","n":"Garlic Broccoli","a":"Chinese","c":"Vegetarian","t":"","y":"","i":[["Broccoli","1"],["Garlic","5 cloves"],["Salt","to taste"],["Oyster Sauce","1 tbsp"],["Vegetable Oil","2 tbsp"],["Chicken Bouillon Powder","1 tsp"],["Sugar","1 tsp"]],"s":"Cut the broccoli into small florets; soak in salted water 10 minutes, then rinse.\n\nBlanch in boiling water 2 minutes until bright green; drain well.\n\nHeat oil in a wok; fry half the minced garlic until just golden.\n\nAdd the broccoli and toss over high heat 1 minute.\n\nStir in oyster sauce, salt, sugar and bouillon powder with 2 tbsp water.\n\nPlate up and scatter the remaining raw minced garlic on top for extra punch.","z":"西兰花切小朵，淡盐水泡10分钟洗净。\n\n开水焯2分钟，捞出沥干，保持翠绿。\n\n热锅倒油，下入一半蒜末小火煸到微黄。\n\n倒入西兰花大火快炒1分钟。\n\n加蚝油、盐、糖、鸡精和2勺水，翻炒均匀入味。\n\n装盘后撒上剩下的一半生蒜末，生熟蒜香叠加，特别提味。","x":"cn"},{"id":"cn017","n":"Tomato and Egg Stir-Fry","a":"Chinese","c":"Vegetarian","t":"","y":"","i":[["Tomatoes","3"],["Eggs","4"],["Spring Onions","2"],["Sugar","1 tbsp"],["Salt","to taste"],["Vegetable Oil","3 tbsp"],["Chicken Bouillon Powder","1 tsp"]],"s":"Beat the eggs with a pinch of salt. Cut the tomatoes into wedges.\n\nHeat 2 tbsp oil; scramble the eggs over high heat until just set but still soft. Remove.\n\nIn the same wok add 1 tbsp oil; fry the tomato wedges 2 minutes until they start to collapse.\n\nAdd sugar and salt; stir until the tomatoes release their juice into a sauce.\n\nReturn the eggs; toss gently 30 seconds so they soak up the sauce.\n\nScatter spring onions and serve with rice.","z":"鸡蛋打散加少许盐，番茄切块。\n\n热锅倒2勺油，大火把鸡蛋炒到刚凝固还嫩嫩的，盛出。\n\n原锅再倒1勺油，下番茄块炒2分钟，炒到番茄变软出水。\n\n加糖和盐，翻炒出浓浓的番茄汁。\n\n鸡蛋回锅，轻轻翻拌30秒，让蛋块吸满番茄汁。\n\n撒上葱花出锅，酸甜下饭，拌米饭一绝。","x":"cn"},{"id":"cn018","n":"Braised Pork Belly","a":"Chinese","c":"Pork","t":"","y":"","i":[["Pork Belly","500 g"],["Ginger","1 piece"],["Spring Onions","3"],["dark soy sauce","1 tbsp"],["Soy Sauce","2 tbsp"],["Sugar","2 tbsp"],["Shaoxing Wine","2 tbsp"],["Star Anise","2"],["Salt","to taste"],["Water","800 ml"],["Vegetable Oil","1 tbsp"]],"s":"Cut the pork belly into 3cm cubes. Blanch in boiling water 3 minutes; rinse clean.\n\nHeat 1 tbsp oil with 2 tbsp sugar over low heat, stirring, until it melts into an amber caramel.\n\nAdd the pork; toss quickly so every cube is coated in caramel.\n\nAdd ginger, spring onions, star anise, both soy sauces and Shaoxing wine; stir 2 minutes.\n\nPour in 800ml hot water. Bring to a boil, then braise covered on low heat 45 minutes.\n\nUncover, turn up the heat and reduce the sauce until thick and glossy, turning the pork so it shines. Rest 5 minutes before serving.","z":"五花肉切3厘米方块，冷水下锅焯3分钟去浮沫，捞出洗净。\n\n热锅倒1勺油，小火放2勺糖慢慢炒，炒到糖融化变成焦糖色，冒小泡。\n\n立刻倒入五花肉快速翻炒，让每块肉都裹上糖色。\n\n加入姜片、葱段、八角、生抽、老抽、料酒，炒2分钟出香。\n\n倒入800毫升热水，大火烧开后转小火加盖炖45分钟。\n\n开盖转大火收汁，不停翻动让肉块裹上浓稠红亮的汤汁，关火焖5分钟再吃，肥而不腻、入口即化。","x":"cn"},{"id":"cn019","n":"Sweet and Sour Spare Ribs","a":"Chinese","c":"Pork","t":"","y":"","i":[["Pork Back Ribs","500 g"],["Sugar","3 tbsp"],["Rice Vinegar","3 tbsp"],["Soy Sauce","2 tbsp"],["dark soy sauce","1 tsp"],["Ginger","3 slices"],["Spring Onions","2"],["Salt","to taste"],["Starch","1 tbsp"],["Sesame Seed","1 tsp"]],"s":"Chop the ribs into 4cm pieces; rinse and pat dry. Toss with salt and starch.\n\nBrown the ribs in a hot oiled wok until golden on all sides.\n\nAdd ginger and spring onions; splash in 500ml hot water.\n\nStir in sugar, vinegar and both soy sauces. Bring to a boil, then simmer covered 30 minutes.\n\nUncover and reduce over high heat, turning the ribs until the sauce thickens into a glaze.\n\nSprinkle with sesame seeds and serve.","z":"排骨斩成4厘米小段，洗净擦干，加盐和淀粉抓匀。\n\n热锅倒油，把排骨煎到四面金黄。\n\n加入姜片葱段，倒入500毫升热水。\n\n加糖、醋、生抽、老抽，大火烧开转小火加盖炖30分钟。\n\n开盖转大火收汁，不停翻动排骨，让汤汁浓稠地裹在排骨上，泛着红亮的光。\n\n撒上芝麻出锅，酸甜适口，啃得停不下来。","x":"cn"},{"id":"cn020","n":"Cola Chicken Wings","a":"Chinese","c":"Chicken","t":"","y":"","i":[["Chicken Wings","10"],["Cola","500 ml"],["Ginger","3 slices"],["Spring Onions","2"],["Soy Sauce","2 tbsp"],["dark soy sauce","1 tsp"],["Salt","to taste"],["Star Anise","1"]],"s":"Score each wing twice so the flavor soaks in; pat dry.\n\nSear the wings in a dry hot wok, skin-side down, until golden.\n\nAdd ginger, spring onions and star anise; pour in the cola to just cover the wings.\n\nStir in both soy sauces and a pinch of salt.\n\nSimmer uncovered 20 minutes, turning once, until the cola reduces to a syrupy glaze.\n\nServe hot — the wings should shine with a sweet-savory coating.","z":"鸡翅两面各划两刀方便入味，擦干水分。\n\n干锅不放油，鸡翅皮朝下煎到两面金黄，逼出油脂。\n\n加入姜片、葱段、八角，倒入可乐没过鸡翅。\n\n加生抽、老抽和少许盐调味上色。\n\n中小火敞开炖20分钟，中途翻一次面，让可乐慢慢收成浓稠的汁。\n\n收汁到鸡翅裹上亮亮的焦糖色就可以出锅了，甜咸适口，孩子最爱。","x":"cn"},{"id":"cn021","n":"Braised Chicken Legs","a":"Chinese","c":"Chicken","t":"","y":"","i":[["Chicken Legs","4"],["Ginger","1 piece"],["Spring Onions","3"],["dark soy sauce","1 tbsp"],["Soy Sauce","2 tbsp"],["Sugar","1 tbsp"],["Shaoxing Wine","1 tbsp"],["Star Anise","2"],["Salt","to taste"],["Water","500 ml"]],"s":"Blanch the chicken legs in boiling water 2 minutes; rinse clean.\n\nHeat 1 tbsp oil in a pot; melt the sugar over low heat into an amber caramel.\n\nAdd the chicken legs; toss to coat in the caramel color.\n\nAdd ginger, spring onions, star anise, both soy sauces and Shaoxing wine.\n\nPour in 500ml hot water; braise covered on medium-low heat 25 minutes.\n\nUncover and reduce the sauce until glossy and clinging to the legs.","z":"鸡腿冷水下锅焯2分钟，捞出洗净去浮沫。\n\n锅里倒少许油，小火把糖炒成焦糖色。\n\n下鸡腿快速翻炒，均匀裹上糖色。\n\n加入姜片、葱段、八角、生抽、老抽、料酒。\n\n倒入500毫升热水，中小火加盖炖25分钟。\n\n开盖大火收汁，翻动鸡腿让汤汁浓稠发亮地裹住，咸香入味，配米饭吃两大碗。","x":"cn"},{"id":"cn022","n":"Beef Stew with Potatoes","a":"Chinese","c":"Beef","t":"","y":"","i":[["Beef","500 g"],["Potatoes","3"],["Carrots","1"],["Onion","1"],["Ginger","1 piece"],["dark soy sauce","1 tbsp"],["Soy Sauce","2 tbsp"],["Star Anise","2"],["Salt","to taste"],["Shaoxing Wine","1 tbsp"],["Water","1 L"],["Vegetable Oil","2 tbsp"]],"s":"Cut the beef into 3cm chunks. Blanch 3 minutes; rinse.\n\nHeat oil; brown the beef with ginger and onion until the edges color.\n\nAdd both soy sauces and Shaoxing wine; stir 2 minutes.\n\nPour in 1L hot water with star anise. Bring to a boil; braise covered 40 minutes.\n\nAdd potato and carrot chunks; simmer 20 minutes more until tender.\n\nSeason with salt; simmer 5 minutes until the broth thickens slightly. Serve hot.","z":"牛肉切3厘米块，冷水下锅焯3分钟，捞出洗净。\n\n热锅倒油，下牛肉、姜片、洋葱块煸炒到表面微焦。\n\n加生抽、老抽、料酒，翻炒2分钟上色出香。\n\n倒入1升热水和八角，大火烧开转小火加盖炖40分钟。\n\n加入土豆块和胡萝卜块，再炖20分钟至软烂。\n\n加盐调味，收一收汤汁，牛肉酥烂、土豆绵软，汤泡饭最香。","x":"cn"},{"id":"cn023","n":"Tomato Beef Brisket","a":"Chinese","c":"Beef","t":"","y":"","i":[["Beef Brisket","500 g"],["Tomatoes","4"],["Onion","1"],["Ginger","1 piece"],["Soy Sauce","2 tbsp"],["dark soy sauce","1 tsp"],["Sugar","1 tbsp"],["Salt","to taste"],["Shaoxing Wine","1 tbsp"],["Water","1 L"]],"s":"Cut the brisket into 3cm chunks; blanch 3 minutes and rinse.\n\nSear the beef with ginger and onion in a hot pot until lightly browned.\n\nAdd both soy sauces, sugar and Shaoxing wine; toss 2 minutes.\n\nAdd 3 chopped tomatoes and 1L hot water. Braise covered 50 minutes.\n\nAdd the remaining tomato cut into wedges; simmer 15 minutes until the broth turns rich and red.\n\nSeason with salt and serve — great over rice or noodles.","z":"牛腩切3厘米块，焯水3分钟捞出洗净。\n\n热锅下牛腩、姜片、洋葱煸炒到微微焦香。\n\n加生抽、老抽、糖、料酒翻炒2分钟。\n\n加入3个切碎的番茄和1升热水，大火烧开小火加盖炖50分钟。\n\n剩下1个番茄切块加入，再炖15分钟，汤汁变得浓稠红亮。\n\n加盐调味，牛腩软烂、番茄酸香，拌饭拌面都绝了。","x":"cn"},{"id":"cn024","n":"Green Pepper and Egg Stir-Fry","a":"Chinese","c":"Vegetarian","t":"","y":"","i":[["Eggs","4"],["Dried Red Chillies","4"],["Garlic","3 cloves"],["Salt","to taste"],["Vegetable Oil","3 tbsp"],["Soy Sauce","1 tsp"],["Chicken Bouillon Powder","1 tsp"]],"s":"Cut fresh green peppers into chunks; beat the eggs with a pinch of salt. (No fresh peppers on the pantry list — dried chillies add the heat here.)\n\nHeat 2 tbsp oil over high heat; scramble the eggs until just set. Remove.\n\nAdd 1 tbsp oil; fry garlic and dried chillies until fragrant, then add the green peppers and stir-fry 2 minutes.\n\nReturn the eggs to the wok.\n\nSeason with soy sauce, salt and bouillon powder; toss 1 minute.\n\nServe immediately with steamed rice.","z":"青椒去蒂去籽切小块，鸡蛋打散加少许盐。（配料表里没有新鲜青椒，干辣椒代替提味，买菜时记得买两根青椒。）\n\n热锅倒2勺油，大火把鸡蛋炒到刚凝固，盛出。\n\n原锅再倒1勺油，下蒜末和干辣椒段爆香，倒入青椒块大火快炒2分钟，炒到断生还脆。\n\n鸡蛋回锅。\n\n加生抽、盐、鸡精调味，大火翻炒1分钟。\n\n出锅装盘，青椒脆嫩、鸡蛋鲜香，超级下饭。","x":"cn"},{"id":"cn025","n":"Hot and Sour Shredded Potatoes","a":"Chinese","c":"Vegetarian","t":"","y":"","i":[["Potatoes","3"],["Dried Red Chillies","5"],["Rice Vinegar","2 tbsp"],["Garlic","3 cloves"],["Salt","to taste"],["Sugar","1 tsp"],["Vegetable Oil","2 tbsp"],["Chicken Bouillon Powder","1 tsp"]],"s":"Julienne the potatoes into fine shreds; rinse in cold water until the water runs clear, then drain.\n\nHeat oil; fry the dried chillies and garlic until fragrant.\n\nAdd the potato shreds; stir-fry over high heat 2 minutes.\n\nSplash in the vinegar around the edge of the wok.\n\nSeason with salt, sugar and bouillon powder; toss 1 minute until just tender but still crunchy.\n\nServe immediately — it should stay crisp.","z":"土豆切细丝，冷水多冲洗几遍，洗掉淀粉水变清，沥干，这样炒出来才脆。\n\n热锅倒油，下干辣椒段和蒜末爆香。\n\n倒入土豆丝大火快炒2分钟。\n\n沿锅边淋入香醋，激出酸香味。\n\n加盐、糖、鸡精调味，翻炒1分钟，土豆丝断生但保持脆爽。\n\n立刻出锅，酸辣脆爽，开胃小菜。","x":"cn"},{"id":"cn026","n":"Smashed Cucumber Salad","a":"Chinese","c":"Starter","t":"","y":"","i":[["Cucumber","2"],["Garlic","4 cloves"],["Rice Vinegar","2 tbsp"],["Soy Sauce","1 tbsp"],["Sesame Seed Oil","1 tbsp"],["Sugar","1 tsp"],["Salt","to taste"],["Dried Red Chillies","2"]],"s":"Smack each cucumber with the flat of a cleaver until it splits; tear into bite-size chunks.\n\nToss with 1 tsp salt; rest 10 minutes, then drain the liquid.\n\nMince the garlic; mix with vinegar, soy sauce, sugar and sesame oil.\n\nToss the cucumbers with the dressing.\n\nTop with dried chilli pieces; rest 5 minutes to absorb.\n\nServe cold as an appetizer.","z":"黄瓜用刀背拍裂，手撕成小块，这样更容易入味。\n\n加1小勺盐拌匀，腌10分钟杀出水分，倒掉多余的水。\n\n蒜末加香醋、生抽、糖、芝麻油调成料汁。\n\n黄瓜块和料汁拌匀。\n\n表面放上干辣椒段，静置5分钟入味。\n\n凉着吃，酸辣脆爽，是夏天餐桌上的开胃神器。","x":"cn"},{"id":"cn027","n":"Hand-Torn Cabbage","a":"Chinese","c":"Vegetarian","t":"","y":"","i":[["Cabbage","1"],["Dried Red Chillies","5"],["Garlic","4 cloves"],["Fermented Black Beans","1 tbsp"],["Soy Sauce","1 tbsp"],["Rice Vinegar","1 tsp"],["Sugar","1 tsp"],["Salt","to taste"],["Vegetable Oil","2 tbsp"]],"s":"Tear the cabbage into large pieces by hand; wash and drain well.\n\nHeat oil until smoking; fry the dried chillies and fermented black beans until fragrant.\n\nAdd garlic; toss 10 seconds.\n\nAdd the cabbage; stir-fry over fierce heat 2-3 minutes until wilted but still crunchy.\n\nSeason with soy sauce, vinegar, sugar and salt.\n\nServe immediately.","z":"包菜用手撕成大片，洗净沥干，手撕的比刀切的更入味。\n\n热锅倒油烧到冒烟，下干辣椒段和豆豉爆香。\n\n下蒜片炒10秒出香。\n\n倒入包菜大火爆炒2到3分钟，炒到变软但还脆。\n\n加生抽、少许醋、糖和盐调味。\n\n大火收汁出锅，镬气十足，越嚼越甜。","x":"cn"},{"id":"cn028","n":"Sliced Pork with Garlic Sauce","a":"Chinese","c":"Starter","t":"","y":"","i":[["Pork Belly","400 g"],["Garlic","6 cloves"],["Ginger","1 piece"],["Spring Onions","2"],["Soy Sauce","2 tbsp"],["Rice Vinegar","1 tbsp"],["Sesame Seed Oil","1 tbsp"],["Sugar","1 tsp"],["Salt","to taste"],["Dried Red Chillies","3"]],"s":"Simmer the pork belly in boiling water with ginger and spring onions 25 minutes until cooked through.\n\nLift out and rest 10 minutes; slice as thin as you can.\n\nArrange the slices overlapping on a plate.\n\nPound the garlic with a pinch of salt into a paste; mix with soy sauce, vinegar, sugar and sesame oil.\n\nSpoon the garlic sauce over the pork.\n\nTop with chilli pieces; serve at room temperature.","z":"五花肉冷水下锅，加姜片葱段，大火烧开转小火煮25分钟，筷子扎透无血水。\n\n捞出晾10分钟，切成薄薄的大片，越薄越好吃。\n\n肉片整齐地码在盘子里。\n\n蒜瓣加少许盐捣成蒜泥，加生抽、香醋、糖、芝麻油调成蒜泥汁。\n\n把蒜泥汁均匀浇在肉片上。\n\n撒上干辣椒段，室温吃最香，肥而不腻、蒜香浓郁，是经典的下酒凉菜。","x":"cn"},{"id":"cn029","n":"Shredded Pork in Beijing Sauce","a":"Chinese","c":"Pork","t":"","y":"","i":[["Pork Tenderloin","300 g"],["Hoisin Sauce","3 tbsp"],["Ginger","1 piece"],["Spring Onions","4"],["Soy Sauce","1 tbsp"],["Sugar","1 tsp"],["Starch","1 tbsp"],["Shaoxing Wine","1 tbsp"],["Salt","to taste"],["Sesame Seed Oil","1 tsp"],["Vegetable Oil","3 tbsp"]],"s":"Cut the pork into fine shreds; marinate with soy sauce, Shaoxing wine and starch 10 minutes. (Beijing sauce is sweet bean sauce; hoisin makes a fine substitute.)\n\nHeat oil; stir-fry the pork over high heat until just cooked. Remove.\n\nIn the same wok add 1 tbsp oil; fry the hoisin sauce with sugar over low heat until glossy and bubbling.\n\nReturn the pork; toss 1 minute so every shred is coated.\n\nFinish with sesame oil.\n\nServe with shredded spring onions — wrap in thin pancakes if you like.","z":"猪里脊切细丝，加生抽、料酒、淀粉抓匀腌10分钟。（京酱用的甜面酱，这里用海鲜酱代替，味道接近。）\n\n热锅倒油，大火把肉丝滑炒到变色，盛出。\n\n原锅再倒1勺油，小火下海鲜酱和糖炒到冒泡发亮。\n\n肉丝回锅，大火翻炒1分钟，让每根肉丝都裹上酱。\n\n淋少许芝麻油提香。\n\n配上切好的葱丝一起吃，用春饼或豆腐皮卷着吃最地道，酱香浓郁。","x":"cn"},{"id":"cn030","n":"Salt and Pepper Chicken Wings","a":"Chinese","c":"Chicken","t":"","y":"","i":[["Chicken Wings","10"],["Salt","1 tbsp"],["Black Pepper","1 tsp"],["Five Spice Powder","1 tsp"],["Garlic","4 cloves"],["Vegetable Oil","500 ml"],["Spring Onions","1"]],"s":"Pat the wings very dry; toss with salt, black pepper and five-spice. Rest 20 minutes.\n\nHeat oil to 170C. Fry the wings 6-8 minutes until deep golden and crisp; drain.\n\nFry the sliced garlic until golden; drain.\n\nToss the wings with the fried garlic.\n\nSprinkle with a little extra salt-pepper mix.\n\nGarnish with spring onion and serve hot.","z":"鸡翅擦干，加盐、黑胡椒、五香粉抓匀，腌20分钟。\n\n油烧到七成热，下鸡翅炸6到8分钟，炸到金黄酥脆捞出。\n\n蒜片下油锅炸到金黄捞出。\n\n鸡翅和炸蒜片拌在一起。\n\n再撒少许椒盐提味。\n\n撒上葱花，趁热吃，外酥里嫩、椒盐香口。","x":"cn"},{"id":"cn031","n":"Chestnut Chicken","a":"Chinese","c":"Chicken","t":"","y":"","i":[["Chicken","1"],["Chestnuts","200 g"],["Ginger","1 piece"],["Spring Onions","3"],["dark soy sauce","1 tbsp"],["Soy Sauce","2 tbsp"],["Sugar","1 tbsp"],["Shaoxing Wine","1 tbsp"],["Star Anise","2"],["Salt","to taste"],["Water","600 ml"]],"s":"Chop the chicken into pieces; blanch 2 minutes and rinse. Score the chestnuts and boil 10 minutes; peel.\n\nBrown the chicken in a hot oiled pot until golden.\n\nAdd ginger, spring onions and star anise; splash in Shaoxing wine.\n\nStir in both soy sauces and sugar; add 600ml hot water.\n\nBraise covered 20 minutes; add the chestnuts and braise 20 minutes more.\n\nReduce the sauce until glossy; the chestnuts should be soft and sweet.","z":"整鸡斩小块，焯水2分钟洗净。栗子划口煮10分钟，剥壳去皮。\n\n热锅倒油，把鸡块煎到表面金黄。\n\n加入姜片、葱段、八角，烹入料酒。\n\n加生抽、老抽、糖，倒入600毫升热水。\n\n加盖炖20分钟，下入栗子再炖20分钟。\n\n大火收汁到浓稠发亮，栗子粉糯香甜，鸡肉酥烂，秋冬吃最暖。","x":"cn"},{"id":"cn032","n":"Di San Xian","a":"Chinese","c":"Vegetarian","t":"","y":"","i":[["Potatoes","2"],["Aubergine","1"],["Dried Red Chillies","4"],["Garlic","3 cloves"],["Ginger","1 piece"],["Soy Sauce","1 tbsp"],["Sugar","1 tsp"],["Salt","to taste"],["Starch","1 tbsp"],["Vegetable Oil","4 tbsp"]],"s":"Cut potatoes into wedges and aubergine into chunks; toss the aubergine with starch. (The classic trio is potato, aubergine and green pepper; dried chillies add heat here.)\n\nHeat oil; fry the potatoes until golden at the edges. Remove.\n\nFry the aubergine until soft and golden. Remove.\n\nFry ginger, garlic and dried chillies until fragrant.\n\nReturn the vegetables; add 100ml water, soy sauce, sugar and salt.\n\nSimmer 3 minutes until the sauce clings to the vegetables. Serve hot.","z":"土豆切滚刀块，茄子切块裹上薄薄一层淀粉。（地三鲜本是土豆茄子青椒，配料表没有青椒，用干辣椒提味，买菜时可加两根青椒。）\n\n热锅多倒油，先把土豆煎到边缘金黄，盛出。\n\n再把茄子煎软煎香，盛出。\n\n下姜蒜片和干辣椒段爆香。\n\n土豆茄子回锅，加100毫升水、生抽、糖、盐。\n\n小火煨3分钟收汁，让酱汁裹住每块菜，咸甜下饭，东北味十足。","x":"cn"},{"id":"cn033","n":"Tomato Egg Noodles","a":"Chinese","c":"Miscellaneous","t":"","y":"","i":[["Noodles","250 g"],["Tomatoes","3"],["Eggs","3"],["Spring Onions","2"],["Garlic","2 cloves"],["Soy Sauce","1 tbsp"],["Salt","to taste"],["Chicken Bouillon Powder","1 tsp"],["Sesame Seed Oil","1 tsp"],["Vegetable Oil","2 tbsp"]],"s":"Cook the noodles until just tender; drain and rinse under cold water.\n\nBeat the eggs; scramble in hot oil until just set. Remove.\n\nFry garlic; add tomato wedges and cook 3 minutes into a chunky sauce.\n\nAdd 400ml water, soy sauce, salt and bouillon powder; boil 3 minutes.\n\nReturn the eggs; drizzle with sesame oil.\n\nPour the tomato-egg topping over the noodles; scatter spring onions.","z":"面条煮到刚熟，捞出过凉水，口感更筋道。\n\n鸡蛋打散，热油炒到刚凝固盛出。\n\n下蒜末爆香，倒入番茄块炒3分钟，炒出浓汤。\n\n加400毫升水、生抽、盐、鸡精，煮3分钟。\n\n鸡蛋回锅，淋少许芝麻油。\n\n浇在面条上，撒上葱花，酸甜开胃，十几分钟搞定一餐。","x":"cn"},{"id":"cn034","n":"Noodles with Soybean Paste","a":"Chinese","c":"Miscellaneous","t":"","y":"","i":[["Noodles","250 g"],["Ground Pork","200 g"],["Doubanjiang","3 tbsp"],["Ginger","1 piece"],["Spring Onions","3"],["Soy Sauce","1 tbsp"],["Sugar","1 tsp"],["Shaoxing Wine","1 tbsp"],["Starch","1 tsp"],["Cucumber","1"]],"s":"Cook the noodles; drain and toss with a little oil. Shred the cucumber.\n\nFry the ground pork in hot oil until browned and crumbly; add ginger and Shaoxing wine.\n\nStir in the doubanjiang (standing in for yellow soybean paste); fry over low heat 3 minutes until the oil reddens.\n\nAdd 100ml water, soy sauce and sugar; simmer 5 minutes into a thick sauce.\n\nSpoon the sauce over the noodles.\n\nTop with cucumber shreds and spring onions; mix well before eating.","z":"面条煮熟捞出，拌少许油防粘。黄瓜切丝。\n\n热锅倒油，下肉末煸炒到变色出油，加姜末和料酒去腥。\n\n加入豆瓣酱（代替黄豆酱）小火炒3分钟，炒出红油酱香。\n\n加100毫升水、生抽、糖，小火咕嘟5分钟，熬成浓稠的炸酱。\n\n面条盛碗，浇上两大勺炸酱。\n\n码上黄瓜丝、葱花，吃前拌匀，酱香浓郁，越嚼越香。","x":"cn"},{"id":"cn035","n":"Scallion Oil Noodles","a":"Chinese","c":"Miscellaneous","t":"","y":"","i":[["Noodles","250 g"],["Spring Onions","6"],["Vegetable Oil","4 tbsp"],["Soy Sauce","2 tbsp"],["dark soy sauce","1 tsp"],["Sugar","1 tbsp"],["Salt","to taste"]],"s":"Cut the spring onions into long sections, separating whites and greens.\n\nHeat oil over medium-low; fry the onion whites 3 minutes, then add the greens and fry until wilted and fragrant, 3 more minutes.\n\nStir in both soy sauces, sugar and salt; simmer 1 minute into a savory scallion oil.\n\nCook the noodles; drain well.\n\nToss the hot noodles with the scallion oil.\n\nTop with the fried scallions and serve.","z":"小葱切长段，葱白葱绿分开。\n\n锅里倒4勺油，中小火先下葱白炸3分钟，再下葱绿炸3分钟，炸到葱段焦黄、葱油香气扑鼻。\n\n加入生抽、老抽、糖和盐，小火煮1分钟成葱油酱汁。\n\n面条煮熟沥干。\n\n趁热把面条和葱油酱汁拌匀。\n\n码上炸好的葱段，葱香浓郁、简单到不讲道理的好吃。","x":"cn"},{"id":"cn036","n":"Egg Fried Rice","a":"Chinese","c":"Miscellaneous","t":"","y":"","i":[["Rice","3 bowls"],["Eggs","3"],["Spring Onions","3"],["Soy Sauce","1 tbsp"],["Salt","to taste"],["Vegetable Oil","3 tbsp"],["Chicken Bouillon Powder","1 tsp"]],"s":"Use day-old cooked rice; break up any clumps. Beat the eggs.\n\nHeat oil until smoking; scramble the eggs into small curds. Remove.\n\nAdd a little more oil; fry the rice over high heat 3 minutes, pressing and tossing until the grains separate.\n\nDrizzle soy sauce around the wok edge; toss to color evenly.\n\nReturn the eggs; season with salt and bouillon powder.\n\nAdd spring onions, toss 30 seconds and serve.","z":"用隔夜米饭，提前把结块捏散。鸡蛋打散。\n\n大火把油烧到冒烟，倒入鸡蛋炒成小块盛出。\n\n再倒少许油，下米饭大火翻炒3分钟，边炒边压散，炒到粒粒分明。\n\n沿锅边淋入生抽，快速翻匀上色。\n\n鸡蛋回锅，加盐和鸡精调味。\n\n撒入葱花翻炒30秒出锅，米粒干香、蛋香十足。","x":"cn"},{"id":"cn037","n":"Yangzhou Fried Rice","a":"Chinese","c":"Miscellaneous","t":"","y":"","i":[["Rice","3 bowls"],["Eggs","2"],["Chinese Sausage","2"],["Shrimp","100 g"],["Carrots","1"],["Spring Onions","2"],["Soy Sauce","1 tbsp"],["Salt","to taste"],["Vegetable Oil","3 tbsp"],["Chicken Bouillon Powder","1 tsp"]],"s":"Dice the sausage and carrots; devein the shrimp. Use day-old rice, grains separated.\n\nScramble the beaten eggs in hot oil; remove while still soft.\n\nStir-fry the shrimp 1 minute until pink; remove.\n\nFry the sausage and carrots 2 minutes until the sausage releases its oil.\n\nAdd the rice; toss over high heat 3 minutes until hot and separate.\n\nReturn eggs and shrimp; season with soy sauce, salt and bouillon powder. Add spring onions; toss and serve.","z":"腊肠和胡萝卜切丁，虾去虾线。米饭用隔夜的，捏散备用。\n\n鸡蛋打散，热油炒成嫩块盛出。\n\n虾仁下锅炒1分钟变色盛出。\n\n下腊肠丁和胡萝卜丁炒2分钟，炒出腊肠的香味。\n\n倒入米饭大火翻炒3分钟，炒到米粒分明、热气腾腾。\n\n鸡蛋虾仁回锅，加生抽、盐、鸡精调味，撒入葱花翻匀，色香味俱全。","x":"cn"},{"id":"cn038","n":"Pork and Cabbage Dumplings","a":"Chinese","c":"Miscellaneous","t":"","y":"","i":[["Flour","500 g"],["Water","250 ml"],["Ground Pork","400 g"],["Chinese Cabbage","300 g"],["Ginger","1 piece"],["Spring Onions","3"],["Soy Sauce","2 tbsp"],["Sesame Seed Oil","1 tbsp"],["Salt","to taste"],["Shaoxing Wine","1 tbsp"],["Chicken Bouillon Powder","1 tsp"]],"s":"Mix flour with water into a firm dough; knead 10 minutes, rest 30 minutes.\n\nChop the cabbage; salt it 10 minutes, then squeeze out all the water.\n\nCombine pork with soy sauce, Shaoxing wine, ginger, spring onions, bouillon powder and 3 tbsp water, stirring one way until sticky. Fold in the cabbage and sesame oil.\n\nRoll the dough into wrappers; fill each with 1 tbsp filling and pleat shut.\n\nBoil in plenty of water; add a cup of cold water each time it boils hard, three times total.\n\nServe hot with black vinegar for dipping.","z":"面粉加水和成稍硬的面团，揉10分钟，盖湿布醒30分钟。\n\n白菜剁碎，加盐腌10分钟，攥干水分，这一步决定馅料好不好吃。\n\n肉馅加生抽、料酒、姜末、葱末、鸡精，分三次打入3勺水，顺一个方向搅上劲，再拌入白菜和芝麻油。\n\n面团搓条切剂、擀皮，每个包1勺馅，捏出好看的褶子。\n\n大锅宽水下饺子，开锅点三次凉水，饺子浮起肚子鼓鼓就熟了。\n\n趁热吃，蘸香醋最地道，皮薄馅大汁水足。","x":"cn"},{"id":"cn039","n":"Homestyle Pork Wontons","a":"Chinese","c":"Miscellaneous","t":"","y":"","i":[["Wonton Skin","30"],["Ground Pork","250 g"],["Ginger","1 piece"],["Spring Onions","2"],["Soy Sauce","1 tbsp"],["Sesame Seed Oil","1 tsp"],["Salt","to taste"],["Chicken Bouillon Powder","1 tsp"],["Boiling Water","1 L"],["Eggs","1"]],"s":"Mix the pork with minced ginger, spring onions, soy sauce, salt, sesame oil and 2 tbsp water, stirring until sticky.\n\nPlace 1 tsp filling on each wonton skin; fold and pinch shut — small wontons need just a squeeze.\n\nBring 1L water to a rolling boil with bouillon powder and a pinch of salt.\n\nDrop in the wontons; when they float, add the beaten egg in a thin stream.\n\nSimmer 1 minute more until the wontons are translucent.\n\nLadle into bowls; finish with sesame oil and spring onions.","z":"肉馅加姜末、葱末、生抽、盐、芝麻油，分次打入2勺水，顺时针搅打上劲。\n\n取一张馄饨皮，放1小勺馅，对折捏紧，小馄饨不用讲究形状，捏住就行。\n\n1升水烧开，加鸡精和少许盐调底味。\n\n下入馄饨，浮起来后淋入打散的蛋液。\n\n再煮1分钟，馄饨皮透明、馅料熟透。\n\n盛入碗中，滴几滴芝麻油、撒上葱花，汤鲜馅嫩，早上来一碗浑身舒坦。","x":"cn"},{"id":"cn040","n":"Soup Dumplings","a":"Chinese","c":"Miscellaneous","t":"","y":"","i":[["Flour","300 g"],["Water","160 ml"],["Ground Pork","300 g"],["Ginger","1 piece"],["Spring Onions","2"],["Soy Sauce","2 tbsp"],["dark soy sauce","1 tsp"],["Shaoxing Wine","1 tbsp"],["Sugar","1 tsp"],["Salt","to taste"],["Starch","1 tsp"],["Sesame Seed Oil","1 tsp"]],"s":"Mix flour with warm water into a soft dough; knead smooth and rest 30 minutes.\n\nCombine pork with soy sauces, wine, sugar, salt, ginger and 100ml water added gradually, stirring until the filling is loose and jiggly — this makes the soup inside.\n\nDivide the dough into 20g pieces; roll into thin-edged wrappers.\n\nFill each with 1 tbsp filling; pleat at least 12 folds and twist shut.\n\nLine a steamer with cloth; steam over boiling water 8 minutes.\n\nServe immediately with black vinegar and ginger shreds — nibble, sip the soup, then eat.","z":"面粉加温水和成软硬适中的面团，揉光醒30分钟。\n\n肉馅加生抽、老抽、料酒、糖、盐、姜末，分次打入100毫升水，搅到馅料水水的、颤巍巍的，这就是汤汁的来源。\n\n面团分成20克小剂子，擀成中间厚边缘薄的皮。\n\n每个包1勺馅，提褶至少捏12个褶，收口捏紧。\n\n笼屉垫湿纱布，水开后大火蒸8分钟。\n\n趁热吃，配香醋和姜丝，先咬个小口吸汤汁，再一口吃掉，皮薄汤多馅鲜。","x":"cn"},{"id":"cn041","n":"Tomato Egg Soup","a":"Chinese","c":"Side","t":"","y":"","i":[["Tomatoes","2"],["Eggs","2"],["Spring Onions","1"],["Salt","to taste"],["Chicken Bouillon Powder","1 tsp"],["Starch","1 tsp"],["Sesame Seed Oil","1 tsp"],["Water","800 ml"]],"s":"Cut the tomatoes into wedges; beat the eggs.\n\nBring 800ml water to a boil; add the tomatoes and simmer 3 minutes.\n\nSeason with salt and bouillon powder.\n\nThicken lightly with starch water.\n\nDrizzle in the beaten egg while stirring to form silky ribbons.\n\nFinish with sesame oil and spring onions.","z":"番茄切块，鸡蛋打散。\n\n800毫升水烧开，下番茄煮3分钟出味。\n\n加盐和鸡精调味。\n\n淋入薄芡，让汤汁微微浓稠。\n\n边搅拌边淋入蛋液，转出漂亮的蛋花。\n\n滴几滴芝麻油、撒上葱花，酸甜爽口，配什么主食都搭。","x":"cn"},{"id":"cn042","n":"Seaweed Egg Drop Soup","a":"Chinese","c":"Side","t":"","y":"","i":[["Eggs","2"],["Dried Shrimp","1 tbsp"],["Starch","1 tsp"],["Salt","to taste"],["Chicken Bouillon Powder","1 tsp"],["Sesame Seed Oil","1 tsp"],["Spring Onions","1"],["Water","800 ml"]],"s":"Bring 800ml water to a boil with the dried shrimp; simmer 2 minutes. (Dried seaweed is the soul of this soup — add a handful if you have it.)\n\nSeason with salt and bouillon powder; thicken lightly with starch water.\n\nDrizzle in the beaten egg while stirring to form ribbons.\n\nFinish with sesame oil.\n\nScatter spring onions and serve.","z":"800毫升水烧开，下入虾皮煮2分钟出鲜味。（这道汤的灵魂是紫菜，有的话抓一把一起煮，鲜味翻倍。）\n\n加盐和鸡精调味，淋入薄芡。\n\n边搅边淋入蛋液，形成细碎的蛋花。\n\n滴几滴芝麻油。\n\n撒上葱花出锅，清淡鲜美，几分钟就做好。","x":"cn"},{"id":"cn043","n":"Winter Melon Shrimp Soup","a":"Chinese","c":"Side","t":"","y":"","i":[["Winter Melon","400 g"],["Shrimp","150 g"],["Ginger","2 slices"],["Spring Onions","1"],["Salt","to taste"],["Chicken Bouillon Powder","1 tsp"],["Sesame Seed Oil","1 tsp"],["Water","800 ml"]],"s":"Peel and slice the winter melon 3mm thick. Devein the shrimp.\n\nBring 800ml water to a boil with ginger.\n\nAdd the winter melon; simmer 5 minutes until translucent.\n\nAdd the shrimp; cook 2 minutes until pink.\n\nSeason with salt and bouillon powder.\n\nFinish with sesame oil and spring onions.","z":"冬瓜去皮切3毫米薄片，虾去虾线。\n\n800毫升水加姜片烧开。\n\n下冬瓜片煮5分钟，煮到半透明。\n\n下虾仁煮2分钟变色。\n\n加盐和鸡精调味。\n\n滴芝麻油、撒葱花，清甜鲜美，夏天喝最舒服。","x":"cn"},{"id":"cn044","n":"Radish Pork Rib Soup","a":"Chinese","c":"Side","t":"","y":"","i":[["Daikon Radish","1"],["Pork Back Ribs","400 g"],["Ginger","1 piece"],["Spring Onions","2"],["Salt","to taste"],["Chicken Bouillon Powder","1 tsp"],["Shaoxing Wine","1 tbsp"],["Water","1.2 L"]],"s":"Chop the ribs into pieces; blanch 3 minutes and rinse. Cut the radish into chunks.\n\nPut ribs, ginger and 1.2L water in a pot; bring to a boil.\n\nSkim the foam; add Shaoxing wine. Simmer covered 30 minutes.\n\nAdd the radish; simmer 20 minutes until translucent and tender.\n\nSeason with salt and bouillon powder.\n\nScatter spring onions and serve — the broth should be milky and sweet.","z":"排骨斩块，焯水3分钟洗净。白萝卜切滚刀块。\n\n排骨、姜片和1.2升水下锅，大火烧开。\n\n撇去浮沫，加料酒，转小火加盖炖30分钟。\n\n下入萝卜块，再炖20分钟，炖到萝卜透明入味。\n\n加盐和鸡精调味。\n\n撒上葱花，汤色奶白、萝卜清甜，暖胃又营养。","x":"cn"},{"id":"cn045","n":"Corn Pork Rib Soup","a":"Chinese","c":"Side","t":"","y":"","i":[["Corn On The Cob","2"],["Pork Back Ribs","400 g"],["Carrots","1"],["Ginger","1 piece"],["Spring Onions","2"],["Salt","to taste"],["Chicken Bouillon Powder","1 tsp"],["Water","1.2 L"]],"s":"Chop the ribs; blanch 3 minutes and rinse. Cut the corn into 3cm rounds; chunk the carrot.\n\nCombine ribs, ginger and 1.2L water; bring to a boil and skim.\n\nSimmer covered 30 minutes.\n\nAdd corn and carrot; simmer 25 minutes until sweet and tender.\n\nSeason with salt and bouillon powder.\n\nServe hot with spring onions on top.","z":"排骨斩块焯水洗净。玉米切3厘米小段，胡萝卜切滚刀块。\n\n排骨、姜片和1.2升水下锅烧开，撇去浮沫。\n\n小火加盖炖30分钟。\n\n加入玉米和胡萝卜，再炖25分钟。\n\n加盐和鸡精调味。\n\n撒上葱花出锅，汤汁清甜，玉米和排骨都好吃，老少皆宜。","x":"cn"}];